msgid "# Welcome to the Holo-Archives!"
msgstr "# ¡Bienvenido a los Holo-Archivos!"

msgid ""
"Here you can find an assortment of data collected throughout your adventures "
"around the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Aquí puedes encontrar una variedad de datos recopilados a lo largo de tus "
"aventuras por la galaxia."

msgid ""
"Below are some quick links to get you started on exploring all the "
"information available at your fingertips!"
msgstr ""
"¡A continuación se muestran algunos enlaces rápidos para que pueda comenzar "
"a explorar toda la información disponible a su alcance!"

msgid "* [Mechanics](mechanics)"
msgstr "* [Mecánica](mechanics)"

msgid "* [Ships](ships)"
msgstr "* [Naves](ships)"

msgid "* [Outfits](outfits)"
msgstr "* [Equipos](outfits)"

msgid "* [Lore](lore)"
msgstr "* [Historia](lore)"

msgid "Lore Overview"
msgstr "Historia Descripción General"

msgid "# Lore"
msgstr "# Historia"

msgid "* [History](lore/history)"
msgstr "* [Historia](lore/history)"

msgid "Fabricators"
msgstr "Fabricantes"

msgid "# Fabricators"
msgstr "# Fabricantes"

msgid ""
"There are a variety of fabricators that produce different ships and outfits."
msgstr ""
"Hay diversos fabricantes que producen diferentes barcos y equipamientos."

msgid "## Independent"
msgstr "## Independiente"

msgid ""
"* **Melendez Corp.**: Focuses on large cargo-oriented trade ships and heavy "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"* **Melendez Corp.**: Se centra en grandes naves comerciales de carga y "
"motores pesados."

msgid ""
"* **Krain Industries**: Fabricator that makes the [Kestrel](ships/kestrel) "
"and [Starbridge](ships/starbridge) and their assorted custom engines."
msgstr ""
"* **Industrias Krain**: fabricante del [Cérnicalo](ships/kestrel) y el "
"[Puente Estelar](ships/starbridge) y sus diversos motores personalizados."

msgid ""
"* **Nexus Shipyards**: Makes a decent amount of ships for [the Empire](lore/"
"factions/empire) and their civilian counterparts. Also makes engines and "
"stealth armour."
msgstr ""
"* **Astilleros Nexus**: Produce una cantidad decente de naves para [El "
"Imperio](lore/factions/empire) y sus homólogos civiles. También fabrica "
"motores y armaduras furtivas."

msgid "* **Aerosys**: Maker of the popular [Hyena](ships/hyena) interceptor."
msgstr "* **Aerosys**: Creador del popular interceptor [Hiena](ships/hyena)."

msgid ""
"* **MilSpec**: Provides high-end cores and outfits. A favourite of bounty "
"hunters."
msgstr ""
"* **MilSpec**: Proporciona núcleos y equipos de alta gama. Un favorito de "
"los cazarrecompensas."

msgid ""
"* **Unicorp**: Designs many accessible core outfits, and also launchers for "
"the Caeser torpedoes, among others."
msgstr ""
"* **Unicorp**: Diseña muchos equipos básicos accesibles y también lanzadores "
"para los torpedos Cesar, entre otros."

msgid "* **Tricon**: Design high-end engines optimized for speed."
msgstr ""
"* **Tricon**: Diseñan motores de alta gama optimizados para la velocidad."

msgid ""
"* **Schafer & Kane Industries**: Manufacturer of heavy armour and cargo "
"hulls."
msgstr ""
"* **Industrias Schafer & Kane**: Fabricante de blindaje pesado y cascos de "
"carga."

msgid ""
"* **Imperial Red Star**: An organization dedicated to relief efforts that "
"has also designed their own line of defensive armours."
msgstr ""
"* **Estrella Roja Imperial**: una organización dedicada a la creación de "
"ayudas que también ha diseñado su propia línea de armaduras defensivas."

msgid "## Houses"
msgstr "## Casas"

msgid ""
"* **House Goddard**: Makes the [Goddard](ships/goddard) and is involved in "
"the design of [House Dvaered](lore/factions/dvaered) ships."
msgstr ""
"* **Casa Diosa**: Fabrica la [Diosa](ships/goddard) y participa en el diseño "
"de las naves de la [Casa Dvaered](lore/factions/dvaered)."

msgid ""
"* **House Dvaered**: Works in tandem with House Goddard to develop the ships "
"used by [House Dvaered](lore/factions/dvaered)."
msgstr ""
"* **Casa Dvaered**: trabaja en conjunto con la Casa Goddard para desarrollar "
"las naves utilizadas por la [Casa Dvaered] (lore/factions/dvaered)."

msgid ""
"* **Sirius Systems**: Besides developing the ships for [House Sirius](lore/"
"factions/sirius), also develops the [Schroedinger](ships/schroedinger) scout "
"ship."
msgstr ""
"* **Sistemas Sirio**: Además de desarrollar las naves para la [Casa Sirio]"
"(lore/factions/sirius), también desarrolla la nave exploradora [Schroedinger]"
"(ships/schroedinger)."

msgid ""
"* **Za'lek Fabricators**: Focuses on developing and making the ships flown "
"by [House Za'lek](lore/factions/zalek)."
msgstr ""
"* **Fabricantes Za'lek**: Se centra en desarrollar y fabricar las naves "
"pilotadas por la [Casa Za'lek] (lore/factions/zalek)."

msgid ""
"* **Za'lek Robotics**: Produces [House Za'lek](lore/factions/zalek) drones."
msgstr ""
"* **Robótica Za'lek**: Produce drones de la [Casa Za'lek](lore/factions/"
"zalek)."

msgid "## Other"
msgstr "## Otro"

msgid ""
"* **Soromid**: Uses advanced genetic techniques to grow and train biological "
"ships."
msgstr ""
"* **Soromida**: Utiliza técnicas genéticas avanzadas para hacer crecer y "
"entrenar naves biológicas."

msgid ""
"* **Skull and Bones**: Known for stealing and developing variants of any "
"ship they can get their hands on. Almost all the materials used are from "
"dubious sources."
msgstr ""
"* **Cráneo y huesos**: Conocido por robar y desarrollar variantes de "
"cualquier barco que pueda tener en sus manos. Casi todos los materiales "
"utilizados son de procedencia dudosa."

msgid ""
"* **Thurion Shipyards**: Produce ships with advanced interfaces for digital "
"humans with minimal life support."
msgstr ""
"* **Astilleros Turion**: Produce naves con interfaces avanzadas para humanos "
"digitales con soporte vital mínimo."

msgid ""
"* **Proteron**: Although they use antiquated fabrication methods, they have "
"refined them to the point they are extremely competitive with other ships."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"* **Robosys**: Provides support and modifications for the Collective ships."
msgstr ""
"* **Robosys**: Proporciona soporte y modificaciones para las naves del "
"colectivo."

