msgid ""
"When a ship's shields get knocked offline, it takes <%= "
"constant( \"PILOT_SHIELD_DOWN_TIME\" ) %> seconds for the shields to start "
"regenerating again, and can be reduced with lower **Shield Down Time**."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Any damage during this window will restart the time it takes to regenerate "
"shields."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When shields get back up there they will regenerate faster during the first "
"3 seconds."
