"Frontier, fed up with both the FLF and Dvaered terrorism, and Empire tyranny."
msgstr ""
"El Clan Pirata Soñador está formado en gran parte por piratas descontentos "
"de la Frontera, hartos del terrorismo de FLF, Dvaered y de la tiranía del "
"Imperio."

msgid "Dummy"
msgstr "Maniquí"

#. Add the Cargo
#. Ship to go back to
#. Set up Major Malik
msgid "Dvaered"
msgstr "Dvaered"

msgid "House Dvaered"
msgstr "Casa Dvaered"

msgid ""
"House Dvaered is one of the oldest Great Houses in the Empire. They are "
"proud and formed by a coalition of many powerful warlords."
msgstr ""
"La Casa Dvaered es una de las Casas Grandes más longevas del Imperio. "
"Orgullosa y formada por una gran coalición de poderosos señores de la guerra."

msgid "Empire"
msgstr "Imperio"

msgid ""
"The Empire is the bureaucratic heart of the universe that provides stability "
"and cohesion, when possible."
msgstr ""
"El Imperio es el corazón burocrático del universo que proporciona "
"estabilidad y cohesión, cuando es posible."

#. FLF are not a natural enemy of the Empire, we have to enforce that
#. Spawn the Shaky Swan for the player to disable them
#. Get a random system with FLF presence.
