msgid "Independent"
msgstr "Independiente"

msgid "Frontier"
msgstr "Frontera"

msgid "Frontier Alliance"
msgstr "Alianza de la Frontera"

msgid ""
"The Frontier Alliance is formed by the survivors of the initial attempts of "
"Human expansion into space."
msgstr ""
"La Alianza de la Frontera está formada por los supervivientes de los "
"primeros intentos de expansión humana en el espacio."

msgid "House Goddard"
msgstr "Casa Goddard"

msgid ""
"House Goddard is a minor house wedged between the Empire and Dvaered. They "
"are one of the main fabricators of ships for the Dvaered."
msgstr ""
"La Casa Goddard es una casa menor ubicada entre el Imperio y Dvaered. Uno de "
"los principales fabricantes de naves para los Dvaered."

msgid "Independent Mercenary"
msgstr ""

