msgid "Sirius"
msgstr "Sirio"

msgid "House Sirius"
msgstr "Casa Sirio"

msgid ""
"House Sirius is defined by its state religion more than anything else, with "
"Sirichana as the focus of worship."
msgstr ""
"La Casa Sirio se define por su religión estatal más que por cualquier otra "
"cosa, con Sirichana como centro de culto."

msgid "Soromid Tribes"
msgstr "Tribus Soromida"

msgid ""
"The Soromid consists of individuals who were forced to genetically modify "
"themselves in order to survive a pandemic. They now openly embrace their "
"human transcendence as a sign of strength."
msgstr ""
"Los Soromida están formados por individuos que se vieron obligados a "
"modificarse genéticamente para sobrevivir a una pandemia. Ahora abrazan "
"abiertamente su trascendencia humana como signo de fortaleza."

msgid "Strangelove"
msgstr "Desamor"

msgid ""
"The Thurion are a mysterious faction located deep in the Nebula. They seem "
"to be out of touch with the external world."
msgstr ""
"Los Turion son una misteriosa facción situada en las profundidades de la "
"Nebulosa. Parecen estar desconectados del mundo exterior."

