msgid "Trader"
msgstr "Comerciante"

msgid "Traders Society"
msgstr "Sociedad de Comerciantes"

msgid "Space Traders Society"
msgstr "Sociedad de Comerciantes Espaciales"

msgid ""
"The Space Traders Society is an organization that spans over all the "
"different guilds, and serves to protect their interests against the Empire, "
"Great Houses, and Soromid. Some of the prominent members include Astra "
"Vigilis, Mining Vrata, and the Imperial Red Star."
msgstr ""
"La Cofradía de Comerciantes Espaciales es una organización que engloba a los "
"diferentes gremios y sirve para proteger sus intereses frente al Imperio, "
"las Grandes Casas y los Soromida. Algunos de sus miembros destacados son "
"Astra Vigilis, Mining Vrata y Estrella Roja Imperial."

msgid "Wild Ones Pirate Clan"
msgstr "Clan de los Piratas Salvajes"

msgid ""
"The Wild Ones Pirate Clan is a violent and loosely organized band of pirates "
"that control the Haven sector between Empire and Soromid territories."
msgstr ""
"El Clan Pirata Salvajes es una banda violenta y poco organizada de piratas "
"que controla el sector Refugio entre los territorios del Imperio y de los "
"Soromid."

msgid "Yetmer"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "House Yetmer"
msgstr "Casa Dvaered"

msgid ""
"While still officially part of House Yetmer-O'rez, to all practical effects, "
"House Yetmer is an independent minor house, engaged in a long war with House "
"O'rez."
msgstr ""

