msgid "Za'lek"
msgstr "Za'lek"

msgid "House Za'lek"
msgstr "Casa Za'lek"

msgid ""
"House Za'lek is the scientific heart of the Empire. Until recently they were "
"a secretive Great House, but they have recently become much more open."
msgstr ""
"La Casa Za'lek es el corazón científico del Imperio. Hasta hace poco era una "
"Gran Casa muy reservada, pero recientemente se ha tornado mucho más abierta."

msgid "Accessory"
msgstr "Accesorio"

msgid ""
"A module once used to infect ship systems with sophisticated malware. Not "
"something to keep anywhere near a computer."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Apparently air fresheners have been traditionally used in human vehicles as "
"ornaments. They used to have scents but, since these have no impact with "
"modern ships' powerful filtration systems, these days they are entirely "
"cosmetic."
msgstr ""
"Al parecer, los ambientadores se han utilizado tradicionalmente en los "
"vehículos humanos como adornos. Solían tener aromas, pero como éstos no "
"tienen ningún impacto con los potentes sistemas de filtración de las naves "
"modernas, hoy en día son enteramente cosméticos."

msgid ""
"A crude doll of a black cat made from authentic \"Felis catus\" fur you made "
"that was all over your ship. It's quite cute."
msgstr ""
"Un tosco muñeco de un gato negro hecho con pieles auténticas de \"Felis "
"catus\" que has hecho con las que se encontraban en tu nave. Bastante bonito."

msgid "#pOnly active when in stealth.#0"
msgstr "#pSolo activo en sigilo.#0"

msgid ""
"A broken prototype for a novel shielding device that is supposed to enable "
"travel into the Sol Nebula. However, due to its malfunction you almost died. "
"On the other hand it does seem to absorb harmful energy and emit heat "
"radiation into space."
msgstr ""
"Un prototipo estropeado de un novedoso dispositivo de blindaje que se supone "
"que permite viajar a la Nebulosa Sol. Sin embargo, debido a su mal "
"funcionamiento casi mueres. Por otro lado, parece que absorbe la energía "
"dañina y emite radiación térmica al espacio."

msgid ""
"This is a stein commemorating the terraforming and establishment of a "
"permanent colony on Antlejos V. The stein is intricately engraved with what "
"seems to be scenes from the short history of the colony. You can make out "
"what appears to be some individuals wrestling, lots of heavy machinery, and "
"people doing some sort of circle dance. Did that all happen? On the bottom "
"there is an inscription saying \"Screw the PUAAA, long live the Hero of "
"Antlejos!\" with an illegible signature."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una jarra que conmemora la terraformación y el establecimiento de "
"una colonia permanente en Antlejos V. La jarra está grabada con lo que "
"parecen ser escenas de la corta historia de la colonia. Se puede distinguir "
"lo que parecen ser algunos individuos luchando, mucha maquinaria pesada y "
"gente haciendo una especie de baile en círculo. ¿Ha sucedido todo eso? En la "
"parte inferior hay una inscripción que dice \"Que se pudran la PUAAA, ¡viva "
"el Héroe de Antlejos!\" con una firma ilegible."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A feather from a cyborg duck. Although the quill is made of some lightweight "
"metal alloy, the rest looks surprisingly close to a normal feather."
msgstr ""
"Una pluma de pato ciborg. Aunque la pluma está hecha de una aleación "
"metálica ligera, el resto se parece mucho a una pluma normal."

msgid ""
"A small statue of a crossed-eyed gorilla lifting a Goddard Battlecruiser."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña estatua de un gorila bizco levantando un Crucero de Batalla "
"Goddard."

msgid ""
"A pair of fuzzy dice that can be hung inside your ship. Apparently they are "
"supposed to bring you good fortune. This particular pair is said to have "
"belonged to starship pilot Mireia, who was famous for recovering artefacts "
"from the Nebula before she disappeared mysteriously."
msgstr ""
"Un par de dados peludos que se pueden colgar dentro de tu nave. Al parecer, "
"se supone que traen buena suerte. Se dice que este par en concreto "
"perteneció a la piloto de la nave Mireia, famosa por recuperar artefactos de "
"la Nebulosa antes de desaparecer misteriosamente."

msgid "#pImproves luck!#0"
msgstr "#p¡Mejora la suerte!#0"

msgid ""
"A rare limited edition Goatee Marker, meant exclusive for drawing not only "
"facial hair, but Goatees in particular. It seems to have been partially used "
"and has the marauder logo on the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Un raro Rotulador de Perillas de edición limitada, exclusivo para dibujar no "
"sólo vello facial, sino perillas en particular. Parece haber sido utilizado "
"parcialmente y tiene el logotipo merodeador en la parte inferior."

msgid ""
"When does a gentleman use the head of another gentleman as a trophy in their "
"bathroom? And when is it more proper to use it as a mug? When is it allowed "
"to burn the house of one of your victims? And when is it an absolute "
"misstep? Lord Chainsaw, one of the most successful Warlords of our time, "
"answers these thorny questions and many others in this essential little "
"book. \"This book has allowed me to quickly work my way up through the "
"highest ranks\" -- Colonel Urnus, Executive Office Manager at the High "
"Command"
msgstr ""
"¿Cuándo un caballero utiliza la cabeza de otro caballero como trofeo en su "
"baño? ¿Y cuándo es más apropiado usarla como taza? ¿Cuándo está permitido "
"quemar la casa de una de tus víctimas? ¿Y cuándo es una falta absoluta? Lord "
"Motosierra, uno de los Señores de la Guerra más exitosos de nuestro tiempo, "
"responde a estas espinosas preguntas y a muchas otras en este pequeño libro "
"esencial. \"Este libro me ha permitido ascender rápidamente en los rangos "
"más altos\" -- Coronel Urnus, Director de la Oficina Ejecutiva en el Alto "
"Mando"

msgid ""
"A ragged eyepatch that seems to have seen its share of adventures among the "
"stars."
msgstr ""

msgid "#pDoubles the range of blink drives.#0"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The left boot of a high-ranking Empire official. It doesn't seem to fit you "
"and is full of confetti. You're not sure what to do with it, but it might "
"liven up the ship."
msgstr ""
"La bota izquierda de un alto funcionario del Imperio. Parece que no te queda "
"bien y está llena de confeti. No estás seguro de qué hacer con ella, pero "
"podría ambientar la nave."

msgid "#pSmells funky.#0"
msgstr "#pHuele raro.#0"

msgid ""
"A misplaced love letter that you were supposed to deliver, reading the first "
"line \"My tootlepumps, how frompscious are thein pluckerpumps...\" you are "
"fairly certain that you did a favour in not delivering it. At least it makes "
"your ship look cuter."
msgstr ""
"Una carta de amor extraviada que se suponía que ibas a entregar, al leer la "
"primera línea \"Mis tootlepumps, que frompscious are thein pluckerpumps...\" "
"estás bastante seguro de que hiciste un favor al no entregarla. Al menos "
"hace que tu nave parezca más bonita."

msgid "#rLove is in the air.#0"
msgstr "#rEl amor esta en el aire.#0"

msgid "A token of commitment to the FLF cause. It smells oddly of fish."
msgstr ""
"Una muestra de compromiso con la causa de la FLF. Huele extrañamente a "
"pescado."

msgid ""
"A doll made by orphans out of their old clothes. You believe it's supposed "
"to be you, but it looks nothing like you at all. However, what is important "
"here is the intention and not the result."
msgstr ""
"Una muñeca hecha por huérfanos con su ropa vieja. Se supone que eres tú, "
"pero no se parece en nada a ti. Sin embargo, lo importante aquí es la "
"intención y no el resultado."

#, fuzzy
msgid "The racing trophy you won with your piloting skills."
msgstr ""
"Trofeo de carreras que ganaste con tus excelentes habilidades de pilotaje. "
"¡Queda muy bien en la pared!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The prestigious Gold Racing trophy you won with your excellent piloting "
"skills. Looks great on the wall!"
msgstr ""
"Trofeo de carreras que ganaste con tus excelentes habilidades de pilotaje. "
"¡Queda muy bien en la pared!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The racing trophy you won with your excellent piloting skills. Looks great "
"on the wall!"
msgstr ""
"Trofeo de carreras que ganaste con tus excelentes habilidades de pilotaje. "
"¡Queda muy bien en la pared!"

msgid ""
"An ornately engraved sword with a lightly curved, razor-sharp nanosteel "
"blade, the favourite weapon of the once legendary pirate Red Rackham. The "
"mere sight of this sword struck fear into his enemies and rallied his crew "
"with visions of plunder and glory."
msgstr ""
"Una espada ornamentada con una hoja de nanoacero ligeramente curvada y "
"afilada como una cuchilla, el arma favorita del antaño legendario pirata "
"Rackham El Rojo. La mera visión de esta espada infundía miedo a sus enemigos "
"y animaba a su tripulación con visiones de saqueo y gloria."

msgid "#gDouble effect when flying a pirate ship.#0"
msgstr "#gEfecto doble al pilotar una nave pirata.#0"

msgid ""
"It appears to be a limited edition Nexus Shipyards sandwich holder. Very "
"useful for hands-free eating of sandwiches in zero gravity. Apparently the "
"CEO really loves his sandwiches."
msgstr ""
"Parece ser un portasandwiches de edición limitada de los Astilleros Nexus. "
"Muy útil para comer sandwiches con las manos libres en gravedad cero. Al "
"parecer, al Director General le encantan sus sándwiches."

msgid ""
"A mock-up of a satellite you helped launch into the Nebula. It even has cute "
"blinking lights!"
msgstr ""
"Una maqueta de un satélite que ayudaste a lanzar a la Nebulosa. ¡Incluso "
"tiene unas bonitas luces parpadeantes!"

msgid ""
"A shiny medal for your contribution to the Dvaered cause. On the back it "
"says \"not for rectal use\". Wait, what?"
msgstr ""
"Una brillante medalla por tu contribución a la causa Dvaered. En el reverso "
"dice \"no para uso rectal\". Espera, ¿qué?"

msgid ""
"A fairly mediocre cocktail that you don't intend to drink. At least it looks "
"good as an accessory."
msgstr ""
"Un cóctel bastante mediocre que no tienes intención de beber. Al menos queda "
"bien como accesorio."

msgid ""
"A small toy drone that can fly around the ship. The AI doesn't seem to work "
"too well and it has a habit of bumping into the walls and beeping all the "
"time, but it is rather cute."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dron de juguete que puede volar alrededor de la nave. La IA no "
"parece funcionar demasiado bien y tiene la costumbre de chocar con las "
"paredes y pitar todo el tiempo, pero es bastante bonito."

msgid ""
"A #oHyena#0 trading card game card of common rarity. It describes in detail "
"all the important statistics of the Hyena. Did you know that early models of "
"the Hyena put so much strain on the pilots that it could crush them during "
"high acceleration?"
msgstr ""
"Una carta del juego de cartas coleccionables #oHyena#0 de rareza común. "
"Describe con detalle todas las estadísticas importantes del Hiena. ¿Sabías "
"que los primeros modelos del Hiena sometían a los pilotos a tanta tensión "
"que podían aplastarlos durante la alta aceleración?"

msgid ""
"A #oGolden Llama#0 trading card game card of #prare#0 rarity. Instead of "
"going into the important details of the ship, it just shows a high "
"definition holographic rendition of the supposed Golden Llama."
msgstr ""
"Una tarjeta del juego de cartas coleccionables #oGolden Llama#0 de rareza "
"#prare#0. En lugar de entrar en los detalles importantes de la nave, solo "
"muestra una representación holográfica de alta definición de la supuesta "
"Llama Dorada."

msgid ""
"A #oDvaered Vigilance#0 trading card game card of #buncommon#0 rarity. It "
"describes in detail all the important statistics of the Dvaered Vigilance. "
"Did you know that the Vigilance has triply redundant life support systems, "
"allowing the crew to man it past damage that would usually incapacitate "
"normal ships?"
msgstr ""
"Una carta del juego de cartas coleccionables #oDvaered Vigilance#0 de rareza "
"#buncommon#0. Describe con detalle todas las estadísticas importantes de la "
"Vigilancia Dvaered. ¿Sabías que la Vigilancia tiene sistemas de soporte "
"vital triplemente redundantes, lo que permite a la tripulación superar daños "
"que normalmente incapacitarían a naves normales?"

msgid ""
"A statue given to you by Baron Sauterfeldt for your fine work. You would "
"feel more grateful if he hadn't mentioned that his lover was making him get "
"rid of it. The statue seems to depict a shrimp wearing a bow tie playing a "
"ukulele and its head bobbles around with the ship acceleration. How "
"tasteful..."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Found on a Four Winds fighter that was carrying a Ragnarok beam. It seems to "
"increase the performance of your engine when the ship's mass is high. It is "
"most certainly not an actual vacuum cleaner, but you don't know this "
"outfit's real name."
msgstr ""
"Encontrado en un caza Cuatro Vientos que llevaba un rayo Ragnarok. Parece "
"aumentar el rendimiento de tu motor cuando la masa de la nave es elevada. "
"Seguramente no es una aspiradora real, pero no se sabe el nombre real de "
"este equipo."

msgid "Bioship Organ"
msgstr "Órgano de Bionave"

msgid ""
"The bioship adrenal gland organ is able to generate immense amounts of "
"adrenaline from raw energy, allowing the ship to temporarily have augmented "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"El órgano de la glándula suprarrenal de la bionave es capaz de generar "
"inmensas cantidades de adrenalina a partir de energía sin procesar, lo que "
"permite que la nave tenga temporalmente un movimiento aumentado."

msgid ""
"Through careful manipulation of the brain stem, the bioship can be induced "
"into a primitive state of feral rage in which forward and turret weapon "
"output is significantly increased. Armour damage is needed to enter the "
"trance-like state."
msgstr ""
"Mediante una cuidadosa manipulación del tronco encefálico, la bionave puede "
"ser inducida a un estado primitivo de furia salvaje en el que la potencia de "
"las armas de la torreta y de la proa aumenta significativamente. Para entrar "
"en el estado de trance es necesario que el blindaje esté dañado."

msgid "Active for 5 seconds since armour was last damaged."
msgstr ""
"Activo durante 5 segundos a partir de la última vez que se dañó el blindaje."

msgid ""
"Through careful manipulation of the brain stem, the bioship can be induced "
"into a primitive state of feral rage in which forward and turret weapon "
"output is significantly increased. Armour damage is needed to enter the "
"trance-like state. Further coupling with the cerebellum allows the trance to "
"also increase the ship agility temporarily."
msgstr ""
"Mediante una cuidadosa manipulación del tronco encefálico, la bionave puede "
"ser inducida a un estado primitivo de furia salvaje en el que la potencia de "
"las armas de la torreta y de la proa aumenta significativamente. Para entrar "
"en el estado de trance es necesario sufrir daños en el blindaje. Un "
"acoplamiento adicional con el cerebelo permite que el trance también aumente "
"temporalmente la agilidad de la nave."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Through careful manipulation of the brain stem, the bioship can be induced "
"into a primitive state of feral rage in which forward and turret weapon "
"output is significantly increased. Further coupling with the cerebellum "
"allows the trance to also increase the ship agility temporarily. The trance "
"is induced automatically upon armour damage, but can also be manually "
"triggered through focusing."
msgstr ""
"Mediante una cuidadosa manipulación del tronco encefálico, la bionave puede "
"ser inducida a un estado primitivo de furia salvaje en el que la potencia de "
"las armas de proa y de la torreta aumenta significativamente. Un "
"acoplamiento adicional con el cerebelo permite que el trance también aumente "
"la agilidad de la nave temporalmente. El trance se induce automáticamente "
"cuando se produce un daño en el blindaje, pero también puede activarse "
"manualmente mediante la concentración."

msgid ""
"Active for 7 seconds since armour was last damaged, or can be manually "
"toggled with a 30 second cooldown."
msgstr ""
"Activo durante 7 segundos desde la última vez que se dañó el blindaje, o "
"puede activarse manualmente con un enfriamiento de 30 segundos."

#. Speed Lights
#. Make sure it's valid.
#. p +=
#, c-format
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ninguna"

msgid ""
"This is a dummy engine for use in missions only, which does nothing. DO NOT "
"BUY."
msgstr ""
"Este es un motor falso para usar en misiones solamente, que no hace nada. NO "
"COMPRAR."

msgid ""
"Clogged, corroded and cracked in every way possible while still remaining in "
"functional condition, this engine really belongs on the scrap heap."
msgstr ""
"Obstruido, corroído y agrietado de todas las maneras posibles mientras sigue "
"en condiciones funcionales, este motor realmente pertenece a un montón de "
"chatarra."

msgid "K. Remige Engine"
msgstr "Remige K. Motor"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Remige was developed by Krain Industries exclusively for their flagship "
"cruiser, the Kestrel. Optimized for the Kestrel's needs, the Remige delivers "
"performance exceeding most other cruiser engines in every respect, though "
"its tuning renders it ill-suited to heavier vessels. Due to the heavily "
"optimized design of the engine, it can not be used jointly with other "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"El Remige fue desarrollado por Industrias Krain exclusivamente para su nave "
"insignia, el Cérnicalo. Optimizado para las necesidades del Cérnicalo, el "
"Remige ofrece un rendimiento que supera a la mayoría de los motores de "
"crucero en todos los aspectos, aunque su puesta a punto lo hace poco "
"adecuado para naves más pesadas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Mammoth Engine"
msgstr "XL Mamut M. Motor"

msgid ""
"Melendez's Mammoth can pull incredible amounts of mass. Requiring "
"specialized grav tethers to keep it attached to the ship's hull, it "
"significantly impacts manoeuvrability, though a good top speed can still be "
"maintained. Many bulk freight corporations only turn a profit thanks to the "
"Mammoth line of engines."
msgstr ""

msgid "N. Bolt 3000 Engine"
msgstr "Bolt 3000 N. Motor"

msgid ""
"Originally developed by Nexus Shipyards to suit the needs of the Hawking-"
"class cruiser, the Bolt 3000 is a well-rounded balanced choice for large "
"ships. Like most Nexus engines, it doesn't excel in speed, but its "
"comparatively low power consumption and high flexibility make it an "
"attractive option for some pilots."
msgstr ""

msgid "T. Typhoon Engine"
msgstr "Tifón T. Motor"

msgid ""
"Development of the Typhoon engine was something of a prestige project for "
"Tricon. Providing cruisers with superb handling and speed, it's a favourite "
"of many captains, though its high power consumption limits it to ships with "
"powerful reactors. It's also commonly found to be of use as a "
"manoeuvrability-enhancing secondary engine on light battleships."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Eagle 3000 Engine"
msgstr "Águila 6500 U. Motor"

msgid ""
"Inexpensive by capital ship standards, the Eagle 3000 is seldom selected by "
"captains who can afford better. While spaceworthy, the engine's performance "
"renders it a liability in combat and uneconomical for freight hauling."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "K. Patagium Twin Engine"
msgstr "Patagio K. Motor"

msgid ""
"The Patagium is an engine developed by Krain Industries, carefully tailored "
"for use on their Destroyer-class Starbridge. While it exceeds the "
"alternatives in maximum speed and manoeuvrability, the engine is not "
"adequate for most other destroyers due to their higher mass. Due to the very "
"particular calibration hyperparameters, the Patagium can only operate in a "
"twin configuration."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Buffalo Engine"
msgstr "XL Búfalo M. Motor"

msgid ""
"The Buffalo is a mid-sized engine intended for freighters, though it's "
"occasionally seen on particularly well-armed corvettes and destroyers. As a "
"typical freight-oriented engine, the Buffalo possesses good top speed, poor "
"handling, and excellent fuel capacity."
msgstr ""

msgid "N. Arrow 700 Engine"
msgstr "Flecha 700 N. Motor"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Arrow 700 is a respectable engine for a respectable price, giving "
"captains good maneuverability without leeching too much off of the ship's "
"reactors."
msgstr ""
"El Flecha 700 es un motor de Corbeta respetable por un precio respetable, "
"que ofrece a los capitanes una maniobrabilidad decente sin que los reactores "
"de la nave se resientan demasiado."

msgid "T. Cyclone Engine"
msgstr "Ciclón T. Motor"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tricon's Cyclone engine upholds the corporation's reputation for premium "
"engines with superb performance. Many large navies and wealthier mercenaries "
"employ the Cyclone in their corvettes and destroyers."
msgstr ""
"El motor Ciclón de Tricon mantiene la reputación de la corporación en cuanto "
"a motores de primera calidad con un rendimiento soberbio. Muchas grandes "
"armadas y los mercenarios más ricos emplean el Ciclón en sus corbetas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Falcon 700 Engine"
msgstr "Halcón 1400 U. Motor"

msgid ""
"The Falcon 700 is a budget engine for use on medium-sized vessels. Its "
"middling performance relegates it primarily to use on civilians vessels, as "
"few captains are comfortable relying on bargain-priced propulsion systems "
"when engaged in battle."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Ox Engine"
msgstr "XL Asno M. Motor"

msgid ""
"A powerful engine for its size, though not a particularly manoeuvrable one. "
"On the slow and steady side as it is, it lets small vessels bring more cargo "
"or outfits along without slowing to a crawl, giving it a good reputation in "
"trader circles. Above-par fuel reserves and atmospheric flight capabilities "
"are some of the other selling points of the Ox."
msgstr ""

msgid "N. Dart 160 Engine"
msgstr "Dardo 160 N. Motor"

msgid ""
"The Dart 160 is a well-rounded engine for light vessels. While it doesn't "
"excel in speed, it offers good handling and power efficiency for a "
"reasonable price. A very popular engine among civilian and military users "
"alike."
msgstr ""
"El Dardo 160 es un motor muy completo para naves ligeras. Aunque no destaca "
"por su velocidad, ofrece una buena manejabilidad y eficiencia de potencia "
"por un precio razonable. Un motor muy popular entre los usuarios civiles y "
"militares por igual."

msgid "T. Zephyr Engine"
msgstr "Céfiro T. Motor"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For light vessel pilots who demand unparalleled performance, Tricon's Zephyr "
"is the engine of choice. Its best-in-class handling does come with the "
"caveat of reduced lifting ability and of markedly increased power "
"consumption, but those flying with Tricon engines can usually afford the "
"requisite reactor upgrades."
msgstr ""
"Para los pilotos de naves ligeras que exigen un rendimiento sin igual, el "
"Céfiro de Tricon es el motor elegido. Su manejo, el mejor de su clase, "
"conlleva la advertencia de que el consumo de energía es notablemente "
"superior, pero los que vuelan con motores Tricon suelen poder permitirse las "
"mejoras necesarias en el reactor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Hawk 160 Engine"
msgstr "Halcón 360 U. Motor"

msgid ""
"The Hawk 160 is a budget general-purpose engine many civilians use to propel "
"their ships. It's not particularly effective, but it's a lightweight engine "
"with low energy demands, making it a solid choice for small vessels."
msgstr ""

msgid "Z. Test Engine"
msgstr "Prueba Z. Motor"

msgid ""
"Built by Za'lek Fabricators, this engine doesn't aim to be an efficient "
"engine. Its goal is to be easily moddable in order to allow Za'lek "
"scientists to test new refrigeration and propulsion systems. These engines "
"are very often modded by students, which makes them unreliable."
msgstr ""
"Construido por Fabricantes Za'lek, este motor no pretende ser un motor "
"eficiente. Su objetivo es ser fácilmente modificable para que los "
"científicos Za'lek puedan probar nuevos sistemas de refrigeración y "
"propulsión. Estos motores suelen ser modificados por estudiantes, lo que los "
"hace poco fiables."

msgid ""
"This is a dummy hull for use in missions only, which does nothing. DO NOT "
"BUY."
msgstr ""
"Este es de un casco ficticio para usar en misiones solamente, el cual no "
"hace nada. NO COMPRAR."

msgid "N. Phantasm Weave"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Though vessels weighing thousands of tonnes can seldom be called stealthy, "
"the Nexus Phantasm Weave does what it can to reduce sensor signatures, "
"without sacrificing protection."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"On the plus side, it keeps air from venting into space. But that's about it. "
"This kind of hull maintenance is simply unacceptable."
msgstr ""
"Por el lado positivo, evita que el aire se ventile en el espacio. Pero eso "
"es todo. Este tipo de casco sin mantenimiento es simplemente inaceptable."

msgid "RS. Large Cargo Hull"
msgstr "Carga Grande RS. Casco"

msgid ""
"The Imperial Red Star is dedicated to relief efforts in areas stricken by "
"war, piracy and disease. Recently developed by the organization is a series "
"of specialized cargo hulls meant to maximize the odds of their supplies and "
"personnel safely arriving where they are needed most. The integrated "
"scrambler systems allow even the largest ships a chance to turn away "
"missiles."
msgstr ""
"La Estrella Roja Imperial se dedica a tareas de socorro en zonas asoladas "
"por la guerra, la piratería y las enfermedades. La organización ha "
"desarrollado recientemente una serie de cascos de carga personalizados "
"destinados a maximizar las probabilidades de que sus suministros y personal "
"lleguen a salvo donde más se necesitan. Los sistemas distorsionadores "
"integrados permiten incluso a las naves más grandes desviar los misiles."

msgid ""
"This cargo hull from Schafer & Kane Industries makes use of state-of-the-art "
"defensive alloys, which allows it to free up even more space for cargo "
"without sacrificing too much durability."
msgstr ""
"Este casco de carga de Industrias Schafer & Kane hace uso de aleaciones "
"defensivas de última generación, lo que le permite liberar aún más espacio "
"para la carga sin sacrificar demasiada durabilidad."

msgid ""
"This heavy plating developed by Schafer & Kane Industries can endure "
"prolonged battle. Quite a few captains and their crews owe their lives to "
"this armour configuration."
msgstr ""
"Este pesado blindaje desarrollado por Industrias Schafer & Kane puede "
"soportar combates prolongados. Bastantes capitanes y sus tripulaciones deben "
"su vida a esta configuración de blindaje."

msgid "U. D-58 Heavy Plating"
msgstr "Pesado D-58 U. Revestimiento"

msgid ""
"Though a respectable design, the D-58 plating is outclassed by modern heavy "
"weapons, with most seasoned captains opting for a heavier, more advanced "
"plating."
msgstr ""
"Aunque es un diseño respetable, el revestimiento D-58 se ve superado por las "
"armas pesadas modernas, y la mayoría de los capitanes experimentados optan "
"por un revestimiento más pesado y avanzado."

#, fuzzy
msgid "K. Nanofoam Padding"
msgstr "Microvínculo Revestimiento"

msgid ""
"Developed by Krain Industries to complement their engine lines, instead of "
"relying on more traditional armour alloys, the Nanofoam Padding uses "
"irregular tessellated nanotube structures to provide resilience against "
"weapon fire. As the nanotubes lack any sort of supporting structure, it "
"becomes necessary to attach them to another hull as an underlayer, where "
"they will provide reactive support upon impact. The foam is extremely "
"elastic and significantly increases the energy needed for ship's plating to "
"lose its cohesion while being extremely lightweight, making it perfect for "
"vessels that can't afford the weight of a regular battle armour underlayer. "
"It does come at a hefty price tag, though."
msgstr ""

msgid "N. Ghost Weave"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Medium-sized ships are usually not in the business of remaining undetected, "
"but Nexus Shipyards have nevertheless developed a hull modification that "
"helps in this area"
msgstr ""
"Las naves de tamaño medio no suelen dedicarse al negocio de pasar "
"inadvertidas, pero los astilleros Nexus han desarrollado, no obstante, una "
"modificación del casco que ayuda en este aspecto"

msgid "RS. Medium Cargo Hull"
msgstr "Cargo Medio RS. Casco"

msgid ""
"The Imperial Red Star is dedicated to relief efforts in areas stricken by "
"war, piracy and disease. Recently developed by the organization is a series "
"of specialized cargo hulls meant to maximize the odds of their supplies and "
"personnel safely arriving where they are needed most. Powered scrambling "
"systems allow medium ships to more effectively weather attacks by guided "
"missiles, especially torpedoes, and compel enemy turrets to track just that "
"little bit slower."
msgstr ""
"La Estrella Roja Imperial se dedica a tareas de socorro en zonas asoladas "
"por la guerra, la piratería y las enfermedades. La organización ha "
"desarrollado recientemente una serie de cascos de carga personalizados "
"destinados a maximizar las probabilidades de que sus suministros y personal "
"lleguen a salvo donde más se necesitan. Los sistemas de distorsión permiten "
"a las naves medianas esquivar con mayor eficacia los ataques de misiles "
"teledirigidos, especialmente torpedos, y obligan a las torretas enemigas a "
"fijar objetivos más lentamente."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Designed for medium-sized vessels, Schafer & Kane's medium combat plating "
"provides ample protection utilizing the latest in defensive materials."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para corbetas y naves de tamaño similar, el revestimiento de "
"combate medio de Schafer & Kane proporciona una amplia protección utilizando "
"lo último en materiales defensivos."

msgid ""
"Schafer & Kane Industries have developed a hull modification that provides "
"both ample cargo space and protection."
msgstr ""
"Industrias Schafer & Kane ha desarrollado una modificación del casco que "
"proporciona un amplio espacio de carga y protección."

msgid "U. D-23 Medium Plating"
msgstr "Medio D-23 U. Revestimiento"

msgid ""
"D-23 plating provides a serviceable layer of armour to medium ships, and "
"doesn't weigh too much."
msgstr ""
"El revestimiento D-23 proporciona una capa de blindaje útil a las naves "
"medianas, y no pesa demasiado."

msgid "N. Shadow Weave"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Designed for military scouting and patrol vessels, Nexus' Shadow Weave "
"configuration features the latest in sensor-absorbing materials and geometry."
msgstr ""

msgid "RS. Small Cargo Hull"
msgstr "Carga Pequeña RS. Casco"

msgid ""
"The Imperial Red Star is dedicated to relief efforts in areas stricken by "
"war, piracy and disease. Recently developed by the organization is a series "
"of specialized cargo hulls meant to maximize the odds of their supplies and "
"personnel safely arriving where they are needed most. This hull integrates "
"scramblers to help blunt the effects of homing missiles and turret tracking, "
"allowing small ships to more effectively run blockades by pirates and "
"privateers."
msgstr ""
"La Estrella Roja Imperial se dedica a tareas de socorro en zonas asoladas "
"por la guerra, la piratería y las enfermedades. La organización ha "
"desarrollado recientemente una serie de cascos de carga personalizados "
"destinados a maximizar las probabilidades de que sus suministros y personal "
"lleguen sanos y salvos a donde más se necesitan. Este casco integra "
"distorsionadores para ayudar a contrarrestar los efectos de los misiles "
"guiados y el rastreo de torretas, lo que permite a las pequeñas naves "
"sortear con mayor eficacia los bloqueos de piratas y corsarios."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Schafer & Kane Industries mostly develop for larger ships, but the Skirmish "
"Plating configuration is a product made for light fighters and in-system "
"patrol craft, providing optimum protection."
msgstr ""
"Industrias Schafer & Kane desarrollan sobre todo para las naves más grandes, "
"pero la configuración del Revestimiento de Combate Ultraligero es un "
"producto hecho para los cazas ligeros y las naves de patrulla de sistema, "
"proporcionando una protección óptima."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Though a pricey investment for couriers, this hull modification from Schafer "
"& Kane Industries provides an impressive amount of cargo space without "
"compromising the hull's integrity."
msgstr ""
"Aunque es una inversión costosa para los pequeños transportistas, esta "
"modificación del casco de Industrias Schafer & Kane proporciona una cantidad "
"impresionante de espacio de carga sin comprometer la integridad del casco."

msgid "U. D-2 Light Plating"
msgstr "Ligero D-2 U. Revestimiento"

msgid ""
"Commonly found on civilian vessels, the D-2 plating is popular with ship "
"manufacturers due to its low cost and adequate, if uninspiring performance."
msgstr ""
"El revestimiento D-2, que se encuentra habitualmente en las naves civiles, "
"es muy popular entre los fabricantes de naves debido a su bajo coste y a su "
"rendimiento adecuado, aunque sin grandes alicientes."

msgid ""
"This is a dummy core system for use in missions only, which does nothing. DO "
"NOT BUY."
msgstr ""
"Este es un sistema base falso para uso en misiones solamente, el cual no "
"hace nada. NO COMPRAR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Aegis 8501 System"
msgstr "Orion 5501 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec cares about your personal safety. Your protection is our number-one "
"concern. The Aegis 8501 is the ultimate bulwark for your ship, equipped with "
"patented shielding technology of impeccable strength, and maintaining energy "
"and subsystem control above par. With the Aegis 8501, you make a statement: "
"you do not compromise on your protection. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "M. Orion 8601 System"
msgstr "Orion 8601 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec develops high performance hardware for your ship, to make sure you "
"can take all the dangers the universe might throw at you on your travels "
"head-on. The Orion 8601 core system is a high-end universal solution for the "
"largest of ships, with zero compromise on computing power, energy, or "
"shields. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Prometheus 8503 System"
msgstr "Thalos 8502 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec offers solutions for pilots looking to power large arrays of "
"powerful weapons. The Prometheus 8503 boasts a heavy-duty power generator to "
"meet the power requirements of battleship-class weapon systems, as well as "
"considerable shielding and subsystem control. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "M. Thalos 8502 System"
msgstr "Thalos 8502 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec knows the difference a few extra fighters can make on a battlefield. "
"The Thalos 8502 provides some serious computational power, perfect for jam-"
"packed carriers, whilst retaining the high standard in energy and shielding "
"that Milspec prides itself on. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prev. Gen. Large Systems"
msgstr "Gen. Prev. Sistemas Grandes"

msgid ""
"A jury-rigged mess of processors and generators that most captains wouldn't "
"be seen dead having installed on their ship."
msgstr ""
"Un lío de procesadores y generadores que la mayoría de los capitanes no "
"verían ni muerto instalados en su nave."

msgid "U. PT-440 System"
msgstr "PT-440 U. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Criticized by some as nothing more than a cluster of PT-310 systems, the "
"PT-440 nevertheless offers acceptable performance for large ships at a "
"fraction of its competitors' prices."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Aegis 4701 System"
msgstr "Orion 3701 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec prides itself in putting customers' safety first. Your protection is "
"our number-one concern. The Aegis 4701 grants your ship excellent shield "
"strength without compromising on energy or compute, so you can explore the "
"universe at peace of mind. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "M. Orion 4801 System"
msgstr "Orion 4801 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec develops high performance hardware for your ship, letting you keep "
"your mind at ease as you tackle the dangers the universe might throw at you "
"on your travels. The Orion 4801 core system is affordable yet capable, "
"recommended for the discerning captain who is looking for well-balanced high-"
"end systems. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Prometheus 4703 System"
msgstr "Thalos 4702 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec offers solutions for pilots who believe in energy weapon supremacy. "
"The Prometheus 4703 boasts a heavy-duty power generator to meet the power "
"requirements of your artillery weapons, as well as considerable shielding "
"and subsystem control. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "M. Thalos 4702 System"
msgstr "Thalos 4702 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec knows that having to make computational power compromises in outfits "
"leads to becoming a chunk of floating scrap metal. The Thalos 4702 provides "
"serious computational power whilst retaining the high standard in energy and "
"shielding that Milspec prides itself on. No need to compromise on outfits, "
"equip them all! Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prev. Gen. Medium Systems"
msgstr "Gen. Prev. Sistemas Medios"

msgid "U. PT-200 System"
msgstr "PT-200 U. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Continuing Unicorp's PT lineup of core systems in the medium ship category, "
"the PT-200 offers acceptable performance at an acceptable price."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Aegis 2201 System"
msgstr "Orion 2301 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec cares about your personal safety. Your protection is our number-one "
"concern. The Aegis 2201 grants your ship excellent shield strength while "
"preserving a high level of subsystem control and energy capacity. Let "
"yourself relax as hostile fire bounces off your shields. Fly safe, fly "
"Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "M. Orion 2301 System"
msgstr "Orion 2301 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec develops high performance hardware for your ship, to make sure you "
"are always optimally prepared for the dangers the universe might throw at "
"you on your travels. The Orion 2301 core system is affordable yet capable, "
"with balanced features at superior quality, recommended for the beginning "
"captain. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Prometheus 2203 System"
msgstr "Thalos 2202 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec offers solutions for pilots who believe the best defence is a good "
"offence. The Prometheus 2203 boasts a heavy-duty power generator to satisfy "
"the heaviest of weapons, as well as considerable shielding and subsystem "
"control. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""

msgid "M. Thalos 2202 System"
msgstr "Thalos 2202 M. Sistema"

msgid ""
"Milspec knows that a ship is merely the sum of its parts, and that means "
"that the more parts, the better the ship. The Thalos 2202 provides serious "
"subsystem control whilst retaining the high standard in energy and shielding "
"that Milspec prides itself on. Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""
"Milspec sabe que una nave es simplemente la suma de sus partes, y eso "
"significa que cuantas más partes, mejor es la nave. El Thalos 2202 "
"proporciona un gran control de los subsistemas al tiempo que mantiene el "
"alto nivel de energía y escudos del que se enorgullece Milspec. Vuele "
"seguro, vuele Milspec."

msgid "Prev. Gen. Small Systems"
msgstr "Gen. Prev. Sistemas Pequeños"

msgid "U. PT-16 System"
msgstr "PT-16 U. Sistema"

msgid ""
"The PT-16 is a modest but to-spec core system offering reasonable all-round "
"performance for small vessels."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ancestor B. Bay"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry a pair of Ancestor class bombers. "
"It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
"bombers."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with the Empire."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con el Imperio."

msgid ""
"The Drone Fighter bay uses the advanced Collective technologies to sustain a "
"group of three Drone Fighters. Drone Fighters require no pilot making them a "
"safer approach in dangerous situations. They do however need some careful "
"maintenance. All the tools needed to take care of them are provided with the "
"bay."
msgstr ""
"La bahía de Cazas Drones utiliza las tecnologías colectivas avanzadas para "
"sostener un grupo de tres Cazas Drones. Los Caza Drones no necesitan piloto, "
"lo que los convierte en un enfoque más seguro en situaciones de peligro. Sin "
"embargo, necesitan un mantenimiento cuidadoso. Todas las herramientas "
"necesarias para cuidar de ellos se proporcionan con la bahía."

msgid "E. Lancelot Bay"
msgstr "Bahía Lancelot I."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry a pair of Empire Lancelot class "
"fighters. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the fighters."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de cazas permite a tu nave llevar un par de cazas de la clase "
"Lancelot del Imperio. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los cazas."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry a pair of Lancelot class fighters "
"with a disabling load out. Each fighter will have a TeraCom Medusa Launcher "
"and three Ion Cannons equipped. The bay comes with all the devices required "
"for the maintenance and flight of the fighters."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Heavy Drone bay uses advanced Collective technologies to maintain a "
"flight of two pilotless Heavy Drones, acting as deadly fighter-bombers."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This bay expands on the popular Hyena Dock, doubling the amount of Hyena "
"interceptors that can be operated. It comes with all the amenities necessary "
"for the maintenance and operation of the interceptors."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía amplía el popular muelle Hyena, doblando la cantidad de "
"interceptores Hiena que pueden ser operados. Viene con todas las "
"instalaciones necesarias para el mantenimiento y el funcionamiento de los "
"interceptores."

msgid ""
"This dock allows your ship to carry twin Hyena interceptors. It comes with "
"all the amenities necessary for the maintenance and operation of the "
"interceptors."
msgstr ""
"Este muelle permite que tu nave lleve dos interceptores Hiena. Viene con "
"todas las instalaciones necesarias para el mantenimiento y el funcionamiento "
"de los interceptores."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry a pair of Lancelot class "
"fighters. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the fighters."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de cazas permite a tu nave llevar un par de cazas de clase "
"Lancelot. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el mantenimiento "
"y el vuelo de los cazas."

msgid ""
"This dock allows your ship to carry a single Pirate Ancestor bomber, armed "
"with disabling Medusa missiles and multiple rockets. It comes with all the "
"amenities necessary for the maintenance and operation of the bomber."
msgstr ""

msgid "P. Hyena Bay"
msgstr "Bahía Hiena P."

msgid ""
"This bay expands on the popular Pirate Hyena Dock, doubling the amount of "
"interceptors that can be operated. It comes with all the amenities necessary "
"for the maintenance and operation of the interceptors. The Pirate Hyenas can "
"also assist in ship scavenging and looting."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía expande el popular Muelle Hiena Pirata, duplicando la cantidad de "
"interceptores que pueden ser operados. Viene con todas las instalaciones "
"necesarias para el mantenimiento y el funcionamiento de los interceptores. "
"Las Hienas Piratas también pueden ayudar en la limpieza y el saqueo de naves."

msgid "P. Hyena Dock"
msgstr "Muelle Hiena P."

msgid ""
"This dock allows your ship to carry a pair of Pirate Hyena interceptors. It "
"comes with all the amenities necessary for the maintenance and operation of "
"the interceptors. The Pirate Hyenas can assist in ship scavenging and "
"looting."
msgstr ""
"Este muelle permite a tu nave llevar un par de interceptores Hiena Pirata. "
"Viene con todas las instalaciones necesarias para el mantenimiento y el "
"funcionamiento de los interceptores. Las Hienas Piratas pueden ayudar en la "
"limpieza y saqueo de naves."

msgid "P. Dalton Bay"
msgstr "Bahía Dalton P."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with the Sovereign Proteron Autarchy."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con los Proteron."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry four Proteron Dalton class "
"interceptors. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the interceptors."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de combate permite a su nave transportar cuatro interceptores "
"Proteron clase Dalton. Viene con todos los dispositivos necesarios para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los interceptores."

msgid "P. Dalton Dock"
msgstr "Muelle Dalton P."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry twin Proteron Dalton class "
"interceptors. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the interceptors."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de cazas permite a tu nave llevar cuatro interceptores de la "
"clase Dalton Proteron. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los cazas."

msgid "S. Fidelity Bay"
msgstr "Bahía Fidelidad S."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with House Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos una reputación de 50 con la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"This bay launches three Sirius Fidelity fighters. Weak individually, they "
"are stronger when working together in groups. Quite apropos, given Sirian "
"society."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía lanza tres cazas Fidelidad Sirio. Débiles individualmente, son "
"más fuertes cuando trabajan juntos en grupo. Bastante apropiado, dada la "
"sociedad Sirio."

msgid "S. Shaman Bay"
msgstr "Bahia Chamán S."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with the Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos una reputación de 50 con Sirio."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry a pair of Sirius Shaman class "
"bombers. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the bombers."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de combate permite a tu nave llevar un par de bombarderos de la "
"clase Chamán Sirio. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los bombarderos."

msgid "S. Brigand Bay"
msgstr "Bahia Forajido S."

msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with the Soromid."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con Soromida."

msgid ""
"This fighter bay allows your ship to carry a triplet of Soromid Brigand "
"class fighters. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance "
"and flight of the fighters."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de cazas permite a tu nave llevar un trio de cazas de la clase "
"Forajido Soromida. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los cazas."

msgid "T. Perspicacity Bay"
msgstr "Bahía Perpicaz T."

msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with the Thurion."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con Turion."

msgid ""
"This bay allows your ship to carry four Thurion Perspicacity fighters. It "
"comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
"fighters.\n"
"\n"
"The Thurion Perspicacity Bay uses a modular design construction process that "
"intelligently adapts the fighter frame depending on local nebula volatility."
msgstr ""

msgid "T. Perspicacity Dock"
msgstr "Muelle Perpicaz T."

msgid "You need at least 30% reputation with the Thurion."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 30% de reputación con Turion."

msgid ""
"This dock allows your ship to carry a pair of Thurion Perspicacity fighters. "
"It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
"fighters.\n"
"\n"
"The Thurion Perspicacity Dock uses a modular design construction process "
"that intelligently adapts the fighter frame depending on local nebula "
"volatility."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "T. Scintillation Bay"
msgstr "Centelleo Turion"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This bay allows your ship to carry a pair of Thurion Scintillation bombers. "
"It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
"bombers."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía de combate permite a tu nave llevar un par de bombarderos de la "
"clase Chamán Sirio. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los bombarderos."

msgid "Z. B. Drone B."
msgstr "B. Dron Z. B."

msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This bay can launch two wings of bomber drones capable of bombarding enemy "
"capital ships into submission without the mothership ever coming into "
"danger. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the drones."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía puede lanzar dos ramas de drones bombarderos capaces de "
"bombardear las naves capitales enemigas hasta la rendición sin que la nave "
"nodriza llegue a estar en peligro. Viene con todos los dispositivos "
"requeridos para el mantenimiento y el vuelo de los drones."

msgid "Z. B. Drone mB."
msgstr "mB Dron P. Z."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 30% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos una reputación de 30 con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This bay can launch a wing of bomber drones capable of bombarding enemy "
"capital ships into submission without the mothership ever coming into "
"danger. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
"flight of the drones."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía puede lanzar un rama de drones bombarderos capaces de bombardear "
"las naves capitales enemigas hasta la rendición sin que la nave nodriza "
"llegue a estar en peligro. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para "
"el mantenimiento y el vuelo de los drones."

msgid "Z. H. Drone B."
msgstr "B.Dron P. Z."

msgid "You need at least 60% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 60% de reputación con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This bay can launch an entire squadron of drones capable of fighting all but "
"the biggest ships in packs. It comes with all the devices required for the "
"maintenance and flight of the drones."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía puede lanzar un escuadrón entero de drones capaz de luchar contra "
"todas las naves, excepto las más grandes, en grupos. Viene con todos los "
"dispositivos requeridos para el mantenimiento y el vuelo de los drones."

msgid "Z. H. Drone mB."
msgstr "mB. Dron P. Z."

msgid "You need at least 40% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 40% de reputación con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This bay can launch three heavy drones, giving the mothership a good deal of "
"punch. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight "
"of the drones."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía puede lanzar tres drones pesados, lo que da a la nave nodriza una "
"buena dosis de potencia. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los drones."

msgid "Z. L. Drone B."
msgstr "B. Dron L. Z."

msgid ""
"This bay is built to launch a swarm of Za'lek Light Drones. The drones are "
"expendable, but in numbers they excel at clearing enemy light craft. It "
"comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
"drones."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía está construida para lanzar un enjambre de drones ligeros Za'lek. "
"Los drones son descartables, pero en número sobresalen en la limpieza de las "
"naves ligeras enemigas. Viene con todos los dispositivos requeridos para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los drones."

msgid "Z. L. Drone mB."
msgstr "mB. Dron L. Z."

msgid ""
"This bay is built to launch a quartet Za'lek Light Drones. The drones are "
"expendable, but in numbers they excel at clearing enemy light craft. It "
"comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
"drones."
msgstr ""
"Esta bahía está construida para lanzar un cuarteto de drones ligeros Za'lek. "
"Los drones son descartables, pero en número sobresalen en la limpieza de las "
"naves ligeras enemigas. Viene con todos los dispositivos necesarios para el "
"mantenimiento y el vuelo de los drones."

msgid "Flow Ability"
msgstr "Habilidad Flujo"

msgid ""
"Focusing flow power allows the creation of ethereal manifestations that can "
"interact directly with reality. These manifestations take the form of ships "
"that are able to engage with enemies of the user, as long as flow is "
"sustained."
msgstr ""
"Concentrar el poder del flujo permite crear manifestaciones etéreas que "
"pueden interactuar directamente con la realidad. Estas manifestaciones "
"adoptan la forma de naves capaces de enfrentarse a los enemigos del usuario, "
"siempre que se mantenga el flujo."

msgid ""
"By turning flow inwards to oneself, one can embody all the virtues of the "
"Sirichana significantly increasing all aspects of the ship being flown."
msgstr ""
"Volviendo el flujo hacia uno mismo, se pueden encarnar todas las virtudes de "
"Sirichana aumentando significativamente todos los aspectos de la nave "
"pilotada."

msgid ""
"Flow can be used to purify the immediate environment of the ship, bathing "
"allies in soothing psychic emanations, while scorching enemies in damaging "
"chakra burns."
msgstr ""
"El Flujo puede utilizarse para purificar el entorno inmediato de la nave, "
"bañando a los aliados en emanaciones psíquicas calmantes y abrasando a los "
"enemigos con dañinas quemaduras de chakra."

msgid ""
"While most modern travel techniques rely on folding space to make long "
"distance become short, the feather drive technique uses flow to unfold the "
"ship instead. This not only allows a ship to nearly instantly travel short "
"distances, hostile ships that are hit have their energy drain, and the "
"residual psychic shockwaves additionally slow them down."
msgstr ""
"Mientras que la mayoría de las técnicas modernas de viaje se basan en el "
"plegado del espacio para hacer que las distancias largas se hagan cortas, la "
"técnica del impulso pluma utiliza en su lugar el flujo para desplegar la "
"nave. Esto no sólo permite que una nave recorra distancias cortas casi "
"instantáneamente, sino que las naves hostiles que son alcanzadas ven drenada "
"su energía, y las ondas de choque psíquicas residuales las ralentizan "
"adicionalmente."

msgid ""
"It's not clear how this flow ability came to be, but stories tell of a "
"pirate who took too many flow mushrooms and ended up locked up in the "
"lavatory with a large mirror. When they managed to get them out, they "
"claimed they had a very long and in-depth conversation with their other "
"selves. The plurality of self concept was then refined with flow amplifiers "
"to be able to project multiple copies of one's ship to amplify the raw "
"destructive power. It has become a favourite of those who have been able to "
"master the skill."
msgstr ""
"No está claro cómo surgió esta habilidad de fluir, pero se cuentan historias "
"de un pirata que tomó demasiadas setas de flujo y acabó encerrado en el "
"lavabo con un gran espejo. Cuando consiguieron sacarlo, afirmaron que "
"tuvieron una conversación muy larga y profunda con sus otros yo. El concepto "
"de pluralidad del yo se perfeccionó después con amplificadores de flujo para "
"poder proyectar múltiples copias de la propia nave y amplificar así el poder "
"destructivo total. Se ha convertido en una de las habilidades favoritas de "
"aquellos que han sido capaces de dominarla."

msgid ""
"A technique developed by a dreamer pirate only known as \"Snort\", by "
"focusing large amounts of flow into a very concentrated area, and then "
"letting it overpower your psyche to become one with the void, it is possible "
"to create what can only be described as a rip in reality. Unlike the more "
"controlled flow abilities that can distinguish between friend and foe, the "
"uncontrolled field affects all ships alike, seemingly slowing time on the "
"outside."
msgstr ""
"Una técnica desarrollada por un pirata soñador sólo conocido como \"Snort\", "
"al concentrar grandes cantidades de flujo en un área muy concentrada, y "
"luego dejar que domine tu psique te conviertes en uno con el vacío, es "
"posible crear lo que sólo puede describirse como una desgarro en la "
"realidad. A diferencia de las habilidades de flujo más controladas, que "
"pueden distinguir entre amigos y enemigos, el campo incontrolado afecta a "
"todas las naves por igual, aparentemente ralentizando el tiempo en el "
"exterior."

msgid ""
"One of the first abilities all Sirii Cadets learn. Flow is focused into a "
"ball which is then hurled at the target. Proficient users are able to create "
"multiple seeking chakra at once."
msgstr ""
"Una de las primeras habilidades que aprenden todos los cadetes Siri. El "
"flujo se concentra en una bola que se lanza contra el objetivo. Los usuarios "
"expertos pueden crear varios chakras de búsqueda a la vez."

msgid "Flow Amplifier"
msgstr "Amplificador de Flujo"

msgid ""
"Although all Sirius ships are equipped with internal flow amplifiers, some "
"are also created as independent units for ships without builtin flow "
"capabilities. Flow Amplifiers are specially tuned to the crew and allow "
"significantly amplifying their psychic abilities to aid the ship with "
"different abilities."
msgstr ""
"Aunque todas las naves Sirio están equipadas con amplificadores de flujo "
"internos, también se crean algunos como unidades independientes para naves "
"sin capacidades de flujo incorporadas. Los amplificadores de flujo están "
"especialmente sintonizados con la tripulación y permiten amplificar "
"significativamente sus capacidades psíquicas para ayudar a la nave con "
"diferentes habilidades."

msgid "Flow Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Flujo"

msgid ""
"By tapping into the flow of each individual, the flow resonator can tune and "
"establish a direct link between the flow amplifier and the personal flow "
"generation. This allows the ship to gain flow regeneration, albeit to only "
"half of the full potential."
msgstr ""
"Al aprovechar el flujo de cada individuo, el resonador de flujo puede "
"sintonizar y establecer un vínculo directo entre el amplificador de flujo y "
"la generación de flujo personal. Esto permite que la nave gane en "
"regeneración de flujo, aunque sólo a la mitad de su máximo potencial."

msgid ""
"A meditation chamber integrated directly into the ship. This allows the crew "
"to aid the ship's flow capabilities and acts as an auxiliary flow buffer. A "
"flow amplifier is required for the meditation chamber to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Una cámara de meditación integrada directamente en la nave. Esto permite a "
"la tripulación ayudar a las capacidades de flujo de la nave y actúa como un "
"amortiguador de flujo auxiliar. Se necesita un amplificador de flujo para "
"que la cámara de meditación haga efecto."

msgid "This ship is in bad shape and works much less well than usual."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For the most demanding famous pirates, the Black Agate Finishing gives a "
"luxurious coat to any ship, while not only being cosmetic, but having some "
"functional properties. Although the maker claims that it is made from "
"crushed virgin black agates mined from the interior of the gas giant Qorel "
"I, it is likely it is made from minerals extracted from the asteroid belt or "
"stolen goods. Popular as a status symbol among those pirates that can afford "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgid "The ship has serious design defects that limit its functionality."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An escape pod that will automatically eject when the ship has taken fatal "
"damage."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The \"Gauntlet Deluxe\" service provides a full retweak and overhaul of the "
"systems forward and turret weapon circuitry. The optimizations are able to "
"slightly increase the power without any significant drawback other than the "
"high cost of the service itself. Due to the nature of the service, only one "
"can be applied to each ship."
msgstr ""
"El servicio \"Guantelete de Lujo\" proporciona una revisión completa de los "
"circuitos de las armas torreta del sistema. Las optimizaciones consiguen "
"aumentar ligeramente la potencia sin más inconvenientes que el elevado coste "
"del propio servicio. Debido a la naturaleza del servicio, sólo se puede "
"aplicar una vez a cada nave."

msgid ""
"This service focuses on refining and polishing the launcher systems to "
"maximize the missile fire power of the ship. It is a comprehensive and in-"
"depth optimization that has to be done on a per-ship basis, with specialized "
"technicians tuning everything for maximum efficiency. Due to the nature of "
"the service, only one can be applied to each ship."
msgstr ""
"Este servicio se centra en refinar y pulir los sistemas de lanzamiento para "
"maximizar la potencia de fuego de misiles de la nave. Se trata de una "
"optimización exhaustiva y en profundidad que debe realizarse por buque, con "
"técnicos especializados que afinan todo para obtener la máxima eficacia. "
"Debido a la naturaleza del servicio, sólo puede aplicarse uno por buque."

msgid ""
"This ship sustained heavy damage when captured and is barely operational."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This ship is maintained at extremely rigorous Proteron military standards, "
"with a highly trained and zealous crew."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Most ships are designed with ample tolerances around the hyperdrive fuel "
"tanks, in order to avoid unhappy surprises to the captain. However, most "
"expert ship engineers will tell you they're not actually necessary, although "
"few will actually go through the trouble and responsibility to retool a "
"ship's hyperdrive making it a rare modification to find.\n"
"#oThis outfit can not be removed once equipped.#0"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Most ships are designed to withstand the harshness of space, with the "
"comfort of the pilot and crew as a nearly forgotten secondary concern. "
"Realizing that not every captain wants to command a sealed coffin, and "
"inspired by the success of the Gawain, Nexus Shipyards now provides a full "
"luxurious overhaul of a ship. Velvet curtains, cushioned panel coating, "
"fully automatic bidets, and a Captain's Chair with 27 degrees of freedom and "
"a 500-page manual are just some of the perks that are included in this ship "
"make-over."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fortune is like an onrushing river pushing an impenetrable wall of water "
"ahead of it. It is possible to build dams and walls to try to contain the "
"flow, but there is no way to prevent the water from hitting."
msgstr ""
"La suerte es como un río caudaloso que empuja un muro impenetrable de agua "
"delante de él. Es posible construir presas y muros para intentar contener el "
"caudal, pero no hay forma de impedir que el agua golpee."

msgid ""
"In order to achieve goals, decisiveness becomes a necessity. A quick strike "
"can determine the outcome of an encounter."
msgstr ""
"Para poder alcanzar objetivos, la decisión se convierte en una necesidad. Un "
"golpe rápido puede determinar el resultado de un encuentro."

msgid ""
"Virtue is the bulwark against the fickle whims of fortune. One can master "
"their own will by mastering their own character."
msgstr ""
"La virtud es el baluarte contra los caprichos de la suerte. Uno puede "
"dominar su propia voluntad dominando su propio carácter."

msgid ""
"Carefully handcrafted markings that indicate a captured vessel as belonging "
"to a pirate. Pirate craftsmen take great pride in the aesthetics and details "
"of ship, maybe even more so than the more functional aspects. Detailing a "
"captured ship with pirate branding will immediately make the ship "
"recognizable by other pilots, especially non-clans pirates, who will respect "
"the captain of the ship more. The details are sophisticated enough that most "
"non-pirate captains are completely unable to tell the ship apart from a "
"regular one. Popular craftsmen have cycles-long waiting lists for their work."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Although many ships go through a tuning process during their mass "
"production, it is far from perfect with imperfections leading to suboptimal "
"performance. Port and polish consists of a complete in-depth tuning of the "
"ship to bring out its best. Since it requires taking apart, fine-tuning, and "
"putting back together large parts of a ship, the cost increases "
"significantly with the size of the ship."
msgstr ""
"Aunque muchas naves pasan por un proceso de puesta a punto durante su "
"producción en serie, éste dista mucho de ser perfecto, con imperfecciones "
"que conducen a un rendimiento subóptimo. El proceso de puerto y pulido "
"consiste en una puesta a punto completa y en profundidad de la nave para "
"sacar lo mejor de ella. Dado que requiere desmontar, afinar y volver a "
"montar grandes partes de una nave, el coste aumenta significativamente con "
"el tamaño de la nave.\n"
"#oEste equipo no puede quitarse una vez equipado.#0"

msgid ""
"The ship seems to have been tainted by whatever is subverting people into "
"the Lost you met in Wild Space. It has spread completely throughout the "
"ship, significantly complicating life support systems, for which only a "
"reduced crew can be used. Although your common sense encourages to avoid it, "
"the taint apparently seems to significantly harden the ship against the "
"nebula radiation."
msgstr ""

msgid "This ship is extremely worn down and is barely functional."
msgstr ""

msgid "Agamemnon L."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Agamemnon Fission Torpedo is a two-stage atomic weapon, designed to "
"cripple capital armour with an initial impact before triggering an immense "
"nuclear explosion as a finishing blow."
msgstr ""

msgid "Convulsion L."
msgstr "Convulsión L."

msgid ""
"The Thurion interceptor class missile focus on high agility rather than "
"destructive power. While it does little damage to physical objects it is "
"quite effective at disrupting shields."
msgstr ""
"El misil de clase interceptora Turion se centra en la alta agilidad más que "
"en la potencia destructiva. Aunque hace poco daño a los objetos físicos, es "
"bastante eficaz a la hora de interrumpir los escudos."

msgid "Electron Burst C."
msgstr "Ráfaga Electrón C."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 20 reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos una reputación de 50 con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This powerful energy weapon is built to bombard from great range with ion "
"bursts, causing debilitating damage to a target's shields and electrical "
"systems, which can leave a ship effectively defenceless. It was developed by "
"the Za'lek for use on their heavier drones to supplement the short range and "
"high damage of their beams."
msgstr ""

msgid "EMP Grenade L."
msgstr "Granadas PEM L."

msgid ""
"This launcher can fire EMP grenades in any direction using a unique internal "
"guidance system. The grenades unleash an electromagnetic pulse upon impact, "
"rapidly disabling the electronics of nearby ships, hostile or otherwise. "
"Useful for taking ships alive; the EM pulses rarely destroy the ship, "
"leaving it floating disabled in space. These are favoured by traders for "
"keeping pirates at bay."
msgstr ""
"Este lanzador puede disparar granadas PEM en cualquier dirección utilizando "
"un sistema de guía interno único. Las granadas desatan un pulso "
"electromagnético al impactar, que deshabilita rápidamente la electrónica de "
"las naves enemigas. Es útil para capturar naves con vida; los pulsos "
"electromagnéticos rara vez destruyen la nave, y la deja flotando "
"incapacitada en el espacio. Los comerciantes las prefieren para mantener a "
"raya a los piratas."

msgid "E. Huntsman L."
msgstr "Cazahombres E. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enygma Systems found that there was an unexploited niche for weapons built "
"to disable large warships. Finding Medusa missiles and ion weaponry "
"insufficient, they redesigned Unicorp's Caesar IV torpedo as a heavy EMP "
"weapon, capable of rapidly frying the systems of even the largest capital "
"ships."
msgstr ""
"Sistemas Enigma descubrió que había un nicho sin explotar en las armas de "
"inutilización dirigidas a las naves de guerra más grandes. Al considerar "
"insuficientes los misiles Medusa y el armamento iónico, rediseñaron el "
"torpedo Cesar IV de Unicorp como un arma PEM pesada, capaz de freír "
"rápidamente los sistemas de incluso las naves de guerra más grandes."

msgid "E. Spearhead L."
msgstr "Punta de Lanza E. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Spearhead class EMP missile is one of Enygma Systems' more specialized "
"pieces of hardware. Its sole function is to do massive damage to shielding. "
"It uses a special energy discharge warhead that is quite effective at "
"disrupting shields, but has little effect on physical objects. The "
"Spearhead's limited agility make it primarily suited to fighting corvette "
"class ships or heavier."
msgstr ""
"El misil PEM rompeescudos de clase Punta de Lanza es una de las piezas más "
"especializadas de Sistemas Enigma. Su única función es causar un daño masivo "
"a los escudos. Utiliza una ojiva especial de descarga de energía que es "
"bastante eficaz para interrumpir los escudos, pero tiene poco efecto sobre "
"los objetos físicos. La agilidad limitada del Punta de Lanza lo hace "
"adecuado principalmente para luchar contra naves de clase corbeta o más "
"pesadas."

msgid "E. Fury T. L."
msgstr "Furia E. T. L"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enygma Systems has developed a turret mounted Fury launcher. It comes at a "
"steep price, but Fury missiles can be a powerful means of discouraging "
"pirate fighters and an effective defence against hostile bombers."
msgstr ""
"Sistemas Enigma ha desarrollado un lanzador Furia montado en una torreta. "
"Tiene un precio elevado, pero los misiles Furia pueden ser un poderoso medio "
"para amedrentar a los cazas piratas y un medio eficaz para defenderse de "
"bombarderos hostiles."

msgid "E. Headhunter T. L."
msgstr "Cazacabezas T. L."

msgid ""
"These turreted launchers are sometimes employed by cruiser captains whose "
"ships aren't manoeuvrable enough to effectively combat enemy fighters and "
"bombers. The punch of the Headhunter missile combined with Enygma Systems' "
"swivel mounted launcher can effectively compensate for any blind spots."
msgstr ""
"Estas torretas lanzadoras son empleadas a veces por los capitanes de "
"cruceros cuyas naves no son lo suficientemente maniobrables como para "
"combatir eficazmente a cazas y bombarderos enemigos. La potencia del misil "
"Cazacabezas, combinada con el lanzador giratorio de Sistemas Enigma, puede "
"compensar eficazmente cualquier punto ciego."

msgid "M. Amoeba Hive"
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 40% reputation with the Soromid."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 40% de reputación con Soromida."

msgid ""
"This launcher is an extensively bioengineered hive of spaceflight-capable "
"single celled organisms. On demand, a pheromone release with a complex "
"biologically encoded target signature will signal the colony's 'defense "
"response', and an amoeba will be released to pursue a matching target. It "
"will rupture on contact, releasing a particularly potent soup of bioplasma "
"to melt through the target's hull. The biological systems they use to sense "
"and track their targets are exceptionally difficult to jam through "
"conventional methods. This larger variant of plasmoid amoeba is most "
"effective against slow, armoured targets."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Pincushion B."
msgstr "Convulsión L."

msgid ""
"Designed for incapacitating enemy fleets, the Pincushion Battery can launch "
"5 Needle missiles at once, each with their own independent tracking unit. "
"The stochastic guidance system is designed to minimize the necessary "
"computation power, allowing the weapon to be mounted on a large diversity of "
"ships. Each missile contains micro-fragmenting payloads designed to disrupt "
"the shielding of an enemy ship."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Launches 1 missile at the target and 4 additional missiles that will target "
"random nearby enemies. Lowers shield regeneration by -70% on hit."
msgstr ""

msgid "P. Amoeba Colony"
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 30% reputation with the Soromid."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 30% de reputación con Soromida."

msgid ""
"This launcher is an extensively bioengineered colony of spaceflight-capable "
"single celled organisms. On demand, a pheromone release with a complex "
"biologically encoded target signature will signal the colony's 'defense "
"response', and a pair of amoebae will be released to pursue a matching "
"target. They will rupture on contact, releasing a soup of bioplasma to melt "
"through the target's hull. The biological systems they use to sense and "
"track their targets are difficult to jam through conventional methods."
msgstr ""

msgid "R. Banshee L."
msgstr "Banshee T. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 15% reputation with House Dvaered."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con la Casa Dvaered."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Designed by House Dvaered for their Ancestors, this launcher features an "
"advanced, but very heavy reloading system that allows for an unparalleled "
"fire rate. The ammo storage is short, but it can be anticipated that either "
"the bomber or its target will have been destroyed before it is empty."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado por la Casa Dvaered para equipar a sus Ancestros, este lanzador "
"cuenta con un sistema de recarga avanzado, pero muy pesado, que permite una "
"cadencia de fuego sin igual. El depósito de munición es corto, pero se puede "
"anticipar que el bombardero o su objetivo habrán sido destruidos antes de "
"que se vacíe."

msgid "Shatterer L."
msgstr "Trizas L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This weapon, based on a Fury missile, is used by the Collective's heavy "
"drones as a bombardment tool against large targets. Weak individually, the "
"sheer numbers that the Collective could bring to bear make this weapon "
"dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Esta arma, basada en un misil Furia, es utilizada por los drones pesados del "
"Colectivo como herramienta de bombardeo contra grandes objetivos. Aunque es "
"débil individualmente, el gran número que el Colectivo puede emplear hace "
"que esta arma sea peligrosa."

msgid "Space Mine L."
msgstr " Minas Espaciales C."

msgid ""
"The vastness of space limits the applicability of space mines in lieu of "
"automated or manned patrols in most situations. However, when raw explosive "
"power is mandated, nothing can surpass the destructive force of space mines."
msgstr ""
"La inmensidad del espacio limita la aplicabilidad de las minas espaciales en "
"lugar de patrullas automatizadas o tripuladas en la mayoría de las "
"situaciones. Sin embargo, cuando se requiere potencia explosiva bruta, nada "
"puede superar la fuerza destructiva de las minas espaciales."

msgid "SFC L."
msgstr "SFC L."

msgid "You need at least 30% reputation with House Dvaered."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 30% de reputación con la Casa Dvaered."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Mostly referred by its initials SFC, the Super-Fast Collider is basically a "
"giant Mace rocket used by Dvaered capships to strike distant enemies."
msgstr ""
"El Colisionador SuperRápido, más conocido por sus siglas CSR, es básicamente "
"un cohete Maza gigante utilizado por las naves Dvaered para golpear a los "
"enemigos distantes."

msgid "T. Banshee L."
msgstr "Banshee T. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"TeraCom has equipped its Banshee launcher model with high grade reload and "
"tube cooling systems, giving a significant boost to rate of fire. These "
"unguided rockets, while slow, can do respectable damage even to fairly large "
"ships in the hands of a competent pilot."
msgstr ""
"TeraCom ha equipado su modelo de lanzador Banshee con sistemas de recarga y "
"refrigeración de válvulas de alto grado, lo que da un impulso significativo "
"a la velocidad de disparo. Estos cohetes no guiados, aunque son lentos, "
"pueden causar un daño bastante respetable incluso a naves bastante grandes."

msgid "T. Fury L."
msgstr "Furia T. L."

msgid ""
"TeraCom's Fury Launcher is a high-performance missile launcher equipped with "
"patented target tracking and missile arming technology, allowing pilots to "
"get a lock on targets quickly and easily. While lacking in destructive "
"power, the Fury missiles launched are nimble enough to easily strike even "
"some of the fastest ships in the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"El lanzador Furia de TeraCom es un lanzador de misiles de alto rendimiento "
"equipado con una tecnología patentada de seguimiento de objetivos y armado "
"de misiles, que permite a los pilotos fijar los objetivos de forma rápida y "
"sencilla. Aunque carecen del poder destructivo, los misiles Furia lanzados "
"son lo suficientemente ágiles como para golpear fácilmente incluso a algunas "
"de las naves más rápidas de la galaxia."

msgid "T. Headhunter L."
msgstr "Cazacabezas T. L."

msgid ""
"This is TeraCom's model Headhunter launcher. Though somewhat pricey and "
"demanding on the ship's resources, the patented tracking and missile arming "
"technology allows pilots to fire their missiles before the competition does. "
"The Headhunter missiles can deal devastating damage to small and medium-"
"sized distant enemies, while remaining reasonably fast and agile."
msgstr ""

msgid "T. Imperator L."
msgstr "Emperador T. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"TeraCom decided not to develop a launcher for the Caesar IV, as it fell "
"short of the company's performance standards. Instead, the company released "
"a completely new torpedo specification. At present, the Imperator class "
"heavy torpedo provides devastating destructive power, though it may take a "
"while for it to reach its target. Faster cruisers may be able to outrun it "
"completely."
msgstr ""
"TeraCom decidió no desarrollar un lanzador para el Cesar IV, porque no "
"cumplía los requisitos de rendimiento de la empresa. En su lugar, la "
"compañía lanzó una especificación de torpedo completamente nueva. En la "
"actualidad, el torpedo pesado de la clase Emperador proporciona un poder "
"destructivo devastador, aunque tarda en alcanzar su objetivo. Los cruceros "
"más rápidos podrían superarlo por completo."

msgid "T. Mace L."
msgstr "Maza T. L."

msgid ""
"The Mace class unguided rocket is a cheap, expendable weapon used to boost "
"peak firepower in tight situations. It is far better at dealing damage to "
"light targets than most fighter sized energy cannons, but comes with the "
"disadvantage of running out of ammunition after only a short time of fire."
msgstr ""
"El cohete no guiado de la clase Maza es un arma barata y prescindible que se "
"utiliza para aumentar la potencia de fuego máxima en situaciones difíciles. "
"Es mucho mejor infligiendo daño a objetivos ligeros que la mayoría de los "
"cañones de energía del tamaño de un caza, pero tiene la desventaja de que se "
"queda sin munición después de un corto tiempo de fuego."

msgid "T. Medusa L."
msgstr "Medusa T. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Medusa class EMP cruise missile is a nonlethal weapon designed to knock "
"out a ship's internal systems, rendering it harmless and ready for boarding. "
"The warhead does little physical damage, so even lightly armoured targets "
"can be effectively disabled with this weapon. However, the Medusa is not the "
"most agile missile on the market."
msgstr ""
"El misil de crucero PEM de la clase Medusa es un arma no letal diseñada para "
"inutilizar los sistemas internos de una nave, dejándola inofensiva y lista "
"para el abordaje. La ojiva sólo causa daños limitados, por lo que incluso "
"los objetivos poco blindados pueden ser incapacitados eficazmente con esta "
"arma. Sin embargo, el Medusa no es el misil más ágil del mercado."

msgid "T. Vengeance L."
msgstr "Venganza T. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Vengeance class interceptor missiles are the heaviest interceptor missiles "
"currently in production. Almost half the missile hull is used for payload, "
"which reduces its ability to catch up to fast targets. It's designed to "
"excel at destroying highly armoured targets at the expense of poor "
"performance penetrating shields. Best paired with anti-shield weapons. "
"TeraCom's patented launcher hardware considerably reduces the time it takes "
"to achieve a lock. Sometimes, those few seconds can make all the difference."
msgstr ""
"Los misiles interceptores de la clase Venganza son los más pesados que se "
"fabrican actualmente. Casi la mitad del casco del misil se utiliza para la "
"carga útil, lo que disminuye su capacidad para alcanzar objetivos veloces. "
"Está diseñado para matar a los objetivos blindados a costa de ser débil "
"contra escudos. Es mejor emparejarlo con armas antiescudo. El hardware del "
"lanzador, patentado por TeraCom, reduce considerablemente el tiempo que se "
"tarda en alcanzar un objetivo. A veces, esos pocos segundos pueden marcar la "
"diferencia."

msgid "T. Convulsion L."
msgstr "Convulsión T. L."

msgid ""
"The Thurion interceptor class missile focus on high agility rather than "
"destructive power. While it does little damage to physical objects it is "
"quite effective at disrupting shields.\n"
"\n"
"This launcher is mounted on a turret and has more ammo capacity than the "
"standard launcher."
msgstr ""
"El misil de clase interceptora Turion se centra en la alta agilidad más que "
"en la potencia destructiva. Aunque hace poco daño a los objetos físicos, es "
"bastante eficaz a la hora de interrumpir los escudos.\n"
"\n"
"Este lanzador está montado en una torreta y tiene más capacidad de munición "
"que el lanzador estándar."

msgid "U. Caesar IV L."
msgstr "Cesar IV U. L."

msgid ""
"Caesar IV class torpedoes are among the most common torpedo weapons "
"available. Though much slower than missiles and useless against mobile "
"targets, they remain manoeuvrable enough to chase down cruisers."
msgstr ""
"Los torpedos de la clase Cesar IV están entre las armas de torpedo más "
"comunes disponibles. Aunque son mucho más lentos que los misiles y resultan "
"inútiles contra objetivos móviles, siguen siendo lo suficientemente "
"maniobrables como para perseguir cruceros."

msgid "U. Storm L."
msgstr "Tormenta U. L."

msgid "You need at least 30% reputation with the Empire."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 30% de reputación con el Imperio."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Storm missiles and launchers were designed by Unicorp to be the guided "
"equivalent to a Mace rocket. However, despite the undeniable ability of "
"Unicorp to design functional and cheap outfits, the result ended up way too "
"costly to mass-equip the Navy with. For that reason, only the Imperial elite "
"squadrons use this very deadly weapon."
msgstr ""
"Los misiles y lanzadores Tormenta fueron diseñados por Unicorp para ser el "
"equivalente guiado de un cohete Maza. Sin embargo, a pesar de la innegable "
"capacidad de Unicorp para diseñar equipos funcionales y baratos, el "
"resultado resultó ser demasiado costoso para equipar en masa a la Marina "
"Espacial. Esta es la razón por la que sólo los escuadrones de élite "
"imperiales utilizan esta arma tan mortífera."

msgid "Z. Hunter L."
msgstr "Cazador Zl. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Za'lek have found conventional missiles and torpedoes woefully primitive "
"compared to their miniaturized drone technology. Thus, they began work on "
"fabricating kamikaze drones to replace them, and the efforts have been "
"fruitful indeed. The hunter-killer drone accelerates towards its target and "
"unleashes its ferromagnetohydraulic payload to deadly effect."
msgstr ""
"Los Za'lek empezaron a encontrar que los misiles y torpedos convencionales "
"eran lamentablemente primitivos en comparación con su tecnología de drones "
"miniaturizados. Por ello, comenzaron a trabajar en la fabricación de drones "
"kamikaze para sustituirlos. Los resultados han dado un fruto mortal con el "
"dron cazador-asesino. Acelera hacia su objetivo y libera su carga útil "
"ferromagnética-hidráulica con un efecto mortal."

msgid "Z. Predator L."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 20% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The classic Hunter launcher has proven too unwieldy to equip on the Za'lek's "
"mass-produced bomber drones. The Predator is a downsized version modelled "
"for those drones, but suitable for any light vessel. The compact design of "
"the launcher has nessesitated heavy compromises, especially to the targeting "
"subsystem, to the point of it being closer to a simple missile than a drone "
"by itself. Thus, it's a poor fit for anything other than what it excels at "
"if brought to bear in numbers: harming medium-to-large sized enemy ships "
"from a safe distance."
msgstr ""

msgid "Z. Reaper L."
msgstr "Segador Zl. L."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This weapon stretches the term 'miniaturized drone' nearly to its breaking "
"point. It is effectively a standard drone platform slimmed down to "
"accommodate a huge ferromagnetohydraulic bomb. It's the Za'lek's answer to "
"torpedoes from less advanced nations, and an eloquent answer it certainly is."
msgstr ""
"Esta arma lleva el término \"dron miniaturizado\" casi hasta su punto de "
"ruptura. En efecto, se trata de una plataforma de drones estándar reducida, "
"a la que se le ha sustituido casi todo en favor de una enorme bomba "
"ferromagnética-hidráulica. Es la respuesta de los Za'lek a los torpedos de "
"las naciones menos avanzadas, y una respuesta elocuente."

msgid "This map contains information about the local system."
msgstr "Este mapa contiene información sobre el sistema local."

msgid ""
"This map charts the known jumps that connect the systems occupied by the "
"Collective. Sadly, the Empire has no accurate intel about Collective assets "
"in the area."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa traza los saltos conocidos que conectan los sistemas ocupados por "
"el Colectivo. Lamentablemente, el Imperio no dispone de información precisa "
"sobre los recursos del Colectivo en la zona."

msgid ""
"This map lists the locations of all Dvaered worlds and stations close to the "
"Dvaered capital."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa recoge la ubicación de todos los mundos Dvaered y las estaciones "
"cercanas a la capital Dvaered."

msgid ""
"This map contains the main trade route between Empire and Soromid controlled "
"space."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la principal ruta comercial entre el espacio controlado "
"por Imperio y Soromida."

msgid ""
"This map lists the locations of all Imperial worlds and stations close to "
"the Imperial capital."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa recoge la ubicación de todos los mundos imperiales y las "
"estaciones cercanas a la capital Imperial."

msgid ""
"This map contains the location of the two-way hidden jump point between the "
"FLF base and the nearest Pirate stronghold."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la ubicación del punto de salto oculto bidireccional "
"entre la base FLF y la fortaleza Pirata más cercana."

msgid ""
"This map contains the location of hidden jump points between the FLF base "
"and Frontier space."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la ubicación de los puntos de salto ocultos entre la base "
"FLF y el espacio Frontera."

msgid ""
"This map contains the location of a hidden jump point leading to the inner "
"nebula."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la ubicación de un punto de salto oculto que lleva a la "
"nebulosa interior."

msgid ""
"A map revealing a hidden jump point from Kretogg to NGC-14549, leading to "
"the Black Lotus Clan-controlled hypergate."
msgstr ""
"Un mapa que revela un punto de salto oculto desde Kretogg a NGC-14549, que "
"conduce a la hiperpuerta controlado por el Clan Loto Negro."

msgid ""
"This map contains the position of hidden jump points leading straight into "
"Za'lek space."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la posición de los puntos de salto ocultos que llevan "
"directamente al espacio Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This map contains border of the Nebula with Dvaered/Imperial space. It also "
"lists the deepest Imperial station within the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la frontera de la Nebulosa con el espacio Dvaered/"
"Imperio. También enumera la estación Imperial más profunda dentro de la "
"Nebulosa."

msgid ""
"This map contains the position of a set of hidden jump points in and around "
"the New Haven system."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la posición de un conjunto de puntos de salto ocultos en "
"el sistema Nuevo Refugio y sus alrededores."

msgid ""
"This map contains the locations of the pirate clan worlds, and a few "
"stations that are known to offer opportunities for pirates in the vicinity."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene las ubicaciones de los mundos de los clanes piratas, y "
"algunas estaciones que se sabe que ofrecen oportunidades para los piratas en "
"los alrededores."

msgid ""
"This map contains the location of the jump points in and out of the Qorel "
"Tunnel, a set of systems not accessible through standard jump points. "
"Getting the location of these very special jump points is usually very "
"costly to reduce the number of people having access to it."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la ubicación de los puntos de salto dentro y fuera del "
"Tunel Qorel, un conjunto de sistemas a los que no se puede acceder a través "
"de los puntos de salto estándar. Conseguir la ubicación de estos puntos de "
"salto tan especiales suele ser muy costoso para reducir el número de "
"personas que tienen acceso a ellos."

msgid "This map contains the systems that lead to Sirius controlled space."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene los sistemas que conducen al espacio controlado por Sirio."

msgid ""
"This map contains the location of Mutris, home of Sirichana and capital to "
"the Sirians, as well as the surrounding systems."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la ubicación de Mutris, hogar de Sirichana y capital "
"Sirio, así como los sistemas colindantes."

msgid ""
"This map contains the location of the Sol system, the origin of mankind. "
"Rendered dead by the Incident, it is now covered by a highly unstable nebula "
"which no known ship in the galaxy can safely pass through. What lies beyond "
"Sol, if anything, is unknown."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene la ubicación del sistema Sol, el origen de la humanidad. "
"Declarado muerto por el Incidente, ahora está cubierto por una nebulosa muy "
"inestable que ninguna nave conocida en la galaxia puede atravesar con "
"seguridad. Lo que hay más allá de Sol, si es que hay algo, es desconocido."

msgid ""
"This map contains an east-west route through Frontier space, as well as the "
"location of the Frontier Council."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene una ruta este-oeste a través del espacio Frontera, así "
"como la ubicación del Consejo Frontera."

msgid ""
"This map provides the hidden route to the Thurion core systems outside of "
"the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa proporciona la ruta oculta a los sistemas principales de Turion "
"fuera de la Nebulosa."

msgid ""
"This map contains the heart of Za'lek space, including its capital Ruadan "
"and central hub, Za'lek."
msgstr ""
"Este mapa contiene el corazón del espacio Za'lek, incluyendo su capital "
"Ruadan y el eje central, Za'lek."

msgid "For cheating."
msgstr "Para hacer trampas."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Through long-honed craftsmanship, pirate software engineers are able to "
"create near perfect replicas of the Heavy Combat Vessel Licence. However, "
"this comes at a significant mark-up compared to the standard licence prices. "
"This licence will authorize you to buy cruiser and carrier-class ships on "
"worlds that perform background checks."
msgstr ""
"Gracias a su larga experiencia, los ingenieros de software piratas son "
"capaces de crear réplicas casi perfectas de la Licencia de Buque de Combate "
"Pesado. Sin embargo, esta licencia tiene un precio muy superior al de la "
"licencias estándar. Esta licencia te autorizará a comprar naves de clase "
"crucero y portanaves en los mundos que realizan comprobaciones de "
"antecedentes."

msgid "Heavy Combat Vessel"
msgstr "Nave de Combate Pesado"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Through long-honed craftsmanship, pirate software engineers are able to "
"create near perfect replicas of the Heavy Weapon Licence. However, this "
"comes at a significant mark-up compared to the standard licence prices. This "
"licence will authorize you to buy and use heavy weapons, like the heavy ion "
"turret, on worlds that perform background checks."
msgstr ""
"Gracias a su larga experiencia, los ingenieros de software pirata son "
"capaces de crear réplicas casi perfectas de la Licencia de Armas Pesadas. "
"Sin embargo, esta licencia tiene un precio muy superior al de las licencias "
"estándar. Esta licencia te autoriza a comprar y utilizar armas pesadas, como "
"la torreta de iones pesada, en los mundos que realizan comprobaciones de "
"antecedentes."

msgid "Heavy Weapon"
msgstr "Arma Pesada"

msgid "Fake License"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Unlike the Great Houses, independent goverments have fairly limited "
"databases and resources to spend on tracking individuals. This presents "
"itself as a great opportunity to those who both wish to make a quick credit "
"selling their identity, and those who are in need of such new identity."
msgstr ""

msgid "Outfit corresponding with the \"Brushed\" GUI."
msgstr "Modelo correspondiente a la GUI \"Pulida\"."

