msgid "Medium Weapon"
msgstr "Arma Media"

msgid ""
"A licence issued by the Astra Vigilis of the Space Trader's society that "
"authorizes you to do mercenary missions and, more importantly, collect "
"bounties."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Gacha"
msgstr "Vracha"

msgid ""
"A mystery outfit of the finest quality! Guaranteed to be of two star rarity. "
"You will not know what you get until you buy it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Map"
msgstr "Mapa"

msgid ""
"A treasure map leading to something that could turn out to be useful. "
"However, you won't know what there is until you find it."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "D. Flare B."
msgstr "Bengala"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Point Defence"
msgstr "Defensa Punto"

msgid ""
"Also known as the Dvaered Firework Battery, the Flare Battery is able to "
"launch cluster munitions with large areas of effect to mow down enemy "
"interceptors and incoming ordinances. What the individuals lack in "
"destructive power is made up for in the sheer amount that are packed into "
"each individual flare. When not being used for destructive purposes, Dvaered "
"Warlords are known for putting on extravagant displays from suborbital "
"positions. Although most Warlords opt for no-explosive munitions in the "
"displays, it is not entirely uncommon for them to just use the normal "
"flares, which has led to more than one major incident in the past."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Guardian I.S."
msgstr "Ruadan II"

msgid ""
"Marketed as a unified system for intercepting missiles and interceptors, the "
"Guardian Interception System is a favourite of merchants and mercenaries "
"alike. Although it lacks the sufficient firepower to efficiently take down "
"torpedoes and other heavy ordnance, it excels at tracking lighter missiles "
"and can even be used to deter small assault craft."
msgstr ""
"Comercializado como un sistema unificado para interceptar misiles e "
"interceptores, el Sistema de Interceptación Guardián es el favorito de "
"mercaderes y mercenarios por igual. Aunque carece de la potencia de fuego "
"suficiente para derribar torpedos y otros artefactos pesados, destaca en el "
"seguimiento de misiles más ligeros e incluso puede utilizarse para disuadir "
"a pequeñas naves de asalto."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Guardian O.S."
msgstr "Guardia A"

msgid ""
"The Guardian Overseer System is a complete rework of the original Guardian "
"Interception System. Instead of basing itself on weaker laser turrets, the "
"system makes use of specially modified Ripper cannons that allow it to "
"neutralize most ordnance. Although designed for intercepting torpedoes, the "
"targeting system is also efficient at tracking small enemy craft."
msgstr ""
"El Sistema de Supervisor Guardian es una revisión completa del Sistema de "
"Interceptación Guardian original. En lugar de basarse en torretas láser más "
"débiles, el sistema hace uso de cañones destripadores especialmente "
"modificados que le permiten neutralizar la mayoría de las proyectiles. "
"Aunque está diseñado para interceptar torpedos, el sistema también es eficaz "
"en el seguimiento de pequeñas naves enemigas."

msgid "Overwatch CIWS"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Overwatch Close In Weapons System, or CIWS, is the application of "
"Proteron pulse laser technology to automated anti-missile tracking and "
"defense. Its rapid rate of fire and effective penetration can make quick "
"work of even a large volume of incoming ordinance. Although designed for "
"intercepting torpedoes, the targeting system is also efficient at tracking "
"small enemy craft."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ratchet P.D."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Ratchet was a popular weapon used during the Dvaered revolts by the "
"Dvaered revolutionaries. Although they lacked power and reliability, they "
"were easily mass produced helping turn the tide of war. Similar to the "
"original Ratchet, the Ratchet Point Defence launches explosive cluster "
"rounds that break and detonate in a large area, making them effective at "
"clearing groups of interceptors or missiles. Unlike the original model, the "
"point defence system has a much higher reliability thanks to tighter "
"tolerances and controls giving it significantly more reliability."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Actually consisting of a small colony of space-hardened parasites, known as "
"Spittle Tubuloids, that leech from the ship energy systems to provide "
"defensive cover. They have been genetically engineered to detect the weak "
"radiation and gravitational signals of incoming ordnance to activate their "
"defence mechanism of spitting large bubbles of plasma. Although the bubbles "
"are quite weak compared to engineered weapons, their numbers allow them to "
"efficiently protect the ship they are attached to from non-armoured missiles."
msgstr ""
"En realidad consiste en una pequeña colonia de parásitos endurecidos en el "
"espacio, conocidos como Tubuloides Escupidores, que se alimentan de los "
"sistemas de energía de la nave para proporcionar cobertura defensiva. Han "
"sido modificados genéticamente para detectar la débil radiación y las "
"señales gravitatorias de las ordenanzas entrantes para activar su mecanismo "
"de defensa de escupir grandes burbujas de plasma. Aunque las burbujas son "
"bastante débiles en comparación con las armas de ingeniería, su número les "
"permite proteger eficazmente a la nave a la que están unidas de misiles no "
"blindados."

msgid ""
"The Za'lek Interception Beam System or ZIBS uses uses a 16-faceted "
"polyhedral focusing crystal which enables very accurate and quick movements, "
"allowing it to effectively intercept incoming missiles and even quickly "
"track small interceptor craft. While most beam weapons make significant "
"concessions to increase the limited weapon range, by minimizing concessions, "
"the initial prototype resulted in a much more powerful penetrating beam. "
"Field-testing quickly showed that the weapon was of very limited use in non-"
"point defence roles, which resulted in the creation of the ZIBS-16, and "
"later ZIBS-32 line of beam-based point defence."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ZIBS-32 was a topic of much controversy when it was first developed, "
"almost leading to important ruptures between multiple military engineering "
"teams. A larger, more powerful counterpart to the ZIBS-16 had just been "
"prototyped, making use of two 16-side faceted polyhedral focusing crystals "
"that would power a single beam. The original designers called it the "
"ZIBS-32, which many other engineers took as a personal affront, considering "
"that it should be called the ZIBS-16x2 (or perhaps even the ZIBS-2x16). "
"Eventually, after many strongly worded letters, several resignations, and "
"the hijacking of a Za'lek Battleship, the issue was officially closed with "
"the name ZIBS-32, and any further discussion became taboo. Although some say "
"you can still find drunk disgruntled Za'lek engineers grumbling about the "
"ZIBS-16x2 in spaceport bars across the House Za'lek territory."
msgstr ""

msgid "This weapon is a cheat. It is not meant to be used by players."
msgstr ""
"Esta arma es una arma tramposa. No está pensada para ser utilizada por los "
"jugadores."

#, fuzzy
msgid "F.W. Laser Cannon"
msgstr "Lancelot Cuatro Vientos"

#, fuzzy
msgid "F.W. Ragnarok Beam"
msgstr "Rayo Ragnarok"

msgid "Armour Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Blindaje"

msgid ""
"This plating developed by House Dvaered takes a unique, yet somewhat brute-"
"force approach to increasing armour strength. By constantly pumping energy "
"through electromagnetic shielding coils spread throughout the hull, armour "
"strength is substantially increased at the cost of dramatically increased "
"energy usage."
msgstr ""
"Este revestimiento, desarrollado por la Casa Dvaered, adopta un enfoque "
"único, aunque algo brusco, para aumentar la resistencia del blindaje. "
"Mediante el bombeo constante de energía a través de bobinas de blindaje "
"electromagnético repartidas por todo el casco, la resistencia del blindaje "
"se incrementa sustancialmente a costa de un aumento drástico del consumo de "
"energía."

msgid ""
"This armour plating does not provide any protection, instead it makes the "
"ship harder to detect. It has integrated sensors that measure the ambient "
"radiation around the ship and is able to emit space-resolved the right "
"amount of radiation to appear invisible for passive sensors."
msgstr ""
"Este blindaje no proporciona ninguna protección, sino que hace que la nave "
"sea más difícil de detectar. Lleva integrados unos sensores que miden la "
"radiación ambiental que rodea a la nave y es capaz de emitir la cantidad de "
"radiación adecuada para parecer invisible a los sensores pasivos."

msgid "A.P.U. I"
msgstr ""

msgid "CPU Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de CPU"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An additional processing unit to supplement the main processor of the core "
"system, giving small ships a little more processing power."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de procesamiento adicional para complementar el procesador "
"principal del sistema base, dando a las naves pequeñas un poco más de poder "
"de procesamiento."

msgid "A.P.U. II"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An additional processing unit to supplement the main processor of the core "
"system, giving medium ships a little more processing power."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de procesamiento adicional para complementar el procesador "
"principal del sistema base, dando a las naves medianas un poco más de poder "
"de procesamiento."

msgid "A.P.U. III"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An additional processing unit to supplement the main processor of the core "
"system, giving large ships a little more processing power."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de procesamiento adicional para complementar el procesador "
"principal del sistema base, dando a las naves grandes un poco más de poder "
"de procesamiento."

msgid "A.P.U. IV"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An additional processing unit to supplement the main processor of the core "
"system, giving capital ships a little more processing power."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de procesamiento adicional para complementar el procesador "
"principal del sistema base, dando a las naves capitales un poco más de poder "
"de procesamiento."

msgid "Energy Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Energía"

msgid ""
"A large battery unit designed to hold 250 GJ of energy. Small enough to "
"mount on many light vessels."
msgstr ""
"Una gran unidad de batería diseñada para contener 250 GJ de energía. Lo "
"suficientemente pequeña como para montarla en muchas naves ligeras."

msgid ""
"A large battery unit designed to hold 500 GJ of energy. Ideally mounted on "
"medium-to-large vessels."
msgstr ""
"Una gran unidad de batería diseñada para contener 500 GJ de energía. Ideal "
"para montarla en naves de tamaño medio-grande."

msgid ""
"A very large battery unit designed to hold 1000 GJ of energy. It can only be "
"mounted on very large ships."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de batería muy grande diseñada para contener 1000 GJ de energía. "
"Solo puede montarse en naves muy grandes."

msgid ""
"A massive battery unit designed to hold 1500 GJ of energy. Given the mass of "
"this battery, it's advisable to only mount it on capital ships."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme unidad de batería diseñada para contener 1500 GJ de energía. Dada "
"la masa de esta batería, es aconsejable montarla solo en naves capitales."

msgid ""
"Biometal is an armour that regenerates itself due to genetically-engineered "
"bacteria throughout it. Due to the compartmentalization to permit bacterial "
"life, and the difficulty of cultivating the bacteria, Biometal has greater "
"mass than alternatives, and is the most expensive hull plating."
msgstr ""
"El Biometal es un blindaje que se regenera por sí mismo gracias a las "
"bacterias creadas genéticamente en su interior. Debido a la "
"compartimentación para permitir la vida bacteriana, y a la dificultad de "
"cultivar las bacterias, elBiometal tiene mayor masa que las alternativas, y "
"es el blindaje más caro."

msgid "Manoeuvrability Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Maniobrabilidad"

msgid ""
"Not much unlike the more primitive solar sails widely used prior to the "
"Second Growth, this is a small array of panels made to exploit sunlight and "
"similar radiation to propel the ship along. While not useful as a sole "
"method of propulsion, it can provide a minor aid in the ship's acceleration."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This enhancement routes energy from the ship's energy supplies to the "
"engine, giving the ship an increased acceleration and turning. It does not "
"directly increase the ship's max speed nor turning abilities, however, a "
"curious effect is that the engines can now also be run in reverse to allow "
"braking with a small loss in reverse thrust capability."
msgstr ""
"Esta mejora dirige la energía de los suministros de energía de la nave al "
"motor, dando a la nave una mayor aceleración y giro. No aumenta directamente "
"la velocidad máxima de la nave ni su capacidad de giro, pero un efecto "
"curioso es que ahora los motores también pueden funcionar en reversa para "
"permitir el frenado con una pequeña pérdida de capacidad de empuje en "
"reversa."

msgid ""
"By improving your ship's stabilization systems drastically, this "
"modification will allow you to reach higher speeds while still keeping the "
"ship stable. As another side effect, the improved stabilizers enable "
"reversing the thrusters with a small loss of thrust."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cargo Expansion"
msgstr "Expansión de Carga"

msgid ""
"Cargo pods are large containers that increase a ship's cargo capacity. Due "
"to being externally added to the ship's hull, it has the side effect of "
"slightly increasing the cargo inertia."
msgstr ""
"Las cápsulas de carga son grandes contenedores que aumentan la capacidad de "
"carga de una nave. Al ser añadidos externamente al casco de la nave, tienen "
"el efecto secundario de aumentar ligeramente la inercia de la carga."

msgid "Fuel Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Combustible"

msgid "The fuel pod allows a ship to store more fuel for hyperspace jumps."
msgstr ""
"La cápsula de combustible permite a la nave almacenar más combustible para "
"los saltos hiperespaciales."

msgid "Shield Booster"
msgstr "Potenciador de Escudo"

msgid ""
"A shield generator that feeds off the ship's main energy line. It will allow "
"you to regenerate your shield faster and give you a small shield capacity "
"boost, at the expense of draining some of the ship's energy."
msgstr ""
"Un generador de escudos que se alimenta de la línea de energía principal de "
"la nave. Te permitirá regenerar tu escudo más rápido y te dará un pequeño "
"aumento a la capacidad de los escudos, a costa de drenar parte de la energía "
"de la nave."

msgid ""
"Further developed from Nanobond plating, Microbond plating is a less dense, "
"lighter revision that's still stronger than Plasteel, making it a great "
"choice to strengthen the hull of a medium-sized ship."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollado a partir del revestimiento Nanovínculo, el revestimiento "
"Microvínculo es una revisión menos densa y más ligera que sigue siendo más "
"resistente que el Plastiacero, lo que lo convierte en una gran opción para "
"reforzar el casco de una nave de tamaño medio."

msgid ""
"Nanobond is the successor to Plasteel. It follows the same approach but has "
"a greatly refined manufacturing process, providing greater particle density. "
"The result is a much more robust material, although it is substantially more "
"expensive."
msgstr ""
"Nanovínculo es el sucesor del Plastiacero. Sigue el mismo planteamiento, "
"pero tiene un proceso de fabricación muy perfeccionado, que proporciona una "
"mayor densidad de partículas. El resultado es un material mucho más robusto, "
"aunque sustancialmente más caro."

msgid ""
"A ship without structural integrity is floating space junk. However, most "
"modern building standards are usually designed around worst-case scenarios "
"with significant reinforcement. While this does make the ship much more "
"robust, it can be overkill for those not expected to be in combat. Newer "
"nanofiber materials can also suit the job without compromising structural "
"integrity, allowing replacing parts of the ship's structural panels with "
"much lighter ones, significantly reducing the mass. It does come with a big "
"disclaimer saying it is not suited for combat, but that is more like a "
"suggestion, right?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shield Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador Escudo"

msgid ""
"A modification to the ship's shields that allows them to resist nebular "
"volatility."
msgstr ""
"Una modificación de los escudos de la nave que les permite resistir la "
"volatilidad nebular."

msgid ""
"Able to compensate up to 30 GW of nebula volatility. Uses 1 GW of energy per "
"GW of damage prevented."
msgstr ""
"Capaz de compensar hasta 30 GW de volatilidad de la nebulosa. Utiliza 1 GW "
"de energía por cada GW de daño evitado."

msgid ""
"Plasteel was one of man's greatest improvements on materials. It's a cheap, "
"strong armour that seems to take the best from both plastic and steel, "
"bending easily yet keeping its incredible strength. The Second Growth was "
"only possible with this material. Although it is no longer cutting-edge, its "
"low price point attracts many buyers."
msgstr ""
"El plastiacero fue uno de los mayores logros del hombre en materiales. Una "
"blindaje barato y fuerte que parece tomar lo mejor del plástico y del acero, "
"doblándose fácilmente pero manteniendo su increíble fuerza. El Segundo "
"Crecimiento sólo fue posible con este material. Aunque ya no es puntero, su "
"bajo precio atrae a muchos compradores."

msgid "Power Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Energía"

msgid ""
"Adding a complementary reactor to your ship is a great way to get that extra "
"energy boost you need. This does not replace the existing reactor but works "
"alongside it and hooks up directly to the energy flux."
msgstr ""
"Añadir un reactor complementario a tu nave es una buena manera de conseguir "
"ese impulso de energía extra que necesitas. No sustituye al reactor "
"existente, sino que funciona junto a él y se conecta directamente al flujo "
"de energía."

msgid ""
"The class II reactor uses a newer fusion technology than the class I, "
"permitting it to have greater energy density. The result is a mid-sized "
"reactor that is best used on ships with moderate energy demands."
msgstr ""
"El reactor de clase II utiliza una tecnología de fusión más reciente que la "
"de clase I, lo que le permite tener una mayor densidad energética. El "
"resultado es un reactor de tamaño medio que se utiliza mejor en naves con "
"una demanda de energía moderada."

msgid ""
"The immense class III reactor provides enough power for nearly anything. The "
"technology used in this reactor is particularly groundbreaking, with the "
"best energy density of the three reactor classes. The huge size of the class "
"III results in it only fitting comfortably on large vessels, though its "
"energy output would be excessive for anything less."
msgstr ""
"El inmenso reactor de clase III proporciona suficiente energía para casi "
"todo. La tecnología utilizada en este reactor es particularmente innovadora, "
"con la mejor densidad energética de las tres clases de reactores. El enorme "
"tamaño de la clase III hace que sólo quepa cómodamente en las naves grandes, "
"aunque su producción de energía sería excesiva para algo menos."

msgid ""
"An enhancement for the shield power system, giving small ships a better "
"chance of escaping attackers."
msgstr ""
"Una mejora para el sistema de energía de los escudos, que da más "
"posibilidades a las naves pequeñas de escapar de atacantes."

msgid ""
"A more powerful shield enhancer, providing better protection during "
"skirmishes."
msgstr ""
"Un potenciador de escudo más potente, que proporciona una mejor protección "
"durante las escaramuzas."

msgid ""
"A heavy duty shield enhancer for ships that face combat on a regular basis."
msgstr ""
"Un potenciador de escudos de alta potencia para las naves que se enfrentan "
"al combate de forma habitual."

msgid ""
"The pinnacle in shield boosting technology, reinforcing the defences of "
"ships fighting on the front lines."
msgstr ""
"La cúspide de la tecnología de aumento de escudos, que refuerza las defensas "
"de las naves que luchan en el frente."

msgid "Pheromone Emitter"
msgstr "Emisor de Feromonas"

msgid ""
"It is not clear how exactly bioships communicate with each other, however, "
"what is clear is that they do not only use electromagnetic frequencies, but "
"also pheromones to influence and communicate with each other. This "
"experimental device is designed to mimic some observed pheromone patterns, "
"albeit with much more potency, and it may be able to have some influence on "
"bioships in some cases."
msgstr ""
"No está claro cómo se comunican exactamente las naves biológicas entre sí, "
"pero lo que sí está claro es que no sólo utilizan frecuencias "
"electromagnéticas, sino también feromonas para influirse y comunicarse entre "
"ellas. Este dispositivo experimental está diseñado para imitar algunos "
"patrones de feromonas observados, aunque con mucha más potencia, y puede ser "
"capaz de ejercer cierta influencia sobre las naves biológicas en algunos "
"casos."

msgid "Release bioship pheromones when used."
msgstr "Libera feromonas de bionave cuando se utiliza."

msgid ""
"This fully-automated bay contains unique and strangely ancient machinery "
"dedicated to the repair, rearming, and maintenance of a squadron of Black "
"Diamond fighter-bomber drones."
msgstr ""

msgid "System Improvement"
msgstr "Mejora del Sistema"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a module that interfaces with the navigation system of a ship, "
"modifying the core behaviour. By pushing to the limit the jump point "
"detection and calibration system, it is able to execute the required "
"preparations well in advance to jump at a moment's notice, however, this "
"comes at the cost of increasing the overall time needed to jump due to "
"necessary in-flight calibration."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un módulo que interactúa con el sistema de navegación de una "
"nave, modificando el comportamiento principal. Al llevar al límite el "
"sistema de detección y calibración de puntos de salto, es capaz de reducir "
"significativamente la cantidad de tiempo necesario para saltar, sin embargo, "
"esto tiene el coste de aumentar el tiempo total necesario para saltar debido "
"a la necesaria calibración en vuelo."

msgid ""
"Scales from an ancient feral bioship that have been repurposed as a "
"secondary hull layer. While they offer less overall armour, and barely any "
"cargo space, the scales are harder and are seemingly able to regenerate from "
"damage taken."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Built into the spinal structure of the Emerald Sword, one can only imagine "
"what terrible hatred could have motivated the creation of a weapon on such "
"scale. Firing it consumes a vast amount of energy in an instant in order to "
"spark a thermonuclear reaction, directing most of the energy from the "
"resulting explosion forwards in a devastatingly powerful beam of gamma "
"radiation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Aura"
msgstr "Aura"

msgid ""
"Developed as part of a confidential Empire program to push the limits of "
"shield technology, the Executor Shield Aura uses polarized electromagnetic "
"fields to remotely overdrive nearby ships. Through careful modulation of the "
"polarization, the effect can be restricted to a subset of ships. Given the "
"advanced technical requirements such as calibration and rare resources "
"necessary, few of such devices are available, and their usage is limited to "
"the fearsome Imperial Executors."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollado como parte de un programa confidencial del Imperio para superar "
"los límites de la tecnología de escudos, el Aura de Escudo Ejecutor utiliza "
"campos electromagnéticos polarizados para sobrecargar a distancia las naves "
"cercanas. Mediante una cuidadosa modulación de la polarización, el efecto "
"puede restringirse a un subconjunto de naves. Dados los avanzados requisitos "
"técnicos, como la calibración, y los raros recursos necesarios, hay pocos "
"dispositivos de este tipo disponibles, y su uso se limita a los temibles "
"Ejecutores Imperiales."

msgid ""
"A fake transponder to make ships appear to be a non-descript and harmless "
"independent ship."
msgstr ""
"Un transpondedor falso para hacer que las naves parezcan una nave "
"independiente indescriptible e inofensiva."

msgid ""
"Makes the ship appear as independent to other ships. Becomes temporarily "
"void when discovered."
msgstr ""
"Hace que la nave aparezca como independiente ante otras naves. Se anula "
"temporalmente cuando se descubre."

msgid ""
"While the process of refining fuel for space ships is possible using cheap "
"available materials with the adequate machinery, production is usually "
"limited to large immobile stations or astral bodies. By sacrificing "
"machinery size and complexity, the Fuel Recycler is able to synthesize fuel "
"in a very compact form. The downside is that the device ends up "
"significantly reducing efficiency and requiring large amounts of raw "
"materials to generate fuel. Despite this, such generation can be useful for "
"long space journeys or when in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el proceso de refinado de combustible para naves espaciales es "
"posible utilizando materiales baratos disponibles con la maquinaria "
"adecuada, la producción suele limitarse a grandes estaciones inmóviles o "
"cuerpos astrales. Al sacrificar el tamaño y la complejidad de la maquinaria, "
"el Reciclador de Combustible es capaz de sintetizar combustible de forma muy "
"compacta. El inconveniente es que el dispositivo acaba reduciendo "
"significativamente la eficiencia y necesitando grandes cantidades de "
"materias primas para generar combustible. A pesar de ello, esta generación "
"puede ser útil para largos viajes espaciales o cuando se está en apuros."

msgid "#gAllows converting space resources to fuel.#0"
msgstr "#gPermite convertir los recursos del espacio en combustible.#0"

msgid ""
"An experimental hull design for scout ships that would allow them to "
"significantly increase their travel range by using a porous hull material "
"that can directly store fuel. The novel design allows significantly "
"increasing the fuel reservoirs of any ship without any complicated "
"interventions or structural changes. Although the design was lauded as ahead "
"of its time, it never really gained in popularity to make it into mainline "
"production. It might have to do with turning the entire ship into a "
"tinderbox and leaking fuel when sustaining damage, but who knows?"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Hades Torch would be an exceptional afterburner except for the minor "
"detail that to obtain maximum performance it has a tendency to burn the hull "
"of the ship it is attached to."
msgstr ""
"La Antorcha de Hades sería un postquemador excepcional si no fuera por el "
"pequeño detalle de que, para obtener el máximo rendimiento, tiene tendencia "
"a quemar el casco de la nave a la que se acopla."

msgid "#rHot hot hot!#0"
msgstr "#r¡Quema Quema Quemat!#0"

msgid ""
"This core system is easily recognizable as the work of some amateurs, with "
"sloppy wiring and dangerously exposed internals. However, unlike mass "
"manufactured cores, you can tell that a lot of love and care has gone into "
"developing the unit. While the shield and computation power are less than "
"most similar cores, it has significantly better developed functionality in "
"other areas."
msgstr ""
"Este sistema base es fácilmente reconocible como obra de algunos "
"aficionados, con un cableado descuidado y unas partes internas "
"peligrosamente expuestas. Sin embargo, a diferencia de los núcleos "
"fabricados en serie, se nota que se ha puesto mucho cariño y cuidado en el "
"desarrollo de la unidad. Aunque el escudo y la potencia de cálculo son "
"inferiores a los de la mayoría de los núcleos similares, tiene una "
"funcionalidad considerablemente mejor desarrollada en otras áreas."

msgid ""
"It's not clear if this weapon was originally a laser cannon or ion cannon, "
"but through many iterations of replacing parts with scraps combined with "
"prolonged usage has changed into something mostly unrecognizable. "
"Functionally, it has evolved to be a mix of energy and ion weapon that would "
"take a Za'lek scientist the good part of the decade to figure out and make "
"for a good article in the peculiarly named Journal of Experimental Weaponry "
"and Penguin Subspecies."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A mix and match of the best scraps found from derelicts and abandoned "
"facilities across the stars. They are jerry-rigged together to work "
"surprisingly well, providing a diversity of bonuses to the equipping ship, "
"although not excelling in any particular task."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This sail-like structural array is a prototype modular ramscoop. It is "
"capable of passively harvesting small amounts of hyperspace fuel from "
"stellar wind, even in star systems with low levels of charged particles and "
"radiation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Usually used by repairers when performing critical ship maintenance on the "
"field, PatchiGel quickly allows keeping a highly damaged hull spaceworthy. "
"Although designed for exterior application, housing it under the primary "
"plating allows for quick application to the damaged areas, resulting in a "
"self-healing armour that further increases in healing capacity as damaged. "
"The downside is that it takes up the valuable space necessary for a "
"secondary hull layer."
msgstr ""

msgid "P.S. T-IVa 'Qickshell'"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Research Log UST 102:2718\n"
"   The last prototype has exceeded expectations in shield regeneration "
"capabilities, this may be the breakthrough we were hoping for. With such "
"incredible results, the Empire shall surely see the power of the clustered "
"sentience interface. Although the shield capacity parameters are suboptimal, "
"that is just a matter of time. It is only a matter of time before Project "
"Thurion becomes the technological backbone of civilization!\""
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Pulse Scanner takes an alternate approach to regular scanning devices "
"for detecting ships. The hardware is heavily modified to not work in the "
"continuous regime, but generate an extremely large signal pulse and then "
"analysing the reflection responses that other ships give. This results in "
"being able to significantly improve the detection capability of a ship for "
"short periods of time, although with the side effect of increasing the "
"visibility of the ship generating the pulse. Furthermore, the pulse is "
"strong enough to pick up nearby faint traces and can be useful for detective "
"work."
msgstr ""
"El Escáner de Pulso adopta un enfoque alternativo a los dispositivos de "
"escaneo habituales para la detección de naves. El hardware está fuertemente "
"modificado para no trabajar en régimen continuo, sino generar un pulso de "
"señal extremadamente grande y luego analizar las respuestas de reflexión que "
"dan otras naves. El resultado es que se puede mejorar significativamente la "
"capacidad de detección de una nave durante cortos periodos de tiempo, aunque "
"con el efecto secundario de aumentar la visibilidad de la nave que genera el "
"pulso. Además, el pulso es lo suficientemente fuerte como para captar "
"rastros débiles cercanos y puede ser útil para el trabajo de investigación."

msgid ""
"Activates for 5 seconds with a 15 second cooldown period.\n"
"#pCan be used for tracking anomaly signals.#0"
msgstr ""
"Se activa durante 5 segundos con un periodo de enfriamiento de 15 segundos.\n"
"#pPuede usarse para rastrear señales de anomalía.#0"

msgid ""
"It's not clear how Misi got the goods to sell and they evade questions on "
"the topic, however, the Squadron Synchronizer Module can be easily connected "
"to any ship to increase the amount of ships it can command efficiently and "
"accurately. At its core it seems to change some of the underlying algorithms "
"to be more efficient to use less bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"No está claro cómo Misi consiguió la mercancía para venderla y evade las "
"preguntas sobre el tema, sin embargo, el Módulo Sincronizador de Escuadrón "
"puede conectarse fácilmente a cualquier nave para aumentar la cantidad de "
"naves que puede comandar de forma eficiente y precisa. En esencia, parece "
"cambiar algunos de los algoritmos subyacentes para que sean más eficientes y "
"utilicen menos ancho de banda."

msgid ""
"The Valkyrie Beam is a heavily modified version of the Ragnarok Beam, where "
"the shields of the ship are significantly rerouted into the beam weapon to "
"increase the output damage. The result is an incredibly potent beam that has "
"a tendency to leave the ship as a sitting duck if it is unable to destroy "
"the target in a single shot."
msgstr ""
"El Rayo Valquiria es una versión muy modificada del Rayo Ragnarok, en la que "
"los escudos de la nave se desvían significativamente hacia el arma del rayo "
"para aumentar el daño de salida. El resultado es un rayo increíblemente "
"potente que tiende a dejar la nave como un blanco fácil si no puede destruir "
"el objetivo de un solo disparo."

msgid "#rDrains 80 shield per second when firing and for one second after.#0"
msgstr ""
"#rDrena 80 de escudo por segundo al disparar y durante un segundo después.#0"

msgid ""
"This device seems to be almost like a parasite that hooks up to the ship's "
"systems. It's not exactly clear what it does, but it seems to feed on the "
"emitted radiation, allowing the ship to remain undetected longer when near "
"other ships."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo parece ser casi un parásito que se conecta a los sistemas "
"de la nave. No está muy claro qué hace, pero parece alimentarse de la "
"radiación emitida, lo que permite a la nave pasar desapercibida durante más "
"tiempo cuando se encuentra cerca de otras naves."

msgid ""
"The ZD-5 Guardian Unit is designed as a last resort defence system, using "
"strong magnetic fields to forcibly keep the ship hull integrity as long as "
"energy can hold out. The small layout limits the maximum damage the unit can "
"compensate. Originally meant to be used for next generation Za'lek drones, "
"although the reasons are not very clear, the project was cancelled and only "
"very few experimental models still exist."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Uses energy to stop lethal damage with 50% efficiency. Can only stop a "
"maximum of 200 damage per second."
msgstr ""
"Utiliza energía para detener el daño letal con una eficacia del 50%. Solo "
"puede detener un máximo de 200 de daño por segundo."

msgid ""
"This device hooks up to the ship's weapon systems and allows launching "
"projectiles at higher velocities and further than usual. This indeed comes "
"with a performance penalty, however."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mining System"
msgstr "Sistema de Minería"

msgid ""
"Any scanner can give the mass, position and velocity of an asteroid. But "
"miners prefer to know the asteroid's value. For that purpose, Milspec "
"designed a scanner array able to deduce the surface composition from "
"spectroscopy, and, what is more impressive, to infer the internal "
"composition via inverse electrical impedance. Of course, that comes at a "
"price that not just any miner can pay."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier escáner puede dar la masa, la posición y la velocidad de un "
"asteroide. Pero los mineros prefieren conocer el valor del asteroide. Para "
"ello, Milspec diseñó un conjunto de escáneres capaces de deducir la "
"composición de la superficie a partir de la espectroscopia y, lo que es más "
"impresionante, de inferir la composición interna mediante la impedancia "
"eléctrica inversa. Por supuesto, eso tiene un precio que no puede pagar "
"cualquier minero."

msgid "A.M. Scrambler"
msgstr ""

msgid "Electronic Warfare Scrambler"
msgstr "Distorsionador de Guerra Electrónica"

msgid ""
"Instead of reflecting signals or drowning nearby space with noise, this "
"advanced scrambler pulses radiation over the ship's hull, using computated "
"noise patterns to mimic the background radiation of nearby space, acting as "
"effective camouflage to sensors and weapon tracking systems. This auto-"
"modulation process imposes a small computational burden on the ship's "
"computer to maintain."
msgstr ""

msgid "Speed Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador de Velocidad"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Berserk Chip is a dangerous thing, used by only the most reckless of "
"pilots. It can be integrated into a ship to override most of the basic "
"functionality, rerouting it into combat capabilities. This comes at a very "
"high expense to the internal systems and physical condition of the ship and "
"can only be used for a short time. Newer versions have a safety shutoff "
"which automatically turn off the chip before hull integrity collapses."
msgstr ""
"El Chip Frenético es algo peligroso, que sólo utilizan los pilotos más "
"temerarios. Puede integrarse completamente en una nave para anular la mayor "
"parte de la funcionalidad básica y redirigirla hacia las capacidades de "
"combate. Esto tiene un coste muy elevado para la integridad del casco y los "
"sistemas de la nave y sólo puede utilizarse durante un corto periodo de "
"tiempo. Las versiones más recientes cuentan con una desconexión de seguridad "
"que apaga automáticamente el chip antes de que la integridad del casco se "
"colapse."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Incurs a large amount of shield and armour damage over time, and shuts down "
"automatically when hull integrity is below 20%."
msgstr ""
"Causa una gran cantidad de daño de escudo y armadura a lo largo del tiempo, "
"y se apaga automáticamente cuando la integridad del casco está por debajo "
"del 30%. Después de usarlo, hay un periodo de enfriamiento de 8 segundos "
"durante el cual el movimiento y la cantidad de daño se reducen en un 20%."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The blink drive uses hyperdrive technology modified to create a small space-"
"time fold allowing ships to instantly cross short distances. Pilots who "
"often use such devices tend to have a higher amount of strong headaches than "
"usual, but any effects more adverse than that have yet to be discovered."
msgstr ""
"El motor de destello utiliza tecnología de hiperpropulsión modificada para "
"crear un pequeño pliegue espacio-temporal que permite a las naves cruzar "
"instantáneamente distancias cortas. Los pilotos que utilizan a menudo este "
"tipo de dispositivos suelen tener una cantidad de fuertes dolores de cabeza "
"superior a la habitual, pero debe ser seguro, ¿no?"

msgid "Boarding Androids"
msgstr "Androides de Abordaje"

msgid ""
"The Asimov Destructicorp Boarding Android is the latest in robotic hostile "
"takeover technology. Equipped with a multifunction plasma blaster/cutting "
"torch/can opener/spatula, the Boarding Android is ready for any situation, "
"be it tactical or culinary."
msgstr ""
"El Androide de Abordaje de Asimov Destructicorp es lo último en tecnología "
"robótica de toma de control hostil. Equipado con un blaster de plasma "
"multifunción/antorcha cortante/abridor de latas/espátula, el Androide de "
"abordaje está preparado para cualquier situación, ya sea táctica o culinaria."

msgid ""
"The Boarding Android Mark 2 improves upon the wide variety of implements "
"sported by its predecessor, additionally including scissor-hands and a "
"sewing needle."
msgstr ""
"El Androide Mark 2 de Abordaje mejora la gran variedad de accesorios que "
"lucía su predecesor, incluyendo además unas tijeras y una aguja de coser."

msgid ""
"When hauling large amounts of cargo, general-purpose ship engines may become "
"overwhelmed and deliver a subpar performance. This device can be installed "
"within a ship's cargo bays to generate a weak directed gravitational field "
"to reduce the impact of cargo inertia on the ship's mobility and offset the "
"requirement for bulkier engines, though this will run counter to efforts to "
"avoid detection by gravitational sensors."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Designed by the Mining Vrata Guildhouse, the Catalytic Energy Drill takes a "
"radical new approach on asteroid mining, increasing efficiency and power at "
"the expense of ease of use. Instead of basing itself on more stable plasma "
"technology, it uses a multi-stage crystallite accelerator to focus an energy "
"beam. Although this results in a really compact and efficient design, due to "
"a tendency to overheat and self-destruct, the operating time is "
"significantly reduced, making skill an important factor in its successful "
"usage."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado por el Gremio de Mineros Vrata, el Taladro de Energía Catalítica "
"adopta un nuevo enfoque radical en la minería de asteroides, aumentando la "
"eficiencia y la potencia a expensas de la facilidad de uso. En lugar de "
"basarse en una tecnología de plasma más estable, utiliza un acelerador de "
"cristal de varias etapas para concentrar un haz de energía. Aunque esto da "
"como resultado un diseño realmente compacto y eficiente, debido a su "
"tendencia al sobrecalentamiento y a la autodestrucción, el tiempo de "
"funcionamiento se reduce significativamente, por lo que la destreza es un "
"factor importante para su uso con éxito."

msgid "#gAllows precise mining of asteroids to extract rare minerals.#0"
msgstr ""
"#gPermite la minería precisa de asteroides para extraer minerales raros.#0"

msgid "Uses 1 MJ of energy per 10 mass and drains shield in 0.5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Utiliza 1 MJ de energía por cada 10 masas y drena el escudo en 0,5 segundos."

msgid "Holograph Projector"
msgstr "Proyector de Hologramas"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The combat hologram projector uses state of the art technology to create a "
"hologram of a ship nearly indistinguishable from the real thing. Such "
"holographic displays are very efficient at drawing away enemy fire and "
"creating confusion, however, when engaged in actual combat the cover is "
"usually quickly blown away."
msgstr ""
"El proyector de hologramas de combate utiliza tecnología punta para crear un "
"holograma de una nave casi indistinguible de las reales. Estas pantallas "
"holográficas son muy eficaces para alejar el fuego enemigo y crear "
"confusión; sin embargo, cuando entran en combate real, la cobertura suele "
"desaparecer rápidamente."

msgid ""
"Creates a hologram of the current ship to distract the enemy ship target."
msgstr ""
"Crea un holograma de la nave actual para distraer al objetivo de la nave "
"enemiga."

msgid "Combat AI"
msgstr "IA de Combate"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This Combat AI augments a ship's functionality with a focus on agility. "
"Through careful regulation of the ship's thrusters, the AI is able to "
"increase both the overall acceleration and turn of the ship without actually "
"modifying the hardware nor increasing the energy consumption."
msgstr ""
"Esta IA de Combate aumenta la funcionalidad normal de la nave centrándose en "
"la agilidad. Mediante una cuidadosa regulación de los propulsores de la "
"nave, la IA es capaz de aumentar tanto la aceleración general como el giro "
"de la nave sin modificar realmente el hardware ni aumentar el consumo de "
"energía."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unlike regular Combat AIs which consist of pure software, this AI relies on "
"a quasi-organic coprocessor made with both living tissue and inorganic "
"material. Acting as a small temporal lobe, the coprocessor is able to "
"analyse all the available sensory data to predict future events, allowing "
"the ship to seemingly gain an edge over others in reaction times."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de la IA de Combate, que consiste en puro software, esta IA "
"consiste en un coprocesador casi orgánico hecho con tejido vivo y material "
"inorgánico. Actuando como un pequeño lóbulo temporal, el coprocesador es "
"capaz de procesar todos los datos sensoriales de la nave para predecir "
"eventos futuros, lo que permite a la nave ganar aparentemente una ventaja "
"sobre otras naves en el tiempo de reacción."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This Combat AI focuses on the optimization of the firing rhythm of forward-"
"mounted weapons. Through careful analysis of the weapons' firing cycles, the "
"AI is able to decide on seemingly trivial modifications to their parameters "
"that lead to an overall increase in fire rate."
msgstr ""
"Esta IA de Combate se centra en la optimización del ritmo de disparo de las "
"armas de montaje frontal. Mediante un cuidadoso análisis del ciclo de "
"disparo de las armas, la IA es capaz de realizar modificaciones "
"aparentemente triviales de los parámetros que conducen a un aumento general "
"de la cadencia de fuego."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This Combat AI utilizes advanced power routeing and process scheduling "
"controls to better distribute the ship's computing power between tasks, "
"allowing to get more use out of the hardware at hand without any increase in "
"energy use."
msgstr ""
"Esta IA de combate utiliza un avanzado enrutamiento de la energía para que "
"la potencia de cálculo de la nave sea más eficiente, lo que permite obtener "
"más potencia con el mismo uso de energía."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 10% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 10 de reputación con la Casa Za'lek."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Heavily inspired by bee and other insect colonies, the Hive Combat AI boosts "
"the amount of data shared between a carrier and its fighters, allowing for "
"increased efficiency in communication. This results in more efficient "
"movement of the fighters, and a better ability to respond to mishaps such as "
"lost fighters."
msgstr ""
"Muy inspirada en las colonias de abejas y otros insectos, la IA de combate "
"enjambre aumenta el intercambio de datos y parámetros entre un portanaves y "
"sus cazas, lo que permite una mayor eficacia en la comunicación. Esto se "
"traduce en un movimiento más eficiente de los cazas y en una mayor capacidad "
"de respuesta ante percances como la pérdida de cazas."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Like a hunter's ambush, the Hunting Combat AI is able to exploit the element "
"of surprise and the weaknesses of enemy ship hulls, resulting in a "
"significant increase in damage for turret weapons, albeit with a reduced "
"fire rate."
msgstr ""
"De forma similar a la emboscada de un cazador, la IA de Combate Cazador es "
"capaz de centrarse en explotar el elemento sorpresa y los puntos débiles de "
"los cascos de las naves enemigas, lo que se traduce en un aumento "
"significativo del daño de las armas de torreta, aunque con una cadencia de "
"fuego reducida."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Developed to solve needle in haystack-type problems, the Pinpoint Combat AI "
"excels at finding and locking onto small objects in the vastness of space. "
"Integrated into a ship's targeting systems, the AI is able to increase both "
"the range and the lock-on speed of all missile launchers on the ship."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollada para resolver problemas del tipo \"aguja en el pajar\", la IA "
"de combate Localizador destaca en la búsqueda y fijación de pequeños objetos "
"en la inmensidad del espacio. Al fusionarla con los sistemas de lanzamiento "
"de misiles de la nave, la IA es capaz de aumentar tanto el alcance como la "
"velocidad de fijación de todos los lanzadores de misiles de la nave."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This Combat AI focuses on optimization of the ship's sensor infrastructure. "
"By making small tweaks to the sensors' tolerances on the fly, it is able to "
"effectively increase the range at which other ships are detected."
msgstr ""
"Esta IA de combate se centra en la optimización de la infraestructura de "
"sensores de la nave. Haciendo pequeños ajustes en línea, es capaz de "
"aumentar eficazmente el alcance al que se detectan otras naves."

msgid "Conduit"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The charge conduit uses surplus shield energy to enhance a multitude of a "
"ship's systems, allowing the rest of the ship to return to pristine "
"condition rapidly once the shield capacitors are fully charged. It results "
"in some overall stability issues, but not enough to offset its contributions "
"in most cases."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Pipeline Conduit funnels excess shield energy into the ammunition and "
"fighter reconstruction pipelines, greatly speeding up those processes at the "
"cost of extra CPU use."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The targeting conduit redirects surplus shield energy into the targeting and "
"tracking systems of a ship, allowing for considerably more precise weapon "
"tracking and faster lock-ons while the shields are undamaged, though at the "
"cost of a slight reduction in peak damage output as a result of overloading "
"those systems."
msgstr ""
"El conducto de puntería redirige el excedente de energía de los escudos "
"hacia los sistemas de objetivo de una nave, lo que permite un tiempo de "
"fijación del objetivo mucho más rápido, aunque a costa de una reducción del "
"alcance debido a la inestabilidad inherente causada por la sobrecarga de "
"sistemas."

msgid "Armour Repair"
msgstr "Reparador de Blindaje"

msgid ""
"Repair nanobots are able to perform what seems nothing short of a miracle, "
"restoring the hull and armour of ships to pristine condition. While they "
"show remarkable behaviour in laboratory conditions, in practice they need a "
"fairly still environment to work in. The active cooling stage of a ship "
"provides an excellent opportunity for the nanobots to show what they are "
"fully capable of, however when the ship is in motion they go into "
"hibernation."
msgstr ""
"Los nanobots reparadores son capaces de realizar lo que parece poco menos "
"que un milagro, restaurando el casco y el blindaje de las naves hasta "
"dejarlo en perfectas condiciones. Aunque muestran un comportamiento notable "
"en condiciones de laboratorio, en la práctica necesitan un entorno bastante "
"tranquilo para trabajar. La fase de refrigeración activa de una nave ofrece "
"una excelente oportunidad para que los nanobots demuestren de lo que son "
"capaces, pero cuando la nave está en movimiento entran en hibernación."

msgid "Restores armour to full when performing an active cooldown."
msgstr "Restaura el blindaje al máximo cuando realiza un enfriamiento activo."

msgid ""
"This low maintenance droid crew will scour your ship to repair any damage "
"caused by space hazards. They are very small and able to work both on the "
"interior or exterior of the ship. Power is drawn from the ship to feed the "
"robots, although the load is generally very low compared to the benefits of "
"having a robotic repair crew. Due to the simplicity of the droid tools, they "
"are unable to restore armour beyond 50%."
msgstr ""
"Esta tripulación de droides de bajo mantenimiento recorrerá tu nave para "
"reparar cualquier daño causado por los peligros espaciales. Son muy pequeños "
"y pueden trabajar tanto en el interior como en el exterior de la nave. La "
"energía se extrae de la nave para alimentar a los robots, aunque la carga es "
"generalmente muy baja en comparación con los beneficios de tener una "
"tripulación de reparación robótica. Debido a la simplicidad de las "
"herramientas de los droides, no pueden restaurar el blindaje más allá del "
"50%."

msgid ""
"Compared to the base model, the Droid Repair Crew MK2 is able to patch up "
"the ship's hull at twice the speed using a new assorted set of tools, "
"included the coveted PatchiGel©. However, this comes with a trade-off of "
"being even more ineffective unless the hull is at fairly critical "
"conditions, when the gel is most effective."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shield Modification"
msgstr "Modificador de Escudo"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This piece of hardware provides an auxiliary energy shunt between the ship's "
"reactor and the shield system. When activated, this device dramatically "
"boosts the ship's shield regeneration by dumping raw energy directly into "
"the shield capacitors. The process is very inefficient, so energy use is "
"disproportionally high and the outfit can't be active for more than a "
"certain period of time before requiring a cooldown cycle."
msgstr ""
"Esta pieza de hardware proporciona una derivación de energía auxiliar entre "
"el reactor de la nave y el sistema de escudos. Cuando se activa, este "
"dispositivo aumenta drásticamente la regeneración de los escudos de la nave "
"vertiendo energía bruta directamente en los condensadores de los escudos. El "
"proceso es muy ineficiente, por lo que el uso de energía es "
"desproporcionadamente alto y el equipo no puede estar activo durante más de "
"un determinado periodo de tiempo antes de tener que entrar en un ciclo de "
"enfriamiento."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Not much unlike the Neural Accelerator Interface, the Emergency Stasis "
"Inducer creates a strong electromagnetic field around the ship, making time "
"appear to move slower for everything outside the ship while causing the ship "
"itself and everything inside to speed up, allowing it to move faster and do "
"far more damage than normal. Its implementation is tuned for a ship with its "
"shields down, the lack of interference allowing for much greater potency of "
"the effect. The mechanism is triggered automatically upon armour damage, "
"without need of manual intervention."
msgstr ""
"El inductor de estasis de emergencia funciona creando un fuerte campo "
"electromagnético alrededor de la nave, lo que hace que el tiempo parezca "
"moverse más lentamente de lo normal para todo lo que está fuera de la nave, "
"a la vez que hace que la nave y todo su equipo y actividades se aceleren. "
"Esto le permite moverse más rápido y hacer mucho más daño de lo normal. El "
"mecanismo se activa automáticamente al dañar el blindaje, sin necesidad de "
"intervención manual. No está del todo claro cómo se crea este efecto, pero "
"los médicos no recomiendan su uso prolongado."

msgid "Triggered on armour damage. Lasts 3 seconds with 8 seconds cooldown."
msgstr ""
"Se activa con el daño al blindaje. Dura 3 segundos con 8 segundos de "
"enfriamiento."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Flicker Drive is a compacted version of the Blink Drive, lowering the "
"power usage, blinking range, and amount of mass that can be blinked, "
"however, this comes at the advantaged of much higher mobility due to a lower "
"cooldown. The brief spatial folds it creates have a secondary effect of "
"obscuring the ship's gravitational footprint. Although most ships commonly "
"make use of afterburners to increase mobility, the Flicker Drive has a "
"strong following who claim it is superior to any alternatives."
msgstr ""
"El Motor de Parpadeo es una versión compactada del Motor Destello, que "
"reduce el consumo de energía, el alcance del parpadeo y la cantidad de masa "
"que puede saltar, pero con la ventaja de una movilidad mucho mayor gracias a "
"un menor enfriamiento. La incertidumbre que proporciona el motor de parpadeo "
"también tiene el efecto secundario de reducir la firma de la nave. Aunque la "
"mayoría de las naves suelen utilizar postcombustión para aumentar la "
"movilidad, el Motor de Parpadeo tiene muchos seguidores que afirman que es "
"superior a todas las alternativas."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Hellburner is one of the best light afterburners on the market. Through "
"proprietary pressurization ducts, the Hellburner is able to generate far "
"more thrust than generic alternatives. Unfortunately, its energy conversion "
"efficiency is lower than that of more generic models, so it consumes energy "
"more rapidly."
msgstr ""
"El Quemador Infernal es uno de los mejores postquemadores ligeros del "
"mercado. A través de conductos de presurización propios, es capaz de generar "
"mucho más empuje que las alternativas genéricas. Lamentablemente, su "
"eficiencia de conversión de energía es significativamente menor que la de "
"los modelos comunes, por lo que consume energía más rápidamente y se "
"sobrecalienta mucho más rápido."

msgid ""
"A specialized piece of sensor technology that can scan its immediate "
"surroundings for unusual anomalies in the fabric of space. Although short-"
"ranged and only capable of scanning for a limited amount of time before "
"needing to recharge, this scanner is capable of discovering jump points that "
"regular sensors can't detect."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza especializada de tecnología de sensores que puede escanear su "
"entorno inmediato en busca de anomalías inusuales en el tejido del espacio. "
"Aunque es de corto alcance y solo puede escanear durante un tiempo limitado "
"antes de tener que recargarse, este escáner es capaz de descubrir puntos de "
"salto que los sensores normales no pueden detectar."

msgid "Hull Coating"
msgstr "Recubrimiento de Casco"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Modern ionic weaponry has found ways to overcome the armour of a ship and "
"directly attack the vulnerable electronic systems. The Faraday Tempest "
"Coating is able to counteract disabling weaponry by dissipating the "
"radiation it impacts via harmless evanescent fields, greatly speeding up "
"recovery from system damage."
msgstr ""
"El armamento iónico moderno ha encontrado formas de superar el blindaje de "
"la nave y atacar directamente los sistemas electrónicos vulnerables. El "
"revestimiento Tempestad Faraday es capaz de contrarrestar el armamento "
"incapacitante disipándolo mediante campos evanescentes inofensivos, lo que "
"acelera enormemente la recuperación de los daños en el sistema."

msgid ""
"By modifying the micro-facets of the hull's surface using a triply periodic "
"minimal surface structure, the Lattice Thermal Coating is able to aid in the "
"regulation of ship internals without disrupting core functionality. This "
"allows for outfits to be used in quicker successions reliably and without "
"long-lasting damage."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Impacto-Plastic Coating"
msgstr "Recubrimiento Impacto-Plástico Milspec"

msgid ""
"The Milspec Impacto-Plastic Coating is based on memory nano-alloys that "
"resist both impact and damage, quickly restoring the protected surface to "
"its original state."
msgstr ""
"El Recubrimiento Impacto-Plástico Milspec se basa en nano-aleaciones con "
"memoria que resisten tanto el impacto como el daño, restaurando rápidamente "
"la superficie protegida a su estado original."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Protecting ships from nebula radiation is not an easy task given the "
"fluctuations and parameters of the different types of radiation being "
"emitted, much of which is not fully understood. While not making a ship "
"fully immune to the Nebula's effects, this hull coating does provide a "
"significant extra resistance, although prolonged exposure is still not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Proteger las naves de la radiación de la nebulosa no es una tarea fácil, "
"dadas las fluctuaciones y los parámetros de los diferentes tipos de "
"radiación que se emiten, gran parte de los cuales no se comprenden del todo. "
"Aunque no hace que una nave sea inmune a los efectos de la nebulosa, este "
"recubrimiento del casco hace que una nave sea significativamente más "
"resistente, aunque no se recomienda una exposición prolongada."

#, fuzzy
msgid "N. Concealment Coating"
msgstr "Recubrimiento Sigilo Nexus"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Modern ship sensors rely on detecting gravitational anormalities to spot "
"ships, a very robust approach in most situations. Nexus Shipyards have "
"developed a breakthrough hull coating that uses quantum entangled self-"
"projections to confuse gravitational readings and obscure the ship's "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Los sensores modernos de las naves se basan en la detección de anormalidades "
"gravitacionales para detectar las naves y son muy robustos en la mayoría de "
"las situaciones. Los astilleros Nexus han desarrollado un innovador "
"recubrimiento del casco que utiliza autoproyecciones cuánticas entrelazadas "
"que pueden confundir las lecturas gravitacionales."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A coating of photo-voltaic nanobot paint covers the ship's entire hull and "
"is able to harness solar energy and redirect it to the power system of the "
"ship. The nanobots are self-regulating and self-repairing, requiring no "
"maintenance once a colony has been established."
msgstr ""
"Un recubrimiento de pintura fotovoltaica de nanobots cubre todo el casco de "
"la nave y es capaz de aprovechar la energía solar y redirigirla al sistema "
"de energía de la nave. Los nanobots se autorregulan y autorreparan, por lo "
"que no necesitan mantenimiento una vez la colonia se ha establecido."

msgid ""
"It is possible to establish a colony of repair nanobots directly on the hull "
"of a ship. Since the design has to account for the potentially harsh "
"conditions outside the approach has limited effectiveness compared to the "
"more intrusive solutions, but nevertheless complements them neatly."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The hyperbolic blink engine seems to have been designed as a response to the "
"question \"How much mass is it possible to move across a space-time fold?\". "
"It has little regard for maintaining careful control of the space-time "
"folding, instead focusing on maximum possible throughput. Due to the heavy "
"amount of disruption to the ship's systems and personnel, after each space-"
"time fold or \"blink\", it takes a while for the ship to be fully responsive "
"again."
msgstr ""
"El motor de destello hiperbólico parece estar diseñado como respuesta a la "
"pregunta \"¿Cuánta masa es posible mover a través de un pliegue espacio-"
"temporal?\". Parece que no tiene en cuenta el mantenimiento de un control "
"cuidadoso del pliegue espacio-temporal, sino que se centra en el máximo "
"rendimiento posible. Debido a la gran cantidad de trastornos que sufren los "
"sistemas y el personal de la nave, después de cada pliegue espacio-temporal "
"o \"destello\", la nave tarda un tiempo en volver a ser totalmente receptiva."

msgid ""
"Warms up for 2 seconds then blinks you 2000 units in roughly the direction "
"you are facing. Can only be run once every 8 seconds and incurs a 20% accel "
"and turn penalty during cooldown. Performance degrades over 6000 tonnes of "
"mass."
msgstr ""
"Se calienta durante 2 segundos y luego te hace saltar 2000 unidades en la "
"dirección aproximada a la que estás mirando. Sólo puede ejecutarse una vez "
"cada 8 segundos e incurre en una penalización de aceleración y giro del 20% "
"durante el enfriamiento. El rendimiento se reduce a partir de las 6000 "
"toneladas de masa."

msgid ""
"This device installs a secondary scanning array on the ship. The array is "
"programmed with the known characteristics of the spatial anomalies "
"associated with hyperspace jumps. Because the scanner detects a very "
"specific kind of signature, its range can be easily boosted without "
"sacrificing accuracy. In effect, this means that a ship with one or more of "
"these scanners installed can detect jump points at a greater range. The "
"scanner will not detect jump points whose signature differs from the "
"standard type."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo instala una matriz de escaneo secundaria en la nave. La "
"matriz está programada con las características conocidas de las anomalías "
"espaciales asociadas con los saltos al hiperespacio. Dado que el escáner "
"detecta un tipo de firma muy específico, su alcance puede aumentarse "
"fácilmente sin sacrificar la precisión. En efecto, esto significa que una "
"nave con uno o más de estos escáneres instalados puede detectar puntos de "
"salto a mayor distancia. El escáner no detectará los puntos de salto cuya "
"firma difiera del tipo estándar."

msgid ""
"A module that lets the ship's generator direct energy to its weapons in "
"larger, more spaced out bursts. It's not perfectly efficient, but has been "
"proven useful in some combat encounters."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"By using special modulation highly tuned for low radiation environments, the "
"Low Radiation Sensor Modulator is able to increase the detection of nearby "
"ships while also giving more sensitivity to jump point signatures when "
"stealthed."
msgstr ""
"Mediante el uso de una modulación especial altamente sintonizada para "
"entornos de baja radiación, el Modulador de Sensor de Baja Radiación es "
"capaz de aumentar la detección de las naves cercanas, a la vez que "
"proporciona más sensibilidad a las firmas de los puntos de salto cuando se "
"está en sigilo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Jammer"
msgstr "Inhibidor Milspec"

msgid "Electronic Warfare Jammer"
msgstr "Inhibidor de Guerra Electrónica"

msgid ""
"Does your work require you to venture into dangerous territory? Are you "
"facing opposition your shields can't handle? The Milspec U-9 \"Magus\" "
"jammer is what you need! Throw the bloodhounds off your scent with the press "
"of a button. While your enemies are still trying to make sense out of the "
"garbage they're getting on their sensors, you will have already made your "
"escape! Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""
"¿Tu trabajo te exige aventurarte en territorios peligrosos? ¿Te enfrentas a "
"un enemigo que tus escudos no pueden soportar? ¡El inhibidor Milspec U-9 "
"\"Magus\" es lo que necesitas! Despistalos con solo pulsar un boton. "
"Mientras tus enemigos aún intentan encontrarle sentido a la basura que "
"reciben en sus sensores, ¡tú ya habrás emprendido la huida! Vuele seguro, "
"vuele Milspec."

#, fuzzy
msgid "M. Scrambler"
msgstr "Distorsionador Milspec"

msgid ""
"Milspec knows what's important out there. It's that you don't get shot! And "
"the best way not to get shot is not to get targeted in the first place. The "
"Milspec RX 500-C scrambler will put the wool over your enemies' sensors, at "
"a minimal cost to you or your ship's reactor! Fly safe, fly Milspec."
msgstr ""
"Milspec sabe lo que es importante ahí fuera. Es que no te disparen. Y la "
"mejor manera de que no te disparen es que no te apunten en primer lugar. El "
"distorsionador RX 500-C de Milspec cubrirá los sensores de tus enemigos, "
"¡con un coste mínimo para ti o para el reactor de tu nave! Vuele seguro, "
"vuele Milspec."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The flow of time is generally not perceived as a constant value, rather it "
"fluctuates greatly depending on the circumstances. Using the latest in neuro-"
"interface technology, the Neural Accelerator Interface is able to exploit "
"large amounts of ship energy to skew the flow of time to benefit the piloted "
"ship."
msgstr ""
"En general, el flujo del tiempo no se percibe como un valor constante, sino "
"que fluctúa mucho según las circunstancias. Utilizando lo último en "
"tecnología de neurointerfaz, la Interfaz Neural Aceleradora es capaz de "
"aprovechar grandes cantidades de energía de la nave para cambiar la "
"percepción del tiempo y acelerar la nave pilotada."

msgid "Active for 5 seconds with a cooldown of 20 seconds."
msgstr "Activo durante 5 segundos con un enfriamiento de 20 segundos."

msgid ""
"This sensor array uses quadralens-magnified photon modulation to more easily "
"detect the faint signals emitted by a distant ship, effectively boosting "
"your ship's normal capability to see and identify other ships in space. This "
"can be useful to counteract the effect of cloaking instruments and also "
"increases the accuracy of short-range tracking information used by your "
"ship's weapons system."
msgstr ""
"Este conjunto de sensores utiliza una modulación de fotones ampliada por "
"cuadralentes para detectar con mayor facilidad las débiles señales emitidas "
"por una nave lejana, lo que aumenta la capacidad normal de tu nave para ver "
"e identificar otras naves en el espacio. Esto puede ser útil para "
"contrarrestar el efecto de los instrumentos de camuflaje y también aumenta "
"la precisión de la información de rastreo de corto alcance utilizada por el "
"sistema de armas de tu nave."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Given the popularity of the Plasma Drill and the inexhaustible demand for "
"resources by human civilization, Schafer & Kane Industries produced a heavy "
"variant of the same. The new design makes no compromises in functionality at "
"the cost of significantly increased size requirements. However, the ships "
"that can equip it, the Heavy Plasma Drill makes into formidable mining "
"vessels."
msgstr ""
"Dada la popularidad del Taladro de Plasma y la inagotable demanda de "
"recursos por parte de la civilización humana, Industrias Schafer & Kane "
"produjo una variante pesada del mismo. El nuevo diseño no hace concesiones "
"en cuanto a la funcionalidad a costa de un aumento significativo de los "
"requisitos de tamaño. Sin embargo, para las naves que puedan equiparlo, el "
"Taladro de Plasma Pesado puede convertirlas en formidables naves mineras."

msgid ""
"The S&K Plasma Drill is an alternate approach to conventional mining lances. "
"Although it requires getting up close to the asteroid and accurate controls "
"to be able to extract minerals, it obtains significantly better yields. An "
"integrated asteroid scanner is just the icing on the cake."
msgstr ""
"El Taladro de Plasma de S&K es un método alternativo a las lanzas mineras "
"convencionales. Aunque requiere acercarse al asteroide y controles precisos "
"para poder extraer minerales, obtiene rendimientos significativamente "
"mejores. Un escáner de asteroides integrado es sólo la guinda del pastel."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"No one really knows the origin of the stealth burster, however, it seems to "
"have been derived from a more primitive makeshift version used by smugglers "
"to evade patrols. By emitting a barrage of strong signals, it is able to "
"temporarily confuse the sensors of nearby ships and give a significant "
"increase in stealth ability. However, this is only a short temporary effect, "
"and the device takes a long time to recalibrate and reload the capacitors."
msgstr ""
"Nadie conoce realmente el origen de la explosión de camuflaje, sin embargo, "
"parece haber derivado de una versión improvisada más primitiva utilizada por "
"los contrabandistas para evadir las patrullas. Al emitir un bombardeo de "
"señales fuertes, es capaz de confundir temporalmente los sensores de las "
"naves cercanas y dar un aumento significativo de la capacidad de sigilo. Sin "
"embargo, este efecto es sólo temporal y el dispositivo tarda mucho tiempo en "
"recalibrarse y cargar los condensadores."

msgid "Weapon Modifier (Launcher)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An improved targeting array allows your missile systems to more quickly "
"acquire targets, and minimizes accuracy losses at range. It requires a short "
"period to compute an ideal vector, slightly slowing firing rates."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Jammer"
msgstr "Inhibidor Unicorp"

msgid ""
"Unlike general purpose scrambler systems, jammers are heavy-duty pieces of "
"hardware used for serious electronic warfare in space. A jammer works by "
"actively interfering with nearby ships' sensor systems, rather than "
"modulating the signature of the ship it's installed in. This is much more "
"effective, but it also uses a lot more power. For this reason, jammer "
"systems are inactive until needed, and must be activated manually."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de los sistemas distorsionadores de uso general, los "
"inhibidores son piezas de hardware de alta resistencia que se utilizan para "
"la guerra electrónica seria en el espacio. Un inhibidor funciona "
"interfiriendo activamente con los sistemas de sensores de las naves "
"cercanas, en lugar de modular la firma de la nave en la que está instalado. "
"Esto es mucho más eficaz, pero también consume mucha más energía. Por esta "
"razón, los sistemas de interferencia están inactivos hasta que se necesitan, "
"y deben ser activados manualmente."

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Light Afterburner"
msgstr "Ligero Unicorp Postquemador"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Afterburners provide your ship with an immediate boost to acceleration and "
"speed when activated. However, while an afterburner is active it will "
"quickly drain the ship's energy. This afterburner model produced by Unicorp "
"is a relatively cheap and efficient option, though only well-suitable for "
"light fighters and interceptors."
msgstr ""
"Los postquemadores proporcionan a tu nave un impulso inmediato de "
"aceleración y velocidad cuando se activan. Sin embargo, mientras la "
"postcombustión está activa, drena constantemente la energía de la nave y "
"también genera calor. Si la postcombustión se calienta demasiado, su efecto "
"disminuirá y finalmente se apagará por completo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Medium Afterburner"
msgstr "Medio Unicorp Postquemador"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Afterburners provide your ship with an immediate boost to acceleration and "
"speed when activated. However, while an afterburner is active it will "
"quickly drain the ship's energy. This model is able to provide an emergency "
"speed boost to heavier ships than Unicorp's light afterburner, but requires "
"a larger mount and more energy to run."
msgstr ""
"Los postquemadores proporcionan a tu nave un impulso inmediato de "
"aceleración y velocidad cuando se activan. Sin embargo, mientras la "
"postcombustión está activa, drena constantemente la energía de la nave y "
"también genera calor. Si la postcombustión se calienta demasiado, su efecto "
"disminuirá y finalmente se apagará por completo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "U. Scrambler"
msgstr "Distorsionador Unicorp"

msgid ""
"Scramblers distort a ship's electromagnetic signature, making it harder for "
"various sensors to pick it up. In effect, a scrambler reduces the distance "
"at which the ship can be scanned, and makes it harder for missiles to lock "
"onto. The effect is quite limited, but on the upside, scramblers put little "
"to no strain on the ship's resources, and are always active."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is an upgrade to the sensor systems that is able to learn from nearby "
"hostile ships' common weaknesses. The AI is able to extract subtle features "
"that the human eye misses and extrapolate into great detail to point out "
"weaknesses in enemy ships. The more ships it is able to analyse and "
"extrapolate from, the stronger the effect."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una mejora de los sistemas de sensores que es capaz de aprender de "
"las debilidades comunes de las naves hostiles cercanas. La IA es capaz de "
"extraer características sutiles que el ojo humano pasa por alto y "
"extrapolarlas con gran detalle para señalar los puntos débiles de las naves "
"enemigas. Cuantas más naves pueda analizar y extrapolar, mayor será el "
"efecto."

msgid "Weapon Modification"
msgstr "Modificador de Armas"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The weapons ionizer works by diverting massive amounts of energy from the "
"weapons to an ion field generator. While that makes for an increase in "
"energy use and a massive reduction to phyisical damage output, the ion field "
"allows conventional weapons to do ionizing damage while the outfit is "
"active. It is designed to automatically activate when the target's armour is "
"below 50%, but can also be triggered manually."
msgstr ""
"El ionizador de armas funciona según el principio de desviar cantidades "
"masivas de energía de las armas a un generador de campo de iones. Aunque el "
"uso de energía aumenta y la producción de daño disminuye significativamente, "
"el campo de iones permite que las armas convencionales hagan daño ionizante "
"mientras el equipo está activo. Está diseñado para activarse automáticamente "
"cuando el blindaje del objetivo es inferior al 50%, pero también puede "
"activarse manualmente."

msgid "Automatically triggers when target armour is below 50%."
msgstr ""
"Se activa automáticamente cuando el blindaje del objetivo es inferior al 50%."

msgid ""
"The antimatter lance directly attacks the integrity of a ship on a molecular "
"level, rather than trying to brute force its way through the armour of enemy "
"ships. The procedure dissipates large amounts of Birkhoff-Kerr radiation "
"that is able to have significantly adverse effects on the ship being shot at."
msgstr ""
"La lanza antimateria ataca directamente la integridad de una nave a nivel "
"molecular en lugar de intentar abrirse paso a la fuerza bruta a través del "
"blindaje de las naves enemigas..El procedimiento disipa grandes cantidades "
"de radiación Birkhoff-Kerr que es capaz de tener efectos significativamente "
"adversos en la nave a la que se dispara."

msgid "Lowers the action speed of ships under fire by 40%."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One of the prized weapons of the Black Lotus Armoury. The Arc Blade is an "
"upscaled version of the Arc Machete, optimized for wrecking havoc on the "
"systems of unsuspecting ships. Most commonly seen on Dealbreaker Battleships "
"that prowl the area between House Za'lek and House Dvaered in search of "
"careless merchant vessels who have not paid the protection racket. Very few "
"pirate captains who purchase it regret their decision."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This weapon unleashes a focused beam of disabling electromagnetic radiation, "
"able to both effectively shred through a target's shielding and render its "
"equipment inoperable in a short amount of time without causing substantial "
"physical harm. It's favoured by the few well-off pirate captains able to get "
"their hands on one, as well as law enforcement on the hunt for those "
"pirates, for similar reasons."
msgstr ""

msgid "Disruptor A. S1"
msgstr "Disruptora A. S1"

msgid ""
"The Disruptor series of weapons is loosely based on the Razor series. House "
"Sirius found it impossible to simply upscale the Razor Artillery S3, and "
"ended up nearly having to redesign them from scratch, although the they both "
"handle very similarly. The Disruptor Artillery S1 lobs high energy self-"
"stabilizing balls of ions that can make short work of energy shields and "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"La serie de armas Disruptor se basa ligeramente en la serie Cuchilla. A la "
"Casa Sirio le resultó imposible mejorar la Artillería Cuchilla S3 y casi "
"tuvo que rediseñarla desde cero, aunque ambas se manejan de forma muy "
"similar. La Artillería Disruptora S1 lanza bolas de iones autoestabilizadas "
"de alta energía que pueden acabar con los escudos y sistemas energéticos."

msgid "Disruptor A. S2"
msgstr "Disruptora A. S2"

msgid ""
"The Disruptor Artillery S2 is an upscaled version of the S1 model. Although "
"the larger dimensions limit the applicability to destroyer-class ships and "
"up, this comes with perks of longer range and significant more damage."
msgstr ""
"La Artillería Disruptora S2 es una versión mejorada del modelo S1. Aunque "
"sus mayores dimensiones limitan su aplicación a naves de clase destructor o "
"superior, tiene la ventaja de un mayor alcance y un daño significativamente "
"mayor."

msgid "Disruptor B. S2"
msgstr "Disruptor B. S2"

msgid ""
"House Sirius typically equips its heaviest vessels with Disruptor Battery "
"S2s. Where the Razor Batteries are ineffective, the Disruptor Battery S2 "
"provides the necessary firepower to batter down virtually any shielding "
"while doing heavy damage to systems. Although the firepower is lower than "
"other standard capital ship weapons, Disruptor connoisseurs claim the weapon "
"more than makes up for it with overall utility. Given the fact that not many "
"survive being the brunt of a barrage from Disruptor Battery S2s, it may be "
"that they have a point."
msgstr ""
"La Casa Sirio suele equipar sus naves más pesadas con Baterías Disruptoras "
"S2. Donde las Baterías Cuchilla son ineficaces, las Baterías Disruptoras S2 "
"proporcionan la potencia de fuego necesaria para destruir prácticamente "
"cualquier escudo y causar graves daños a los sistemas. Aunque la potencia de "
"fuego es inferior a la de otras armas estándar de las naves capitales, los "
"entendidos en disruptores afirman que el arma lo compensa con creces con su "
"utilidad general. Teniendo en cuenta que no muchos sobreviven a una descarga "
"de la Batería Disruptor S2, puede que tengan razón."

msgid ""
"The Energy Harpoon is an ensemble of stolen and hacked technologies "
"developed by Skull and Bones engineers over many cycles that finally has "
"been developed into a formidable weapon. By exploiting the power of "
"carefully-calibrated electromagnetic harmonics, unlike standard energy "
"weapons, blasts from the Energy Harpoon are designed to not damage directly "
"but instead employ a cavitation effect that both causes heavy damage while "
"also pulling the ship. Although quite new to the potential arsenal of "
"pirates, the weapon seems poised to strike fear in the heart of merchants "
"everywhere."
msgstr ""
"El Arpón de Energía es un conjunto de tecnologías robadas y pirateadas "
"desarrolladas por los ingenieros de Cráneo y Huesos a lo largo de muchos "
"ciclos que finalmente se ha convertido en un arma formidable. Al explotar el "
"poder de los armónicos electromagnéticos cuidadosamente calibrados, a "
"diferencia de las armas de energía estándar, las ráfagas del Arpón de "
"Energía están diseñadas para no dañar directamente, sino emplear un efecto "
"de cavitación que causa graves daños al tiempo que arrastra la nave. Aunque "
"es bastante nueva en el arsenal potencial de los piratas, el arma parece "
"dispuesta a infundir miedo en el corazón de los mercantes de todo los "
"lugares."

msgid "#oOn hit pulls target.#0"
msgstr "#oAl golpear tira del objetivo.#0"

msgid ""
"Fires waste debris in a shotgun-like blast that can be useful in taking down "
"small craft or hitting large targets. Not widely used due the tendency to "
"jam and blow up, which has been known to cause hull breaches, fires, and "
"other major issues on the ship. However, this one looks like it is in quite "
"good shape."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Gauss Gun is one of the oldest weapon designs in the galaxy today, "
"dating back to the times of the Federation. It fires a rapid stream of high "
"velocity projectiles at a target, dealing damage through sheer kinetic "
"impact. Gauss Guns are popular among small time pirates for being an easy to "
"use, reliable weapon."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón Gauss es uno de los diseños de armas más antiguos de la galaxia, "
"que se remonta a los tiempos de la Federación. Dispara un chorro rápido de "
"proyectiles de alta velocidad contra un objetivo, causando daños por puro "
"impacto cinético. Los Cañones Gauss son populares entre los piratas de poca "
"monta por ser un arma fiable y fácil de usar."

msgid ""
"The Grave Beam is a lighter, faster version of the Ragnarok Beam. It does "
"not deal as much damage, but its lighter size and more forgiving CPU "
"requirements makes it a competitive contender."
msgstr ""
"El Rayo de la Tumba es una versión más ligera y rápida del Rayo de Ragnarok. "
"No inflige tanto daño, pero su menor tamaño y sus requisitos de CPU más "
"permisivos lo convierten en un competidor."

msgid ""
"The Grave Lance is one of the most powerful Lance weapons around. The "
"technology behind it is poorly understood by everyone except the Za'lek, who "
"use it as a standard weapon."
msgstr ""
"La Lanza de Tumba es una de las armas de lanza más poderosas que existen. La "
"tecnología que la sustenta es poco conocida por todos, excepto por los "
"Za'lek, que la utilizan como arma estándar."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Heavy Ion Cannon does a far better job at disabling ships than the "
"standard model, but it requires a medium mount. Most militaries employ these "
"weapons on specialized capture teams, but the design is licenced for public "
"use as well."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón de Iones Pesado hace un trabajo mucho mejor a la hora de inutilizar "
"naves que el modelo estándar, pero requiere una montura media. La mayoría de "
"los ejércitos emplean estas armas en equipos de captura especializados, pero "
"el diseño tiene licencia para su uso público también."

msgid ""
"The Heavy Ion Turret is a Sirius military design, applying brute force to "
"its target's internal systems. When coupled with Razor weaponry, it is "
"terribly efficient at reducing enemy warships to tumbling hunks of junk."
msgstr ""
"La Torreta de Iones Pesada es un diseño militar de Sirio que aplica la "
"fuerza bruta a los sistemas internos de su objetivo. Cuando se combina con "
"el armamento Razor, es terriblemente eficaz para reducir las naves de guerra "
"enemigas a trozos de chatarra."

msgid ""
"The Heavy Laser Turret is more or less an upscaled version of the Laser "
"Turret, though some fundamental mechanisms had to be redesigned to adapt to "
"the increased energy throughput found in this weapon. While the resulting "
"design only fits larger ships, very few pilots who equip them regret their "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"La Torreta Láser Pesada es más o menos una versión mejorada de la Torreta "
"Láser, aunque algunos mecanismos fundamentales tuvieron que ser rediseñados "
"para adaptarse al mayor rendimiento energético de esta arma. Aunque el "
"diseño resultante sólo se adapta a las naves más grandes, muy pocos pilotos "
"que los equipan se arrepienten de su compra."

msgid ""
"The Heavy Neutron Disruptor improves upon the processes behind the smaller "
"Neutron Disruptor, giving this weapon greater damage and range."
msgstr ""
"El Disruptor de Neutrones Pesado mejora los procesos del Disruptor de "
"Neutrones más pequeño, dando a esta arma mayor daño y alcance."

msgid ""
"By modulating the frequency of the basic Ripper Cannon, the Empire military "
"increased its range, accuracy and destructive power. After reworking the "
"power conduits, their efforts culminated in the devastating Heavy Ripper "
"Cannon. The main drawback to this model is its increased bulk, which makes "
"it unsuitable for smaller ships."
msgstr ""
"Al modular la frecuencia del Cañón Destripador básico, los militares del "
"Imperio aumentaron su alcance, precisión y poder destructivo. Tras modificar "
"los conductos de energía, sus esfuerzos culminaron en el devastador Cañón "
"Destripador Pesado. El principal inconveniente de este modelo es su mayor "
"volumen, que lo hace inadecuado para las naves más pequeñas."

msgid ""
"Built off the heavy ripper cannon, the ripper turret is the heaviest turret "
"conventionally available to civilians. Its bulk, high energy requirements, "
"and high damage make it unsuitable for non-capital ships."
msgstr ""
"Construida a partir del cañón pesado destripador, la torreta destripadora es "
"la torreta más pesada disponible convencionalmente para los civiles. Su "
"volumen, sus elevados requisitos de energía y su elevado daño la hacen "
"inadecuada para las naves no capitales."

msgid ""
"Ion Cannons are primarily nonlethal weapons designed to short out internal "
"ship systems and rendering it disabled without killing the crew in the "
"process. The standard Ion Cannon is the most basic and compact design, which "
"allows it to be mounted on small craft. This makes the Ion Cannon one of the "
"most popular weapons for pirates, although it also finds heavy use in "
"policing and militia when nonlethal force is needed."
msgstr ""
"Los cañones de iones son principalmente armas no letales diseñadas para "
"cortocircuitar los sistemas internos de la nave y dejarla incapacitada sin "
"matar a la tripulación en el proceso. El Cañón de Iones estándar es el "
"diseño más básico y compacto, lo que permite montarlo en naves pequeñas. "
"Esto hace que el cañón de iones sea una de las armas más populares entre los "
"piratas, aunque también se utiliza mucho en la milicia y la policía cuando "
"se necesita una fuerza no letal."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Laser Cannon MK1 is a standard weapon on many vessels, and the first "
"defence of merchants everywhere. The cannon fires charged energy that can do "
"a decent amount of damage to both shield and armour of offending vessels, "
"while remaining efficient enough to mount several even on small ships."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón Láser es un arma estándar en muchas naves, y la primera defensa de "
"los comerciantes de todo el mundo. El cañón dispara cargas de energía que "
"causan una cantidad decente de daño al escudo como al blindaje de naves "
"atacantes, siendo lo suficientemente eficiente como para poderse montar "
"varios de ellos en naves pequeñas."

msgid ""
"A high-powered version of the Laser Cannon MK1, the MK2 is usually found on "
"Imperial law enforcement and military ships. Its superior firepower helps "
"keep order among the civilian populace and pirates at bay. It is even "
"capable of dealing with larger Corvette vessels with some effort."
msgstr ""
"El MK2, una versión de alta potencia del Cañón Láser MK1, suele encontrarse "
"en las naves militares y de las fuerzas del orden Imperial. Su potencia de "
"fuego superior ayuda a mantener el orden entre la población civil, y "
"mantener a raya a los piratas. Es también capaz de enfrentarse a Corbetas "
"grandes con cierto esfuerzo."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A pair of modified laser cannon MK1s mounted on a rotating turret, providing "
"excellent defensive capabilities. With a full 360 degrees of rotation, laser "
"turrets provide affordable, energy-efficient firepower to courier vessels. "
"They are highly valued among civilian ships to provide defences against "
"stray pirates and marauders."
msgstr ""
"Un par de cañones láser MK1 modificados montados en una torreta giratoria, "
"que proporciona una excelente capacidad defensiva. Con una rotación completa "
"de 360 grados, las torretas láser proporcionan una potencia de fuego "
"asequible y de bajo consumo a las naves de transporte. Son muy apreciados "
"entre las naves civiles para proporcionar defensas contra piratas y "
"merodeadores sueltos."

msgid ""
"The Laser Turret MK2 is often found on Imperial fast response fleets, for "
"use against fleets of small to medium ships. Due to the low cost and high "
"firepower, this weapon is one of the mainstays in the Imperial space forces."
msgstr ""
"La Torreta Láser MK2 se encuentra a menudo en las flotas de respuesta rápida "
"Imperial, para su uso contra flotas de naves pequeñas a medianas. Debido a "
"su bajo coste y gran potencia de fuego, esta arma es uno de los pilares de "
"la fuerza espaciale Imperial."

msgid ""
"Mass Drivers fire massive slugs of matter at enemy ships, dealing damage "
"through kinetic impact and knocking the target back. One of the most "
"economical heavy weapons in the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Los Impulsores de Masa disparan enormes proyectiles de materia a las naves "
"enemigas, causando daños por impacto cinético y haciendo retroceder al "
"objetivo. Una de las armas pesadas más económicas de la galaxia."

msgid ""
"Mining lances are optimized for high destructive power at short range, "
"specialized in mining space asteroids. While they can deal significant "
"damage to heavy armour, they are impractical against shields, however, there "
"are stories of miners using them to get away from marauders in a clutch.."
msgstr ""
"Las lanzas mineras están optimizadas para un alto poder destructivo a corto "
"alcance, especializadas en la minería de asteroides espaciales. Aunque "
"pueden infligir un daño considerable a blindajes pesados, son muy poco "
"prácticas contra escudos, sin embargo, hay historias de mineros que los "
"utilizan para escapar de los merodeadores en un apuro."

msgid ""
"Mining lances are optimized for high destructive power at short range, "
"specialized in mining space asteroids. While they can deal significant "
"damage to heavy armour, they are impractical against shields. The Mining "
"Lance MK2 uses its larger size to overcome one of the main drawbacks of the "
"Mining Lance MK1, namely that the short range creates a tendency for mining "
"ships to get caught up and damaged by the exploding asteroids. The Mining "
"Vrata reports a large number of such incidents every year in their mining "
"safety analysis reports."
msgstr ""
"Las lanzas mineras están optimizadas para un alto poder destructivo a corto "
"alcance, especializadas en la minería de asteroides espaciales. Aunque "
"pueden infligir un daño considerable a los blindajes pesados, son poco "
"prácticas contra los escudos. La Lanza Minera MK2 utiliza su mayor tamaño "
"para superar uno de los principales inconvenientes de la Lanza Minera "
"MK1,que es que el corto alcance crea una tendencia a que las naves mineras "
"queden atrapadas y dañadas por la explosión de los asteroides.La Vrata "
"Minera informa cada año de un gran número de incidentes de este tipo en sus "
"informes de análisis de la seguridad minera."

msgid ""
"The destroyer-grade version of the Muon Disruptor launches microbot swarms "
"sheathed in a highly-energized sheathe of exotic particles, able to cause "
"significant damage to even heavy armour plating."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Light Muon Disruptor is a curious weapon, firing a volley of energy-"
"sheathed microbots, able to seek and impact targets at short ranges with a "
"volatile burst of high-energy particles. As the microbots utilize swarm "
"consensus for targeting and guidance they are exceptionally resistant to "
"electonic jamming."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Equally as esoteric as the light Muon Disruptor, this turreted variant "
"launches slightly larger microbot swarms containing higher particle charge."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This exotic weapon system is the largest manufactured by the Thurion, "
"launching seeking microbot swarms sheathed in a corona of highly volatile "
"exotic particles. Their high energy charge slows them down somewhat compared "
"to their smaller cousins."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Neutron Disruptor uses high-energy pulses that alter the base "
"composition of molecules, causing heavy damage. This weapon was first "
"popular with the Collective, whose drones were immune to early versions' "
"lethal backscatter radiation."
msgstr ""
"El Disruptor de Neutrones utiliza pulsos de alta energía que alteran la "
"composición básica de las moléculas, causando graves daños. Esta arma fue "
"muy popular entre el Colectivo, cuyos drones eran inmunes a la letal "
"radiación de retrodispersión de las primeras versiones."

msgid ""
"Mining lances are known for their destructive capabilities, unfortunately, "
"such power can be detrimental for the extraction of sensible materials. The "
"Nexus Drill Lance takes a different approach, and instead of maximizing "
"power, it operates on less efficient but more stable wavelengths. While this "
"allows it to extract materials that other mining lances are incapable of, it "
"also has the downside of significantly lowering the amount of extractable "
"materials."
msgstr ""
"Las lanzas mineras son conocidas por su capacidad destructiva; por "
"desgracia, esa potencia puede ser perjudicial para la extracción de "
"materiales sensibles. La Lanza Minera Nexus adopta un enfoque diferente, y "
"en lugar de maximizar la potencia, opera con longitudes de onda menos "
"eficientes pero más estables. Aunque esto le permite extraer materiales que "
"otras lanzas mineras son incapaces de hacer, también tiene la desventaja de "
"que disminuye considerablemente la cantidad de materiales extraíbles."

msgid ""
"The turret-mounted edition of the Orion Lance offers mid-sized ships "
"exceptional short-duration firepower, a potent deterrent against enemy "
"vessels that dare venture within firing range."
msgstr ""
"La edición con torreta de la Lanza Orion ofrece a las naves de tamaño medio "
"una excepcional potencia de fuego de corta duración, un potente elemento "
"disuasorio contra las naves enemigas que se atrevan a aventurarse dentro de "
"su rango de tiro."

msgid ""
"The Orion Lance is a fixed-mount weapon designed to be mounted on fighters "
"and up. Based on a heavily-modified, liquid-cooled laser, it's capable of "
"bursts of continuous fire, resulting in a destructive beam. Due to the large "
"energy usage and need for focus, like the Particle Lance, the Orion Beam "
"shares a fairly limiting short range. That said, very few enemy ships "
"survive the encounter once they are in range."
msgstr ""
"La Lanza Orión es un arma de montaje fijo diseñada para ser montada de cazas "
"en adelante. Basada en un láser fuertemente modificado y refrigerado por "
"líquido, es capaz de realizar ráfagas de fuego continuo, dando lugar a un "
"rayo destructivo. Debido al gran consumo de energía y a la necesidad de "
"concentración, al igual que la Lanza de Partículas, el Rayo de Orión tiene "
"un alcance bastante limitado. Dicho esto, muy pocas naves enemigas "
"sobreviven al encuentro una vez dentro de su alcance."

msgid ""
"A turret-mounted particle lance. The smallest possible turreted beam weapon, "
"used as a last-ditch weapon against light enemies. Like the particle lance, "
"it can simultaneously hit multiple targets, however, this comes at the cost "
"of a significantly reduced range."
msgstr ""
"Una torreta de lanza de partículas. El arma de rayo más pequeña posible "
"montada en torreta, utilizada como última arma contra enemigos ligeros. Al "
"igual que la lanza de partículas, puede golpear simultáneamente a varios "
"objetivos, pero a costa de reducir considerablemente su alcance."

msgid ""
"This is the smallest direct beam weapon built, purpose-built by the Za'lek "
"for their drones. While the beam can instantaneously hit multiple targets "
"simultaneously, it comes at a downside of a really short range, requiring "
"the pilot to get very close to their target risking enemy fire."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la arma más pequeña de rayo directo construida por los Za'lek para "
"sus drones. Aunque el rayo puede alcanzar varios objetivos a la vez de forma "
"instantánea, tiene el inconveniente de su corto alcance, que obliga al "
"piloto a acercarse mucho al objetivo y arriesgarse al fuego enemigo."

msgid "Plasma Bl. MK1"
msgstr "Plasma MK1 Bl."

msgid ""
"The Plasma Blaster M1 fires superheated plasma which is very effective at "
"damaging armour, but less effective against shields. While dealing direct "
"damage, the lingering plasma will continue to damage the target ship for a "
"while after the initial impact. This weapon is often used by bounty hunters "
"and mercenaries for its high killing potential, although the plasma burns "
"tend to make it harder to disable ships."
msgstr ""
"El Blaster de Plasma M1 dispara plasma sobrecalentado que es muy eficaz para "
"dañar el blindaje, pero menos eficaz contra los escudos. Aunque inflige daño "
"directo, el plasma residual seguirá dañando a la nave objetivo durante un "
"tiempo después del impacto inicial. Esta arma es utilizada a menudo por los "
"cazarrecompensas y los mercenarios por su alto potencial asesino, aunque las "
"quemaduras de plasma tienden a dificultar la inutilización de las naves."

msgid "Plasma Bl. MK2"
msgstr "Plasma MK2 Bl."

msgid ""
"The Plasma Blaster MK2 is a high-powered version of the Plasma Blaster MK1, "
"powerful enough to blow all but the heaviest pirate ships out of the sky. "
"Its power is substantial enough that it even gets used by some militaries, "
"typically in combination with anti-shield weaponry. Like the original MK1 "
"model, the lingering plasma will significantly damage any ship that is "
"unlucky enough to get hit."
msgstr ""
"El Blaster de Plasma MK2 es una versión de alta potencia del Blaster de "
"Plasma MK1, lo suficientemente potente como para hacer volar todas las naves "
"piratas, excepto las más pesadas. Su potencia es lo suficientemente "
"importante como para que incluso sea utilizado por algunos militares, "
"normalmente en combinación con armamento antiescudo.Al igual que el modelo "
"MK1 original, el plasma residual dañará significativamente cualquier nave "
"que tenga la mala suerte de ser alcanzada."

msgid ""
"The Plasma Cannon is a scaled-up version of the Plasma Blaster design for "
"use on Corvettes. It manages to pack a markedly stronger punch, but the "
"engineering complexities of fitting such a powerful weapon into a small slot "
"lead to much higher dependence on guidance from the ship's central computer."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón de Plasma es una versión ampliada del diseño del Blaster de Plasma "
"para su uso en Corbetas. Consigue un impacto mucho más fuerte, pero la "
"complejidad de la ingeniería para encajar un arma tan poderosa en una ranura "
"pequeña hace que dependa mucho más de la guía del ordenador central de la "
"nave."

msgid "Plasma C. Cannon"
msgstr "Cañón de Plasma"

msgid ""
"The Plasma Cluster Cannon is a Soromid refinement to the standard Plasma "
"Cannon design. By confining a massive cluster of superheated plasma into a "
"small space within a specialized \"membrane shield\", the impact creates "
"large explosions which tear through even the strongest hulls. The downside "
"to this design is that a lot of space is required, which limits its use to "
"medium mounts, but this also means biological Soromid ships are able to "
"handle its computational load despite being a synthetic construct."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón Cúmulo de Plasma es un refinamiento Sorómida del diseño estándar "
"del Cañón de Plasma. Al confinar un enorme cúmulo de plasma sobrecalentado "
"en un pequeño espacio dentro de un \"escudo de membrana\" especializado, el "
"impacto crea grandes explosiones que atraviesan incluso los cascos más "
"resistentes. El inconveniente de este diseño es que requiere mucho espacio, "
"lo que limita su uso a montajes medianos, pero esto también significa que "
"las naves biológicas Soromida son capaces de manejar su carga computacional "
"a pesar de ser una construcción sintética."

msgid ""
"Using a genetically engineered modified plasma organ, the Eruptor is able to "
"spray large areas of space with highly corrosive plasma. Unlike other plasma "
"weapons, this specialized plasma burns enemy hulls much longer, causing "
"significantly more damage over time. Due to the volatility of the plasma, "
"accuracy is comprised, however, as it can spray around a large area, it is "
"almost guaranteed to hit anything within sight."
msgstr ""

msgid "Plasma T. MK1"
msgstr "Plasma MK1 T."

msgid ""
"The plasma turret essentially takes a plasma blaster and mounts it on a "
"turret. Its short range makes it ill-suited for defence, so it is not "
"especially popular with traders and merchants, but it has found a niche "
"among inexperienced mercenaries who are not as well-practiced at aiming as "
"the pros."
msgstr ""
"La torreta de plasma toma básicamente un blaster de plasma y lo monta en una "
"torreta. Su corto alcance la hace poco adecuada para la defensa, por lo que "
"no es especialmente popular entre comerciantes y mercaderes, pero ha "
"encontrado un nicho entre mercenarios inexpertos que no tienen tanta "
"práctica en la puntería como los profesionales."

msgid "Plasma T. MK2"
msgstr "Plasma MK2 T."

msgid ""
"The mark 2 plasma turret isn't especially impressive compared to other "
"medium-size turrets, but it is sometimes favoured by corvettes for its "
"unusually low weight compared to its range and damage output."
msgstr ""
"La torreta de plasma grado 2 no es especialmente impresionante en "
"comparación con otras torretas de tamaño medio, pero a veces se ve "
"favorecida por las corbetas por su peso inusualmente bajo en comparación con "
"su alcance y producción de daños."

msgid ""
"The Light Pulse Cannon is a technologically advanced upgrade to the Laser "
"Cannon, firing rapid charged energy pulses that penetrate more effectively "
"than standard lasers, although it operates less efficiently."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Heavy Pulse Turret is a terrifying Proteron heavy destroyer and cruiser-"
"scale weapon, considered a more advanced refinement of the venerable Heavy "
"Laser Turret. In Proteron fleet doctrine, cruisers and destroyers will "
"coordinate withering hails of rapid fire from these turrets, destroying all "
"but the largest capital ships with horrific speed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Cycles of extravagantly funded Proteron weapons research programs resulted "
"in the Hyperpulse Turret, a battleship-scale 'superweapon'. Compared to the "
"Turbolaser, its predecessor in Proteron fleet doctrine, the Hyperpulse "
"Turret fires even faster energy pulses with better penetration against even "
"the toughest battleship and carrier hull plating."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A pair of further overcharged Light Pulse Cannons mounted on a rotating "
"turret, this turret can penetrate small plating with relative ease, although "
"it is energy-hungry and requires computing power to operate at rates that "
"can be difficult for small craft to support."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Medium Pulse Turret is a mainstay of the Proteron fleet for use on "
"destroyer class ships. Devastating to small and medium craft, this turret is "
"capable of fully penetrating plating on even the heaviest fighters and "
"bombers."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Ragnarok Beam is one of the most powerful beam class weapons on the "
"market. It was designed by House Za'lek for capital ship combat, although "
"its extremely large payload makes it somewhat useful for clearing enemy "
"fighters that stray into the blast. Although the range is quite limited "
"compared to other capital ship weapons, the extreme power combined with the "
"fact it can slice through battleship heavy armour like butter makes it a "
"favourite of pilots who like to get close to their enemies."
msgstr ""
"El Rayo Ragnarok es una de las armas de clase rayo más potentes del mercado. "
"Fue diseñada por la Casa Za'lek para el combate de naves capitales, aunque "
"su carga extremadamente grande la hace algo útil para eliminar cazas "
"enemigos que se desvían hacia la explosión. Aunque su alcance es bastante "
"limitado en comparación con otras armas de naves capitales, su potencia "
"extrema, combinada con el hecho de que puede atravesar el blindaje pesado de "
"acorazados como si fuera mantequilla, la convierte en una de las favoritas "
"de los pilotos a los que les gusta acercarse a sus enemigos."

msgid ""
"A recent House Goddard innovation, the Railcannon uses heavy magnetic pulses "
"to accelerate multiple railgun-caliber projectiles at a target vector, with "
"some inaccuracy. Capable of extreme damage at close ranges, it does however "
"compare poorly to the tried and true Railgun in long ranged combat."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The railgun is a cannon that uses heavy magnetic pulses to accelerate pieces "
"of debris to extremely high velocities. The impact caused by the pieces of "
"debris can tear apart even the strongest ship hulls. It is the preferred "
"weapon of House Dvaered, who take particular delight in the havoc these "
"weapons can cause on their targets."
msgstr ""
"El cañón de riel es un cañón que utiliza fuertes impulsos magnéticos para "
"acelerar trozos de escombros a velocidades extremadamente altas. El impacto "
"causado por los trozos de escombros puede destrozar incluso los cascos de "
"las naves más resistentes. Esta arma es la preferida de la Casa Dvaered, que "
"se deleita especialmente con los estragos que estas armas pueden causar en "
"sus objetivos."

msgid ""
"While one railgun is a formidable weapon, the ultimate in brute-force "
"capital ship weaponry is the railgun turret. Mounting two railguns in a "
"specialized turret housing, it manages to mitigate the recoil normally "
"associated with railguns at a slight velocity cost. Very few capital ships "
"can survive being pounded by these weapons for long."
msgstr ""
"Aunque un cañón de riel es un arma formidable, lo último en armamento de "
"fuerza bruta para naves capitales es la torreta de cañones de riel. Al "
"montar dos cañones de riel en una carcasa de torreta especializada, se "
"consigue mitigar el retroceso normalmente asociado a los cañones de riel con "
"un ligero coste de velocidad. Muy pocas naves capitales pueden sobrevivir "
"mucho tiempo al ataque de estas armas."

msgid "Razor A. S1"
msgstr "Cuchilla A. S1"

msgid ""
"Designed and employed by House Sirius, the Razor Artillery S1 fires "
"concentrated pockets of high energy ions that are very effective at draining "
"shields, but have only limited effect on a ship's armour. However, the ion "
"energy is also very effective at damaging system components, effectively "
"disabling ships. The ionization effect lingers for several seconds, and can "
"drain significant energy reserves during that time. While House Sirius "
"proclaims their use as non-lethal weapons, if care is not taken, they can "
"prove to be quite lethal."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada y empleada por la Casa Sirio, la Artillería Cuchilla S1 dispara "
"bolsas concentradas de iones de alta energía que son muy eficaces para "
"drenar los escudos, pero sólo tienen un efecto limitado sobre el blindaje de "
"una nave. Sin embargo, la energía iónica también es muy eficaz para dañar "
"los componentes del sistema e inutilizar las naves. El efecto de ionización "
"dura varios segundos y puede agotar las reservas de energía durante ese "
"tiempo. Aunque la Casa Sirio proclama su uso como armas no letales, si no se "
"tiene cuidado, pueden resultar bastante letales."

msgid "Razor A. S2"
msgstr "Cuchilla A. S2"

msgid ""
"The upgraded Razor Artillery S2 model packs increased overall effectiveness "
"compared to the more compact S2 model, and has less difficulty in "
"overloading corvette and destroyer-grade shielding, and disabling critical "
"components."
msgstr ""
"El modelo mejorado Artilleria Cuchilla S2 ofrece una mayor eficacia general "
"en comparación con el modelo S2 más compacto, y tiene menos dificultades "
"para sobrecargar los blindajes de grado corbeta y destructor, y desactivar "
"los componentes críticos."

msgid "Razor A. S3"
msgstr "Cuchilla A. S3"

msgid ""
"The Razor Artillery S3 is the highest powered member of the Razor series, "
"proven to be excellent at stripping the shields from those who would stand "
"against House Sirius. It is commonly employed by Sirius Preachers and other "
"corvettes."
msgstr ""
"La Artillería Cuchilla S3 es el miembro de mayor potencia de la serie "
"Cuchilla, y ha demostrado ser excelente para despojar de sus escudos a "
"aquellos que se oponen a la Casa Sirio. La emplean habitualmente los "
"Predicadores de Sirio y otras corbetas."

msgid "Razor B. S2"
msgstr "Cuchilla B. S2"

msgid ""
"Being the only turreted version of the Razor Artillery series, the Razor "
"Battery S2 sees a lot of application on medium escort ships. The strong "
"shield stripping effect in combination with the heavy systems damage can "
"quickly demoralize pirates and marauders looking to make some quick credits."
msgstr ""
"Al ser la única versión con torreta de la serie Artilleria Cuchilla, la "
"Bateria Cuchilla S2 se utiliza mucho en naves de escolta medianas. El "
"potente efecto de destrucción de escudos, combinado con el gran daño a los "
"sistemas, puede desmoralizar rápidamente a los piratas y merodeadores que "
"buscan ganar créditos rápidamente."

msgid ""
"While the Railgun was devastating in its effects, it wasn't quite "
"devastating enough for Dvaered High Command. They had their engineers "
"enhance the weapon into a heavier, faster firing variant that isn't so much "
"a gun as it is a miniature meteor shower generator."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el Cañón de rRel era devastador en sus efectos, no era lo "
"suficientemente devastador para el Alto Mando Dvaered. Hicieron que sus "
"ingenieros mejoraran el arma para convertirla en una variante más pesada y "
"de disparo más rápido que no es tanto un arma como un generador de lluvia de "
"meteoritos en miniatura."

msgid ""
"The Ripper Cannon is a variant on the Laser Cannon that has stronger "
"capacitors and twin, synchronous muzzles. The result is an increase in "
"damage per hit at a cost of tremendously increased CPU requirements. The "
"Ripper Cannon is mostly used by Corvettes which possess small weapon mounts, "
"but need heavy firepower so they can take on heavier ships effectively."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón Destripador es una variante del Cañón Láser que tiene condensadores "
"más potentes y boquillas gemelas y sincronizadas. El resultado es un aumento "
"del daño por impacto a costa de un tremendo aumento de los requisitos de la "
"CPU. El Cañón Destripador es utilizado sobre todo por las Corbetas, que "
"poseen pequeños montajes de armas, pero necesitan una gran potencia de fuego "
"para poder enfrentarse con eficacia a naves más pesadas."

msgid ""
"The Shredder quite lives up to the name its Dvaered manufacturers gave it. "
"The sheer damage dealing capacity of this weapon makes Dvaered Corvettes "
"dangerous to engage by ships that aren't substantially larger than they are."
msgstr ""
"La Trituradora hace honor al nombre que le dieron sus fabricantes Dvaered. "
"La gran capacidad de daño de esta arma hace que las corbetas Dvaered sean "
"peligrosas para las naves que no son mucho más grandes que ellas."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This special model of the Heavy Laser Turret is one of the heaviest weapons "
"found in the galaxy. Imperial Capital ships use it to lay down devastating "
"barrages against enemy vessels from long range. The high velocity of the "
"energy particles lobbed by the Turbolaser make it very hard for enemy ships "
"to perform evasive manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"Este modelo especial de la Torreta Láser Pesada es una de las armas más "
"pesadas de la galaxia. Las naves capitales imperiales la utilizan para "
"lanzar descargas devastadoras contra las naves enemigas, a larga distancia. "
"La alta velocidad de las partículas de energía lanzadas por el Turboláser "
"dificulta mucho las maniobras evasivas de las naves enemigas."

msgid ""
"One of the more common countermeasures employed by low-budget merchant "
"ships, the turret version of the Gauss Gun provides basic defence against "
"lone pirates. A more determined attacker is unlikely to be deterred, however."
msgstr ""
"Una de las contramedidas más comunes empleadas por las naves mercantes de "
"bajo presupuesto, la versión de torreta del cañón Gauss proporciona una "
"defensa básica contra los piratas solitarios. Sin embargo, es poco probable "
"que un atacante más decidido sea disuadido."

msgid ""
"Turreted Vulcan Guns pack the same calibre ammunition as their fixed mount "
"brethren. Ships not nimble enough to evade its relentless stream of "
"projectiles might find themselves riddled with hull punctures before long."
msgstr ""
"La Torreta Cañón Vulcano lleva el mismo calibre de munición que sus hermanos "
"de montura fija. Las naves que no sean lo suficientemente ágiles como para "
"evadir su implacable flujo de proyectiles podrían verse acribilladas con "
"agujeros en el casco en poco tiempo."

msgid ""
"The Vulcan Gun improves over the Gauss Gun with increased range and damage, "
"achieved by using a heavier calibre ammunition. A skilled pilot can wreak "
"some serious havoc even to medium-sized vessels with a pair of Vulcan Guns "
"installed on their ship."
msgstr ""
"El Cañón Vulcano mejora al Cañón Gauss con un mayor alcance y daño, "
"conseguido mediante el uso de una munición de mayor calibre. Un piloto hábil "
"puede causar serios estragos incluso en naves de tamaño medio con un par de "
"cañones Vulcanos instalados en su nave."

msgid "Robotic Interceptor"
msgstr "Interceptor Robótico"

msgid "Robosys"
msgstr "Robosys"

msgid ""
"This is a modified version of the Collective Drone that now includes a life "
"support system for humans."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una versión modificada del Dron Colectivo que ahora incluye un "
"sistema de soporte vital para humanos."

msgid "Robotic Carrier"
msgstr "Portanaves Robótico"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This carrier is highly automated and is designed to command fleets of "
"Collective Drones. It can be operated by a skeleton crew although most "
"sections of the ship are not pressurized. Maintenance can be carried out by "
"remotely controlled droids. Due to the lack of unnecessary crew facilities "
"and heavy armour the Drone Carrier is an unusual lightweight and fast "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"Este portanaves está altamente automatizado y está diseñado para comandar "
"flotas de Drones Colectivo. Puede ser operado por una tripulación reducida, "
"aunque la mayoría de las secciones de la nave no están presurizadas. El "
"mantenimiento puede ser llevado a cabo por droides controlados a distancia. "
"Debido a la falta de instalaciones innecesarias para la tripulación y al "
"pesado blindaje, el Portanaves de Drones es un inusual portanaves ligero y "
"rápido."

msgid "A fully sentient drone disguised as a Hyena."
msgstr "Un dron totalmente sensible camuflado de hiena."

msgid "Robotic Fighter"
msgstr "Caza Robótico"

msgid ""
"This Collective Heavy Drone has been modified by engineers to support a "
"human pilot."
msgstr ""
"Este Dron Pesado Colectivo ha sido modificado por los ingenieros para "
"soportar un piloto humano."

msgid ""
"On this military grade version of the Ancestor, the distribution of the "
"weight on the structure has been optimized in order to allow embarking more "
"payload."
msgstr ""
"En esta versión de grado militar del Ancestro, se ha optimizado la "
"distribución del peso en la estructura para poder embarcar más carga útil."

msgid "You need at least 40% reputation with House Dvaered."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 40% de reputación con la Casa Dvaered."

msgid ""
"The Super-Fast Collider Launchers have more in common with most torpedo "
"launchers than you'd think. All it takes for them to work just as well on a "
"comparatively tiny bomber-class vessel is a redesign of its weapon mounts to "
"be rigidly integrated with them. The newly possible generous design "
"assumptions have also allowed for a substantial increase in targeting "
"accuracy, much needed for better luck fighting off ships of its own caliber, "
"but Dvaered technology can only be pushed so far, so the result is a ship "
"much heavier yet less armoured than the original Ancestor, although bearing "
"ridiculous firepower.\n"
"\n"
"This design carries the legend of one empoverished Lord Calamares, who, as "
"they say, lost their prized Goddard in a bet on the Crimson Gauntlet. "
"Desperate to earn back their pride, they spent the last of their finances on "
"second-hand launchers that barely fit on their last space-worthy ship, a "
"Dvaered Ancestor, to threaten the very warlord they lost the jewel of their "
"once-grand fleet to. Both perished in what passed for a fight, one that "
"would be a footnote in history had it not been taken note of by a High "
"Command officer, who would then order a refined design based on the doomed "
"pilot's idea."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 60% reputation with House Dvaered."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 60% de reputación con la Casa Dvaered."

msgid ""
"The Arsenal is a heavily armed bulk freighter used by House Dvaered to "
"transport large amount of supplies and troops whenever such a task would be "
"too dangerous for lighter armoured freighters. The name derives from the "
"fact that House Dvaered transport ships are usually focused on distributing "
"and deploying weapons and troops in preference over raw materials, goods or "
"even basic necessities. Colloquially they have been also been known to be "
"called \"Dvaered Gunboxes\"."
msgstr ""
"El Arsenal es un gran carguero fuertemente armado, utilizado por la Casa "
"Dvaered para transportar grandes cantidades de suministros y tropas siempre "
"que dicha tarea resulte demasiado peligrosa para los cargueros más ligeros. "
"El nombre deriva del hecho de que las naves de transporte de la Casa Dvaered "
"suelen centrarse en la distribución y el despliegue de armas y tropas con "
"preferencia a las materias primas, las mercancías o incluso las necesidades "
"básicas. Coloquialmente, también se les conoce como \"Armeros Dvaered\"."

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with House Dvaered."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con la Casa Dvaered."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, the Goddard Battlecruiser was commissioned by the Empire "
"for military service. However, during the Dvaered Revolts most Goddard "
"captains sided with the insurgents and, after the establishment of House "
"Dvaered, the Empire ceded the licence for the ageing vessel to them. Today, "
"House Dvaered is House Goddard's biggest client and this Dvaered military "
"grade version has been adapted to the needs of the Dvaered Warlords, which "
"means better armour and forwards weapon damage at the cost of increased mass."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo, el Imperio encargó el Crucero de Batalla Goddard para el "
"servicio militar. Sin embargo, durante las revueltas Dvaered, la mayoría de "
"los capitanes Goddard se pusieron del lado de los insurgentes y, tras el "
"establecimiento de la Casa Dvaered, el Imperio les cedió la licencia de la "
"vieja nave. En la actualidad, la Casa Dvaered es el mayor cliente de la Casa "
"Goddard y esta versión de grado militar Dvaered ha sido adaptada a las "
"necesidades de los Señores de la Guerra Dvaered, lo que significa un mejor "
"blindaje y un mayor daño de las armas a costa de una mayor masa."

msgid ""
"On this military grade version of the Phalanx, the distribution of the "
"weight on the structure has been optimized in order to allow embarking more "
"payload."
msgstr ""
"En esta versión de grado militar del Falanje, la distribución del peso en la "
"estructura se ha optimizado para permitir abordar más carga útil."

msgid ""
"When the Empire replaced their aging cruisers with the new Hawking class "
"House Dvaered seized the opportunity to acquire the licence for the cruiser "
"and most of the remaining ships. Dvaered engineers reinforced the armour and "
"redesigned the ship's structure while also attaching additional weapon hard "
"points. Afterwards, the ship was renamed to Retribution. However, the "
"electronics remained outdated."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"On this military grade version of the Vendetta, the distribution of the "
"weight on the structure has been optimized in order to allow embarking more "
"payload."
msgstr ""
"En esta versión de grado militar del Vendetta, se ha optimizado la "
"distribución del peso en la estructura para poder embarcar más carga útil."

msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with House Dvaered."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con la Casa Dvaered."

msgid ""
"This military grade version of the Vigilance has an optimized weight "
"distribution allowing it to carry cruiser-scale armour plating, however this "
"did necessitate shrinking some other core systems."
msgstr ""

msgid "Nexus Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Nexus"

msgid "You need at least 40% reputation with the Empire."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 40% de reputación con el Imperio."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This military grade version of the Admonisher is mostly identical in "
"function to a standard Admonisher, but with slightly better armour, and "
"shields."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión de grado militar del Amonestador es parcialmente idéntica a un "
"Amonestador estándar, pero con un blindaje, unos escudos y una disipación "
"del calor ligeramente mejores."

msgid ""
"Standard Empire Admonishers are fabricated to suit many needs, in a one-size-"
"fits-all approach. However, there are times when such a focus on flexibility "
"can wind up to be a liability. The Longbow reconfiguration drastically "
"changes how the Admonisher performs in combat by specializing in long-range "
"attacks. A complete revamp of the targeting system makes any improvement to "
"the ship's sensors directly translate into increased weapon range. To make "
"full use of those new capabilities, the weapon mounts have been reworked to "
"support high-caliber weaponry. As a downside, the ship ends up having much "
"more difficulty dealing with enemy interceptors and fighters."
msgstr ""

msgid "#bGains as much weapon range bonus as the ship detection.#0"
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 60% reputation with the Empire."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 60% de reputación con el Imperio."

msgid ""
"This military grade version of the Hawking is mostly identical in function "
"to a standard Hawking, but with slightly better armour and shields."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This military grade version of the Lancelot is mostly identical in function "
"to a standard Lancelot, but with slightly better armour, and shields."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión de grado militar del Lancelot es en su mayor parte idéntica en "
"funcionamiento a un Lancelot estándar, pero con un blindaje, escudos y "
"disipación de calor ligeramente mejores."

msgid ""
"A high-spec bombing focused Lancelot that is most known by the use with the "
"famous Sigma-5 squadron. The Golden Efreeti features a classified targeting "
"system, compromising on effective range as compared to standard variants to "
"enable much faster and more effective lock-ons. The result is an agile ship "
"that is able to engage ships at short distances and quickly switch targets "
"while relying on missiles and torpedoes."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This military grade version of the Pacifier is mostly identical in function "
"to a standard Pacifier, but with slightly better armour, and shields."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión de grado militar del Pacificador es parcialmente idéntica a un "
"Pacificador estándar, pero con un blindaje, escudos y disipación de calor "
"ligeramente mejores."

msgid ""
"Designed by an Imperial Combat Bureaucrat for personal use, the Pacifier "
"Hoplite was in design limbo for over 50 cycles before it was finally "
"approved and produced by Nexus Shipyards. Sadly, the original Bureaucrat "
"that designed it died before they were ever able to see it completed.\n"
"\n"
"Instead of standard shield arrays, the ship design uses special flash "
"capacitors that are able to store significantly more power, but as a means "
"to this end, they were originally designed to be single-use. Some minor "
"design improvements have since made it possible to recharge them once fully "
"drained, however, it takes a long time for them to naturally recover. The "
"recovery process can be accelerated by performing an active cooldown cycle."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shields start regenerating again upon full cooldown."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with the Empire."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con el Imperio."

msgid ""
"Built under contract for the Empire by Nexus Shipyards, the Peacemaker is "
"one of the grandest vessels in the galaxy, dwarfing even the mighty Goddard. "
"Peacemakers typically function as flag ships in Imperial fleets, and due to "
"the modular layout of their weapon bays can be refitted to function as "
"either a carrier or battleship as called for by mission requirements."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Rainmaker is the largest freighter used by the Empire. It is capable of "
"transporting extensive amounts of material through dangerous territory as "
"small groups of pirates are no threat due to its heavy armour. The name is "
"derived from a series of events when, shortly after the Incident, they were "
"used to deliver supplies to starving, cut-off worlds by doing low atmosphere "
"flybys while opening the cargo holds, resulting in a literal rain of "
"supplies. After the events an EE-1891-392 official ship rename form was "
"approved and Rainmaker became the ship's official name."
msgstr ""
"El Hacedor de Lluvia es el mayor carguero utilizado por el Imperio. Es capaz "
"de transportar grandes cantidades de material a través de un territorio "
"peligroso, ya que los pequeños grupos de piratas no son una amenaza debido a "
"su pesado blindaje. Su nombre se debe a una serie de acontecimientos en los "
"que, poco después del Incidente, se utilizaron para entregar suministros a "
"mundos hambrientos y aislados, realizando sobrevuelos a baja atmósfera y "
"abriendo las bodegas de carga, lo que provocó una auténtica lluvia de "
"suministros. Después de los acontecimientos, se aprobó un formulario oficial "
"de cambio de nombre de la nave EE-1891-392 y Rainmaker se convirtió en el "
"nombre oficial de la nave."

msgid "You need at least 20% reputation with the Empire."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 20% de reputación con el Imperio."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Empire military grade version of the Shark is mostly identical in "
"function to a standard Shark, but with slightly better armour, and shields. "
"The military-grade materials used also result in the ship being slightly "
"lighter than its generic counterpart."
msgstr ""
"La versión de grado militar del Tiburón del Imperio es parcialmente idéntica "
"a la de un Tiburón estándar, pero con un blindaje, unos escudos y una "
"disipación del calor ligeramente mejores. Los materiales de grado militar "
"utilizados también hacen que la nave sea ligeramente más ligera que su "
"homóloga genérica."

msgid "Elder Feral Bioship"
msgstr "Bionave Mayor Salvaje"

msgid "Still to do..."
msgstr "Todavía queda por hacer..."

msgid "Bio-Fighter"
msgstr "Bio-Caza"

msgid ""
"Nohinohi were originally created as Soromid Reaver Bio-Fighters. However, "
"although the process is not entirely clear, when the original Soromid Reaver "
"is abandoned or lost through misfortune it can undergo a remarkable "
"transformation where the biological components of the ship end up dominating "
"the synthetic parts. These ships are commonly referred to as \"Feral "
"Bioships\" and not much is known about them."
msgstr ""
"Los nohinohi fueron creados originalmente como biocazas segadores Soromida. "
"Sin embargo, aunque el proceso no está del todo claro, cuando el Segador "
"Soromida original es abandonado o se pierde por mala suerte, este puede "
"sufrir una notable transformación en la que los componentes biológicos de la "
"nave acaban dominando a las partes sintéticas. Estas naves se denominan "
"comúnmente \"Bionaves Salvajes\" y no se sabe mucho sobre ellas."

msgid "Bio-Corvette"
msgstr "Bio-Corveta"

msgid "Not meant for the player."
msgstr "No está destinado al jugador."

msgid "Station"
msgstr "Estación"

msgid "This is a base. It's for AI use only. Don't buy it. Seriously."
msgstr "Esto es una base. Es sólo para uso de la IA. No comprar. En serio."

