msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Desconocido"

msgid ""
"A very versatile combat ship. Nexus defines the Admonisher as a compromise "
"between the ruggedness of the Pacifier and the agility of the Lancelot. "
"Overall a very solid combat ship."
msgstr ""
"Una nave de combate muy versátil. Nexus define el Amonestador como un "
"compromiso entre la robustez del Pacificador y la agilidad del Lancelot. En "
"general, es una nave de combate muy sólida."

msgid ""
"The Admonisher ΩIIa makes the hard choice of sacrificing long-range "
"engagement capability to be able to excel in dogfighting. The original long-"
"range targeting system has been scrapped and replaced by an efficient close "
"range weapon system. In particular, the high tracking allows it to mow down "
"fighters and bombers with ease. However, the difficulty to equip torpedo "
"launchers make the ship ill-suited for engagements with larger ships."
msgstr ""

msgid "Melendez Corp."
msgstr "Melendez Corp."

msgid ""
"Designed to be piloted by a single person, the Alpaca is a minimalistic ship "
"designed for cargo transport, and not much more. The lack of advanced "
"thrusters results in low mobility, which, along with very little space "
"devoted to anything other than cargo, gives the ship no flexibility to "
"perform anything other than hauling jobs. However, the low cost and wide "
"availability make the ship popular among novice pilots."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Commonly referred to as the \"Little Goddard\", the Ancestor also has its "
"roots in the primitive flying machines used by men many ages ago. Unlike the "
"Goddard though, the electronics are manufactured by House Dvaered, making it "
"considerably inferior in that area."
msgstr ""
"Conocido comúnmente como el \"Pequeño Goddard\", el Ancestro también tiene "
"sus raíces en las primitivas máquinas voladoras utilizadas por los hombres "
"hace muchos años. Sin embargo, a diferencia del Goddard, la electrónica es "
"manufacturada por la Casa Dvaered, lo que lo hace considerablemente inferior "
"en esa área."

msgid ""
"A product of a special collaboration between House Goddard and House "
"Dvaered, the Ancestor House Goddard Eagle-Eye is a special collectors item. "
"While the outer frame is fabricated by House Dvaered, the internals have "
"been redesigned by House Goddard with a focus on high precision. The "
"resulting is a ship that, although it seems very similar to the original "
"model, performs vastly different. The new targeting system, although still "
"outdated, expands the range of ordinances, while also allowing them to "
"precisely hit their targets for significant damage. As the tight tolerances "
"do hamper the resulting launch rates and ammo reserves, the pilot will have "
"to make sure every missile counts."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of the most long-lived designs in spacefaring, the Bedivere was designed "
"to be able to fulfil a diversity of different roles. Although technically "
"considered a combat vessel, it has significant cargo holds and can also "
"serve as a cargo ship. While still a flexible ship, even with retrofitting, "
"the ancient system layout and lack of specialization led to the Bedivere "
"being discontinued in favour of more modern ships. Although it is not "
"possible to obtain new Bediveres, given their ease to repair, it seems like "
"it will take a long time for them to completely disappear."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los diseños más longevos de la navegación espacial, el Bedivere fue "
"diseñado para poder desempeñar diversas funciones. Aunque técnicamente se "
"considera una nave de combate, tiene importantes bodegas de carga y también "
"puede servir como carguero. Aunque sigue siendo una nave flexible, incluso "
"con reequipamiento, la antigua disposición de los sistemas y la falta de "
"especialización hicieron que la Bedivere dejara de utilizarse en favor de "
"naves más modernas. Aunque no es posible obtener nuevos Bediveres, dada su "
"facilidad de reparación, parece que tardarán mucho en desaparecer por "
"completo."

msgid "Armoured Bulk Freighter"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When you need to move large amounts of cargo through dangerous territory, "
"Melendez Corporation's Clydesdale has got you covered. Making few "
"compromises on storage density, the Clydesdale also has the firepower to "
"keep the cargo secure. A favourite of security shipping firms, that also "
"sees some usage by bounty hunters and captains that favour both cargo and "
"firepower."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The colonists of Antlejos V have now had a wealth of experience running "
"crucial supplies through a hostile blockade. Some of the cargo capacity has "
"been stripped in order to lighten the ship and increase agility both in and "
"out of orbit. With the addition of extra manoeuvring thrusters that can be "
"supercharged when the ship is endangered, this variant of the venerable "
"Clydesdale has earned a reputation for escaping many a tight spot."
msgstr ""

msgid "Luxury Yacht"
msgstr "Yate de Lujo"

msgid ""
"The Gawain is a very high-end ship, outpacing nearly all other production "
"vessels. It relies heavily on technology first implemented on the Lancelot "
"and is widely used as a sporting vessel as it is extremely manoeuvrable, "
"though they rarely survive combat due to their meagre weapons space and "
"relative fragility."
msgstr ""
"El Gawain es una nave de muy alta gama, que supera a casi todas las demás "
"naves de producción. Se basa en gran medida en la tecnología implementada "
"por primera vez en el Lancelot y se utiliza ampliamente como nave de recreo, "
"ya que es extremadamente maniobrable, aunque rara vez sobrevive al combate "
"debido a su escaso espacio de armas y a su relativa fragilidad."

msgid ""
"The Gawain XY-37 was meant to rework the engine and start a new era of "
"extreme speed spacecraft. Although, on paper, the new design seemed "
"flawless, it quickly hit a roadblock in practice when the stability of the "
"entire electro-magnetic grid couldn't keep up with the high engine demands. "
"Although the project was scrapped, some insistent engineers worked in their "
"free time to tweak the design into something usable. The result is a ship, "
"that while otherwise seeming significantly slower than the baseline model, "
"really shines when the shields are disabled. A great ship for those who like "
"living life on the edge."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Designed by eccentric genius Eduard Manuel Goddard, the Goddard Battleship "
"is what skyrocketed House Goddard to fame and fortune. Production is "
"entirely done on Zhiru in the Goddard system by House Goddard. Over time, "
"specialization and improvements on the original design have kept it very "
"competitive in the market. It's a classic of space."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado por el excéntrico genio Eduard Manuel Goddard, el Acorazado Goddard "
"es lo que lanzó a la Casa Goddard a la fama y la fortuna. La producción se "
"realiza íntegramente en Zhiru, en el sistema Goddard, por la Casa Goddard. "
"Con el tiempo, la especialización y las mejoras del diseño original lo han "
"mantenido a la altura del mercado. Un clásico del espacio."

msgid ""
"It all began with an insurance dispute at Manuel Station when a sensor "
"malfunction resulted in a Zebra being damaged beyond repair while delivering "
"a large shipment of gambling chips and bar furniture to Minerva Station. Due "
"to the cargo job's importance and strict deadline, the insurance provider "
"offered the Zebra captain a used Goddard that had recently been sold by a "
"retired bounty hunter. The Captain, knowing that a Goddard is worth more "
"than a Zebra, agreed with the idea of later trading it in. The goods would "
"not have fit had it not been for the idea of filling the fighter bays up to "
"the brim with gambling chips.\n"
"While contemplating a replacement, the captain realized that she encountered "
"none of the regular harassment in the Goddard, which was instead permanently "
"reconfigured for cargo transport. Sightings of the brilliant captain in her "
"trading Goddard turned to gossip and stories, leading to an eventual "
"standardization of the reconfiguration. Although not many captains choose a "
"ship like this for freight, they are common enough that a large amount of "
"second hand Goddards are reconfigured and re-sold as 'Merchantman' variants."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Hawking is the flagship vessel of Nexus Shipyards. A large cruiser "
"designed for extended engagements, it is widely used by the Empire to exert "
"control over their territories. In terms of raw firepower, the Hawking is "
"second only to the flagship of House Goddard, though its narrower frame "
"allows it to present a smaller target to the enemy."
msgstr ""
"El Hawking es la nave insignia de los Astilleros Nexus. Se trata de un gran "
"crucero diseñado para enfrentamientos prolongados, muy utilizado por el "
"Imperio para ejercer el control sobre sus territorios. En términos de "
"potencia de fuego bruta, el Hawking sólo es superado por la nave insignia de "
"la Casa Goddard, aunque su estructura más estrecha le permite ser un "
"objetivo más pequeño para el enemigo."

msgid "Aerosys"
msgstr "Aerosys"

msgid ""
"The star product of Aerosys, the Hyena quickly has also become a favourite "
"of guerrilla and paramilitary groups far and wide. Their top-notch "
"acceleration combined with fast reaction time allow them to exhaust enemy "
"energy supplies while wearing them down. While Aerosys claim that their "
"ships are only sold to reputable pilots, it's suspected that they sell to "
"anyone willing to pay, as it seems there are countless Hyenas among the "
"ranks of the more notorious and unruly pilots."
msgstr ""
"El producto estrella de Aerosys, la Hiena, se ha convertido rápidamente en "
"el favorito de los grupos guerrilleros y paramilitares de todo el mundo. Su "
"gran aceleración, combinado con su rápido tiempo de reacción, le permite "
"agotar las reservas de energía del enemigo mientras lo agotan. Aunque "
"Aerosys afirma que sus naves sólo se venden a pilotos reputados, se sospecha "
"que lo hacen a cualquiera que esté dispuesto a pagar, ya que parece que hay "
"innumerables Hienas entre las filas de los pilotos más notorios y rebeldes."

msgid "Krain Industries"
msgstr "Industrias Krain"

msgid ""
"The ship that single-handedly put Krain Industries on the map, the Kestrel "
"was designed to be a sleek heavy assault cruiser. Generally more fragile "
"than other cruisers, it manages to combine excellent manoeuvrability and "
"firepower with state-of-the-art electronics, making for a truly fearsome "
"ship in the hands of an able captain."
msgstr ""
"El Cérnicalo, la nave que puso por sí sola a Industrias Krain en el mapa, "
"fue diseñado para ser un elegante crucero de asalto pesado. Generalmente más "
"frágil que otros cruceros, consigue combinar una excelente maniobrabilidad y "
"potencia de fuego con una electrónica de última generación, lo que la "
"convierte en una nave realmente temible en manos de un capitán competente."

msgid ""
"The Kestrel Sigma features a high-end reflectokinetic hull padding that not "
"only increases the durability of the ship, but can also interfere with "
"weapon tracking and missile locks. A significant rework of the internals "
"allows the padding to fit with minimal effects on the ship's functionality, "
"although it can affect the local guidance of ordinance systems. The ship is "
"complemented by a secondary shield circuit that slightly boosts shielding "
"capacity. The difficulty of production leading to high failure rates racks "
"up a premium on the final ship's cost."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Koala is your standard cargo vessel. It's a small ship with little "
"weapon space but a decent amount of cargo space. Good for the entrepreneur "
"working looking to turn a profit while making their way across the stars."
msgstr ""
"El Koala es una nave de carga estándar. Una nave pequeña con poco espacio "
"para armas pero con una cantidad decente de espacio de carga. Buena para los "
"empresarios que buscan obtener beneficios mientras se abren camino por las "
"estrellas."

msgid ""
"The Koala is one of the sturdier courier ships, with a small size that also "
"aids it in survival. The armoured variant sacrifices speed for even more "
"durability, allowing it to survive risky deliveries by sturdiness and not "
"speed. Furthermore, a revamped weapon system allows it to wield a medium-"
"sized weapon instead of two small weapons, allowing it to ward off larger "
"ships efficiently. It is commonly used for the delivery of critical cargo "
"without raising too much attention."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One of the prized heavy fighters of Nexus Shipyards. The Lancelot was "
"originally a classified design for the Empire military but its existence was "
"revealed during an aborted test flight. Now, a modified version is available "
"for civilians, though it doesn't quite match the original specifications. It "
"is used by security agencies all over the galaxy for its reliability and "
"availability."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los preciados cazas pesados de los Astilleros Nexus. El Lancelot era "
"originalmente un diseño clasificado para el ejército del Imperio, pero su "
"existencia se reveló durante un vuelo de prueba abortado. Ahora, una versión "
"modificada está disponible para los civiles, aunque no se ajusta a las "
"especificaciones originales. Las agencias de seguridad de toda la galaxia lo "
"utilizan por su fiabilidad y disponibilidad."

msgid ""
"One of the most widely used ships in the galaxy. Renowned for its stability "
"and stubbornness. The design hasn't been modified much since its creation "
"many, many cycles ago. It was one of the first civilian use spacecrafts, "
"first used by aristocracy and now used by everyone who cannot afford better."
msgstr ""
"Una de las naves más utilizadas en la galaxia. Conocida por su estabilidad y "
"obstinación. Su diseño no se ha modificado mucho desde su creación hace "
"muchos, muchos ciclos. Fue una de las primeras naves espaciales de uso "
"civil, primero utilizada por la aristocracia y ahora por todos los que no "
"pueden permitirse algo mejor."

msgid ""
"The Llama's popularity is based on the wide availability of the base ship, "
"and is most pilots introduction to spacefaring. Inspired by the popularity, "
"Melendez Corporation released a premium series nicknamed Voyager. Although "
"the new model nearly sports double the price tag, it comes a built-in fuel "
"ramscoop that is able to capture and filter minuscule space dust to slowly "
"refill fuel. The downside of the ramscoop is it takes up some vital engine "
"room, leading to longer jump times."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A heavy freighter specialized in transporting cargo throughout the galaxy. "
"Also has sufficient accommodation for passengers, depending on the model, "
"allowing for enjoyable cruises. The Mule is a favourite target of pirates, "
"so avoiding dangerous systems is strongly advised."
msgstr ""
"Un carguero pesado especializado en el transporte de carga por toda la "
"galaxia. También cuenta con suficiente alojamiento para los pasajeros, según "
"el modelo, lo que permite realizar agradables cruceros. La Mula es un "
"objetivo favorito de los piratas, por lo que se recomienda encarecidamente "
"evitar los sistemas más peligrosos."

msgid ""
"Specially ordered by the Mining Vrata, the Mule Hardhat is a modified "
"version of the Mule with a focus on augmenting the mining capabilities. In "
"particular, the hull has been significantly reinforced to be able to "
"withstand occasional collisions with asteroids. A built-in asteroid scanner, "
"in addition to specialized asteroid processing equipment has made it quite "
"popular among miners. However, such changes come with an increase in the "
"fabrication cost."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Pacifier is one of the older and trustier designs of Nexus Shipyards. It "
"was designed primarily as a border-patrol vessel and, as such, it is able to "
"withstand heavy punishment from raiding parties. The Pacifier features high "
"fuel capacity to facilitate lengthy patrol routes."
msgstr ""
"El Pacificador es uno de los diseños más antiguos y fiables de los "
"Astilleros Nexus. Se diseñó principalmente como buque de patrulla fronteriza "
"y, como tal, es capaz de soportar el duro castigo de las partidas de asalto. "
"El Pacificador cuenta con una gran capacidad de combustible para facilitar "
"las largas rutas de patrulla."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Phalanx is, by Dvaered standards, a fast corvette that can be used as a "
"missile platform, that it also manoeuvres poorly is standard Dvaered "
"construction. Its high armour makes it a capable corvette provided one "
"equips it with turrets."
msgstr ""
"La Falange es, según los estándares Dvaered, una corbeta rápida que puede "
"utilizarse como plataforma de misiles, que maniobra mal al ser una "
"construcción estándar Dvaered. Su elevado blindaje la convierte en una "
"corbeta capaz siempre que se la equipe con torretas."

msgid ""
"When all your care about is cargo, the Plowshare is the vessel you need. By "
"minimizing defence capabilities, the plowshare is able to dedicate most of "
"the ship's volume to cargo holds, allowing it to carry incredible amount of "
"cargo. However, this also limits their movements to safe areas, which is why "
"they are commonly seen only on trade lanes. Plowshares play a fundamental "
"role in the distribution of low cost goods around the universe and are one "
"of the cornerstones of modern spacefaring societies."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"While still a cargo hauler, the Quicksilver is quite different from "
"Melendez's other offerings. Featuring a streamlined frame and oversized "
"engines, it's the prime choice for expedient shipping."
msgstr ""
"Aunque sigue siendo un transportador de carga, el Azogue es bastante "
"diferente de las otras ofertas de Melendez. Con un chasis aerodinámico y "
"motores de gran tamaño, es la mejor opción para el transporte rápido."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Luxury Courier"
msgstr "Mensajero"

msgid ""
"A collector's model of the Melendez Quicksilver Courier. This model boasts a "
"much improved engine interface that overcomes much of the limitations of the "
"standard model. Furthermore, a state-of-the-art hyperdrive allows for "
"instant jumping, one of the most popular features of the model. As if it "
"wasn't enough, the finish on the hull uses strategic patterns and reflective "
"materials that can confuse weapon tracking. As expected, the ship comes with "
"a hefty price tag that many can not afford."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A particularly durable Melendez design, the Rhino is well-suited to "
"transporting high-value, high-risk freight. While it has much lower cargo "
"density than dedicated freighters, it protects itself extremely effectively. "
"Its modular bays allow it to function as a personnel transport, a fact not "
"lost on modern militaries."
msgstr ""
"El Rino, un diseño de Melendez especialmente duradero, es idóneo para el "
"transporte de carga de alto valor y alto riesgo. Aunque tiene una densidad "
"de carga mucho menor que la de los cargueros dedicados, se protege de forma "
"extremadamente eficaz. Sus bahías modulares le permiten funcionar como "
"transporte de personal, un hecho que no pasa desapercibido para los "
"ejércitos modernos."

msgid "Sirius Systems"
msgstr "Sistema Sirio"

msgid ""
"The Schroedinger is primarily used as a reconnaissance vessel. It requires a "
"skeleton crew due to its advanced automation subsystems, and its proprietary "
"fuel tanks allow it to have range much greater than most ships. The downside "
"is that the ship is extremely vulnerable to attack due to its light armour "
"and low amount of weapons space."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A newer Nexus Shipyards design, the Shark is an agile, light fighter "
"designed for in-system patrolling. While it's not as capable as its larger "
"relative, the Lancelot, it's still an effective addition to any fleet."
msgstr ""
"El Tiburón, un nuevo diseño de los Astilleros Nexus, es un caza ligero y "
"ágil diseñado para patrullar un sistema local. Aunque no es tan capaz como "
"su pariente más grande, el Lancelot, sigue siendo una contribución eficaz a "
"cualquier flota."

msgid ""
"With the Shark ΨIIIa, Nexus Shipyards rethinks the Shark as a Scout-class "
"vessel. The weapon mounts are significantly reduced in exchange for more "
"utility. However, unlike most scout ships, it still retains the durability, "
"allowing it to play a more combat-focused reconnaissance role. For reasons "
"unknown, there has been almost no publicity regarding the ΨIIIa and it is "
"very hard to find."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Starbridge is the latest ship designed by Krain Industries. It is a "
"lightweight destroyer reaching the same manoeuvrability as a corvette and "
"comparable maximum speed. Its low mass comes at the cost of reduced "
"structural space."
msgstr ""
"El Puente Estelar es la última nave diseñada por Industrias Krain. Es un "
"destructor ligero que alcanza la misma maniobrabilidad que una corbeta y una "
"velocidad máxima comparable. Su baja masa tiene como contrapartida una "
"reducción del espacio estructural."

msgid ""
"Heavily modified, the Starbridge Sigma boasts the capability of housing "
"fighters in new modified weapon mounts. The increased weapon room is "
"obtained by shrinking the cargo hold and battery capacity. At the same time, "
"the hull has been reinforced and systems interfaces tuned. The resulting "
"ship is a premium variant of the Starbridge capable of holding its own in "
"deep space."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Tristan is the predecessor of Nexus Shipyards' popular Lancelot model. "
"Originally developed for the Empire during the Dvaered Revolts for "
"peacekeeping and suppressing dissent, delays made it so the Tristan was "
"unable prevent the loss of territory and creation of House Dvaered. Due to a "
"powerful atmospheric flight mode, the Tristan quickly became very popular as "
"a flexible fighter. However, production quickly ceased when it was replaced "
"by the Lancelot, with a more compact and flexible form. Although no new "
"Tristan ships are being produced anymore, the abundance of decommissioned "
"vessels and a large refurbishing and repair community make it so they are "
"still surprisingly in use, especially by those who can not afford better."
msgstr ""
"El Tristán es el predecesor del popular modelo Lancelot de los Astilleros "
"Nexus. Originalmente desarrollado para el Imperio durante las Revueltas "
"Dvaered para el mantenimiento de la paz y la represión de la disidencia, los "
"retrasos hicieron que el Tristán no pudiera evitar la pérdida de territorio "
"y la creación de la Casa Dvaered. Gracias a su potente modo de vuelo "
"atmosférico, el Tristán se hizo rápidamente muy popular como caza flexible. "
"Sin embargo, su producción cesó rápidamente cuando fue sustituido por el "
"Lancelot, con una forma más compacta y flexible. Aunque ya no se fabrican "
"nuevas naves Tristán, la abundancia de naves retiradas del servicio y una "
"gran comunidad de restauración y reparación hacen que sigan siendo "
"sorprendentemente utilizadas, sobre todo por aquellos que no pueden "
"permitirse algo mejor."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Vendetta displays the House Dvaered philosophy very well. Give a ship "
"many intimidating guns, layer it with heavy armour and neglect the "
"electronics. Due to the obsolete electronics used in the Vendetta, it is "
"better suited to short fights than extended battles, as it possesses "
"inferior energy regeneration compared to other ships of its class. On the "
"other hand it has a truly fearsome barrage it can unleash that has precisely "
"the power to transform extended battles into short fights."
msgstr ""
"La Vendetta muestra muy bien la filosofía de la Casa Dvaered. Darle a una "
"nave muchos cañones intimidantes, recubrirla de un pesado blindaje y "
"descuidar la electrónica. Debido a la obsoleta electrónica utilizada en la "
"Vendetta, es más adecuada para combates cortos que para batallas "
"prolongadas, ya que posee una regeneración de energía inferior a la de otras "
"naves de su clase. Por otro lado, cuenta con una andanada realmente temible "
"que puede desatar y que tiene precisamente el poder de transformar las "
"batallas prolongadas en combates cortos."

msgid ""
"The Vendetta's great flaw is trying to provide a consistent weapon system, "
"requiring the ship's system to perform equally at maximum and minimum weapon "
"load. By doing away with such a constraint, the true power of the vendetta's "
"6-slot weapon mounts can shine. The Vendetta Whiplash uses a \"just in "
"time\" weapon profiling system that allows it to dynamically adjust based on "
"the current weapon load. While this does mean the weapon systems take longer "
"to start up, once they are up and running, the firepower is unmatched by any "
"ship of the same size."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Vigilance is the embodiment of Dvaered philosophy. Featuring immense "
"energy reserves and six weapon hardpoints, it's designed to hit as hard as "
"possible with forward weapons. Given its Dvaered origins, it possesses "
"inferior technology relative to its counterparts."
msgstr ""
"El Vigilancia es la encarnación de la filosofía Dvaered. Con inmensas "
"reservas de energía y seis puntos duros de armamento, está diseñado para "
"golpear lo más fuerte posible con armas delanteras. Dado su origen Dvaered, "
"posee una tecnología inferior a la de sus homólogos."

msgid ""
"The Zebra bulk freighter is the largest of all of the freighters produced by "
"Melendez, and one of the most desired ships by all independent civilian "
"traders. The Zebra offers an unmatched cargo density with reasonable "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"El gran carguero Cebra es el mayor de todos los cargueros producidos por "
"Melendez, y una de la naves más deseadas por todos los comerciantes civiles "
"independientes. El Cebra ofrece una densidad de carga inigualable con una "
"protección razonable."

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Personalizado"

msgid "Skull and Bones"
msgstr "Cráneo y Huesos"

msgid ""
"Few people meet a Dealbreaker and survive to tell the tale. Designed through "
"a mix of reverse engineering other fabricators and reusing existing "
"components, the Skull and Bones engineers designed a monstrous battleship "
"used by the upper bosses of the Black Lotus Pirate Clan. Although pirate "
"shipbuilders lack the formal training of traditional fabricators, they make "
"up for it in cunning and experience, and the Dealbreaker is much more "
"capable than you would expect from a hodgepodge of pirates. Given how few "
"are made, not only is it an icon that strikes fear in those who know the "
"Black Lotus, but it is a status symbol that even pirates from other clans "
"have come to know and respect."
msgstr ""
"Pocas personas se encuentran con un Rompetratos y sobreviven para contarlo. "
"Diseñado mediante una mezcla de ingeniería inversa de otros fabricantes y "
"reutilización de componentes existentes, los ingenieros de Cráneo y Huesos "
"diseñaron un monstruoso acorazado utilizado por los altos jefes del Clan "
"Pirata Loto Negro. Aunque los constructores navales piratas carecen de la "
"formación formal de los fabricantes tradicionales, lo compensan con astucia "
"y experiencia, y el Rompetratos es mucho más capaz de lo que cabría esperar "
"de una mezcolanza de piratas. Dado que se fabrican pocas unidades, no sólo "
"es un icono que infunde miedo a los que conocen el Loto Negro, sino que es "
"un símbolo de estatus que incluso piratas de otros clanes han llegado a "
"conocer y respetar."

msgid ""
"The stock Admonisher is a powerful vessel, especially for its size. Through "
"the usual Skull and Bones refit the Pirate Admonisher features improved "
"manoeuvrability and slightly thicker armour, at a cost of cargo capacity and "
"shielding power."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Ancestors were one of the first ships to be fancied by pirates. The big "
"intimidating wings and good top speeds would usually get ships to surrender "
"without firing a shot. As better ships came out in the market, their use has "
"fallen due to their archaic electronics and targeting systems."
msgstr ""
"Los Ancestros fueron una de los primeras naves a los que se aficionaron los "
"piratas. Sus grandes e intimidantes alas y sus buenas velocidades máximas "
"solían conseguir que las naves se rindieran sin disparar un tiro. A medida "
"que fueron apareciendo en el mercado mejores naves, su uso ha disminuido "
"debido a su arcaica electrónica y sistemas de puntería."

msgid ""
"Realizing the Bedivere's potential as a versatile scavenger vessel, the "
"Skull and Bones refitted the model for more efficient plundering. In "
"addition to a rehaul of the electronic warfare systems, the weapon mounts "
"have been shrunk to make room for more crew and boarding androids. Thus, the "
"Pirate Bedivere best used in a fleet with more combat-capable ships."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As any good pirate would know, you can hardly pillage a ship if you blow it "
"to pieces. Building upon the popular Pirate Shark, this variant has been "
"additionally refitted around a simple integrated ion field generator to aid "
"in disabling targets even without the use of disabling weapons. Despite "
"being widely considered a superior version of the ship, the blue colours "
"prevent it gaining significant traction in popularity. \"Everyone knows Red "
"makes ships go fast, Blue makes them go slower!\" is a common ill-informed "
"complaint."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Pirate Hyena has quickly become a favourite of pirates far and wide. Not "
"much of a fighter, nor does it pack too much of a punch, but in groups they "
"can overcome nearly any vessel and it's so simple to pilot that reaction "
"times are vastly improved. Skull and Bones has added modifications to make "
"them even more efficient as scavengers and harder to hit than their Aerosys "
"counterparts."
msgstr ""
"La Hiena Pirata se ha convertido rápidamente en la favorita de los piratas "
"de todo el mundo. No es un gran caza, ni tiene demasiada fuerza, pero en "
"grupo pueden superar casi cualquier nave y es tan fácil de pilotar que los "
"tiempos de reacción mejoran enormemente. Craneo y Huesos ha añadido "
"modificaciones para hacerlos aún más eficientes como carroñeros y más "
"difíciles de golpear que sus homólogos de Aerosys."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Kestrel is one of the best ships offered by Skull and Bones. It is "
"extremely agile for a cruiser yet doesn't lack the firepower necessary to "
"question the authority of the Empire. A very strong ship for those pirate "
"captains who can afford it and want to make a lasting impression."
msgstr ""
"El Cérnicalo es la mejor nave que ofrece Cráneo y Huesos. Es extremadamente "
"ágil para un crucero, pero no le falta la potencia de fuego necesaria para "
"cuestionar la autoridad del Imperio. Una nave muy fuerte para aquellos "
"piratas que puedan permitírselo."

msgid ""
"Boasting a far-out paint finish, this Kestrel has been retrofitted by "
"Dreamer Clan pirates with facilities to amplify and channel flow for the few "
"Dreamers capable of doing so. For some reason, this seems to involve a "
"concerning quantity of lava lamps."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One-Eyed Yuri was a famous ship engineer at Skull and Bones, renown for her "
"extravagant antics, many mistresses, and unconventional designs. She pushed "
"the limits of her designs, and many of the pirate modifications have her "
"signature on them. She perished in the annihilation of Haven, however, her "
"legacy lives with the blueprints of a modified Pirate Kestrel, popularly "
"called Yuri's Kiss.\n"
"\n"
"The model diverges from the classic Kestrel design by removing the fighter "
"bays and using the newly obtained space to install a gravitational distorter "
"that is able to mess with the signature of the ship. This gives the ship a "
"surprisingly hard to detect signature that can allow it to catch targets off "
"guard. Not only that, but the ship features an unconventional weapon adapter "
"that both allows weapons systems to track more accurately and fire from a "
"significantly higher range. In the hands of a skilled pilot, the Yuri's Kiss "
"can sneak up on unsuspecting ships and unleash deadly barrages before the "
"targets are able to react."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Building upon the already-capable Phalanx chassis, the Skull and Bones "
"engineers have substantially improved the ship's performance, while only "
"minorly sacrificing protection."
msgstr ""
"Sobre la base del chasis de la Falange, los ingenieros de Cráneo y Huesos "
"han mejorado sustancialmente el rendimiento de la nave, sacrificando sólo un "
"poco de protección."

msgid ""
"As Skull and Bones does not have the technology to grow new bioships from "
"scratch they salvage stolen Soromid ships. While the adaptation process can "
"be seen as cruel from an anthropomorphic point of view, leading to some "
"conflicts with anti-animal cruelty pirate organizations, advocates argue "
"that the process does not cause pain nor significant stress to the ships. "
"The modifications do not target internal organs, and focus on redoing the "
"externals, allowing the ship to equip synthetic hulls and stronger non-bio "
"weapons. Many pirates who obtain a Revenant become very fond of them and "
"there are many stories of pirates that have developed strong bonds with "
"their bioships.\n"
"\n"
"The Revenant can only obtain half the maximum experience of an equivalent "
"Soromid bioship, and also gains half as much experience."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The traditional Skull and Bones refit has left the Rhino substantially more "
"manoeuvrable, though somewhat less armoured. Exploiting its large cargo bay "
"and durability, the Rhino has become an excellent scavenger ship."
msgstr ""
"El tradicional reacondicionamiento de Cráneo y Huesos ha dejado al Rino "
"sustancialmente más maniobrable, aunque algo menos blindado. Aprovechando su "
"gran bahía de carga y su durabilidad, el Rino se ha convertido en una "
"excelente nave carroñera."

msgid ""
"The nimble Nexus Shipyards Shark has proved an excellent canvas for the "
"Skull and Bones technicians. Fitted with an additional weapon mount, its "
"handling suffers minimally while it's able to bring substantially more "
"firepower to bear."
msgstr ""
"El veloz Tiburón de los Astilleros Nexus ha demostrado ser un excelente "
"lienzo para los técnicos de Cráneo y Huesos. Equipado con una montura de "
"armas adicional, su manejo se resiente mínimamente mientras que es capaz de "
"aportar una potencia de fuego sustancialmente mayor."

msgid ""
"Even though the Starbridge is already a light and fast destroyer, Skull and "
"Bones engineers managed to further improve its speed. Due to its large "
"firepower and relatively high speed, for its ship class, the Starbridge is "
"truly a fearsome sight."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el Puente Estelar ya es un destructor ligero y rápido, los ingenieros "
"de Cráneo y Huesos consiguieron mejorar aún más su velocidad. Gracias a su "
"gran potencia de fuego y a su velocidad relativamente alta, para su tipo de "
"nave, el Puente Estelar es realmente temible."

msgid ""
"The Pirate Vendetta is even more intimidating than its regular counterpart. "
"It's been heavily tweaked to be more adjusted to the pirate style of flying. "
"Some of the armour has been removed to make more room for loot, while the "
"reactor has been jacked up by some dubious naval technician. The ship ends "
"up being substantially better than the original but every so often the "
"reactor goes nova, destroying the ship. You hope it won't happen to you if "
"you get in one."
msgstr ""
"El Vendetta Pirata es aún más intimidante que su homólogo normal. Se ha "
"retocado mucho para que se ajuste más al estilo de vuelo pirata. Se ha "
"eliminado parte del blindaje para hacer más espacio para botín, mientras que "
"el reactor ha sido modificado por algún dudoso técnico sin luces . La nave "
"acaba siendo sustancialmente mejor que la original, pero de vez en cuando el "
"reactor entra en estado nova, destruyendo la nave. Esperas que no te pase a "
"ti si te metes en una de ellas."

msgid ""
"The Zebra, one of the largest freighters available for independent civilian "
"traders, was refitted by Skull and Bones to serve as carrier. Large portions "
"of the cargo bays were left out to harden the hull or repurposed as hangars; "
"those hangars have to operate in a scarily makeshift manner, slowing fighter "
"maintenance substantially, but on the flipside, releasing the fighters is "
"hardly more involved than jettisoning unwanted cargo, making it quick to "
"respond to sudden threats. Although its capacity for cargo ends up "
"suboptimal, the pirate version of the Zebra is used as a freighter "
"occasionally."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with the Proteron."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con los Proteron."

msgid ""
"The Archimedes is the backbone of the Proteron fleet. Offering heavy "
"firepower and high durability, it can always be found in the heat of battle."
msgstr ""
"El Arquímedes es la columna vertebral de la flota Proteron. Con una gran "
"potencia de fuego y una gran durabilidad, siempre se encuentra en el fragor "
"de la batalla."

msgid "You need at least 20% reputation with the Proteron."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 20% de reputación con los Proteron."

msgid ""
"While smaller and less intimidating than its bigger siblings in the Proteron "
"arsenal, a pack of Daltons is still a foe to be reckoned with. It's the "
"latest in a long line of largely carrier-based interceptors. The Dalton's "
"armour shell can be retracted and functions as cargo box for more convenient "
"handling and storage. Packing relatively little firepower, they're ill-"
"suited to dueling, but a carrier group unleashing several squadrons has been "
"known to turn the tide of battle on many occasions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Proteron chose their battles carefully as their slow capital ships "
"cannot retreat from a battle easily. Thus, they have rather large fleet of "
"reconnaissance vessels with the Euler being the primarily used "
"reconnaissance vessel. Not geared for combat, this ship relies on stealth "
"and speed to avoid hostiles."
msgstr ""
"Los Proteron eligen sus batallas con cuidado, ya que sus lentas naves "
"capitales no pueden retirarse fácilmente de una batalla. Por lo tanto, "
"tienen una flota bastante grande de naves de reconocimiento, siendo la Euler "
"la nave de reconocimiento más utilizada. Esta nave no está preparada para el "
"combate y se vale del sigilo y la velocidad para evitar a los enemigos."

msgid "You need at least 50% reputation with the Proteron."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con los Proteron."

msgid ""
"The Gauss is a cutting-edge vessel. Its design was completed shortly before "
"the Incident, and it was on track to become the Proteron military's primary "
"combat vessel. While possessing fewer weapon mounts than the Pacifier, it "
"makes up for it with its lower mass and expanded structural space."
msgstr ""
"El Gauss es una nave de vanguardia. Su diseño se completó poco antes del "
"Incidente, y estaba en camino de convertirse en la principal nave de combate "
"del ejército Proteron. Aunque posee menos soportes de armas que el "
"Pacificador, lo compensa con su menor masa y su mayor espacio estructural."

msgid ""
"As the Proteron only use carrier-based fighters small fleets lack fighter "
"support. To make up this issue the Hippocrates was developed, an ultra-light "
"carrier specialized to provide fighter support for the Proteron raiding "
"fleets. The Hippocrates can also be used as missile platform using the "
"hangar bay to store additional ammo crates."
msgstr ""
"Como los Proteron sólo utilizan cazas basados en portanaves, las flotas "
"pequeñas carecen de apoyo de cazas. Para solucionar este problema se "
"desarrolló el Hipócrates, un portanaves ultraligero especializado en "
"proporcionar apoyo de cazas a las flotas de incursión Proteron. El "
"Hipócrates también puede usarse como plataforma de misiles usando la bahía "
"del hangar para almacenar cajas de munición adicionales."

msgid "You need at least 60% reputation with the Proteron."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 60% de reputación con los Proteron."

msgid ""
"While the Proteron mostly rely on heavy and powerful capital ships the "
"Pythagoras is an exception. It is a light and fast cruiser often deployed in "
"small skirmishes against medium sized ships. It can usually be found testing "
"the defence of the enemy trying to find a weak spot for the heavy Proteron "
"fleets to break through."
msgstr ""
"Mientras que los Proteron apuestan sobre todo por naves capitales pesadas y "
"potentes, el Pitágoras es una excepción. Se trata de un crucero ligero y "
"rápido que suele desplegarse en pequeñas escaramuzas contra naves de tamaño "
"medio. Normalmente se le puede encontrar probando la defensa del enemigo "
"intentando encontrar un punto débil para que las flotas pesadas de Proteron "
"lo atraviesen."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The heart of the Proteron battle fleet is formed by the Watson. Acting as a "
"mobile launch base as well as a command and control unit, this vessel "
"coordinates the rest of the fleet in the fight for dominance over the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"El corazón de la flota de combate Proteron está formado por la Watson. "
"Actuando como base de lanzamiento móvil y como unidad de mando y control, "
"esta nave coordina el resto de la flota en la lucha por el dominio de la "
"galaxia."

msgid "Sirius Psychic Powers"
msgstr "Poderes Psíquicos Sirio"

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with House Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"Whilst the Dogma is said to form the core of any Sirian fleet, few combat "
"pilots would dismiss the significance of the Divinity. Though not "
"exceptionally formidable in direct combat, the Divinity's ability to field a "
"multitude of fighters gives it unparalleled flexibility in combat, serving "
"as a key logistical vessel in any sizable fleet."
msgstr ""
"Aunque se dice que el Dogma forma el núcleo de cualquier flota Sirio, pocos "
"pilotos de combate descartarían la importancia de la Divinidad. Aunque no es "
"excepcionalmente formidable en el combate directo, la capacidad de la "
"Divinidad para desplegar una multitud de cazas le da una flexibilidad sin "
"igual en el combate, sirviendo como nave logística clave en cualquier flota "
"de tamaño considerable."

msgid ""
"The backbone of the House Sirius fleet, the Dogma is a sight to behold. "
"Trimmed in gold and silver and fielding a large array of weapons, the Dogma "
"is seldom surpassed in either prestige or military might."
msgstr ""
"La columna vertebral de la flota de la Casa Sirio, el Dogma es un "
"espectáculo para la vista. Adornado con oro y plata y con un gran arsenal de "
"armas, el Dogma rara vez es superado ni en prestigio ni en poderío militar."

msgid "You need at least 20% reputation with House Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 20% de reputación con la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"The Fidelity is the interceptor of House Sirius. While not particularly "
"competent alone, it's often employed as a forward scout, bringing with it "
"far deadlier allies."
msgstr ""
"La Fidelidad es el interceptor de la Casa Sirio. Aunque no es especialmente "
"competente en solitario, a menudo se emplea como explorador de avanzada, "
"trayendo consigo aliados mucho más mortíferos."

msgid "You need at least 40% reputation with House Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 40% de reputación con la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"The Preacher, as its name implies, is the primary vessel by which House "
"Sirius projects its message and will. Fielding a large array of weaponry, "
"the Preacher is adept at making converts out of unbelievers."
msgstr ""
"El Predicador, como su nombre indica, es el principal vehículo mediante el "
"cual la Casa Sirio proyecta su mensaje y su voluntad. El Predicador, que "
"dispone de un amplio arsenal de armas, es experto en convertir a los "
"incrédulos en adeptos."

msgid "You need at least 60% reputation with House Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 60% de reputación con la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"The Providence is the bulk freighter of House Sirius and is mainly used to "
"transport large amounts of supplies. Some of them are also being used to "
"transport pilgrims, even though most Sirii dislike these overcrowded mass "
"transports."
msgstr ""
"El Providencia es el gran carguero de la Casa Sirio y se utiliza "
"principalmente para transportar grandes cantidades de suministros. Algunos "
"de ellos también se utilizan para transportar peregrinos, aunque a la "
"mayoría de los Sirios les disgustan estos transportes masivos sobrecargados."

msgid "You need at least 30% reputation with House Sirius."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 30% de reputación con la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"Though its relatively sleek form may cause it to be mistaken for a light "
"fighter from a distance, the Shaman is anything but. A purpose-built light "
"missile platform, few enemies escape the reach of the Shaman."
msgstr ""
"Aunque su forma relativamente elegante puede hacer que se le confunda con un "
"caza ligero desde la distancia, el Chamán es cualquier cosa menos eso. Como "
"plataforma de misiles ligera, pocos enemigos escapan al alcance del Chamán."

msgid ""
"Sirius Systems has imported limited numbers of the Krain Starbridge, which "
"they have retrofitted into a luxury fast passenger liner for high-echelon "
"citizens. Featuring shuttle bays, premium passenger cabins, hot water "
"showers, and a built-in meditation chamber, this remodel doesn't come cheap."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bio-Carrier"
msgstr "BioPortanaves"

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with the Soromid."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con Soromida."

msgid ""
"The Soromid Arx usually features in Soromid fleets as a command vessel and "
"fighter carrier. Its unique properties allow it amply the strength of its "
"carried ships, which easily makes up for its reduced number of slots. The "
"Arx tends to be a more lightweight carrier than is typically found in non-"
"Soromid fleets, without sacrificing carrying capacity."
msgstr ""
"El Arx Soromida suele figurar en las flotas Soromida como nave de mando y "
"portanaves de combate. Sus propiedades únicas le permiten una gran fuerza de "
"sus naves portadoras, lo que compensa fácilmente su reducido número de "
"ranuras. El Arx tiende a ser un portanaves más ligero de lo que se suele "
"encontrar en las flotas no Soromida, sin sacrificar la capacidad de "
"transporte."

msgid "Bio-Interceptor"
msgstr "Bio-Interceptor"

msgid "You need at least 20% reputation with the Soromid."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 20% de reputación con Soromida."

msgid ""
"The Brigand is a fast, maneuverable bioship that the Soromid use for system "
"patrols and police duties. The ship is lightly armoured and fairly fragile, "
"but it makes up for this by being fast to grow and therefore relatively "
"expendable."
msgstr ""
"La Forajido es una bionave rápida y maniobrable que los Soromida utilizan "
"para las patrullas del sistema y las tareas policiales. La nave está "
"ligeramente blindada y es bastante frágil, pero lo compensa con un "
"crecimiento rápido y, por tanto, relativamente prescindible."

msgid "Bio-Freighter"
msgstr "Bio-Carguero"

msgid "You need at least 60% reputation with the Soromid."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 60% de reputación con Soromida."

msgid ""
"The Copia bio-freighter is the backbone of Soromid convoys and is frequently "
"used to supply Soromid fleets or military installations with critical "
"supplies. Unlike most cargo ships, the Copia is designed to not shy away "
"from combat, and can be a very deadly ship in the right hands."
msgstr ""
"El biocarguero Copia es la columna vertebral de los envios Soromida y se "
"utiliza con frecuencia para abastecer a las flotas Soromida o a las "
"instalaciones militares con suministros críticos. A diferencia de la mayoría "
"de los cargueros, el Copia está diseñado para no rehuir el combate y puede "
"ser una nave muy letal en las manos adecuadas."

msgid "Bio-Cruiser"
msgstr "Bio-Crucero"

msgid ""
"The Ira is a purpose-grown cruiser commonly found leading Soromid forces. "
"While its armour is somewhat weak, this rarely saves those met with its "
"devastating barrage."
msgstr ""
"El Ira es un crucero creado ex profeso que se encuentra habitualmente al "
"frente de las fuerzas Soromida. Aunque su blindaje es algo débil, esto rara "
"vez salva a los que se encuentran con su devastador bombardeo."

msgid "Bio-Bomber"
msgstr "Bio-Bombardero"

msgid ""
"The Marauder was developed from the same base as the Brigand, but the two "
"ships are quite different. The Marauder was developed to fill a bomber role, "
"which calls for increased durability and ammunition chambers. This makes it "
"quite a bit slower than its distant cousin."
msgstr ""
"El Merodeador se desarrolló a partir de la misma base que el Forajido, pero "
"las dos naves son bastante diferentes. El Merodeador se desarrolló para "
"desempeñar una función de bombardero, lo que exige una mayor durabilidad y "
"cámaras de munición. Esto lo hace bastante más lento que su primo lejano."

msgid "Bio-Destroyer"
msgstr "Bio-Destructor"

msgid ""
"The Nyx is the symbol of the Soromid's military might. Able to provide heavy "
"firepower in heated battles and agile enough to withdraw when needed, this "
"ship usually forms the backbone of any sizable Soromid fleet."
msgstr ""
"El Nyx es el símbolo del poderío militar Soromida. Capaz de proporcionar una "
"gran potencia de fuego en batallas encarnizadas y lo suficientemente ágil "
"como para retirarse cuando es necesario, esta nave suele formar la columna "
"vertebral de cualquier flota Soromida de tamaño considerable."

msgid ""
"This Nyx variant has been engineered as a mobile nest to house and sustain a "
"small squadron of Brigand fighters, allowing the Soromid to project remote "
"carrier-based firepower quickly to where it is needed. The modifications "
"required to create suitable nesting space and cerebrum capacity to support "
"it have resulted in a significant reduction to the ship's direct fire "
"weapons capability."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Odium offers a good balance between shields and armour, as well as an "
"impressive amount of system hardpoints for a ship its size. It can often be "
"found dominating smaller military engagements."
msgstr ""
"El Odio ofrece un buen equilibrio entre escudos y blindaje, así como una "
"impresionante cantidad de puntos de armamento del sistema para una nave de "
"su tamaño. A menudo se puede encontrar dominando los enfrentamientos "
"militares más pequeños."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Reavers are often found at the forefront of Soromid military engagements. "
"Their good speed and maneuverability are compounded by their durability, "
"making the Reaver one of the most effective fighters in the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Los segadores suelen estar en la vanguardia de los enfrentamientos militares "
"Soromida. Su buena velocidad y maniobrabilidad se suma a su durabilidad, lo "
"que convierte al Segador en uno de los cazas pesados más eficaces de la "
"galaxia."

msgid "Bio-Battleship"
msgstr "Bio-Acorazado"

msgid ""
"The Vox is the biggest vessel the Soromid field, hands down. This battleship "
"serves as the core of any given Soromid war fleet and is only called upon in "
"notable engagements."
msgstr ""
"El Vox es la nave más grande Soromida, sin lugar a dudas. Este acorazado es "
"el núcleo de cualquier flota de guerra Soromida y sólo se recurre a él en "
"enfrentamientos importantes."

msgid "Thurion Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Turion"

msgid ""
"The Thurion Apprehension is a defence-focused light destroyer. High mobility "
"paired with advanced electronic defences make it difficult for enemies to "
"detect the ship, let alone attempt to lock onto it."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with the Thurion."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con Turion."

msgid ""
"The largest ship produced by Thurion Shipyards, the Certitude boasts an "
"advanced array of electronics that reproduces a lot of functionality found "
"in any of the node stations, although non-uploaded humans can only make "
"limited use of them through the standard interface. Combat functionality is "
"also unrivaled by other Thurion ships, and the towering presence makes it "
"clear that the ship is not only for support."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Thurion Ingenuity is a fighter built for survival. Like all Thurion "
"ships, it puts defensive capabilities first and offensive capabilities "
"second. However, by no means is the Ingenuity a poor combat craft. It is "
"capable of staying in combat and slugging it out, and when things get too "
"hot, it can quickly retreat to recharge and regenerate. Also, like every "
"Thurion ship, the electronics are well above average."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 20% reputation with the Thurion."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 20% de reputación con Turion."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Thurion Perspicacity is a fast, light fighter typically used for "
"scouting or attacking in swarms. Due to their small size, they use a special "
"nebula-hardened frame, giving them much needed resistance to the nebula "
"volatility."
msgstr ""
"El Perpicaz Turion es un caza rápido y ligero que suele utilizarse para "
"explorar o atacar en enjambres."

msgid ""
"Originally designed as a fast scout ship, the lack of usability quickly led "
"to the redesign as a more capable interceptor. The Perspicacity Beta is the "
"last version before the redesign. It is incapable of supporting weapons due "
"to its small size. However, it can boast an incredible speed boost and "
"slightly more nebula hardening."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Thurion Scintillation is a bomber designed to attack from a large "
"distance. It is better armed than any other Thurion ship of comparable size, "
"but still not as well as bombers from other makers."
msgstr ""
"El Centelleo Turion es un bombardero diseñado para atacar a gran distancia. "
"Está mejor armado que cualquier otra nave Turion de tamaño comparable, pero "
"todavía no tan bien como otros bombarderos no Turion."

msgid ""
"The Thurion Taciturnity is an armoured and stealthy transport capable both "
"of surviving the harsh nebula and defending itself from attack."
msgstr ""
"El Taciturno Turion es un transporte blindado y sigiloso capaz de sobrevivir "
"a la dura nebulosa como de defenderse de los ataques."

msgid "You need at least 40% reputation with the Thurion."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 40% de reputación con Turion."

msgid ""
"The Thurion Virtuosity is a medium-sized ship used by the Thurion for "
"frontal assaults. While weapon space is less than stellar, the vessel's "
"superior electronics and resistance to the harsh nebula more than make up "
"for it."
msgstr ""
"El Virtuoso Turion es una nave de tamaño medio utilizada por los Turion para "
"los asaltos frontales. Aunque el espacio para las armas es menos que "
"estelar, la electrónica superior de la nave y su resistencia a la dura "
"nebulosa lo compensan con creces."

msgid ""
"The Black Diamond is an autonomous fighter-bomber. The hardware that "
"controls this isn't much more complex than House Za'lek combat drones, but "
"it is bigger, and the lack of life support systems and amenities for a pilot "
"allows it to carry extra outfitting space."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This warship is clearly ancient, far predating the Incident. The battleship "
"itself is constructed around a built-in spinal fusion-pumped gamma-ray laser "
"- simple in theory, but utilizing immense energy to terrifying effect. "
"Despite the relatively primitive nature of this weapon, it is a robust and "
"powerful technology, and as a result the Emerald Sword remains a "
"devastatingly powerful warship to this day. One can only wonder from what "
"ancient tomb world, mothballed Imperial project, or museum within the Nebula "
"it was recovered from."
msgstr ""

msgid "Robotic Bomber"
msgstr "Bombardero Robótico"

msgid "Za'lek Robotics"
msgstr "Robóticos Za'lek"

msgid ""
"This is the Za'lek Bomber Drone. Built for attacking heavy ships. Not to be "
"flown by the player."
msgstr ""
"Este es el Dron Bombardero Za'lek. Construido para atacar naves pesadas. No "
"sirve para ser pilotado por el jugador."

msgid "Za'lek Fabricators"
msgstr "Fabricadores Za'lek"

msgid ""
"House Za'lek's ferociously-named destroyer has earned the moniker with "
"disproportionately powerful shields and energy management, as well as size. "
"It has poor armour, like all Za'lek ships, but this comes as little "
"consolation to the Za'lek's enemies."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Za'lek Demon Type IV is a departure from the standard autonomous drone-"
"focused combat philosophy, redesigned to make heavy use of long range "
"weapons such as Za'lek Reaper suicide drones. To achieve this goal, this "
"Demon sports a completely reworked electronics system, with top-notch "
"specially tailored lock-on algorithms. However, as per the no free lunch "
"theorem, this comes at a cost of a much weaker drone command and control "
"system, and the extra weapon slot and missile system storage required "
"removing more of the ship's shield emitters and already thin armour."
msgstr ""

msgid "You need at least 70% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 70% de reputación con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This carrier is the archetypical Za'lek warship. Virtually unarmoured and "
"equipped with heavy shields, they are, however, meant to serve as a platform "
"for devastating drone swarms, not frontline combat."
msgstr ""
"Este portanaves es el arquetipo de nave de guerra Za'lek. Prácticamente sin "
"blindaje y equipado con escudos pesados, está destinado a servir de "
"plataforma para devastadores enjambres de drones, no para el combate en "
"primera línea."

msgid ""
"The Range Artillery Terminal, not-so-lovingly dubbed \"Rat\" by some, is the "
"likely result of someone looking at the design on the Diablo and thinking, "
"\"how many Reapers could we fill this thing up with?\" The special-made "
"weapons system applies the Za'lek's expertise in controlling drones and then "
"some to the many missiles and torpedoes the weapon mounts can be stuffed "
"full of. Where a normal bomber would have to rely on stealth or agility to "
"survive as long as it takes to wear down an opponent, this jumbo-sized "
"counterpart can just as well rely on the enemy being blown to smithereens "
"before being able to do much about it."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This is the Za'lek Heavy Drone. Fewer and not as crap. Not to be flown by "
"the player."
msgstr ""
"Este es el Dron Pesado Za'lek. Menos y no tan malo. No puede ser volado por "
"el jugador."

msgid ""
"The crown of the House Za'lek Defence Fleet, the heaviest ship to be mass-"
"produced in the known galaxy, these proud buttresses of the Za'lek's ideals "
"are unmatched in carrying capacity. Prized by Za'lek battle forces for the "
"terrifying drone swarms it can bring to bear, as well as its utility as a "
"mobile nerve centre owing to the cutting-edge processing and sensor suites, "
"the Hephaestus is rarely-seen, but commands respect."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This is the Za'lek Light Drone. Very weak, cheap and numerous. Not to be "
"flown by the player."
msgstr ""
"Este es el Dron Ligero Za'lek. Muy débil, barato y numeroso. No puede ser "
"pilotado por el jugador."

msgid ""
"While House Za'lek relies on drones for most everything, their limited fuel "
"make them inadequate for performing long-distance transportation. To "
"overcome this limitation, the Mammon Bulk Freighter was developed. It has "
"large amounts of storage space, able to fit entire mobile research centres "
"inside. Like most House Za'lek ships, the armour plating is fairly weak, "
"although it is partially made up for by the advanced shield technology. "
"However, the standard strategy is to rely on drones for fighting while "
"making a getaway."
msgstr ""
"Aunque la Casa Za'lek confía en los drones para casi todo, su limitado "
"combustible los hace inadecuados para realizar transportes de larga "
"distancia. Para superar esta limitación, se desarrolló el Gran Carguero "
"Avaricia. Tiene un gran espacio de almacenamiento, capaz de albergar centros "
"de investigación móviles enteros en su interior. Como la mayoría de las "
"naves de la Casa Za'lek, el blindaje es bastante débil, aunque se compensa "
"parcialmente con la avanzada tecnología de escudos. Sin embargo, la "
"estrategia estándar es confiar en los drones para luchar mientras se produce "
"la huida."

msgid ""
"A mighty ship, the Mephisto has grand energy and shielding management, and "
"its shields allow it to shrug off a lot of abuse. A core of these ships can "
"reduce even powerful fleets to slag in short order."
msgstr ""
"La Mephisto es una nave poderosa, con una gran gestión de la energía y de "
"los escudos, y sus escudos le permiten resistir mucho abuso. Un núcleo de "
"estas naves puede reducir a escoria incluso a las flotas más poderosas en "
"poco tiempo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "You need at least 80% reputation with House Za'lek."
msgstr "Necesitas al menos 50% de reputación con la Casa Za'lek."

msgid ""
"The Mephisto Type V features a drastic yet innovative rehaul of the entire "
"weapons system. It features built-in focusing crystals for beam weapons, "
"that when combined with a energy supercapacitor backend, allows the ship to "
"concentrate beams in devastating attacks. The framework is monolithic, so it "
"can only be activated when only beam weapons and fighter bays are equipped. "
"However, when the conditions are met, the beam weapons can fire at extremely "
"fast rates while still having acceptable energy usage. Although the "
"specifications of the beam focusing crystals are not made public, it is "
"likely they are a severe limiter on the production of such ships, making it "
"very hard to get your hands on one."
msgstr ""

msgid "Robotic Scout"
msgstr "Explorador Robótico"

msgid ""
"This is the Za'lek Scout Drone. Built for scouting, not for battle. Not to "
"be flown by the player."
msgstr ""
"Este es el Dron Explorador Za'lek. Construido para la exploración, no para "
"la batalla. No puede ser pilotado por el jugador."

msgid ""
"The Sting Corvette is rather large for its class, but its advanced sensor "
"suite, impressive weapons loadout, tough shields, and overall flexibility "
"makes it a core part of the House Za'lek fleets. Its low fuel consumption "
"and high autonomy, due to the embedded carrier functionality, make it also "
"an ideal ship for reconnaissance missions."
msgstr ""
"La Corbeta Aguijón es bastante grande para su clase, pero su avanzado "
"conjunto de sensores, su impresionante armamento, sus resistentes escudos y "
"su flexibilidad general la convierten en una parte fundamental de las flotas "
"de la Casa Za'lek. Su bajo consumo de combustible y su gran autonomía, "
"gracias a la funcionalidad de portanaves incorporada, la convierten también "
"en una nave ideal para misiones de reconocimiento."

msgid ""
"The Sting Type II reworks the shield systems of the original model. By "
"rerouting the capacitor recharge loop in a positive feedback loop, "
"regeneration capabilities are significantly increased, at the cost of "
"diminished total shield capacity. The resulting modification results in a "
"ship that is surprisingly robust as long as the shields are up, however, the "
"moment they go down the hull tends to fail shortly after."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A lot of the popularity of the Za'lek Sting comes from the large amount of "
"drones it can deploy for such a small ship. Seeing that, some engineers at "
"Za'lek Fabricators decided to see if they could fit a third fighter bay into "
"the equation. As it turned out, by stripping out a lot of armour and adding "
"auxiliary computational units, it can be made to work. However, these "
"changes do not come cheap."
msgstr ""

msgid "Abacus"
msgstr "Ábaco"

msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Abacus is a very large planet, by rocky planet standards. The Soromid have "
"established a research outpost here to find out more about its structure. "
"The outpost is pretty small, with only a couple dozen researchers on site at "
"any one time. Tourism is out of the question, so is a bar."
msgstr ""
"Ábaco es un planeta muy grande, para los parámetros de los planetas rocosos. "
"Soromida ha establecido aquí un puesto de investigación para averiguar más "
"sobre la estructura del planeta. El puesto de avanzada es bastante pequeño, "
"con sólo un par de docenas de investigadores en el lugar en cualquier "
"momento. El turismo está fuera de lugar, así como un bar."

msgid "Adham"
msgstr "Adham"

msgid "P"
msgstr "P"

msgid ""
"Adham is a cold, lifeless planet. The only reason a landing strip is here at "
"all is that the planet hosts the three arctic-themed arenas for Totoran's "
"gladiatorial games. While the landing zone and a small buffer around it is "
"considered neutral territory, most of the planet's surface is subject to the "
"destructive sport that is so popular among Totoran's visitors."
msgstr ""
"Adham es un planeta frío y sin vida. La única razón por la que existe una "
"pista de aterrizaje es que el planeta alberga las tres arenas de temática "
"ártica para los juegos de gladiadores de Totoran. Mientras que la zona de "
"aterrizaje y una pequeña zona de amortiguación a su alrededor se consideran "
"territorio neutral, la mayor parte de la superficie del planeta está sujeta "
"al deporte destructivo que es tan popular entre los visitantes de Totoran."

msgid "Adius"
msgstr "Adius"

msgid "Adrian"
msgstr "Adrian"

msgid ""
"A cold and unpleasant world, the Sirius established their colony on Adrian "
"in the days when they were just expanding into Eiderdown. At the time the "
"system was controlled by the Empire but with a firm beachhead in the system "
"it was a matter of a few cycles before the Sirii came to power. Today Adrian "
"persists, despite having served its only purpose."
msgstr ""
"Un mundo frío y desagradable, Sirio estableció su colonia en Adrian en los "
"días en que apenas se estaban expandiendo en Eiderdown. En aquel momento el "
"sistema estaba controlado por el Imperio, pero con una firme cabeza de playa "
"en el sistema fue cuestión de unos pocos ciclos que Sirio llegara al poder. "
"Hoy en día Adrian perdura, a pesar de haber cumplido su único propósito."

msgid ""
"Heating on P class worlds is often a costly affair so the temperature is "
"kept at an acceptable, though uncomfortable, low. Most patrons of this "
"spaceport bar are in full winter gear."
msgstr ""
"La calefacción en los mundos de clase P suele ser un asunto costoso, por lo "
"que la temperatura se mantiene en un nivel aceptable, aunque incómodo. La "
"mayoría de los clientes de este bar del puerto espacial llevan ropa de "
"invierno."

msgid "Aera"
msgstr "Aera"

msgid "I"
msgstr "I"

msgid ""
"This gas giant is rich enough in valuable minerals that the Proteron decided "
"to establish a mining colony. The minerals are extracted with OOA heat "
"subduction, which coaxes them out of the planet's dangerous core and into "
"the upper atmosphere where they can be safely collected."
msgstr ""
"Este gigante gaseoso es lo suficientemente rico en minerales valiosos como "
"para que los Proteron decidan establecer una colonia minera. Los minerales "
"se extraen con la subducción de calor OOA, que los saca del peligroso núcleo "
"del planeta y los lleva a la atmósfera superior, donde se pueden recoger de "
"forma segura."

msgid "Aesir IV"
msgstr "Aesir IV"

msgid "Agino"
msgstr "Agino"

msgid "M"
msgstr "M"

msgid ""
"Agino is a bustling planet mostly full of middle-class Soromid citizens. The "
"planet doesn't excel in any area when compared to the worlds in the Soromid "
"core but, this being a remote part of Soromid space, it is still a local "
"highlight."
msgstr ""
"Agino es un planeta bullicioso lleno de ciudadanos Soromida de clase media. "
"El planeta no destaca en ningún ámbito si se compara con los mundos del "
"núcleo Soromida, pero, al tratarse de una parte remota del espacio Soromida, "
"sigue siendo un punto de interés local."

msgid ""
"The person running this spaceport bar is a portly Soromid man named Alverik "
"Sogheem. Alverik usually mans the bar himself and he knows all his customers "
"by name and face. It doesn't matter how long you've been away or where "
"you've been in the galaxy, on your return to Agino, Alverik will remember "
"who you are and cheerfully pour you a drink. Some spacers secretly suspect "
"he has an audiovisual database installed in his head."
msgstr ""
"La persona que regenta este bar del puerto espacial es un corpulento "
"Soromida llamado Alverik Sogheem. Alverik suele atender el bar él mismo y "
"conoce a todos sus clientes por su nombre y su cara. No importa cuánto "
"tiempo hayas estado fuera o en qué lugar de la galaxia hayas estado, a tu "
"regreso a Agino, Alverik recordará quién eres y te servirá alegremente una "
"copa. Algunos espaciales sospechan en secreto que tiene una base de datos "
"audiovisual instalada en su cabeza."

msgid "Ahmed"
msgstr "Ahmed"

msgid "H"
msgstr "H"

msgid ""
"The moon of Ahmed is a small colony of serious minded people, but then given "
"that they are mostly miners that's not too much of a surprise. The few "
"people not mining are doing administration or come here as traders and "
"businessmen looking for turn a credit or two."
msgstr ""
"La luna de Ahmed es una pequeña colonia de gente seria, pero teniendo en "
"cuenta que la mayoría son mineros, no es demasiado sorprendente. Las pocas "
"personas que no se dedican a la minería se dedican a la administración o "
"vienen como comerciantes y hombres de negocios en busca de un crédito o dos."

msgid ""
"A very utilitarian bar with a rather lax attitude to comfort, at least by "
"Empire standards. People come here to do business and talk ore, mineral and "
"gas extraction. The Soromid might understand comfort and how to have a good "
"time but this is clearly not the place where they are doing it."
msgstr ""
"Un bar muy utilitario con una actitud más bien laxa respecto a la comodidad, "
"al menos para los estándares del Imperio. La gente viene aquí a hacer "
"negocios y a hablar de la extracción de minerales y gas. Puede que los "
"Soromida entiendan de comodidad y de cómo pasarlo bien, pero está claro que "
"este no es el lugar donde lo hacen."

msgid "Aillis"
msgstr "Aillis"

msgid ""
"Aillis is the base of operations for miners who mine Koralis VI. Koralis VI "
"itself is highly radioactive so no human habitation is, or will ever be, "
"possible. However, some of the heavy elements within the planet are quite "
"valuable, and so Aillis offers a fair living for those who don't shun heavy, "
"dangerous labour."
msgstr ""
"Aillis es la base de operaciones de los mineros que explotan Koralis VI. "
"Koralis VI es altamente radiactivo, por lo que no es posible, ni lo será "
"nunca, la habitabilidad humana. Sin embargo, algunos de los elementos "
"pesados del planeta son bastante valiosos, por lo que Aillis ofrece una vida "
"justa para aquellos que no rehúyen el trabajo pesado y peligroso."

msgid "Akios Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal Akios"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid ""
"Akios Terminal is a Za'lek border station meant to keep the pirates from the "
"Kretogg system out of Za'lek space. Because of the real threat that the "
"loathsome criminals pose to the great house's security, there is "
"(comparatively) little debate over the necessity over this station's "
"existence."
msgstr ""
"La Terminal Akios es una estación fronteriza Za'lek destinada a mantener a "
"los piratas del sistema Kretogg fuera del espacio Za'lek. Debido a la "
"amenaza real que los repugnantes criminales suponen para la seguridad de la "
"gran casa, hay (comparativamente) poco debate sobre la necesidad de la "
"existencia de esta estación."

msgid "Akra III"
msgstr "Akra III"

msgid "Akra V"
msgstr "Akra V"

msgid "S"
msgstr "S"

msgid "Akrikos"
msgstr "Akrikos"

msgid "J"
msgstr "J"

msgid ""
"Originally significantly larger, Akrikros has very low density due to what "
"has been documented as \"excessive rotation speed\" in the documents from "
"the original Za'lek inspection. Over time, the upper atmosphere has been "
"leaked into space, resulting in the reduced size it has now. The high "
"rotational speed makes it popular along joyriders who like to \"surf\" the "
"atmosphere, however, care has to be taken as turbulences can knock the ship "
"towards the core where all the electromagnetic interference nullifies the "
"sensory equipment. Very few survive such accidents, which have made the "
"activity illegal due to repeated incidents."
msgstr ""

msgid "Aldarus"
msgstr "Aldarus"

msgid "K"
msgstr "K"

msgid ""
"Aldarus has vast oceans filled with an organic sludge that has little to do "
"with water. The atmosphere is toxic and will kill an unprotected human "
"within hectoseconds, requiring full body suits when venturing outside, and "
"mainly confining inhabitants to hermetically sealed living quarters, similar "
"to a space station. The sludge in the seas is a good source of raw materials "
"for all sorts of industries though, and the lack of pollution controls on "
"the planet make it very attractive for unscrupulous corporations."
msgstr ""
"Aldarus tiene vastos océanos llenos de un lodo orgánico que poco tiene que "
"ver con el agua. La atmósfera es tóxica y mataría a un humano desprotegido "
"en cuestión de hectosegundos, que necesitan trajes integrales para salir al "
"exterior y que confinan a sus habitantes en habitáculos herméticamente "
"cerrados, similares a los de una estación espacial. Sin embargo, el lodo de "
"los mares es una buena fuente de materias primas para todo tipo de "
"industrias, y la falta de controles de contaminación en el planeta lo hace "
"muy atractivo para las corporaciones sin escrúpulos."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar on Aldarus offers a variety of recreational activities, "
"such as gambling and competitive gaming. There are also walled-off booths "
"for private conversations, in case the bar's main area is a little too "
"public for comfort. The music here can also be a bit grating on the ears."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Aldarus ofrece diversas actividades "
"recreativas, como juegos de azar y competiciones. También hay cabinas "
"amuralladas para conversaciones privadas, en caso de que la zona principal "
"del bar sea demasiado pública para la comodidad. La música también puede ser "
"un poco molesta para los oídos."

msgid "Aldernael"
msgstr "Aldernael"

msgid "G"
msgstr "G"

msgid ""
"To an ordinary visitor Aldernael might appear rough and unpleasant. When you "
"consider that the world used to be a lifeless planet with a toxic surface "
"and barely any atmosphere to speak of, it's really become a lot more "
"hospitable since the Soromid began to terraform it. Currently, the planet is "
"going through a mainstream colonization phase, thanks to the newly "
"accessible minerals found below the surface. New immigrants arrive every day "
"and Soromid habitation centres are constantly under construction."
msgstr ""
"Para un visitante ordinario, Aldernael puede parecer áspero y desagradable. "
"Si se tiene en cuenta que el mundo solía ser un planeta sin vida, con una "
"superficie tóxica y sin apenas atmósfera, en realidad se ha vuelto mucho más "
"hospitalario desde que Soromida comenzo a terraformarlo. En la actualidad, "
"el planeta está atravesando una fase de colonización generalizada, gracias a "
"los nuevos minerales accesibles que se encuentran bajo la superficie. Todos "
"los días llegan nuevos inmigrantes y se construyen constantemente centros de "
"hábitat Soromida."

msgid ""
"Due to the heavy development on Aldernael the spaceport bar is subject to "
"occasional relocation. The spaceport is at the centre of this, of course, "
"and so the bar suffers and benefits from this in turns. This growth leads to "
"more customers but also the occasional move from one building to another to "
"make room for renovations."
msgstr ""
"Debido al fuerte desarrollo de Aldernael, el bar del puerto espacial está "
"sometido a una reubicación ocasional. El puerto espacial está en el centro "
"de todo esto, por lo que el bar sufre y se beneficia de ello por turnos. "
"Este crecimiento conlleva un aumento de la clientela, pero también el "
"traslado ocasional de un edificio a otro para hacer sitio a las reformas."

msgid "Aldous"
msgstr "Aldous"

msgid ""
"The planet Aldous is a giant sea of a fluid toxic to humans. Even the "
"tiniest exposure to the toxic material in Aldous' ocean is lethal. As far as "
"habitability is concerned, planets like this one come in dead last on the "
"list. Nevertheless, a handful of brave souls have chosen to make this planet "
"their home. The ocean may be toxic, but it also happens to be the perfect "
"environment for producing high quality positronic circuitry."
msgstr ""
"El planeta Aldous es un gigantesco mar de un fluido tóxico para los humanos. "
"Incluso la más mínima exposición al material tóxico del océano de Aldous es "
"letal. En lo que respecta a la habitabilidad, los planetas como éste ocupan "
"el último lugar de la lista. Sin embargo, un puñado de almas valientes han "
"decidido hacer de este planeta su hogar. El océano puede ser tóxico, pero "
"también resulta ser el entorno perfecto para producir circuitos positrónicos "
"de alta calidad."

msgid ""
"The spaceport facility is part of a larger structure that houses the "
"entirety of this planet's human inhabitants. The complex, more or less, "
"floats on the surface and is tightly sealed against the outside environment. "
"Furthermore, the complex is highly compartmentalized, in case a leak somehow "
"occurs. Some spacers even insist on wearing breathing masks, even in the "
"spaceport bar, just to be on the safe side."
msgstr ""
"La instalación del puerto espacial forma parte de una estructura mayor que "
"alberga a todos los habitantes humanos de este planeta. El complejo, más o "
"menos, flota en la superficie y está herméticamente sellado contra el "
"entorno exterior. Además, el complejo está muy compartimentado, por si se "
"produce alguna fuga. Algunos espaciales insisten en llevar máscaras "
"respiratorias, incluso en el bar del puerto espacial, para estar seguros."

msgid "Aldous' moon"
msgstr "Luna de Aldous"

msgid "Aleph"
msgstr "Aleph"

msgid ""
"In an impressive feat of de-terraforming, the Dvaered have transformed Aleph "
"from a borderline class M to a barren wasteland. Though the world is "
"primarily residential and sports no superheavy industry, the wastefulness of "
"the Dvaered inhabitants more than makes up for that."
msgstr ""
"En una impresionante hazaña de desterraformación, los Dvaered han "
"transformado Aleph de una clase M limítrofe a un páramo estéril. Aunque el "
"mundo es principalmente residencial y no cuenta con una industria "
"superpesada, el derroche de los habitantes Dvaered lo compensa con creces."

msgid ""
"The air in the spaceport bar is stuffy. The air is stuffy everywhere on this "
"planet. No amount of air conditioning and filtering is going to get rid of "
"the staleness completely. The drinks do little to relieve the stuffiness "
"either."
msgstr ""
"El aire del bar del puerto espacial está cargado. El aire está viciado en "
"todo el planeta. Ningún tipo de aire acondicionado ni de filtro va a "
"eliminar por completo el aire viciado. Las bebidas tampoco ayudan a aliviar "
"la congestión."

msgid "Alleyway"
msgstr "Alleyway"

msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Originally intended to be a trading hub and refuelling stop for merchants, "
"this station has effectively turned into a hub for both pirates and bounty "
"hunters. Authorities have long ago given up any hope of controlling the "
"chaos, so everyone knows to be armed and remain vigilant at all times."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación, que en un principio iba a ser un centro de comercio y una "
"parada para repostar para los comerciantes, se ha convertido en un centro de "
"piratas y cazarrecompensas. Las autoridades hace tiempo que perdieron toda "
"esperanza de controlar el caos, así que todo el mundo sabe que debe ir "
"armado y permanecer vigilante en todo momento."

msgid ""
"The bar is a mix of mostly pirates and bounty hunters, with a handful of "
"merchants and gamblers. Fights often break out and it's hard to tell who to "
"trust, so most people keep to themselves and avoid eye contact with others."
msgstr ""
"El bar es una mezcla de piratas y cazarrecompensas, con un puñado de "
"comerciantes y jugadores. A menudo se producen peleas y es difícil saber en "
"quién confiar, por lo que la mayoría de la gente es reservada y evita el "
"contacto visual con los demás."

msgid "Allous Citadel"
msgstr "Ciudadela Allous"

msgid ""
"Despite the name, Allous Citadel is not a military outpost, it is more of a "
"scientific observation centre and deep-space observatory. Originally it was "
"meant to keep an eye on the high-interference nebula of PSO. Even the "
"Dvaered have a scientific community, and they paid for this station out of "
"their own pockets. Of course, once it was built, there was no longer any "
"need for them to pay for it as numerous warlords, with dreams of "
"intellectualism, are happy to offer their patronage."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de su nombre, la Ciudadela Allous no es un puesto de avanzada "
"militar, es más bien un centro de observación científica y un observatorio "
"del espacio profundo. Originalmente estaba destinada a vigilar la nebulosa "
"de alta interferencia de PSO. Incluso los Dvaered tienen una comunidad "
"científica, y pagaron esta estación de su propio bolsillo. Por supuesto, una "
"vez construida, ya no fue necesario que la pagaran, ya que numerosos señores "
"de la guerra, con sueños de intelectualidad, están encantados de ofrecer su "
"patrocinio."

msgid ""
"This bar looks like something one would expect from Za'lek space. Scientists "
"and soldiers are interacting with surprising friendliness and conviviality. "
"Of course, the local warlords would, and do, tolerate nothing less."
msgstr ""
"Este bar parece algo que uno esperaría del espacio Za'lek. Científicos y "
"soldados se relacionan con sorprendente amabilidad y convivencia. Por "
"supuesto, los señores de la guerra locales no tolerarían, y no toleran, nada "
"menos."

msgid "Allous GG-3"
msgstr "Allous GG-3"

msgid "Allous I"
msgstr "Allous I"

msgid "Allous II"
msgstr "Allous II"

msgid "Alpha Aquilea"
msgstr "Alfa Aquilea"

msgid "Alsafi I"
msgstr "Alsafi I"

msgid "Alsafi Ia"
msgstr "Alsafi Ia"

msgid ""
"Once a small-time trading colony that dealt with resources collected from "
"Alsafi I and the nearby asteroid field, it has been abandoned since shortly "
"after the incident with the loss of the atmosphere and deteriorated "
"habitability due to the Nebula. Whatever the inhabitants weren't able to "
"take with them when they fled has been completely ransacked by scavengers. "
"Only the left behind garbage and worthless buildings give an indication that "
"there used to be civilization here."
msgstr ""
"Antaño una pequeña colonia comercial que manejabao los recursos recogidos en "
"Alsafi I y el campo de asteroides cercano, ha estado abandonada desde poco "
"después del incidente con la pérdida de la atmósfera y el deterioro de la "
"habitabilidad debido a la Nebulosa. Todo lo que los habitantes no pudieron "
"llevarse cuando huyeron ha sido completamente saqueado por los carroñeros. "
"Sólo la basura abandonada y los edificios sin valor dan indicios de que aquí "
"hubo civilización."

msgid "Alsafi Ib"
msgstr "Alsafi Ib"

msgid "Alsafi II"
msgstr "Alsafi II"

msgid "D"
msgstr "D"

msgid ""
"Alsafi II is a barren world that other than some indications of prospection "
"sites looking for mineral, is devoid of anything of interest."
msgstr ""
"Alsafi II es un mundo estéril que, salvo algunos signos de prospección en "
"busca de minerales, carece de cualquier cosa de interés."

msgid "Alteris I"
msgstr "Alteris I"

msgid "Alteris IV"
msgstr "Alteris IV"

msgid "Alteris V"
msgstr "Alteris V"

msgid "Aluben"
msgstr "Aluben"

msgid "Amaroq I"
msgstr "Amaroq I"

msgid "Amaroq III"
msgstr "Amaroq III"

msgid "O"
msgstr "O"

msgid "Amatiri I"
msgstr "Amatiri I"

msgid "Amatiri Ia"
msgstr "Amatiri Ia"

msgid "Amatiri II"
msgstr "Amatiri II"

msgid "C"
msgstr "C"

msgid "Ambre"
msgstr "Ambre"

msgid ""
"Ambre was one of the planets that played a key role in the workers' revolts "
"that eventually led to the establishment of House Dvaered. In those days the "
"planet was home to a considerable percentage of the Imperial workforce in "
"this sector of space. Without labourers to work the mines and construction "
"yards, the Empire stood to lose astronomical amounts of money each cycle. "
"This was one of the important reasons the Emperor granted House Dvaered its "
"independence."
msgstr ""
"Ambre fue uno de los planetas que desempeñó un papel clave en las revueltas "
"obreras que acabaron conduciendo a la creación de la Casa Dvaered. En "
"aquella época, el planeta albergaba un porcentaje considerable de la mano de "
"obra imperial en este sector del espacio. Sin trabajadores que trabajaran en "
"las minas y los astilleros de construcción, el Imperio perdía cantidades "
"astronómicas de dinero cada ciclo. Esta fue una de las razones importantes "
"por las que el Emperador concedió a la Casa Dvaered su independencia."

msgid ""
"Ambre's spaceport bar is never quiet. At regular intervals all other noise "
"in the bar is drowned out by the sound of cargo pods trundling along the "
"railway just below. The bar was built relatively late in the planet's "
"development; the Imperial government didn't see the need for one when Ambre "
"was little more than a labour camp. After independence the bar was squeezed "
"into one of the only remaining spaces available, which was right over the "
"freight lines."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Ambre nunca está tranquilo. A intervalos "
"regulares, todo el ruido del bar se ve ahogado por el sonido de las cápsulas "
"de carga que circulan por la vía férrea justo debajo. El bar se construyó "
"relativamente tarde en el desarrollo del planeta; el gobierno imperial no "
"vio la necesidad de uno cuando Ambre era poco más que un campo de trabajo. "
"Después de la independencia, el bar se instaló en uno de los únicos espacios "
"disponibles, justo encima de las líneas de carga."

msgid "Amhurst"
msgstr "Amhurst"

msgid ""
"A glorified mining and trading world, this planet is one of the better-off "
"casualties of the brain-drain affecting Za'lek's southern frontier. While it "
"has not been hit as hard as many, it has seen its population dip in recent "
"cycles. Most of the population are miners and other working-class folk."
msgstr ""
"Este planeta, un mundo minero y comercial glorificado, es una de las "
"víctimas más favorecidas de la fuga de cerebros que afecta a la frontera sur "
"de Za'lek. Aunque no se ha visto tan afectado como otros, ha visto disminuir "
"su población en los últimos ciclos. La mayoría de la población son mineros y "
"otros trabajadores."

msgid ""
"If one didn't know better, they would assume this was a Dvaered bar. The "
"rough aesthetic, the clientele, almost everything. There is little sign of "
"the usual Za'lek trappings here."
msgstr ""
"Si uno no lo supiera, asumiría que se trata de un bar Dvaered. La estética "
"tosca, la clientela, casi todo. Hay pocos indicios de los rasgos habituales "
"de los Za'lek aquí."

msgid "Amianta"
msgstr "Amianta"

msgid ""
"The frigid temperatures of Amianta would drive some people away, but the "
"Proteron colonized it anyway due to the rich source of both food and water "
"found underneath the ice."
msgstr ""
"Las gélidas temperaturas de Amianta ahuyentarían a algunas personas, pero "
"Proteron la colonizó de todos modos debido a la rica fuente tanto de "
"alimentos como de agua que se encuentra bajo el hielo."

msgid "Amlet I"
msgstr ""

msgid "Amlet Ia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A large chunk of rock orbiting around the gas giant Amlet I. With barely any "
"gravity and no remarkable characteristics, Amlet Ia is mainly ignored by "
"those that travel through the system."
msgstr ""

msgid "Amlet Ib"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Much denser than Amlet 1a, this moon of Amlet I has some insignificant "
"mineral deposits near the core. There used to be a small mining operation, "
"but it has long since been abandoned given the difficulty of operating in "
"war, and the small yields. Now, most of House Yetmer's resources are "
"obtained through imports or mining operations on Amletia."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Amlet Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Eist"

msgid ""
"The first thing you notice about the Amlet Shipyard is the large amount of "
"anti-spacecraft mounts all over the station. The second is the minimal "
"infrastructure, seemingly designed to maximize ship production with as few "
"additional expenses as possible. This includes not using pressured "
"spacedocks, with workers operating on the new ships directly in space suits. "
"The actual pressurized area of the station is minimal, with most workers "
"spending their leisure time in ships parked nearby instead of actually "
"entering the tight station quarters."
msgstr ""

msgid "Amletia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Ceded to House Yetmer-O'rez and named after the first-born heir Amlet Yetmer-"
"O'rez, Amletia was meant to be the secondary planet of the House, a safe "
"place to raise children. However, after the intra-house war started, the "
"local infrastructure has been forced to transition from luxurious housing "
"and second homes to industrial infrastructure to support the war efforts. As "
"can be expected, this has taken a heavy toll on the quality of life on the "
"planet over the many cycles that have passed since the fighting began. It is "
"not uncommon for sirens to sound when enemy ships enter the system, but it "
"seems like most people have gotten used to and mostly ignore them as they go "
"about their business.\n"
"\n"
"Amletia was heavily hit during the beginning of the war, coming under siege "
"by House O'rez. However, it was nearly miraculously overcome by a small "
"fleet that was able to break the blockade and liberate the planet. The "
"pilots are still revered as heroes to this day with a prominent statue at "
"the space port. A lot of the damage done then is still visible throughout "
"the planet surface."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"What was once the Amlet Bistro has been replaced with a more practical "
"Yetmer Cantina. The outer building is spectacularly lavish, however, half of "
"it has had to be replaced due to a near-miss by a bomb at the beginning of "
"the war. The insides have been reinforced with ship panels to give more "
"protection to the clients at a low cost. Usually, the bar is crowded with "
"weary pilots between their patrol and attack shifts. The few non-locals tend "
"to mind their own business as much as possible and leave as soon as they can."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ammu"
msgstr "Ammu"

msgid ""
"Ammu is a generally calm planet, once one is accustomed to the constant "
"rumbling of the lava flows. Lava eruptions are often felt in the "
"subterranean spaceport, but the way it doesn't seem to faze the locals "
"reassures you. The lava does have a more positive aspect in attracting "
"industries that need high pressure and temperature to function effectively, "
"but the climate makes Ammu dependent on nearby planets such as Reidd for "
"food supplies."
msgstr ""
"Ammu es un planeta generalmente tranquilo, una vez que uno se acostumbra al "
"constante estruendo de las corrientes de lava. Las erupciones de lava se "
"sienten a menudo en el puerto espacial subterráneo, pero la forma en que no "
"parece perturbar a los lugareños te tranquiliza. La lava tiene un aspecto "
"más positivo al atraer industrias que necesitan alta presión y temperatura "
"para funcionar eficazmente, pero el clima hace que Ammu dependa de planetas "
"cercanos como Reidd para el suministro de alimentos."

msgid ""
"The Ammu Spaceport Bar, known as \"The Heatsink\" due to its frigid "
"temperatures, is a contrast to the rest of the station, although on most "
"planets it would be considered fairly warm. While primarily known for its "
"temperature, that's not to say you can't get a mean Pan-Galactic Gargle "
"Blaster."
msgstr ""
"El Bar del Puerto Espacial de Ammu, conocido como \"El Disipador\" debido a "
"sus gélidas temperaturas, contrasta con el resto de la estación, aunque en "
"la mayoría de los planetas se consideraría bastante cálido. Aunque es "
"conocido sobre todo por su temperatura, eso no quiere decir que no se pueda "
"conseguir un buen Trago Blaster Pan-Galáctico."

msgid "Amphion"
msgstr "Amphion"

msgid ""
"Amphion is a popular retirement spot for Empire officers. It is close enough "
"to the Empire's core to provoke appreciative memories of service but far "
"enough away for peace. The oceans that dominate the planet's surface are "
"calm and the many underwater cities are famous all over the Empire for their "
"grandeur and opulence."
msgstr ""
"Amphion es un lugar de retiro popular para los oficiales del Imperio. Está "
"lo suficientemente cerca del núcleo del Imperio como para provocar recuerdos "
"agradecidos del servicio, pero lo suficientemente lejos como para que haya "
"paz. Los océanos que dominan la superficie del planeta son tranquilos y las "
"numerosas ciudades submarinas son famosas en todo el Imperio por su grandeza "
"y opulencia."

msgid ""
"The average age of the patrons here appears to be late middle-age. The bar "
"itself is done up in an old-world style tavern, low and dark, cozy and "
"cheery. You wind up making easy friends in the amiable and relaxing "
"atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"La edad media de los clientes parece ser de mediana edad. El bar en sí está "
"decorado como una taberna del viejo mundo, baja, oscura, acogedora y alegre. "
"Se acaban haciendo amigos fácilmente en el ambiente amable y relajado."

msgid "Anarbalis II"
msgstr "Anarbalis II"

msgid "Anarbalis III"
msgstr "Anarbalis III"

msgid "Andee II"
msgstr "Andee II"

msgid "Andee IIa"
msgstr "Andee IIa"

msgid "Andee III"
msgstr "Andee III"

msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

msgid "Andee IIIa"
msgstr "Andee IIIa"

msgid ""
"A moon of the X-class highly radioactive Andee III, although the planet is "
"deemed highly uninhabitable by any of the habitability metrics of the "
"Empire, Andee IIIa shows as beautiful as is dangerous atmospheric displays "
"of light when the eccentric orbit passes close to the primary. Originally "
"used as a tour spot that some wealthier Touched pilgrims would detour to see "
"on their way to Mutris, after the fated incident of the Provenius Mule-class "
"ship where 300 pilgrims lost their lives, House Sirius forbid tourism under "
"strict penalties. Nowadays few venture out to visit, making it a very solemn "
"site."
msgstr ""

msgid "Andors"
msgstr "Andors"

msgid ""
"This barren world has a wealth of minerals buried beneath kilometres of ice, "
"and the Za'lek have deployed considerable resources in order to tap its "
"resources. Unlike more developed Za'lek settlements, there is little in the "
"way of scholarly presence here."
msgstr ""
"Este mundo estéril tiene una gran riqueza de minerales enterrados bajo "
"kilómetros de hielo, y los Za'lek han desplegado considerables recursos para "
"aprovechar sus recursos. A diferencia de los asentamientos Za'lek más "
"desarrollados, aquí hay poca presencia de estudiosos."

msgid ""
"This bar serves as a welcome respite from the biting winds and frigid "
"temperatures that pervade the planet. The menu largely consists of hot "
"beverages and hearty food, and the patrons are almost exclusively off-duty "
"Za'lek workers."
msgstr ""
"Este bar sirve como un bienvenido respiro de los vientos cortantes y las "
"gélidas temperaturas que invaden el planeta. El menú consiste en gran parte "
"en bebidas calientes y comida abundante, y los clientes son casi "
"exclusivamente trabajadores Za'lek fuera de servicio."

msgid "Andors Refining"
msgstr "Refinería Andors"

msgid ""
"This simple refining plant is where the ore collected on Andors is turned "
"into a more useful form and shipped out to other worlds to be turned into "
"whatever is needed. The entire station is heavily automated with only the "
"bare minimum of staff manning the station. Work consists mainly of the "
"maintenance of the droids and playing card games."
msgstr ""

msgid "Anecu"
msgstr "Anecu"

msgid ""
"Anecu is a completely aquatic planet. Its surface is covered completely by "
"water but in the shallow areas great underwater cities are constructed. The "
"climate above the water can be very harsh; waves been recorded to be up to "
"two kilometres high. The planet boasts extensive ship-design facilities "
"which use the high pressure of the water as a benchmark against which ships "
"can be measured."
msgstr ""
"Anecu es un planeta completamente acuático. Su superficie está cubierta "
"completamente por agua, pero en las zonas poco profundas se construyen "
"grandes ciudades submarinas. El clima sobre el agua puede ser muy extremo; "
"se han registrado olas de hasta dos kilómetros de altura. El planeta cuenta "
"con amplias instalaciones de diseño de naves que utilizan la alta presión "
"del agua como test para sus capacidades."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is approximately three kilometres below the surface of the "
"planet. The walls are constructed from a hardened, transparent polymer that "
"allows you to see into the darkness of the water. Every so often you can see "
"gelatinous creatures sliding around, barely illuminated by the bar's "
"lighting."
msgstr ""
"La barra del puerto espacial está a unos tres kilómetros por debajo de la "
"superficie del planeta. Las paredes están construidas con un polímero "
"endurecido y transparente que permite ver en la oscuridad del agua. De vez "
"en cuando se pueden ver criaturas gelatinosas deslizándose, apenas "
"iluminadas por la iluminación del bar."

msgid "Anger I"
msgstr "Cólera I"

msgid "Anger II"
msgstr "Cólera II"

msgid "L"
msgstr "L"

msgid "Anifta"
msgstr "Anifta"

msgid "Anker"
msgstr "Anker"

msgid "An'ku I"
msgstr "An'ku I"

msgid "An'ku II"
msgstr "An'ku II"

msgid "An'ku III"
msgstr "An'ku III"

msgid "Antica"
msgstr "Antica"

msgid ""
"Though the orbiting military installation is all business, Antica mixes "
"business and pleasure quite readily. Given its location, a vast number of "
"transports stop at Antica to sell their wares before venturing deeper into "
"Empire space."
msgstr ""
"Aunque la instalación militar en órbita es todo comercio, Antica mezcla con "
"bastante facilidad los negocios y el placer. Dada su ubicación, un gran "
"número de transportes se detienen en Antica para vender sus productos antes "
"de aventurarse en el espacio del Imperio."

msgid ""
"The Antican bar is a rather lavish affair, quite in contrast to the stark "
"exterior of the orbiting military station. Serving some of the Empire's "
"finest food and drink, this Arcturian bar is often a traveller's "
"introduction to Empire cuisine."
msgstr ""
"El bar Antican es un lugar bastante lujoso, que contrasta con el austero "
"exterior de la estación militar en órbita. Este bar Arcturiano, que sirve "
"algunas de las mejores comidas y bebidas del Imperio, suele ser la "
"introducción de los viajeros a la cocina del Imperio."

msgid "Antlejos III"
msgstr "Antlejos III"

msgid "B"
msgstr "B"

msgid "Antlejos IV"
msgstr "Antlejos IV"

msgid "Antlejos Prime"
msgstr "Antlejos Prime"

#. Use default
#. Function for adding log entries for miscellaneous one-off missions.
msgid "Antlejos V"
msgstr "Antlejos V"

msgid "A cold and barren inhospitable moon devoid of all life."
msgstr "Una luna inhóspita, fría y estéril, desprovista de toda vida."

msgid "Anubis"
msgstr "Anubis"

msgid "Y"
msgstr "Y"

msgid ""
"Named after the Egyptian god of death, Anubis was established as a mining "
"base by a mining faction even before the Faction Wars. The abundance of "
"radioactive and heavy elements made the planet a good location to produce "
"weapons, a lucrative business given its relative proximity to Sol. During "
"the Faction Wars, Anubis was annexed by the Empire but the local population "
"subsequently joined the protest movement that eventually led to the "
"establishment of House Dvaered. Today, the Dvaered use Anubis to produce "
"ammunition and light combat ships which are shipped back to the Dvaered "
"territories."
msgstr ""
"Nombrado en honor al dios Egipcio de la muerte, Anubis fue establecido como "
"base minera por una facción minera incluso antes de las Guerras de Facción. "
"La abundancia de elementos radiactivos y pesados hacía del planeta un buen "
"lugar para producir armas, un negocio lucrativo dada su proximidad a Sol. "
"Durante las Guerras de las Facciones, Anubis fue anexionado por el Imperio, "
"pero la población local se unió posteriormente al movimiento de protesta que "
"finalmente condujo a la creación de la Casa Dvaered. En la actualidad, los "
"Dvaered utilizan Anubis para producir munición y naves de combate ligeras "
"que se envían de vuelta a los territorios Dvaered."

msgid ""
"What is beautiful is often dangerous but sometimes it also works the other "
"way around. The spaceport bar on Anubis has a view over a ravine in the "
"planet's surface and the radioactive storms that frequently rage through it "
"are quite a sight to behold. Only offworlders appreciate it though, most of "
"the locals know how unpleasant it is to have to work in such raging, "
"radioactive conditions."
msgstr ""
"Lo que es bello suele ser peligroso, pero a veces también ocurre lo "
"contrario. El bar del puerto espacial de Anubis tiene vistas a un barranco "
"en la superficie del planeta y las tormentas radiactivas que a menudo lo "
"atraviesan son un espectáculo digno de ver. Sin embargo, sólo los "
"extranjeros lo aprecian, ya que la mayoría de los lugareños saben lo "
"desagradable que es tener que trabajar en esas condiciones radiactivas."

msgid "Anya"
msgstr "Anya"

msgid "N"
msgstr "N"

msgid ""
"Anya is the twin planet to Sabe, orbiting around their shared centre of "
"gravity in tandem. Anya is shrouded in a permanent cloud cover of ash and "
"snow however, as a result of geological activity. A small number of Thurions "
"live on the surface of Anya but no large scale colonization effort has "
"commenced as of yet, despite the planet's proximity to Sabe, the Thurian "
"capital world. This is due, at least in part, to the geological "
"instabilities of the planet."
msgstr ""
"Anya es el planeta gemelo de Sabe, que orbita alrededor de su centro de "
"gravedad compartido en tándem. Sin embargo, Anya está envuelta en una capa "
"permanente de ceniza y nieve, como resultado de la actividad geológica. En "
"la superficie de Anya vive un pequeño número de Turiones, pero todavía no se "
"ha iniciado ningún esfuerzo de colonización a gran escala, a pesar de la "
"proximidad del planeta a Sabe, el mundo capital de los Turianos. Esto se "
"debe, al menos en parte, a las inestabilidades geológicas del planeta."

msgid ""
"The bar on Anya is small and quaint, populated by locals who live here. As "
"is usual for Thurion bars, no alcohol or other substances deemed to be "
"damaging to the brain are served."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Anya es pequeño y pintoresco, poblado por los lugareños que viven "
"aquí. Como es habitual en los bares de Turión, no se sirve alcohol ni otras "
"sustancias consideradas perjudiciales para el cerebro."

msgid "Apez II"
msgstr "Apez II"

msgid "Apez V"
msgstr "Apez V"

msgid "Apik I"
msgstr "Apik I"

msgid "Apik II"
msgstr "Apik II"

msgid "Apik Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Apik"

msgid ""
"Unlike Sigma Bastion in Leporis, Apik Shipyard is designed to cater to the "
"needs of the general population. It efficiently churns out and services "
"civilian vessels on an as-needed basis."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia del Bastión Sigma en Leporis, el Astillero Apik está diseñado "
"para atender las necesidades de la población en general. Produce y atiende "
"eficazmente a las naves civiles en función de sus necesidades."

msgid "Aquilia"
msgstr "Aquilia"

msgid "Arai"
msgstr "Arai"

msgid "Arandon Station"
msgstr "Estación Arandon"

msgid "Ruined Station"
msgstr "Estación Arruinada"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once a bustling commerce centre, the station was irreparably wrecked in the "
"Incident, and has been picked clean by scavengers. One inexplicable thing is "
"that it seems like large nebula crystals have started to grow on the "
"station's ruins. Wait, is this really Arandon Station?"
msgstr ""
"La estación, que en su día fue un bullicioso centro comercial, quedó "
"irremediablemente destrozada en el Incidente y ha sido limpiada por los "
"carroñeros. Una cosa inexplicable es que parece que grandes cristales de "
"nebulosa han empezado a crecer en las ruinas de la estación. Espera, ¿es "
"esto realmente la Estación Arandon?"

msgid "Arashu"
msgstr "Arashu"

msgid ""
"Arashu is a peculiar planet, it is both oceanic and highly volcanic. The "
"planet's oceanic crust is prone to earthquakes, this causes tidal waves to "
"wash over the few areas of dry land. A Sirian corporation has invested in "
"harnessing the energies released by this process, turning the planet into a "
"profitable weapons production plant. All manufacturing happens on floating "
"platforms so the workers and equipment are safe from the constant seismic "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"Arashu es un planeta peculiar, es a la vez oceánico y altamente volcánico. "
"La corteza oceánica del planeta es propensa a los terremotos, lo que hace "
"que los maremotos arrasen las pocas zonas de tierra firme. Una corporación "
"siria ha invertido en el aprovechamiento de las energías liberadas por este "
"proceso, convirtiendo el planeta en una rentable planta de producción de "
"armas. Toda la fabricación se realiza en plataformas flotantes para que los "
"trabajadores y el equipo estén a salvo de la constante actividad sísmica."

msgid ""
"The bar features a big display that shows a geological map of the planet "
"which, due to most of the world being covered in ocean, makes for a rather "
"uninteresting map. The display also shows all the volcanic activity going on "
"at the moment, so it is actually quite fascinating interesting to watch, "
"especially once you can place the spaceport and bar!"
msgstr ""
"El bar cuenta con una gran pantalla que muestra un mapa geológico del "
"planeta que, debido a que la mayor parte del mundo está cubierta de océanos, "
"resulta un mapa poco interesante. La pantalla también muestra toda la "
"actividad volcánica que se está produciendo en ese momento, por lo que "
"resulta bastante fascinante de ver, ¡especialmente una vez que puedes "
"colocar el puerto espacial y el bar!"

msgid "Arcadia"
msgstr "Arcadia"

msgid ""
"Rather ironically, yet aptly named, Arcadia is a world bombarded by acidic "
"rains and other, equally nasty weather patterns. As such, it was the core "
"world of a successful experiment to see if such an environment can still "
"support a massive crop growing campaign given the proper insulation "
"technology and procedures. The project was in fact so successful that "
"Arcadia became a hub for food distribution throughout localized Za'lek space."
msgstr ""
"De forma bastante irónica, pero con un nombre muy apropiado, Arcadia es un "
"mundo bombardeado por lluvias ácidas y otros patrones climáticos igualmente "
"desagradables. Como tal, fue el mundo central de un exitoso experimento para "
"ver si un entorno así podía soportar una campaña de cultivo masivo con la "
"tecnología y los procedimientos de aislamiento adecuados. De hecho, el "
"proyecto tuvo tanto éxito que Arcadia se convirtió en un centro de "
"distribución de alimentos en todo el espacio Za'lek localizado."

msgid ""
"Many freight captains, farmers and scientists mingle peacefully here, "
"discussing new and better ways to improve farming technology and get more "
"and better food for less cost."
msgstr ""
"Muchos capitanes de carga, agricultores y científicos se mezclan "
"pacíficamente aquí, discutiendo nuevas y mejores formas de mejorar la "
"tecnología agrícola y obtener más y mejores alimentos por menor coste."

msgid "Arcania"
msgstr "Arcania"

msgid ""
"Arcania used to host the prestigious Arcania Military Academy which was "
"highly coveted by the imperial forces. While the planet was not "
"significantly affected by the Incident directly, changes in the star and "
"gravitational field of the Arcanis system led the planet to sharing a new "
"orbit with the Arcanis asteroid field to devastating effects. The constant "
"pummeling of the planet surface by meteorites of all sizes has eliminated "
"all traces of human occupation, clearing what were once cities to dust "
"mixing with the arid sand of the planet surface."
msgstr ""
"Arcania solía albergar la prestigiosa Academia Militar Arcania, muy "
"codiciada por las fuerzas imperiales. Aunque el planeta no se vio afectado "
"de forma significativa por el Incidente directamente, los cambios en la "
"estrella y el campo gravitatorio del sistema Arcanis llevaron al planeta a "
"compartir una nueva órbita con el campo de asteroides Arcanis con efectos "
"devastadores. El constante azote de la superficie del planeta por meteoritos "
"de todos los tamaños ha eliminado todo rastro de ocupación humana, "
"convirtiendo lo que una vez fueron ciudades en polvo que se mezcla con la "
"árida arena de la superficie del planeta."

msgid "Arch Arai"
msgstr "Arch Arai"

msgid ""
"Once an independent world, home to pirates and black market traders, Arch "
"Arai has long since fallen under the spell of the Touched. Now it is a "
"fairly law-abiding Sirius world, earning its existence through legal trade "
"and industry like almost every other planet. Given its proximity with the "
"Dvaered border, it still continues to attract new immigrants and converts "
"that have recently entered Sirius space."
msgstr ""
"Arch Arai, que antaño fue un mundo independiente, hogar de piratas y "
"comerciantes del mercado negro, hace tiempo que cayó bajo el hechizo de los "
"Tocados. Ahora es un mundo Sirio bastante respetuoso con la ley, que se gana "
"la existencia mediante el comercio y la industria legales, como casi "
"cualquier otro planeta. Dada su proximidad con la frontera Dvaered, sigue "
"atrayendo a nuevos inmigrantes y conversos que han entrado recientemente en "
"el espacio de Sirio."

msgid ""
"This bar is a quiet place. Though it is certainly not lacking in patronage, "
"the people who come here don't seem about to make a fuss over anything. The "
"effect is contagious making newcomers follow the example of those who are "
"already there, almost instinctively."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es un lugar tranquilo. Aunque no le falta clientela, la gente que "
"viene aquí no parece estar dispuesta a hacer un escándalo por nada. El "
"efecto es contagioso haciendo que los recién llegados sigan el ejemplo de "
"los que ya están allí, casi instintivamente."

msgid "Arck"
msgstr "Arck"

msgid ""
"With nine billion inhabitants, Arck is one of the most densely populated "
"worlds in the galaxy. Most of the planet's surface is covered by a gigantic, "
"sprawling city. Naturally, with so much habitation comes massive "
"environmental pollution, many skeptics believe that what the Dvaered are "
"doing here is a form of reverse terraforming - an attempt to turn Arck into "
"an X class planet."
msgstr ""
"Con nueve mil millones de habitantes, Arck es uno de los mundos más "
"densamente poblados de la galaxia. La mayor parte de la superficie del "
"planeta está cubierta por una gigantesca ciudad en expansión. Naturalmente, "
"con tanta población viene la contaminación ambiental masiva, muchos "
"escépticos creen que lo que los Dvaered están haciendo aquí es una forma de "
"terraformación inversa - un intento de convertir Arck en un planeta de clase "
"X."

msgid ""
"The spaceport on Arck is located right in the middle of a particularly "
"densely populated urban hub. The associated bar has been expanded and turned "
"into a general leisure facility for the local inhabitants, something that "
"often irritates traders who come here to do business, only to find "
"themselves in the middle of a Dvaered Turborave party."
msgstr ""
"El puerto espacial de Arck está situado justo en el centro de un núcleo "
"urbano especialmente densamente poblado. El bar asociado ha sido ampliado y "
"convertido en un lugar de ocio general para los habitantes locales, algo que "
"a menudo irrita a los comerciantes que vienen aquí a hacer negocios, sólo "
"para encontrarse en medio de una fiesta Turborave Dvaered."

msgid "Arcturus Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Arcturus"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Arcturus Enclave is the Empire's main line of defence when it comes to their "
"core systems from the northeast. An imposing force force stationed here with "
"constant routine patrols tries to make sure no undesirable ships make it "
"into Empire space."
msgstr ""
"El Enclave Arcturus es la primera línea de defensa del Imperio cuando se "
"trata de sus sistemas base desde el este. Una imponente fuerza estacionada "
"aquí con constantes patrullas de rutina intenta asegurarse de que ninguna "
"nave indeseable llegue al espacio del Imperio."

msgid ""
"A truly utilitarian place, the Arcturus Enclave bar is metallic grey, "
"meticulously maintained and full of off-duty Empire soldiers - not a place "
"to get into a fight."
msgstr ""
"El bar del Enclave de Arcturus, un lugar realmente utilitario, es de color "
"gris metálico, está meticulosamente mantenido y lleno de soldados del "
"Imperio fuera de servicio: no es un lugar para meterse en una pelea."

msgid "Arcturus I"
msgstr "Arcturus I"

msgid "Arcturus II"
msgstr "Arcturus II"

msgid "Ariadus II"
msgstr "Ariadus II"

msgid "Ariadus IV"
msgstr "Ariadus IV"

msgid "Ariadus VI"
msgstr "Ariadus VI"

msgid "Ariadus VIa"
msgstr "Ariadus VIa"

msgid "Ariadus VIb"
msgstr "Ariadus VIb"

msgid "Ariak"
msgstr "Ariak"

msgid "Arietis B"
msgstr ""

msgid "Arietis C"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Once a fairly well-off inhabited M-class planet, the Incident has irradiated "
"all of its atmosphere and surface layer, rendering it completely "
"uninhabitable. The only legacy of human colonization is in the sparse "
"underground structures that have mostly survived the cataclysm."
msgstr ""

msgid "Armorhead I-1"
msgstr "CabezaBlindada I-1"

msgid "Armorhead I-1 b"
msgstr "Cabezablindada I-1 b"

msgid "Arrakis"
msgstr "Arrakis"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Arrakis is a desert planet with no natural precipitation and the dust storms "
"can rage for many periods at a time. Due to the expense of constantly "
"importing water, lots of care is taken to minimize evaporation with most "
"buildings are almost completely hermetic. The locals are continuously "
"discussing sandworms, though you're not sure what to make of it."
msgstr ""
"Arrakis es un planeta desértico, sin precipitaciones naturales, y las "
"tormentas de polvo pueden durar muchos periodos seguidos. Debido al gasto "
"que supone importar constantemente agua, se tiene mucho cuidado en minimizar "
"la evaporación y la mayoría de los edificios son casi completamente "
"herméticos. Los lugareños hablan continuamente de los gusanos de arena, "
"aunque no está seguro de qué pensar."

msgid ""
"The Arrakeen canteen is one of the shadier bars in Empire space. Lying on "
"the border of the Empire, few patrols come through and many scoundrels and "
"mercenaries can be found plying their trade. \"The spice must flow\", they "
"say, it may not, but at least the rum does."
msgstr ""
"La cantina Arrakeen es uno de los bares más sombríos del espacio del "
"Imperio. Situado en la frontera del Imperio, pasan pocas patrullas y se "
"pueden encontrar muchos sinvergüenzas y mercenarios ejerciendo su oficio. "
"\"La especia debe fluir\", dicen, puede que no, pero al menos el ron sí."

msgid "Arrentil"
msgstr "Arrentil"

msgid ""
"As is typical for Soromid worlds, Arrentil would be considered utterly "
"inhospitable by the rest of humanity. The atmosphere is toxic and the "
"surface unstable, but the Soromid have managed to tame this world. Of course "
"even they need to live in sheltered habitats, but in spite of that the "
"population is thriving and the industry-focused economy is stable. By all "
"means, Arrentil is an example of Soromid persistence."
msgstr ""
"Como es típico de los mundos Soromida, Arrentil sería considerado totalmente "
"inhóspito por el resto de la humanidad. La atmósfera es tóxica y la "
"superficie inestable, pero Soromida ha conseguido domesticar este mundo. Por "
"supuesto, incluso ellos necesitan vivir en hábitats protegidos, pero a pesar "
"de ello la población es próspera y la economía centrada en la industria es "
"estable. A todas luces, Arrentil es un ejemplo de persistencia Soromida."

msgid ""
"As the habitats of this inhospitable world were being built little thought "
"was given to less essential amenities. This bar was added by grafting it "
"onto the side of the spaceport. Anywhere else in the galaxy being an "
"afterthought would likely have resulted in a rather cramped, run-down bar "
"but here in Soromid space it has given it a more organic feel, so much so "
"that it almost feels like it is growing."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se construyeron los hábitats de este mundo inhóspito se pensó poco en "
"las comodidades menos esenciales. Este bar se añadió injertándolo en el "
"lateral del puerto espacial. En cualquier otro lugar de la galaxia, el hecho "
"de ser una idea tardía probablemente habría dado lugar a un bar bastante "
"estrecho y destartalado, pero aquí, en el espacio Soromida, le ha dado una "
"sensación más orgánica, tanto que casi parece que está creciendo."

msgid "Astana"
msgstr "Astana"

msgid ""
"Astana is the home of the Imperial Experimental Weapons Testing Facility, "
"commonly abbreviated as IEWTF. It is here where most of the newer weapons "
"and outfits equipped by the Empire military are tested and qualified for "
"active service. This planet is an ideal spot for this as, besides the "
"scientists who work here, no one else wants to land on the planet."
msgstr ""
"Astana es la sede de la Instalación Imperial de Pruebas de Armas "
"Experimentales, comúnmente abreviada como IIPAE. Es aquí donde se prueban la "
"mayoría de las nuevas armas y equipos llevados por el ejército del Imperio y "
"se califican para el servicio activo. Este planeta es un lugar ideal para "
"ello ya que, aparte de los científicos que trabajan aquí, nadie más quiere "
"aterrizar en el planeta."

msgid ""
"The bar is where many of the workers for the IEWTF take a moment to relax, "
"several of them are talking about a project that leaves you baffled. Other "
"than the IEWTF there is little reason to remain on the world for very long "
"apart from the bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar es el lugar donde muchos de los trabajadores del IIPAE se toman un "
"momento para relajarse, varios de ellos hablan de un proyecto que le deja "
"desconcertado. Aparte del IIPAE hay pocas razones para permanecer en el "
"mundo por mucho tiempo aparte del bar."

msgid "Astana IIV"
msgstr "Astana IIV"

msgid "Atalanta"
msgstr "Atalanta"

msgid ""
"Atalanta is named directly after the colony ship that settled it, Atalanta. "
"Though the planet is too cold to be of any real value, the population is "
"making a decent enough living thanks to the caches of heavy elements trapped "
"under the ice."
msgstr ""
"Atalanta recibe su nombre directamente de la nave colonial que lo colonizó, "
"Atalanta. Aunque el planeta es demasiado frío para tener un valor real, la "
"población se gana la vida de forma bastante decente gracias a los alijos de "
"elementos pesados atrapados bajo el hielo."

msgid ""
"Like all structures on the planet, Atalanta's bar is built under the ice but "
"it is quite close to the surface. This is because a spectacular lighting "
"effect can be observed overhead when the sun shines directly onto the ice. "
"Atalanta's orbit makes this a rare occurrence but the bar's profits soar "
"every cycle."
msgstr ""
"Como todas las estructuras del planeta, el bar de Atalanta está construido "
"bajo el hielo, pero está bastante cerca de la superficie. Esto se debe a que "
"se puede observar un espectacular efecto de iluminación en la superficie "
"cuando el sol brilla directamente sobre el hielo. La órbita de Atalanta hace "
"que esto ocurra raramente, pero los beneficios del bar se disparan cada "
"ciclo."

msgid "Atlantis I"
msgstr "Atlantis I"

msgid ""
"As a large inert planetary body made of regolith, Atlantis I was largely "
"unfazed by the Incident. If anything, the Nebula blocking the intense solar "
"radiation has increased the inhabitability index of the planet."
msgstr ""

msgid "Atryssa"
msgstr "Atryssa"

msgid ""
"Atryssa is an economically rich world thanks to Za'lek technology. It is "
"also the closest noteworthy Za'lek planet, where outsiders can land, to "
"Ruadan. Beyond these two things there is little to recommend it (though one "
"of these may, at least, be plenty enough)."
msgstr ""
"Atryssa es un mundo económicamente rico gracias a la tecnología Za'lek. "
"También es el planeta Za'lek más cercano a Ruadan, donde los forasteros "
"pueden aterrizar. Más allá de estas dos cosas hay poco que recomendar "
"(aunque una de ellas puede ser, al menos, suficiente)."

msgid ""
"The archetype of a Za'lek bar, although a very crowded one. The crowd seems "
"to be divided up into groups of people discussing things in hushed tones. "
"There are also one or two people wandering about with notepads, though "
"everyone goes quiet when they approach."
msgstr ""
"El arquetipo de un bar Za'lek, aunque muy concurrido. La multitud parece "
"estar dividida en grupos de personas que discuten en voz baja. También hay "
"una o dos personas que deambulan con libretas, aunque todos se callan cuando "
"se acercan."

