msgid "August"
msgstr "Agosto"

msgid ""
"August is a fairly standard, if cold, world. Rarely for a Za'lek planet, it "
"doesn't have that many research stations on it. It is almost purely a "
"residential world, primarily for the scientists working on Warnecke who, "
"after a hard week's work, don't want to see another lab for a while."
msgstr ""
"August es un mundo bastante estándar, aunque frío. Raramente para un planeta "
"Za'lek, no tiene muchas estaciones de investigación en él. Es un mundo casi "
"puramente residencial, principalmente para los científicos que trabajan en "
"Warnecke y que, tras una dura semana de trabajo, no quieren ver otro "
"laboratorio durante un tiempo."

msgid ""
"This bar has the feel of an old-world pub, with plenty of wood furnishing on "
"display, good food and better beer. A great place to relax and unwind."
msgstr ""
"Este bar tiene la sensación de un pub del viejo mundo, con mucho mobiliario "
"de madera a la vista, buena comida y mejor cerveza. Un gran lugar para "
"relajarse y desconectar."

msgid "Avoss"
msgstr "Avoss"

msgid ""
"Avoss was originally a mediocre but habitable world. When the fourteenth "
"colony ship, Petrovsk, arrived, its colonists considered themselves fairly "
"fortunate to have found a place they could call home. However, some fifty "
"years after the expedition had touched down, the world began to change. "
"Seismic activity everywhere began escalating off the charts causing "
"earthquakes and volcanic eruptions the world over. The world is now "
"devastated, a mere shadow of its former self. The colonists have managed to "
"survive, however, and the hardy remain even today."
msgstr ""
"Avoss era originalmente un mundo mediocre pero habitable. Cuando llegó la "
"decimocuarta nave colonial, Petrovsk, sus colonos se consideraron bastante "
"afortunados por haber encontrado un lugar al que podían llamar hogar. Sin "
"embargo, unos cincuenta años después de que la expedición tocara tierra, el "
"mundo empezó a cambiar. La actividad sísmica en todas partes comenzó a "
"dispararse, provocando terremotos y erupciones volcánicas en todo el mundo. "
"El mundo está ahora devastado, una mera sombra de lo que fue. Sin embargo, "
"los colonos han conseguido sobrevivir y los más resistentes siguen aún hoy "
"en día."

msgid "Awowa IV"
msgstr "Awowa IV"

msgid "Awowa V"
msgstr "Awowa V"

msgid "Baba Yaga"
msgstr "Baba Yaga"

msgid "Babylon I"
msgstr "Babilonia I"

msgid "Babylon II"
msgstr "Babilonia II"

msgid "Babylon IIa"
msgstr "Babilonia IIa"

msgid "Baf I"
msgstr "Baf I"

msgid "Baf IV"
msgstr "Baf IV"

msgid "Barnard's Star Ruined Ringworld"
msgstr "Mundo Anillo Estelar de Barnard Arruinado"

msgid "Ruined Ringworld"
msgstr "Mundo Anillo Arruinado"

msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first known ringworld constructed by humanity, Barnard's Star Ringworld "
"boasted to almost a billion inhabitants at its peak. With a diversity of "
"ecosystems supported by the artificial gravity, it was lauded as one of "
"humanity's major accomplishments in megastructure engineering. Although the "
"construction took over 30 cycles, it only took the explosion generated by "
"the Incident an instant to completely blast away the atmosphere, fracture "
"the structure, and condemn those who survived to a slow suffocation in the "
"vacuum of space.\n"
"No longer composed of a single connected ring, exploring the structure is "
"very time-consuming as it requires many complicated zero-g suit manoeuvres. "
"As most of the structure has been picked clean of anything of value by many "
"scavengers and artefact hunters, there is not much reason to search the "
"structure either way."
msgstr ""
"El primer mundo anillo construido por la humanidad, el Mundo Anillo Estelar "
"de Barnard, llegó a tener casi mil millones de habitantes en su apogeo. Con "
"una diversidad de ecosistemas soportados por la gravedad artificial, fue "
"alabado como uno de los mayores logros de la humanidad en ingeniería de "
"megaestructuras. Aunque su construcción duró más de 30 ciclos, bastó un "
"instante para que la explosión generada por el Incidente destruyera por "
"completo la atmósfera, fracturara la estructura y condenara a los "
"supervivientes a una lenta asfixia en el vacío del espacio.\n"
"Al no estar ya compuesta por un único anillo conectado, la exploración de la "
"estructura lleva mucho tiempo, ya que requiere muchas maniobras complicadas "
"con trajes de gravedad cero. Como la mayor parte de la estructura ha sido "
"limpiada de cualquier cosa de valor por muchos carroñeros y cazadores de "
"artefactos, no hay muchas razones para buscar en la estructura de cualquier "
"manera."

msgid "Basel I"
msgstr "Basel I"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Bastion Centre"
msgstr "Centro Bastión"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Bastion Centre is one of the two primary defence, border guard, and patrol "
"base stations leading into Za'lek space. As such, it is one of the few "
"military expenditures that goes (largely) unchallenged even by the notorious "
"Za'lek political scene. The House Za'lek Defence Force conducts most of "
"their foreign contact here, where they can keep an eye on affairs."
msgstr ""
"El Centro Bastión es una de las dos principales estaciones de defensa, "
"guardia fronteriza y base de patrulla que se adentran en el espacio Za'lek. "
"Como tal, es uno de los pocos gastos militares que pasa (en gran medida) "
"desapercibido incluso por la notoria escena política Za'lek. La Fuerza de "
"Defensa de la Casa Za'lek realiza aquí la mayor parte de sus contactos con "
"el exterior, donde puede vigilar los asuntos."

msgid ""
"The Bastion Centre sports a large spaceport bar. Although most is private "
"and used for diplomatic meetings, the common area is still large by space "
"station standards and has a wide selection of beverages from around the "
"galaxy, even making the \"Za'lek Life\" magazine hottest tourism spot right "
"after a full life-size replication of the Great Library of Alexandria."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bedimann Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Bedimann"

msgid ""
"These shipyards are one of the places where Za'lek vessels are built and "
"sent out to the defence forces. It also maintains a small contingent of "
"Za'lek vessels at home to serve as a in-system guard."
msgstr ""
"Estos astilleros son uno de los lugares donde se construyen las naves Za'lek "
"que se envían a las fuerzas de defensa. También mantiene un pequeño "
"contingente de naves Za'lek en casa para servir de guardia en el sistema."

msgid "Beeklo II"
msgstr "Beeklo II"

msgid "Beene"
msgstr "Beene"

msgid ""
"Beene is rich in all sorts of common minerals, so the Soromid are using this "
"world the same way anyone would: as a source of raw materials. The elements "
"mined here are processed into standard packages that are used by the Soromid "
"bioships. This supply of minerals means Beene is quite an important "
"strategic location for Soromid fleets."
msgstr ""
"Beene es rico en todo tipo de minerales comunes, por lo que Soromida utiliza "
"este mundo como lo haría cualquiera: como fuente de materias primas. Los "
"elementos extraídos aquí se procesan en paquetes estándar que son utilizados "
"por las naves biológicas Soromida. Este suministro de minerales hace que "
"Beene sea un lugar estratégico bastante importante para la flota Soromida."

msgid ""
"Pilots are advised to wear air-sealed suits when visiting Beene's bar. The "
"planet's atmosphere can cause serious problems for normal humans and the "
"Soromid haven't bothered installing decontamination filters for the local "
"population. As such, having a drink in Beene's bar is a bit of an ordeal. "
"It's one of the less popular places among traders looking for a drink."
msgstr ""
"Se aconseja a los pilotos que lleven trajes herméticos cuando visiten el bar "
"de Beene. La atmósfera del planeta puede causar serios problemas a los "
"humanos normales y Soromida no se ha molestado en instalar filtros de "
"descontaminación para la población local. Por lo tanto, tomar una copa en el "
"bar de Beene es un poco complicado. Es uno de los lugares menos populares "
"entre los comerciantes que buscan una bebida."

msgid "Behar Prime"
msgstr "Behar Prime"

msgid "Behar Station"
msgstr "Estación Behar"

msgid "Ruined Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Arruinado"

msgid ""
"Once a bustling and productive Imperial shipyard, Behar Station suffered "
"heavy structural damage in the Incident. Life support systems quickly fell "
"and most perished in the following moments. Although originally very "
"impressive and able to turn out three full Peacemakers each cycle, the ruins "
"have been picked clean by countless scavengers following its destruction."
msgstr ""
"La estación de Behar, que antaño fue un bullicioso y productivo astillero "
"Imperial, sufrió graves daños estructurales en el Incidente. Los sistemas de "
"soporte vital cayeron rápidamente y la mayoría pereció en los momentos "
"posteriores. Aunque originalmente era muy impresionante y era capaz de "
"producir tres Pacificadores completos en cada ciclo, las ruinas han sido "
"recogidas por innumerables carroñeros tras su destrucción."

msgid "Behemoth"
msgstr "Mastodonte"

msgid "Belltower Nest"
msgstr "Nido Belltower"

msgid ""
"Belltower Nest is a small Soromid military outpost whose main purpose is to "
"keep the Adiadus system in line. Being this far from the Soromid core there "
"is little interstellar traffic, which has led to some of the inhabitants "
"occasionally wondering if they're really part of the Soromid collective at "
"all. Belltower is here to remind them that they are."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The bar has a door that leads directly to the cell block. Prisoners here "
"don't usually stay very long. Belltower has neither the capacity nor the "
"authority to deal with more than petty criminals on its own. More serious "
"offenders are transferred to the penal facilities on Agino, in the Zintar "
"system."
msgstr ""
"El bar tiene una puerta que lleva directamente al bloque de celdas. Los "
"presos aquí no suelen permanecer mucho tiempo. Belltower no tiene ni la "
"capacidad ni la autoridad para ocuparse de algo más que de los pequeños "
"delincuentes. Los delincuentes más graves son trasladados a las "
"instalaciones penales de Agino, en el sistema de Zintar."

msgid "Benedict"
msgstr "Benedict"

msgid ""
"Another gas giant, another Soromid outpost. This particular outpost is "
"rather larger than some due to the large amounts of mineral and element "
"extraction performed here.\n"
"Because the planet is high in organic matter as well as the elements used to "
"produce them, it's an almost literal gold mine for Soromid building "
"materials."
msgstr ""
"Otro gigante gaseoso, otro puesto de avanzada Soromida. Este puesto de "
"avanzada en particular es bastante más grande que otros debido a las grandes "
"cantidades de extracción de minerales y elementos que se realizan aquí.\n"
"Dado que el planeta es rico en materia orgánica, así como en los elementos "
"utilizados para producirla, es casi literalmente una mina de oro para los "
"materiales de construcción Soromida."

msgid ""
"Typical of many Soromid bars in less than hospitable places, there's an "
"element of danger for an unaccostomed visitor. The atmosphere in this bar is "
"rather stuffy and the air not so pleasant to non-Soromids.\n"
"Most of the drinks here are served with straws, which is a thoughtful touch "
"for those traders who are forced to wear air-breathers."
msgstr ""
"Típico de muchos bares Soromida en lugares poco hospitalarios, hay un "
"elemento de peligro para un visitante no acostumbrado. El ambiente de este "
"bar esta bastante cargado y el aire no es muy agradable para los no "
"Soromida.\n"
"La mayoría de las bebidas se sirven con pajita, un detalle para los "
"comerciantes que se ven obligados a llevar respiradores."

msgid "Benteen"
msgstr "Benteen"

msgid ""
"Benteen has become one of the Empire's primary agriworlds, growing most of "
"the crops that are bound for the quickly developing western systems. It is a "
"quiet world, with little in the way of the bustle and fuss of other coreward "
"planets.\n"
"It is not uncommon for people to migrate here looking for a calmer "
"lifestyle, away from the chaos and people near the major trade lanes."
msgstr ""
"Benteen se ha convertido en uno de los principales agromundos del Imperio, "
"donde se cultiva la mayor parte de las cosechas destinadas a los sistemas "
"occidentales en rápido desarrollo. Es un mundo tranquilo, con un poco del "
"bullicio y alboroto de otros planetas del centro.\n"
"No es raro que la gente emigre aquí en busca de un estilo de vida más "
"tranquilo, lejos del caos y de la gente de las principales rutas comerciales."

msgid ""
"The bar is a place to relax after a long trip or a hard day's work. The beer "
"is fine and the locals seem friendly enough. Mostly harmless."
msgstr ""
"El bar es un lugar para relajarse después de un largo viaje o un duro día de "
"trabajo. La cerveza está bien y los lugareños parecen bastante amables. La "
"mayoría son inofensivos."

msgid "Berkhere"
msgstr "Berkhere"

msgid ""
"Most of Berkhere's surface is rock, dust and sand. But under that surface "
"lie rare and valuable gems and minerals. The colony here relies on this "
"mineral wealth for survival. Crops will not grow on this arid planet, so all "
"food has to be imported."
msgstr ""
"La mayor parte de la superficie de Berkhere es roca, polvo y arena. Pero "
"bajo esa superficie hay gemas y minerales raros y valiosos. La colonia "
"depende de esta riqueza mineral para sobrevivir. Los cultivos no crecen en "
"este árido planeta, por lo que todos los alimentos tienen que ser importados."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is arranged around a central area that serves as a "
"showcase for the single largest uncut gem ever found under the sands of "
"Berkhere. It is a reminder to both visitors and the local populace that "
"Berkhere is still wealthy. So long as the gem on display doesn't have to be "
"sold, the reasoning goes, Berkhere's future isn't in peril. Needless to say, "
"the gem is heavily protected by security systems."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial se organiza en torno a una zona central que sirve "
"de escaparate para la mayor gema en bruto jamás encontrada bajo las arenas "
"de Berkhere. Es un recordatorio, tanto para los visitantes como para la "
"población local, de que Berkhere sigue siendo rica. Mientras la gema "
"expuesta no tenga que ser vendida, el razonamiento es que el futuro de "
"Berkhere no está en peligro. Ni que decir tiene que la gema está fuertemente "
"protegida por sistemas de seguridad."

msgid "Beth"
msgstr "Beth"

msgid "BGG-1356"
msgstr "BGG-1356"

msgid "Bilgewater"
msgstr ""

msgid "Z"
msgstr "Z"

msgid ""
"This world was thoroughly unpleasant even before it became the Empire's "
"official garbage dump. Tectonically hyperactive, bombarded by asteroids and "
"solar radiation, and prone to devastating acid rain, it did everything in "
"its power to dissuade colonization. It was found to even lack enough rare "
"minerals to justify a penal mining colony by even the most callous Imperial "
"bureaucrat. However, the violence of the surface did make it convenient for "
"legally dumping the Empire's collective effluence here and forgetting about "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Blackwell I"
msgstr "Pozonegro I"

msgid "Blackwell IIX"
msgstr "Pozonegro IIX"

msgid "Blackwell VII"
msgstr "Pozonegro VII"

msgid "Blunderbuss II"
msgstr "Trabuco II"

msgid "Bolero"
msgstr "Bolero"

msgid ""
"Bolero has quickly become one of the Empire's most successful planets due to "
"its recent growth. The population is prosperous and successful, and the "
"planet's conditions are mild. Although it is still treated as something of a "
"backwater due to its location, it is becoming increasingly important in "
"Imperial politics.\n"
"A lot of Bolero's popularity comes from its Earth-like climate, giving a "
"reassuring sense of nostalgia to all those who were able to visit Earth "
"before the Incident. However, some people avoid it for exactly the same "
"reason…"
msgstr ""
"Bolero se ha convertido en uno de los planetas más exitosos del Imperio "
"debido a su reciente crecimiento. La población es próspera y exitosa, y las "
"condiciones del planeta son suaves. Aunque todavía es tratado como una "
"especie de remanso debido a su ubicación, cada vez es más importante en la "
"política imperial.\n"
"Gran parte de la popularidad de Bolero se debe a que su clima es similar al "
"de la Tierra, lo que proporciona una reconfortante sensación de nostalgia a "
"todos aquellos que pudieron visitar la Tierra antes del Incidente. Sin "
"embargo, algunas personas la evitan exactamente por la misma razón…"

msgid ""
"Making the most of Bolero's similarity with Earth, the bar here is an old-"
"Earth style pub, with a low ceiling, warm beer and good food. The atmosphere "
"is warm and welcoming, the clients are all polite and cheerful and the "
"bouncers barely loom at all.\n"
"There seems to be relatively few locals mixed in with the patrons; the "
"majority of people appear to be temporary visitors, either arriving for "
"vacations or business trips."
msgstr ""
"Aprovechando la similitud de Bolero con la Tierra, el bar aquí es un pub de "
"estilo terrestre, con un techo bajo, cerveza caliente y buena comida. El "
"ambiente es cálido y acogedor, los clientes son todos educados y alegres y "
"los porteros apenas se asoman. \n"
"Parece que hay relativamente pocos lugareños mezclados con los clientes, y "
"la mayoría de las personas parecen visitantes temporales, que llegan de "
"vacaciones o en viaje de negocios."

msgid "Bon Sebb"
msgstr "Bon Sebb"

msgid ""
"Bon Sebb is a mysterious place. Objects from all over the galaxy have a "
"habit of turning up here. In fact, a large area of the planet's surface is a "
"gigantic junk yard, known as the \"Junkle\", where the locals \"hunt\" for "
"useful equipment they can sell to each other, or to passing travellers."
msgstr ""
"Bon Sebb es un lugar misterioso. Los objetos de toda la galaxia tienen la "
"costumbre de aparecer aquí. De hecho, una gran parte de la superficie del "
"planeta es un gigantesco depósito de chatarra, conocido como el "
"\"Chatarras\", donde los lugareños \"cazan\" equipos útiles que pueden "
"vender entre ellos, o a los viajeros que pasan."

msgid ""
"The bar on Bon Sebb is built out of things scavenged from the Junkle. The "
"walls and furniture are all patchworks of various designs and materials. The "
"only somewhat symmetrical feature of the bar is a holoportrait of the "
"Creator of the Universe, hanging over the lopsided bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Bon Sebb está construido con cosas rebuscadas en la Chatarra. Las "
"paredes y los muebles son retazos de diversos diseños y materiales. El único "
"rasgo algo simétrico del bar es un holoretrato del Creador del Universo, que "
"cuelga sobre la barra inclinada."

msgid "Bonanza I"
msgstr "Bonanza I"

msgid "Bonanza II"
msgstr "Bonanza II"

msgid "Boowoy"
msgstr "Boowoy"

msgid ""
"Boowoy was never a very respectable colony. It was settled in the hopes that "
"the world could be terraformed into a nice M class residential planet, but "
"persistent corruption and mismanagement caused the effort to go awry. Now, "
"the planet's ecosystem has been terminally disrupted, causing most of the "
"surface to erode into desert."
msgstr ""
"Boowoy nunca fue una colonia muy respetable. Se asentó con la esperanza de "
"que el mundo pudiera ser terraformado en un bonito planeta residencial de "
"clase M, pero la persistente corrupción y la mala gestión hicieron que el "
"esfuerzo se fuera al traste. Ahora, el ecosistema del planeta se ha visto "
"definitivamente perturbado, lo que ha provocado que la mayor parte de la "
"superficie se convierta en un desierto."

msgid ""
"The locals don't like outsiders, but they keep the spaceport running because "
"being cut off from the galaxy would be fatal for a world so dependent on "
"imports. Nevertheless, the glances you get from the working staff and the "
"local patrons makes it clear they'd prefer it if you weren't here for long, "
"at all."
msgstr ""
"A los lugareños no les gustan los forasteros, pero mantienen el puerto "
"espacial en funcionamiento porque quedar aislado de la galaxia sería fatal "
"para un mundo tan dependiente de las importaciones. Sin embargo, las miradas "
"que recibes del personal y de los clientes locales dejan claro que "
"preferirían que no estuvieras aquí mucho tiempo."

msgid "Botarn I"
msgstr "Botarn I"

msgid "Brandt Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Brandt"

msgid ""
"Serving as a local security checkpoint, Brandt Cloister sports two squadrons "
"of light response ships. The station is mainly responsible for Rhu, Niger, "
"and Anarbalis. The ships here, however, are not equipped to handle the "
"stress of the border conflicts with the Dvaered at Eye of Night."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Brandt, que sirve como puesto de control de seguridad local, "
"cuenta con dos escuadrones de naves ligeras de respuesta. La estación es "
"responsable principalmente de Rhu, Níger, y Anarbalis. Sin embargo, las "
"naves de esta estación no están equipadas para soportar la tensión de los "
"conflictos fronterizos con los Dvaered en Ojo de Noche."

msgid ""
"Curiously, this spacedock bar seems to make no distinction between the three "
"Sirian echelons in any way. However, the soldiers and sailors stationed on "
"Brandt Cloister all know their place and treat each other accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Curiosamente, esta muelle espacial no parece hacer ninguna distinción entre "
"los tres escalafones Sirio. Sin embargo, los soldados y los marineros "
"estacionados en el Claustro Brandt conocen todos su lugar y se tratan en "
"consecuencia."

msgid "Brendon I"
msgstr "Brendon I"

msgid "Brimstone I"
msgstr "Azufre I"

msgid "Brimstone Ia"
msgstr "Azufre Ia"

msgid "Brimstone Ib"
msgstr "Azufre Ib"

msgid "Brimstone II"
msgstr "Azufre II"

msgid ""
"A prominent gas giant that is constantly wracked by extreme storms, that can "
"whittle down the strongest defences in a manner of seconds. While not "
"technically possible to land on, it is fairly easy to find a geostationary "
"orbit to park your ship in."
msgstr ""

msgid "Brimstone III"
msgstr "Azufre III"

msgid "Brock"
msgstr "Brock"

msgid ""
"One of the Dvaered gas-mining operations is located here. The gas is refined "
"and turned into fuel for Dvaered ships. The facilities here are built solely "
"for this purpose and no other, comfort was the last thing on the designers' "
"minds."
msgstr ""
"Aquí se encuentra una de las explotaciones de gas Dvaered. El gas se refina "
"y se convierte en combustible para las naves Dvaered. Las instalaciones aquí "
"se construyen exclusivamente para este propósito y no para otro, la "
"comodidad era lo último en lo que pensaban los diseñadores."

msgid ""
"The bar is filled with miners and garrison troops, like most Dvaered bars. "
"Copious drinking is also most certainly on the cards, like most Dvaered "
"bars. Unlike most Dvaered bars, this one is small and rather clean. Rather "
"shocking, especially for outsiders."
msgstr ""
"El bar está lleno de mineros y tropas de guarnición, como la mayoría de los "
"bares Dvaered. También se bebe mucho, como en la mayoría de los bares "
"Dvaered. A diferencia de la mayoría de los bares Dvaered, éste es pequeño y "
"bastante limpio. Bastante chocante, sobre todo para los forasteros."

msgid "Brooks"
msgstr "Brooks"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Brooks is a bustling, highly populated Imperial civilian planet. But with "
"the decline of the Empire and especially after the Incident, it has found "
"itself in a rather uncomfortable position on the borders of hostile space.\n"
"As Brooks is a rich planet with a lot of economic and political weight "
"within the Empire, the Imperial Navy protects Arcturus for Brooks' sake, as "
"much as for the Imperial core systems."
msgstr ""
"Brooks es un planeta civil imperial bullicioso y muy poblado. Pero con el "
"declive del Imperio, y especialmente tras el Incidente, se ha encontrado en "
"una posición bastante incómoda en las fronteras del espacio hostil. Como "
"Brooks es un planeta rico con mucho peso económico y político dentro del "
"Imperio, la Armada Imperial protege Arcturus por el bien de Brooks, y de los "
"sistemas principales imperiales."

msgid ""
"On Brooks everything is expensive, something that comes with most "
"economically booming worlds. However, most traders put up with the inflated "
"prices for refreshments and services at the spaceport bar, Brooks, after "
"all, is a boom world and where profit is to made, nobody wants to miss out "
"on such a chance."
msgstr ""
"En Brooks todo es caro, algo que se da en la mayoría de los mundos "
"económicamente pujantes. Sin embargo, la mayoría de los comerciantes "
"soportan los precios inflados de los refrescos y los servicios del bar del "
"puerto espacial; ya que al fin y al cabo, Brooks es un mundo creciente en el "
"que se obtienen beneficios y nadie quiere perder una oportunidad."

msgid "Buritt"
msgstr "Buritt"

msgid ""
"Not as nice as Varia in the Darkstone system, Buritt is, never the less, a "
"reasonably habitable world. You will find much of the Dvaered middle class "
"here, such as it is. You will also find a large-scale pollution of the "
"natural environment but, with the Dvaered being Dvaered, no attempt is being "
"made to address this."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es tan bonito como Varia en el sistema Piedraoscura, Buritt es, "
"sin embargo, un mundo razonablemente habitable. Aquí encontrarás gran parte "
"de la clase media Dvaered, tal y como es. También encontrarás una "
"contaminación a gran escala del entorno natural pero, Dvaered siendo "
"Dvaered, no se hace ningún intento de solucionar esto."

msgid ""
"If this spaceport bar didn't play a locally produced, incessant, droning, "
"brain-melting music, it would be quite a comfortable place to be. But it "
"does, so it isn't."
msgstr ""
"Si este bar del puerto espacial no pusiera una música incesante, producida "
"localmente, que derrite el cerebro, sería un lugar bastante cómodo para "
"estar. Pero lo hace, así que no lo es."

msgid "Burnan"
msgstr "Burnan"

msgid ""
"As Aesir is so far away and many government services are better rendered "
"locally than over a distance of many hyperspace jumps, Burnan serves as the "
"local capital in this sector of Sirius space. Because of this, the primary "
"city of Burnan sports an atypically large political district, as well as one "
"of the largest Sirian temples in all of Sirius space.\n"
"Due to the highly political nature of the planet, the cities and districts "
"are designed with specific echelons in mind, and mixing is kept to a minimum."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Burnan doesn't have a separate spaceport bar in the way many other worlds "
"do. The spaceport bar and the main spaceport hall are, instead, one and the "
"same thing. There are exits to terminals on all sides and the central area "
"is dominated by an island of service interfaces and counters. There is an "
"elevated area that has tables for visitors to sit down at, where they won't "
"get in the way of the bustle and traffic of the main floor."
msgstr ""
"Burnan no tiene un bar de puerto espacial separado como muchos otros mundos. "
"El bar del puerto espacial y la sala principal del puerto espacial son, en "
"cambio, una misma cosa. Hay salidas a las terminales en todos los lados y la "
"zona central está dominada por una isla de interfaces de servicio y "
"mostradores. Hay una zona elevada con mesas para que los visitantes se "
"sienten, donde no estorben el bullicio y el tráfico de la planta principal."

msgid "Burnan's moon"
msgstr "Luna de Burnan"

msgid "Caethia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Caethia is a sparsely developed semi-agricultural world with plenty of "
"jungle to go around. Some of the lifeforms here have evolved to harvest "
"significant amounts of thermal energy as part of their natural lifecycles, "
"keeping the planet cool enough for humans to thrive despite the planet's "
"close proximity to the local star. The phoenomena has attracted some "
"research efforts, but for obvious reasons any interference with the natural "
"lifecycles of those species is strictly regulated."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The main spaceport, and thus the bar, is located in one of the few urban "
"areas on the planet, but the establishment makes a point of being one with "
"nature, meaning the floors and walls are overgrown with vegetation that you "
"are assured is only occasionally toxic."
msgstr ""

msgid "Caladan"
msgstr "Caladan"

msgid ""
"The surface of the planet is predominantly covered with water and the "
"planetary climate is characterized by abundant precipitation and strong "
"winds, though sufficiently tolerable to make costly weather modification "
"equipment unnecessary. Habitable land is often characterized by soft "
"meadows, swamps and dense forests. The resource base of Caladan consists "
"mainly of agriculture and biomass, with the locally bred and grown pundi "
"rice being its main export, and fishing, a traditional source of sustenance "
"for its people. Other traditional products include wine and various "
"livestock, most prominently cattle."
msgstr ""
"La superficie del planeta está predominantemente cubierta de agua y el clima "
"planetario se caracteriza por abundantes precipitaciones y fuertes vientos, "
"aunque lo suficientemente tolerables como para hacer innecesarios los "
"costosos equipos de modificación del clima. La tierra habitable suele "
"caracterizarse por praderas suaves, pantanos y densos bosques. La base de "
"recursos de Caladán consiste principalmente en la agricultura y la biomasa, "
"siendo el arroz pundi, criado y cultivado localmente, su principal producto "
"de exportación, y la pesca, fuente tradicional de sustento para sus "
"habitantes. Otros productos tradicionales son el vino y diversos tipos de "
"ganado, sobre todo el vacuno."

msgid ""
"The bar is just off the starport with a great view of the harbour. You could "
"watch the fishermen run frantically about attending their duties for hours. "
"You could also tuck into some of the local cuisine which is rather refined, "
"with most dishes containing meat."
msgstr ""
"El bar está justo al lado del puerto estelar con una gran vista del puerto. "
"Se puede ver a los pescadores correr frenéticamente por sus tareas durante "
"horas. También se puede degustar la cocina local, que es bastante refinada y "
"la mayoría de los platos contienen carne."

msgid "Calvin"
msgstr "Calvin"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Cantina Centre"
msgstr "Centro Cantina"

msgid ""
"This station is primarily a trade centre for western Za'lek space. Many "
"deals are made here, and given the frequent and transitory foot traffic, it "
"makes for a good place to meet someone."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación es principalmente un centro de comercio para el espacio Za'lek "
"occidental. Aquí se hacen muchos tratos y, dado el frecuente y transitorio "
"tráfico peatonal, es un buen lugar reunirte con alguien."

msgid ""
"This bar lives up to the name of the station itself. Indeed, it seems to be "
"the main attraction, being a massive ring-shaped casino-esque room with many "
"bartenders treating the patrons, music in the background, and good food. The "
"only sign of being Za'lek in origin is the casual use of bafflingly advanced "
"technology and the fact that at least half of the populace look like "
"scientists, researchers, or engineers."
msgstr ""
"Este bar hace honor al nombre de la propia estación. De hecho, parece ser la "
"atracción principal, ya que se trata de una enorme sala en forma de anillo "
"similar a un casino, con muchos camareros atendiendo a los clientes, música "
"de fondo y buena comida. El único signo de ser Za'lek en su origen es el uso "
"casual de tecnología desconcertantemente avanzada y el hecho de que al menos "
"la mitad de los habitantes parecen científicos, investigadores o ingenieros."

msgid "Capricorn II"
msgstr "Capricornio II"

msgid "Capricorn III"
msgstr "Capricornio III"

msgid "Capricorn IIIa"
msgstr "Capricornio IIIa"

msgid "Castellan Epsilon"
msgstr "Castellano Epsilon"

msgid "Castellan I"
msgstr "Castellano I"

msgid "Castellan III"
msgstr "Castellano III"

msgid ""
"Castellan III is, like most Dvaered planets, a mining world and, like most "
"Dvaered mining worlds, the conditions are hellish. The planet has virtually "
"no way to support natural life so it needs a constant stream of resources to "
"support it. The majority of these are food and medical supplies for the "
"miners."
msgstr ""
"Castellano III es, como la mayoría de los planetas Dvaered, un mundo minero "
"y, como la mayoría de los mundos mineros Dvaered, las condiciones son "
"infernales. El planeta no tiene prácticamente ninguna forma de mantener la "
"vida natural, por lo que necesita un flujo constante de recursos para "
"mantenerse. La mayoría de ellos son alimentos y suministros médicos para los "
"mineros."

msgid ""
"Castellan III's bar is surprisingly good. Perhaps it has to do with being a "
"favoured haven for Dvaered officers. Perhaps it's that someone in a position "
"of some power or influence decided that a nice place for the miners to relax "
"and recuperate was a good way to show off their philanthropy. Either way, "
"it's appreciated."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Castellano III es sorprendentemente bueno. Tal vez tenga que ver "
"con el hecho de ser un refugio preferido por los oficiales Dvaered. Tal vez "
"sea que alguien en una posición de cierto poder o influencia decidió que un "
"lugar agradable para que los mineros se relajaran y recuperaran era una "
"buena forma de mostrar su filantropía. Sea como sea, se agradece."

msgid "Castellan VI"
msgstr "Castellano VI"

msgid "Castellum Hystera"
msgstr "Hystera Castellum"

msgid ""
"After the Incident, the surviving Proteron on Protera Sigma sought to "
"establish new colonies to replace the ones they had lost. Hystera was the "
"first nearby system to be discovered, but it was found to contain a gas "
"giant and a hostile planet with nothing of interest. The Proteron therefore "
"instead decided to establish an outpost, this one, orbiting Hystera II, with "
"the goal of finding additional systems in the vicinity. With the discovery "
"of Korifa, the station had fulfilled its purpose and was converted for use "
"as a trade hub."
msgstr ""
"Tras el Encidente, los supervivientes Proteron en Protera Sigma trataron de "
"establecer nuevas colonias para sustituir a las que habían perdido. Hystera "
"fue el primer sistema cercano que se descubrió, pero se descubrió que "
"contenía un gigante gaseoso y un planeta hostil sin nada de interés. Por "
"ello, los Proteron decidieron establecer un puesto de avanzada, éste, en "
"órbita de Hystera II, con el objetivo de encontrar otros sistemas en las "
"cercanías. Con el descubrimiento de Korifa, la estación cumplió su propósito "
"y se convirtió en un centro de comercio."

msgid ""
"Proteron civilians enter and exit the bar with incredible efficiency, not "
"wasting a moment of their time."
msgstr ""
"Los civiles de Proteron entran y salen del bar con una eficiencia increíble, "
"sin perder un momento de su tiempo."

msgid "Castellum Telika"
msgstr "Castellum Telika"

msgid ""
"The Proteron decided that they should have a centre for scientific progress, "
"so they built this station. The greatest Proteron scientific minds come "
"together here to further the technological prowess of the Proteron."
msgstr ""
"Los Proteron decidieron que debían tener un centro para el progreso "
"científico, así que construyeron esta estación. Las mejores mentes "
"científicas de Proteron se reúnen aquí para impulsar las proezas "
"tecnológicas de Proteron."

msgid ""
"The bar is mostly empty, probably due to the busy schedules of the station's "
"scientists. Other than that, it's essentially the same as other Proteron "
"bars."
msgstr ""
"El bar está casi siempre vacío, probablemente debido a la apretada agenda de "
"los científicos de la estación. Aparte de eso, es esencialmente igual que "
"otros bares de Proteron."

msgid "Castrum Akra"
msgstr "Castrum Akra"

msgid ""
"Built to service ships in the area, Akra Bastion also serves as an essential "
"communication and trade hub for residents of Akra. People from all over the "
"system congregate here, leading to more inter-planetary personal "
"relationships than normal."
msgstr ""
"Construida para dar servicio a las naves de la zona, el Bastión Akra también "
"sirve como centro esencial de comunicación y comercio para los residentes de "
"Akra. Aquí se congrega gente de todo el sistema, lo que da lugar a más "
"relaciones personales interplanetarias de lo normal."

msgid ""
"The bar is bustling and seemingly constantly packed, yet never seems to "
"cause anyone any problem due to how efficient everything is."
msgstr ""
"El bar es bullicioso y parece estar constantemente lleno, pero nunca parece "
"causar ningún problema a nadie debido a lo eficiente que es todo."

msgid "Castrum Sigma"
msgstr "Castrum Sigma"

msgid ""
"This station's sole job is to crank out the powerful Proteron military "
"ships. Regular Proteron civilians typically aren't allowed access to this "
"facility."
msgstr ""
"El único trabajo de esta estación es fabricar las poderosas naves militares "
"Proteron. Los civiles normales Proteron no suelen tener acceso a estas "
"instalaciones."

msgid ""
"Even for a Proteron bar, this one is heavily business-oriented. Most patrons "
"seem to be here for a specific purpose."
msgstr ""
"Incluso para un bar Proteron, éste está muy orientado a los negocios. La "
"mayoría de los clientes parecen estar aquí con un propósito específico."

msgid "Cebus Prime"
msgstr "Cebus Prime"

msgid ""
"Although originally small-time calm world, the Nebula has stripped away most "
"of the atmosphere making it nearly unlivable. Most of the inhabitants have "
"long since left, and the Empire has officially declared it a ruined world, "
"however, some stubborn individuals still persist and survive in a mainly "
"self-sufficient manner outside of what could be considered civilized "
"society. The locals mainly live in the underground installations around the "
"spaceport, using the abandoned spacious accommodations freely."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cerberus I"
msgstr "Cerbero I"

msgid "Cerberus II"
msgstr "Cerbero II"

msgid "Cerberus IIa"
msgstr "Cerbero IIa"

msgid "Cerberus IV"
msgstr "Cerbero IV"

msgid "Cerberus Outpost"
msgstr "Puesto de Avanzada Cerbero"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Aptly named after the guardian dog of the underworld, Cerberus Outpost was "
"established soon after the stabilization of the immense Sol Nebula. While "
"the station's stated purpose is to monitor and research the effects of the "
"nebula, its exact details are confidential; to some, there's more than "
"enough military influence in the station to make it suspicious. With all the "
"theories around the Incident, one can never be too sure where reality ends "
"and fiction begins."
msgstr ""
"Acertadamente bautizado con el nombre del perro guardián del inframundo, el "
"Puesto Avanzado Cerbero se estableció poco después de la estabilización de "
"la inmensa Nebulosa de Sol.\n"
"Aunque el propósito declarado de la estación es vigilar e investigar los "
"efectos de la nebulosa, sus detalles exactos son confidenciales; para "
"algunos, hay más que suficiente influencia militar en la estación como para "
"hacerla sospechosa. Con todas las teorías en torno al Incidente, uno nunca "
"puede estar demasiado seguro de dónde acaba la realidad y empieza la "
"ficción.\n"
"Aunque en la estación hay un astillero, no ofrece ninguna nave a la venta y "
"se utiliza principalmente para reparar y mantener las naves dañadas por "
"incursiones en las profundidades de la nebulosa."

msgid ""
"The bar is maintained by off-duty scientists and soldiers. It's rather small "
"and has a minuscule selection of beverages. There's little ambient noise; it "
"seems as though boredom has gotten the best of most of the souls aboard."
msgstr ""
"El bar es mantenido por científicos y soldados fuera de servicio. Es "
"bastante pequeño y tiene una minúscula selección de bebidas. Hay poco ruido "
"ambiental; parece que el aburrimiento se ha apoderado de la mayoría de las "
"almas a bordo."

msgid "Cetrat"
msgstr "Cetrat"

msgid ""
"Cetrat is an aquatic planet known for its medical algae. No one has been "
"able to reproduce it exactly as it is in the wild, but with the abundance of "
"it throughout the planet's massive oceans, there has been little effort in "
"that field.\n"
"Cetrat was colonized by the eighth colony ship launched during the First "
"Growth, Brooklyn."
msgstr ""
"Cetrat es un planeta acuático conocido por sus algas medicinales. Nadie ha "
"sido capaz de reproducirlas exactamente como son en la naturaleza, pero con "
"la abundancia de las mismas en todo el enorme océano del planeta, ha habido "
"pocos esfuerzos en ese campo. \n"
"Cetrat fue colonizado por la octava nave colonial lanzada durante el Primer "
"Crecimiento, Brooklyn."

msgid ""
"The bar is very large and yet has fairly few patrons. You notice the drinks "
"list has a \"living\" menu. When you ask the bartender about them, he says "
"they specialize in drinks containing living creatures. Generally jellyfish, "
"but sometimes small cephalopods or more exotic beings. As exotic cultures "
"go, Cetrat is among the stranger."
msgstr ""
"El bar es muy grande y, sin embargo, tiene pocos clientes. Te das cuenta de "
"que la lista de bebidas tiene un menú \"vivo\". Cuando preguntas al camarero "
"por ellas, te dice que están especializados en bebidas que contienen seres "
"vivos. Generalmente medusas, pero a veces pequeños cefalópodos o seres más "
"exóticos. En cuanto a las culturas exóticas, el Cetrat está entre las más "
"extrañas."

msgid "Charcoal"
msgstr "Carbón "

msgid "Charred"
msgstr "Calcinado"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Chloe I"
msgstr "Chloe"

msgid ""
"Chloe I is covered in a dense layer of vegetation, likely brought here by a "
"human visitor many cycles ago. The atmosphere contains large amounts of "
"oxygen, making it flammable and unstable, with planetary-scale "
"conflagrations a frequent phenomena. However, the vegetation has adapted and "
"competes to quickly regrow from the ashes of their predecessors."
msgstr ""

msgid "Churchill I"
msgstr "Churchill I"

msgid "Churchill II"
msgstr "Churchill II"

msgid "Churchill IIa"
msgstr "Churchill IIa"

msgid "Claudius Mehan"
msgstr "Claudius Mehan"

msgid "Cole Outpost"
msgstr "Puesto de Avanzada Raelid"

msgid ""
"Cole Outpost is the last civilian station on the route to Doeston, and was "
"constructed as part of a large post-Incident movement to try to recover "
"territory from the Nebula. Many transport ships stop to refuel and "
"regenerate their shields within, safely away from the brunt of the Nebula's "
"radiation.\n"
"The station isn't well populated, and its inhabitants mainly make a living "
"off servicing the ships going to and from the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"El Puesto de Avanzada Cole es la última estación civil en la ruta hacia "
"Doeston, y se construyó como parte de un gran movimiento posterior al "
"Incidente para intentar recuperar territorio de la Nebulosa. Muchas naves de "
"transporte se detienen para repostar y regenerar sus escudos, a salvo de la "
"radiación de la Nébula.\n"
"La estación no está muy poblada y sus habitantes viven principalmente del "
"servicio a las naves que van y vienen de la Nebulosa."

msgid "Colley"
msgstr "Colley"

msgid ""
"Colley is a popular retirement and vacation spot due to its quiet and "
"unassuming nature. The world has mild weather and is ideally closeted away "
"from the cares and worries of the wider galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Colley es un lugar de retiro y vacaciones muy popular debido a su naturaleza "
"tranquila y discreta. El mundo tiene un clima suave y está idealmente "
"encerrado lejos de los cuidados y preocupaciones de la galaxia más amplia."

msgid ""
"The average age of the patrons here seems to be very high, but they look as "
"alert as they have ever been and you feel their eyes look you over as you "
"sit down to order a drink."
msgstr ""
"La edad media de los clientes parece ser muy alta, pero parecen tan "
"despiertos como siempre y sientes que sus ojos te miran de arriba abajo "
"cuando te sientas a pedir una bebida."

msgid "Coral Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Coral"

msgid ""
"Coral Cloister was established as a new border guard station shortly after "
"the Incident to attempt to organize the refugees and new traffic in and out "
"of Sirius space at the new Sirius border. The forces stationed here are the "
"first line of defence against threats coming from outside Sirian space. The "
"station inspects all traffic entering Sirius space this way as well as "
"keeping an eye on outbound traffic too."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Coral se estableció como una nueva estación de guardia "
"fronteriza poco después del Incidente para intentar organizar a los "
"refugiados y el nuevo tráfico que entraba y salía del espacio de Sirio en la "
"nueva frontera Sirio. Las fuerzas estacionadas aquí son la primera línea de "
"defensa contra las amenazas procedentes de fuera del espacio sirio. La "
"estación inspecciona todo el tráfico que entra en el espacio Sirio por esta "
"vía, además de vigilar también el tráfico saliente."

msgid "Coran"
msgstr "Coran"

msgid "Corax"
msgstr "Corax"

msgid ""
"Though the world of Corax might, in the distant future, become a semi-"
"inhabitable world there will be precious few ores and minerals left (barring "
"iron) by that point. The Soromid's ability to withstand unusual levels of "
"environmental discomfort has given them a head start on this world in terms "
"of resource extraction. Other life, it seems, will have to wait its turn."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el mundo de Corax podría, en un futuro lejano, convertirse en un "
"mundo semihabitable, para entonces quedarán muy pocas menas y minerales "
"(salvo el hierro). La capacidad de Soromida para soportar niveles inusuales "
"de incomodidad ambiental les ha dado una ventaja en este mundo en cuanto a "
"la extracción de recursos. El resto de la vida, al parecer, tendrá que "
"esperar su turno."

msgid ""
"Given the relative stability of this world the bar looks rather more Empire "
"standard-issue than on many Soromid worlds. There are tables, chairs, "
"dispensers, a barman and, most importantly, drinks. These there are in "
"profusion, though, this being a smaller world, not in any great variety. If "
"you ask for a cocktail though, you'll likely be directed to one of the local "
"sulphurous hot-water geysers."
msgstr ""
"Dada la relativa estabilidad de este mundo, el bar tiene un aspecto más "
"parecido al del Imperio que el de muchos mundos Soromida. Hay mesas, sillas, "
"dispensadores, un camarero y, lo más importante, bebidas. Estas últimas se "
"encuentran en abundancia, aunque, al tratarse de un mundo más pequeño, no "
"son muy variadas. Sin embargo, si pide un cóctel, es probable que le dirijan "
"a uno de los géiseres de agua caliente sulfurosa del lugar."

msgid "Corinth 1"
msgstr "Corinto 1"

msgid "Corinth 2"
msgstr "Corinto 2"

msgid "Corinth Foods"
msgstr "Comidas Corinto"

msgid ""
"This new type of agristation serves as the primary food producer for the "
"Procyon enclave and beyond. The station is designed in a multi-tiered way to "
"produce more food in a better-controlled environment using less materials "
"and maintenance. So far it seems to be working, as Corinth Foods produces "
"enough food to be exported from Za'lek space entirely."
msgstr ""
"Este nuevo tipo de agriestación sirve como principal productor de alimentos "
"para el enclave de Procyon y más allá. La estación está diseñada en varios "
"niveles para producir más alimentos en un entorno mejor controlado "
"utilizando menos materiales y mantenimiento. Hasta ahora parece funcionar, "
"ya que Comidas Corinto produce suficientes alimentos para ser exportados "
"desde el espacio Za'lek por completo."

msgid "Cornwal Ordnance"
msgstr "Ordenanza de Cornwal"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a weapons manufacturing plant run by a local businessman called "
"Frederick Cornwal. Cornwal makes money by mass producing ammunition and "
"civilian-licenced weaponry. Cornwal imports raw materials from the nearby "
"planets of Wagenni and Sollebor and sells the finished products out-of-"
"system for a tidy profit. Cornwal is sympathetic towards the people living "
"on the harsh worlds in Undergate and always makes sure they receive a "
"generous price for their exports."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una fábrica de armas dirigida por un empresario local llamado "
"Frederick Cornwal. Cornwal gana dinero produciendo en masa munición y "
"armamento con licencia civil. Cornwal importa materias primas de los "
"planetas cercanos de Wagenni y Sollebor y vende los productos acabados fuera "
"del sistema para obtener un buen beneficio. Cornwal es comprensivo con la "
"gente que vive en los duros mundos de Bajopuerta y siempre se asegura de que "
"reciban un precio generoso por sus exportaciones."

msgid ""
"For such a remote station, Cornwal Ordnance is remarkably well frequented by "
"traders. Frederick Cornwal is a talented businessman to have spread word of "
"his merchandise so widely throughout Sirius space. The regular shipments "
"required to keep business going helps too, so it is with the bar too."
msgstr ""
"Para ser una estación tan remota, la Ordenanza Cornwal está notablemente "
"bien frecuentada por los comerciantes. Frederick Cornwal es un hombre de "
"negocios con talento para haber dado a conocer su mercancía tan ampliamente "
"por todo el espacio de Sirio. Los envíos regulares que se requieren para "
"mantener el negocio en marcha también ayudan, así como el bar."

msgid "Corvus I"
msgstr "Corvus I"

msgid "Corvus VI"
msgstr "Corvus VI"

msgid "Corvus VI-a"
msgstr "Corvus VI-a"

msgid "Corvus VI-b"
msgstr "Corvus VI-b"

msgid ""
"Being a small moon in a heavily colonized system fewer colonists have paid "
"attention to Corvus VI-b, with the lack of a proper name itself is a bit of "
"a giveaway. However, the colonists of this moon appreciate its larger "
"neighbours which, inadvertently, provide protection by being more important, "
"juicier, and more obvious targets."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A small bar but clearly with space to expand into and, given the current "
"fortunes of this system, something the owner must already be considering "
"given how crowded it is. Then again, given the interesting position this "
"system occupies in space, maybe caution is the better part of valour."
msgstr ""
"Un bar pequeño, pero claramente con espacio para expandirse y, dada la "
"suerte actual de este sistema, algo que el propietario ya debe estar "
"considerando dado lo abarrotado que está. Por otra parte, dada la "
"interesante posición que ocupa este sistema en el espacio, quizá la "
"precaución sea la mejor parte del valor."

msgid "Cristen"
msgstr "Cristen"

msgid ""
"All water on Cristen is toxic and, as such, the planet is inhospitable to "
"all but the most hardy forms of life. However, the toxicity of the water "
"system also means that certain substances can be obtained very easily here. "
"Due to this the settlement on Cristen is one giant complex, isolated from "
"the outside environment."
msgstr ""
"Toda el agua de Cristen es tóxica y, como tal, el planeta es inhóspito para "
"todas las formas de vida, excepto las más resistentes. Sin embargo, la "
"toxicidad del sistema de agua también significa que ciertas sustancias "
"pueden obtenerse muy fácilmente aquí. Por ello, el asentamiento de Cristen "
"es un complejo gigante, aislado del entorno exterior."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is one of the best protected facilities on the planet. The "
"local government considers the lives of potential trading partners of "
"greater importance than the lives of its workers. Having said that they do "
"get to wear hazard suits outside of the main domes and they get a rather "
"nice bar too - certainly not something many Dvaereds can claim."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es una de las instalaciones mejor protegidas del "
"planeta. El gobierno local considera que la vida de los posibles socios "
"comerciales es más importante que la de sus trabajadores. Dicho esto, pueden "
"llevar trajes de riesgo fuera de las cúpulas principales y también disponen "
"de un bar bastante agradable, algo de lo que no pueden presumir muchos "
"Dvaereds."

msgid "Crow"
msgstr "Cuervo"

msgid ""
"Despite bordering on a dangerous sector of space, the Corvus system, and "
"Crow in particular, are thriving. The planet is a frontier of culture, "
"commerce and prosperity. Even for the Soromid, one of the youngest societies "
"in the galaxy, being away from the core worlds can give people the breathing "
"room to live on the edge."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de lindar con un sector peligroso del espacio, el sistema Corvus, y "
"Cuervo en particular, son prósperos. El planeta es una frontera de cultura, "
"comercio y prosperidad. Incluso para Soromida, una de las sociedades más "
"jóvenes de la galaxia, estar lejos de los mundos centrales puede dar a la "
"gente el respiro necesario para vivir al límite."

msgid ""
"This bar was designed with acoustics in mind. The background music is "
"pervasive, yet unobtrusive and conversations held at one table won't disturb "
"those at another. Given some of the newer customs cropping up here a lot of "
"out-of-system traders are thankful for this."
msgstr ""
"Este bar se ha diseñado teniendo en cuenta la acústica. La música de fondo "
"es penetrante, pero discreta, y las conversaciones que se mantienen en una "
"mesa no molestan a las de otra. Teniendo en cuenta algunas de las nuevas "
"costumbres que surgen aquí, muchos comerciantes de fuera del sistema lo "
"agradecen."

msgid "Crylo"
msgstr "Crylo"

msgid ""
"Crylo is an oceanic world with very little land surface, but it sports a "
"surprising number of inhabitants. As it happens, the aquatic life found on "
"this world is considered a delicacy in large parts of the galaxy, this has "
"attracted people to settle and spawned a flourishing fishing industry, and "
"attracts tourists interested in the old practice of catching their own meals."
msgstr ""
"Crylo es un mundo oceánico con muy poca superficie terrestre, pero que "
"cuenta con un sorprendente número de habitantes. Resulta que la vida "
"acuática que se encuentra en este mundo se considera un manjar en gran parte "
"de la galaxia, lo que ha atraído a la gente a establecerse y ha generado una "
"floreciente industria pesquera, y atrae a los turistas interesados en la "
"antigua práctica de pescar su propia comida."

msgid ""
"Fishing is the name of the game on Crylo and the spaceport bar is nothing if "
"not in character. Almost everything in here is fish-themed, including the "
"bar, which has been made out of the spine of some gargantuan aquatic "
"creature. Some of the more experimental drinks might also be better avoided "
"unless you like your ingredients very fresh indeed."
msgstr ""
"La pesca es el nombre del juego en Crylo y el bar del puerto espacial no es "
"más que un personaje. Casi todo lo que hay aquí es de temática piscícola, "
"incluida la barra, que se ha hecho con la columna vertebral de alguna "
"criatura acuática gigantesca. También es mejor evitar algunas de las bebidas "
"más experimentales, a menos que te gusten los ingredientes muy frescos."

msgid "Culex"
msgstr "Culex"

msgid ""
"Culex is the moon of planet Myonei. Myonei itself is a factory world, but "
"it's too unpleasant for even the genetically altered Soromid to live on. "
"Fortunately, Culex is quite suitable for habitation and so the workers who "
"labour on the surface have their homes here. Culex is little more than a "
"habitat with no economy of its own. It's fairly uninteresting to most people "
"who don't actually live here."
msgstr ""
"Culex es la luna del planeta Myonei. Myonei es un mundo industrial, pero es "
"demasiado desagradable para que vivan en él incluso los Soromida "
"genéticamente alterados. Afortunadamente, Culex es bastante apto para ser "
"habitado, por lo que los trabajadores que laboran en la superficie tienen "
"aquí sus hogares. Culex es poco más que un hábitat sin economía propia. Es "
"bastante poco interesante para la mayoría de la gente que no vive aquí."

msgid ""
"As Culex sees little traffic other than commuters to and from Myonei, the "
"spaceport bar has been repurposed as a community centre by the locals. The "
"standard facilities are still present and operational but in a minimal "
"fashion. Most of the facility is filled with recreational facilities and "
"even a dance floor."
msgstr ""
"Dado que Culex tiene poco tráfico, aparte de los viajeros que van y vienen "
"de Myonei, el bar del puerto espacial ha sido reutilizado como centro "
"comunitario por los lugareños. Las instalaciones estándar siguen estando "
"presentes y operativas, pero de forma mínima. La mayor parte de las "
"instalaciones están ocupadas por instalaciones recreativas e incluso una "
"pista de baile."

msgid "Curie"
msgstr "Curie"

msgid ""
"This planet is still in its infancy, and is a primary source of geological "
"research for Za'lek scientists, hosting one of the main materials research "
"centres. This, and the high density of rare and valuable heavy metals makes "
"it a potentially valuable Za'lek world despite the unpleasantness of its "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Este planeta está todavía en sus inicios, y es una fuente primaria de "
"investigación geológica para los científicos Za'lek, albergando uno de los "
"principales centros de investigación de materiales. Esto, y la alta densidad "
"de metales pesados raros y valiosos, lo convierten en un mundo Za'lek "
"potencialmente valioso a pesar de lo desagradable de su entorno."

msgid ""
"The bar has pictures of the famous scientists that the planet was named "
"after, as well as various pictures and holopaintings of some of the "
"phenomena on the planet that those whose interests in geology might find "
"interesting."
msgstr ""
"El bar cuenta con imágenes de los famosos científicos que dan nombre al "
"planeta, así como con diversas imágenes y holopinturas de algunos de los "
"fenómenos del planeta que pueden resultar interesantes para quienes se "
"interesen por la geología."

msgid "Cutha"
msgstr "Cutha"

msgid ""
"Cutha is a marvel of planetary engineering. It started out as a fairly "
"hostile world, its atmosphere filled with toxic substances, but the Soromid "
"have tamed it and turned it into a pretty decent place to live. Of course, "
"even Soromid engineering has its limits, so Cutha isn't quite as nice a "
"world as Turawee in Sarcophagus, but the result is still impressive. "
"Nowadays, Cutha houses most of the Soromid involved in the military "
"operations at Heronus."
msgstr ""
"Cutha es una maravilla de la ingeniería planetaria. Comenzó siendo un mundo "
"bastante hostil, con una atmósfera llena de sustancias tóxicas, pero "
"Soromida lo ha domesticado y lo ha convertido en un lugar bastante decente "
"para vivir. Por supuesto, incluso la ingeniería Soromida tiene sus límites, "
"así que Cutha no es un mundo tan agradable como Turawee en Sarcófago, pero "
"el resultado sigue siendo impresionante. En la actualidad, Cutha alberga a "
"la mayoría de Soromida que participan en las operaciones militares de "
"Heronus."

msgid ""
"Cutha's bar is very close to being an open-air bar. The airspace is still "
"fully enclosed but most of the surfaces, that aren't the actual floor, are "
"transparent. The ceiling, in particular, is made of a material that's all "
"but invisible to the naked eye, with the artificial breeze that blows "
"through the bar it's very easy to believe the illusion that one is actually "
"outside. Only on rainy days is the effect spoiled, something the regular "
"patrons, if not the outworlders, appreciate."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Cutha está muy cerca de ser un bar al aire libre. El espacio aéreo "
"sigue siendo totalmente cerrado, pero la mayoría de las superficies, que no "
"son el suelo, son transparentes. El techo, en particular, está hecho de un "
"material que es casi invisible a simple vista, y con la brisa artificial que "
"sopla a través del bar es muy fácil creer la ilusión de que uno está "
"realmente en el exterior. Sólo en los días de lluvia se estropea el efecto, "
"algo que los clientes habituales, si no los forasteros, agradecen."

msgid "Cygnus IV"
msgstr "Cygnus IV"

msgid "Cyrene"
msgstr "Cyrene"

msgid "Daahrax"
msgstr "Daahrax"

msgid ""
"When the Soromid claimed the barren world of Hadosh I, they had the "
"privilege of naming it and its moon. The planet came to be known as Daahrax. "
"However, in an impressive display of bureaucratic indecision, the planet's "
"moon remains unnamed. There is constant debate in the various government "
"institutions and, time and again, naming committees are created whose "
"suggestions are promptly rejected. It doesn't seem the Soromid are going to "
"come up with a good name anytime soon."
msgstr ""
"Cuando Soromida reclamo el mundo estéril de Hadosh I, tuvieron el privilegio "
"de ponerle nombre a él y a su luna. El planeta pasó a ser conocido como "
"Daahrax. Sin embargo, en un impresionante alarde de indecisión burocrática, "
"la luna del planeta sigue sin nombre. Hay un debate constante en las "
"distintas instituciones gubernamentales y, una y otra vez, se crean comités "
"de denominación cuyas sugerencias son rápidamente rechazadas. No parece que "
"Soromida vaya a dar con un buen nombre a corto plazo."

msgid ""
"Hello, traveller, welcome to the Daahrax spaceport bar. A word of advice, "
"don't ask about the moon. Trust me, don't do it. The locals are a little "
"touchy on the subject. How about a drink instead?"
msgstr ""
"Hola, viajero, bienvenido al bar del puerto espacial de Daahrax. Un consejo, "
"no preguntes por la luna. Créeme, no lo hagas. Los lugareños son un poco "
"sensibles al tema. ¿Qué tal un trago en su lugar?"

msgid "Daal"
msgstr "Daal"

msgid ""
"The small moon orbiting Rhu IV, named Daal, is easily overlooked but, as it "
"happens, it is quite an important piece of real estate for the Sirii. The "
"people who live here are particularly zealous in their beliefs and most of "
"them end up serving a lifetime in the Sirius army. The Fyrra are especially "
"well represented on this world."
msgstr ""
"La pequeña luna que orbita alrededor de Rhu IV, llamada Daal, se pasa por "
"alto con facilidad, pero resulta que es una pieza bastante importante para "
"Sirio. La gente que vive aquí es especialmente celosa en sus creencias y la "
"mayoría acaba sirviendo toda la vida en el ejército Sirio. Los Fyrra están "
"especialmente bien representados en este mundo."

msgid ""
"On Daal, people like to be reminded that they are part of a large galactic "
"faction. The tables in this spaceport bar have low-tech displays "
"incorporated in their surfaces, each table displays one of the Sirian "
"worlds, as well as up-to-date information about that world. Naturally, "
"Mutris is displayed on the largest table, but Daal itself comes a good "
"second."
msgstr ""
"En Daal, a la gente le gusta que le recuerden que forma parte de una gran "
"facción galáctica. Las mesas de este bar del puerto espacial tienen "
"pantallas de baja tecnología incorporadas en sus superficies, cada mesa "
"muestra uno de los mundos Sirio, así como información actualizada sobre ese "
"mundo. Naturalmente, Mutris se exhibe en la mesa más grande, pero el propio "
"Daal ocupa un buen segundo lugar."

msgid "Dakron III"
msgstr "Dakron III"

msgid "Dakron V"
msgstr "Dakron V"

msgid "Damien VII"
msgstr "Damien VII"

msgid "Damphyr"
msgstr "Damphyr"

msgid "Daravon I"
msgstr "Daravon I"

msgid ""
"A fairly standard large chunk of regolith, it is only notable for Eclipse "
"Citadel performing both training and weapon exercises on the surface. "
"Although it is not officially off-limits to civilians, it is highly "
"recommended to not overstay your welcome lest your ship turns into the new "
"cadets' training target."
msgstr ""

msgid "Daravon III"
msgstr "Daravon III"

msgid "Darkshed"
msgstr "Hangar Oscuro"

msgid ""
"Renowned for its outfit market and shipyards, nearly the entirety of the "
"Darkshed station is dedicated to trading outfits and ships. Mercenaries and "
"bounty hunters from all over the galaxy come here to see and try the newest "
"enhancements available on the market. It also tends to attract many of the "
"shadier characters in the universe, leading to frequent fights in which they "
"test their newly bought outfits."
msgstr ""
"Famosa por su mercado de equipos y sus astilleros, casi la totalidad de la "
"estación Hangar Oscuro está dedicada al comercio de equipos y naves. "
"Mercenarios y cazarrecompensas de toda la galaxia acuden aquí para ver y "
"probar las últimas mejoras disponibles en el mercado. También suele atraer a "
"muchos de los personajes más turbios del universo, lo que provoca frecuentes "
"peleas en las que ponen a prueba sus equipos recién comprados."

msgid ""
"The Darkshed canteen is decorated with all sorts of odd artefacts that "
"chronicle trends in spaceship outfitting over the years since the station "
"was established. Scale models of many popular ships hang from the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"La cantina de Hangar Oscuro está decorada con todo tipo de artefactos "
"extraños que describen las tendencias en el equipamiento de las naves "
"espaciales a lo largo de los años desde la creación de la estación. Del "
"techo cuelgan modelos a escala de muchas naves populares."

msgid "Darkstone IV"
msgstr "Piedraoscura IV"

msgid "Darkstone V"
msgstr "Piedraoscura V"

msgid "Dawn"
msgstr "Amanecer"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Gilligan's Light was one of the first systems to ever be chosen for a "
"colonization project. Dawn was the first world on which humans set foot in "
"this sector of space, despite the fact that the colony ship sent here, "
"Mythril, was only the fifth to be launched. Nevertheless, Dawn proved to be "
"one of the most fertile expeditions in the First Growth and its development "
"outstripped that of most other worlds.\n"
"With the advent of hyperspace travel, Dawn found itself the local capital of "
"the Frontier worlds and so is graced by the Frontier Council hanging "
"overhead. This status is strictly symbolic, but it explains why the FLF have "
"chosen to rally around Gilligan's Light."
msgstr ""
"La Luz de Gilligan fue uno de los primeros sistemas elegidos para un "
"proyecto de colonización. Amanecer fue el primer mundo en el que los humanos "
"pusieron el pie en este sector del espacio, a pesar de que la nave de "
"colonización enviada aquí, Mythril, fue sólo la quinta en ser lanzada. Sin "
"embargo, Amanecer resultó ser una de las expediciones más fértiles del "
"Primer Crecimiento y su desarrollo superó al de la mayoría de los demás "
"mundos. Con la llegada de los viajes hiperespaciales, Amanecer se convirtió "
"en la capital local de los mundos Frontera y, por ello, el Consejo Frontera "
"cuelga de su techo. Este estatus es estrictamente simbólico, pero explica "
"por qué la FLF ha decidido reunirse en torno a la Luz de Gilligan."

msgid ""
"Dawn's bar has a rustic feel to it; the locals have made a point of keeping "
"the style close to what was the prevalent design in the early expansion era. "
"Other than that, this bar doesn't have much to set it apart from others. The "
"noise, the smell, and the drunks are features that are commonplace "
"throughout the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Amanecer tiene un aire rústico, los lugareños se han esforzado por "
"mantener el estilo cercano a lo que era el diseño predominante en la época "
"de la expansión. Aparte de eso, este bar no tiene mucho que lo distinga de "
"los demás. El ruido, el olor y los borrachos son características habituales "
"en toda la galaxia."

msgid "Delta Pavonis I"
msgstr "Delta Pavonis I"

msgid "Delta Pavonis II"
msgstr "Delta Pavonis II"

msgid "Delta Pavonis IIa"
msgstr "Delta Pavonis IIa"

msgid "Delta Polaris I"
msgstr "Delta Polaris I"

msgid "Delta Polaris II"
msgstr "Delta Polaris II"

msgid "Delta Polaris VI"
msgstr "Delta Polaris VI"

msgid "Dendria Alpha-a"
msgstr "Alpha-a Dendria"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A small moon orbiting Dendria Alpha that exhibits a very deep surface layer "
"of ice with a small inert core. Although there is no atmosphere, once every "
"orbit it gets close enough to Dendria Alpha to melt the outer layer of ice, "
"which then refreezes and erases any signs of ships that have visited the "
"moon. Your ships sensors can pick up traces of bacterial life that probably "
"flourish during the short \"summer\" period, probably brought in by careless "
"ships."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña luna en órbita alrededor de Dendria Alfa que presenta una capa "
"superficial de hielo muy profunda con un pequeño núcleo inerte. Aunque no "
"tiene atmósfera, cada órbita se acerca lo suficiente a Dendria Alfa como "
"para derretir la capa exterior de hielo, que luego se vuelve a congelar y "
"borra cualquier señal de naves que hayan visitado la luna. Los sensores de "
"tu nave pueden captar rastros de vida bacteriana que probablemente florezcan "
"durante el corto periodo \"estival\", probablemente traída por naves "
"descuidadas."

msgid "Dendria Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa Dendria"

msgid "Deneb III"
msgstr "Deneb III"

msgid "Deneb III-a"
msgstr "Deneb III-a"

msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Originally a moon of Deneb III, Deneb III-a seems to have been blown off-"
"orbit and is now a rogue planet, likely to leave the system in the next few "
"hundred cycles. The surface of the planet seems heavily damaged, with odd "
"crystalline formations here and there, likely from some sort of reaction "
"with the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente una luna de Deneb III, Deneb III-a parece haber salido de su "
"órbita y ahora es un planeta rebelde, que probablemente abandonará el "
"sistema en los próximos cientos de ciclos. La superficie del planeta parece "
"extremadamente dañada, con extrañas formaciones cristalinas que aparecen "
"aquí y allá, probablemente debido a algún tipo de reacción con la nebulosa."

msgid "Diabolos Station"
msgstr "Estación Diabolos"

msgid ""
"Diabolos Station was constructed especially for the sport that made Totoran "
"famous. The station sports two separate arenas. The first one is a deadly, "
"three dimensional labyrinth filled with dangerous traps and obstacles. It "
"fills most of the station's bulk. The second arena is actually space itself. "
"Gladiators fight in lifesuits on the outer hull of the station, without "
"lifelines."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Diabolos se construyó especialmente para el deporte que hizo "
"famoso a Totoran. La estación cuenta con dos arenas separadas. La primera es "
"un laberinto tridimensional lleno de peligrosas trampas y obstáculos. Ocupa "
"la mayor parte de la superficie de la estación. La segunda arena es en "
"realidad el espacio mismo. Los gladiadores luchan con trajes salvavidas en "
"el casco exterior de la estación, sin líneas de vida."

msgid "Diadem I"
msgstr "Diadema I"

msgid "Diadem II"
msgstr "Diadema II"

msgid "Doeston Prime"
msgstr "Doeston Prime"

msgid "Dohriabi Prime"
msgstr "Dohriabi Prime"

msgid "Dolmen"
msgstr "Dolmen"

msgid ""
"Dolmen is a nice planet but it's only sparsely populated. The local "
"government aims to keep the planet free from crime and, while this is likely "
"to be an unrealistic goal, the strict immigration policy does help to filter "
"out the more unsavoury characters, and keeps the population from increasing "
"too much."
msgstr ""
"Dolmen es un planeta agradable pero poco poblado. El gobierno local pretende "
"mantener el planeta libre de delincuencia y, aunque probablemente sea un "
"objetivo poco realista, la estricta política de inmigración ayuda a filtrar "
"a los personajes más desagradables y evita que la población aumente "
"demasiado."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is officially outside the borders of the Dolmen global "
"political area. This legal construction was necessary for Dolmen to allow "
"both free trade and a tight migration policy. An interesting side effect is "
"that all drinks in this bar are tax free."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial está oficialmente fuera de las fronteras del área "
"política global de Dolmen. Esta construcción legal era necesaria para que "
"Dolmen permitiera tanto el libre comercio como una estricta política "
"migratoria. Un efecto secundario interesante es que todas las bebidas de "
"este bar están libres de impuestos."

msgid "Donnar"
msgstr "Donnar"

msgid ""
"Despite not having been officially classified as habitable, Donnar has been "
"settled by sufficient numbers of Dvaered to give the planet civilian world "
"status. Though the soil is barely fertile and the atmosphere is less than "
"pleasant for even the most hardy plant life, Donnar has the major advantage "
"of having almost no seismic activity at all. As many a colony prospector "
"would tell you, a stable planet is a good planet."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de no haber sido clasificado oficialmente como habitable, Donnar ha "
"sido colonizado por un número suficiente Dvaered como para darle al planeta "
"el estatus de mundo civil. Aunque el suelo apenas es fértil y la atmósfera "
"es poco agradable incluso para la vida vegetal más resistente, Donnar tiene "
"la gran ventaja de no tener casi ninguna actividad sísmica. Como dirían "
"muchos buscadores de colonias, un planeta estable es un buen planeta."

msgid ""
"Donnar has something unusual to offer to offworlders. The spaceport bar is "
"constructed as an arena, with the spectator area fulfilling the functions "
"that most other spaceport bars do. The central area serves as a stage for "
"entertainment of all kinds, ranging from fights to displays of art. The "
"concept is rather ingenious and many a spacer is as astonished by the "
"display as they are by the fact that the Dvaered came up with this idea."
msgstr ""
"Donnar tiene algo inusual que ofrecer a los extranjeros. El bar del puerto "
"espacial está construido como una arena, con la zona de espectadores "
"cumpliendo las funciones que la mayoría de los bares de otros puertos "
"espaciales. La zona central sirve de escenario para espectáculos de todo "
"tipo, desde peleas hasta muestras de arte. El concepto es bastante ingenioso "
"y muchos espaciadores se quedan tan sorprendidos por el espectáculo como por "
"el hecho de que a los Dvaered se les haya ocurrido esta idea."

msgid "Dono"
msgstr "Dono"

msgid ""
"Dono is one of the more laid-back Soromid worlds. It is quite Earth-like and "
"the Soromid make use of the strange properties of the local flora and fauna "
"in their genetic experiments. It is a quiet world, with little that stands "
"out about it."
msgstr ""
"Dono es uno de los mundos Soromida más relajados. Es bastante parecido a la "
"Tierra y Soromida utilizan las extrañas propiedades de la flora y la fauna "
"locales en sus experimentos genéticos. Es un mundo tranquilo, con poco que "
"destaque."

msgid ""
"The bar's patrons are scientists, labourers and regular civilians, mingling "
"with little conflict. The service is acceptable and the food and drink "
"average. A sleepy little bar, that's for sure."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes del bar son científicos, obreros y civiles normales, que se "
"mezclan con pocos conflictos. El servicio es aceptable y la comida y la "
"bebida son normales. Un bar pequeño y tranquilo, eso es seguro."

msgid "Doormat"
msgstr "Alfombrilla"

msgid ""
"Doormat is a lightly populated frontier world still being terraformed. "
"Despite the Incident, the Empire's population is still growing fast and new "
"worlds need to be sought out to lighten the load. Doormat is one of these "
"worlds. While not a particularly rich world, there are enough minerals for a "
"modest mining operation."
msgstr ""
"Alfombrilla es un mundo fronterizo poco poblado que aún se está "
"terraformando. A pesar del Incidente, la población del Imperio sigue "
"creciendo rápidamente y hay que buscar nuevos mundos para aligerar la carga. "
"Alfombrilla es uno de estos mundos. Aunque no es un mundo especialmente "
"rico, hay suficientes minerales para una modesta operación minera."

msgid "Doranthex Prime"
msgstr "Doranthex Prime"

msgid ""
"Doranthex Prime is a mostly-molten planet. One of the few pieces of solid "
"land is a small island drifting around the northern polar region. On this "
"island the Dvaered have established a small base, primarily for research and "
"military prototyping, though civilians are allowed in the main facilities. "
"Due to the intense temperatures, the base is shielded by over 50m of "
"temperature isolation plating, which affords no view of the planet itself "
"once a ship has landed."
msgstr ""
"Doranthex Prime es un planeta mayoritariamente fundido. Uno de los pocos "
"trozos de tierra firme es una pequeña isla a la deriva en la región polar "
"norte. En esta isla los Dvaered han establecido una pequeña base, "
"principalmente para la investigación y la creación de prototipos militares, "
"aunque se permite la entrada de civiles en las instalaciones principales. "
"Debido a las intensas temperaturas, la base está protegida por más de 50 "
"metros de placas de aislamiento térmico, que no permiten ver el planeta una "
"vez que la nave ha aterrizado."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The drinks served in 'The Furnace', as the bar calls itself, are a rather "
"curious sort. They are generally very strong and served lukewarm. The house "
"specialities also contain volcanic ash which is harvested from the planet's "
"surface. A strange bar indeed."
msgstr ""
"Las bebidas que se sirven en \"El Horno\", como se llama el bar, son "
"bastante curiosas. Suelen ser muy fuertes y se sirven tibias. Además, las "
"especialidades de la casa contienen cenizas volcánicas que se recogen de la "
"superficie del planeta. Un bar realmente extraño."

msgid "Doranthex Secundus"
msgstr "Doranthex Secundus"

msgid "Doranthex Stop"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Originally a minor refuelling stop, it has since a large uptick in activity "
"since the Incident thanks to increased smuggling in the area. So much, that "
"it was pushed by a dozen stolen plowshares into an asteroid field to lower "
"visibility in an extreme feat of reckless engineering. Surprisingly enough, "
"damage from impacts has been minimal and the station has never ceased "
"operating during the entire time."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The bar hasn't seen many changes nor improvements since the station was a "
"tiny refuelling depot. What was originally a fairly spacious area has become "
"significantly more crowded, however, the poor quality of the food and drinks "
"helps to keep it from being packed. Looking at the amount of grime on the "
"walls, it would also seem that the bar may have not been cleaned since then "
"either."
msgstr ""

msgid "Doro"
msgstr "Doro"

msgid "Dowue"
msgstr "Dowue"

msgid ""
"Dowue is a planet known for the infamous \"Dowue Syndrome\", a condition "
"where patients will temporarily come down with hysteria due to prolonged "
"exposure to certain visual wavelengths. This was at first attributed to a "
"contaminated shipment of food, but later it was found that the sun in the "
"Apez system emitted abnormal wavelengths whose effects were multiplied by "
"particulate in Dowue's atmosphere. Shortly thereafter, it became mandatory "
"for all personnel to wear special goggles designed to filter out the harmful "
"light."
msgstr ""
"Dowue es un planeta conocido por el infame \"Síndrome de Dowue\", una "
"condición en la que los pacientes caen temporalmente en la histeria debido a "
"la exposición prolongada a ciertas longitudes de onda visuales. Al principio "
"se atribuyó a un cargamento de comida contaminada, pero más tarde se "
"descubrió que el sol del sistema Apez emitía longitudes de onda anormales "
"cuyos efectos se multiplicaban por las partículas de la atmósfera de Dowue. "
"Poco después, se hizo obligatorio para todo el personal el uso de gafas "
"especiales diseñadas para filtrar la luz dañina."

msgid ""
"The Dowue Spaceport Bar is better known as the 'Frozen Shrimp' after some "
"ancient crustaceans found during the construction of the spaceport. It is a "
"place where most of the personnel spend their time. Even with protective "
"goggles, the dangers of Dowue Syndrome persuade most people to stay indoors "
"and the bar lies at the heart of the spaceport."
msgstr ""
"El Bar del Puerto Espacial de Dowue es más conocido como la \"Gamba "
"Congelada\" por unos antiguos crustáceos encontrados durante la construcción "
"del puerto espacial. El lugar donde pasa la mayor parte del personal. "
"Incluso con gafas protectoras, los peligros del Síndrome de Dowue persuaden "
"a la mayoría de la gente a permanecer en el interior y el bar se encuentra "
"en el corazón del puerto espacial."

msgid "Draconis Alpha"
msgstr "Draconis Alpha"

msgid "Draconis Beta"
msgstr "Draconis Beta"

msgid "Draconis Delta"
msgstr "Draconis Delta"

msgid "Draconis Epsilon"
msgstr "Draconis Epsilon"

msgid ""
"Draconis Epsilon is a densely populated Imperial world that grew rich in the "
"days before the Incident, when Draconis was still a core system, not at the "
"outer fringes of Imperial controlled territory. The inhabitants here have "
"suffered from the change, but not as much as what might be expected; the "
"world maintains a solid consumer base."
msgstr ""
"Draconis Epsilon es un mundo imperial densamente poblado que see enriqueció "
"en los días anteriores al Incidente, cuando Draconis aún era un sistema "
"principal, no en los márgenes del territorio controlado por el Imperio. Sus "
"habitantes han sufrido el cambio, pero no tanto como cabría esperar; el "
"mundo mantiene una sólida base de consumidores."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar on Draconis Epsilon is circular in shape, with exits all "
"around leading to the various spaceport platforms. The place is gigantic, "
"providing seats for up to ten thousand customers at the same time, and more "
"at the bar. Most spacers who have visited Epsilon Draconis agree that few "
"spaceport bars are quite as impressive as this one."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Draconis Epsilon tiene forma circular, con "
"salidas alrededor que llevan a las distintas plataformas del puerto "
"espacial. El lugar es gigantesco, y ofrece asientos para hasta diez mil "
"clientes al mismo tiempo, y más en la barra. La mayoría de los espaciales "
"que han visitado Draconis Epsilon coinciden en que pocos bares de puertos "
"espaciales son tan impresionantes como éste."

msgid "Draconis Gamma"
msgstr "Draconis Gamma"

msgid "Draconis Omega"
msgstr "Draconis Omega"

msgid ""
"Draconis Omega was one of the old Empire's most successful colonies. The "
"planet is large compared to Earth, yet its gravity is comparable. This made "
"it ideal as a population base, which it remains today.\n"
"Draconis Omega remains firmly loyal to the Empire, despite its now isolated "
"position. The people here believe that the after effects of the Incident are "
"only temporary and that the Empire will, one day, regain its former glory, "
"in which Draconis Omega will, of course, feature prominently."
msgstr ""
"Draconis Omega fue una de las mejores colonias del antiguo Imperio más "
"exitoso. El planeta es grande comparado con la Tierra, pero su gravedad es "
"comparable. Esto lo hizo ideal como base de población, que sigue siendo hoy "
"en día. \n"
"Draconis Omega sigue siendo firmemente leal al Imperio, a pesar de su "
"posición ahora aislada. Sus habitantes creen que las secuelas del Incidente "
"son sólo temporales y que el Imperio recuperará algún día su antigua gloria, "
"en la que Draconis Omega ocupará, por supuesto, un lugar destacado."

msgid ""
"Ever the optimists, the people of Draconis Omega have decorated their "
"spaceport bar with displays of past Imperial power, portraits of former "
"Emperors and charts that show the size of the Empire when it was at its "
"peak. It's certainly a good lesson in history and it's clear that the "
"inhabitants truly believe that the good times will one day return."
msgstr ""
"Siempre optimistas, los habitantes de Draconis Omega han decorado su bar del "
"puerto espacial con muestras del poder Imperial del pasado, retratos de "
"antiguos Emperadores y gráficos que muestran el tamaño del Imperio cuando "
"estaba en su apogeo. Es, sin duda, una buena lección de historia y está "
"claro que sus habitantes creen de verdad que los buenos tiempos volverán "
"algún día."

msgid "Draygar III"
msgstr "Draygar III"

msgid "Drognain"
msgstr "Drognain"

msgid ""
"Drognain is an example of the Za'lek intellectual elite's more excessive "
"traits and occasional flamboyant failures.. The planet is an abysmal hell "
"that has only gotten worse thanks to being the foreground of various "
"terraforming experiments that failed. However, the Za'lek still maintain a "
"presence on the world despite this, mostly through borderline force."
msgstr ""
"Drognain es un ejemplo de los rasgos más excesivos y los ocasionales "
"fracasos extravagantes de la élite intelectual \"a'lek... El planeta es un "
"infierno abismal que no ha hecho más que empeorar gracias a ser el primer "
"plano de varios experimentos de terraformación que fracasaron. Sin embargo, "
"los Za'lek siguen manteniendo su presencia en el mundo a pesar de ello, "
"sobre todo a través de la frontera de la fuerza."

msgid "Druss II"
msgstr "Druss II"

msgid "Druss IIa"
msgstr "Druss IIa"

msgid "Druss III"
msgstr "Druss III"

msgid "Dun Hill"
msgstr "Colina Dun"

msgid ""
"Dun Hill is one of those little mining worlds that is regarded as being "
"totally insignificant. Indeed, the world has no real personality of its own "
"as the population is imported from nearby planets. It isn't a pleasant place "
"to live but, none-the-less, it has valuable resources the Empire would "
"rather not go without."
msgstr ""
"Colina Dun es uno de esos pequeños mundos mineros que se consideran "
"totalmente insignificantes. De hecho, el mundo no tiene personalidad propia, "
"ya que la población es importada de los planetas cercanos. No es un lugar "
"agradable para vivir, pero, sin embargo, cuenta con valiosos recursos de los "
"que el Imperio preferiría no prescindir."

msgid ""
"This bar is primarily frequented by off-duty miners trying to unwind. "
"Pictures of antique mining equipment hang from the walls. Little else here "
"is worthy of notice."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es frecuentado principalmente por mineros fuera de servicio que "
"intentan relajarse. De las paredes cuelgan fotos de equipos mineros "
"antiguos. Poco más hay que destacar aquí."

msgid "Dundrop Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Dundrop"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dundrop Monastery is a commerce oriented station. Traders usually come here "
"to buy and sell goods and then take them elsewhere. Some traders rent out "
"cargo bays to store non-perishable goods, however, then they can be the "
"first to capitalize when a neighbouring planet develops a high demand for "
"them."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Dundrop es una estación orientada al comercio. Los "
"comerciantes suelen venir aquí a comprar y vender mercancías para luego "
"llevarlas a otro lugar. Sin embargo, algunos comerciantes alquilan las "
"bahías de carga para almacenar productos no perecederos, así pueden ser los "
"primeros en sacar provecho cuando un planeta vecino desarrolle una gran "
"demanda de ellos."

msgid ""
"All the tables in this bar have multiple displays for tracking economic "
"information for the whole of known space. The patrons are mostly engrossed "
"in absorbing the graphs and charts displayed. There is little room for "
"social interaction on Dundrop."
msgstr ""
"Todas las mesas de este bar tienen múltiples pantallas para seguir la "
"información económica de todo el espacio conocido. La mayoría de los "
"clientes están absortos en los gráficos y tablas que se muestran. En Dundrop "
"hay poco espacio para la interacción social."

msgid "Dunmer"
msgstr "Dunmer"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Even the Dvaered realize that not every world can be devoted to industry. "
"Food has to be grown somewhere and crop-growing stations are not yet "
"practical, for the Dvaered, on a large scale. Hence, the setting aside of "
"Dunmer for agriculture. Despite its small size, the planet actually has a "
"significantly larger population than Castellan III, due to its much more "
"pleasant climate."
msgstr ""
"Incluso los Dvaered son conscientes de que no todo el mundo puede dedicarse "
"a la industria. Los alimentos tienen que crecer en algún lugar y las "
"estaciones de cultivo aún no son prácticas, para los Dvaered, a gran escala. "
"De ahí que se haya reservado Dunmer para la agricultura. A pesar de su "
"pequeño tamaño, el planeta tiene en realidad una población "
"significativamente mayor que Castellano III, debido a su clima mucho más "
"agradable."

msgid ""
"This bar is populated by traders carrying food to Castellan III and beyond, "
"farmers who maintain the agri-businesses and Dvaered soldiers who function "
"as a garrison. The bar is lively and friendly, except for the dour soldiers."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está poblado por comerciantes que llevan alimentos a Castellano III "
"y más allá, agricultores que mantienen los negocios agrícolas y soldados "
"Dvaered que funcionan como guarnición. El bar es animado y amigable, excepto "
"por los adustos soldados."

msgid "Duran Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Duran"

msgid ""
"Duran Shipyard produces light support craft used by the Dvaered military "
"machine. It also has a line of civilian and cargo ships which it makes "
"available to retailers and consumers.\n"
"Since the ships produced here are combat-ready and the facility always has "
"at least one completed squadron standing by, Duran Shipyard is an important "
"contributor to the stability in the region."
msgstr ""
"El Astillero Duran produce naves ligeras de apoyo utilizadas por la "
"maquinaria militar Dvaered. También tiene una línea de naves civiles y de "
"carga que pone a disposición de los comerciantes y consumidores.\n"
"Dado que las naves que se producen aquí están listos para el combate y la "
"instalación siempre tiene al menos una escuadra completa en espera, el "
"Astillero Duran es un importante contribuyente a la estabilidad de la región."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar provides visitors with a view over part of the assembly "
"line. It is quite impressive to see a spacecraft being built, even if it is "
"only a relatively small one."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial ofrece a los visitantes una vista sobre parte de "
"la cadena de montaje. Es bastante impresionante ver cómo se construye una "
"nave espacial, aunque sea relativamente pequeña."

msgid "Durea"
msgstr "Durea"

msgid ""
"Durea is not a terribly pleasant place to live, as it orbits its star a "
"little too distantly for comfort, which leaves most of the planet covered in "
"snow and ice. Only a small portion of the surface thaws far enough in summer "
"for mining operations, but despite that the riches underneath the crust "
"compel a hardy population to dig. Indeed, if one day resources in the galaxy "
"grow sparse enough, Durea may well find itself in an economically superior "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Durea no es un lugar terriblemente agradable para vivir, ya que orbita "
"alrededor de su estrella a una distancia demasiado grande para ser cómoda, "
"lo que deja la mayor parte del planeta cubierto de nieve y hielo. Sólo una "
"pequeña porción de la superficie se descongela lo suficiente en verano para "
"las operaciones mineras, pero a pesar de ello las riquezas bajo la corteza "
"obligan a una población resistente a excavar. De hecho, si un día los "
"recursos de la galaxia escasean lo suficiente, Durea podría encontrarse en "
"una posición económicamente superior."

msgid ""
"This bar is the standard-issue model that can be found on unpopular mining "
"colonies throughout the galaxy. It's essentially a regular prefab habitation "
"unit converted into a bar. It has all the amenities and features you might "
"expect in a public facility but it offers none of the comfort that bars on "
"metropolis planets tend to sport. The liquor served here is often pretty "
"strong, this is, in no small part, due to the planet's harsh environment."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es el modelo estándar que se puede encontrar en las colonias "
"mineras poco populares de toda la galaxia. Es esencialmente una unidad "
"habitacional prefabricada normal convertida en un bar. Tiene todos los "
"servicios y características que se pueden esperar de un establecimiento "
"público, pero no ofrece ninguna de las comodidades que suelen tener los "
"bares de los planetas metropolitanos. El licor que se sirve aquí suele ser "
"bastante fuerte, lo que se debe, en gran medida, al duro entorno del planeta."

msgid "Duros I"
msgstr "Duros I"

msgid "Duros Ia"
msgstr "Duros Ia"

msgid "Durumdra"
msgstr "Durumdra"

msgid ""
"While Durumdra technically classifies as a P-class ice world, the place can "
"be quite comfortable to live on. Some regions near the equator melt during "
"part of the planet's solar cycle and during this period there is an outburst "
"of life, ranging from vegetation to small hibernating animals. By Dvaered "
"standards, the planet is not so bad at all."
msgstr ""
"Aunque Durumdra se clasifica técnicamente como un mundo de hielo de clase P, "
"el lugar puede ser bastante cómodo para vivir. Algunas regiones cercanas al "
"ecuador se derriten durante parte del ciclo solar del planeta y durante este "
"periodo se produce un estallido de vida, que va desde la vegetación hasta "
"los pequeños animales que hibernan. Para los estándares Dvaered, el planeta "
"no está tan mal."

msgid ""
"Durumdra doesn't have much to distinguish itself by in the galaxy but the "
"spaceport bar goes a long way to helping. It has drinks from all over the "
"galaxy, though Draygar's awkward location means that most of them are rather "
"pricey. Nevertheless, Durumdra has earned itself a footnote in several noted "
"galactic tourist guides."
msgstr ""
"Durumdra no tiene mucho por lo que distinguirse en la galaxia, pero el bar "
"del puerto espacial ayuda mucho. Tiene bebidas de toda la galaxia, aunque la "
"incómoda ubicación de Draygar hace que la mayoría de ellas sean bastante "
"caras. No obstante, Durumdra se ha ganado una nota a pie de página en varias "
"guías turísticas galácticas de renombre."

msgid "Dusk"
msgstr "Atardecer"

msgid "Dust"
msgstr "Polvo"

msgid "Dvaer II"
msgstr "Dvaer II"

msgid "Dvaer III"
msgstr "Dvaer III"

msgid "Dvaer IIIa"
msgstr "Dvaer IIIa"

msgid "Dvaer IV"
msgstr "Dvaer IV"

msgid "Dvaer Prime"
msgstr "Dvaer Prime"

msgid ""
"Dvaer Prime is the capital world of all of Dvaered space, the world on which "
"the Old Empire granted House Dvaered its status as a Great House, and the "
"world after which its founders chose to name their people.\n"
"However, iconic though the planet may be, it is of little actual "
"consequence. At best it is fought over jealously by the Dvaered Warlords, "
"who consider ownership of the world a matter of great prestige; otherwise "
"there is nothing that sets Dvaer Prime apart from other planets. After all, "
"the decisions are all made in Dvaered High Command, which floats in high "
"orbit over Dvaer Prime."
msgstr ""
"Dvaer Prime es el mundo capital de todo el espacio Dvaered, el mundo en el "
"que el Antiguo Imperio concedió a la Casa Dvaered su estatus de Gran Casa, y "
"el mundo que sus fundadores eligieron para dar nombre a su pueblo.\n"
"Sin embargo, por muy emblemático que sea el planeta, tiene poca importancia "
"real. En el mejor de los casos, los Señores de la Guerra Dvaered se lo "
"disputan celosamente, ya que consideran que la propiedad del mundo es una "
"cuestión de gran prestigio; por lo demás, no hay nada que distinga a Dvaer "
"Prime de otros planetas. Al fin y al cabo, todas las decisiones se toman en "
"el Alto Mando Dvaered, que flota en alta órbita sobre Dvaer Prime."

msgid ""
"Dvaer Prime sports a well appointed spaceport bar. It is not so much "
"luxurious as it is grimy, but at least all necessary facilities are present "
"and in working order and the drinks are decent enough by Dvaered standards. "
"A holopainting on the wall commemorates the inauguration ceremony of House "
"Dvaered but it is faded and warped in places, a testament to the fact that "
"most Dvaered citizens have long ago forgotten that they are technically "
"still part of the Empire."
msgstr ""
"Dvaer Prime cuenta con un bar en el puerto espacial bien equipado. No es tan "
"lujoso como mugriento, pero al menos todas las instalaciones necesarias "
"están presentes y en funcionamiento, y las bebidas son bastante decentes "
"para los estándares Dvaered. Una holopintura en la pared conmemora la "
"ceremonia de inauguración de la Casa Dvaered, pero está descolorida y "
"deformada en algunas partes, un testimonio del hecho de que la mayoría de "
"los ciudadanos Dvaered hace tiempo que olvidaron que técnicamente aún forman "
"parte del Imperio."

msgid "Dvaered High Command"
msgstr "Alto Mando Dvaered"

msgid "#pDvaered Homeworld#0"
msgstr "#pMundo Hogar Dvaered#0"

msgid ""
"This is Dvaered High Command, the true seat of power over all Dvaered space, "
"and where the Generals come together and decide on a course of action for "
"the Dvaered military forces.\n"
"Understandably, Dvaered High Command is a military stronghold, one of the "
"most heavily guarded places in the galaxy. One needs a certain number of "
"Dvaered commendations to be even allowed to set foot on the station."
msgstr ""
"Este es el Alto Mando Dvaered, la verdadera sede del poder sobre todo el "
"espacio Dvaered, y donde los Generales se reúnen y deciden el curso de "
"acción de las fuerzas militares Dvaered.\n"
"Como es lógico, el Alto Mando Dvaered es una fortaleza militar, uno de los "
"lugares más vigilados de la galaxia. Se necesita un cierto número de "
"encomiendas Dvaered para poder siquiera poner un pie en la estación."

msgid "DVNN Central"
msgstr "RNDV Central"

msgid ""
"Even before House Dvaered gained its independence, there were unofficial "
"news channels that fueled the discontent among the Imperial labour force. "
"Later, after their work was done, these channels pooled their resources to "
"establish the Dvaered News Network, DVNN.\n"
"Because this station serves as the main nexus for all Dvaered mass media, it "
"is coveted by many a Warlord but Dvaered High Command makes sure that the "
"station remains firmly under its control."
msgstr ""
"Incluso antes de que la Casa Dvaered obtuviera su independencia, había "
"canales de noticias no oficiales que alimentaban el descontento entre la "
"mano de obra Imperial. Más tarde, una vez terminada su labor, estos canales "
"unieron sus recursos para establecer la Red de Noticias Dvaered, RNDV.\n"
"Porque esta emisora sirve de nexo principal para todos los medios de "
"comunicación Dvaered. Es codiciada por muchos Señores de la Guerra, pero el "
"Alto Mando Dvaered se asegura de que la emisora permanezca firmemente bajo "
"su control."

msgid ""
"Spaceport bar, waiting lounge, interview room, this facility is everything "
"at once. It's the only place accessible to non-DVNN personnel so all "
"dealings with visitors have to take place here. In fact, one of the Dvaered "
"reality shows is a live feed from the spaceport bar on DVNN Central, showing "
"how the various visitors behave. The Dvaered seem to find this entertaining."
msgstr ""
"Bar del puerto espacial, sala de espera, sala de entrevistas, esta "
"instalación es todo a la vez. Es el único lugar al que puede acceder el "
"personal ajeno a RNDV, por lo que todo el trato con los visitantes tiene que "
"tener lugar aquí. De hecho, uno de los reality shows Dvaered es una "
"transmisión en directo desde el bar del puerto espacial en la Central de "
"RNDV, mostrando cómo se comportan los distintos visitantes. Los Dvaered "
"parecen encontrarlo entretenido."

msgid "Ebenezer"
msgstr "Ebenezer"

msgid ""
"A small moon orbiting Sarcophagus II, Ebenezer's atmosphere is deadly to "
"humans and Soromid alike. However, the Soromid discovered that their "
"biological ships quite like it here and a few weeks of continued exposure "
"makes their outer skins tougher and more resistant to damage. Most Soromid "
"military ships will make a visit to Ebenezer early on in their lives for "
"this reason."
msgstr ""
"La atmósfera de Ebenezer, una pequeña luna que orbita alrededor de Sarcófago "
"II, es mortal tanto para los humanos como para Soromida. Sin embargo, "
"Soromida descubrió que a sus naves biológicas les gusta bastante este lugar "
"y unas semanas de exposición continuada hacen que sus pieles exteriores sean "
"más duras y resistentes a los daños. La mayoría de las naves militares "
"Soromida hace una visita a Ebenezer al principio de su vida por esta razón."

msgid ""
"There's really not too much to do on Ebenezer. The Soromid who live here "
"permanently are here to oversee the ships tethered to the surface and their "
"population isn't large enough to present much of a market. Traders don't "
"often come to this place."
msgstr ""
"Realmente no hay mucho que hacer en Ebenezer. Los Soromida que viven aquí "
"permanentemente están aquí para supervisar las naves atadas a la superficie "
"y su población no es lo suficientemente grande como para presentar un gran "
"mercado. Los comerciantes no suelen venir a este lugar."

msgid "Eclipse Citadel"
msgstr "Ciudadela Eclipse"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eclipse Citadel is the major military outpost in this area of Dvaered space, "
"serving as a customs checkpoint for Imperial and Society traders looking to "
"travel to Dvaer and beyond. Simultaneously, it is charged with minimizing "
"the pirate threat in this region of space. It therefore should come as no "
"surprise that Eclipse Citadel supports a sizeable fleet."
msgstr ""
"La Ciudadela Eclipse es el principal puesto militar de esta zona del espacio "
"Dvaered. Sirve como punto de control aduanero para los comerciantes "
"imperiales y del Consorcio que desean viajar a Dvaer y más allá. Al mismo "
"tiempo, se encarga de minimizar la amenaza pirata en esta región del "
"espacio. Por lo tanto, no debería sorprender que la Ciudadela Eclipse "
"soporte una flota considerable."

msgid ""
"This bar is clearly not a place for relaxation; it is frequented mostly by "
"traders who are waiting for their shipments to clear. The appointments are "
"drab and functional and the smell of cleaning chemicals is prevalent."
msgstr ""
"Está claro que este bar no es un lugar para relajarse. Lo frecuentan sobre "
"todo comerciantes que esperan el despacho de sus envíos. Las citas son "
"monótonas y funcionales y el olor a productos químicos de limpieza es "
"predominante."

msgid "Edergast"
msgstr "Edergast"

msgid ""
"A beautiful glaciated planet consisting mainly of frozen carbon compounds. "
"It is speculated that it potentially may have had life many millions of "
"cycles ago, however, some cataclysmic event led to a drastic temperature "
"drop, where it now keeps an average yearly temperature of about 30 to 40 "
"kelvins depending on the cycle.\n"
"\n"
"Although it used to be popular with tourists for its natural beauty, since "
"the Incident, it is hardly visited at all. This is likely exacerbated by the "
"fact by the Nebula giving the planet a more sinister and eerie glow."
msgstr ""

msgid "Edorn"
msgstr "Edorn"

msgid ""
"Edorn is a rather squalid world. Many Soromid citizens live here but the "
"standard of life isn't very high. With a few exceptions, most residential "
"districts consist of featureless tenements housing lower class citizens who "
"work in equally featureless manufactories."
msgstr ""
"Edorn es un mundo bastante sórdido. En él viven muchos ciudadanos Soromida, "
"pero el nivel de vida no es muy alto. Salvo algunas excepciones, la mayoría "
"de los distritos residenciales están formados por viviendas sin rasgos "
"distintivos que albergan a ciudadanos de clase baja que trabajan en fábricas "
"igualmente sin rasgos distintivos."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is stark and unattractive with plain concrete walls and "
"pipes and cabling crisscrossing overhead. It's a place for getting things "
"done, not for kicking back. It's a pretty good model of what city life is "
"like on the rest of the planet, really."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es austero y poco atractivo, con paredes de "
"hormigón liso y tuberías y cables que se entrecruzan por encima. Es un lugar "
"para hacer cosas, no para relajarse. En realidad, es un modelo bastante "
"bueno de cómo es la vida en la ciudad en el resto del planeta."

msgid "Eenerim"
msgstr "Eenerim"

msgid ""
"With over 80% of its surface covered in water, Eenerim teeters on the brink "
"of classes M and O. The population here is spread out over many small or "
"medium sized islands scattered evenly across the globe. The Sirius "
"government has divided up the land between the three echelons, with each "
"island predominantly inhabited by either Shaira, Fyrra, or Serra."
msgstr ""
"Con más del 80% de su superficie cubierta de agua, Eenerim se tambalea al "
"borde de las clases M y O. La población está repartida en muchas islas "
"pequeñas o medianas repartidas uniformemente por el globo. El gobierno Sirio "
"ha repartido la tierra entre los tres escalones, y cada isla está habitada "
"predominantemente por Shaira, Fyrra o Serra."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar here is utterly unremarkable. That's not a bad thing "
"though because bars that distinguish themselves, more often than not, do so "
"in an unpleasant way."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es totalmente anodino. Pero eso no es malo, "
"porque los bares que se distinguen, la mayoría de las veces, lo hacen de "
"forma desagradable."

msgid "Efferey"
msgstr "Efferey"

msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Effetey's Efferey station is the southern most port of the Tunnel in which "
"allows refuelling, and serves to expand the Raven clans influence in the "
"southern systems. Despite being quite far away, nearly all the pirate "
"traffic from and to the Black Lotus clan has to come through the station, "
"making for lively exchanges and interactions."
msgstr ""
"La estación Efferey de Effetey es el puerto más meridional del Túnel en el "
"que se puede repostar, y sirve para ampliar la influencia del clan Cuervo en "
"los sistemas del sur. A pesar de estar bastante alejada, casi todo el "
"tráfico pirata desde y hacia el clan del Loto Negro tiene que pasar por la "
"estación, lo que propicia animados intercambios e interacciones."

msgid "Eiderdown I"
msgstr "Eiderdown I"

msgid "Eiderdown III"
msgstr "Eiderdown III"

msgid "Eiger"
msgstr "Eiger"

msgid ""
"The Salvador system has little of worth or use to the Empire but it still "
"has valuable minerals that it needs to mine. Hence a group of intrepid "
"miners and traders have made this place their base of operations. Minerals "
"are mined and refined here and traders buy it cheap and sell it dear in the "
"deeper reaches of the Empire."
msgstr ""
"El sistema Salvador tiene poco valor o utilidad para el Imperio, pero sigue "
"teniendo minerales valiosos que necesita extraer. De ahí que un grupo de "
"intrépidos mineros y comerciantes hayan hecho de este lugar su base de "
"operaciones. Los minerales se extraen y refinan aquí y los comerciantes los "
"compran baratos y los venden caros en las zonas más profundas del Imperio."

msgid ""
"This bar is home to several miners and their trade partners haggling and "
"making deals over beer and coffee. The bar is large but it is still filled "
"almost to the point of standing room only."
msgstr ""
"En este bar se reúnen varios mineros y sus socios comerciales que regatean y "
"hacen tratos mientras toman cerveza y café. El bar es grande, pero aún así "
"se llena casi hasta el punto de estar de pie."

msgid "Eiroik"
msgstr "Eiroik"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eiroik used to be a mining planet under Empire rule, known for its toxic "
"atmosphere and difficult, rough terrain formed over millennia of volcanic "
"activity. The few human colonies were eradicated by the Collective. The "
"generators have failed and the former spaceport lies in ruins. All that "
"remains is dust."
msgstr ""
"Eiroik era un antiguo planeta minero bajo el dominio del Imperio, conocido "
"por su atmósfera tóxica y su terreno difícil y abrupto producido por "
"milenios de actividad volcánica. Las pocas colonias humanas fueron "
"erradicadas por el Colectivo. Los generadores han fallado y el antiguo "
"puerto espacial está en ruinas. Todo lo que queda es polvo."

msgid "Eist Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Eist"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eist Shipyard is one of the primary ship construction facilities in Dvaered "
"space. Most of the Dvaered's heavy military vessels are produced here, "
"though production of the lighter ships is taken care of by shipyards beyond "
"Dvaer. Eist Shipyard also supplies civilian models to some individuals and "
"organizations."
msgstr ""
"Astillero Eist es una de las principales instalaciones de construcción naval "
"del espacio Dvaered. La mayoría de las naves militares pesadas Dvaered se "
"producen aquí, aunque de la producción de las naves más ligeras se encargan "
"astilleros de fuera de Dvaer. El Astillero Eist también suministra modelos "
"civiles a algunos individuos y organizaciones."

msgid "Ekkodu Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa Ekkodu"

msgid "Ekkodu Gamma"
msgstr "Gamma Ekkodu"

msgid ""
"Ekkodu Gamma is a harsh world, battered by constant sandstorms that grind "
"down most objects above the surface. It was originally designed as a forced "
"mining camp when controlled by the Empire, and when passed over to House "
"Dvaered, the tradition not only continued, but was expanded with criminals "
"and other undesirables. When the Incident happened, to minimize the effect "
"of refugees on their core worlds, incoming refugees were diverted in large "
"numbers here, significantly increasing the population. Although initial "
"attempts were made to keep the forced labourers and refugees separated, the "
"situation quickly got out of control as large slums were carved out below "
"the planet's surface for the increase in population. Life is hard on Ekkodu "
"Gamma, with low expectations of improvement, with most inhabitants working "
"in the mines throughout the planet."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Like almost all the constructions on the planet, the bar is located under "
"the surface, just below the spaceport. It is a dusty and dirty place, quite "
"crowded with people off their mining shifts. Drink covers are offered to try "
"to minimize the ratio of sand-to-drink, however, quite a few of the locals "
"have given up on such endeavour."
msgstr ""
"Como casi todas las construcciones del planeta, el bar está situado bajo la "
"superficie, justo debajo del puerto espacial. Es un lugar polvoriento y "
"sucio, bastante abarrotado de gente fuera de sus turnos mineros. Se ofrecen "
"cobertores de bebidas para intentar minimizar la proporción de arena por "
"bebida, aunque bastantes de los lugareños han renunciado a tal empeño."

msgid "Ekta I"
msgstr "Ekta I"

msgid "Ekta II"
msgstr "Ekta II"

msgid "Ekta IIa"
msgstr "Ekta IIa"

msgid "Ekta IIb"
msgstr "Ekta IIb"

msgid "Ekta Station"
msgstr "Estación Ekta"

msgid ""
"With the influx of Proteron civilians into the planet Thavma, it soon became "
"clear that a local shipyard would be useful. For that purpose, Ekta Station "
"was built. While not as extensive as Apik Shipyard in terms of offerings, "
"Ekta Station nonetheless manages to be a good source of ships and ship "
"maintenance for locals."
msgstr ""
"Con la afluencia de civiles de Proteron al planeta Thavma, pronto quedó "
"claro que sería útil contar con un astillero local. Para ello se construyó "
"la Estación Ekta. Aunque no es tan extensa como el Astillero Apik en "
"términos de oferta, la Estación Ekta se las arregla para ser una buena "
"fuente de naves y de mantenimiento de naves para los locales."

msgid ""
"Civilians, traders, and military personnel alike meet at this bar as they "
"wait for the repairs and modifications of their ships to be finished. It's a "
"small but cozy bar, with people constantly coming and going."
msgstr ""
"En este bar se reúnen civiles, comerciantes y militares por igual mientras "
"esperan a que terminen las reparaciones y modificaciones de sus naves. Es un "
"bar pequeño pero acogedor, con gente entrando y saliendo constantemente."

msgid "Elixir I"
msgstr "Elixir I"

msgid "Elpa"
msgstr "Elpa"

msgid ""
"Elpa was the first post-Incident Proteron colony which was able to sustain "
"human life without significant terraforming, designated for the production "
"of Proteron goods."
msgstr ""
"Elpa fue la primera colonia de Proteron posterior al incidente que pudo "
"sostener la vida humana sin una terraformación significativa, designada para "
"la producción de bienes de Proteron."

msgid ""
"The bar hums with activity from traders and workers alike despite the lack "
"of seating arrangements."
msgstr ""
"El bar bulle con la actividad de comerciantes y trabajadores por igual a "
"pesar de la falta de asientos."

msgid "Elza I"
msgstr "Elza I"

msgid "Elza Ia"
msgstr "Elza Ia"

msgid "Elza III"
msgstr "Elza III"

msgid "Em 1"
msgstr "Em 1"

msgid ""
"Em 1 is a completely unremarkable world. It's just one of those places that "
"contributes to the Empire's treasury and serves no other purpose of note.\n"
"While not having any exciting industry nor exports, a small agricultural "
"surplus allows Em 1 to export food to nearby systems."
msgstr ""
"Em 1 es un mundo completamente anodino. Es uno de esos lugares que "
"contribuyen a la tesorería del Imperio y no tienen ningún otro propósito "
"destacable. \n"
"Aunque no tiene ninguna industria ni exportaciones interesantes, un pequeño "
"excedente agrícola permite a Em 1 exportar alimentos a los sistemas cercanos."

msgid ""
"The bar exclusively plays local music, serves local food and drink and "
"provides mainly local news. The people here apparently seem to want to cling "
"on to what little personality the world still has, for fear that Em 1 has "
"really become just an extension of the Imperial economy."
msgstr ""
"El bar reproduce exclusivamente música local, sirve comida y bebida local y "
"ofrece principalmente noticias locales. Por lo visto, la gente de aquí "
"parece querer aferrarse a la poca personalidad que aún tiene el mundo, por "
"miedo a que Em 1 se haya convertido realmente en una mera extensión de la "
"economía imperial."

msgid "Em 2"
msgstr "Em 2"

msgid "Em 4"
msgstr "Em 4"

msgid "Em 5"
msgstr "Em 5"

msgid ""
"Deep within Empire space, Em 5 is a quiet world. Few would have ranked it "
"highly in the spectrum of galactic politics, yet after the Incident it "
"gained notability when it became a temporary refuge of the Emperor. In the "
"time since it's become a popular place for the aristocracy to meet."
msgstr ""
"En las profundidades del espacio del Imperio, Em 5 es un mundo tranquilo. "
"Pocos lo habrían situado en un lugar destacado en el espectro de la política "
"galáctica, pero tras el Incidente adquirió notoriedad cuando se convirtió en "
"un refugio temporal del Emperador. En el tiempo transcurrido desde entonces "
"se ha convertido en un lugar popular de reunión de la aristocracia."

msgid ""
"The Drunken Lobster has a plaque commemorating the time the Emperor spent on "
"Em 5 It seems unlikely he ever visited this bar, though, given its less than "
"refined patrons and threadbare furniture."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ember"
msgstr "Brasas"

msgid ""
"Ember, like its primary Forge, is a hot world. Its surface is molten in "
"places, its atmosphere will burn an unprotected human to a crisp in seconds, "
"and seismic activity makes the planet a death trap even in a protected "
"environment. Despite all this, the Sirii have established a sizeable "
"industry on Forge's moon. Located on a relatively stable plate, this complex "
"collects the rare materials produced by Ember's volcanic activity and turns "
"them into raw materials for ship building. The business is quite lucrative, "
"supplying a significant portion of all the materials for Sirius's ships."
msgstr ""
"Ascua, al igual que su principal Forja, es un mundo caliente. Su superficie "
"está fundida en algunos lugares, su atmósfera quemaría a un humano sin "
"protección en segundos, y la actividad sísmica convierte al planeta en una "
"trampa mortal incluso en un entorno protegido. A pesar de todo esto, los "
"Sirio han establecido una industria considerable en la luna de Forja. "
"Situado en una placa relativamente estable, este complejo recoge los "
"materiales raros producidos por la actividad volcánica de Ascua y los "
"convierte en materias primas para la construcción de naves. El negocio es "
"bastante lucrativo, ya que suministra una parte importante de todos los "
"materiales para las naves Sirio."

msgid ""
"Ember's spaceport bar is frequented by workers from the industrial complex, "
"most of them from the Shaira echelon. They have many tales to tell of the "
"dangers of their job and the brutal nature of Ember's weather. None of them "
"seem to be discontent with their lives though."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Ascua es frecuentado por trabajadores del "
"complejo industrial, la mayoría de ellos del escalafón Shaira. Tienen muchas "
"historias que contar sobre los peligros de su trabajo y la naturaleza brutal "
"del clima de Ascua. Sin embargo, ninguno parece estar descontento con su "
"vida."

msgid "Emperor's Fist"
msgstr "Puño del Emperador"

msgid ""
"Emperor's Fist is intended to be the new homeworld of the Emperor himself "
"since the last one was destroyed in the Incident. It's a massive project "
"that is attempting to completely transform a C-class world into one which is "
"suitable for the highest ranks of the Empire's aristocracy. Currently it "
"possesses few amenities beyond the Starport."
msgstr ""
"El Puño del Emperador está destinado a ser el nuevo mundo natal del propio "
"Emperador, ya que el último fue destruido en el Incidente. Es un proyecto "
"masivo que intenta transformar completamente un mundo de clase C en uno apto "
"para los rangos más altos de la aristocracia del Imperio. Actualmente posee "
"pocas comodidades más allá del puerto estelar."

msgid ""
"The bar is designed for those working on the terraforming project. Small "
"compared to many planetary bars, it nonetheless has a steady flow of "
"patrons, largely consisting of the off-duty aforementioned terraforming "
"workers."
msgstr ""
"El bar está pensado para los que trabajan en el proyecto de terraformación. "
"Es pequeño en comparación con muchos bares planetarios, pero tiene un flujo "
"constante de clientes, en gran parte formado por los mencionados "
"trabajadores de la terraformación fuera de servicio."

msgid "Emperor's Wrath"
msgstr "La Ira del Emperador"

msgid "#pEmpire Homeworld#0"
msgstr "#pMundo Hogar Imperio#0"

msgid ""
"The Emperor's Wrath is where the Emperor and his Council reside. It is a "
"massive space ship offering enough space for a permanent military "
"installation, the Emperor's personal city and the administration of the "
"entire Empire. In addition the Wrath serves as a symbol of the Emperor's "
"power. The ship is essentially functional, capable of flight under its own "
"power and even hyperspace jumps but it has not moved from its current orbit "
"around Emperor's Fist since it was first commissioned. The Wrath is closed "
"to the public, conducting its official business via the nearby station of "
"Polaris Prime. Very few people have the privilege to step aboard the ship at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"La Ira del Emperador es el lugar donde residen el Emperador y su Consejo. Es "
"una enorme nave espacial que ofrece espacio suficiente para una instalación "
"militar permanente, la ciudad personal del Emperador y la administración de "
"todo el Imperio. Además, la Ira sirve como símbolo del poder del Emperador. "
"La nave es esencialmente funcional, capaz de volar por sus propios medios e "
"incluso de realizar saltos al hiperespacio, pero no se ha movido de su "
"órbita actual alrededor del Puño del Emperador desde que fue encargada por "
"primera vez. La Ira está cerrada al público, llevando a cabo sus asuntos "
"oficiales a través de la cercana estación de Polaris Prime. Muy pocas "
"personas tienen el privilegio de subir a bordo de la nave."

msgid "Eneguoz II"
msgstr "Eneguoz II"

msgid "Erebus Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Erebus"

msgid ""
"Erebus Enclave was established during the Dvaered revolts to enforce their "
"military presence in the area and prevent the revolts from reaching further "
"into Empire space.\n"
"Although House Dvaered has been formally recognized by the Empire and poses "
"no imminent danger towards its space, Erebus Enclave remains in use as an "
"active military installation to monitor Dvaered movements. But after the "
"Incident, it has also served a secondary function to keep taps the situation "
"on Majesteka II, so that it does not devolve into something more dangerous."
msgstr ""
"El Enclave Erebus se estableció durante las revueltas Dvaered para reforzar "
"su presencia militar en la zona y evitar que las revueltas llegaran más "
"lejos al espacio del Imperio.\n"
"Aunque la Casa Dvaered ha sido reconocida formalmente por el Imperio y no "
"supone ningún peligro inminente hacia su espacio, el Enclave Erebus sigue en "
"uso como instalación militar activa para vigilar los movimientos de los "
"Dvaered. Pero tras el Incidente, también ha cumplido una función secundaria "
"para vigilar la situación en Majesteka II, para que no devenga en algo más "
"peligroso."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar has not deviated one bit from the standard issue set-up "
"for Imperial stations. A diligent staff keeps it in tip-top shape. While it "
"is enjoyable, it fails to make an impression on you and you will probably "
"forget immediately upon leaving the station."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial no se ha desviado ni un ápice de la configuración "
"estándar de las estaciones imperiales. Un personal diligente lo mantiene en "
"perfecto estado. Aunque es agradable, no llega a impresionarte y "
"probablemente lo olvides nada más salir de la estación."

msgid "Eridani II"
msgstr "Eridani II"

msgid "Eridani III"
msgstr "Eridani III"

msgid "Eryla"
msgstr "Eryla"

msgid "Esker I"
msgstr "Esker I"

msgid "Esker II"
msgstr "Esker II"

msgid "Esker IV"
msgstr "Esker IV"

msgid "Eta Vadornia"
msgstr "Eta Vadornia"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A small planet on the outsides of the inner asteroid ring of Vadornia, Eta "
"Vadornia is known for being composed mainly of water. There is a small core "
"of rocks surrounded by hundreds of kilometres of ice, before being covered "
"by water. The population lives in dense urban floating cities that drift "
"endlessly around the surface. Every so often two cities get close to "
"collision, requiring complex reorienting procedures, however, other than "
"those rare events, life on Eta Vadornia is calm and relaxing, with many "
"Dvaereds opting to retire to a life at sea.\n"
"While not having important industries or agriculture, Eta Vadornia is mainly "
"self-sufficient. Most of the lifeforms consist of small animals and plants "
"that float along the currents. However, the exception is the Vadornia "
"Jellywhale which can grow up to hundreds of metres. These jellywhales "
"endlessly roam the currents and, although not very tasteful, are considered "
"a local delicacy."
msgstr ""
"Eta Vadornia, un pequeño planeta situado en las afueras del anillo interior "
"de asteroides de Vadornia, es conocido por estar compuesto principalmente de "
"agua. Hay un pequeño núcleo de rocas rodeado por cientos de kilómetros de "
"hielo, antes de quedar cubierto por el agua. La población vive en densas "
"ciudades urbanas flotantes que se desplazan sin cesar por la superficie. De "
"vez en cuando, dos ciudades están a punto de colisionar, lo que requiere "
"complejos procedimientos de reorientación; sin embargo, aparte de esos raros "
"sucesos, la vida en Eta Vadornia es tranquila y relajante, y muchos Dvaereds "
"optan por retirarse a una vida en el mar.\n"
"Eta Vadornia no tiene industrias ni agricultura importantes, por lo que es "
"autosuficiente. La mayoría de las formas de vida consisten en pequeños "
"animales y plantas que flotan a lo largo de las corrientes. Sin embargo, la "
"excepción es la Medusa de Vadornia, que puede crecer hasta cientos de "
"metros. Estas medusas vagan sin cesar por las corrientes y, aunque no son "
"muy sabrosas, se consideran un manjar local."

msgid ""
"The bar is located under sea level with view the abyssal depths of the sea. "
"From the windows you can see lots of small dust-like animals and plants "
"floating around. If you get very lucky, you can get to see a large jelly "
"whale passing by. They have been known to try to engulf and devour the bar "
"leading to quite a impressive, yet harmless, spectacle. Most of the drinks "
"are local, with premium jellywhale extracts-based beverages."
msgstr ""
"El bar está situado bajo el nivel del mar, con vistas a las profundidades "
"abisales del mar. Desde las ventanas se pueden ver montones de pequeños "
"animales y plantas parecidos al polvo que flotan alrededor. Si tienes mucha "
"suerte, puedes llegar a ver pasar una gran ballena gelatinosa. Se sabe que "
"intentan engullir y devorar el bar, lo que provoca un espectáculo "
"impresionante, aunque inofensivo. La mayoría de las bebidas son locales, con "
"extractos de medusas de primera calidad."

msgid "Euler I"
msgstr "Euler I"

msgid "Euler Ia"
msgstr "Euler Ia"

msgid "Euler II"
msgstr "Euler II"

msgid "Euler III"
msgstr "Euler III"

msgid "Euler IIIa"
msgstr "Euler IIIa"

msgid "Euler IV"
msgstr "Euler IV"

msgid "Europea"
msgstr "Europa"

msgid ""
"Europea is almost completely covered in water, which was considered "
"undesirable in the early days of the Second Growth. However, it was soon "
"discovered that Europea's biosphere contained many organisms that were "
"useful in the production of high-grade medicine and an exception was made. "
"This means that Europea is one of the earliest O-class planets that were "
"ever colonised. Today the world still thrives on its medical exports, though "
"advances in pharmaceutical technology since the days of the Second Growth "
"have rendered a considerable portion of it obsolete."
msgstr ""
"Europa está casi completamente cubierta de agua, lo que se consideró "
"indeseable en los primeros días del Segundo Crecimiento. Sin embargo, pronto "
"se descubrió que la biosfera de Europa contenía muchos organismos útiles "
"para la producción de medicamentos de alto grado y se hizo una excepción. "
"Esto significa que Europa es uno de los primeros planetas de clase O que "
"fueron colonizados. En la actualidad, el mundo sigue prosperando gracias a "
"sus exportaciones médicas, aunque los avances en la tecnología farmacéutica "
"desde los días del Segundo Crecimiento han dejado obsoleta una parte "
"considerable de ellas."

msgid ""
"Perhaps uniquely in the galaxy, both the spaceport and its associated "
"facilities are afloat without tethers. This means that the location of the "
"spaceport itself changes over time as the platform is carried on the major "
"currents that span the face of the planet."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez sea el único en la galaxia que tanto el puerto espacial como sus "
"instalaciones asociadas están a flote sin ataduras. Esto significa que la "
"ubicación del propio puerto espacial cambia con el tiempo, ya que la "
"plataforma es arrastrada por las principales corrientes que atraviesan la "
"faz del planeta."

msgid "Evergreen"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A densely lush tropical word with extremely large quantities of micro-"
"organisms in the air that pretty much require hazard suits to be outside. "
"Most of the locals make use of not complete space suits, but very minimal "
"protection that seems to be not much more than some special cloth with small "
"eye cover lenses. However, they also seem to be very used to living in the "
"constant grime and highly bioactive environment, which probably takes quite "
"a while to adapt to. Due to the precautions required outside, most of the "
"buildings are connected to each other with tubes, making for a "
"claustrophobic space station-like environment.\n"
"\n"
"Despite having so much life, the planet is not very productive in human-"
"edible goods and doesn't make much more food than what is needed to sustain "
"its current population. Nonetheless, the dense atmosphere and the lack of "
"significant military targets on the surface attracts many O'rez citizens who "
"try to make life on Evergreen in an attempt to ignore the war raging on "
"around them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is very compact, embedded directly under the spaceport "
"like on many space stations. The first thing that strikes your attention is "
"the extremely high humidity, likely necessary to accommodate the bio-active "
"brews on sale in the bar. It seems like they have perfected cultivating the "
"local micro-organisms to make all sorts of foods and drinks. You try a few, "
"and are not entirely sure what to make of them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Excelcior"
msgstr "Excelcior"

msgid ""
"The seat of the infamously rancorous Procyon Enclave of House Za'lek, "
"Excelcior is one of House Za'lek's richest and most productive worlds and is "
"what gives Procyon its outsized influence on much of House Za'lek.\n"
"Many scientific organizations and universities operate out of this planet "
"and its Earth-like environment. Helped along by Za'lek terraforming, "
"Excelcior is also a popular planet for retirees and vacationers."
msgstr ""
"Excelcior, sede del rencoroso Enclave Procyon de la Casa Za'lek, es uno de "
"los mundos más ricos y productivos de la Casa Za'lek y es lo que confiere a "
"Procyon su enorme influencia en mayor parte de la Casa Za'lek.\n"
"Muchas organizaciones científicas y universidades operan fuera de este "
"planeta y su entorno similar a la Tierra. Gracias a la terraformación "
"Za'lek, Excelcior es también un planeta popular entre jubilados y turistas."

msgid ""
"This bar is full of shouting and arguments, with the occasional fist-fight, "
"all based on matters that most laymen find difficult to understand, let "
"alone pick a side on. There is a large quantity of food and drink spilled on "
"the floors as a result of this and the harried staff seem relieved when you "
"make sure to avoid provoking anyone or making eye contact."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está lleno de gritos y discusiones, con alguna que otra pelea a "
"puñetazos, todo ello basado en asuntos que a la mayoría de los profanos les "
"resulta difícil de entender, y mucho menos de elegir un bando. Hay una gran "
"cantidad de comida y bebida derramada en el suelo como resultado de esto y "
"el acosado personal parece aliviado cuando te aseguras de no provocar a "
"nadie ni hacer contacto visual."

msgid "Eye of Night I"
msgstr "Ojo de la Noche I"

msgid "Eye of Night II"
msgstr "Ojo de la Noche II"

msgid "Eye of Night III"
msgstr "Ojo de la Noche III"

msgid "Eye of Night Station"
msgstr "Estación Ojo de la Noche"

msgid ""
"An eerily quiet station. Although it seems to be fully functional, it's "
"almost as like everyone onboard was mysteriously vanished an instant before "
"you arrived. Why is there nobody here?"
msgstr ""
"Una estación inquietantemente silenciosa. Aunque parece completamente "
"funcional, es casi como si todo el mundo a bordo hubiera desaparecido "
"misteriosamente un instante antes de tu llegada. ¿Por qué no hay nadie aquí?"

msgid "Facett Nest"
msgstr "Nido Facett"

msgid ""
"Facett Nest is little more than a local police station. It was created as a "
"precaution against the pirate threat coming from Khaas, but the Soromid know "
"that no single station could withstand a coordinated attack. Facett is "
"mostly a visible sign of Soromid presence in Hatter. It puts the local "
"population at ease. The real security has to come from Hartwell Station in "
"the neighbouring system of Father's Pride."
msgstr ""
"El Nido Facett es poco más que una estación de policía local. Se creó como "
"precaución ante la amenaza pirata procedente de Khaas, pero Soromida sabe "
"que ninguna estación podría resistir un ataque coordinado. Facett es sobre "
"todo una señal visible de la presencia Soromida en Hatter. Hace que la "
"población local se sienta tranquila. La verdadera seguridad tiene que venir "
"de la estación Hartwell, en el sistema vecino de Orgullo de Padre."

msgid ""
"The bar is where the local security employees go when they're on standby. "
"They seldom have to wait for a long time before their assistance is required."
msgstr ""
"El bar es el lugar al que acuden los empleados de seguridad locales cuando "
"están de guardia. Rara vez tienen que esperar mucho tiempo antes de que se "
"requiera su asistencia."

msgid "Fae"
msgstr "Fae"

msgid "Fairfax Nest"
msgstr "Nido Fairfax"

msgid ""
"This station is a minor Soromid military outpost. The ships here mainly "
"patrol the surrounding systems and perform routine cargo inspections. "
"Otherwise, the station serves mainly as a refuel and resupply base for "
"larger Soromid fleets that move through this area of space."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación es un puesto militar menor de Soromida. Las naves que se "
"encuentran aquí patrullan principalmente los sistemas circundantes y "
"realizan inspecciones de carga rutinarias. Por lo demás, la estación sirve "
"principalmente como base de reabastecimiento para las flotas Soromida más "
"grandes que se desplazan por esta zona del espacio."

msgid "Falas"
msgstr "Falas"

msgid ""
"Falas is a sparsely populated garrison planet with little to no resources of "
"any economic use. The existence of the garrison, however, owes itself to the "
"fact that it was cheaper to build an outpost on this barren rock than to "
"build a whole new space station. But being located in a relatively safe area "
"of Empire space, there's not much to do for those assigned here. Instead, "
"most of the problems are caused by soldiers bored out of their minds."
msgstr ""
"Falas es un planeta guarnición escasamente poblado y sin apenas recursos de "
"utilidad económica. La existencia de la guarnición, sin embargo, se debe al "
"hecho de que era más barato construir un puesto de avanzada en esta roca "
"estéril que construir toda una nueva estación espacial. Pero al estar "
"situada en una zona relativamente segura del espacio del Imperio, no hay "
"mucho que hacer para los asignados aquí. En cambio, la mayoría de los "
"problemas son causados por soldados aburridos hasta la saciedad."

msgid ""
"This fairly spartan bar is host to several off-duty personnel. There aren't "
"many of them here and the bar is mostly empty."
msgstr ""
"Este bar bastante espartano acoge a varios miembros del personal fuera de "
"servicio. No hay muchos aquí y el bar está casi vacío."

msgid "Father's Pride I"
msgstr "Orgullo de Padre I"

msgid "Father's Pride II"
msgstr "Orgullo de Padre II"

msgid "Father's Pride III"
msgstr "Orgullo de Padre III"

msgid "Faust III"
msgstr "Fausto III"

msgid "Faust VI"
msgstr "Fausto VI"

msgid "FD-24"
msgstr "FD-24"

msgid ""
"The Thurion placed this fuel supply depot to allow ships heading between "
"their shipyards in the nebula and their core systems to fill up their fuel "
"tanks for the long journey ahead."
msgstr ""
"Los Turion colocaron este depósito de suministro de combustible para que las "
"naves que se dirigen entre sus astilleros en la nebulosa y sus sistemas "
"principales puedan llenar sus depósitos de combustible para el largo viaje "
"que les espera."

msgid "Ferrungir"
msgstr "Ferrungir"

msgid ""
"Ferrungir is a fairly low-profile industrial world. Raw materials are being "
"mined here and then either shipped offworld immediately or processed into "
"low-level components before heading the same way. There is not much else of "
"value on this planet. The people who live here tend to be Shaira echelon who "
"haven't been able to find a job anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"Ferrungir es un mundo industrial de perfil bastante bajo. Las materias "
"primas se extraen aquí y se envían inmediatamente fuera del mundo o se "
"procesan en componentes de bajo nivel antes de seguir el mismo camino. No "
"hay mucho más de valor en este planeta. La gente que vive aquí tiende a ser "
"el escalón de Shaira que no ha podido encontrar un trabajo en ningún otro "
"lugar."

msgid ""
"The bar on Ferrungir is simple and grim. It's little more than a storage "
"unit converted into a makeshift drinking establishment. It's to be expected "
"from a world as run down as this one."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Ferrungir es sencillo y lúgubre. Es poco más que un almacén "
"convertido en un improvisado local de copas. Es de esperar en un mundo tan "
"deteriorado como éste."

msgid "Feye I"
msgstr "Feye I"

msgid "Feye IV"
msgstr "Feye IV"

msgid "Fidelis III"
msgstr "Fidelis III"

msgid "Fidelis IV"
msgstr "Fidelis IV"

msgid "Fidelis Mining Station"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An old station, originally designed to exploit the asteroids in Fidelis, it "
"was quickly retired and abandoned during the Dvaered Revolts as the company "
"in charge of it dissolved. Although stability was partially compromised by "
"asteroid impact, it quickly became a home to scavengers, scoundrels, "
"ruffians, and the likes, who now maintain the facilities in a fairly "
"surprising spartan style."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Most of the locals tend to spend their free time lounging around the Smash, "
"which, as the name may indicate, is a bar operating in what is clearly the "
"result of a large asteroid impact. The bar has a dominantly spherical shape, "
"with the servers anchored in the centre. The house speciality is the "
"Asteroid Smasher, which is served in crude carved out asteroid mugs, and is "
"served strong enough so you don't notice the rocky sediment that remains in "
"the mug, and after a few drinks, you probably won't even remember it in the "
"case you had noticed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Finn"
msgstr "Finn"

msgid ""
"Finn is a prison rock. The surface is completely uninhabitable but the "
"natural caverns underground make for a perfect prison complex. The Empire "
"dumps its worst criminals here, leaving them to fend for themselves, many of "
"the convicts from the Jade Court end up here too."
msgstr ""
"Finn es una roca prisión. La superficie es completamente inhabitable, pero "
"las cavernas naturales del subsuelo constituyen un complejo penitenciario "
"perfecto. El Imperio arroja aquí a sus peores criminales, dejándolos a su "
"suerte, muchos de los convictos de la Corte de Jade acaban aquí también."

msgid ""
"The spaceport is separated from the main prison complex by a long, twisting "
"tube that must be traversed on foot. If there is ever a prison break the "
"tube can be blown apart by security guns mounted on the outer spaceport "
"structure, instantly spacing any inmates inside."
msgstr ""
"El puerto espacial está separado del complejo penitenciario principal por un "
"tubo largo y retorcido que debe atravesarse a pie. Si alguna vez se produce "
"una fuga de la prisión, el tubo puede ser volado por las armas de seguridad "
"montadas en la estructura exterior del puerto espacial, separando "
"instantáneamente a los reclusos que estén dentro."

msgid "Flach"
msgstr "Flach"

msgid ""
"Quite a lot of Soromid live on Flach. Where normal humans would have built a "
"mining colony at best, the Soromid found a planet good enough to build "
"extensive megacities and suburban industries."
msgstr ""
"En Flach viven bastantes Soromida. Donde los humanos normales habrían "
"construido una colonia minera en el mejor de los casos, los Soromida "
"encontraron un planeta lo suficientemente bueno como para construir extensas "
"megaciudades e industrias suburbanas."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is one of the few places on the planet that is "
"environmentally conditioned to suit normal humans. Any non-Soromid wishing "
"to visit the actual population centres will need to wear protective clothing "
"… or suffer the consequences."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es uno de los pocos lugares del planeta que está "
"acondicionado ambientalmente para adaptarse a los humanos normales. "
"Cualquier persona que no sea Soromida y desee visitar los centros de "
"población reales tendrá que llevar ropa protectora... o sufrir las "
"consecuencias."

msgid "Folevo"
msgstr "Folevo"

msgid "Forbes Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Forbes"

msgid ""
"Forbes Monastery is the biggest and best equipped military station in this "
"area of Sirius space. It provides security to systems up to three jumps away "
"and serves as the local headquarters of the Sirian fleets. Though the Kiwi "
"is otherwise empty, meaning the station relies on surrounding systems for "
"support, the Sirian authorities chose to build it here for strategic reasons."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Forbes es la estación militar más grande y mejor equipada de "
"esta zona del espacio Sirio. Proporciona seguridad a sistemas de hasta tres "
"saltos de distancia y sirve de cuartel general local de las flotas Sirio. "
"Aunque por lo demás está vacía, lo que significa que la estación depende de "
"los sistemas circundantes para su apoyo, las autoridades Sirio eligieron "
"construirla aquí por razones estratégicas."

msgid ""
"This is more a waiting room than a bar. It is barely used at all as visitors "
"to Forbes Monastery are usually on pressing business and tend to have the "
"clearance to proceed deeper into the complex."
msgstr ""
"Esta es más una sala de espera que un bar. Apenas se utiliza, ya que los "
"visitantes del Monasterio Forbes suelen tener asuntos urgentes y suelen "
"tener autorización para adentrarse en el complejo."

msgid "Forge"
msgstr "Forja"

msgid "Fort Allan"
msgstr "Fuerte Allan"

msgid ""
"Fort Allan was set up by a patrol sent out to explore the southern reaches "
"of space. With the Incident and the regression of Imperial power, the "
"soldiers were left behind to fend for themselves and set up the station from "
"scrap and parts of their ships. It is now barely maintained by a small "
"contingent of Dvaered soldiers and engineers for the use of traders."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Allan fue establecida por una patrulla enviada a explorar los "
"confines meridionales del espacio. Con el Incidente y la regresión del poder "
"imperial, los soldados fueron abandonados a su suerte y levantaron la "
"estación con chatarra y partes de sus naves. Ahora apenas la mantiene un "
"pequeño contingente de soldados e ingenieros Dvaered para que sea utilizada "
"por los comerciantes."

msgid ""
"Fort Allan does not have the resources for much but the bar looks decent "
"enough, with clean facilities, decent food and strong drink. For its patrons "
"it provides a small respite from the harsh galaxy."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Allan no tiene recursos para mucho, pero el bar parece bastante "
"decente, con instalaciones limpias, comida decente y bebidas fuertes. Para "
"sus clientes supone un alivio de la dura galaxia."

msgid "Fort Dumas"
msgstr "Fuerte Dumas"

msgid ""
"Fort Dumas is a staging area for a planned expansion into the southern "
"reaches of the galaxy where there is no unified force and pirates roam "
"unfettered. The station is largely ignored at the time being, however, more "
"and more soldiers are being transferred here."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Dumas es una zona de parada para una expansión planeada en los "
"confines del sur de la galaxia, donde no hay una fuerza unificada y los "
"piratas vagan sin trabas. Por el momento, la estación se ignora en gran "
"medida, pero cada vez se trasladan más soldados a ella."

msgid ""
"The bar is typical of a Dvaered-style military canteen, i.e. barely "
"habitable. The station's age does it no favours either."
msgstr ""
"El bar es el típico comedor militar de estilo Dvaered, es decir, apenas "
"habitable. La edad de la estación tampoco le favorece."

msgid "Fort Fernando"
msgstr "Fuerte Fernando"

msgid ""
"Officially Fort Fernando is a local security nexus, meant to keep the local "
"systems safe from pirates and the FLF, but it is rather heavily equipped for "
"simply maintaining law and order. Some people believe that the Dvaered are "
"gradually reinforcing Ogat, preparing for military conflict with the Empire. "
"Nothing currently suggests that the Dvaered are on the warpath but Fort "
"Fernando might be a harbinger of things to come."
msgstr ""
"Oficialmente, el Fuerte Fernando es un nexo de seguridad local, destinado a "
"mantener los sistemas locales a salvo de los piratas y el FLF, pero está "
"bastante equipada para simplemente mantener la ley y el orden. Algunos creen "
"que los Dvaered están reforzando gradualmente Ogat, preparándose para un "
"conflicto militar con el Imperio. Nada sugiere actualmente que los Dvaered "
"estén en pie de guerra, pero el Fuerte Fernando podría ser un presagio de lo "
"que está por venir."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is mainly frequented by Dvaered military pilots, as can be "
"expected from a bar on a military base. The drinks served here are mostly "
"free of mind-altering substances, a serious detractor for the ordinary "
"visitor but then Fort Fernando isn't out to make itself popular."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial es frecuentado principalmente por pilotos "
"militares Dvaered, como cabe esperar de un bar en una base militar. La "
"mayoría de las bebidas que se sirven aquí están libres de sustancias que "
"alteran la mente, un serio detractor para el visitante ordinario, pero "
"entonces el Fuerte Fernando no está destinada a ser popular."

msgid "Fort Maus"
msgstr "Fuerte Maus"

msgid ""
"Fort Maus controls the jump route that runs between Verex and Gruz. This "
"route bypasses Dvaer entirely, which makes it popular with smugglers to and "
"from Sirius space. Fort Maus intends to make sure that security in this area "
"is as tight as everywhere else."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Maus controla la ruta de salto que discurre entre Verex y Gruz. "
"Esta ruta evita por completo Dvaer, lo que la hace popular entre los "
"contrabandistas que van y vienen del espacio Sirio. El Fuerte Maus tiene la "
"intención de asegurarse de que la seguridad en esta zona es tan estricta "
"como en todas partes."

msgid "Fort Myuirr"
msgstr "El Fuerte Myuirr"

msgid ""
"The Dvaered war machine relies a lot on flinging chunks of matter at enemy "
"ships, and those chunks of matter have to come from somewhere. Fort Myuirr "
"is one of the most productive ammunition production facilities in Dvaered "
"space. It produces ordnance for a variety of ballistic and missile weaponry. "
"The portion of its produce that isn't claimed by Dvaered High Command in tax "
"is sold to Warlords, retailers and civilians for profit."
msgstr ""
"La máquina de guerra Dvaered se basa en gran medida en el lanzamiento de "
"trozos de materia a las naves enemigas, y esos trozos de materia tienen que "
"venir de alguna parte. El Fuerte Myuirr es una de las instalaciones de "
"producción de munición más productivas del espacio Dvaered. Produce munición "
"para una variedad de armamento balístico y de misiles. La parte de su "
"producción que no es reclamada por el Alto Mando Dvaered en concepto de "
"impuestos se vende a Señores de la Guerra, minoristas y civiles para obtener "
"beneficios."

msgid ""
"Hastily constructed by forced labour in the wake of the Incident, Fort "
"Raelid serves as a control point and listening post for Dvaered forces in "
"the area. However, after its construction, Warlords quickly lost interest in "
"the Nebula which was left to the Empire. Other than routine patrols, nothing "
"often happens in this outpost."
msgstr ""
"Construido apresuradamente mediante trabajos forzados tras el Incidente, el "
"Fuerte Raelid sirve como punto de control y puesto de escucha para las "
"fuerzas Dvaered de la zona. Sin embargo, tras su construcción, los Señores "
"de la Guerra perdieron rápidamente el interés por la Nebulosa, que quedó en "
"manos del Imperio. Aparte de las patrullas rutinarias, no suele ocurrir nada "
"en este puesto avanzado."

msgid ""
"The Raelid bar fits the Dvaered stereotype well. It's one of the more "
"prominent areas as soon as you exit the docking area, and, as many Dvaered "
"bars seem to be, it's much larger than it functionally needs to be. Far from "
"the spotless bars of Polaris Prime, it's encrusted with dirt and you can "
"sense the presence of other patrons by their smell alone. Truly, a Dvaered "
"bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Raelid se ajusta bien al estereotipo Dvaered. Es una de las zonas "
"más destacadas nada más salir de la zona de atraque y, como muchos bares "
"Dvaered, es mucho más grande de lo que necesita funcionalmente. Lejos de los "
"bares inmaculados de Polaris Prime, está incrustado de suciedad y se puede "
"percibir la presencia de otros clientes sólo por su olor. Verdaderamente, un "
"bar Dvaered."

msgid ""
"Fort Raglan is the Dvaereds' single most visible presence in Frontier space. "
"Officially, the station is a mixture of a trade station and an embassy for "
"Dvaered citizens, but it is public knowledge that the Dvaered use the base "
"as a stronghold in their fight against the FLF, and many Frontier "
"inhabitants fear that in time it will also be the staging point for the "
"Dvaered invasion of the Frontier."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Raglan es la presencia más visible de los Dvaered en el espacio "
"Frontera. Oficialmente, la estación es una mezcla de estación comercial y "
"embajada para los ciudadanos Dvaered, pero es de dominio público que los "
"Dvaered utilizan la base como baluarte en su lucha contra el FLF, y muchos "
"habitantes de la Frontera temen que con el tiempo sea también el punto de "
"partida para la invasión Dvaered de Frontera."

msgid ""
"The Raglan bar is a utilitarian affair, quite small and nearly empty. Though "
"Dvaereds do like to drink, all outpost personnel are under standing orders "
"to remain on alert, given the threat of FLF attack."
msgstr ""
"El bar Raglan es un funcional, bastante pequeño y casi vacío. Aunque a los "
"Dvaereds les gusta beber, todo el personal del puesto de avanzada tiene "
"órdenes permanentes de permanecer en alerta, dada la amenaza de ataque del "
"FLF."

msgid "Fort Sarrii"
msgstr "El Fuerte Sarril"

msgid ""
"Fort Sarrii serves as the garrison point for the nearby planet of Wayline. "
"The Dvaered garrison don't want to have to be on the planet at all, so they "
"had this station built."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Sarrii sirve como punto de guarnición para el planeta cercano de "
"Wayline. La guarnición Dvaered no quiere tener que estar en el planeta en lo "
"más mínimo, así que mandaron construir esta estación."

msgid "Fort Secundus"
msgstr "Fuerte Secundus"

msgid ""
"This old, rusty station has been mostly abandoned, but a handful of "
"dedicated individuals continue to keep it running. It has been rumoured that "
"the maintainers of the station have connections to pirates, but no such "
"connection has been proven and the local Dvaered officials don't seem to "
"care anyway."
msgstr ""
"Esta vieja y oxidada estación ha sido abandonada en su mayor parte, pero un "
"puñado de personas dedicadas sigue manteniéndola en funcionamiento. Se ha "
"rumoreado que los encargados del mantenimiento de la estación tienen "
"conexiones con los piratas, pero no se ha demostrado tal conexión y, de "
"todos modos, a los funcionarios locales Dvaered no parece importarles."

msgid "Fort Shariff"
msgstr "Fuerte Shariff"

msgid ""
"For being a Dvaered military base, Fort Shariff has it tough. This close to "
"Frontier space, the station is a popular target for FLF raids, and despite "
"the many extra security measures that have been implemented in the past "
"cycles, the losses continue to pile up."
msgstr ""
"Para ser una base militar Dvaered, el Fuerte Shariff lo tiene difícil. Al "
"estar tan cerca del espacio Frontera, la estación es un objetivo popular "
"para las incursiones de la FLF y, a pesar de las numerosas medidas de "
"seguridad adicionales que se han aplicado en los últimos ciclos, las "
"pérdidas siguen acumulándose."

msgid "Fort Tarsus"
msgstr "Fuerte Tarsus"

msgid ""
"Fort Tarsus is a Dvaered military base. It was constructed shortly after the "
"Incident, when piracy and the FLF began to gain in power. Fort Tarsus serves "
"as one of the key fortifications in the defence of the Dvaered core systems."
msgstr ""
"El Fuerte Tarsus es una base militar Dvaered. Fue construida poco después "
"del Incidente, cuando la piratería y el FLF comenzaron a ganar poder. El "
"Fuerte Tarsus es una de las fortificaciones clave en la defensa de los "
"sistemas principales Dvaered."

msgid "Fortitude I"
msgstr "Fortaleza I"

msgid "Fortitude II"
msgstr "Fortaleza II"

msgid "Fortitude III"
msgstr "Fortaleza III"

msgid ""
"With an icy surface several dozen kilometres deep, Fortitude III provides "
"all the water necessary to run Omega Enclave. Originally planned to house "
"the military presence in the system, the general extreme cold combined with "
"sudden flash floods due to the eccentric orbit forced the Imperial "
"Bureaucrats to scrap those plans. Your sensors do, however, seem to pick up "
"some installations buried deep beneath the surface, but they do not seem "
"very accessible at the current time."
msgstr ""

msgid "Foundation Station"
msgstr "Estación Fundación"

msgid ""
"Foundation Station is the northern refuel point of the Qorel Tunnel, and "
"symbolizes the strength of the ties between the Wild Ones Clan and Raven "
"Clan.\n"
"As with all pirate outposts, it also serves as a trading post in which loot "
"is exchanged, and offers some simple outfitting."
msgstr ""
"La Estación de la Fundación es el punto de reabastecimiento septentrional "
"del Túnel de Qorel, y simboliza la fuerza de los lazos entre el Clan de los "
"Salvajes y el Clan del Cuervo.\n"
"Como todos los puestos avanzados piratas, también sirve como puesto "
"comercial en el que se intercambia botín, y ofrece algunos equipamientos "
"sencillos."

msgid "Freshwater Station"
msgstr "Estación Aguadulce"

msgid ""
"After the success of the Empire's experimental INNS-1, the Sirii saw "
"potential for off-world crop growing in the Anarbalis system. Aptly named, "
"Freshwater Station produces carefully engineered bumper crops for "
"consumption by Sirian worlds in the immediate vicinity."
msgstr ""
"Tras el éxito del INNS-1 experimental del Imperio, los Sirio vieron el "
"potencial del cultivo fuera del mundo en el sistema Anarbalis. "
"Acertadamente, la Estación de Agua Dulce produce cosechas abundantes "
"cuidadosamente diseñadas para el consumo de los mundos Sirio de las "
"inmediaciones."

msgid ""
"The bar is dominated by the likeness of the Touched who officially blessed "
"the station. The local Sirian workers seem to take particular pride in the "
"visit since the Touched usually operate only in population centres."
msgstr ""
"El bar está dominado por la imagen de los Tocados que han bendecido "
"oficialmente la estación. Los trabajadores locales Sirio parecen sentirse "
"especialmente orgullosos de la visita, ya que los Tocados suelen actuar sólo "
"en los centros de población."

msgid "Fried I"
msgstr "Frito I"

msgid "Fried Ia"
msgstr "Frito Ia"

msgid "Fried II"
msgstr "Frito II"

msgid "Fried III"
msgstr "Frito III"

msgid "Fried IIIa"
msgstr "Frito IIIa"

msgid ""
"Although classified as a moon of Fried III, the relationship is more "
"bidirectional that was originally thought, with both planets nearly tidal "
"locked. Over time, much of the gas from Fried III has also come to Fried "
"IIIa, however, due to the significantly lower surface temperature, most of "
"it lays as a fine dust of frozen particles that cover the planet. Due to a "
"thin atmosphere, the surface has relatively little movement, allowing you to "
"clearly see tracks of other ships before you. Although there are more than "
"you expect, it is likely that some are very old, potentially pre-dating the "
"formation of many of the Great Houses of the Empire."
msgstr ""

msgid "Fulcrum I"
msgstr "Fulcrum I"

msgid "Fury I"
msgstr "Furia I"

msgid "Fury Station"
msgstr "Estación Furia"

msgid ""
"While Fury Station is not the most well-built of stations, it gets the job "
"done with both a shipyard with all the standard pirate ships and an "
"outfitter with a substantial lineup of goods. It even has some merchandise "
"not offered at the nearby clanworld Sanchez."
msgstr ""
"Aunque la Estación Furia no es la mejor construida, cumple con su cometido "
"al contar con un astillero con todas las nave piratas habituales y armador "
"de equipos con una importante gama de productos. Incluso tiene algunas "
"mercancías que no se ofrecen en el cercano mucho clan Sánchez."

msgid "Fuzka"
msgstr "Fuzka"

msgid ""
"Fuzka is a fairly typical Imperial civilian world. It has a good atmosphere, "
"stable tectonics and a large population. The world grows most of its own "
"food but still needs imports to make ends meet. The local population is as "
"well off as can be expected from a middle-class Imperial colony. Otherwise, "
"there is little to note about Fuzka."
msgstr ""
"Fuzka es un mundo civil imperial bastante típico. Tiene una buena atmósfera, "
"una tectónica estable y una gran población. El mundo cultiva la mayor parte "
"de sus alimentos, pero todavía necesita importaciones para llegar a fin de "
"mes. La población local está tan bien como se puede esperar de una colonia "
"imperial de clase media. Por lo demás, hay poco que destacar de Fuzka."

msgid ""
"The bar caters to its clientele with considerable efficiency. Since Fuzka "
"has quite a high amount of civilian traffic, its bar needs to handle the "
"many passengers who are waiting for their transport to depart."
msgstr ""
"El bar atiende a su clientela con considerable eficacia. Dado que Fuzka "
"tiene un tráfico civil bastante elevado, su bar necesita atender a los "
"numerosos pasajeros que esperan la salida de su transporte."

msgid "Fyruse Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Fyruse"

msgid ""
"The Sirii have a rather extensive military infrastructure within their "
"borders and Fyruse Monastery is part of that infrastructure. There's a "
"regular detachment stationed here, making sure that law and order are "
"maintained as well as can reasonably be expected in Esker and its "
"neighbouring systems. Fyruse Monastery also acts as a border guard for "
"Frontier space, though nobody really believes in the need for such."
msgstr ""
"Los Sirio tienen una infraestructura militar bastante amplia dentro de sus "
"fronteras y el Monasterio Fyruse forma parte de esa infraestructura. Hay un "
"destacamento regular estacionado aquí, que se asegura de que la ley y el "
"orden se mantienen tan bien como se puede esperar razonablemente en Esker y "
"sus sistemas vecinos. El Monasterio Fyruse también actúa como guardia "
"fronteriza del espacio Frontera, aunque nadie cree realmente en la necesidad "
"de ello."

msgid ""
"As Fyruse Monastery is a Sirius-only facility, the bar is divided into three "
"sections, one for each echelon. In the rare event that a non-Sirius visitor "
"is allowed on board, they are catered for in the Shaira section."
msgstr ""
"Como el Monasterio Fyruse es una instalación exclusiva Sirio, el bar está "
"dividido en tres secciones, una para cada escalón. En el raro caso de que se "
"permita subir a bordo a un visitante que no sea de Sirio, se le atiende en "
"la sección de Shaira."

msgid "Galileo Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal Galileo"

msgid ""
"Originally funded by an ambitious research proposal to expand Za'lek space "
"beyond the Anubis black hole, the Galileo project has been plagued by "
"funding mismanagement, inner quarrels, and even a murder investigation. "
"While the original research project itself is more or less a failure, the "
"station does host a significant amount of researchers. Furthermore, despite "
"originally being focused on applied science, the funding issues have made it "
"so that most of the researchers that remain are more focused on theoretical "
"developments that require few resources."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente financiada por una ambiciosa propuesta de investigación para "
"ampliar el espacio Za'lek más allá del agujero negro de Anubis, el proyecto "
"Galileo ha estado plagado por una mala gestión de la financiación, peleas "
"internas e incluso una investigación por asesinato. Aunque el proyecto de "
"investigación original en sí es más o menos un fracaso, la estación acoge a "
"una cantidad significativa de investigadores. Además, a pesar de centrarse "
"originalmente en la ciencia aplicada, los problemas de financiación han "
"hecho que la mayoría de los investigadores que quedan se centren más en "
"desarrollos teóricos que requieren pocos recursos."

msgid ""
"The bar is frequented by many Za'lek scientists who mainly keep to "
"themselves as they attempt to untangle large equations and decipher texts on "
"theoretical advances in their field of study. Even by Za'lek standards it is "
"very quiet and calm."
msgstr ""
"El bar es frecuentado por muchos científicos Za'lek que intentan desentrañar "
"grandes ecuaciones y descifrar textos sobre avances teóricos en su campo de "
"estudio. Incluso para los estándares Za'lek es muy tranquilo y silencioso."

msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "Gamma"

msgid "Gamma Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Gamma"

msgid ""
"All of the Empire's military cadets end up having a mandatory stay at Gamma "
"Enclave. Although not luxurious by any standard, it is well organized and "
"designed for dealing with large numbers of personnel. The station is well "
"equipped for organizing in-system exercises with in-depth visualizations of "
"everything that is happening locally.\n"
"Although the space docks are not large enough to allow for ship "
"construction, the station is also well suited for making adjustments and "
"repairs on even the largest of Empire vessels."
msgstr ""
"Todos los cadetes militares del Imperio acaban teniendo una estancia "
"obligatoria en el Enclave Gamma. Aunque no es lujosa bajo ningún concepto, "
"está bien organizada y diseñada para manejar una gran cantidad de personal. "
"La estación está bien equipada para organizar ejercicios en el sistema con "
"visualizaciones en profundidad de todo lo que ocurre localmente.\n"
"Aunque los muelles espaciales no son lo suficientemente grandes como para "
"permitir la construcción de naves, la estación también es muy adecuada para "
"realizar ajustes y reparaciones incluso en las naves más grandes del Imperio."

msgid ""
"Due to the ever changing staff rosters on the station, the bar has a very "
"casual atmosphere, so it's very easy to meet new people. There's a wall of "
"shame and wall of glory where visualizations of horrible mishaps and "
"glorious feats are highlighted for everyone to see. The drinks flow "
"generously fueled by military paychecks and it is not uncommon to see "
"novices passed out."
msgstr ""
"Debido a los constantes cambios de personal en la estación, el bar tiene un "
"ambiente muy informal por lo que es muy fácil conocer gente nueva. Hay un "
"muro de la vergüenza y un muro de la gloria en los que se visualizan los "
"horribles percances y las gloriosas hazañas para que todo el mundo las vea. "
"Las bebidas fluyen generosamente alimentadas por las pagas militares y no es "
"raro ver a novatos desmayados."

msgid "Gammacron IV"
msgstr "Gammacron IV"

msgid "Gammacron V"
msgstr "Gammacron V"

msgid "Gammacron Va"
msgstr "Gammacron Va"

msgid "Gammacron Vb"
msgstr "Gammacron Vb"

msgid "Ganth I"
msgstr "Ganth I"

msgid ""
"Ganth I seems to have been initially a super-dense asteroid with a "
"significant gravitational field, that over a few billion years was able to "
"capture large amounts of a hydrogen polyoxides from a local nebula. Ship "
"scanners still pick up an abnormal core, however, so far, no Za'lek "
"expedition has been able to figure out anything due to the depth and "
"instability of the surface. Or so that is the official story, while rumours "
"point to funding issues compounded with Imperial vetoes have left the planet "
"under-explored.\n"
"\n"
"The surface of the planet has been testimony of different efforts to resolve "
"occasional tensions between Za'lek and Imperial military forces, usually "
"with pointless shows of bravado trying to show off how well they can survive "
"with minimal gear in the sub-100 kelvin environment. Usually such shows end "
"up with a visit to life care support, however, there are no noted deaths "
"yet, although the practice is officially discouraged."
msgstr ""

msgid "Garten IV"
msgstr "Garten IV"

msgid "Garten X"
msgstr "Garten X"

msgid "Gastan"
msgstr "Gastan"

msgid ""
"Gastan is one of House Za'leks research worlds that moonlights as a mining "
"world for valuable materials. Many of the labs here are off-limits to "
"outsiders, but the main city and space-port is a popular hub for internal "
"trade and commerce."
msgstr ""
"Gastan es uno de los mundos de investigación de la Casa Za'leks que se "
"convierte en un mundo minero de materiales valiosos. Muchos de los "
"laboratorios están prohibidos para los forasteros, pero la ciudad principal "
"y el puerto espacial son un centro popular para el comercio interno."

msgid ""
"There is nothing particularly note-worthy about this bar other than the "
"complex machinery on display through metre-thick translucent plasteel. The "
"bar is built underground in a long-drained mining shaft, and the equipment "
"seems to be of interest to many of the patrons."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada especialmente destacable en este bar, aparte de la compleja "
"maquinaria que se exhibe a través de plastiacero traslúcido de un metro de "
"grosor. El bar está construido en el subsuelo de un pozo minero de gran "
"profundidad, y el equipo parece ser de interés para muchos de los clientes."

msgid "Gath Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Gath"

msgid ""
"Gath Cloister is a local law enforcement and customs station. Although it "
"delegates the defence of Sirius space to Inios Monastery, it maintains "
"security in the sector and supports patrols that scan incoming vessels to "
"enforce law and order."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro de Gath es una estación local de orden público y aduanas. Aunque "
"delega la defensa del espacio Sirio al Monasterio de Inios, mantiene la "
"seguridad en el sector y apoya a las patrullas que escanean las naves "
"entrantes para hacer cumplir la ley y el orden."

msgid "Gaula"
msgstr "Gaula"

msgid ""
"Soromid space is low on worlds suitable for agriculture, so the Soromid need "
"to rely on alternative food production. Gaula, an aquatic planet, is one "
"such alternative. Vast stretches of the ocean floor are taken up by enormous "
"submarine farms where certain kinds of underwater flora are cultivated and "
"harvested, to be processed into food by the factory station up above."
msgstr ""
"En el espacio Soromida hay pocos mundos aptos para la agricultura, por lo "
"que los Soromida tienen que recurrir a una producción de alimentos "
"alternativa. Gaula, un planeta acuático, es una de esas alternativas. "
"Grandes extensiones del fondo del océano están ocupadas por enormes granjas "
"submarinas en las que se cultivan y cosechan ciertos tipos de flora "
"submarina, que se transforman en alimentos en la estación industrial de "
"arriba."

msgid ""
"The spaceport and its accompanying support facilities are floating on a "
"platform above one of the primary farms on Gaula. The water is strictly off-"
"limits, and anyone foolish enough to dump waste into the ocean is harshly "
"penalized."
msgstr ""
"El puerto espacial y las instalaciones de apoyo que lo acompañan flotan en "
"una plataforma sobre una de las principales granjas de Gaula. El agua está "
"estrictamente prohibida, y cualquier persona lo suficientemente insensata "
"como para verter residuos en el océano es duramente penalizada."

msgid "Gaula Foods"
msgstr "Comidas Gaula"

msgid ""
"Gaula Foods is the food factory that processes the produce grown on Gaula "
"into human digestible meal units. The station outputs an amazing variety of "
"foodstuffs considering the limited diversity of the plants they are made "
"from."
msgstr ""
"Comidas Gaula es la fábrica de alimentos que transforma los productos "
"cultivados en Gaula en unidades de comida digeribles por el ser humano. La "
"estación produce una increíble variedad de alimentos teniendo en cuenta la "
"escasa diversidad de las plantas con las que se elaboran."

msgid ""
"The bar offers samples of most of the products made in the factory complex. "
"The taste is generally not bad, although after a while it starts to get a "
"little samey."
msgstr ""
"El bar ofrece muestras de la mayoría de los productos elaborados en el "
"complejo de la fábrica. En general, el sabor no está mal, aunque al cabo de "
"un rato empieza a ser un poco igual."

msgid "Gayathi"
msgstr "Gayathi"

msgid ""
"The colony on Gayathi has been around since before Sirichana settled on "
"Mutris. In those days it was an outpost of one of the Factions that were "
"destroyed in the Faction Wars, forgotten and overlooked by all. With its "
"source of funding and supplies gone, Gayathi never had a chance to fully "
"develop its economic infrastructure. Then, when Sirius rose as a galactic "
"power, Gayathi came to fall under its influence. Now it is home to some of "
"the most devout believers found in Sirius space."
msgstr ""
"La colonia de Gayathi existe desde antes de que Sirichana se estableciera en "
"Mutris. En aquellos tiempos era un puesto de avanzada de una de las "
"facciones que fueron destruidas en las Guerras de Facciones, olvidada y "
"pasada por alto por todos. Sin su fuente de financiación y suministros, "
"Gayathi nunca tuvo la oportunidad de desarrollar plenamente su "
"infraestructura económica. Luego, cuando Sirio se alzó como potencia "
"galáctica, Gayathi cayó bajo su influencia. Ahora es el hogar de algunos de "
"los creyentes más devotos del espacio de Sirio."

msgid "Gem"
msgstr "Gema"

msgid "Gennus"
msgstr "Gennus"

msgid ""
"Gennus is a cold world now, but it wasn't quite this harsh when it was first "
"settled during the Second Growth. Poor climate management and rampant "
"pollution have filled the sky with sunlight-blocking substances, and now the "
"fragile ecosystem has collapsed. The people here only live on Gennus because "
"they have nowhere else to go. The problem is aggravated by Empire "
"bureaucracy that ensures that change is hard to come by."
msgstr ""
"Gennus es un mundo frío en la actualidad, pero no era tan duro cuando se "
"estableció por primera vez durante el Segundo Crecimiento. La mala gestión "
"del clima y la contaminación desenfrenada han llenado el cielo de sustancias "
"que bloquean la luz solar, y ahora el frágil ecosistema se ha colapsado. La "
"gente de aquí sólo vive en Gennus porque no tiene otro lugar al que ir. El "
"problema se ve agravado por la burocracia del Imperio, que hace que el "
"cambio sea difícil de conseguir."

msgid ""
"It's hard to find a smiling face in this spaceport bar. Not too surprising, "
"given how unpleasant life on this planet is."
msgstr ""
"Es difícil encontrar una cara sonriente en este bar del puerto espacial. No "
"es demasiado sorprendente, dado lo desagradable que es la vida en este "
"planeta."

msgid "Gerhart Central"
msgstr "Central Gerhart"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Gerhart Central was built by the Za'lek Central Council in response to the "
"Empire building Outbound Enclave. The Za'lek felt miffed that the Empire "
"would step in on what they saw as their space and, instead of meekly backing "
"down or risking military conflict, merely built a larger and better-equipped "
"station.\n"
"The fact that it would also be an ideal location for defending the Za'lek "
"from Imperial treachery, or for launching an attack into the Empire itself, "
"is an open secret."
msgstr ""
"La Central Gerhart fue construida por el Consejo Central Za'lek en respuesta "
"a la construcción del Enclave Salida por parte del Imperio. Los Za'lek se "
"sintieron molestos por el hecho de que el Imperio se metiera en lo que "
"consideraban su tierra y, en lugar de retroceder dócilmente o arriesgarse a "
"un conflicto militar, se limitaron a construir una estación más grande y "
"mejor equipada. El hecho de que puede ser un lugar ideal para defender a los "
"Za'lek de la traición imperial, o para lanzar un ataque al propio Imperio, "
"es un secreto a voces."

msgid ""
"There are many Za'lek military officials, scientists, and traders from all "
"over in this large and clean bar. It is much nicer than the one on Outbound "
"Enclave. Quite a pointed snub."
msgstr ""
"Hay muchos oficiales militares Za'lek, científicos y comerciantes de todas "
"partes en este gran bar limpio. Es mucho más agradable que el del Enclave de "
"Salida. Todo un desaire."

msgid "Geron"
msgstr "Geron"

msgid ""
"Geron was once an Imperial colony, but when House Goddard was established "
"and granted full authority over the system, it also acquired jurisdiction "
"over Geron. In the decades that followed the Imperial bureaucracy was "
"largely dismantled and replaced by a more gubernatorial arrangement. That "
"improved the efficiency at which the world was run, but without its Imperial "
"status the economy took a serious hit. Nowadays, Geron is a fairly average "
"civilian world that houses the majority of Goddard's citizens."
msgstr ""
"Geron fue en su día una colonia Imperial, pero cuando se estableció la Casa "
"Goddard y se le concedió plena autoridad sobre el sistema, también adquirió "
"jurisdicción sobre Geron. En las décadas siguientes, la burocracia Imperial "
"se desmanteló en gran medida y se sustituyó por un sistema más "
"gubernamental. Esto mejoró la eficiencia de la gestión del mundo, pero sin "
"su estatus imperial la economía sufrió un duro golpe. En la actualidad, "
"Geron es un mundo civil bastante normal que alberga a la mayoría de los "
"ciudadanos de Goddard."

msgid ""
"Like many spaceport bars, this one is loud, crowded and a little smelly. In "
"other words, it's a home away from home for those who make their living in "
"space."
msgstr ""
"Como muchos bares de los puertos espaciales, éste es ruidoso, está lleno de "
"gente y huele un poco mal. En otras palabras, es un hogar lejos del hogar "
"para los que se ganan la vida en el espacio."

msgid "Gewirn IV"
msgstr "Gewirn IV"

msgid "Gilligan's Light III"
msgstr "Luz de Gilligan III"

msgid "Gilligan's Memory"
msgstr "Memoria de Gilligan"

msgid ""
"Wilibrord Gilligan was a famous explorer of space in the times of the Second "
"Growth. He was responsible for charting many of the currently known jump "
"routes, having a knack for spotting the areas in space that allowed entry "
"into hyperspace for prolonged periods. In those days this was exceptional, "
"since scanning technology was nowhere near as advanced as now.\n"
"In honour of Gilligan's services to the old Factions, he was granted his own "
"planetary system and settlement therein. After the Faction Wars, Gilligan's "
"Memory came to fall under Sirian rule, though the Sirii have chosen to "
"uphold Gilligan's memory."
msgstr ""
"Wilibrord Gilligan fue un famoso explorador del espacio en los tiempos del "
"Segundo Crecimiento. Es el responsable de trazar muchas de las rutas de "
"salto conocidas actualmente, ya que tenía un don para detectar las zonas del "
"espacio que permitían entrar en el hiperespacio durante periodos "
"prolongados. En aquella época esto era excepcional, ya que la tecnología de "
"escaneo no estaba ni de lejos tan avanzada como ahora. \n"
"En honor a los servicios prestados por Gilligan a las antiguas Facciones, se "
"le concedió su propio sistema planetario y un asentamiento en él. Tras las "
"Guerras de las Facciones, la Memoria de Gilligan pasó a estar bajo el "
"dominio de Sirio, aunque éstos han optado por mantener la memoria de "
"Gilligan."

msgid ""
"Predictably, the spaceport bar is themed on Wilibrord Gilligan, showing his "
"likeness in several places and displaying a map of his travels through the "
"galaxy on the wall. A popular topic in this bar is the dwarf planets in "
"Gilligan's Memory, particularly speculations on why Gilligan chose to name "
"them the way he did."
msgstr ""
"Como era de esperar, el bar del puerto espacial está ambientado en Wilibrord "
"Gilligan, mostrando su imagen en varios lugares y mostrando un mapa de sus "
"viajes por la galaxia en la pared. Un tema popular en este bar es el de los "
"planetas enanos de la Memoria de Gilligan, en particular las especulaciones "
"sobre por qué Gilligan eligió nombrarlos de la forma en que lo hizo."

msgid "Gilligan's Tomb"
msgstr "Tumba de Gilligan"

msgid "Ginger II"
msgstr "Jenjibre II"

msgid "Ginger III"
msgstr "Jenjibre III"

msgid "Ginni"
msgstr "Ginni"

msgid ""
"Somewhat unusual in Dvaered space, Ginni is primarily a crop growing world. "
"Though most Dvaered worlds trace their lineage to either mining or "
"industrial roots, Ginni was a food producer even in the days when the Empire "
"was still in control. However, with the change in political influence "
"throughout the region, Ginni's government wisely chose to ally with the "
"Dvaered movement."
msgstr ""
"Algo inusual en el espacio Dvaered, Ginni es principalmente un mundo de "
"cultivo. Aunque la mayoría de los mundos Dvaered tienen raíces mineras o "
"industriales, Ginni era un productor de alimentos incluso en los días en que "
"el Imperio aún tenía el control. Sin embargo, con el cambio de influencia "
"política en toda la región, el gobierno de Ginni optó sabiamente por aliarse "
"con el movimiento Dvaered."

msgid ""
"A lot of planetside spaceport bars have windows that give visitors a glance "
"of the immediate environment, but the one on Ginni does not. This is because "
"the sunlight on Ginni can get rather intense, and it was cheaper to build a "
"wall than an automatically adjusting viewport. Besides, there's not too much "
"to see anyway."
msgstr ""
"Muchos bares de los puertos espaciales del planeta tienen ventanas que "
"permiten a los visitantes echar un vistazo al entorno inmediato, pero el de "
"Ginni no las tiene. Esto se debe a que la luz del sol en Ginni puede ser "
"bastante intensa, y era más barato construir un muro que una ventana que se "
"ajustara automáticamente. Además, no hay mucho que ver de todos modos."

msgid "Gliese I"
msgstr "Gliese I"

msgid "Gliese II"
msgstr "Gliese II"

msgid "Gliese II-a"
msgstr "Gliese II-a"

msgid "Gliese III"
msgstr "Gliese III"

msgid "Gliese IV"
msgstr "Gliese IV"

msgid "Gliese VI"
msgstr "Gliese VI"

msgid "Goddard III"
msgstr "Goddard III"

msgid "Goddard IV"
msgstr "Goddard IV"

msgid "Godtra"
msgstr "Godtra"

msgid ""
"Godtra is a reasonably balanced world, with a sizeable civilian population, "
"a fair amount of heavy industry and some farming for internal consumption, "
"though the population largely depends on Torg Crops for sustenance. As "
"Godtra is one of the wealthiest Dvaered systems within a few jumps, it is a "
"popular target for Warlords to conquer."
msgstr ""
"Godtra es un mundo razonablemente equilibrado, con una población civil "
"considerable, una buena cantidad de industria pesada y algo de agricultura "
"para consumo interno, aunque la población depende en gran medida de los "
"cultivos Torg para su sustento. Como Godtra es uno de los sistemas Dvaered "
"más ricos a pocos saltos, es un objetivo popular para que los Señores de la "
"Guerra lo conquisten."

msgid ""
"A pretty decent place as far as spaceport bars go, Godtra's bar is well "
"equipped to facilitate traders and other offworlders. The data uplinks are "
"decently speedy, which is rare on a Dvaered world. Clearly, the local "
"infrastructure has been well designed."
msgstr ""
"Un lugar bastante decente en lo que respecta a los bares de los puertos "
"espaciales, el bar de Godtra está bien equipado para facilitar a los "
"comerciantes y a otros extranjeros. Los enlaces de datos son decentemente "
"rápidos, lo que es raro en un mundo Dvaered. Está claro que la "
"infraestructura local ha sido bien diseñada."

msgid "Golem"
msgstr "Golem"

msgid ""
"Despite being hellish, Golem has a respectably large population, albeit a "
"population restricted to hab units at the top of mountains. The gasses here "
"are useful, and hence mined, but the world is not harsh enough to justify "
"making it a prison planet. Many lower-class Dvaered make their homes here, "
"unperturbed by the conditions. It's a living, after all."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de ser infernal, Golem tiene una población respetablemente grande, "
"aunque restringida a un número de habitantes en la cima de las montañas. Los "
"gases de este lugar son útiles, y por ello se extraen, pero el mundo no es "
"lo suficientemente duro como para justificar que sea un planeta prisión. "
"Muchos Dvaered de clase baja tienen su hogar aquí, sin que les molesten las "
"condiciones. Al fin y al cabo, es un medio de vida."

msgid ""
"This bar is shockingly convivial and clean, all things considered. The "
"locals are determined to make their lives that much more enjoyable, and to "
"prove to outsiders that they can conquer their homeworld's harsh environment."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es sorprendentemente acogedor y limpio, a pesar de todo. Los "
"lugareños están decididos a hacer su vida mucho más agradable y a demostrar "
"a los forasteros que pueden conquistar el duro entorno de su mundo natal."

msgid "Gorchenchev Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Gorchenchev"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Though Gorchenchev Shipyards is a commercial enterprise, House Sirius has "
"licenced it to produce their military ships. As such, the station is "
"classified as a military installation, meaning no access to independent "
"traders."
msgstr ""
"Aunque los Astilleros Gorchenchev son una empresa comercial, la Casa Sirio "
"ha concedido una licencia para producir sus naves militares. Como tal, la "
"estación está clasificada como una instalación militar, lo que significa que "
"no tiene acceso a los comerciantes independientes."

msgid ""
"The factional emblem of House Sirius is predominant in this spacedock bar. "
"The owner of the station clearly wants to show that his allegiance to his "
"faction is strong."
msgstr ""
"El emblema de la facción de la Casa Sirio predomina en este bar del muelle "
"espacial. El propietario de la estación quiere demostrar claramente que su "
"lealtad a su facción es fuerte."

msgid "Gordon's Exchange"
msgstr "Intercambio de Gordon"

msgid ""
"Gordon's Exchange is one of the few stations owned and operated by traders. "
"It is here that most of the deals are made and ore shipped. It is a "
"bustling, modern facility, and there are always things for weary traveller "
"to do."
msgstr ""
"Intercambio de Gordon es una de las pocas estaciones que son propiedad de "
"los comerciantes y están gestionadas por ellos. Es aquí donde se hacen la "
"mayoría de los tratos y se embarca el mineral. Es una instalación bulliciosa "
"y moderna, y siempre hay cosas que hacer para los cansados viajeros."

msgid ""
"The bar has some classy music playing in the background over the chatter of "
"businessmen going about their jobs. The sounds of a modern economy."
msgstr ""
"En el bar suena una música elegante de fondo por encima del parloteo de los "
"hombres de negocios en su trabajo. El sonido de la economía moderna."

msgid "Gorgate"
msgstr "Gorgate"

msgid ""
"Gorgate is a loyal Sirian world. The local story goes that Sirichana once "
"set foot on its surface personally, when the colony was only just "
"established, and showed the colonists the light. This is said to have "
"happened over a hundred cycles ago, however, and records of the colony's "
"early days are scarce and unreliable at best. Still, the locals believe the "
"story without question.\n"
"Although battered by plasma storms, the strong ionosphere of the planet "
"keeps the local population safe."
msgstr ""
"Gorgate es un mundo leal Sirio. La historia local cuenta que Sirichana pisó "
"una vez su superficie personalmente, cuando la colonia acababa de "
"establecerse, y mostró a los colonos la luz. Sin embargo, se dice que esto "
"ocurrió hace más de cien ciclos, y los registros de los primeros días de la "
"colonia son escasos y poco fiables en el mejor de los casos. Aun así, los "
"lugareños creen la historia sin dudarlo.\n"
"Aunque azotado por tormentas de plasma, la fuerte ionosfera del planeta "
"mantiene a salvo a la población local."

msgid ""
"The Gorgaters are always eager to tell outsiders about their alleged "
"history. The spaceport bar contains a holodisplay that recounts the story of "
"Sirichana's visit to this world, though it's anyone's guess how much of it "
"is true and how much of it has been invented over the cycles."
msgstr ""
"Los Gorgateros siempre están dispuestos a contar a los forasteros su "
"supuesta historia. En el bar del puerto espacial hay una holopantalla que "
"cuenta la historia de la visita de Sirichana a este mundo, aunque nadie sabe "
"cuánto de ella es cierta y cuánto se ha inventado a lo largo de los ciclos."

msgid "Grandard"
msgstr "Grandard"

msgid ""
"Grandard is the home of some of the Empire's most legendary fighter pilots. "
"For reasons unknown, this world has become renowned for its highly-skilled "
"light combat ship specialists. Rather than discourage this anomaly, the "
"Empire has taken full advantage of it, and established an elite pilot "
"training faculty."
msgstr ""
"Grandard es el hogar de algunos de los pilotos de caza más legendarios del "
"Imperio. Por razones desconocidas, este mundo se ha hecho famoso por sus "
"especialistas en naves de combate ligeras altamente cualificados. En lugar "
"de desalentar esta anomalía, el Imperio la ha aprovechado al máximo y ha "
"establecido una facultad de entrenamiento de pilotos de élite."

msgid ""
"This bar has pictures of some of the more renowned fighter pilots in its "
"history. Several imperial officers look at these pictures with what can only "
"be described as burning envy. Prospective aces, then."
msgstr ""
"Este bar tiene fotos de algunos de los pilotos de combate más renombrados de "
"su historia. Varios oficiales imperiales miran estas fotos con lo que sólo "
"puede describirse como envidia ardiente. Futuros ases, entonces."

msgid "Green Eye"
msgstr "Ojo Verde"

msgid "Greenberg"
msgstr "Monte Verde"

msgid ""
"This world has suffered from the centralization of Za'lek space particularly "
"hard. With the effective abandonment by the Za'lek authorities beyond a "
"skeleton government, this world has fallen into hard times and struggles to "
"remain afloat."
msgstr ""
"Este mundo ha sufrido con especial dureza la centralización del espacio "
"Za'lek. Con el abandono efectivo de las autoridades Za'lek más allá de un "
"gobierno esquelético, este mundo ha caído en tiempos difíciles y lucha por "
"mantenerse a flote."

msgid ""
"This bar seems very shabby and run-down. It has mismatching furniture and "
"the walls have been visibly repaired more than once. There are few people, "
"and most of them seem to be the types too old and stubborn to leave."
msgstr ""
"Este bar parece muy cutre y deteriorado. Tiene muebles que no hacen juego y "
"las paredes han sido visiblemente reparadas más de una vez. Hay poca gente, "
"y la mayoría parece ser de los que son demasiado viejos y testarudos para "
"irse."

msgid "Greis"
msgstr "Greis"

msgid ""
"Greis has a tradition, and that tradition is that whichever Warlord controls "
"the planet renames it after himself. This often causes confusion among "
"spacers everywhere, who will refer to the world by names that have been "
"rendered obsolete. The current warlord is a man named Harmstadt Greis. His "
"rule isn't particularly benevolent, but he at least doesn't seem worse than "
"most Dvaered Warlords."
msgstr ""
"Greis tiene una tradición, y esa tradición es que el Señor de la Guerra que "
"controla el planeta lo rebautiza con su nombre. Esto suele causar confusión "
"entre los espaciales de todo el mundo, que se referirán al mundo con nombres "
"que han quedado obsoletos. El actual caudillo es un hombre llamado Harmstadt "
"Greis. Su gobierno no es especialmente benévolo, pero al menos no parece "
"peor que el de la mayoría de los caudillos Dvaered."

msgid ""
"At the centre of this spaceport bar stands a pillar, on which are displayed "
"all the names that the planet has been known by, including the name of one "
"unfortunate Warlord named Clerke, who was in control of this world for a "
"little under four periods."
msgstr ""
"En el centro de este bar del puerto espacial se encuentra un pilar, en el "
"que se muestran todos los nombres por los que se ha conocido el planeta, "
"incluido el de un desafortunado señor de la guerra llamado Clerke, que "
"estuvo en control de este mundo durante algo menos de cuatro períodos."

msgid "Griffin I"
msgstr "Grifo I"

msgid "Griffin II"
msgstr "Grifo II"

msgid "Griffin III"
msgstr "Grifo III"

msgid ""
"Griffin III is, despite the generic name, a well-populated and prosperous "
"world. It has a booming industrial base and a respectable government "
"complex. The facilities are well-maintained and extensive here. Truly a "
"model world for the Empire, even if it's a little lacking in personality."
msgstr ""
"Grifo III es, a pesar de su nombre genérico, un mundo bien poblado y "
"próspero. Tiene una base industrial floreciente y un complejo gubernamental "
"respetable. Las instalaciones están bien mantenidas y son amplias. Realmente "
"es un mundo modelo para el Imperio, aunque le falte un poco de personalidad."

msgid ""
"The bar is clean and large, with various games and holovids for "
"entertainment of patrons. The food is good and the drinks are great. One "
"could stay a long time here. However, it is missing some of the uniqueness "
"you find on other planets."
msgstr ""
"El bar es limpio y grande, con varios juegos y holovideos para el "
"entretenimiento de los clientes. La comida es buena y las bebidas son "
"estupendas. Uno podría quedarse mucho tiempo aquí. Sin embargo, le falta "
"algo de la singularidad que se encuentra en otros planetas."

msgid "Griffin VI"
msgstr "Grifo VI"

msgid "Grindstone Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Molienda"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Grindstone Shipyards is a private manufacturing plant owned by Titus "
"Grindstone, a wealthy Fyrra Sirian who has moved into the spaceship "
"business. He is licenced to manufacture some of the more common civilian "
"models, and his factory supplies a fair number of the surrounding retailers. "
"Ships can also be purchased directly from this station.\n"
"Although originally distributing ships to both the Empire and House Sirius, "
"with the trade lane now cut off, it focuses entirely on the Sirius market, "
"also producing House Sirius ships."
msgstr ""
"Los Astilleros Molienda son una planta de fabricación privada propiedad de "
"Titus Molienda, un adinerado Sirio de Fyrra que se ha dedicado al negocio de "
"las naves espaciales. Tiene licencia para fabricar algunos de los modelos "
"civiles más comunes, y su fábrica abastece a un buen número de comerciantes "
"de los alrededores. También se pueden comprar naves directamente en esta "
"estación.\n"
"Aunque originalmente distribuía naves tanto al Imperio como a la Casa Sirio, "
"con la ruta comercial ahora cortada, se centra por completo en el mercado "
"Sirio, produciendo también naves de la Casa Sirio."

msgid ""
"Titus Grindstone likes to keep his potential customers in a good mood, which "
"is why he has invested into a small yet luxurious spacedock bar on his "
"manufacturing plant. It sports all the standard bar facilities, as well as "
"ready access to the station's ship catalogue."
msgstr ""
"A Titus Molienda le gusta mantener a sus clientes potenciales de buen humor, "
"por lo que ha invertido en un pequeño pero lujoso bar del muelle espacial en "
"su planta de fabricación. Cuenta con todas las instalaciones estándar de un "
"bar, así como con acceso al catálogo de naves de la estación."

msgid "Gruz I"
msgstr "Gruz I"

msgid "Gruz II"
msgstr "Gruz II"

msgid "Gruz III"
msgstr "Gruz III"

msgid "Guntesh's Rock"
msgstr "La Roca de Guntesh"

msgid ""
"Guntesh's Rock is an uninhabitable atmosphere-less planet that has been "
"traditionally used as a reference point for astral navigation in the area, "
"due to the high visibility from the extreme electromagnetic activity of its "
"active core. The core has also ensured its uninhabitability, which has been "
"further intensified by the Nebula taking over the system."
msgstr ""
"La Roca de Guntesh es un planeta inhabitable sin atmósfera que se ha "
"utilizado tradicionalmente como punto de referencia para la navegación "
"astral en la zona, debido a la gran visibilidad derivada de la extrema "
"actividad electromagnética de su núcleo activo. El núcleo también ha "
"garantizado su inhabitabilidad, que se ha intensificado aún más con la "
"Nebulosa al tomar el sistema."

msgid "Gutter I"
msgstr "Canalón I"

msgid "Gutter III"
msgstr "Canalón III"

msgid "Gyrios II"
msgstr "Gyrios II"

msgid "Gyrios IV"
msgstr "Gyrios IV"

msgid "Gyrios V"
msgstr "Gyrios V"

msgid "Hadosh Ia"
msgstr "Hadosh Ia"

msgid "Hadosh II"
msgstr "Hadosh II"

msgid "Hadosh III"
msgstr "Hadosh III"

msgid "Hadosh IV"
msgstr "Hadosh IV"

msgid "Haldr"
msgstr "Haldr"

msgid ""
"Haldr ranks quite high on the official list of \"most unpleasant inhabited "
"planets in the galaxy\", which is compiled at regular intervals by the "
"Gilligan Foundation. Indeed, even the most optimistic space traveller would "
"be hard pressed to find a good reason why anyone would want to come to "
"Haldr, let alone stay there. As it turns out, Dvaered High Command has such "
"a reason: Haldr serves as a training grounds for Dvaered military recruits. "
"Though many an upcoming soldier finds death on the radioactive surface of "
"Haldr, those who survive make for tough fighters indeed."
msgstr ""
"Haldr ocupa un lugar bastante alto en la lista oficial de \"planetas "
"habitados más desagradables de la galaxia\", que la Fundación Gilligan "
"elabora periódicamente. De hecho, incluso el viajero espacial más optimista "
"se vería en apuros para encontrar una buena razón por la que alguien "
"quisiera venir a Haldr, y mucho menos quedarse allí. Resulta que el Alto "
"Mando Dvaered tiene una razón: Haldr sirve de campo de entrenamiento para "
"los reclutas militares Dvaered. Aunque muchos de los futuros soldados "
"encuentran la muerte en la superficie radiactiva de Haldr, los que "
"sobreviven son luchadores muy duros."

msgid ""
"To get into Haldr's bar, you first have to undergo a rigorous "
"decontamination procedure, even when you're coming straight from the "
"spaceport dock. This fact has made more than a few visitors so uneasy that "
"they never want to visit Haldr again."
msgstr ""
"Para entrar en el bar de Haldr, primero hay que someterse a un riguroso "
"procedimiento de descontaminación, incluso cuando se viene directamente del "
"muelle del puerto espacial. Este hecho ha hecho que más de un visitante se "
"sienta tan incómodo que no quiere volver a visitar Haldr."

msgid "Haleb IV"
msgstr "Haleb IV"

msgid "Halir"
msgstr "Halir"

msgid ""
"Before there was Emperor's Fist, before there was even the Incident, there "
"was Halir, located in the Gamma Polaris system. While near the outskirts of "
"the Empire, it served as one of the largest local civilian hubs, with a "
"strong economy and considerable political influence. Then, one day, the new "
"Emperor had Polaris Prime built, renamed most of the worlds in the system, "
"and subsequently started the Emperor's Fist project. Halir was reduced to an "
"economic support role. However, the local government has stubbornly clung on "
"to the right to sovereignty, and so Halir remains a civilian world."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que existiera el Puño del Emperador, antes incluso de que existiera "
"el Incidente, existía Halir, situada en el sistema Gamma Polaris. Aunque "
"estaba cerca de las afueras del Imperio, era uno de los mayores centros "
"civiles locales, con una economía fuerte y una influencia política "
"considerable. Entonces, un día, el nuevo Emperador hizo construir Polaris "
"Prime, rebautizó la mayoría de los mundos del sistema y, posteriormente, "
"inició el proyecto del Puño del Emperador. Halir quedó reducida a un papel "
"de apoyo económico. Sin embargo, el gobierno local se aferró obstinadamente "
"al derecho de soberanía, por lo que Halir sigue siendo un mundo civil."

msgid ""
"Halir's bar has everything the weary traveller could hope for, from drinks "
"to data uplink terminals to per-table sound dampening fields and music "
"generators. In short it is a luxurious place, which is largely due to "
"Halir's long history of economic success. Anything you can't find in the bar "
"you can find in the pleasure district, which is just a single tube station "
"away."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Halir tiene todo lo que el viajero cansado puede esperar, desde "
"bebidas hasta terminales de subida de datos, pasando por campos de "
"amortiguación de sonido por mesa y generadores de música. En resumen, es un "
"lugar lujoso, lo que se debe en gran medida a la larga historia de éxito "
"económico de Halir. Todo lo que no se encuentra en el bar se puede encontrar "
"en el distrito del placer, que está a una sola estación de metro."

msgid "Handalier"
msgstr "Handalier"

msgid ""
"Even the Dvaered need to operate testing facilities. Hence the House Dvaered "
"Research Institute on Handalier. It is not known what goes on here, as the "
"Dvaered tightly control the entire planet."
msgstr ""
"Incluso los Dvaered necesitan operar instalaciones de prueba. De ahí el "
"Instituto de Investigación de la Casa Dvaered en Handalier. No se sabe lo "
"que ocurre aquí, ya que los Dvaered controlan estrechamente todo el planeta."

msgid ""
"The bar is fairly typical for a Dvaered bar in everything but the security "
"cameras along the walls. Fairly paranoid here, it seems."
msgstr ""
"El bar es bastante típico para un bar Dvaered en todo, excepto en las "
"cámaras de seguridad a lo largo de las paredes. Parece que aquí hay bastante "
"paranoia."

msgid "Hankies"
msgstr "Hankies"

msgid ""
"Hankies is something of a holiday resort as well as retreat for the wealthy. "
"It is mainly a consumer world, having neither the land for agriculture nor "
"the resources for industry. It does, however, have a pleasant ecosystem and "
"a wealth of beautiful geography."
msgstr ""
"Hankies es una especie de lugar de vacaciones y de retiro para los ricos. Es "
"un mundo principalmente consumista, ya que no dispone de tierras para la "
"agricultura ni de recursos para la industria. Sin embargo, cuenta con un "
"ecosistema agradable y una geografía de gran belleza."

msgid ""
"Since Hankies doesn't have much to offer, the bar is almost entirely an "
"import product. The architecture, the facilities and the drinks can all be "
"traced offworld. The only thing that is truly authentic to this world is the "
"view from the windows - a mountain range stretching away into the distance."
msgstr ""
"Dado que Hankies no tiene mucho que ofrecer, el bar es casi totalmente un "
"producto de importación. La arquitectura, las instalaciones y las bebidas "
"son de otro mundo. Lo único verdaderamente auténtico de este mundo es la "
"vista desde las ventanas: una cordillera que se extiende en la distancia."

msgid "Harnaar"
msgstr "Harnaar"

msgid ""
"Though officially classified as a wintry P class planet, Harnaar isn't all "
"that cold. Temperatures in most areas don't dip below human tolerable "
"levels, and to the local Soromid it is actually quite comfortable. The "
"planet's population isn't immensely high, but Harnaar still has the "
"characteristics of a low-density residential world."
msgstr ""
"Aunque oficialmente está clasificado como un planeta invernal de clase P, "
"Harnaar no es tan frío. Las temperaturas en la mayoría de las zonas no "
"descienden por debajo de los niveles tolerables para el ser humano, y para "
"los Soromida locales es bastante confortable. La población del planeta no es "
"inmensamente alta, pero Harnaar sigue teniendo las características de un "
"mundo residencial de baja densidad."

msgid ""
"As Harnaar isn't an intolerably cold world, conditions lend themselves well "
"to outdoor winter recreation. Tourists from all over Soromid space and "
"beyond visit this planet to indulge in winter sports or outdoor relaxation. "
"The spaceport bar welcomes them with open arms."
msgstr ""
"Como Harnaar no es un mundo intolerablemente frío, las condiciones se "
"prestan bien a la recreación invernal al aire libre. Turistas de todo el "
"espacio Soromida y de otros lugares visitan este planeta para practicar "
"deportes de invierno o relajarse al aire libre. El bar del puerto espacial "
"los recibe con los brazos abiertos."

msgid "Hartwell Nidus"
msgstr "Nido Hartwell"

msgid ""
"Father's Pride is an important junction in Soromid space, and it needs to be "
"well secured. Hartwell Station does just that. Besides securing local "
"traffic, it also sends patrols into neighbouring systems, particularly "
"Shikima, as Soromid Wards Alpha is a vital asset to the Soromid economy."
msgstr ""
"El Orgullo del Padre es un cruce importante en el espacio Soromida, y debe "
"estar bien protegido. La estación de Hartwell hace precisamente eso. Además "
"de asegurar el tráfico local, también envía patrullas a los sistemas "
"vecinos, especialmente a Shikima, ya que Soromida Wards Alpha es un activo "
"vital para la economía Soromida."

msgid ""
"It's typically only Soromid officers who frequent the recreational "
"facilities on a military station. Regular Soromid sailors tend to stay with "
"the ships, caring for them and making sure they are in good health."
msgstr ""
"Por lo general, sólo los oficiales Soromida frecuentan las instalaciones "
"recreativas de una estación militar. Los marineros habituales Soromida "
"suelen quedarse con las naves, cuidándolos y asegurándose de que gozan de "
"buena salud."

msgid "Hassak"
msgstr "Hassak"

msgid ""
"Not exactly unhabitable and not exactly habitable, Hassak is one of those "
"places where the less fortunate in society end up. The people here have it "
"hard, with storms of almost every variety plaguing the landscape on a "
"regular basis. The population feeds itself with the sale of raw minerals to "
"the Nexus corporation, which buys well under the market price, because it "
"can."
msgstr ""
"Ni exactamente inhabitable ni exactamente habitable, Hassak es uno de esos "
"lugares donde acaban los menos afortunados de la sociedad. La gente de aquí "
"lo tiene difícil, con tormentas de casi todas las variedades que asolan el "
"paisaje con regularidad. La población se alimenta con la venta de minerales "
"en bruto a la corporación Nexus, que compra muy por debajo del precio de "
"mercado, porque puede hacerlo."

msgid ""
"The bar on Hassak is a lousy affair. The planet is poor, and so can't afford "
"any luxury, least of all for offworlders. The Empire has provided the world "
"with basic facilities and equipment because it is bound to do so by "
"intergalactic treaties, but most of it is old and run-down."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Hassak es un sitio pésimo. El planeta es pobre, por lo que no "
"puede permitirse ningún lujo, y menos para los extranjeros. El Imperio ha "
"dotado al mundo de instalaciones y equipos básicos porque está obligado a "
"ello por los tratados intergalácticos, pero la mayoría de ellos son viejos y "
"están deteriorados."

msgid "Hasselt II"
msgstr "Hasselt II"

msgid "Hasselt IV"
msgstr "Hasselt IV"

msgid "Hatter I"
msgstr "Hatter I"

msgid "Hatter II"
msgstr "Hatter II"

msgid "Haurn"
msgstr "Haurn"

msgid ""
"Haurn is a small planet with mild planetary conditions. The Soromid have "
"designated it a dedicated farming world. Apart from a few small settlements, "
"most of the planet's land surface is given to agriculture."
msgstr ""
"Haurn es un pequeño planeta con condiciones planetarias suaves. Los Soromida "
"lo han designado como un mundo dedicado a la agricultura. Aparte de algunos "
"pequeños asentamientos, la mayor parte de la superficie del planeta se "
"dedica a la agricultura."

msgid ""
"This bar is arranged in a coliseum fashion. The facility is circular, with "
"several concentric rings leading down to the centre, where the bar is "
"located. The stairways that lead from the centre to the upper rings are not "
"gravity conditioned, so moving up them isn't so tiresome."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está dispuesto en forma de coliseo. La instalación es circular, con "
"varios anillos concéntricos que descienden hasta el centro, donde se "
"encuentra el bar. Las escaleras que llevan del centro a los anillos "
"superiores no están condicionadas por la gravedad, por lo que subirlas no es "
"tan pesado."

msgid "Haven"
msgstr "Refugio"

msgid "Heii"
msgstr "Heii"

msgid ""
"Heii is the rather unattractive moon of Juran. Juran itself is a natural M-"
"class, so first time visitors often wonder why the Soromid chose to settle "
"here and not down below. The reason is actually quite interesting. Juran is "
"home to many amazing life forms, including large creatures not at all unlike "
"the dinosaurs that once roamed ancient Earth. Settling down on Juran would "
"not only be dangerous, it would also mean a disturbance in the natural "
"ecosystem. Thus, the Soromid chose not to inhabit Juran, but instead tap its "
"natural animal life by selling specimens as exotic pets throughout the "
"galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Heii es la luna poco atractiva de Juran. Juran es un planeta natural de "
"clase M, por lo que los que la visitan por primera vez a menudo se preguntan "
"por qué los Soromida eligieron establecerse aquí y no más abajo. La razón es "
"bastante interesante. Juran es el hogar de muchas formas de vida "
"sorprendentes, incluyendo grandes criaturas que no se diferencian en "
"absoluto de los dinosaurios que una vez vagaron por la antigua Tierra. "
"Asentarse en Juran no sólo sería peligroso, sino que también supondría una "
"alteración del ecosistema natural. Por ello, los Soromida decidieron no "
"habitar Juran, sino aprovechar su vida animal natural vendiendo especímenes "
"como mascotas exóticas por toda la galaxia."

msgid ""
"Visitors to Heii spaceport bar can use special consoles to access video "
"feeds from survey satellites deployed all around Juran, to observe the life "
"forms on the surface and perhaps even pick one to take back to their own "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Los visitantes del bar del puerto espacial de Heii pueden utilizar consolas "
"especiales para acceder a las transmisiones de vídeo de los satélites de "
"estudio desplegados alrededor de Juran, para observar las formas de vida en "
"la superficie y quizás incluso elegir una para llevarla a su propio mundo."

msgid "Hekaras III"
msgstr "Hekaras III"

msgid "Hekaras IV"
msgstr "Hekaras IV"

msgid "Heronus"
msgstr "Heronus"

msgid ""
"The first Soromid bioships were grown on Sorom itself, and it was in those "
"ships that the Soromid spread through the galaxy. But Sorom is no more. "
"Nowadays, most Soromid ships are grown here, on Heronus. The planet's "
"gravitic and atmospheric properties make it ideal for raising ships in all "
"kinds of sizes and shapes. A carrier class vessel can reach maturity in as "
"few as four cycles."
msgstr ""
"Las primeras naves biológicas Soromida se cultivaron en el propio Sorom, y "
"fue en esas naves donde los Soromida se extendieron por la galaxia. Pero "
"Sorom ya no existe. Hoy en día, la mayoría de las naves Soromida se cultivan "
"aquí, en Heronus. Las propiedades gravitatorias y atmosféricas del planeta "
"lo hacen ideal para criar naves de todo tipo de tamaños y formas. Una nave "
"de clase portanaves puede alcanzar la madurez en tan sólo cuatro ciclos."

msgid "Heronus Nidus"
msgstr "Nido Heronus"

msgid ""
"Heronus Nidus is a military base directly tied to Heronus below. Its primary "
"duty is to protect the planet, because it is vital to the Soromid fleet. If "
"Heronus were to cease producing new ships, the Soromid would suffer a "
"tremendous blow to their military capabilities. Needless to say, Heronus "
"Nidus is one of the most heavily armed stations in Soromid space."
msgstr ""
"El Nido Heronus es una base militar vinculada directamente a Heronus. Su "
"deber principal es proteger el planeta, ya que es vital para la flota "
"Soromida. Si Heronus dejara de producir nuevas naves, Soromida sufriría un "
"tremendo golpe en sus capacidades militares. No hace falta decir que el Nido "
"Heronus es una de las estaciones más armadas del espacio Soromida."

msgid ""
"A large viewport gives a magnificent view of the young ships that "
"occasionally lift off from Heronus. There's something about the sheen of a "
"ship that has not yet undergone treatment at Ebenezer that particularly "
"catches the eye."
msgstr ""
"Un gran mirador ofrece una magnífica vista de las jóvenes naves que de vez "
"en cuando despegan de Heronus. Hay algo en el brillo de una nave que aún no "
"ha sido tratada en Ebenezer que llama especialmente la atención."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Highland"
msgstr "Alto"

msgid ""
"One of the few industrial backbones of what once was the Yetmer-O'rez "
"family, Highland has become the primary supplier of weapons and ships to "
"House O'rez. There are many military checkpoints throughout the planet, and "
"many of the factories have strict access controls so as to minimize sabotage "
"and spies, which they had significant problems with at the beginning of the "
"war."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Highland Cafe is not quite up to the pre-war standards, however, the "
"portions are surprisingly generous. Most patrons here pilot transport ships, "
"but on occasion military pilots show up too. The ambiance is quite somber, "
"as if everyone has things to do and places to be that don't allow them to "
"fully relax."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hikatalat"
msgstr "Hikatalat"

msgid ""
"Hikatalat used to be a resource world, before the rise of the Empire. But "
"over time the colony was deemed to be unprofitable, and operations ceased. "
"The world is still inhabited today, but its only value now lies in "
"territorial control for Dvaered Warlords. The population is poor and lives "
"in bad circumstances. There's nothing much to do here for offworlders."
msgstr ""
"Hikatalat solía ser un mundo de recursos, antes del surgimiento del Imperio. "
"Pero con el paso del tiempo se consideró que la colonia no era rentable, y "
"las operaciones cesaron. El mundo sigue habitado hoy en día, pero su único "
"valor reside ahora en el control territorial para los Señores de la Guerra "
"de Dvaered. La población es pobre y vive en malas condiciones. No hay mucho "
"que hacer aquí para los extranjeros."

msgid "Holly I"
msgstr "Acebo I"

msgid "F"
msgstr "F"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Holly system is one of those statistical flukes that is almost bound to "
"happen somewhere in the galaxy. Holly I is one of the trinary planetary "
"system that currently exists here. Scientists have long predicted that the "
"system will become unstable, especially with all the mining activity over "
"the years, but there has been no appreciable change and so the miners "
"continue, many arguing that their activities are actually contributing to "
"the stability here!\n"
"Holly I itself is heavily volcanic and, aside from the extensive mining "
"operations, has little to recommend it, having a largely toxic and corrosive "
"atmosphere, lava flows all over the place, no water, thick clouds and, just "
"to put a real damper on things, frequent and new volcanoes erupting daily. "
"Even the miners consider living here a job, one that is absolutely worth it "
"but few consider bringing family here, never mind starting one.\n"
"Holly I also, along with its siblings Holly II and Holly III, are assets of "
"the Mining Vrata - the most influential of the mining guilds in the known "
"galaxy."
msgstr ""
"El sistema Acebo es una de esas casualidades estadísticas que casi siempre "
"ocurren en algún lugar de la galaxia. Acebo I es uno de los sistemas "
"planetarios trinarios que existen actualmente. Los científicos llevan mucho "
"tiempo prediciendo que el sistema se volverá inestable, especialmente con "
"toda la actividad minera que ha habido a lo largo de los años, pero no ha "
"habido ningún cambio apreciable y por eso los mineros continúan, ¡muchos "
"argumentan: !Las actividades en realidad están contribuyendo a la "
"estabilidad del lugar!\n"
"Acebo I es fuertemente volcánico y, aparte de las extensas explotaciones "
"mineras, no tiene mucho que ofrecer: una atmósfera tóxica y corrosiva, ríos "
"de lava por todas partes, ausencia de agua, densas nubes y, para colmo, "
"frecuentes erupciones diarias. Incluso los mineros consideran que vivir aquí "
"es un trabajo, uno que merece la pena, pero pocos se plantean traer una "
"familia, por no hablar de empezar una.\n"
"Además, Acebo I, junto con sus hermanas Acebo II y Acebo III, son activos de "
"la Vrata Minera, el gremio minero más influyente de la galaxia conocida."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Largely a dive where people drown their sorrows or celebrate anything they "
"can think of to pass their off-hours. The karaoke is, predictably, bad, "
"though, according to the chalked comments on the wall, it is decidedly "
"better than the comedy or poetry sessions!\n"
"Curiously the garden that the bar looks onto is rather artfully designed, "
"making great use of the backdrop of gas clouds, lava, and volcanoes while "
"clearly being a contrast to the destructive forces outside the confines of "
"the Mining Vrata Colony."
msgstr ""
"Un antro donde la gente ahoga sus penas o celebra cualquier cosa que se les "
"ocurra para pasar las horas muertas. El karaoke es, como era de esperar, "
"malo, aunque, según los comentarios grabados en la pared, es mucho mejor que "
"las sesiones de comedia o poesía.\n"
"Curiosamente, el jardín al que da el bar está diseñado con mucho arte, "
"aprovechando el telón de fondo de nubes de gas, lava y volcanes, a la vez "
"que contrasta claramente con las fuerzas destructivas fuera de los confines "
"de la Colonia Vrata Minera."

msgid "Holly II"
msgstr "Acebo II"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Holly system is one of those statistical flukes that is almost bound to "
"happen somewhere in the galaxy. Holly II is one of the trinary planetary "
"system that currently exists here. Scientists have long predicted that the "
"system will become unstable, especially with all the mining activity over "
"the years, but there has been no appreciable change and so the miners "
"continue, many arguing that their activities are actually contributing to "
"the stability here!\n"
"With Holly II having been created at much the same time and from much the "
"same material as its siblings Holly I and Holly III it is similarly heavily "
"volcanic and, aside from the extensive mining operations, has little to "
"recommend it, having a toxic and corrosive atmosphere, volcanoes erupting "
"daily and lava running down the valleys and cooling in the basins that shift "
"regularly. Those living here seem to have adapted by spending time outside "
"of working hours cultivating a healthy interest in all the most time "
"consuming indoor activities that the galaxy has to offer."
msgstr ""
"El sistema Acebo es una de esas casualidades estadísticas que casi siempre "
"ocurren en algún lugar de la galaxia. Acebo I es uno de los sistemas "
"planetarios trinarios que existen actualmente. Los científicos llevan mucho "
"tiempo prediciendo que el sistema se volverá inestable, especialmente con "
"toda la actividad minera que ha habido a lo largo de los años, pero no ha "
"habido ningún cambio apreciable y por eso los mineros continúan, ¡muchos "
"argumentan: !Las actividades en realidad están contribuyendo a la "
"estabilidad del lugar!\n"
"Acebo II fue creado casi al mismo tiempo y con los mismos materiales que sus "
"hermanas Acebo I y Acebo III, por lo que es muy volcánica y, aparte de las "
"extensas explotaciones mineras, tiene poco que recomendar: su atmósfera es "
"tóxica y corrosiva, los volcanes erupcionan a diario y la lava corre por los "
"valles y se enfría en las cuencas, que se mueven con regularidad. Los que "
"viven aquí parecen haberse adaptado pasando el tiempo fuera de las horas de "
"trabajo cultivando un sano interés en todas las actividades de interiores de "
"las que ofrece la galaxia."

msgid ""
"A high-class, though schizophrenic, looking bar with at seat service by "
"servers wearing some very impressive costumes of every sort under the sun. "
"It appears they compete to create the most impressive look they can with the "
"tables they serve matching the style of their costumes. The results "
"patchwork is rather jarring but novel, to say the least, and with clearly a "
"lot of effort put in to create and maintain every aspect… probably to "
"distract the patrons from the hard labour and life threatening conditions "
"they face working here."
msgstr ""
"Un bar de clase alta, aunque de aspecto esquizofrénico, atendido por "
"camareros ataviados con impresionantes disfraces de todo tipo. Parece que "
"compiten por crear el aspecto más impresionante que pueden usar emparejado "
"con el estilo de las mesas a las que sirven. El resultado es un mosaico "
"bastante chocante pero novedoso, por no decir otra cosa, y está claro que se "
"ha invertido mucho esfuerzo en crear y mantener cada aspecto... "
"probablemente para distraer a los clientes de las duras condiciones "
"laborales y de vida o muerte a las que se enfrentan trabajando aquí."

msgid "Holly III"
msgstr "Acebo III"

msgid ""
"The Holly system is one of those statistical flukes that is almost bound to "
"happen somewhere in the galaxy. Holly III is one of the trinary planetary "
"system that currently exists here. Scientists have long predicted that the "
"system will become unstable, especially with all the mining activity over "
"the years, but there has been no appreciable change and so the miners "
"continue, many arguing that their activities are actually contributing to "
"the stability here!\n"
"Holly III, Holly II and Holly I were named by the original mining pioneer "
"who either had no imagination or an obsession and having since never been "
"renamed by the miners that congregate here, possibly as a reminder of the "
"that they should only tarry in this system while they make large sums mining "
"the ore-rich surfaces of the planets and then move on lest they also "
"succumb. Due to this concentration of miners, the galaxy's largest mining "
"guild, the Mining Vrata, established its headquarters in the system."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As you enter from the near silence of the main concourse you are greeted by "
"a wonderfully melodic sound, calming and yet lyrical. The entire bar is made "
"up of small \"enclaves\" with some sort of sound curtain which lets you "
"overhear a litany of different musical styles as people move in and out of "
"their little, for want of a better word, comfort zones. The bartender is a "
"some sort of robot but seems to have been designed such that the hums of its "
"movements have been tuned so as to create a shifting harmonious cascade as "
"it prepares your order."
msgstr ""
"Al entrar, desde el casi silencio del vestíbulo principal, te recibe un "
"sonido maravillosamente melódico, calmante y lírico a la vez. Todo el bar "
"está formado por pequeños \"enclaves\" con una especie de cortina de sonido "
"que permite escuchar una letanía de diferentes estilos musicales a medida "
"que la gente entra y sale de sus pequeñas, a falta de una palabra mejor, "
"zonas de confort. El camarero es una especie de robot, pero parece haber "
"sido diseñado de tal manera que los zumbidos de sus movimientos se han "
"afinado para crear una cascada armónica cambiante mientras prepara tu pedido."

msgid "House Za'lek Central"
msgstr "Central de la Casa Za'lek"

msgid ""
"This station was once the nerve centre of the entirety of House Za'lek. It "
"still is to an extent, but with the move of much the Za'lek government to "
"Ruadan, this station's become something of a secondary capital. Most day to "
"day business of running the Great House still takes place here."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación fue en su día el centro neurálgico de toda la Casa Za'lek. Lo "
"sigue siendo hasta cierto punto, pero con el traslado de gran parte del "
"gobierno Za'lek a Ruadan, esta estación se ha convertido en una especie de "
"capital secundaria. La mayor parte de los asuntos cotidianos de la Gran Casa "
"siguen teniendo lugar aquí."

msgid ""
"This bar seems to double as a conference hall, with many Za'lek university "
"deans and government officials (more often than not being represented by the "
"same people) meeting with each other as well as foreign trade leaders and "
"dignitaries. The food and drink here is of course top notch, but not "
"extravagant."
msgstr ""
"Este bar parece hacer las veces de sala de conferencias, ya que en él se "
"reúnen muchos decanos de universidades de Za'lek y funcionarios del gobierno "
"(la mayoría de las veces representados por las mismas personas), así como "
"líderes comerciales y dignatarios extranjeros. La comida y la bebida son, "
"por supuesto, de primera calidad, pero no extravagantes."

msgid "Hrimfaxi"
msgstr "Hrimfaxi"

msgid "HS-224"
msgstr "HS-224"

msgid ""
"This is a Thurion habitation station, which provide the living space for the "
"biological Thurians who have yet to be uploaded. While not opulent by any "
"extent, they are not at all an unpleasant place to live."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una estación habitacional Turion, que proporciona el espacio vital "
"para los Turianos biológicos que aún no han sido subidos. Aunque no son "
"opulentas en absoluto, no son un lugar desagradable para vivir."

msgid ""
"The Thurion \"bar\" is really not so much of a bar, considering that no "
"alcohol is sold. Still, this is a place where biological Thurions socialize "
"and enjoy foods and drinks safe for the brain."
msgstr ""
"El \"bar\" Turion no es realmente un bar, ya que no se vende alcohol. Aun "
"así, es un lugar donde los Turion biológicos socializan y disfrutan de "
"comidas y bebidas seguras para el cerebro."

msgid "HS-232"
msgstr "HS-232"

msgid "HS-24"
msgstr "HS-24"

msgid "HS-37"
msgstr "HS-37"

msgid "HS-5"
msgstr "HS-5"

msgid "HS-51"
msgstr "HS-51"

msgid ""
"This airless, low-gravity moon serves as a modest civilian space borne "
"shipyard. It was dubbed cheaper and less effort to get ships to and from the "
"surface of Jurai. There is little of interest to experienced captains, but "
"younger pilots, primarily from Jurai, flock here."
msgstr ""
"Esta luna sin aire y de baja gravedad sirve como modesto astillero espacial "
"civil. Se consideró que era más barato y que suponía menos esfuerzo llevar "
"las naves desde y hacia la superficie de Jurai. Hay poco de interés para los "
"capitanes experimentados, pero los pilotos más jóvenes, principalmente de "
"Jurai, llegan en masa a este lugar."

msgid ""
"This bar is even more of a mess than usual for a Za'lek world. The clientele "
"are young, and congregate around the randomly-placed tables and chairs "
"enthusiastically arguing over a myriad of subjects. Unlike most Za'lek "
"worlds, there are few scientists here."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es aún más desordenado de lo habitual para un mundo Za'lek. La "
"clientela es joven y se congrega en torno a las mesas y sillas colocadas al "
"azar discutiendo con entusiasmo sobre un sinfín de temas. A diferencia de la "
"mayoría de los mundos Za'lek, aquí hay pocos científicos."

msgid "HS-54"
msgstr "HS-54"

msgid "Huan'xi"
msgstr "Huan'xi"

msgid ""
"Huan'xi may be a relatively remote planet, but it has a thriving "
"agriculture. The planet's soil is extremely fertile, allowing for multiple "
"crops per cycle. The planet also exports unique foodstuffs that are "
"difficult to produce elsewhere. Indeed, one can find \"genuine Huan'xi "
"products\" in food outlets all over the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Huan'xi puede ser un planeta relativamente remoto, pero tiene una "
"agricultura próspera. El suelo del planeta es extremadamente fértil, lo que "
"permite obtener múltiples cosechas por ciclo. El planeta también exporta "
"productos alimenticios únicos que son difíciles de producir en otros "
"lugares. De hecho, se pueden encontrar \"productos genuinos de Huan'xi\" en "
"los puntos de venta de alimentos de toda la galaxia."

msgid ""
"The rustic feel of this bar is the product of a careful choice of "
"appointments, music and holographic illusions. The owner clearly feels that "
"customers will be attracted by the atmosphere of his establishments, rather "
"than by the drinks he serves."
msgstr ""
"El ambiente rústico de este bar es producto de una cuidadosa elección de las "
"citas, la música y las ilusiones holográficas. El propietario piensa "
"claramente que los clientes se sentirán atraídos por el ambiente de sus "
"establecimientos, más que por las bebidas que sirve."

msgid "Hubfar Citadel"
msgstr "Ciudadela Hubfar"

msgid ""
"Originally an Imperial base, it was turned over to the Dvaered as part of "
"the agreement when House Dvaered was formed. The core of the station follows "
"traditional Imperial designs, while the additional wings and barracks are "
"much more functional and crude, breaking the little harmony the original "
"design had. The citadel is used exert Dvaered influence on the norther "
"border of Dvaered space and has several large platoons and squadrons ready "
"to be sent to instill peace at a moments notice."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente una base Imperial, fue entregada a los Dvaered como parte del "
"acuerdo cuando se formó la Casa Dvaered. El núcleo de la estación sigue el "
"diseño Imperial tradicional, mientras que las alas y barracones adicionales "
"son mucho más funcionales y toscos, rompiendo la poca armonía que tenía el "
"diseño original. La ciudadela se utiliza para ejercer la influencia Dvaered "
"en la frontera norte del espacio Dvaered y cuenta con varios grandes "
"pelotones y escuadrones listos para ser enviados a infundir la paz en cuanto "
"se les avise."

msgid ""
"Although the bar is in the Imperial part of the station, it has been "
"reformed from the inside out and rebranded as the Hubfar Beer Garden. There "
"is always an assortment of merry soldiers munching down on all sorts of "
"hearty foods with beer constantly flowing. Not a bad place if you are into "
"that sort of stuff."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el bar está en la parte Imperial de la estación, ha sido reformado de "
"dentro a fuera y rebautizado como Jardín de la Cerveza Hubfar. Siempre hay "
"un surtido de alegres soldados comiendo todo tipo de comidas sustanciosas y "
"cerveza a raudales. No es mal sitio si te gustan esas cosas."

msgid "Hubfar I"
msgstr "Hubfar I"

msgid "Humdrum I"
msgstr "Humdrum I"

msgid "Humdrum II"
msgstr "Humdrum II"

msgid "Humdrum III"
msgstr "Humdrum III"

msgid "Hurada"
msgstr "Hurada"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A formerly-promising world; following intense volcanic activity, a shift in "
"Hurada's centre of gravity caused its orbit to decay, increasing surface "
"temperatures severely and all but eradicating natural surface life. Hurada "
"only maintains a population due to its proximity to Arcturus, providing "
"affordable housing for reserve military troops. Not knowing when more "
"volcanic activity will send Hurada into the nearby star ensures that the "
"prices stay low."
msgstr ""
"Un mundo antes prometedor; tras una intensa actividad volcánica, un cambio "
"en el centro de gravedad de Hurada hizo que su órbita decayera, aumentando "
"gravemente las temperaturas de la superficie y erradicando prácticamente la "
"vida natural de la superficie. Hurada sólo mantiene una población debido a "
"su proximidad a Arcturus, proporcionando viviendas asequibles para las "
"tropas militares de reserva. El hecho de no saber cuándo la actividad "
"volcánica enviará a Hurada a la estrella cercana asegura que los precios se "
"mantengan bajos."

msgid ""
"The Hurada bar is large, yet nearly deserted. The booth seats in the back "
"have long been unused, and have collected a layer of dust in that time. The "
"brews are stale, and the bartender doesn't look like he wants to be here."
msgstr ""
"El bar Hurada es grande, pero está casi desierto. Los asientos del fondo "
"llevan mucho tiempo sin utilizarse y han acumulado una capa de polvo. Las "
"cervezas están rancias y el camarero no parece querer estar aquí."

msgid "Hurne Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Hurne"

msgid ""
"Hurne Monastery is a commercial centre for this region of Sirius space. It "
"serves as a local commodity exchange as well as a warehouse for traders with "
"a long-term strategy. Traders coming from the Frontier often stop by this "
"place, as it is the closest commerce station to the Frontier-Sirius border."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Hurne es un centro comercial para esta región del espacio "
"Sirio. Sirve como bolsa de productos locales, así como de almacén para los "
"comerciantes con una estrategia a largo plazo. Los comerciantes que vienen "
"de la Frontera se detienen a menudo en este lugar, ya que es la estación "
"comercial más cercana a la zona Frontera-Sirio."

msgid ""
"As is common on commerce stations, the spacedock bar is both a place to do "
"business and a place to hear the latest rumours about the state of the "
"galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Como es habitual en las estaciones de comercio, el bar de la estación "
"espacial es a la vez un lugar para hacer negocios y un lugar para escuchar "
"los últimos rumores sobre el estado de la galaxia."

msgid "Hypergate Dvaer"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Dvaer"

msgid "Construction"
msgstr "Construcción"

msgid "Construct"
msgstr "Construir"

msgid "Hypergate Feye"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Feye"

msgid "Hypergate Gamma Polaris"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Gamma Polaris"

msgid "Hypergate Haven"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Refugio"

msgid "Hypergate Kiwi"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Kiwi"

msgid "Hypergate NGC-14549"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta NGC-14549"

msgid "Hypergate Polaris"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Polaris"

msgid "Ruined Hypergate"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta En Ruinas"

msgid "Hypergate Protera"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Protera"

msgid ""
"The sprawling structure of what seems to have been once a colossal "
"hypergate, but lies in complete ruins. Most of the structure is "
"unrecognizable with deep scars and burns, however, there is a small area "
"that seems to have been slightly refurbished and you can dock your ship. "
"Surprisingly enough, some basic electronics are working, although it seems "
"like no part is from the original structure, and some makeshift atmosphere "
"generator allows moving around without a HEV suit. Not the greatest place to "
"land, but at least you can siphon fuel to refuel your ship."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A small atmospherized room that was once tidied up. There are some rotten "
"remains of food left out and clear signs that nobody other than you has been "
"here in ages. It might have been cozy at one point at time, but it looks "
"fairly neglected now."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hypergate Ruadan"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta Ruadan"

msgid "Hystera I"
msgstr "Hystera I"

msgid "Hystera Ia"
msgstr "Hystera Ia"

msgid "Hystera II"
msgstr "Hystera II"

msgid "HZMM-01"
msgstr "HZMM-01"

msgid ""
"This small moon is a mining world run by House Za'lek; it is regarded as so "
"insignificant that it does not even have a formal name yet, and likely never "
"will."
msgstr ""
"Esta pequeña luna es un mundo minero dirigido por la Casa Za'lek; se "
"considera tan insignificante que ni siquiera tiene un nombre formal todavía, "
"y probablemente nunca lo tendrá."

msgid "HZNSS-1"
msgstr "EESHZ-1"

msgid ""
"This agristation is the first in a series of stations built by House Za'lek "
"to mimic the successful INSS system in the Empire. Because there are so many "
"Za'lek worlds that are incapable of supporting themselves without outside "
"assistance, the stations become mandatory to feed the people there. Unlike "
"its successors, HZNSS-1 has a research centre with a large conservatory "
"containing a diversity of modified and rare plants which attracts many "
"curious civilians from the area around."
msgstr ""
"Esta agristación es la primera de una serie de estaciones construidas por la "
"Casa Za'lek para imitar el exitoso sistema EENI en el Imperio. Dado que hay "
"muchos mundos Za'lek que son incapaces de mantenerse sin ayuda exterior, las "
"estaciones son obligatorias para alimentar a sus habitantes. A diferencia de "
"sus sucesoras, EESHZ-1 tiene un centro de investigación con un gran "
"conservatorio que contiene una diversidad de plantas modificadas y raras que "
"atrae a muchos civiles curiosos de los alrededores."

msgid ""
"This bar has a series of botanists and scientists arguing over some degree "
"of minutia while several of the laymen around the edges of the bar ignore "
"them, occasionally rolling their eyes at the louder declarations. Even so, "
"none of it seems to make sense to you."
msgstr ""
"En este bar hay una serie de botánicos y científicos discutiendo sobre "
"alguna minucia mientras varios de los legos que se encuentran en los bordes "
"del bar los ignoran, poniendo ocasionalmente los ojos en blanco ante las "
"declaraciones más ruidosas. Aun así, nada de esto parece tener sentido para "
"ti."

msgid "HZNSS-2"
msgstr "EENHZ-2"

msgid ""
"Another entry in the House Za'lek Nutrition Space Station program. Nothing "
"of note really exists here; it is solely an extension of the House's economy."
msgstr ""
"Otra entrada en el programa de la Estación Espacial de Nutrición de la Casa "
"Za'lek. Aquí no existe nada realmente destacable; es únicamente una "
"extensión de la economía de la Casa."

msgid "HZNSS-3"
msgstr "EENHZ-3"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of House Za'lek's nutrition stations, this simple agristation services "
"the local sector, augmenting what worlds are unable to feed themselves."
msgstr ""
"Una de las estaciones de nutrición de la Casa Za'lek, esta simple "
"agristación da servicio al sector local, incrementando lo que los mundos no "
"pueden obtener por sí mismos."

msgid "Ian"
msgstr "Ian"

msgid ""
"Serving as the main consumer world on the Western fringe of Empire space, "
"Ian makes up for its small size by its wealth. The little sphere is quite a "
"pleasant place to live and many retiring Imperial officials and aristocrats "
"have made the place their home. And where wealth goes, industry follows - "
"Ian has its own modest ship construction facilities."
msgstr ""
"Como principal mundo consumidor en la franja occidental del espacio del "
"Imperio, Ian compensa su pequeño tamaño con su riqueza. La pequeña esfera es "
"un lugar bastante agradable para vivir y muchos funcionarios y aristócratas "
"Imperiales que se jubilan han hecho de este lugar su hogar. Y donde va la "
"riqueza, va la industria: Ian tiene sus propias y modestas instalaciones de "
"construcción de naves."

msgid ""
"On Ian, it's all about being seen. The bar never goes quiet, though the "
"level of noise also never grows to uncivilized proportions. Both the gentry "
"and the rich up-starts come to the recreational facilities to mingle and to "
"strut their stuff to the offworlders who come here on business."
msgstr ""
"En Ian, todo es cuestión de ser visto. El bar nunca está tranquilo, aunque "
"el nivel de ruido tampoco alcanza proporciones incivilizadas. Tanto la alta "
"burguesía como los ricos advenedizos acuden a las instalaciones recreativas "
"para mezclarse y pavonearse ante los extranjeros que vienen por negocios."

msgid "Ianella I"
msgstr "Ianella I"

msgid "Ianella I-a"
msgstr "Ianella I-a"

msgid ""
"The only moon of Ianella to have a landable surface, Ianella I-a would have "
"been colonized by now if it had not been skimming the surface of Ianella I's "
"ionosphere. Constant electrical storms and extreme static electricity would "
"make living on Ianella I-a be a never ending cycle of repairing broken "
"electrical components. Combined with the lack of atmosphere and necessity to "
"have active life support systems, living on Ianella I-a would amount to "
"never knowing when your life systems would fail, condemning you to slow "
"suffocation."
msgstr ""
"La única luna de Ianella que tiene superficie terrestre, Ianella I-a, ya "
"habría sido colonizada si no hubiera estado rozando la superficie de la "
"ionosfera de Ianella I. Las constantes tormentas eléctricas y la extrema "
"electricidad estática harían que vivir en Ianella I-a fuera un ciclo "
"interminable de reparación de componentes eléctricos rotos. Combinado con la "
"falta de atmósfera y la necesidad de tener sistemas de soporte vital "
"activos, vivir en Ianella I-a equivaldría a no saber nunca cuándo fallarían "
"tus sistemas vitales, condenándote a una lenta asfixia."

msgid "Ianella I-b"
msgstr "Ianella I-b"

msgid "Ianella I-c"
msgstr "Ianella I-c"

msgid "Ianella III"
msgstr "Ianella III"

msgid "Ianella IV"
msgstr "Ianella IV"

msgid ""
"Ianella IV was colonized early in the Second Growth given its naturally high "
"habitability index. However, planet topology consisting of a soft outer "
"mantle with heavy active seismic activity have limited the types of "
"constructions that are feasible to maintain on the planet. This has lead to "
"a low population density and a focus on agriculture as a prime export. After "
"the Incident, the loss of critical trade and concentration of refugees has "
"led Ianella IV to experience a growth in both population and agricultural "
"output, now playing an important role in feeding many nearby planets and "
"stations. Despite a significant increase in population from refugees, "
"Ianella IV has not succumbed to issues in overpopulation or supply demands."
msgstr ""
"Ianella IV fue colonizada a principios del Segundo Crecimiento dado su alto "
"índice de habitabilidad natural. Sin embargo, la topología del planeta, "
"consistente en un manto exterior blando con una fuerte actividad sísmica, ha "
"limitado los tipos de construcciones que es factible mantener en el planeta. "
"Esto ha llevado a una baja densidad de población y a centrarse en la "
"agricultura como principal producto de exportación. Tras el Incidente, la "
"pérdida de comercio crítico y la concentración de refugiados ha llevado a "
"Ianella IV a experimentar un crecimiento tanto en población como en "
"producción agrícola, desempeñando ahora un papel importante en la "
"alimentación de muchos planetas y estaciones cercanas. A pesar del "
"significativo aumento de población debido a los refugiados, Ianella IV no ha "
"sucumbido a los problemas de superpoblación o demanda de suministros."

msgid ""
"Although remodeled recently, the spaceport bar reminisces about the origins "
"and past of the planet. From the early settlers who immigrated and built the "
"first city, to said destruction of first city in a major earthquake, and the "
"establishment of Ianella IV as an agricultural low population density world. "
"Local trinkets, baubles, and traditional farming utensils litter the walls, "
"giving it a rustic and homely look."
msgstr ""
"Aunque remodelado recientemente, el bar del puerto espacial rememora los "
"orígenes y el pasado del planeta. Desde los primeros colonos que emigraron y "
"construyeron la primera ciudad, pasando por la destrucción de ésta en un "
"gran terremoto, hasta el establecimiento de Ianella IV como un mundo "
"agrícola de baja densidad de población. Baratijas locales, adornos y "
"utensilios agrícolas tradicionales pueblan las paredes, dándole un aspecto "
"rústico y hogareño."

msgid "Icarus"
msgstr "Icaro"

msgid ""
"Named after the figure from Greek mythology, Icarus is a hot world with "
"extreme seismic activity. This makes it the perfect location for some of "
"Totoran's volcanic-themed arenas. Gladiators fighting on Icarus have as much "
"to fear from the environment as they have from each other, and the most "
"spectacular kills made in the arenas here involve the unstable terrain "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Llamado así por la figura de la mitología griega, Ícaro es un mundo caliente "
"con una actividad sísmica extrema. Esto lo convierte en el lugar perfecto "
"para algunas de las arenas de temática volcánica de Totoran. Los gladiadores "
"que luchan en Ícaro tienen tanto que temer al entorno como a los demás, y "
"las muertes más espectaculares que se producen en las arenas tienen que ver "
"con el terreno inestable."

msgid "Idio"
msgstr "Idio"

msgid ""
"Idio is a densely populated world, but not a particularly rich one. It just "
"so happens that the planet offers a lot of buildable terrain and little in "
"the way of natural hazards, so it's an attractive place to live."
msgstr ""
"Idio es un mundo densamente poblado, pero no especialmente rico. Sucede que "
"el planeta ofrece mucho terreno edificable y pocos peligros naturales, por "
"lo que es un lugar atractivo para vivir."

msgid ""
"For some reason, whenever you order a drink here, you always get a different "
"one. It seems to be some kind of running joke."
msgstr ""
"Por alguna razón, cada vez que pides una bebida aquí, siempre te dan una "
"diferente. Parece ser una especie de broma."

msgid "Imk"
msgstr "Imk"

msgid "Impala"
msgstr "Impala"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This lonely outpost was once an active space-based research and development "
"centre. Since the congregation of scientists to Ruadan, it has been all but "
"abandoned. Its sole purpose now is as a refuelling stop in the sparsely-"
"populated south of Za'lek space."
msgstr ""
"Este solitario puesto de avanzada fue una vez un activo centro de "
"investigación y desarrollo espacial. Desde la congregación de científicos en "
"Ruadan, ha sido prácticamente abandonado. Su único propósito ahora es servir "
"de parada para repostar en el escasamente poblado sur del espacio Za'lek."

msgid "Inca"
msgstr "Inca"

msgid "Infinity III"
msgstr "Infinito III"

msgid "Infinity IV"
msgstr "Infinito IV"

msgid "Infinity VII"
msgstr "Infinito VII"

msgid "Ingot I"
msgstr "Lingote I"

msgid "Inios Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Inios"

msgid ""
"Inios Monastery is something like a border guard between Sirius and Dvaered "
"controlled territories. Though officially not a military complex, Inios does "
"garrison far more combat capable ships that one might expect of a commercial "
"station. Whenever the Dvaered send in skirmish fleets to try the Sirius "
"defences, it is Inios Monastery that sends them on their way home."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Inios es algo así como un guardia fronteriza entre los "
"territorios controlados por Sirio y Dvaered. Aunque oficialmente no es un "
"complejo militar, Inios cuenta con una guarnición de naves mucho más capaces "
"de combatir de lo que cabría esperar de una estación comercial. Cada vez que "
"los Dvaered envían flotas de escaramuzas para poner a prueba las defensas de "
"Sirio, el Monasterio es Inios la que los envía de vuelta a casa."

msgid ""
"The bar is built against an outer wall. Several large windows allow patrons "
"to look out on the frozen wastes of Eye of Night III, the planet around "
"which the station orbits. Not coincidentally, the windows also allow people "
"to see the Sirius armed forces docking and taking off, emphasizing the "
"military capacity of the station."
msgstr ""
"El bar está construido contra una pared exterior. Varias ventanas grandes "
"permiten a los clientes contemplar los desechos helados de Ojo de la Noche "
"III, el planeta alrededor del cual orbita la estación. No por casualidad, "
"las ventanas también permiten ver a las fuerzas armadas de Sirio atracando y "
"despegando, enfatizando la capacidad militar de la estación."

msgid "INSS-1"
msgstr "EENI-1"

msgid ""
"INSS-1, or Imperial Nutrient Supply Station 1, was the first in a number of "
"Imperially funded space-side crop growing projects. The main purpose of the "
"station is to grow food for nearby colonies and stations at extreme "
"efficiency."
msgstr ""
"EENI-1, o Estación Espacial de Nutrición Imperial 1, fue el primero de una "
"serie de proyectos de cultivo en el espacio financiados por el Imperio. El "
"objetivo principal de la estación es cultivar alimentos para las colonias y "
"estaciones cercanas con una eficiencia extrema."

msgid ""
"Trim and functional, the bar here is situated in the central growing dome of "
"INSS-1 The windows look out on vast stretches of multi-layered crop beds, "
"and there's always a harvester to be seen at work somewhere out there."
msgstr ""

msgid "INSS-2"
msgstr "EENI-2"

msgid ""
"INSS-2, or Imperial Nutrient Supply Station 2, was built in this remote "
"section of space to compensate for the lack of farming output in the sector. "
"Food is not a very profitable commodity to trade over long distances, and "
"the colonies in Nartur found themselves limited in their growth due to "
"chronic shortages. INSS-2 has allowed them to grow."
msgstr ""
"La EENI-2, o Estación Espacial de Nutrición Imperial 2, se construyó en esta "
"sección remota del espacio para compensar la falta de producción agrícola en "
"el sector. Los alimentos no son un producto muy rentable para comerciar a "
"larga distancia, y las colonias de Nartur se vieron limitadas en su "
"crecimiento debido a la escasez crónica. La EENI-2 les ha permitido crecer."

msgid ""
"Trim and functional, the bar here is situated in the central growing dome of "
"INSS-2 The windows look out on vast stretches of multi-layered crop beds, "
"and there's always a harvester to be seen at work somewhere out there."
msgstr ""

msgid "INSS-3"
msgstr "EENI-3"

msgid ""
"Somewhat curiously, Imperial Nutrient Supply Station 3 is actually owned by "
"House Dvaered. Though initially constructed by the Empire, the station was "
"ceded to House Dvaered as part of its official inception. INSS-3 still "
"provides food for the Imperial colonies at Virgo and Van Maanen, though the "
"price of food there has gone up by a fair margin ever since the change in "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"Curiosamente, la Estación Espacial de Nutrición Imperial 3 es en realidad "
"propiedad de la Casa Dvaered. Aunque inicialmente fue construida por el "
"Imperio, la estación fue cedida a la Casa Dvaered como parte de su creación "
"oficial. La EENI-3 sigue suministrando alimentos a las colonias imperiales "
"de Virgo y Van Maanen, aunque el precio de los alimentos ha subido bastante "
"desde el cambio de propiedad."

msgid ""
"The bar is not much to speak of. The Dvaered have shown a greater interest "
"in farming than in public relations, so the spaceport bar has been largely "
"neglected. It's a wonder the basic facilities are even functional at all."
msgstr ""
"El bar no tiene mucho que decir. Los Dvaered han mostrado un mayor interés "
"en la agricultura que en las relaciones públicas, por lo que el bar del "
"puerto espacial ha sido descuidado en gran medida. Es una maravilla que las "
"instalaciones básicas sean funcionales."

msgid "Isador"
msgstr "Isador"

msgid "Jaan"
msgstr "Jaan"

msgid ""
"Jaan is one of the most densely populated planets in this corner of the "
"galaxy. The world benefits greatly from nearby Nexus operations, which makes "
"it a popular place to live despite the environmental issues that inevitably "
"come with a large population, and the problems with security that have "
"arisen in recent cycles."
msgstr ""
"Jaan es uno de los planetas más densamente poblados de este rincón de la "
"galaxia. El mundo se beneficia en gran medida de las operaciones cercanas de "
"Nexus, lo que lo convierte en un lugar popular para vivir a pesar de los "
"problemas medioambientales que inevitablemente conlleva una gran población, "
"y de los problemas de seguridad que han surgido en los últimos ciclos."

msgid ""
"Jaan has a big spaceport, and to facilitate the many pilots and crews that "
"pass through it has multiple spaceport bars. Each spaceport bar is exactly "
"the same as all the others, though. Not even the people who frequently visit "
"Jaan can tell them apart. This regularly causes problems for unsuspecting "
"people who promised to meet at the spaceport bar."
msgstr ""
"Jaan tiene un gran puerto espacial, y para facilitar el paso de los muchos "
"pilotos y tripulaciones tiene múltiples bares de puerto espacial. Sin "
"embargo, cada bar del puerto espacial es exactamente igual a los demás. Ni "
"siquiera la gente que visita frecuentemente Jaan puede distinguirlos. Esto "
"suele causar problemas a los incautos que han prometido reunirse en el bar "
"del puerto espacial."

msgid "Jackson II"
msgstr "Jackson II"

msgid ""
"Originally planned to house Paxadon's heavy industries, technical "
"difficulties with unstable tectonics combined a with a local feud between "
"the echelons has kept Jackson II from any development. As the cycles have "
"passed, the surface has ended up littered with significant amounts of "
"surveying hardware used to build the different failed proposals that have "
"yet to bring development out of its impasse."
msgstr ""

msgid "Jackson V"
msgstr "Jackson V"

msgid "Jacqueline"
msgstr "Jacqueline"

msgid ""
"Though technically an oceanic world, Jacqueline's oceans are filled with "
"algae that absorb light and release toxic fumes into the planet's "
"atmosphere. The organic soup is so thick that the planet appears purple when "
"seen from space. The Soromid, true to form, have taken a great interest in "
"the local ecosystem. Some people believe they are conducting bio-experiments "
"here, treating the whole planet as a laboratory."
msgstr ""
"Aunque técnicamente es un mundo oceánico, los océanos de Jacqueline están "
"llenos de algas que absorben la luz y liberan gases tóxicos en la atmósfera "
"del planeta. La sopa orgánica es tan espesa que el planeta parece púrpura "
"cuando se ve desde el espacio. Los Soromida, fieles a su estilo, se han "
"interesado mucho por el ecosistema local. Algunos creen que están realizando "
"bioexperimentos aquí, tratando todo el planeta como un laboratorio."

msgid ""
"Though Jacqueline is a fascinating world (according to the Soromid anyway), "
"little can be seen of it for an ordinary ship captain visiting here. The "
"spaceport and its neighbouring habitation complex are completely shielded "
"from the outside environment, and any windows would soon be rendered opaque, "
"crusted over with residue from the toxic gases outside."
msgstr ""
"Aunque Jacqueline es un mundo fascinante (según los Soromida, al menos), "
"poco se puede ver de él para un capitán de nave corriente que lo visite. El "
"puerto espacial y su complejo habitacional vecino están completamente "
"protegidos del entorno exterior, y cualquier ventana pronto se vuelve opaca, "
"cubierta de residuos de los gases tóxicos del exterior."

msgid "Jade Court"
msgstr "Corte Jade"

msgid ""
"Jade Court is a large judiciary installation, and has gained significant "
"importance since the destruction of the Imperial Court in the Incident. "
"Though owned by the Empire, the station itself counts as neutral territory. "
"Cases here come from all over the galaxy, presided over by judges who are "
"not affiliated with any of the major factions. Typically, any large "
"international case that local law enforcement is unable to handle on its own "
"will be taken to Jade."
msgstr ""
"La Corte Jade es una gran instalación judicial y ha adquirido una "
"importancia significativa desde la destrucción de la Corte Imperial en el "
"Incidente. Aunque es propiedad del Imperio, la estación en sí cuenta como "
"territorio neutral. Los casos que se presentan aquí proceden de toda la "
"galaxia y están presididos por jueces que no están afiliados a ninguna de "
"las principales facciones. Normalmente, cualquier caso internacional de gran "
"envergadura que las fuerzas del orden locales no puedan tratar por sí mismas "
"se lleva a Jade."

msgid ""
"This is just mostly an ordinary bar that occasionally streams public trials "
"on holovid. The security is a bit tighter than most places, but it is rather "
"subtle. Most of the clientele are people coming to the trials as the judges "
"and lawyers all have their own private offices aboard the station, and do "
"not come here often."
msgstr ""
"Este bar no es más que un bar normal y corriente que de vez en cuando "
"retransmite juicios públicos en holovídeo. La seguridad es un poco más "
"estricta que en la mayoría de los lugares, pero es bastante sutil. La mayor "
"parte de la clientela son personas que acuden a los juicios, ya que los "
"jueces y abogados tienen sus propios despachos privados a bordo de la "
"estación y no acuden aquí a menudo."

msgid "Jade I"
msgstr "Jade I"

msgid "Jade II"
msgstr "Jade II"

msgid "Jade III"
msgstr "Jade III"

msgid "Jade VI"
msgstr "Jade VI"

msgid "Jaegnhild"
msgstr "Jaegnhild"

msgid ""
"There can almost be no greater contrast than there is between Jaegnhild and "
"its primary, Uuries. One is an ocean world, filled with all kinds of "
"unlikely forms of life, while the other is a lifeless chunk of coalesced "
"dust. Jaegnhild was one of the last colonies established in the First "
"Growth, but among all the chosen worlds it was perhaps the most suitable to "
"life when the colony ship arrived. Though not many call the floating cities "
"their home, the standard of living is unusually high for a Frontier world."
msgstr ""
"Casi no puede haber mayor contraste que el que existe entre Jaegnhild y su "
"principal, Uuries. Uno es un mundo oceánico, lleno de todo tipo de formas de "
"vida improbables, mientras que el otro es un trozo de polvo cohesionado sin "
"vida. Jaegnhild fue una de las últimas colonias establecidas en el Primer "
"Crecimiento, pero entre todos los mundos elegidos era quizá el más adecuado "
"para la vida cuando llegó la nave colonia. Aunque no son muchos los que "
"llaman a las ciudades flotantes su hogar, el nivel de vida es inusualmente "
"alto para un mundo Frontera."

msgid ""
"Jaegnhild's bar is built into an ancient compartment of the colony ship "
"Pristine, which brought the first human settlers to this world so long ago. "
"Though most of the structure has been rebuilt using newer materials, the "
"original plating can still be seen in places."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Jaegnhild está construido en un antiguo compartimento de la nave "
"colonial Pristine, que trajo a los primeros colonos humanos a este mundo "
"hace tanto tiempo. Aunque la mayor parte de la estructura ha sido "
"reconstruida con materiales más nuevos, todavía se puede ver el "
"revestimiento original en algunos lugares."

msgid "Jankelo"
msgstr "Jankelo"

msgid ""
"Jankelo is a world filled with all sorts of industry. It is utterly "
"uninhabitable even by the Soromid, but it has mineral deposits that make it "
"economically attractive for certain dirty industries to settle here."
msgstr ""
"Jankelo es un mundo lleno de todo tipo de industrias. Es totalmente "
"inhabitable incluso para los Soromida, pero tiene depósitos minerales que "
"hacen que sea económicamente atractivo para que se instalen aquí ciertas "
"industrias sucias."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is the only place where a normal spacer can go, other than "
"the spaceport docks themselves. Jankelo is such a hostile planet that "
"maintaining human friendly conditions is a considerable, and costly, "
"operation. Anyone who is not a trader or otherwise on business has no reason "
"to be here."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es el único lugar al que puede acudir un espacial "
"normal, aparte de los propios muelles del puerto espacial. Jankelo es un "
"planeta tan hostil que mantener las condiciones para los humanos es una "
"operación considerable y costosa. Cualquiera que no sea un comerciante o que "
"no esté en viaje de negocios no tiene ninguna razón para estar aquí."

msgid "Janko"
msgstr "Janko"

msgid ""
"Though a fairly pleasant planet, Janko is a little too backwater to really "
"flourish. The local population is largely self-sufficient and doesn't export "
"much. As a result the amount of inhabitants is quite a bit lower than what a "
"world of this size and quality could support in a busier area of space."
msgstr ""
"Aunque es un planeta bastante agradable, Janko es demasiado atrasado para "
"prosperar realmente. La población local es en gran medida autosuficiente y "
"no exporta mucho. En consecuencia, el número de habitantes es bastante "
"inferior al que podría soportar un mundo de este tamaño y calidad en una "
"zona más concurrida del espacio."

msgid ""
"Thanks to its somewhat sparse population density, Janko can afford to have "
"its spaceport well away from the bigger residential centres. The spaceport "
"bar has exits leading directly to the hypermag transport system. A ten-"
"second trip will take you to the capital city."
msgstr ""
"Gracias a su escasa densidad de población, Janko puede permitirse tener su "
"puerto espacial bien alejado de los grandes centros residenciales. El bar "
"del puerto espacial tiene salidas que conducen directamente al sistema de "
"transporte hipermagnético. Un viaje de diez segundos te llevará a la capital."

msgid "Janus Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Janus"

msgid ""
"Janus Enclave is a quiet garrison post for the empire. It serves as a "
"potential rallying point for imperial forces trying to defend the core, but "
"at the moment, it is considered an acceptable post for older crewmen wanting "
"a relaxing post before they retire to Amphion not far away."
msgstr ""
"El Enclave Janus es un tranquilo puesto de guarnición del imperio. Sirve "
"como posible punto de reunión para las fuerzas imperiales que intentan "
"defender el núcleo, pero por el momento se considera un puesto aceptable "
"para los tripulantes de más edad que desean un puesto de descanso antes de "
"retirarse a Amphion, no muy lejos."

msgid ""
"The bar has a few games on, and the drinks are cold. There is food, but it "
"is mostly pre-packaged stuff. Not bad, but not amazing either."
msgstr ""
"En el bar hay algunos juegos y las bebidas están frías. Hay comida, pero en "
"su mayor parte es comida envasada. No está mal, pero tampoco es increíble."

msgid "Janus Farming"
msgstr "Granja Janus"

msgid ""
"This station is a high-yield crop growing facility. While most farm stations "
"are always facing the local star to make optimal use of its light, this "
"station slowly rotates, exposing both of its sides to the star in turns. One "
"side of the station is used for crop fields while the other side is used to "
"breed livestock. The artificial day-night cycle is found to have a positive "
"effect on the animals."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación es una instalación de cultivo de alto rendimiento. Mientras "
"que la mayoría de las estaciones agrícolas están siempre orientadas hacia la "
"estrella local para aprovechar al máximo su luz, esta estación gira "
"lentamente, exponiendo por turnos sus dos lados a la estrella. Un lado de la "
"estación se utiliza para los campos de cultivo, mientras que el otro se "
"utiliza para la cría de ganado. Se ha comprobado que el ciclo artificial día-"
"noche tiene un efecto positivo en los animales."

msgid "Jasmine"
msgstr "Jazmín"

msgid ""
"Jasmine was a dusty dead-end world on the border between Soromid and Empire "
"space for a long time, until the blockade was lifted and trade was allowed. "
"Despite that, the local economy never really took off, with the planet being "
"more of a stop on the way to more successful worlds with vibrant industries "
"and valuable resources. When the Incident happened and refugees from "
"Imperial space started to flow in, the Soromid decided to use Jasmine as a "
"temporary refugee camp for those without genetic modifications necessary to "
"survive long-term in less hospitable Soromid planets. Although some were "
"able to undergo genetic treatment, the truth is Jasmine is still inundated "
"with refugees with poor future outlook."
msgstr ""
"Jazmín fue durante mucho tiempo un polvoriento mundo sin futuro en la "
"frontera entre el espacio Soromida y el Imperio, hasta que se levantó el "
"bloqueo y se permitió el comercio. A pesar de ello, la economía local nunca "
"despegó del todo, siendo el planeta más bien una parada en el camino hacia "
"mundos más prósperos con industrias vibrantes y recursos valiosos. Cuando se "
"produjo el Incidente y empezaron a llegar refugiados del espacio imperial, "
"los Soromida decidieron utilizar Jazmín como campo de refugiados temporal "
"para aquellos que carecían de las modificaciones genéticas necesarias para "
"sobrevivir a largo plazo en planetas Soromida menos hospitalarios. Aunque "
"algunos pudieron someterse a tratamiento genético, lo cierto es que Jazmín "
"sigue inundado de refugiados con malas perspectivas de futuro."

msgid ""
"This bar is a short walk from the spaceport, which itself is little more "
"than a collection of crude pits in the ground that contain the bare "
"essentials needed to service landed ships. Jasmine was never rich enough to "
"afford a serious space port, and this does not seem likely to change."
msgstr ""
"Este bar se encuentra a un corto paseo del puerto espacial, que en sí mismo "
"es poco más que una colección de toscos pozos en el suelo que contienen lo "
"esencial necesario para dar servicio a las naves aterrizadas. Jazmín nunca "
"fue lo suficientemente rica como para permitirse un puerto espacial serio, y "
"no parece que esto vaya a cambiar."

msgid "Jaxheen"
msgstr "Jaxheen"

msgid ""
"Jaxheen was established in a time when the Soromid had already settled many "
"of the worlds that make up the Soromid core today. The colonization effort "
"was focused more on building a smoothly functioning society than on "
"pioneering, a mentality that paid off in the long run. Jaxheen doesn't "
"suffer from many of the inefficiencies found in societies that evolved by "
"building on themselves. This has made the world quite powerful economically."
msgstr ""
"Jaxheen se estableció en una época en la que los Soromida ya habían "
"colonizado muchos de los mundos que hoy conforman el núcleo Soromida. El "
"esfuerzo de colonización se centró más en construir una sociedad que "
"funcionara sin problemas que en ser pioneros, una mentalidad que dio sus "
"frutos a largo plazo. Jaxheen no sufre muchas de las ineficiencias que se "
"encuentran en las sociedades que evolucionan construyendo sobre sí mismas. "
"Esto ha hecho que el mundo sea bastante poderoso económicamente."

msgid ""
"There are four main portals leading into and out of this spaceport bar. One "
"leads to the spaceport facility. The second leads to the central public "
"transit hub in this area of the metroplex that spans much of the continent. "
"The third leads directly to the local commercial node, and the final portal "
"is connected to the emergency service network, a separate infrastructure "
"completely dedicated to emergency vehicles."
msgstr ""
"Hay cuatro portales principales que entran y salen de este bar del puerto "
"espacial. Uno lleva a las instalaciones del puerto espacial. El segundo "
"lleva al nodo central de transporte público de esta zona del metroplex que "
"abarca gran parte del continente. El tercero lleva directamente al nodo "
"comercial local, y el último portal está conectado a la red de servicios de "
"emergencia, una infraestructura separada completamente dedicada a los "
"vehículos de emergencia."

msgid "Jemard"
msgstr "Jemard"

msgid ""
"Jernard is the moon orbiting the first planet of the Kansas system. It's a "
"hot place, but despite that it's remarkably stable. That, combined with the "
"low gravity, has prompted a commercial producer of starships to set up a "
"manufacturing plant here."
msgstr ""
"Jernard es la luna que orbita el primer planeta del sistema Kansas. Es un "
"lugar caluroso, pero a pesar de ello es notablemente estable. Eso, combinado "
"con la baja gravedad, ha llevado a un productor comercial de naves estelares "
"a establecer una planta de fabricación aquí."

msgid ""
"Though the spaceport bar is constantly air conditioned, the temperature is "
"still uncomfortably high. Some visitors have voiced concerns about the "
"reliability of the cooling system. Should it ever fail, pilots may not make "
"it back to their ships before being cooked alive."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el bar del puerto espacial está constantemente climatizado, la "
"temperatura sigue siendo incómodamente alta. Algunos visitantes han "
"expresado su preocupación por la fiabilidad del sistema de refrigeración. Si "
"alguna vez falla, los pilotos podrían no llegar a sus naves antes de ser "
"cocinados vivos."

msgid "Jermose"
msgstr "Jermose"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Jermose is an aquatic world with two sizeable moons. The moons orbit the "
"planet in a complex pattern that makes the tides highly erratic, both in "
"terms of the rhythm of ebb and flood and in terms of how high the water can "
"rise. This means that there are few areas of dry land that can safely be "
"built upon, and the surrounding beaches can sometimes grow up to fifteen "
"kilometres wide."
msgstr ""
"Jermose es un mundo acuático con dos lunas de gran tamaño. Las lunas orbitan "
"el planeta siguiendo un complejo patrón que hace que las mareas sean muy "
"erráticas, tanto en lo que respecta al ritmo de reflujo y crecida como a la "
"altura que puede alcanzar el agua. Esto significa que hay pocas zonas de "
"tierra firme en las que se pueda construir con seguridad, y las playas que "
"las rodean pueden llegar a tener hasta quince kilómetros de ancho."

msgid ""
"The people of Jermose have created a local calendar based on the movements "
"of the moons through the sky. It's a very confusing affair, with over "
"seventy different months that vary greatly in length, and not all of which "
"necessarily have to appear in any given year. The spaceport bar offers "
"specials based on this calendar, but most spacers haven't a clue how it "
"works."
msgstr ""
"Los habitantes de Jermose han creado un calendario local basado en los "
"movimientos de las lunas por el cielo. Es un asunto muy confuso, con más de "
"setenta meses diferentes que varían mucho en duración, y no todos tienen que "
"aparecer necesariamente en un año determinado. El bar del puerto espacial "
"ofrece ofertas basadas en este calendario, pero la mayoría de los espaciales "
"no tienen ni idea de cómo funciona."

msgid "Jeronon"
msgstr "Jeronon"

msgid ""
"Jeronon is a cold, lifeless ball of rock. Geologists claim it was rather "
"cool even in its early days, and now its core barely has any heat left. "
"Worlds like this are not unheard of, but Jeronon is an unusually large "
"specimen. A mining corporation and a spaceship peripheral manufacturer have "
"set up a joint enterprise here, extracting the vast amounts of base metals "
"from the planet's interior and fashioning them into equipment for use on "
"ships."
msgstr ""
"Jeronon es una bola de roca fría y sin vida. Los geólogos afirman que era "
"bastante fría incluso en sus primeros días, y ahora su núcleo apenas tiene "
"calor. Los mundos como éste no son desconocidos, pero Jeronon es un "
"espécimen inusualmente grande. Una corporación minera y un fabricante de "
"periféricos para naves espaciales han creado una empresa conjunta aquí, "
"extrayendo las enormes cantidades de metales básicos del interior del "
"planeta y convirtiéndolos en equipos para su uso en las naves."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is probably the most luxurious public facility on the "
"planet. Not that it's a particularly nice spaceport bar, it's just that all "
"the other facilities are even danker and grubbier than it."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es probablemente la instalación pública más "
"lujosa del planeta. No es que sea un bar de puerto espacial especialmente "
"bonito, es que todas las demás instalaciones son aún más húmedas y más "
"sucias que él."

msgid "Jervis V"
msgstr "Jervis V"

msgid "Jervis VII"
msgstr "Jervis VII"

msgid "Jezza"
msgstr "Jezza"

msgid "Jomos"
msgstr "Jomos"

msgid ""
"Jomos is a small aquatic world that serves as a luxury resort for well-to-do "
"Sirii. The relatively low gravity, combined with a rapidly changing weather "
"system makes the world ideal for all kinds of spectacular water-oriented "
"pastimes. The place is popular among the upper class of Paxadon, who like to "
"get away from the crowded life there, but Sirii from all over the faction's "
"space come here to relax."
msgstr ""
"Jomos es un pequeño mundo acuático que sirve de centro turístico de lujo "
"para los Sirio acomodados. La gravedad relativamente baja, combinada con un "
"sistema meteorológico que cambia rápidamente, hace que el mundo sea ideal "
"para todo tipo de pasatiempos acuáticos espectaculares. El lugar es popular "
"entre la clase alta de Paxadon, a la que le gusta alejarse de la vida "
"atestada del lugar, pero los Sirio de todo el espacio de la facción vienen "
"aquí a relajarse."

msgid ""
"Jomos' bar is a luxury bar first and foremost. It is usually the first place "
"incoming tourists visit after disembarking their transport, and the local "
"authorities want to make them feel welcome. There is music, the windows let "
"in a lot of sunshine, and the interior is adorned with plants and small "
"pieces of art. For regular spacers, however, this is of little use, as they "
"are typically here on business, not for fun."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Jomos es, ante todo, un bar de lujo. Suele ser el primer lugar que "
"visitan los turistas que llegan tras desembarcar de su transporte, y las "
"autoridades locales quieren hacerles sentir bienvenidos. Hay música, las "
"ventanas dejan entrar mucho sol y el interior está adornado con plantas y "
"pequeñas piezas de arte. Sin embargo, a los espaciales habituales esto les "
"sirve de poco, ya que suelen estar aquí por negocios, no por diversión."

msgid "Jorcan"
msgstr "Jorcan"

msgid ""
"Jorcan is a very barren, dull planet, like most mining worlds. Having been "
"mined for decades, its resources have been nearly exhausted. However, mining "
"corporations are known to persist until there's no longer a profit to be "
"made, leaving depleted, dead planets."
msgstr ""
"Jorcan es un planeta muy estéril y aburrido, como la mayoría de los mundos "
"mineros. Tras haber sido minado durante décadas, sus recursos están casi "
"agotados. Sin embargo, se sabe que las corporaciones mineras persisten hasta "
"que ya no hay beneficios, dejando planetas agotados y muertos."

msgid ""
"The one word that would describe the Jorcan spaceport bar would be dust. "
"It's everywhere: on the seats, on the counter, in the drinks, on everyone's "
"faces. A coarse soot has coated your palm just holding your drink. You "
"wonder if it will ever wash off."
msgstr ""
"La única palabra que describiría el bar del puerto espacial de Jorcan sería "
"polvo. Está por todas partes: en los asientos, en el mostrador, en las "
"bebidas, en las caras de todos. Un hollín grueso ha cubierto la palma de la "
"mano al sostener la bebida. Te preguntas si alguna vez se quitará."

msgid "Jorla"
msgstr "Jorla"

msgid ""
"This Class-O planet is another purely residential planet in Za'lek space, "
"with a rather large population and several university campuses. The standard "
"of living is rather high, and life expectancy is long, making it a popular "
"place to live out a retirement. Other than that, there isn't much to "
"recommend it to adventurers. Which is just how many of the inhabitants like "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Este planeta de clase O es otro planeta puramente residencial en el espacio "
"Za'lek, con una población bastante numerosa y varios campus universitarios. "
"El nivel de vida es bastante alto y la esperanza de vida es larga, lo que lo "
"convierte en un lugar popular para vivir la jubilación. Aparte de eso, no "
"hay mucho que recomendar a los aventureros. Y así es como les gusta a muchos "
"de sus habitantes."

msgid ""
"This bar bears a closer resemblance to a family restaurant, with the average "
"patron being about late middle age."
msgstr ""
"Este bar se parece más a un restaurante familiar, con un cliente medio de "
"mediana edad."

msgid "Jorlan"
msgstr "Jorlan"

msgid ""
"Jorlan is one of the least successful Frontier worlds. Its colony ship, "
"Santa Maria, arrived to find a barren, desolate rock that had next to no "
"potential for human inhabitants. But with the only other reachable planet "
"being a gas giant, Santa Maria's captain was faced with the choice to settle "
"or perish. Somehow, this expedition has managed to eke out an existence on "
"Jorlan.\n"
"Jorlan's inhabitants are mostly part of the ore refining process, as it "
"supplies most of the Frontier with all sorts of alloys. Gas miners are also "
"sent to Haleb IV every few dozen decaperiods when the weather conditions are "
"favourable."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Rather atypically for a heavy-industry world, the people of Jorlan don't "
"really have a habit of drinking. You see numerous other spacefarers, but "
"almost no natives."
msgstr ""
"De forma bastante atípica para un mundo de industria pesada, los habitantes "
"de Jorlan no tienen la costumbre de beber. Se ven muchos otros espaciadores, "
"pero casi ningún nativo."

msgid "Jugreny"
msgstr "Jugreny"

msgid "Jurai"
msgstr "Jurai"

msgid ""
"Jurai is a humble and pleasantly liveable class M world. It is a population "
"centre for the Za'lek, and is dotted with universities and laboratories. "
"Many younger people on this world yearn to leave to more exciting worlds, "
"while older Za'lek tend to retire here."
msgstr ""
"Jurai es un mundo de clase M humilde y agradablemente habitable. Un centro "
"de población para los Za'lek, salpicado de universidades y laboratorios. "
"Muchos jóvenes de este mundo anhelan marcharse a mundos más emocionantes, "
"mientras que los Za'lek de más edad tienden a retirarse aquí."

msgid ""
"The bar is as rambling as many Za'lek institutions, yet seems cozy all the "
"same with booths sunken into the floor and soft lighting. The patrons are "
"disproportionately older."
msgstr ""
"El bar es tan farragoso como muchas instituciones de Za'lek, pero parece "
"acogedor de todos modos, con cabinas hundidas en el suelo y una iluminación "
"suave. Los clientes son desproporcionadamente mayores."

msgid "Juran"
msgstr "Juran"

msgid "Kaira"
msgstr "Kaira"

msgid "Kal Atok Obelisk"
msgstr "Obelico Kal Atok"

msgid "#yObelisk#0"
msgstr "#yObelisco#0"

msgid "Obelisk"
msgstr "Obelisco"

msgid "Kal Maro Obelisk"
msgstr "Obelisco Kal Maro"

msgid "Kal Niut Obelisk"
msgstr "Obelisco Kal Niut"

msgid "Kal Sitra Obelisk"
msgstr "Obelisco Kal Sitra"

msgid "Kal Vora Obelisk"
msgstr "Obelisco Kal Vora\t"

msgid "Kan'ar"
msgstr "Kan'ar"

msgid ""
"Kan'ar is a class-O world with a large population and an extensive marine "
"biology research community. A lot of underwater research and study goes on "
"here, and like many class-O worlds, it is a large producer of medicine. "
"Although the main focus is industrial and research, a deep sea zoo attracts "
"visitors from afar."
msgstr ""
"Kan'ar es un mundo de clase O con una gran población y una amplia comunidad "
"de investigación en biología marina. Aquí se realizan muchas investigaciones "
"y estudios submarinos y, como muchos mundos de clase O, es un gran productor "
"de medicamentos. Aunque el foco principal es la industria y la "
"investigación, un zoológico de aguas profundas atrae a visitantes de lejos."

msgid ""
"This bar is a fairly typical underwater bar with built-in overhead aquarium. "
"Plenty of scientists inside of it arguing and talking about what they see, "
"however."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es un bar submarino bastante típico con un acuario incorporado en "
"el techo. Sin embargo, hay un montón de científicos en su interior "
"discutiendo y hablando sobre lo que ven."

msgid "Kanel"
msgstr "Kanel"

msgid "Kansas I"
msgstr "Kansas I"

msgid "Kansas III"
msgstr "Kansas III"

msgid "Kansas IV"
msgstr "Kansas IV"

msgid "Kansas VI"
msgstr "Kansas VI"

msgid "Kappa Vadornia"
msgstr "Kappa Vadornia"

msgid "Karman I"
msgstr "Karman I"

msgid "Karman II"
msgstr "Karman II"

msgid "Karvua"
msgstr "Karvua"

msgid ""
"While not exactly hospitable, Karvua is a rich source of minerals that the "
"Proteron were all too happy to exploit, leading them to turn the planet into "
"a big mining colony."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es precisamente hospitalaria, Karvua es una rica fuente de "
"minerales que los Proteron no dudaron en explotar, lo que les llevó a "
"convertir el planeta en una gran colonia minera."

msgid "Kaso"
msgstr "Kaso"

msgid "Kataka"
msgstr "Kataka"

msgid "#pSoromid Homeworld#0"
msgstr "#pMundo Hogar Soromida#0"

msgid ""
"With the loss of Sorom, the Soromid had to decide on a new political "
"capital. After some debate, it was decided that Kataka would fill this "
"position. Kataka is by no means a pleasant world, but the Soromid being the "
"Soromid, that made no difference. Present day, Kataka is home to most if not "
"all of the influential Soromid citizens. Authorities on all aspects of "
"Soromid can be found here."
msgstr ""
"Con la pérdida de Sorom, los Soromida tuvieron que decidir un nuevo capital "
"político. Tras algunos debates, se decidió que Kataka ocuparía este puesto. "
"Kataka no es en absoluto un mundo agradable, pero siendo los Soromida, eso "
"no supuso ninguna diferencia. En la actualidad, Kataka es el hogar de la "
"mayoría, si no de todos los ciudadanos influyentes de Soromida. Aquí se "
"pueden encontrar autoridades Soromida de todas las áreas."

msgid ""
"It's quite unusual for a non-Soromid to be granted landing rights on Kataka. "
"And even when this happens, offworlders are usually restricted to the "
"spaceport facility, and if they have business with planetside officials then "
"those officials come to them. The spaceport bar is built for such "
"occurrences, providing private booths where people may converse in private."
msgstr ""
"Es bastante inusual que se concedan derechos de aterrizaje en Kataka a "
"personas que no son Soromida. E incluso cuando esto ocurre, los extranjeros "
"suelen estar restringidos a las instalaciones del puerto espacial, y si "
"tienen negocios con funcionarios del planeta, éstos acuden a ellos. El bar "
"del puerto espacial está construido para este tipo de acontecimientos, con "
"cabinas privadas donde la gente puede conversar en privado."

msgid "Katami I"
msgstr "Katami I"

msgid "Katar"
msgstr "Katar"

msgid "Katar I"
msgstr "Katar I"

msgid ""
"Katar is a planet with a very active core that creates a very particular "
"electromagnetic field that is very useful for high energy physics "
"experiments. However, the same electromagnetic fields make it nearly "
"impossible to use standard electronics nearby. When it was decided to build "
"a geostationary particle physics testing site, Katar was quickly ruled out "
"for setting up a nearby base, and eventually it was decided that the base "
"would be established on Katar I, a small nearby moon. Other than a research "
"centre, nothing else has been really constructed, and Katar I ended up a "
"small staff of Za'lek scientists focused on researching with the testing "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Katar es un planeta con un núcleo muy activo que crea un campo "
"electromagnético muy particular que es muy útil para los experimentos de "
"física de alta energía. Sin embargo, los mismos campos electromagnéticos "
"hacen casi imposible el uso de la electrónica estándar en las cercanías. "
"Cuando se decidió construir un centro geoestacionario de pruebas de física "
"de partículas, Katar fue rápidamente descartado para establecer una base "
"cercana, y finalmente se decidió que la base se establecería en Katar I, una "
"pequeña luna cercana. Aparte de un centro de investigación, no se construyó "
"realmente nada más, y Katar I acabó con una pequeña plantilla de científicos "
"Za'lek centrada en la investigación con el centro de pruebas."

msgid ""
"The bar is fairly unremarkable except for the fact it has live streams of "
"the testing being done at the nearby geostationary particle physics testing "
"site. They have a special drink called the \"Atom Smasher\", which tastes "
"weirdly like engine fuel, and is commonly used in a not entirely healthy "
"bonding ritual in which interns tend to end up passed out after smashing "
"atoms."
msgstr ""
"El bar es bastante anodino, excepto por el hecho de que tiene transmisiones "
"en directo de las pruebas que se realizan en el cercano centro de pruebas de "
"física de partículas geoestacionarias. Tienen una bebida especial llamada "
"\"Destructor de Átomos\", que sabe extrañamente a combustible de motor, y "
"que se utiliza comúnmente en un ritual de unión no del todo saludable en el "
"que los internos tienden a terminar desmayados después de romper átomos."

msgid "Kaulas"
msgstr "Kaulas"

msgid ""
"Volcanic A class planets aren't usually prime candidates for colonization. "
"But sometimes it can be advantageous for an industry to put a factory or two "
"on a planet like Kaulas. Geothermal energy is available in plentiful supply, "
"and some select spots on the planet's surface are stable enough to set up a "
"natural furnace for producing things that require a lot of heat in their "
"production process."
msgstr ""
"Los planetas volcánicos de clase A no suelen ser los principales candidatos "
"para la colonización. Pero a veces puede ser ventajoso para una industria "
"poner una o dos fábricas en un planeta como Kaulas. La energía geotérmica "
"está disponible en abundancia, y algunos puntos selectos de la superficie "
"del planeta son lo suficientemente estables como para establecer un horno "
"natural para producir cosas que requieren mucho calor en su proceso de "
"producción."

msgid ""
"Some spacers are uneasy when coming to Soromid worlds that are inhospitable "
"to normal humans. They fear that the conditions within the public facilities "
"will be unhealthy to them. They have no reason to fear though. The Soromid "
"realize full well that unmodified humans make their economy tick, so they "
"make sure to clearly mark all hazardous areas and keep public spaces "
"unmodified-friendly. This bar, for example, is completely safe."
msgstr ""
"Algunos espaciales se sienten incómodos cuando llegan a mundos Soromida que "
"son inhóspitos para los humanos normales. Temen que las condiciones de las "
"instalaciones públicas sean insalubres para ellos. Sin embargo, no tienen "
"motivos para temer. Los Soromida son conscientes de que los humanos no "
"modificados son los que hacen funcionar su economía, por lo que se aseguran "
"de marcar claramente todas las zonas peligrosas y de mantener los espacios "
"públicos no modificados. Este bar, por ejemplo, es completamente seguro."

msgid "Kayel"
msgstr "Kayel"

msgid ""
"Kayel is a small, isolated little world that keeps away from the larger "
"problems of the galaxy. It maintains a few mining outposts here and there, "
"and sells food, and keeps a respectable shipyard running."
msgstr ""
"Kayel es un pequeño y aislado mundo que se mantiene alejado de los grandes "
"problemas de la galaxia. Mantiene algunos puestos de avanzada minera aquí y "
"allá, y vende alimentos, y mantiene un respetable astillero en "
"funcionamiento."

msgid ""
"The bar is mostly a dingy little place with a few groups of people making "
"shady deals. There are a bunch of drunks at scattered parts, and the "
"bartender always keeps a hand under the bar. Not the most relaxing place."
msgstr ""
"El bar es en su mayor parte un pequeño y sucio lugar con algunos grupos de "
"personas que hacen tratos turbios. Hay un montón de borrachos en partes "
"dispersas, y el camarero siempre mantiene una mano bajo la barra. No es el "
"lugar más relajante."

msgid "Khaas I"
msgstr "Khaas I"

msgid "Khelim"
msgstr "Khelim"

msgid ""
"Khelim was the target world for Majestic, the eleventh colony ship sent from "
"Earth in the First Growth. Majestic was populated chiefly by people from "
"India and the Middle East, and though interstellar traffic has been "
"commonplace for many cycles now, the characteristic features of that area "
"can still be seen on the faces of the people of Khelim."
msgstr ""
"Khelim era el mundo objetivo del Majestic, la undécima nave colonial enviada "
"desde la Tierra en el Primer Crecimiento. Majestic estaba poblado "
"principalmente por gente de la India y Oriente Medio, y aunque el tráfico "
"interestelar es habitual desde hace muchos ciclos, los rasgos "
"característicos de esa zona aún pueden verse en los rostros de los "
"habitantes de Khelim."

msgid ""
"The Crescent Blade bar is about as respectable as low-profile bars come. It "
"has all the standard facilities the galactic traveller has come to rely on, "
"and the service leaves nothing to be desired. Other than that, the place is "
"unremarkable."
msgstr ""
"El bar Espada Curva es tan respetable como los bares de bajo perfil. Tiene "
"todas las instalaciones estándar en las que el viajero galáctico ha llegado "
"a confiar, y el servicio no deja nada que desear. Aparte de eso, el lugar no "
"tiene nada de especial."

msgid "Khorin"
msgstr "Khorin"

msgid "Killerog"
msgstr "Killerog"

msgid "Klantar I"
msgstr "Klantar I"

msgid "Klantar III"
msgstr "Klantar III"

msgid "Kobopos I"
msgstr "Kobopos I"

msgid "Kobopos II"
msgstr "Kobopos II"

msgid "Kobopos IV"
msgstr "Kobopos IV"

msgid "Koga"
msgstr "Koga"

msgid ""
"Koga has a highly active crust, and many describe the surface as being a "
"reasonable facsimile of hell. They may not be too far off the mark, as lava "
"flows and sudden rumbles from the earth are quite common. Although most of "
"the planet is unsuitable for construction, there is a small area at the "
"south pole that is reasonably stable, by Koga standards, allowing for people "
"to live."
msgstr ""
"Koga tiene una corteza muy activa, y muchos describen la superficie como un "
"facsímil razonable del infierno. Puede que no estén muy equivocados, ya que "
"los flujos de lava y los repentinos estruendos de la tierra son bastante "
"comunes. Aunque la mayor parte del planeta es inadecuada para la "
"construcción, hay una pequeña zona en el polo sur que es razonablemente "
"estable, según los estándares de Koga, lo que permite que la gente viva."

msgid ""
"The bar has holovids and pictures of the more spectacular activity of Koga's "
"turbulent geography. The bar is known for the \"Lava Storm\" drink, which "
"you need to sign a waiver to drink."
msgstr ""
"El bar cuenta con holovídeos e imágenes de la actividad más espectacular de "
"la turbulenta geografía de Koga. El bar es conocido por la bebida \"Tormenta "
"de lava\", que hay que firmar una renuncia para poder beber."

msgid "Koralis IV"
msgstr "Koralis IV"

msgid "Koralis VI"
msgstr "Koralis VI"

msgid "Korifa I"
msgstr "Korifa I"

msgid "Korifa Ia"
msgstr "Korifa Ia"

msgid "Korifa II"
msgstr "Korifa II"

msgid "Korifa III"
msgstr "Korifa III"

msgid "Kotori"
msgstr "Kotori"

msgid "Kraft I"
msgstr "Kraft I"

msgid "Kraft II"
msgstr "Kraft II"

msgid "Kraft IV"
msgstr "Kraft IV"

msgid "Kraft V"
msgstr "Kraft V"

msgid "Kraft VI"
msgstr "Kraft VI"

msgid "Kramer"
msgstr "Kramer"

msgid ""
"Kramer is a backwater, almost devoid of an atmosphere. However, the primary "
"point it has in its favour, the hidden jump point makes it an attractive "
"stop-over point for pirates on deeper raids into the civilized parts of the "
"galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Kramer es un remanso, casi sin atmósfera. Sin embargo, el principal punto "
"que tiene a su favor, el punto de salto oculto, lo convierte en un atractivo "
"punto de parada para los piratas en incursiones más profundas hacia las "
"partes civilizadas de la galaxia."

msgid ""
"The bar is alive with the fighting and carousing of drunk patrons. A few "
"patrons busy themselves with card games in a corner and the shadier "
"merchants talk business over debatably drinkable alcohol. Truly a pirate bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar está animado por las peleas y las juergas de los clientes borrachos. "
"Unos pocos clientes se entretienen con juegos de cartas en un rincón y los "
"comerciantes más sombríos hablan de negocios con alcohol discutiblemente "
"bebible. Un verdadero bar de piratas."

msgid "Kretogg I"
msgstr "Kretogg I"

msgid "Kretogg II"
msgstr "Kretogg II"

msgid "Kretogg III"
msgstr "Kretogg III"

msgid "Ksher I"
msgstr "Ksher I"

msgid "Ksher II"
msgstr "Ksher II"

msgid "Ksher III"
msgstr "Ksher III"

msgid "Kyo III"
msgstr "Kyo III"

msgid "Laarss"
msgstr "Laarss"

msgid ""
"Laarss is a resource world. Before the inception of House Dvaered, it used "
"to supply the Imperial economy with raw materials at bottom prices. "
"Nowadays, its chief export market is Eist Shipyard, which is in constant "
"need of ship building resources. Though Laarss is largely the same mining "
"colony it was before, working here is considered something of a privilege "
"among Dvaered citizens, considering its location in Dvaer."
msgstr ""
"Laarss es un mundo de recursos. Antes de la creación de la Casa Dvaered, "
"solía suministrar a la economía Imperial materias primas a precios bajos. "
"Hoy en día, su principal mercado de exportación es el Astillero de Eist, que "
"necesita constantemente recursos para la construcción de naves. Aunque "
"Laarss es en gran medida la misma colonia minera que era antes, trabajar "
"aquí se considera una especie de privilegio entre los ciudadanos Dvaered, "
"teniendo en cuenta su ubicación en Dvaer."

msgid ""
"Though technically this place is the spaceport bar, its main function is a "
"place of leisure for the local population. At all times, you can find large "
"groups of Dvaered workers here, spending their off-time and their credits on "
"booze and entertainment."
msgstr ""
"Aunque técnicamente este lugar es el bar del puerto espacial, su función "
"principal es un lugar de ocio para la población local. En todo momento, se "
"pueden encontrar aquí grandes grupos de trabajadores Dvaered, que gastan su "
"tiempo libre y sus créditos en bebida y entretenimiento."

msgid "Lanze"
msgstr "Lanze"

msgid ""
"Lanze is one of the best developed colonies in the stellar neighbourhood. As "
"such it is seen by many as the unofficial capital of the cluster of systems "
"Margarita is part of. Many corporations have their branch headquarters here, "
"and there is a high concentration of bureaucratic infrastructure present."
msgstr ""
"Lanze es una de las colonias mejor desarrolladas del barrio estelar. Como "
"tal, es considerada por muchos como la capital no oficial del conjunto de "
"sistemas del que forma parte Margarita. Muchas corporaciones tienen aquí su "
"sede, y hay una gran concentración de infraestructura burocrática."

msgid ""
"Where other spaceports tend to tuck their spaceport bars away in a corner of "
"the spaceport facility, the architect of this spaceport decided the bar "
"should be right on top of the complex - literally. The spaceport bar is the "
"topmost facility, looking out and down on the rest of the spaceport. All "
"outer walls and the ceiling are transparent, so visitors have a great view "
"of spaceships coming in and going out."
msgstr ""
"Mientras que otros puertos espaciales tienden a esconder sus bares en una "
"esquina de las instalaciones del puerto espacial, el arquitecto de este "
"puerto espacial decidió que el bar debía estar justo en la cima del "
"complejo, literalmente. El bar del puerto espacial es la instalación más "
"alta, con vistas al resto del puerto espacial. Todas las paredes exteriores "
"y el techo son transparentes, por lo que los visitantes tienen una gran "
"vista de las naves espaciales que entran y salen."

msgid "Lapis I"
msgstr "Lapis I"

msgid "Lapis II"
msgstr "Lapis II"

msgid "Lapra"
msgstr "Lapra"

msgid ""
"Though Coriolis was the second colony ship, it arrived at Lapra well after "
"New Dortmund had been colonized due to technical difficulties and unforeseen "
"incidents during the journey. When it finally did establish orbit around "
"Lapra, it found a world so low on potential for life that the trip almost "
"seemed like a lost cause. However, upon touchdown the colonists found that "
"there were many useful minerals hidden below the surface of the planet. The "
"colony on Lapra has survived, first out of sheer necessity and later by "
"virtue of its exports."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el Coriolis fue la segunda nave colonial, llegó a Lapra mucho después "
"de que Nueva Dortmund hubiera sido colonizada, debido a dificultades "
"técnicas e incidentes imprevistos durante el viaje. Cuando finalmente se "
"estableció en órbita alrededor de Lapra, se encontró con un mundo con tan "
"poco potencial para la vida que el viaje casi parecía una causa perdida. Sin "
"embargo, al tocar tierra los colonos descubrieron que había muchos minerales "
"útiles escondidos bajo la superficie del planeta. La colonia de Lapra ha "
"sobrevivido, primero por pura necesidad y después en virtud de sus "
"exportaciones."

msgid ""
"Lapra's bar looks more like a market than a place for relaxation, and indeed "
"that is exactly what it is. Not only do traders come here to make "
"transactions, the local population also uses the bar as a centre for "
"commerce. That said, one can still find a drink and a news terminal, if one "
"looks hard enough."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Lapra se parece más a un mercado que a un lugar de esparcimiento, "
"y de hecho eso es exactamente lo que es. No sólo los comerciantes vienen "
"aquí a hacer transacciones, sino que la población local también utiliza el "
"bar como centro de comercio. Dicho esto, todavía se puede encontrar una "
"bebida y una terminal de noticias, si se busca lo suficiente."

msgid "Larling"
msgstr "Larling"

msgid ""
"Larling is a popular world for businesses and industries to settle. Sergio "
"Vix is located close to a number of important Soromid systems, and the price "
"of real estate on Larling is low. In addition, the world has quite relaxed "
"environmental legislation, which means industries can cut on emission "
"reduction costs."
msgstr ""
"Larling es un mundo popular para el asentamiento de empresas e industrias. "
"Sergio Vix está situado cerca de varios sistemas Soromida importantes, y el "
"precio de los inmuebles en Larling es bajo. Además, el mundo tiene una "
"legislación medioambiental bastante relajada, lo que significa que las "
"industrias pueden recortar los costes de reducción de emisiones."

msgid ""
"You won't find Larling's spaceport bar in any top 100 list, but that doesn't "
"mean it's bad. There's just nothing particularly exceptional about it."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Larling no figura en ninguna lista de los 100 "
"mejores, pero eso no significa que sea malo. Simplemente no hay nada "
"particularmente excepcional en él."

msgid "Las Vegas"
msgstr "Las Vegas"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Originally a calm and quiet prosperous M-class world, it has become another "
"planet devastated by the Incident. Not only was the entire atmosphere "
"scrubbed off by the Nebula, the brute force of the impact fractured the "
"planet's surface, exposing and cooling the once molten core, leaving no "
"opportunity for any forms of life to survive. Although invisible to the "
"naked eye, your ship's advanced sensors are able to make out faint traces of "
"once bustling cities on the planet's surface."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente un tranquilo y próspero mundo de clase M, ahora se ha "
"convertido en otro mundo devastado por el Incidente. La Nebulosa no sólo "
"arrasó toda la atmósfera, sino que la fuerza bruta del impacto también "
"fracturó la superficie del planeta, dejando al descubierto y enfriando el "
"núcleo, antaño fundido, para acabar finalmente con cualquier forma de vida "
"en el planeta. Aunque invisibles a simple vista, los avanzados sensores de "
"tu nave son capaces de distinguir débiles rastros de lo que una vez fueron "
"bulliciosas ciudades en la superficie del planeta."

msgid "Lazuli I"
msgstr "Lazuli I"

msgid "Lazuli Ia"
msgstr "Lazuli Ia"

msgid "Lazuli III"
msgstr "Lazuli III"

msgid "Leo"
msgstr "Leo"

msgid "Leszec"
msgstr "Leszec"

msgid ""
"The Dvaered are keeping a \"rehabilitation facility\" here. As you might "
"expect it's a prison, but unlike most Dvaered prisons - which just leave "
"inmates to fend for themselves - this facility is a labour camp, staffed by "
"wardens, guards and overseers for the various subsections. Prisoners never "
"make for very eager workers though, so the actual yield of this facility "
"isn't spectacular."
msgstr ""
"Los Dvaered mantienen aquí un \"centro de rehabilitación\". Como era de "
"esperar, se trata de una prisión, pero a diferencia de la mayoría de las "
"prisiones Dvaered, que dejan a los reclusos a su suerte, esta instalación es "
"un campo de trabajo, dotado de guardianes y supervisores para las distintas "
"subsecciones. Sin embargo, los presos nunca son trabajadores muy "
"entusiastas, por lo que el rendimiento real de esta instalación no es "
"espectacular."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar here has booths where people can have interviews with "
"inmates. They're not used very often. Friends and family of the kind of "
"people who are sent to Leszec tend not to have the resources to make the "
"trip."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial tiene cabinas donde la gente puede entrevistarse "
"con los presos. No se utilizan muy a menudo. Los amigos y familiares del "
"tipo de personas que son enviadas a Leszec no suelen tener recursos para "
"hacer el viaje."

msgid "Leviathan"
msgstr "Leviatán"

msgid "Levo"
msgstr "Levo"

msgid ""
"Levo is an independent world that stays aside from galactic politics. Anyone "
"is welcome at the tiny but neutral Levo Spaceport, located on the island of "
"Locanda in Levo's southern ocean."
msgstr ""
"Levo es un mundo independiente que se mantiene al margen de la política "
"galáctica. Cualquiera es bienvenido en el minúsculo pero neutral Puerto "
"Espacial de Levo, situado en la isla de Locanda, en el océano sur de Levo."

msgid ""
"Welcome to the Levo Bar & Grill - home of the best plastibugers on this side "
"of the Soromid-Empire trade lane!"
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido al Levo Bar & Grill, ¡el hogar de los mejores plastibugers de "
"este lado de la ruta comercial Soromida-Imperio!"

msgid "Limbo I"
msgstr "Limbo I"

msgid "Limbo II"
msgstr "Limbo II"

msgid "Lirith"
msgstr "Lirith"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Little Polaris"
msgstr "Delta Polaris"

msgid ""
"Named by Grand Duchess Mayla Yetmer after her childhood vacation home on "
"Polaris Prime due to the similar crystalline mountains. It is said she "
"enjoyed going on long walks in atmospheric suits here alone, to the great "
"chagrin of her entire security staff.\n"
"\n"
"Although Little Polaris has significant resources, the large amounts of "
"natural contaminants make extraction not very cost-effective, so the "
"moratorium on exploitation put in place by Mayla is still respected to this "
"day."
msgstr ""

msgid "Little Rock"
msgstr "Roca Pequeña"

msgid "Long Rock"
msgstr "Roca Grande"

msgid ""
"Long Rock is a mining world, where the Soromid harvest most of the resources "
"they need. Their thirst for raw materials is considerably small due to the "
"semi-organic nature of their ships, but there is still a demand, and Long "
"Rock is here to deliver."
msgstr ""
"Roca Grande es un mundo minero en el que los Soromida cosechan la mayor "
"parte de los recursos que necesitan. Su sed de materias primas es "
"considerablemente pequeña debido a la naturaleza semiorgánica de sus naves, "
"pero sigue habiendo demanda, y Roca Grande está aquí para satisfacerla."

msgid ""
"The bar is virtually as harsh as the planet outside. The Soromid miners "
"don't mind the conditions nearly as bad as outsiders. Given Long Rock's near "
"isolation and the rarity of visits from non-Soromid, that suits the locals "
"just fine."
msgstr ""
"El bar es prácticamente tan duro como el planeta exterior. A los mineros "
"Soromida no les importan las condiciones tanto como a los forasteros. Dado "
"el casi aislamiento de Roca Grande y la escasez de visitas de personas que "
"no son Soromida, eso les viene muy bien a los lugareños."

msgid "Longbow I"
msgstr "Arcolargo I"

msgid "Longbow III"
msgstr "Arcolargo III"

msgid "Longbow IV"
msgstr "Arcolargo IV"

msgid "Lora-Mor"
msgstr "Lora-Mor"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The second moon of Druss' only gas giant, Lora-Mor is a small but pleasant "
"luxury resort. The low gravity has given rise to fantastic plant life, with "
"trees that reach almost 400 metres in height and whose crowns can span over "
"a kilometre from one end to the other. Together with the giant shape of "
"Druss II in the sky, it makes for one of the more exotic places in the "
"galaxy to spend a holiday."
msgstr ""
"Lora-Mor, la segunda luna del gigante gaseoso de Druss, es un pequeño pero "
"agradable centro turístico de lujo. La baja gravedad ha dado lugar a una "
"fantástica vida vegetal, con árboles que alcanzan casi 400 metros de altura "
"y cuyas copas pueden abarcar más de un kilómetro de un extremo a otro. Junto "
"con la gigantesca forma de Druss II en el cielo, constituye uno de los "
"lugares más exóticos de la galaxia para pasar unas vacaciones."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Most of Lora-Mor's surface is given over to spacious holiday residences and "
"nature parks. The majority of the planet's permanent population lives around "
"the spaceport, and the spaceport bar is their chief recreational facility. "
"This generally works out, as not many spacers visit Lora-Mor other than to "
"ferry tourists to and fro."
msgstr ""
"La mayor parte de la superficie de Lora-Mor está dedicada a amplias "
"residencias vacacionales y parques naturales. La mayor parte de la población "
"permanente del planeta vive alrededor del puerto espacial, y el bar del "
"puerto espacial es su principal lugar de recreo. En general, esto funciona, "
"ya que no hay muchos espaciadores que visiten Lora-Mor más que para "
"transportar a los turistas de un lado a otro."

msgid "Lorelei"
msgstr "Lorelei"

msgid ""
"Churchill's economic position has turned Lorelei into a well developed "
"world. The constant trade revenues have allowed for large habitation "
"complexes and underground factories that wouldn't look out of place on a "
"Dvaered industrial world. However, unlike the Dvaered, the Sirii have put "
"some thought into their infrastructure, and pollution is kept to a minimum."
msgstr ""
"La posición económica de Churchill ha convertido a Lorelei en un mundo bien "
"desarrollado. Los constantes ingresos comerciales han permitido construir "
"grandes complejos habitacionales y fábricas subterráneas que no "
"desentonarían en un mundo industrial Dvaered. Sin embargo, a diferencia de "
"los Dvaered, los Sirio han reflexionado sobre sus infraestructuras y la "
"polución se mantiene al mínimo."

msgid ""
"Because the Sirii didn't want to waste space on a full-fledged spaceport "
"bar, the bar on Lorelei is a virtual one. Visitors enter a VR booth and are "
"given the illusion of being in a large, luxurious spaceport bar, where they "
"can interact with other visitors and the uplink avatars. It is even possible "
"to consume beverages in the virtual bar, as the VR booth is capable of "
"stimulating the part of the human brain that deals with food and drink."
msgstr ""
"Como los Sirio no querían desperdiciar espacio en un bar de puerto espacial "
"completo, el bar de Lorelei es virtual. Los visitantes entran en una cabina "
"de RV y tienen la ilusión de estar en un gran y lujoso bar de puerto "
"espacial, donde pueden interactuar con otros visitantes y con los avatares "
"de la subida. Incluso es posible consumir bebidas en el bar virtual, ya que "
"la cabina de RV es capaz de estimular la parte del cerebro humano que se "
"ocupa de la comida y la bebida."

msgid "Lugun"
msgstr "Lugun"

msgid ""
"Lugun is a research hub where a large amount of the data from surrounding "
"laboratories and universities is kept for storage and use for other "
"researchers. As such, it is regarded as an important asset to House Za'lek "
"in the area and is guarded."
msgstr ""
"Lugun es un centro de investigación donde se guardan gran cantidad de datos "
"de los laboratorios y universidades de los alrededores para su "
"almacenamiento y uso por parte de otros investigadores. Como tal, se "
"considera un activo importante para la Casa Za'lek en la zona y está "
"vigilado."

msgid ""
"This bar is full of chatting scientists and a few military personnel; though "
"with Za'lek's society, the two are not always readily apparent. It is very "
"clean and orderly however, with server droids handing out drinks and food."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está lleno de científicos que charlan y de algunos militares; "
"aunque con la sociedad de Za'lek, los dos no siempre son evidentes. Sin "
"embargo, está muy limpio y ordenado, con droides servidores que reparten "
"bebidas y comida."

msgid "Luna Skona"
msgstr "Luna Skona"

msgid "Luxsor"
msgstr "Luxsor"

msgid "Lyncis I"
msgstr "Lyncis I"

msgid "Lyncis II"
msgstr "Lyncis II"

msgid "Lyncis IIa"
msgstr "Lyncis IIa"

msgid "Lyncis IIb"
msgstr "Lyncis IIb"

msgid ""
"One of the multiple moons considered for human settlement. In the end, due "
"to the volatile nature of the planet's surface, Lyncis IIc was preferred "
"which ended up being renamed New Xantusia.\n"
"Lyncis IIb has an abnormally soft outer mantle, which combined with a highly "
"unstable core and the gravitational pull of Lyncis II, leads to extreme "
"undulations and tides of the surface. This makes anything short of floating "
"constructions nearly instantly sink, however, floating constructions do not "
"fare much better due to the highly abrasive sand that can be propelled at "
"extreme velocities by storms. Despite all the dangers, Lyncis IIb is "
"somewhat popular for the extreme sport of sand surfing when the weather "
"permits."
msgstr ""
"Una de las múltiples lunas consideradas para el asentamiento humano. Al "
"final, debido a la naturaleza volátil de la superficie del planeta, se "
"prefirió Lyncis IIc, que acabó siendo rebautizada como Nueva Xantusia.\n"
"Lyncis IIb tiene un manto exterior anormalmente blando, que combinado con un "
"núcleo altamente inestable y la atracción gravitatoria de Lyncis II, provoca "
"ondulaciones y mareas extremas en la superficie. Esto hace que todo lo que "
"no sean construcciones flotantes se hundan casi instantáneamente, sin "
"embargo, a las construcciones flotantes no les va mucho mejor debido a la "
"arena altamente abrasiva que puede ser impulsada a velocidades extremas por "
"las tormentas. A pesar de todos los peligros, Lyncis IIb es un de alguna "
"forma popular para el deporte extremo del surf de arena cuando el tiempo lo "
"permite."

msgid "Lyncis III"
msgstr "Lyncis III"

msgid "Maanen"
msgstr "Maanen"

msgid "Maanen's Moon"
msgstr "Luna de Maanen"

msgid ""
"Maanen's Moon was just beyond the effect of the Incident and, finding itself "
"on a major evacuation route, ended up becoming a hotspot for refugees - a "
"circumstance that has seriously affected the planet's future.\n"
"Following the Incident, many damaged refugee ships arrived on Maanen's Moon; "
"while the most spaceworthy pressed on, large numbers stayed behind for "
"emergency repairs. But the material needed to repair ships soon ran out and "
"the moon did not have the housing to hold so many refugees, so many of the "
"vessels that remained on the planet were converted into temporary dwellings "
"to house the massively-increased population.\n"
"As local supplies ran dry and the prospect of more supplies unlikely given "
"the disarray of the Imperial government, the local Imperial Governor "
"declared a state of emergency that is still in effect today. Despite a "
"relative stabilization of events and humanitarian aid from organizations "
"such as the Red Star, famine and plague continues to devastate the planet."
msgstr ""
"La Luna de Maanen se encontraba más allá del efecto del Incidente y, al "
"encontrarse en una de las principales rutas de evacuación, acabó "
"convirtiéndose en un punto caliente de refugiados, circunstancia que ha "
"afectado gravemente al futuro del planeta.\n"
"Tras el Incidente, muchas naves de refugiados dañadas llegaron a la Luna de "
"Maanen; mientras que las más aptas para el espacio siguieron adelante, un "
"gran número se quedó atrás para reparaciones de emergencia. Pero el material "
"necesario para reparar las naves pronto se agotó y la luna no disponía de "
"viviendas para albergar a tantos refugiados, por lo que muchas de las naves "
"que permanecieron en el planeta se convirtieron en viviendas temporales para "
"alojar a la población masivamente incrementada.\n"
"Al agotarse los suministros locales y ante la improbabilidad de que llegaran "
"más, dada la desorganización del gobierno del Imperio, el Gobernador del "
"Imperio local declaró el estado de emergencia que sigue vigente hoy en día. "
"A pesar de una relativa estabilización de los acontecimientos y de la ayuda "
"humanitaria de organizaciones como la Estrella Roja, el hambre y la peste "
"siguen devastando el planeta."

msgid ""
"Given that few ships wish to land on Maanen's Moon, and exacerbated by the "
"fact that even fewer are given clearance, the spaceport bar has few patrons. "
"Most of them are Imperial bureaucrats and military personal who are forced "
"to live here to try to keep control of the population; among the faces here, "
"there is an almost universal look of desperation to leave this planet."
msgstr ""
"Dado que pocas naves desean aterrizar en la Luna de Maanen, y agravado por "
"el hecho de que aún menos reciben autorización, el bar del puerto espacial "
"tiene pocos clientes. La mayoría son burócratas del Imperio y personal "
"militar que se ven obligados a vivir aquí para intentar mantener el control "
"de la población; entre los rostros que aquí se ven, hay una mirada casi "
"universal de desesperación por abandonar este planeta."

msgid "Maatsu"
msgstr "Maatsu"

msgid ""
"Though Maatsu's surface was never truly tamed, there is a fairly substantial "
"population here. The larger population centres are kept climate neutral by "
"localized weather control systems, while some of the more remote regions are "
"left to the elements. This has made Maatsu a bit of an attraction to "
"adventurous types who like to go out into the wild."
msgstr ""
"Aunque la superficie de Maatsu nunca fue realmente domesticada, hay una "
"población bastante considerable. Los centros de población más grandes se "
"mantienen con un clima neutro gracias a los sistemas de control "
"meteorológico localizados, mientras que algunas de las regiones más remotas "
"se dejan a merced de los elementos. Esto ha convertido a Maatsu en una "
"atracción para los aventureros a los que les gusta adentrarse en la "
"naturaleza."

msgid ""
"Maatsu sees a fair bit of commercial traffic, so its spaceport bar thrives. "
"Prices of food and drink are exorbitant as a result, but that's nothing new "
"to the average interplanetary trader. So long as the basic facilities are "
"present and readily available, bars can get away with quite a lot."
msgstr ""
"Maatsu recibe bastante tráfico comercial, por lo que su bar del puerto "
"espacial prospera. Los precios de la comida y la bebida son exorbitantes, "
"pero eso no es nada nuevo para el comerciante interplanetario medio. "
"Mientras las instalaciones básicas estén presentes y disponibles, los bares "
"pueden salirse con la suya."

msgid "Madeleine Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Madeleine"

msgid ""
"In a strange twist of fate, Madeleine Enclave was named after the "
"granddaughter of the first commander to be stationed here. The place serves "
"as the Empire's southernmost military base. It was originally little more "
"than a minor depot, but has grown into an important line of defence against "
"the southern pirates in recent cycles."
msgstr ""
"En un extraño giro del destino, el Enclave Madeleine recibió el nombre de la "
"nieta del primer comandante destinado aquí. El lugar sirve como la base "
"militar más meridional del Imperio. Originalmente era poco más que un "
"depósito menor, pero en los últimos ciclos se ha convertido en una "
"importante línea de defensa contra los piratas del sur."

msgid ""
"Since traders don't come to this military base, the bar is only frequented "
"by Imperial military personnel. It's more like a canteen than a bar, really."
msgstr ""
"Como los comerciantes no vienen a esta base militar, el bar sólo es "
"frecuentado por el personal militar imperial. En realidad, es más una "
"cantina que un bar."

msgid "Madria"
msgstr "Madria"

msgid ""
"Madria is one of the few immigration worlds in Sirius space. Colonists from "
"the Frontier constantly trickle into Esker, and they all end up here. The "
"new arrivals are immediately converted and incorporated into the Shaira "
"echelon, which is why that group is over-represented on this world. Only "
"after several cycles of life on Madria do the immigrants get permission to "
"move to other Sirius worlds or serve in the Sirius military."
msgstr ""
"Madria es uno de los pocos mundos de inmigración en el espacio Sirio. Los "
"colonos de la Frontera llegan constantemente a Esker, y todos acaban aquí. "
"Los recién llegados son inmediatamente convertidos e incorporados al "
"escalafón Shaira, por lo que ese grupo está sobrerrepresentado en este "
"mundo. Sólo después de varios ciclos de vida en Madria, los inmigrantes "
"obtienen el permiso para trasladarse a otros mundos Sirio o servir en el "
"ejército Sirio."

msgid ""
"There are two spaceport bars on Madria, one for regular visitors and one for "
"immigrants. The one for immigrants is more or less a portal into Sirius "
"society - a one way portal. Normal spacers stay away from it."
msgstr ""
"En Madria hay dos bares en el puerto espacial, uno para los visitantes "
"habituales y otro para los inmigrantes. El de los inmigrantes es más o menos "
"un portal a la sociedad. Los espaciales normales se mantienen alejados de él."

msgid "Magellan"
msgstr "Magellan"

msgid ""
"Magellan, named after the famous Earth explorer, is one of the Soromid's "
"more recent terraforming ventures. The planet is arid and inhospitable, but "
"work has begun to change the ecosphere and introduce weather systems that "
"will support life. Support from the Soromid core is sketchy though, and the "
"colonists here have to improvise a lot of the time."
msgstr ""
"Magallanes, que lleva el nombre del famoso explorador de la Tierra, es una "
"de las empresas de terraformación más recientes Soromida. El planeta es "
"árido e inhóspito, pero se ha empezado a trabajar para cambiar la ecosfera e "
"introducir sistemas climáticos que permitan la vida. Sin embargo, el apoyo "
"del núcleo Soromida es escaso, y los colonos tienen que improvisar la mayor "
"parte del tiempo."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is full of bedraggled colonists who are trying to get away "
"from their hard everyday lives. Though a fairly unimpressive facility, it "
"still beats the habitat complexes that litter the surrounding desert. "
"Magellan has a long way to go."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial está lleno de colonos desaliñados que intentan "
"alejarse de su dura vida cotidiana. Aunque es una instalación bastante poco "
"impresionante, sigue siendo mejor que los complejos de hábitats que pueblan "
"el desierto circundante. Magallanes tiene un largo camino por recorrer."

msgid "Majesteka II"
msgstr "Majesteka II"

msgid ""
"Majesteka II was originally planned for terraforming by the Empire. However, "
"before completion the Incident struck and in its half-finished state it was "
"redesigned as a planet to accommodate all the incoming refugees. With a "
"barely breathable atmosphere, poorly developed cities, and a population that "
"well exceeds the limits that it could support at maximum, Majesteka II is "
"covered in permanent gloom. Those who can afford it and are lucky enough to "
"find a way off leave to not be condemned to a life of scarcity and "
"depression. Although technically part of the Empire, through legal loopholes "
"it is considered to be under temporary independent control, allowing the "
"living standards to fall well below the worst in the Empire."
msgstr ""
"Majesteka II fue planeado inicialmente para ser terraformado por el Imperio. "
"Sin embargo, antes de su finalización se produjo el Incidente y, en su "
"estado a medio terminar, fue rediseñado como planeta para acoger a todos los "
"refugiados que llegaban. Con una atmósfera apenas respirable, ciudades poco "
"desarrolladas y una población que supera con creces los límites que podría "
"soportar al máximo, Majesteka II está cubierto de una penumbra permanente. "
"Aquellos que pueden permitírselo y tienen la suerte de encontrar una salida "
"se marchan para no verse condenados a una vida de escasez y depresión. "
"Aunque técnicamente forma parte del Imperio, por lagunas legales se "
"considera que está bajo control independiente temporal, lo que permite que "
"el nivel de vida esté muy por debajo del peor del Imperio."

msgid ""
"Just like the atmosphere throughout the planet, the spaceport bar is a very "
"glum place. The installations look improvised, but the layers of dust "
"indicate that man cycles have passed without any serious reforms. Many "
"vagabonds spend their time here trying to find a ship to get them out of the "
"dump. Not the best place to spend your time."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que la atmósfera deel planeta, el bar del puerto espacial es un "
"lugar muy lúgubre. Las instalaciones parecen improvisadas, pero las capas de "
"polvo indican que los ciclos del hombre han pasado sin ninguna reforma "
"seria. Muchos vagabundos pasan aquí el tiempo intentando encontrar una nave "
"que les saque del vertedero. No es el mejor lugar para pasar el tiempo."

msgid "Majesteka IV"
msgstr "Majesteka IV"

msgid "Majesteka Prime"
msgstr "Majesteka Prime"

msgid ""
"Majesteka Prime is a tough planet battled by constant storms that can cover "
"an entire hemisphere at a time. Living requires constant battling the "
"elements, which is why the Dvaered designed it as a military training "
"complex. Many rookies spend cycles here where they are hardened by the "
"constant fight against the elements. Those that survive often go on to lead "
"successful military careers in space. Other than the abnormally tempestuous "
"climate, there is not much interesting to the planet."
msgstr ""
"Majesteka Prime es un planeta duro, azotado por tormentas constantes que "
"pueden cubrir todo un hemisferio a la vez. Vivir requiere luchar "
"constantemente contra los elementos, por eso los Dvaered lo diseñaron como "
"complejo de entrenamiento militar. Muchos novatos pasan aquí ciclos en los "
"que se endurecen con la lucha constante contra los elementos. Los que "
"sobreviven suelen tener una exitosa carrera militar en el espacio. Aparte "
"del clima anormalmente tempestuoso, el planeta no tiene mucho de interesante."

msgid ""
"The bar is hidden deep inside the military complex citadel in a futile "
"effort to guard it against the elements. The floor is a constant mess of mud "
"that never quite dries. Due to the abrasiveness of the elements contained in "
"the mud, cleaning robots never really survive long and it has become a "
"custom for newer recruits to be forced to futilely try to mop the floor. The "
"selection of drinks is dominated by a stout brewed locally from algae that "
"thrives in the constant storms. It is extremely sour and leaves a bitter "
"aftertaste, but all the locals seem to be completely used to it."
msgstr ""
"El bar está escondido en lo más profundo de la ciudadela del complejo "
"militar, en un vano esfuerzo por protegerlo de los elementos. El suelo es un "
"amasijo constante de barro que nunca acaba de secarse. Debido a la "
"abrasividad de los elementos contenidos en el barro, los robots de limpieza "
"nunca sobreviven mucho tiempo y se ha convertido en una costumbre que los "
"nuevos reclutas se vean obligados a intentar inútilmente fregar el suelo. La "
"selección de bebidas está dominada por una cerveza negra elaborada "
"localmente a partir de algas que prosperan en las constantes tormentas. Es "
"extremadamente ácida y deja un regusto amargo, pero todos los lugareños "
"parecen estar completamente acostumbrados a ella."

msgid "Malebolge"
msgstr "Malebolge"

msgid "Malebolge III"
msgstr "Malebolge III"

msgid "Malebolge IV"
msgstr "Malebolge IV"

msgid ""
"A small smouldering planet that not even the most resilient neohuman can "
"survive, Malbolge IV is mainly used for flybys of bioships to try to burn "
"exterior parasites and hull flakes off. Due to the different sensitivities "
"of bioships, some have an extreme dislike of such manoeuvres and have been "
"known to refuse to cooperate with their captains when repeatedly forced to "
"perform such flybys."
msgstr ""

msgid "Malebolge V"
msgstr "Malebolge V"

msgid "Manis"
msgstr "Manis"

msgid ""
"Manis is a cool world, though it still counts as earthlike. Unlike many "
"other class M planets in the galaxy, no terraforming was ever performed "
"here, so the world has almost the same ecosystem it did when it was first "
"settled during the Second Growth. Many people are attracted to this "
"\"authentic\" feel of the planet, which accounts for a significant portion "
"of its popularity."
msgstr ""
"Manis es un mundo genial, aunque sigue contando como terrestre. A diferencia "
"de muchos otros planetas de clase M de la galaxia, aquí nunca se realizó "
"ninguna terraformación, por lo que el mundo tiene casi el mismo ecosistema "
"que tenía cuando fue colonizado por primera vez durante el Segundo "
"Crecimiento. A mucha gente le atrae esta sensación de \"autenticidad\" del "
"planeta, lo que explica una parte importante de su popularidad."

msgid ""
"Perhaps uniquely in the entire galaxy, Manis' spaceport bar doesn't serve "
"alcohol. It has any amount of sodas and herbal teas available, but they "
"don't seem as effective at attracting customers to the bar as would your "
"ordinary spacer's swill."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez sea el único en toda la galaxia, el bar del puerto espacial de Manis "
"no sirve alcohol. Dispone de cualquier cantidad de refrescos y tés de "
"hierbas, pero no parecen tan eficaces para atraer a los clientes al bar como "
"lo haría la ordinaria bazofia espacial."

msgid "Mannannan"
msgstr "Mannannan"

msgid ""
"Mannannan is one of the more frequently visited Dvaered worlds. "
"Uncharacteristically for a Dvaered planet, its political policies and its "
"economy have remained fairly stable, since none of the Warlords controlling "
"the planet have ever bothered to change the local laws in major ways. This "
"has made Mannannan a favourable place to trade for foreigners. Of course, "
"the Dvaered Warlords seem to be oblivious to this, so Mannannan will likely "
"continue to be a unicum."
msgstr ""
"Mannannan es uno de los mundos Dvaered más visitados. Inusualmente para un "
"planeta Dvaered, sus políticas y su economía han permanecido bastante "
"estables, ya que ninguno de los Señores de la Guerra que controlan el "
"planeta se ha molestado en cambiar las leyes locales de manera importante. "
"Esto ha hecho que Mannannan sea un lugar favorable para el comercio para "
"extranjeros. Por supuesto, los Señores de la Guerra Dvaered parecen ser "
"ajenos a esto, por lo que Mannannan probablemente seguirá siendo un único."

msgid ""
"This bar is one of many. The increase in trade has also brought an increase "
"in tastes, so there are several places that cater to particular tastes, even "
"some very unsavoury ones. Fortunately, the most accessible bar seems to be "
"as respectable as bars come."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es uno de tantos. El aumento del comercio también ha traído consigo "
"un aumento de los gustos, por lo que hay varios lugares que atienden a "
"gustos particulares, incluso algunos muy desagradables. Afortunadamente, el "
"bar más accesible parece ser tan respetable como los bares."

msgid "Manuel Station"
msgstr "Estación Manuel"

msgid ""
"Manuel Station is named after Eduard Manuel Goddard, the man to which House "
"Goddard owes its existence. The station is primarily a shipyard, and thus "
"contributes a great deal to House Goddard's local economy. Its position "
"around Goddard III is no coincidence, as the lifeless planet provides many "
"of the raw materials needed to produce space ships."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Manuel lleva el nombre de Eduard Manuel Goddard, el hombre al "
"que la Casa Goddard debe su existencia. La estación es principalmente un "
"astillero, por lo que contribuye en gran medida a la economía local de la "
"Casa Goddard. Su posición en torno a Goddard III no es casualidad, ya que el "
"planeta sin vida proporciona muchas de las materias primas necesarias para "
"producir naves espaciales."

msgid ""
"The station's bar is more businesslike than recreational. The people who "
"come here are either traders who came to load or unload goods, or potential "
"customers looking for a Goddard-made ship. Nobody is really interested in "
"just passing the time, because time is money on Manuel Station."
msgstr ""
"El bar de la estación es más comercial que recreativo. La gente que viene "
"aquí son comerciantes que vienen a cargar o descargar mercancías, o clientes "
"potenciales que buscan una nave fabricada por Goddard. Nadie está realmente "
"interesado en pasar el rato, porque el tiempo es dinero en la Estación "
"Manuel."

msgid "Marauder Citadel"
msgstr "Ciudadela Merodeador"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This Station serves as a patrol point and refuelling depot for runs into the "
"Southern reaches of the Dvaered. The station is large and well-supplied, "
"providing an ample launching pad and rallying point near Sirius space."
msgstr ""
"Esta Estación sirve como punto de patrulla y depósito de reabastecimiento "
"para las incursiones en el Sur del Dvaered. La estación es grande y está "
"bien abastecida, proporcionando una amplia plataforma de lanzamiento y un "
"punto de reunión cerca del espacio Sirio."

msgid "The bar is completely unnoteworthy, besides the vile stench."
msgstr "El bar es completamente imperceptible, además del vil hedor."

msgid "Margarita I"
msgstr "Margarita I"

msgid "Margarita II"
msgstr "Margarita II"

msgid "Margarita IV"
msgstr "Margarita IV"

msgid "Margot"
msgstr "Margot"

msgid ""
"Margot teeters on the brink of classes M and O. It just about matches the "
"criteria for class O, having a dry surface area just short of the maximum "
"area allowed. The difference is minimal, however, and it is speculated that "
"if the world had a moon, the tides would reveal just enough extra land to "
"switch the planet to class M during low tide."
msgstr ""
"Margot se encuentra al borde de las clases M y O. Casi cumple con los "
"criterios de la clase O, ya que su superficie seca no alcanza el área máxima "
"permitida. Sin embargo, la diferencia es mínima, y se especula que si el "
"mundo tuviera una luna, las mareas revelarían suficiente tierra extra para "
"cambiar el planeta a la clase M durante la marea baja."

msgid ""
"This bar is a commuters' bar. Every day, a large stream of people flows to "
"and from the spaceport, where vast transport ships ferry them to the nearby "
"planet of Zazarin to work. The flow is fairly continuous in both directions, "
"as day-night cycles tend to lose their meaning when more than one planet is "
"involved."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es un bar de viajeros. Cada día, un gran flujo de personas va y "
"viene del puerto espacial, donde grandes naves de transporte los llevan al "
"cercano planeta de Zazarin para trabajar. El flujo es bastante continuo en "
"ambas direcciones, ya que los ciclos día-noche tienden a perder su "
"significado cuando se trata de más de un planeta."

msgid "Marius Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Marius"

msgid ""
"Marius Enclave used to be a customs station of the old Empire, checking "
"traffic bound for Sol and the core Imperial systems. Now, in the post-"
"Incident era, the station had been first repurposed to handle those fleeing "
"from the irradiated worlds and to serve as a first line of defence from "
"anything that can come out of the Sol Nebula. But since it is perpetually "
"under-staffed and under-equipped, Marius Enclave is barely capable of "
"maintaining its own presence in Raelid, let alone protect or manage anything "
"else."
msgstr ""
"El Enclave de Marius solía ser una estación aduanera del antiguo Imperio, "
"que controlaba el tráfico con destino a Sol y a los sistemas imperiales "
"centrales. Ahora, en la era posterior al Incidente, la estación ha sido "
"reasignada en primer lugar para ocuparse de aquellos que huyen de los mundos "
"irradiados y para servir como primera línea de defensa ante cualquier cosa "
"que pueda salir de la Nebulosa de Sol. Pero como está perpetuamente "
"infradotada de personal y de equipo, el Enclave de Marius apenas es capaz de "
"mantener su propia presencia en Raelid, por no hablar de proteger o "
"gestionar cualquier otra cosa."

msgid ""
"This bar is self-service most of the time. All Empire personnel on board "
"have their hands full with double shifts, repair duties and briefings. Few "
"have the spare time to even visit the spacedock bar, let alone staff it."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es de autoservicio la mayor parte del tiempo. Todo el personal del "
"Imperio a bordo tiene las manos llenas con los dobles turnos, las tareas de "
"reparación y las reuniones informativas. Pocos tienen tiempo para visitar el "
"bar del muelle, y mucho menos para atenderlo."

msgid "Mason I"
msgstr "Mason I"

msgid "Mason II"
msgstr "Mason II"

msgid "Mason IV"
msgstr "Mason IV"

msgid "Massia I"
msgstr "Massia I"

msgid "Massia IV"
msgstr "Massia IV"

msgid "Massia IVa"
msgstr "Massia IVa"

msgid "Mastodon Station"
msgstr "Estación Mastodonte"

msgid ""
"Mastodon Station is a power generator, supplying the local planets with "
"energy cells. It also produces power cores and low power energy weapons for "
"the ships produced at Orville Shipyard."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Mastodonte es un generador de energía que suministra células "
"energéticas a los planetas locales. También produce núcleos de energía y "
"armas de baja potencia para las naves producidas en el Astillero Orville."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is constantly filled with the low hum of heavy machinery. "
"The entire station reverberates with it, which really gives you the "
"impression that the place is active."
msgstr ""
"En el bar del muelle espacial esta constantemente lleno con el zumbido de la "
"maquinaria pesada. Toda la estación reverbera con él, lo que realmente da la "
"impresión de que el lugar está activo."

msgid "Maus I"
msgstr "Maus I"

msgid "Maus II"
msgstr "Maus II"

msgid "Maus III"
msgstr "Maus III"

msgid "Maya"
msgstr "Maya"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Mayla I"
msgstr "Ianella I"

msgid ""
"An extremely active molten planet with only small rocky floating islands to "
"land on. You can only land on the largest ones, as most seem unable to "
"support your ship's mass. To go outside and test your space suit's thermal "
"resistance would be unwise."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Mayla III"
msgstr "Elza III"

msgid ""
"With a highly corrossive atmosphere, Mayla III is not a planet most ships, "
"even with space-hardy hulls, should stay on for long. You hope it won't "
"stain your ship's hull permanently."
msgstr ""

msgid "Medenus Observatory"
msgstr "Observatorio Medenus"

msgid ""
"Medenus Observatory is a semi-public astronomical station. Built at the edge "
"of Soromid space as well as the outer fringe of human inhabited space, its "
"main purpose is to learn more about the universe that lies beyond. Although "
"hyperspace travel has made classical astronomy largely obsolete, there are "
"still merits in being able to see the universe as it was in the distant past."
msgstr ""
"El Observatorio Medenus es una estación astronómica semipública. Construida "
"en el límite del espacio Soromida, así como en la franja exterior del "
"espacio habitado por los humanos, su principal objetivo es aprender más "
"sobre el universo que hay más allá. Aunque los viajes hiperespaciales han "
"hecho que la astronomía clásica quede en gran medida obsoleta, todavía tiene "
"mérito poder ver el universo tal y como era en un pasado lejano."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is also the central communal area of the station. "
"Researchers and astronomy enthusiasts gather here to discuss readings, "
"comparisons of observations with real-time data, and the latest theories "
"about the Incident."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial es también la zona común central de la estación. "
"Los investigadores y los aficionados a la astronomía se reúnen aquí para "
"discutir las lecturas, las comparaciones de las observaciones con los datos "
"en tiempo real y las últimas teorías sobre el Incidente."

msgid "Megala"
msgstr "Megala"

msgid "Megan Station"
msgstr "Estación Megan"

msgid ""
"The Frontier is relatively poor, and part of the reason for this is that the "
"Frontier is lacking in energy output. In an attempt to reinforce this weak "
"link, the Frontier Council sanctioned the construction of a deep-space power "
"generator, which was to provide energy cells to industries across Frontier "
"space. That generator is Megan Station."
msgstr ""
"La Frontera es relativamente pobre, y parte de la razón es que la Frontera "
"carece de producción de energía. En un intento de reforzar este punto débil, "
"el Consejo de la Frontera sancionó la construcción de un generador de "
"energía en el espacio profundo, que debía proporcionar células de energía a "
"las industrias de todo el espacio de la Frontera. Ese generador es la "
"Estación Megan."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is quite plain in its appointments. The Frontier people "
"have learned to be practical and utilitarian, and so didn't waste any more "
"space or effort on the bar onboard Megan than was required."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial es bastante sencillo en su equipamiento. La gente "
"de Frontera ha aprendido a ser práctica y utilitaria, por lo que no ha "
"malgastado más espacio o esfuerzo en el bar de a bordo de Megan del "
"necesario."

msgid "Megas"
msgstr "Megas"

msgid ""
"Megas is a poor world filled with unskilled labourers. It is a world of "
"little value, but many an aspiring Warlord has started a successful campaign "
"by taking Megas and using it as a base of operation."
msgstr ""
"Megas es un mundo pobre lleno de trabajadores no cualificados. Es un mundo "
"de poco valor, pero muchos aspirantes a Señor de Guerra han comenzado una "
"exitosa campaña tomando Megas y utilizándolo como base de operaciones."

msgid ""
"The patrons of this bar are all hard-faced, tight-lipped individuals. They "
"will give you the time of day, but most would rather forget their troubles "
"by applying enough alcohol to them."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes de este bar son todos individuos de cara dura y labios "
"apretados. Te darán la hora, pero la mayoría prefiere olvidar sus problemas "
"aplicando suficiente alcohol."

msgid "Melendez Dome"
msgstr "Cúpula Melendez"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Melendez Dome were originally a military listening post created during "
"the Faction Wars, but was nearly destroyed and abandoned when the Empire was "
"formed. However, after the Third Growth it was rediscovered by an ambitious "
"entrepreneur and refurbished as a small-scale starship development research "
"laboratory. This company would later become part of the Melendez "
"Corporation, and the station became an engine test centre with the name it "
"has kept until today: the Melendez Dome.\n"
"In later years the station was partially ceded to the Empire and expanded "
"with a racing facility for the recruitment and training of fighter pilots. "
"While the Melendez Corporation still retains significant control of the "
"station and operations, it is legally considered under Imperial jurisdiction."
msgstr ""
"La Cúpula Meléndez fue originalmente un puesto de escucha militar creado "
"durante las Guerras de Facción, pero estuvo a punto de ser destruido y "
"abandonado cuando se formó el Imperio. Sin embargo, tras el Tercer "
"Crecimiento fue redescubierta por un ambicioso empresario y reformada como "
"laboratorio de investigación de desarrollo para naves estelares a pequeña "
"escala. Esta empresa pasaría más tarde a formar parte de la Corporación "
"Meléndez, y la estación se convirtió en un centro de pruebas de motores con "
"el nombre que ha mantenido hasta hoy: la Cúpula Meléndez.\n"
"En años posteriores, la estación fue cedida parcialmente al Imperio y "
"ampliada con una instalación de carreras para el reclutamiento y "
"entrenamiento de pilotos de caza. Aunque la Corporación Meléndez aún "
"conserva un control significativo de la estación y sus operaciones, "
"legalmente se considera bajo jurisdicción Imperial."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar has a real-time feed showing the multiple racetracks in real-time. "
"The counter is made of one of the original prototype engines for the "
"Quicksilver model Courier ship, partially cut to both show the inner "
"workings and to provide a flat counter top for serving drinks. Many of the "
"patrons are viewing and making informal bets on the different races. Overall "
"it is surprisingly less rowdy than one would expect from a competitive "
"racing venue full of hot-shot young pilots trying to make a name for "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"El bar cuenta con una pantalla que muestra los múltiples circuitos de "
"carreras en tiempo real. El mostrador está hecho con uno de los motores "
"prototipo originales de la nave modelo Correo de Azogue, parcialmente "
"cortado para mostrar su funcionamiento interno y proporcionar una superficie "
"plana para servir bebidas. Muchos de los clientes miran las carreras y hacen "
"apuestas informales. En general, es sorprendentemente menos ruidoso de lo "
"que cabría esperar de un lugar de competición lleno de jóvenes pilotos que "
"intentan hacerse un nombre."

msgid "Memory of Sorom"
msgstr "Memoria de Sorom"

msgid ""
"This is the headquarters of all spaceborne Soromid military operations. It "
"was dedicated in memory of the Soromid's original homeworld, Sorom. Though "
"the Incident happened many cycles ago and most Soromid are too young to "
"remember their planet of origin, the emotional attachment is shared among "
"young and old alike."
msgstr ""
"Este es el cuartel general de todas las operaciones militares Soromida en el "
"espacio. Se dedicó a la memoria del mundo natal original de los Soromida, "
"Sorom. Aunque el incidente ocurrió hace muchos ciclos y la mayoría de los "
"Soromida son demasiado jóvenes para recordar su planeta de origen, el apego "
"emocional es compartido entre jóvenes y viejos por igual."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar, if you can even call it that, is just a modest section of "
"a larger facility that's used for all sorts of military-to-civilian "
"business, such as recruitment procedures. The place is always busy. Memory "
"of Sorom is not a place for anyone to relax."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial, si es que se le puede llamar así, no es más que "
"una modesta sección de una instalación más grande que se utiliza para todo "
"tipo de asuntos entre militares y civiles, como los procedimientos de "
"reclutamiento. El lugar está siempre ocupado. La Memoria de Sorom no es un "
"lugar para que nadie se relaje."

msgid "Mendez"
msgstr "Mendez"

msgid ""
"From space, Mendez looks like a dustball. Its surface is mostly brown and "
"the only visible clouds are dust storms. It is therefore rather surprising "
"that the Soromid use this planet as a major food growing world. The Soromid "
"have developed a kind of crop that will grow in the harsh conditions of "
"Mendez. Unfortunately, the leaves are brown and tough and, while nutritious, "
"don't taste very good."
msgstr ""
"Desde el espacio, Méndez parece una bola de polvo. Su superficie es "
"mayoritariamente marrón y las únicas nubes visibles son tormentas de polvo. "
"Por lo tanto, es bastante sorprendente que los Soromida utilicen este "
"planeta como un importante mundo de cultivo de alimentos. Los Soromida han "
"desarrollado un tipo de cultivo que crece en las duras condiciones de "
"Méndez. Por desgracia, las hojas son marrones y duras y, aunque son "
"nutritivas, no tienen muy buen sabor."

msgid ""
"When there's a dust storm raging outside, the spaceport bar is filled with "
"an eerie noise. This happens quite a lot, but despite the local authorities' "
"best efforts, the sound refuses to be blocked out completely."
msgstr ""
"Cuando hay una tormenta de polvo en el exterior, el bar del puerto espacial "
"se llena de un ruido espeluznante. Esto ocurre a menudo, pero a pesar de los "
"esfuerzos de las autoridades locales, el sonido se niega a ser bloqueado por "
"completo."

msgid "Merisi I"
msgstr "Merisi I"

msgid ""
"Covered in perpetually undulating sand, made dance by endless powerful "
"storms, Merisi I is not a very comfortable stay. There seem to be traces of "
"attempted structures, or maybe crash-wrecked ships on the surface, however, "
"it is unlikely that they will ever be recoverable. You can not dally too "
"long lest your ship join the others."
msgstr ""

msgid "Merisi II"
msgstr "Merisi II"

msgid "Merisi III"
msgstr "Merisi III"

msgid "Merisi IV"
msgstr "Merisi IV"

msgid ""
"The planet is covered in a thick layer of what was once organic gunk, but "
"has degraded beyond recognition. It is speculated life here had reached the "
"primordial soup stage of evolution, but for reasons unclear, some millions "
"of years ago, the planetary core cooled, leading to an unrecoverable mass "
"extinction event. It is now a testament to the fragility of life in the "
"harsh universe."
msgstr ""

msgid "Meya"
msgstr "Meya"

msgid "MGG-003"
msgstr "MGG-003"

msgid "MGG-007"
msgstr "MGG-007"

msgid "MGG-1294"
msgstr "MGG-1294"

#. Discover will not work if the planet is found through maps
#. type = "discover",
#. asset = spob.get("Minerva Station"),
msgid "Minerva Station"
msgstr "Estación Minerva"

msgid ""
"The station consists of essentially one gigantic gambling complex. No matter "
"where you go, there seems to be gambling going on, that combined with the "
"constant coming and going of ships, creates a very high-energy frenetic "
"environment. When docking to the station there is a big neon says that "
"displays \"What happens in Limbo, stays in Limbo\"."
msgstr ""
"La estación consiste esencialmente en un gigantesco complejo de juego. Vayas "
"donde vayas, parece que hay juegos de azar, lo que, combinado con el "
"constante ir y venir de naves, crea un ambiente frenético de gran energía. "
"Al atracar en la estación hay un gran cartel de neón que dice \"Lo que pasa "
"en el Limbo, se queda en el Limbo\"."

msgid ""
"Like most of the station, the bar is directly built into the gambling "
"complex, with a constant buzz of noises from the different slot machines and "
"game tables. Station staff wiz around the floor bestowing complementary "
"drinks to newcomers and heavy gamblers alike. You can feel how the entire "
"ambience is designed to encourage excessive behaviour in a very carefully "
"planned mechanical way."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que la mayor parte de la estación, el bar está directamente "
"integrado en el complejo de juego, con un zumbido constante de ruidos "
"procedentes de las diferentes máquinas tragaperras y mesas de juego. El "
"personal de la estación se pasea por la planta ofreciendo bebidas "
"complementarias tanto a los recién llegados como a los grandes jugadores. Se "
"puede sentir cómo todo el ambiente está diseñado para fomentar el "
"comportamiento excesivo de una manera mecánica muy cuidadosamente "
"planificada."

msgid "Mining Vrata Guildhouse"
msgstr "Casa Gremial Vrata Minera"

msgid ""
"As the centre of power of the Mining Vrata Guild, one of the strongest "
"organizations in the Space Traders Society, the Mining Vrata Guildhouse "
"wields a considerable amount of influence and power. As such, the station "
"has an extravagant spacious design, significantly diverging from the "
"standard space-conscious space station layouts, likely permitted by using "
"the nearby planets as storage facilities, allowing the station itself to "
"focus mainly on its social functionality and trade.\n"
"Although the station is almost entirely devoted to the Mining Vrata, other "
"organizations in the Space Traders Society also have small chapterhouses "
"located throughout the station."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Unlike the rest of the station, the Guildhouse Grill is made entirely out of "
"stone brought from the nearby Holly I, II, and III worlds. While the floor "
"has an attractive smooth finish, the walls are much more rough with the "
"history of the Mining Vrata engraved throughout it. Overall, it does not "
"feel like a station bar at all."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia del resto de la estación, la Casa Gremial Parrilla está hecha "
"enteramente de piedra traída de los cercanos mundos Acebo I, II y III. "
"Mientras que el suelo tiene un atractivo acabado liso, las paredes son mucho "
"más ásperas, con la historia de la Vrata Minera grabada por todas partes. En "
"conjunto, no parece en absoluto un bar de estación."

msgid "Mirror I"
msgstr "Espejo I"

msgid "Mirror IV"
msgstr "Espejo IV"

msgid "Mirror VI"
msgstr "Espejo VI"

msgid "Mirror VIa"
msgstr "Espejo VIa"

msgid "Mirror VIb"
msgstr "Espejo VIb"

msgid "Mizar III"
msgstr "Mizar III"

msgid "Mizar IV"
msgstr "Mizar IV"

msgid "Mizar VI"
msgstr "Mizar VI"

msgid "M.K."
msgstr "M.K."

msgid ""
"M.K., a rather oddly named planet, holds a special place in many Soromid's "
"hearts. It is the closest inhabited world to Sorom that survived the "
"Incident. It has little else to set it apart, however. The local economy is "
"operating along predictable lines, and the population is no better off than "
"on most Soromid worlds. To most traders, M.K. is just another market to make "
"profit in."
msgstr ""
"M.K., un planeta de nombre bastante extraño, ocupa un lugar especial en el "
"corazón de muchos Soromida. Es el mundo habitado más cercano a Sorom que "
"sobrevivió al Incidente. Sin embargo, no tiene mucho más que lo distinga. La "
"economía local funciona según líneas predecibles, y la población no está "
"mejor que en la mayoría de los mundos Soromida. Para la mayoría de los "
"comerciantes, M.K. no es más que otro mercado en el que obtener beneficios."

msgid ""
"Both Soromid and non-Soromid frequent this spaceport bar. As Wildwood Nest "
"is more of a service utility than a real community, M.K. is often the first "
"real Soromid port most new traders visit. It is therefore here they get "
"their first taste of a full-fledged Soromid society. It's not uncommon to "
"find young pilots looking at the surroundings with a mixture of wonder and "
"nervousness."
msgstr ""
"Tanto los Soromida como los no Soromida frecuentan este bar del puerto "
"espacial. Como la Nido Bosquesalvaje es más un servicio que una comunidad "
"real, M.K. suele ser el primer puerto Soromida real que visitan la mayoría "
"de los nuevos comerciantes. Por lo tanto, es aquí donde tienen su primer "
"contacto con una sociedad Soromida de pleno derecho. No es raro encontrar a "
"los jóvenes pilotos observando los alrededores con una mezcla de asombro y "
"nerviosismo."

msgid "Modus"
msgstr "Modus"

msgid ""
"Modus is an unstable world, but it is surprisingly well populated. Something "
"about the planet is greatly beneficial to human fertility, which makes it a "
"popular destination for couples trying to conceive a child the natural way. "
"Of course this is not without risk, as the planet's volatile nature claims a "
"considerable number of lives each cycle."
msgstr ""
"Modus es un mundo inestable, pero está sorprendentemente bien poblado. Hay "
"algo en el planeta que favorece enormemente la fertilidad humana, lo que lo "
"convierte en un destino popular para las parejas que intentan concebir un "
"hijo de forma natural. Por supuesto, esto no está exento de riesgos, ya que "
"la naturaleza volátil del planeta se cobra un número considerable de vidas "
"en cada ciclo."

msgid ""
"This bar has chosen to constantly play a heavy beat music track. This is not "
"because people like heavy beat music, but rather to mask the tremors the "
"planet's unstable crust sometimes creates."
msgstr ""
"Este bar ha optado por reproducir constantemente una pista de música heavy "
"beat. No es porque a la gente le guste la música heavy beat, sino para "
"enmascarar los temblores que a veces genera la inestable corteza del planeta."

msgid "Mokoshotar Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Mokoshotar"

msgid ""
"This station protects the Empire's north-western flank from incursions. It "
"is a modern station, with a large complement of crew and ships to protect "
"the local space. However, the occasional pirate still slips through, but not "
"in enough numbers to be a true threat."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación protege el flanco noroeste del Imperio de las incursiones. Es "
"una estación moderna, con una gran dotación de tripulación y naves para "
"proteger el espacio local. Sin embargo, todavía se cuela algún pirata "
"ocasional, pero no en número suficiente como para ser una verdadera amenaza."

msgid ""
"The bar is clean and orderly, and there are several bartenders tending to "
"the needs of the patrons. Several officers come and go to talk to the men in "
"here."
msgstr ""
"El bar está limpio y ordenado, y hay varios camareros atendiendo las "
"necesidades de los clientes. Varios oficiales van y vienen para hablar con "
"los hombres que están aquí."

msgid "Monogram III"
msgstr "Monograma III"

msgid "Monogram IV"
msgstr "Monograma IV"

msgid "Monogram V"
msgstr "Monograma V"

msgid "Monsoon Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Monsoon"

msgid ""
"Monsoon Cloister is the lone bastion of Sirian law enforcement in this area "
"of space. Though the region is generally quiet, the soldiers here take their "
"responsibility seriously."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Monzón es el único bastión de las fuerzas del orden Sirio en "
"esta zona del espacio. Aunque la región es generalmente tranquila, los "
"soldados de aquí se toman en serio su responsabilidad."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is a utilitarian, no-frills affair that is kept clean and "
"in prime functioning condition. Most of the facilities are automated, as "
"Monsoon Cloister doesn't have the space to keep on a full serving staff."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial es práctico y sin lujos, y se mantiene limpio y "
"en perfectas condiciones de funcionamiento. La mayoría de las instalaciones "
"están automatizadas, ya que el Claustro Monzón no tiene espacio para "
"mantener un personal de servicio completo."

msgid "Moor I"
msgstr "Páramo I"

msgid "Moor II"
msgstr "Páramo II"

msgid "Moor III"
msgstr "Páramo III"

msgid "Moordra I"
msgstr "Moordra I"

msgid "Moordra II"
msgstr "Moordra II"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Moorline Nidus"
msgstr "Claustro Moorline"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A local starbase that guards the peace in this sector of Soromid space, "
"Moorline Nidus is a source of confidence to the nearby inhabited worlds. "
"People tend to feel safer when a naval base is close by."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Moorline, una base estelar local que vela por la paz en este "
"sector del espacio Soromida, es una fuente de confianza para los mundos "
"habitados cercanos. La gente tiende a sentirse más segura cuando hay una "
"base naval cerca."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This spacedock bar is full of angles and straight edges, which is unusual in "
"Soromid architecture. The reason for this is that Moorline Nidus was "
"originally an Empire deep space outpost. It was abandoned toward the end of "
"the Golden Age however, and the Soromid repurposed it when they took control "
"of this area of space."
msgstr ""
"Este muelle espacial está llena de ángulos y bordes rectos, algo inusual en "
"la arquitectura Soromida. La razón es que el Claustro Moorline era "
"originalmente un puesto de avanzada del espacio profundo del Imperio. Sin "
"embargo, fue abandonada hacia el final de la Edad de Oro, y los Soromidas la "
"readaptaron cuando tomaron el control de esta zona del espacio."

msgid "Morgan Citadel"
msgstr "Ciudadela Morgan"

msgid ""
"Morgan Citadel serves as a valuable staging area in this region of space. "
"The local warlord values his position as the policeman of southern Dvaered "
"space, and makes sure his rivals are aware of his power. The result is a lot "
"of low-key but nonetheless obvious infighting between the rival warlords. "
"Dvaered High Command tolerates such antics as it keeps a large number of "
"troops in the region on hand."
msgstr ""
"La Ciudadela Morgan sirve como una valiosa zona de paso en esta región del "
"espacio. El señor de la guerra local valora su posición como policía del sur "
"del espacio Dvaered, y se asegura de que sus rivales sean conscientes de su "
"poder. El resultado es una gran cantidad de luchas internas, discretas pero "
"evidentes, entre los señores de la guerra rivales. El Alto Mando Dvaered "
"tolera estas travesuras, ya que mantiene a mano un gran número de tropas en "
"la región."

msgid ""
"The bar is more of a military canteen that reluctantly allows civilians. The "
"inhabitants are soldiers who are served the typical freeze-dried, "
"prepackaged and sub-par food and drink."
msgstr ""
"El bar es más bien una cantina militar que admite civiles a regañadientes. "
"Los habitantes son soldados a los que se les sirve la típica comida y bebida "
"liofilizada, preenvasada y de baja calidad."

msgid "Mouddar"
msgstr "Mouddar"

msgid ""
"Mouddar is a bit of a leisure resort, in all but name. While the planet does "
"have a resident population, most of its income is from tourism. The planet "
"is speckled with tiny coral peninsulae, which are perfect for all kinds of "
"water sports. Unfortunately, the enthusiasm of the Imperial adolescents who "
"come here has had a detrimental effect on the environment."
msgstr ""
"Mouddar es una especie de centro de ocio, en todo menos en el nombre. Aunque "
"el planeta tiene una población residente, la mayor parte de sus ingresos "
"proceden del turismo. El planeta está salpicado de pequeñas penínsulas de "
"coral, perfectas para practicar todo tipo de deportes acuáticos. Por "
"desgracia, el entusiasmo de los adolescentes Imperiales que acuden a él ha "
"tenido un efecto perjudicial para el medio ambiente."

msgid ""
"Nobody really cares about Mouddar's spaceport bar, apart from the traders "
"who only stop here to load and unload. Most civilian visitors, though, "
"immediately head for the sun, sand and surf that they came here to enjoy."
msgstr ""
"A nadie le interesa realmente el bar del puerto espacial de Mouddar, aparte "
"de los comerciantes que sólo se detienen aquí para cargar y descargar. La "
"mayoría de los visitantes civiles, sin embargo, se dirigen inmediatamente al "
"sol, la arena y el surf que han venido a disfrutar."

msgid "Mugen"
msgstr "Mugen"

msgid ""
"An unusually stable hot world, Mugen has become home to a wide variety of "
"industrial processing companies. Using the planet's own heat via the stable "
"magma streams that suffuse what passes for the planet's crust, smelting and "
"refining operations can be carried out at significantly reduced cost."
msgstr ""
"Mugen, un mundo caliente inusualmente estable, se ha convertido en el hogar "
"de una gran variedad de empresas de procesamiento industrial. Utilizando el "
"propio calor del planeta a través de los flujos de magma estables que "
"inundan lo que pasa por la corteza del planeta, las operaciones de fundición "
"y refinado pueden llevarse a cabo a un coste significativamente reducido."

msgid ""
"On Mugen there is a sharp tang of molten rock and metal in the air no matter "
"where you go. Air scrubbers and scent masking agents can't seem to "
"completely get rid of it despite the best efforts of environmental engineers "
"the galaxy over. This bar is no exception."
msgstr ""
"En Mugen hay un fuerte olor a roca y metal fundido en el aire, vayas donde "
"vayas. Los depuradores de aire y los agentes de enmascaramiento de olores no "
"parecen poder deshacerse por completo de él, a pesar de los esfuerzos de los "
"ingenieros medioambientales de toda la galaxia. Este bar no es una excepción."

msgid "Mutris"
msgstr "Mutris"

msgid "#pSirius Homeworld#0"
msgstr "#pMundo Hogar Sirio#0"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Mutris. The very heart of Sirius space. This is where Crater City is to be "
"found, home of Sirichana and the many Sirii pilgrims who will one day become "
"the Touched. Crater City being the most holy of places, the airspace in a "
"wide area around it is closed. The spaceport is located thousands of "
"kilometres away. All approaches happen under a tight escort, and non-Sirii "
"are confined to the commercial district of the planet's political capital."
msgstr ""
"Mutris. El corazón mismo del espacio de Sirio. Aquí se encuentra la Ciudad "
"Cráter, hogar de Sirichana y de los muchos peregrinos Sirie que un día se "
"convertirán en los Tocados. Al ser Ciudad Cráter el más sagrado de los "
"lugares, el espacio aéreo en una amplia zona a su alrededor está cerrado. El "
"puerto espacial se encuentra a miles de kilómetros. Todos los acercamientos "
"se producen bajo una estrecha escolta, y los no Sirios están confinados en "
"el distrito comercial de la capital política del planeta."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is the primary meeting place for offworlders on Mutris. "
"Since only Sirii may venture beyond the commercial district, all others are "
"either conducting business or relaxing here. As far as bars go, Mutris' is a "
"fairly accommodating one, though the various religious references make it "
"somewhat uncomfortable to some."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es el principal lugar de encuentro de los "
"extranjeros en Mutris. Dado que sólo los Sirio pueden aventurarse más allá "
"del distrito comercial, todos los demás hacen negocios o se relajan aquí. En "
"cuanto a los bares, el de Mutris es bastante acogedor, aunque las diversas "
"referencias religiosas lo hacen algo incómodo para algunos."

msgid "Myonei"
msgstr "Myonei"

msgid ""
"Myonei is an industry planet supplying many of the surrounding Soromid "
"worlds with basic necessities. The atmosphere is so dense that it can "
"actually be tapped for raw materials. Most of the infrastructure on the "
"planet is dedicated to the industry, with all of the permanent workforce "
"living up on the moon of Culex."
msgstr ""
"Myonei es un planeta industrial que abastece a muchos de los mundos Soromida "
"circundantes con productos de primera necesidad. La atmósfera es tan densa "
"que se puede aprovechar para obtener materias primas. La mayor parte de la "
"infraestructura del planeta está dedicada a la industria, y toda la mano de "
"obra permanente vive en la luna de Culex."

msgid ""
"As Myonei has quite a lot of goods to transport offworld at any given time, "
"there is never a lull in the bustle of the spaceport bar. Freighter captains "
"make up most of the clientele, as the workers tend to work continuous shifts "
"and head straight to Culex when they get off."
msgstr ""
"Como Myonei tiene una gran cantidad de mercancías que transportar fuera del "
"mundo en cualquier momento, nunca hay una pausa en el bullicio del bar del "
"puerto espacial. Los capitanes de los cargueros constituyen la mayor parte "
"de la clientela, ya que los trabajadores suelen trabajar en turnos continuos "
"y se dirigen directamente a Culex cuando bajan."

msgid "Naga"
msgstr "Naga"

msgid ""
"Naga is a purely aquatic planet. The land closest to the surface is under "
"more than a mile of water, which can make landing quite tricky for "
"inexperienced pilots. The planet is teeming with life of mind-boggling "
"variety and type. The planets scientific and aesthetic value makes it one of "
"the most favoured Za'lek worlds."
msgstr ""
"Naga es un planeta puramente acuático. La tierra más cercana a la superficie "
"está bajo más de una milla de agua, lo que puede hacer que el aterrizaje sea "
"bastante complicado para los pilotos inexpertos. El planeta está repleto de "
"vida de una variedad y tipo alucinantes. El valor científico y estético del "
"planeta lo convierte en uno de los mundos Za'lek más favorecidos."

msgid ""
"This bar is built on one of the upper decks of the underwater cities, with "
"the entire ceiling being a window out into Naga's oceans. With intense "
"lighting attracting all sorts of subaquatic life, the sight is nothing short "
"of breathtaking."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está construido en una de las cubiertas superiores de las ciudades "
"submarinas, siendo todo el techo una ventana hacia los océanos de Naga. Con "
"una intensa iluminación que atrae a todo tipo de vida subacuática, el "
"espectáculo es nada menos que impresionante."

msgid "Nanek"
msgstr "Nanek"

msgid ""
"Nanek is a rarity in Dvaered space: a world devoted to something other than "
"mining. Despite being mostly desert and ocean, Nanek is a popular retirement "
"point for soldiers, officers, and anyone else who can afford it. This makes "
"it a very popular world for warlords to conquer, and fighting here is "
"endemic. No warlord is bold enough to interfere with the relaxed lifestyles "
"of the locals, however."
msgstr ""
"Nanek es una rareza en el espacio Dvaered: un mundo dedicado a algo más que "
"a la minería. A pesar de ser mayoritariamente desierto y oceánico, Nanek es "
"un popular punto de retiro para soldados, oficiales y cualquiera que pueda "
"permitírselo. Esto lo convierte en un mundo muy popular para que los señores "
"de la guerra lo conquisten, y la lucha aquí es endémica. Sin embargo, ningún "
"señor de la guerra se atreve a interferir en el relajado estilo de vida de "
"los lugareños."

msgid ""
"The average age of the patrons here seems to be late middle age. Their "
"senses have not dulled with time, however, and you feel their eyes boring "
"into you as you sit down. But they seem friendly enough after a while."
msgstr ""
"La edad media de los clientes parece ser de mediana edad. Sin embargo, sus "
"sentidos no se han embotado con el tiempo, y sientes sus ojos clavados en ti "
"cuando te sientas. Pero al cabo de un rato parecen bastante amables."

msgid "Nappi"
msgstr "Nappi"

msgid ""
"Nappi is one of those names that gets chuckled over in distant spaceport "
"bars. The world is home to a small population that moves across the face of "
"the planet as the seasons progress, living a semi-nomadic life. The capital "
"city is always populated though, because it is the only link to the rest of "
"the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Nappi es uno de esos nombres que se cacarean en los bares de los puertos "
"espaciales lejanos. El mundo alberga una pequeña población que se desplaza "
"por la faz del planeta a medida que avanzan las estaciones, llevando una "
"vida seminómada. Sin embargo, la capital siempre está poblada, porque es el "
"único vínculo con el resto de la galaxia."

msgid ""
"Few offworlders venture beyond the spaceport bar. There is little to do in "
"the capital city other than to conduct trade, and the outside air becomes "
"unpleasant after mere hectoseconds of exposure. Besides, there's very little "
"to see, unless you enjoy looking at endless stretches of rock and sand."
msgstr ""
"Pocos extranjeros se aventuran más allá del bar del puerto espacial. Hay "
"poco que hacer en la capital, aparte de comerciar, y el aire exterior se "
"vuelve desagradable tras apenas unos hectosegundos de exposición. Además, "
"hay muy poco que ver, a no ser que te guste contemplar interminables "
"extensiones de roca y arena."

msgid "Narousse I"
msgstr "Narousse I"

msgid "Narousse II"
msgstr "Narousse II"

msgid "Narousse III"
msgstr "Narousse III"

msgid "Narousse IIIa"
msgstr "Narousse IIIa"

msgid "Narousse IV"
msgstr "Narousse IV"

msgid "Nartur I"
msgstr "Nartur I"

msgid "Nartur II"
msgstr "Nartur II"

msgid "Nartur III"
msgstr "Nartur III"

msgid "Nartur IV"
msgstr "Nartur IV"

msgid "Nartur IVa"
msgstr "Nartur IVa"

msgid "Nasano"
msgstr "Nasano"

msgid "Nava I"
msgstr "Nava I"

msgid "Neexi I"
msgstr "Neexi I"

msgid "Neexi II"
msgstr "Neexi II"

msgid "Neo Pomerania"
msgstr "Neo Pomerania"

msgid ""
"Although the Bedimann Enclave is not as powerful as the Procyon Enclave, it "
"is still powerful enough, and Neo Pomerania is very much the reason for "
"this. This Earth-like Class-M has a large population, thriving industry, and "
"the Za'lek's intellectual elite have a strong presence here. Over and all, "
"it is a fully self-sufficient world that serves as the metropolis planet for "
"the local sector of systems."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el Enclave de Bedimann no es tan poderoso como el de Procyon, sigue "
"siendo lo suficientemente poderoso, y Neo Pomerania es en gran medida la "
"razón de ello. Esta clase M similar a la Tierra tiene una gran población, "
"una industria próspera y la élite intelectual de los Za'lek tiene una fuerte "
"presencia aquí. En definitiva, es un mundo totalmente autosuficiente que "
"sirve de planeta metrópolis para el sector local de sistemas."

msgid ""
"This bar has a brace of scientists of all types loudly arguing over this or "
"that subject. Most of what they are saying escapes you, and many of the "
"laymen in the bar do not seem fazed by them a bit. A Za'lek bar to the very "
"core."
msgstr ""
"En este bar hay un par de científicos de todo tipo discutiendo a gritos "
"sobre tal o cual tema. La mayor parte de lo que dicen se te escapa, y muchos "
"de los legos en el bar no parecen inmutarse ni un poco por ellos. Un bar "
"Za'lek hasta la médula."

msgid "Neon I"
msgstr "Neon I"

msgid "Neon III"
msgstr "Neon III"

msgid "Nera"
msgstr "Nera"

msgid ""
"Nera was found by the Proteron not long after Elpa, and it turned out to be "
"a perfect complement. Where Elpa is dry and arid, Nera's surface is almost "
"entirely made up of water, to the point where those who live here have to "
"make do with underwater habitations."
msgstr ""
"Nera fue encontrada por los Proteron no mucho después de Elpa, y resultó ser "
"un complemento perfecto. Mientras que Elpa es seca y árida, la superficie de "
"Nera está formada casi en su totalidad por agua, hasta el punto de que los "
"que viven aquí tienen que conformarse con viviendas submarinas."

msgid "Neurri"
msgstr "Neurri"

msgid ""
"Though life on Neurri is tough, the planet has nevertheless evolved to be "
"one of the most prominent pieces of real estate in Soromid space. Kataka's "
"presence implies that Feye gets a lot of traffic, so economically Neurri is "
"in a good position. The world mostly subsists on rendering services to "
"Kataka, though a modest private ship building company has settled here as "
"well."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For many non-Soromid, Neurri's bar is a home away from home. Quite a lot of "
"traders come to this planet, so the spaceport bar always has a high number "
"of \"regulars\" in it. Not that they really mind being around the Soromid, "
"of course. Fine people, the Soromid. They just start giving you the creeps "
"after a while, know what I mean?"
msgstr ""
"Para muchos no Soromida, el bar de Neurri es un hogar lejos de casa. "
"Bastantes comerciantes acuden a este planeta, por lo que el bar del puerto "
"espacial siempre cuenta con un elevado número de \"asiduos\". No es que les "
"moleste estar cerca de los Soromida, por supuesto. Buena gente, los "
"Soromida. Sólo que después de un tiempo empiezan a darte escalofríos, ¿me "
"entiendes?"

msgid "New Deimos"
msgstr "Nueva Deimos"

msgid "New Dortmund"
msgstr "Nueva Dortmund"

msgid ""
"New Dortmund was founded by the very first colony ship to leave Earth, "
"Genesis. The planet itself was known only by its systematic designation for "
"a long time, New Dortmund being the name of the settlement. However, since "
"the settlement was the only thing the colonists knew for many years, its "
"name became synonymous with the world. The moon Folevo was named after the "
"leader of the Genesis expedition, who sadly perished only a few years after "
"the initial touchdown.\n"
"New Dortmund was never very successful in any sense of the term, but it is "
"still pulling its weight in the overall Frontier economy."
msgstr ""
"Nueva Dortmund fue fundada por la primera nave colonial que salió de la "
"Tierra, la Génesis. Durante mucho tiempo, el planeta sólo se conoció por su "
"denominación sistemática, siendo Nueva Dortmund el nombre del asentamiento. "
"Sin embargo, como el asentamiento era lo único que conocían los colonos "
"durante muchos años, su nombre se convirtió en sinónimo del mundo. La luna "
"Folevo recibió el nombre del líder de la expedición Génesis, que "
"lamentablemente pereció pocos años después del aterrizaje inicial.\n"
"Nueva Dortmund nunca tuvo mucho éxito en ningún sentido, pero sigue tirando "
"del carro en la economía general de la Frontera."

msgid ""
"New Dortmund's spaceport bar is mostly deserted, the locals frequenting "
"their own establishments and offworlders preferring to stay with their "
"ships. The only reason the place is still running is because the Frontier "
"Council subsidizes it, on the basis that a spaceport bar will help attract "
"people to New Dortmund. So far, it hasn't."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Nueva Dortmund está prácticamente desierto, ya "
"que los lugareños frecuentan sus propios establecimientos y los extranjeros "
"prefieren quedarse en sus naves. La única razón por la que el lugar sigue "
"funcionando es porque el Consejo de la Frontera lo subvenciona, basándose en "
"que un bar en el puerto espacial ayudará a atraer gente a Nueva Dortmund. "
"Hasta ahora, no lo ha hecho."

msgid "New Europe"
msgstr "Nueva Europa"

msgid ""
"New Europe was once a prosperous M-class world located on the major trade "
"route between Sirius space and Sol. With abundant crop yields and a stable "
"and agreeable climate, many people considered it to be very close to the old "
"less developed Earth. When the Incident occurred, New Europe was outside the "
"explosive barrier and survived unscathed. However, over time, the Nebula "
"began to encroach on the territory, and in a mere 20 cycles was able to "
"block out a significant amount of light and begin to strip the atmosphere "
"off the planet. Although the planet is not yet completely barren and "
"unlivable, it seems like the process is irreversible, leading to the "
"population trying to evacuate and leave the planet towards better "
"territories. Although there is still a fair number of people left, all "
"people of importance to the Sirius have long since left, leaving only the "
"new Nebula refugees."
msgstr ""
"Nueva Europa fue una vez un próspero mundo de clase M situado en la "
"principal ruta comercial entre el espacio Sirio y Sol. Con abundantes "
"cosechas y un clima estable y agradable, mucha gente la consideraba muy "
"cercana a la antigua Tierra menos desarrollada. Cuando se produjo el "
"Incidente, Nueva Europa se encontraba fuera de la barrera explosiva y "
"sobrevivió indemne. Sin embargo, con el tiempo, la Nebulosa comenzó a "
"invadir el territorio y, en apenas 20 ciclos, fue capaz de bloquear una "
"cantidad significativa de luz y empezar a despojar de atmósfera al planeta. "
"Aunque el planeta aún no es completamente estéril e inhabitable, parece que "
"el proceso es irreversible, lo que ha llevado a la población a intentar "
"evacuar y abandonar el planeta hacia territorios mejores. Aunque todavía "
"queda bastante gente, todas las personas importantes para Sirio se han "
"marchado hace tiempo, dejando sólo a los nuevos refugiados de Nebulosa."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The New Europe Tavern is fairly abandoned, and the few patrons that are "
"there have long faces. It seems like they would be happier drinking off "
"planet, instead of impotently waiting for the demise of their home world. By "
"the size of the tavern, it is clear that it used to be a bustling centre of "
"activity not too long ago."
msgstr ""
"La Taberna Nueva Europa está prácticamente abandonada, y los pocos clientes "
"que hay tienen caras largas. Parece que serían más felices bebiendo fuera "
"del planeta, en lugar de esperar impotentes la desaparición de su mundo "
"natal. Por el tamaño de la taberna, está claro que solía ser un bullicioso "
"centro de actividad no hace mucho tiempo."

#.
#. -- Pirate Strongholds
#. --
msgid "New Haven"
msgstr "Nuevo Refugio"

msgid ""
"New Haven is a planet located beyond the boundaries of law and justice. "
"Founded by Bartax the Great, one of the most successful pirates to ever "
"live, after Haven was annihilated. The planet's atmosphere is highly toxic "
"and has high levels of radiation outside of the stronghold. These very "
"features are what made the Empire classify it as uninhabitable, as it lacks "
"strategic resources necessary to justify the cost of terraforming. Its "
"distance from other civilized worlds affords it protection from prying eyes."
msgstr ""
"Nuevo Refugio es un planeta situado más allá de los límites de la ley y la "
"justicia. Fue fundado por Bartax el Grande, uno de los piratas más exitosos "
"de la historia, tras la aniquilación de Refugio. La atmósfera del planeta es "
"altamente tóxica y tiene altos niveles de radiación fuera de la fortaleza. "
"Estas mismas características son las que hicieron que el Imperio lo "
"clasificara como inhabitable, ya que carece de los recursos estratégicos "
"necesarios para justificar el coste de la terraformación. Su distancia de "
"otros mundos civilizados le permite protegerse de las miradas indiscretas."

msgid ""
"The Slop and Grill is one of the nastiest taverns in the universe. The food "
"and drink don't help matters. Most of it is brewed on New Haven and wouldn't "
"pass any minimal health insurance tests anywhere. Some of the booze even "
"doubles as ship fuel, in times of need. The clients are also deep space "
"thugs, pirates, black marketeers, mercenaries and other shady folk that "
"insist on keeping the ground coated with blood and broken teeth. Not a great "
"place to bring your family."
msgstr ""
"Bazofia y Parrilla es una de las tabernas más desagradables del universo. La "
"comida y la bebida no ayudan. La mayor parte se elabora en Nueva Refugio y "
"no pasaría ninguna prueba mínima de seguro sanitario en ningún sitio. Parte "
"de la bebida incluso sirve de combustible para la nave, en tiempos de "
"necesidad. Los clientes son también matones del espacio profundo, piratas, "
"mercaderes del mercado negro, mercenarios y otras personas sospechosas que "
"insisten en mantener el suelo cubierto de sangre y dientes rotos. No es un "
"buen lugar para llevar a tu familia."

msgid "New Konnor"
msgstr "Nuevo Konnor"

msgid "New Mars"
msgstr "Nuevo Marte"

msgid ""
"The Emperor's Fist project needs a lot of raw materials. A portion of those "
"materials are mined right here on New Mars, which has the advantage that no "
"trip through hyperspace is needed to get them to location. New Mars is being "
"systematically strip-mined, and as such the planet has nothing to offer in "
"the way of leisure or tourism."
msgstr ""
"El proyecto Puño del Emperador necesita muchas materias primas. Una parte de "
"esos materiales se extrae aquí mismo, en Nuevo Marte, lo que tiene la "
"ventaja de que no es necesario un viaje por el hiperespacio para llevarlos a "
"su ubicación. Nuevo Marte está siendo sistemáticamente minado, por lo que el "
"planeta no tiene nada que ofrecer en cuanto a ocio o turismo."

msgid ""
"Clean and functional, this bar has been built according to recent Imperial "
"standards. It's more a utility service than a place to unwind."
msgstr ""
"Limpio y funcional, este bar ha sido construido según las recientes normas "
"del Imperial. Es más un servicio de utilidad que un lugar para desconectar."

msgid "New Palovi"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Tucked on the dark side of Palovi IV, New Palovi is a small settlement "
"established by Free Traders to facilitate the flow of contraband around "
"House Sirius controlled space. Thanks to a particular orbital and low "
"density, New Palovi is particularly hard to pick up on sensor scans, which "
"facilitate its role as a smuggling hub in the area."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar has been completely shielded against psychic powers to "
"ensure the safety of conversations and dealings of dubious legality going "
"on. It also makes it easy to tell when a psychic enters due to clear signs "
"of discomfort."
msgstr ""

msgid "New Phobos"
msgstr "Nuevo Fobos"

msgid "New Pluto"
msgstr "Nuevo Plutón"

msgid "New Space Trade Hub"
msgstr "Nuevo Centro de Comercio Espacial"

msgid ""
"The New Space Trade Hub gathers the largest representation of the different "
"organizations of the Space Trade Society. Originally called the Santoros "
"Chapter Station, since the original Space Trade Hub was destroyed in the "
"Incident, it was re-inaugurated as the replacement and renamed the New Space "
"Trade Hub. With the recent expansion, it is now considered the largest free-"
"floating station in the galaxy.\n"
"The station is split into 4 different wings housing the assortment of guilds "
"and unions that belong to the Space Trade Society, and even quite a few that "
"do not. The large number of people working at the station, combined with the "
"constant flux of incoming traders and merchants makes it very lively with "
"trade offers being discussed even in the hallways. Security is provided by "
"the mercenary guild Astra Vigilis who make sure that pirates and wanted "
"individuals do not get on station, at least the most obvious ones, anyway."
msgstr ""
"El Nuevo Centro de Comercio Espacial reúne la mayor representación de las "
"diferentes organizaciones de la Sociedad de Comercio Espacial. Originalmente "
"llamada Estación Capitular de Santoros, desde que el Centro de Comercio "
"Espacial original fue destruido en el Incidente, fue reinaugurado como "
"sustituto y rebautizado como Nuevo Centro de Comercio Espacial. Con la "
"reciente ampliación, ahora se considera la mayor estación flotante de la "
"galaxia.\n"
"La estación está dividida en 4 alas diferentes que albergan a los distintos "
"gremios y sindicatos que pertenecen a la Sociedad de Comercio Espacial, e "
"incluso a algunos que no. El gran número de personas que trabajan en la "
"estación, combinado con el flujo constante de comerciantes y mercaderes que "
"llegan, hace que esté muy animada, con ofertas comerciales que se discuten "
"incluso en los pasillos. La seguridad corre a cargo del gremio de "
"mercenarios Astra Vigilis, que se asegura de que los piratas y los "
"individuos buscados no entren en la estación, al menos los más obvios."

msgid ""
"The bar connects and sprawls through the 4 different station wings, acting "
"as the de facto meeting place for connecting and meeting people. Originally "
"called the Santoros Dining and Drinks, it was renamed along with the station "
"to simply the Forum, given its important functionality as one of the cores "
"of the station. Provided by many of the guilds, the bar features over 17,000 "
"different drinks, making it all but impossible to find ones you truly enjoy, "
"but that doesn't stop everyone from keeping on trying."
msgstr ""
"El bar conecta y se extiende por las 4 alas diferentes de la estación, "
"actuando como lugar de encuentro de facto para conectar y conocer gente. "
"Originalmente llamado Bebidas y Comidas Santoros, fue rebautizado junto con "
"la estación a simplemente el Foro, dada su importante funcionalidad como uno "
"de los núcleos de la estación. Proporcionado por muchos de los gremios, el "
"bar cuenta con más de 17.000 bebidas diferentes, lo que hace casi imposible "
"encontrar alguna que realmente te guste, pero eso no impide que todo el "
"mundo siga intentándolo."

msgid "New Thomas"
msgstr "Nuevo Thomas"

msgid "New Xantusia"
msgstr "Nuevo Xantusia"

msgid ""
"New Xantusia is the main headquarters of the Astra Vigilis mercenary guild, "
"one of the important members of the Space Traders Society. Being quite small "
"in size, there is only a single city sprawling nearly a third of the "
"planet's frozen surface. The guild motto \"No Escape from the Pull of the "
"Stars\" is prominent in the large spaceport that accommodates what seems to "
"be many mismatched combat-ready vessels. Directly accessible from the "
"spaceport is the Astra Vigilis guildhall, with the Space Traders Society "
"hall of guilds adjacent to it. Although most of the organizations are "
"present, most of the people coming to the planet are those looking for "
"dealings with Astra Vigilis members."
msgstr ""
"Nueva Xantusia es la sede principal del gremio mercenario Astra Vigilis, uno "
"de los miembros importantes de la Sociedad de Comerciantes Espaciales. Al "
"ser bastante pequeña en tamaño, sólo hay una ciudad que se extiende por casi "
"un tercio de la superficie helada del planeta. El lema del gremio, \"No hay "
"escapatoria a la atracción de las estrellas\", destaca en el gran puerto "
"espacial que alberga lo que parecen ser muchas naves desparejadas listas "
"para el combate. Directamente accesible desde el puerto espacial está el "
"ayuntamiento de Astra Vigilis, con la sala de gremios de la Sociedad de "
"Comerciantes Espaciales adyacente. Aunque la mayoría de las organizaciones "
"están presentes, la mayoría de la gente que llega al planeta son aquellos "
"que buscan tratos con miembros de Astra Vigilis."

msgid ""
"The Vigilante Cantina is the place to do business on New Xantusia. Bounties "
"and other mercenary offers are shown in real-time on the central holo-"
"display of the cantina. Many mercenaries and bounty hunters spend their time "
"enjoying the food and drink while keeping an eye out for a good job. Every "
"so often a popular job will cause a spur of activity as people scramble to "
"complete it before others."
msgstr ""
"La Cantina del Vigilante es el lugar donde hacer negocios en Nueva Xantusia. "
"Las recompensas y otras ofertas de los mercenarios se muestran en tiempo "
"real en la pantalla holográfica central de la cantina. Muchos mercenarios y "
"cazarrecompensas pasan el tiempo disfrutando de la comida y la bebida "
"mientras buscan un buen trabajo. De vez en cuando, un trabajo popular "
"provoca una oleada de actividad, ya que la gente se apresura a completarlo "
"antes que los demás."

msgid "Newmarch A-1"
msgstr "Nuevomarzo A-1"

msgid "Newmarch D-3"
msgstr "Nuevomarzo D-3"

msgid "Nexus Shipyards HQ"
msgstr "Astilleros Nexus HQ"

msgid ""
"Although consisting mainly of a shipbuilding factory, Nexus Shipyards HQ "
"also sports an extravagant tower where the executives and marketing work, "
"directly accessible from the spaceport. The lobby is impressive, with marble "
"floors and columns, it is hard to believe that this is a station with such "
"waste of space. There is also a large waiting area and what seems to be some "
"complementary tea for people visiting, and it seems like many people decide "
"to come directly to the Nexus Shipyards HQ to make their ship purchases."
msgstr ""
"Aunque consiste principalmente en una fábrica de construcción naval, la sede "
"de los Astilleros Nexus también cuenta con una extravagante torre donde "
"trabajan los ejecutivos y el departamento de marketing, a la que se accede "
"directamente desde el puerto espacial. El vestíbulo es impresionante, con "
"suelos y columnas de mármol, cuesta creer que se trate de una estación con "
"semejante derroche de espacio. También hay una gran sala de espera y lo que "
"parece ser un té complementario para la gente que la visita, y parece que "
"mucha gente decide venir directamente a Astilleros Nexus HQ para hacer sus "
"compras de naves."

msgid ""
"The Nexus bar is split into two areas: one caters the executive class and "
"people looking for more drinks with hefty price tags, while the other is "
"more simple and dedicated to serving the factory workers. The kitchen seems "
"to be the same for both of them, the main thing that changes is the "
"presentation and expenses. Both areas have a good overlook of the ship "
"factory, where you can see the assembly line constantly producing new ships "
"to try to meet the demand. It seems like business is booming for Nexus "
"Shipyards."
msgstr ""
"El bar Nexus está dividido en dos zonas: una atiende a la clase ejecutiva y "
"a la gente que busca más bebidas con precios elevados, mientras que la otra "
"es más sencilla y está dedicada a servir a los trabajadores de la fábrica. "
"La cocina parece ser la misma en ambas, lo que más cambia es la presentación "
"y los gastos. Ambas zonas tienen una buena vista de la fábrica de naves, "
"donde se puede ver la cadena de montaje produciendo constantemente nuevas "
"naves para intentar satisfacer la demanda. Parece que el negocio va viento "
"en popa para los Astilleros Nexus."

msgid "Niflheim Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Niflheim"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Although not a large installation by any measure, Niflheim Enclave is the "
"main commercial station in the southwestern quadrant of Empire space. Though "
"it doesn't see as much traffic as the more centrally located trade hubs, it "
"provides a good opportunity for traders between the Empire, the Za'lek and "
"the Society to meet and greet. Of course, the Imperial Navy also uses this "
"station as a base of operations."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es una instalación grande en absoluto, Enclave Niflheim es la "
"principal estación comercial del cuadrante suroeste del espacio del Imperio. "
"Aunque no tiene tanto tráfico como los centros comerciales más céntricos, "
"ofrece una buena oportunidad para que los comerciantes del Imperio, los "
"Za'lek y el Consorcio se reúnan y se saluden. Por supuesto, la Armada "
"Imperial también utiliza esta estación como base de operaciones."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On Niflheim Enclave, space is at a premium. As such there is not much room "
"to spare for leisure, which shows in the spaceport bar. All tables are stand-"
"up arrangements, and there is not much room to manoeuvre. Any visitor will "
"have to be prepared for some necessary intimacies if he wants to frequent "
"this establishment."
msgstr ""
"En el Enclave Niflheim, el espacio es escaso. Por ello, no hay mucho espacio "
"para el ocio, lo que se nota en el bar del puerto espacial. Todas las mesas "
"están dispuestas de pie y no hay mucho espacio para maniobrar. Cualquier "
"visitante tendrá que estar preparado para algunas intimidades necesarias si "
"quiere frecuentar este establecimiento."

msgid "Niger I"
msgstr "Niger I"

msgid "Niger II"
msgstr "Niger II"

msgid "Nixa"
msgstr "Nixa"

msgid ""
"Nixa is a young colony. It was first settled mere years before the Incident "
"occurred. With the galaxy-wide economic collapse that followed in its wake, "
"Nixa's budding growth came close to a halt. The population struggles to make "
"the colonization project a success even so, but now that Dune has become a "
"fringe system, chances of that seem remote."
msgstr ""
"Nixa es una colonia joven. Se asentó por primera vez pocos años antes de que "
"se produjera el Incidente. Con el colapso económico de toda la galaxia que "
"le siguió, el crecimiento incipiente de Nixa estuvo a punto de detenerse. La "
"población lucha por hacer que el proyecto de colonización sea un éxito, pero "
"ahora que Duna se ha convertido en un sistema marginal, las posibilidades "
"parecen remotas."

msgid ""
"Nixa's bar is still the makeshift affair it was when the planet was first "
"colonized. There haven't been the resources nor the time to replace it with "
"something more solid."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Nixa sigue siendo el improvisado asunto que era cuando el planeta "
"fue colonizado por primera vez. No ha habido recursos ni tiempo para "
"sustituirlo por algo más sólido."

msgid "Nixon I"
msgstr "Nixon I"

msgid "Nixon II"
msgstr "Nixon II"

msgid "Nixon III"
msgstr "Nixon III"

msgid "Nixon IV"
msgstr "Nixon IV"

msgid "Nixon V"
msgstr "Nixon V"

msgid "Nocalin"
msgstr "Nocalin"

msgid ""
"Nocalin is a fairly good world for human habitation, especially if the "
"humans in question are Soromid. The surface is stable and the native "
"atmosphere is nitrox. Gravitational and orbital statistics are not too far "
"from Earth Standard. There is only one problem: Nocalin is completely and "
"utterly dry. Nothing can grow on this world without importing an ocean's "
"worth of water, which is too costly an operation by any standard. As a "
"result, Nocalin relies entirely on food imports."
msgstr ""
"Nocalin es un mundo bastante bueno para la habitabilidad humana, "
"especialmente si los humanos en cuestión son Soromida. La superficie es "
"estable y la atmósfera nativa es de nitrox. Las estadísticas gravitacionales "
"y orbitales no se alejan demasiado del estándar terrestre. Sólo hay un "
"problema: Nocalin es total y absolutamente seco. Nada puede crecer en este "
"mundo sin importar el agua de un océano, lo que es una operación demasiado "
"costosa desde cualquier punto de vista. Por ello, Nocalin depende totalmente "
"de la importación de alimentos."

msgid ""
"This spaceport bar has warning signs mounted over the doors and on the "
"walls. The signs warn travellers of the dry climate on Nocalin. Dehydration "
"is a real risk, and while exposing oneself to the outside air directly isn't "
"harmful in itself, it is a good idea to protect your skin with a "
"moisturizing lotion first."
msgstr ""
"Este bar del puerto espacial tiene carteles de advertencia montados sobre "
"las puertas y en las paredes. Los carteles advierten a los viajeros del "
"clima seco de Nocalin. La deshidratación es un riesgo real, y aunque "
"exponerse directamente al aire exterior no es perjudicial en sí mismo, es "
"buena idea protegerse antes la piel con una loción hidratante."

msgid "Nolan"
msgstr "Nolan"

msgid ""
"Yet another prison world. While Nolan is not the harshest world in Dvaered "
"space, it's shrouded in near-perpetual darkness. Convicts are kept here to "
"be shipped off to Veren for their typically brief work stints."
msgstr ""
"Otro mundo prisión. Aunque Nolan no es el mundo más duro del espacio "
"Dvaered, está envuelto en una oscuridad casi perpetua. Los convictos son "
"retenidos aquí para ser enviados a Veren para sus típicas breves temporadas "
"de trabajo."

msgid "Nonuri"
msgstr "Nonuri"

msgid ""
"Nonuri is a world with an under-developed economy, even by Frontier "
"standards. It barely manages to keep itself from going bankrupt. The people "
"who live here stay mainly out of a sense of belonging, a feeling that Nonuri "
"is their birthright. In fact, Nonuri was colonized by the colony ship "
"Wendigo, which makes Nonuri one of the oldest extrasolar human settlements. "
"Unfortunately for the locals, most of the galaxy doesn't care quite as much "
"as they do. Recently, Nonuri has seen an increase in population from Nebula "
"refugees that were not able to make it to Empire or Dvaered territories."
msgstr ""
"Nonuri es un mundo con una economía subdesarrollada, incluso para los "
"estándares de Frontera. A duras penas consigue evitar la bancarrota. La "
"gente que vive aquí se queda principalmente por un sentido de pertenencia, "
"un sentimiento de que Nonuri es su derecho de nacimiento. De hecho, Nonuri "
"fue colonizada por la nave colonial Wendigo, lo que convierte a Nonuri en "
"uno de los asentamientos humanos extrasolares más antiguos. Por desgracia "
"para los lugareños, a la mayor parte de la galaxia no le importa tanto como "
"a ellos. Recientemente, Nonuri ha visto aumentar su población con los "
"refugiados de la Nebulosa que no pudieron llegar a los territorios del "
"Imperio o Dvaered."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is humble, yet tidy and functional. The Nonurians may not "
"enjoy a rich life, but they make the most of what they've got. Though the "
"equipment is outdated, in some cases by several generations, this bar has "
"most of the things an intergalactic traveller needs to keep abreast of "
"events."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es humilde, pero ordenado y funcional. Puede que "
"los nonurianos no disfruten de una vida rica, pero aprovechan al máximo lo "
"que tienen. Aunque el equipo está anticuado, en algunos casos por varias "
"generaciones, este bar tiene la mayoría de las cosas que un viajero "
"intergaláctico necesita para mantenerse al día."

msgid "Nor"
msgstr "Nor"

msgid ""
"Nor was one of the first Dvaered worlds to be terraformed. Its abundance of "
"gas and ore make it a strategic location and a prime target for the FLF. Due "
"to repeated attacks and sabotage attempts, the Dvaered military has "
"increased the frequency of patrols."
msgstr ""
"Nor fue uno de los primeros mundos Dvaered en ser terraformados. Su "
"abundancia de gas y mineral lo convierten en un lugar estratégico y en un "
"objetivo primordial para la FLF. Debido a los repetidos ataques e intentos "
"de sabotaje, el ejército Dvaered ha aumentado la frecuencia de las patrullas."

msgid ""
"Typical of poorer Dvaered mining worlds, the Nor spaceport bar is cavernous, "
"sparsely decorated and full of drunken Dvaereds trying to forget their hard "
"labour."
msgstr ""
"Típico de los mundos mineros más pobres Dvaered, el bar del puerto espacial "
"de Nor es cavernoso, escasamente decorado y lleno Dvaereds borrachos que "
"intentan olvidar su duro trabajo."

msgid "Norpin II"
msgstr "Norpin II"

msgid ""
"Norpin II is truly at the edge of the frontier, a barely-habitable world "
"being mined and terraformed, though the latter is being done as cheaply as "
"possible, resulting in very poor conditions. The Dvaered are loathed here, "
"and it's rumoured that the local shipyard is a major source of FLF vessels."
msgstr ""
"Norpin II está realmente en el límite de la frontera, un mundo apenas "
"habitable que está siendo minado y terraformado, aunque esto último se está "
"haciendo de la forma más barata posible, lo que resulta en condiciones muy "
"pobres. Los Dvaered son odiados aquí, y se rumorea que el astillero local es "
"una fuente importante de naves FLF."

msgid ""
"The Norpin II bar isn't the safest place around. With a deep-seated loathing "
"of the Dvaered, the local citizens have brawled with Dvaered soldiers on "
"numerous occasions."
msgstr ""
"El bar Norpin II no es el lugar más seguro. Con un profundo odio hacia los "
"Dvaered, los ciudadanos del lugar se han peleado con los soldados Dvaered en "
"numerosas ocasiones."

msgid "Norpin IV"
msgstr "Norpin IV"

msgid "Nougat I"
msgstr "Nougat I"

msgid "Nougat II"
msgstr "Nougat II"

msgid ""
"The outer few kilometres of Nougat II are frozen solid, but the core of the "
"planet is still active and very hot. Most of the planetary mass is porous "
"ceramic that acts as a strong insulator, leading to the drastic temperature "
"differences between the interior and exterior."
msgstr ""

msgid "Nova Shakar"
msgstr "Nova Shakar"

msgid ""
"Nova Shakar was an utterly unremarkable Empire planet until the Emperor's "
"Fist project began. Increasingly, Empire officials are settling here, given "
"its close proximity to Gamma Polaris. In the time since then, it's become a "
"supplier of many materials for the project, gaining importance within the "
"Empire."
msgstr ""
"Nova Shakar era un planeta del Imperio totalmente anodino hasta que comenzó "
"el proyecto del Puño del Emperador. Cada vez más funcionarios del Imperio se "
"instalan aquí, dada su proximidad a Gamma Polaris. En el tiempo transcurrido "
"desde entonces, se ha convertido en un proveedor de muchos materiales para "
"el proyecto, ganando importancia dentro del Imperio."

msgid ""
"While not a grandiose affair, the spaceport bar is reasonably sized and "
"immaculately clean. Due to the increasing number of Empire officials making "
"their home here, it remains busy throughout the day."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es un asunto grandioso, el bar del puerto espacial tiene un tamaño "
"razonable y está inmaculadamente limpio. Debido al creciente número de "
"funcionarios del Imperio que tienen aquí su hogar, permanece ocupado durante "
"todo el día."

msgid "NS-1"
msgstr "EN-1"

msgid ""
"This hulking Node Station is one of the places of habitation for the "
"uploaded Thurion."
msgstr ""
"Esta imponente Estación Nodo es uno de los lugares de habitación de los "
"Turion cargados."

msgid "NS-144"
msgstr "ES-144"

msgid "NS-27"
msgstr "ES-27"

msgid "NS-42"
msgstr "ES-42"

msgid "NS-63"
msgstr "ES-63"

msgid "Obelisk Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Obelisco"

msgid ""
"Obelisk Monastery is a military base; not so much an active force as much as "
"it is a reserve of military strength. Whenever a law enforcement division in "
"this region of space requires backup or heavy firepower for an operation, it "
"is Obelisk Monastery that provides.\n"
"Most of the space within the station hull is taken up by ship hangars and "
"service docks."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Obelisco es una base militar; no tanto una fuerza activa como "
"una reserva de fuerza militar. Siempre que una división de las fuerzas de "
"seguridad de esta región del espacio necesita refuerzos o potencia de fuego "
"pesada para una operación, es el Monasterio del Obelisco el que se los "
"proporciona.\n"
"La mayor parte del espacio dentro del casco de la estación está ocupado por "
"hangares de naves y muelles de servicio."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar on Obelisk Monastery is primarily used for pilots and crew "
"members to standby as an immediate response team. These people are required "
"to be immediately available in case an emergency pops up. While they are "
"idle, they have access to all sorts of training simulations and recreational "
"venues at this bar."
msgstr ""
"El muelle espacial del Monasterio Obelisco se utiliza principalmente para "
"que los pilotos y los miembros de la tripulación estén a la espera como "
"equipo de respuesta inmediata. Estas personas deben estar disponibles de "
"inmediato en caso de que surja una emergencia. Mientras están inactivos, "
"tienen acceso a todo tipo de simulaciones de entrenamiento y lugares de "
"recreo en este bar."

msgid "Oberon"
msgstr "Oberon"

msgid ""
"Oberon is primarily a remote research post for various purposes deemed too "
"minor to justify placing in more prestigious stations. Most interns and new "
"researchers get their start here before moving on to better things, leading "
"to a constant renewal of personnel."
msgstr ""
"Oberon es principalmente un puesto de investigación a distancia para "
"diversos fines que se consideran demasiado pequeños para justificar su "
"colocación en estaciones más prestigiosas. La mayoría de los becarios y los "
"nuevos investigadores se inician aquí antes de pasar a cosas mejores, lo que "
"provoca una renovación constante del personal."

msgid ""
"Given the large presence of young people, you would hope the bar would be an "
"energetic and fun place. However, the overworked interns and young "
"researchers are too stressed out and engrossed in their research leading to "
"a fairly depressive and quiet atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"Dada la gran presencia de jóvenes, cabría esperar que el bar fuera un lugar "
"enérgico y divertido. Sin embargo, los becarios y los jóvenes "
"investigadores, sobrecargados de trabajo, están demasiado estresados y "
"absortos en sus investigaciones, lo que da lugar a un ambiente bastante "
"depresivo y tranquilo."

msgid "Oberon I"
msgstr "Oberon I"

msgid "Oberon III"
msgstr "Oberon III"

msgid "Oberon IV"
msgstr "Oberon IV"

msgid "Ocata"
msgstr "Ocata"

msgid "Octantis I"
msgstr "Octantis I"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An uninhabited planet devoid of atmosphere and life. Given its small size, "
"it is also quite difficult to perform the little terraforming required to "
"sustain genetically modified humans, for which the Soromid have left it be "
"for now."
msgstr ""
"Un planeta deshabitado, sin atmósfera ni vida. Dado su pequeño tamaño, "
"también es bastante difícil llevar a cabo la terraformación mínima para "
"sustentar humanos modificados genéticamente, por lo que los Soromida lo han "
"dejado así por ahora."

msgid "Odonga"
msgstr "Odonga"

msgid "Odonga m1"
msgstr "Odonga m1"

msgid ""
"This small moon's reason for existing is the valuable minerals located in "
"the crust of the volatile Odonga planet itself. It also serves as a stopping "
"point for Dvaered military ships and the occasional trader on their way into "
"Za'lek space or the wilder southern galactic regions."
msgstr ""
"La razón de ser de esta pequeña luna son los valiosos minerales que se "
"encuentran en la corteza del volátil planeta Odonga. También sirve como "
"punto de parada para las naves militares Dvaered y los ocasionales "
"comerciantes que se dirigen al espacio Za'lek o a las regiones galácticas "
"más salvajes del sur."

msgid ""
"The bar has a foot in two worlds In one, the quiet, clean efficiency of a "
"trader bar. In the other, the filthy mess of a Dvaered bar. The overall "
"effect is less than the sum of its parts."
msgstr ""
"El bar tiene un pie en dos mundos En uno, la eficiencia tranquila y limpia "
"de un bar de comerciantes. En el otro, el sucio desorden de un bar Dvaered. "
"El efecto global es menor que la suma de sus partes."

msgid "Ohon"
msgstr "Ohon"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ohon was a quiet mainly residential world, mainly catering to the Shaira "
"echelon, and accommodating many of the touched after their visit to Mutris "
"where they can continue their religious practices. When the Incident struck, "
"many refugees fled from the Nebula towards House Sirius territory. The Arch-"
"Canters decided to focus the refugees on Ohon, while trying to make more "
"permanent accommodations. What was meant to be temporary became somewhat "
"permanent, and Ohon still has large districts of slums accommodating "
"refugees. While many do go on to become Touched and begin their pilgrimage "
"to Mutris, even more continue to survive on Ohon."
msgstr ""
"Ohon era un mundo tranquilo, principalmente residencial, que acogía sobre "
"todo al escalafón Shaira y a muchos de los tocados tras su visita a Mutris, "
"donde podían continuar con sus prácticas religiosas. Cuando se produjo el "
"Incidente, muchos refugiados huyeron de la Nebulosa hacia el territorio de "
"la Casa Sirio. Los Archicantores decidieron concentrar a los refugiados en "
"Ohon, mientras intentaban establecer alojamientos más permanentes. Lo que se "
"suponía que iba a ser temporal se convirtió en algo permanente, y Ohon sigue "
"teniendo grandes distritos de chabolas que acogen a refugiados. Aunque "
"muchos se convierten en Tocados e inician su peregrinaje a Mutris, aún son "
"más los que sobreviven en Ohon."

msgid ""
"The bar is fairly tidy. It doubles as a small place of worship for Sirian "
"spacers who haven't got time to travel to the urban centres and still want "
"to practise their spirituality."
msgstr ""
"El bar está bastante ordenado. Funciona como un pequeño lugar de culto para "
"los espaciales Sirio que no tienen tiempo de viajar a los centros urbanos y "
"quieren practicar su espiritualidad."

msgid "Olario"
msgstr "Olario"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This world is the location of several harsh environment testing facilities, "
"used by military and civilian interests alike. Aside from that, there is "
"little of interest here."
msgstr ""
"En este mundo se encuentran varias instalaciones de pruebas en entornos "
"adversos, utilizadas tanto por los militares como por los civiles. Aparte de "
"eso, hay poco más de interés aquí."

msgid "Old King Cole"
msgstr "Antiguo Rey Cole"

msgid "Old Man Jack"
msgstr "El Viejo Jack"

msgid ""
"Named after the famous one-eyed pirate Jack, who was known to get into drunk "
"arguments with other pirates at Haven. Instead of it leading to a good 'ol "
"brawl, he would say nothing, get up as if to go to the loo, and end up "
"stealing the offenders ship, crash landing on a nearby planet, called Haven "
"III at the time. He would then use the escape pod to get back to the Haven "
"bar just in time for the second round of drinks. To this day, nobody ever "
"knows how he pulled it off while barely being able to walk in a straight "
"line, even pulling off feats flying an entire Pirate Kestrel by himself.\n"
"\n"
"After a long and successful career, he was able to retire as an old man on "
"Haven, however, his retirement was cut short with the demise of Haven. Some "
"survivors said he did not hesitate to run into the fray, headfirst in a "
"stolen Pirate Kestrel to buy time as non-combatants fled. Legends say he's "
"still out there stealing ships over minor arguments."
msgstr ""

msgid "Olljan"
msgstr "Olljan"

msgid ""
"Olljan is an aquatic world with a rich variety of indigenous plant and "
"animal life. In particular, the ocean's chemical composition (which contains "
"only 65% water, the rest is a mix of various chemicals) has given rise to "
"unique and amazing single-cellular life are providing biologists and medical "
"researchers with a wealth of information even today."
msgstr ""
"Olljan es un mundo acuático con una rica variedad de vida vegetal y animal "
"autóctona. En particular, la composición química del océano (que sólo "
"contiene un 65% de agua, el resto es una mezcla de diversas sustancias "
"químicas) ha dado lugar a una vida unicelular única y asombrosa que está "
"proporcionando a los biólogos e investigadores médicos una gran cantidad de "
"información incluso hoy en día."

msgid ""
"There is a running joke in Olljan's bar that one of the drinks available to "
"customers is a glass of pure, unprocessed ocean water. This, of course, "
"isn't true. The ocean's water would kill any human outright. Instead, the "
"drink on offer is a blend of unknown recipe, which is completely safe to "
"drink, but also utterly disgusting. It's amazing how many spacers really "
"believe the story about the ocean water."
msgstr ""
"En el bar de Olljan existe la broma de que una de las bebidas disponibles "
"para los clientes es un vaso de agua de mar pura y sin procesar. Esto, por "
"supuesto, no es cierto. El agua del océano mataría a cualquier ser humano. "
"En su lugar, la bebida que se ofrece es una mezcla de receta desconocida, "
"que es completamente segura de beber, pero también totalmente repugnante. Es "
"sorprendente la cantidad de espaciales que realmente se creen la historia "
"del agua del océano."

msgid "Oma"
msgstr "Oma"

msgid ""
"Oma is one of the harsher desert worlds. The external temperature varies "
"nearly 400 degrees each day, making it completely incapable of sustaining "
"human life outside of climate-controlled bases. The lack of proper "
"terraforming equipment also makes it hard on the visitors by the drastic "
"temperature changes they endure across the base."
msgstr ""
"Oma es uno de los mundos desérticos más duros. La temperatura exterior varía "
"casi 400 grados cada día, lo que lo hace completamente incapaz de sostener "
"la vida humana fuera de las bases con clima controlado. La falta de equipos "
"de terraformación adecuados también dificulta la vida de los visitantes por "
"los drásticos cambios de temperatura que soportan en toda la base."

msgid ""
"The Lost Drunk isn't much of a bar. The high price of most beverages and the "
"low population results in few customers. From what you can see it's mainly "
"shipping pilots and the odd mercenary sitting apart from each other. Not a "
"jolly place."
msgstr ""
"El Borracho Perdido no es un gran bar. El alto precio de la mayoría de las "
"bebidas y la escasa población hacen que haya pocos clientes. Por lo que se "
"ve, se trata principalmente de pilotos de naves y algún que otro mercenario "
"sentados aparte. No es un lugar alegre."

msgid "Omar"
msgstr "Omar"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Omar's planetary conditions lend it particularly well to the extraction of "
"many common metals. Dvaered High Command has licenced a local enterprise to "
"set up a weapons and munitions factory here."
msgstr ""
"Las condiciones planetarias de Omar se prestan especialmente bien a la "
"extracción de muchos metales comunes. El Alto Mando Dvaered ha concedido una "
"licencia a una empresa local para instalar aquí una fábrica de armas y "
"municiones."

msgid ""
"First time visitors are always taken aback when they enter this spaceport "
"bar. The centre of the room is occupied by a real, actual Mass Driver "
"cannon, and it's pointing straight at the door. Local rumour has it that the "
"cannon is loaded and powered at all times, and that the bar's proprietor "
"uses it to discourage people from misbehaving in his bar."
msgstr ""
"Los visitantes que entran por primera vez en este bar del puerto espacial "
"siempre se quedan sorprendidos. El centro de la sala está ocupado por un "
"cañón Impulsor de Masa de verdad, que apunta directamente a la puerta. El "
"rumor local es que el cañón está cargado y alimentado en todo momento, y que "
"el propietario del bar lo utiliza para disuadir a la gente de portarse mal "
"en su bar."

msgid "Omega Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Omega"

msgid ""
"Hurriedly built to defend the Empire from the Collective, the Omega Enclave "
"has observed countless battles fought in its sector. Its presence has helped "
"stem the flow of Collective drones into Empire space. Due to the constant "
"attacks, the construction of the base is a mismatch of reinforced panels and "
"salvaged ship parts, contrasting greatly with the standardized designs of "
"most Imperial stations."
msgstr ""
"Construida apresuradamente para defender al Imperio del Colectivo, el "
"Enclave Omega ha observado innumerables batallas libradas en su sector. Su "
"presencia ha ayudado a frenar el flujo de drones del Colectivo en el espacio "
"del Imperio. Debido a los constantes ataques, la construcción de la base es "
"un desajuste de paneles reforzados y piezas de naves recuperadas, lo que "
"contrasta enormemente con los diseños estandarizados de la mayoría de las "
"estaciones imperiales."

msgid ""
"The Omega Canteen is a dark place that seems calm, although every time a "
"robotic drone approaches an alarm sounds sending pilots to man their ships "
"to fight off the menace. There is also a ever-growing small memorial to the "
"Empire pilots lost against the Collective menace."
msgstr ""
"La Cantina Omega es un lugar oscuro que parece tranquilo, aunque cada vez "
"que se acerca un dron robótico suena una alarma que envía a los pilotos a "
"tripular sus naves para luchar contra la amenaza. También hay un pequeño y "
"creciente monumento a los pilotos del Imperio perdidos contra la amenaza del "
"Colectivo."

msgid "Onar"
msgstr "Onar"

msgid ""
"Onar serves as one of House Dvaered's foremost weapons development "
"facilities. The planet has a peculiar characteristic that causes its gravity "
"to fluctuate from region to region, which makes for an ideal testing "
"environment to test ballistic weaponry."
msgstr ""
"Onar es una de las principales instalaciones de desarrollo de armas de la "
"Casa Dvaered. El planeta tiene una característica peculiar que hace que su "
"gravedad fluctúe de una región a otra, lo que lo convierte en un entorno de "
"pruebas ideal para ensayar armamento balístico."

msgid ""
"Every visitor to Onar is required to check in at the spaceport bar "
"immediately after landing. Nobody is allowed off the premises of the "
"spaceport without a good reason, and even then they will be accompanied by "
"an official Dvaered chaperone. Most visitors therefore find themselves "
"confined to the spaceport bar."
msgstr ""
"Todos los visitantes de Onar deben registrarse en el bar del puerto espacial "
"inmediatamente después de aterrizar. A nadie se le permite salir del puerto "
"espacial sin una buena razón, e incluso entonces estará acompañado por un "
"acompañante oficial Dvaered. Por lo tanto, la mayoría de los visitantes se "
"encuentran confinados en el bar del puerto espacial."

msgid "Onasan"
msgstr "Onasan"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You dock with the remains of a once majestic Dvaered Goddard. The hull is "
"covered in burns and war scars from countless of encounters during the time "
"it was in service. It seems like the ship finally met its match with "
"enormous holes throughout the structure as a testament to its fate. Given "
"that there doesn't seem to be many working parts left in the ship, or even a "
"basic amount of structural integrity, you have to remain in your atmospheric "
"suit throughout your visit to the ship."
msgstr ""
"Atracas los restos de un Goddard Dvaered. El casco está cubierto de "
"quemaduras y cicatrices de guerra con grandes agujeros por toda la nave. "
"Dado que no parecen quedar muchas piezas funcionales en la nave, tienes que "
"permanecer con tu traje atmosférico durante toda tu visita a la nave. Sin "
"embargo, el hangar parece ser mínimamente funcional y puede permitirte "
"cambiar de nave."

msgid "Oni"
msgstr "Oni"

msgid ""
"Oni is a harsh place to live, with a thick, toxic atmosphere, violent "
"weather and frequent seismic activity. All of this makes it a favoured "
"dumping ground for criminals and other undesirables of Dvaered society. "
"Soldiers assigned here consider it to be a punishment almost as severe as "
"being a prisoner. It's one of the few planets controlled by the central "
"Dvaered government, as no sensible warlord wants the place."
msgstr ""
"Oni es un lugar duro para vivir, con una atmósfera espesa y tóxica, un clima "
"violento y una frecuente actividad sísmica. Todo ello lo convierte en un "
"vertedero favorito para los delincuentes y otros indeseables de la sociedad "
"Dvaered. Los soldados asignados aquí lo consideran un castigo casi tan "
"severo como ser un prisionero. Es uno de los pocos planetas controlados por "
"el gobierno central Dvaered, ya que ningún señor de la guerra sensato quiere "
"el lugar."

msgid "Onyx Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Ónix"

msgid ""
"The Onyx Shipyard is a modern, high-tech shipyard... at least by Dvaered "
"standards. The station manufactures both combat and trade vessels, and "
"commissions a portion of the Dvaered fleet. Several Warlords also have "
"personal contracts at Onyx, drawing ships for their private fleets from here."
msgstr ""
"El Astillero Onix es un astillero moderno y de alta tecnología... al menos "
"para los estándares Dvaered. La estación construye naves de combate y "
"comerciales, y se encarga de una parte de la flota Dvaered. Varios Señores "
"de la Guerra también tienen contratos personales en Onix, sacando de aquí "
"naves para sus flotas privadas."

msgid ""
"Each table in the spaceport bar is themed around a ship design that is "
"manufactured here. Some are even built out of old or faulty components of "
"the ships in question. Of course it's not very artistic, considering that a "
"Dvaered came up with it, but there's still a certain class to it that gets "
"potential buyers in the mood."
msgstr ""
"Cada mesa del bar del puerto espacial está ambientada en torno a un diseño "
"de nave que se fabrica aquí. Algunas incluso están construidas con "
"componentes antiguos o defectuosos de las naves en cuestión. Por supuesto, "
"no es muy artístico, teniendo en cuenta que se le ocurrió a un Dvaered, pero "
"no deja de tener cierta clase que hace que los compradores potenciales se "
"animen."

msgid "Oort Farming Station"
msgstr "Estación Granja Oort"

msgid ""
"The Oort Farming Station is one of the farming complexes that supply "
"citizens throughout Sirius space with food. Much of the station is "
"automated, but maintaining any space facility requires many workers on site "
"at any given time. Most of the workers on this station are commuters who "
"live on the nearby planet of Wikon."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Granja de Oort es uno de los complejos agrícolas que abastecen "
"de alimentos a los ciudadanos de todo el espacio Sirio. Gran parte de la "
"estación está automatizada, pero el mantenimiento de cualquier instalación "
"espacial requiere la presencia de muchos trabajadores en todo momento. La "
"mayoría de los trabajadores de esta estación son trabajadores que viven en "
"el cercano planeta de Wikon."

msgid "Opa"
msgstr "Opa"

msgid "Opal I"
msgstr "Ópalo I"

msgid "Opal Station"
msgstr "Estación Ópalo"

msgid ""
"Since Varaati is located in a rather isolated corner of the galaxy, the "
"local government decided to invest in a trade station within the system, to "
"attract more traffic. Though the station is a far cry from commercial "
"powerhouses like Darkshed, Opal Station must be considered a good effort by "
"Frontier standards."
msgstr ""
"Dado que Varaati se encuentra en un rincón bastante aislado de la galaxia, "
"el gobierno local decidió invertir en una estación comercial dentro del "
"sistema, para atraer más tráfico. Aunque la estación está muy lejos de las "
"potencias comerciales como Hangar Oscuro, la Estación Ópalo debe "
"considerarse un buen esfuerzo para los estándares de la Frontera."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is geared towards trading. There are private booths, "
"tables with integrated data uplinks, a ship outfitting service and charts on "
"the walls showing nearby trade opportunities. The place is never quite "
"packed with people, but there is enough activity in the bar to indicate that "
"Opal Station is slowly returning on its investment."
msgstr ""
"El bar de la muelle espacial está orientado al comercio. Hay cabinas "
"privadas, mesas con enlaces de datos integrados, un servicio de equipamiento "
"de naves y cartas en las paredes que muestran las oportunidades comerciales "
"cercanas. El lugar nunca está lleno de gente, pero hay suficiente actividad "
"en el bar para indicar que la Estación Ópalo está recuperando poco a poco su "
"inversión."

msgid "O'rez Palace"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Originally a vacation home of the Yetmer-O'rez family, the station has been "
"revamped into a military command post, with a large war-room in the centre. "
"The station is crowded with military personal coming and going from the "
"constant flux of ships in the shipyard. The installation also has many "
"leisure rooms where idle military personal spend their time playing simple "
"games or socializing with each other. On the surface it seems like everyone "
"is used to the constant warfare House O'rez is involved in."
msgstr ""

msgid "(null)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Oring"
msgstr "Oring"

msgid ""
"The Soromid have only started challenging Oring as recently as 30 cycles "
"ago. Though the planet has no soil suitable for cultivation and is "
"constantly plagued by rust winds, the Soromid intend to one day house a "
"large population on this world. Right now, there is a modest number of "
"colonists living in underground habitats while the terraforming complexes on "
"the surface labour to alter the atmospheric makeup. It's quite fascinating, "
"to someone who's into this sort of thing."
msgstr ""
"Los Soromida han empezado a desafiar a Oring hace tan sólo 30 ciclos. Aunque "
"el planeta no tiene suelo apto para el cultivo y está constantemente azotado "
"por los vientos de óxido, los Soromida pretenden albergar algún día una gran "
"población en este mundo. Ahora mismo, hay un modesto número de colonos que "
"viven en hábitats subterráneos mientras los complejos de terraformación de "
"la superficie trabajan para alterar la composición atmosférica. Es bastante "
"fascinante, para alguien a quien le gusten este tipo de cosas."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is not too remarkable, as you might expect from a colonist "
"world. The place is functional and simple. There is, however, a public "
"display that shows the current state of the terraforming operation. It never "
"visibly changes, but the graphs show that over the cycles, progress is being "
"made."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial no es demasiado notable, como cabría esperar de "
"un mundo de colonos. El lugar es funcional y sencillo. Sin embargo, hay una "
"pantalla pública que muestra el estado actual de la operación de "
"terraformación. Nunca cambia visiblemente, pero los gráficos muestran que, a "
"lo largo de los ciclos, se están haciendo progresos."

msgid "Orion's Anger"
msgstr "Cólera de Orion"

msgid "Orion's Fist"
msgstr "Puño de Orion"

msgid "Orion's Might"
msgstr "Poder de Orion"

msgid "Orville Shipyard"
msgstr "Astillero Orville"

msgid ""
"Orville Shipyard is a relatively modest ship building facility, though it is "
"invaluable to Inios Monastery and Brandt Cloister, as most of their "
"reinforcements come from here. The station relies on Mastodon Station for "
"the ships' energy cores and weaponry, as Rhu is too far removed from Aesir "
"to send the ships to be outfitted at Sirius Ordnance."
msgstr ""
"El Astillero Orville es una instalación de construcción de naves "
"relativamente modesta, aunque tiene un valor incalculable para el Monasterio "
"Inios y el Claustro Brandt, ya que la mayoría de sus refuerzos proceden de "
"aquí. La estación depende de la Estación Mastodonte para los núcleos de "
"energía y el armamento de las naves, ya que Rhu está demasiado lejos de "
"Aesir como para enviar las naves a equiparlas en la Ordenanza Sirio."

msgid ""
"Over the bar in this facility, there is a counter display that keeps track "
"of the amount of ships that have been produced at Orville Shipyard since it "
"was commissioned. Clearly, the people here at Rhu take pride in being able "
"to contribute to the Sirian military effort."
msgstr ""
"Sobre el bar de esta instalación, hay un contador que lleva la cuenta de la "
"cantidad de naves que se han producido en el Astillero Orville desde su "
"puesta en marcha. Está claro que la gente de Rhu se enorgullece de poder "
"contribuir al esfuerzo militar Sirio."

msgid "Outbound Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Saliente"

msgid ""
"The last bastion of Imperial control before entering Za'lek space, Outbound "
"Enclave is meant to patrol and tax traffic between the Empire and its "
"supposedly subservient great house. In theory, the system is owned by the "
"Empire, but the Za'lek also maintains a strong presence here because of "
"Gerhart Central, so the debate over who truly owns the Ganth system and its "
"tolls is a tense one."
msgstr ""
"El último bastión de control imperial antes de entrar en el espacio Za'lek, "
"el Enclave Saliente está destinado a patrullar y gravar el tráfico entre el "
"Imperio y su supuestamente servil gran casa. En teoría, el sistema es "
"propiedad del Imperio, pero los Za'lek también mantienen una fuerte "
"presencia aquí debido a la Central Gerhart, por lo que el debate sobre a "
"quién pertenece realmente el sistema Ganth y sus peajes es bastante tenso."

msgid ""
"The bar is staffed with traders and Imperial Military officials. It is "
"noteworthy that there is no Za'lek in sight here."
msgstr ""
"El bar cuenta con comerciantes y oficiales militares imperiales. Cabe "
"destacar que aquí no hay ningún Za'lek a la vista."

msgid "Overture I"
msgstr "Aperturea I"

msgid "Overture II"
msgstr "Apertura II"

msgid "Overture III"
msgstr "Apertura III"

msgid "Ozogo X"
msgstr "Ozogo X"

msgid "P0125"
msgstr "P0125"

msgid "P-13571"
msgstr "P-13571"

msgid "P-1587"
msgstr "P-1587"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An atmosphere-less amalgam of rock, likely created by a concentration of "
"asteroids that ended up reaching enough of a mass to become stable with its "
"own gravitational pull. While there are probably rare resources under the "
"planet's mantle, they're likely more easily obtained from the nearby "
"asteroid fields that originally gave birth to this planet."
msgstr ""
"Una amalgama de rocas sin atmósfera, probablemente creada por la "
"concentración de asteroides que acabaron alcanzando una masa crítica "
"volviéndose estables y teniendo su propia atracción gravitatoria. Aunque es "
"probable que haya recursos raros bajo el manto del planeta, probablemente "
"sea mucho más fácil obtenerlos de los campos de asteroides cercanos que "
"dieron origen a este planeta."

msgid "P-15919"
msgstr "P-15919"

msgid "P2020"
msgstr "P2020"

msgid "P2021"
msgstr "P2021"

msgid "P2022"
msgstr "P2022"

msgid "P-2317"
msgstr "P-2317"

msgid ""
"The planet has a harsh, unbreathable carbon dioxide atmosphere with volatile "
"elements. Despite this, microbacterial life seems to be teeming on the "
"planet's surface and large bodies of water. It is likely that this planet "
"could rather easily be terraformed if anyone had the inclination. However, "
"the poor location is a significant deterrent."
msgstr ""
"El planeta tiene una atmósfera dura e irrespirable de dióxido de carbono con "
"elementos volátiles. A pesar de ello, parece haber vida microbacteriana en "
"su superficie y grandes masas de agua. Es probable que este planeta pudiera "
"terraformarse fácilmente si alguien tuviera la voluntad de hacerlo. Sin "
"embargo, su mala ubicación es un importante factor disuasorio."

msgid "P-3030"
msgstr "P-3030"

msgid ""
"The planet seems to be enveloped in a never ending sandstorm that tears at "
"the outer hull of your ship until you find an alcove where you can land. "
"Your ship sensors pick up some strange undulations beneath the surface, but "
"you are unable to determine the exact source. The hostility of the planet "
"makes you feel like you should not overstay your welcome."
msgstr ""
"El planeta parece estar envuelto en una interminable tormenta de arena que "
"desgarra el casco exterior de tu nave hasta que encuentras un hueco donde "
"poder aterrizar. Los sensores de tu nave captan unas extrañas ondulaciones "
"bajo la superficie, pero eres incapaz de determinar el origen exacto. La "
"hostilidad del planeta te hace sentir que no debes quedarte demasiado tiempo."

msgid "P-4705"
msgstr "P-4705"

msgid "P-5003"
msgstr "P-5003"

msgid "P-5717"
msgstr "P-5717"

msgid "P-6608"
msgstr "P-6608"

msgid "P-8318"
msgstr "P-8318"

msgid "P-8493"
msgstr "P-8493"

msgid "P-880"
msgstr "P-880"

msgid "P9122"
msgstr "P9122"

msgid "P-9172"
msgstr "P-9172"

msgid "P-9199"
msgstr "P-9199"

msgid "P9234"
msgstr "P9234"

msgid "P-9832"
msgstr "P-9832"

msgid "P-9922"
msgstr "P-9922"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Over the course of time, the planet seems to have synchronized with the "
"plasma storm and now almost looks to be an extension of it. The surface is a "
"more or less constant flux of hot plasma arcing to and from space. You are "
"able to find a small outcropping to land on that is mostly safe from the "
"chaotic atmospheric fury, but it's probably best not to idle here."
msgstr ""
"Con el paso del tiempo, el planeta parece haberse sincronizado con la "
"tormenta de plasma y parece ser casi una extensión de ella. La superficie "
"del planeta es un flujo más o menos constante de plasma caliente que se "
"arquea hacia y desde el espacio. Consigues encontrar un pequeño afloramiento "
"en el que aterrizar, que parece estar a salvo de la caótica furia "
"atmosférica, pero probablemente no sea mejor quedarse aquí."

msgid "Palin I"
msgstr "Palin I"

msgid "Palin II"
msgstr "Palin II"

msgid "Palin III"
msgstr "Palin III"

msgid "Palovi II"
msgstr "Palovi II"

msgid "Palovi IV"
msgstr "Palovi IV"

msgid "Palovi V"
msgstr "Palovi V"

msgid "Paradox II"
msgstr "Paradoja II"

msgid "Paradox III"
msgstr "Paradoja III"

msgid "Paradox III-a"
msgstr "Paradoja III-a"

msgid "Paradox V"
msgstr "Paradoja V"

msgid "Passir"
msgstr "Passir"

msgid ""
"Passir is an aquatic world. A lot of the inhabited areas are under the "
"surface of the ocean. But even there, suitable living space is scarce. "
"Passir's oceans run so deep that large areas of the ocean floor are out of "
"reach even for modern day submarine technology. Although originally a better "
"off world near the Empire-Sirius trade route, the Incident affected the "
"local economy greatly, with the now-remote world slowly fading into "
"obscurity and poverty."
msgstr ""
"Passir es un mundo acuático. Muchas de las zonas habitadas están bajo la "
"superficie del océano. Pero incluso allí, el espacio vital adecuado es "
"escaso. Los océanos de Passir son tan profundos que grandes zonas del fondo "
"marino están fuera del alcance incluso de la tecnología submarina actual. "
"Aunque originalmente era un mundo mejor situado cerca de la ruta comercial "
"entre el Imperio y Sirio, el Incidente afectó enormemente a la economía "
"local, y el ahora remoto mundo se fue sumiendo poco a poco en la oscuridad y "
"la pobreza."

msgid ""
"The spaceport is situated on dry land, and so is the spaceport bar. The bar "
"overlooks the main hall of the spaceport, which is dominated by the massive "
"mega-escalators that take people and goods to and from the nearby submarine "
"settlements."
msgstr ""
"El puerto espacial está situado en tierra firme, al igual que el bar del "
"puerto espacial. El bar tiene vistas al vestíbulo principal del puerto "
"espacial, dominado por las enormes megaescaleras que llevan a las personas y "
"las mercancías hacia y desde los asentamientos submarinos cercanos."

msgid "Pastor II"
msgstr "Pastor II"

msgid "Pastor IIX"
msgstr "Pastor IIX"

msgid "Pastor VI"
msgstr "Pastor VI"

msgid "Pauldur"
msgstr "Pauldur"

msgid ""
"Although one may expect crime to be lower in a society where weak psychic "
"powers are commonplace, the truth is that it is not much different from the "
"rest of the galaxy. To accommodate the growing penal population, Pauldur was "
"designed as a prison world given the difficulty of access and inhospitality. "
"Although most the planet is inaccessible without high security clearance, "
"the spaceport has modest accommodations for those who get lost or wish to "
"visit their incarcerated relatives."
msgstr ""
"Aunque cabría esperar que la delincuencia fuera menor en una sociedad en la "
"que los poderes psíquicos débiles son moneda corriente, lo cierto es que no "
"difiere mucho del resto de la galaxia. Para acomodar a la creciente "
"población penal, Pauldur fue diseñado como un mundo prisión dada la "
"dificultad de acceso y la inhospitalidad. Aunque la mayor parte del planeta "
"es inaccesible sin una autorización de alta seguridad, el puerto espacial "
"dispone de modestos alojamientos para quienes se pierdan o deseen visitar a "
"sus familiares encarcelados."

msgid "Paxadon"
msgstr "Paxadon"

msgid ""
"Paxadon's population has been estimated at an impressive ten billion in the "
"latest census. For a world not much larger than old Earth, that's a hefty "
"number. Over the cycles, the local authorities have found it necessary to "
"banish all heavy industry from the planet's surface to combat the rapidly "
"increasing levels of pollution. The world's air is cleaner these days, but "
"it's not quite at a comfortable, or even healthy level."
msgstr ""
"La población de Paxadon se ha estimado en unos impresionantes diez mil "
"millones en el último censo. Para un mundo no mucho más grande que la vieja "
"Tierra, es una cifra considerable. A lo largo de los ciclos, las autoridades "
"locales han considerado necesario desterrar toda la industria pesada de la "
"superficie del planeta para combatir el rápido aumento de los niveles de "
"contaminación. El aire del mundo es más limpio hoy en día, pero no está en "
"un nivel cómodo, ni siquiera saludable."

msgid ""
"This is the main Paxadon spaceport bar. Paxadon has several secondary "
"spaceports, because traffic to and from the world is rather heavy. The main "
"spaceport remains the port of choice for most spacers, though, because it "
"alone offers the various utilities that many need in everyday space life. "
"The spaceport bar is one such utility."
msgstr ""
"Este es el bar principal del puerto espacial de Paxadon. Tiene varios "
"puertos espaciales secundarios, porque el tráfico hacia y desde este mundo "
"es bastante intenso. Sin embargo, el puerto espacial principal sigue siendo "
"el puerto elegido por la mayoría de los espaciales, ya que es el único que "
"ofrece las diversas utilidades que muchos necesitan en la vida espacial "
"cotidiana. El bar del puerto espacial es uno de esos servicios."

msgid "Paxsor"
msgstr "Paxsor"

msgid ""
"Paxsor is a mining planet within Empire space, supplying ore to the "
"shipyards in the system and sending surplus ore to help with the Emperor's "
"Fist project. Although not particularly rich in ore deposits, they are very "
"accessible, allowing sieving through vast quantities of planet mass to "
"extract them."
msgstr ""
"Paxsor es un planeta minero dentro del espacio del Imperio, que suministra "
"mineral a los astilleros del sistema y envía el excedente de mineral para "
"ayudar en el proyecto del Puño del Emperador. Aunque no es especialmente "
"rico en depósitos de mineral, son muy accesibles, lo que permite tamizar "
"grandes cantidades de masa planetaria para extraerlos."

msgid ""
"The Paxsorian bar is a rather simple one, patronized mostly by traders "
"trafficking ore. Given the limited nature of the planet's public facilities, "
"it's impossible to know whether the Nexus employees are hard at work or "
"drinking at a bar of their own."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Paxsorian es bastante sencillo, frecuentado sobre todo por "
"comerciantes que trafican con mineral. Dado el carácter limitado de las "
"instalaciones públicas del planeta, es imposible saber si los empleados del "
"Nexus están trabajando duro o bebiendo en un bar propio."

msgid "Peogas II"
msgstr "Peogas II"

msgid "Peogas III"
msgstr "Peogas III"

msgid "Peogas IV"
msgstr "Peogas IV"

msgid "Peogas V"
msgstr "Peogas V"

msgid "Percola"
msgstr "Percola"

msgid ""
"Percola is a small world, but it is a rather major producer of food within "
"Soromid space. The planet is rich in carbon and gets a lot of sun, so plant "
"life thrives here. The planet sometimes manages as many as four harvests a "
"cycle. About seventy percent of the land surface is used for agriculture, "
"ten percent is used for livestock and the remaining twenty percent is for "
"the residents and supporting infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Percola es un mundo pequeño, pero es un productor de alimentos bastante "
"importante dentro del espacio Soromida. El planeta es rico en carbono y "
"recibe mucho sol, por lo que la vida vegetal prospera aquí. El planeta "
"consigue a veces hasta cuatro cosechas por ciclo. Alrededor del setenta por "
"ciento de la superficie de la tierra se utiliza para la agricultura, el diez "
"por ciento se utiliza para el ganado y el veinte por ciento restante es para "
"los residentes y la infraestructura de apoyo."

msgid ""
"This spaceport bar has a view on one of the nearby mega-meadows that sprawl "
"across Percola. The endless sea of uniform vegetation is impressive to "
"behold, but it's only really a small part of what's out there."
msgstr ""
"Este bar del puerto espacial tiene vistas a una de las mega-praderas "
"cercanas que se extienden por Percola. El interminable mar de vegetación "
"uniforme es impresionante de contemplar, pero en realidad es solo una "
"pequeña parte de lo que hay ahí fuera."

msgid "Perhelion Alpha"
msgstr "Perhelion Alpha"

msgid "Perhelion Beta"
msgstr "Perhelion Beta"

msgid "Perhelion Gamma"
msgstr "Perhelion Gamma"

msgid "Petaat"
msgstr "Petaat"

msgid ""
"Petaat can be called a civilian Dvaered world, if you're feeling nice. Fact "
"is that people live here, and a Dvaered Warlord controls the local "
"government. But that's about as far as it goes. Petaat is a very unpleasant "
"world, its surface constantly plagued by dust storms and its soil unfit for "
"crop growing. The people living here only do so because they don't have the "
"means to leave."
msgstr ""
"Petaat puede ser llamado un mundo civil Dvaered, si te sientes amable. El "
"hecho es que la gente vive aquí, y un Señor de la Guerra Dvaered controla el "
"gobierno local. Pero eso es todo. Petaat es un mundo muy desagradable, su "
"superficie está constantemente plagada de tormentas de polvo y su suelo no "
"es apto para el cultivo. La gente que vive aquí sólo lo hace porque no tiene "
"medios para marcharse."

msgid ""
"Amazingly, Petaat does have a spaceport bar, despite the fact that this is, "
"well, Petaat. It's rather a dump, though. If you didn't know better you'd "
"think yourself in a decaying slum. Most people here look like they belong in "
"one, too."
msgstr ""
"Sorprendentemente, Petaat tiene un bar en el puerto espacial, a pesar de que "
"esto es, bien, Petaat. Más bien un basurero. Si no lo supieras, pensarías "
"que estás en una barriada en decadencia. La mayoría de la gente aquí parece "
"pertenecer a uno, además."

msgid "Petra"
msgstr "Petra"

msgid ""
"While not the most comfortable planet in Proteron space, Petra is filled "
"with valuable minerals and much easier to mine than the nearby planet Karvua."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es el planeta más cómodo del espacio de Proteron, Petra está "
"repleto de minerales valiosos y es mucho más fácil de extraer que el cercano "
"planeta Karvua."

msgid "Phee"
msgstr "Phee"

msgid ""
"Phee is a tad hot, but it's still habitable. The people who live here have "
"to be healthy and robust to stand the environment, and that's the reason why "
"Dvaered High Command likes to conscript new soldiers from this world. But "
"rather than feel dissatisfied about this, the population takes pride in its "
"history of military service. These people are true Dvaered."
msgstr ""
"Phee es un poco caluroso, pero sigue siendo habitable. La gente que vive "
"aquí tiene que ser sana y robusta para soportar el entorno, y esa es la "
"razón por la que al Alto Mando Dvaered le gusta reclutar nuevos soldados de "
"este mundo. Pero en lugar de sentirse insatisfechos por esto, la población "
"se enorgullece de su historia de servicio militar. Estas personas son "
"verdaderos Dvaered."

msgid ""
"The owner of the bar has served in several Dvaered campaigns in his day, and "
"it shows. The bar is decorated with trophies and other memorabilia from "
"those days, and the man will tell anyone who will listen about what he calls "
"his glory days."
msgstr ""
"El propietario del bar ha servido en varias campañas Dvaered en su día, y se "
"nota. El bar está decorado con trofeos y otros recuerdos de aquellos días, y "
"el hombre cuenta a cualquiera que quiera escuchar, lo que él llama sus días "
"de gloria."

msgid "Phosarrus"
msgstr "Phosarrus"

msgid ""
"Phosarrus is a pristine civilian world inhabited by the Soromid. The "
"biosphere is very mild even by non-modified standards, so for the Soromid it "
"is a rare gem. The population is estimated at an impressive one billion, but "
"despite this the planet's ecological system remains in balance. This is in "
"no small thanks to Soromid bioengineering - modified microbiological and "
"plant life help keep the balance from breaking down."
msgstr ""
"Phosarrus es un mundo civil prístino habitado por los Soromida. La biosfera "
"es muy suave incluso para los estándares no modificados, por lo que para los "
"Soromida es una joya rara. La población se estima en unos impresionantes mil "
"millones, pero a pesar de ello el sistema ecológico del planeta se mantiene "
"en equilibrio. Esto se debe en gran medida a la bioingeniería Soromida: la "
"vida microbiológica y vegetal modificada ayuda a evitar que se rompa el "
"equilibrio."

msgid ""
"For a world as nice as Phosarrus, the spaceport bar is a surprisingly simple "
"affair. The reason for this is that the planet's civilian offworld mass "
"transit is handled via a different terminal, so the only people who use this "
"section of the spaceport are traders and civilians who own their own ships. "
"Lavish recreational facilities would be wasted on them, the thought must "
"have been."
msgstr ""
"Para un mundo tan bonito como Phosarrus, el bar del puerto espacial es un "
"asunto sorprendentemente sencillo. La razón es que el transporte civil fuera "
"del planeta se gestiona a través de una terminal diferente, por lo que los "
"únicos que utilizan esta sección del puerto espacial son los comerciantes y "
"los civiles que poseen sus propias naves. El pensamiento debió ser que las "
"instalaciones recreativas de lujo serían un desperdicio para ellos."

msgid "Pike I"
msgstr "Pica I"

msgid "Pilatis I"
msgstr "Pilatis I"

msgid "Pilatis II"
msgstr "Pilatis II"

msgid "Pilatis III"
msgstr "Pilatis III"

msgid "Pirate's Cove"
msgstr "Cala Pirata"

msgid ""
"Tucked away in the shadow of P-8493, Pirate's Cove is a den of swashbucklers "
"and independent privateers from the southern region of Sirius Space. Not "
"directly affiliated with any of the main pirate clans, the place is a "
"chaotic mess where strength and cunning is the rule of law. The inhabitants "
"live in a sprawling construction extending from the space port, full of "
"small winding paths resembling a labyrinth more than a city. The constant "
"electromagnetic interference from all the devices makes it so one can not "
"rely on advanced navigation hardware, and it all comes down to memorization "
"and use of crude maps. Outside the sprawling city, the planet is lush and "
"wild, home to hundreds if not thousands of illegally obtained species that "
"have escaped or been released. It is rumoured that some man-eating beasts "
"also lurk in the forests, but people disappearing through misfortunes and "
"murders is a more likely explanation."
msgstr ""
"Escondida a la sombra de P-8493, la Cala de los Piratas es una guarida de "
"espadachines y corsarios independientes de la región sur del Espacio Sirio. "
"Sin afiliación directa a ninguno de los principales clanes piratas, el lugar "
"es un caos donde la fuerza y la astucia son la regla de la ley. Los "
"habitantes viven en una construcción en expansión que se extiende desde el "
"puerto espacial, llena de pequeños caminos serpenteantes que se asemejan más "
"a un laberinto que a una ciudad. La constante interferencia electromagnética "
"de todos los dispositivos hace que no se pueda confiar en el hardware de "
"navegación avanzada, y todo se reduce a la memorización y el uso de mapas "
"rudimentarios. Fuera de la ciudad en expansión, el planeta es exuberante y "
"salvaje, hogar de cientos, si no miles, de especies obtenidas ilegalmente "
"que han escapado o han sido liberadas. Se rumorea que algunas bestias "
"devoradoras de hombres también acechan en los bosques, pero la desaparición "
"de personas por desgracias y asesinatos es una explicación más probable."

msgid ""
"The adeptly named bar the Cove is located directly under the spaceport "
"landing pads in a naturally formed cave. The owner has made some attempts to "
"insulate it from the noise of constant pounding of ships landing and taking "
"off to mixed success, however, most of the patrons do not seem to care much. "
"The place is boisterous with constant fights breaking out and drunks passing "
"out here and there, which surprisingly does not seem to phase the more "
"hardened locals who are used to this sort of life. Other than the ever "
"popular homebrewn grogs, the Cove is also famous for its fish and chips, "
"although its better not to ask where the fish are being caught."
msgstr ""
"El habilmente llamado bar \"La Cala\" se encuentra justo debajo de las "
"pistas de aterrizaje del puerto espacial, en una cueva natural. El "
"propietario ha hecho algunos intentos por aislarlo del ruido del constante "
"golpeteo de las naves que aterrizan y despegan, pero no ha tenido mucho "
"éxito. Sin embargo, a la mayoría de los clientes no parece importarles "
"demasiado. El local es bullicioso, con peleas constantes y borrachos que se "
"desmayan aquí y allá, lo que sorprendentemente no parece alterar a los "
"lugareños más curtidos, acostumbrados a este tipo de vida. Además de los "
"populares grogs caseros, la Cala también es famosa por su pescado con "
"patatas fritas, aunque es mejor no preguntar dónde se pesca."

msgid "Pity"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As the name would suggest, Pity is not the most pleasant place to live. The "
"fringe location does not prompt much development, and facilities are "
"minimal, but those hardened souls who are willing to tolerate the thin air "
"and cold winds can manage a decent living off of the largely untapped "
"deposits of minerals under the surface."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This bar is a homely place, close in spirit to the traditional bars of pre-"
"Growth Earth. A place for people to find comfort in one another's company as "
"they deal with the struggles of everyday life on a newly-colonised world."
msgstr ""

msgid "Point Zero 0"
msgstr "Punto Zero 0"

msgid "Point Zero Nidus"
msgstr "Nido Punto Zero"

msgid ""
"Acting as the primary gateway for goods traveling to and from Sol, Point "
"Zero Nidus was a very busy commercial port. This changed quite significantly "
"when the trade lane was cut off by the Incident. While some traders still "
"reminiscence of the golden era of Point Zero, due to its strategic position, "
"it has suffered much less than other systems near the Nebula, still acting "
"as an important trade hub in Soromid space."
msgstr ""
"El Nido Punto Cero, principal puerta de entrada y salida de mercancías de "
"Sol, era un puerto comercial muy activo. Esto cambió significativamente "
"cuando la ruta comercial fue cortada por el Incidente. Aunque algunos "
"comerciantes aún recuerdan la época dorada de Punto Cero, debido a su "
"posición estratégica, ha sufrido mucho menos que otros sistemas cercanos a "
"la Nebulosa, y sigue actuando como un importante centro comercial en el "
"espacio Soromida."

msgid ""
"Reminiscent of the stock markets on pre-Federation Earth, the spacedock bar "
"of Point Zero Nidus is one of the biggest and most important facilities "
"aboard. People come here on business just as much as to socialize. Commodity "
"exchange rates are displayed on big screens along the walls, and for a small "
"fee a pilot can make use of a private trade booth."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Nido Punto Cero, que recuerda a los mercados de valores de la "
"Tierra anterior a la Federación, es una de las instalaciones más grandes e "
"importantes a bordo. La gente viene aquí tanto para hacer negocios como para "
"socializar. Los tipos de cambio de los productos se muestran en grandes "
"pantallas a lo largo de las paredes, y por una pequeña cuota un piloto puede "
"hacer uso de una cabina comercial privada."

msgid "Pokyos Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Pokyos"

msgid ""
"Pokyos Cloister was built to reinforce the Sirian military in this area of "
"space. It isn't a big station, but it is always fully staffed and has access "
"to the best equipment. Quality over quantity, as they say here."
msgstr ""
"Claustro Pokyos se construyó para reforzar el ejército Sirio en esta zona "
"del espacio. No es una estación grande, pero siempre está dotada "
"completamente de personal y tiene acceso a los mejores equipos. Calidad "
"sobre cantidad, como dicen aquí."

msgid ""
"There's not much to do here. Military stations are seldom places to sit down "
"and have a chat. At best, you can use the spacedock bar to meet one of the "
"officers on station."
msgstr ""
"No hay mucho que hacer aquí. Las estaciones militares rara vez son lugares "
"para sentarse y charlar. Como mucho, puedes utilizar el bar de la estación "
"para reunirte con uno de los oficiales de la estación."

msgid "Polaris Prime"
msgstr "Polaris Prime"

msgid ""
"Polaris Prime is the service station for the Emperor's Wrath. Normal people "
"are not allowed to set foot on the gargantuan ship, so all official business "
"has to happen on Polaris Prime. The station is a trade hub as well as a "
"centre of government, serving as the civilian end of the Empire's capital."
msgstr ""
"Polaris Prime es la estación de servicio de la Ira del Emperador. A la gente "
"normal no se le permite poner un pie en la gigantesca nave, por lo que todos "
"los asuntos oficiales deben tener lugar en Polaris Prime. La estación es un "
"centro de comercio y de gobierno, y sirve como extremo civil de la capital "
"del Imperio."

msgid ""
"A simple, utilitarian bar patronized largely by off-duty dock workers and "
"terraformers, this bar is nonetheless kept immaculately clean. It clearly "
"means to set the… bar for all bars in Empire space."
msgstr ""
"Un bar sencillo y utilitario, frecuentado principalmente por trabajadores "
"portuarios y terraformadores fuera de servicio, pero que se mantiene "
"inmaculadamente limpio. Está claro que intenta sentar las bases para todos "
"los bares del espacio Imperial."

msgid "Poller D-2"
msgstr "Poller D-2"

msgid "Poller I-1"
msgstr "Poller I-1"

msgid "Poller Mass"
msgstr "Masa Poller"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"What was originally a fairly mineral rich world known as Poller D-4 quickly "
"devolved into its current state in what became known as the Poller incident. "
"While what happened is still officially under investigation, the common "
"consensus is that a research project focusing on developing microrobots for "
"mineral extraction lost control of a batch of self-replicating nanobots. "
"These nanobots quickly began to reproduce by converting all matter into more "
"nanobots, in the first public case of a grey-goo scenario.\n"
"The Za'lek have made the best out of the situation by designating the now "
"called Poller Mass as a waste disposal centre. Pilots must take care to not "
"make direct contact or they become part of the grey-goo itself."
msgstr ""
"Lo que originalmente era un mundo bastante rico en minerales, conocido como "
"Poller D-4, evolucionó rápidamente hacia su estado actual en lo que se "
"conoció como el incidente Poller. Aunque oficialmente se sigue investigando "
"lo sucedido, la opinión generalizada es que un proyecto de investigación "
"centrado en el desarrollo de microrobots para la extracción de minerales "
"perdió el control de un lote de nanobots autorreplicantes. Estos nanobots "
"comenzaron rápidamente a reproducirse convirtiendo toda la materia en más "
"nanobots, en el primer caso público de un escenario de grey-goo.\n"
"Los Za'lek han sacado lo mejor de la situación designando la ahora llamada "
"Masa Poller como centro de eliminación de residuos. Los pilotos deben tener "
"cuidado de no entrar en contacto directo o se convertirán en parte de la "
"propia grey-goo."

msgid "Poltergeist Alpha"
msgstr "Poltergeist Alfa"

msgid ""
"Likely the result of a fairly recent collision of multiple large astral "
"bodies, Poltergeist Alpha has a highly unstable radioactive exposed core "
"that is constantly releasing radioactive isotopes into the atmosphere. The "
"young planet is considered highly toxic by any of the different scales used "
"throughout the Empire, and can prove to be a real test of a ship's shielding "
"capabilities. It is probably best not to tarry too long within range of the "
"radiation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Porro Farming Station"
msgstr "Estación Granja Porro"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Stations like this one are a marvel of technology. They span only a few "
"dozen kilometres in diameter, yet have the food production capability to "
"feed several planets. Food is grown so rapidly that it takes a constant "
"stream of merchant ships to take it all away."
msgstr ""
"Las estaciones como ésta son una maravilla de la tecnología. Abarcan sólo "
"unas decenas de kilómetros de diámetro, pero tienen la capacidad de "
"producción de alimentos para alimentar a varios planetas. Los alimentos se "
"producen tan rápidamente que se necesita un flujo constante de naves "
"mercantes para llevárselos todos."

msgid ""
"It is said among spacers that if you sit down in a spacedock bar, order a "
"drink and read a few articles on the galactic news, a whole generation of "
"vegetables will have grown from seed to crop by the time you get up again. "
"This is not true, of course - unless you take small sips."
msgstr ""
"Se dice entre los espaciales que si te sientas en un bar de una nave "
"espacial, pides una copa y lees unos cuantos artículos sobre las noticias "
"galácticas, toda una generación de vegetales habrá crecido desde la semilla "
"hasta la cosecha para cuando te levantes de nuevo. Esto no es cierto, por "
"supuesto, a menos que se tomen en pequeños sorbos."

msgid "Porro II"
msgstr "Porro II"

msgid "Porro III"
msgstr "Porro III"

msgid "Port Oread"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Port Oread is a stopover point for scoundrels, free traders, and game "
"hunters travelling around Soromid space. The station is very small and "
"compact, barely accommodating the number of visitors in peak hunting season."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Jayock Tavern is decorated with holo-painting of strange, mythical "
"creatures from many different planets. Some seem to exist in the holo-"
"archives, such as the Vadornia Jellywhale, however, the ferocious Cunjo does "
"not seem to appear in any public database."
msgstr ""

msgid "Possum II"
msgstr "Zarigüeya II"

msgid "Praxis"
msgstr "Praxis"

msgid ""
"Praxis is an anomaly in Dvaered culture, known for its commerce rather than "
"production of materials. Beginning as a small colony, it has become "
"increasingly important since the Incident. Praxis is now considered one of "
"the core Dvaered worlds, the gateway through which Dvaered ore and materials "
"flow into Empire space."
msgstr ""
"Praxis es una anomalía en la cultura Dvaered, conocida por su comercio más "
"que por la producción de materiales. Comenzó como una pequeña colonia, pero "
"desde el Incidente ha ido ganando importancia. Praxis se considera ahora uno "
"de los mundos centrales Dvaered, la puerta a través de la cual el mineral y "
"los materiales Dvaered fluyen hacia el espacio del Imperio."

msgid ""
"While not nearly as pristine as many Empire bars, the Praxis bar is "
"remarkably well-kept for a Dvaered bar."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no está tan impoluto como muchos bares del Imperio, el bar Praxis "
"está muy bien cuidado para ser un bar Dvaered."

msgid "Priscus"
msgstr "Priscus"

msgid ""
"Priscus was settled because of the rich soil being useful for cultivating a "
"series of unusually durable plants that are useful in the growing process of "
"Soromid ships. No one is quite sure how the plants are useful, only that the "
"Soromid insist on tightly controlling this little farming world."
msgstr ""
"Priscus se asentó porque el rico suelo es útil para cultivar una serie de "
"plantas inusualmente duraderas que son útiles en el proceso de crecimiento "
"de las naves Soromida. Nadie sabe con certeza para qué sirven las plantas, "
"sólo que los Soromida insisten en controlar estrictamente este pequeño mundo "
"agrícola."

msgid ""
"The bar is crowded with exhausted farmers, government-mandated trading "
"factors, or suspicious government officials. The service, while not stellar, "
"is at least competent enough to not cause comment."
msgstr ""
"El bar está abarrotado de granjeros agotados, agentes de comercio por "
"mandato del gobierno o funcionarios sospechosos. El servicio, aunque no es "
"estelar, es al menos lo suficientemente competente como para no provocar "
"comentarios."

msgid "Procyon Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Procyon"

msgid ""
"Procyon Shipyard is a mainstay of the Za'lek navy and its merchant marine. "
"The base is constantly alive with engineers and the sound of hulls being "
"assembled. It is noisy filthy and there's little room for comfort. "
"Nevertheless, many spacers call this place home."
msgstr ""
"El Astillero Procyon es un pilar de la armada Za'lek y de su marina "
"mercante. La base está constantemente llena de ingenieros y del sonido de "
"los cascos que se ensamblan. Es ruidosa y sucia y hay poco espacio para la "
"comodidad. Sin embargo, muchos espaciales llaman a este lugar su hogar."

msgid ""
"The bar is much like the station itself. The beer is only theoretically "
"drinkable from what you can tell, and fights are surprisingly common. The "
"patrons are mostly wearing thick suits smeared with all manner of chemicals, "
"burns and oils. Many older captains seem to be enjoying themselves despite "
"it all."
msgstr ""
"El bar es muy parecido a la propia estación. La cerveza sólo es teóricamente "
"potable por lo que se ve, y las peleas son sorprendentemente frecuentes. Los "
"clientes llevan en su mayoría gruesos trajes embadurnados con todo tipo de "
"productos químicos, quemaduras y aceites. Muchos capitanes mayores parecen "
"divertirse a pesar de todo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Protera Husk"
msgstr "Protera"

msgid ""
"Protera Husk seems to be the remains of a once populous city-world that took "
"a turn for the worst in the aftermath of the Incident. The planet seems to "
"have lost most of its sphericity and has an extremely eccentric orbit. While "
"this would usually be a major problem for any celestial body, it seems to be "
"the least of the problems Protera Husk is facing, with radiation readings "
"off the charts and endless destruction and carnage all over.\n"
"\n"
"The only place to land seems to be the urban remains of the elongated side "
"of the planet. The rest of the planet is covered in an endless layer of "
"ruins and decay. As your ship approaches, you pick up a surprising amount of "
"lifeforms; it is best to be careful, you don't think you would be given a "
"warm welcome by the natives. You keep a low profile on your entry to the "
"feeble atmosphere, hoping to confuse your ship signature with the orbital "
"rubbish.\n"
"\n"
"There is no functioning landing port, and you have to land among the rubble. "
"At least it seems like you can refuel by siphoning from the remains of a "
"fuel tank. You probably shouldn't overstay your welcome though."
msgstr ""

msgid "Protera Nova"
msgstr "Protera Nova"

msgid ""
"You see a massive crater around the severely damaged ship dominating the "
"landscape, with signs indicating that the shockwave travelled all over the "
"relatively small planet."
msgstr ""
"Ves un enorme cráter alrededor de una nave gravemente dañada que domina el "
"paisaje, con señales que indican que la onda expansiva recorrió todo el "
"relativamente pequeño planeta."

msgid ""
"The ship's old bar has been restored to an acceptable state. You're told, "
"oddly enough, that a bar is never supposed to have seats in Proteron "
"culture, but here, considering that the installation skews at a rather "
"worrying angle, there are at least toeholds to keep you from falling."
msgstr ""
"El antiguo bar de la nave ha sido restaurado a un estado aceptable. Te han "
"dicho, curiosamente, que en la cultura de Proteron se supone que un bar "
"nunca debe tener asientos, pero aquí, teniendo en cuenta que la instalación "
"se inclina en un ángulo bastante preocupante, al menos hay asideros para "
"evitar que te caigas."

msgid "Protera Sigma"
msgstr "Protera Sigma"

msgid ""
"Protera Sigma is the only original Proteron colony known to have survived "
"the Incident. One of the earlier Proteron settlements, it has an established "
"shipyard and access to the original blueprints, so Proteron shipbuilding "
"traditions live on."
msgstr ""
"Protera Sigma es la única colonia original Proteron que se sabe que ha "
"sobrevivido al Incidente. Uno de los primeros asentamientos de Proteron que "
"cuenta con un astillero establecido y acceso a los planos originales, por lo "
"que las tradiciones de construcción naval de Proteron siguen vivas."

msgid ""
"Rather distinct from traditional Empire bars, the Protera Sigma bar is "
"entirely open and without seats, as the Proteron believe one should stand "
"while eating and drinking. Despite this curiosity, their brews don't stray "
"far from typical Empire fare."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de los bares tradicionales del Imperio, el bar Protera Sigma "
"está completamente abierto y sin asientos, ya que los Proteron creen que uno "
"debe estar de pie mientras come y bebe. A pesar de esta curiosidad, sus "
"cervezas no se alejan de la oferta típica del Imperio."

msgid "Provectus Nova I"
msgstr "Provectus Nova I"

msgid "Provectus Nova Ia"
msgstr "Provectus Nova Ia"

msgid "Proxima Centauri c"
msgstr "Proxima Centauri c"

msgid "PRP-1"
msgstr "PRP-1"

msgid ""
"One of four stations devoted to housing much of the research and knowledge "
"that House Za'lek has accumulated and continues to accumulate. Many of the "
"most prestigious scientific organizations make its main headquarters on "
"these stations. The walls are covered in old publication posters and "
"research symposium fliers."
msgstr ""
"Una de las cuatro estaciones dedicadas a albergar gran parte de la "
"investigación y conocimientos que la Casa Za'lek ha acumulado y sigue "
"acumulando. Muchas de las organizaciones científicas más prestigiosas tienen "
"su sede principal en estas estaciones. Las paredes están cubiertas de "
"antiguos carteles de publicaciones y folletos de simposios de investigación."

msgid ""
"A rather eclectic bar with various 'enhancements' and upgrades that make it "
"into a mad scientist's dream and a neat freak's nightmare. The constant flux "
"of scientists in and out of the bar further accentuates the chaotic "
"behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Un bar bastante ecléctico con diversas \"mejoras\" y actualizaciones que lo "
"convierten en el sueño de un científico loco y en la pesadilla de un "
"maniático del orden. El constante flujo de científicos que entran y salen "
"del bar acentúa aún más el comportamiento caótico."

msgid "PRP-2"
msgstr "PRP-2"

msgid "PRP-3"
msgstr "PRP-3"

msgid "PRP-4"
msgstr "PRP-4"

msgid "PSO 1234"
msgstr "PSO 1234"

msgid "PSO 1251"
msgstr "PSO 1251"

msgid "PSO 1324"
msgstr "PSO 1324"

msgid "PSO 2212"
msgstr "PSO 2212"

msgid "PSO 2345"
msgstr "PSO 2345"

msgid "PSO 2356"
msgstr "PSO 2356"

msgid "PSO 2434"
msgstr "PSO 2434"

msgid "PSO Monitor"
msgstr "Monitor PSO"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PSO Monitor is a small scientific station run by an independent university, "
"monitoring the high-interference nebula PSO. As no government actually funds "
"the station, it only has what it absolutely needs to run. It also has a "
"refuelling depot for travelling ships in an effort to raise funding."
msgstr ""
"Monitor PSO es una pequeña estación científica dirigida por una universidad "
"independiente, que vigila la nebulosa de alta interferencia PSO. Como ningún "
"gobierno financia realmente la estación, sólo tiene lo que necesita "
"absolutamente para funcionar. También cuenta con un depósito de "
"reabastecimiento de combustible para las naves que viajan, en un esfuerzo "
"por conseguir financiación."

msgid "Ptolemy"
msgstr "Ptolemy"

msgid "Pudas I"
msgstr "Pudas I"

msgid "Pudas II"
msgstr "Pudas II"

msgid "Pultatis I"
msgstr "Pultatis I"

msgid "Pultatis II"
msgstr "Pultatis II"

msgid "Pultatis III"
msgstr "Pultatis III"

msgid "Pund"
msgstr "Pund"

msgid "Qex II"
msgstr "Qex II"

msgid "Qex IV"
msgstr "Qex IV"

msgid "Qex V"
msgstr "Qex V"

msgid "Qoman"
msgstr "Qoman"

msgid ""
"Before the human settlement here was established, Qoman's atmosphere was "
"methane of an unusually high purity, an unusual circumstance for a rock-"
"based world. A harvesting operation was placed on the planet in the days of "
"the Old Empire, but due to the time's poor engineering practices and "
"subsequent Dvaered mismanagement, the quality of Qoman's atmosphere and, "
"subsequently, its exports, has fallen."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que se estableciera el asentamiento humano aquí, la atmósfera de "
"Qoman era de metano de una pureza inusualmente alta, una circunstancia "
"inusual para un mundo basado en la roca. En los tiempos del Antiguo Imperio "
"se instaló en el planeta una operación de recolección, pero debido a las "
"malas prácticas de ingeniería de la época y a la posterior mala gestión "
"Dvaered, la calidad de la atmósfera de Qoman y, por tanto, sus "
"exportaciones, han disminuido."

msgid ""
"A credit-a-dozen bar whose only distinguishing feature is an ancient plaque "
"on the wall on which are the words \"Breathe the air, but don't inhale!\" "
"Presumably it's a joke. Nobody gets it."
msgstr ""
"Un bar de como otros cuya única característica distintiva es una antigua "
"placa en la pared en la que se lee \"¡Respira el aire, pero no lo inhales!"
"\". Presumiblement una broma. Que nadie entiende."

msgid "Qoral"
msgstr "Qoral"

msgid ""
"Qoral is primarily a resource-producing world. The terrain is mostly barren "
"and unfit for human habitation, so most of the population is concentrated on "
"a few stretches of suitable land, scattered around the globe, while the rest "
"of the land mass is littered with strip mines."
msgstr ""
"Qoral es principalmente un mundo productor de recursos. El terreno es en su "
"mayor parte estéril y no apto para la vida humana, por lo que la mayor parte "
"de la población se concentra en unas pocas extensiones de tierra adecuada, "
"repartidas por todo el globo, mientras que el resto de la masa terrestre "
"está plagada de minas a cielo abierto."

msgid ""
"This is a fairly typical spaceport bar. The clientele consists mostly of "
"merchants, though some locals come here also, if not for the drinks then for "
"the chance to talk to people who come from more interesting places than "
"Qoral."
msgstr ""
"Este es un bar bastante típico de un puerto espacial. La clientela se "
"compone principalmente de comerciantes, aunque también acuden algunos "
"lugareños, si no por las bebidas, sí por la posibilidad de hablar con gente "
"que viene de lugares más interesantes que Qoral."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Qorel I"
msgstr "Qorel"

msgid "Qorellia"
msgstr "Qorellia"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The clan world in control of the whole Qorel Tunnel and centre of power of "
"the Raven clan, Qorellia is a lively planet with booming trade and markets, "
"albeit consisting of mainly stolen goods. There also is an active stock "
"market where pirates can invest and bet on other pirate's heists and "
"operations. Despite the apparent chaos, the Raven clan prides themselves in "
"getting things done and the planet infrastructure is surprisingly efficient. "
"Qorellia might be seen as a civilian hub if only its traffic didn't entirely "
"consist of pirate ships."
msgstr ""
"Qorellia, el mundo del clan que controla todo el Túnel de Qorel y centro de "
"poder del clan del Cuervo, es un planeta animado con un comercio y unos "
"mercados en auge, aunque consistentes principalmente en bienes robados. "
"También hay un activo mercado de valores donde los piratas pueden invertir y "
"apostar en los atracos y operaciones de otros piratas. A pesar del aparente "
"caos, el clan Cuervo se enorgullece de hacer las cosas bien y la "
"infraestructura del planeta es sorprendentemente eficiente. Qorellia podría "
"considerarse un centro civil si su tráfico no consistiera exclusivamente en "
"naves piratas."

msgid ""
"A lively pirate bar, where the local militia make sure no troublemaker stays "
"unharmed. While the main area is a large open area, there are many smaller "
"private rooms where most of the deal and contract signing take place."
msgstr ""
"Un animado bar pirata, donde la milicia local se asegura de que ningún "
"alborotador salga ileso. Aunque la zona principal es un gran espacio "
"abierto, hay muchas salas privadas más pequeñas donde tienen lugar la "
"mayoría de los tratos y firmas de contratos."

msgid "Quai I"
msgstr "Quai I"

msgid "Quai II"
msgstr "Quai II"

msgid "Quai IIa"
msgstr "Quai IIa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quai IIb"
msgstr "Quai II"

msgid ""
"With nearly all the surface covered in an ocean of toxic sludge, there are "
"few landable areas on Quai IIb. It doesn't seem like even the best hull "
"coating will last too long if you bury your ship in the sludge. Good thing "
"there is not much of an atmosphere, so you don't have to worry about the "
"possibility of toxic rain. On the downside, the air is heavily contaminated "
"with microparticles that will slowly melt your ship if you dawdle too long."
msgstr ""

msgid "Qulam Primus"
msgstr "Qulam Primus"

msgid "Racheka"
msgstr "Racheka"

msgid ""
"Racheka is a relatively young Sirius colony. Where most Sirius planets are "
"converted planets that once belonged to another faction, Racheka was "
"actually established by Sirius colonists a considerable time after Sirichana "
"settled on Mutris. Perhaps for this reason the Sirian religion can be felt "
"very strongly here, as there are no remnants of other cultures mingling in "
"the lives of the population."
msgstr ""
"Racheka es una colonia Sirio relativamente joven. Mientras que la mayoría de "
"los planetas Sirio son planetas convertidos que en su día pertenecieron a "
"otra facción, Racheka fue establecida por colonos Sirio un tiempo "
"considerable después de que Sirichana se estableciera en Mutris. Tal vez por "
"esta razón, la religión Sirio se siente muy fuertemente aquí, ya que no hay "
"restos de otras culturas que se mezclen en la vida de la población."

msgid ""
"The first thing anyone notices when they step into the bar is the ceiling, "
"which is a holographic display of the galaxy, centred around Anarbalis. "
"Though an impressive display as well as a marvel of technology, the bar's "
"proprietor apparently doesn't realize that many of his customers spend all "
"day looking at the stars, and therefore have little desire to look at them "
"when onworld."
msgstr ""
"Lo primero que se observa al entrar en el bar es el techo, que es una "
"pantalla holográfica de la galaxia, centrada en Anarbalis. Aunque es una "
"pantalla impresionante y una maravilla de la tecnología, parece que el "
"propietario del bar no se da cuenta de que muchos de sus clientes se pasan "
"el día mirando las estrellas y, por tanto, tienen pocas ganas de mirarlas "
"cuando están en el mundo."

msgid "Racheka Secundus"
msgstr "Racheka Secundus"

msgid "Radix I"
msgstr "Radix I"

msgid "Radix II"
msgstr "Radix II"

msgid "Radix III"
msgstr "Radix III"

msgid "Raelid II"
msgstr "Raelid II"

msgid "Raelid Prime"
msgstr "Raelid Prime"

msgid "Rage"
msgstr "Rabia"

msgid "Ramen"
msgstr "Ramen"

msgid ""
"Ramen produces raw materials, in the truest sense of the word. Radioactive "
"slag is mined from the volcanic pits that litter the landscape of this moon, "
"and packaged into storage canisters that are shipped offworld directly. No "
"processing of any kind occurs here."
msgstr ""
"Ramen produce materias primas, en el sentido más estricto de la palabra. La "
"escoria radiactiva se extrae de los pozos volcánicos que pueblan el paisaje "
"de esta luna, y se empaqueta en botes de almacenamiento que se envían "
"directamente al exterior. Aquí no se realiza ningún tipo de procesamiento."

msgid ""
"This bar is frequented by local workers whose shift is about to begin, or "
"has just ended. The workers don't live on station, but migrate from the "
"living complexes on the nearby world of Timu."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es frecuentado por trabajadores locales cuyo turno está a punto de "
"comenzar o acaba de terminar. Los trabajadores no viven en la estación, sino "
"que emigran desde los complejos habitacionales del cercano mundo de Timu."

msgid "Raptor Nest"
msgstr "Nido Raptor"

msgid ""
"Raptor Nest is built to protect Soromid holding from pirate raids. The men "
"here all go about their tasks with grim efficiency, and there is little room "
"for luxuries."
msgstr ""
"El Nido Raptor se construyó para proteger las posesiones Soromida de las "
"incursiones de los piratas. Todos los hombres que trabajan aquí lo hacen con "
"gran eficiencia, y hay poco espacio para los lujos."

msgid ""
"The bar has a few off-duty soldiers and the rare civilian relaxing here "
"before duty calls them onward. The bar itself is not particularly engaging, "
"being a pre-fab model built into the station."
msgstr ""
"En el bar hay unos cuantos soldados fuera de servicio y algún que otro civil "
"que se relaja aquí antes de que el deber les llame a seguir adelante. El bar "
"en sí no es especialmente atractivo, ya que se trata de un modelo "
"prefabricado integrado en la estación."

msgid "Red Eye"
msgstr "Ojo Rojo"

msgid "Regensburg"
msgstr "Regensburg"

msgid ""
"Regensburg is a classical den of iniquity. Basically a floating casino, many "
"people come here to earn their fortunes, inevitably losing them, of course. "
"Although never too large, many periods of continuous operation have taken "
"its toll on the station, with any trace of glamour it had long lost."
msgstr ""
"Ratisbona es un clásico antro de iniquidad. Básicamente un casino flotante, "
"mucha gente viene aquí a ganar sus fortunas, perdiéndolas inevitablemente "
"por supuesto. Aunque nunca ha sido demasiado grande, muchos periodos de "
"funcionamiento continuado han pasado factura a la estación, que ha perdido "
"hace tiempo cualquier rastro de glamour."

msgid ""
"The bar serves as a sort of allegory of better times with some decorations "
"from the grand opening a long time ago still up. However, despite this worn "
"down appearance, the drink repertoire and quality is still top-notch."
msgstr ""
"El bar sirve como una especie de alegoría de tiempos mejores, con algunos "
"adornos de la gran inauguración de hace tiempo todavía en pie. Sin embargo, "
"a pesar de este aspecto desgastado, el repertorio de bebidas y la calidad "
"siguen siendo de primera categoría."

msgid "Rei II"
msgstr "Rei II"

msgid "Rei III"
msgstr "Rei III"

msgid "Reidd"
msgstr "Reidd"

msgid ""
"Some planets just don't have the capacity to feed their own populations, "
"despite advanced crop-growing techniques. Reidd is not one of those planets. "
"In fact, Reidd's orbit and axial inclination make it such a good farming "
"world that it can supply many worlds in nearby systems. The local government "
"acknowledges this, and has dedicated 97% of Reidd's land surface to "
"agricultural operations."
msgstr ""
"Algunos planetas simplemente no tienen la capacidad de alimentar a su propia "
"población, a pesar de las avanzadas técnicas de cultivo. Reidd no es uno de "
"esos planetas. De hecho, la órbita y la inclinación axial de Reidd lo "
"convierten en un mundo agrícola tan bueno que puede abastecer a muchos "
"mundos de los sistemas cercanos. El gobierno local lo reconoce, y ha "
"dedicado el 97% de la superficie terrestre de Reidd a operaciones agrícolas."

msgid ""
"In what might be a slight case of overreaction, Reidd's bar is underground, "
"so as not to have to sacrifice any land surface. Still, the primary "
"difference between this bar and most others in the galaxy is that pilots "
"have to take an elevator to reach this one."
msgstr ""
"En lo que podría ser un ligero caso de exageración, el bar de Reidd es "
"subterráneo, para no tener que sacrificar ninguna superficie terrestre. Aun "
"así, la principal diferencia entre este bar y la mayoría de los demás de la "
"galaxia es que los pilotos tienen que tomar un ascensor para llegar a este."

msgid "Research Post Sigma-13"
msgstr "Puesto de investigación Sigma-13"

msgid ""
"You see what looks like was once a small Za'lek research station. While the "
"inside is largely intact, there are large plasma scars all over the hull of "
"the station. There are also large amounts of structural damage which are "
"likely the result of a collision with a large object. A brief inspection of "
"the inside makes it clear that there is no life remaining on the station. "
"The spaceport dock also has a small shipyard that seems to be unusable from "
"all the destruction. However, what is strangest of all the things you find "
"on the station is the puzzling fact that the fuel has been taken through a "
"large hole in the exterior…"
msgstr ""
"Ves lo que parece haber sido una pequeña estación de investigación Za'lek. "
"Aunque el interior está prácticamente intacto, hay grandes cicatrices de "
"plasma por todo el casco de la estación. También hay grandes daños "
"estructurales que probablemente sean el resultado de una colisión con un "
"objeto grande. Una breve inspección del interior deja claro que no queda "
"vida en la estación. El muelle del puerto espacial también tiene un pequeño "
"astillero que parece estar inutilizado por toda la destrucción. Sin embargo, "
"lo más extraño de todo lo que encuentras en la estación es el desconcertante "
"hecho de que el combustible ha sido extraído a través de un gran agujero en "
"el exterior…"

msgid "Rhaana"
msgstr "Rhaana"

msgid ""
"Rhaana is one of the outer worlds of Dvaered control. The population is "
"high, but forced to live in insulated containment centres. It is a poor "
"world, with little to recommend it to the wider galaxy. Thusly, it's very "
"quiet."
msgstr ""
"Rhaana es uno de los mundos exteriores de control Dvaered. La población es "
"alta, pero se ve obligada a vivir en centros de contención aislados. Es un "
"mundo pobre, con poco que recomendar a la galaxia en general. Por lo tanto, "
"es muy tranquilo."

msgid ""
"The bar is a standard-issue model, seen in most space stations. Other than "
"that, it is as overlarge and dingy as any Dvaered bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar es un modelo estándar, visto en la mayoría de las estaciones "
"espaciales. Aparte de eso, es tan grande y sucio como cualquier bar Dvaered."

msgid "Rhu II"
msgstr "Rhu II"

msgid "Rhu III"
msgstr "Rhu III"

msgid "Rhu IV"
msgstr "Rhu IV"

msgid "Ridrack"
msgstr "Ridrack"

msgid "Rikaina"
msgstr "Rikaina"

msgid ""
"Rikaina is typically tasked with mass-producing the most advanced Thurion "
"technology. Due to its potential value to advarsaries, outsiders are "
"generally not allowed in until they have proven themselves trustworthy to "
"the Thurion council."
msgstr ""
"Rikaina suele encargarse de la producción en masa de la tecnología Turion "
"más avanzada. Debido a su valor potencial para los advenedizos, por lo "
"general no se permite la entrada a los forasteros hasta que hayan demostrado "
"ser dignos de confianza ante el consejo de Turion."

msgid ""
"The bar here really is no different from any other Thurion bar. As usual, no "
"alcohol is sold, and biological Thurions can be seen socializing and "
"enjoying safe foods and drinks."
msgstr ""
"El bar aquí no es diferente de cualquier otro bar Turion. Como es habitual, "
"no se vende alcohol, y se puede ver a los Turion biológicos socializando y "
"disfrutando de comidas y bebidas seguras."

msgid "Rionna"
msgstr "Rionna"

msgid ""
"Rionna is a cold world, but it was not always so. Only a hundred years ago, "
"it was classified as a class M planet, though even then it was on the chilly "
"side. The reason why the face of the planet is covered in ice now is that "
"the local star is going through a dim phase. Astronomers have predicted that "
"in another century and a half, the star will brighten up again, and Rionna "
"will once again be green. The population has dug in, preferring to wait for "
"better years than to move offworld and leave their homes behind."
msgstr ""
"Rionna es un mundo frío, pero no siempre lo fue. Hace sólo cien años, estaba "
"clasificado como un planeta de clase M, aunque incluso entonces estaba en el "
"lado frío. La razón por la que la cara del planeta está ahora cubierta de "
"hielo es que la estrella local está pasando por una fase de oscuridad. Los "
"astrónomos han predicho que dentro de un siglo y medio la estrella volverá a "
"brillar y Rionna volverá a ser verde. La población se ha atrincherado, "
"prefiriendo esperar a que lleguen años mejores que trasladarse fuera del "
"planeta y dejar atrás sus hogares."

msgid ""
"This spaceport bar is wholly unremarkable. It could be any other bar on any "
"other planet. The only thing that reminds you that you're still on Rionna is "
"that the patrons are all wearing warm clothes."
msgstr ""
"Este bar del puerto espacial es totalmente anodino. Podría ser cualquier "
"otro bar en cualquier otro planeta. Lo único que te recuerda que sigues en "
"Rionna es que todos los clientes llevan ropa de abrigo."

msgid "Riun"
msgstr "Riun"

msgid "Rockhardt"
msgstr "Rockhardt"

msgid ""
"Rockhardt was originally commissioned as an auxiliary manufacturing plant "
"for the Imperial military. But when the Incident happened the Empire lost a "
"lot of its core manufacturing plants, and Rockhardt was upgraded to a main "
"line facility. An observant visitor can clearly make out the boundary "
"between the first and second generation industrial centres."
msgstr ""
"Rockhardt fue encargado originalmente como una planta de fabricación "
"auxiliar para el ejército Imperial. Pero cuando se produjo el Incidente, el "
"Imperio perdió muchas de sus plantas de fabricación principales, y Rockhardt "
"se convirtió en una instalación de línea principal. Un visitante atento "
"puede distinguir claramente el límite entre los centros industriales de "
"primera y segunda generación."

msgid ""
"Even today, the Empire's military remains a well oiled machine. It isn't "
"content to work with old or substandard equipment, and so replacement parts "
"and ships must constantly be produced. Rockhardt has a steady supply of "
"manufacturing orders coming in at any given time, and the commercial traffic "
"that accompanies it is clearly visible in the spaceport bar."
msgstr ""
"Incluso hoy, el ejército del Imperio sigue siendo una máquina bien "
"engrasada. No se conforma con trabajar con equipos viejos o de baja calidad, "
"por lo que hay que producir constantemente piezas y naves de repuesto. "
"Rockhardt tiene un suministro constante de pedidos de fabricación que llegan "
"en cualquier momento, y el tráfico comercial que lo acompaña es claramente "
"visible en el bar del puerto espacial."

msgid "Rodney"
msgstr "Rodney"

msgid ""
"Rodney is a world where precious gems are mined and sold further south to "
"bolster the Soromid economy. The planet also grows several valuable crops, "
"and is mined for valuable minerals. While this makes it a valuable addition "
"to the Soromid economy, it makes it an aggressively dull place to live."
msgstr ""
"Rodney es un mundo en el que se extraen gemas preciosas que se venden más al "
"sur para reforzar la economía Soromida. En el planeta también crecen varios "
"cultivos valiosos y se extraen valiosos minerales. Aunque esto lo convierte "
"en una valiosa adición a la economía Soromida, lo convierte en un lugar "
"agresivamente aburrido para vivir."

msgid ""
"You see several rich magnates and merchant lords in this bar, talking "
"business or making small talk. The sheer pompousness of the scene makes you "
"want to run out the door screaming."
msgstr ""
"En este bar ves a varios magnates ricos y señores mercaderes, hablando de "
"negocios o manteniendo una pequeña charla. La mera pomposidad de la escena "
"hace que quieras salir corriendo por la puerta gritando."

msgid "Rogan"
msgstr "Rogan"

msgid ""
"Rogan is a relatively prosperous world, despite the fact that much of the "
"planetary surface is desert. However, these deserts conveniently have huge "
"repositories of valuable minerals, and the oceans teem with sea life. The "
"result is a rich planet with a booming population."
msgstr ""
"Rogan es un mundo relativamente próspero, a pesar de que gran parte de la "
"superficie del planeta es un desierto. Sin embargo, estos desiertos tienen "
"convenientemente enormes depósitos de minerales valiosos, y los océanos "
"rebosan de vida marina. El resultado es un planeta rico con una población "
"floreciente."

msgid ""
"You see several rich trading magnates talking business in this bar. It seems "
"to be split between the rich section and the poorer section, for tramp "
"traders and miners."
msgstr ""
"En este bar se ven varios ricos magnates del comercio hablando de negocios. "
"Parece estar dividido entre la sección rica y la sección más pobre, para "
"comerciantes vagabundos y mineros."

msgid "Ross Prime"
msgstr "Ross Prime"

msgid "Rostra"
msgstr "Rostra"

msgid ""
"Rostra is another enclave core world. The Straight Row is the largest of the "
"enclaves, but also the weakest, with a divided agenda and the burden of "
"dealing with pirates trying to break into Za'lek space. As such, Rostra does "
"not have quite the same amenities as the other enclave cores, and the "
"intellectual elite here live here primarily to avoid the politics in other "
"enclaves and the capital."
msgstr ""
"Rostra es otro mundo central de enclave. La Fila Recta es el mayor de los "
"enclaves, pero también el más débil, con una agenda dividida y la carga de "
"lidiar con los piratas que intentan entrar en el espacio Za'lek. Como tal, "
"Rostra no tiene las mismas comodidades que los otros núcleos de enclave, y "
"la élite intelectual vive aquí principalmente para evitar la política de "
"otros enclaves y de la capital."

msgid ""
"This bar is loud and dirty with arguing researchers, drinking workers, and "
"stressed out and overworked bar staff. Combined with the cramped quarters "
"and mediocre service, the result is not likely to impress."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es ruidoso y sucio, con investigadores que discuten, trabajadores "
"que beben y personal del bar estresado y con exceso de trabajo. Combinado "
"con la estrechez del local y un servicio mediocre, el resultado no suele "
"impresionar."

msgid "Rotide I"
msgstr "Rotide I"

msgid "Rotide II"
msgstr "Rotide II"

msgid "Ruadan Gamma"
msgstr "Ruadan Gamma"

msgid "Ruadan Host"
msgstr "Anfitrión Ruadan"

msgid ""
"Ruadan Host houses the Za'lek military concentrated around Ruadan Prime. "
"Like Ruadan Prime, very few people are allowed to land here, and those that "
"are allowed face intense security scrutiny."
msgstr ""
"El Anfitrión Ruadan alberga a los militares Za'lek concentrados en torno a "
"Ruadan Prime. Al igual que en Ruadan Prime, muy pocas personas pueden "
"aterrizar aquí, y las que lo hacen se enfrentan a un intenso escrutinio de "
"seguridad."

msgid "Ruadan II"
msgstr "Ruadan II"

msgid "Ruadan J-1"
msgstr "Ruadan J-1"

msgid "Ruadan J-2"
msgstr "Ruadan J-2"

msgid "Ruadan Prime"
msgstr "Ruadan Prime"

msgid "#pZa'lek Homeworld#0"
msgstr "#pMundo Hogar Za'lek#0"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ruadan has recently become the nerve centre of the Za'lek. Most of the "
"Za'lek's strength is concentrated here, and they don't allow anyone but the "
"highest level captains to land here. Even being allowed to be here is "
"considered a great honour."
msgstr ""
"Ruadan se ha convertido recientemente en el centro neurálgico de los Za'lek. "
"La mayor parte de la fuerza del Za'lek se concentra aquí, y no permiten que "
"nadie, excepto los capitanes de más alto nivel, aterrice aquí. Incluso que "
"se les permita estar aquí se considera un gran honor."

msgid ""
"Given the exclusive nature of Ruadan Prime, the atmosphere of the bar is "
"very to-the-point and focused. Everyone here has a reason to be here, and "
"not much time to spare."
msgstr ""
"Dado el carácter exclusivo de Ruadan Prime, el ambiente del bar es muy "
"directo y concentrado. Todo el mundo tiene una razón para estar aquí, y no "
"mucho tiempo que compartir."

msgid "Ruadan Secundus"
msgstr "Ruadan Secundus"

msgid "Ruadan Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal Ruadan"

msgid ""
"This simple station serves as a refuel depot for those ships that do not "
"have security clearance to land on Ruadan Prime or Ruadan Host. There is "
"precious little else of interest here."
msgstr ""
"Esta sencilla estación sirve como depósito de combustible para aquellas "
"naves que no tienen autorización de seguridad para aterrizar en Ruadan Prime "
"o en Anfitrión Ruadan. Hay muy poco más de interés aquí."

msgid "Rudderfern"
msgstr "Rudderfern"

msgid ""
"Rudderfern is a small but wealthy Soromid colony. Its primary, Father's "
"Pride III, is far too hostile for even the Soromid to utilize, but its moon "
"has very Earth-like properties, apart from its low gravity. Many well-to-do "
"Soromid have settled here, enjoying the pleasant environment and the high "
"level of security offered in Father's Pride."
msgstr ""
"Rudderfern es una pequeña pero rica colonia Soromida. Su principal, Orgullo "
"de Padre III, es demasiado hostil incluso para los Soromida, pero su luna "
"tiene propiedades muy parecidas a las de la Tierra, aparte de su baja "
"gravedad. Muchos Soromida adinerados se han establecido aquí, disfrutando "
"del agradable entorno y del alto nivel de seguridad que ofrece Orgullo de "
"Padre."

msgid ""
"Most planets have spaceport bars. Not Rudderfern. It has a spaceport lounge. "
"It has classy furniture, richly decorated walls and ceilings, and even "
"actual Soromid serving personnel. Rudderfern rather takes pride in "
"officially having the highest class spaceport bar in the known galaxy."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los planetas tienen bares en los puertos espaciales. "
"Rudderfern no. Tiene un salón en el puerto espacial. Tiene muebles de clase, "
"paredes y techos ricamente decorados, e incluso personal de servicio "
"Soromida. Rudderfern se enorgullece de tener oficialmente el bar de puerto "
"espacial de mayor clase de la galaxia conocida."

msgid "Ruid"
msgstr "Ruid"

msgid "Ruin"
msgstr "Ruina"

msgid ""
"It is said that when the first colonist ship landed here, its captain took a "
"look outside and muttered to himself: \"what a ruin of a planet\". His cabin "
"crew overheard, and the word stuck. Today, the planet is officially known as "
"Ruin on all publicly sold star maps. While the planet has been significantly "
"developed since its colonization, it is hard to say that it is an "
"interesting or exciting world."
msgstr ""
"Se dice que cuando la primera nave de colonos aterrizó aquí, su capitán echó "
"un vistazo al exterior y murmuró para sí mismo \"vaya ruina de planeta\". Su "
"tripulación lo escuchó y la palabra se quedó grabada. Hoy en día, el planeta "
"se conoce oficialmente como Ruina en todos los mapas estelares de venta al "
"público. Aunque el planeta se ha desarrollado considerablemente desde su "
"colonización, es difícil decir que sea un mundo interesante o emocionante."

msgid ""
"Ruin's spaceport bar is a deliberate retro affair. Although it does have all "
"of the standard spaceport facilities, they have been encased in old-"
"fashioned terminal housings. The furniture and overall design also have been "
"styled on what was commonplace several dozen cycles ago. Some like it, some "
"don't."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Ruina es de aspecto deliberadamente retro. "
"Aunque cuenta con todas las instalaciones estándar de los puertos "
"espaciales, se han encerrado en carcasas de terminales anticuadas. El "
"mobiliario y el diseño general también se han inspirado en lo que era "
"habitual hace varias docenas de ciclos. A algunos les gusta, a otros no."

msgid "Rulk'ar"
msgstr "Rulk'ar"

msgid ""
"Rulk'ar is a mining-world with a strong presence of Za'lek universities "
"thanks to its rather isolated nature aesthetic view. It is a centre of "
"terraforming research, turning an already inhabitable planet into a full "
"class-M world. Many burnt out Za'lek researchers come here to get more in "
"touch with nature and get away from the intense research schedules they have "
"back at their research centres, and quite a few never return."
msgstr ""
"Rulk'ar es un mundo minero con una fuerte presencia de universidades Za'lek "
"gracias a su visión estética de naturaleza bastante aislada. Es un centro de "
"investigación de terraformación, que convierte un planeta ya habitable en un "
"mundo de clase M. Muchos investigadores Za'lek agotados vienen aquí para "
"estar más en contacto con la naturaleza y alejarse de las intensas agendas "
"de investigación que tienen en sus centros de investigación, y bastantes "
"nunca regresan."

msgid ""
"This bar has holopaintings of some of Rulk'ar's breathtaking canyons, "
"mountains, and skyline, as well as the progress on the world's terraforming. "
"The laid-back and casual ambience is also very fitting."
msgstr ""
"Este bar tiene holopinturas de algunos de los impresionantes cañones, "
"montañas y horizonte de Rulk'ar, así como el progreso de la terraformación "
"del mundo. El ambiente relajado e informal también es muy adecuado."

msgid "Ruttwi I"
msgstr "Ruttwi I"

msgid "Ruttwi II"
msgstr "Ruttwi II"

msgid "Ryder"
msgstr "Ryder"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once a booming developed world, it met a swift end with the Incident burning "
"off half of the planet's surface, stripping away the atmosphere and nearly "
"cracking the core. It is not clear if anybody managed to survive, however, "
"the planet is now desolate of any living entities. Yet another uninhabited "
"rock in the void of space."
msgstr ""
"Una vez fue un floreciente mundo desarrollado, pero todo terminó rápidamente "
"cuando el Incidente quemó la mitad de la superficie del planeta, eliminó la "
"atmósfera y casi agrietó el núcleo. No está claro si alguien consiguió "
"sobrevivir, pero el planeta está ahora desolado de cualquier entidad "
"viviente. Otra roca deshabitada en el vacío del espacio."

msgid "Ryder III"
msgstr "Ryder III"

msgid "S00000"
msgstr "S00000"

msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

msgid "S00018"
msgstr "S00018"

msgid "S00522"
msgstr "S00522"

msgid "S00653"
msgstr "S00653"

msgid "S13024"
msgstr "S13024"

msgid "S23001"
msgstr "S23001"

msgid "S23491"
msgstr "S23491"

msgid "S38729"
msgstr "S38729"

msgid "S49281"
msgstr "S49281"

msgid "S49335"
msgstr "S49335"

msgid "S49588"
msgstr "S49588"

msgid "S58309"
msgstr "S58309"

msgid "S72288"
msgstr "S72288"

msgid "S72839"
msgstr "S72839"

msgid "S91456"
msgstr "S91456"

msgid "Sabe"
msgstr "Sabe"

msgid ""
"Sabe and Anya are a pair of planets tidally locked to each other, rotating "
"around their shared centre of gravity. Sabe is the centre of the Thurian "
"government, housing the largest population of both uploaded and biological "
"Thurions, acting as the de-facto capital. The majority of the planet's "
"surface is untouched, as virtually all its inhabitants reside in the "
"multitude of arcologies spread across its surface."
msgstr ""
"Sabe y Anya son un par de planetas unidos por la marea, que giran alrededor "
"de su centro de gravedad común. Sabe es el centro del gobierno Turion, y "
"alberga la mayor población de Turion tanto subidos como biológicos, actuando "
"como capital de facto. La mayor parte de la superficie del planeta está "
"intacta, ya que prácticamente todos sus habitantes residen en la multitud de "
"arcologías repartidas por su superficie."

msgid ""
"The bar here is extremely active, with many biological and uploaded Thurions "
"alike. Of course, as is the custom, biological Thurions do not eat or drink "
"any substances that could harm the brain, meaning that the bar doesn't even "
"offer alcoholic drinks on the menu."
msgstr ""
"El bar aquí es extremadamente activo, con muchos Turions biológicos y "
"subidos por igual. Por supuesto, como es costumbre, los Turions biológicos "
"no comen ni beben ninguna sustancia que pueda dañar el cerebro, lo que "
"significa que el bar ni siquiera ofrece bebidas alcohólicas en el menú."

msgid "Salsax Nest"
msgstr "Nido Salsax"

msgid ""
"Salsax Nest is a commerce station much like stations found all over the "
"galaxy. It acts as a local centre for commodity trade, and is considered a "
"home away from home for many regular freighter captains because they can "
"meet kindred spirits here."
msgstr ""
"El Nido Salsax es una estación comercial muy parecida a las estaciones que "
"se encuentran en toda la galaxia. Actúa como centro local para el comercio "
"de productos básicos y se considera un hogar lejos de casa para muchos "
"capitanes de cargueros habituales, ya que aquí pueden encontrar espíritus "
"afines."

msgid ""
"Trader-heavy spacedock bars like this one are often a good place to hear "
"stories from across the galaxy. Word of mouth is still a potent source of "
"information even in this day and age, as the news channels only report on so "
"much that goes on in the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Los bares espaciales con muchos comerciantes, como éste, suelen ser un buen "
"lugar para escuchar historias de toda la galaxia. El boca a boca sigue "
"siendo una potente fuente de información incluso en esta época, ya que los "
"canales de noticias sólo informan de una parte de lo que ocurre en la "
"galaxia."

msgid "Samell"
msgstr "Samell"

msgid ""
"Samell is a predominantly industrial world. Heavy industry is often not "
"welcome on densely populated M class planets, so it tends to settle on "
"planets with hostile environments. Samell is no exception to that trend. The "
"low temperatures are favourable fabrication processes that require high "
"precision and calibration, allowing them to produce high-end components with "
"relative ease."
msgstr ""
"Samell es un mundo predominantemente industrial. La industria pesada no "
"suele ser bienvenida en los planetas de clase M densamente poblados, por lo "
"que tiende a instalarse en planetas con entornos hostiles. Samell no es una "
"excepción a esta tendencia.Las bajas temperaturas favorecen los procesos de "
"fabricación que requieren gran precisión y calibración, lo que les permite "
"producir componentes de gama alta con relativa facilidad."

msgid ""
"Whoever designed the spaceport placed the spaceport bar at the outside, "
"adding windows so visitors could look out over the frozen landscape. He "
"didn't realize that the windows would soon become frozen over themselves, "
"making them completely useless."
msgstr ""
"Quien diseñó el puerto espacial colocó el bar del mismo en el exterior, "
"añadiendo ventanas para que los visitantes pudieran contemplar el paisaje "
"helado. No se dio cuenta de que las ventanas pronto se congelarían sobre sí "
"mismas, haciéndolas completamente inútiles."

msgid "Sanchez"
msgstr "Sanchez"

msgid ""
"Although having a very low hospitality index due to the thin atmosphere and "
"abundance of damaging space dust, Old King Cole's moon Sanchez was colonized "
"due to being located on a trade lane. While not being very prosperous, it "
"grew and expanded over time. When the Incident struck, Sanchez was lucky to "
"be shielded from the expanding Nebula by being in Old King Cole's shadow. "
"Despite not being destroyed outright, the severe intensity of the radiation "
"ended up killing nearly all that were unable to emigrate to safer territory. "
"Out of sheer necessity the few survivors were able to mainly shield "
"themselves by digging into the core of the moon, using extreme "
"pharmacological treatments to survive their apocalypse. Eventually "
"scavengers and pirates found the station again, and a unique alliance was "
"struck, leading to the creation of the Dreamer Pirate Clan.\n"
"Through piracy, Sanchez has reached a prosperity it never had before "
"Incident. Although still far from a rich planet, it hosts many refugees from "
"nearby systems and criminals fleeing from more civilized society. Given the "
"frail balance one would think that this would lead to an inevitable doom, "
"however, heavy use of narcotics and a communal mindset avoids most serious "
"conflicts and allows the society at Sanchez to be relatively stable."
msgstr ""
"Aunque tiene un índice de hospitalidad muy bajo debido a la delgada "
"atmósfera y a la abundancia de polvo espacial dañino, la luna Sánchez del "
"Viejo Rey Cole fue colonizada por estar situada en una ruta comercial. "
"Aunque no era muy próspera, creció y se expandió con el tiempo. Cuando se "
"produjo el Incidente, Sánchez tuvo la suerte de estar protegida de la "
"Nebulosa en expansión por encontrarse a la sombra del Viejo Rey Cole. A "
"pesar de no haber sido destruida del todo, la gran intensidad de la "
"radiación acabó matando a casi todos los que no pudieron emigrar a un "
"territorio más seguro. Por pura necesidad, los pocos supervivientes pudieron "
"protegerse principalmente excavando en el núcleo de la luna, utilizando "
"tratamientos farmacológicos extremos para sobrevivir a su apocalipsis. Con "
"el tiempo, los carroñeros y los piratas volvieron a encontrar la estación y "
"se estableció una alianza única, que dio lugar a la creación del Clan Pirata "
"Soñador.\n"
"Gracias a la piratería, Sánchez ha alcanzado una prosperidad que nunca antes "
"había tenido. Aunque aún dista mucho de ser un planeta rico, acoge a muchos "
"refugiados de sistemas cercanos y a criminales que huyen de una sociedad más "
"civilizada. Dado el frágil equilibrio se podría pensar que esto llevaría a "
"una perdición inevitable, sin embargo, el uso intensivo de narcóticos y una "
"mentalidad comunal evitan la mayoría de los conflictos graves y permiten que "
"la sociedad de Sánchez sea relativamente estable."

msgid ""
"The bar is quiet and orderly, with a few deals going down in closed-off "
"booths, nice food and only the occasional drunken brawl. The lord of Sanchez "
"doesn't appreciate louts, it seems. If it were not for the abundant presence "
"of narcotics of all sorts being used, you would believe to be in a regular "
"backwater spaceport bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar es tranquilo y ordenado, con algunos tratos en cabinas cerradas, "
"buena comida y sólo alguna pelea de borrachos. Parece que el señor de "
"Sanchez no aprecia a los groseros. Si no fuera por la abundante presencia de "
"narcóticos de todo tipo que se consumen, creerías estar en un bar de puerto "
"espacial normal y corriente."

msgid "Sander"
msgstr "Sander"

msgid ""
"Griffin III's sister world is Sander. Owing to its largely aquatic surface, "
"its population is significantly lower than Griffin III's, but its oceans "
"provide food to many nearby planets, and Imperial mining operations are able "
"to harvest many valuable materials from the sea floor."
msgstr ""
"El mundo hermano de Grifo III es Sander. Debido a su superficie "
"mayoritariamente acuática, su población es significativamente menor que la "
"de Grifo III, pero sus océanos proporcionan alimento a muchos planetas "
"cercanos, y las operaciones mineras Imperiales son capaces de recoger muchos "
"materiales valiosos del fondo marino."

msgid ""
"This underwater bar is quite the spectacle. Large marine creatures swim by "
"the windows, and the main lobby is designed to enhance the aesthetic. A "
"little overdone, but pleasant overall."
msgstr ""
"Este bar submarino es todo un espectáculo. Grandes criaturas marinas nadan "
"junto a las ventanas, y el vestíbulo principal está diseñado para realzar la "
"estética. Un poco exagerado, pero agradable en general."

msgid "Santoros I"
msgstr "Santoros I"

msgid "Santoros I-a"
msgstr "Santoros I-a"

msgid "Santoros I-b"
msgstr "Santoros I-b"

msgid "Santoros II"
msgstr "Santoros II"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With no atmosphere or any rare resources, Santoros II is just an oversized "
"rock floating in space. It is speculated that most of the asteroids in the "
"system were originally part of Santoros II, broken off due the flakiness and "
"low density of the planetary crust."
msgstr ""
"Sin atmósfera ni recursos raros, Santoros II no es más que una roca de gran "
"tamaño flotando en el espacio. Se especula con que la mayoría de los "
"asteroides del sistema formaban parte originalmente de Santoros II, "
"desprendidos debido a la escamosidad de la corteza planetaria y a su baja "
"densidad."

msgid "Saraab"
msgstr "Saraab"

msgid ""
"Saraab is a small mining colony. The planet's core is comprised of valuable "
"metals and has almost completely cooled, which makes this world one giant "
"strip mine. The planet is slowly being dismantled and taken to various "
"manufacturing plants elsewhere in the galaxy. In fact, since the planet was "
"first settled around the end of the Imperial Golden Age, its gravity has "
"decreased by 17%."
msgstr ""
"Saraab es una pequeña colonia minera. El núcleo del planeta está compuesto "
"por metales valiosos y se ha enfriado casi por completo, lo que convierte a "
"este mundo en una gigantesca mina a cielo abierto. El planeta está siendo "
"desmantelado lentamente y llevado a varias plantas de fabricación en otros "
"lugares de la galaxia. De hecho, desde que el planeta fue colonizado por "
"primera vez a finales de la Edad de Oro Imperial, su gravedad ha disminuido "
"en un 17%."

msgid ""
"Like on many low-gravity worlds, Saraab's spaceport bar has artificial "
"gravity generators installed in various places. The bar is no exception. "
"However, the generators are old and sometimes break down, which can cause "
"serious discomfort for the patrons. The workers don't seem to mind however - "
"they are used to gravitational shifts."
msgstr ""
"Como en muchos mundos de baja gravedad, el bar del puerto espacial de Saraab "
"tiene generadores de gravedad artificial instalados en varios lugares. El "
"bar no es una excepción. Sin embargo, los generadores son viejos y a veces "
"se estropean, lo que puede causar graves incomodidades a los clientes. Sin "
"embargo, a los trabajadores no parece importarles, ya que están "
"acostumbrados a los cambios de gravedad."

msgid "Sarcophagus I"
msgstr "Sarcófago I"

msgid "Sarcophagus II"
msgstr "Sarcófago II"

msgid "Sarcophagus IIb"
msgstr "Sarcófago IIb"

msgid "Sarcophagus V"
msgstr "Sarcófago V"

msgid "Savoy Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal Savoy"

msgid ""
"An ageing station, this serves as a simple guard station against possible "
"piracy in the south. There is little to warm or recommend the place to "
"curious visitors. There are few people wandering the halls, and most of them "
"are militia or scientists."
msgstr ""
"Una estación envejecida que sirve como simple puesto de guardia contra la "
"posible piratería en el sur. Hay poco que caliente o recomiende el lugar a "
"los visitantes curiosos. Hay poca gente deambulando por los pasillos, y la "
"mayoría son milicianos o científicos."

msgid "Scarlet II"
msgstr "Escarlata II"

msgid "Scarlett III"
msgstr "Escarlata III"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Scholz's Moon"
msgstr "Estrella de Scholz"

msgid ""
"Completely ravaged and barely recognizable, your ship logs indicate that "
"Scholz's Moon was once a prosperous city-moon of Scholz IIa. However, unlike "
"the records, the top one kilometre of the surface has been completely burnt "
"off, leaving only irradiated waste. Scattered large craters seem to indicate "
"the fate of the planet around which the moon was once orbiting.\n"
"\n"
"Although there are no forms of life, you find a grisly scene of a pile of "
"ships, likely landing after the incident to try to take cover, however, the "
"chance for any survivors is long gone. At least you can find decent amounts "
"of fuel to refuel your ship as necessary, as long as you don't focus on the "
"horrific scenery."
msgstr ""

msgid "Scinfaxi"
msgstr "Scinfaxi"

msgid "Scipio"
msgstr "Scipio"

msgid "Scorch"
msgstr "Chamuscado"

msgid ""
"This world is teeming with volcanoes and rivers of lava, punctuated with "
"frequent earthquakes and acid rains. It is possibly one of the most hostile "
"environments to be found in space. So naturally, there is a sizable presence "
"of scientists and geologists who find it to be a treasure trove. The Za'lek "
"authorities use it as a hostile environment training centre as well."
msgstr ""
"Este mundo está repleto de volcanes y ríos de lava, salpicado de frecuentes "
"terremotos y lluvias ácidas. Es posiblemente uno de los entornos más "
"hostiles que se pueden encontrar en el espacio. Así que, naturalmente, hay "
"una considerable presencia de científicos y geólogos que lo consideran un "
"tesoro. Las autoridades de Za'lek lo utilizan también como centro de "
"entrenamiento en entornos hostiles."

msgid ""
"The bar overlooks Scorch's lively weather. The glass is at least a metre "
"thick. The patrons to not seem to mind the visible havoc going on outside, "
"tending to their drinks and conversations with reassuring casualness."
msgstr ""
"El bar tiene vistas al animado clima de Chamuscado. Los cristales tienen al "
"menos un metro de grosor. A los clientes no parece importarles los visibles "
"estragos que se producen en el exterior, y atienden a sus bebidas y "
"conversaciones con una tranquilizadora despreocupación."

msgid "Scorpii Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Scorpii"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Scorpii Enclave is located in the stable zone of the intertwined Scorpii "
"Omega-1 and 2 gas giants, that keep the station in a prime position to "
"overlook the system. The station was developed as a civilian operation and "
"focused on medical developments, however, after the incident, it became a "
"trauma centre for the survivors and ended up specializing in the different "
"physical and neurological conditions from prolonged exposure to nebular "
"radiation. Through Imperial funding, it has also started new research into "
"treatments and shielding to survive the deep Nebula with mixed success. "
"Other than extensive medical installations, the station sports fairly high "
"end amenities for pilots."
msgstr ""
"El Enclave Scorpii está situado en la zona estable de los gigantes gaseosos "
"entrelazados Scorpii Omega-1 y 2, que mantienen a la estación en una "
"posición privilegiada para dominar el sistema. La estación se desarrolló "
"como una operación civil y se centró en desarrollos médicos, sin embargo, "
"tras el Incidente, se convirtió en un centro de traumatología para los "
"supervivientes y acabó especializándose en las diferentes afecciones físicas "
"y neurológicas derivadas de la exposición prolongada a la radiación de la "
"nebulosa. Gracias a la financiación imperial, también ha iniciado nuevas "
"investigaciones sobre tratamientos y blindajes para sobrevivir a la Nebulosa "
"profunda, con éxito desigual. Aparte de las amplias instalaciones médicas, "
"la estación cuenta con comodidades de gama bastante alta para los pilotos."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar is fairly standard Imperial design, however, it contains several "
"panels extracted from ships that barely survived the incident as a "
"centrepiece to raise awareness about the dangers that nebular radiation "
"possess. The panels are barely unrecognizable and feel warm to the touch and "
"seem to get the message across."
msgstr ""
"El bar tiene un diseño Imperial bastante estándar, sin embargo, contiene "
"varios paneles extraídos de naves que apenas sobrevivieron al incidente como "
"pieza central para concienciar sobre los peligros que posee la radiación de "
"la nebulosa. Los paneles, apenas irreconocibles y cálidos al tacto, parecen "
"transmitir el mensaje."

msgid "Scorpii Omega-1"
msgstr "Scorpii Omega-1"

msgid "Scorpii Omega-2"
msgstr "Scorpii Omega-2"

msgid "Scorpion Nest"
msgstr "Nido Escorpión"

msgid ""
"Scorpion Nest is hardly the most prestigious post for a Soromid captain to "
"be assigned to, but the peace needs to be kept everywhere, even in Hadosh."
msgstr ""
"Nido Escorpión no es el puesto más prestigioso para un capitán Soromida, "
"pero hay que mantener la paz en todas partes, incluso en Hadosh."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar is a place to meet officers and make formal inquiries. "
"It's not of much use for anything else."
msgstr ""
"El bar de la nave espacial es un lugar para reunirse con los oficiales y "
"hacer consultas formales. No sirve para mucho más."

msgid "Seanich"
msgstr "Seanich"

msgid ""
"On the edge of the Delta Pavonis system, unnoticed by all but a few, orbits "
"the tiny world of Seanich. Though technically a registered Imperial colony, "
"this backwater planet does not receive the attention that should come with "
"its status. The population is decidedly upset about this, to the point that "
"the local administration has stopped paying taxes to the central Imperial "
"government in protest. The Imperial government hasn't noticed."
msgstr ""
"En el borde del sistema Delta Pavonis, desapercibido para todos excepto para "
"unos pocos, orbita el pequeño mundo de Seanich. Aunque técnicamente es una "
"colonia Imperial registrada, este planeta aislado no recibe la atención que "
"debería tener su estatus. La población está decididamente molesta por ello, "
"hasta el punto de que la administración local ha dejado de pagar impuestos "
"al gobierno Imperial central en señal de protesta. El gobierno imperial no "
"se ha dado cuenta."

msgid ""
"Seanich has a pretty well-appointed spaceport bar. It has all the facilities "
"a spacer could need, and many are quite up to date. Sadly, this hasn't "
"helped to make the unfortunate colony more conspicuous in the galaxy. Most "
"of the tables are empty."
msgstr ""
"Seanich tiene un bar en el puerto espacial bastante bien equipado. Tiene "
"todas las instalaciones que un espacial podría necesitar, y muchas están "
"bastante actualizadas. Lamentablemente, esto no ha ayudado a que la "
"desafortunada colonia sea más llamativa en la galaxia. La mayoría de las "
"mesas están vacías."

msgid "Secundus Alpha"
msgstr "Secundus Alpha"

msgid "Secundus Beta"
msgstr "Secundus Beta"

msgid "Seiben IV"
msgstr "Seiben IV"

msgid "Seiben XI"
msgstr "Seiben XI"

msgid "Selphod"
msgstr "Selphod"

msgid ""
"Selphod is a harsh and barren ice planet. Most of the locals have never "
"ventured outside the established bases. Outdoor travels require heavy "
"thermal protection with a personal generator to keep the wearer from "
"succumbing to hypothermia. Many have met a swift, excruciatingly painful end "
"by venturing out in ill-sealed thermal suits."
msgstr ""
"Selphod es un planeta de hielo duro y estéril. La mayoría de los habitantes "
"nunca se han aventurado fuera de las bases establecidas. Los viajes al aire "
"libre requieren una fuerte protección térmica con un generador personal para "
"evitar que el usuario sucumba a la hipotermia. Muchos han tenido un final "
"rápido y terriblemente doloroso por aventurarse con trajes térmicos mal "
"cerrados."

msgid ""
"Most of the drinks served at the bar are served very warm with heavy "
"infusions of all kinds of spices. They are meant to bring warmth and energy "
"in the cold corridors of the base."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de las bebidas que se sirven en el bar están muy calientes, con "
"fuertes infusiones de todo tipo de especias. Están pensadas para aportar "
"calor y energía en los fríos pasillos de la base."

msgid "Semper"
msgstr "Semper"

msgid ""
"Though Semper is slightly on the poor side by Imperial standards, the people "
"who live here at least have the comfort of tight Imperial security. For that "
"reason, it is quite popular among immigrants into the Empire, who usually "
"don't have the means to settle on the richer civilian worlds."
msgstr ""
"Aunque Semper es un poco pobre para los estándares Imperiales, la gente que "
"vive aquí tiene al menos la comodidad de una estricta seguridad Imperial. "
"Por esa razón, es bastante popular entre los inmigrantes del Imperio, que "
"normalmente no tienen los medios para establecerse en los mundos civiles más "
"ricos."

msgid ""
"Semper is an immigrant world, which is reflected in its spaceport bar. The "
"design betrays influences from all over the galaxy, such as a holograph of a "
"Dvaered cruiser, a Sirius crest on some of the furniture and even some "
"Soromid-oriented drinks."
msgstr ""
"Semper es un mundo de inmigrantes, lo que se refleja en su bar del puerto "
"espacial. El diseño delata influencias de toda la galaxia, como un holograma "
"de un crucero Dvaered, un escudo Sirio en algunos muebles e incluso algunas "
"bebidas orientadas a los Soromida."

msgid "Senara I"
msgstr "Senara I"

msgid "Sergio Vix I"
msgstr "Sergio Vix I"

msgid "Sergio Vix III"
msgstr "Sergio Vix III"

msgid "Serria"
msgstr "Serria"

msgid "Servax"
msgstr "Servax"

msgid "Sevlow"
msgstr "Sevlow"

msgid ""
"Sevlow is one of the few truly inhabited Thurian worlds. Sevlow is an "
"uneventful planet, as it serves primarily as an agricultural world producing "
"algae, and as a living place for biological Thurions."
msgstr ""
"Sevlow es uno de los pocos mundos Turion realmente habitados. Sevlow es un "
"planeta sin incidentes, ya que sirve principalmente como mundo agrícola "
"productor de algas, y como lugar de vida para los Turiones biológicos."

msgid ""
"This bar is crowded with biological Thurions socializing and drinking non-"
"alcoholic beverages. Just like every other Thurion bar, no alcohol is sold "
"as that is believed to damage the brain."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está repleto de Turion biológicos que socializan y toman bebidas no "
"alcohólicas. Como en cualquier otro bar de Turion, no se vende alcohol, ya "
"que se cree que daña el cerebro."

msgid "Shade & Sunshine"
msgstr "Sombra & Sol"

msgid ""
"When the Soromid do something to do with biology, you can assume they do it "
"really well. Shade & Sunshine is a crop growing station with an amazing "
"output. Between the eternal day granted by the station's alignment with the "
"sun and the Soromid's skill with genetic manipulation, crops here are among "
"the most bountiful in the entire galaxy."
msgstr ""
"Cuando Soromida hacen algo relacionado con la biología, se puede suponer que "
"lo hacen muy bien. Sombra & Sol es una estación de cultivo con una "
"producción sorprendente. Entre el día eterno que otorga la alineación de la "
"estación con el sol y la habilidad Soromida con la manipulación genética, "
"las cosechas aquí son de las más abundantes de toda la galaxia."

msgid ""
"Shade & Sunshine rotates the crops it grows on a regular basis. The "
"spacedock bar is themed on the currently cultivated crops, using subtle "
"lighting and holopaintings along the walls."
msgstr ""
"Sombra & Sol rota regularmente los cultivos que realiza. El bar de la nave "
"espacial está ambientado en los cultivos actuales, con una sutil iluminación "
"y holopinturas en las paredes."

msgid "Shakar I"
msgstr "Shakar I"

msgid "Shakar III"
msgstr "Shakar III"

msgid "Shangris Station"
msgstr "Estación Shangris"

msgid ""
"Although not well publicized due to the nature of many deals going on at the "
"location, Shangris Station is infamous for being a place where one can "
"acquire all sorts of outfits, as long as you don't ask or care about where "
"it has come from. There is a constant coming and going of ships of all types "
"with people from all walks of life. You can see hardened thugs and "
"criminals, fairly normal looking pilots, and even what looks like poorly "
"disguised Imperial bureaucrats walking around the station. It seems like "
"pretty much everything goes as long as you don't call too much attention to "
"yourself or stir too much trouble."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no tiene mucha publicidad debido a la naturaleza de muchos de los "
"negocios que se llevan a cabo en el lugar, la estación de Shangris es famosa "
"por ser un lugar donde uno puede adquirir todo tipo de mejoras, siempre y "
"cuando no pregunte ni se preocupe por su procedencia. Hay un constante ir y "
"venir de naves de todo tipo con gente de toda condición. Se pueden ver "
"matones y criminales empedernidos, pilotos de aspecto bastante normal e "
"incluso lo que parecen burócratas imperiales mal disfrazados paseando por la "
"estación. Parece que todo vale, siempre que no llames demasiado la atención "
"ni causes demasiados problemas."

msgid ""
"Whether you're looking to get black out drunk, get into fights with the "
"locals, or do shady business, the Shangris Bar is the place to be. It is a "
"tumultuous place where it is impossible to keep track of what is going on at "
"any given time. Lots of shady characters can be seen all over and every so "
"often a fight breaks out to the cheering of onlookers. However, it does seem "
"like there are some unspoken rules and even fights end shortly and get "
"cleaned up so quick that you would have doubted there had been one in the "
"first place."
msgstr ""
"El Bar Shangris es el lugar ideal para emborracharse, pelearse con los "
"lugareños o hacer negocios turbios. Es un lugar tumultuoso en el que es "
"imposible seguir la pista de lo que ocurre en cada momento. Se pueden ver "
"muchos personajes turbios por todas partes y de vez en cuando estalla una "
"pelea entre los vítores de los espectadores. Sin embargo, parece que hay "
"algunas reglas tácitas e incluso las peleas terminan pronto y se limpian tan "
"rápido que uno habría dudado de que hubiera habido una en primer lugar."

msgid "Sharak"
msgstr "Sharak"

msgid ""
"Sharak is a place where the wealthy make their homes. Rather than breathe "
"the same air as the commoners on Edorn below, the people on this moon elect "
"to form their own elite society here on Sharak."
msgstr ""
"Sharak es un lugar donde los ricos tienen su hogar. En lugar de respirar el "
"mismo aire que los plebeyos de Edorn, los habitantes de esta luna eligen "
"formar su propia sociedad de élite en Sharak."

msgid ""
"There's a small public city built around the spaceport for servicing ships "
"and handling the usual planetary logistics, but most of Sharak's surface is "
"private property. The spaceport bar is the only public recreational facility "
"on the face of Sharak."
msgstr ""
"Hay una pequeña ciudad pública construida alrededor del puerto espacial para "
"dar servicio a las naves y la logística planetaria habitual, pero la mayor "
"parte de la superficie de Sharak es propiedad privada. El bar del puerto "
"espacial es la única instalación recreativa pública en la superficie de "
"Sharak."

msgid "Sheik Hall"
msgstr "Sala Sheik"

msgid ""
"Since well before the rise of House Dvaered, Sheik Hall has been an "
"important exporter of precious metals and valuable minerals. The people on "
"this planet make their living by mining those resources, and crafting "
"jewellery out of them. Though the planet's raw output isn't very high by any "
"standard, the amount of money involved is on par with a medium-sized mining "
"colony."
msgstr ""
"Desde mucho antes del ascenso de la Casa Dvaered, Sala Sheik ha sido un "
"importante exportador de metales finos y minerales valiosos. Los habitantes "
"de este planeta se ganan la vida extrayendo esos recursos y fabricando joyas "
"con ellos. Aunque la producción bruta del planeta no es muy elevada, la "
"cantidad de dinero que se maneja está a la altura de una colonia minera de "
"tamaño medio."

msgid ""
"The bar is ornately decorated with all that glitters and gleams. Of course, "
"everything you can see here is a replica, as the real valuables are all "
"shipped offworld. Nevertheless, it's attractive to pretend that you're "
"surrounded by riches for a moment."
msgstr ""
"El bar está decorado con todo lo que brilla y reluce. Por supuesto, todo lo "
"que se ve aquí es una réplica, ya que los verdaderos objetos de valor se "
"envían fuera del mundo. Sin embargo, es atractivo fingir que se está rodeado "
"de riquezas por un momento."

msgid "Shiarta"
msgstr "Shiarta"

msgid ""
"Where Oma is too hot, Shiarta is too cold for comfort. Still, the Empire is "
"always in need of raw materials, and Shiarta is rich in same. Mining is done "
"in a peculiar way with strong snow storms redepositing minerals on the "
"surface and large insulated mobile collectors scraping them off and bringing "
"them to delivery points."
msgstr ""
"Donde Oma es demasiado calurosa, Shiarta es demasiado fría para la "
"comodidad. Aun así, el Imperio siempre necesita materias primas, y Shiarta "
"es rica en ellas. La minería se realiza de una forma peculiar, con fuertes "
"tormentas de nieve que redepositan los minerales en la superficie y grandes "
"recolectores móviles aislados que los raspan y los llevan a los puntos de "
"entrega."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar sells only a select number of drinks. Like most mining "
"worlds, there is not much in the way of luxury to be found on Shiarta. There "
"is, however, one small piece of good news: ice cubes are free of charge."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial sólo vende un número selecto de bebidas. Como en "
"la mayoría de los mundos mineros, en Shiarta no hay mucho lujo. Sin embargo, "
"hay una pequeña buena noticia: los cubitos de hielo son gratuitos."

msgid "Shickhaw I"
msgstr "Shickhaw I"

msgid "Shickhaw II"
msgstr "Shickhaw II"

msgid "Shickhaw IV"
msgstr "Shickhaw IV"

msgid "Shikima II"
msgstr "Shikima II"

msgid "Shion"
msgstr "Shion"

msgid "Sidhe"
msgstr "Sidhe"

msgid "Silverstone"
msgstr "Piedra Plateada"

msgid ""
"Silverstone is one of the Soromid's greatest producers of ships and weapons. "
"Growing bioships is only useful if those ships can be equipped with guns, as "
"the local governor argues."
msgstr ""
"Piedraplateada es uno de los mayores productores de naves y armas Soromida. "
"Cultivar bionaves solo es útil si esas naves pueden equiparse con armas, "
"como argumenta el gobernador local."

msgid ""
"As Silverstone is a semi-military business world, the locals take security "
"seriously. All visitors to the spaceport bar must relinquish any weapons on "
"their persons, and submit to a scan upon entry."
msgstr ""
"Como Piedraplateada es un mundo de negocios semimilitar, los lugareños se "
"toman la seguridad muy en serio. Todos los visitantes del bar del puerto "
"espacial deben renunciar a cualquier arma que lleven encima y someterse a un "
"escáner al entrar."

msgid "Simoen"
msgstr "Simoen"

msgid ""
"Simoen is the only habitable planet in the Kraft system, just barely. Crops "
"don't grow well here and life is hardly luxurious, but there are reasons for "
"humans to live here all the same. Like many desert planets, Simoen has a lot "
"of space for solar power, which makes energy prices here very low. This "
"makes the world interesting for all kinds of manufacturing operations."
msgstr ""
"Simoen es el único planeta habitable del sistema Kraft, a duras penas. Los "
"cultivos no crecen bien aquí y la vida no es muy lujosa, pero de todos modos "
"hay razones para que los humanos vivan aquí. Como muchos planetas "
"desérticos, Simoen tiene mucho espacio para la energía solar, lo que hace "
"que los precios de la energía sean muy bajos. Esto hace que el mundo sea "
"interesante para todo tipo de operaciones de fabricación."

msgid ""
"This spaceport bar is fairly sandy and grubby. Not that it isn't being kept "
"clean, it's just one of those things you see on most G class worlds. "
"Fortunately all of the facilities here are in working order, and the drinks "
"available at the bar are decent enough, if a bit modest in selection."
msgstr ""
"Este bar del puerto espacial es bastante arenoso y mugriento. No es que no "
"se mantenga limpio, sino que es una de esas cosas que se ven en la mayoría "
"de los mundos de clase G. Afortunadamente, todas las instalaciones están en "
"funcionamiento y las bebidas disponibles en el bar son bastante decentes, "
"aunque la selección es un poco modesta."

msgid "Sinass"
msgstr "Sinass"

msgid ""
"Despite being a fairly typical civilian Sirius world where Sirii of all "
"echolons make their home, Sinass stands out for having some of the best "
"civilian academies. It is common for highly educated Sirii to make the "
"choice between a military career and study at the Socrates Academy "
"Monastery, or focus on civilian applications by studying at Sinass. "
"Additionally, Sinass provides most of the supplies needed by Sirius "
"Monastery, ensuring the stability of thy system."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de ser un mundo Sirio civil bastante típico, donde Sirii de todos "
"los escalafones hacen su hogar, Sinass destaca por tener algunas de las "
"mejores academias civiles. Es habitual que los Sirii con estudios superiores "
"elijan entre una carrera militar y estudiar en la Academia Monasterio de "
"Sócrates, o centrarse en aplicaciones civiles estudiando en Sinass. Además, "
"Sinass proporciona la mayoría de los suministros que necesita el Monasterio "
"Sirio, garantizando la estabilidad de su sistema."

msgid ""
"This bar is divided into three sections. One is blue, one is green and the "
"other is purple. It seems to have some significance, but nobody seems to "
"know exactly what it is. The locals get very upset when you're sitting in "
"the wrong section, though."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está dividido en tres secciones. Una es azul, otra verde y la otra "
"púrpura. Parece tener algún significado, pero nadie parece saber exactamente "
"cuál es. Sin embargo, los lugareños se molestan mucho cuando te sientas en "
"la sección equivocada."

msgid "Sinclair"
msgstr "Sinclair"

msgid ""
"Sinclair was named after one of the more renowned nobles in House Dvaered, "
"Godfried Sinclair. Like all Dvaered nobles he was a Warlord, and his "
"victories in battle as well as the manner in which he won them earned him "
"the respect in his House as well as the rest of the Empire. The planet that "
"came to bear his name was the last of his conquests, and ultimately became "
"his final resting place. The tomb is a popular destination for Dvaered "
"pilgrims."
msgstr ""
"Sinclair lleva el nombre de uno de los nobles más reconocidos de la Casa "
"Dvaered, Godfried Sinclair. Como todos los nobles Dvaered, era un señor de "
"la guerra, y sus victorias en la batalla, así como la forma en que las "
"obtuvo, le valieron el respeto de su Casa y del resto del Imperio. El "
"planeta que llegó a llevar su nombre fue la última de sus conquistas, y "
"finalmente se convirtió en su lugar de descanso final. La tumba es un "
"destino popular para los peregrinos Dvaered."

msgid ""
"Sinclair's spaceport bar is run by entrepreneurs, not warriors. But being "
"entrepreneurs, they recognize the value of catering to the locals and to "
"those that pass through, and so it is that this bar has a large holoportrait "
"of Godfried Sinclair hanging over the bar, and his family's weapon can be "
"seen on various decorative fixtures."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Sinclair está dirigido por empresarios, no por "
"guerreros. Pero al ser empresarios, reconocen el valor de atender a los "
"lugareños y a los que pasan por allí, y así es como este bar tiene un gran "
"holoretrato de Godfried Sinclair colgado sobre la barra, y el arma de su "
"familia puede verse en varios accesorios decorativos."

msgid ""
"From the outside, FLF station Sindbad looks like a piece of junk. This suits "
"the FLF, as their base isn't meant to stand out. The more travellers believe "
"that the station is just another carcass floating in space, the better. On "
"the inside however, Sindbad looks, well, it still looks like a piece of "
"junk. The FLF have limited resources, and the fact that they have a secret, "
"autonomous outpost at all must be considered an achievement. Still, Sindbad "
"is more than a token resistance. The base has all the facilities and "
"defensive capabilities that befit a structure its size, and while stealth "
"remains the FLF's best protection from their Dvaered oppressors, Sindbad can "
"defend itself if need be."
msgstr ""
"Desde el exterior, la estación FLF Sindbad parece un trozo de chatarra. Esto "
"le viene bien a la FLF, ya que su base no está pensada para destacar. Cuanto "
"más crean los viajeros que la estación no es más que otra carcasa flotando "
"en el espacio, mejor. Sin embargo, por dentro, Sindbad parece, bueno, sigue "
"pareciendo un trozo de chatarra. Los recursos de la FLF son limitados, y el "
"hecho de que tengan un puesto de avanzada secreto y autónomo debe "
"considerarse un logro. Aun así, Sindbad es más que una resistencia "
"simbólica. La base cuenta con todas las instalaciones y capacidades "
"defensivas que corresponden a una estructura de su tamaño, y aunque el "
"sigilo sigue siendo la mejor protección de la FLF frente a sus opresores "
"Dvaered, Sindbad puede defenderse por sí misma si es necesario."

msgid ""
"The FLF don't have much use for leisures, so it's debatable whether this "
"place can be called a bar. Still, it provides space to sit and talk, and it "
"serves a liquid that seems different from industrial acid, in that it "
"doesn't burn a hole through your stomach. The people here are mostly hard-"
"faced men, and the topics of conversation are limited to the Dvaered and the "
"FLF's cause."
msgstr ""
"Los FLF no tienen mucho uso de pasatiempos, así que es discutible si este "
"lugar puede llamarse bar. Aun así, ofrece un espacio para sentarse y hablar, "
"y sirve un líquido que parece diferente del ácido industrial, en el sentido "
"de que no te hace un agujero en el estómago. La gente aquí es en su mayoría "
"hombres de cara dura, y los temas de conversación se limitan a los Dvaered y "
"a la causa del FLF."

msgid "Sirius Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Sirio"

msgid ""
"Sirius Monastery is the primary military hub of the Sirius army. It serves "
"as the gatekeeper for Aesir, making sure no threats will ever reach Mutris. "
"The station has hundreds of hangars in all sizes, allowing a full contingent "
"to be stationed and ready at all times. Large meditation chambers also "
"ensure that the psychic powers of the military are always ready to be "
"deployed."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Sirio es el principal centro militar del ejército Sirio. Sirve "
"como guardián de Aesir, asegurándose de que ninguna amenaza llegue a Mutris. "
"La estación cuenta con cientos de hangares de todos los tamaños, lo que "
"permite tener un contingente completo y listo en todo momento.Las grandes "
"cámaras de meditación también garantizan que los poderes psíquicos de los "
"militares estén siempre listos para ser desplegados."

msgid "Sirius Ordnance"
msgstr "Ordenanza Sirio"

msgid ""
"As with most of the Sirius fleet, the equipment installed on the ships is "
"produced right here at Aesir. As a general rule, no finished ship leaves the "
"system without being fully equipped first."
msgstr ""
" Al igual que la mayor parte de la flota Sirio, el equipo instalado en las "
"naves se produce aquí mismo, en Aesir. Por regla general, ninguna nave "
"terminada sale del sistema sin haber sido equipada completamente antes."

msgid "Sirius Shipyards"
msgstr "Astilleros Sirio"

msgid ""
"Sirius Shipyards is where most of the Sirius fleet was built, though some of "
"the smaller support ships were constructed elsewhere.\n"
"Though Aesir is not an ideal location for mass producing warships, the Sirii "
"believe that building ships in proximity to Mutris will endow some small "
"portion of Sirichana's power on the ships produced."
msgstr ""
"En los astilleros Sirio se construyo la mayor parte de la flota Sirio, "
"aunque algunas de las naves de apoyo más pequeñas se construyen en otro "
"lugar. \n"
"Aunque Aesir no es un lugar ideal para la producción masiva de naves de "
"guerra, los Sirio creen que la construcción de naves en las proximidades de "
"Mutris dotará de una pequeña parte del poder de Sirichana a las naves "
"producidas."

msgid "Sirou Enclave"
msgstr "Enclave Sirou"

msgid ""
"Sirou Enclave is a bastion of Imperial control in this sector. Given Sirou's "
"proximity to the Imperial capital, it makes sense to have such a heavily "
"reinforced station so close. The station is relatively new, with modern "
"facilities all around following the latest of Imperial standardized design "
"patterns."
msgstr ""
"El Enclave Sirou es un bastión del control Imperial en este sector. Dada la "
"proximidad de Sirou a la capital imperial, tiene sentido tener una estación "
"reforzada tan cerca. La estación es relativamente nueva, con instalaciones "
"modernas por todas partes siguiendo los últimos patrones de diseño imperial "
"estandarizados."

msgid ""
"The bar still smells of disinfectant and industrial equipment. Massive, yet "
"quiet air scrubbers keep the air clean, no matter how much cigar smoke the "
"Imperial officers here can throw at it. It's a popular stopping point for "
"traders and Imperial soldiers alike."
msgstr ""
"El bar sigue oliendo a desinfectante y a equipo industrial. Los enormes y "
"silenciosos depuradores de aire mantienen el aire limpio, por mucho humo de "
"cigarro que lancen los oficiales Imperiales. Es un punto de parada popular "
"para comerciantes y soldados Imperiales por igual."

msgid "Sirou I"
msgstr "Sirou I"

msgid "Sirou II"
msgstr "Sirou II"

msgid "Sirou VI"
msgstr "Sirou VI"

msgid "Sixbat Station"
msgstr "Estación Sixbat"

msgid ""
"Sixbat Station is a marvel of technology. It's not so much a station as it "
"is a gigantic mass replicator, capable of replicating entire spaceships "
"given design blueprints and enough raw materials. The facility is of unknown "
"origin. Some believe it to be alien, but there is no proof of this. So far, "
"mankind has yet to design a ship too big for Sixbat to handle."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Sixbat es una maravilla de la tecnología. No es tanto una "
"estación como un gigantesco replicador masivo, capaz de replicar naves "
"espaciales enteras si se le dan planos de diseño y suficientes materias "
"primas. La instalación es de origen desconocido. Algunos creen que es "
"alienígena, pero no hay pruebas de ello. Hasta ahora, la humanidad no ha "
"diseñado una nave demasiado grande para que Sixbat no pueda manejarla."

msgid ""
"The bar is where customers come to enjoy a few drinks and pleasant "
"conversation while they select which ship they want and in what colour, and "
"then wait for it to finish replicating."
msgstr ""
"El bar es el lugar al que acuden los clientes para disfrutar de unas copas y "
"una agradable conversación mientras seleccionan qué nave quieren y de qué "
"color, y esperan a que termine de replicarse."

msgid "Skater"
msgstr "Skater"

msgid ""
"Originally, Skater was settled as a supply base for traffic between Feye and "
"the systems beyond. This was in a time when the Soromid were still expanding "
"into what is current day Soromid territory. Of course, the infrastructure "
"has developed considerably since then, and Skater is no longer needed as a "
"resupply base. But the colony is still there. The people who live here "
"consider this their home now."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente, Skater se asentó como base de abastecimiento para el tráfico "
"entre Feye y los sistemas de más allá. Esto ocurría en una época en la que "
"los Soromida todavía se estaban expandiendo hacia lo que es el actual "
"territorio Soromida. Por supuesto, la infraestructura se ha desarrollado "
"considerablemente desde entonces, y Skater ya no es necesaria como base de "
"reabastecimiento. Pero la colonia sigue ahí. La gente que vive aquí la "
"considera ahora su hogar."

msgid ""
"Skater was never of much interest to visitors, but it can be a surprisingly "
"good place to live. If you're a Soromid. The spaceport bar acts as a sort of "
"low-profile tourist centre, providing visitors with information about the "
"colony and its environment. The local authorities hope to attract more "
"people to the planet in order to grow the local economy."
msgstr ""
"Skater nunca fue de mucho interés para los visitantes, pero puede ser un "
"lugar sorprendentemente bueno para vivir, si eres un Soromida. El bar del "
"puerto espacial actúa como una especie de centro turístico de bajo perfil, "
"proporcionando a los visitantes información sobre la colonia y su entorno. "
"Las autoridades locales esperan atraer a más gente al planeta para hacer "
"crecer la economía local."

msgid "Skona"
msgstr "Skona"

msgid ""
"Originally possessing very little atmosphere to speak of, the Proteron "
"terraformed this planet into a respectable, though not altogether that "
"impressive planet. It is mainly engaged in the production of goods."
msgstr ""
"Este planeta, que originalmente tenía muy poca atmósfera, fue transformado "
"por los Proteron en un planeta respetable, aunque no tan impresionante. Se "
"dedica principalmente a la producción de bienes."

msgid ""
"The bar is decorated with various trinkets and artwork dedicated to Proteron "
"nationalism, with some of its drinks named after famous Proteron leaders."
msgstr ""
"El bar está decorado con diversas baratijas y obras de arte dedicadas al "
"nacionalismo Proteron, y algunas de sus bebidas llevan el nombre de famosos "
"líderes Proteron."

msgid "Sleuth II"
msgstr "Detective II"

msgid "Slofeldt Museum"
msgstr "Museo Slofeldt"

msgid ""
"Slofeldt Museum is a floating museum and memorial to the Incident. It "
"contains relics from Old Earth, as well as holos of Sol before the Incident "
"sterilized it. It is a monument to last and remind people of days gone by. A "
"place for quiet contemplation."
msgstr ""
"El Museo Slofeldt es un museo flotante y un memorial del Incidente. Contiene "
"reliquias de la Vieja Tierra, así como holos de Sol antes de que el "
"Incidente la esterilizara. Es un monumento para durar y recordar los días "
"pasados. Un lugar para la contemplación tranquila."

msgid ""
"The bar is more of a restaurant, with overpriced if tasty food and drinks "
"both alcoholic and otherwise. The beer is brewed on site, and has a "
"surprising kick to it."
msgstr ""
"El bar es más bien un restaurante, con comida y bebidas, tanto alcohólicas "
"como de otro tipo, excesivamente caras pero sabrosas. La cerveza se elabora "
"allí mismo y tiene un sabor sorprendente."

msgid "Smaal"
msgstr "Smaal"

msgid ""
"Smaal is right in Malebolge's sweet spot - the orbital distance that's ideal "
"for the development of life. The planet is covered with plant life and even "
"has a few indigenous species of insects. However, Smaal is a very small "
"world, and so the colony here is inhabited by Soromid who have adapted "
"themselves to the low gravity. These Soromid can't ever set foot on another "
"world - their bodies are no longer capable of withstanding higher gees."
msgstr ""
"Smaal se encuentra justo en el punto dulce de Malebolge: la distancia "
"orbital ideal para el desarrollo de la vida. El planeta está cubierto de "
"vida vegetal e incluso tiene algunas especies autóctonas de insectos. Sin "
"embargo, Smaal es un mundo muy pequeño, por lo que la colonia aquí está "
"habitada por Soromidas que se han adaptado a la baja gravedad. Estos "
"Soromidas no pueden pisar nunca otro mundo, ya que sus cuerpos no son "
"capaces de soportar una gravedad mayor."

msgid ""
"Smaal isn't very popular with traders. Life in space inevitably involves "
"periods of working outside the gravity controlled areas of the ship, and the "
"last thing a captain wants when coming to port is to have to deal with low "
"gravity."
msgstr ""
"Smaal no es muy popular entre los comerciantes. La vida en el espacio "
"implica inevitablemente períodos de trabajo fuera de las zonas de gravedad "
"controlada de la nave, y lo último que quiere un capitán al llegar a puerto "
"es tener que enfrentarse a la baja gravedad."

msgid "Smuggler's Den"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A haphazardly constructed station in the heart of the Empire, Smuggler's Den "
"provides respite to all those who want to avoid unwanted attention. Although "
"built in the centre of an asteroid field, collisions are rare, but not "
"entirely unheard of. The station does not seem to have any advanced early "
"warning systems which doesn't help you put your mind to rest. Statistically "
"you're more likely to get shot by an angry pirate or free trader at the "
"station than get impacted by a meteorite, so that is that.\n"
"\n"
"Rumour says that the station's existence is tolerated given that it has its "
"paperwork in order, however, it is somewhat a dubious claim as it does not "
"appear in any of the Imperial maps."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Half of the spaceport bar is located outside of the station, with food being "
"served on both sides of the airlock. Such an unorthodox setup allows, for "
"grabbing food on the go, or even when there is no free docking space for "
"ships. For an extra charge you can have a small atmospheric dome to preserve "
"the food from the harshness of direct space contact, however, the Blastin' "
"Burritos are designed to survive the vacuum of space without any changes in "
"flavour or texture, making them the staple food of the station."
msgstr ""

msgid "Socrates Academy Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Academia Socrates"

msgid ""
"The Socrates Academy Monastery is where the highest ranking military "
"officers in the Sirian fleet are trained. The facility is predominantly "
"populated by Serra echelon Sirii, with a minority of Fyrra echelon Sirii "
"mixed in. In this facility the students learn do command fleets, win "
"military engagements and represent the interests of House Sirius in "
"diplomatic negotiations."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Academia Sócrates es el lugar donde se forman los oficiales "
"militares de más alto rango de la flota Sirio. La instalación está poblada "
"predominantemente por Sirios del escalón Serra, con una minoría de Sirios "
"del escalón Fyrra mezclados. En estas instalaciones los estudiantes aprenden "
"a comandar flotas, a ganar compromisos militares y a representar los "
"intereses de la Casa Sirio en las negociaciones diplomáticas."

msgid ""
"Many students are seen studying here at the spaceport bar. Being accepted "
"here is a feat in itself, and only top-notch performance is accepted by the "
"teachers. Needless to say, most students have little time for social "
"pleasantries."
msgstr ""
"Muchos estudiantes son vistos estudiando aquí en el bar del puerto espacial. "
"Ser aceptado aquí es una hazaña en sí misma, y los profesores sólo aceptan "
"un rendimiento de primera categoría. Ni que decir tiene que la mayoría de "
"los estudiantes tienen poco tiempo para las cortesías sociales."

msgid "Sola"
msgstr "Sola"

msgid ""
"A low-profile and somewhat shabby ship parts manufacturing plant is present "
"on Sola. It provides tertiary ship modules such as heads, toilets and gym "
"equipment. The facility is chronically under-funded and its manufacturing "
"wings are in various states of disrepair, but somehow the plant always "
"manages to stay in operation."
msgstr ""
"En Sola hay una planta de fabricación de piezas de nave de bajo perfil y "
"algo cutre. Suministra módulos terciarios de la nave, como cabezales, aseos "
"y equipos de gimnasio. Las instalaciones están crónicamente infrafinanciadas "
"y sus alas de fabricación están en varios estados de deterioro, pero de "
"alguna manera la planta siempre se las arregla para seguir funcionando."

msgid ""
"A side room off the main bar features a small arena used for Fureng rat "
"fights. Technically such fights are banned across the known galaxy for being "
"cruel and barbaric, and animal rights organizations have tried to close the "
"Solan arena for decades now, but they are being stonewalled by the local "
"Dvaered administration."
msgstr ""
"En una sala lateral del bar principal hay una pequeña arena utilizada para "
"las peleas de ratas Fureng. Técnicamente, estas peleas están prohibidas en "
"toda la galaxia conocida por ser crueles y bárbaras, y las organizaciones de "
"defensa de los animales llevan décadas intentando cerrar la arena de Solan, "
"pero la administración local Dvaered les pone trabas."

msgid "Sollav II"
msgstr "Sollav II"

msgid "Sollav VI"
msgstr "Sollav VI"

msgid "Sollebor"
msgstr "Sollebor"

msgid ""
"Sollebor stands a long way from its primary, and thus is a cold planet. "
"Astronomers think that it was originally a gas giant, but it cooled so much "
"that it collapsed into a solid sphere. They think this because the icy "
"landscape is composed largely of frozen methane. The frozen methane provides "
"for a lucrative mining business."
msgstr ""
"Sollebor está muy alejado de su primario, por lo que es un planeta frío. Los "
"astrónomos creen que originalmente era un gigante gaseoso, pero que se "
"enfrió tanto que colapsó hasta convertirse en una esfera sólida. Creen que "
"esto se debe a que el paisaje helado está compuesto en gran parte por metano "
"congelado. El metano congelado proporciona un lucrativo negocio minero."

msgid ""
"Like most of the planet's habitation complex, the spaceport bar is "
"subterranean. It is well heated, so it doesn't really seem like you're on a "
"frozen ball of methane at all."
msgstr ""
"Como la mayor parte del complejo habitacional del planeta, el bar del puerto "
"espacial es subterráneo. Está bien calentado, así que no parece que estés en "
"una bola de metano congelada."

msgid "Solpere"
msgstr "Solpere"

msgid ""
"Solpere is a cold planet with a relatively small population. It only has "
"three seasons: spring, winter, and deep winter. However, there are perks to "
"such a harsh climate. The sky is quite frequently lit up by auroras, and for "
"those who can endure the cold the icy landscape is a magnificent sight to "
"behold."
msgstr ""
"Solpere es un planeta frío con una población relativamente pequeña. Sólo "
"tiene tres estaciones: primavera, invierno e invierno profundo. Sin embargo, "
"un clima tan duro tiene sus ventajas. El cielo se ilumina con frecuencia con "
"auroras, y para los que pueden soportar el frío, el paisaje helado es un "
"espectáculo magnífico."

msgid ""
"This is a fairly average bar. The service quality is decent enough and all "
"facilities are available. It's not a big place though, since Solpere isn't a "
"very frequently visited port."
msgstr ""
"Este es un bar relativamente normal. La calidad del servicio es bastante "
"decente y todas las instalaciones están disponibles. Sin embargo, no es un "
"lugar grande, ya que Solpere no es un puerto muy visitado."

msgid "Solvac Crops"
msgstr "Cultivos Solvac"

msgid ""
"Solvac Crops is an agricultural station. Its main purpose is to supply "
"nutrients to satisfy the demand for food on nearby planets. The crops here "
"are genetically modified by the Soromid, and are grown in zero-G conditions, "
"which allows for much more potent yields. Unfortunately, the produce is "
"often structurally unsound, collapsing under its own weight in even low-"
"gravity environments. This is why it us usually processed into liquid or "
"dried foods before being sent to the consumer market."
msgstr ""
"Cultivos Solvac es una estación agrícola. Su objetivo principal es "
"suministrar nutrientes para satisfacer la demanda de alimentos en los "
"planetas cercanos. Los cultivos aquí son modificados genéticamente por "
"Soromida, y se cultivan en condiciones de gravedad cero, lo que permite "
"obtener rendimientos mucho más potentes. Desgraciadamente, los productos son "
"a menudo estructuralmente inseguros, y se derrumban por su propio peso "
"incluso en entornos de baja gravedad. Por ello, se suelen procesar en "
"alimentos líquidos o secos antes de ser enviados al mercado de consumo."

msgid ""
"The entire station is zero-G, including the spacedock bar. This can be "
"inconvenient, but most spacers worth their salt know how to deal with it."
msgstr ""
"Toda la estación es de gravedad cero, incluida el bar del muelle espacial. "
"Esto puede ser un inconveniente, pero la mayoría de los espaciales que se "
"precien saben cómo lidiar con ello."

msgid "Sorom"
msgstr "Sorom"

msgid "Soromid Customs Central"
msgstr "Central de Aduanas Soromida"

msgid ""
"The Soromid and the rest of the galaxy have enjoyed a tense kind of "
"friendship ever since the first bioships launched from Sorom. The rest of "
"humanity is keenly interested in Soromid genetic treatments and the Soromid, "
"in turn, are happy to turn a profit on their expertise, but there's still "
"some degree of caution on both sides.\n"
"Soromid Customs Central is a visible sign of that caution. In addition to "
"inspecting the traffic that passes through Oberon, it also houses a full "
"division of Soromid ships responsible for maintaining the order in this "
"space."
msgstr ""
"Los Soromida y el resto de la galaxia han disfrutado de una tensa amistad "
"desde que se lanzaron las primeras naves biológicas desde Sorom. El resto de "
"la humanidad está muy interesada en los tratamientos genéticos Soromida y "
"los Soromida, a su vez, están encantados de sacar provecho de su "
"experiencia, pero sigue habiendo cierto grado de precaución por ambas "
"partes.\n"
"La Central de Aduanas Soromida es una muestra visible de esa cautela. Además "
"de inspeccionar el tráfico que pasa por Oberón, también alberga una división "
"completa de naves Soromida responsables de mantener el orden en este espacio."

msgid "Soromid Databank"
msgstr "Banco de Datos Soromida"

msgid ""
"The Soromid Databank is the primary Soromid data centre. All administration "
"about interplanetary policy as well as the records of the gene treatment "
"industry are managed here. This is why, although the Soromid Databank is not "
"a military base, it has been classified a restricted facility."
msgstr ""
"El Banco de Datos Soromida es el principal centro de datos Soromida. Aquí se "
"gestiona toda la administración sobre la política interplanetaria, así como "
"los registros de la industria de tratamiento genético. Por eso, aunque el "
"Banco de Datos Soromida no es una base militar, ha sido clasificado como "
"instalación restringida."

msgid ""
"Most visitors don't make it past the spacedock bar, not even ranking Soromid "
"personnel. The data centre is managed mostly by internal automated drones, "
"requiring manual maintenance only occasionally. Information requests are "
"taken at booths adjoining the spacedock bar, which are manned by secretive-"
"looking Soromid who never leave the station."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los visitantes no pasan del bar del muelle espacial, ni "
"siquiera el personal de rango Soromida. El centro de datos está gestionado "
"en su mayor parte por drones automatizados internos, que sólo requieren "
"mantenimiento manual ocasionalmente. Las solicitudes de información se "
"atienden en las cabinas contiguas al bar del muelle espacial, atendidas por "
"Soromida de aspecto reservado que nunca salen de la estación."

msgid "Soromid Wards Alpha"
msgstr "Pabellones Soromida Alfa"

msgid ""
"As everyone knows, the Soromid are exporters of genetic treatment services. "
"People from all over the galaxy travel to Soromid space to have their "
"natural abilities enhanced, diseases cured or appearances improved. All of "
"these people need to be treated somewhere, and this is one such place. "
"Soromid Wards Alpha is a massive medical facility, the largest of all the "
"Soromid Wards. Thousands of clients can be treated here at any one time. "
"Most of the station's volume is taken up by personal treatment tanks, where "
"clients spend anywhere from a 5 to 65 decaperiods in an artificial coma "
"while their genetic code is rewritten."
msgstr ""
"Como todo el mundo sabe, Soromida son exportadores de servicios de "
"tratamiento genético. Gente de toda la galaxia viaja al espacio Soromida "
"para mejorar sus habilidades naturales, curar enfermedades o mejorar su "
"apariencia. Todas estas personas necesitan ser tratadas en algún lugar, y "
"este es uno de esos lugares. El Pabellón Soromida Alfa es una enorme "
"instalación médica, la mayor de todos los Pabellones Soromida. Aquí se puede "
"tratar a miles de clientes a la vez. La mayor parte del volumen de la "
"estación la ocupan los tanques de tratamiento personal, donde los clientes "
"pasan entre 5 y 65 decaperiodos en coma artificial mientras se reescribe su "
"código genético."

msgid "Soromid Wards Beta"
msgstr "Pabellones Soromida Beta"

msgid ""
"While Soromid Wards Alpha in Shikima handles seven out of ten gene therapy "
"clients, it is ill equipped for some of the more invasive operations. "
"Soromid Wards Beta, on the other hand, has several facilities that make such "
"operations possible. Of course these advanced procedures come at a higher "
"cost, so the clients visiting Beta tend to be from the upper classes of "
"galactic society."
msgstr ""
"Mientras los Pabellones Soromida Alfa de Shikima atienden a siete de cada "
"diez clientes de terapia génica, estos están mal equipados para algunas de "
"las operaciones más invasivas. En cambio, los Pabellones Soromida Beta "
"disponen de varias instalaciones que hacen posible este tipo de operaciones. "
"Por supuesto, estos procedimientos avanzados tienen un coste más elevado, "
"por lo que los clientes que visitan Beta suelen pertenecer a las clases "
"altas de la sociedad galáctica."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar, which doubles as a waiting room for clients, provides its "
"visitors with information on the services that are rendered on Beta, such as "
"ocular augmentation, bone and muscle reinforcement, disease immunities and "
"reproductive facility expansion."
msgstr ""
"El bar del muelle espacial, que hace las veces de sala de espera para los "
"clientes, ofrece a sus visitantes información sobre los servicios que se "
"prestan en Beta, como el aumento ocular, el refuerzo óseo y muscular, la "
"inmunidad a las enfermedades y la instalación de ampliación reproductiva."

msgid "Soromid Wards Gamma"
msgstr "Pabellones Soromida Gamma"

msgid ""
"Soromid Wards Gamma can be considered a private facility. While Alpha and "
"Beta cater to the gene treatment needs of the rest of the galaxy, Gamma is "
"for Soromid only. The operations here are geared toward a higher tolerance "
"for modification that normal humans would likely not survive. The patients "
"here are usually colonists or working personnel who need to adapt themselves "
"to a particular climate."
msgstr ""
"Los pabellones Soromida Gamma pueden considerarse una instalación privada. "
"Mientras que Alfa y Beta atienden las necesidades de tratamiento genético "
"del resto de la galaxia, Gamma es sólo para Soromida. Las operaciones aquí "
"están orientadas a una mayor tolerancia a las modificaciones a las que los "
"humanos normales probablemente no sobrevivirían. Los pacientes aquí suelen "
"ser colonos o personal de trabajo que necesitan adaptarse a un clima "
"determinado."

msgid ""
"Unlike Alpha and Beta, the spacedock bar on Gamma does not offer much "
"information on what goes on in the facility. The Soromid learn about their "
"genes and the modifications in youth education. They know what they're "
"coming for."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de Alfa y Beta, el bar del muelle espacial de Gamma no ofrece "
"mucha información sobre lo que ocurre en la instalación. Los Soromida "
"aprenden sobre sus genes y las modificaciones en la educación primaria. "
"Saben a qué vienen."

msgid "Sorrow II"
msgstr "Lamento II"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Almost true to its name, Sorrow II is a sad planet designated a waste "
"disposal facility by the whims of a Sirii Arch-Canter. Although at one point "
"there was a small manned station here that allowed for refuelling, it has "
"long been abandoned. Now the planet is little more than a dump location for "
"toxic waste brought from throughout the House Sirius territories."
msgstr ""
"Casi fiel a su nombre, Lamento II es un triste planeta designado como "
"vertedero de la Casa Sirio por los caprichos de un Archicantor. Aunque en un "
"momento dado hubo una pequeña estación tripulada que permitía repostar. Hace "
"tiempo que está abandonada y se utiliza como vertedero de materiales tóxicos "
"traídos de todos los territorios de la Casa Sirio."

msgid "Spica"
msgstr "Spica"

msgid ""
"Spica is an old well-off colony that was established near the end of the "
"second growth. The many cities littered on the surface boast complex local "
"traditions and fierce rivalries with one and other. One slip up with "
"traditions can easily stir up problem with the locals, and the locals tend "
"to hold long grudges.\n"
"The planet itself is very arid, with large temperature swings during the "
"long days. The locals are used to living with the rhythm of the planet, only "
"going out when the temperature permits, and sticking to the specially "
"insulated installations when the temperature goes sour, just like the Spica "
"Blossom plants that use a similar technique to survive in the local "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Spica es una antigua colonia acomodada que se estableció cerca del final del "
"segundo crecimiento. Las numerosas ciudades repartidas por la superficie "
"cuentan con complejas tradiciones locales y feroces rivalidades entre sí. Un "
"desliz con las tradiciones puede suscitar fácilmente problemas con los "
"lugareños, y éstos tienden a guardar largos rencores.\n"
"El planeta en sí es muy árido, con grandes oscilaciones de temperatura "
"durante los largos días. Los lugareños están acostumbrados a vivir al ritmo "
"del planeta, sólo salen cuando la temperatura lo permite, y se aferran a las "
"instalaciones especialmente aisladas cuando la temperatura empeora, al igual "
"que las plantas de la Flor Spica, que utilizan una técnica similar para "
"sobrevivir en el entorno local."

msgid ""
"The bar boasts a diversity of local drinks with in-depth explanations of "
"their origins and histories. You would swear that a couple are the same "
"drink with different names, but you're pretty sure that if you point it out "
"you'll start a riot. The people seem friendly enough, but they all seem to "
"keep their distance with newcomers."
msgstr ""
"El bar presume de una diversidad de bebidas locales con explicaciones en "
"profundidad de sus orígenes e historias. Jurarías que un par de ellas son la "
"misma bebida con nombres diferentes, pero estás seguro de que si lo señalas "
"empezarás un motín. La gente parece bastante amable, pero todos parecen "
"mantener las distancias con los recién llegados."

msgid "Sroolu"
msgstr "Sroolu"

msgid ""
"Sroolu is the lone moon orbiting An'ku II. The colony here mostly concerns "
"itself with harvesting the resources that can be found in An'ku, refining "
"them for processing and even producing some low-level end products out of "
"them. The operation seems to be making profit, though it seems it is fated "
"to remain a minor player in the Sirian economy."
msgstr ""
"Sroolu es la única luna que orbita alrededor de An'ku II. La colonia se "
"dedica principalmente a la recolección de los recursos que se encuentran en "
"An'ku, refinándolos para su procesamiento e incluso produciendo algunos "
"productos finales de bajo nivel a partir de ellos. La operación parece ser "
"rentable, aunque parece que está destinada a seguir siendo un actor menor en "
"la economía Sirio."

msgid ""
"Sroolu is only a small colony, but its bar is huge, even by intergalactic "
"standards. It seems whoever built it intended for the entire workforce to "
"fit inside at once. Suffice to say only part of the bar's floor surface is "
"actually in use, the remaining space being screened off by mobile panels."
msgstr ""
"Sroolu es sólo una pequeña colonia, pero su bar es enorme, incluso para los "
"estándares intergalácticos. Parece que quien lo construyó pretendía que toda "
"la plantilla cupiera dentro a la vez. Basta con decir que sólo una parte de "
"la superficie del bar se utiliza realmente, ya que el espacio restante está "
"protegido por paneles móviles."

msgid "Stalwart Citadel"
msgstr "Ciudadela Incondicional"

msgid ""
"Since well-to-do Dvaereds have laid complete claim to Varia's surface, all "
"industrial and military enterprises have been moved offworld to Stalwart "
"Citadel. While two-thirds of the station's decks are in use by major Dvaered "
"corporations, there is enough space left for a respectable military wing. In "
"fact, Stalwart Citadel features as the base of most military operations in "
"the surrounding systems."
msgstr ""
"Desde que los acomodados Dvaereds han reclamado por completo la superficie "
"de Varia, todas las empresas industriales y militares se han trasladado "
"fuera del mundo a la Ciudadela Incondicional. Aunque dos tercios de las "
"cubiertas de la estación están en uso por las principales corporaciones "
"Dvaered, queda espacio suficiente para un ala militar respetable. De hecho, "
"la Ciudadela Incondicional es la base de la mayoría de las operaciones "
"militares en los sistemas circundantes."

msgid "Starlight End I"
msgstr "Fin de Luz Estelar I"

msgid "Starlight End II"
msgstr "Fin de Luz Estelar II"

msgid "Starlight End III"
msgstr "Fin de Luz Estelar III"

msgid "Stein"
msgstr "Stein"

msgid ""
"Probably the largest Za'lek presence left in the south of their space. A "
"moderately prosperous oceanic world with a diverse economy and several "
"prestigious universities. This world has resisted the entropy that has "
"gripped much of this region of Za'lek space."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente la mayor presencia Za'lek que queda en el sur de su espacio. "
"Un mundo oceánico moderadamente próspero con una economía diversa y varias "
"universidades prestigiosas. Este mundo ha resistido la entropía que se ha "
"apoderado de gran parte de esta región del espacio Za'lek."

msgid ""
"A ramshackle, rather cheerful place. It has several large aquariums showing "
"off the local marine life. Tables are placed with little rhyme or reason, "
"and the chatter of the patrons adds to the somewhat energetic feel."
msgstr ""
"Un lugar destartalado y bastante alegre. Tiene varios acuarios grandes que "
"muestran la vida marina local. Las mesas están colocadas sin ton ni son, y "
"el parloteo de los clientes contribuye a la energía de la atmósfera."

msgid "Steiner Station"
msgstr "Estación Steiner"

msgid ""
"Once a highly prosperous planet of the old Empire, Uhrabi-9 was tragically "
"struck by a large asteroid; the subsequently unstable volcanic activity "
"reduced the planet to a lifeless state.\n"
"Steiner was originally one of the satellites previously used by the people "
"of Uhrabi-9, but following the loss of the planet Steiner expanded large "
"enough to be classified as a station. It is now a popular tourist spot due "
"to its proximity to Uhrabi-9"
msgstr ""

msgid "Stella"
msgstr "Stella"

msgid ""
"As a resource for many common building materials, Stella is a busy yet "
"fairly squalid world. Planets like these crop up in most interplanetary "
"economies, a sad but inevitable phenomenon. Life here is rough and "
"unforgiving, and nobody comes here because they like to."
msgstr ""
"Como recurso para muchos materiales de construcción comunes, Stella es un "
"mundo ocupado pero bastante escuálido. Planetas como éste aparecen en la "
"mayoría de las economías interplanetarias, un fenómeno triste pero "
"inevitable. La vida aquí es dura e implacable, y nadie viene aquí porque le "
"guste."

msgid ""
"It's not much fun living on a world like Stella. Few people can stay "
"cheerful after living here for any appreciable amount of time. This "
"spaceport bar attempts to lift spirits with a plaque over the bar that reads "
"\"A better tomorrow for all\". It doesn't help any."
msgstr ""
"No es muy divertido vivir en un mundo como el de Stella. Pocas personas "
"pueden mantenerse alegres después de vivir aquí durante un tiempo "
"considerable. Este bar del puerto espacial intenta levantar el ánimo con una "
"placa sobre la barra que dice \"Un mañana mejor para todos\". Pero no ayuda "
"en nada."

msgid "Stelman I-3"
msgstr "Stelman I-3"

msgid "Sternguard"
msgstr "Sternguard"

msgid ""
"Though a fairly unobtrusive world filled with lower-middle class Dvaered "
"citizens, the Dvaered authorities nevertheless pay close attention to what "
"goes on on Sternguard. Close to the Sirian border, the world is a prime "
"candidate for conversion. At the moment the population seems to be stable, "
"but the Dvaered know better than to relax their guard."
msgstr ""
"Aunque es un mundo bastante discreto, lleno de ciudadanos de clase media "
"baja Dvaered, las autoridades Dvaered prestan mucha atención a lo que ocurre "
"en Sternguard. Cerca de la frontera con Sirio, el mundo es un candidato "
"ideal para la conversión. Por el momento, la población parece estable, pero "
"los Dvaered saben que no deben bajar la guardia."

msgid ""
"Grimy. Smelly. Dank. Drinks that taste of waste products. All in all, this "
"bar meets the galactic norm."
msgstr ""
"Mugriento. Apestoso. Húmedo. Bebidas que saben a productos de desecho. En "
"definitiva, este bar cumple con la normativa galáctica."

msgid "Stint III"
msgstr "Stint III"

msgid "Stormgard"
msgstr "Stormgard"

msgid ""
"Stormgard is, despite its harsh, icy environment, a heavily populated world. "
"This is because several elements of the emperor's family has made this world "
"their home, and inevitably that means that imperial bureaucrats, courtiers, "
"and general hangers-on are going to move here too. Industry is a popular "
"pastime here, with the valuable minerals hiding beneath the ice sheets."
msgstr ""
"Stormgard es, a pesar de su duro y gélido entorno, un mundo muy poblado. "
"Esto se debe a que varios elementos de la familia del emperador han hecho de "
"este mundo su hogar, e inevitablemente eso significa que los burócratas "
"imperiales, los cortesanos y los parásitos en general también se trasladarán "
"aquí. La industria es un pasatiempo popular aquí, con los valiosos minerales "
"que se esconden bajo las capas de hielo."

msgid ""
"This bar is warm and cozy despite the howling winds outside. Windows show "
"off the breathtaking view of the sunlight reflecting off the ice crystals."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es cálido y acogedor a pesar de los fuertes vientos del exterior. "
"Las ventanas muestran la impresionante vista de la luz del sol reflejada en "
"los cristales de hielo."

msgid "Stormy"
msgstr "Tormentoso"

msgid ""
"This gas giant serves as a resource gathering and advanced atmospheric "
"research node with stations dotting its orbit as low as is safe (and perhaps "
"a bit lower than that). The facilities here are frequently used in the "
"construction of advanced beam weaponry, allowing a larger-than-usual "
"presence of the Za'lek military."
msgstr ""
"Este gigante gaseoso sirve como nodo de recolección de recursos y de "
"investigación atmosférica avanzada, con estaciones que salpican su órbita "
"tan bajo como es seguro (y quizás un poco más bajo que eso). Las "
"instalaciones aquí se utilizan con frecuencia en la construcción de "
"armamento de rayo avanzado, lo que permite una presencia mayor de lo "
"habitual de los militares Za'lek."

msgid ""
"This bar is significantly neater than most Za'lek spaceport bars. That is "
"not to say it's orderly. The patrons are overwhelmingly gas miners, "
"manufacturers and a few militia. The drinks glow suspiciously and the "
"bartender smirks as you side-eye them."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es significativamente más ordenado que la mayoría de los bares de "
"los puertos espaciales Za'lek. Eso no quiere decir que sea ordenado. La "
"mayoría de los clientes son mineros de gas, fabricantes y algunos "
"milicianos. Las bebidas brillan de forma sospechosa y el camarero sonríe "
"cuando las mira de reojo."

msgid "Straight Row II"
msgstr "Fila Recta II"

msgid "Strangelove Lab"
msgstr "Laboratorio StrangeLove"

msgid ""
"The laboratory is concealed on an asteroid with all the infrastructure "
"located underground. Inside, a network of dusty tunnels connects the "
"different facilities, and put all together, the insides seem to be smaller "
"than that of a medium-sized ship. It is incredible that anyone could "
"survive, let alone live here."
msgstr ""
"El laboratorio está oculto en un asteroide y toda la infraestructura se "
"encuentra bajo tierra. En el interior, una red de túneles polvorientos "
"conecta las diferentes instalaciones y, en conjunto, el interior parece más "
"pequeño que el de una nave de tamaño medio. Es increíble que alguien pueda "
"sobrevivir, y mucho menos vivir aquí."

msgid ""
"The recreation room of the laboratory has piles of research equipment "
"gathering dust in the corners. There seems to be also poorly refrigerated "
"biological samples that you wouldn't be surprised if they moved. The only "
"recreational things you can find are a chessboard that is missing about a "
"dozen pieces and bottles of ethanol which you probably shouldn't be drinking."
msgstr ""
"La sala de descanso del laboratorio tiene montones de equipos de "
"investigación acumulando polvo en los rincones. Parece que también hay "
"muestras biológicas mal refrigeradas que no te sorprendería que se movieran. "
"Las únicas cosas recreativas que encuentras son un tablero de ajedrez al que "
"le faltan una docena de piezas y botellas de etanol que probablemente no "
"deberías beber."

msgid "Stutee"
msgstr "Stutee"

msgid ""
"Stutee is a former prison world of the Old Empire. Since it had a breathable "
"atmosphere and little else, it was deemed perfect for dropping off criminals "
"and then forgetting about them. However, as the lower class workers rebelled "
"against the Empire, resulting in the inception of House Dvaered, Stutee came "
"to fall under the jurisdiction of the new Great House. House Dvaered decided "
"to settle Stutee more permanently, bringing the former convicts under their "
"rule and setting them to work. Though Stutee is still of little material "
"value, its location one jump off Dvaer makes up for that."
msgstr ""
"Stutee es un antiguo mundoprisión del Viejo Imperio. Como tenía una "
"atmósfera respirable y poco más, se consideraba perfecto para dejar a los "
"criminales y luego olvidarse de ellos. Sin embargo, cuando los trabajadores "
"de clase baja se rebelaron contra el Imperio, dando lugar a la creación de "
"la Casa Dvaered, Stutee pasó a estar bajo la jurisdicción de la nueva Gran "
"Casa. La Casa Dvaered decidió asentarse en Stutee de forma más permanente, "
"poniendo a los antiguos convictos bajo su dominio y poniéndolos a trabajar. "
"Aunque Stutee sigue teniendo poco valor material, su ubicación a un salto de "
"Dvaer lo compensa."

msgid ""
"Stutee's bar is located right off the spaceport. Though the planet has been "
"settled and proper infrastructure is now present, the world is not very "
"appealing to any who visit. As such, the spaceport bar is arguably the most "
"important meeting place on the face of the moon."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Stutee está situado justo al lado del puerto espacial. Aunque el "
"planeta ha sido colonizado y cuenta con una infraestructura adecuada, el "
"mundo no es muy atractivo para quienes lo visitan. Por ello, el bar del "
"puerto espacial es, sin duda, el lugar de encuentro más importante sobre la "
"faz de la luna."

msgid "Sudra"
msgstr "Sudra"

msgid ""
"Located on the fringes of Dvaered-controlled territory, Sudra has a "
"relatively high amount of illegal activity going on. Though the Dvaered "
"authorities actively try to stamp out criminal elements and make arrests "
"almost every week, they are fighting a futile battle."
msgstr ""
"Situada en la periferia del territorio controlado por Dvaered, Sudra tiene "
"una cantidad relativamente alta de actividad ilegal. Aunque las autoridades "
"Dvaered intentan activamente acabar con los elementos criminales y realizan "
"detenciones casi todas las semanas, están librando una batalla fútil."

msgid ""
"This spaceport bar is unsavoury. No other word will describe the place with "
"the same accuracy. A good portion of the bar's clientele are wearing hoods, "
"masks, or other garments to hide their personal features. The lighting is "
"set to quite a dim level, allowing customers to find corners as dark as they "
"please. Despite these obvious signs, the Dvaered officials that sometimes "
"visit the bar don't seem very keen to investigate."
msgstr ""
"Este bar del puerto espacial es desagradable. Ninguna otra palabra "
"describiría el lugar con la misma precisión. Una buena parte de la clientela "
"del bar lleva capuchas, máscaras u otras prendas para ocultar sus rasgos "
"personales. La iluminación está ajustada a un nivel bastante tenue, lo que "
"permite a los clientes encontrar rincones tan oscuros como deseen. A pesar "
"de estos signos evidentes, los funcionarios Dvaered que a veces visitan el "
"bar no parecen muy dispuestos a investigar."

msgid "Suk II"
msgstr "Suk II"

msgid "Suk IV"
msgstr "Suk IV"

msgid "Sultan III"
msgstr "Sultan III"

msgid "Sultan VI"
msgstr "Sultan VI"

msgid "Suna I"
msgstr "Suna I"

msgid "Suna II"
msgstr "Suna II"

msgid "Suoer"
msgstr "Suoer"

msgid ""
"Though Suoer classifies as a moon, it is technically a sister planet to "
"Esker IV. Its superdense core gives it so much gravity that it significantly "
"affects its primary, so both planets orbit each other. Suoer's high gravity "
"also makes it a comfortable world to live on for humans. Suoer is well known "
"for its system of universities and research laboratories, many with a focus "
"on material science."
msgstr ""
"Aunque Suoer se clasifica como una luna, es técnicamente un planeta hermano "
"de Esker IV. Su núcleo superdenso le da tanta gravedad que afecta "
"significativamente a su primario, por lo que ambos planetas se orbitan "
"mutuamente. La alta gravedad de Suoer también hace que sea un mundo "
"agradable para la vida humana. Suoer es conocido por su sistema de "
"universidades y laboratorios de investigación, muchos de ellos centrados en "
"la ciencia de los materiales."

msgid "SY-1025"
msgstr "SY-1025"

msgid ""
"This is a standard Thurion shipyard manufactured to the exact same "
"specifications as every other Thurion shipyard. The station hums with "
"activity as ships are constructed at the station's maximum capacity."
msgstr ""
"Este es un astillero estándar Turion fabricado con las mismas "
"especificaciones que cualquier otro astillero Turion. La estación bulle de "
"actividad mientras se construyen naves a la máxima capacidad."

msgid "SY-1206"
msgstr "SY-1206"

msgid "SY-159"
msgstr "SY-159"

msgid "SY-19"
msgstr "SY-19"

msgid "SY-237"
msgstr "SY-237"

msgid "SY-256"
msgstr "SY-256"

msgid "SY-314"
msgstr "SY-314"

msgid "SY-413"
msgstr "SY-413"

msgid "SY-612"
msgstr "SY-612"

msgid "SY-894"
msgstr "SY-894"

msgid "SY-920"
msgstr "SY-920"

msgid "Sylph II"
msgstr "Sílfide II"

msgid "Sylph IV"
msgstr "Sílfide IV"

msgid "Sylph IVa"
msgstr "Sílfide IVa"

msgid "Symm II"
msgstr "Symm II"

msgid "Symm III"
msgstr "Symm III"

msgid "Symm IIIa"
msgstr "Symm IIIa"

msgid "Symm IIIb"
msgstr "Symm IIIb"

msgid ""
"Symm IIIb is a small moon covered in naturally forming crystalline "
"formations. Although the crystals are pretty to look at, they are mainly "
"formed from silicon and contain only trace amounts of more valuable "
"materials."
msgstr ""

msgid "Takeru"
msgstr "Takeru"

msgid ""
"The colony on Takeru was founded as part of an Imperial colonization "
"program. However, the government at the time deemed the colony to be a "
"failure, and refused to grant it Imperial status. Since then, the colonists "
"have governed themselves."
msgstr ""
"La colonia de Takeru se fundó como parte de un programa de colonización "
"Imperial. Sin embargo, el gobierno de la época consideró que la colonia era "
"un fracaso y se negó a concederle el estatus de Imperial. Desde entonces, "
"los colonos se autogobiernan."

msgid ""
"What is a spaceport bar? A miserable pile of drink, noise, data terminals, "
"and of course the occasional fight. Takeru's bar has all of these "
"components, which makes it a comfortable place to be for anyone with more "
"than a few light years under their belt."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué es un bar de puerto espacial? Un miserable montón de bebida, ruido, "
"terminales de datos y, por supuesto, alguna que otra pelea. El bar de Takeru "
"tiene todos estos componentes, lo que lo convierte en un lugar cómodo para "
"cualquier persona con más de unos cuantos años luz a sus espaldas."

msgid "Tandar I"
msgstr "Tandar I"

msgid "Tandar Ia"
msgstr "Tandar Ia"

msgid "Tandar IIX"
msgstr "Tandar IIX"

msgid "Tankard Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Cisterna"

msgid ""
"Tankard Cloister is a Sirius economical space facility. It processes a large "
"portion of all trade transactions made within An'ku, and also serves as a "
"terminal for the materials produced by Sroolu. There is also a small "
"security detail stationed here, but this is merely for the purpose of "
"customs, not so much the repulsion of hostile elements."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Cisterna es una instalación espacial económica de Sirio. Procesa "
"una gran parte de todas las transacciones comerciales realizadas dentro de "
"An'ku, y también sirve como terminal para los materiales producidos por "
"Sroolu. También hay un pequeño destacamento de seguridad estacionado aquí, "
"pero esto es meramente para el cometido de las aduanas, no tanto para la "
"repulsión de elementos hostiles."

msgid ""
"Serving both as a trading hub and an outlet of consumer end products, the "
"spacedock bar on Tankard Cloister is always a bustle of activity. In fact, "
"the actual bar seems more like a section of a larger commerce centre than "
"the other way around."
msgstr ""
"El bar del Claustro Cisterna, que sirve tanto de centro comercial como de "
"punto de venta de productos finales de consumo, es siempre un hervidero de "
"actividad. De hecho, el propio bar parece más una sección de un centro "
"comercial más grande que lo contrario."

msgid "Tanulwa"
msgstr "Tanulwa"

msgid ""
"The Soromid are often seen by the rest of the galaxy as non-humans, and "
"indeed they themselves tend to think of themselves as a different kind of "
"people as well. But in many ways the Soromid and the rest of humanity are "
"much alike. Crime, for example, exists in Soromid space just as much as "
"elsewhere. Tanulwa is a detention world where some of the worst Soromid "
"criminals are kept."
msgstr ""
"El resto de la galaxia suele considerar a los Soromida como no humanos, y de "
"hecho ellos mismos tienden a considerarse un tipo diferente de personas. "
"Pero en muchos aspectos los Soromida y el resto de la humanidad son muy "
"parecidos. El crimen, por ejemplo, existe en el espacio Soromida tanto como "
"en cualquier otro lugar. Tanulwa es un mundo de detención en el que se "
"encuentran algunos de los peores criminales Soromida."

msgid ""
"Less a bar and more a waiting area, this facility is used for the rare "
"occasions when visitors have reason to come to Tanulwa. Since Tanulwa "
"doesn't allow personal visits to prisoners and all logistics of personnel "
"and goods are handled strictly by the government, there's not much in the "
"way of civilian traffic to and from the planet."
msgstr ""
"Menos un bar y más una zona de espera, esta instalación se utiliza para las "
"raras ocasiones en que los visitantes tienen motivos para venir a Tanulwa. "
"Dado que Tanulwa no permite las visitas personales a los presos y que toda "
"la logística de personal y bienes es manejada estrictamente por el gobierno, "
"no hay mucho tráfico civil hacia y desde el planeta."

msgid "Tarrum"
msgstr "Tarrum"

msgid "Tarsus II"
msgstr "Tarso II"

msgid "Tartarus"
msgstr "Tartaro"

msgid ""
"Tartarus is a hard place to live, and for that reason the Imperial Hostile "
"Environment Training Centre is located here. Casualties are distressingly "
"high, but those that do come out whole are so much the better for it. After "
"all, it's hard to find a world worse than Tartarus."
msgstr ""
"Tártaro es un lugar duro para vivir, y por eso el Centro Imperial de "
"Entrenamiento en Entorno Hostil se encuentra aquí. El número de bajas es "
"alarmantemente alto, pero los que salen sanos son mucho mejores. Después de "
"todo, es difícil encontrar un mundo peor que el Tártaro."

msgid ""
"Trainers and students alike unwind here after a hard day's \"work\", doing "
"things that no reasonable human being would consider. That they seem so "
"relaxed about this is enough to chill anyone."
msgstr ""
"Tanto los entrenadores como los estudiantes se relajan aquí después de un "
"duro día de \"trabajo\", haciendo cosas que ningún ser humano razonable "
"consideraría. El hecho de que parezcan tan relajados al respecto es "
"suficiente para relajar a cualquiera."

msgid "Tau Ceti e"
msgstr "Tau Ceti e"

msgid ""
"Tau Ceti e was once a well-developed world in the Imperial Core, and one of "
"the most populated among human planets. Yet when the Incident came Tau Ceti "
"e took complete and irreversible damage to its ionosphere. Although the "
"effects were not immediate because of the distance from Sol, there was "
"nevertheless a breakdown of the entire atmosphere and a destabilization of "
"the planet's core.\n"
"The population of Tau Ceti e were forced to flee as its atmosphere became "
"less and less breathable and its tectonics became more violent, until it "
"eventually reached the desolate state you find it in. The planet is covered "
"in the ruins of many cities flooded and burned, but successive scavenging "
"expeditions have picked the planet clean of anything of value."
msgstr ""
"Tau Ceti e fue una vez un mundo bien desarrollado en el Núcleo Imperial, y "
"uno de los más poblados entre los planetas humanos. Sin embargo, cuando "
"llegó el Incidente, Tau Ceti e sufrió daños completos e irreversibles en su "
"ionosfera. Aunque los efectos no fueron inmediatos debido a la distancia a "
"Sol, se produjo una ruptura de toda la atmósfera y una desestabilización del "
"núcleo del planeta.\n"
"La población de Tau Ceti e se vio obligada a huir a medida que su atmósfera "
"se volvía cada vez menos respirable y su tectónica se volvía más violenta, "
"hasta que finalmente alcanzó el estado desolado en el que se encuentra. El "
"planeta está cubierto por las ruinas de muchas ciudades inundadas e "
"incendiadas, pero las sucesivas expediciones de carroñeros han despojado al "
"planeta de cualquier cosa de valor."

msgid "Tau Ceti f"
msgstr "Tau Ceti f"

msgid "Tau Ceti g"
msgstr "Tau Ceti g"

msgid "Tau Ceti h"
msgstr "Tau Ceti h"

msgid "Tau Ceti Station"
msgstr "Estación Tau Ceti"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Originally a state-of-the-art agricultural research centre, Tau Ceti Station "
"did not survive the Incident; the blast immediately punctured the station's "
"hull and destroyed its life support systems.\n"
"Tau Ceti Station quickly devolved into chaos, with multitudes of ships "
"attempting to evacuate its population. The station's docks, not meant to "
"deal with such heavy ship traffic, became jammed; ships began ramming into "
"each other in their attempts to flee. The result is a horrible, tumultuous "
"mass of ships mashed together with the station hull, looking almost like a "
"macabre statue to death. The fact that many parts have been cut open and "
"salvaged by scavengers makes it all the more of a twisted tragedy."
msgstr ""
"La estación Tau Ceti, originalmente un centro de investigación agrícola de "
"vanguardia, no sobrevivió al Incidente; la explosión perforó inmediatamente "
"el casco de la estación y destruyó sus sistemas de soporte vital.\n"
"La estación Tau Ceti se sumió rápidamente en el caos, con multitud de naves "
"intentando evacuar a su población. Los muelles de la estación, que no "
"estaban preparados para un tráfico de naves tan intenso, se atascaron y las "
"naves empezaron a chocar entre sí en su intento de huir. El resultado fue "
"una horrible y tumultuosa masa de naves aplastadas contra el casco de la "
"estación, que parece casi una macabra escultura de la muerte. El hecho de "
"que muchas partes hayan sido cortadas y rescatadas por los carroñeros lo "
"convierten en una tragedia aún más retorcida."

msgid "Tau Prime"
msgstr "Tau Prime"

msgid "Tau Secundus"
msgstr "Tau Secundus"

msgid "Tau Station"
msgstr "Estación Tau"

msgid ""
"Tau Station was constructed with the sole purpose of exploiting the algae "
"produced on Tau Prime. Being a completely oceanic world with a highly "
"corrosive atmosphere, it was deemed more profitable to build an orbiting "
"station, rather than a platform city on the surface. From the station "
"windows you can see heavy algae collectors flying to and from the surface on "
"their endless algae runs."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Tau se construyó con el único propósito de explotar las algas "
"producidas en Tau Prime. Al ser un mundo completamente oceánico con una "
"atmósfera altamente corrosiva, se consideró más rentable construir una "
"estación en órbita, en lugar de una ciudad de plataforma en la superficie. "
"Desde las ventanas de la estación se pueden ver pesados recolectores de "
"algas volando hacia y desde la superficie en sus interminables carreras de "
"algas."

msgid ""
"The Tau Prime algae has a powerful odour which pervades the bar. The air is "
"wreathed in the smell, such that you can taste it. It doesn't taste nearly "
"as good unprocessed. Most algae runners stop to grab drinks between runs to "
"try to get the taste of the algae out of their mouth, though the liquors the "
"bar serves happen to be made with processed algae."
msgstr ""
"Las algas de Tau Prime tienen un potente olor que impregna el bar. El aire "
"está envuelto en el olor, de tal manera que se puede saborear. No sabe tan "
"bien sin procesar. La mayoría de los corredores de algas se detienen a tomar "
"bebidas entre carrera y carrera para intentar quitarse el sabor de las algas "
"de la boca, aunque los licores que sirve el bar están hechos con algas "
"procesadas."

msgid "Taxumi I"
msgstr "Taxumi I"

msgid "Taxumi II"
msgstr "Taxumi II"

msgid "Taxumi III"
msgstr "Taxumi III"

msgid "Taxumi IIIa"
msgstr "Taxumi IIIa"

msgid ""
"Taxumi IIIa has undergone extensive bioforming through bioengineered-"
"accelerated evolution. However, unlike the tame fauna of most Soromid "
"civilian planets, the Soromid military have decided to incorporate it as "
"part of the recruits hand-to-hand training, and focused on evolving "
"extremely aggressive and dangerous life forms. It is not uncommon for "
"careless individuals to wander around the forests only to never be heard of "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Taxumi IIIa ha sido objeto de una amplia bioformación a través de la "
"evolución acelerada por bioingeniería. Sin embargo, a diferencia de la fauna "
"dócil de la mayoría de los planetas civiles Soromida, los militares Soromida "
"han decidido incorporarla como parte del entrenamiento cuerpo a cuerpo de "
"los reclutas, y se han centrado en la evolución de formas de vida "
"extremadamente agresivas y peligrosas. No es raro que individuos descuidados "
"deambulen por los bosques para no volver a saber de ellos."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar is decorated with holograms, pictures, and artwork depicting the "
"different lifeforms found on the planet. A large Cakkak head is displayed as "
"a centrepiece and it looks like the head only is well over a few tonnes of "
"mass. You wouldn't want to meet that out in the wild. The bartender seems to "
"specialize in unique drinks that are made with locally sourced ingredients, "
"mostly animal based. Despite the allure of such drinks, your curiosity is "
"not able to overcome names like Cakkak Brine Brew."
msgstr ""
"El bar está decorado con hologramas, imágenes y obras de arte que "
"representan las diferentes formas de vida que se encuentran en el planeta. "
"Una gran cabeza de Cakkak se exhibe como pieza central y parece que la "
"cabeza sólo tiene más de unas cuantas toneladas de masa. No te gustaría "
"encontrarte con eso en la naturaleza. El camarero parece estar especializado "
"en bebidas únicas elaboradas con ingredientes de origen local, en su mayoría "
"de origen animal. A pesar del atractivo de estas bebidas, tu curiosidad no "
"es capaz de superar nombres como Brebaje de Salmuera Cakkak."

msgid "Teapat"
msgstr ""

msgid "Teapit"
msgstr ""

msgid "Teapot"
msgstr ""

msgid "Telika II"
msgstr "Telika II"

msgid "Telika III"
msgstr "Telika III"

msgid "Tenal-P"
msgstr "Tenal-P"

msgid ""
"Tenal-P was once a prosperous trade station between the Empire and the "
"Soromid, surviving the initial blast simply because of Akodu' distance from "
"Sol. Since then, many residents have left the station, though a couple "
"hundred stubborn individuals have kept the station going."
msgstr ""
"Tenal-P fue en su día una próspera estación comercial entre el Imperio y "
"Soromida, sobreviviendo a la explosión inicial simplemente por la distancia "
"de Akodu a Sol. Desde entonces, muchos residentes han abandonado la "
"estación, aunque un par de centenares de individuos obstinados han mantenido "
"la estación en funcionamiento."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Tenebros"
msgstr "Deneb"

msgid ""
"A small frozen block of ice. The low temperatures and lack of rocky core "
"have kept Tenebros uninhabited since its discovery. Your sensors pick up "
"some wholly encased ships of fairly recent makes, potentially left behind by "
"people escaping the Incident, however, unless you want to burn excessive "
"amounts of fuel trying to reach the ships, it's likely nobody will ever find "
"out what happened."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Tenebros Station"
msgstr "Estación Steiner"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Abandoned Station"
msgstr "Estación Arandon"

msgid ""
"The station seems completely abandoned, with only mild traces of radiation "
"from the Incident. Whatever happened here, it seems like it happened before. "
"You wander around the haunted station for a while before you give up and "
"return for your ship."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tepdania Customs"
msgstr "Aduanas Tepdania"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Originally a small outpost, Tepdania Customs was refurnished into a customs "
"station to control the flux of refugees fleeing from the Incident. However, "
"its main purpose has been to dissuade refugees from coming into Dvaered "
"territories and push them towards specially designed worlds such as "
"Majestika II. Since its existence as a customs control, it has built up a "
"reputation as a aggressive and unsympathetic to refugees. Although once "
"sporting nearly a full Dvaered fleet, as the number of refugees have "
"dwindled, so have the resources and the station has vast areas that are more "
"or less abandoned."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente un pequeño puesto avanzado, Aduanas Tepdania fue reformada en "
"una estación aduanera para controlar el flujo de refugiados que huían del "
"Incidente. Sin embargo, su principal objetivo ha sido disuadir a los "
"refugiados de entrar en los territorios Dvaered y empujarlos hacia mundos "
"especialmente diseñados como Majestika II. Desde su existencia como control "
"aduanero, se ha forjado una reputación de agresivo y poco comprensivo con "
"los refugiados. Aunque en su día contó con una flota Dvaered casi al "
"completo, a medida que el número de refugiados ha ido disminuyendo, también "
"lo han hecho los recursos y la estación cuenta con vastas zonas más o menos "
"abandonadas."

msgid "Tepdania Prime"
msgstr "Tepdania Prime"

msgid ""
"Tepdania Prime was originally established by advances in technology allowed "
"by Project Za'lek, before it would become Great House Za'lek. The planet is "
"a J-class Gas Giant with an incredibly dense core formed of rare minerals "
"and resources surrounded by a dense acidic atmosphere. The spaceport and "
"only city of Tepdania Prime is located in a geostationary orbit inside the "
"atmosphere, and protects itself from the local environment by an adaptively "
"tuned shielding unit. The only entrance through the shielding unit is "
"located in the aft and precise manoeuvres are needed to get in and out. "
"Specialized drones are used to guide ships as a single mistake can easily "
"cause the entire ship to spiral into the core. Despite the precariousness of "
"the entire set-up, it is incredibly well-designed and has continued with "
"very little modification since its inception. Mining of the core is done by "
"special drones, and most of the work on the station is around the "
"maintenance of said drones. Given that much of the technology used is not "
"well understood and incompatible with modern approaches, there are no plans "
"to replace or refurbish the station, which, once it fails, will return "
"Tepdania Prime to its original uncolonized state."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The bar is located at the head of the station and undulates with the flow of "
"the atmosphere. Similar to the rest of the station, it relies heavily on "
"drones for serving drinks. Some look very ancient, nothing like the "
"extremely optimized drones you would see on Za'lek worlds. Almost all food "
"and drink is imported from other worlds given the space constraints limiting "
"the use of hydroponics."
msgstr ""
"El bar está situado en la cabecera de la estación y ondula con el flujo de "
"la atmósfera. Al igual que el resto de la estación, depende en gran medida "
"de drones para servir las bebidas. Algunos parecen muy antiguos, nada que "
"ver con los drones extremadamente optimizados que se ven en los mundos "
"Za'lek. Casi toda la comida y bebida se importa de otros mundos, dadas las "
"restricciones de espacio que limitan el uso de la hidroponía."

msgid "Tepvin Gamma"
msgstr "Tepvin Gamma"

msgid "Tepvin Lambda"
msgstr "Tepvin Lambda"

msgid "Tepvin's Point"
msgstr "Punto de Tepvin"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tepvin's Point is a small moon orbiting Tepvin Lambda. While having a fairly "
"low habitability ranking, it was nonetheless colonized as a minor Imperial "
"colony. Due to the scarcity of metals and resources on the planet, the local "
"industry focuses mainly on agriculture, however, low fertility and sub-"
"optimal lighting gives fairly meager yields, even when using the most "
"bountiful types of crops. Despite that, since there is nothing much better "
"to do, the locals persevere in the fields. Since the incident, many refugees "
"have also found their way, someway or other, to Tepvin's Point and it is "
"currently at its highest population ever."
msgstr ""
"El Punto Tepvin es una pequeña luna en órbita alrededor de Tepvin Lambda. "
"Aunque tiene un índice de habitabilidad bastante bajo, fue colonizada como "
"colonia Imperial menor. Debido a la escasez de metales y recursos en el "
"planeta, la industria local se centra principalmente en la agricultura, sin "
"embargo, la baja fertilidad y la iluminación subóptima dan rendimientos "
"bastante escasos, incluso cuando se utilizan los tipos de cultivos más "
"generosos. A pesar de ello, como no hay nada mejor que hacer, los lugareños "
"perseveran en los campos. Desde el Incidente, muchos refugiados también han "
"encontrado el camino, de un modo u otro, a Punto Tepvin y actualmente se "
"encuentra en su momento de mayor población."

msgid ""
"The bar is calm with more patrons than you would expect. It seems like the "
"low agricultural yields also imply not much work to do for the locals, and "
"many turn to drinking as their main hobby."
msgstr ""
"El bar está tranquilo, con más clientes de los que cabría esperar. Parece "
"que los bajos rendimientos agrícolas también implican que no hay mucho "
"trabajo que hacer para los lugareños, y muchos recurren a la bebida como "
"principal pasatiempo."

msgid "Terminus"
msgstr "Terminus"

msgid ""
"A small, volcanic world on the edge of the Uridhrion system, Terminus "
"provides Heronus with raw materials needed to grow new ships."
msgstr ""
"Terminus, un pequeño mundo volcánico situado en el borde del sistema "
"Uridhrion, proporciona a Heronus las materias primas necesarias para el "
"desarrollo de nuevas naves."

msgid ""
"Terminus's bar is permanently sooty because of the volcanic activity going "
"on all around outside. The facility does have air filters, but the stuff "
"always manages to get in anyway."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Terminus está permanentemente lleno de hollín debido a la "
"actividad volcánica que se desarrolla en el exterior. La instalación tiene "
"filtros de aire, pero la materia siempre se las arregla para entrar de todos "
"modos."

msgid "Tesla Station"
msgstr "Estación Tesla"

msgid ""
"Tesla Station is the centre of operations for the Xeric experimental weapons "
"testing site. Many high energy physics researchers flock over for the easier "
"chances of funding, and more importantly, the ability to perform high energy "
"physics experiments with little or no ethics committee oversight. The result "
"is that the base feels no real different from any large Za'lek research "
"centre or university."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Tesla es el centro de operaciones del centro de pruebas de armas "
"experimentales Xeric. Muchos investigadores de física de alta energía acuden "
"a ella por las mayores posibilidades de financiación y, lo que es más "
"importante, por la posibilidad de realizar experimentos de física de alta "
"energía con poca o ninguna supervisión del comité de ética. El resultado es "
"que la base no se diferencia realmente de cualquier gran centro de "
"investigación o universidad Za'lek."

msgid ""
"The bar is very lively, filled with physics researchers discussing the "
"results of the latest experiments and research directions. From how crowded "
"the bar is, you get the impression that most of the researchers rather "
"converse here than the cramped research rooms. The walls all being "
"whiteboards helps keep the atmosphere tense, more so than than holopanels. "
"There is a prominent sign behind the counter that says \"7 periods since the "
"last accident\" with a sticky note underneath that says \"thanks fred\"."
msgstr ""
"El bar está muy animado, lleno de investigadores de física que discuten los "
"resultados de los últimos experimentos y las direcciones de investigación. "
"Por lo abarrotado que está el bar, da la impresión de que la mayoría de los "
"investigadores prefieren conversar aquí que en las estrechas salas de "
"investigación. El hecho de que todas las paredes sean pizarras blancas ayuda "
"a mantener el ambiente tenso, más que los holopaneles. Detrás del mostrador "
"hay un cartel destacado que dice \"7 periodos desde el último accidente\" "
"con una nota adhesiva debajo que dice \"gracias Fred\"."

msgid "Thaddius Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal Thaddius"

msgid ""
"Ostensibly a 'research station' this rickety station is in fact a gambling "
"den and smuggling outpost for the criminal underbelly in Za'lek space. There "
"is a diverse array of goods available to the captain who is carefully "
"incurious about the origins. Scientists looking into illegal research (what "
"little there is in Za'lek space), 'private military contractors', 'free "
"traders', it's all here."
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente una \"estación de investigación\", esta desvencijada estación "
"es, de hecho, una guarida de juego y un puesto de contrabando para los bajos "
"fondos criminales del espacio Za'lek. Hay una gran variedad de productos a "
"disposición del capitán, que no muestre curiosidad en cuanto a su origen. "
"Científicos que investigan ilegalmente (lo poco que hay en el espacio "
"Za'lek), \"contratistas militares privados\", \"comerciantes libres\", todo "
"está aquí."

msgid ""
"This bar contains most of the flaws of both pirate and Za'lek "
"'sensibilities'. It is poorly laid-out, filthy, full of suspicious "
"characters, and overlooked by bouncers who seem somewhat overeager to find "
"troublemakers. At least the drinks are strong."
msgstr ""
"Este bar contiene la mayoría de los defectos de las \"sensibilidades\" tanto "
"de piratas como Za'lek. Está mal distribuido, sucio, lleno de personajes "
"sospechosos y vigilado por porteros que parecen un poco ansiosos por "
"encontrar a los problemáticos. Al menos las bebidas son fuertes."

msgid "Thar"
msgstr "Thar"

msgid ""
"Thar is a simple mining world owned by the Dvaered. It has a very variable "
"atmosphere that can rapidly alternate from several kilometres wide to barely "
"existent. The pressure changes are harmful to most lifeforms, making it an "
"almost completely sterile planet. With the advent of terraforming techniques "
"it was finally made habitable for humans so they could exploit some of its "
"many resources."
msgstr ""
"Thar es un simple mundo minero propiedad Dvaered. Tiene una atmósfera muy "
"variable que puede pasar rápidamente de varios kilómetros a apenas existir. "
"Los cambios de presión son perjudiciales para la mayoría de las formas de "
"vida, por lo que es un planeta casi completamente estéril. Con el "
"advenimiento de las técnicas de terraformación se hizo finalmente habitable "
"para los humanos, que pudieron explotar algunos de sus muchos recursos."

msgid ""
"The bar has a strange old meter on one of the walls that seems to dance "
"erratically. When you ask the bartender about it he mentions it measures the "
"current pressure outside."
msgstr ""

msgid "Thavma"
msgstr "Thavma"

msgid ""
"Thavma was an unexpected and welcome discovery for the Proteron, an "
"undiscovered lush planet perfect for agriculture. Not being ones to miss an "
"opportunity, the Proteron immediately set to work turning the planet into a "
"supplier of food and water."
msgstr ""
"Thavma fue un descubrimiento inesperado y bienvenido para los Proteron, un "
"planeta exuberante aún por descubrir, perfecto para la agricultura. Como no "
"querían perder una oportunidad, los Proteron se pusieron inmediatamente a "
"trabajar para convertir el planeta en un proveedor de alimentos y agua."

msgid ""
"A radio permanently installed in this bar constantly delivers important news "
"interspersed with Proteron propaganda. The locals seem used to it."
msgstr ""
"Una radio instalada permanentemente en este bar da constantemente noticias "
"importantes intercaladas con propaganda Proteron. Los lugareños parecen "
"estar acostumbrados."

msgid "The Crucible"
msgstr "El Crisol"

msgid ""
"The Crucible is a hive of scum and villainy. All sorts of illicit activities "
"go on here including gambling, drug dealing and money laundering. Though the "
"station is within Soromid controlled territory, the Pirates have an interest "
"in keeping the station online so they make sure the local Soromid forces "
"have more important things to worry about than shutting it down. The Soromid "
"also seem to play into this game, as they are interested in concentrating "
"the villainy, least it spread to nearby Soromid planets."
msgstr ""
"El Crisol es un hervidero de escoria y maldad. Aquí se llevan a cabo todo "
"tipo de actividades ilícitas, como el juego, el tráfico de drogas y el "
"blanqueo de dinero. Aunque la estación está dentro del territorio controlado "
"por Soromida, los Piratas tienen interés en mantener la estación en línea, "
"por lo que se aseguran de que las fuerzas locales de los Soromida tengan "
"cosas más importantes de las que preocuparse que de cerrarla. Los Soromida "
"también parecen entrar en este juego, ya que están interesados en concentrar "
"la delincuencia, para que no se extienda a los planetas Soromida cercanos."

msgid ""
"As you would expect, the bar is the heart of organizing all the illegal "
"deals going on. The constant movement of individuals and the constant "
"ambient noise makes it hard to keep an eye out on your surroundings, which "
"you feel is fairly important to getting out of here in one piece. Every so "
"often a deal goes wrong, ending in yelling, brawls, and sometimes worse "
"outcomes. However, no matter the commotion, the veterans and bartenders do "
"not seem to flinch, seems like this happens all the time."
msgstr ""
"Como es de esperar, el bar es el corazón de la organización de todos los "
"negocios ilegales que se llevan a cabo. El constante movimiento de "
"individuos y el constante ruido ambiental hace que sea difícil vigilar los "
"alrededores, lo que te parece bastante importante para salir de aquí de una "
"pieza. De vez en cuando, un trato sale mal y acaba con gritos, peleas y, a "
"veces, con resultados peores. Sin embargo, no importa la conmoción, los "
"veteranos y los camareros no parecen inmutarse, parece que esto ocurre "
"siempre."

msgid "The Frontier Council"
msgstr "El Consejo Frontera"

msgid ""
"This is the seat of the Frontier Council, the over-arching political body "
"representing the Frontier to the rest of the galaxy. While the Council does "
"not rule the Frontier worlds as such, it does set region-wide policies such "
"as trade taxes and constitutional standards."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la sede del Consejo Frontera, el órgano político supremo que "
"representa a Frontera ante el resto de la galaxia. Aunque el Consejo no "
"gobierna los mundos Frontera como tal, establece políticas regionales como "
"los impuestos comerciales y las normas constitucionales."

#, fuzzy
msgid "The Knot"
msgstr "El Final"

msgid ""
"Originally an ancient mining outpost, it was acquired by the Space Traders "
"Society shortly after the creation of House Za'lek, anticipating the future "
"of things to come from the area. Since then, it has been expanded and "
"rebuilt upon, all while remaining fully functional, giving it a labyrinth-"
"like and extremely complex layout, which has led to its current name: \"The "
"Knot\".\n"
"\n"
"Due to the distance from Sol, it has never been as prosperous in commerce as "
"the other Space Traders Society assets, and has been mainly taken over by "
"more engineering-focused guilds. Making use of House Za'lek developments, "
"the Knot has gotten a reputation for having the latest in cutting edge "
"technology."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Knot bar is located at the core of the station, where the original "
"hangars where. As the space station developed, the hangars lost direct "
"access to space, losing their original purpose, and eventually were "
"transformed into the lively atmosphere you find in front of you. Most of the "
"patrons are engineers, both Za'lek and Society alike, who engage in lively "
"conversations on extremely technical details over which they get easily "
"worked up over."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Pit"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Originally a large pit created by the spontaneous and unexpected landing of "
"a large ship, the Pit has grown through usage by Free Traders over time. The "
"depth of the impact provides cover from the harsh atmospheric winds, with "
"haphazard constructions slowly creeping out, to inevitably get ripped off "
"during strong seasonal storms, along with some of the more careless "
"inhabitants too. Even though there is technically life support, most people "
"wear light atmospheric suits with the front open just in case an emergency "
"hits. Can never be too careful when there are no building regulations to be "
"seen."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Due to the limited size of the crater, and the difficulties with digging "
"deeper into the planet mantle, space is a premium at the Pit. At the centre "
"of it all, and with a premium location, the Pit Pit bar is the place to be, "
"where the groans of the atmospheric shielding under the turbulent winds are "
"drowned out by the sound of drinking and bantering."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Stinker"
msgstr "El Apestoso"

msgid ""
"In an impressive act of combined planetary engineering and irresponsibility, "
"the Soromid have turned this backwater planet into a giant, globe-"
"encompassing landfill. Some people prefer to use the term \"worldfill\" to "
"describe it. Waste materials of all kinds are brought to this planet, "
"usually delivered by simple means of a re-entry orbit. There's also a "
"rudimentary spaceport on the surface in case something needs to be carried "
"down aboard a ship for some reason. Otherwise, there is no real reason why "
"anyone would want to land here."
msgstr ""
"En un impresionante acto de ingeniería planetaria e irresponsabilidad "
"combinadas, los Soromida han convertido este planeta atrasado en un "
"gigantesco vertedero que abarca todo el mundo. Algunos prefieren utilizar el "
"término \"vertedero mundial\" para describirlo. A este planeta llegan "
"materiales de desecho de todo tipo, normalmente entregados por el simple "
"medio de una órbita de reentrada. También hay un rudimentario puerto "
"espacial en la superficie por si hay que llevar algo a bordo de una nave por "
"alguna razón. Por lo demás, no hay ninguna razón real por la que alguien "
"quiera aterrizar aquí."

msgid "The Wringer"
msgstr "El Escurridor"

msgid ""
"The Wringer is actually called Ulysses Outpost, but apart from a few worn, "
"rusted name plates there is nothing that reminds the people onboard of that "
"name. Once an outlying scientific installation of the Old Empire, the "
"facility was abandoned as the funds needed to keep it running dried up under "
"ever increasing budget cuts following the end of the Empire's golden age.\n"
"Since then, the station has been claimed by petty criminals and loners, "
"people who are persona non grata in whatever region they come from, but are "
"unwilling or unable to turn pirate. Needless to say, the Wringer is not the "
"most pleasant of places, and few come here by choice. Even the Touched avoid "
"the Wringer, despite the fact that Suna is within Sirius borders."
msgstr ""
"El Escurridor se llama en realidad Puesto de Avanzada Ulises, pero aparte de "
"unas cuantas placas de identificación desgastadas y oxidadas no hay nada que "
"recuerde ese nombre a la gente de a bordo. En su día fue una instalación "
"científica periférica del Antiguo Imperio, pero fue abandonada cuando los "
"fondos necesarios para mantenerla en funcionamiento se agotaron debido a los "
"crecientes recortes presupuestarios tras el fin de la edad de oro del "
"Imperio. \n"
"Desde entonces, la estación ha sido reclamada por pequeños delincuentes y "
"solitarios, gente que es persona non grata en la región de la que proceden, "
"pero que no quieren o no pueden convertirse en piratas. No hace falta decir "
"que el Escurridor no es el lugar más agradable, y pocos vienen aquí por "
"elección. Incluso los Tocados evitan el Anillo, a pesar de que Suna está "
"dentro de las fronteras Sirio."

msgid ""
"The Wringer doesn't have a clear infrastructure, but most people agree that "
"this compartment counts as the spaceport bar. It distinguishes itself by "
"having slightly more drunks lying in the corners than the rest of the "
"station, thanks to the availability of booze at the fenced-off bar on one "
"side."
msgstr ""
"El Escurridor no tiene una infraestructura clara, pero la mayoría de la "
"gente está de acuerdo en que este compartimento cuenta como el bar del "
"puerto espacial. Se distingue por tener ligeramente más borrachos tirados en "
"las esquinas que el resto de la estación, gracias a la disponibilidad de "
"alcohol en el bar vallado de un lado."

msgid "Theras II"
msgstr "Theras II"

msgid "Theras III"
msgstr "Theras III"

msgid "Theras IV"
msgstr "Theras IV"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Theras IV was once considered for colonization, however, the increase of "
"animosity between the Frontier and House Dvaered led to it being declared an "
"unmanned waste disposal site. Although meant for usage by the Frontier, it "
"has seen an increase in usage by House Dvaered, whose ships do not always "
"pay the required processing fees."
msgstr ""
"Theras IV se consideró originalmente como una posibilidad de colonización. "
"Sin embargo, el aumento de la animosidad entre Frontera y Casa Dvaered ha "
"llevado a declararla vertedero de desechos sin tripulación. Aunque está "
"destinado a ser utilizado por la frontera, ha visto aumentar su uso por "
"parte de la Casa Dvaered, cuyas naves no siempre pagan las tasas de "
"tramitación necesarias."

msgid "Thosson"
msgstr "Thosson"

msgid ""
"Thosson is mostly a normal aquatic world, capitalizing on its abundant "
"supply of water. However, a small Soromid community on this world has taken "
"it upon itself to evolve into water-dwelling creatures through genetic "
"manipulation. So far they haven't had much success, and their position on "
"the planet is rather marginal. By and large, the Soromid believe in space "
"more than in oceans."
msgstr ""
"Thosson es un mundo acuático normal, que aprovecha su abundante suministro "
"de agua. Sin embargo, una pequeña comunidad de Soromida de este mundo se ha "
"propuesto evolucionar hacia criaturas acuáticas mediante la manipulación "
"genética. Hasta ahora no han tenido mucho éxito, y su posición en el planeta "
"es bastante marginal. En general, los Soromida creen más en el espacio que "
"en los océanos."

msgid ""
"The architect of this spaceport placed the designated area for the spaceport "
"bar a little too close to the landing platforms. From time to time, the "
"music in the bar is drowned out by the engines of an arriving or departing "
"space vessel."
msgstr ""
"El arquitecto de este puerto espacial colocó la zona destinada al bar del "
"puerto espacial un poco demasiado cerca de las plataformas de aterrizaje. De "
"vez en cuando, la música del bar se ve ahogada por los motores de una nave "
"espacial que llega o sale."

msgid "Three and a Half Kings"
msgstr "Tres Reyes y Medio"

msgid ""
"It's a nickname, of course. How could it not be? Trouble is, nobody "
"remembers where the name came from, and, bizarrely, there are no records of "
"the station's original name. It's quite a famous story, both within Hekaras "
"and elsewhere. Meanwhile, all involved simply call it Three and a Half "
"Kings. It seems to work for them. Despite the curious name, Three and a Half "
"Kings is a fairly unremarkable station, offering its services to ships that "
"pass by."
msgstr ""
"Es un apodo, por supuesto. ¿Cómo no iba a serlo? El problema es que nadie "
"recuerda de dónde vino el nombre y, extrañamente, no hay registros del "
"nombre original de la estación. Es una historia bastante famosa, tanto "
"dentro de Hekaras como en otros lugares. Mientras tanto, todos los "
"implicados la llaman simplemente Tres Reyes y Medio. Parece que les "
"funciona. A pesar del curioso nombre, Tres Reyes y Medio es una estación "
"bastante poco llamativa, que ofrece sus servicios a las naves que pasan por "
"allí."

msgid ""
"This is a typical station-side bar. It has viewports looking into space, "
"which are of course ignored by everyone, since anyone who comes to a station "
"like this has seen all the space they could possibly want to."
msgstr ""
"Este es el típico bar de la estación. Tiene miradores que miran al espacio, "
"que por supuesto son ignorados por todo el mundo, ya que cualquiera que "
"venga a una estación como esta ha visto todo el espacio que podría querer."

msgid "Thymo"
msgstr "Thymo"

msgid ""
"People sometimes joke that Soromid will live anywhere, like vermin. This is "
"not true. But a pilot looking at the colony on Thymo might well understand "
"why people say such things. The planet is uninteresting by all means, having "
"little in the way of natural resources and lacking an atmosphere entirely. "
"But the Soromid still live here, mainly because they can. Thymo counts as a "
"civilian world, albeit not a very rich one."
msgstr ""
"La gente a veces bromea diciendo que los Soromida viven en cualquier lugar, "
"como las alimañas. Esto no es cierto. Pero un piloto que observe la colonia "
"de Thymo podría entender por qué la gente dice esas cosas. El planeta no es "
"interesante en absoluto, ya que tiene pocos recursos naturales y carece por "
"completo de atmósfera. Pero los Soromida siguen viviendo aquí, "
"principalmente porque pueden hacerlo. Thymo es un mundo civil, aunque no muy "
"rico."

msgid ""
"Like everything on Thymo, the spaceport bar is sober, utilitarian, "
"efficient. Some pilots like it that way though, as the modest but content "
"clientele testifies."
msgstr ""
"Como todo en Thymo, el bar del puerto espacial es sobrio, utilitario y "
"eficiente. Pero a algunos pilotos les gusta así, como atestigua la modesta "
"pero contenta clientela."

msgid "Timu"
msgstr "Timu"

msgid ""
"With no axial tilt, Timu enjoys no seasons, only day and night. This has "
"made the cold, arctic landscape dull and featureless. The Dvaered "
"inhabitants don't really care, of course, as they're here to work, not to "
"enjoy the view."
msgstr ""
"Al no tener inclinación axial, Timu no tiene estaciones, sólo día y noche. "
"Esto ha hecho que el paisaje frío y ártico sea aburrido y sin rasgos "
"distintivos. A los habitantes Dvaered no les importa, por supuesto, ya que "
"están aquí para trabajar, no para disfrutar del paisaje."

msgid ""
"Run-down and sad, this bar has suffered from crass lack of upkeep over the "
"cycles. The walls are covered in graffiti, a sight uncommon even in Dvaered "
"bars."
msgstr ""
"Este bar, deteriorado y triste, ha sufrido una falta de mantenimiento "
"grosera a lo largo de los ciclos. Las paredes están cubiertas de grafitis, "
"algo poco común incluso en los bares Dvaered."

msgid "Tomas I-1"
msgstr "Tomas I-1"

msgid "Tomas J-1"
msgstr "Tomas J-1"

msgid "Tomas X-1"
msgstr "Tomas X-1"

msgid "Topkapi Station"
msgstr "Estación Topkapi"

msgid ""
"Topkapi is a trade hub and research post for the radiation-bombarded planet "
"of Anker. The Za'lek use the data gleaned from this research to create more "
"hostile-environment resistant habitats and shielding for vessels."
msgstr ""
"Topkapi es un centro de comercio y un puesto de investigación del planeta "
"Anker, bombardeado por la radiación. Los Za'lek utilizan los datos obtenidos "
"de esta investigación para crear hábitats más resistentes a entornos "
"hostiles y blindajes para naves."

msgid "Tora"
msgstr "Tora"

msgid ""
"Tora is a residential world for the Dvaered, and one of the largest "
"recruitment offices in Dvaered space is located here. The planet does not "
"have enough rare materials to justify turning it into a mining world, yet."
msgstr ""
"Tora es un mundo residencial Dvaered, y una de las mayores oficinas de "
"reclutamiento del espacio Dvaered se encuentra aquí. El planeta no tiene "
"suficientes materiales raros para justificar su conversión en un mundo "
"minero, todavía."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar has a large number of off-duty soldiers and workers. It is filthy "
"and the inhabitants smell horrendous. A typical bar."
msgstr ""
"En el bar hay un gran número de soldados y trabajadores fuera de servicio. "
"Está sucio y sus habitantes huelen fatal. Un bar típico."

msgid "Torg Crops"
msgstr "Cultivos Torg"

msgid ""
"Torg Crops is a crop-growing station constructed by the Dvaered to avert a "
"famine that threatened to erupt in the Torg and Doranthex systems some "
"cycles ago. It's currently running at about 80% of its potential output, but "
"since population figures have remained relatively stable recently it seems "
"that the station won't need to be expanded anytime soon."
msgstr ""
"Cultivos Torg es una estación de cultivo construida por los Dvaered para "
"evitar una hambruna que amenazaba con estallar en los sistemas Torg y "
"Doranthex hace algunos ciclos. Actualmente funciona al 80% de su producción "
"potencial, pero dado que las cifras de población se han mantenido "
"relativamente estables en los últimos tiempos, parece que la estación no "
"necesitará ser ampliada en breve."

msgid ""
"The spacedock bar here exclusively serves drinks that have been produced "
"from the plants that are grown on-station. This means that while the drinks "
"have all kinds of exotic colours, they all basically taste like cabbage."
msgstr ""
"El bar de la estación sirve exclusivamente bebidas producidas a partir de "
"las plantas que se cultivan en la estación. Esto significa que, aunque las "
"bebidas tienen todo tipo de colores exóticos, todas saben básicamente a col."

msgid "Torg I"
msgstr "Torg I"

msgid "Torg IV"
msgstr "Torg IV"

msgid "Tori"
msgstr "Tori"

msgid ""
"When the thirteenth colony ship, Yamato Nadeshiko, arrived at Tori, it was "
"sterile - in spite of the planet's abundant supply of both water and carbon. "
"But the colonists' introduction of Earth flora was successful beyond "
"expectations, and within a century the planet had acquired a fully "
"functional ecosystem; today much of the world's surface is covered by "
"nature, a state the inhabitants of Tori have maintained since.\n"
"Though Tori's economic potential remains largely untapped, the thriving "
"tourist industry largely compensates."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la decimotercera nave colonial, Yamato Nadeshiko, llegó a Tori, era "
"estéril, a pesar del abundante suministro de agua y carbono del planeta. Sin "
"embargo, la introducción de la flora terrestre por parte de los colonos "
"superó todas las expectativas y, al cabo de un siglo, el planeta había "
"adquirido un ecosistema plenamente funcional; en la actualidad, gran parte "
"de la superficie del mundo está cubierta por la naturaleza, un estado que "
"los habitantes de Tori han mantenido desde entonces.\n"
"Aunque el potencial económico de Tori sigue en gran medida sin explotar, la "
"próspera industria turística lo compensa con creces."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is more than just functional. Since most new arrivals on "
"the planet come here first, the authorities have taken pains to make the bar "
"appealing and comfortable. Of course, the fact that Tori is a tourist "
"attraction also means drinks are quite expensive in this bar…"
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es más que funcional. Dado que la mayoría de los "
"recién llegados al planeta son los primeros en llegar aquí, las autoridades "
"se han esforzado por hacer que el bar sea atractivo y cómodo. Por supuesto, "
"el hecho de que Tori sea una atracción turística también significa que las "
"bebidas son bastante caras en este bar…"

msgid "Torloth"
msgstr "Torloth"

msgid ""
"Torloth is a heavy mining planet. It has rich ores and minerals in abundance "
"with no local fauna to speak of. It's one of the strongholds of the Nexus "
"corporation, housing some of their important ship factories, though the "
"heavy gravity of the planet necessitates constructing larger ships off-"
"world. Torloth produces ships exclusively for delivery to Nexus depots and "
"endorsed shipyards."
msgstr ""
"Torloth es un planeta de minería pesada. Posee abundantes minerales y menas, "
"pero no hay fauna local. Es uno de los baluartes de la corporación Nexus, "
"que alberga algunas de sus importantes fábricas de naves, aunque la pesada "
"gravedad del planeta obliga a construir naves más grandes fuera del planeta. "
"Torloth produce naves exclusivamente para ser entregadas a los depósitos "
"Nexus y a los astilleros autorizados."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is carved from a rich mineral deposit lending the walls a "
"glimmering, reflective quality. The local brews often include minerals in "
"their production process, giving them a rich, somewhat saline taste."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial está tallado en un rico yacimiento mineral que "
"confiere a las paredes una calidad brillante y reflectante. Las cervezas "
"locales suelen incluir minerales en su proceso de producción, lo que les da "
"un sabor rico y algo salino."

msgid "Toros IV"
msgstr "Toros IV"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Toros IV once had a city that covered the entire planetary surface. Despite "
"being originally a frozen world covered in ice, the perseverance of the "
"people of Toros IV and the good location led to a quick expansion of "
"settlements and population. The Toros IV you find today has reverted back to "
"its more wild and natural frozen state with the complete destruction of the "
"entire city. It doesn't help that the planet seems to no longer be orbiting "
"the Toros Star nor that it seems to have arrived to a completely different "
"system…"
msgstr ""
"Toros IV llegó a tener una ciudad que cubría toda la superficie planetaria. "
"A pesar de ser originalmente un mundo helado cubierto de hielo, la "
"perseverancia de los habitantes de Toros IV y la buena ubicación propiciaron "
"una rápida expansión de los asentamientos y la población. El Toros IV que se "
"encuentra hoy en día ha vuelto a su estado helado más salvaje y natural con "
"la destrucción completa de toda la ciudad. No ayuda que el planeta parezca "
"no orbitar ya alrededor de la Estrella Toros ni que haya acabado llegando a "
"un sistema completamente distinto…"

msgid "Totoran"
msgstr "Totoran"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Welcome to Totoran, home of the galaxy's biggest and best fighting "
"tournament: The Crimson Gauntlet! With 34 major rankings and 17 deadly "
"arenas, there is always a fight to suit your tastes! Feel the adrenaline "
"rush as you watch the head-to-head duels, team melees, and deathmatches "
"careen to their violent finales! Sponsor a contestant, invest in their "
"equipment, see them obliterate their opponents and win a fortune! Snacks "
"available at all licenced outlets."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenidos a Totoran, hogar del mayor y mejor torneo de lucha de la "
"galaxia: ¡El Guantelete Carmesí! Con 34 clasificaciones principales y 17 "
"arenas mortales, ¡siempre hay un combate que se adapta a tus gustos! Siente "
"la adrenalina al ver cómo los duelos cara a cara, las melees por equipos y "
"los combates a muerte llegan a sus violentos finales. Patrocine a un "
"concursante, invierta en su equipo, véalo arrasar con sus oponentes y gane "
"una fortuna. Aperitivos disponibles en todos los puntos de venta autorizados."

msgid ""
"This bar is always full of people, some crowding around the many holovid "
"pillars to watch the fights in the tournament, others drinking their sorrows "
"away if their contestant was unlucky. The air is buzzing with excitement, "
"and it's hard to make oneself heard over the din. For this reason, orders "
"are placed through terminals projected onto the table surface, and drinks "
"are served from a small dispenser in the middle of the table. Obviously, "
"this establishment is making a lot of money."
msgstr ""
"Este bar está siempre lleno de gente, algunos agolpándose alrededor de las "
"numerosas columnas de holovideo para ver los combates del torneo, otros "
"bebiendo sus penas si su concursante no ha tenido suerte. El aire bulle de "
"excitación y es difícil hacerse oír por encima del estruendo. Por eso, los "
"pedidos se hacen a través de terminales proyectados en la superficie de la "
"mesa, y las bebidas se sirven desde un pequeño dispensador en el centro de "
"la mesa. Evidentemente, este establecimiento gana mucho dinero."

msgid "Traal"
msgstr "Traal"

msgid ""
"Traal is a pleasant civilian world. With stable tectonics and a favourable "
"climate on most of its land masses, the world makes for good living. It "
"comes as no surprise that the Dvaered eye it greedily, so close to their "
"borders, but so long as Inios Monastery guards Eye of Night, Dvaered High "
"Command can't claim Traal."
msgstr ""
"Traal es un mundo civil agradable. Con una tectónica estable y un clima "
"favorable en la mayoría de sus masas de tierra, el mundo permite vivir bien. "
"No es de extrañar que los Dvaered lo observen con avidez, tan cerca de sus "
"fronteras, pero mientras el Monasterio Inios vigile el Ojo de la Noche, el "
"Alto Mando Dvaered no puede reclamar Traal."

msgid ""
"Traal's spaceport bar is heavy on Sirian propaganda. With foreign "
"territories just a jump away, the Sirii feel the need to spread their "
"beliefs, even if only passively. Though House Sirius has stopped expanding "
"in recent cycles, the Traalians believe that Sirichana is merely taking a "
"pause to stabilize the existing Sirian worlds. Soon, they say, Fidelis will "
"be Sirius space."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Traal está lleno de propaganda Sirio. Con los "
"territorios extranjeros a un salto de distancia, los Sirio sienten la "
"necesidad de difundir sus creencias, aunque sea de forma pasiva. Aunque la "
"Casa Sirio ha dejado de expandirse en los últimos ciclos, los traalianos "
"creen que Sirichana sólo se está tomando una pausa para estabilizar los "
"mundos Sirio existentes. Pronto, dicen, Fidelis será espacio Sirio."

msgid "Treacle"
msgstr "Melaza"

msgid "Trevis Cloister"
msgstr "Claustro Trevis"

msgid ""
"Trevis Cloister is the local law enforcement base. It is fairly small and "
"only has a limited number of ships available, but given how quiet this "
"sector of space is most of the time it can deal with whatever incidents do "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Trevis es la base local de las fuerzas del orden. Es bastante "
"pequeña y sólo dispone de un número limitado de naves, pero dado lo "
"tranquilo que es este sector del espacio la mayor parte del tiempo, puede "
"ocuparse de cualquier incidente que se produzca."

msgid ""
"Trevis Cloister is one of those places where young military personnel are "
"stationed to get some field experience under their belt before being sent to "
"the more dangerous systems. Many of them will complain at each other in the "
"bar about how bored they are and how they hope to get a real position "
"sometime soon, but the more experienced soldiers know that few posts are as "
"enviable as the ones on Trevis."
msgstr ""
"El Claustro Trevis es uno de esos lugares donde se destina a los jóvenes "
"militares para que adquieran algo de experiencia sobre el terreno antes de "
"ser enviados a los sistemas más peligrosos. Muchos de ellos se quejan en el "
"bar de lo aburridos que están y de que esperan conseguir un puesto de verdad "
"algún día, pero los soldados más experimentados saben que pocos puestos son "
"tan envidiables como los de Trevis."

msgid "Triap I"
msgstr "Triap I"

msgid "Trichu"
msgstr "Trichu"

msgid ""
"Trichu is both the base for a mining operation that extracts hydrogen from "
"Adiadus IV and a manufacturing plant for low-level industrial goods. The "
"goods are mostly consumed by other worlds in this system, but a small "
"portion of it is exported abroad. Profit margins are minimal, but the "
"facility at least manages to keep from going under."
msgstr ""
"Trichu es a la vez la base de una operación minera que extrae hidrógeno de "
"Adiadus IV y una planta de fabricación de bienes industriales de bajo nivel. "
"Los productos se consumen principalmente en otros mundos del sistema, pero "
"una pequeña parte se exporta al extranjero. Los márgenes de beneficio son "
"mínimos, pero la instalación al menos se las arregla para no hundirse."

msgid ""
"By far, most patrons here are workers whose shifts have ended and whose "
"transport home hasn't arrived yet. The rest are traders who are here to pick "
"up goods."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los clientes son trabajadores que han terminado su turno y "
"cuyo transporte a casa aún no ha llegado. El resto son comerciantes que "
"vienen a recoger mercancías."

msgid "Trincea"
msgstr "Trincea"

msgid ""
"Trincea is one of the most heavily populated worlds in Dvaered space. As "
"such it is a rather attractive planet for Warlords to fight over, so the "
"laws of the planet are prone to frequent change. The citizens have grown "
"used to it, though, adapting to new legislation as a matter of course. By "
"Dvaered standards, they're exceptionally flexible in their thinking."
msgstr ""
"Trincea es uno de los mundos más poblados del espacio Dvaered. Como tal, es "
"un planeta bastante atractivo para que los Señores de la Guerra luchen por "
"él, por lo que las leyes del planeta son propensas a cambiar con frecuencia. "
"Sin embargo, los ciudadanos se han acostumbrado a ello y se adaptan a la "
"nueva legislación como algo natural. Para los estándares Dvaered, son "
"excepcionalmente flexibles en su forma de pensar."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is subject to the whims of the Warlords just like anything "
"else on the face of the planet, so it is best to check the local rules every "
"time you set your ship down on Trincea. Fortunately, having drinks and "
"checking the news have never been outlawed so far."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial está sujeto a los caprichos de los Señores de la "
"Guerra como cualquier otra cosa en la faz del planeta, así que es mejor "
"comprobar las normas locales cada vez que se posa la nave en Trincea. "
"Afortunadamente, hasta ahora no se han prohibido las bebidas y las noticias."

msgid "Trinel"
msgstr "Trinel"

msgid ""
"Trinel is a cold, empty mining world with a single colony upon it. Only the "
"bare minimum of Za'lek forces are here to maintain order. Most of the people "
"working the mines are criminals who are kept here for life. The main "
"spaceport is separated from the prison complex."
msgstr ""
"Trinel es un mundo minero frío y vacío con una sola colonia. Sólo el mínimo "
"de fuerzas Za'lek están aquí para mantener el orden. La mayoría de la gente "
"que trabaja en las minas son criminales que se quedan aquí de por vida. El "
"puerto espacial principal está separado del complejo penitenciario."

msgid "Triton Shipyard"
msgstr "Astilleros Triton"

msgid ""
"Triton Shipyard is a shipyard station that's owned by the Empire, but most "
"of its compartments have been leased by the Nexus corporation. The company "
"produces combat-capable ships here, and given the stability of the "
"neighbouring systems, there certainly is a market for them."
msgstr ""
"El Astillero Tritón es una estación astillera propiedad del Imperio, pero la "
"mayoría de sus compartimentos han sido alquilados por la corporación Nexus. "
"La empresa produce aquí naves con capacidad de combate y, dada la "
"estabilidad de los sistemas vecinos, no cabe duda de que existe un mercado "
"para ellas."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is a public facility onboard the station, and so the "
"Empire runs it. As such, the bar complies with galactic standards, something "
"that might not have been the case if Nexus had been in charge."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial es una instalación pública a bordo de la "
"estación, por lo que el Imperio lo gestiona. Como tal, el bar cumple con las "
"normas galácticas, algo que podría no haber ocurrido si Nexus hubiera estado "
"a cargo."

msgid "Tu'halar"
msgstr "Tu'halar"

msgid "Tulla"
msgstr "Tulla"

msgid ""
"Tulla is an utterly insignificant world. It is primarily the space "
"equivalent of a suburb, with a large residential population and basic "
"facilities to service them and allow them contact with the wider galaxy, but "
"as a whole the world is very boring."
msgstr ""
"Tulla es un mundo totalmente insignificante. Es principalmente el "
"equivalente espacial de un suburbio, con una gran población residencial e "
"instalaciones básicas para darles servicio y permitirles el contacto con la "
"galaxia más amplia, pero en su conjunto el mundo es muy aburrido."

msgid ""
"This bar is standard in almost all respects, though the food is respectable."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es estándar en casi todos los aspectos, aunque la comida es "
"respetable."

msgid "Tummalin"
msgstr "Tummalin"

msgid ""
"Tummalin is the base of operations of a small mining company. Its primary, "
"Longbow III, is rich in various unusual substances. However, the planet "
"itself is far too unstable to permit a permanent presence, so all mining "
"operations are carried out with mobile harvester ships. It's dangerous work, "
"but as long as there's a market there will always be someone willing to do "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Tummalin es la base de operaciones de una pequeña empresa minera. Su "
"principal fuente, Arcolargo III, es rica en diversas sustancias inusuales. "
"Sin embargo, el planeta en sí es demasiado inestable para permitir una "
"presencia permanente, por lo que todas las operaciones mineras se llevan a "
"cabo con naves recolectoras móviles. Es un trabajo peligroso, pero mientras "
"haya mercado siempre habrá alguien dispuesto a hacerlo."

msgid ""
"The bar has a window that looks out over the main docks for the harvester "
"ships that the miners use to collect resources from the planet below. The "
"ships are ugly and battered, but they are always kept in prime working "
"condition. A malfunction on the surface of Longbow III can quickly lead to "
"the deaths of all crew."
msgstr ""
"El bar tiene una ventana que da a los muelles principales de las naves "
"cosechadoras que los mineros utilizan para recoger recursos del planeta. Las "
"naves son feas y maltratadas, pero siempre se mantienen en óptimas "
"condiciones de funcionamiento. Una avería en la superficie de Arcolargo III "
"puede provocar rápidamente la muerte de toda la tripulación."

msgid "Tumut"
msgstr "Tumut"

msgid ""
"Tumut is a young volcanic world that the Za'lek have taken some interest in "
"as a massive geological study. Moreover, it is the primary location of "
"several rare mineral mines that are hard to find in other parts of the "
"inhabited galaxy. However, these mines are strictly small-scale, and the "
"geological study takes large precedent."
msgstr ""
"Tumut es un mundo volcánico joven por el que los Za'lek han mostrado cierto "
"interés como estudio geológico masivo. Además, es la ubicación principal de "
"varias minas de minerales raros que son difíciles de encontrar en otras "
"partes de la galaxia habitada. Sin embargo, estas minas son estrictamente a "
"pequeña escala, y el estudio geológico tiene gran precedencia."

msgid "Tuomi's Orb"
msgstr "Orbe de Tuomi"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tuomi's Orb was a bustling heavily-colonized planet before the Incident. "
"What's left of it is no longer recognizable and nearly all traces of past "
"human settlements have evaporated. All that's left is a burnt Nebula-infused "
"sphere."
msgstr ""
"El Orbe de Tuomi fue un planeta bullicioso y fuertemente colonizado antes "
"del Incidente. Lo que queda de él ya no es reconocible y casi todos los "
"rastros de asentamientos humanos pasados se han evaporado. Todo lo que queda "
"es una esfera calcinada infundida por la Nebulosa."

msgid "Turawee"
msgstr "Turawee"

msgid ""
"There is literally a world of difference between Thymo and Turawee. Unlike "
"its barren cousin, Turawee is a lush, comfortable world that was never "
"charted even during the Third Growth. The Soromid, having few natural M-"
"class planets at their disposal, take good care of this world. While most "
"other factions would struggle with the trade-off between prosperity and "
"ecology, the Soromid have managed to strike a perfect balance. Turawee may "
"be the only inhabited planet in the galaxy whose environment has not been "
"significantly altered in any way by its occupants."
msgstr ""
"Hay literalmente un mundo de diferencia entre Thymo y Turawee. A diferencia "
"de su estéril primo, Turawee es un mundo exuberante y confortable que nunca "
"fue cartografiado ni siquiera durante el Tercer Crecimiento. Los Soromida, "
"al disponer de pocos planetas naturales de clase M, cuidan bien este mundo. "
"Mientras que la mayoría de las demás facciones tendrían que luchar con el "
"equilibrio entre la prosperidad y la ecología, los Soromida han conseguido "
"alcanzar un equilibrio perfecto. Puede que Turawee sea el único planeta "
"habitado de la galaxia cuyo entorno no ha sido alterado de forma "
"significativa por sus ocupantes."

msgid ""
"The Soromid are very protective of Turawee. Offworlders are allowed to land, "
"but they have to abide by strict local rules. No smoking is allowed in this "
"bar, nor can any unauthorized goods or substances be brought inside."
msgstr ""
"Los Soromida son muy protectores con Turawee. Los extranjeros pueden "
"aterrizar, pero tienen que respetar las estrictas normas locales. No se "
"permite fumar en este bar, ni introducir mercancías o sustancias no "
"autorizadas en su interior."

msgid "Turnpike Station"
msgstr "Estación Peaje"

msgid ""
"Turnpike Station is a semi-privatised commerce facility. It is located on "
"one of the major junctions in Empire space, making it a welcome opportunity "
"for traders to barter with one another. The station also offers private "
"storage and ship moorings for pilots who travel through this region of space "
"a lot."
msgstr ""
"La Estación Peaje es una instalación comercial semiprivatizada. Está situada "
"en uno de los principales cruces del espacio del Imperio, por lo que es una "
"buena oportunidad para que los comerciantes realicen trueques entre ellos. "
"La estación también ofrece almacenamiento privado y amarres de naves para "
"los pilotos que viajan mucho por esta región del espacio."

msgid ""
"The bar is bustling with traders making money and, in some cases, losing it. "
"The gears of the free market grind heaviest on stations like these and "
"sometimes someone gets crushed between them."
msgstr ""
"El bar bulle de comerciantes que ganan dinero y, en algunos casos, lo "
"pierden. Los engranajes del mercado libre son los más pesados en estaciones "
"como ésta y, a veces, alguien queda aplastado entre ellos."

msgid "Tuur"
msgstr "Tuur"

msgid "UHP-1001"
msgstr "UHP-1001"

msgid "UHP-1002"
msgstr "UHP-1002"

msgid "Uhriabi-17"
msgstr "Uhriabi-17"

msgid "Uhriabi-9"
msgstr "Uhriabi-9"

msgid "Ulios"
msgstr "Ulios"

msgid ""
"Ulios is a backwater independent world. Though a province of the Old Empire "
"before the Incident, the planet has recently declared its independence and "
"is now governed by a small political elite headed by Baron Dovai "
"Sauterfeldt. As the Empire is all but impotent in this region of space and "
"the world is too remote and isolated to be of much interest to the Dvaered, "
"Ulios' independence stands."
msgstr ""
"Ulios es un mundo independiente y atrasado. Aunque era una provincia del "
"Viejo Imperio antes del Incidente, el planeta ha declarado recientemente su "
"independencia y ahora está gobernado por una pequeña élite política "
"encabezada por el barón Dovai Sauterfeldt. Como el Imperio es casi impotente "
"en esta región del espacio y el mundo está demasiado alejado y aislado para "
"ser de mucho interés para los Dvaered, la independencia de Ulios se mantiene."

msgid ""
"Despite the relatively accommodating interior, Ulios' spaceport bar doesn't "
"get too many customers. Traders do visit the world, but as there is little "
"profit to be made the ships are few and far between. The captains often "
"choose to conduct their business and move on rather than stay and kick back "
"for a few periods."
msgstr ""
"A pesar del interior relativamente acogedor, el bar del puerto espacial de "
"Ulios no recibe demasiados clientes. Los comerciantes sí visitan el mundo, "
"pero como hay pocos beneficios, las naves son escasas. Los capitanes suelen "
"optar por llevar a cabo sus negocios y seguir adelante en lugar de quedarse "
"a descansar durante algunos períodos."

msgid "Ullnorn"
msgstr "Ullnorn"

msgid ""
"Ullnorn isn't actually a habitable planet, and there is no good reason why "
"humans should make their home here. The fact that they do can be traced back "
"to a Dvaered in-house conflict between two minor Warlords, who each claimed "
"dominion over Ginger and everything in it. With both sides unwilling to back "
"down, it came down to whoever held a permanent presence in the system. Thus, "
"the colony on Ullnorn was established. Today, it is populated by Dvaered "
"citizens unwilling to live there, but too stubborn to leave, lest their "
"rivals claim victory in the age-old dispute."
msgstr ""
"Ullnorn no es en realidad un planeta habitable, y no hay ninguna buena razón "
"por la que los humanos deban establecer su hogar aquí. El hecho de que lo "
"hagan se remonta a un conflicto interno Dvaered entre dos Señores de la "
"Guerra menores, que reclamaban cada uno el dominio sobre Jengibre y todo lo "
"que había en él. Como ambas partes no estaban dispuestas a dar marcha atrás, "
"todo se redujo a quien tuviera una presencia permanente en el sistema. Así "
"se estableció la colonia de Ullnorn. En la actualidad, está poblada por "
"ciudadanos Dvaered que no quieren vivir allí, pero que son demasiado "
"testarudos para marcharse, no sea que sus rivales reclamen la victoria en la "
"antigua disputa."

msgid ""
"This is a bar. It has to be, because you usually don't have to pay for muddy "
"rainwater. It doesn't seem this place is frequented by its patrons for the "
"purpose of entertainment, because there are no recreational facilities, not "
"even a jukebox. The few appointments are welded to the floor, and everything "
"else is either made out of steel or has steel bars covering it. Clearly, "
"this is a place where fists meet faces. Maybe you shouldn't stay here too "
"long…"
msgstr ""
"Esto es un bar. Tiene que serlo, porque normalmente no hay que pagar por el "
"agua de lluvia. No parece que este lugar sea frecuentado por sus clientes "
"con el propósito de entretenerse, porque no hay instalaciones recreativas, "
"ni siquiera una gramola. Las pocas citas están soldadas al suelo, y todo lo "
"demás es de acero o tiene barras de acero que lo cubren. Claramente, este es "
"un lugar donde los puños se encuentran con las caras. Tal vez no deberías "
"quedarte aquí demasiado tiempo…"

msgid "Ulysses III"
msgstr "Ulises III"

msgid "Ulysses IV"
msgstr "Ulises IV"

msgid "Umbrella Clinic"
msgstr "Clínica Paraguas"

msgid ""
"Umbrella Clinic is a space-based clinic. It's common for most worlds to take "
"care of their own health facilities as it is cheaper and faster than lifting "
"patients off-planet, but sometimes medical stations like Umbrella have their "
"uses. Umbrella is primarily a research clinic where unknown ailments are "
"studied in perfect quarantine, in order to develop a cure. Without places "
"such as this, public health would be under constant threat across the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"La Clínica Umbrella es una clínica basada en el espacio. Es habitual que la "
"mayoría de los mundos se ocupen de sus propias instalaciones sanitarias, ya "
"que es más barato y rápido que llevar a los pacientes fuera del planeta, "
"pero a veces las estaciones médicas como Umbrella tienen su utilidad. "
"Umbrella es principalmente una clínica de investigación donde se estudian "
"dolencias desconocidas en perfecta cuarentena, con el fin de desarrollar una "
"cura. Sin lugares como éste, la salud pública estaría constantemente "
"amenazada en toda la galaxia."

msgid ""
"Though Umbrella Clinic doesn't have a spacedock bar in the classical sense, "
"it does have a large waiting area equipped with news and recreational "
"facilities. The patrons here aren't patients though, as patients tend to be "
"kept in quarantine. Rather, they are here to visit family or friends, or to "
"do business with the station itself."
msgstr ""
"Aunque la Clínica Umbrella no tiene un bar espacial en el sentido clásico, "
"sí tiene una gran sala de espera equipada con noticias e instalaciones "
"recreativas. Sin embargo, los clientes no son pacientes, ya que éstos suelen "
"estar en cuarentena. Más bien están aquí para visitar a familiares o amigos, "
"o para hacer negocios con la propia estación."

msgid "Ummula"
msgstr "Ummula"

msgid ""
"Ummula is a wealthy residential planet. Its proximity to the Sirian core and "
"the presence of a prestigious military academy in the system have given it "
"all the economic exposure it could want. On the flip side, taxes on Ummula "
"are among the highest in Sirius space, so the population is mostly comprised "
"of working class citizens."
msgstr ""
"Ummula es un planeta residencial rico. Su proximidad al núcleo Sirio y la "
"presencia de una prestigiosa academia militar en el sistema le han dado toda "
"la exposición económica que podría desear. Por otro lado, los impuestos en "
"Ummula son de los más altos del espacio Sirio, por lo que la población está "
"compuesta principalmente por ciudadanos de clase trabajadora."

msgid ""
"Many spaceport bars play music, but few spaceport bars allow their customers "
"control over it. This one does. A central platform contains a control "
"interface that patrons can use to request specific pieces of music to play "
"in the bar. This being Ummula, customers have to pay a fee to access the "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"Muchos bares de puertos espaciales ponen música, pero pocos permiten a sus "
"clientes controlarla. Éste lo hace. Una plataforma central contiene una "
"interfaz de control que los clientes pueden utilizar para solicitar que se "
"reproduzcan determinadas piezas musicales en el bar. Al ser Ummula, los "
"clientes tienen que pagar una cuota para acceder a los controles."

msgid "UMW-1231d"
msgstr "UMW-1231d"

msgid "UMW-1345a"
msgstr "UMW-1345a"

msgid "Undergate II"
msgstr "Bajopuerta II"

msgid "Undergate III"
msgstr "Bajopuerta III"

msgid "Undergate V"
msgstr "Bajopuerto V"

msgid "Unicorn I"
msgstr "Unicornio I"

msgid "Unicorn II"
msgstr "Unicornio II"

msgid ""
"Although there are rare marks of ships visiting the surface, Unicorn II "
"remains largely pristine. With an eccentric orbit, the conditions on the "
"planetary surface vary drastically depending on the time in the local cycle. "
"Your ship's scanner can pick up an extensive cave system under the surface."
msgstr ""

msgid "Unicorp Orbital"
msgstr "Orbital Unicorp"

msgid ""
"Acting as the focal point of the Unicorp corporation, 70% of all company "
"employees are located at Unicorp Orbital. Although the station does not have "
"the full fabrication facilities necessary for producing all the Unicorp "
"products, it has a small workshop mainly focused with collaborating with the "
"research department located at the same station. Once you leave the "
"spaceport you are greeted with the company motto \"Quality for All\" and a "
"frenzy of employees going to and fro. Quite a lively station."
msgstr ""
"Actuando como centro neurálgico de la corporación Unicorp, el 70% de todos "
"los empleados de la empresa se encuentran en el Orbital Unicorp. Aunque la "
"estación no dispone de las instalaciones de fabricación necesarias para "
"producir todos los productos de Unicorp, cuenta con un pequeño taller "
"centrado fundamentalmente en la colaboración con el departamento de "
"investigación ubicado en la misma estación. Al salir del puerto espacial te "
"recibe el lema de la empresa \"Calidad para Todos\" y un frenesí de "
"empleados que van de aquí para allá. Una estación bastante bulliciosa."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Unicorp Mess Hall serves as a meeting point for all employees and "
"visitors regardless of status. It is a self-service style with automated "
"food dispensers to minimize waits and latency, which seems to be quite "
"useful with the amount of employees constantly visiting the bar. Not very "
"elegant, but very functional."
msgstr ""
"El Comedor de Unicorp sirve de punto de encuentro para todos los empleados y "
"visitantes, independientemente de su estatus. Es de estilo autoservicio, con "
"dispensadores automáticos de comida para minimizar las esperas y la "
"latencia, lo que parece bastante útil con la cantidad de empleados que lo "
"visitan constantemente. No es muy elegante, pero sí muy funcional."

msgid "Unseelie"
msgstr "Unseelie"

msgid "Urail"
msgstr "Urail"

msgid ""
"Urail is a halfway decently habitable planet. Its proximity to Mutris makes "
"it a very popular place to live for Sirii, which has driven the price of "
"real estate to almost ridiculous heights. Many Sirii believe that living on "
"Urail gives them a better chance of meeting a Touched, or even being called "
"to Crater City themselves. There is no indication that this is indeed the "
"case, however."
msgstr ""
"Urail es un planeta medianamente habitable. Su proximidad a Mutris lo "
"convierte en un lugar muy popular para vivir para los Sirio, lo que ha hecho "
"que el precio de los inmuebles alcance cotas casi ridículas. Muchos Sirio "
"creen que vivir en Urail les da más posibilidades de conocer a un Tocado, o "
"incluso de ser llamados ellos mismos a Ciudad Cráter. Sin embargo, no hay "
"indicios de que esto sea así."

msgid ""
"Every spaceport needs a spaceport bar. That is probably the only reason why "
"Urail has one, since the population would much prefer to use the space so "
"build housing for upper echelon Sirii. Nevertheless, the bar is comfortable "
"enough, despite the pricey drinks."
msgstr ""
"Todo puerto espacial necesita un bar espacial. Esa es probablemente la única "
"razón por la que Urail tiene uno, ya que la población preferiría utilizar el "
"espacio para construir viviendas para los Sirio de alto nivel. No obstante, "
"el bar es lo suficientemente cómodo, a pesar de lo caro de las bebidas."

msgid "Urbanus Crops"
msgstr "Cultivos Urbanos"

msgid ""
"Urbanus Crops is one of House Dvaered's crop growing complexes. Though the "
"idea was largely 'borrowed' from the Empire's INSS series, the efficiency of "
"the actual installation is somewhat lower, because of the Dvaered's inferior "
"technological background. Urbanus Crops gets the job done, though, and in "
"fact most of Trincea's food is grown here."
msgstr ""
"Cultivos Urbanos es uno de los complejos de cultivo de la Casa Dvaered. "
"Aunque la idea fue tomada en gran medida de la serie EENI del Imperio, la "
"eficiencia de la instalación real es algo menor, debido a la inferioridad "
"tecnológica Dvaered. Sin embargo, Cultivos Urbanos cumple con su cometido y, "
"de hecho, la mayor parte de los alimentos de Trincea se cultivan aquí."

msgid ""
"If you didn't know better, you'd think you were on a Dvaered military base, "
"from the look of the bar. It's utterly utilitarian, though in the owner's "
"defence an attempt has been made at fitting in with the station's purpose, "
"testament the withered plant on the corner of the bar."
msgstr ""
"Si no lo supieras, pensarías que estás en una base militar Dvaered, por el "
"aspecto del bar. Es totalmente utilitario, aunque en defensa del propietario "
"se ha hecho un intento de encajar con el propósito de la estación, como "
"demuestra la planta marchita en la esquina del bar."

msgid "Urbanus II"
msgstr "Urbano II"

msgid "Urbanus III"
msgstr "Urbano III"

msgid "Uridhrion I"
msgstr "Uridhrion I"

msgid "Uridhrion II"
msgstr "Uridhrion II"

msgid "Uridhrion III"
msgstr "Uridhrion III"

msgid "Ururis"
msgstr "Ururis"

msgid ""
"Ururis is a relatively wealthy Sirian world. It lies on several major trade "
"routes, which brings in quite a bit of revenue. Cashing in on the amount of "
"visitors it gets, the local government often stages entertainment events "
"designed to make the maximum amount of profit possible."
msgstr ""
"Ururis es un mundo Sirio relativamente rico. Se encuentra en varias rutas "
"comerciales importantes, lo que aporta bastantes ingresos. Aprovechando la "
"cantidad de visitantes que recibe, el gobierno local suele organizar eventos "
"de entretenimiento diseñados para obtener el máximo beneficio posible."

msgid "Utsuwa"
msgstr "Utsuwa"

msgid ""
"Many people who live in the Empire think of the Dvaered as unsophisticated, "
"brawny louts who spend all day down in the mines and all night picking "
"fights with each other. This is a stereotype, and it's hardly a fair "
"description of Dvaered society as a whole, but it happens to be absolutely "
"accurate when it comes to the Dvaereds on Utsuwa. The colony on this planet "
"is a full-time mining operation, and all who live on Utsuwa work in the "
"mining industry or its peripherals. Needless to say, House Dvaered gets a "
"significant amount of its raw resources from here."
msgstr ""
"Mucha gente que vive en el Imperio piensa que los Dvaered son patanes poco "
"sofisticados y musculosos que se pasan todo el día en las minas y toda la "
"noche peleándose entre ellos. Esto es un estereotipo, y no es una "
"descripción justa de la sociedad Dvaered en su conjunto, pero resulta ser "
"absolutamente exacta cuando se trata de los Dvaered de Utsuwa. La colonia de "
"este planeta es una operación minera a tiempo completo, y todos los que "
"viven en Utsuwa trabajan en la industria minera o en sus periféricos. No "
"hace falta decir que la Casa Dvaered obtiene una cantidad significativa de "
"sus recursos en bruto de aquí."

msgid ""
"This bar is a miner's bar, alpha and omega. Virtually all its patrons are "
"miners, and they do what miners do, which is drink, fight, and talk about "
"miner things. Fortunately, the owner of the bar is considerate to outside "
"visitors, so in addition to Miner's Ale, Miner's Vodka, Miner's Whiskey and "
"Bloody Miners you can also order a light beer, which has a little wooden "
"miner's pickaxe in it."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es un bar de mineros, alfa y omega. Prácticamente todos sus "
"clientes son mineros, y hacen lo que hacen los mineros, que es beber, pelear "
"y hablar de cosas de mineros. Afortunadamente, el dueño del bar es "
"considerado con los visitantes de fuera, así que además de Cerveza de "
"Minero, Vodka de Minero, Whisky de Minero y Bloody Miners también puedes "
"pedir una cerveza ligera, que tiene un pequeño pico de minero de madera."

msgid "Uuries"
msgstr "Uuries"

msgid "UX I"
msgstr "UX I"

msgid "UX IIX"
msgstr "UX IIX"

msgid "UX VII"
msgstr "UX VII"

msgid "Vaal"
msgstr "Vaal"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This mysterious, stormy world has a rich amount of minerals and noble gasses "
"in its atmosphere but seems devoid of life. It seems that a Za'lek survey "
"once investigated this world, explaining the small landing pad, but no other "
"sign of their presence, or indeed any human presence, is here at all. The "
"sound of the wind and distant thunder are your only companions."
msgstr ""
"Este misterioso y tormentoso mundo tiene una gran cantidad de minerales y "
"gases nobles en su atmósfera, pero parece carecer de vida. Parece que un "
"estudio de Za'lek investigó una vez este mundo, lo que explica la pequeña "
"plataforma de aterrizaje, pero no hay ninguna otra señal de su presencia, o "
"de hecho de cualquier presencia humana, aquí en absoluto. Sólo el sonido del "
"viento y los truenos lejanos son su única compañía."

msgid "Valerie II"
msgstr "Valerie II"

msgid "Valerie IIX"
msgstr "Valerie IIX"

msgid "Valerie IV"
msgstr "Valerie IV"

msgid "Valt"
msgstr "Valt"

msgid ""
"Valt is recent home to a Dvaered mining colony. An utterly inhospitable "
"world, the extremely thin atmosphere makes the surface highly dangerous due "
"to its perpetual bombardment by asteroids and solar radiation. The colony is "
"situated nearly a kilometre below the planet's surface, in an immense, "
"resource-rich cavern."
msgstr ""
"Valt es el hogar reciente de una colonia minera Dvaered. Se trata de un "
"mundo totalmente inhóspito, con una atmósfera extremadamente delgada que "
"hace que la superficie sea muy peligrosa debido al perpetuo bombardeo de "
"asteroides y a la radiación solar. La colonia está situada a casi un "
"kilómetro bajo la superficie del planeta, en una inmensa caverna rica en "
"recursos."

msgid ""
"The Valt spaceport bar is nothing special. It's rather clean for a Dvaered "
"bar, though that may speak more about the small size of the settlement than "
"the pride the proprietor takes in keeping his establishment clean."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Valt no es nada especial. Está bastante limpio "
"para ser un bar Dvaered, aunque eso puede hablar más del pequeño tamaño del "
"asentamiento que del orgullo que siente el propietario por mantener limpio "
"su establecimiento."

msgid "Valur Gem I"
msgstr "Gema Valur I"

msgid "Vanir I"
msgstr "Vanir I"

msgid "Vanir Ia"
msgstr "Vanir Ia"

msgid "Vanir II"
msgstr "Vanir II"

msgid "Vao Vos"
msgstr "Vao Vos"

msgid ""
"The Ulysses system is fairly close to the Sirian core, and the Sirian core "
"always needs more energy. Vao Vos is a hot planet that orbits its sun rather "
"closely, which makes it a suitable place to generate lots of power and "
"package it up into high-efficiency power cells.\n"
"Given the inhospitality of the planet, the few who live at Vao Vos are all "
"concentrated in a single heavily-insulated dome. With the spaceport built-"
"in, everything is within a short walking distance."
msgstr ""
"El sistema Ulises está bastante cerca del núcleo Sirio, y éste siempre "
"necesita más energía. Vao Vos es un planeta caliente que orbita bastante "
"cerca de su sol, lo que lo convierte en un lugar adecuado para generar mucha "
"energía y empaquetarla en células energéticas de alta eficiencia.\n"
"Dada la inhospitalidad del planeta, los pocos que viven en Vao Vos se "
"concentran en una única cúpula fuertemente aislada. Con el puerto espacial "
"incorporado, todo se encuentra a una corta distancia a pie."

msgid ""
"Vao Vos' surface is mostly in a liquid state, even on the dark side. The "
"local colonists have learned to deal with their environment, but many space "
"traders aren't used to conditions like that. This spaceport bar is built "
"right on top of a lava field, or rather, right into it. The facility is "
"partially submerged, which is clearly visible from the viewports. It often "
"makes offworld visitors uneasy, which is undoubtedly what the designers had "
"in mind."
msgstr ""
"La superficie de Vao Vos está en su mayor parte en estado líquido, incluso "
"en el lado oscuro. Los colonos locales han aprendido a lidiar con su "
"entorno, pero muchos comerciantes espaciales no están acostumbrados a estas "
"condiciones. Este bar del puerto espacial está construido justo encima de un "
"campo de lava, o mejor dicho, justo dentro de él. La instalación está "
"parcialmente sumergida, lo que es claramente visible desde los miradores. "
"Suele incomodar a los visitantes de fuera del planeta, que es sin duda lo "
"que los diseñadores tenían en mente."

msgid "Varaati"
msgstr "Varaati"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sixteenth colony ship to be launched from Earth, Archimedes had many "
"improvements over its predecessors. Though high-yield terraforming was still "
"unknown in those days, the ship did have rather effective atmospheric "
"equalisers and soil enhancers, which allowed it to transform Varaati from a "
"primordial world into a stable class M. Despite this success, Varaati's "
"economic development started relatively late in the game, placing it a good "
"distance behind Dawn and Tori."
msgstr ""
"La decimosexta nave colonial lanzada desde la Tierra, Arquímedes tenía "
"muchas mejoras respecto a sus predecesoras. Aunque la terraformación de alto "
"rendimiento era aún desconocida en aquella época, la nave disponía de "
"ecualizadores atmosféricos y potenciadores de suelo bastante eficaces, que "
"le permitieron transformar Varaati de un mundo primordial a uno estable de "
"clase M. A pesar de este éxito, el desarrollo económico de Varaati comenzó "
"relativamente tarde en el juego, situándose a una buena distancia de "
"Amanecer y Tori."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Varaati's spaceport bar is one of those places where everything is in a "
"state of disrepair, where none of the safety regulations are met and where "
"the air is thick with odours you don't want to guess the origin of. In "
"short, it's a great place to hang out."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Varaati es uno de esos lugares donde todo está "
"en mal estado, donde no se cumple ninguna de las normas de seguridad y donde "
"el aire está cargado de olores cuyo origen no quieres adivinar. En resumen, "
"es un gran lugar para pasar el rato."

msgid "Vargo's Flint"
msgstr "El pedernal de Vargo"

msgid "Vargo's Rock"
msgstr "Piedra de Vargo"

msgid ""
"This cold, dead, rocky world was named after the man who settled the colony "
"here, an entrepreneur by the name of Shaan Vargo. Vargo was convinced that "
"this planet harboured untold wealth in precious metals and minerals deep "
"underneath its surface. He persisted in his belief right up until his death "
"in the Incident but the miners here never found anything. What they did find "
"was fairly average, which at least sell well enough to keep the colony "
"marginally profitable."
msgstr ""
"Este mundo frío, muerto y rocoso recibió el nombre del hombre que estableció "
"la colonia aquí, un empresario llamado Shaan Vargo. Vargo estaba convencido "
"de que este planeta albergaba una riqueza incalculable en metales y "
"minerales preciosos bajo su superficie. Persistió en su creencia hasta su "
"muerte en el Incidente, pero los mineros de aquí nunca encontraron nada. Lo "
"que sí encontraron fue algo mediocre, que al menos se vendía lo suficiente "
"como para que la colonia siguiera siendo marginalmente rentable."

msgid ""
"Miner bars are miner bars the galaxy over, but Sirian miner bars distinguish "
"themselves by incorporating the typical Sirian spirituality into the down-to-"
"earth-and-lower nature of a mining colony. Miners frequently come above "
"ground to perform their religious ceremonies, and so are less prone to the "
"stress and mental trauma that a prolonged stay in a mine can cause."
msgstr ""
"Los bares mineros son bares mineros en toda la galaxia, pero los bares "
"mineros Sirio se distinguen por incorporar la típica espiritualidad Sirio a "
"la naturaleza realista de una colonia minera. Los mineros suelen salir a la "
"superficie para realizar sus ceremonias religiosas, por lo que son menos "
"propensos al estrés y al trauma mental que puede causar una estancia "
"prolongada en una mina."

msgid "Varia"
msgstr "Varia"

msgid ""
"Varia is a Dvaered world, so it can't be called lush or relaxing. But it's "
"the next best thing. The climate on Varia is as close to old Earth's as "
"makes no difference, and the inhabitants of this world typically lead "
"healthy, long lives. In fact, the planet is so nice that some feel it is "
"wasted on the Dvaered, who misuse the bounty the planet offers for their "
"crude, destructive forms of entertainment.\n"
"The headquarters of Schafer & Kane Industries and their main fabrication "
"plants are also located on Varia, which helps contribute greatly to the "
"prosperity of the local population. Following traditional Dvaered design, "
"S&K Industries prioritize function over form, leading to very practical "
"buildings that further clash with the planets natural beauty."
msgstr ""
"Varia es un mundo Dvaered, por lo que no se puede decir que sea exuberante o "
"relajante. Pero es lo más parecido. El clima de Varia es lo más parecido al "
"de la vieja Tierra, y los habitantes de este mundo suelen llevar una vida "
"sana y larga. De hecho, el planeta es tan agradable que algunos creen que se "
"desperdicia con los Dvaered, que abusan de la generosidad que ofrece el "
"planeta para sus burdas y destructivas formas de entretenimiento.\n"
"La sede de Industrias Schafer & Kane y sus principales plantas de "
"fabricación también se encuentran en Varia, lo que contribuye en gran medida "
"a la prosperidad de la población local. Siguiendo el diseño tradicional "
"Dvaered, Industrias S&K prioriza la función sobre la forma, lo que da lugar "
"a edificios muy prácticos que chocan aún más con la belleza natural del "
"planeta."

msgid ""
"Varia's bar is more like a bar complex than a bar. With multiple rooms, each "
"decorated in different styles and each serving different beverages, the "
"discerning alcoholic with money to spare could spend all week here without "
"ever getting bored. Most of the merchants and businesspeople prefer to stick "
"to the main room, however."
msgstr ""
"El bar de Varia es más un complejo de bares que un bar. Con múltiples salas, "
"cada una de ellas decorada con diferentes estilos y en las que se sirven "
"diferentes bebidas, el alcohólico exigente con dinero de sobra podría pasar "
"aquí toda la semana sin aburrirse nunca. Sin embargo, la mayoría de los "
"comerciantes y empresarios prefieren quedarse en la sala principal."

msgid "Varona"
msgstr "Varona"

msgid "Vauban I-1"
msgstr "Vauban I-1"

msgid "Vault"
msgstr "Bóveda"

msgid ""
"Vault is a small world with little in the way of industry to recommend it. "
"It has respectable facilities but is otherwise too poor for anyone to bother "
"with the place."
msgstr ""
"Bóveda es un mundo pequeño con poco en el camino de la industria para "
"recomendarlo. Tiene unas instalaciones respetables, pero por lo demás es "
"demasiado pobre para que alguien se moleste en el lugar."

msgid ""
"The bar is a small and dingy place, the beer can only be called technically "
"drinkable, the inhabitants are rather dirty and several of them look "
"dangerous. There might be worse places to spend an evening but none "
"immediately come to mind!"
msgstr ""
"El bar es un lugar pequeño y lúgubre, la cerveza sólo puede llamarse "
"técnicamente potable, los habitantes son bastante sucios y varios de ellos "
"parecen peligrosos. ¡Puede que haya lugares peores para pasar una noche, "
"pero no se me ocurre ninguno!"

msgid "Vean I"
msgstr "Vean I"

msgid "Vean II"
msgstr "Vean II"

msgid "Vennis"
msgstr "Vennis"

msgid ""
"Vennis is a planet with characteristics quite close to the Earth Standard. "
"Its gravity, surface area, day-night cycle and annual cycle closely match "
"that of old Earth. It would be a highly suitable planet to live on, were it "
"not for the highly acidic atmosphere. House Sirius has recently settled a "
"dome colony here, with the intent of eventually terraforming the planet to a "
"high class residential world. It will be many cycles before this ideal is be "
"realized but the inhabitants of Vennis persevere."
msgstr ""
"Vennis es un planeta con características bastante cercanas al estándar de la "
"Tierra. Su gravedad, superficie, ciclo día-noche y ciclo anual coinciden con "
"los de la antigua Tierra. Sería un planeta muy adecuado para vivir si no "
"fuera por su atmósfera altamente ácida. La Casa Sirio recientement ha "
"establecido aquí una colonia con cúpula, con la intención de terraformar el "
"planeta para convertirlo en un mundo residencial de alto nivel. Pasarán "
"muchos ciclos antes de que este ideal se haga realidad, pero los habitantes "
"de Vennis perseveran."

msgid ""
"Though the planet is many cycles away from being suitable for open-air human "
"life, the spaceport authorities have put up various promotional holovids "
"that showcase the terraforming effort and its predicted effects. It's a "
"mandatory watch for any visitor to the spaceport bar who wishes to use the "
"standard facilities."
msgstr ""
"Aunque al planeta le faltan muchos ciclos para ser apto para la vida humana "
"al aire libre, las autoridades del puerto espacial han colocado varios "
"holovídeos promocionales que muestran el esfuerzo de terraformación y sus "
"efectos previstos. Es un visionado obligatorio para cualquier visitante del "
"bar del puerto espacial que desee utilizar las instalaciones estándar."

msgid "Vercingetorix"
msgstr "Vercingetorix"

msgid ""
"Vercingetorix is mined for rare resources that the Dvaered need to keep "
"their war machine running. Fittingly, the planet's atmosphere is as harsh as "
"it gets on a class-X planet. The Dvaered primarily use convicts to do the "
"mining here, as then the brutal casualty rate does not have to concern the "
"'true' Dvaered citizens."
msgstr ""
"Vercingetorix se explota en busca de recursos raros que los Dvaered "
"necesitan para mantener su maquinaria de guerra en funcionamiento. La "
"atmósfera del planeta es tan dura como la de un planeta de clase X. Los "
"Dvaered utilizan principalmente a los convictos para realizar la minería "
"aquí, ya que así el brutal índice de bajas no tiene que preocupar a los "
"\"verdaderos\" ciudadanos Dvaered."

msgid ""
"The bar is completely filled with off-duty soldiers tasked with overseeing "
"the prisoners in their mining duties. It must be an easy job, considering "
"how relaxed most of them look. Then again, the planet's environment must do "
"more to beat down the convicts than they ever could."
msgstr ""
"El bar está completamente lleno de soldados fuera de servicio encargados de "
"supervisar a los prisioneros en sus tareas mineras. Debe ser un trabajo "
"fácil, teniendo en cuenta lo relajados que parecen la mayoría de ellos. Por "
"otra parte, el entorno del planeta debe hacer más por machacar a los "
"convictos de lo que ellos podrían hacer."

msgid "Verex I"
msgstr "Verex I"

msgid "Verex II"
msgstr "Verex II"

msgid "Verex III"
msgstr "Verex III"

msgid "Vert"
msgstr "Vert"

msgid "Vertigo"
msgstr "Vértigo"

msgid ""
"Vertigo is the second moon orbiting Nartur IV. While the rock itself is "
"utterly uninteresting, Nartur's first moon is anything but. It is a semi-"
"fluid sphere of valuable mineral that often gets used in hyperdrives. "
"Vertigo is the closest place where a harvesting base can be set up, short of "
"building a whole new starbase."
msgstr ""
"Vértigo es la segunda luna que orbita alrededor de Nartur IV. Mientras que "
"la roca en sí misma no tiene ningún interés, la primera luna de Nartur es "
"cualquier cosa menos eso. Es una esfera semifluida de un valioso mineral que "
"suele utilizarse en los hipermotores. Vértigo es el lugar más cercano donde "
"se puede instalar una base de recolección, a falta de construir una nueva "
"base estelar."

msgid ""
"Vertigo's spaceport bar has an excellent view of Nartur IV and IVa. "
"Depending on the phase of the various orbital cycles, it can be quite a "
"fetching sight. Of course, some of the time there's very little to see at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Vértigo tiene una excelente vista de Nartur IV "
"y IVa. Dependiendo de la fase de los distintos ciclos orbitales, puede ser "
"una vista bastante atractiva. Por supuesto, algunas veces hay muy poco que "
"ver."

msgid "Vigil Station"
msgstr "Estación de Vigilia"

msgid ""
"Vigil Station was built to honour all those who died in the ordeals of the "
"Soromid. The system sees few visitors, and the station is primarily a "
"ceremonial post rather than an actual defensive installation. Nonetheless, "
"many Soromid want to be posted here, to be connected with their past."
msgstr ""
"La Estación de Vigilia se construyó para honrar a todos los que murieron en "
"las pruebas Soromida. El sistema recibe pocos visitantes, y la estación es "
"principalmente un puesto ceremonial más que una instalación defensiva real. "
"Sin embargo, muchos Soromida quieren ser destinados aquí, para estar "
"conectados con su pasado."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Vigilance Centre"
msgstr "Centro Vigilancia"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Vigilance Centre is the defence centre for Procyon. Unusually for a Za'lek "
"military asset, it is well-supplied and cared for, with the staff being "
"ready at a moment's notice to come to Procyon's aid."
msgstr ""
"El Centro Vigilancia es el centro de defensa de Procyon. Inusualmente para "
"un activo militar Za'lek, está bien abastecido y cuidado, con el personal "
"listo en un momento para acudir a la ayuda de Procyon."

msgid "This bar is simple and clean. Every inch a military establishment."
msgstr ""
"Este bar es sencillo y limpio. Cada centímetro de un establecimiento militar."

msgid "Vilati Vilata"
msgstr "Vilati Vilata"

msgid ""
"Frozen worlds are usually not colonized unless there is good reason. Vilati "
"Vilata is no exception. The world offers a wealth of valuable natural "
"resources, as well as expansive subglacial cavern systems that lend "
"themselves quite well to human habitation. The Dvaered based, what would "
"become, one of their most successful industrial franchises on this planet, "
"so although nobody likes living here, the place is home to a sizeable number "
"of workers."
msgstr ""
"Los mundos congelados no suelen ser colonizados a menos que haya una buena "
"razón. Vilati Vilata no es una excepción. El mundo ofrece una gran cantidad "
"de valiosos recursos naturales, así como amplios sistemas de cavernas "
"subglaciales que se prestan bastante bien a la habitabilidad humana. Los "
"Dvaered basaron en este planeta lo que se convertiría en una de sus "
"franquicias industriales más exitosas, por lo que, aunque a nadie le gusta "
"vivir aquí, el lugar es el hogar de un número considerable de trabajadores."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar is cold. It must be mentioned. Every effort has been made to "
"minimize loss of heat from the building, but given the bar's proximity to "
"the spaceport, which is exposed to the elements, and the constant flow of "
"customers, it has proven impossible to keep out the cold. This situation has "
"given rise to a number of unkind jokes about the Vilati bar, which are told "
"throughout the galaxy."
msgstr ""
"El bar está frío. Hay que decirlo. Se ha hecho todo lo posible para "
"minimizar la pérdida de calor del edificio, pero dada la proximidad del bar "
"al puerto espacial, que está expuesto a los elementos, y el flujo constante "
"de clientes, ha resultado imposible mantener el frío a raya. Esta situación "
"ha dado lugar a una serie de bromas desagradables sobre el bar Vilati, que "
"se cuentan por toda la galaxia."

msgid "Vino"
msgstr "Vino"

msgid ""
"Though Vino is a good world for civilian habitation by most standards, the "
"local government is rather distrustful of offworlders. It has made "
"immigration procedures so arduous that the vast majority of potential "
"newcomers give up when they see the requirements. On the flip side, Vinoan "
"citizens are loath to leave their world, be it temporarily or permanently. "
"This makes Vino an isolated enclave, although trade is still at a decent "
"level despite everything."
msgstr ""
"Aunque Vino es un buen mundo para la vida civil según la mayoría de los "
"estándares, el gobierno local es bastante desconfiado con los "
"extraterrestres. Ha hecho que los procedimientos de inmigración sean tan "
"arduos que la gran mayoría de los potenciales recién llegados desisten "
"cuando ven los requisitos. Por otro lado, los ciudadanos de Vino se resisten "
"a abandonar su mundo, ya sea temporal o permanentemente. Esto convierte a "
"Vino en un enclave aislado, aunque el comercio se mantiene a un nivel "
"decente a pesar de todo."

msgid ""
"Vino has a spaceport bar, but only because the government couldn't close it "
"down without running foul of Empire-wide spaceport regulations. So, although "
"the place is open and functional, no effort has been spared to make the "
"place as inhospitable and unpleasant as possible. Real, seasoned traders "
"have learned to ignore this though."
msgstr ""
"Vino tiene un bar en el puerto espacial, pero sólo porque el gobierno no "
"podía cerrarlo sin incumplir las normas de los puertos espaciales del "
"Imperio. Así que, aunque el lugar está abierto y es funcional, no se han "
"escatimado esfuerzos para que el lugar sea lo más inhóspito y desagradable "
"posible. Sin embargo, los verdaderos y experimentados comerciantes han "
"aprendido a ignorar esto."

msgid "Vinooso"
msgstr "Vinooso"

msgid ""
"Vinooso is an odd little planet. Cold, small and on the outside of the "
"system, it shouldn't attract much interest from anyone. However, Soromid "
"scientists have discovered that the planet's axial rotation speed isn't "
"constant - it speeds up and slows down in a regular pattern. Nobody knows "
"why this happens. The settlement here was created as part of the quest to "
"find out."
msgstr ""
"Vinooso es un pequeño y extraño planeta. Frío, pequeño y situado en el "
"exterior del sistema, no debería atraer el interés de nadie. Sin embargo, "
"los científicos Soromida han descubierto que la velocidad de rotación axial "
"del planeta no es constante: se acelera y se ralentiza siguiendo un patrón "
"regular. Nadie sabe por qué ocurre esto. El asentamiento aquí fue creado "
"como parte de la búsqueda para averiguarlo."

msgid ""
"There's a story the barman here likes to tell. He says he can tell how fast "
"the planet is spinning by the subtle shift in its gravitational pull. It's a "
"tall tale, of course. The difference is immeasurably small, and certainly "
"can't be detected with human senses, even if those senses are Soromid."
msgstr ""
"Hay una historia que le gusta contar al camarero. Dice que puede saber a qué "
"velocidad gira el planeta por el sutil cambio de su atracción gravitatoria. "
"Es un cuento chino, por supuesto. La diferencia es inconmensurablemente "
"pequeña, y ciertamente no puede ser detectada con los sentidos humanos, "
"incluso si esos sentidos son Soromida."

msgid "Violin Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Violín"

msgid ""
"Violin Monastery is one of the more important Sirian military outposts. With "
"so much traffic coming through Churchill, extra security is called for. "
"Violin Monastery also responds to disturbances in Eiderdown, when the "
"Wringer is causing trouble again."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Violín es uno de los puestos militares más importantes de "
"Sirio. Con tanto tráfico que pasa por Churchill, se requiere una seguridad "
"adicional. El Monasterio Violín también responde a los disturbios en "
"Eiderdown, cuando el Escurridor vuelve a causar problemas."

msgid "Virginis Alpha"
msgstr "Virginis Alfa"

msgid ""
"Virginis Alpha has a a violently dusty atmosphere that doesn't sit well with "
"most spaceships. Just a single visit when a storm is raging can cause enough "
"damage to almost write the ship off as lost. However, the important mineral "
"resources almost ensure that there are always pilots foolish enough to risk "
"it for a chance at making some quick credits. Virginis Alpha was colonized "
"shortly after Spica, although the environment ensures that it will never be "
"as prosperous. Those who immigrate from abroad quickly find themselves "
"dreaming of going back; it is only the unlucky ones born at Virginis Alpha "
"that do not know better who can get truly used to the planet."
msgstr ""
"Virginis Alfa tiene una atmósfera violentamente polvorienta que no sienta "
"bien a la mayoría de las naves espaciales. Una sola visita en plena tormenta "
"puede causar suficientes daños como para dar la nave casi por perdida. Sin "
"embargo, los importantes recursos minerales casi garantizan que siempre haya "
"pilotos lo suficientemente insensatos como para arriesgarse por una "
"oportunidad de ganar algunos créditos rápidos. Virginis Alfa fue colonizada "
"poco después de Spica, aunque el entorno asegura que nunca será tan "
"próspera. Los que emigran del extranjero se encuentran rápidamente soñando "
"con volver; son sólo los desafortunados nacidos en Virginis Alfa que no "
"saben lo que es mejor los que pueden acostumbrarse de verdad al planeta."

msgid "Virginis Beta"
msgstr "Virginis Beta"

msgid "Virginis Chi"
msgstr "Virginis Chi"

msgid "Virginis Eta"
msgstr "Virginis Eta"

msgid "Virginis Lambda"
msgstr "Virginis Lambda"

msgid "Vlexair"
msgstr "Vlexair"

msgid ""
"Vlexair is a harsh, frozen world. Formerly a lush paradise, an internal "
"cataclysm caused its molten core to solidify, resulting in an ice age. "
"Virtually no flora or fauna exist outside of the station. Due to its an "
"extremely dangerous environment, it's proven suitable only to the Dvaered "
"workers."
msgstr ""
"Vlexair es un mundo duro y helado. Antes era un paraíso exuberante, pero un "
"cataclismo interno hizo que su núcleo fundido se solidificara, dando lugar a "
"una edad de hielo. Prácticamente no existe flora ni fauna fuera de la "
"estación. Debido a su entorno extremadamente peligroso, sólo es apto para "
"los trabajadores Dvaered."

msgid ""
"The Vlexair bar is small, as far as Dvaered bars go. There's not much "
"variety of drink other than the standard Dvaered grogs."
msgstr ""
"El bar Vlexair es pequeño, en lo que respecta a los bares Dvaered. No hay "
"mucha variedad de bebidas, aparte del estandar grog Dvaered."

msgid "Vlexon I"
msgstr "Vlexon I"

msgid "Vlexon II"
msgstr "Vlexon II"

msgid "Voproid Monastery"
msgstr "Monasterio Voproid"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Voproid Monastery is a centre for training the physical and especially "
"mental attributes of new recruits. It has a very classic design with little "
"clutter and large rooms, which is very uncommon in space station designs due "
"to the low efficiency. A third of the entire fort is dedicated to meditation "
"rooms that are routinely visited by commanders and new recruits alike. Until "
"one gets used to the layout of the station it is very common to suffer from "
"frequent disorientation."
msgstr ""
"El Monasterio Voproid es un centro para entrenar los atributos físicos y "
"sobre todo mentales de los nuevos reclutas. Tiene un diseño muy clásico, con "
"poco desorden y grandes habitaciones, algo poco común en los diseños de las "
"estaciones espaciales debido a su baja eficiencia. Un tercio de todo el "
"fuerte está dedicado a las salas de meditación que visitan habitualmente "
"tanto los comandantes como los nuevos reclutas. Hasta que uno se acostumbra "
"a la disposición de la estación es muy común sufrir una frecuente "
"desorientación."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar follows the same minimalistic aesthetics of the rest of the station, "
"feeling closer to a centre of meditation rather than a crowded space bar. "
"Most of the beverages provided have no alcohol and are designed to boost the "
"mental prowess."
msgstr ""
"El bar sigue la misma estética minimalista del resto de la estación, "
"pareciendo más un centro de meditación que un bar espacial abarrotado. La "
"mayoría de las bebidas que se ofrecen no tienen alcohol y están diseñadas "
"para potenciar la destreza mental."

msgid "Voproid Prime"
msgstr "Voproid Prime"

msgid "Vorca"
msgstr "Vorca"

msgid ""
"Vorca has long been the main base of operations of small time gangsters and "
"crooks, but it didn't grow into a serious Pirate stronghold until the "
"Dvaered Revolts. In that time of tension and discord, many decided to turn "
"their backs on the Empire entirely and eke out a new life, accruing wealth "
"by taking it from others. Those who survived in that line of work flocked to "
"Vorca. Now the planet is host to an impressive fleet of private, more-or-"
"less similarly aligned ships."
msgstr ""
"Vorca ha sido durante mucho tiempo la principal base de operaciones de "
"gánsteres y ladrones de poca monta, pero no se convirtió en un Baluarte "
"Pirata serio hasta las Revueltas Dvaered. En esa época de tensión y "
"discordia, muchos decidieron dar la espalda al Imperio por completo y "
"ganarse una nueva vida acumulando riquezas al tomarla de otros. Los que "
"sobrevivieron en esa línea de trabajo acudieron a Vorca. Ahora el planeta "
"alberga una impresionante flota de naves privadas de alineación más o menos "
"similar."

msgid ""
"The average space pilot would, when walking into a Pirate bar, expect utter "
"chaos, fraught with boozing, gambling, violence and narcotic substances. "
"This is an expectation the bar on Vorca does not live up to. As a matter of "
"fact the establishment is quite tightly policed by henchmen of the Clan "
"leaders and, as such, is one of the most orderly places within several "
"jumps. The bar serves as neutral ground among the Pirates themselves and a "
"meeting place for those who, for whatever reason, want to solicit their aid."
msgstr ""
"El piloto espacial medio, al entrar en un bar pirata, esperaría un caos "
"absoluto, cargado de bebida, juego, violencia y sustancias estupefacientes. "
"Esta es una expectativa que el bar de Vorca no cumple. De hecho, el "
"establecimiento está fuertemente vigilado por los esbirros de los líderes "
"del clan y, como tal, es uno de los lugares más ordenados en varios saltos. "
"El bar sirve como terreno neutral entre los propios Piratas y como lugar de "
"encuentro para aquellos que, por cualquier motivo, quieren solicitar su "
"ayuda."

msgid "Vracha"
msgstr "Vracha"

msgid ""
"Vracha was colonized by the Proteron for use as a testing ground for "
"potentially dangerous terraforming techniques and other things that require "
"a planetary surface, but may cause serious harm to said planetary surface."
msgstr ""
"Vracha fue colonizada por el Proteron para utilizarla como campo de pruebas "
"de técnicas de terraformación potencialmente peligrosas y otras cosas que "
"requieren una superficie planetaria, pero que pueden causar graves daños a "
"dicha superficie planetaria."

msgid ""
"Every once in a while you hear an explosion, see strange colours, or notice "
"the lights flickering on and off. The bar staff and patrons pay no mind to "
"this phenomenon, suggesting that they experience it on a regular basis."
msgstr ""
"De vez en cuando se oye una explosión, se ven colores extraños o se nota que "
"las luces se encienden y se apagan. El personal del bar y los clientes no "
"prestan atención a este fenómeno, sugiriendo que lo experimentan con "
"regularidad."

msgid "Vuere"
msgstr "Vuere"

msgid ""
"The Emperor's Fist project needs labour. A lot of labour. And so long as the "
"world itself remains unfit for habitation, the workforce needs someplace "
"else to live. The inhabitants of Halir refused to provide them shelter, "
"invoking various complicated rights and regulations, so rather than persuade "
"the local government, the Imperial Council decided to deploy prefab survival "
"units on Vuere. As such, Vuere should be considered a temporary camp rather "
"than a colony. However, with a population this size and a projected duration "
"of stay this long, it is doubtful if Vuere will ever truly be abandoned."
msgstr ""
"El proyecto del Puño del Emperador necesita mano de obra. Mucha mano de "
"obra. Y mientras el propio mundo siga sin ser habitable, la mano de obra "
"necesita otro lugar donde vivir. Los habitantes de Halir se negaron a darles "
"cobijo, invocando diversos y complicados derechos y regulaciones, así que en "
"lugar de persuadir al gobierno local, el Consejo Imperial decidió desplegar "
"unidades de supervivencia prefabricadas en Vuere. Como tal, Vuere debe "
"considerarse un campamento temporal más que una colonia. Sin embargo, con "
"una población de este tamaño y una duración prevista de la estancia tan "
"larga, es dudoso que Vuere llegue a ser realmente abandonada."

msgid ""
"The bar is surprisingly hospitable for such a makeshift settlement. The "
"inhabitants apparently feel the need to make up for the harsh environment of "
"their C-class planet by making their indoor areas as comfortable and "
"appealing as they can. The bar is a prime example of this."
msgstr ""
"El bar es sorprendentemente hospitalario para un asentamiento tan "
"improvisado. Al parecer, los habitantes sienten la necesidad de compensar el "
"duro entorno de su planeta de clase C haciendo que sus zonas interiores sean "
"lo más cómodas y atractivas posible. El bar es un buen ejemplo de ello."

msgid "Wagenni"
msgstr "Wagenni"

msgid ""
"A small, poor colony on the edge of Sirius inhabited space, Wagenni is one "
"of those places that are doomed to forever dangle at the bottom rung of "
"interstellar society. The locals lead a rough, underpaid existence, the kind "
"that sparked the Dvaered Revolts elsewhere in the galaxy. Yet, there is no "
"sign of discontent here. The Sirii have accepted their fate and take "
"strength from their faith."
msgstr ""
"Wagenni, una pequeña y pobre colonia en el límite del espacio habitado "
"Sirio, es uno de esos lugares que están condenados a colgar para siempre en "
"el escalón más bajo de la sociedad interestelar. Los lugareños llevan una "
"existencia dura y mal pagada, del tipo que provocó las Revueltas Dvaered en "
"otros lugares de la galaxia. Sin embargo, aquí no hay señales de "
"descontento. Los Sirio han aceptado su destino y se fortalecen con su fe."

msgid ""
"Amazingly, this spaceport bar is off-premises. It's a free standing facility "
"some ways from the spaceport itself. There's no security, no terminal "
"checkpoints in between it and the landing docks. Wagenni is a poor colony. "
"It has no use for such things."
msgstr ""
"Sorprendentemente, este bar del puerto espacial está fuera del recinto. Es "
"una instalación independiente a cierta distancia del propio puerto espacial. "
"No hay seguridad, ni puestos de control entre él y los muelles de "
"aterrizaje. Wagenni es una colonia pobre. No tiene uso para tales cosas."

msgid "Wahri"
msgstr "Wahri"

msgid ""
"A simple lunar outpost built primarily to mine the local X-class world for "
"its resources and ship them to other parts of Za'lek space. There are "
"rumours of the world being used for weapons testing, but there is little "
"evidence to support that."
msgstr ""
"Un simple puesto de avanzada lunar construido principalmente para extraer "
"los recursos del mundo local de clase X y enviarlos a otras partes del "
"espacio Za'lek. Hay rumores de que el mundo se utiliza para pruebas de "
"armamento, pero hay pocas pruebas que lo confirmen."

msgid ""
"A simple spaceport bar built entirely out of prefabricated parts. If you "
"want watered-down beer and a filling meal, it will do the job."
msgstr ""
"Un sencillo bar de puerto espacial construido enteramente con piezas "
"prefabricadas. Si quieres una cerveza aguada y una comida que te llene, te "
"servirá."

msgid "Wahri III"
msgstr "Wahri III"

msgid "Wahri IV"
msgstr "Wahri IV"

msgid "Wa'kan"
msgstr "Wa'kan"

msgid ""
"Wa'kan is a mining world where the mines are solely worked by prisoners. "
"There is a guard detail posted and a small degree of Za'lek researchers here "
"working on criminal justice programs."
msgstr ""
"Wa'kan es un mundo minero donde las minas son trabajadas únicamente por "
"prisioneros. Hay un destacamento de guardia y un pequeño grupo de "
"investigadores Za'lek que trabajan en programas de justicia penal."

msgid "Waldar"
msgstr "Waldar"

msgid ""
"Waldar is a pleasant, well-balanced Sirian world. Gravity is close to Earth "
"Gee and the sunlight is warm without being hot. Many Sirians would like to "
"live here, but the local authorities keenly protect the planet's beauty. To "
"this end, they tightly control the influx of new residents. Similarly, each "
"family is not allowed to exceed a certain size, or risk eviction from Waldar."
msgstr ""
"Waldar es un mundo Sirio agradable y equilibrado. La gravedad es cercana a "
"la de la Tierra Gee y la luz del sol es cálida sin llegar a serlo. A muchos "
"Sirio les gustaría vivir aquí, pero las autoridades locales protegen con "
"ahínco la belleza del planeta. Para ello, controlan estrictamente la "
"afluencia de nuevos residentes. Asimismo, no se permite que cada familia "
"supere un determinado tamaño, o se arriesga a ser expulsada de Waldar."

msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is kept within the spaceport terminal. Visitors are not "
"allowed out of the facility unless they have a permit to do so. Waldar is a "
"controlled paradise - no tourists."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial se mantiene dentro de la terminal del mismo. No "
"se permite a los visitantes salir de las instalaciones a menos que tengan un "
"permiso para hacerlo. Waldar es un paraíso controlado: no hay turistas."

msgid "Warden's End"
msgstr "El Fin de la Guardia"

msgid ""
"Warden's End exists as a place for less-than-legal wares to be bought and "
"sold. Known as one of the few truly \"free\" markets, many of the less "
"reputable merchants in the galaxy come here to peddle their wares. Many a "
"merchant has gained - and lost - a fortune here. The station itself is made "
"out of the welded-together ships of merchants who became destitute."
msgstr ""
"El Fin de la Guardia es un lugar donde se compran y venden productos poco "
"legales. Conocido como uno de los pocos mercados verdaderamente \"libres\", "
"muchos de los mercaderes menos reputados de la galaxia vienen aquí a vender "
"sus productos. Muchos comerciantes han ganado -y perdido- una fortuna aquí. "
"La propia estación está formada por las naves soldadas de los mercaderes que "
"quedaron en la miseria."

msgid ""
"Many of the denizens of Warden's End are richer and the bar caters to this "
"with a bit more of a posh appearance. The usually rowdy pirates are kept in "
"check by the small armies that seem to surround every seedy merchant, "
"keeping the place quieter and, tensely, stable."
msgstr ""
"Muchos de los habitantes del Fin de la Guardia son más ricos y el bar se "
"adapta a ello con una apariencia más elegante. Los piratas, normalmente "
"alborotados, se mantienen a raya gracias a los pequeños ejércitos que "
"parecen rodear a todos los mercaderes de mala muerte, manteniendo el lugar "
"más tranquilo y, tensamente, estable."

msgid "Warei"
msgstr "Warei"

msgid ""
"Part of the reason why Warei's surface is permanently frozen is because the "
"planet's core is cold. This is a fascinating aberration from the standard "
"planetary model but, more than that, it offers great economic possibilities "
"as there are vast amounts of raw minerals to be had under the crust. The "
"Soromid have set up a parts and ship manufacturing complex here."
msgstr ""
"Parte de la razón por la que la superficie de Warei está permanentemente "
"congelada es porque el núcleo del planeta es frío. Se trata de una "
"fascinante aberración del modelo planetario estándar, pero, además, ofrece "
"grandes posibilidades económicas, ya que bajo la corteza hay grandes "
"cantidades de minerales en bruto. Los Soromida han instalado aquí un "
"complejo de fabricación de piezas y naves."

msgid ""
"Even the Soromid need protection from the cold climate, but they're "
"certainly more resistant to it than normal humans. Most non-Soromid traders "
"visiting Warei complain about the cold - the ambient temperature in the bar "
"is far from comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Incluso los Soromida necesitan protegerse del frío, pero sin duda son más "
"resistentes a él que los humanos normales. La mayoría de los comerciantes no "
"Soromida que visitan Warei se quejan del frío: la temperatura ambiente en el "
"bar dista mucho de ser confortable."

msgid "Warnecke"
msgstr "Warnecke"

msgid ""
"This gas giant is the epicentre of a gas mining operation for the Za'lek "
"navy and merchant marine. The gasses here are refined into fuel for the "
"Za'lek's new ring drives. Obviously, scientists here also work obsessively "
"on building new and better forms of engines for the house's vessels."
msgstr ""
"Este gigante gaseoso es el epicentro de una operación de extracción de gas "
"para la armada y la marina mercante de Za'lek. Los gases aquí se refinan "
"para convertirlos en combustible para los nuevos motores anulares de los "
"Za'lek. Obviamente, los científicos de aquí también trabajan obsesivamente "
"en la construcción de nuevas y mejores formas de motores para las naves de "
"la casa."

msgid ""
"This bar smells faintly of the refining going on throughout the orbital "
"station skimming the upper atmosphere of the gas giant Warnecke. It does "
"very little to impress, and the bartender apologizes for the poor air "
"scrubbers labouring in the corners."
msgstr ""
"Este bar huele ligeramente a la refinación que se realiza en toda la "
"estación orbital que roza la atmósfera superior del gigante gaseoso "
"Warnecke. No impresiona mucho, y el camarero se disculpa por los pobres "
"depuradores de aire que trabajan en las esquinas."

msgid "Warnecke I"
msgstr "Warnecke I"

msgid "Warnecke II"
msgstr "Warnecke II"

msgid "Waterhole"
msgstr "Pozo de Agua"

msgid "Waterhole's Moon"
msgstr "Luna de Pozo de Agua"

msgid ""
"In the days of the Old Empire, Waterhole was the farthest outpost of the "
"Empire. To the Imperials, it was the last outpost of civilization, the last "
"bastion of safety before venturing out into the systems beyond. It is "
"because of this that Waterhole, the system and the planet, derive their "
"names. Now, centuries later, Waterhole remains at the border of Empire "
"space. Although it is no longer the border of civilized society, with the "
"establishment of House Za'lek and House Goddard, it is still the last stop "
"for traders venturing out of Imperial space, and the first of those coming "
"in."
msgstr ""
"En los días del Antiguo Imperio, Pozo de Agua era el puesto de avanzada más "
"lejano del Imperio. Para los Imperiales, era el último puesto de avanzada de "
"la civilización, el último bastión de seguridad antes de aventurarse en los "
"sistemas del más allá. Es por ello que Pozo de Agua, el sistema y el "
"planeta, derivan sus nombres. Ahora, siglos después, Pozo de Agua sigue "
"estando en la frontera del espacio del Imperio. Aunque ya no es la frontera "
"de la sociedad civilizada, con el establecimiento de la Casa Za'lek y la "
"Casa Goddard, sigue siendo la última parada de los comerciantes que se "
"aventuran a salir fuera del espacio Imperial, y la primera de los que entran."

msgid ""
"Waterhole's Moon wouldn't be Waterhole's Moon if its bar wasn't called The "
"Waterhole. Though the place is open to visitors from all origins and walks "
"of life, the majority of the clientele is Imperial in nature. It seems that "
"nothing creates a longing for home like being away from it for prolonged "
"periods of time."
msgstr ""
"La Luna de Pozo de Agua no sería Luna Pozo de Agua si su bar no se llamara "
"El Pozo de Agua. Aunque el lugar está abierto a visitantes de todas las "
"procedencias y condiciones, la mayoría de la clientela es de naturaleza "
"Imperial. Parece que nada crea más añoranza del hogar que estar lejos de él "
"durante períodos prolongados."

msgid "Wayline"
msgstr "Wayline"

msgid ""
"Wayline is a barely inhabited ball of ice. Almost the sole reason for its "
"existence is serving as a stopover point in the southern regions. The "
"Dvaered use it as a prison planet as well, due to its remoteness. Few people "
"like coming here and the most common stopovers are Dvaered prison-ships."
msgstr ""
"Wayline es una bola de hielo apenas habitada. Casi la única razón de su "
"existencia es servir como punto de parada en las regiones del sur. Los "
"Dvaered lo utilizan también como planeta prisión, debido a su lejanía. A "
"poca gente le gusta venir aquí y las escalas más comunes son las "
"navesprisión Dvaered."

msgid "Wayline m1"
msgstr "Wayline m1"

msgid "Wayline m2"
msgstr "Wayline m2"

msgid "Waystar"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A large frozen hunk of ice and regolith with an ad-hoc station dug out into "
"the crust from abandoned ships and opportunistically recycled materials, and "
"with life-support seeming like more of an afterthought. Although barely "
"visible from afar, the sprawling complex covers a large swathe of the planet "
"with intricate tunnels and rooms dug deep in the surface. Naturally, rumours "
"of all sorts of incredible riches hidden throughout abound, and it is no "
"uncommon to hear of the horrible demise of scavengers freezing to death or "
"getting crushed by unstable constructions in their search. Of course, those "
"could also just be rumours discouraging people to find said incredible "
"riches."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As part of the marketing strategy, the Lonely Star bar uses no direct "
"heating to keep clients warm, instead, encouraging the consumption of hot "
"drinks. While this may seem like a questionable business decision, the low "
"temperature also minimizes the fistfights with visiting House Dvaered "
"soldiers, something very appreciated by the locals, such that complaints are "
"kept at a minimum."
msgstr ""

msgid "Wellen"
msgstr "Wellen"

msgid ""
"Wellen is a good example of how the individual planetary management policy "
"of the Empire can go wrong. Started as a prestigious project, the world was "
"to be a perfect society with good housing and facilities for everyone, lots "
"of greenery and no pollution. However, the goals were too ambitious, the "
"funds too short and the leadership inadequate. Today Wellen is a slum of run-"
"down, oftentimes half-finished, buildings."
msgstr ""
"Wellen es un buen ejemplo de cómo la política de gestión planetaria "
"individual del Imperio puede salir mal. Iniciado como un prestigioso "
"proyecto, el mundo debía ser una sociedad perfecta con buenas viviendas e "
"instalaciones para todos, mucha vegetación y ninguna contaminación. Sin "
"embargo, los objetivos eran demasiado ambiciosos, los fondos demasiado "
"cortos y el liderazgo inadecuado. Hoy en día, Wellen es una barriada de "
"edificios deteriorados, a menudo a medio terminar."

msgid ""
"The spaceport was the first facility to be constructed on the planet when it "
"was colonized, as is often the case. As such, it is well-built and polished. "
"The spaceport bar is quite respectable, as spaceport bars go. It's only when "
"you leave the terminal and enter the urban areas that the squalor begins to "
"become apparent."
msgstr ""
"El puerto espacial fue la primera instalación que se construyó en el planeta "
"cuando fue colonizado, como suele ocurrir. Como tal, está bien construido y "
"pulido. El bar del puerto espacial es bastante respetable, como los bares de "
"los puertos espaciales. Sólo cuando se sale de la terminal y se entra en las "
"zonas urbanas, la miseria empieza a ser evidente."

msgid "Werlen"
msgstr "Werlen"

msgid ""
"Werlen is a world devoted to the cultivation of the raw materials the "
"Soromid use to fabricate their ships. The world is off-limits to casual "
"traffic, and only those trusted by the Soromid are permitted access."
msgstr ""
"Werlen es un mundo dedicado al cultivo de las materias primas que los "
"Soromida utilizan para fabricar sus naves. El mundo está prohibido para el "
"tráfico casual, y solo se permite el acceso a aquellos que cuentan con la "
"confianza Soromida."

msgid ""
"Virtually spotless despite being situated on a mining colony, this bar is an "
"anomaly. Its cleanliness appears to be thanks, in large part, to an "
"automated cleaning apparatus, the sides of which are covered in dire warning "
"labels. The other patrons appear to be giving the machine a wide berth."
msgstr ""
"Prácticamente impecable a pesar de estar situado en una colonia minera, este "
"bar es una anomalía. Su limpieza parece deberse, en gran parte, a un aparato "
"de limpieza automatizado, cuyos laterales están cubiertos de terribles "
"etiquetas de advertencia. Los demás clientes parecen no prestar atención a "
"la máquina."

msgid "Westeros Nest"
msgstr "Nido Westeros"

msgid ""
"Serving as an auxiliary trading platform for the nearby mining colony of "
"Ahmed, Westeros Nest allows for merchants to not have to brave the "
"atmosphere of the nearby planetoid, making bulk transfers far easier."
msgstr ""
"Como plataforma comercial auxiliar para la cercana colonia minera de Ahmed, "
"el Nido Westeros permite a los comerciantes no tener que enfrentarse a la "
"atmósfera del planetoide cercano, lo que facilita enormemente las "
"transferencias a granel."

msgid ""
"Being a station primarily for bulk merchants, the bar is posh, with "
"comfortable seats looking out over big views of the planetary system."
msgstr ""
"Al ser una estación destinada principalmente a los comerciantes a granel, el "
"bar es elegante, con cómodos asientos que dan a grandes vistas del sistema "
"planetario."

msgid "Wigheta"
msgstr "Wigheta"

msgid ""
"While the main line of Soromid military ship production is located on "
"Heronus in Uridhrion, there is a secondary ship plant here on Wigheta. "
"Wigheta does not grow the regular models, however. Instead, the world acts "
"as a research facility for bioships, where new designs and growth methods "
"are invented and tested. It's a slow and expensive process, and Wigheta only "
"produces a useful result once every few cycles, but without the work done "
"here the Soromid bioship technology will never evolve."
msgstr ""
"Mientras que la línea principal de producción de naves militares Soromida se "
"encuentra en Heronus, en Uridhrion, hay una planta de naves secundaria aquí, "
"en Wigheta. Sin embargo, en Wigheta no se producen los modelos habituales. "
"En lugar de ello, el mundo actúa como una instalación de investigación para "
"las bionavegaciones, donde se inventan y prueban nuevos diseños y métodos de "
"crecimiento. Es un proceso lento y costoso, y Wigheta sólo produce un "
"resultado útil una vez cada varios ciclos, pero sin el trabajo realizado "
"aquí la tecnología de las naves biológicas Soromida nunca evolucionará."

msgid ""
"Wigheta's spaceport bar is located very close to the actual landing docks of "
"the spaceport. The research done on Wigheta is top-secret, so every "
"precaution is being taken to prevent visitors from wandering into places "
"they shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial de Wigheta está situado muy cerca de los "
"verdaderos muelles de aterrizaje del puerto espacial. La investigación que "
"se realiza en Wigheta es de alto secreto, por lo que se toman todas las "
"precauciones para evitar que los visitantes se adentren en lugares que no "
"deben."

msgid "Wikon"
msgstr "Wikon"

msgid ""
"Wikon is a high-profile Sirian world, one of the driving economic forces in "
"the core of Sirius space. With planetary characteristics fairly close to "
"ideal Class M, it is both attractive for habitation and industry. Land "
"values are rather high, and the population tends toward the Serra echelon."
msgstr ""
"Wikon es un mundo Sirio de alto nivel, uno de los motores económicos del "
"núcleo del espacio de Sirio. Con unas características planetarias bastante "
"cercanas a la clase M ideal, es atractivo tanto para la habitabilidad como "
"para la industria. El valor de la tierra es bastante elevado y la población "
"tiende al escalafón Serra."

msgid ""
"A better name for the spaceport bar would be \"spaceport lounge\". The "
"establishment is luxurious even by non-spaceport standards, offering various "
"recreational facilities in addition to the standard ones. It is possible to "
"dine here too, and the menu is far from modest. Of course all this comes "
"with a considerable price tag, but the economic climate allows for that."
msgstr ""
"Un nombre mejor para el bar del puerto espacial sería \"salón del puerto "
"espacial\". El establecimiento es lujoso incluso para los estándares de los "
"no-puertos espaciales, y ofrece varias instalaciones recreativas además de "
"las estándar. También se puede cenar aquí, y el menú no es nada modesto. Por "
"supuesto, todo esto tiene un precio considerable, pero el clima económico lo "
"permite."

msgid "Wildwood Nest"
msgstr "Nido Bosquesalvaje"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Almost anyone who seeks to travel from Empire to Soromid space, or the other "
"way around, stops by Wildwood on the way. It's a long haul and Wildwood is "
"one of the sparse providers of refuelling along the route. While mainly a "
"commercially oriented installation, Wildwood is also home to a small Soromid "
"military outpost. The ships stationed here provide a bare minimum of "
"protection to the traffic that passes through the system."
msgstr ""
"Casi todos los que pretenden viajar desde Dvaered al espacio Soromida, o al "
"revés, hacen una parada en Bosquesalvaje por el camino. Es un trayecto largo "
"y Bosquesalvaje es uno de los escasos proveedores de combustible a lo largo "
"de la ruta. Aunque es una instalación orientada principalmente al comercio, "
"Bosquesalvaje también alberga un pequeño puesto militar Soromida. Las naves "
"estacionadas aquí proporcionan un mínimo de protección al tráfico que pasa "
"por el sistema."

msgid ""
"Ships need fuel, so do their captains. Wildwood's spacedock bar, though "
"modest, offers visiting captains a respectable choice in beverages and "
"pastimes before they have to move on."
msgstr ""
"Las naves necesitan combustible, y sus capitanes también. El bar del muelle "
"de Bosquesalvaje, aunque modesto, ofrece a los capitanes visitantes una "
"respetable oferta de bebidas y pasatiempos antes de que tengan que seguir "
"adelante."

msgid "Wolf I"
msgstr "Lobo I"

msgid "Wolf II"
msgstr "Lobo II"

msgid "Wolf VII"
msgstr "Lobo VII"

msgid "Wonclock"
msgstr "Wonclock"

msgid ""
"The Soromid have more or less stabilized as a genetically modified offshoot "
"from humanity, but that doesn't mean research into genetic alteration isn't "
"still ongoing. Wonclok hosts one of the largest bioresearch centres in "
"Soromid space. Many of the commercially sold gene treatments were developed "
"here, and being a researcher on Wonclok carries a lot of prestige with the "
"Soromid."
msgstr ""
"Los Soromida se han estabilizado más o menos como una rama genéticamente "
"modificada de la humanidad, pero eso no significa que no se siga "
"investigando la alteración genética. Wonclok alberga uno de los mayores "
"centros de investigación biológica del espacio Soromida. Muchos de los "
"tratamientos genéticos que se venden comercialmente se desarrollaron aquí, y "
"ser investigador en Wonclok conlleva mucho prestigio entre los Soromida."

msgid ""
"Being such an important location for Soromid society, security on Wonclok is "
"pretty tight. In particular, visitors have their background checked, to make "
"sure they're not here with a Za'lek agenda. The spaceport bar can only be "
"accessed after pilots have passed all the security protocols."
msgstr ""
"Al ser un lugar tan importante para la sociedad Soromida, la seguridad en "
"Wonclok es bastante estricta. En particular, se comprueban los antecedentes "
"de los visitantes, para asegurarse de que no están aquí con una agenda "
"Za'lek. Sólo se puede acceder al bar del puerto espacial después de que los "
"pilotos hayan superado todos los protocolos de seguridad."

msgid "Worgen"
msgstr "Worgen"

msgid "Wormhole Carrza"
msgstr "Agujero de Gusano Carrza"

msgid "#bWormhole#0"
msgstr "#bAgujero de gusano#0"

msgid "Wormhole"
msgstr "Agujero de gusano"

msgid "Wormhole Ivella"
msgstr "Agujero de Gusano Ivella"

msgid "Wormhole NGC-13674"
msgstr "Agujero de gusano NGC-13674"

msgid "Wormhole NGC-15670"
msgstr "Agujero de gusano NGC-15670"

msgid "Wormhole NGC-1931"
msgstr "Agujero de gusano NGC-1931"

msgid "Wormhole NGC-4087"
msgstr "Agujero de gusano NGC-4087"

msgid "Wormhole Rei"
msgstr "Agujero de Gusano Rei"

msgid "Wormhole Surano"
msgstr "Agujero de Gusano Surano"

msgid "Wormhole Zied"
msgstr "Agujero de Gusano Zied"

msgid "Worscha"
msgstr "Worscha"

msgid ""
"Worscha is a relatively wealthy Sirian world with a mild climate and "
"pleasant planetary conditions. Its rotation is a bit on the long side, about "
"25% longer than that of old Earth, which has led to the daily rhythm being a "
"little slower than elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Worscha es un mundo Sirio relativamente rico, con un clima suave y "
"condiciones planetarias agradables. Su rotación es un poco larga, "
"aproximadamente un 25% más larga que la de la vieja Tierra, lo que ha "
"provocado que el ritmo diario sea un poco más lento que en otros lugares."

msgid ""
"Many Sirian bars have some sort of layout separation for the various "
"echelons, but Worscha's bar doesn't have anything of the sort. This "
"sometimes leads to Sirian traders getting confused, as they are used to "
"placing themselves in the correct section of the bar."
msgstr ""
"Muchos bares de Sirio tienen algún tipo de separación de disposición para "
"los distintos escalones, pero el bar de Worscha no tiene nada de eso. Esto "
"hace que a veces los comerciantes Sirio se confundan, ya que están "
"acostumbrados a colocarse en la sección correcta del bar."

msgid "WSTHVN D-1"
msgstr "WSTHVN D-1"

msgid ""
"Although scanners pick up traces of rare minerals, an impressive layer of "
"unstable regolith and constant micro-meteor impacts, plus a less-than-"
"impressive location, have left the source of the minerals intact. There have "
"been several proposals on the realization of the planet's mining and "
"terraforming potential, but they seem to be more of a pipe dream than "
"anything that can be made into reality."
msgstr ""

msgid "WSTHVN P-1"
msgstr "WSTHVN P-1"

msgid ""
"Although designated as an emergency source of water by House Za'lek, WSTHVN "
"P-1 has never yet had to be used in such ways. It's not clear how the planet "
"developed, but it seems to consist of a small ultra-dense core covered in "
"hundreds of kilometres of ice. Za'lek scientists speculate that the ice is "
"of extraterrestrial origin, likely accumulated from stray nearby asteroids "
"or some other eccentric phenomena.\n"
"\n"
"Except for the odd PhD student or post-doc coming to try to do research, it "
"is mainly visited by individuals coming from Thaddius Terminals, although it "
"is not entirely clear what they are doing here."
msgstr ""

msgid "Wunomi"
msgstr "Wunomi"

msgid "Wunomi I"
msgstr "Wunomi I"

msgid "Wunomi I-a"
msgstr "Wunomi I-a"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A small and dusty moon with no discernible atmosphere. There is a small "
"mining facility used to obtain materials for construction and operations on "
"Wunomi's World, but no resources useful enough to export to other systems."
msgstr ""
"Una luna pequeña y polvorienta sin atmósfera perceptible. Hay una pequeña "
"instalación minera que se utiliza para obtener materiales para la "
"construcción y las operaciones en el Mundo Wunomi, pero no hay recursos lo "
"bastante interesantes como para exportarlos a otros sistemas."

msgid "Wunomi's Moon"
msgstr "Luna Wunomi"

msgid ""
"Wunomi's Moon was originally a large asteroid that was adjusted and pushed "
"into orbit of Wunomi's World to give it a more Earthly look. Technically, it "
"is expected to crash into Wunomi's World in roughly 500 cycles, but the "
"local government has planned to make more major adjustments by decreasing "
"the mass to extend the period of orbit. Like Wunomi's World, Wunomi's Moon "
"is strictly controlled, with permission needed for most activities."
msgstr ""
"Luna Wunomi era originalmente un gran asteroide que fue ajustado y empujado "
"a la órbita del Mundo Wunomi para darle un aspecto más terrestre. "
"Técnicamente, se espera que se estrelle contra el Mundo Wunomi en unos 500 "
"ciclos, pero el gobierno local ha planeado realizar ajustes profundos "
"disminuyendo la masa para ampliar el periodo de la órbita. Al igual que el "
"Mundo Wunomi, la Luna Wunomi está estrictamente controlada, y se necesita "
"permiso para la mayoría de las actividades."

msgid "Wunomi's World"
msgstr "Mundo Wunomi"

msgid ""
"Wunomi's World is an old world that was colonized early for its similarity "
"with the now-gone Earth. However, unlike Earth, the governor wanted to keep "
"the planet in a less developed state, conserving much of its natural fauna "
"and beauty. Development was then taken to space, in which an enormous "
"geostationary ring was built, known as Wunomi's Ring. Only few cities remain "
"down on the surface, with much of the focus on managing tourism. Most of the "
"population lives in the ring which has gotten slightly crowded with the "
"Incident. However, Wunomi's World acts as an important local trade hub, and "
"work is still plentiful due to a somewhat strict population control system "
"designed to conserve the planet and by extension the ring's characteristic "
"nature.\n"
"As most of the population and cities are located on the ring instead of the "
"planet, it is closer to a station than a planet. Low gravity allows for easy "
"transpiration of bulk goods and encourages the sale of ships. For this "
"reason, it is easy to find many supplies tailored for traders."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The bar has a unique design where you enter through small vertical glass "
"elevator platforms directly from the Ring's main corridor. The room is "
"designed as a concave glass dome facing the planet, which provides an "
"incredible view of the splendour of Wunomi's World. Platforms with tables "
"and sofas are suspended throughout, making it look like almost some boats "
"floating at sea. Although confusing first, when you get used to it, you "
"begin to admire the architectural design and thought that went into bar."
msgstr ""
"El bar tiene un diseño único en el que se entra a través de pequeñas "
"plataformas verticales de ascensor de cristal directamente desde el pasillo "
"principal del Anillo. La sala está diseñada como una cúpula cóncava de "
"cristal orientada hacia el planeta, lo que proporciona una vista increíble "
"del esplendor del Mundo de Wunomi. Hay plataformas con mesas y sofás "
"suspendidos por todas partes, lo que hace que parezca casi como unos "
"barquitos flotando en el mar. Aunque al principio resulta confuso, cuando te "
"acostumbras empiezas a admirar el diseño arquitectónico y el pensamiento que "
"se ha puesto en el bar."

msgid "Wyrmwood"
msgstr "Wyrmwood"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Wyrmwood is extremely well camouflaged in the asteroid field of Octantis, "
"and for this reason it was only colonized fairly recently. Being surrounded "
"and constantly pummelled by asteroids, one would think that Wyrmwood would "
"not be able to sustain and develop life, however, it has significantly "
"adapted and the ecosystem is based around nutrients and resources unearthed "
"by the constant battering. The Soromid have also quickly adapted to life "
"here and a rich and prosperous research community exists mainly in the "
"depths of the oceans to minimize the risk of a direct asteroid impact. The "
"locals are, in general, somewhat oblivious to the surrounding galaxy and are "
"mainly focused on happenings at Wyrmwood."
msgstr ""
"Wyrmwood está extremadamente bien camuflado en el campo de asteroides de "
"Octantis, y por esta razón sólo fue colonizado recientemente. Al estar "
"rodeada y constantemente azotada por asteroides, cabría pensar que Wyrmwood "
"no sería capaz de sustentar y desarrollar la vida; sin embargo, se ha "
"adaptado significativamente y el ecosistema se basa en nutrientes y recursos "
"desenterrados por el constante azote. Los Soromida también se han adaptado "
"rápidamente a la vida aquí y existe una rica y próspera comunidad de "
"investigación principalmente en las profundidades de los océanos para "
"minimizar el riesgo de un impacto de asteroide directo. Los lugareños son, "
"en general, algo ajenos a la galaxia que les rodea y se centran "
"principalmente en los sucesos de Wyrmwood."

msgid ""
"The bar is extremely dimly lit as the locals have been genetically modified "
"to have extremely sensitive low-light vision, although some hovering lamp "
"globes can be borrowed by visitors that are not as well adapted. The "
"atmosphere is very quiet which contrasts starkly with the occasional boom of "
"an asteroid impact on the surface of the planet."
msgstr ""
"El bar está muy poco iluminado, ya que los lugareños han sido modificados "
"genéticamente para tener una visión extremadamente sensible con poca luz, "
"aunque los visitantes que no estén tan bien adaptados pueden tomar prestadas "
"algunas bombillas flotantes. El ambiente es muy tranquilo, lo que contrasta "
"con el estruendo ocasional del impacto de un asteroide en la superficie del "
"planeta."

msgid "Xavier"
msgstr "Xavier"

msgid "XO-4"
msgstr "XO-4"

msgid "Yak Nest"
msgstr "Nido Yak"

msgid ""
"This military station was originally supposed to be built in the "
"neighbouring system of Bonanza, but the Soromid military chose to change the "
"location for reasons of logistics. Hasselt has several inhabited planets, "
"and in-system supply routes are always easier to maintain than routes "
"leading through a jump point."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación militar iba a construirse originalmente en el sistema vecino "
"de Bonanza, pero los militares Soromida optaron por cambiar la ubicación por "
"razones de logística. Hasselt tiene varios planetas habitados, y las rutas "
"de suministro dentro del sistema son siempre más fáciles de mantener que las "
"rutas que pasan por un punto de salto."

msgid ""
"Most of the people in this bar are Soromid soldiers. There are few officers, "
"since they have their own facility elsewhere on the station."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de la gente de este bar son soldados Soromida. Hay pocos "
"oficiales, ya que tienen sus propias instalaciones en otra parte de la "
"estación."

msgid "Yaroslav Farming Station"
msgstr "Estación Granja Yaroslav"

msgid ""
"This farming facility provides the nearby systems with food. Due to the "
"heavy plasma storm activity in the system, it is generally easier to mass-"
"produce vegetation in specially sealed stations with a fully controlled "
"environment, instead of risking low yields on planets. The Yaroslav Farming "
"Station is so successful at production, that although some of the produce is "
"shipped to the nearby world of Boowoy, the majority is traded out of system."
msgstr ""
"Esta instalación agrícola abastece de alimentos a los sistemas cercanos. "
"Debido a la intensa actividad de las tormentas de plasma en el sistema, "
"suele ser más fácil producir vegetación en masa en estaciones especialmente "
"selladas con un entorno totalmente controlado, en lugar de arriesgarse a "
"obtener bajos rendimientos en los planetas. La Estación Agrícola de Yaroslav "
"tiene tanto éxito en la producción que, aunque parte de los productos se "
"envían al cercano mundo de Boowoy, la mayor parte se comercializa fuera del "
"sistema."

msgid ""
"Most visitors to this spaceport bar are here for the same reason. They want "
"to buy food so they can sell it at a planet that imports it for a profit. "
"Some merchants time their purchase right after one of the harvests that "
"happen once every dozen decaperiods or so to get the lowest prices possible."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los visitantes de este bar del puerto espacial están aquí por "
"la misma razón. Quieren comprar comida para poder venderla en un planeta que "
"la importe con beneficio. Algunos comerciantes programan su compra justo "
"después de una de las cosechas que se producen una vez cada doce "
"decaperíodos o así para conseguir los precios más bajos posibles."

msgid "Yetmer-O'rez"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Once a buzzing metropolis of House Yetmr-O'rez, the constant war has left "
"the planet all but unrecognizable. Where there were once abundant Opera "
"Houses and signs of excessive opulence, now there are anti-air defenses set "
"up in ruins, while commandos battle it out in the skeletons of what was once "
"a prosperous society. It is not a place to dawdle in, as the battle "
"attrition has blurred the line between friend and foe, and you never know "
"when some artillery fire or sniper shots may be headed your way."
msgstr ""

msgid "Yrina"
msgstr "Yrina"

msgid ""
"Yrina is a resource world that's being strip-mined by the Sirii. The climate "
"is harsh and almost all of the planet's surface is frozen, but in some cases "
"that is actually desirable, as substances that would normally be fluid are "
"now solid, and therefore mined more easily. Yrina supplies mostly Aesir, but "
"some of the more exotic elements are exported to other parts of Sirius "
"space, and beyond."
msgstr ""
"Yrina es un mundo de recursos que está siendo explotado por los Sirio. El "
"clima es duro y casi toda la superficie del planeta está congelada, pero en "
"algunos casos eso es realmente deseable, ya que las sustancias que "
"normalmente serían fluidas son ahora sólidas, y por lo tanto se extraen más "
"fácilmente. Yrina suministra principalmente a Aesir, pero algunos de los "
"elementos más exóticos se exportan a otras partes del espacio de Sirio, y "
"más allá."

msgid ""
"The bar has various displays that provide the patrons with details about the "
"mining process, and the current state of the operation in various areas. "
"Though to most visitors it is of passing interest at best, you've got to at "
"least hand it to the Sirius that they take an informative approach to their "
"operation here."
msgstr ""
"El bar cuenta con varios expositores que ofrecen a los clientes detalles "
"sobre el proceso de extracción y el estado actual de la operación en "
"diversas áreas. Aunque para la mayoría de los visitantes es un interés "
"pasajero en el mejor de los casos, hay que reconocer que Sirio tiene un "
"enfoque informativo de su operación."

msgid "Zaals"
msgstr "Zaals"

msgid ""
"A bit of an odd planet, Zaals has a rotational period almost (but not quite) "
"identical to its orbital period. One day on Zaals lasts many, many cycles. "
"The Soromid habitation here has been built on the side facing the sun, where "
"conditions are still acceptable. It's actually the second iteration of the "
"settlement, as the first iteration has begun to slip into the dark side. The "
"current settlement is predicted to stay in the light for another forty "
"cycles."
msgstr ""
"Zaals, un planeta un poco extraño, tiene un periodo de rotación casi (pero "
"no del todo) idéntico a su periodo orbital. Un día en Zaals dura muchos, "
"muchos ciclos. La vivienda de los Soromida aquí se ha construido en el lado "
"que da al sol, donde las condiciones son todavía aceptables. En realidad es "
"la segunda iteración del asentamiento, ya que la primera iteración ha "
"comenzado a deslizarse hacia el lado oscuro. Se prevé que el asentamiento "
"actual permanezca en la luz durante otros cuarenta ciclos."

msgid ""
"This spaceport bar offers excursions to the old, abandoned spaceport that's "
"in the twilight zone of the planet. To some adventurous types it can be "
"quite thrilling to roam around such a large complex that has been completely "
"left to the elements."
msgstr ""
"Este bar del puerto espacial ofrece excursiones al viejo y abandonado puerto "
"espacial que se encuentra en la zona crepuscular del planeta. Para algunos "
"aventureros puede ser muy emocionante recorrer un complejo tan grande que ha "
"sido abandonado completamente a la intemperie."

msgid "Zabween Outpost"
msgstr "Puesto de Avanzada Zabween"

msgid ""
"Zabween outpost is an old station. It was first created as an outpost to "
"fight piracy but with the destruction of the Haven it has settled into a "
"more traditional role. It presently functions as a largely commercial "
"station, trading in many commodities, while also keeping on eye on the "
"Soromid border. It keeps a museum with all sorts of ships and weapons that "
"were used in the final fight against Haven."
msgstr ""
"El puesto de avanzada Zabween es una estación antigua. En un principio se "
"creó como puesto de avanzada para luchar contra la piratería, pero con la "
"destrucción de Refugio se ha asentado en un papel más tradicional. En la "
"actualidad funciona como una estación principalmente comercial, que comercia "
"con muchas mercancías, al tiempo que vigila la frontera Soromida. Mantiene "
"un museo con todo tipo de naves y armas que se utilizaron en la lucha final "
"contra Refugio."

msgid ""
"The bar walls are decorated with pictures of Empire soldiers who have fallen "
"in the fight against Haven and piracy in general. It has become customary "
"for the Empire to post pictures of the fallen, honouring those who gave "
"their lives protecting the Empire's ideals. They are working on another "
"addition to be able to fit more pictures."
msgstr ""
"Las paredes del bar están decoradas con fotos de los soldados del Imperio "
"que han caído en la lucha contra Refugio y la piratería en general. Se ha "
"convertido en una costumbre del Imperio colocar fotos de los caídos, en "
"honor a los que dieron su vida protegiendo los ideales del Imperio. Están "
"trabajando en otra adición para poder colocar más fotos."

msgid "Zalebus"
msgstr "Zalebus"

msgid ""
"Zalebus is a nice planet that was terraformed by the Soromid shortly before "
"the Incident. It was a borderline class M to begin with, so the process was "
"one of the fastest in human history. Now, there are billions of people "
"living here."
msgstr ""
"Zalebus es un bonito planeta que fue terraformado por los Soromida poco "
"antes del Incidente. Para empezar, era un planeta de clase M, por lo que el "
"proceso fue uno de los más rápidos de la historia de la humanidad. Ahora, "
"hay miles de millones de personas viviendo aquí."

msgid ""
"The age demographic of Zalebus tends toward younger citizens. As a result, "
"the spaceport bar is often full of youngsters preparing for a trip into "
"space or just returning from one."
msgstr ""
"La edad demográfica de Zalebus tiende a los ciudadanos más jóvenes. Por "
"ello, el bar del puerto espacial suele estar lleno de jóvenes que se "
"preparan para un viaje al espacio o que acaban de regresar de él."

msgid "Za'lek II"
msgstr "Za'lek II"

msgid "Za'lek IV"
msgstr "Za'lek IV"

msgid "Zaren"
msgstr "Zaren"

msgid ""
"Zaren is a world where rare and valuable gasses are mined, to be used as "
"propellant by House Dvaered. It is one of the harshest planets in Dvaered "
"space, so convicts are the ones usually used to get the gasses necessary."
msgstr ""
"Zaren es un mundo en el que se extraen gases raros y valiosos, para ser "
"utilizados como propulsores por la Casa Dvaered. Es uno de los planetas más "
"duros del espacio Dvaered, por lo que los convictos son los que se suelen "
"utilizar para conseguir los gases necesarios."

msgid "Zazarin"
msgstr "Zazarin"

msgid ""
"Zazarin was a human habitable world to begin with, but it didn't get settled "
"until relatively recently. The reason for this is simple: it's an ugly "
"world. Nothing about it makes it in any way attractive. Its surface is "
"mostly flat, its sky is yellow with dust, its air is stale and its soil is "
"devoid of any materials of value. The only thing it has to offer is a large "
"amount of buildable real estate. That real estate is now being occupied by "
"heavy industry."
msgstr ""
"Zazarin era un mundo habitable para los humanos desde el principio, pero no "
"se asentó hasta hace relativamente poco. La razón es simple: es un mundo "
"feo. No hay nada en él que lo haga atractivo. Su superficie es "
"mayoritariamente plana, su cielo es amarillo por el polvo, su aire es "
"viciado y su suelo carece de materiales de valor. Lo único que ofrece es una "
"gran cantidad de terrenos edificables. Y ese terreno está ocupado por la "
"industria pesada."

msgid ""
"Reflecting the poor state of planet Zazarin, this spaceport bar is a sad "
"affair. The staff clearly don't feel motivated enough to do anything but the "
"bare minimum of maintenance, which has left tables rickety and chairs "
"broken. It's a miracle the basic facilities are mostly in working order."
msgstr ""
"Como reflejo del mal estado del planeta Zazarin, este bar del puerto "
"espacial es un negocio triste. Está claro que el personal no se siente lo "
"suficientemente motivado como para hacer nada más que el mínimo de "
"mantenimiento, lo que ha dejado las mesas desvencijadas y las sillas rotas. "
"Es un milagro que las instalaciones básicas funcionen en su mayor parte."

msgid "Zembla Shakar"
msgstr "Zembla Shakar"

msgid ""
"Zembla Shakar is like a resort for the elite within the Shakar system. The "
"people who live here live on gigantic estates that they usually haven't seen "
"all of. Most of the planet is off-limits to offworlders, and most traffic to "
"the planet consists of imports of luxury goods and exports of waste products."
msgstr ""
"Zembla Shakar es como un complejo turístico para la élite del sistema "
"Shakar. La gente que vive aquí lo hace en fincas gigantescas que, por lo "
"general, no han visto en su totalidad. La mayor parte del planeta está "
"vedada a los forasteros, y la mayor parte del tráfico hacia el planeta "
"consiste en la importación de bienes de lujo y la exportación de productos "
"de desecho."

msgid ""
"The bar is where traders wait until their cargo is loaded and unloaded. "
"Pilots who come here expecting a glimpse of the rich lands that cover the "
"surface of the planet will be disappointed, as there is very little to see "
"here."
msgstr ""
"El bar es el lugar donde los comerciantes esperan hasta que se cargue y "
"descargue su mercancía. Los pilotos que vengan aquí esperando echar un "
"vistazo a las ricas tierras que cubren la superficie del planeta se sentirán "
"decepcionados, ya que hay muy poco que ver aquí."

msgid "Zemur III"
msgstr "Zemur III"

msgid "Zeo"
msgstr "Zeo"

msgid ""
"Most of Zeo's habitation is recently constructed. After the Incident, real "
"estate prices had a major overhaul all across the galaxy and the once "
"neglected backwater world of Zeo quickly became prime land to settle for "
"Imperial citizens. Though the population is still on the low side compared "
"to older civilian worlds, the number of people living here rises by the day."
msgstr ""
"La mayor parte de la población de Zeo es de reciente construcción. Tras el "
"Incidente, los precios de los bienes inmuebles experimentaron una importante "
"revisión en toda la galaxia y el otrora descuidado mundo atrasado de Zeo se "
"convirtió rápidamente en tierra de primera para el asentamiento de "
"ciudadanos Imperiales. Aunque la población sigue siendo baja en comparación "
"con los mundos civiles más antiguos, el número de personas que viven aquí "
"aumenta cada día."

msgid ""
"Because of Zeo's abrupt rise in value after the Incident, the antiquated "
"facilities at the time had to be replaced to handle the influx of Imperial "
"colonists. As a result, most of the infrastructure here is relatively "
"modern. You won't find anything out of order or slow to respond in this bar."
msgstr ""
"Debido a la brusca revalorización de Zeo tras el Incidente, las anticuadas "
"instalaciones de la época tuvieron que ser sustituidas para hacer frente a "
"la afluencia de colonos Imperiales. Como resultado, la mayor parte de la "
"infraestructura aquí es relativamente moderna. No encontrarás nada que esté "
"fuera de servicio o que sea lento para responder en este bar."

msgid "Zepei"
msgstr "Zepei"

msgid ""
"Zepei has a modest native population, and a sizeable non-permanent "
"population. The surface of the planet is covered with holiday resorts, "
"nature parks and outdoor sports areas. Most of the vacation goers are "
"Soromid. Non-modified humans would find the recreational activities too "
"rough for comfort."
msgstr ""
"Zepei tiene una modesta población autóctona y una considerable población no "
"permanente. La superficie del planeta está cubierta de centros de "
"vacaciones, parques naturales y zonas deportivas al aire libre. La mayoría "
"de los asistentes a las vacaciones son Soromida. Los humanos no modificados "
"encontrarían las actividades recreativas demasiado duras para su comodidad."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The spaceport bar is not frequented much. The Soromid who come here on "
"vacation typically go straight to the terminals, and they constitute most of "
"the spaceport's traffic. The bar is used only by the captains of the supply "
"and trade ships that land on Zepei."
msgstr ""
"El bar del puerto espacial no es muy frecuentado. Los Soromida que vienen "
"aquí de vacaciones suelen ir directamente a las terminales, y constituyen la "
"mayor parte del tráfico del puerto espacial. El bar sólo lo utilizan los "
"capitanes de las naves de suministro y comercio que aterrizan en Zeppei."

msgid "Zero-Eleven"
msgstr "Cero-Once"

msgid "Zero-Five"
msgstr "Cero-Cinco"

msgid "Zero-One"
msgstr "Cero-Uno"

msgid "Zesta"
msgstr "Zesta"

msgid ""
"Mineral-rich, but unbearably hot, Zesta has been established as a high-"
"intensity mining colony by the Proteron. Water and ice taken from Amianta is "
"routinely used as part of the extraction process, and to prevent severe "
"burns to the miners."
msgstr ""
"Rica en minerales, pero insoportablemente calurosa, Zesta ha sido "
"establecida como una colonia minera de alta intensidad por Proteron. El agua "
"y el hielo extraídos de Amianta se utilizan habitualmente como parte del "
"proceso de extracción, y para evitar graves quemaduras a los mineros."

msgid "Zethus"
msgstr "Zethus"

msgid "Zhang Lu"
msgstr "Zhang Lu"

msgid ""
"Zhang Lu is a world with vast mountain ranges, the biggest of which reaches "
"almost a third of the way around the planet. The world is utterly "
"uninteresting for habitation even by Soromid standards, but the rugged "
"terrain is irresistible for people who like mountaineering. There are "
"countless peaks that have never been conquered, so tourists like to try and "
"be the first to climb one."
msgstr ""
"Zhang Lu es un mundo con vastas cadenas montañosas, la mayor de las cuales "
"alcanza casi un tercio de la superficie del planeta. El mundo carece por "
"completo de interés para ser habitado, incluso para los estándares de los "
"Soromida, pero el terreno escarpado es irresistible para las personas a las "
"que les gusta el alpinismo. Hay innumerables picos que nunca han sido "
"conquistados, por lo que a los turistas les gusta intentar ser los primeros "
"en escalar uno."

msgid ""
"The spaceport is built in a valley. The reason for this is that tourists "
"arriving will immediately be presented with mountains towering over them on "
"all sides, which really gets them in the mood. Unfortunately this location "
"is less than practical from a pilot's point of view, as having mountains all "
"around the spaceport severely limits the choice in approach vectors."
msgstr ""
"El puerto espacial está construido en un valle. La razón de ello es que los "
"turistas que llegan se encuentran inmediatamente con montañas que se elevan "
"sobre ellos por todos los lados, lo que les hace sentir muy bien. "
"Desgraciadamente, esta ubicación es poco práctica desde el punto de vista "
"del piloto, ya que el hecho de tener montañas alrededor del puerto espacial "
"limita mucho la elección de los vectores de aproximación."

msgid "Zhiru"
msgstr "Zhiru"

msgid ""
"Zhiru was once home to Eduard Manuel Goddard, the man who single-handedly "
"designed the then-revolutionary Goddard battlecruiser, and who would "
"establish the minor House Goddard. Now Zhiru has a booming spacecraft "
"industry, specialized in the creation and maintenance of the Goddard ships. "
"This is all possible due to the weak gravity and atmosphere that envelops "
"Zhiru, which allows the massive spacecraft to land and take off with little "
"difficulty."
msgstr ""
"Zhiru fue una vez el hogar de Eduard Manuel Goddard, el hombre que diseñó "
"sin ayuda el entonces revolucionario crucero de batalla Goddard, y que "
"fundaría la Casa Goddard, de menor importancia. Ahora Zhiru tiene una "
"floreciente industria de naves espaciales, especializada en la creación y el "
"mantenimiento de las naves Goddard. Todo esto es posible gracias a la débil "
"gravedad y a la atmósfera que envuelve a Zhiru, que permite que las enormes "
"naves espaciales aterricen y despeguen con poca dificultad."

msgid ""
"The Goddard Bar is, unsurprisingly, an obsolete model of their eponymous "
"ship, stripped and refitted in the form of a bar. It's surprisingly "
"comfortable and cozy as a bar, although every so often you can hear creaking "
"in the ancient metal frame."
msgstr ""
"El Bar Goddard es, como es lógico, un modelo obsoleto de su nave homónima, "
"despojado y reacondicionado en forma de bar. Es sorprendentemente cómodo y "
"acogedor como bar, aunque de vez en cuando se oyen crujidos en la antigua "
"estructura metálica."

msgid "Zintar IV"
msgstr "Zintar IV"

msgid "Zintar V"
msgstr "Zintar V"

msgid "Ziz"
msgstr "Ziz"

msgid "Zuner"
msgstr "Zuner"

msgid ""
"Zuner's surface has been dedicated almost entirely to crop growing. While "
"there are some urban centres scattered around the world, their population is "
"low compared to the residential megaplexes of more densely populated worlds. "
"Though the community is, to a large extent, agricultural, the inhabitants "
"are in no way out of touch with the rest of the galaxy and are, in fact, "
"quite wealthy, due to how lucrative Zuner's choice of food production is."
msgstr ""
"La superficie de Zuner se ha dedicado casi por completo al cultivo. Aunque "
"hay algunos núcleos urbanos repartidos por el mundo, su población es baja en "
"comparación con los megaplexos residenciales de los mundos más densamente "
"poblados. Aunque la comunidad es, en gran medida, agrícola, sus habitantes "
"no están en absoluto fuera de contacto con el resto de la galaxia y son, de "
"hecho, bastante ricos, debido a lo lucrativa que es la producción de "
"alimentos en Zuner."

msgid ""
"Many spacers think of agricultural worlds as backwater places that lag way "
"behind the rest of the galaxy. Sometimes, they are right, but not in the "
"case of Zuner. The spaceport is as modern as can be and its bar wouldn't be "
"out of place even in the Sirius core."
msgstr ""
"Muchos espaciales piensan que los mundos agrícolas son lugares atrasados que "
"van muy por detrás del resto de la galaxia. A veces tienen razón, pero no en "
"el caso de Zuner. El puerto espacial es todo lo moderno que puede ser y su "
"bar no desentonaría ni siquiera en el núcleo Sirio."

