msgid ""
"Alsafi II is a barren world that other than some indications of prospection "
"sites looking for mineral, is devoid of anything of interest, apart from a "
"small one-man druglab operation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A cold and barren inhospitable moon devoid of all life except for a small "
"base camp for terraforming the entire planet."
msgstr ""
"Una luna inhóspita, fría y estéril, desprovista de toda vida, salvo un "
"pequeño campamento base para la terraformación de todo el planeta."

msgid ""
"A cold and barren inhospitable moon devoid of all life except for a base "
"camp for terraforming the entire planet. You can see dust on the ground "
"vibrating as heavy machinery operates nearby."
msgstr ""
"Una luna inhóspita, fría y estéril, desprovista de toda vida, salvo un "
"campamento base para la terraformación de todo el planeta. Se puede ver el "
"polvo en el suelo vibrando mientras la maquinaria pesada opera cerca."

msgid ""
"A barren inhospitable moon devoid of all life except for a base camp for "
"terraforming the entire planet. You can see dust on the ground vibrating as "
"heavy machinery operates nearby. A weak atmosphere has started to form "
"around the surface of the planet."
msgstr ""
"Una luna inhóspita y estéril, desprovista de toda vida, salvo un campamento "
"base para la terraformación de todo el planeta. Se puede ver el polvo en el "
"suelo vibrando mientras la maquinaria pesada opera cerca. Una débil "
"atmósfera ha comenzado a formarse alrededor de la superficie del planeta."

msgid ""
"A mostly barren moon devoid of all life with a sprawling terraforming base "
"camp that is already visible from space. An atmosphere has started to form "
"around the surface of the planet and it seems like there are fungus and "
"bacteria starting to colonize the surface. There is a deafening background "
"noise of heavy machinery operating non-stop."
msgstr ""
"Una luna mayoritariamente estéril y desprovista de toda vida con un extenso "
"campamento base de terraformación que ya es visible desde el espacio. Se ha "
"empezado a formar una atmósfera alrededor de la superficie del planeta y "
"parece que hay hongos y bacterias que empiezan a colonizar la superficie. "
"Hay un ruido de fondo ensordecedor de maquinaria pesada que funciona sin "
"parar."

msgid ""
"A heavily terraformed moon with a large sprawling base camp clearly visible "
"from space. Despite the low gravity, there is a breathable atmosphere and a "
"diversity of simple life forms such as fungus and lichens are colonizing the "
"surface of the place. Faint sounds of heavy machinery operating under the "
"surface can be heard from all around the moon. It doesn't seem like a great "
"place to live at, but it has gone leaps and bounds from how the moon was "
"when you first landed on it."
msgstr ""
"Una luna fuertemente terraformada con un gran campamento base claramente "
"visible desde el espacio. A pesar de la baja gravedad, hay una atmósfera "
"respirable y una diversidad de formas de vida simples, como hongos y "
"líquenes, están colonizando la superficie del lugar. Desde los alrededores "
"de la luna se oyen débiles sonidos de maquinaria pesada operando bajo la "
"superficie. No parece un gran lugar para vivir, pero ha avanzado mucho "
"respecto a cómo era la luna cuando se aterrizó en ella por primera vez."

msgid ""
"The Antlejos V cantina is fairly loud and crowded with terraforming workers, "
"with the sound of heavy machinery near the moon core acting as background "
"music. The bartender says he is working on developing a local brew, but you "
"have no idea whether or not that is possible, nor if you even should brave "
"to drink it if distilled."
msgstr ""
"La cantina de Antlejos V es bastante ruidosa y está abarrotada de "
"trabajadores de la terraformación, con el sonido de la maquinaria pesada "
"cerca del núcleo lunar actuando como música de fondo. El camarero dice que "
"está trabajando en la elaboración de una cerveza local, pero no tienes ni "
"idea de si eso es posible o no, ni siquiera si deberías atreverte a beberla "
"si está destilada."

msgid ""
"A heavily terraformed moon with a large sprawling base camp clearly visible "
"from space. Despite the low gravity, there is a breathable atmosphere and a "
"diversity of simple life forms such as fungus and lichens are colonizing the "
"surface of the place. Faint sounds of heavy machinery operating under the "
"surface can be heard from all around the moon. It doesn't seem like a great "
"place to live at, but it has gone leaps and bounds from how the moon was "
"when you first landed on it. People have started to flock from other points "
"of the galaxy and a trade centre has recently begun operations."
msgstr ""
"Una luna fuertemente terraformada con un gran campamento base claramente "
"visible desde el espacio. A pesar de la baja gravedad, hay una atmósfera "
"respirable y una diversidad de formas de vida simples, como hongos y "
"líquenes, están colonizando la superficie del lugar. Desde los alrededores "
"de la luna se oyen débiles sonidos de maquinaria pesada operando bajo la "
"superficie. No parece un gran lugar para vivir, pero ha mejorado mucho "
"respecto a cómo era la luna cuando aterrizastes en ella por primera vez. La "
"gente ha empezado a acudir en masa desde otros puntos de la galaxia y "
"recientemente ha comenzado a funcionar un centro comercial."

msgid ""
"A heavily terraformed moon with a large sprawling base camp clearly visible "
"from space. Despite the low gravity, there is a breathable atmosphere and a "
"diversity of simple life forms such as fungus and lichens are colonizing the "
"surface of the place. Faint sounds of heavy machinery operating under the "
"surface can be heard from all around the moon. It doesn't seem like a great "
"place to live at, but it has gone leaps and bounds from how the moon was "
"when you first landed on it. People have started to flock from other points "
"of the galaxy, allowing for trade centre, and even a space ship dealer to "
"begin operations."
msgstr ""
"Una luna fuertemente terraformada con un gran campamento base claramente "
"visible desde el espacio. A pesar de la baja gravedad, hay una atmósfera "
"respirable y una diversidad de formas de vida simples, como hongos y "
"líquenes, están colonizando la superficie del lugar. Desde los alrededores "
"de la luna se oyen débiles sonidos de maquinaria pesada operando bajo la "
"superficie. No parece un gran lugar para vivir, pero ha mejorado mucho "
"respecto a cómo era la luna cuando aterrizastes en ella por primera vez. La "
"gente ha empezado a acudir en masa desde otros puntos de la galaxia, lo que "
"ha permitido que el centro de comercio, e incluso un comerciante de naves "
"espaciales, hayan empezado a operar."

msgid ""
"Ulios is a backwater world. Formerly a province of the Old Empire before the "
"Incident, the planet had recently declared its independence and was governed "
"by a small political elite headed by Baron Dovai Sauterfeldt. Shortly after "
"you dismantled the bulk of the Ulios defense fleet and took the Baron into "
"custody, the Empire moved a small military force into the Ingot system and "
"appointed a replacement governor. Now the government of Ulios is quickly "
"reorganizing into a typical Empire bureaucracy."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hypergate"
msgstr "Hiperpuerta"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The station consists of essentially one gigantic gambling complex. While it "
"is usually a very high-energy frenetic environment full of gambling, the "
"station seems to be in a partially locked down state full of Imperial "
"bureaucrats running around. It's not really clear what is going on, but at "
"least nobody seems to give you a second look so you are quite free to move "
"around the station."
msgstr ""
"La estación consiste esencialmente en un gigantesco centro de juego. Aunque "
"suele ser un entorno frenético y lleno de energía, la estación parece estar "
"parcialmente cerrada y llena de burócratas imperiales corriendo de un lado a "
"otro. No está muy claro lo que está pasando, pero al menos nadie parece "
"darte importancia, así que puedes moverte libremente por la estación."

msgid ""
"Like most of the station, the bar is directly built into the gambling "
"complex. It's mainly empty except for some bureaucrats and personnel who "
"seem to be taking a break from whatever they are doing."
msgstr ""
"Como la mayor parte de la estación, el bar está directamente integrado en el "
"recinto del juego. Está prácticamente vacío, salvo por algunos burócratas y "
"personal que parece tomarse un descanso de lo que sea que estén haciendo."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The station consists of essentially one gigantic gambling complex. While it "
"is usually a very high-energy frenetic environment full of gambling, the "
"station seems to undergoing renovation due to a hole being blown off the "
"side of it. Only the spaceport area is still available to the public, where "
"you can still buy horrible souvenirs if you are so inclined. Except for the "
"workers and the occasional tourist who didn't know the station was under "
"renovation, the station is mainly empty."
msgstr ""
"La estación consiste esencialmente en un gigantesco recinto de juego. Aunque "
"suele ser un entorno frenético y lleno de juegos de azar, la estación parece "
"estar siendo renovada, sobre todo desde que se abrió un agujero en uno de "
"sus laterales. Sólo la zona del puerto espacial sigue a disposición del "
"público, donde todavía se pueden comprar horribles souvenirs si uno se "
"siente inclinado a ello. A excepción de los trabajadores y de algún turista "
"ocasional que no sabía que la estación estaba en obras, la estación está "
"prácticamente vacía."

msgid ""
"Like most of the station, the bar is directly built into the gambling "
"complex. It's mainly empty except for some workers who seem to be taking a "
"break from whatever they are doing."
msgstr ""
"Como la mayor parte de la estación, el bar está directamente integrado en el "
"recinto del juego. Está prácticamente vacío, salvo por algunos trabajadores "
"que parecen tomarse un descanso de lo que sea que estén haciendo."

msgid ""
"The station consists of essentially one gigantic gambling complex. No matter "
"where you go, there seems to be gambling going on, that combined with the "
"constant coming and going of ships, creates a very high-energy frenetic "
"environment. When docking to the station there is a big neon says that "
"displays \"What happens in Limbo, stays in Limbo\". The station was "
"remodeled after an unexplained large explosion took out a large part of the "
"station.\n"
"\n"
"There seem to be a lot more shadier characters around the station than you "
"last remember. Could this be the result of the new CEO of Minerva Station? "
"Who could they be?"
msgstr ""
"La estación consiste esencialmente en un gigantesco complejo de juego. Vayas "
"donde vayas, parece que hay juegos de azar, lo que, combinado con el "
"constante ir y venir de naves, crea un ambiente frenético de gran energía. "
"Al atracar en la estación hay un gran cartel de neón que dice \"Lo que pasa "
"en el Limbo, se queda en el Limbo\".La estación fue remodelada después de "
"que una gran explosión inexplicable acabara con gran parte de la estación.\n"
"\n"
"Parece que hay muchos más personajes turbios por la estación de los que "
"recordabas. ¿Podría ser el resultado del nuevo director general de la "
"estación Minerva? ¿Quiénes podría ser?"

msgid ""
"The station consists of essentially one gigantic gambling complex. No matter "
"where you go, there seems to be gambling going on, that combined with the "
"constant coming and going of ships, creates a very high-energy frenetic "
"environment. When docking to the station there is a big neon says that "
"displays \"What happens in Limbo, stays in Limbo\". The station was "
"remodeled after an unexplained large explosion took out a large part of the "
"station.\n"
"\n"
"The station is currently under Dvaered rule, after a public hearing at the "
"Jade Court ended up removing the Independent status it had held after its "
"construction. This has lead to a larger affluence of Dvaered tourists and "
"military than you remember."
msgstr ""
"La estación consiste esencialmente en un gigantesco complejo de juego. Vayas "
"donde vayas, parece que hay juegos de azar, lo que, combinado con el "
"constante ir y venir de naves, crea un ambiente frenético de gran energía. "
"Al atracar en la estación hay un gran cartel de neón que dice \"Lo que pasa "
"en el Limbo, se queda en el Limbo\".La estación fue remodelada después de "
"que una gran explosión inexplicable acabara con gran parte de la estación.\n"
"\n"
"En la actualidad, la estación se encuentra bajo el dominio Dvaered, después "
"de que una audiencia pública en el Tribunal de Jade acabara eliminando el "
"estatus de Independiente que había ostentado tras su construcción. Esto ha "
"provocado una mayor afluencia de turistas y militares Dvaered de la que "
"recordabas."

msgid ""
"The station consists of essentially one gigantic gambling complex. No matter "
"where you go, there seems to be gambling going on, that combined with the "
"constant coming and going of ships, creates a very high-energy frenetic "
"environment. When docking to the station there is a big neon says that "
"displays \"What happens in Limbo, stays in Limbo\". The station was "
"remodeled after an unexplained large explosion took out a large part of the "
"station.\n"
"\n"
"The station is currently under Za'lek rule, after a public hearing at the "
"Jade Court ended up removing the Independent status it had held after its "
"construction. This has lead to an increased automation of the station, with "
"many service drones flying around to provide amenities to the hordes of "
"tourists, but you can't shake the feeling they are mainly used for "
"surveillance and control."
msgstr ""
"La estación es básicamente un gigantesco complejo de juego. Vayas donde "
"vayas, parece que hay juego, lo que, combinado con el constante ir y venir "
"de naves, crea un ambiente frenético y lleno de energía. Al atracar en la "
"estación hay un gran letrero de neón que dice \"Lo que pasa en el Limbo, se "
"queda en el Limbo\". La estación fue remodelada después de que una gran "
"explosión inexplicable acabara con gran parte de la estación.\n"
"\n"
"En la actualidad, la estación se encuentra bajo el dominio Za'lek, después "
"de que una audiencia pública en el Tribunal de Jade acabara eliminando el "
"estatus de Independiente que ostentaba tras su construcción. Esto ha llevado "
"a una mayor automatización de la estación, con muchos drones de servicio "
"volando alrededor para proporcionar comodidades a las hordas de turistas, "
"pero no se puede evitar la sensación de que se utilizan principalmente para "
"la vigilancia y el control."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Serving as the main consumer world on the Western fringe of Empire space, "
"Ian makes up for its small size by its wealth. The little sphere was quite a "
"pleasant place to live and many retiring Imperial officials and aristocrats "
"have made the place their home. And where wealth goes, industry follows - "
"Ian has its own modest ship construction facilities.\n"
"\n"
"The local community was shocked by what the Empire claims to be a terrorist "
"attack when several ships crashed head on in a residential area, killing "
"thousands. Although an Imperial investigation is underway, this has severely "
"hurt the planets popularity and reputation throughout space."
msgstr ""
"Como principal mundo consumidor en la franja occidental del espacio del "
"Imperio, Ian compensa su pequeño tamaño con su riqueza. La pequeña esfera es "
"un lugar bastante agradable para vivir y muchos funcionarios y aristócratas "
"Imperiales que se jubilan han hecho de este lugar su hogar. Y donde va la "
"riqueza, va la industria: Ian tiene sus propias y modestas instalaciones de "
"construcción de naves."

msgid ""
"Enveloped in a permanent abrasive and unpredictable planetary storm, it is "
"near impossible to get close to this planet's surface."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enveloped in a permanent abrasive and unpredictable planetary storm, it is "
"near impossible to get close to this planet's surface. You're determined to "
"make your first attempt the last, and stick to viewing the mesmerizing "
"patterns in the atmosphere from low orbit. Out of curiosity you try to see "
"if your scanners can pick up any remains of the Wolfie, but it seems to have "
"been grinded away into dust in little time."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The small research station has had minimal services restored to it, although "
"it is far from working at full power. Large plasma scars over the hull give "
"indication of the traumatic happenings in the station's recent past. There "
"also seem to be large bite marks around the docking bays, and especially the "
"fuel tanks."
msgstr ""
"La pequeña estación de investigación ha recuperado unos servicios mínimos, "
"aunque está lejos de funcionar a plena potencia. Las grandes cicatrices de "
"plasma sobre el casco indican los traumáticos sucesos del pasado reciente de "
"la estación. También parece haber grandes marcas de mordiscos alrededor del "
"astillero, y especialmente en los depósitos de combustible."

msgid ""
"What passes for the spaceport bar is a simple room labelled \"Storage Room "
"18\" with \"Mie's Friendly Bar!\" written on top. Inside you find all sorts "
"of weird beverages stored in beaker tubes and other scientific equipment. "
"Like the rest of the station, it is quite a mess with old research papers "
"littering the floor. However, it is not bad by Za'lek standards."
msgstr ""
"Lo que pasa por ser el bar del puerto espacial es una simple habitación "
"etiquetada como \"Almacén 18\" con \"¡El bar amistoso de Mie!\" escrito en "
"la parte superior. En su interior se encuentran todo tipo de bebidas "
"extrañas almacenadas en tubos de vasos de precipitados y otros equipos "
"científicos. Al igual que el resto de la estación, está bastante "
"desordenado, con viejos papeles de investigación tirados por el suelo. Sin "
"embargo, no está mal para los estándares Za'lek."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The small research station has had minimal services restored to it, although "
"it is far from working at full power. Large plasma scars over the hull give "
"indication of the traumatic happenings in the station's recent past. There "
"also seem to be large bite marks around the docking bays, and especially the "
"fuel tanks, which is now minimally operational."
msgstr ""
"La pequeña estación de investigación ha recuperado unos servicios mínimos, "
"aunque está lejos de funcionar a plena potencia. Grandes cicatrices de "
"plasma sobre el casco dan cuenta de los traumáticos sucesos del pasado "
"reciente de la estación. También parece haber grandes marcas de mordiscos "
"alrededor del astillero, y especialmente en los depósitos de combustible, "
"que ahora está mínimamente operativo."

