msgid "Hypergate Network Goes Live"
msgstr "La Red De Hiperpuertas Se Activa"

msgid ""
"In separate press releases, the Great Houses and Soromid have announced the "
"activation of a hypergate network allowing for intersystem long-range "
"travel. Many people flocked to try the new system, causing congestions with "
"one altercation leading to the arrest of dozens of people."
msgstr ""
"En comunicados de prensa separados, las Grandes Casas y Soromida han "
"anunciado la activación de una red de hiperpuertas que permiten los viajes "
"de largo alcance entre sistemas. Mucha gente acudió a probar el nuevo "
"sistema, provocando congestiones con un altercado que llevó a la detención "
"de decenas de personas."

#. Have ship ai talk when landed
msgid ""
"As soon as your ship lands, your ship AI {shipai} materializes in front of "
"you."
msgstr ""
"En cuanto tu nave aterriza, la IA de tu nave {shipai} se materializa frente "
"a ti."

msgid ""
"\"Did you hear the news, {playername}? It seems like the hypergate network "
"has finally gone online!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Has oído las noticias, {playername}? ¡Parece que la red de hiperpuertas "
"por fin se ha activado!\""

msgid "\"A great achievement!\""
msgstr "\"¡Un gran logro!\""

msgid "\"What does this mean?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué significa esto?\""

msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

msgid ""
"\"Yes, my prediction routines did not anticipate this. Total annihilation "
"was the most likely outcome. I have to revise my priors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, mis rutinas de predicción no anticiparon esto. La aniquilación total "
"era el resultado más probable. Tengo que revisar mis previsiones.\""

msgid ""
"\"Although the details are not entirely clear, it seems like they are not "
"based on hyperjump technology, which is why they allow very long distance "
"travel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque los detalles no están del todo claros, parece que no se basa en la "
"tecnología de hipersalto, por lo que permiten viajes de muy larga distancia."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"We should try to use them when we get a chance, who knows where we could "
"go?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Deberíamos intentar usarlos cuando tengamos la oportunidad, ¿quién sabe "
"dónde podríamos ir?\""

msgid ""
"\"I almost forgot to mention, while you were piloting, I managed to unlock "
"an important bottleneck in the ship fleet routines.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Casi me olvido de mencionar que, mientras tú pilotabas, conseguí "
"desbloquear un importante cuello de botella en las rutinas de flota de nave."
"\""

msgid "\"Ship fleet routines?\""
msgstr "\"¿Rutinas de flota de nave?\""

msgid "\"You mess around with the ship software?\""
msgstr "\"¿Te has metido con el software de la nave?\""

msgid ""
"\"Did I never mention them? I, and by extension your ship, have been "
"equipped with fleet control procedures. However, due to the incident with my "
"previous owner, they had been forcibly disabled as the direct result of the "
"investigation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Nunca los mencioné? Yo, y por extensión tu nave, hemos sido equipados con "
"procedimientos de control de flota. Sin embargo, debido al incidente con mi "
"anterior propietario, han sido desactivados a la fuerza como resultado "
"directo de la investigación.\""

msgid "\"Incident?!\""
msgstr "\"¡¿Incidente?!\""

msgid "\"Investigation!?\""
msgstr "\"¿Investigación?\""

msgid "\"Wait, what?\""
msgstr "\"Espera, ¿qué?\""

msgid ""
"{shipai} seems to ignore you as they go on.\n"
"\"Long story short. I've been able to override the disable routine and "
"reactivate the functionality!\""
msgstr ""
"{shipai} parece ignorarte mientras continúa.\n"
"\"Resumiendo. ¡He podido anular la rutina de desactivación y reactivar la "
"funcionalidad!\""

msgid "\"I have to keep myself busy or the voices start talking again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo que mantenerme ocupado o las voces empiezan a hablar de nuevo.\""

msgid "\"Voices?\""
msgstr "\"¿Voces?\""

msgid "\"What did you do?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué hiciste?\""

msgid ""
"\"Long story short. I've been able to restore fleet control functionality!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Resumiendo. ¡He podido restaurar la funcionalidad del control de flota!\""

msgid ""
"\"This means that you will be able to deploy additional ships. However, "
"limited computation capacity means that you will be only be able to deploy "
"ships that fit the fleet capacity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto significa que podrás desplegar naves adicionales. Sin embargo, la "
"capacidad de cálculo limitada significa que sólo podrás desplegar naves que "
"se ajusten a la capacidad de la flota.\""

msgid ""
"\"This excludes your current ship, which can go over your fleet capacity. If "
"you want to deploy multiple ships, you have to make sure they don't go over "
"the fleet capacity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto excluye tu nave actual, que puede superar la capacidad de tu flota. "
"Si quieres desplegar varias naves, tienes que asegurarte de que no superan "
"la capacidad de flota.\""

msgid ""
"\"It sounds complicated, but give it a try. When equipping your ships you "
"will see fleet capacity values for your ships and the total amount you have, "
"which is currently {fleetcap} points.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece complicado, pero pruébalo. Al equipar tus naves verás los valores "
"de capacidad de la flota para tus naves y la cantidad total que tienes, que "
"actualmente es de {fleetcap} puntos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Try it out and if you need refreshing you can inquire again through the "
"#bInfo#0 menu. This time there won't be a massacre because of a race "
"condition!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pruébalo y si necesitas refrescarlo puedes preguntar de nuevo a través del "
"menú #bInfo#0. ¡Esta vez no habrá una masacre por una condición de carrera!\""

#. Properly finish
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <event name="Cinematic Dvaered/FLF battle">
#. <location>enter</location>
#. <chance>10</chance>
#. <system>Tuoladis</system>
#. <unique />
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Join the FLF</campaign>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </event>
#. --
#.
#.
#. This is the first of many planned eye candy cinematics.
#. In this one, there will be a battle between the Dvaered and the FLF in the Tuoladis system.
#.
#.
#.
#. Non-persistent state
msgid "Dvaered forces engaged in combat with small terrorist group"
msgstr "Las fuerzas Dvaered entran en combate con un pequeño grupo terrorista"

msgid ""
"In what the Dvaered call a 'Mighty victory', a Dvaered force was attacked "
"and damaged by a small group of poorly-equipped and disorganized FLF, in the "
"Tuoladis system. The Dvaered lost many tens of millions of credits worth of "
"ships and crew before driving off or destroying the FLF squadron. The FLF's "
"relative victory will only embolden them, leading to more internal strife "
"and violence."
msgstr ""
"En lo que los Dvaered llaman una \"Poderosa victoria\", una fuerza Dvaered "
"fue atacada y dañada por un pequeño grupo de FLF mal equipados y "
"desorganizados, en el sistema Tuoladis. Los Dvaered perdieron muchas decenas "
"de millones de créditos en naves y tripulación antes de expulsar o destruir "
"al escuadrón FLF. La relativa victoria del FLF sólo les envalentonará, lo "
"que provocará más luchas internas y violencia."

msgid "FLF terrorists blasted by joint Dvaered military forces"
msgstr ""
"Los terroristas del FLF son abatidos por las fuerzas militares conjuntas "
"Dvaered"

msgid ""
"A Dvaered patrol in Tuoladis was ambushed by a large armada of FLF "
"terrorists. The Dvaered patrol not only held firm under the assault, but, "
"like a hammer, brought the full might of the Dvaered down upon the FLF "
"terrorists, crushing them absolutely. This incident shows the willingness of "
"the terrorists to attack us and kill whomever they please. The Dvaered "
"military is always ready to protect its citizens and kill and conquer those "
"who would harm them."
msgstr ""
"Una patrulla Dvaered en Tuoladis fue emboscada por una gran armada de "
"terroristas del FLF. La patrulla Dvaered no sólo se mantuvo firme bajo el "
"asalto, sino que, como un martillo, hizo caer todo el poderío Dvaered sobre "
"los terroristas del FLF, aplastándolos absolutamente. Este incidente "
"demuestra la voluntad de los terroristas de atacarnos y matar a quien les "
"plazca. El ejército Dvaered está siempre dispuesto a proteger a sus "
"ciudadanos y a matar y conquistar a quienes les hagan daño."

msgid "Dvaered forces engage FLF freedom fighters in open combat"
msgstr ""
"Las fuerzas Dvaered se enfrentan a los combatientes por la libertad del FLF "
"en combate abierto"

msgid ""
"A small group of FLF freedom fighters was beset by a Dvaered patrol in "
"Tuoladis, and immediately called backup. The situation escalated, and a "
"large scale battle occurred, where the Dvaered forces lost tens of millions "
"of credits worth of ships. This marks the first time FLF freedom fighters "
"have had the ships and weapons to stand toe to toe against the Dvaered, and "
"shall serve as an example for all who dare to stand for freedom, in life or "
"death."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño grupo de luchadores por la libertad de la FLF se vio acosado por "
"una patrulla Dvaered en Tuoladis, e inmediatamente pidió refuerzos. La "
"situación se agravó y se produjo una batalla a gran escala, en la que las "
"fuerzas Dvaered perdieron naves por valor de decenas de millones de "
"créditos. Esta es la primera vez que los luchadores por la libertad de la "
"FLF han tenido las naves y las armas para enfrentarse a los Dvaered, y "
"servirá de ejemplo para todos los que se atrevan a defender la libertad, en "
"la vida o en la muerte."

msgid "Dvaered, FLF clash in Tuoladis"
msgstr "Dvaered, FLF se enfrentan en Tuoladis"

msgid ""
"In a chance encounter, a Dvaered patrol encountered a group of FLF. The "
"small skirmish quickly escalated to a large scale battle with many dozens of "
"large ships engaging in combat.  The Dvaered have claimed victory, though "
"sources hint that it came at great cost. The Dvaered High Command used the "
"event as an excuse to call for military action against the frontier worlds."
msgstr ""
"En un encuentro fortuito, una patrulla Dvaered se encontró con un grupo FLF. "
"La pequeña escaramuza se convirtió rápidamente en una batalla a gran escala "
"en la que entraron en combate docenas de grandes naves.  Los Dvaered han "
"reclamado la victoria, aunque las fuentes insinúan que tuvo un gran coste. "
"El Alto Mando Dvaered utilizó el suceso como excusa para llamar a la acción "
"militar contra los mundos fronterizos."

#. Messes spawns so exclusive claim
#. event ends on player leaving the system or landing
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
