msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto"

#. Must be not-space worthy
#. Much more visible
#. Derelicts are obvious on the map either way, and we want to board on double click
#. In case of special event loaded, just use that
#. Roll for events
#. neuevent is a table of tables { {title of event, text of event, log of event}, {...}, ... }
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Derelict Rescue">
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. <location>None</location>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Derelict Rescue Mission
#.
#. Triggered by boarding a derelict ship. Just have to take the passengers to a nearby system to save them.
#. --
#. See if we got something
#. Can't find target so just make everyone be dead
msgid "Empty derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto Vacío"

msgid ""
"You spend some time searching the derelict, but it doesn't appear there are "
"any remaining passengers, nor is there anything of interest to you. You "
"decide to return to your ship."
msgstr ""
"Pasas un rato registrando el derrelicto abandonado, pero no parece que haya "
"ningún pasajero restante, ni tampoco hay nada de interés para ti. Decides "
"volver a tu nave."

msgid "You searched an empty derelict in {sys}."
msgstr "Has registrado un derrelicto vacío en {sys}."

msgid "Distracting Derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto Distrayente"

msgid ""
"This ship has clearly been abandoned a long time ago. Looters have been here "
"many times and all of the primary and backup systems are down. However, "
"there is one console that is still operational. It appears to be running an "
"ancient computer game about space exploration, trade and combat. Intrigued, "
"you decide to give the game a try, and before long you find yourself hooked "
"on it. You spend many fun periods hauling cargo, upgrading your ship, "
"fighting enemies and exploring the universe. But of course you can't stay "
"here forever and besides the chirping over the comms from your ship's AI, "
"{shipai}, is getting annoying. You regretfully leave the game behind and "
"return to the reality of your everyday life."
msgstr ""
"Esta nave ha sido claramente abandonada hace mucho tiempo. Los saqueadores "
"han estado aquí muchas veces y todos los sistemas primarios y de respaldo "
"están caídos. Sin embargo, hay una consola que todavía está operativa. "
"Parece estar ejecutando un antiguo juego de ordenador sobre exploración "
"espacial, comercio y combate. Intrigado, decides probar el juego, y al poco "
"tiempo te encuentras enganchado a él. Pasas muchos ratos divertidos "
"transportando carga, mejorando tu nave, luchando contra los enemigos y "
"explorando el universo. Pero, por supuesto, no puedes quedarte aquí para "
"siempre y, además, los chirridos a través de las comunicaciones de la IA de "
"tu nave, {shipai}, se están volviendo molestos. Lamentablemente, dejas el "
"juego y vuelves a la realidad de tu vida cotidiana."

msgid ""
"You searched a derelict in {sys} and ended up spending an inordinate amount "
"of time playing an ancient computer game!"
msgstr ""
"¡Registrastes un derrelicto en {sys} y acabaste pasando un tiempo "
"desmesurado jugando a un antiguo juego de ordenador!"

msgid "Eerie Derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto Escalofriante"

msgid ""
"You are exploring the derelict ship when you hear a strange creaking noise. "
"You decide to follow it to see what is causing it, but you never seem to be "
"able to pinpoint the source. After about an hour of fruitlessly opening up "
"panels, pressing your ear against the deck and running hull scans from your "
"own ship, you decide to give up and leave the derelict to its creepy "
"creaking."
msgstr ""
"Estás explorando el derrelicto abandonado cuando oyes un extraño ruido que "
"cruje. Decides seguirlo para ver cuál es su causa, pero no consigues "
"localizar el origen. Después de una hora abriendo paneles sin éxito, "
"presionando el oído contra la cubierta y realizando escaneos del casco desde "
"tu propia nave, decides rendirte y dejar que el derrelicto abandonado siga "
"con su espeluznante chirrido."

msgid "You searched an empty, creaking derelict in {sys}."
msgstr "Has registrado un vacío y chirriante derrelicto en {sys}."

msgid ""
"While exploring the cockpit of this derelict, you come across the captain's "
"logs. Hoping to find some information that could be of use to you, you "
"decide to play back the most recent entries. Unfortunately, it turns out the "
"captain's logs are little more than recordings of the captain having heated "
"arguments with her co-pilot. It isn't long before you decide you probably "
"aren't going to find anything worthwhile here. Having returned to your ship "
"{shipai}, your Ship AI, confirms there is little but \"emotional human "
"chatter\" in the captain's logs."
msgstr ""
"Mientras exploras la cabina de este derrelicto abandonada, encuentras los "
"diarios del capitán. Con la esperanza de encontrar alguna información que "
"pueda serte útil, decides reproducir las entradas más recientes. Por "
"desgracia, resulta que los diarios de la capitana no son más que grabaciones "
"de las acaloradas discusiones de la capitana con su copiloto. No tardas en "
"decidir que probablemente no vas a encontrar nada que valga la pena aquí. Al "
"volver a tu nave {shipai}, la IA de tu nave, te confirma que en los "
"registros de la capitana hay poco más que \"charla humana emocional\"."

msgid ""
"You searched a derelict in {sys} but found little but for \"emotional human "
"chatter\" in the captain's logs."
msgstr ""
"Registrastes un derrelicto en {sys} pero encontraste poco más que \"charla "
"humana emocional\" en los registros del capitán."

msgid "Wrecked Derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto Abandonado"

msgid ""
"This derelict is not deserted. The crew are still onboard. Unfortunately for "
"them, they didn't survive whatever wrecked their ship, neither did much of "
"their ship. Your ship AI, {shipai}, and you decide to give the crew and "
"their ship a decent space burial before moving on."
msgstr ""
"Este derrelicto no está abandonado. La tripulación sigue a bordo. Por "
"desgracia para ellos, no han sobrevivido a lo que sea que haya destrozado su "
"nave, ni tampoco gran parte de ella. Tu IA de nave, {shipai}, y tú decidís "
"dar a la tripulación y a su nave un entierro espacial decente antes de "
"seguir adelante."

msgid ""
"You found a wrecked derelict in {sys} and gave it and its crew a decent "
"space burial."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un derrelicto abandonada en {sys} y le has dado a ella y a su "
"tripulación un entierro espacial decente."

msgid "Empty Derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto Vacio"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This derelict seems to have been visited by looters already. You find a "
"message carved into the wall near the airlock. It reads: \"I WUS HEAR\". "
"Below it is another carved message that says \"NO U WASN'T\". Otherwise, "
"there is nothing of interest left on this ship."
msgstr ""
"Parece que este derrelicto ya ha sido visitado por los saqueadores. "
"Encuentras un mensaje grabado en la pared cerca de la esclusa. Se lee: \"YO "
"ESTAVO AQUI\". Debajo hay otro mensaje tallado que dice \"NO TU NO\". Por lo "
"demás, no queda nada de interés en esta nave."

msgid "You searched an empty derelict in {sys} and found only graffiti."
msgstr ""
"Has registrado un derrelicto vacío en {sys} y solo has encontrado grafitis."

msgid "Not-so-empty Derelict"
msgstr "Derrelicto No Tan Vacío"

msgid ""
"This derelict seems to have been, at one time, used as an illegal casino. "
"There are roulette tables and slot machines set up in the cargo hold. "
"However, it seems the local authorities caught wind of the operation; there "
"are scorch marks on the furniture and walls and assault rifle shells "
"underfoot. You don't reckon you're going to find anything useful here so you "
"leave."
msgstr ""
"Este derrelicto parece haber sido, en algún momento, utilizado como casino "
"ilegal. Hay mesas de ruleta y máquinas tragaperras instaladas en la bodega. "
"Sin embargo, parece que las autoridades locales se enteraron de la "
"operación; hay marcas de quemaduras en los muebles y las paredes y "
"casquillos de rifles de asalto bajo los pies. No crees que vayas a encontrar "
"nada útil aquí, así que te vas."

msgid ""
"You boarded a derelict in {sys} and found an ex-hive of illegal activity."
msgstr ""
"Abordaste un derrelicto en {sys} y encontraste una ex colonia de actividad "
"ilegal."

msgid ""
"When the airlock opens, you are hammered in the face by an ungodly smell "
"that almost makes you pass out on the spot. You hurriedly close the airlock "
"again and flee back into your own ship. Whatever is on that derelict, you "
"don't want to find out!"
msgstr ""
"Cuando la esclusa se abre, te golpea en la cara un olor impío que casi te "
"hace desmayarte en el acto. Te apresuras a cerrar la esclusa de nuevo y "
"huyes a tu propia nave. Lo que sea que haya en ese derrelicto abandonado, "
"¡no quieres averiguarlo!"

msgid "An ungodly smell stopped you from searching a derelict in {sys}."
msgstr "Un olor infernal te impidió buscar en un derrelicto en {sys}."

msgid ""
"This derelict has been really badly beaten up. Most of the corridors are "
"blocked by mangled metal and your ship AI, {shipai}, tells you there are "
"depressurized compartments all over the ship. There's not much you can do "
"here, so you decide to leave the derelict to itself."
msgstr ""
"Este derrelicto ha sido muy maltratado. La mayoría de los pasillos están "
"bloqueados por metal destrozado y tu IA de nave, {shipai}, te dice que hay "
"compartimentos despresurizados por toda la nave. No hay mucho que puedas "
"hacer aquí, así que decides dejar el derrelicto a su suerte."

msgid ""
"You tried to search a wrecked derelict in {sys} but there wasn't much left."
msgstr ""
"Intentaste buscar en un derrelicto destrozado en {sys} pero no quedaba mucho."

msgid ""
"The interior of this ship is decorated in a gaudy fashion. There are cute "
"plushes hanging from the doorways, drapes on every viewport, coloured "
"pillows in the corners of most compartments and cheerful graffiti on almost "
"all the walls. A scan of the ship's computer shows that this ship belonged "
"to a trio of adventurous young ladies who decided to have a wonderful trip "
"through space. Sadly, the ship's log tells you none of them really knew how "
"to fly a space ship, so they ended up stranded and had to be rescued. "
"Shaking your head, you return to your own ship."
msgstr ""
"El interior de esta nave está decorada de forma llamativa. Hay lindos "
"peluches colgando de las puertas, cortinas en cada mirador, almohadas de "
"colores en las esquinas de la mayoría de los compartimentos y alegres "
"grafitis en casi todas las paredes. Un análisis del ordenador de la nave "
"muestra que ésta pertenecía a un trío de jóvenes aventureras que decidieron "
"realizar un maravilloso viaje por el espacio. Lamentablemente, el diario de "
"a bordo te dice que ninguna de ellas sabía realmente cómo pilotar una nave "
"espacial, por lo que acabaron varadas y tuvieron que ser rescatadas. "
"Sacudiendo la cabeza, vuelves a tu propia nave."

msgid ""
"You searched a gaudily decorated derelict in {sys} and found the previous "
"occupants had already been rescued"
msgstr ""
"Registraste un derrelicto llamativamente decorado en {sys} y descubriste que "
"los anteriores ocupantes ya habían sido rescatados"

msgid ""
"The artificial gravity on this ship has bizarrely failed, managing to "
"somehow reverse itself. As soon as you step aboard you fall upwards and onto "
"the ceiling, getting some nasty bruises in the process. Annoyed, you search "
"the ship but without result. You return to your ship - but forget about the "
"polarized gravity at the airlock, so you, again, smack against the deck "
"plates."
msgstr ""
"La gravedad artificial de esta nave ha fallado extrañamente, consiguiendo "
"invertirse de algún modo. En cuanto subes a bordo, te caes hacia arriba y "
"hacia el techo, con lo que te llevas unos desagradables moratones. Molesto, "
"buscas en la nave, pero sin resultado. Vuelves a tu nave, pero te olvidas de "
"la gravedad polarizada en la esclusa, por lo que, de nuevo, te golpeas "
"contra las placas de la cubierta."

msgid ""
"Having searched a derelict in {sys} you remind yourself always to check the "
"gravity before boarding another ship. Ow."
msgstr ""
"Después de registrar un derrelicto abandonado en {sys} te recuerdas a ti "
"mismo que debes comprobar siempre la gravedad antes de subir a otra nave. Ay."

msgid ""
"The cargo hold of this ship contains several heavy, metal chests. You pry "
"them open but they are empty. Whatever was in them must have been pilfered "
"by other looters already. You decide not to waste any time on this ship and "
"return to your own."
msgstr ""
"La bodega de esta nave contiene varios cofres metálicos pesados. Haces "
"palanca para abrirlos, pero están vacíos. Lo que había en ellos ya debe "
"haber sido robado por otros saqueadores. Decides no perder el tiempo en esta "
"nave y volver a la tuya."

msgid "You found some empty chests on an empty derelict in {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado unos cofres vacíos en un derrelicto vacío en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"You have attached your docking clamp to the derelict's airlock but the door "
"refuses to open. {shipai}, your ship AI, tells you that the other side isn't "
"pressurized and the doors are trying to save your life. The derelict must "
"have suffered too many hull breaches over the years. It doesn't seem like "
"there's much you can do here."
msgstr ""
"Has acoplado tu pinza de acoplamiento a la esclusa del derrelicto, pero la "
"puerta se niega a abrirse. {shipai}, tu IA de nave, te dice que el otro lado "
"no está presurizado y que las puertas están tratando de salvar tu vida. El "
"derrelicto debe haber sufrido muchas brechas en el casco a lo largo de los "
"años. No parece que haya mucho que puedas hacer aquí."

msgid ""
"You tried to search an empty derelict in {sys} but your airlock doors and "
"the vacuum of space defeated you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Intentaste registrar un derrelicto vacío en {sys} pero las puertas de tu "
"esclusa y el vacío del espacio te derrotaron!"

msgid ""
"As you walk through the corridors of the derelict, you can't help but notice "
"the large scratch marks on the walls, the floor and even the ceiling. It's "
"as if something went on a rampage throughout this ship - something big, with "
"a lot of very sharp claws and teeth… You feel it might be best to leave as "
"soon as possible, despite your ship's assurances of sensing no signs of life "
"onboard, so you abandon the search and swiftly disengage your boarding clamp."
msgstr ""
"Mientras caminas por los pasillos del derrelicto, no puedes evitar notar las "
"grandes marcas de arañazos en las paredes, el suelo e incluso el techo. Es "
"como si algo hubiera hecho estragos en esta nave, algo grande, con un montón "
"de garras y dientes muy afilados... Crees que lo mejor sería marcharse "
"cuanto antes, a pesar de que tu nave te asegura que no percibe señales de "
"vida a bordo, así que abandonas la búsqueda y desactivas rápidamente tu "
"pinza de abordaje."

msgid ""
"You left an empty, torn-up (literally) derelict you found in {sys} system to "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Dejaste un vacío, desgarrado (literalmente) derrelicto que encontraste en el "
"sistema {sys} para sí mismo."

msgid ""
"Entering your airlock you see the derelict's own airlock, oddly, spiral open "
"onto a faintly-purple glowing, octagonal corridor. Noting this slightly "
"strange interior design choice you continue along the faintly radiating "
"corridor to find yourself in an octagonal (\"Truncated cuboctahedronal\" "
"chirps in {shipai}, your ship AI) room emanating a rather stranger purple-"
"green or green-purple eldritch colour. What furnishings you can see are "
"angular in a way that makes your eyes water. These design choices go from "
"strange too… \"Thump\"! You land on the floor(?) as you trip over your "
"gravity confused feet! Seriously!?! They rigged gravity to the outside "
"\"walls\" of the room!?! You decide it might be better not to discover "
"anything more about this ship without an appropriately equipped boarding "
"party, maybe one with a magician!"
msgstr ""
"Al entrar en la esclusa, ves que la esclusa del derrelicto se abre, "
"extrañamente, en espiral hacia un pasillo octogonal que brilla débilmente en "
"color púrpura. Observando esta extraña elección de diseño interior, "
"continúas por el pasillo que irradia débilmente para encontrarte en una "
"habitación octogonal (\"cuboctaedro truncado\", chirría en {shipai}, la IA "
"de tu nave) que emana un color púrpura-verde o verde-púrpura bastante "
"extraño. Los muebles que puedes ver son angulares de una manera que hace que "
"te lloren los ojos. Estas elecciones de diseño van de lo extraño a lo... "
"¡\"Golpe\"! ¡Aterrizas en el suelo (?) al tropezar con tus pies confundidos "
"por la gravedad! ¿¡En serio!? ¿¡Han instalado la gravedad en las \"paredes\" "
"exteriores de la habitación!? Decides que sería mejor no descubrir nada más "
"sobre esta nave sin un grupo de abordaje debidamente equipado, ¡quizás uno "
"con un mago!"

msgid ""
"An eldritch, possibly derelict, {shp} in {sys} system unnerved you, its true "
"story is no longer your concern, thankfully!"
msgstr ""
"Un espeluznante, posiblemente derrelicto, {shp} en el sistema {sys} te "
"inquietó, su verdadera historia ya no te preocupa, ¡afortunadamente!"

msgid ""
"Your airlock doors slide open starting, what turns out to be, the most "
"uneventful, dull, mundane, entirely-boring and mind-numbingly unhelpful "
"waste of time that any boarding of a derelict ship has ever been, it even "
"tempts you not to do this again on the off chance you run across another "
"such distressingly worthless derelict."
msgstr ""
"Las puertas de la esclusa se abren para dar comienzo a lo que resulta ser la "
"pérdida de tiempo más aburrida, insípida, mundana y poco útil que jamás haya "
"tenido un abordaje de un derrelicto, incluso te tienta a no volver a hacerlo "
"en caso de que te encuentres con otro derrelicto tan angustiosamente inútil."

msgid ""
"You became disenchanted with boarding derelicts on a ship in {sys}… next "
"time better to watch paint dry."
msgstr ""
"Te has desencantado de abordar a los derrelictos en una nave en {sys}... la "
"próxima vez mejor ver cómo se seca la pintura."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The derelict appears deserted, its passengers long gone. However, they seem "
"to have left behind a small amount of credit chips in their hurry to leave! "
"You decide to help yourself to the #g{reward}#0 and leave the derelict."
msgstr ""
"El derrelicto parece desierto, sus pasajeros se han ido hace tiempo. Sin "
"embargo, parece que se han dejado una pequeña cantidad de fichas de crédito "
"en su prisa por irse. Decides cogerlas y dejar el derrelicto."

msgid ""
"You found a derelict in {sys}, it was empty but for some scattered credit "
"chips. Lucky you!"
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un derrelicto en {sys}, estaba vacío salvo por algunas fichas "
"de crédito dispersas. ¡Qué suerte!"

#. between destroying a corvette / destroyer
#. Only insert factions that can still gain standing
msgid ""
"This ship looks like any old piece of scrap at a glance, but it is actually "
"an antique, one of the very first of its kind ever produced according to "
"your ship AI, {shipai}! Museums all over the galaxy would love to have a "
"ship like this. You plant a beacon on the derelict to mark it for salvaging "
"and contact the {fct} authorities. Your reputation with them has slightly "
"improved."
msgstr ""
"Esta nave parece un trozo de chatarra a simple vista, pero en realidad es "
"una antigüedad, ¡una de las primeras de su clase jamás producidas según tu "
"IA de nave, {shipai}! A los museos de toda la galaxia les encantaría tener "
"una nave como ésta. Colocas una baliza en la nave abandonada para marcarla "
"para su rescate y te pones en contacto con las autoridades de la {fct}. Tu "
"reputación con ellos ha mejorado ligeramente."

msgid ""
"In the {sys} system you found a very rare antique derelict {shp} and "
"reported it to the, happy to hear from you, {fct} authorities."
msgstr ""
"En el sistema {sys} encontraste un derrelicto abandonado antiguo muy raro "
"{shp} y lo reportaste, felices de saber de ti, a las autoridades {fct}."

#. Only give cargo if enough space
#. Uncommon
#. Rare
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You explore the empty derelict without much success. As you cross a hallway "
"you hear a weird echo of your footsteps. After some careful investigation. "
"You find that there is an entirely hidden cargo hold in the ship full of "
"{cargo}! This should fetch a pretty penny on the market. You load as much of "
"it as you can fit in your hold."
msgstr ""
"Exploras el derrelicto sin mucho éxito. Al cruzar un pasillo oyes un extraño "
"eco de tus pasos. Tras una cuidadosa investigación, descubres que en la nave "
"hay toda una bodega oculta llena de {cargo}. Esto debería valer un buen "
"dinero en el mercado. Cargas todo lo que te cabe en tu bodega."

msgid ""
"You found a derelict in {sys}, it had a hidden cargo hold full of {cargo}!"
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un derrelicto en {sys}, ¡tenía una bodega oculta llena de "
"{cargo}!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You explore the empty derelict without much success. As you cross a hallway "
"you hear a weird echo of your footsteps. After some careful investigation. "
"You find that there is an entirely hidden cargo hold in the ship full of "
"{cargo}! This should fetch a pretty penny on the market. You are able to "
"load all of it into your hold."
msgstr ""
"Exploras el derrelicto sin mucho éxito. Al cruzar un pasillo oyes un extraño "
"eco de tus pasos. Tras una cuidadosa investigación, descubres que en la nave "
"hay toda una bodega oculta llena de {cargo}. Esto debería valer un buen "
"dinero en el mercado. Eres capaz de cargarlo todo en tu bodega."

#. See if we should add maps
msgid "local system"
msgstr "sistema local"

msgid "Empire core systems"
msgstr "Sistemas principales del Imperio"

msgid "Za'lek core systems"
msgstr "Sistemas principales Za'lek"

msgid "Dvaered core systems"
msgstr "Sistemas principales Dvaered"

msgid "Empire-Soromid trade route"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sirius core systems"
msgstr "Sistemas principales Sirio"

msgid "Sirian border systems"
msgstr "sistemas fronterizos Sirio"

msgid "Frontier systems"
msgstr "sistemas Frontera"

msgid "Imperial Nebula edge"
msgstr "borde de Nebulosa del Imperio"

#. Make sure map names are valid
#. There are unknown maps
msgid ""
"The derelict is empty and seems to have been thoroughly picked over by other "
"space buccaneers. However, the ship's computer contains a map of the {smp}! "
"You download it to your own computer."
msgstr ""
"El derrelicto está vacío y parece haber sido minuciosamente revisado por "
"otros piratas espaciales. Sin embargo, el ordenador de la nave contiene un "
"mapa del {smp}. Lo descargas en tu propio ordenador."

msgid ""
"You found a derelict in {sys}, it was empty but the nav system contained a "
"{smp} map! Nice!"
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un derrelicto en {sys}, ¡estaba vacío pero el sistema de "
"navegación contenía un mapa {smp}! ¡Qué bien!"

#. If the player has little fuel left allow for refuelling
msgid ""
"The derelict appears deserted, with almost everything of value long gone. As "
"you explore the ship your handyscan suddenly picks up a back-up fuel tank "
"hidden in the walls. The fuel is in a good state and you siphon it off to "
"fill your own ship's fuel tanks."
msgstr ""
"El derrelicto parece abandonado, con casi todo lo de valor desaparecido. "
"Mientras exploras la nave, tu escáner de mano detecta de repente un depósito "
"de combustible de reserva escondido en las paredes. El combustible está en "
"buen estado y lo extraes para llenar los depósitos de tu propia nave."

msgid ""
"A derelict you found in {sys} was empty but for a reserve fuel tank you "
"fortuitously discovered!"
msgstr ""
"¡Un derrelicto que encontraste en {sys} estaba vacío de no ser por un tanque "
"de combustible de reserva que descubriste fortuitamente!"

#. If the player is low on health and not regenerating, offer armour repairs
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The derelict is deserted and stripped of everything of value, however, you "
"notice that the ship hull is in very good shape. In fact, it is rather "
"suspicious that a ship in such good repair became a derelict. Hushing "
"{shipai}, your ship AI, and without thinking too deeply about it, you strip "
"some of the hull components and are able to repair your own ship's armour."
msgstr ""
"El derrelicto está abandonado y despojado de todo lo que tiene valor, sin "
"embargo, observas que el casco de la nave está en muy buen estado. De hecho, "
"es bastante sospechoso que una nave en tan buen estado se haya convertido en "
"un derrelicto. Sin pensarlo demasiado, desmontas algunos de los componentes "
"del casco y eres capaz de reparar el blindaje de tu propia nave."

msgid ""
"The hull of a derelict you found in {sys} provided you with the resources to "
"repair your own, very useful in the circumstances!"
msgstr ""
"¡El casco de un derrelicto que encontraste en {sys} te proporcionó los "
"recursos para reparar el tuyo, muy útil en estas circunstancias!"

#. See if there can be a treasure hunt map
#. Make sure to generate it first
msgid ""
"You scour the deserted ship, which has been mainly picked clean by others, "
"and when you are about to give up and turn back, you find a small map tucked "
"in between some beams. Probably everyone missed it because it doesn't show "
"up on scans. Looks it leads to someone's cache. Might be worth checking out!"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You obtained a treasure map on a derelict you found in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado información sobre una anomalia de sensor a bordo de un "
"derrelicto en el sistema {sys}."

#. Run random good event
msgid "Oh no!"
msgstr "¡Oh no!"

#. So the pilot doesn't end the event by dying.
msgid ""
"The moment you affix your boarding clamp to the derelict ship, it triggers a "
"booby trap! The derelict explodes, severely damaging your ship. You escaped "
"death this time, but it was a close call!"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que colocas tu pinza de abordaje en el derrelicto, ¡se "
"activa una trampa explosiva! ¡La nave abandonada explota, dañando gravemente "
"tu nave. Esta vez te has librado de la muerte, pero ha estado muy cerca!"

msgid ""
"It was a trap! A derelict you found in {sys} was rigged to explode when your "
"boarding clamp closed! That was a little too close for comfort."
msgstr ""
"¡Era una trampa! ¡Un derrelicto que encontraste en {sys} estaba preparado "
"para explotar cuando se cerrara tu pinza de abordaje! Eso fue un poco "
"demasiado cerca para tu comodidad."

#. luacheck: ignore
msgid ""
"You board the derelict ship and search its interior, but you find nothing. "
"When you return to your ship, however, your ship's sensors finds there were "
"Space Leeches onboard the derelict - and they've now attached themselves to "
"your ship! You scorch them off with a plasma torch, but it's too late. The "
"little buggers have already drunk all of your fuel. You're not jumping "
"anywhere until you find some more!"
msgstr ""
"Abordas el derrelicto y buscas en su interior, pero no encuentras nada. Sin "
"embargo, cuando vuelves a tu nave, los sensores de tu nave descubren que "
"había Sanguijuelas Espaciales a bordo de la nave abandonada, ¡y que se han "
"adherido a tu nave! Las quemas con una antorcha de plasma, pero es demasiado "
"tarde. Los pequeños bichos ya se han bebido todo el combustible. ¡No vas a "
"saltar a ningún sitio hasta que encuentres más!"

msgid ""
"Space Leeches attached to a derelict you found in {sys} sucked your ship "
"empty of jump fuel before you could get rid of them! Rough break."
msgstr ""
"Unas Sanguijuelas Espaciales adheridas a un derrelicto que has encontrado en "
"{sys} han vaciado tu nave de combustible de salto antes de que pudieras "
"deshacerte de ellas. Un golpe duro."

msgid ""
"You affix your boarding clamp and walk aboard the derelict ship. You've only "
"spent a little time searching the interior when {shipai}, your ship AI "
"sounds a proximity alarm from your ship! Pirates are closing on your "
"position! Clearly this derelict was a trap! You run back onto your ship and "
"prepare to undock, but you've lost precious time. The pirates are already in "
"firing range…"
msgstr ""
"Colocas tu pinza de abordaje y subes al derrelicto abandonado. Apenas llevas "
"un rato registrando el interior cuando {shipai}, la IA de tu nave, hace "
"sonar una alarma de proximidad desde tu nave. ¡Los piratas se acercan a su "
"posición! Está claro que este derrelicto era una trampa. Vuelves a tu nave y "
"te preparas para el abordaje, pero has perdido un tiempo precioso. Los "
"piratas ya están a rango de tiro…"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It was a trap! Pirates baited you with a derelict ship in {sys}, fortunately "
"you lived to tell the tale, but you'll be more wary next time you board a "
"derelict."
msgstr ""
"¡Era una trampa! Los piratas te atrajeron con un derrelicto en {sys}, "
"afortunadamente viviste para contarlo, pero serás más cauteloso la próxima "
"vez que abordes un derrelicto."

#. Should naturally attack the player
#. Let the player capture them
#. Run random bad event
#. Failed to run
#. Must not have been done yet
#. Must have Wild Ones presence
#. Must have not gotten the pack yet
#. Must be a system the junker likes
msgid ""
"You board the derelict ship and begin a routine search to see if there's "
"anything left. Unluckily, it seems like the ship has been picked clean in a "
"surprisingly methodological way. Almost as if someone went room by room, "
"taking apart the most valuable parts, before progressing to the next room. "
"The precision of the disassembly is uncanny, and something you haven't seen "
"before in your travels."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You go about the ship, about to give up on finding anything useful, when you "
"find a weird mass of different ship parts sort of mashed together. In fact, "
"not only seemingly random ship parts, some of quite high value. Not wanting "
"it to go to waste, you decide to take it with you and leave the ship."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You found a meticulously cleaned up derelict in the {sys} system with some "
"weird Junker Pack that someone abandoned or perhaps forgot. Seeming rather "
"useful, you took it with you."
msgstr ""

#. Have gotten the pack already
#. Must be a system the junker likes
#. Must have not finished event already
msgid ""
"You board the derelict and suddenly feel a sense of déjà vu: the ship has "
"been stripped clean in a meticulous way you've only seen once before. How "
"strange..."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Wait, you get a signal that it seems like a ship is rapidly approaching your "
"location. A pirate trap?!?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You rush back aboard your ship before you get blown up into smithereens."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You boarded a derelict in the {sys} system and were ambushed by a strange "
"pilot known as \"The Junker\"."
msgstr ""

#. Don't give new POI until intro finished
#. Limit max amount of POI to 3 (or try to at least)
#. Tries to do the intro the first time
#. Failed to start
#. Failed to generate
msgid ""
"While the derelict itself has been picked clean. You manage to find some "
"interesting data regarding a sensor anomaly remaining in the navigation log. "
"It looks like you may be able to follow the lead to something of interest in "
"the {sys} system. Do you wish to download the data?"
msgstr ""
"Mientras que el propio derrelicto ha sido limpiado. Consigues encontrar "
"algunos datos interesantes sobre una anomalía de un sensor que quedan en el "
"registro de navegación. Parece que puedes seguir la pista a algo de interés "
"en el sistema {sys}. ¿Deseas descargar los datos?"

msgid ""
"While the derelict itself has been picked clean. You manage to find some "
"interesting data regarding a sensor anomaly remaining in the navigation log. "
"It looks like you may be able to follow the lead to something of interest in "
"what appears to be a nearby system. Do you wish to download the data?"
msgstr ""
"Mientras que el propio derrelicto ha sido limpiado. Consigues encontrar "
"algunos datos interesantes sobre una anomalía de un sensor que quedan en el "
"registro de navegación. Parece que puedes seguir la pista a algo de interés "
"en lo que parece ser un sistema cercano. ¿Deseas descargar los datos?"

msgid "Download the data"
msgstr "Descargar los datos"

#. Set up main options
msgid "Leave."
msgstr "Irse."

msgid ""
"You download the data and mark the target system on your navigation console. "
"With nothing else to do on the derelict, you leave it behind, and return to "
"your ship."
msgstr ""
"Descargas los datos y marcas el sistema objetivo en tu consola de "
"navegación. Sin nada más que hacer en el derrelicto, lo dejas atrás y "
"vuelves a tu nave."

msgid "You leave the information alone and leave the derelict."
msgstr "Dejas la información en paz y deja el derrelicto."

msgid ""
"You found information on a sensor anomaly aboard a derelict in the {sys} "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado información sobre una anomalia de sensor a bordo de un "
"derrelicto en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"You found information about a sensor anomaly aboard a derelict, but decided "
"not to download it."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado información sobre una anomalía de sensor a bordo de una nave "
"abandonada, pero has decidido no descargarla."

#. Success
#. Lower duplicates by ignoring active
#. Must not be psychic
#. Must have sirius presence
#. We want to prioritize "Eye of Night Mystery" start, so wait until the player knows sirius space a lot
msgid ""
"You carefully board the derelict and begin to explore the ship. Although it "
"has no power, the ship still has a breathable atmosphere once you make it "
"through the airlock. You start looking through the cargo hold, but it seems "
"to be picked clean."
msgstr ""
"Subes con cuidado a bordo de la nave abandonada y comienzas a explorarla. "
"Aunque carece de energía, la atmósfera de la nave es respirable una vez que "
"atraviesas la esclusa. Empiezas a buscar en la bodega de carga, pero parece "
"estar limpia."

msgid ""
"Eventually you make your way towards the cockpit, but something smells off. "
"When you finally open the door, a pungent odour assaults you, forcing you to "
"activate your external oxygen while you gag. It's a close call, but you "
"manage to keep yourself together."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente te diriges hacia la cabina, pero algo huele mal. Cuando por fin "
"abres la puerta, te asalta un olor acre que te obliga a activar el oxígeno "
"externo mientras te dan arcadas. Por poco, pero consigues mantener la "
"compostura."

msgid ""
"Regaining your senses, you make out some bodies in the room. A quick "
"inspection reveals that they are starting to decompose. There's nothing of "
"value, but you have to decide what to do next."
msgstr ""
"Al recobrar el sentido, distingues algunos cuerpos en la habitación. Una "
"rápida inspección revela que están empezando a descomponerse. No hay nada de "
"valor, pero tienes que decidir qué hacer a continuación."

msgid "Return to your ship"
msgstr "Regresa a tu nave"

msgid "Eject the bodies to space"
msgstr "Expulsar los cuerpos al espacio"

msgid "Notify local Sirius authorities"
msgstr "Notificar a las autoridades locales Sirio"

msgid ""
"You head back to your ship and notify the local Sirius authorities about the "
"issue. They thank you for the information."
msgstr ""
"Regresas a tu nave y notificas el problema a las autoridades locales Sirio. "
"Te agradecen la información."

msgid ""
"You decide to give the bodies a space funeral and eject them out of the "
"airlock, letting them float among the stars. With the deed done, you do a "
"second pass over the ship's interior and find a small credit chip that you "
"stash before heading back to your ship."
msgstr ""
"Decides dar a los cuerpos un funeral espacial y los expulsas por la esclusa, "
"dejándolos flotar entre las estrellas. Una vez hecho esto, haces una segunda "
"pasada por el interior de la nave y encuentras una pequeña ficha de crédito "
"que guardas antes de volver a tu nave."

msgid ""
"You decide that it's best to forget about the whole derelict and get back to "
"your ship. Nothing good can come out of this."
msgstr ""
"Decides que lo mejor es olvidarte de todo el derrelicto y volver a tu nave. "
"Nada bueno puede salir de esto."

msgid ""
"With everything settled, you sit in your captain's chair and are about to "
"get back to the controls when you are suddenly overcome by a horrible "
"headache."
msgstr ""
"Con todo resuelto, te sientas en la silla del capitán y estás a punto de "
"volver a los mandos cuando de repente te invade un horrible dolor de cabeza."

msgid "Memory"
msgstr "Memoria"

msgid "You feel a light breeze caressing you."
msgstr "Sientes una ligera brisa que te acaricia."

msgid "Is that..."
msgstr "Es eso..."

msgid "Is that the sound of the ocean?"
msgstr "¿Es ese el sonido del océano?"

#. TODO change music
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

msgid "It feels good."
msgstr "Te sientes bien."

msgid "Wait, someone is sitting next to you."
msgstr "Espera, hay alguien sentado a tu lado."

msgid "Who could they be?"
msgstr "¿Quién puede ser?"

#. vn.scene() -- vn.scene() is done in vne.flashbackTextEnd
msgid "You awake to your ship AI {shipai} looming over you."
msgstr "Te despiertas y la IA de tu nave {shipai} se cierne sobre ti."

msgid ""
"\"Are you alright, {pilotname}? You usually wake up after a single electric "
"shock, but this time you did not respond and had me worried.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Estás bien, {pilotname}? Sueles despertarte tras una sola descarga "
"eléctrica, pero esta vez no respondías y me tenías preocupado.\""

msgid "\"Electric shock?\""
msgstr "\"¿Una descarga eléctrica?\""

msgid "\"My head is killing me.\""
msgstr "\"La cabeza me está matando.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's great to have you back! Maybe you should get a doctor to look at your "
"head this time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Es genial tenerte de vuelta! Quizá esta vez deberías ir al médico para "
"que te mire la cabeza.\""

msgid ""
"{shipai} quickly dematerializes, leaving you alone with your throbbing "
"headache. It'll probably go away soon..."
msgstr ""
"{shipai} se desmaterializa rápidamente, dejándote solo con tu palpitante "
"dolor de cabeza. Probablemente desaparecerá pronto..."

msgid ""
"You notified the House Sirius authorities who took care of them for you. "
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You decided to give them a space burial and eject the bodies among the "
"stars. "
msgstr ""

msgid "You left the bodies as is. "
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You found some Sirius corpses aboard a derelict ship. {msg} Afterwards you "
"had a weird vision. Maybe you should start eating less expired space rations."
msgstr ""

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Home"

msgid "Human Made Divine"
msgstr "Lo Humano Convertido en Divino"

