msgid "You are needed for a special job"
msgstr "Se le necesita para un trabajo especial"

msgid ""
"The pilot of the fighter says, over an encrypted channel: \"I have finally "
"found you, {player}. Better late than never. My employers want to "
"congratulate you about how effective you have been with Lord Battleaddict. I "
"am afraid there won't be many people to mourn him.\" You answer that you "
"don't know what this is about, and that as far as you know, Lord "
"Battleaddict has been killed in an honest duel by the General Klank. The "
"interlocutor laughs \"You're playing your part, eh? I can understand you, "
"after all, they pay you well... Wait, no, they don't pay well. Not at all! "
"How much was it for risking your life twice with this EMP bomb trick? "
"{credits_01}? Haw haw haw! You can make better money with a cargo mission!\n"
"   \"I've even heard that once, they paid you with gauss guns! Those guys "
"are so pitiful, aren't they?\n"
"   \"Now, let's talk seriously: you want money and I want a pilot. We're "
"made to get along, you and me! I need you for a special task. I won't deny "
"it implies going against the interests of General Klank and Major Tam and "
"co, but if you do it well, they won't ever know that you are implicated, and "
"you'll receive {credits} in the process. Oh yes, that's different from what "
"you're used to! What do you say?\""
msgstr ""
"El piloto del caza dice, a través de un canal encriptado: \"Por fin te he "
"encontrado, {jugador}. Más vale tarde que nunca. Mis jefes quieren "
"felicitarte por lo eficaz que has sido con el Señor AdictoABatalla. Me temo "
"que no habrá mucha gente que lo llore\". Tu respondes que no sabes de qué se "
"trata y que, por lo que sabe, Señor AdictoABatalla ha sido asesinado en un "
"duelo honesto por el General Klank. El interlocutor se ríe \"Estás haciendo "
"tu papel, ¿eh? Puedo entenderte, después de todo, te pagan bien... Espera, "
"no te pagan bien. En absoluto. ¿Cuánto fue por arriesgar tu vida dos veces "
"con ese truco de la bomba EMP? {credits_01}? ¡Haw haw haw! ¡Puedes ganar más "
"dinero con una misión de carga!\n"
"   \"¡Incluso he oído que una vez te pagaron con armas gauss! Esos tipos son "
"tan lamentables, ¿no?\n"
"   \"Ahora, hablemos en serio: tú quieres dinero y yo quiero un piloto. "
"¡Estamos hechos para llevarnos bien, tú y yo! Te necesito para una tarea "
"especial. No voy a negar que implica ir en contra de los intereses del "
"General Klank y del Mayor Tam y compañía, pero si lo haces bien, ellos nunca "
"sabrán que estás implicado, y recibirás {credits} en el proceso. Oh sí, "
"¡bastante diferente a lo que estás acostumbrado! ¿Qué me dices?\""

msgid "Accept the offer"
msgstr "Aceptar la oferta"

msgid "Refuse and miss a unique opportunity"
msgstr "Rechazar y perder una oportunidad única"

msgid "Your task"
msgstr "Tu tarea"

msgid ""
"\"Very good choice, colleague!\" The pilot answers. \"Go to {system}, and "
"you will be hailed by another Vendetta for your briefing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Muy buena elección, colega!\" El piloto responde. \"Dirígete a {system}, "
"y serás llamado por otra Vendetta para informarte.\""

msgid "Too bad"
msgstr "Una pena"

msgid "\"I see. Stay tuned, then, maybe we will see each other again!\""
msgstr "\"Ya veo. Permanece atento, ¡quizás nos volvamos a ver!\""

#. Reaction to player's choice at first landing
msgid "You are a loyal citizen of House Dvaered"
msgstr "Eres un leal ciudadano de la Casa Dvaered"

#. Traitor
msgid "You tried to betray us"
msgstr "Intentaste traicionarnos"

msgid ""
"As you land, you see the Captain Leblanc at the dock and she reprimands you: "
"\"It was a trap, {player}. The fact that you fell into it proves that you "
"are disloyal. Disloyal and stupid by the way, as the trap was quite obvious "
"if I may add. And the High Command can not afford to work with disloyal and "
"stupid people. With regards to how well you have helped us in the past, we "
"will exceptionally let you live, but don't expect us to trust you anymore!\""
msgstr ""
"Al desembarcar, ves a la capitana Leblanc en el muelle y te reprende: \"Era "
"una trampa, {player}. El hecho de que hayas caído en ella demuestra que eres "
"desleal. Desleal y estúpido, por cierto, ya que la trampa era bastante "
"obvia, si se me permite añadir. Y el Alto Mando no puede permitirse trabajar "
"con gente desleal y estúpida. Con respecto a lo bien que nos has ayudado en "
"el pasado, excepcionalmente te dejaremos vivir, ¡pero no esperes que sigamos "
"confiando en ti!\""

msgid "Dvaered Military Coordination"
msgstr "Coordinación Militar Dvaered"

msgid ""
"Major Tam and Captain Leblanc, from the DHC, have tested your loyalty to the "
"General Klank... and you miserably failed. By chance, they did not kill you, "
"but you'll have to find other employers."
msgstr ""
"El Mayor Tam y el Capitán Leblanc, del AMD, han puesto a prueba tu lealtad "
"al general Klank... y has fracasado estrepitosamente. Por suerte, no te han "
"matado, pero tendrás que buscar a otros patrones."

#. Loyal
msgid ""
"As you land, you see the Captain Leblanc at the dock and she congratulates "
"you: \"I've heard good things about you, citizen {player}. It seems that you "
"have passed the test. You remained loyal to our general, in spite of the "
"absurdly high reward they had proposed to you for betraying us.\""
msgstr ""
"Al desembarcar, ves al Capitán Leblanc en el muelle y te felicita: \"He oído "
"hablar bien de ti, ciudadano {player}. Parece que has superado la prueba. "
"Has permanecido fiel a nuestro general, a pesar de la recompensa "
"absurdamente alta que te habían propuesto por traicionarnos.\""

msgid "The amount of your rewards is pathetic"
msgstr "La cantidad de tus recompensas es patética"

msgid "Money is not important, captain"
msgstr "El dinero no es importante, capitán"

#. Actually we don't care of the answer
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Money matters are secondary matters, pilot. One day you are rich, and the "
"next, you are poor. Valour, on the other hand, is the central matter of life "
"for valour contains all the other qualities a Dvaered must have:\n"
"   \"Righteousness to understand what has to be done,\n"
"   \"Loyalty to know who you can trust to help you in your duty,\n"
"   \"Strength to be able to do what Righteousness and Loyalty require you to "
"do.\n"
"   \"This demanding morale may require the Dvaered to risk their own lives "
"or to kill for the community, because the philosophy of House Dvaered is a "
"philosophy of life. And life does not come without its counterpart, death. "
"Being a Dvaered means to accept the ultimate rule of the universe, the "
"finitude of all things, unlike all the other factions, who hopelessly pursue "
"eternity. Eternity in the succession of Emperors, eternity in faith, "
"eternity in the progress of biological enhanced humanity. Their quest is "
"doomed to fail, creating weird and ugly monsters like the Empire, House "
"Sirius or the Soromid.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los temas de dinero son asuntos secundarios, piloto. Un día eres rico y al "
"siguiente eres pobre. El valor, en cambio, es el asunto central de la vida, "
"pues el valor contiene todas las demás cualidades que debe tener un "
"Dvaered:\n"
"   \"Rectitud para entender lo que hay que hacer,\n"
"   \"Lealtad para saber en quién puedes confiar para ayudarte en tu deber,\n"
"   \"Fuerza para ser capaz de hacer lo que la Rectitud y la Lealtad te "
"exigen.\n"
"   \"Esta moral exigente puede requerir que los Dvaered arriesguen sus "
"propias vidas o que maten por la comunidad, porque la filosofía de la Casa "
"Dvaered es una filosofía de vida. Y la vida no viene sin su contrapartida, "
"la muerte. Ser un Dvaered significa aceptar la regla última del universo, la "
"finitud de todas las cosas, ya que a diferencia de las demás facciones, que "
"persiguen desesperadamente la eternidad. La eternidad en la sucesión de "
"Emperadores, la eternidad en la fe, la eternidad en el progreso de la "
"humanidad biológicamente mejorada. Su búsqueda está condenada al fracaso, "
"creando monstruos raros y feos como el Imperio, la Casa Sirio o Soromida.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"House Dvaered has been built in respect of this ethic of life and death, "
"that is taught to all children around all worlds in Dvaered space. You did "
"not receive such an education and still, you passed the loyalty test. This "
"means that Dvaered High Command can trust you. As a proof of this trust, I "
"can reveal you what some among the army know, but was never revealed to non-"
"Dvaered.\n"
"   \"For one cycle now, the warlords have been greedily watching the "
"Frontier planets. Since the FLF has been destroyed, Dvaered High Command "
"does everything in its power to hold them back because we know that many "
"other factions are waiting for us to get entangled in a war in the Frontier "
"in order to hit us. But the purpose of warlords is to invade worlds, and the "
"role of the DHC is not to hinder that, so ultimately, we will have to allow "
"this invasion.\n"
"   \"A few decaperiods ago, General Klank had been promoted as second class "
"general, with the task to organize this invasion. The first invasion plan "
"that had been proposed to him was giving free rein to each warlord, allowing "
"them to choose which planet to invade and how to proceed. However, contrary "
"to the other generals, Klank soon realized that such a disorganized "
"invasion, with inevitable battles between warlords, would take several "
"periods, with a huge risk of ending up bogged down and vulnerable to attacks "
"on other fronts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La Casa Dvaered se ha construido respetando esta ética de vida y muerte, "
"que se enseña a todos los niños de todos los mundos del espacio Dvaered. Tú "
"no recibiste tal educación y aun así, pasaste la prueba de lealtad. Esto "
"significa que el Alto Mando Dvaered puede confiar en ti. Como prueba de esta "
"confianza, puedo revelarte lo que algunos en el ejército saben, pero que "
"nunca fue revelado a los no Dvaered.\n"
"   \"Desde hace un ciclo, los señores de la guerra han estado vigilando con "
"avidez los planetas Frontera. Desde que el FLF ha sido destruido, el Alto "
"Mando Dvaered hace todo lo que está en su mano para retenerlos porque "
"sabemos que muchas otras facciones están esperando a que nos enredemos en "
"una guerra en la frontera para golpearnos. Pero el propósito de los señores "
"de la guerra es invadir mundos, y el papel del AMD es no obstaculizarlo, así "
"que, en última instancia, tendremos que permitir esta invasión.\n"
"   \"Hace unos decenios, el general Klank había sido ascendido a general de "
"segunda clase, con la tarea de organizar esta invasión. El primer plan de "
"invasión que se le había propuesto era dar rienda suelta a cada señor de la "
"guerra, permitiéndoles elegir qué planeta invadir y cómo proceder. Sin "
"embargo, al contrario que los demás generales, Klank pronto se dio cuenta de "
"que una invasión tan desorganizada, con inevitables batallas entre señores "
"de la guerra, llevaría varios periodos, con el enorme riesgo de acabar "
"empantanado y exponiéndonos a ataques en otros frentes.\""

msgid ""
"\"This is why the General Klank proposed an effective invasion plan, that "
"requires coordinating the efforts of all the warlords, as well as supporting "
"them with a reserve fleet directly commanded by DHC. The problem is that "
"many warlords don't want the DHC to decide how they use their troops. The "
"most reckless of them was Lord Battleaddict, but there are also Lady "
"Bitterfight and Lord Jim. Now that the internal opposition to the plan has "
"been weakened with Battleaddict's death, we will move to the diplomatic "
"step. That is why you should expect to be summoned again by us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por eso, el general Klank propuso un plan de invasión eficaz, que requiere "
"coordinar los esfuerzos de todos los señores de la guerra, así como "
"apoyarlos con una flota de reserva comandada directamente por el AMD. El "
"problema es que muchos señores de la guerra no quieren que el AMD decida "
"cómo utilizar sus tropas. El más temerario de ellos fue el Señor "
"AdictoABatalla, pero también están Dama Bitterfight y Señor Jim. Ahora que "
"la oposición interna al plan se ha debilitado con la muerte de "
"AdictoABatalla, pasaremos al paso diplomático. Por eso debes esperar que te "
"convoquemos de nuevo.\""

#. Pay and finish the mission
#. Timer for the next mission
msgid "Frontier War"
msgstr "Guerra Frontera"

msgid ""
"Major Tam and Captain Leblanc, from the DHC, have tested your loyalty to the "
"General Klank. The test has proven to be conclusive, and Leblanc revealed to "
"you that they will soon need your services in the framework of the "
"preparation of the invasion of the Frontier."
msgstr ""
"El Mayor Tam y el Capitán Leblanc, del AMD, han puesto a prueba tu lealtad "
"al General Klank. La prueba ha resultado concluyente, y Leblanc te ha "
"revelado que pronto necesitarán tus servicios en el marco de la preparación "
"de la invasión de la Frontera."

