msgid "Spectator"
msgstr "Espectador"

msgid "Aficionado"
msgstr "Aficionado"

msgid "Gauntlet Fan"
msgstr "Fan del Guantelete"

msgid "A person enjoying their time at the station."
msgstr "Una persona disfrutando de su tiempo en la estación."

msgid "An individual taking a break from viewing the action."
msgstr "Un individuo que se toma un descanso para ver la acción."

msgid "A spectator that looks strangely out of place."
msgstr "Un espectador que parece extrañamente fuera de lugar."

msgid "A person enjoying some drinks."
msgstr "Una persona disfrutando de unas copas."

msgid ""
"\"Sometimes when watching some of the competitions, I forget it is all just "
"virtual reality.\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces, cuando veo algunas de las competiciones, me olvido de que todo es "
"realidad virtual.\""

msgid ""
"\"The realism of virtual reality here is impressive! It almost feels like "
"it's real!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡El realismo de la realidad virtual aquí es impresionante! ¡Casi parece "
"que es real!\""

msgid ""
"\"I came all the way from {pnt} to be here! We don't have anything like this "
"back at home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡He venido desde {pnt} para estar aquí! No tenemos nada como esto en casa."
"\""

#. No Dvaered
msgid ""
"\"The Dvaered sure know how to put on a good show. I love seeing it rain "
"Mace Rockets!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Los Dvaered sí que saben dar un buen espectáculo. Me encanta ver llover "
"Cohetes de Maza!\""

msgid ""
"\"It's a shame that they require you to own the ship you want to use to "
"enter the virtual reality competitions. I would love to try fly one of those "
"majestic Dvaered Goddards.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es una pena que te exijan ser dueño de la nave que quieres usar para "
"participar en las competiciones de realidad virtual. Me encantaría intentar "
"volar uno de esos majestuosos Dvaered Goddarde\""

msgid ""
"\"I like watching the competitions between fighters, it's incredible all the "
"moves they can pull off.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gusta ver las competiciones entre luchadores, es increíble todos los "
"movimientos que pueden hacer.\""

msgid ""
"\"I tried to compete in my Llama, but it doesn't stand a chance against even "
"a single Hyena.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Intenté competir en mi Llama, pero no tiene ninguna posibilidad contra una "
"sola Hiena.\""

msgid ""
"\"I was always told that Dvaered technology was primitive, but the virtual "
"reality of the Crimson Gauntlet is incredible!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Siempre me dijeron que la tecnología Dvaered era primitiva, pero la "
"realidad virtual del Guantelete Carmesí es increíble!\""

msgid ""
"\"There's nothing quite like seeing two capital ships duke it out. I love "
"watching railguns blasting away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No hay nada como ver a dos naves capitales enfrentarse. Me encanta ver los "
"cañones de riel disparandoe\""

msgid ""
"\"I used to think the Za'lek virtual games were great, but this is so much "
"better!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Antes pensaba que los juegos virtuales de los Za'lek eran geniales, ¡pero "
"esto es mucho mejor!\""

msgid "Gauntlet Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto de Guantelete"

msgid "Resting Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Descansando"

msgid "Tired Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Cansado"

msgid "A pilot enjoying some downtime between competitions."
msgstr "Un piloto disfrutando de un tiempo de descanso entre competiciones."

msgid "A tired pilot taking a break."
msgstr "Un piloto cansado tomándose un respiro."

msgid "A pilot lounging around."
msgstr "Un piloto descansando."

msgid ""
"\"Some people say that the Crimson gauntlet encourages and promotes "
"violence, but I've been destroying ships long before I started participating "
"in the Crimson Gauntlet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algunas personas dicen que el Guantelete Carmesí fomenta y promueve la "
"violencia, ¡pero yo he estado destruyendo naves mucho antes de empezar a "
"participar en el Guantelete Carmesí!\""

msgid ""
"\"Hey, didn't I see you flying a {ship} in the Crimson Gauntlet? Nice flying."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, ¿no te vi volando una {ship} en el Guantelete Carmesí? Buen vuelo.\""

msgid ""
"\"I was doing so well in my Hyena, but it just lacks the firepower to take "
"on larger ships. Maybe I should upgrade to a Vendetta.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me iba muy bien con mi Hiena, pero le falta potencia de fuego para "
"enfrentarse a naves más grandes. Tal vez debería cambiar a una Vendetta.\""

msgid ""
"\"The Crimson Gauntlet has really taught me to appreciate the small things "
"in life, you know, blowing up your enemies with mace rockets and such.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El Guantelete Carmesí me ha enseñado de verdad a apreciar las pequeñas "
"cosas de la vida, ya sabes, reventar a tus enemigos con cohetes maza y demás."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"I used to be a pretty sloppy pilot before participating in the Crimson "
"Gauntlet. I still am, but I used to be too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Solía ser un piloto bastante descuidado antes de participar en el "
"Guantelete Carmesí. Todavía lo soy, pero antes también lo era.\""

msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I get motion sickness from the virtual reality. What's more "
"troublesome is it also happens when I fly my real ship!\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces me mareo con la realidad virtual. ¡Lo que es más molesto es que "
"también me pasa cuando piloto mi nave real!\""

msgid ""
"\"Sometimes when I get blown up in Crimson Gauntlet, it takes me a while to "
"realize I haven't actually been blown up to smithereens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces, cuando salgo por los aires en el Guantelete Carmesí, tardo en "
"darme cuenta de que en realidad no he volado en pedazos.\""

#. Create random noise NPCs while avoiding duplicate messages
