msgstr ""
"SOS. Aquí {plt}. Los sistemas primarios no funcionan. Solicitando ayuda."

#. Ship broadcasts an SOS every 10 seconds, until boarded or destroyed.
msgid ""
"Calling all ships. This is {plt}. Engines down, ship damaged. Please help."
msgstr ""
"Llamando a todas las naves. Aquí {plt}. Motores apagados, nave dañada. Por "
"favor, ayuda."

