#. <notes>
#. <done_misn name="The FLF Split"/>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </event>
#. --
#.
#.
#. The FLF Catastrophe
#.
#. --
#. State of battle phase (jumping out to save not allowed).
#. Event constants
msgid "Catastrophe Looms"
msgstr "La catástrofe se acerca"

msgid ""
"As you enter the bar on Sindbad, you immediately know that something is "
"wrong. Everyone is frantic and you sense dread around your comrades. You are "
"about to ask around when Benito approaches."
msgstr ""
"Cuando entras en el bar de Sindbad, sabes inmediatamente que algo va mal. "
"Todo el mundo está frenético y percibes el temor en torno a tus compañeros. "
"Estás a punto de preguntar cuando se acerca Benito."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"{player}, it's horrible,\" she says with a look of dread in her eyes. "
"\"They found us. The damn Empire found us! I'm going to be frank, I don't "
"even know if we can survive this.\" You stammer for a moment. No, it can't "
"be true! It has to be some mistake! How can the FLF be defeated like this? "
"Now the commotion makes perfect sense.\n"
"   \"It's those damn traitors!\" Benito continues. \"One of them went off "
"and told the Empire where our base is, and they even told them where our "
"hidden jumps are! This is terrible!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{player}, es horrible\", dice con una mirada de espanto en sus ojos. \"Nos "
"han encontrado. El maldito Imperio nos ha encontrado. Voy a ser sincero, ni "
"siquiera sé si podremos sobrevivir a esto\". Balbucea por un momento. No, "
"¡no puede ser verdad! ¡Tiene que ser un error! ¿Cómo puede la FLF ser "
"derrotada así? Ahora la agitación tiene mucho sentido.\n"
"    \"¡Son esos malditos traidores!\" Continúa Benito. \"¡Uno de ellos se "
"fue y le dijo al Imperio dónde está nuestra base, e incluso les dijeron "
"dónde están nuestros saltos ocultos! ¡Esto es terrible!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Listen, we don't have much longer. A combined Empire and Dvaered fleet is "
"just about to enter from {sys}. They have Peacemakers, Hawkings, Goddards, "
"Pacifiers, you name it. They're ready to wipe us off the map. {player}, I "
"don't know how to say this, but...\" Benito digs in her pockets a bit before "
"pulling out a small data chip. \"Here, take this,\" she says as she presses "
"it into your hand. \"That's plan B. I hope it doesn't come to that, but... "
"keep it safe, just in case.\"\n"
"   Benito clears her throat. \"But I'm sure you can guess what your mission "
"is. You need to join with the others in the fight against the incoming "
"Empire ships. You have to destroy all of the ships. I will be here helping "
"to man the station; our defences are weak, but better than nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Escucha, no tenemos mucho más tiempo. Una flota combinada del Imperio y "
"Dvaered está a punto de entrar desde {sys}. Tienen Mediadores, Hawkings, "
"Goddards, Pacificadores, lo que sea. Están listos para borrarnos del mapa. "
"{player}, no sé cómo decir esto, pero...\" Benito rebusca un poco en sus "
"bolsillos antes de sacar un pequeño chip de datos. \"Toma, coge esto\", dice "
"mientras te lo pone en la mano. \"Es el plan B. Espero que no se llegue a "
"eso, pero... mantenlo a salvo, por si acaso\".\n"
"    Benito se aclara la garganta. \"Pero estoy seguro de que puedes adivinar "
"cuál es tu misión. Tienes que unirte a los demás en la lucha contra las "
"naves del Imperio que llegan. Tienes que destruir todas las naves. Yo estaré "
"aquí ayudando a tripular la estación; nuestras defensas son débiles, pero es "
"mejor que nada.\""

msgid ""
"Silence seems to engulf the room. You see the mouths of your comrades "
"frantically talking, but you cannot hear them. Benito puts her hand on your "
"shoulder and looks at you in the eye. \"Don't die, soldier,\" she says, only "
"this time, it's not in the usual playful tone you tend to expect of her. She "
"then hurriedly exits toward the station's weapon controls room."
msgstr ""
"El silencio parece envolver la sala. Ves las bocas de tus compañeros "
"hablando frenéticamente, pero no puedes oírlos. Benito te pone la mano en el "
"hombro y te mira a los ojos. \"No te mueras, soldado\", te dice, sólo que "
"esta vez no lo hace en el habitual tono juguetón que sueles esperar de ella. "
"Luego sale apresuradamente hacia la sala de control de armas de la estación."

msgid ""
"There's no time to lose. You go to the hangar bay and immediately take off."
msgstr ""
"No hay tiempo que perder. Ve a la bahía del hangar e inmediatamente despega."

#. Spawn FLF ships
#. Spawn Empire ships
#. Spawn Dvaered ships
#. Get rid of Sindbad
#. Punish the player with a faction hit every time they attack
#. Player decided to help destroy Sindbad for some reason. Set FLF
#. reputation to "enemy", add a log entry, and finish the event
#. without giving the usual rewards.
msgid ""
"You turned on the FLF and helped the Empire and the Dvaereds destroy Sindbad "
"for some reason."
msgstr ""
"Te enfrentaste al FLF y ayudaste al Imperio y a los Dvaereds a destruir a "
"Sindbad por alguna razón."

msgid "Escape and Live On"
msgstr "Escapa y Mantente Con Vida"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As the last shot penetrates the hull of Sindbad, a sense of dread comes over "
"you. The FLF, Benito, your comrades... no...\n"
"   Just as you think this, the now exploding station hails you. You "
"immediately accept, and you see Benito on your screen once again. You hear "
"sirens and explosions in the background, but you pay them no mind."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el último disparo penetra en el casco del Sindbad, te invade una "
"sensación de espanto. El FLF, Benito, tus compañeros... no...\n"
"Justo cuando piensas esto, la estación que ahora está explotando te llama. "
"Aceptas inmediatamente y vuelves a ver a Benito en tu pantalla. Oyes sirenas "
"y explosiones de fondo, pero no les prestas atención."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Well, this is it, soldier. My last transmission to you. I can't say I "
"wanted it to go this way, but...\n"
"   \"Listen. That chip I handed you before? It's a map. It shows the "
"location of a hidden jump from Iris to an unknown system deep in the nebula. "
"Go straight there, right now. Escape the Empire, find what lies beyond, and "
"live on. Perhaps, in your future travels, you'll find a way to destroy the "
"Dvaereds, and the Empire, once and for all.\" Benito smiles as more and more "
"of the station detonates around her. \"Goodbye, {player}. Stay vigilant.\" "
"The transmission then cuts as you are forced to watch Sindbad finally erupt "
"in a fiery explosion."
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, esto es todo, soldado. Mi última transmisión para ti. No puedo "
"decir que quería que fuera de esta manera, pero...\n"
"    \"Escucha. ¿Ese chip que te entregué antes? Es un mapa. Muestra la "
"ubicación de un salto oculto de Iris a un sistema desconocido en lo profundo "
"de la nebulosa. Ve directamente allí, ahora mismo. Escapa del Imperio, "
"encuentra lo que hay más allá, y sigue viviendo. Quizás, en tus futuros "
"viajes, encuentres la forma de destruir a los Dvaereds, y al Imperio, de una "
"vez por todas\". Benito sonríe mientras crece la detonación de la estación a "
"su alrededor. \"Adiós, {player}. Mantente alerta\". La transmisión se corta "
"entonces mientras te ves obligado a ver cómo Sindbad estalla finalmente en "
"una intensa explosión."

msgid ""
"The Empire discovered Sindbad. Try as you might, you and your comrades could "
"not stop the combined onslaught of the Empire and the Dvaereds, and Sindbad "
"erupted in a fiery explosion, killing Benito and all of your other comrades "
"who were within Sindbad. Before the station exploded, Benito gave you a map "
"leading into the unknown reaches of the inner nebula and told you to use the "
"map to find what lies within in the hopes that one day, you can help the FLF "
"rise again and defeat the Dvaereds once and for all. Her last words were "
"short, but memorable: \"Goodbye, {player}. Stay vigilant.\""
msgstr ""
"El Imperio descubrió a Sindbad. Por más que lo intentasteis, tú y tus "
"compañeros no pudisteis detener el ataque combinado del Imperio y los "
"Dvaereds, y Sindbad estalló en una intensa explosión, matando a Benito y a "
"todos los demás compañeros que estaban dentro de Sindbad. Antes de que la "
"estación explotara, Benito te dio un mapa que conducía a los confines "
"desconocidos de la nebulosa interior y te dijo que utilizaras el mapa para "
"encontrar lo que había dentro con la esperanza de que un día pudieras ayudar "
"a la FLF a levantarse de nuevo y derrotar a los Dvaereds de una vez por "
"todas. Sus últimas palabras fueron cortas, pero memorables: \"Adiós, "
"{player}. Mantente alerta.\""

msgid "Strange Happenings"
msgstr "Acontecimientos Extraños"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your instruments go haywire and your ship goes dark. You swear under your "
"breath as you try to get the system back online. This isn't good. How could "
"your core system fail, and at such a critical moment? Is this going to be "
"the end for you, just like Benito and your other comrades moments ago?\n"
"   Just as you start to panic, the power comes back on and you breathe a "
"sigh of relief. An unfamiliar face appears on your viewscreen. She glares "
"silently for what seems like an eternity. Finally, she speaks up."
msgstr ""
"Tus instrumentos se vuelven locos y tu nave se queda a oscuras. Juras en voz "
"baja mientras intentas que el sistema vuelva a funcionar. Esto no es bueno. "
"¿Cómo ha podido fallar tu sistema base, y en un momento tan crítico? ¿Va a "
"ser esto el fin para ti, como para Benito y tus otros compañeros hace unos "
"momentos?\n"
"    Justo cuando empiezas a entrar en pánico, la energía vuelve a funcionar "
"y respiras aliviado. Una cara desconocida aparece en tu pantalla. Te mira en "
"silencio durante lo que parece una eternidad. Finalmente, habla."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"So the FLF is dead, I see. Well, not so much dead as a shadow of its "
"former self. I can see that you did manage to more or less achieve your "
"goal; Dvaered forces have largely withdrawn from Frontier space. I suppose "
"that was the double-edged sword you wielded when you got pirates involved. "
"The Empire was never going to allow you to live once you did that, but it "
"did give you the edge you needed to weaken the Dvaered forces temporarily.\n"
"   \"Not that it matters anyway, of course. The ultimate result will be the "
"same either way. But that's neither here nor there. FLF pilot, I can see "
"that you have acquired some insider knowledge. That said, you still know "
"nothing in the grand scheme of things. So I'll tell you what: proceed to "
"Metsys if you dare. I will explain everything then. Be warned: the nebula "
"here is highly unstable, so your shields had better be up to par. If you "
"don't have the guts for it, turn back now while you still can. But if you "
"do, you turn back for good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que la FLF está muerta, por lo que veo. Bueno, no tan muerta como una "
"sombra de lo que fue. Veo que has conseguido más o menos tu objetivo; las "
"fuerzas Dvaered se han retirado en gran medida del espacio Frontera. Supongo "
"que esa fue el arma de doble filo que esgrimiste cuando involucraste a los "
"piratas. El Imperio nunca iba a permitirte vivir una vez que hicieras eso, "
"pero te dio la ventaja que necesitabas para debilitar a las fuerzas Dvaered "
"temporalmente.\n"
"    \"No es que importe de todos modos, por supuesto. El resultado final "
"será el mismo de cualquier manera. Pero eso no es ni aquí ni allá. Piloto de "
"FLF, puedo ver que has adquirido algunos datos internos. Dicho esto, sigues "
"sin saber nada en el gran esquema de las cosas. Así que te diré lo "
"siguiente: procede a Metsys si te atreves. Entonces te lo explicaré todo. Te "
"advierto: la nebulosa de aquí es muy inestable, así que será mejor que tus "
"escudos estén a la altura. Si no tienes las agallas para ello, regresa ahora "
"mientras puedas. Pero si lo haces, no vuelvas para nada.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before you can even respond, the mysterious figure disappears. You detect no "
"presences nearby, but you notice that your ship has been refuelled somehow! "
"Odd. In any case, it looks like you have two choices: do you brave the "
"dangers of the nebula and proceed to Metsys, or do you turn back now? The "
"figure said that you can only make this decision once, so you'd better make "
"sure it's the right one."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que puedas responder, la misteriosa figura desaparece. No detectas "
"ninguna presencia cercana, pero notas que tu nave ha sido repostada de "
"alguna manera. Qué raro. En cualquier caso, parece que tienes dos opciones: "
"¿te enfrentas a los peligros de la nebulosa y sigues hacia Metsys, o te das "
"la vuelta ahora? La figura dice que sólo puedes tomar esta decisión una vez, "
"así que será mejor que te asegures de que es la correcta."

msgid "Welcome To the Nebula"
msgstr "Bienvenido a la Nebulosa"

msgid ""
"As you land on the mysterious station, armed guards immediately surround "
"your ship and order you out into the hangar. You comply, and they take you "
"to a room that appears to be an interrogation room, where you wait for a few "
"nerve-wracking hectostu. Finally, a holoscreen flickers on, showing the "
"figure you had seen earlier. She looks in your direction.\n"
"   \"Well met,\" she says. \"I see you have made the right choice and "
"survived the nebula. Very good.\""
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure you're wondering who we are. We are the Thurion, a civilization "
"left over from one of the Empire's former secret projects. Have you met the "
"Za'lek? The Collective? Those too were the Empire's \"great projects\", as "
"were the now dead Proteron. But we were kept a lot more in the dark.\n"
"   \"You see, when the Empire gave up on Project Thurion many cycles ago, "
"they tried to kill us so that word of our existence would never get out. "
"They thought us an embarrassment to the Empire. Little did they know, "
"however, that we had discovered a method of uploading the human mind to a "
"computer, and so when they came after us, we uploaded ourselves and escaped "
"into what are now our core systems to rebuild.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Seguro que te preguntas quiénes somos. Somos los Turion, una civilización "
"sobrante de uno de los antiguos proyectos secretos del Imperio. ¿Has "
"conocido a los Za'lek? ¿Colectivo? Esos también eran los \"grandes "
"proyectos\" del Imperio, al igual que el ahora muerto Proteron. Pero nos "
"mantuvieron mucho más en la oscuridad.\n"
"    \"Verás, cuando el Imperio renunció al Proyecto Turion hace muchos "
"ciclos, intentaron matarnos para que nunca se supiera de nuestra existencia. "
"Pensaron que éramos una vergüenza para el Imperio. Sin embargo, no sabían "
"que habíamos descubierto un método para cargar la mente humana en un "
"ordenador, así que cuando vinieron a por nosotros, nos cargamos a nosotros "
"mismos y escapamos a lo que ahora son nuestros sistemas principales para "
"reconstruir.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Now, about half of us are uploaded, myself included. This face you see and "
"this voice you hear are but projections, a reflection of myself that I have "
"freely chosen. Being uploaded is wonderful, I must say; there is no "
"suffering, we are immortal, and we can have whatever human experiences we "
"desire and much more. And when we decide we have lived to our fullest, we "
"can delete ourselves and disappear into the emptiness just like any other "
"person does when they die. It's not uncommon for people to choose to self-"
"terminate after they have been uploaded for about 200 cycles or so. I, "
"however, have stuck around from the very beginning. I very much enjoy seeing "
"the biological Thurion grow, learn, and join us in uploaded consciousness "
"when their human bodies grow old and weary.\n"
"   \"Sadly, I don't think you can be uploaded. The uploading process tends "
"to fail with people who have even the slightest brain damage, and you "
"outsiders usually drink far too many brain-damaging substances. That said, "
"the time to check if you are eligible for uploading is many cycles away "
"anyhow, so we'll see when we get there, should you have an interest in being "
"uploaded.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ahora, casi la mitad de nosotros estamos cargados, yo incluido. Este "
"rostro que ves y esta voz que oyes no son más que proyecciones, un reflejo "
"de mí mismo que he elegido libremente. Ser subido es maravilloso, debo "
"decir; no hay sufrimiento, somos inmortales, y podemos tener cualquier "
"experiencia humana que deseemos y mucho más. Y cuando decidimos que hemos "
"vivido al máximo, podemos borrarnos y desaparecer en el vacío como hace "
"cualquier otra persona cuando muere. No es raro que la gente decida "
"autoeliminarse después de haber estado subido durante unos 200 ciclos más o "
"menos. Yo, sin embargo, me he quedado desde el principio. Disfruto mucho "
"viendo cómo los Turion biológicos crecen, aprenden y se unen a nosotros en "
"la conciencia subida cuando sus cuerpos humanos envejecen y se cansan.\n"
"    \"Lamentablemente, no creo que puedas ser subido. El proceso de carga "
"tiende a fallar con las personas que tienen el más mínimo daño cerebral, y "
"vosotros, los forasteros, normalmente tomáis demasiadas sustancias que dañan "
"al cerebro. Dicho esto, el momento de comprobar si eres apto para ser subido "
"está a muchos ciclos de distancia, así que ya veremos cuando lleguemos, si "
"es que tienes interés en ser subido.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Fascinated, you finally speak up, prompting a smile from the uploaded "
"Thurion and a fairly long, friendly discussion about her experiences as an "
"uploaded Thurion and your experience as a pilot on the outside. You find out "
"that her name is Alicia. Somewhere in the conversation, a pair of human "
"Thurion guards enters the room. They ask Alicia how it went, and she says "
"that you've been properly introduced to Thurion culture and can be trusted "
"to roam free. The two guards then smile and shake your hand. \"Welcome to "
"the nebula, {player},\" one of them says. \"You now have permission to roam "
"Thurion space freely and conduct your business. Of course, I trust you won't "
"reveal our secret location to anyone. That would be just as bad for you as "
"it would be for us.\"\n"
"   You affirm that you will keep the Thurion's secret safe. \"Yes, welcome,"
"\" Alicia says. \"And do check out our bars and mission computers from time "
"to time. We very well might have some missions for you in the future. In the "
"meantime, buy yourself some nebula-resistant coating, and make yourself "
"comfortable. You are our honoured guest and, I hope, the first of many "
"outsiders to learn the wonders of our way of life.\"\n"
"   The guards then promptly but politely escort you back to your ship, which "
"has been refuelled while you were gone. This should be an interesting "
"experience...."
msgstr ""
"Fascinado, finalmente hablas, lo que provoca una sonrisa del Turion subido y "
"una discusión bastante larga y amistosa sobre sus experiencias como Turion "
"subido y tu experiencia como piloto en el exterior. Descubres que se llama "
"Alicia. En algún momento de la conversación, un par de guardias Turion "
"humanos entran en la habitación. Le preguntan a Alicia cómo te fue, y ella "
"les dice que te han introducido correctamente en la cultura Turion y que se "
"puede confiar en ti para que te muevas libremente. Los dos guardias sonríen "
"y te dan la mano. \"Bienvenido a la nebulosa, {player}\", dice uno de ellos. "
"\"Ahora tienes permiso para vagar libremente por el espacio de Turion y "
"llevar a cabo tus negocios. Por supuesto, confío en que no revelarás nuestra "
"ubicación secreta a nadie. Eso sería tan malo para ti como para nosotros\".\n"
"    Afirmas que mantendrás a salvo el secreto de los Turion. \"Sí, "
"bienvenido\", dice Alicia. \"Y no dejes de visitar nuestros bares y "
"ordenadores de misiones de vez en cuando. Es muy posible que tengamos alguna "
"misión para ti en el futuro. Mientras tanto, cómprate un revestimiento "
"resistente a la nebulosa y ponte cómodo. Eres nuestro invitado de honor y, "
"espero, el primero de muchos forasteros que aprenderán las maravillas de "
"nuestro modo de vida\".\n"
"    A continuación, los guardias te acompañan rápida pero cortésmente de "
"vuelta a su nave, que ha sido repostada mientras estabas fuera. Esta debería "
"ser una experiencia interesante...."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Having braved the nebula, you were introduced to the Thurion by Alicia, one "
"of many uploaded Thurion. The Thurion are the remnants of a secret project "
"initiated by the Empire, Project Thurion. The Za'lek, the Collective, and "
"the now-dead Proteron were also \"great projects\" of the Empire, but "
"Project Thurion was seen as an embarrassment, prompting the Empire to "
"attempt to kill the Thurion so word of their existence wouldn't get out. "
"However, the Thurion learned a way to upload the human mind to a computer, "
"allowing them to escape and rebuild.\n"
"   Now, the Thurion have formed a secret civilization. About half of the "
"Thurion population is uploaded and Alicia was quick to extol the virtues of "
"being uploaded, but also noted that you probably can't be uploaded due to a "
"likelihood of excessive brain damage.\n"
"   In any case, you have earned the Thurion's trust and have been granted "
"permission to roam Thurion space freely. You have promised to keep the "
"Thurion's secret safe. Alicia has said that the Thurion may have missions "
"for you in the future and has also recommended that you buy one of the "
"Thurion's nebula-resistant ships."
msgstr ""
"Después de haber desafiado la nebulosa, Alicia, una de las muchas Turion "
"subidas, te presentó a los Turion. Los Turion son los restos de un proyecto "
"secreto iniciado por el Imperio, el Proyecto Turion. El Za'lek, Colectivo y "
"el ya fallecido Proteron también fueron \"grandes proyectos\" del Imperio, "
"pero el Proyecto Turion se consideró una vergüenza, lo que llevó al Imperio "
"a intentar matar a los Turion para que no se supiera de su existencia. Sin "
"embargo, los Turion aprendieron una forma de cargar la mente humana en un "
"ordenador, lo que les permitió escapar y reconstruirse.\n"
"    Ahora, los Turion han formado una civilización secreta. Alrededor de la "
"mitad de la población Turion está cargada y Alicia se apresuró a ensalzar "
"las virtudes de estar cargado, pero también señaló que probablemente no te "
"puedas cargar debido a la probabilidad de un daño cerebral excesivo.\n"
"    En cualquier caso, te has ganado la confianza de los Turion y se te ha "
"concedido permiso para vagar libremente por el espacio de Turion. Has "
"prometido mantener a salvo el secreto del Turion. Alicia ha dicho que Turion "
"puede tener misiones para ti en el futuro y también te ha recomendado que "
"compres una de las naves resistentes a la nebulosa de Turion."

