msgid "Supervisor"
msgstr "Supervisor"

msgid "Boss"
msgstr "Jefe"

msgid "Chief"
msgstr "Lider"

msgid "Shepherd"
msgstr "Pastor"

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Administrador"

msgid "Mineral acquisition skills required. Inquire within."
msgstr ""
"Se requieren conocimientos de adquisición de minerales. Infórmese en el "
"interior."

msgid "Interested in blowing asteroids up? Looking for miners!"
msgstr "¿Interesado en explotar asteroides? ¡Buscamos mineros!"

msgid "Seeking mineral gatherers."
msgstr "Buscando recolectores de minerales."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Requiring miners for the Sirichana."
msgstr "Se requieren mineros para Sirichana."

msgid "Mine minerals for the Empire!"
msgstr "¡Mina minerales para el Imperio!"

msgid "\"We don't deal with the likes of you!\""
msgstr "\"¡No tratamos con gente como tú!\""

msgid ""
"\"We are looking for miners to obtain valuable minerals such as {minerals}. "
"Given the difficulty of acquiring them, we are willing to pay {markup}% of "
"the market price. If you are interested, please bring the minerals and board "
"to do the transaction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Buscamos mineros para obtener minerales valiosos como {minerals}. Dada la "
"dificultad de adquirirlos, estamos dispuestos a pagar el {markup}% del "
"precio de mercado. Si estás interesado, por favor traigan los minerales y "
"embarquen para hacer la transacción.\""

msgid ""
"\"Do you have minerals available? If so, please board for the transaction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Tiene minerales disponibles? Si es así, por favor, aborde para la "
"transacción.\""

#. Should allow the player to ransack the ship
msgid "You are not allowed to board the ship!"
msgstr "¡No se te permite abordar la nave!"

msgid ""
"You board the {ship}, and find that the cargo bay has been set up to "
"efficiently process minerals. There is a holosign with the needed resources "
"and their prices:"
msgstr ""
"Abordas la {ship}, y descubres que la bahía de carga ha sido preparada para "
"procesar eficazmente los minerales. Hay un holosigno con los recursos "
"necesarios y sus precios:"

msgid "{mineral}: {price}"
msgstr "{mineral}: {price}"

msgid "What do you want to do?"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres hacer?"

msgid "Trade {mineral} for {value} (You have {amount})"
msgstr "Intercambias {mineral} por {valor} (Tienes {amount})"

msgid "Ask about the construction."
msgstr "Preguntas por la construcción."

msgid ""
"\"It's some sort of high power quantum energy translator or something like "
"that. I'm not too up-to-date on the details, but I do recall there was "
"something similar to this back at Sol before the incident…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es una especie de traductor de energía cuántica de alta potencia o algo "
"así. No estoy muy al tanto de los detalles, pero recuerdo que había algo "
"similar a esto en Sol antes del incidente...\""

#. Mineral options
msgid ""
"You deliver the {amount} of {mineral}.\n"
"{reward}"
msgstr ""
"Entregas {amount} de {mineral}.\n"
"{reward}"

