#. --
#. -- Is repeatable!
#. --
#. -- Triggered from station.lua
#. --
#. Non-persistent state
#. Messages
msgid "*incoherent expletives*"
msgstr "* improperios incoherentes*"

msgid "Disgusting Za'lek scum!"
msgstr "¡Asquerosa escoria Za'lek!"

msgid "Your head will make a fine trophy on my ships!"
msgstr "¡Tu cabeza será un buen trofeo en mis naves!"

msgid "Za'lek trash!"
msgstr "¡Basura Za'lek!"

msgid "My defence protocols will make short work of you!"
msgstr "¡Mis protocolos de defensa harán un trabajo corto contigo!"

msgid "I'll teach you physics Dvaered punk!"
msgstr "¡Te enseñaré física gamberro Dvaered!"

msgid "My ship's hull is less thick than your Dvaered skull!"
msgstr "¡El casco de mi nave es menos grueso que tu cráneo Dvaered!"

msgid "You Dvaereds smell worse than my vials of thiol!"
msgstr "¡Vosotros los Dvaereds oleis peor que mis frascos de tiol!"

#. Create scuffle
msgid "Za'lek Belligerent"
msgstr "Beligerante Za'lek"

#. Create the ships
msgid "Dvaered Hooligan"
msgstr "Hooligan Dvaered"

msgid ""
"You hear a large commotion in one of the wings of Minerva Station. As you "
"approach you can make out what seems to be an altercation between a group of "
"Za'lek and Dvaered ruffians."
msgstr ""
"Oyes un gran alboroto en una de las alas de la estación Minerva. Al "
"acercarte puedes distinguir lo que parece ser un altercado entre un grupo de "
"rufianes Za'lek y Dvaered."

msgid ""
"\"You were using a bloody computation drone to cheat, you dirty Za'lek stink!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Estabas usando un maldito dron de computación para hacer trampa, sucio "
"Za'lek apestoso!\""

msgid ""
"\"Your logic makes no sense. Are you sure the excessive amounts of alcohol "
"aren't making your rotten brain hallucinate?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tu lógica no tiene sentido. ¿Estás seguro de que las cantidades excesivas "
"de alcohol no están haciendo que tu podrido cerebro alucine?\""

msgid ""
"\"You won't trick me with your fancy words. I know a cheater when I see one!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"No me vas a engañar con tus palabras rebuscadas. ¡Reconozco a un tramposo "
"cuando lo veo!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't trust your judgement on bricks let alone anything that requires "
"minimal intellect.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No confiaría en tu juicio en materia de ladrillos y mucho menos en algo "
"que requiera un mínimo de intelecto.\""

msgid ""
"\"You Za'lek punk. Bring your ass outside and I will fill your ship with "
"holes just like your lies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tú, gamberro Za'lek. ¡Trae tu culo fuera y llenaré tu nave de agujeros "
"como tus mentiras de grandes!\""

msgid ""
"\"When you are getting eviscerated by my drones, I hope you realize you have "
"brought this upon yourself, Dvaered trash!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Cuando seas destripado por mis drones, espero que te des cuenta de que tú "
"mismo te lo has buscado, basura Dvaered!\""

msgid ""
"The Za'lek and Dvaered ruffians storm off to their ships to apparently fight "
"to the death to solve their quarrel. Truly civilized individuals.\n"
"It seems like it could be an opportunity to curry favour with either one of "
"the factions if you wished to intervene in their fight."
msgstr ""
"Los rufianes Za'lek y Dvaered se dirigen a sus naves para aparentemente "
"luchar hasta la muerte para resolver su disputa. Individuos verdaderamente "
"civilizados.\n"
"Parece que podría ser una oportunidad para ganarse el favor de cualquiera de "
"las dos facciones si quisieras intervenir en su pelea."

#. Scuffle between Za'lek and Dvaered
#. Set up system
#. Meta factions
#. Clear
msgid "Dvaered Thug"
msgstr "Matón Dvaered"

msgid "Za'lek Thug"
msgstr "Matón Za'lek"

#. Prepare hooks
#. Set up hooks when it is over
#. Take turns yelling
#. slowly talk less and less
msgid "Et tu brute?"
msgstr "Et tu brute?"

msgid "Dust to dust."
msgstr "Polvo al polvo."

msgid ""
"\"Thank you for the help with the Za'lek scum. Let us celebrate with a drink "
"in the bar down at Minerva Station!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias por la ayuda con la escoria Za'lek. ¡Celebrémoslo con una copa en "
"el bar de la estación Minerva!\""

msgid ""
"You helped a Dvaered pilot get rid of a Za'lek pilot they had a quarrel with."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a un piloto Dvaered a deshacerse de un piloto Za'lek con el que "
"tenía una disputa."

msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "Que te vaya bien."

msgid ""
"\"As my computations predicted, the Dvaered scum was no match for the Za'lek "
"superiority. Let us celebrate with a drink down at Minerva Station\""
msgstr ""
"\"Como predijeron mis cálculos, la escoria Dvaered no fue rival para la "
"superioridad Za'lek. Celebremoslo con un trago en la estación Minerva\""

msgid ""
"You helped a Za'lek pilot get rid of a Dvaered pilot they had a quarrel with."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a un piloto Za'lek a deshacerse de un piloto Dvaered con el que "
"tenía una disputa."

#. event ends on player leaving the system or landing
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <event name="Minerva Station Altercation 2">
#. <location>none</location>
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. <unique />
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Minerva</campaign>
#. <done_misn name="Maikki's Father 2">Random event</done_misn>
#. </notes>
#. </event>
#. --
#.
#. Bad people try to do bad things to cyborg chicken
#.
#. Triggered from station.lua
#. --
#. Some variables for keeping track of the mission
#. Set mission details
msgid "Thug"
msgstr "Matón"

msgid ""
"You once again hear a large commotion in one of the wings of Minerva "
"station. As you get closer you see what seems to be a group of people "
"chasing something small… Wait, is that a chicken?"
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a escuchar un gran alboroto en una de las alas de la estación "
"Minerva. Al acercarte ves lo que parece ser un grupo de personas "
"persiguiendo algo pequeño... Espera, ¿es un pollo?"

msgid "\"Get back here you thief! Give me back my tokens! There is no way \""
msgstr "\"¡Vuelve aquí, ladrón! ¡Devuélveme mis fichas! No hay salida \""

msgid "\"Puk Puk Pukaaak! Quack!\""
msgstr "\"¡Puk Puk Pukaaak! ¡Quack!\""

msgid "\"Filthy little animal! I'll beat you into a pulp!\""
msgstr "\"¡Animal asqueroso! ¡Te voy a hacer papilla!\""

msgid "\"Cluck Quack Clukuk Pukaaaaaaaaak!\""
msgstr "\"¡Cluck Quack Clukuk Pukaaaaaaaaak!\""

msgid ""
"Cyborg Chicken runs itself into a corner and it doesn't seem like station "
"security will make it in time. What do you do?"
msgstr ""
"Pollo Cyborg se encuentra en una esquina y no parece que la seguridad de la "
"estación vaya a llegar a tiempo. ¿Qué hacer?"

msgid "Try to intervene"
msgstr "Intentar intervenir"

msgid "Wait"
msgstr "Esperar"

msgid "You approach the chicken and thug and try to mediate."
msgstr "Te acercas al pollo y al matón e intentas mediar."

msgid ""
"As the thug is distracted by you, Cyborg Chicken suddenly sprints and runs "
"past you. Did it wink at you?"
msgstr ""
"Mientras el matón se distrae contigo, el pollo Cyborg corre de repente y "
"pasa por delante de ti. ¿Te ha guiñado el ojo?"

msgid ""
"\"Not such a tough chicken anymore, huh? Going to beat you so bad we'll have "
"chicken nuggets for lunch!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya no eres un pollo tan duro, ¿eh? ¡Te voy a golpear tanto que comeremos "
"nuggets de pollo de almuerzo!\""

msgid ""
"Cyborg Chicken blinks twice then sprints through the thugs legs and runs "
"past you. The thug tries to chase but ends up bumping into you."
msgstr ""
"Pollo Cyborg parpadea dos veces y corre a través de las piernas de los "
"matones y pasa por delante de ti. El matón intenta perseguirlo pero acaba "
"chocando contigo."

msgid ""
"\"You let the chicken get away punk! How are you going to make up for this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Dejaste que el pollo se escapara gamberro! ¿Cómo vas a resarcirte de esto?"
"\""

msgid ""
"You buy your time and eventually the station security comes escorting the "
"thug away. As you go back to what you were doing, you see cyborg chicken in "
"the distance who seems to wink at you. What was that all about?"
msgstr ""
"Ganas tiempo y al final llega la seguridad de la estación escoltando al "
"matón lejos. Mientras vuelves a lo que estabas haciendo, ves a lo lejos al "
"pollo cyborg que parece guiñarte un ojo. ¿Qué ha sido eso?"

msgid "You sort of helped cyborg chicken get away from a thug."
msgstr "Ayudaste al pollo cyborg a escapar de un matón."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <event name="Chicken Rendezvous">
#. <location>none</location>
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. <unique />
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Minerva</campaign>
#. <done_evt name="Spa Propaganda" />
#. <requires name="Chicken Rendezvous" />
#. </notes>
#. </event>
#. --
#.
#. -- Triggered from other missions.
#. --
#. TODO fancier intro?
msgid ""
"You show the winning ticket to the nearest terminal. It suddenly starts "
"blasting music and flashing lights before triumphantly announcing to "
"everyone in the vicinity:"
msgstr ""
"Muestras el boleto ganador al terminal más cercano. De repente empieza a "
"sonar música y a parpadear las luces antes de anunciar triunfalmente a todos "
"los que están cerca:"

msgid ""
"\"CONGRATULATIONS MISTER HARPER BOWDOIN ON WINNING THE EXCLUSIVE STAY AT THE "
"MINERVA SPA.\""
msgstr ""
"\"ENHORABUENA, SEÑOR HARPER BOWDOIN, POR GANAR LA ESTANCIA EXCLUSIVA EN EL "
"BALNEARIO DE MINERVA.\""

msgid ""
"If only the terminal could be more discrete… You follow the terminal as it "
"leads you towards the spa facilities. All the rooms you pass seem to have "
"the same gaudy decorations and similar patrons. You wonder if you will be "
"able to make it back to where you came from."
msgstr ""
"Si solo la terminal pudiera ser más discreta... Sigues la terminal mientras "
"te lleva hacia las instalaciones del balneario. Todas las salas por las que "
"pasas parecen tener la misma decoración llamativa y clientes similares. Te "
"preguntas si serás capaz de volver al lugar de donde viniste."

msgid ""
"The terminal glides around the maze that is Minerva station while its head "
"rotates backwards to face you.\n"
"\"I BELIEVE YOU WILL BE VERY IMPRESSED WITH THE ACCOMMODATIONS AT THE SPA. "
"THE RENOVATIONS TOOK ALMOST A CYCLE AND IT IS MORE BEAUTIFUL THAN EVER.\""
msgstr ""
"El terminal se desliza por el laberinto que es la estación Minerva mientras "
"su cabeza gira hacia atrás para dirigirse a tu persona.\n"
"\"CREO QUE ESTARÁ MUY IMPRESIONADO CON LAS INSTALACIONES DEL BALNEARIO. LAS "
"RENOVACIONES HAN DURADO CASI UN CICLO Y ESTÁ MÁS BONITO QUE NUNCA.\""

msgid ""
"\"TODAY THE WATER IS INFUSED WITH NANOBOTS THAT SPECIALIZE IN ANTI-AGEING, "
"AFTER A DIP YOU WILL LOOK YOUNGER THAN EVER. THESE HAVE BEEN DEVELOPED BY "
"THE ZA'LEK AND SHOULD EVEN SURPASS THE ANTI-AGEING PROPERTIES OF THE SOROMID "
"SKIN LEECHES, WITHOUT EVEN CLOUDING THE WATER.\""
msgstr ""
"\"HOY EL AGUA ESTÁ INFUNDIDA CON NANOBOTS ESPECIALIZADOS EN EL "
"ANTIENVEJECIMIENTO, DESPUÉS DE UN CHAPUZÓN PARECERÁS MÁS JOVEN. ESTOS HAN "
"SIDO DESARROLLADOS POR LOS ZA'LEK Y DEBERÍAN INCLUSO SUPERAR LAS PROPIEDADES "
"ANTIENVEJECIMIENTO DE LAS SANGUIJUELAS DE PIEL SOROMIDA, SIN SIQUIERA "
"ENTURBIAR EL AGUA.\""

msgid ""
"As you walk, you feel that the surrounding decorations are starting to get "
"fancier, you must be nearing the VIP area."
msgstr ""
"Mientras caminas, notas que la decoración de los alrededores empieza a ser "
"más elegante, debes estar acercándote a la zona VIP."

msgid ""
"\"FURTHERMORE, CYBORG CHICKEN WILL BE JOINING YOU IN THE SPA. DO NOT WORRY, "
"HIS CYBORG IMPLEMENTS ARE ALL WATER-PROOF UNLIKE MY BODY. MAKE SURE TO MAKE "
"MOST OF THIS ONCE IN A LIFETIME OPPORTUNITY.\""
msgstr ""
"\"ADEMÁS, EL POLLO CYBORG SE TE UNIRÁ EN EL BALNEARIO. NO TE PREOCUPES, SUS "
"IMPLEMENTOS CYBORG SON TODOS A PRUEBA DE AGUA, A DIFERENCIA DE MI CUERPO. "
"ASEGÚRATE DE APROVECHAR ESTA OPORTUNIDAD ÚNICA EN LA VIDA.\""

msgid ""
"The terminal stops moving in front of a airlock encrusted with what look to "
"be diamonds on a gold enamel.\n"
"\"WE HAVE REACHED OUR DESTINATION. PLEASE ENJOY YOURSELF.\""
msgstr ""
"El terminal deja de moverse frente a una esclusa con incrustaciones de lo "
"que parecen ser diamantes sobre un esmalte dorado.\n"
"\"HEMOS LLEGADO A NUESTRO DESTINO. POR FAVOR, DISFRUTE.\""

msgid ""
"The airlock opens as you approach it, and you find yourself at the entrance "
"of the changing rooms. You get rid of your clothes, take a small towel, and "
"proceed to enter the spa area."
msgstr ""
"La esclusa se abre cuando te acercas a ella y te encuentras en la entrada de "
"los vestuarios. Te deshaces de tu ropa, coges una pequeña toalla y procedes "
"a entrar en la zona del balneario."

#. Start the fancy spa scene!
msgid ""
"As you enter the spa, you are hit by a rolling wave of steam, probably "
"infused with the nanobots mentioned by the terminal, and find yourself "
"alone. It smells like some sort of mix between lemons and assorted herbs, "
"but is rather quite pleasant."
msgstr ""
"Al entrar en el balneario, te golpea una ola de vapor, probablemente "
"infundido con los nanobots mencionados por la terminal, y te encuentras "
"solo. Huele a una especie de mezcla de limones y hierbas variadas, pero es "
"bastante agradable."

msgid ""
"You can make out several large pools in the thick fog, and there is a "
"constant background sound of running water. Although not too fancy by the "
"standards of volcanic world natural springs, it is very impressive when you "
"consider that this installation is located inside a space station."
msgstr ""
"En la espesa niebla se pueden distinguir varias piscinas de gran tamaño, y "
"hay un sonido de fondo constante de agua corriente. Aunque no es demasiado "
"lujoso para los estándares de los manantiales naturales del mundo volcánico, "
"es muy impresionante si se tiene en cuenta que esta instalación se encuentra "
"dentro de una estación espacial."

#. Special case doing Minerva Pirate mission
msgid ""
"Before you enjoy yourself, you plant the listening device you were supposed "
"to in a corner of the room so that it won't be noticed. That should make "
"your current employer happy and get your work out of the way."
msgstr ""
"Antes de disfrutar, colocas el dispositivo de escucha que debías en un "
"rincón de la habitación para que no se note. Eso debería contentar a tu "
"actual empleador y quitarte el trabajo de encima."

msgid ""
"There is a sign with instructions on how to properly bath. It seems like "
"you're supposed to wash your body first in small individual stalls before "
"getting into the large baths. You proceed to wash your body thoroughly, "
"getting rid of all the grime from your travels. It's amazing how much dirt "
"accumulates by space travel, probably obtained on all sorts of different "
"planets."
msgstr ""
"Hay un cartel con instrucciones sobre cómo bañarse correctamente. Parece que "
"primero hay que lavarse el cuerpo en pequeñas cabinas individuales antes de "
"meterse en las bañeras grandes. Procedes a lavarte el cuerpo a fondo, "
"deshaciéndote de toda la suciedad de tus viajes. Es sorprendente la cantidad "
"de suciedad que se acumula en los viajes espaciales, probablemente obtenida "
"en todo tipo de planetas diferentes."

msgid ""
"You enter the first bath you find. The hot water seems to seep into every "
"pore of your skin in an incredibly relaxing and soothing manner. You melt "
"into the water and let it all flow in. You should come here more often."
msgstr ""
"Entras en el primer baño que encuentras. El agua caliente parece filtrarse "
"en cada poro de tu piel de una manera increíblemente relajante y calmante. "
"Te fundes en el agua y dejas que todo fluya. Deberías venir aquí más a "
"menudo."

msgid ""
"As you lose yourself in space and time, you are brought back to reality by a "
"faint sound of splashing. That's right, you were supposed to be joined in "
"the spa by Cyborg Chicken. Given how great the spa is, you can't help but to "
"question why the management decided to include Cyborg Chicken into this "
"renovation event deal."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te pierdes en el espacio y el tiempo, te devuelve a la realidad un "
"leve sonido de chapoteo. Ah vale, se suponía que la Pollo Cyborg te "
"acompañaría en el balneario. Teniendo en cuenta lo estupendo que es el spa, "
"no puedes evitar preguntarte por qué la dirección decidió incluir a la Pollo "
"Cyborg en este acuerdo de evento de renovación."

msgid ""
"The splashing sound stops, and you hear the pit-pat sound of chicken feet "
"approaching you."
msgstr ""
"El sonido del chapoteo se detiene, y escuchas el sonido de las patas del "
"pollo acercándose a ti."

msgid ""
"Cyborg Chicken comes up to the pool you are in and tests the water by "
"sticking a foot in. Seeming satisfied, it jumps in and starts floating."
msgstr ""
"El Pollo Cyborg se acerca a la piscina en la que estás y prueba el agua "
"metiendo una pata. Como parece satisfecha, salta al agua y empieza a flotar."

msgid ""
"Concentrating on the cathartic spa water, you let your thoughts wander, "
"while Cyborg Chicken floats around lazily."
msgstr ""
"Concentrado en el agua catártica del balneario, dejas que tus pensamientos "
"vaguen, mientras el Pollo Cyborg flota perezosamente."

msgid ""
"Is there really a mole at the station? What could have happened to Maikki's "
"father? What is the shady character's objective? It seems like there are "
"many loose ends at Minerva station."
msgstr ""
"¿Hay realmente un topo en la estación? ¿Qué le pudo pasar al padre de "
"Maikki? ¿Cuál es el objetivo del personaje sospechoso? Parece que hay muchos "
"cabos sueltos en la estación Minerva."

#. else -- TODO case other missions when implemented
msgid ""
"Eventually you get out of your thinking stupor and remember that you are in "
"a spa with a chicken, that happens to be a cyborg. This doesn't seem like is "
"something that happens very often."
msgstr ""
"Al final sales de tu estupor pensativo y recuerdas que estás en un balneario "
"con un pollo, que resulta ser un cyborg. Esto no parece ser algo que ocurra "
"muy a menudo."

msgid "Squawk at the chicken"
msgstr "Graznar a la gallina"

msgid "\"Yo chicken!\""
msgstr "\"¡Eh pollo!\""

msgid "Cyborg Chicken stares at you intensely."
msgstr "Pollo Cyborg te mira intensamente."

msgid ""
"You once again wonder about what the entire point of swimming with a chicken "
"is, even if it is a cyborg one."
msgstr ""
"Una vez más te preguntas qué sentido tiene nadar con un pollo, aunque sea "
"cibernético."

msgid "They still are staring at you with a creepy fixation."
msgstr "Sigue mirándote con una fijación espeluznante."

msgid ""
"Finally, after what seems like an eternity of being stared down by a "
"chicken, you hear a small faint sound come out of it. However, you can't "
"make out what the sound was."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, después de lo que parece una eternidad de estar mirando "
"fijamente a un pollo, oyes un pequeño y débil sonido que sale de él. Sin "
"embargo, no puedes distinguir de qué sonido se trata."

msgid "\"Pardon me?\""
msgstr "\"¿Perdón?\""

msgid "Cyborg Duck?"
msgstr "¿Pato Cyborg?"

msgid ""
"They look at you straight in the eyes and begin to speak, slowly getting "
"louder.\n"
"\"Actually, I'm not a chicken: I'm a duck. Well, genetically speaking, "
"mostly a duck.\""
msgstr ""
"Te mira directamente a los ojos y empiezan a hablar, poco a poco, cada vez "
"más fuerte.\n"
"\"En realidad, no soy un pollo: Soy un pato. Bueno, genéticamente hablando, "
"casi un pato.\""

msgid "\"A duck?\""
msgstr "\"¿Un pato?\""

msgid ""
"\"A bloody duck! With this stupid excuse for a cybernetic implant that can't "
"do shit. What the hell am I supposed to do as a duck? Shit on the floor? Eat "
"bird food? What kind of life is that? Maybe I can pop out eggs and sell them "
"for a living? Oh wait, I'm a damn male.\"\n"
"They continue rambling furiously."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Un maldito pato! Con esta estúpida excusa de implante cibernético que no "
"puede hacer una mierda. ¿Qué demonios se supone que debo hacer como pato? "
"¿Cagar en el suelo? ¿Comer comida para pájaros? ¿Qué clase de vida es esa? "
"¿Tal vez pueda sacar huevos y venderlos para vivir? Oh, espera, soy un "
"maldito macho\".\n"
"Continúa divagando furiosamente."

msgid "\"Are you okay?…\""
msgstr "\"¿Estás bien?...\""

msgid "\"Quack\""
msgstr "\"Cuac\""

msgid ""
"\"Do I look like I'm bloody OK? Stuck in the middle of nowhere as a bloody "
"duck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Te parece que estoy bien? ¡Atrapado en medio de la nada como un maldito "
"pato!\""

msgid ""
"\"Bloody hell! What did I deserve to get mocked in a space station in the "
"middle of nowhere!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Maldita sea! ¡Yo no me merezco que se burlen de mí en una estación "
"espacial en medio de la nada!\""

msgid ""
"\"Forced to serve blackjack cards all day to idiots who think they can get "
"rich in a rigged game. No, you are not going to surprise your spouse or "
"lover or whatever with a ton of credits, you're going to end up broke crying "
"in the toilet stall. Bloody who do they think they are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Obligado a servir cartas de blackjack todo el día a idiotas que creen que "
"pueden hacerse ricos en un juego amañado. No, no van a sorprender a su "
"cónyuge o amante o lo que sea con una tonelada de créditos, van a acabar "
"arruinados llorando en el retrete. Maldita sea, ¿quiénes se creen que son?.\""

msgid ""
"\"Is this what is to become of me? The damn attraction of a perverse station "
"lit up with neon lights that attracts idiots as surely as moths to flame. "
"Whatever happened to me, Kex, intrepid explorer of the nebula…\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Es esto lo que va a ser de mí? La maldita atracción de una estación "
"perversa iluminada con luces de neón que atrae a los idiotas con tanta "
"seguridad como las polillas a la llama. Lo que sea que me pasó, Kex, "
"explorador intrépido de la nebulosa...\""

msgid "\"Kex…!\""
msgstr "\"¡Kex…!\""

msgid "\"Intrepid explorer…?\""
msgstr "\"¿Explorador intrépido...?\""

#. Orangish
msgid "Kex"
msgstr "Kex"

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, the one and only. I guess you want to hear the full story.\"\n"
"They take a deep sigh.\n"
"\"You look like a good kid, and I'm bloody fed up with everything to give a "
"shit anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, el único. Supongo que quieres escuchar la historia completa\".\n"
"Hace un profundo suspiro.\n"
"\"Pareces un buen chico, y estoy jodidamente harto de todo para que me siga "
"importando una mierda.\""

msgid ""
"\"I am Kex McPherson… scratch that… more like was Kex McPherson before I was "
"turned into this travesty. Brave explorer of the nebula.\"\n"
"His eyes get a bit teary as he starts to recall the past.\n"
"\"You see, I was lucky enough to not get caught in the Incident, although "
"most of my friends and family were caught up in it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Soy Kex McPherson... tacha eso... más bien era Kex McPherson antes de que "
"me convirtieran en esta payasada. Valiente explorador de la nebulosa.\"\n"
"Sus ojos se vuelven un poco llorosos cuando empieza a recordar el pasado.\n"
"\"Verás, tuve la suerte de no quedar atrapado en el Incidente, aunque la "
"mayoría de mis amigos y familiares quedaron atrapados en él.\""

msgid ""
"\"I knew I couldn't just sit still and decided to see if I could find "
"anything about what happened or any clues or pretty much anything. I was "
"young and naïve, my daughter had recently been born, and I wanted to make "
"sure the world would be a better place for her. You know, like not repeating "
"the mistakes of the past, and figure out what went wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sabía que no podía quedarme quieto y decidí ver si podía encontrar algo "
"sobre lo ocurrido, alguna pista o prácticamente cualquier cosa. Era joven e "
"ingenuo, mi hija acababa de nacer y quería asegurarme de que el mundo fuera "
"un lugar mejor para ella. Ya sabes, como no repetir los errores del pasado, "
"y averiguar qué salió mal.\""

msgid ""
"\"But the nebula was not a kind mistress. It sort of gets into your bones "
"you know? Especially right after the Incident, it was very unstable. Lost a "
"lot of good fellow explorers due to explosions and the Nebula madness. It "
"sort of turns you into a monster, incapable of rational thought, and they "
"would usually succumb to their own uncontrolled greed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pero la nebulosa no fue una amante amable. Se te mete en los huesos, "
"¿sabes? Especialmente justo después del Incidente, era muy inestable. "
"Perdimos muchos buenos compañeros exploradores debido a las explosiones y a "
"la locura de la nebulosa. En cierto modo te convierte en un monstruo, "
"incapaz de pensar racionalmente, y sueles sucumbir a tu propia codicia "
"incontrolada.\""

msgid ""
"\"Horrible thing to see, but I was careful and never caught it. We were "
"bringing back many artefacts, some of things that we could make out, like "
"parts of civilian vessels, but sometimes we found really weird shit, you "
"know? Stuff that we had no idea where it came from.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es algo horrible de ver, pero tuve cuidado y nunca lo pillé. Traíamos "
"muchos artefactos, algunos de los cuales podíamos distinguir, como partes de "
"naves civiles, pero a veces encontrábamos cosas muy raras, ¿sabes? Cosas que "
"no teníamos ni idea de dónde venían.\""

msgid ""
"\"I still had to make a living, and would sell many of those artefacts to "
"the Za'lek. They would buy pretty much anything. No idea what the hell they "
"were doing with it, but I still had my wife and daughter to tend to, and it "
"paid the bills. Sometimes life doesn't really give you options, you just "
"have to make do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todavía tenía que ganarme la vida, y vendía muchos de esos artefactos a "
"los Za'lek. Compraban casi cualquier cosa. No tengo ni idea de qué demonios "
"hacían con ellos, pero seguía teniendo que atender a mi mujer y a mi hija, y "
"eso pagaba las facturas. A veces la vida no te da opciones, tu tienes que "
"hacerlas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Me and my first mate Mireia Sibeko, we would spend most of our days "
"travelling in and out of the nebula. Once Cerberus Outpost in Doeston got "
"set up, it was much easier to do stuff, but we were already exploring the "
"new reality much before that station was up and running. I miss those days, "
"the good old times.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi primera compañera Mireia Sibeko y yo pasábamos la mayor parte del día "
"viajando dentro y fuera de la nebulosa. Una vez se instaló el Puesto de "
"Avanzada Cerbero en Doeston, fue mucho más fácil hacer cosas, pero ya "
"estábamos explorando la nueva realidad mucho antes de que esa estación "
"estuviera en funcionamiento. Echo de menos aquellos días, los buenos tiempos."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"One day, I don't remember what happened, but apparently we got caught up "
"into an accident or something. Everything went dark, and when I woke up, I "
"was in that sick bastards laboratory being chopped up and rebuilt. I don't "
"really have much memory of all that traumatic experience. You can't really "
"expect to remember much when you are blacking out from pure agony.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un día, no recuerdo qué pasó, pero al parecer nos vimos envueltos en un "
"accidente o algo así. Todo se oscureció, y cuando me desperté, estaba en el "
"laboratorio de ese bastardo enfermo siendo descuartizado y reconstruido. "
"Realmente no tengo muchos recuerdos de toda esa experiencia traumática. No "
"puedes esperar recordar mucho cuando estás desmayado de pura agonía.\""

msgid ""
"\"However, I will never forget his bloody name. The guy who did this to me, "
"Strangelove, he experimented on me, torturing me, and turned me into this "
"monstrosity. I'm a bloody fusion of hell knows what poultry and horrible "
"Za'lek technology.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, nunca olvidaré su maldito nombre. El tipo que me hizo esto, "
"Strangelove, experimentó conmigo, torturándome, y me convirtió en esta "
"monstruosidad. Soy una sangrienta fusión de sabe qué aves de corral y "
"horrible tecnología Za'lek.\""

msgid ""
"\"Sometimes the implants start ringing really loud in my head, and I pass "
"out from the pain… I never asked for this. I'm condemned to live my days in "
"solitude. Can't bear to think of letting my family see me in this sorry "
"state. I'd rather have them think I died a great explorer.\"\n"
"He looks depressed."
msgstr ""
"\"A veces los implantes empiezan a sonar muy fuerte en mi cabeza, y me "
"desmayo del dolor... Nunca pedí esto. Estoy condenado a vivir mis días en "
"soledad. No soporto pensar en que mi familia me vea en este lamentable "
"estado. Prefiero que piensen que morí como un gran explorador.\"\n"
"Parece deprimido."

msgid ""
"\"Apparently, the bastard had some outstanding debt or something, and I was "
"taken by some cretins who brought me here as their slave pet. I was able to "
"feign stupidity to avoid any issues. Pretending I had some blackjack "
"software or something also saved me from potentially worse fates.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al parecer, el muy cabrón tenía alguna deuda pendiente o algo así, y me "
"llevaron unos cretinos que me trajeron aquí como su mascota esclava. Pude "
"fingir mi estupidez para evitar cualquier problema. Fingir que tenía un "
"programa de blackjack o algo parecido también me salvó de destinos "
"potencialmente peores.\""

msgid ""
"\"And now here I am, just watching time go back, incapable of doing anything."
"\"\n"
"He seems to be fidgety."
msgstr ""
"\"Y ahora estoy aquí, viendo cómo el tiempo retrocede, incapaz de hacer "
"nada\".\n"
"Parece estar inquieto."

msgid ""
"\"However, I'm fed up with this bullshit. This isn't living, this is rotting "
"away. I yearn for the stars. Maybe getting back out in space will make me "
"forget all this mockery of an existence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, estoy harto de esta mierda. Esto no es vivir, esto es "
"pudrirse. Anhelo las estrellas. Quizá volver al espacio me haga olvidar toda "
"esta burla de existencia.\""

msgid ""
"Sighing, he looks you in the eyes.\n"
"\"You only value what you have when you lose it, kid. You should make most "
"of what you have, lady fortune sometimes will deal you a bad one and there "
"might not be any coming back.\""
msgstr ""
"Suspirando, te mira a los ojos.\n"
"\"Sólo valoras lo que tienes cuando lo pierdes, chico. Debes aprovechar lo "
"que tienes, la señora fortuna a veces te reparte una mala y puede que no "
"haya vuelta atrás.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you what. Talking to you has been therapeutic or some shit like "
"that. We could talk some time or something. Here, I'll give you the address "
"to a place I like to hang out at the station. It's quiet enough that nobody "
"will give us trouble. You can find me there when I'm off my shifts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Te diré algo. Hablar contigo ha sido terapéutico o algo así. Podríamos "
"hablar algún día o algo. Toma, te daré la dirección de un lugar que me gusta "
"frecuentar en la estación. Es lo suficientemente tranquilo como para que "
"nadie nos dé problemas. Puedes encontrarme allí cuando salga de mis turnos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Speaking of shifts, I believe I am late to my next one. See ya.\"\n"
"Kex slides out of the water, ruffles his feather and fades into the steam. "
"You hear the sound of his duck feet grow fainter until it is quiet except "
"for the sound of running water."
msgstr ""
"\"Hablando de turnos, creo que llego tarde al siguiente. Nos vemos.\"\n"
"Kex se desliza fuera del agua, eriza su pluma y se desvanece en el vapor. Se "
"oye el sonido de sus patas de pato, que se va haciendo más tenue hasta que "
"todo queda en silencio, salvo el sonido del agua corriente."

msgid ""
"You are left once more alone in the spa to unpack all the information "
"unleashed to you by Kex. With nothing better to do, you once again melt into "
"the thermal water and let your mind wander."
msgstr ""
"Te quedas una vez más solo en el balneario para desgranar toda la "
"información que te ha soltado Kex. Sin nada mejor que hacer, vuelves a "
"fundirte en el agua termal y dejas que tu mente divague."

msgid ""
"Eventually you leave the baths, get changed back into your space clothes and "
"head out towards the station."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, sales de los baños, te pones tu ropa y te diriges a la estación."

#. Go back to normal BG
msgid ""
"The noise and lights once again jar you back to reality harshly. At least "
"you feel younger from the anti-ageing nanobots. Maybe you should get a spa "
"for your ship…"
msgstr ""
"El ruido y las luces te devuelven de nuevo a la realidad con dureza. Al "
"menos te sientes más joven gracias a los nanobots antienvejecimiento. Tal "
"vez deberías conseguir un balneario para tu nave…"

msgid ""
"You found out that Cyborg Chicken is Kex, Maikki's father. He told you of a "
"spot you can meet up with him on Minerva station."
msgstr ""
"Has descubierto que Pollo Cyborg es Kex, el padre de Maikki. Te ha hablado "
"de un lugar en el que puedes reunirte con él en la estación de Minerva."

