msgid ""
"You are sitting at your command chair when you suddenly hear a horrible "
"scraping noise throughout the ship. Fearing the worst, you unholster your "
"weapon and carefully go investigate."
msgstr ""
"Estás sentado en tu sillón de mando cuando de repente oyes un horrible ruido "
"de raspado por toda la nave. Temiendo lo peor, desenfundas tu arma y vas con "
"cuidado a investigar."

msgid ""
"Eventually you find it seems to be coming out of a cleaning robot that is "
"tidying your ship. You find something jammed in it, it looks quite odd. You "
"fiddle a bit with it until you are able to pull it out."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente descubres que el sonido parece salir de un robot de limpieza que "
"está ordenando tu nave. Encuentras algo atascado en él, con un aspecto "
"bastante extraño. Lo manipulas un poco hasta que consigues sacarlo."

msgid ""
"It looks like a feather? A quite fancy one at that with a metal core? Not "
"sure what to make of it, you pocked the strange cyborg feather as you don't "
"think Kex will need it back."
msgstr ""
"¿Parece una pluma? ¿Una muy elegante con un núcleo de metal? No sabes qué "
"pensar, pero te guardas la extraña pluma ciborg porque no crees que Kex vaya "
"a necesitarla."

msgid ""
"Maybe this is a sign that you should go pay Kex and Maikki a visit at New "
"Haven?"
msgstr ""
"¿Quizás sea una señal de que deberías ir a visitar a Kex y Maikki a Nuevo "
"Refugio?"

