msgid ""
"You make your way to the blackjack table which seems to be surrounded by "
"many patrons, some of which are apparently taking pictures of something. You "
"eventually have to elbow your way to the front to get a view of what is "
"going on."
msgstr ""
"Te diriges a la mesa de blackjack, que parece estar rodeada de muchos "
"clientes, algunos de los cuales parecen estar haciendo fotos de algo. Al "
"final tienes que abrirte paso a codazos hasta la parte delantera para poder "
"ver lo que está pasando."

msgid ""
"When you make it to the front you are greeted by the cold eyes of what "
"apparently seems to be the Cyborg Chicken you were told about. It seems to "
"be sizing the crowd while playing against a patron. The way it moves is very "
"uncanny with short precise mechanical motions. You can tell it has been "
"doing this for a while. You watch as the game progresses and the patron "
"loses all his credits to the chicken, who seems unfazed."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegas al frente te recibe la fría mirada de lo que parece ser el "
"Pollo Cyborg del que te hablaron. Parece estar midiendo al público mientras "
"juega contra un cliente. La forma en que se mueve es muy extraña, con "
"movimientos mecánicos cortos y precisos. Se nota que lleva tiempo "
"haciéndolo. Observas cómo avanza la partida y el cliente pierde todos sus "
"créditos ante el pollo, que parece no inmutarse."

msgid ""
"You elbow your way to the front of the table and are once again greeted by "
"the cold mechanical eyes of Cyborg Chicken."
msgstr ""
"Te abres paso a codazos hasta la parte delantera de la mesa y, una vez más, "
"te reciben los fríos ojos mecánicos del Pollo Cyborg."

#. Clear buffer without waiting
msgid "Play"
msgstr "Jugar"

msgid "Explanation"
msgstr "Explicación"

msgid ""
"Cyborg Chicken's eyes blink one second and go blank as a pre-recorded "
"explanation is played from its back. Wait… are those embedded speakers?"
msgstr ""
"Los ojos del Pollo Cyborg parpadean un segundo y se quedan en blanco "
"mientras se reproduce una explicación pregrabada desde su espalda. Espera... "
"¿son altavoces integrados?"

msgid ""
"\"Welcome to MINERVA STATION'S blackjack table. The objective of this card "
"game is to get as close to a value of 21 without going over. All cards are "
"worth their rank except for Jack, Queen, and King which are all worth 10, "
"and ace is either worth 1 or 11. You win if you have a higher value than "
"CYBORG CHICKEN without going over 21.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bienvenido a la mesa de blackjack de ESTACIÓN MINERVA. El objetivo de este "
"juego de cartas es acercarse al máximo al valor de 21 sin pasarse. Todas las "
"cartas valen su rango, excepto la jota, la reina y el rey, que valen 10, y "
"el as vale 1 u 11. Ganas si tienes un valor más alto que POLLO CYBORG sin "
"pasarte de 21.\""

msgid ""
"Cyborg Chicken eyes flutter as it seems like consciousness returns to its "
"body."
msgstr ""
"Los ojos del Pollo Cyborg revolotean cuando parece que la conciencia vuelve "
"a su cuerpo."

msgid "You leave the blackjack table behind and head back to the main area."
msgstr "Dejas atrás la mesa de blackjack y vuelves a la zona principal."

