msgid "Flintley"
msgstr "Flintley"

msgid ""
"Flintley is here. He nervously sips from his drink, clearly uncomfortable in "
"this environment."
msgstr ""
"Flintley está aquí. Da un sorbo nervioso a su bebida, claramente incómodo en "
"este entorno."

msgid ""
"Flintley greets you, relieved to see a friendly face. \"Hello again, "
"{player}. What brings you here today? As you can see, I'm here on business "
"again. Nothing too interesting, I'm afraid, just everyday stuff.\"\n"
"You spend some time chatting with Flintley, then you get back to work."
msgstr ""
"Flintley te saluda, aliviado de ver una cara amiga. \"Hola de nuevo, "
"{player}. ¿Qué te trae hoy por aquí? Como puedes ver, estoy aquí de nuevo "
"por negocios. Nada demasiado interesante, me temo, sólo cosas cotidianas\".\n"
"Pasas un rato charlando con Flintley y luego vuelves al trabajo."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <event name="Prowling baron">
#. <location>enter</location>
#. <chance>100</chance>
