#. Create question
msgid "\"What class is the #o{ship}#0 ship?\""
msgstr "\"¿De qué clase es la nave #o{ship}#0?\""

#. Create question
msgid "\"What is the name of this ship?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cuál es el nombre de esta nave?\""

#. elseif difficulty == 2 then
#. Create the log if necessary.
msgid "Ship Quiz"
msgstr "Prueba de Naves"

msgid "Neutral"
msgstr "Neutral"

#. Ignore claimed systems (don't want to ruin the atmosphere)
#. See how many times cleared
#. Clear met if didn't play last time
#. Increase the difficulty as progresses
#. Generate the question
#. Determine reward
msgid ""
"You obtained 1 {outfit} from the Ship Enthusiast for getting 5 quizzes right."
msgstr ""
"Obtuviste un {outfit} de la Entusiasta de las Naves por acertar 5 pruebas."

msgid ""
"\"Wow. This is the 5th time you got my quiz right. This deserves a special "
"reward. Here, take this special trading card. Don't worry, I have a dozen "
"like it. I'll have to step up my quiz game from now on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vaya. Es la quinta vez que aciertas mi cuestionario. Esto merece una "
"recompensa especial. Toma, coge esta tarjeta especial de intercambio. No te "
"preocupes, tengo una docena como esta. Tendré que mejorar mi juego de "
"preguntas a partir de ahora.\""

msgid ""
"You obtained 1 {outfit} from the Ship Enthusiast for getting 10 quizzes "
"right."
msgstr ""
"Obtuviste un {outfit} de la Entusiasta de las Naves por acertar 10 pruebas."

msgid ""
"\"Wow. This is the 10th time you got my quiz right. You are doing much "
"better than I anticipated. Here, take one of my favourite trading cards. "
"Make sure not to lose it, this one is fairly special! I'll have to think of "
"better quizzes from now on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vaya, es la décima vez que aciertas mi cuestionario. Lo estás haciendo "
"mucho mejor de lo que esperaba. Toma, coge una de mis cartas de intercambio "
"preferidas. Asegúrate de no perderla, ¡ésta es bastante especial! Tendré que "
"pensar en mejores pruebas a partir de ahora.\""

msgid ""
"You obtained a {outfit} from the Ship Enthusiast for getting 25 quizzes "
"right."
msgstr ""
"Obtuviste un {outfit} de la Entusiasta de las Naves por acertar 25 pruebas."

msgid ""
"\"Damn. This is the 25th time you got my quiz right. Nobody has played my "
"quiz with me for this long. I guess I have to commemorate this in a special "
"way. Here, take one of the rarest cards in my collection. I only have one "
"copy of this one so make sure to take good care of it. No! Don't take it out "
"of the card foil! It might get damaged that way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea. Esta es la 25ª vez que aciertas mi cuestionario. Nadie ha "
"jugado mi prueba conmigo durante tanto tiempo. Supongo que tengo que "
"conmemorar esto de una manera especial. Toma, coge una de las cartas más "
"raras de mi colección. Sólo tengo una copia de ésta, así que asegúrate de "
"cuidarla bien. ¡No! ¡Ni se te ocurra sacarla de la lámina de la tarjeta! "
"¡Podría dañarse de esa forma!\""

msgid ""
"You obtained {credits} from the Ship Enthusiast for getting a quiz right."
msgstr ""
"Has obtenido {credits} de la Entusiasta de las naves por acertar una prueba."

#. Don't trigger hooks
msgid ""
"\"That's right! Damn, I thought you wouldn't know this one. You've solved my "
"quiz {n} time now! Here, take this as a reward for your performance.\""
msgid_plural ""
"\"That's right! Damn, I thought you wouldn't know this one. You've solved my "
"quiz {n} times now! Here, take this as a reward for your performance.\""
msgstr[0] ""
"\"¡Eso es! Maldita sea, pensé que no sabrías esta. ¡Has resuelto mi "
"cuestionario {n} vez! Toma, coge esto como recompensa por tu actuación.\""
msgstr[1] ""
"\"¡Eso es! Maldita sea, pensé que no sabrías esta. ¡Has resuelto mi "
"cuestionario {n} veces! Toma, coge esto como recompensa por tu actuación.\""

#. Set up NPC and hooks
msgid "Ship Enthusiast"
msgstr "Entusiasta de las Naves"

msgid ""
"You see a surprisingly young individual who is playing with a small ship "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un individuo sorprendentemente joven que está jugando con un pequeño "
"modelo de nave."

#. First meeting
msgid ""
"You approach the individual who is making weird noises, likely imitating "
"space ship noises, while playing with a space ship toy."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a la individua que está haciendo ruidos extraños, probablemente "
"imitando ruidos de naves espaciales, mientras juega con un juguete de nave "
"espacial."

msgid ""
"\"Why hello there. How do you like my new limited edition Lancelot figurine?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vaya, hola. ¿Qué te parece mi nueva estatuilla de edición limitada de "
"Lancelot?\""

msgid "\"It looks great!\""
msgstr "\"¡Se ve muy bien!\""

msgid "\"It's awful.\""
msgstr "\"Es horrible.\""

msgid "\"Aren't you too young to be here?\""
msgstr "\"¿No eres demasiado joven para estar aquí?\""

msgid "\"You know I own a real one.\""
msgstr "\"Sabes que tengo una de verdad.\""

msgid ""
"\"I know right! It cost me a lot to find it. It was sold out all over! But "
"it was all worth it in the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Lo sé bien! Me costó mucho encontrarlo. ¡Estaba agotado por todas partes! "
"Pero al final valió la pena.\""

msgid ""
"\"Phhhsssh. You can't appreciate this beauty. Look at the curves! The "
"shining lights! It's a fully anatomically correct 1/128 scale model! You can "
"even see the pilots through the cockpit.\"\n"
"You look closely and indeed are able to see the pilots. The level of detail "
"is fairly ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"\"Phhhsssh. No puedes apreciar esta belleza. ¡Mira las curvas! ¡Las luces "
"brillantes! ¡Es un modelo a escala 1/128 totalmente anatómico! Incluso "
"puedes ver a los pilotos a través de la cabina\".\n"
"Miras de cerca y, efectivamente, se pueden ver a los pilotos. El nivel de "
"detalle es verdaderamente ridículo."

msgid ""
"\"Aren't you too old to be here? It's not like I'm drinking or anything.\"\n"
"They stick their tongue out at you as they still play with the space ship."
msgstr ""
"\"¿No eres demasiado mayor para estar aquí? No es que esté bebiendo o algo "
"así\".\n"
"Te saca la lengua mientras siguen jugando con la nave espacial."

msgid ""
"\"Really? Is it a Sigma-5 squadron Golden Efreeti model too?! You don't know "
"what that is? Stop messing with me, it's probably just another mass-produced "
"Lancelot without any history behind it. This is a masterpiece!\"\n"
"They lift up their toy Lancelot. You can barely make out a golden Efreeti "
"etched on the side."
msgstr ""
"\"¿De verdad? ¿También es un modelo del escuadrón Sigma-5 Efreeti Dorado? "
"¿No sabes lo que es? Deja de meterte conmigo, probablemente sea otro "
"Lancelot producido en masa sin ninguna historia detrás. Esto es una obra "
"maestra\".\n"
"Levanta su Lancelot de juguete. Apenas se puede distinguir un Efreeti dorado "
"grabado en el lateral."

msgid ""
"\"You know what, let's play a game. I know ALL the facts of all the ships. "
"I'll ask you a question and if you get it right, I'll give you a nice "
"reward. What do you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabes qué? Vamos a jugar a un juego. Conozco TODOS los datos de todos las "
"naves. Te haré una pregunta y si la aciertas, te daré una buena recompensa. "
"¿Qué dices?\""

#. Met, didn't play quiz and came back
msgid "You once again approach the ship enthusiast."
msgstr "De nuevo te acercas al Entusiasta de las naves."

msgid ""
"\"So you're back. Did you change your mind about playing my ship quiz?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que has vuelto. ¿Cambiaste de opinión sobre jugar a mi prueba de naves?"
"\""

msgid ""
"You once again approach the ship enthusiast. They seem to move about a lot."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a acercarte a la entusiasta de las naves. Parece que se mueve un "
"montón."

msgid ""
"\"Would you like to play another round of the ship quiz? I think the "
"question I prepared will stump you completely!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Te gustaría jugar otra ronda de la prueba de naves? ¡Creo que la pregunta "
"que he preparado te dejará completamente perplejo!\""

msgid "\"Yes!\""
msgstr "\"¡Sí!\""

msgid "\"No.\""
msgstr "\"No.\""

msgid "\"Oh well, your loss!\""
msgstr "\"¡Oh, bueno, tú te lo pierdes!\""

msgid "\"Great! So here it goes. Listen carefully.\""
msgstr "\"¡Genial! Así que aquí va. Escucha con atención.\""

msgid "\"Great! So take a look at this ship and listen carefully.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Así que echa un vistazo a esta nave y escucha con atención.\""

#. Show choices
#. Give reward
msgid "You got the Ship Enthusiast's quiz wrong."
msgstr "Te equivocaste en la prueba de la Entusiasta de las Naves."

#. TODO wrong sound
msgid ""
"They look smug as they exclaim \"Wrong!\".\n"
"\"The correct answer was #g{answer}#0! Better luck next time.\"\n"
"They take their leave."
msgstr ""
"Parece presumida mientras exclama \"¡Error!\".\n"
"\"¡La respuesta correcta era #g{answer}#0! Mejor suerte la próxima vez\".\n"
"Y se despide."

#. Non-persistent state
#. Make sure system isn't claimed, but we don't claim it
#. The _("Shipwrecked {plt}") will be a random trader vessel.
#. Create the derelict.
msgid "Shipwrecked {plt}"
msgstr "Náufragos en {plt}"

#. Added extra visibility for big systems (A.)
#. Set hooks
#. Ship broadcasts an SOS every 15 seconds, until boarded or destroyed.
msgid ""
"SOS. This is {plt}. We are shipwrecked. Please #bboard#0 us by #bdouble-"
"clicking#0 on our ship."
msgstr ""

#. Player boards the _("Shipwrecked {plt}") and rescues the crew, this spawns a new mission.
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <event name="Surano Pirates">
#. <unique/>
#. <location>load</location>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. </event>
#. --
#.
#. Small blockade of pirates in the Surano system that persist until
#. eliminated
#. --
msgid "Black Goatee"
msgstr "Perilla Negra"

#. Check to see if player is spotted
msgid "This system is under my control! Eat hot plasma!"
msgstr "¡Este sistema está bajo mi control! ¡Come plasma caliente!"

msgid "This system is under {pirate} control! Scram!"
msgstr "¡Este sistema está bajo control {pirate}! ¡Largo!"

#. Check if done
msgid "{left} pirate left to clear the blockade."
msgid_plural "{left} pirates left to clear the blockade."
msgstr[0] "{left} pirata queda para despejar el bloqueo."
msgstr[1] "{left} piratas quedan para despejar el bloqueo."

