msgid "I have new wares you might want to see!"
msgstr "¡Tengo nuevos artículos que quizás quieras ver!"

msgid ""
"\"Howdy Human! Er, I mean, Greetings! If you want to take a look at my "
"wonderful, exquisite, propitious, meretricious, effulgent, … wait, what was "
"I talking about? Oh yes, please come see my wares on my ship. You are "
"welcome to board anytime!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola, humano! Er, quiero decir, ¡Saludos! Si quieres echar un vistazo a "
"mi maravillosa, exquisita, propicia, meretriz, refulgente, ... espera, ¿de "
"qué estaba hablando? Oh sí, por favor, ven a ver mis mercancías en mi nave. "
"¡Son bienvenidos a bordo cuando quieran!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Howdy Human! I have new propitious and meretricious wares available. Come "
"see the wares on my ship!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola Humano! Tengo nuevas mercancías propicias y merecidas disponibles. "
"¡Ven a ver las mercancías a mi nave!\""

#. Boarding sound
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You open the airlock and are immediately greeted by an intense humidity and "
"heat, almost like a jungle. As you advance through the dimly lit ship you "
"can see all types of mould and plants crowing in crevices in the wall. Wait, "
"was that a small animal scurrying around? Eventually you reach the cargo "
"hold that has been re-adapted as a sort of bazaar. As you look around the "
"mess of different wares, most seemingly to be garbage, you suddenly notice a "
"mysterious figure standing in front of you. You're surprised at how you "
"didn't notice them getting so close to you, almost like a ghost."
msgstr ""
"Abres la esclusa e inmediatamente te recibe una humedad y un calor intensos, "
"casi como de jungla. A medida que avanzas por la nave poco iluminada puedes "
"ver todo tipo de moho y plantas cantando en las grietas de la pared. Espera, "
"¿era eso un pequeño animal correteando por ahí? Finalmente llegas a la "
"bodega de carga que ha sido readaptada como una especie de bazar. Mientras "
"observas el desorden de mercancías, la mayoría aparentemente basura, de "
"repente te fijas en una misteriosa figura de pie frente a ti. Te sorprende "
"no haber notado que se acercaba tanto a ti, casi como un fantasma."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You stare dumbfounded at the figure who seems to be capturing your entire "
"essence with a piercing gaze, when suddenly you can barely make out what "
"seems to be a large grin.\n"
"\"You look a bit funky for a human, but all are welcome at Misi's Fabulous "
"Bazaar!\"\n"
"They throw their hands up in the air, tossing what seems to be some sort of "
"confetti. Wait, is that ship mould?"
msgstr ""
"Te quedas boquiabierto mirando a la figura que parece captar toda tu esencia "
"con una mirada penetrante, cuando de repente apenas puedes distinguir lo que "
"parece ser una gran sonrisa.\n"
"\"Pareces un poco raro para ser humano, ¡pero todos son bienvenidos al "
"Fabuloso Bazar de Misi!\".\n"
"Levanta las manos y lanza lo que parece ser una especie de confeti. Espera, "
"¿es eso de la nave moho?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"During my travels, I've collected quite a fair amount of rare and "
"expensive jun… I mean trinkets from all over the galaxy. Not many appreciate "
"my fine wares, so I peddle them as I travel around. If you see anything you "
"fancy, I'll let it go for a fair price. You won't find such a good bargain "
"anywhere else!\""
msgstr ""
"\"En mis viajes, he coleccionado una buena cantidad de trastos raros y "
"caros... quiero decir, baratijas de toda la galaxia. No muchos aprecian mis "
"baratijas, así que las vendo en mis viajes. Si ves algo que te guste, te lo "
"daré por un precio justo. ¡No encontrarás una ganga tan buena en ningún otro "
"sitio!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You open the airlock and are immediately greeted by an intense humidity and "
"heat, almost like a jungle. As you advance through the dimly lit ship you "
"can see all types of mould and plants crowing in crevices in the wall. Wait, "
"was that a small animal scurrying around? Eventually you reach the cargo "
"hold bazaar where Misi is waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"Abres la esclusa e inmediatamente te recibe una humedad y un calor intensos, "
"casi como una jungla. A medida que avanzas por la nave poco iluminada puedes "
"ver todo tipo de moho y plantas cacareando en las grietas de la pared. "
"Espera, ¿era eso un pequeño animal correteando por ahí? Finalmente llegas a "
"la bodega de carga que contiene el bazaar donde Misi te esta esperando."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Suddenly they start sniffing the air.\n"
"\"Wait is that…?\"\n"
"They get uncomfortably close\n"
"\"Say, you smell like… something odd…"
msgstr ""
"De repente empieza a olfatear el aire.\n"
"\"Espera, ¿eso es...?\"\n"
"Se acerca incómodamente\n"
"\"Oye, hueles a... algo raro…"

msgid ""
"They seem to mutter something under their breath as the pace around trying "
"to remember. Suddenly, they stop, turn around and point at you and exclaim:\n"
"\"Data Matrices!\""
msgstr ""
"Parece murmurar algo en voz baja mientras caminan de un lado a otro "
"intentando recordar. De repente, se detiene, se da la vuelta, te señala y "
"exclama:\n"
"\"¡Matrices de datos!\""

msgid "\"You wouldn't have happened to come about some Data Matrices?\""
msgstr "\"¿No se te habrás cruzado con algunas Matrices de Datos?\""

msgctxt "not to come"
msgid "\"No\""
msgstr "\"No\""

msgctxt "not to come"
msgid "\"Yes\""
msgstr "\"Sí\""

msgid "\"…\""
msgstr "\"…\""

msgid "\"I knew it! I would never forget that smell in a lifetime.\""
msgstr "\"¡Lo sabía! No olvidaría ese olor en toda mi vida.\""

msgid "\"Hah, I can clearly see through your lies. You can't fool my nose!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hah, puedo ver claramente a través de tus mentiras. ¡No puedes engañar a "
"mi nariz!\""

msgid ""
"\"Cat's got your tongue? No point in wasting breath when the answer is clear."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿El gato te ha comido la lengua? No tiene sentido malgastar saliva cuando "
"la respuesta está clara.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"They sniff the air as to confirm their findings.\n"
"\"You haven't been able to decrypt them, have you? Old technology is a "
"bugger, and most of the cipher codes have been lost, not making it an easy "
"task. I don't think the Encrypted Data Matrices will be of any use to you. "
"However, if you're willing to trade, I have some better offerings that may "
"pique your interest.\""
msgstr ""
"Olfatea el aire para confirmar su hallazgo.\n"
"\"No han podido desencriptarlos, ¿verdad? La tecnología antigua es un "
"engorro, y la mayoría de los códigos cifrados se han perdido, por lo que no "
"es una tarea fácil. No creo que las matrices de datos encriptadas te sirvan "
"de nada. Sin embargo, si estás dispuesto a comerciar, tengo algunas ofertas "
"mejores que pueden despertar tu interés.\""

msgid ""
"\"If you aren't interested in material goods, I also have some special "
"services up my sleeves that should suit any of your ships. Just ask me about "
"them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si no te interesan los bienes materiales, también tengo algunos servicios "
"especiales bajo la manga que deberían convenir a cualquiera de tus naves. "
"Pregúntame por ellos.\""

msgid ""
"Guaranteed to not smell like they were plundered from some stinky old "
"derelict!"
msgstr ""
"¡Garantizado que no huelen como si hubieran sido robadas de un viejo y "
"apestoso vertedero!"

msgid "Part of a complete breakfast!"
msgstr "¡Parte de un desayuno completo!"

msgid "Buy one and get zero free!"
msgstr "¡Compre uno y llévese cero gratis!"

msgid "Now free of flesh-eating bacteria!"
msgstr "¡Ahora libre de bacterias carnívoras!"

msgid "Goes well with a side of rice!"
msgstr "¡Va bien con una guarnición de arroz!"

msgid "Now with fewer side effects!"
msgstr "¡Ahora con menos efectos secundarios!"

msgid ""
"\"I haven't seen you in a while old friend! I've gotten some new wares you "
"may want to see. Always the best quality! {sillyphrase}\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hacía tiempo que no te veía, viejo amigo! He comprado algunas cosas "
"nuevas que quizá quieras ver. ¡Siempre la mejor calidad! {sillyphrase}\""

msgid ""
"\"I haven't seen you in a while old friend! Looking for a bargain again? "
"Always the best quality! {sillyphrase}\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hacía tiempo que no te veía, viejo amigo! ¿Buscando una ganga otra vez? "
"¡Siempre la mejor calidad! {sillyphrase}\""

msgid "What do you wish to do?"
msgstr "¿Qué deseas hacer?"

msgid "Shop (#rNew Wares!#0)"
msgstr "Tienda (#r¡Nuevas Mercancias!#0)"

msgid "Shop"
msgstr "Tienda"

msgid "Special Services"
msgstr "Servicios Especiales"

#. Mark outfits as seen
#. Open store
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"So you're interested in my special services. Quite a bargain might I say. "
"Each service costs only {cost}.\"\n"
"\n"
"You currently have {amount}."
msgstr ""
"\"Así que estás interesado en mis servicios especiales. Toda una ganga se "
"podría decir. Cada servicio cuesta sólo {cost}.\"\n"
"\n"
"Actualmente tienes {amount}."

#. Create the window.
msgid "Info"
msgstr "Información"

msgid "{intrinsic} Service"
msgstr "Servicio {intrinsic}"

msgid ""
"\"I would be able to provide my special services for, let's say, {cost}, how "
"does that sound?\"\n"
"\n"
"{upgrade_desc}\n"
"\n"
"You have {amount}. Pay {cost} for {upgrade}?"
msgstr ""
"\"Podría prestar mis servicios especiales por, digamos, {cost}, ¿qué te "
"parece?\".\n"
"\n"
"{upgrade_desc}\n"
"\n"
"Tienes {amount}. ¿Pagar {cost} por {upgrade}?"

#. TODO better visualization of the stats and details, maybe an outfit that on mouse over shows all the stats or something?
msgid ""
"\"It seems like I have already upgraded your current ship with {upgradename}."
"\""
msgstr "\"Parece que ya he mejorado tu nave actual con {upgradename}.\""

msgid ""
"\"It seems like I have already upgraded your current ship with "
"{replacement}. Would you like to replace it with {upgrade} for 2 Encrypted "
"Data Matrices?\"\n"
"\n"
"{upgrade_desc}\n"
"\n"
"You have {amount}. Pay {cost} for replacing {replacement} with {upgrade}?"
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que ya he actualizado tu nave actual con {replacement}. ¿Te "
"gustaría reemplazarla con {upgrade} por 2 Matrices de Datos Encriptadas?\"\n"
"\n"
"{upgrade_desc}\n"
"\n"
"Tienes {amount}. ¿Pagar {coste} por sustituir {replacement} por {upgrade}?"

msgid ""
"\"This will take a second.\"\n"
"They grab a toolbox and rush over to your boarded ship. You decide not to "
"follow as some things are best left not known. At least they know what they "
"are doing right?"
msgstr ""
"\"Esto llevará un segundo\".\n"
"Agarra una caja de herramientas y corre hacia tu nave ya abordada. Decides "
"no seguirlo, ya que algunas cosas es mejor no saberlas. Al menos sabe lo que "
"hace, ¿no?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eventually, they come back covered in what seems to be fish parts and "
"slime.\n"
"\"That was fun! However, when I put it back together, I found some extra "
"screws. Oh well, it does seem to hold together fairly well. Hope you enjoy "
"the upgrades! The fish smell will go away in a few periods, hopefully.\""
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, regresa cubierto de lo que parecen ser partes de peces y baba.\n"
"\"¡Ha sido divertido! Sin embargo, cuando lo volví a montar, encontré "
"algunos tornillos de más. Bueno, parece que se mantiene bastante bien. "
"Espero que disfrutes de las mejoras. El olor a pescado desaparecerá en unos "
"pocos periodos, con suerte.\""

#. Remove old and add new
msgid "\"OK, tell me if you change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"De acuerdo, avísame si cambias de opinión.\""

msgid ""
"\"You'll need to get some Encrypted Data Matrices first to be able to get an "
"upgrade!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Primero tendrás que conseguir algunas Matrices de Datos Encriptadas para "
"poder obtener una actualización!\""

msgid ""
"\"Throughout my travels, I've been in many a tight spot. I remember getting "
"stuck with a broken engine capacitor in a lost asteroid field, no food, no "
"equipment, and a hull leaking solar radiation. It was either adapt or "
"perish, and me being here is a testament to my ship modification skills "
"acquired under pressure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"A lo largo de mis viajes, he estado en muchos apuros. Recuerdo quedarme "
"atrapado con un condensador de motor roto en un campo de asteroides perdido, "
"sin comida, sin equipo y con un casco que filtraba radiación solar. Era "
"adaptarse o perecer, y que yo esté aquí es un testimonio de mis habilidades "
"para modificar naves adquiridas bajo presión.\""

msgid ""
"\"Or it could be the Toni's Discount Ship Repair Certification Course I did "
"for {cost} in a back-alley on Darkshed. Still never really understood why we "
"need to slap fish skin on the radiators. Bug juice would work much better, "
"but anyway, I got my licence and I can spruce up your ship for all your "
"space needs!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I can offer you three different services, however, you can only have one "
"active at a time on your ship. It is possible to change them if you wish "
"though. In particular, I offer three services: Machiavellian Necessity, "
"Machiavellian Fortune, and Machiavellian Virtue.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Puedo ofrecerle tres servicios diferentes, sin embargo, sólo puedes tener "
"uno activo a la vez en tu nave. No obstante, es posible cambiarlos si lo "
"deseas. En concreto, ofrezco tres servicios: Maquiavélica Necesidad, "
"Maquiavélica Fortuna y Maquiavélica Virtud.\""

msgid ""
"\"Machiavellian Necessity focuses on tweaking your weapon systems to be able "
"to take decisive action when necessary.\"\n"
"\"Machiavellian Fortune will help you minimize the risks of fickleness of "
"fortune.\"\n"
"\"Finally, Machiavellian Virtue will make you a bulwark against unforeseen "
"mishaps.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maquiavélica Necesidad se centra en ajustar tus sistemas de armas para "
"poder actuar con decisión cuando sea necesario\".\n"
"\"La Fortuna Maquiavélica te ayudará a minimizar los riesgos de la "
"inconstancia de la fortuna.\"\n"
"\"Por último, la Virtud Maquiavélica te convertirá en un baluarte contra "
"contratiempos imprevistos.\""

