#. Only do 5 tries to not overlap
#. Make sure NPC doesn't overlap with new NPCs
#. Also try make sure it's not a message we have seen before
#. in case of multiple messages, we concatenate into one
#. Try to recreate
msgid "NPC spawner failed to spawn NPC!"
msgstr "¡El generador de PNJ no ha podido generar PNJ!"

#. local fmt = require "format"
#. State. Nothing persists.
msgid "A Black Lotus clansperson sipping a sophisticated cocktail."
msgstr "Un miembro del clan Loto Negro saboreando un sofisticado cóctel."

msgid "A Black Lotus pirate with a sharp wit and a charming smile."
msgstr ""
"Un pirata del Loto Negro con un ingenio agudo y una sonrisa encantadora."

#. codespell:ignore wit
msgid "A Black Lotus clansperson with a subtle hint of intrigue."
msgstr "Una persona del clan Loto Negro con un sutil toque de intriga."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A Black Lotus clansperson skilfully manipulating a deck of cards in a "
"mesmerizing display of precision."
msgstr ""
"Un miembro del clan Loto Negro manipula hábilmente una baraja de cartas en "
"un fascinante despliegue de precisión."

msgid "A Black Lotus pirate elegantly sipping a glass of vintage wine."
msgstr "Un pirata del Loto Negro sorbe con elegancia una copa de vino añejo."

msgid "A burly Black Lotus clansperson scanning the bar for trouble."
msgstr ""
"Un fornido miembro del clan Loto Negro escanea el bar en busca de problemas."

msgid ""
"A tall Black Lotus clansperson quietly observing the spaceport's comings and "
"goings with a penetrating gaze."
msgstr ""
"Un alto miembro del clan del Loto Negro observa en silencio las idas y "
"venidas del puerto espacial con una mirada penetrante."

msgid ""
"\"I thought joining a pirate clan would lead to adventure and flying around "
"the universe. Instead, I spend all my time crunching numbers in a cubicle. "
"Maybe I picked the wrong clan to join.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pensé que unirme a un clan pirata me llevaría a la aventura y a volar por "
"el universo. En lugar de eso, me paso todo el tiempo haciendo números en un "
"cubículo. Quizá elegí mal el clan al que unirme.\""

msgid ""
"\"Being in the Black Lotus has its perks, health care is much better than "
"what I had back when I lived in the Empire!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estar en el Loto Negro tiene sus ventajas, ¡la sanidad es mucho mejor que "
"la que tenía cuando vivía en el Imperio!\""

msgid ""
"\"They say our methods are anti-social and violent, yet the Great Houses get "
"away with incarceration and taxation at a massive scale! Who is the real "
"criminal here?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Dicen que nuestros métodos son antisociales y violentos, y sin embargo "
"las Grandes Casas se salen con la suya encarcelando e imponiendo impuestos a "
"gran escala! ¿Quién es el verdadero criminal aquí?\""

msgid ""
"\"We're the real ones keeping the peace here. If it weren't for us, House "
"Za'lek and House Dvaered would be wiping planets clean and killing billions "
"of people! Humanity should be grateful to us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nosotros somos los que realmente mantenemos la paz aquí. ¡Si no fuera por "
"nosotros, la Casa Za'lek y la Casa Dvaered estarían limpiando planetas y "
"matando a miles de millones de personas! La humanidad debería estarnos "
"agradecida.\""

msgid ""
"\"Funny how House Za'lek condemns piracy, yet they always come crawling for "
"us to get them their scientific toys. Talk about double standards.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es curioso cómo la Casa Za'lek condena la piratería, y sin embargo siempre "
"vienen arrastrándose para que les consigamos sus juguetes científicos. "
"Hablando de doble moral.\""

msgid ""
"\"We pirates are supposed to be the violent brutes, yet House Dvaered is "
"subjugating everything they can get their hands on by force, including each "
"other!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se supone que los piratas somos los brutos violentos, y sin embargo la "
"Casa Dvaered está subyugando todo lo que puede por la fuerza, ¡incluidos los "
"unos a los otros!\""

msgid ""
"\"The Black Lotus is all about making use of personal skill. If you work "
"hard enough, you can even become a manager or executive!\""
msgstr ""
"\"El Loto Negro trata de aprovechar las habilidades personales. Si trabajas "
"lo suficiente, ¡incluso puedes llegar a ser directivo o ejecutivo!\""

msgid ""
"\"Za'lek drones can quickly overwhelm your ship. It's important to take them "
"down as fast as possible. Disabling them is a good way to get them out of "
"combat and not allow the mothership to launch new ones.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los drones Za'lek pueden abrumar rápidamente a tu nave. Es importante "
"derribarlos lo antes posible. Inutilizarlos es una buena forma de sacarlos "
"de combate y no permitir que la nave nodriza lance otros nuevos.\""

