#. State. Nothing persists.
msgid "A FLF fighter."
msgstr "Un luchador del FLF."

msgid "A FLF combatant."
msgstr "Un combatiente del FLF."

msgid "A tired-looking FLF combatant."
msgstr "Un combatiente del FLF de aspecto cansado."

msgid "An exhausted FLF fighter."
msgstr "Un piloto de cazas del FLF agotado."

msgid "An FLF combatant that smells like ship oil."
msgstr "Un combatiente del FLF que huele a aceite de nave."

msgid "A grease-covered FLF militant."
msgstr "Un militante del FLF cubierto de grasa."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I can't stand the Dvaered. I just want to wipe them all off the map. Don't "
"you?\""
msgstr "\"No soporto a los Dvaereds. Sólo quiero borrarlos del mapa. ¿Tú no?\""

msgid ""
"\"One of these days, we will completely rid the Frontier of Dvaered "
"oppressors. Mark my words!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Uno de estos días, libraremos completamente a la Frontera de los opresores "
"Dvaered. ¡Recuerda mis palabras!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Have you ever wondered about our chances of actually winning over the "
"Dvaered? Sometimes I worry a little.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Te has preguntado alguna vez sobre nuestras posibilidades de ganar a los "
"Dvaereds? A veces me preocupa un poco.\""

msgid ""
"\"I was in charge of a bombing run recently. The mission was a success, but "
"I lost a lot of comrades. Oh well… this is the sacrifice we must make to "
"resist the oppressors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hace poco estuve a cargo de un bombardeo. La misión fue un éxito, pero "
"perdí muchos camaradas. Oh, bueno… este es el sacrificio que debemos hacer "
"para resistir a los opresores.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"What after we beat the Dvaered, you say? Well, our work is never truly "
"done until the Frontier is completely safe from oppression. Even if the "
"Dvaered threat is ended, we'll still have those Sirius freaks to worry "
"about. I don't think our job will ever end in our lifetimes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Y después de vencer a los Dvaereds, dices? Bueno, nuestro trabajo nunca "
"está realmente hecho hasta que la Frontera esté completamente a salvo de la "
"opresión. Incluso si la amenaza de los Dvaered ha terminado, todavía "
"tendremos que preocuparnos por esos monstruos de Sirio. No creo que nuestro "
"trabajo termine nunca en nuestras vidas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, it's true, lots of Frontier officials fund our operations. If they "
"didn't, we'd have a really hard time landing on Frontier planets, what with "
"the kinds of operations we perform against the Dvaereds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, es cierto, muchos funcionarios de la Frontera financian nuestras "
"operaciones. Si no lo hicieran, tendríamos muchas dificultades para "
"aterrizar en planetas de la Frontera, con el tipo de operaciones que "
"realizamos contra los Dvaereds.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, some civilians die because of our efforts, but that's just a "
"sacrifice we have to make. It's for the greater good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, algunos civiles mueren por nuestros esfuerzos, pero es un sacrificio "
"que tenemos que hacer. Es por un bien mayor.\""

msgid ""
"\"No, we're not terrorists. We're soldiers. True terrorists kill and destroy "
"without purpose. Our operations do have a purpose: to drive out the Dvaered "
"oppressors from the Frontier.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No, no somos terroristas. Somos soldados. Los verdaderos terroristas matan "
"y destruyen sin un propósito. Nuestras operaciones sí tienen un propósito: "
"expulsar a los opresores Dvaered de la Frontera.\""

msgid ""
"\"Riddle me this: how can we be terrorists if the Dvaereds started it by "
"encroaching on Frontier territory? It's the most ridiculous thing I ever "
"heard.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Adivíname esto: ¿cómo podemos ser terroristas si los Dvaereds empezaron "
"por invadir el territorio de la Frontera? Es la cosa más ridícula que he "
"oído nunca.\""

msgid ""
"\"Well, no, the Dvaereds never actually attacked Frontier ships, but that's "
"not the point. They have their ships in Frontier territory. What other "
"reason could they possibly have them there for if not to set up an invasion?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, no, los Dvaereds nunca han atacado a las naves de la Frontera, pero "
"ese no es el punto. Tienen sus naves en territorio Frontera. ¿Por qué otra "
"razón podrían tenerlas allí si no es para preparar una invasión?\""

