#. State. Nothing persists.
msgid "A citizen of the Frontier."
msgstr "Un ciudadano de la Frontera."

msgid "An individual that has a solemn gaze."
msgstr "Un individuo que tiene una mirada solemne."

msgid "This person seems to be very easy going."
msgstr "Esta persona parece muy tranquila."

msgid "A civilian that looks slightly bored."
msgstr "Un civil que parece ligeramente aburrido."

msgid "A laid back person relaxing."
msgstr "Una persona relajada que descansa."

