#, fuzzy
msgid "A neohuman civilian is twirling their drink."
msgstr "Un civil nuevo da vueltas a su bebida."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A genetically-modified individual is idle at the bar."
msgstr "Un individuo modificado genéticamente está ocioso en el bar."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A neohuman individual, sitting alone at the bar, lost in contemplation."
msgstr ""
"Un individuo posthumano, sentado solo en la barra, perdido en la "
"contemplación."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A neohuman individual, genetically modified for high gravity environments."
msgstr ""
"Un nuevo individuo humano, modificado genéticamente para entornos de alta "
"gravedad."

msgid ""
"A Soromid individual, biologically engineered to thrive in high gravity."
msgstr ""
"Un individou Soromida, biológicamente diseñado para prosperar en alta "
"gravedad."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A neohuman with heavy gravity traits, enjoying their drink."
msgstr "Un posthumano con rasgos de gravedad pesada, disfrutando de su bebida."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A neohuman individual with gills and slimy skin."
msgstr "Un nuevo individuo humano con branquias y piel viscosa."

msgid "A Soromid individual that seems suited for aquatic life."
msgstr "Un individuo Soromida que parece adecuado para la vida acuática."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The lights highlight the neohuman's slimy skin, as they enjoy their drink."
msgstr ""
"Las luces resaltan la piel viscosa del posthumano, que está disfrutando de "
"su bebida."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A neohuman with large eyes meant for seeing in low light environments."
msgstr ""
"Un nuevo individuo humano, modificado genéticamente para entornos de alta "
"gravedad."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A Soromid neohuman that seems to be using sonar to see around."
msgstr ""
"Un miembro del clan de los Salvajes que parece estar buscando problemas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "A pale individual with bat-like ears and eyes."
msgstr "Un nuevo individuo humano con branquias y piel viscosa."

msgid ""
"The neohuman seems to be carefully mixing their drink with ultra-sonic "
"screetching."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Hello. Can I interest you in one of our galaxy famous cosmetic gene "
"treatments? You look like you could use them…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola. ¿Puede interesarle en uno de nuestros famosos tratamientos genéticos "
"cosméticos de la galaxia? Parece que podrías usarlos…\""

msgid ""
"\"Can you believe it? I was going to visit Sorom to find my roots, and then "
"boom! It got burnt to a crisp! Even now, cycles later, I still can't believe "
"it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Te lo puedes creer? Iba a visitar Sorom para encontrar mis raíces, y "
"entonces ¡boom! ¡Se quemó hasta la saciedad! Incluso ahora, ciclos después, "
"todavía no puedo creerlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Everyone knows that we Soromid altered ourselves to survive the deadly "
"conditions on Sorom during the Great Quarantine. What you don't hear so "
"often is that billions of us died from the therapy itself. We paid a high "
"price for survival.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo el mundo sabe que los Soromida nos alteramos para sobrevivir a las "
"condiciones mortales de Sorom durante la Gran Cuarentena. Lo que no se oye "
"tan a menudo es que miles de millones de nosotros murieron por la propia "
"terapia. Pagamos un alto precio por sobrevivir.\""

msgid ""
"\"Our cosmetic gene treatments are even safer now for non-Soromids, with a "
"rate of survival of 99.4%!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nuestros tratamientos genéticos cosméticos son ahora incluso más seguros "
"para los no soromida, ¡con una tasa de supervivencia del 99,4%!\""

msgid ""
"\"We have been rebuilding and enhancing our bodies for so long, I say we've "
"become a new species, one above human.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Llevamos tanto tiempo reconstruyendo y mejorando nuestros cuerpos que digo "
"que nos hemos convertido en una nueva especie, una por encima de la humana.\""

msgid ""
"\"The Soromid have been shunned and ridiculed by the Great Houses since "
"inception. Over time, they have had no choice but to learn to respect us, "
"however, treatment as equals seems still far away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los Soromida han sido rechazados y ridiculizados por las Grandes Casas "
"desde su creación. Con el tiempo no han tenido más remedio que aprender a "
"respetarnos, sin embargo, el trato como iguales parece aún lejano.\""

msgid ""
"\"It feels good to be free of Empire interference. If we, the Soromid, were "
"a Great House like the Dvaered or Za'lek, we would have much less freedom "
"than what we enjoy today!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sienta bien estar libre de la interferencia del Imperio. Si nosotros, los "
"Soromida, fuéramos una Gran Casa como los Dvaered o los Za'lek, ¡tendríamos "
"mucha menos libertad de la que disfrutamos hoy!\""

msgid ""
"\"I once went to Empire territory and got stared at and ridiculed for my "
"looks. The Empire is such a backwards society. Probably all the paperwork "
"and bureaucracy is rotting their brains.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Una vez fui a territorio del Imperio y me miraron mal y se burlaron de mí "
"por mi aspecto. El Imperio es una sociedad tan atrasada. Probablemente todo "
"el papeleo y la burocracia les está pudriendo el cerebro.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"We sometimes get Za'lek researchers trying to find out the science behind "
"our bioships. No matter how much they analyse them, they can never reproduce "
"anything. They can't seem to understand that bioships are more of an art "
"than a science!\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces tenemos investigadores Za'lek que intentan averiguar la ciencia "
"que hay detrás de nuestras bionaves. Por mucho que las analicen, nunca "
"pueden reproducir nada. ¡Parece que no entienden que las naves biológicas "
"son más un arte que una ciencia!\""

msgid ""
"\"The Empire laughs at our bioships and calls us brutish cattle herders. "
"However, they seem to laugh a lot less when their cruisers get bitten in "
"half by a Soromid capship!\""
msgstr ""
"\"El Imperio se ríe de nuestras bionaves y nos llamal brutos pastores de "
"ganado. Sin embargo, ¡parecen reírse mucho menos cuando sus cruceros son "
"mordidos por la mitad por una nave capital Soromida!\""

msgid ""
"\"I've heard of some bioships going missing during creation. It must be the "
"will of the universe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He oído hablar de algunas naves biológicas que desaparecen durante la "
"creación. Debe ser la voluntad del universo.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"We Soromid are split into tribes, each with their own traditions and "
"customs. Tribes are mainly independent, but the Elders convene with each "
"other periodically to decide what to do with things that affect us all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los Soromida estamos divididos en tribus, cada una con sus propias "
"tradiciones y costumbres. Las tribus son principalmente independientes, pero "
"los Ancianos se reúnen entre sí periódicamente para decidir qué hacer con "
"cosas que nos afectan a todos.\""

msgid ""
"\"I have no idea how the Great Houses can organize them as they do. How can "
"a single person manage and be in charge of billions and billions of humans? "
"It makes no sense!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No tengo ni idea de cómo las Grandes Casas pueden organizarse como lo "
"hacen. ¿Cómo puede una sola persona gestionar y estar a cargo de miles y "
"miles de millones de humanos? ¡No tiene sentido!\""

msgid ""
"\"There are those who wished we had all perished on Sorom, however, the "
"Soromid do not go down without a fight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hay quienes desearían que todos hubiéramos perecido en Sorom, sin embargo, "
"¡los Soromida no caen sin luchar!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"We never meant to become neohumans, but when you are faced with the "
"annihilation of your people, you have to take decisive action to save as "
"many as you can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nunca quisimos convertirnos en nuevos humanos, pero cuando te enfrentas a "
"la aniquilación de tu pueblo, tienes que tomar medidas decisivas para salvar "
"a todos los que puedase\""

msgid ""
"\"We do not easily forget the treatment the Empire gave us during the Great "
"Quarantine. We will make sure that does not happen again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No olvidamos fácilmente el trato que nos dio el Imperio durante la Gran "
"Cuarentena. Nos aseguraremos de que no vuelva a ocurrir.\""

msgid ""
"\"We have many stories about the Great Quarantine. It is important to not "
"forget our past as we strive for a better future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tenemos muchas historias sobre la Gran Cuarentena. Es importante no "
"olvidar nuestro pasado mientras luchamos por un futuro mejor.\""

msgid ""
"\"Some think that making the Soromid inhabit the barely inhabitable is a "
"sign of inferiority to the Great Houses. However, we see it as our pride and "
"accomplishments. Let the Great Houses fight over their few worlds while we "
"live harmonious with nature!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algunos piensan que hacer que los Soromida habiten lo apenas habitable es "
"un signo de inferioridad frente a las Grandes Casas. Sin embargo, nosotros "
"lo vemos como un orgullo y un logro. ¡Dejemos que las Grandes Casas luchen "
"por sus pocos mundos mientras nosotros vivimos en armonía con la naturaleza!"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Soromid Bioships are living creatures. If you train them properly they can "
"learn to do all sorts of new tricks!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las naves biológicas Soromida son criaturas vivas. ¡Si las entrenas "
"adecuadamente, pueden aprender a hacer todo tipo de trucos nuevos!\""

msgid ""
"\"If you screw up training your bioship you can always reset the skills. "
"This comes at an experience penalty though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si metes la pata entrenando tu bionave, siempre puedes reiniciar las "
"habilidades. Aunque esto conlleva una penalización de experiencia.\""

msgid ""
"\"Plasma weapons are not like other weapons. Instead of only directly "
"damaging ships, most of the damage comes from a corrosive effect that takes "
"place over a few seconds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las armas de plasma no son como las demás. ¡En lugar de dañar directamente "
"a las naves, la mayor parte del daño proviene de un efecto corrosivo que "
"tiene lugar durante unos segundos!\""

msgid ""
"\"If used properly, plasma weapons are really good at taking down enemy "
"ships. They do lack range and are hard to hit with, but if you get up close, "
"the corrosion will melt your enemies away!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si se usan correctamente, las armas de plasma son realmente buenas para "
"derribar naves enemigas. Les falta alcance y es difícil acertar con ellas, "
"pero si te acercas, ¡la corrosión derretirá a tus enemigos!\""

msgid ""
"\"They are building something big in Feye and apparently need all the rare "
"minerals they can get. If you're a good miner, this may be a good way to "
"make some quick credits.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Están construyendo algo grande en Feye y al parecer necesitan todos los "
"minerales raros que puedan conseguir. Si eres un buen minero, esta puede ser "
"una buena manera de hacer algunos créditos rápidose\""

msgid ""
"\"I hadn't been to Feye in a while and had my mind blown when I saw the new "
"hypergate they built. Apparently it lets you go to far away systems in a "
"single jump.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hacía tiempo que no iba a Feye y me quedé alucinado cuando vi la nueva "
"hiperpuerta que construyeron. Al parecer te permite ir a sistemas lejanos en "
"un solo salto.\""

