msgid "A non-uploaded Thurion civilian."
msgstr "Un civil Thurion no subido."

msgid "An individual idling around."
msgstr "Un individuo holgazaneando."

msgid ""
"\"Non-uploaded citizens are known as 'inits'. We have the possibility of "
"initializing an upload, however, in many cases we are not able to upload due "
"to physical problems.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los ciudadanos no subidos se conocen como 'iniciados'. Tenemos la "
"posibilidad de inicializar una subida, sin embargo, en muchos casos no "
"podemos subirnos debido a problemas físicos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Did you know that even the slightest bit of brain damage can lead to death "
"during the upload process? That's why we're very careful to not allow our "
"brains to be damaged, even a little.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que el más mínimo daño cerebral puede provocar la muerte durante "
"el proceso de carga? Por eso tenemos mucho cuidado de no permitir que "
"nuestros cerebros se dañen, aunque sea un poco.\""

msgid ""
"\"One great thing once you're uploaded is that you can choose to forget "
"things you don't want to remember. My great-grandfather had a movie spoiled "
"for him before he could watch it, so once he got uploaded, he deleted that "
"memory and watched it with a fresh perspective. Cool, huh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Una cosa estupenda una vez que estás subido es que puedes elegir olvidar "
"las cosas que no quieres recordar. A mi bisabuelo le estropearon una "
"película antes de que pudiera verla, así que una vez que se cargó, borró ese "
"recuerdo y la vio con una nueva perspectiva. Genial, ¿no?\""

msgid ""
"\"The best part of our lives is after we're uploaded, but that doesn't mean "
"we lead boring lives before then. We have quite easy and satisfying "
"biological lives as inits before uploading.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La mejor parte de nuestras vidas es después de ser subidos, pero eso no "
"significa que llevemos vidas aburridas antes de eso. Tenemos vidas "
"biológicas bastante fáciles y satisfactorias como iniciados antes de la "
"subida.\""

msgid ""
"\"Being uploaded allows you to live forever, but that doesn't mean you're "
"forced to. Any uploaded Thurion can choose to end their own life if they "
"want, though few have chosen to do so.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estar subido te permite vivir para siempre, pero eso no significa que "
"estés obligado a ello. Cualquier Turion subido puede elegir acabar con su "
"propia vida si lo desea, aunque pocos han elegido hacerlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Uploading is a choice in our society. No one is forced to do it. It's just "
"that, well, what kind of person would turn down the chance to live a second "
"life on the network and live as an init?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Subir es una opción en nuestra sociedad. Nadie está obligado a hacerlo. Es "
"que, bueno, ¿qué clase de persona rechazaría la posibilidad de vivir una "
"segunda vida en la red y viviría como iniciado?\""

msgid ""
"\"We were lucky to not get touched by the Incident. In fact, we kind of "
"benefited from it. The nebula that resulted gave us a great cover and sealed "
"off the Empire from us. It also got rid of those dangerous Proterons.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tuvimos suerte de que no nos tocara el Incidente. De hecho, nos "
"beneficiamos de él. La nebulosa que resultó nos dio una gran cobertura y nos "
"selló el Imperio. También nos libró de esos peligrosos Proteron.\""

msgid ""
"\"We don't desire galactic dominance. That being said, we do want to spread "
"our way of life to the rest of the galaxy, so that everyone can experience "
"the joy of being uploaded.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No deseamos el dominio galáctico. Dicho esto, sí queremos extender nuestra "
"forma de vida al resto de la galaxia, para que todos puedan experimentar la "
"alegría de ser subidos.\""

msgid ""
"\"I think you're from the outside, aren't you? That's awesome! I've never "
"met a foreigner before. What's it like outside the nebula?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Creo que eres de fuera, ¿no? ¡Esto es increíble! Nunca había conocido a un "
"extranjero. ¿Cómo es el exterior de la nebulosa?\""

msgid ""
"\"We actually make occasional trips outside of the nebula, though only "
"rarely, and we always make sure to not get discovered by the Empire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"En realidad hacemos viajes ocasionales fuera de la nebulosa, aunque sólo "
"en raras ocasiones, y siempre nos aseguramos de no ser descubiertos por el "
"Imperio.\""

msgid ""
"\"The Soromid have a rough history. Have you read up on it? First the Empire "
"confined them to a deadly planet and doomed them to extinction. Then, when "
"they overcame those odds, the Incident blew up their homeworld. The fact "
"that they're still thriving now despite that is phenomenal, I must say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los Soromida tienen una historia difícil. ¿Has leído algo al respecto? "
"Primero el Imperio los confinó en un planeta mortal y los condenó a la "
"extinción. Luego, cuando superaron esas probabilidades, el Incidente voló su "
"mundo natal. El hecho de que ahora sigan prosperando a pesar de eso es "
"fenomenal, debo decir.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure if it's the upload process or the access to the vast "
"information, but many people change character significantly after they get "
"uploaded. Maybe I would change too if I was uploaded!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No estoy seguro de si es el proceso de subida o el acceso a la enorme "
"información, pero muchas personas cambian significativamente de carácter "
"después de ser subidas. ¡Quizá yo también cambiaría si me subieran!\""

msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I feel like the uploaded treat us inits as pets they have to "
"take care of just because we can't backup ourselves if something goes wrong."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces siento que los subidos nos tratan a los iniciados como mascotas a "
"las que tienen que cuidar sólo porque no podemos respaldarnos si algo va mal."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Many uploaded have backups. If for some reason their ship blows up or "
"their processor blows up, their backups get automatically activated and they "
"can keep on going like nothing happened!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Muchos subidos tienen copias de seguridad. ¡Si por alguna razón su nave "
"explota o su procesador se estropea, sus copias de seguridad se activan "
"automáticamente y pueden seguir adelante como si nada hubiera pasado!\""

msgid ""
"\"Lots of uploaded modify their memory and edit themselves, is this why "
"their personality changes so much after uploading?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Muchos subidos modifican su memoria y se editan a sí mismos, ¿es por eso "
"que cambia tanto su personalidad después de subirse?\""

msgid ""
"\"I never really understood why non-uploaded Thurions were called inits "
"until it was explained to me. It is because we can be seeds to initialize "
"uploads!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nunca entendí muy bien por qué a los Thurions no subidos se les llamaba "
"iniciados hasta que me lo explicaron. ¡Es porque podemos ser semillas para "
"inicializar subidas!\""

