msgstr "Garra de Cuervo"

msgid ""
"\"When I get sick of hauling cargo for the Raven Clan, nothing helps me "
"unwind like some good old fashion piracy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando me harto de transportar carga para el Clan del Cuervo, nada me "
"ayuda a relajarme como la piratería a la antigua usanza.\""

msgid "Fighters, engage!"
msgstr "Cazas, ¡ataquen!"

msgid "Barrel 'o Joy"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I packed this Zebra with all the explosives I could fit. Gonna have "
"fireworks lighting up 'em skies!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Let me show you what this barrel is made of!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shroomancer"
msgstr "Champiñante"

msgid ""
"\"Did you know that there are over 5,000 types of psychedelic mushrooms "
"grown on Sanchez alone?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que sólo en Sánchez se cultivan más de 5.000 tipos de setas "
"psicodélicas?\""

msgid "You're ruining my vibes, soul!"
msgstr "¡Estás arruinando mis ondas, alma!"

msgid "Feldspar"
msgstr "Feldespato"

msgid ""
"\"I've been working overtime to get my rank up in the Black Lotus. I won't "
"be the underdog forever!\""
msgstr ""
"\"He estado trabajando horas extras para subir mi rango en el Loto Negro. "
"¡No seré el desvalido para siempre!\""

msgid "You're my ticket to a promotion. Die!"
msgstr "Eres mi boleto para un ascenso. ¡Muere!"

msgid "Lapis Lazuli"
msgstr "Lapis Lázuli"

msgid ""
"\"With so many careless merchants flying around, business has never been "
"better. I always like to get my hands dirty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Con tantos comerciantes descuidados volando por ahí, el negocio nunca ha "
"ido mejor. Siempre me gusta ensuciarme las manos.\""

msgid "Let me add you to my trophy collection!"
msgstr "¡Déjame añadirte a mi colección de trofeos!"

msgid ""
"\"It's hard being a rising star in the Black Lotus. They expect so much from "
"you. Good thing I'm an overachiever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es duro ser una estrella emergente en el Loto Negro. Esperan mucho de ti. "
"Menos mal que soy un aventajado.\""

msgid "It's my time to shine!"
msgstr "¡Hora de brillar!"

msgid "Emerald"
msgstr "Esmeralda"

msgid ""
"\"Paperwork is such a bore. I escaped from the Empire to join the Black "
"Lotus only to find I have to fill out more and more paperwork as I rise in "
"rank. Maybe I should have joined the Wild Ones instead?\""
msgstr ""
"\"El papeleo es un aburrimiento. Escapé del Imperio para unirme al Loto "
"Negro y me di cuenta de que tenía que rellenar cada vez más papeles a medida "
"que subía de rango. ¿Quizá debería haberme unido a los Salvajes?\""

msgid "Time for some fun!"
msgstr "¡Hora de divertirse!"

msgid "Topaz"
msgstr "Topacio"

msgid "(ΦωΦ)"
msgstr "(ΦωΦ)"

msgid "\"(｢・ω・)｢\""
msgstr "\"(｢・ω・)｢\""

msgid ""
"\"It's nice being near the top of the pecking order. It's fun to give "
"contradictory orders to your subordinates and see them run around in chaos.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es agradable estar cerca de la cima del orden jerárquico. Es divertido dar "
"órdenes contradictorias a tus subordinados y verlos correr alrededor en caos."
"\""

msgid "Time to snare another bonus!"
msgstr "¡Hora de conseguir otra bonificación!"

