#. TODO should be specific echelon?
msgid ""
"A Sirian appears on your viewscreen. They seems different than most Sirii "
"you've met. They regards you with a neutral, yet intense, gaze."
msgstr ""
"Un Sirio aparece en tu pantalla. Parece diferente a la mayoría de los Sirios "
"que has conocido. Te mira con una mirada neutra pero intensa."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Man is cruel and deceptive,\" he says. \"You deserve more than you shall "
"ever get from humanity. Your only hope is to follow the Holy One, the "
"Sirichana. They shall guide you to peace and wisdom. They are the sole "
"refuge for humans like you and me. You MUST follow them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"El hombre es cruel y mentiroso\", dice. \"Mereces más de lo que jamás "
"obtendrás de la humanidad. Tu única esperanza es seguir al Sagrado, "
"Sirichana. Ellos te guiarán hacia la paz y la sabiduría. Son el único "
"refugio para los humanos como tú y como yo. ¡Debes seguirlos!\""

msgid ""
"You feel a brief but overpowering urge to follow them, but it passes and "
"your head clears. The Sirian ship makes no further attempt to communicate "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"Sientes un breve pero irresistible impulso de seguirlos, pero se te pasa y "
"se te aclara la mente. La nave Siria no intenta comunicarse contigo."

