msgstr ""

msgid "\"Hey {player}, what are you up to?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Show him {commodity}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You show some of the Nebula Crystals you collected to Steve, and give a "
"short explanation of how you acquired them. He seems to take a deep look at "
"them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Wow! You found these in the Nebula? They look really hard.\"\n"
"He taps on the crystals.\n"
"\"I'll take a small sample so we can study it at the Mining Vrata. Exciting!"
"\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You provided a sample of Nebula Crystals to the Mining Vrata, who "
"commemorated your find."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You show some of the Space Moss you you collected to Steve, and give him an "
"explanation of your travels until you found the Space Moss. He seems very "
"interested in them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, there's wild bioships just chilling and eating space moss out in "
"Fertile Crescent? There must be so much left to explore! I'll show a small "
"sample to our researchers. Who knows what they'll find out of it!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You delivered a sample of Space Moss to the Mining Vrata who were impressed "
"by the new sample."
msgstr ""

