#. Non-persistent state
msgid "Unaffiliated Pilot"
msgstr ""

#. Can do inclusives as pilot.clear() is not called
msgid "Unable to claim systems that should be claimed from event!"
msgstr ""
"¡No se pueden reclamar los sistemas que se deberían reclamar del evento!"

msgid "A pilot that seems to be looking for someone to do something for them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You're greeted by the nondescript pilot who doesn't seem to be affiliated "
"with anyone you know."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Hello there! I represent a man by the name of Baron Sauterfeldt. You may "
"have heard of him in your travels? No? Well, I suppose you can't have it "
"all. My employer is a moderately influential man, you see, and... But no, "
"I'll not bore you with the details. The bottom line is, Lord Sauterfeldt is "
"looking for hired help, and you seem like the sort he needs, judging by your "
"ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola! Represento a un hombre llamado Barón Sauterfeldt. ¿Habrás oído "
"hablar de él en tus viajes? ¿No? Bueno, supongo que no se puede tener todo. "
"Mi empleador es un hombre moderadamente influyente, y... Pero bueno, no te "
"aburriré con los detalles. La conclusión es que el Señor Sauterfeldt busca "
"ayuda, y tú pareces ser del tipo que el necesita, a juzgar por tu nave.\""

msgid ""
"You inquire what it is exactly this Mr. Sauterfeldt needs from you. \"Oh, "
"nothing too terribly invasive, I assure you. His Lordship currently needs a "
"courier, nothing more. Erm, well, a courier who can't be traced back to him, "
"if you understand what I mean. So what do you think? Sound like a suitable "
"job for you? The pay is good, I can assure you that!\""
msgstr ""
"Preguntas qué es exactamente lo que el Sr. Sauterfeldt necesita de tí. \"Oh, "
"nada terriblemente invasivo, se lo aseguro. Su señoría necesita actualmente "
"un mensajero, nada más. Eh, bueno, un mensajero que no pueda ser rastreado "
"hasta él, si entiende lo que quiero decir. Entonces, ¿qué te parece? ¿Te "
"parece un trabajo conveniente para ti? La paga es buena, ¡te lo puedo "
"asegurar!\""

msgid ""
"You pause for a moment before responding to this sudden offer. It's not "
"everyday that people come to you with work instead of you looking for it, "
"but then again this job sounds like it could get you in trouble with the "
"authorities. What will you do?"
msgstr ""
"Te detienes un momento antes de responder a esta repentina oferta. No todos "
"los días la gente viene a ti con trabajo en lugar de que tú lo busques, "
"pero, por otra parte, este trabajo parece que podría meterte en problemas "
"con las autoridades. ¿Qué vas a hacer?"

#. skip back to message if already accepted job
msgid "Accept the job"
msgstr "Aceptar el trabajo"

msgid "Politely decline"
msgstr "Declinar educadamente"

msgid "Angrily refuse"
msgstr "Rechazar airadamente"

msgid ""
"\"Oh. Oh well, too bad. I'll just try to find someone who will take the job, "
"then. Sorry for taking up your time. See you around!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, bueno, qué pena. Intentaré encontrar a alguien que acepte el trabajo, "
"entonces. Siento haberte molestado. ¡Nos vemos!\""

msgid ""
"The pilot frowns. \"I see I misjudged you. I thought for sure you would be "
"more open-minded. Get out of my sight and never show your face to me again! "
"You are clearly useless to my employer.\""
msgstr ""
"El piloto frunce el ceño. \"Veo que te juzgué mal. Estaba seguro de que "
"serías más abierto de mente. Sal de mi vista y no vuelvas a mostrar tu cara "
"ante mí. Está claro que eres inútil para mi jefe.\""

msgid ""
"You were offered a sketchy-looking job by a nondescript pilot, but you "
"angrily refused to accept the job. It seems whoever the pilot worked for "
"won't be contacting you again."
msgstr ""
"Un piloto anodino te ha ofrecido un trabajo de poca monta, pero te has "
"negado airadamente a aceptarlo. Parece que la persona para la que trabajaba "
"el piloto no volverá a ponerse en contacto contigo."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's great! Okay, here's what Baron Sauterfeldt needs you to do. You "
"should fly to the Dvaered world {pnt}. There's an art museum dedicated to "
"one of the greatest Warlords in recent Dvaered history. I forget his name. "
"Drovan or something? Durvan? Uh, anyway. This museum has a holopainting of "
"the Warlord and his military entourage. His Lordship really wants this piece "
"of art, but the museum has refused to sell it to him. So, we've sent agents "
"to... appropriate... the holopainting.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Oh, eso es genial! Bien, esto es lo que el Barón Sauterfeldt necesita que "
"hagas. Debes volar al mundo Dvaered {pnt}. Hay un museo de arte dedicado a "
"uno de los más grandes Señores de la Guerra en la historia reciente Dvaered. "
"He olvidado su nombre. ¿Drovan o algo así? ¿Durvan? Uh, como sea. Este museo "
"tiene una holopintura del Señor de la Guerra y su séquito militar. Su "
"señoría realmente quiere esta pieza de arte, pero el museo se ha negado a "
"vendérsela. Así que hemos enviado agentes para... apropiarse... de la "
"holopintura.\""

msgid ""
"You raise an eyebrow, but the pilot on the other end seems to be oblivious "
"to the gesture."
msgstr "Alzas una ceja, pero el piloto del otro lado parece ignorar el gesto."

msgid ""
"\"So, right, you're going to {pnt} to meet with our agents. You should find "
"them in the spaceport bar. They'll get the item onto your ship, and you'll "
"transport it out of Dvaered space. All quiet-like of course. No need for the "
"authorities to know until you're long gone. Don't worry, our people are "
"pros. It'll go off without a hitch, trust me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que, bien, vas a {pnt} para reunirte con nuestros agentes. Deberías "
"encontrarlos en el bar del puerto espacial. Ellos llevarán el objeto a tu "
"nave, y tú lo transportarás fuera del espacio Dvaered. Todo en silencio, por "
"supuesto. No hay necesidad de que las autoridades lo sepan hasta que te "
"hayas ido. No te preocupes, nuestra gente es profesional. Todo saldrá bien, "
"confía en mí.\""

msgid ""
"You smirk at that. You know from experience that things seldom 'go off "
"without a hitch', and this particular plan doesn't seem to be all that well "
"thought out. Still, it doesn't seem like you'll be in a lot of danger. If "
"things go south, they'll go south well before you are even in the picture. "
"And even if the authorities somehow get on your case, you'll only have to "
"deal with the planetary police, not the entirety of House Dvaered."
msgstr ""
"Sonríes ante eso. Sabes por experiencia que las cosas rara vez \"salen "
"bien\", y este plan en particular no parece estar muy bien pensado. Sin "
"embargo, no parece que vayas a correr mucho peligro. Si las cosas se van al "
"garete, se irán al garete mucho antes de que tú aparezcas en escena. E "
"incluso si las autoridades se ocupan de tu caso, sólo tendrás que lidiar con "
"la policía planetaria, no con toda la Casa Dvaered."

msgid ""
"You ask the Baron's messenger where this holopainting needs to be delivered."
msgstr ""
"Pregunta al mensajero del Barón dónde hay que entregar esta holopintura."

msgid ""
"\"His Lordship will be taking your delivery in the {sys} system, aboard his "
"ship, the Pinnacle,\" he replies. \"Once you arrive with the holopainting "
"onboard your ship, hail the Pinnacle and ask for docking permission. They'll "
"know who you are, so you should be allowed to dock. You'll be paid on "
"delivery. Any questions?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Su Señoría recibirá su entrega en el sistema {sys}, a bordo de su nave, la "
"Pináculo\", responde. \"Una vez que llegue con la holopintura a bordo de su "
"nave, llame a la Pináculo y pide permiso para atracar. Sabrán quién eres, "
"así que te permitirán atracar. Te pagarán a la entrega. ¿Alguna pregunta?\""

msgid ""
"You indicate that you know what to do, then cut the connection. Next stop: "
"planet {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Indicas que sabes qué hacer y cortas la conexión. Próxima parada: planeta "
"{pnt}."

#.
#.
#. Baron Common Functions
#.
#. --
#. Function for adding log entries for miscellaneous one-off missions.
msgid "Baron"
msgstr "Barón"

msgid "A tidy sum of money"
msgstr "Una buena suma de dinero"

msgid ""
"You've been hired as a courier for one Baron Sauterfeldt. Your job is to "
"transport a holopainting from a Dvaered world to the Baron's ship."
msgstr ""
"Has sido contratado como mensajero de un tal Barón Sauterfeldt. Tu trabajo "
"consiste en transportar una holopintura desde un mundo Dvaered hasta la nave "
"del Barón."

msgid "Fly to the {sys} system and land on planet {pnt}"
msgstr "Vuela al sistema {sys} y aterriza en el planeta {pnt}"

msgid "Fly to the {sys} system and dock with (board) Gauss Pinnacle"
msgstr "Vuela al sistema {sys} y atraca con (aborda) Pináculo Gauss"

msgid ""
"These must be the 'agents' hired by this Baron Sauterfeldt. They look "
"shifty. Why must people involved in underhanded business always look shifty?"
msgstr ""
"Estos deben ser los \"agentes\" contratados por este Barón Sauterfeldt. "
"Parecen sospechosos. ¿Por qué la gente involucrada en negocios turbios "
"siempre parece sospechosa?"

msgid "Sauterfeldt's agents"
msgstr "Agentes de Sauterfeldt"

msgid ""
"Your comm is answered by a communications officer on the bridge of the "
"Pinnacle. You tell her you've got a delivery for the baron. She runs a few "
"checks on a console off the screen, then tells you that you've been cleared "
"for docking and that the Pinnacle will be brought to a halt."
msgstr ""
"Una oficial de comunicaciones en el puente del Pináculo responde a tu "
"llamada. Le dices que tienes una entrega para el barón. Ella realiza algunas "
"comprobaciones en una consola fuera de la pantalla, y luego te dice que te "
"han autorizado a atracar y que el Pináculo se detendrá."

msgid ""
"When you arrive at your ship's airlock, the chest containing the Dvaered "
"holopainting is already being carted onto the Pinnacle by a pair of crewmen. "
"\"You'll be wanting your reward, eh? Come along\", one of them yells at you. "
"They both chuckle and head off down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegas a la esclusa de tu nave, el cofre que contiene la holopintura "
"Dvaered ya está siendo cargado en el Pináculo por un par de tripulantes. "
"\"Querrás tu recompensa, ¿eh? Vamos\", te grita uno de ellos. Ambos se ríen "
"y se alejan por el corredor."

msgid ""
"You follow the crewmen as they push the cart through the main corridor of "
"the ship. Soon you arrive at a door leading to a large, luxurious "
"compartment. You can tell at a glance that these are Baron Sauterfeldt's "
"personal quarters. The Baron himself is present. He is a large man, wearing "
"a tailored suit that manages to make him look stately rather than pompous, a "
"monocle, and several rings on each finger. In a word, the Baron has a taste "
"for the extravagant."
msgstr ""
"Sigues a los tripulantes mientras empujan el carro por el pasillo principal "
"de la nave. Pronto llegas a una puerta que conduce a un gran y lujoso "
"compartimento. A simple vista, puedes ver que se trata de los aposentos "
"personales del barón Sauterfeldt. El barón en persona está presente. Es un "
"hombre corpulento, que lleva un traje a medida que le hace parecer "
"majestuoso más que pomposo, un monóculo y varios anillos en cada dedo. En "
"una palabra, el Barón tiene un gusto por lo extravagante."

msgid ""
"\"Ah, my holopainting,\" he coos as the chest is being carried into his "
"quarters. \"At last, I've been waiting forever.\" The Baron does not seem to "
"be aware of your presence at all. He continues to fuss over the holopainting "
"even as his crewmen strip away the chest and lift the frame up to the wall."
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, mi holopintura\", murmura mientras llevan el cofre a sus aposentos. "
"\"Por fin, he estado esperando una eternidad\". El Barón no parece darse "
"cuenta de tu presencia. Continúa preocupándose por la holopintura mientras "
"su tripulación retira el cofre y levanta el marco hasta la pared."

msgid ""
"You look around his quarters. All sorts of exotic blades and other \"art\" "
"works adorn his room, along with tapestries and various other holopaintings. "
"You notice a bowl atop a velvet rug with \"Fluffles\" on it. Hanging above "
"it seems to be a precariously balanced ancient blade."
msgstr ""
"Miras alrededor de sus aposentos. Todo tipo de cuchillas exóticas y otras "
"obras de \"arte\" adornan su habitación, junto con tapices y otras "
"holopinturas. Te fijas en un cuenco sobre una alfombra de terciopelo con la "
"inscripción \"Fluffles\". Sobre él parece colgar una antigua espada en "
"precario equilibrio."

msgid ""
"The crewmen finally unpack the holopainting. You glance at the three-"
"dimensional depiction of a Dvaered warlord, who seems to be discussing "
"strategy with his staff. Unfortunately you don't seem to be able to "
"appreciate Dvaered art, and you lose interest almost right away."
msgstr ""
"Los tripulantes finalmente desembalan la holopintura. Miras la "
"representación tridimensional de un señor de la guerra Dvaered, que parece "
"estar discutiendo la estrategia con su personal. Desgraciadamente, no "
"pareces capaz de apreciar el arte dvaered, y pierdes el interés casi de "
"inmediato."

msgid ""
"You cough to get the Baron's attention. He looks up, clearly displeased at "
"the disturbance, then notices you for the first time."
msgstr ""
"Toses para llamar la atención del Barón. Levanta la vista, claramente "
"disgustado por el alboroto, y se fija en ti por primera vez."

msgid ""
"\"Ah, of course,\" he grunts. \"I suppose you must be paid for your service. "
"Here, have some credits. Now leave me alone. I have art to admire.\" The "
"Baron tosses you a couple of credit chips, and then you are once again air "
"to him."
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, por supuesto\", gruñe. \"Supongo que hay que pagarte por tu servicio. "
"Toma, ten unos créditos. Ahora déjame en paz. Tengo arte que admirar\". El "
"Barón te lanza un par de fichas de crédito, y entonces vuelves a estar "
"desaparecido para él."

msgid ""
"You are left with little choice but to return to your ship, undock, and be "
"on your way."
msgstr ""
"No te queda más remedio que volver a tu nave, desengancharte y seguir tu "
"camino."

msgid ""
"You helped some selfish baron steal a Dvaered holopainting and were paid a "
"measly sum of credits."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a un barón egoísta a robar una holopintura Dvaered y te pagaron una "
"miserable suma de créditos."

msgid ""
"The three shifty-looking patrons regard you with apprehension as you "
"approach their table. Clearly they don't know who their contact is supposed "
"to be. You decide to be discreet, asking them if they've ever heard of a "
"certain Sauterfeldt. Upon hearing this, the trio visibly relaxes. They tell "
"you that indeed they know the man you speak of, and that they have something "
"of his in their possession. Things proceed smoothly from that point, and "
"several hectostu later you are back at your ship, preparing it for takeoff "
"while you wait for the agents to bring you your cargo."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You're halfway through your pre-flight security checks when the three appear "
"in your docking hangar. They have a cart with them on which sits a "
"rectangular chest as tall as a man and as long as two. Clearly this "
"holopainting is fairly sizeable. As you watch them from your bridge's "
"viewport, you can't help but wonder how they managed to get something that "
"big out of a Dvaered museum unnoticed."
msgstr ""
"Estáis a mitad de camino de los controles de seguridad previos al vuelo "
"cuando los tres aparecen en el hangar de atraque. Llevan un carro sobre el "
"que se asienta un cofre rectangular tan alto como un hombre y tan largo como "
"dos. Está claro que esta holopintura es bastante grande. Mientras los "
"observas desde el mirador de tu puente, no puedes evitar preguntarte cómo se "
"las han arreglado para sacar algo tan grande de un museo Dvaered sin que se "
"note."

msgid ""
"As it turns out, they didn't. They have only just reached the docking bridge "
"leading into your ship when several armed Dvaered security forces come "
"bursting into the docking hangar. They spot the three agents and immediately "
"open fire. One of them goes down, the others hurriedly push the crate over "
"the bridge towards your ship. Despite the drastic change in the situation, "
"you have time to note that the Dvaered seem more interested in punishing the "
"criminals than retrieving their possession intact."
msgstr ""
"Resulta que no lo hicieron. Acaban de llegar al puente de atraque que da "
"acceso a su nave cuando varias fuerzas de seguridad Dvaered armadas irrumpen "
"en el hangar de atraque. Descubren a los tres agentes e inmediatamente abren "
"fuego. Uno de ellos cae, y los otros se apresuran a empujar la caja por el "
"puente hacia tu nave. A pesar del drástico cambio en la situación, tienes "
"tiempo de comprobar que los Dvaered parecen más interesados en castigar a "
"los delincuentes que en recuperar su posesión intacta."

msgid ""
"The second agent is caught by a Dvaered bullet, and topples off the docking "
"bridge and into the abyss below. The third manages to get the cart with the "
"chest into your airlock before catching a round with his chest as well. As "
"the Dvaered near your ship, you seal the airlock, fire up your engines and "
"punch it out of the docking hangar."
msgstr ""
"El segundo agente es alcanzado por una bala Dvaered, y cae del puente de "
"atraque al abismo de abajo. El tercero consigue meter el carro con el cofre "
"en tu esclusa antes de recibir también una bala con el cofre. Mientras los "
"Dvaered se acercan a tu nave, sellas la esclusa, enciendes tus motores y la "
"sacas del hangar de atraque."

msgid "The Baron's holopainting"
msgstr "La holopintura del Barón"

msgid "A rectangular chest containing a holopainting."
msgstr "Un cofre rectangular que contiene una holopintura."

msgid "Dvaered Police Vendetta"
msgstr "Vendetta Policia Dvaered"

msgid "All troops, engage {ship_type} {ship_name}! It has broken {pnt} law!"
msgstr ""
"¡Todas las tropas, ataquen a {ship_name}! ¡Ha quebrantado la ley de {pnt}!"

