#.
#. -- This is the second mission in the baron string.
#. --
#. Mission constants
#. Messes up player name
#. Non-persistent state
#. Note: this mission makes no system claims.
msgid "An unfamiliar man"
msgstr "Un hombre desconocido"

msgid ""
"A man you've never seen before makes eye contact with you. He seems to know "
"who you are."
msgstr ""
"Un hombre que nunca has visto antes hace contacto visual contigo. Parece "
"saber quién eres."

msgid ""
"As you approach the stranger, he extends his hand in greeting. He introduces "
"himself as an associate of Baron Sauterfeldt, the man you helped to "
"\"acquire\" a holopainting not too long ago."
msgstr ""
"Cuando te acercas al desconocido, te tiende la mano en señal de saludo. Se "
"presenta como socio del barón Sauterfeldt, el hombre al que ayudaste a "
"\"adquirir\" una holopintura no hace mucho."

msgid ""
"\"The Baron was quite pleased with your performance in that matter,\" he "
"confides. \"He has asked me to try to find you again for another job not "
"unlike the last one. The Baron is a collector, you see, and his hunger for "
"new possessions is a hard one to satiate.\" He makes a face. \"Of course, "
"his methods aren't always completely respectable, as you've experienced for "
"yourself. But I assure you that the Baron is not a bad man, he is simply "
"very enthusiastic.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El barón quedó bastante satisfecho con tu actuación en ese asunto\", "
"confiesa. \"Me ha pedido que intente encontrarte de nuevo para otro trabajo "
"no muy diferente al anterior. El Barón es un coleccionista, ya ves, y su "
"hambre de nuevas posesiones es difícil de saciar\". Hace una mueca. \"Por "
"supuesto, sus métodos no siempre son completamente respetables, como usted "
"mismo ha experimentado. Pero te aseguro que el Barón no es un mal hombre, "
"simplemente es muy entusiasta.\""

msgid ""
"You decide to keep your opinion of the aristocrat to yourself. Instead you "
"inquire as to what the man wants from you this time."
msgstr ""
"Decides guardarte para ti tu opinión sobre el aristócrata. En su lugar, "
"preguntas qué quiere el hombre de ti esta vez."

msgid ""
"\"To tell the truth, I don't actually know,\" the man says. \"The Baron "
"wants you to meet him so he can brief you in person. You will find his ship "
"in the {sys} system. Shall I inform his lordship that you will be paying him "
"a visit?\""
msgstr ""
"\"A decir verdad, no lo sé\", dice el hombre. \"El Barón quiere que te "
"reúnas con él para informarte en persona. Encontrarás su nave en el sistema "
"{sys}. ¿Debo informar a su señoría de que vas a hacerle una visita?\""

msgid "\"At your beck and call.\""
msgstr "\"A su entera disposición.\""

msgid "\"Sorry, not today.\""
msgstr "\"Lo siento, hoy no.\""

msgid ""
"\"Splendid. Please go see his lordship at the earliest opportunity. He "
"doesn't like to be kept waiting. I will send word that you will be coming, "
"so contact the Pinnacle when you arrive at {sys}, and they will allow you to "
"board.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espléndido. Por favor, vaya a ver a su señoría lo antes posible. No le "
"gusta que le hagan esperar. Enviaré la noticia de que vendrá, así que "
"contacte con la Pináculo cuando llegue a {sys}, y le permitirán embarcar.\""

msgid ""
"\"Okay, fair enough,\" the man says with a disappointed look on his face. "
"\"I'll try to find someone else. But maybe we'll run into each other again, "
"so if you change your mind…\""
msgstr ""
"\"De acuerdo, es justo\", dice el hombre con una mirada de decepción. "
"\"Intentaré encontrar a otra persona. Pero tal vez nos encontremos de nuevo, "
"por si cambias de opinión...\""

msgid "Prince"
msgstr "Principe"

msgid "You weren't told!"
msgstr "¡No te lo han dicho!"

msgid ""
"Baron Sauterfeldt has summoned you to his ship, which is in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"El barón Sauterfeldt te ha convocado a su nave, que está en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"You find yourself once again aboard the Pinnacle, Baron Sauterfeldt's "
"flagship. After a short time, an attendant ushers you into the Baron's "
"personal quarters, which are as extravagant as you remember them. You notice "
"the holopainting is now firmly fixed on one of the walls."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras de nuevo a bordo del Pináculo, el buque insignia del barón "
"Sauterfeldt. Al cabo de poco tiempo, un asistente te conduce a los aposentos "
"personales del barón, que son tan extravagantes como los recordabas. "
"Observas que la holopintura está firmemente fijada en una de las paredes."

msgid ""
"Baron Dovai Sauterfeldt greets you with a pompous wave of his hand. \"Ahh "
"yes, there you are at last. {wrongname1}, was it? Do have a seat.\" He then "
"offers you a drink, but you decline on the basis that you still have to "
"drive. \"Now then, {wrongname2}, I assume you're wondering why I've called "
"you here. As you've no doubt heard, I have an interest in the unique, the "
"exquisite.\" The Baron gestures around the room. \"I have built up quite an "
"impressive collection, as you can see, but it is still lacking something. "
"Fortunately, news has reached me about a priceless artefact from Earth "
"itself, dating back to before the Faction Wars. I must have it. It belongs "
"in the hands of a connoisseur like myself.\""
msgstr ""
"El barón Dovai Sauterfeldt te saluda con un pomposo gesto de la mano. \"Ahh "
"sí, ahí estás por fin. {wrongname1}, ¿no? Toma asiento\". Te ofrece una "
"copa, pero la rechazas porque tienes que conducir. \"Ahora bien, "
"{wrongname2}, supongo que te preguntarás por qué te he llamado aquí. Como "
"sin duda has oído, me interesa lo único, lo exquisito\". El Barón hace un "
"gesto alrededor de la sala. \"He reunido una colección bastante "
"impresionante, como puede ver, pero aún le falta algo. Afortunadamente, me "
"han llegado noticias de un artefacto de valor incalculable procedente de la "
"propia Tierra, que data de antes de las Guerras de las Facciones. Debo "
"tenerlo. Debe estar en manos de un conocedor como yo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately, news of this artefact has reached more ears than just mine. "
"All over the galaxy there are people who will try to sell you 'ancient "
"artefacts', which always turn out to be imitations at best and worthless "
"scrap they picked up from the streets at worst.\" The Baron snorts "
"derisively. \"Even the contacts who usually fenc- ah, I mean, supply me with "
"new items for my collection are in on the frenzy."
msgstr ""
"\"Por desgracia, las noticias sobre este artefacto han llegado a más oídos "
"que sólo los míos. Por toda la galaxia hay gente que intentará venderte "
"'artefactos antiguos', que siempre resultan ser imitaciones, en el mejor de "
"los casos, y chatarra sin valor que recogieron de las calles, en el peor\". "
"El Barón resopla burlonamente. \"Incluso los contactos que normalmente me "
"proporcionan nuevos objetos para mi colección participan en el frenesí."

msgid ""
"\"I've narrowed down my search to three of these people. I'm confident that "
"one of them is selling the genuine article, while the other two are shams. "
"And this is where you come in, {wrongname}. I want you to visit these "
"vendors, buy their wares off them and bring me the authentic artefact. You "
"will have the help of a man named Flintley, who is a history buff or some "
"such rot. You will find him on {pnt} in the {sys} system. Simply tell him "
"you're working for me and show him any artefacts in your possession. He will "
"tell you which are authentic and which are fake."
msgstr ""
"\"He reducido mi búsqueda a tres de estas personas. Estoy seguro de que uno "
"de ellos está vendiendo el artículo genuino, mientras que los otros dos son "
"falsos. Y aquí es donde entras tú, {wrongname1}. Quiero que visites a estos "
"vendedores, les compres sus mercancías y me traigas el artefacto auténtico. "
"Tendrás la ayuda de un hombre llamado Flintley, que es un aficionado a la "
"historia o algo así. Lo encontrarás en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. "
"Simplemente dile que trabajas para mí y muéstrale los artefactos que tengas "
"en tu poder. Él te dirá cuáles son auténticos y cuáles son falsos."

msgid ""
"\"I should warn you, {wrongname}. Some of my, ah, colleagues have also set "
"their sights on this item, and so you can expect their henchmen to try to "
"take it off you. I trust you are equipped to defend yourself against their "
"despicable sort.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Debo advertirte, {wrongname}. Algunos de mis colegas también han puesto "
"sus ojos en este objeto, así que puedes esperar que sus secuaces intenten "
"quitártelo. Confío en que estés equipado para defenderte de su despreciable "
"calaña.\""

msgid ""
"You are swiftly escorted back to your ship. You didn't really get the chance "
"to ask the Baron any questions, such as whom these potential attackers are, "
"how you're supposed to pay for the artefacts once you locate the sellers, or "
"what you will get out of all this. You do, however, find an update to your "
"galaxy map that shows the location of the sellers, as well as a list of "
"names and portraits. It would seem that the only way to find out what you're "
"dealing with is the hard way."
msgstr ""
"Te escoltan rápidamente de vuelta a tu nave. No tienes la oportunidad de "
"preguntarle al Barón nada, como quiénes son estos potenciales atacantes, "
"cómo se supone que vas a pagar por los artefactos una vez que localices a "
"los vendedores, o qué vas a conseguir con todo esto. Sin embargo, encuentras "
"una actualización de tu mapa de la galaxia que muestra la ubicación de los "
"vendedores, así como una lista de nombres y retratos. Parece que la única "
"manera de saber con qué te enfrentas es por las malas."

msgid "Buy the artefact and take it to Flintley"
msgstr "Compra el artefacto y llévalo a Flintley"

msgid ""
"Baron Sauterfeldt has tasked you with finding an ancient artefact, but he "
"doesn't know exactly where to get it."
msgstr ""
"El barón Sauterfeldt te ha encargado que encuentres un antiguo artefacto, "
"pero no sabe exactamente dónde conseguirlo."

msgid ""
"You have not yet collected and identified the genuine artefact. Buy the "
"artefacts from the sellers and visit Flintley on {pnt} ({sys}) to identify "
"the real one."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no has recogido e identificado el artefacto auténtico. Compra los "
"artefactos a los vendedores y visita a Flintley en {pnt} ({sys}) para "
"identificar el auténtico."

msgid ""
"Baron Dovai Sauterfeldt turns the skate-board over in his hands, inspecting "
"every nick, every scratch on the surface. His eyes are gleaming with delight."
msgstr ""
"El barón Dovai Sauterfeldt le da la vuelta a la tabla de skate en sus manos, "
"inspeccionando cada mella, cada arañazo de la superficie. Sus ojos brillan "
"de placer."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, this is marvellous, marvellous indeed, {wrongname}! A piece of pre-"
"Growth history, right here in my hands! I can almost hear the echoes of that "
"ancient civilization when I put my ear close to it! This is going to be the "
"centrepiece in my collection of relics and artefacts. Yes indeed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Oh, esto es maravilloso, maravilloso de verdad, {wrongname}! Un trozo de "
"la historia anterior al Crecimiento, ¡justo aquí, en mis manos! ¡Casi puedo "
"oír los ecos de aquella antigua civilización cuando le acerco el oído! Esto "
"va a ser la pieza central de mi colección de reliquias y artefactos. ¡Así es!"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"I was right to send you, {wrongname1}, you've beautifully lived up to my "
"expectations. And I'm a man of my word, I will reward you as promised. What "
"was it we agreed on again? What, I never promised you anything? Well, that "
"won't do. I'll have my assistant place a suitable amount of money in your "
"account. You will not find me ungrateful! Ah, but you must excuse me. I need "
"time to revel in this fantastic piece of art! Goodbye, {wrongname2}, I will "
"call on you when I have need of you again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hice bien en enviarte, {wrongname1}, has estado maravillosamente a la "
"altura de mis expectativas. Y soy un hombre de palabra, te recompensaré como "
"te prometí. ¿Qué fue lo que acordamos de nuevo? ¿Qué, nunca te prometí nada? "
"Bueno, eso no servirá. Haré que mi asistente deposite una cantidad adecuada "
"de dinero en tu cuenta. ¡No me encontrarás desagradecido! Ah, pero debe "
"disculparme. Necesito tiempo para deleitarme con esta fantástica obra de "
"arte. Adiós, {wrongname2}, te llamaré cuando vuelva a necesitarte.\""

msgid ""
"You are seen out of the Baron's quarters, so you head back through the "
"airlock and back into your own ship. The first thing you do is check your "
"balance, and to your relief, it has indeed been upgraded by a substantial "
"amount. You also seem to have received a statue of dubious taste. As you "
"undock, you wonder what kind of wild goose chase the man will send you on "
"next time."
msgstr ""
"Te ves fuera de los aposentos del Barón, así que te diriges de nuevo a "
"través de la esclusa y vuelves a tu propia nave. Lo primero que haces es "
"comprobar tu saldo y, para tu alivio, ha aumentado considerablemente. "
"También parece que has recibido una estatua de dudoso gusto. Mientras te "
"desacoplas, te preguntas en qué clase de búsqueda inútil te meterá ese "
"hombre la próxima vez."

msgid ""
"Baron Sauterfeldt sent you on a wild goose chase to find some ancient "
"artefact known as a \"skate-board\", which you found for him."
msgstr ""
"El barón Sauterfeldt te envió a buscar un antiguo artefacto conocido como "
"\"tabla de skate\", que encontraste para él."

msgid ""
"You spot a dodgy individual who matches one of the portraits in your ship's "
"database. This must be one of the artefact sellers."
msgstr ""
"Descubres a un individuo dudoso que coincide con uno de los retratos de la "
"base de datos de tu nave. Debe ser uno de los vendedores de artefactos."

msgid "Artefact seller"
msgstr "Vendedor de artefactos"

msgid "A reedy-looking man"
msgstr "Un hombre de aspecto flacucho"

msgid ""
"You spot a thin, nervous looking individual. He does not seem to want to be "
"here. This could be that Flintley fellow the Baron told you about."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un individuo delgado y de aspecto nervioso. No parece querer estar "
"aquí. Podría ser el tipo Flintley del que te habló el Barón."

msgid ""
"You approach the nervous-looking man and inquire if he is Flintley, the "
"historian in Baron Sauterfeldt's employ."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al hombre de aspecto nervioso y le preguntas si es Flintley, el "
"historiador al servicio del barón Sauterfeldt."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes. Yes! That is me! I'm Flintley,\" the man responds. \"And you must "
"be {player}. I know what's going on, the people from the Pinnacle have "
"informed me. Oh, but where are my manners. Let me properly introduce myself. "
"My name is Flintley, and I'm an archaeologist and historian. The best in the "
"galaxy, some might say, ha-ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, sí. ¡Sí! Ese soy yo. Soy Flintley\", responde el hombre. \"Y tú debes "
"ser {player}. Sé lo que está pasando, la gente del Pináculo me ha informado. "
"Oh, pero dónde están mis modales. Permíteme que me presente como es debido. "
"Mi nombre es Flintley, y soy arqueólogo e historiador. El mejor de la "
"galaxia, dirían algunos, ¡ja, ja!\""

msgid ""
"He gives you a look. \"Well, maybe not. But I'm quite knowledgeable about "
"the history of the galaxy. Too bad not too many people seem interested in "
"that these days. The only work I can really get is the occasional appraisal, "
"like I'm doing now for his lordship. I wish I didn't have to take jobs like "
"this, but there you have it.\""
msgstr ""
"Te lanza una mirada. \"Bueno, quizá no. Pero conozco bastante bien la "
"historia de la galaxia. Lástima que hoy en día no haya demasiada gente "
"interesada en ella. El único trabajo que realmente puedo conseguir es la "
"tasación ocasional, como la que estoy haciendo ahora para su señoría. Ojalá "
"no tuviera que aceptar trabajos así, pero ahí lo tienes.\""

msgid ""
"Flintley sighs. \"Well, that's that. Come to me with any artefacts you "
"manage to procure, and I'll analyse them to the best of my ability.\""
msgstr ""
"Flintley suspira. \"Bueno, eso es todo. Ven a mí con cualquier artefacto que "
"consigas y lo analizaré lo mejor que pueda.\""

msgid ""
"Flintley greets you. \"Do you have any objects for me to look at, {player}? "
"No? Well, alright. I'll be here if you need me. Good luck out there.\""
msgstr ""
"Flintley te saluda. \"¿Tienes algún objeto para que lo mire, {player}? ¿No? "
"Bueno, está bien. Estaré aquí si me necesitas. Buena suerte ahí fuera.\""

msgid ""
"\"Let's see what we have here,\" Flintley says as you hand him the artefact "
"you bought on {pnt}. \"Ah, I know what this is without even looking anything "
"up. It's a piece of an old-fashioned airlock mechanism, as used on most "
"ships during the Faction Wars. That makes it rather old, but that also makes "
"it worthless, I'm afraid. This is just old scrap.\" He gives you an "
"apologetic look. \"Don't let it get you down. Not many people would know "
"this on first sight. Those scammers can be pretty clever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Veamos qué tenemos aquí\", dice Flintley mientras le entregas el artefacto "
"que compraste en {pnt}. \"Ah, ya sé lo que es esto sin siquiera buscar nada. "
"Es una pieza de un mecanismo de esclusa antiguo, como los que se usaban en "
"la mayoría de las naves durante las Guerras de Facción. Eso lo hace bastante "
"antiguo, pero también lo hace inútil, me temo. Esto es sólo chatarra "
"vieja\". Le lanza una mirada de disculpa. \"No dejes que te desanime. No "
"mucha gente lo sabría a primera vista. Esos estafadores pueden ser muy "
"astutos.\""

msgid ""
"You feel disappointed and frustrated, but you have no choice but to deposit "
"the \"artefact\" into the nearest disintegrator inlet."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes decepcionado y frustrado, pero no tienes más remedio que "
"depositar el \"artefacto\" en la entrada del desintegrador más cercano."

msgid ""
"You hand Flintley the artefact you procured on {pnt}. He examines it for a "
"few moments, then enters a few queries in the info terminal in his table. "
"Once he has found what he was looking for, he heaves a sigh. \"I'm sorry, "
"{player}. It seems you've been had. What you've got here is little more than "
"a trinket. It's a piece of 'art' created by a third-rank sculptress named "
"Biena Gharibri who lives on Lapra. She's not very talented, I'm afraid. Her "
"creations have been called 'worse than Dvaered opera' by a leading art "
"critic. I really don't think you want to present his lordship with this.\""
msgstr ""
"Le entregas a Flintley el artefacto que conseguiste en {pnt}. Lo examina "
"durante unos instantes y luego introduce algunas consultas en el terminal de "
"información de su mesa. Una vez que ha encontrado lo que buscaba, lanza un "
"suspiro. \"Lo siento, {player}. Parece que te han engañado. Lo que tienes "
"aquí es poco más que una baratija. Es una pieza de \"arte\" creada por una "
"escultora de tercer rango llamada Biena Gharibri que vive en Lapra. Me temo "
"que no tiene mucho talento. Sus creaciones han sido calificadas como "
"\"peores que la ópera Dvaered\" por un importante crítico de arte. No creo "
"que quiera presentar esto a su señoría.\""

msgid ""
"You promptly decide to dispose of the thing, unwilling to carry it around "
"with you a moment longer than necessary."
msgstr ""
"Inmediatamente decides deshacerte de él, ya que no estás dispuesto a "
"llevarlo contigo más tiempo del necesario."

msgid ""
"Flintley studies the object on the table for a while, checking the online "
"database a number of times in the process. Then, finally, he turns to you. "
"\"I hate to say this, but it seems you've bought a counterfeit. It's a good "
"one, though! That seller on {pnt} must have known his stuff. You see, this "
"is very similar to a number plate used by hovercars on Mars at the time of "
"the Second Growth. However, it's missing a number of vital characteristics, "
"and some details betray its recent manufacture. Close, {player}, close. But "
"no cigar.\""
msgstr ""
"Flintley estudia el objeto sobre la mesa durante un rato, consultando varias "
"veces la base de datos en línea. Luego, finalmente, se dirige a usted. "
"\"Odio decir esto, pero parece que has comprado una falsificación. Pero es "
"una buena. El vendedor de {pnt} debía saber lo que hacía. Verás, esto es muy "
"similar a una matrícula utilizada por los aerodeslizadores en Marte en la "
"época del Segundo Crecimiento. Sin embargo, le faltan algunas "
"características vitales, y algunos detalles delatan su reciente fabricación. "
"Cerca, {player}, cerca. Pero no es lo que buscas.\""

msgid ""
"You dispose of the counterfeit artefact. Hopefully the next one will be what "
"Sauterfeldt is looking for…"
msgstr ""
"Te deshaces del artefacto falsificado. Esperemos que el próximo sea el que "
"busca Sauterfeldt…"

msgid ""
"Flintley carefully studies the object in front of him, turning it around and "
"consulting the online database via the bar table's terminal. After several "
"hectostu he leans back and whistles. \"Well I never. This has to be it, "
"{player}. I'd do a carbon dating if I could, but even without I'm positive. "
"This object dates back to pre-Growth Earth. And it's in an amazingly good "
"condition!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You take another look at the thing. It resembles a small flat surface, apart "
"from the crook at one end. On one side, there are cylindrical, solid "
"protrusions that don't seem to serve any useful purpose at all. You are at a "
"loss as to the artefact's purpose."
msgstr ""
"Echas otro vistazo a la cosa. Parece una pequeña superficie plana, aparte "
"del recodo de un extremo. En uno de los lados hay unas protuberancias "
"cilíndricas y sólidas que no parecen tener ninguna utilidad. No sabes para "
"qué sirve el artefacto."

msgid ""
"\"It's called a skate-board,\" Flintley continues. \"The records about it "
"are a bit sketchy and a lot is nothing but conjecture, but it appears it was "
"once used in primitive communal rituals. The exact nature of these rituals "
"is unknown, but they may have been tribal initiations or even mating "
"rituals. The patterns in the board itself are thought to have a spiritual or "
"mystical meaning. Also, according to some theories, people used to stand on "
"top of the skate-board, with the cylinder wheels facing the ground. This has "
"led some historians to believe that the feet were once central to human "
"psychology.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se llama monopatín\", continúa Flintley. \"Los registros sobre él son un "
"poco escasos y mucho no son más que conjeturas, pero parece que en su día se "
"utilizó en rituales comunales primitivos. Se desconoce la naturaleza exacta "
"de estos rituales, pero pueden haber sido iniciaciones tribales o incluso "
"rituales de apareamiento. Se cree que los patrones del tablero tienen un "
"significado espiritual o místico. Además, según algunas teorías, la gente se "
"ponía de pie encima del monopatín, con las ruedas cilíndricas mirando al "
"suelo. Esto ha llevado a algunos historiadores a creer que los pies fueron "
"una vez fundamentales para la psicología humana.\""

msgid ""
"Flintley seems to have a lot more to say on the subject, but you're not that "
"interested, so you thank him and return to your ship with the ancient "
"artefact. You can only hope that the Baron is as enthusiastic about this "
"skate-board as his historian!"
msgstr ""
"Flintley parece tener mucho más que decir sobre el tema, pero a ti no te "
"interesa tanto, así que le das las gracias y vuelves a tu nave con el "
"antiguo artefacto. ¡Sólo te queda esperar que el Barón esté tan entusiasmado "
"con este monopatín como su historiador!"

msgid "Take the artefact to Baron Sauterfeldt"
msgstr "Lleva el artefacto al Barón Sauterfeldt"

msgid "Ancient Artefact"
msgstr "Artefacto Antiguo"

msgid "A seemingly ancient artefact."
msgstr "Un artefacto aparentemente antiguo."

msgid "Buy the artefact ({credits})"
msgstr "Comprar el artefacto ({credits})"

msgid "Don't buy the artefact"
msgstr "No comprar el artefacto"

msgid "A suspicious salesman"
msgstr "Un vendedor sospechoso"

msgid ""
"\"Hello there,\" the guy says to you when you approach. \"Can I interest you "
"in this bona fide relic from an ancient past? Unlike all those scammers out "
"there, I offer you the real deal, no fakes here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola\", te dice el tipo cuando te acercas. \"¿Puede interesarte por esta "
"reliquia de buena fe de un pasado antiguo? A diferencia de todos esos "
"estafadores que hay por ahí, yo te ofrezco la auténtica, ¡no hay "
"falsificaciones aquí!\""

msgid "Artefact? A"
msgstr "¿Artefacto? A"

msgid "An ancient artefact?"
msgstr "¿Un artefacto antiguo?"

msgid ""
"The man grins at you. \"Ah, I can tell you have the eye of a connoisseur! I "
"deal only in the finest, counterfeit-free antiques. If you're smart, and I "
"can see that you are, you won't trust all those opportunists who will try to "
"sell you fakes! How about it?\""
msgstr ""
"El hombre te sonríe. \"¡Ah, me doy cuenta de que tienes el ojo de un "
"conocedor! Sólo negocio con las mejores antigüedades, sin falsificaciones. "
"Si eres inteligente, y veo que lo eres, no te fiarás de todos esos "
"oportunistas que intentarán venderte falsificaciones. ¿Qué te parece?\""

msgid "Artefact? B"
msgstr "¿Artefacto? B"

msgid "A suspicious saleswoman"
msgstr "Una vendedora sospechosa"

msgid ""
"The woman beckons you over to the bar. \"Listen, friend. I have here a "
"unique, extremely rare remnant of prehistoric times. This is the genuine "
"article, trust me on that. One hundred per cent legit! And you wouldn't want "
"to spend good credits on a fake, right?\""
msgstr ""
"La mujer te hace señas para que te acerques a la barra. \"Escuche, amigo. "
"Tengo aquí un vestigio único y extremadamente raro de la prehistoria. Este "
"es el artículo genuino, créame. Cien por cien legítimo. Y no querrás gastar "
"buenos créditos en una falsificación, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "Artefact? C"
msgstr "¿Artefacto? C"

msgid "You can't currently afford to buy this artefact. You need {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente no puedes permitirte comprar este artefacto. Necesitas {credits}."

msgid "You decide not to buy the artefact."
msgstr "Decides no comprar el artefacto."

msgid "You pay {cost} to obtain the artefact and take your leave."
msgstr "Pagas {cost} para obtener el artefacto y te marchas."

#. Spawn artefact hunters, maybe.
#. 60% chance of artefact hunters.
msgid "Artefact Hunter"
msgstr "Cazador de Artefactos"

#. Just go towards the player position and attack if they are around
msgid "Green light for docking"
msgstr "Luz verde para el atraque"

