#.
#.    MISSION: Assault on Unicorn
#.    DESCRIPTION: Kill some pirates!
#.
#. --
#. Mission constants
#. local misn_return_sys = system.get("Amaroq")
msgid "Fly to the Unicorn system."
msgstr "Vuela al sistema Unicornio."

msgid "You have reached your maximum payment. Return to {pnt} ({sys} system)."
msgstr "Has alcanzado tu pago máximo. Volver a {pnt} (sistema {sys})."

msgid ""
"Destroy some pirates! You have killed {n} and have earned {credits}. If "
"finished, return to {pnt} ({sys} system)."
msgstr ""
"¡Destruye algunos piratas! Has matado a {n} y has ganado {credits}. Si has "
"terminado, vuelve a {pnt} (sistema {sys})."

#. Round the payment to the nearest thousand.
msgid "Assault on Unicorn"
msgstr "Asalto a Unicornio"

msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

msgid ""
"It is time to put a dent in the pirates' forces. We have detected a strong "
"pirate presence in the system of Unicorn. We are offering a small sum for "
"each pirate killed. The maximum we will pay you is {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Es hora de hacer mella en las fuerzas de los piratas. Hemos detectado una "
"fuerte presencia pirata en el sistema de Unicornio. Ofrecemos una pequeña "
"suma por cada pirata muerto. El máximo que le pagaremos es de {credits}."

#. This mission makes no system claims.
msgid ""
"As you land, you see a Dvaered military official approaching. Thanking you "
"for your hard and diligent work, he hands you the bounty you've earned, a "
"number of chips worth {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Al aterrizar, ves que se acerca un oficial militar Dvaered. Agradeciendo tu "
"duro y diligente trabajo, te entrega la recompensa que has ganado, un número "
"de fichas por valor de {credits}."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="The Dvaered Championship">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>50</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Dvaer Prime</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. The player takes part into a challenge between fighter pilots in Dvaered space, he has to defeat 5 opponents to win.
#.
#. Stages :
#. 0) Way to positions
#. 1) Begin of the fight
#. 2) Player won
#. 3) End of competition
#.
#. --
#. Needed scripts
#. local bioship = require "bioship"
#. NPC
#. Non-persistent state
#. In order not to have two pilots with the same name
#. Change here to change the planet and the system
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "An official"
msgstr "Un oficial"

msgid "This person seems to be looking for suitable combat pilots."
msgstr "Esta persona parece estar buscando pilotos de combate adecuados."

#. add some random npcs
msgid "Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto"

msgid "This pilot looks very self-confident"
msgstr "Este piloto parece muy seguro de sí mismo"

msgid "This pilot seems to work as a private combat pilot"
msgstr "Este piloto parece trabajar como piloto privado de combate"

msgid "Imperial pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Imperial"

msgid "This pilot is clearly from the Empire."
msgstr "Este piloto es claramente del Imperio."

msgid "Dvaered pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Dvaered"

msgid "This pilot surely works as a Vendetta pilot."
msgstr "Este piloto seguramente trabaja como piloto de Vendetta."

msgid "Strange pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Extraño"

msgid ""
"This pilot looks like a pirate, but strangely enough, the authorities don't "
"seem worried."
msgstr ""
"Este piloto parece un pirata, pero extrañamente, las autoridades no parecen "
"preocupadas."

msgid "I am here to win the championship"
msgstr "Estoy aquí para ganar el campeonato"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I am here to claim my place as this cycle's champion! I've prepared myself "
"since the first day I piloted a ship. Trust me, I'm nearly invincible and my "
"Vendetta is indestructible.\n"
"   \"Do you know who I am? I am the famous independent pilot who helped "
"Dvaered High Command destroy the FLF base in the nebula! I managed to defeat "
"lots of FLF fighters with my ship! I will tell you my adventures some other "
"time, but for now, I need to concentrate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Estoy aquí para reclamar mi lugar como campeón de este ciclo! Me he "
"preparado desde el primer día que piloté una nave. Créanme, soy casi "
"invencible y mi Vendetta es indestructible.\n"
"    \"¿Saben quién soy? Soy el famoso piloto independiente que ayudó al Alto "
"Mando Dvaered a destruir la base de la FLF en la nebulosa. ¡Conseguí "
"derrotar a muchos cazas de la FLF con mi nave! Ya te contaré mis aventuras "
"en otro momento, pero por ahora, necesito concentrarme.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Hello! I am here to claim my place as this cycle's champion! I've prepared "
"myself since the first day I piloted a ship. Trust me, I'm nearly invincible "
"and my Vendetta is indestructible.\n"
"   \"Did you know that the Vendetta is the best fighter in this part of the "
"galaxy? It's the reason why every pilot who's won this championship had one."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola! Estoy aquí para reclamar mi lugar como campeón de este ciclo. Me he "
"preparado desde el primer día que piloté una nave. Confía en mí, soy casi "
"invencible y mi Vendetta es indestructible.\n"
"    \"¿Sabías que la Vendetta es el mejor caza de esta parte de la galaxia? "
"Es la razón por la que todos los pilotos que han ganado este campeonato "
"tenían uno.\""

msgid "Hello"
msgstr "Hola"

msgid ""
"\"Are you here for the Dvaered dogfight championship? I am a competitor. I "
"fly a Shark, so I don't hope to win lots of rounds... But I still enjoy the "
"battle. Every cycle, a Dvaered pilot wins. Do you know why? It's because the "
"rules of the championship advantage heavy armoured, well armed fighters, "
"like the Vendetta. Imperial pilots are used to electronic warfare with "
"guided missiles and stealth ships. Dvaered pilots, on the other hand, only "
"understand basic dogfighting.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Estás aquí por el campeonato de combate de naves Dvaered? Soy un "
"competidor. Vuelo una, así que no espero ganar muchas rondas... Pero aún así "
"disfruto de la batalla. Cada ciclo, un piloto Dvaered gana. ¿Sabes por qué? "
"Es porque las reglas del campeonato favorecen a los cazas pesados y bien "
"armados, como el Vendetta. Los pilotos imperiales están acostumbrados a la "
"guerra electrónica con misiles guiados y naves furtivas. Los pilotos "
"Dvaered, en cambio, sólo entienden de combate de naves básicas.\""

msgid "Imperial Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Imperial"

msgid ""
"\"What a pity. I am the best in my squad. I trained cycles to be able to "
"take down these pitiful Vendettas with my missiles before they even see my "
"Lancelot on their radar. But in this championship, only armour and firepower "
"are useful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Qué lástima. Soy el mejor de mi escuadrón. He entrenado ciclos para poder "
"derribar a estos lamentables Vendettas con mis misiles antes de que vean mi "
"Lancelot en su radar. Pero en este campeonato, sólo sirven el blindaje y la "
"potencia de fuego.\""

msgid "Dvaered Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Dvaered"

msgid ""
"\"Nice to see you. I am a Vendetta pilot. I hope I win this time! For us, "
"being the champion here means that you become member of the senior staff, "
"which makes you closer to Dvaered High Command! Who knows? Maybe one day I "
"will become a Warlord.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de verte. Soy un piloto de Vendetta. ¡Espero ganar esta vez! "
"Para nosotros, ser el campeón aquí significa que te conviertes en miembro "
"del personal superior, ¡lo que te hace estar más cerca del Alto Mando "
"Dvaered! ¿Quién sabe? Tal vez un día me convierta en un Señor de la Guerra.\""

msgid "Obvious Pirate"
msgstr "Pirata Obvio"

msgid ""
"\"Hi, I'm... err... I'm an independent pilot. I'm here to take part in the "
"challenge and see the best Dvaered Vendetta pilots in action. It helps to "
"know how they fly in my job.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, soy... err... Soy un piloto independiente. Estoy aquí para "
"participar en el desafío y ver a los mejores pilotos Dvaered Vendetta en "
"acción. Me ayuda saber cómo vuelan en mi trabajo.\""

#. 800,000 for the champion
msgid "Do you want to take part to a challenge?"
msgstr "¿Quieres participar en un reto?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Hello, I'm a member of the staff of the Dvaered dogfight challenge. Here "
"are the rules: you need to take off with a fighter-class ship and to join "
"your starting mark. After that, you will try to disable your opponent. Don't "
"kill them; the security staff won't forgive that. It is forbidden to use "
"missiles, so you won't be allowed to have those equipped while taking off. "
"It's also forbidden to board the opponent's ship and to attack him before "
"the signal is given. You are not allowed to land on any planet or jump away "
"during the championship.\n"
"   We are looking for pilots. Are you in?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, soy un miembro del personal del desafío de naves de combate Dvaered. "
"Estas son las reglas: tienes que despegar con una nave de clase caza y "
"unirte a tu marca inicial. Después, intentarás inutilizar a tu oponente. No "
"los mates; el personal de seguridad no te lo perdonará. Está prohibido "
"utilizar misiles, por lo que no podrás tenerlos equipados mientras despegas. "
"También está prohibido abordar la nave del oponente y atacarle antes de que "
"se dé la señal. No está permitido aterrizar en ningún planeta ni saltar "
"durante el campeonato.\n"
"    Estamos buscando pilotos. ¿Te apuntas?\""

msgid "The Dvaered Championship"
msgstr "El Campeonato Dvaered"

msgid "From {low} to {high} credits, depending on your rank"
msgstr "De {low} a {high} créditos, según tu rango"

msgid "You are taking part in a fight contest. Try to do your best!"
msgstr ""
"Estás participando en un concurso de lucha. ¡Intenta hacerlo lo mejor "
"posible!"

msgid "Go to the starting point"
msgstr "Ir al punto de partida"

msgid "Disable your opponent; DO NOT KILL"
msgstr "Inhabilita a tu oponente; NO LO MATES"

msgid "Land on {pnt}"
msgstr "Atraca en {pnt}"

msgid "Sorry, not interested"
msgstr "Lo siento, no me interesa"

msgid "\"That's your choice. Goodbye, then.\""
msgstr "\"Esa es tu elección. Entonces, adiós.\""

#. Everyone lands in case the player aborts
#. Give a name to the competitor
msgid "The Nice Killer"
msgstr "El Asesino Agradable"

msgid "Longship Victory"
msgstr "Nave de Guerra Victoria"

msgid "The Victim"
msgstr "La Victima"

msgid "Old Fellow"
msgstr "Antiguo Compañero"

msgid "Angel of Grace"
msgstr "Ángel de la Gracia"

msgid "Easy Killer"
msgstr "Asesino Fácil"

msgid "The Unicorn"
msgstr "El Unicornio"

msgid "The White Knight"
msgstr "El Caballero Blanco"

msgid "Spirit of St Jean"
msgstr "Espíritu de San Juan"

msgid "Nec Mergitur"
msgstr "Nec Mergitur"

#. Re-pick a name while it is in the usedNames list
msgid "Let's go"
msgstr "Vamos"

msgid ""
"For this round, your opponent is {plt}. Remember: use a fighter with no "
"launchers. You still have to defeat {n} opponents to win."
msgstr ""
"Para esta ronda, tu oponente es {plt}. Recuerda: usa un caza sin lanzadores. "
"Todavía tienes que derrotar a {n} oponentes para ganar."

