msgid "You won this round"
msgstr "Has ganado esta ronda"

msgid ""
"\"Congratulations,\" the staff says to you. \"Come back when you are ready "
"for the next round!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Enhorabuena\", te dice el personal. \"¡Vuelve cuando estés preparado para "
"la siguiente ronda!\""

#. player will be paid
#. you are the champion
msgid "You are the new champion"
msgstr "Eres el nuevo campeón"

msgid "Congratulations! The staff pays you {credits}."
msgstr "¡Felicidades! El personal te paga {credits}."

msgid "You are the vice-champion"
msgstr "Eres el vicecampeón"

#. You gain at most 200000 and can retry.
msgid "Thanks for playing"
