msgid "The Meeting"
msgstr "La Reunión"

msgid ""
"You are part of the space security service for a special meeting of the high "
"council of Warlords, where the invasion plan of the Frontier will be "
"discussed."
msgstr ""
"Formas parte del servicio de seguridad espacial para una reunión especial "
"del alto consejo de los Señores de la Guerra, donde se discutirá el plan de "
"invasión de Frontera."

msgid "The greatness of House Dvaered."
msgstr "La grandeza de la Casa Dvaered."

msgid "Stay close to {pnt} and wait for orders"
msgstr "Quédate cerca de {pnt} y espera las órdenes"

msgid "Intercept suspect ship for visual identification"
msgstr "Interceptar la nave sospechosa para su identificación visual"

#. Player is running away
#. Landing on Laars after Hamelsen
msgid "Officer"
msgstr "Oficial"

msgid ""
"This Dvaered officer is probably waiting for you and might have information "
"about ex-Colonel Hamelsen's escape."
msgstr ""
"Este oficial Dvaered probablemente te está esperando y podría tener "
"información sobre la fuga del ex-Coronel Hamelsen."

#. Player killed attackers, and can finally land for reward
msgid "Time for a gorgeous reward?"
msgstr "¿Es hora de una magnífica recompensa?"

msgid ""
"When you step out of your ship, you see an officer alone on the dock, "
"obviously waiting for you. As you get closer, you recognize Major Tam. The "
"cold wind pulls the lapels of his coat, and make them whip his sad face.\n"
"   \"We had better days, eh, citizen? A spy managed to run away with what "
"seems to be a copy of our invasion plan, they killed one of my best pilots, "
"and Hamelsen escaped... Once more.\" Tam looks at the sky as it starts to "
"rain \"... and it's winter on the spacedock of Dvaer Prime. Shall we enter "
"the building? I was told that the chemical plant works twice as hard in "
"winter, and the rain often turns to acid.\"\n"
"   You enter and head to the military bar. Tam looks at you: \"I grew up on "
"Nanek in Allous. For 13 years, the only part of the universe I knew was my "
"village on Nanek, and the only people I knew were its inhabitants. And now, "
"I've seen hundreds of planets, and thousands of people all around the "
"galaxy. But most of them have been killed at some point. Now they are "
"corpses, drifting here and there in space, along with the pitiful remains of "
"their defeated ships. The night sky is filled with the souls of dead pilots. "
"Our control of space gave us access to experiences our forefathers could not "
"even dream of, but you know what? No matter how cold the graves of my "
"ancestors on Nanek are, they are warmer than the emptiness of infinite space."
"\""
msgstr ""
"Cuando sales de tu nave, ves a un oficial solo en el muelle, obviamente "
"esperándote. Al acercarse, reconoces al Mayor Tam. El viento frío tira de "
"las solapas de su abrigo y hace que azoten su rostro triste.\n"
"   \"Tuvimos días mejores, ¿eh, ciudadano? Un espía consiguió huir con lo "
"que parece ser una copia de nuestro plan de invasión, mataron a uno de mis "
"mejores pilotos, y Hamelsen escapó... Una vez más\". Tam mira al cielo "
"mientras empieza a llover \"... y es invierno en el muelle espacial de Dvaer "
"Prime. ¿Entramos en el edificio? Me han dicho que la planta química trabaja "
"el doble en invierno, y la lluvia suele convertirse en ácido\".\n"
"   Entráis y os dirigís al bar militar. Tam te mira: \"Crecí en Nanek, en "
"Allous. Durante 13 años, la única parte del universo que conocía era mi "
"pueblo en Nanek, y las únicas personas que conocía eran sus habitantes. Y "
"ahora, he visto cientos de planetas, y miles de personas por toda la "
"galaxia. Pero la mayoría de ellos han sido asesinados en algún momento. "
"Ahora son cadáveres, a la deriva aquí y allá en el espacio, junto con los "
"lamentables restos de sus naves derrotadas. El cielo nocturno está lleno de "
"las almas de los pilotos muertos. Nuestro control del espacio nos dio acceso "
"a experiencias que nuestros antepasados no podían ni soñar, pero ¿sabes qué? "
"Por muy frías que estén las tumbas de mis antepasados en Nanek, son más "
"cálidas que el vacío del espacio infinito.\""

msgid ""
"You start wondering if the major will remember to pay you, but his voice "
"suddenly changes: \"We definitely had better days, but you know, the true "
"valour of a warrior reveals itself in times of adversity. The dark clouds "
"that drift above the horizon, pushed by the cruel winds of despair, are here "
"to challenge the strength of our Dvaered souls. And it is up to us to accept "
"this challenge.\n"
"   \"I did not anticipate that the traitor Hamelsen could reassemble her "
"group of mercenaries so fast, but you already killed some of them, and "
"Leblanc's squadron will kill even more in the near future. We will then hunt "
"ex-Colonel Hamelsen down, and finally we will continue the invasion.\n"
"   \"Anyway, for now, we will transfer {credits} to your account, as a "
"reward for this mission, and be certain that we will need you again soon!\""
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a preguntarte si el Mayor se acordará de pagarte, pero su voz "
"cambia de repente: \"Definitivamente hemos tenido días mejores, pero ya "
"sabes, el verdadero valor de un guerrero se revela en tiempos de adversidad. "
"Las nubes oscuras que se ciernen sobre el horizonte, empujadas por los "
"crueles vientos de la desesperación, están aquí para desafiar la fuerza de "
"nuestras almas Dvaered. Y depende de nosotros aceptar este desafío.\n"
"   \"No preveía que la traidora Hamelsen pudiera volver a reunir a su grupo "
"de mercenarios tan rápidamente, pero ya habéis matado a algunos de ellos, y "
"el escuadrón de Leblanc matará aún más en un futuro próximo. Entonces "
"daremos caza al ex Coronel Hamelsen, y finalmente continuaremos la "
"invasión.\n"
"   \"De todos modos, por ahora, transferiremos {credits} a tu cuenta, como "
"recompensa por esta misión, ¡y ten por seguro que volveremos a necesitarte "
"pronto!\""

msgid ""
"You were part of the security for a meeting of Dvaered warlords to discuss "
"the plan for the invasion of the Frontier. Unfortunately, ex-Colonel "
"Hamelsen, and her squadron, managed to seize data and escape the system. "
"Lieutenant Strafer was killed in action during this incident."
msgstr ""
"Formabas parte de la seguridad de una reunión de señores de la guerra "
"Dvaered para discutir el plan de invasión de Frontera. Desgraciadamente, la "
"ex-coronel Hamelsen, y su escuadrón, consiguieron apoderarse de los datos y "
"escapar del sistema. El teniente Strafer murió en combate durante este "
"incidente."

msgid ""
"Harsh voice, frank gaze, and easy trigger. Lieutenant Strafer is a Dvaered "
"pilot."
msgstr ""
"Voz dura, mirada franca y gatillo fácil. El Teniente Strafer es un piloto "
"Dvaered."

#. Taking off from Dvaer Prime for first part of mission
#. hook.rm(mem.takhook)
#. Taking off from Laars for the death of Strafer and the attack from henchmen
#. Chatter
msgid ""
"A-NightClaws Leader to all pilots: Engage and destroy this Schroedinger at "
"all costs!"
msgstr ""
"Líder de A-GarrasNocturnas a todos los pilotos: ¡Ataquen y destruyan a este "
"Schroedinger a toda costa!"

msgid "A-NightClaws Second to Leader: I'm on it!"
msgstr "A-GarrasNocturnas Segundo a Líder: ¡Estoy en ello!"

msgid "Bye, suckers!"
msgstr "¡Adiós, tontos!"

msgid "Just wait for my shredders to..."
msgstr "Sólo espera por mis trituradoras..."

msgctxt "fw04"
msgid "Come on!"
msgstr "¡Vamos!"

#. Player flees from the system
msgid "Look who is running away!"
msgstr "¡Mira quién se está escapando!"

msgid "You were supposed to secure the meeting, not to run away like that!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que tenías que asegurar la reunión, no huir así!"

msgid "What do you want to ask the lieutenant before taking off?"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres preguntarle al teniente antes de despegar?"

msgid "Ask for a briefing"
msgstr "Solicita una reunión informativa"

msgid "Ask about Colonel Hamelsen"
msgstr "Pregunta por el Coronel Hamelsen"

msgid "Ask why you were hired for this mission"
msgstr "Pregunta por qué fuistes contratado para esta misión"

msgid "Ask how one becomes a warlord"
msgstr "Pregunta cómo se llega a ser un señor de la guerra"

msgid "I am ready for action!"
msgstr "¡Estoy listo para la acción!"

msgid "Is this some kind of joke?"
msgstr "¿Es esto una especie de broma?"

msgid "You are obsessed with this question. Just move on, please."
msgstr "Estás obsesionado con esta pregunta. Sigue adelante, por favor."

msgid "Hem... You asked the exact same question earlier."
msgstr "Hem... Antes hiciste exactamente la misma pregunta."

