msgid "Dvaered Soldier"
msgstr "Soldado Dvaered"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This Dvaered soldier may have a task for a private pilot."
msgstr "Este soldado Dvaered puede tener una tarea para un piloto privado"

#. Discussion
msgid "Cyborg"
msgstr "Cyborg"

msgid ""
"Good day, citizen. I am Colonel Okran, second in command under Lord Fatgun. "
"Do you know Lord Fatgun?"
msgstr ""
"Buenos días, ciudadano. Soy el Coronel Okran, segundo al mando del Señor "
"Gordalma. ¿Conoces al Señor Gordarma?"

msgid "Of course! I am his greatest fan!"
msgstr "¡Claro que sí! ¡Soy su mayor fan!"

msgid "I'm afraid I do not know this person."
msgstr "Me temo que no conozco a esta persona."

msgid "I couldn't care less."
msgstr "No podría importarme menos."

msgid ""
"Oh, really? Then I guess you won't be interested in the job I have to offer."
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, sí? Entonces supongo que no te interesará el trabajo que te ofrezco."

msgid ""
"For real? Yes, Lord Fatgun truly is amazing! His career is a real success "
"story! And he is a true full-time warlord. Not a fake media warrior like "
"Lady Bitterfly or Lord Chainsaw who only invade a planet once in a while in "
"order to get free advertisement for their shitty books."
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? ¡Sí, el Señor Gordarma es realmente increíble! ¡Su carrera es "
"una verdadera historia de éxito! Y es un auténtico señor de la guerra a "
"tiempo completo. No un falso guerrero mediático como la Dama Moscamarga o el "
"Señor Motosierra, que sólo invaden un planeta de vez en cuando para "
"conseguir publicidad gratuita para sus libros de mierda."

msgid ""
"Lord Fatgun is the most successful Warlord of our time. He has managed to "
"obtain many great victories. For example, he defeated Lady Bitterfly on "
"Icarus and Lord Richthofen in orbit of Oni. Even before he obtained his "
"title of Warlord, when he used to be a general for the High Command, he made "
"some really outstanding achievements. He conducted the famous raid on Tora "
"in Gruz, and nuked fifteen cities on that planet."
msgstr ""
"El Señor Gordarma es el Señor de la Guerra más exitoso de nuestro tiempo. Ha "
"conseguido muchas grandes victorias. Por ejemplo, derrotó a la Dama "
"Moscamarga en Ícaro y al Señor Richthofen en la órbita de Oni. Incluso antes "
"de obtener su título de Señor de la Guerra, cuando era general del Alto "
"Mando, consiguió algunos logros realmente sobresalientes. Dirigió la famosa "
"incursión en Tora, en Gruz, y bombardeó quince ciudades de ese planeta."

msgid ""
"So, as you may think, Lord Fatgun is very successful, and many lesser "
"Warlords envy him and dream of invading his planets. For that reason, we are "
"in need of more weapons of all kinds. I have recently bought two hundred "
"armoured ground vehicles that will help us finally kick off the troops of "
"Lady Proserpina on Golem in Palin, where the war is raging for two cycles."
msgstr ""
"Así que, como puedes pensar, el Señor Gordarma tiene mucho éxito, y muchos "
"Señores de la Guerra menores le envidian y sueñan con invadir sus planetas. "
"Por eso, necesitamos más armas de todo tipo. Recientemente he comprado "
"doscientos vehículos terrestres blindados que nos ayudarán a dar por fin el "
"pistoletazo de salida a las tropas de Lady Proserpina en Golem de Palin, "
"donde la guerra se está librando desde hace dos ciclos."

msgid ""
"But before definitely bringing peace to this planet, we need to deliver "
"those weapons there. And Lord Richthofen, who has been humiliated by his "
"recent defeats, tends to ambush our convoys. This is why we need our "
"transport to be escorted by a complete fleet, including a battlecruiser."
msgstr ""
"Pero antes de llevar definitivamente la paz a este planeta, necesitamos "
"entregar allí esas armas. Y el Señor Richthofen, humillado por sus recientes "
"derrotas, tiende emboscadas a nuestras caravanas. Por eso necesitamos que "
"nuestro transporte sea escoltado por una flota completa, incluyendo un "
"crucero de batalla."

msgid ""
"As you probably know, most warlords only own one Goddard battlecruiser. This "
"is due to both the High Command being reluctant to give the authorization, "
"and to House Goddard often refusing to sell a second battlecruiser. However, "
"in our particular situation, having a second Goddard battlecruiser would "
"ease our logistics by a lot."
msgstr ""
"Como probablemente sepas, la mayoría de los señores de la guerra sólo poseen "
"un crucero de batalla Goddard. Esto se debe tanto a que el Alto Mando es "
"reacio a dar la autorización, como a que la Casa Goddard suele negarse a "
"vender un segundo crucero de batalla. Sin embargo, en nuestra situación "
"particular, tener un segundo crucero de batalla Goddard facilitaría mucho "
"nuestra logística."

msgid ""
"And I managed to get the special authorization from the High Command. I "
"should soon present my request for the ship to House Goddard, but before "
"doing so, we need to make sure that Goddard shareholders are on our side. "
"And that is why we need you."
msgstr ""
"Y he conseguido la autorización especial del Alto Mando. Pronto debería "
"presentar mi solicitud de la nave a la Casa Goddard, pero antes de hacerlo, "
"necesitamos asegurarnos de que los accionistas de Goddard están de nuestro "
"lado. Y por eso te necesitamos."

msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"

msgid "I don't want to get involved in that mess."
msgstr "No quiero verme envuelto en ese lío."

msgid ""
"We identified a shareholder whose name is Agrippina Grosjean. She is an ally "
"of Lord Richthofen, and she will be firmly against us buying a second "
"battlecruiser. This is why I have elaborated a negotiation plan that "
"consists in eliminating her. What do you think of that negotiation plan?"
msgstr ""

msgid "That is a very Dvaered kind of negotiation."
msgstr "Es un tipo de negociación muy Dvaered."

msgid "This plan is very subtle Indeed."
msgstr "De hecho, este plan es muy sutil."

msgid "I think it is a shitty plan."
msgstr "Creo que es un plan de mierda."

msgid "Isn't it kind of… illegal?"
msgstr "¿No es un poco... ilegal?"

msgid "Indeed, it is. But let me explain further."
msgstr "Así es. Pero déjame que te lo explique mejor."

msgid ""
"Actually, my plan is totally legal… Mwell, not totally. Let's say… mostly "
"legal."
msgstr ""
"En realidad, mi plan es totalmente legal ... Bueno, no totalmente. "
"Digamos... mayormente legal."

msgid ""
"Let me explain: Grosjean has a very special hobby that consists in flying a "
"Pirate Shark in {sys} and killing lone traders under the name 'Silent "
"Death'. Dvaered patrols in the system are under the responsibility of her "
"friend, the dishonourable Lord Richthofen. We have collected data on her "
"habits, and we know she should be cruising in the system soon. So we need "
"you to go there, pretend you are a harmless trader, wait for her to attack, "
"and kill her."
msgstr ""
"Dejad que me explique: Grosjean tiene una afición muy especial que consiste "
"en pilotar un Tiburón Pirata en {sys} y matar a comerciantes solitarios bajo "
"el nombre de 'Muerte Silenciosa'. Las patrullas Dvaered en el sistema están "
"bajo la responsabilidad de su amigo, el deshonroso Señor Richthofen. Hemos "
"recopilado datos sobre sus hábitos, y sabemos que pronto estará navegando "
"por el sistema. Así que necesitamos que vayas allí, te hagas pasar por un "
"comerciante inofensivo, esperes a que ataque y la mates."

msgid ""
"The problem is that she tends to only attack Llamas as it is probably the "
"least dangerous ship that exists. This means that you will have to fly such "
"a ship for her to engage you. Now, you may wonder how you are supposed to "
"catch her in a Llama if she decides to run away, and that is where the less "
"legal part of the mission comes into play."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Before entering {sharksys}, we will have to sabotage her ship's engine. We "
"know that she has purchased a new engine that will be delivered to her soon. "
"This engine will transit in the main warehouse of Tricon on {enginpnt}. Your "
"first task will be to shuttle a group of… hem… special… workers to that "
"planet for them to infiltrate the warehouse and sabotage the engine. You "
"will then deposit them back on {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Antes de entrar en {sharksys}, tendremos que sabotear el motor de su nave. "
"Sabemos que ha comprado un nuevo motor que le será entregado en breve. Este "
"motor transitará en el almacén principal de Tricon en {enginpnt}. Tu primera "
"tarea será transportar a un grupo de... hem... trabajadores... especiales a "
"ese planeta para que se infiltren en el almacén y saboteen el motor. Luego "
"los depositarás de vuelta en {pnt}."

msgid ""
"And only afterwards, you will go and encounter the target. Her engine will "
"malfunction at the very moment you will hit her ship with whatever weapon, "
"and she won't be able to run away any more. Moreover, as you know, the "
"combat ability of an interceptor like the Shark is closely linked to its "
"manoeuvrability, which means that this sabotage will make the target much "
"less dangerous for your own safety. So, what do you say? Are you in?"
msgstr ""
"Y sólo después, irás al encuentro del objetivo. Su motor se averiará en el "
"mismo momento en que golpees su nave con el arma que sea, y ya no podrá "
"huir. Además, como sabes, la capacidad de combate de un interceptor como el "
"Tiburón está estrechamente ligada a su maniobrabilidad, lo que significa que "
"este sabotaje hará que el objetivo sea mucho menos peligroso para tu propia "
"seguridad. Entonces, ¿qué dices? ¿Te apuntas?"

msgid "Agree"
msgstr "De Acuerdo"

msgid ""
"Hehe. I knew you would accept. It's time for you to finally work for someone "
"really important! The first part of your mission is really straightforward: "
"my special team will fly in your ship to {pnt} in {sys} where they will take "
"care of the engine. Let me guide you to them."
msgstr ""
"Jeje. Sabía que aceptarías. Es hora de que por fin trabajes para alguien "
"realmente importante. La primera parte de tu misión es muy sencilla: mi "
"equipo especial volará en tu nave hasta {pnt} en {sys}, donde se encargará "
"del motor. Deja que te guíe hasta ellos."

msgid ""
"Colonel Okran guides you through narrow gangways. You arrive at a large hall "
"and cross a checkpoint guarded by spider-cyborgs and Okran tells you: "
"\"those are the soldiers of the 26th multi-terrain assault regiment (ground "
"forces), they are deployed on this spaceport because our intelligence "
"detected a high risk of FLF terrorist attack in this sector in the near "
"future. They look a bit odd with their biologically-grown and mechanically-"
"enhanced pawns, but they are friendly… I mean mostly.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You finally arrive in a tiny ill-lit room, where a strange group is waiting "
"for you. Two of them are much taller than average, wear an intimidating "
"amount of implants on their skin, and carry impressive guns while the two "
"others seem unarmed. All of them wear an incoherent assortment of colourful "
"civilian clothes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sergeant Krakadak! Why are you all wearing ridiculous outfits? What happened "
"here?"
msgstr ""
"¡Sargento Krakadak! ¿Por qué lleváis todos trajes ridículos? ¿Qué ha pasado "
"aquí?"

msgid ""
"My Colonel! You ordered us to dress like civilians. Private Krokodok told us "
"the brother of the neighbour of his sister-in-law is a civilian, but he does "
"not really know how this guy dresses. So we let our imagination do the work."
msgstr ""
"¡Mi Coronel! Usted nos ordenó vestirnos como civiles. El soldado Krokodok "
"nos dijo que el hermano de la vecina de su cuñada es un civil, pero no sabe "
"realmente cómo se viste este tipo. Así que dejamos que nuestra imaginación "
"hiciera el trabajo."

msgid ""
"Colonel Okran presents you the members of the team: Sergeant Krakadak and "
"Private Krokodok are both gamma-class cyborgs, who were detached from "
"Dvaered High Command's Space Infantry to the personnel multirole commando "
"company of Lord Fatgun. The two others are light engine specialists from "
"Lord Fatgun's interception squadrons, whose role will be to actually "
"sabotage the target."
msgstr ""
"El Coronel Okran les presenta a los miembros del equipo: El Sargento "
"Krakadak y el Soldado Krokodok son dos cyborgs de clase gamma, que fueron "
"destinados de la Infantería Espacial del Alto Mando Dvaered a la compañía de "
"comandos polivalentes personal del Señor Gordarma. Los otros dos son "
"especialistas en motores ligeros de los escuadrones de interceptación del "
"Señor Gordarma, cuyo papel consistirá en sabotear realmente el objetivo."

msgid ""
"Okran finally guides you to the spacedocks, where you find your ship. The "
"four soldiers enter it, carrying large backpacks. Before leaving, Okran "
"tells you to meet him on {pnt} once the mission is completed. It is time to "
"fly to {sys}."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ah. I see. You are probably what is called a coward. Too bad."
msgstr ""
"Ah. Ya veo. Usted es probablemente lo que se llama un cobarde. Lástima."

#. Test acceptance
#. Mission details
msgid "Dvaered Negotiation 1"
msgstr "Negociación Dvaered 1"

msgid ""
"A Dvaered Warlord needs you to kill a Goddard shareholder. Strangely enough, "
"this operation will be mostly legal."
msgstr ""
"Un Señor de la Guerra Dvaered te necesita para matar a un accionista de "
"Goddard. Por extraño que parezca, esta operación será en su mayor parte "
"legal."

msgid "Deposit the commandos back on {pnt} in {sys}."
msgstr "Deposita a los comandos de vuelta en {pnt} en {sys}."

msgid "Go to {sys} with a Llama. Find the 'Silent Death' and kill her."
msgstr "Ve a {sys} con una Llama. Encuentra a la 'Muerte Silenciosa' y mátala."

msgid "Get your payment on {pnt} in {sys}."
msgstr "Consigue tu pago en {pnt} en {sys}."

#. hooks
#. Add the cargo
#. Player jumps in Arcturus to intercept the Koala
#. We don't want them to kill our Siren of Halir
#. Player jump in Dvaered system to intercept Agrippina Grosjean
#. Test if player is not escaping a situation
#. Player makes it to the first planet.
msgid ""
"You land and the saboteurs team leave your ship to disappear among the crowd "
"on the docks. You head to the bar to wait for their return behind a drink. "
"The atmosphere in the spaceport seems unusual. There are groups of workers "
"wandering around and policemen guarding the stores in the shopping alley. "
"You finally ask someone for information."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y el equipo de saboteadores abandona tu nave para desaparecer "
"entre la multitud de los muelles. Te diriges al bar para esperar su regreso "
"detrás de una copa. El ambiente en el puerto espacial parece inusual. Hay "
"grupos de trabajadores deambulando y policías vigilando las tiendas del "
"callejón comercial. Finalmente pides información a alguien."

msgid "Sergeant Krakadak"
msgstr "Sargento Kradakak"

msgid "Worker"
msgstr "Trabajador"

msgid ""
"\"We are on strike! That is what's going on! Nexus docks, who runs the "
"spaceport, decided to lower our wages to only 0.026 credits per tonne for "
"loaders, and 0.051 credits per kilometre for drivers. It is totally "
"impossible for non-modified workers to survive like that, and costs for "
"maintenance are also increasing for cyborg-workers. There are planets where "
"the gravity is lower than here, but the wages are higher. According to some "
"workers, there are even docker companies that offer a fixed salary, on other "
"planets. So we are on strike to force Nexus docks to give us better "
"remuneration.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Estamos en huelga! ¡Eso es lo que está pasando! Muelles Nexus, que "
"gestiona el puerto espacial, ha decidido bajar nuestros salarios a sólo "
"0,026 créditos por tonelada para los cargadores, y 0,051 créditos por "
"kilómetro para los conductores. Es totalmente imposible para los "
"trabajadores no modificados sobrevivir así, y los costes de mantenimiento "
"también aumentan para los trabajadores ciborg. Hay planetas donde la "
"gravedad es menor que aquí, pero los salarios son más altos. Según algunos "
"trabajadores, incluso hay empresas portuarias que ofrecen un salario fijo, "
"en otros planetas. Así que estamos en huelga para obligar a los muelles de "
"Nexus a darnos una mejor remuneración.\""

msgid "\"Why don't you go to one of those other planets, then?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué no vas a uno de esos otros planetas, entonces?\""

msgid ""
"\"Your strike will mostly handicap the clients of the docks, not Nexus docks "
"itself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Su huelga perjudicará sobre todo a los clientes de los muelles, no a los "
"propios muelles Nexus.\""

msgid "\"Does the Imperial law authorize strikes?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Do you think Tricon main warehouse might be impacted by the strike?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Crees que el almacén principal de Tricon podría verse afectado por la "
"huelga?\""

msgid ""
"\"That is unfortunately impossible: a cheap spacebus ticket costs about 50 "
"credits at least. That is about what we dockers can spare in several cycles. "
"Besides, most of us have our roots on this planet. Our parents, families, "
"children that we cannot abandon like that. You know, you are used to "
"travelling across the stars and such, but remember that most of the "
"population won't ever make interplanetary travel in their whole life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Eso es desgraciadamente imposible: un billete barato de autobús espacial "
"cuesta unos 50 créditos como mínimo. Eso es más o menos de lo que podemos "
"disponer los estibadores en varios ciclos. Además, la mayoría de nosotros "
"tenemos nuestras raíces en este planeta. Nuestros padres, familias, hijos "
"que no podemos abandonar así. ¡Ustedes están acostumbrados a viajar por las "
"estrellas y tal, pero recuerden que la mayoría de la población no hará un "
"viaje interplanetario en toda su vida!\""

msgid ""
"\"It is of the responsibility of Nexus docks to do all that is needed to "
"satisfy their clients. And this includes providing us workers (who actually "
"do the work) with suitable wages. Nowadays, with our current remuneration, "
"we had to work about 5 periods per decaperiod, and at this rhythm, non-"
"modified workers start having severe health issues at the age of 20 cycles, "
"while cyborgs tend to fall apart even earlier. This is why Nexus docks is "
"the only one to blame for this situation and we workers have no choice but "
"to defend our right to live longer than 25 cycles and to feed our children "
"without having to force them to work.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Actually, nowadays, only few people really care about Imperial laws. All I "
"know is that Nexus sent their private police after us when we created our "
"labour union. Then we threw large bolts at the cops, and they never came "
"back. So I suppose what we do is legal.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"By the way, the General Inquisitor of Nexus private police on the planet "
"was found dead in his bath at that same period. Some say that a foreign "
"power sent agents to disorganize the repression against our union. I don't "
"know if it is true, or if it is just another attempt at flagging the union "
"as an 'agent of hostile foreign powers'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por cierto, el Inquisidor General de la policía privada de Nexus en el "
"planeta fue encontrado muerto en su bañera en ese mismo período. Algunos "
"dicen que una potencia extranjera envió agentes para desorganizar la "
"represión contra nuestro sindicato. No sé si es cierto, o si es sólo otro "
"intento de señalar al sindicato como 'agente de potencias extranjeras "
"hostiles'.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Ahah! Of course, it is! Nothing enters nor gets out of that warehouse! I "
"have information that suggests that Tricon is already lobbying for Nexus "
"docks to accept our claims because they cannot afford that strike!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ahah! ¡Claro que sí! ¡Nada entra ni sale de ese almacén! Tengo "
"informaciones que sugieren que Tricon ya está presionando para que los "
"muelles de Nexus acepten nuestras reclamaciones, ¡porque no pueden "
"permitirse esa huelga!\""

msgid ""
"You leave the workers and head to the bar, where you were supposed to meet "
"the saboteurs once they have completed their mission. You soon notice the "
"two gamma-class cyborgs and approach them."
msgstr ""
"Abandonas a los obreros y te diriges al bar, donde se suponía que te "
"reunirías con los saboteadores una vez cumplida su misión. Pronto reparas en "
"los dos ciborgs de clase gamma y te acercas a ellos."

msgid ""
"\"Unexpected event, {player}. Some lazy workers are on strike, and the "
"engine in question was not delivered to the warehouse. We managed to contact "
"Colonel Okran and he got the information that it was sent to a secondary "
"warehouse in Mural to avoid the strike. It is too late to get to it there, "
"but it will soon be transferred again. Let us go back to the ship: we will "
"intercept it in {sys}.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The new plan is the following: you will find and hail that transport ship, "
"whose name is the 'Siren of Halir'. You will pretend you're in need of fuel "
"and they will board you. Meanwhile, we are going to do a small spacewalk and "
"infiltrate the ship. Once we have done what is planned, we will evacuate the "
"'Siren of Halir'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El nuevo plan es el siguiente: encontrarás y llamarás a esa nave de "
"transporte, cuyo nombre es la 'Sirena de Halir'. Fingirás que necesitas "
"combustible y te abordarán. Mientras tanto, nosotros haremos un pequeño "
"paseo espacial y nos infiltraremos en la nave. Una vez que hayamos hecho lo "
"previsto, evacuaremos la 'Sirena de Halir'.\""

msgid ""
"\"That is actually the tricky part: you are going to have to recover us in "
"space (like when a miner gathers ore). In the Space Forces, the officers "
"call that kind of stunt an \"extra-vehicular recovery operation\", but I "
"prefer to refer to it as \"one of the stupid stunts I would refuse to do if "
"half my brain had not been amputated before birth in that damn embryo "
"factory\". So please, please don't miss us when we will be helplessly "
"floating out there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esa es en realidad la parte complicada: vas a tener que recuperarnos en el "
"espacio (como cuando un minero recoge mineral). En las Fuerzas Espaciales, "
"los oficiales llaman a ese tipo de maniobra \"operación de recuperación "
"extravehicular\", pero yo prefiero referirme a ella como \"una de las "
"estúpidas maniobras que me negaría a hacer si no me hubieran amputado la "
"mitad del cerebro antes de nacer en esa maldita fábrica de embriones\". Así "
"que, por favor, no nos eches de menos cuando estemos flotando indefensos ahí "
"fuera.\""

msgid "Go to {sys}."
msgstr "Ve a {sys}."

msgid "Ask the 'Siren of Halir' for fuel."
msgstr "Pide combustible a la \"Sirena de Halir\"."

msgid "Follow the ship and recover the commandos in space."
msgstr "Sigue a la nave y recupera a los comandos en el espacio."

#. Player deposits the commandos
msgid ""
"You drop the commandos off. The chief of the group wishes you good luck with "
"the 'Silent Death' and they head to the stand of the Dvaered consulate on "
"the spaceport."
msgstr ""
"Dejas a los comandos. El jefe del grupo te desea buena suerte con la "
"\"Muerte Silenciosa\" y se dirigen al mostrador del consulado Dvaered en el "
"puerto espacial."

#. Player gets paid
msgid "After landing, you notice Colonel Okran waiting for you on the dock."
msgstr "Tras aterrizar, ves al Coronel Okran esperándote en el muelle."

msgid ""
"\"Hello again, citizen {name}. We have been informed by House Goddard of the "
"tragic death of Mrs Grosjean. Lord Fatgun sent flowers to her family, and I "
"believe you may have come to receive your reward. We will re-contact you in "
"case we need your services again in the future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola de nuevo, ciudadano {name}. Hemos sido informados por la Casa Goddard "
"de la trágica muerte de la Sra. Grosjean. El Señor Gordarma envió flores a "
"su familia, y creo que usted puede haber venido a recibir su recompensa. Nos "
"volveremos a poner en contacto con usted en caso de que necesitemos sus "
"servicios de nuevo en el futuro.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Hello again, citizen {name}. We have been informed by House Goddard of the "
"tragic death of Mrs Grosjean. Lord Fatgun sent flowers to her family, and I "
"believe you may have come to receive your reward. We will re-contact you in "
"case we need your services again in the future.\"\n"
"\"Oh, and as an additional reward, I made sure you can now purchase the "
"Heavy Weapon Licence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola de nuevo, ciudadano {name}. Hemos sido informados por la Casa Goddard "
"de la trágica muerte de la Sra. Grosjean. Señor Gordarma envió flores a su "
"familia, y creo que usted puede haber venido a recibir su recompensa. Nos "
"volveremos a poner en contacto con usted en caso de que necesitemos sus "
"servicios de nuevo en el futuro\".\n"
"\"Ah, y como recompensa adicional, me he asegurado de que ahora puedas "
"comprar la Licencia de Armas Pesadas.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can now purchase the #bHeavy Weapon Licence#0."
msgstr "Ya puedes comprar la #bLicencia de Armas Pesadas#0."

msgid "Colonel Okran pays you {credits}."
msgstr "El Coronel Okran te paga {credits}."

msgid ""
"You performed a negotiation mission for Lord Fatgun, who needs to purchase a "
"second Goddard battlecruiser. This mission consisted in killing a "
"shareholder of Goddard who was opposed to this contract."
msgstr ""
"Realizaste una misión de negociación para el Señor Gordarma, que necesita "
"comprar un segundo crucero de batalla Goddard. Esta misión consistió en "
"matar a un accionista de Goddard que se oponía a este contrato."

#. Player does not have the licence
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You performed a negotiation mission for Lord Fatgun, who needs to purchase a "
"second Goddard battlecruiser. This mission consisted in killing a "
"shareholder of Goddard who was opposed to this contract. Completing this "
"mission has granted you access to the Heavy Weapon Licence."
msgstr ""
"Realizaste una misión de negociación para el Señor Gordarma, que necesita "
"comprar un segundo crucero de batalla Goddard. Esta misión consistió en "
"matar a un accionista de Goddard que se oponía a este contrato. Completar "
"esta misión te ha otorgado acceso a la Licencia de Armas Pesadas."

#. Tests to determine if the player is running away
#. Player should be hailing the Siren of Halir
msgid ""
"You were supposed to intercept the 'Siren of Halir'\n"
"Your mission is a failure!"
msgstr ""
"Se suponía que interceptarías la \"Sirena de Halir\".\n"
"¡Has fallado en tu misión!"

#. Player should be killing Agrippina Grosjean
msgid ""
"You were supposed to kill Agrippina Grosjean!\n"
"Your mission is a failure!"
msgstr ""
"¡Se suponía que debías matar a Agrippina Grosjean!\n"
"¡Has fallado en tu misión!"

#. Spawn the Siren of Halir for the player to board it
msgid "Siren of Halir"
msgstr "Sirena de Halir"

#. Koala hooks
msgid ""
"When you ask the pilot for Fuel, they first sound surprised, but propose to "
"help for {pr} credits. You accept and they come to board you. The commandos "
"proceed to equip their space outfits."
msgstr ""
"Cuando pides Combustible al piloto, primero parecen sorprendidos, pero te "
"proponen ayudarte por {pr} créditos. Aceptas y vienen a abordarte. Los "
"comandos proceden a equiparse con sus trajes espaciales."

#. Player is too poor
msgid ""
"When you ask the pilot for Fuel, they first sound surprised, but propose to "
"help for {pr} credits. You realize you don't have enough credits for that!"
msgstr ""
"Cuando pides Combustible al piloto, primero parecen sorprendidos, pero te "
"proponen ayudarte por {pr} créditos. ¡Te das cuenta de que no tienes "
"suficientes créditos para eso!"

#. Only matters before commandos
msgid ""
"It appears the Siren of Halir left the system. Your mission is a failure!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When the 'Siren of Halir' is close enough, the members of the team leave "
"your ship by the airlock and you wish them safety reaching the target. Once "
"fuel transfer is finished, it is time for you to follow the Siren, waiting "
"for the team to jump out of the ship."
msgstr ""

#. Free the Siren
#. Spawn the Commandos gatherable
msgid "Commandos"
msgstr "Comandos"

#. Spawn the commando (player-only gatherable) just behind the Koala
msgid "Spacewalking commandos in sight."
msgstr "Comandos de caminata espacial a la vista."

#. Player gathers the commandos
#. Test commodity type
#. Remove standard cargo and add mission cargo
msgid "Commandos recovered."
msgstr "Comandos recuperados."

#. Spawn the Silent Death for the player to kill it
msgid "Silent Death"
msgstr "Muerte Silenciosa"

#. Make sure the battle actually happens
#. Silent Death won't shut their mouth
#. Manage Silent running away
#. Hooks for the Shark
msgid ""
"It appears the Silent Death did leave the system. Your mission is a failure!"
msgstr ""
"Parece que la Muerte Silenciosa abandonó el sistema. ¡Has fallado en tu "
"misión!"

msgid "Target eliminated."
msgstr "Objectivo eliminado."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Dvaered Intelligence">
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>150</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <faction>Dvaered</faction>
#. <cond>player.outfitNum("Mercenary Licence") &gt; 0</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. <campaign>Dvaered Recruitment</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. -- Dvaered Intelligence
#. -- This is the mercenary mission corresponding to "Dvaered Census"
#. -- The player has to get in range of a given amount of Pirate Ships in a given system.
#.
#. Stages :
#. 0) Way to system and in-system traffic
#. 1) Way to any Dvaered Spob to get paid
#. --
#. Estimate travelling risk (similar to what is done in cargo)
#. /!\ This is relative to the faction, and ideally not to the current system
#. I'm not sure about merging with cargo code as coefficients are different
#. Because we assume the player can hide and defend themselves
#. If there is a Spob of the faction is system, risk is 0 for the faction
#. Use standard pirates to see if system is suitable
#. Mission details
msgid "Monitor Pirate Activity in {sys}"
msgstr "Monitorizar la actividad pirata en {sys}"

msgid ""
"Dvaered High Command requires a pilot to go to {sys} and detect {nb} Pirate "
"ships."
msgstr ""

msgid "Dvaered Intelligence"
msgstr "Inteligencia Dvaered"

#. Test pilots in range.
#. Wrong system: abort
#. Test if mission is complete
msgid "You have acquired data on enough Pirate ships"
msgstr "Has adquirido datos sobre suficientes naves Piratas"

#. Recursivity 1 s
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Dvaered Delivery">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Dvaered</faction>
#. <done>Dvaered Census 0</done>
#. <cond>
#. if system.cur():reputation("Dvaered") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("Dvaered") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. if diff.isApplied("flf_dead") then
#. return false
#. end
#. local misn_test = require "misn_test"
#. if not misn_test.mercenary(true) then
#. return false
#. end
#. --return misn_test.reweight_active() -- don't reweight for licences
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. <campaign>Dvaered Recruitment</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Dvaered Delivery
#. This is the mission of the Dvaered Recruitment arc when the player starts to commit with Dvaered.
#. The player has to transmit a parcel to another private pilot on Zhiru. The destination of the parcel is the Empire.
#. But the other pilot is missing and the player has to do a series of tasks.
#. At some point, the FLF is suspected to have abducted the agent (pretext to get the player enemy with them)
#.
#. Stages :
#. 0) Way to Zhiru to meet Dvaered contact agent
#. 1) Way to Caladan to meet Empire contact agent
#. 2) Going to speak to the contact agent
#. 3) Way to Theras and ambush on the FLF Tristan
#. 4) Battle at Theras
#. 5) After the Battle against the Swan
#. 6) Kill the true killer of the lost agent
#. 7) Battle
#. 8) Way back to any Dvaered planet to get paid
#. --
#. Test acceptance
#. Mission details
msgid "Dvaered Delivery"
msgstr "Entrega Dvaered"

#. Define the cargo commodity
msgid "Secret Cargo"
msgstr "Cargamento Secreto"

msgid ""
"A pink container with two stickers on it. First one reads 'teddy bears', and "
"second one reads 'bio-hazard, do not open without protection'"
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor rosa con dos pegatinas. En la primera se lee \"osos de "
"peluche\", y en la segunda 'riesgo biológico, no abrir sin protección'"

msgid "This soldier seems to want to talk to you."
msgstr "Este soldado parece querer hablar contigo."

msgid ""
"\"I am glad to meet you, citizen {player}. Please let me introduce myself: I "
"am...\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Hem... Hehe...\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Actually, I am not authorized to tell you my rank nor my name or the "
"service I am working for. Anyway, I am an employee of the High Command and "
"we need you for a transport task.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"It should be a relatively straightforward mission, except that you have to "
"avoid getting scanned by patrol ships, including Dvaered patrol ships. What "
"you need is a ship capable to discretely transport {tonnes} of fret to {pnt} "
"in {sys}.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A mysterious soldier, a confidential identity and a secret delivery. You "
"look at the small Dvaered insignia on your interlocutor's chest: are your "
"ready to work with that Great House?\n"
"Red-painted ships, mace rockets and big nose drawings... This mission might "
"be the gate to a further association with House Dvaered. Are you going to "
"take part to this secret delivery?"
msgstr ""
"Un soldado misterioso, una identidad confidencial y una entrega secreta. "
"Miras la pequeña insignia Dvaered en el pecho de tu interlocutor: ¿estás "
"preparado para trabajar con esa Gran Casa?\n"
"Naves pintadas de rojo, cohetes maza y dibujos de grandes narices... Esta "
"misión podría ser la puerta a una mayor asociación con la Casa Dvaered. ¿Vas "
"a participar en esta entrega secreta?"

msgid "\"I will do it.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"I'm not interested\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Too bad! I'll have to find someone else then.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Good choice, citizen!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"So, as said, go to {pnt} in {sys}. There, you will meet our contact agent "
"named Bony Boudica who will take the cargo in charge. I'll give you a "
"datapad containing information to identify her.\n"
"Oh, I almost forgot! There is one thing you are authorized to know: this "
"cargo is transferred to the Empire as a part of the Dvaered-Empire "
"collaboration program.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "You have to transfer a parcel to the Empire at {pnt} ({sys})"
msgstr "Tiene que transferir un paquete al Imperio en {pnt} ({sys})"

msgid "Go to {sys} and land on {pnt}. Avoid being scanned on the way."
msgstr "Ve a {sys} y aterriza en {pnt}. Evita que te escaneen por el camino."

#. hooks
#. Add the cargo
#. Track previour system
#. Player transports cargo : just initialize scan hook.
#. Player jumps in Theras to intercept the Swan
#. Player jump in Dvaered system to intercept Chilperic Duchmol
#. Test if player is not escaping a situation
#. Player makes it to the first rendez-vous point.
msgid "Agent"
msgstr "Agente"

msgid ""
"When you step out from your ship, you notice a woman that was waiting for "
"you on the dock who matches the description that was given to you."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Glad to see that you made it to our rendezvous point, {player}. My name is "
"Bony Boudica... I mean, it's my codename, of course.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I am afraid we might have an issue to deal with, you and me. The other "
"pilot, who was supposed to take your cargo did not show up.\n"
"But it is too risky to wait for them here. This means that we have to take "
"the cargo to a safer destination, where the Imperials will be able to store "
"it. I'll embark with you next time you take off, and you will go to {pnt} in "
"{sys}.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Understood.\""
msgstr "\"Comprendido.\""

msgid "\"Look, lady, I have been hired to take that cargo and nothing more.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Well, pilot, I have three answers to that:\n"
"1) The cargo is of the highest importance and has to be transported to a "
"safe destination at all costs\n"
"2) You have not been paid yet and if you want to, you'll have to do what I "
"say\n"
"3) You will be rewarded for that\""
msgstr ""

#. Player makes it to the second rendez-vous point. An overly complicated discussion happens to show how messy the Dvaered-Imperial black-ops system is.
#. Remove scan hook.
#. Player meets Boudica again after having captured Shaky Swan.
#. Player gets finally paid
msgid "Intermediate"
msgstr "Intermediar"

msgid "Imperial Agent"
msgstr "Agente Imperial"

msgid ""
"A group is waiting at your dock. Before you proceed with the final landing "
"procedure, Boudica looks at them with binoculars, and then confirms they are "
"the Imperial team.\n"
"You dock at the spaceport and step out on the platform. Workers immediately "
"take your cargo in charge, under the protection of armed cyborgs."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo está esperando en tu muelle. Antes de proceder con el procedimiento "
"final de aterrizaje, Boudica los mira con prismáticos y luego confirma que "
"son el equipo Imperial.\n"
"Atracáis en el puerto espacial y bajáis a la plataforma. Los trabajadores se "
"hacen cargo inmediatamente de vuestra carga, bajo la protección de ciborgs "
"armados."

msgid ""
"You observe the soldiers, looking for imperial insignias, in vain. You "
"accidentally make eye contact with one of the cyborgs, which cause the blood "
"in your veins to instantly freeze. Does this guy have scars INSIDE the eyes? "
"How is that even possible!?\n"
"A seemingly-unarmed man steps forward. He must be the imperial agent in "
"charge of the operation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Hello, pilot. Hello, Boudica, nice to meet you again, how do you do?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Not so bad on my side. Glad to see you too, Ak-Ak. Though I would have "
"preferred we meet in different circumstances... Any news of your pilot?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Neh. Not a single clue. I'd say the safest bet is that the FLF is "
"implicated.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"How would they have known?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Dunno. Anyway, you remember when I told ya we didn't know where \"Shaky "
"Swan\" was?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Yep.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"It was not true.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Oooh. I'm sooo surprised! I totally was not expecting you to lie at all "
"about that!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Come on... Anyway, I think it's time to get that Swan. If the FLF is "
"implicated in the disappearance, so is the Swan. The good thing is that we "
"know that he is supposed to have business in {sys} soon.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Nice to hear that from you. But why bother telling me? Just send the "
"flying circus after him.\""
msgstr ""

#. Flying Circus is the surname of the squadron of the red baron during WWI, And in game, I plan it to be the surname of an imperial black ops squadron.
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, I've made a backup request to the Imperial Lair's Secretary, but the "
"Second Archbishop of Mayhem has threatened a veto, so I only have access to "
"the squadrons that are outside his jurisdiction. And I finally got squadron "
"138...\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Man, I don't care about your Bishop of My-ass, nor the ID of your "
"squadron. Just get them to intercept the Swan.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I can't. Squadron 138 has army transponders, and as you obviously know, "
"the Swan can identify them. I need an unrelated pilot to disable his ship "
"before the squadron jumps in to catch him.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Both agents turn their faces towards you. You try to pretend you are not "
"here, looking at the roof and scratching your nose, but soon Boudica breaks "
"the silence."
msgstr ""
"Ambos agentes vuelven la cara hacia ti. Intentas fingir que no estás aquí, "
"mirando al techo y rascándote la nariz, pero pronto Boudica rompe el "
"silencio."

msgid ""
"\"Okay, {player}. Once you are ready, just meet me at the bar. We'll put "
"together a plan to catch the Swan.\""
msgstr ""

#. Add boudica at the bar
#. Discussion with agent Boudica about the interception of the "Shaky Swan"
msgid "Bony Boudica"
msgstr "Bony Boudica"

msgid "This agent is an intermediate between the Empire and Dvaered."
msgstr "Este agente es un intermediario entre el Imperio y Dvaered."

#. Add boudica at the bar
#. Done with the cargo
msgid "Meet Bony Boudica at the {pnt} bar in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bony Boudica was waiting for you at the dock."
msgstr "La Bony Boudica te estaba esperando en el muelle."

msgid ""
"\"Hi, {name}. Did you have fun out there with the Imperial pilots?\n"
"Meanwhile, our boy Ak-Ak did his investigation. He got his cyborgs to break "
"a few knees, and now we know what happened to the lost pilot.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Actually, Shaky Swan has nothing to do with that. Nor the FLF. The Empire "
"pilot just accepted a random bounty hunt mission on their way to the "
"rendezvous planet. And they miserably failed.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"And now, the Imperials want to avenge their pilot. They tracked the pirate "
"pilot, who is called 'The Death Dealer'. He is a clanless pirate, wanted by "
"the Imperial police, as well as a few other faction's authorities. But he "
"never broke the law in Dvaered space, where he is a peaceful trader under "
"his real name: Chilperic Duchmol.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"So, Duchmol is supposed to take off from {pnt} in {sys} with his Koala "
"soon.\n"
"Of course, the Imperials could send their squadron to obliterate him, but as "
"you probably already guessed at this point, that would lead to unneeded "
"tensions between the Empire and House Dvaered. On the other hand, requesting "
"support from the Dvaered Space Forces would mean more risk that Duchmol gets "
"warned and escapes.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"In conclusion, once more, we need you to take care of this.\n"
"And again, be assured that your reward will be dramatically increased from "
"its initial amount.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Hopefully much more than {credits}"
msgstr "Espero que mucho más que {credits}"

msgid "When will it end?"
msgstr "¿Cuándo terminará?"

msgid "Dvaered Delivery (Gone Wild)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Go to {sys} and kill Chilperic Duchmol."
msgstr "Ve a {sys} y mata a Chilperic Duchmol."

msgid "Go back to {pnt} and (hopefully) get your reward."
msgstr "Vuelve a {sys} y (con suerte) obtén tu recompensa."

msgid ""
"After landing, you once again meet Bony Boudica. And hopefully now, she has "
"a nice reward for you."
msgstr ""
"Después de aterrizar, te encuentras de nuevo con Bony Boudica. Y, con "
"suerte, ahora tiene una buena recompensa para ti."

msgid "\"Hi, {name}. How do you do?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Very well for someone who met a guy named 'The Death Dealer'.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Well... Unless there is yet another bastard I need to fight before you "
"finally pay me.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Am I going to get paid some day?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Actually... No.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Of course. I know the mission did not go very well from your point of "
"view, but sometimes unexpected things happen. And when you work for secret "
"services of major powers, you have to fix unexpected problems as soon as "
"possible. Otherwise, the consequences might be catastrophic.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Now that Chilperic Duchmol aka 'The Death Dealer' is no more, your mission "
"is over and it is my utmost privilege to reward you the sum of {credits} in "
"name of the Dvaered High Command.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The fact that this mission did not go as planned is actually a rather good "
"thing for you, you know: now you have proven to the Dvaered High Command "
"that you are a reliable pilot. I don't know if you intend to continue "
"working for them, but I have information that suggests that they might offer "
"you more work in the future.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You performed a delivery mission for the Dvaered-Empire collaboration. This "
"mission did however turn out oddly and you ended up helping the Empire "
"capture a shady FLF-friendly agent surnamed \"Shaky Swan\" and killing a "
"pirate."
msgstr ""
"Realizaste una misión de entrega para la colaboración entre Dvaered y el "
"Imperio. Sin embargo, esta misión resultó extraña y acabaste ayudando al "
"Imperio a capturar a un turbio agente amigo de la FLF apellidado \"Cisne "
"Tembloroso\" y a matar a un pirata."

#. Tests to determine if the player is running away
#. Player should be catching Shaky Swan
msgid ""
"Didn't you have a certain Shaky Swan to catch?\n"
"Your mission is a failure!"
msgstr ""
"¿No tenías que atrapar a cierto Cisne Tembloroso?\n"
"¡Has fallado en tu misión!"

#. Player should be kill Chilperic Duchmol
msgid ""
"Didn't you have a certain Chilperic Duchmol to kill?\n"
"Your mission is a failure!"
msgstr ""
"¿No tenías que matar a un tal Chilperic Duchmol?\n"
"¡Has fallado en tu misión!"

#. Player got scanned by a patrol ship: mission is a failure
msgid ""
"You receive the signal that a patrol ship has achieved a scan of your cargo. "
"The pilot does not mention anything special, but it is obvious that they now "
"know what you were transporting. In that condition, you have to jettison the "
"cargo and to abort the mission."
msgstr ""
"Recibes la señal de que una nave de patrulla ha logrado escanear tu carga. "
"El piloto no menciona nada especial, pero es obvio que ahora saben lo que "
"estabas transportando. En esas condiciones, tienes que deshacerte de la "
"carga y abortar la misión."

msgid ""
"\"I don't know how much you understood of our conversation at the spaceport, "
"but now we need you to disable the ship of a pilot named 'Shaky Swan'. He is "
"supposed to be hanging around {sys} in the near future.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ask for details on the operation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tell her you need more information on the context."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Protest and tell her you initially were only supposed to deliver a parcel."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tell her you know what to do."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"According to our information, Shaky Swan is in the Frontier sector right "
"now, flying a Tristan, presumably under FLF transponder. It might soon enter "
"{sys1} from the jump point to {sys2}.\n"
"Your task will be to approach, engage and disable the ship. Only afterwards, "
"squadron 138 will enter the system and load the swan's ship into a "
"Pacifier's hangar. After that, you will come back here to collect your "
"payment.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Very important point: the Imperials insist that they want to catch the "
"swan by themselves. Do not board the ship under any circumstances.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "What do you want to ask Boudica?"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"What was actually in that box I transported?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Who is that Imperial agent and those cyborgs?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Who is 'Shaky Swan'?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"What is the 'Flying Circus'?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Who is the Second Archbishop of Mayhem?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Now, back to my mission...\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"That were teddy bears, of course. Didn't you read the sticker on it?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Oh, thanks for the information!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Actually, there was another sticker on the box, where it was written 'bio-"
"hazard, do not open without protection'. So I doubt there are really teddy "
"bears in it.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Boudica seems irritated by your remark."
msgstr "Boudica parece irritada por tu comentario."

msgid ""
"\"Look, mate. If the High Command says there are teddy bears in the damn "
"box, then there are teddy bears in the damn box. Period.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"He is cool, isn't he? His codename is Akward Akira, but most people in the "
"business call him Ak-Ak. I am regularly in contact with him as he seems to "
"be in charge of the Dvaered affairs at the Imperial secret services. And for "
"the cyborgs, they are probably Imperial spacemarines which were put at the "
"disposition of Ak-Ak.\""
msgstr ""

#. codespell:ignore Akward
msgid ""
"\"Shaky Swan is a shifty individual. Really. I don't know much about them, "
"except for some of their deeds. Some say they used to be an Imperial agent "
"as well. But nowadays, they are more into stuff like assassinations, weapons "
"dealing, or even terrorism...\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Boudica stops talking and seems to think."
msgstr "Boudica deja de hablar y parece pensar."

msgid ""
"\"... Actually, those are the kind of things Imperial agents do.\n"
"But Shaky Swan is also in touch with the FLF and provides them with all "
"kinds of information and weapons. The Dvaered counter-insurrection task-"
"force, led by Colonel Urnus, has wanted to capture this Swan for quite a "
"while now.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"We have always suspected that the Imperials are protecting the Swan. "
"Anyway, now that a pilot employed by the Empire is missing, they are "
"disposed to capture that individual. The only thing I hope is that they "
"don't set the Swan free once they have recovered their pilot.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Forget about the Flying Circus. Just remember you don't want to get "
"involved with them.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Second Archbishop of Mayhem? Who knows who this other clown is? Probably "
"one of the numerous Imperial dignitaries that live at the Emperor's lair. "
"You know, they are a pack of decadent weirdos who tend to veto things just "
"because there was not enough honey on their ostrich pudding at last night's "
"orgy.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Boudica sighs and turns her face to the roof."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Listen, {name}, would you by any chance like the Empire and House Dvaered "
"to trigger a Universal War?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"Sí.\""

msgid "\"I couldn't care less.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You obviously have no idea what you are talking about.\n"
"Shall you see the death squadrons taking off from Halir, loaded with all the "
"kinds of deadly viruses only human madness can breed. Shall you see the "
"fleet of the united Warlords silently flying towards humanity's doom before "
"a helpless sky of horrified stars. Shall you see them hide the sun of "
"Doranthex as would the black wings of death.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Shall you hear the frenetic lament of sirens while the sky of Antica gets "
"torn apart by the trails of hypersonic bombs. Shall you hear the roaring of "
"space stations, wounded to death by torpedoes, disseminating into the void "
"the helpless bodies of their inhabitants.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Maybe you think that as a pilot, you won't endure starvation, contrary to "
"the billions of poor souls who will struggle to survive the nuclear winter "
"on their sterilized planets. Maybe you think you won't have to endure the "
"gaze of the slowly dying victims of incendiary bombs, bio-weapons, climatic, "
"and seismic bombs...\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"But this won't be the worst! Because I've got my information. And the "
"Empire has weapons even more powerful. Even more abominable. Even more "
"unmentionable and unimaginable. Some say the Incident was provoked by such a "
"weapon. Imagine if they decide to make a new incident happen!\n"
"Then you would have to bear that monstrous responsibility on your shoulders. "
"Just because you refused to catch that Shaky bastard!\""
msgstr ""

#. Clearly, she is not well informed about the Incident.
msgid ""
"\"Because war is not that far away, you know. Galactopolitics has not been "
"this unstable since the end of the Faction Wars. Our work is to do our best "
"to have the Empire and House Dvaered barely tolerate each other. If they "
"don't, they will soon start a war, and House Sirius, Za'lek, and the "
"Soromids would have to follow.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I know you were only asked to transport a random parcel, but this pilot "
"who disappeared is serious business. We have to find who is behind that "
"disappearance. And by the way, you can be ensured that you will be paid more "
"than whatever initial reward was promised to you.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Dvaered Delivery (Not Going as Expected)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Go to {sys} and disable Shaky Swan. Target is supposed to come from {syso}."
msgstr ""
"Ve a {sys} y desactiva el Cisne Tembloroso. El objetivo se supone que viene "
"de {syso}."

msgid ""
"Wait for squadron 138 to jump in to arrest Shaky Swan. DO NOT BOARD THE SHIP "
"YOURSELF!"
msgstr ""
"Espere a que el escuadrón 138 salte para arrestar a Cisne Tembloroso. ¡NO "
"ABORDES LA NAVE TU MISMO!"

msgid "Go back to {pnt} to get your reward."
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} para obtener tu recompensa."

msgid "Hopefully more than {credits}"
msgstr "Espero que más de {credits}"

msgid ""
"You are helping the Empire investigate the disappearance of one of their "
"agents"
msgstr ""
"Estás ayudando al Imperio a investigar la desaparición de uno de sus agentes"

msgid "Shaky Swan"
msgstr "Cisne Tembloroso"

#. Not very elegant...
#. Player Has disabled Shaky Swan
#. To be sure it won't recover.
msgid "What the? Damn!"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¡Maldita sea!"

#. Faction loss with the FLF.
#. All ways to get Shaky Swan's interception to fail
msgid ""
"Good work, pilot! You can be proud for how well you managed to make short "
"work of the Swan!\n"
"Wait a second... You were actually supposed to catch this pilot alive, "
"weren't you?\n"
"Your mission is a pitiful failure."
msgstr ""
"¡Buen trabajo, piloto! Puedes estar orgulloso de lo bien que te las "
"arreglaste para hacer un trabajo breve con el Cisne.\n"
"Espera un segundo... Se suponía que debías atrapar a este piloto con vida, "
"¿no es así?\n"
"Has fallado lamentablement en tu misión."

msgid ""
"Once the boarding manoeuvre is over, you remember that Bony Boudica had "
"explicitly requested you NOT to board the ship yourself.\n"
"Your mission is a failure."
msgstr ""
"Una vez terminada la maniobra de abordaje, recuerdas que Bony Boudica te "
"había pedido explícitamente que NO abordaras la nave tú mismo.\n"
"Has fallado en tu misión."

msgid ""
"It appears Shaky Swan has managed to escape the system. Your mission is a "
"failure!"
msgstr ""
"Parece que Cisne Tembloroso ha logrado escapar del sistema. ¡Has fallado en "
"tu misión!"

#. Squadron 138 Boards Shaky Swan
msgid "Hi, Swanie, we have to talk, you and me!"
msgstr "Hola, Cisnecito, tenemos que habla, ¡tú y yo!"

#. Spawn Squadron 138 to capture the swan
msgid "138-Asset"
msgstr "138-Recurso"

msgid "138-Leader"
msgstr "138-Lider"

msgid "138-Wingman"
msgstr "138-Compañero"

#. Some messages to give the player something to read during the approach of the Imperials.
msgid "Hey! Did you just disable my ship?"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¿Acabas de incapacitar mi nave?"

msgid "How disrespectful it is!"
msgstr "¡Qué falta de respeto!"

msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "¿Hola?"

msgid "Are you even listening?"
msgstr "¿Estás escuchando?"

msgid "I'm Shaky Swan, you know? You're supposed to be scared of me!"
msgstr "Soy Cisne Tembloroso, ¿sabes? ¡Se supone que debes tener miedo de mí!"

msgid "Is anyone listening?"
msgstr "¿Hay alguien que escuche?"

msgid "Wait! Wait! Are that imperial ships?"
msgstr "¡Espera! ¡Espera! ¿Son naves imperiales?"

msgid "Hey, Imperial guys! You're not after me, right?"
msgstr "¡Hey, Imperiales! No estáis detrás de mí, ¿verdad?"

msgid "Are you?"
msgstr "¿Lo estáis?"

#. Spawn target Chilperic Duchmol
msgid "Chilperic Duchmol"
msgstr "Chilperic Duchmol"

#. Poor Chilperic Duchmol: he chose the system the player comes from!
#. Manage target running away if attacked
msgid ""
"The final explosion of a hostile ship is always a pleasant sight, isn't it? "
"It is now time to report back to Bony Boudica."
msgstr ""
"La explosión final de una nave hostil es siempre una vista agradable, ¿no? "
"Ahora es el momento de informar a Bony Boudica."

msgid ""
"It appears Chilperic Duchmol has managed to escape the system. Your mission "
"is a failure!"
msgstr ""
"Parece que Chilperic Duchmol ha conseguido escapar del sistema. ¡Has fallado "
"en tu misión!"

#. Gets someone to make a message (useful for hook.timer)
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Dvaered Propaganda">
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>150</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <faction>Dvaered</faction>
#. <cond>
#. if var.peek("dp_available") ~= true then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").computer()
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>2</tier>
#. <campaign>Dvaered Recruitment</campaign>
#. <done_evt name="Deliver Flyers">If you accept</done_evt>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. -- Dvaered Propaganda
#. -- The player has to overfly a planet and escape ships pursuing them.
#.
#. Stages :
#. 0) Way to target planet
#. 1) Way back
#. --
#. Define the flyers commodity
msgid "Propaganda Posters"
msgstr "Posters de Propaganda"

msgid "Heaps of posters representing big-nose characters hitting each other."
msgstr ""
"Montones de posters que representan a personajes de gran tamaño golpeándose "
"entre sí."

#. Remove the misn cargo or accidentally-scooped posters
#. mem.misn_state == 1
#. Select a random Dvaered planet at 4 distance. Stations not allowed.
#. No planet: abort
#. Claim
#. (per ton)
#. Mission details
msgid "Warlords Propaganda spreading on {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "Propaganda de los Señores de la Guerra difundida en {pnt} en {sys}"

msgid "{credits} per ton"
msgstr "{credits} por tonelada"

msgid ""
"The Warlords Affairs Office requires a pilot to spread as many posters as "
"possible in the atmosphere of {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr ""
"La Oficina de Asuntos de los Señores de la Guerra requieren un piloto para "
"difundir tantos carteles como sea posible en la atmósfera de {pnt} en {sys}"

msgid "Warlords Propaganda"
msgstr "Propaganda de los Señores de la Guerra"

msgid "Go to {sys} and overfly {pnt} to spread your posters"
msgstr "Ve a {sys} y sobrevuela {pnt} para difundir tus posters"

msgid "Land on any Dvaered planet or station (except {pnt})"
msgstr "Aterriza en cualquier planeta o estación Dvaered (excepto {pnt})"

#. remove their allies for them not to chase the player
#. Add a few hostile-to-be patrol ships
#. Proximity of the planet
#. Sets timers for flyers spread
#. We'll drop them in 10 times. Compute how long it will be
#. We'll drop r times d+1 flyers, and 10-r times d flyers. The total is equal to mem.qtt
#. Remove all at once for simplicity
#. Prepare hostiles
#. Spreads some Flyers
#. Activates hostility
msgid "That is an insult to our Lord's honour!"
msgstr "¡Eso es un insulto al honor de nuestro Señor!"

msgid ""
"Hey! Smart ass! Did you think about the environmental consequences of what "
"you just did?"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye! ¡Idiota! ¿Has pensado en las consecuencias medioambientales de lo que "
"acabas de hacer?"

msgid "Everyone! Get that ship!"
msgstr "¡A todos! ¡Atrapen esa nave!"

msgid "Come back! I have got candies for you... and MACE ROCKETS!"
msgstr "¡Vuelve! Tengo caramelos para ti... ¡y COHETES MAZA!"

msgid ""
"You spread posters on my planet. My turn to spread rockets on your face!"
msgstr "Esparces posters en mi planeta. ¡Me toca esparcir cohetes en tu cara!"

msgid ""
"As you step out of your ship, your eye is caught by a flying poster, carried "
"away by the wind. And suddenly, you remember there was written on your "
"mission pad: 'Land on any Dvaered planet or station (except {pnt})'. A group "
"of angry-looking Dvaered soldiers comes at you: maybe you will discover soon "
"why you were told not to land there...\n"
"Your mission is a FAILURE!"
msgstr ""
"Al salir de tu nave, te llama la atención un cartel volador, arrastrado por "
"el viento. Y de repente, recuerdas que en tu libreta de misión estaba "
"escrito: \"Aterriza en cualquier planeta o estación Dvaered (excepto {pnt})"
"\". Un grupo de soldados Dvaered con aspecto enfadado se acerca a ti: quizá "
"pronto descubras por qué te dijeron que no aterrizaras allí...\n"
"¡Has FALLADO en tu misión!"

msgid "For accomplishing a Warlord Propaganda Mission, you are rewarded {pay}."
msgstr ""
"Por cumplir una Misión de Propaganda del Señor de la Guerra, recibes una "
"recompensa {pay}."

msgid "Colonel Okran, the second of Lord Fatgun"
msgstr "Coronel Okran, el segundo del Señor Gordarma"

msgid ""
"\"Hello, citizen. We finally got the formal agreement of The Goddard Company "
"for the obtention of our second battlecruiser. We would like you to escort "
"our convoy to and from Zhiru. I can pay you {credits} Are you interested in "
"that mission?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, ciudadano. Finalmente conseguimos el acuerdo formal de la Compañía "
"Goddard para la obtención de nuestro segundo crucero de batalla. Nos "
"gustaría que escoltaras nuestra caravana hacia y desde Zhiru. Puedo pagarte "
"{credits} ¿Estás interesado en esta misión?\""

msgid ""
"\"Really? Well… I was not expecting that. Anyway, come back if you change "
"your mind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿En serio? Bueno... no me lo esperaba. De todos modos, vuelve si cambias "
"de opinión.\""

msgid ""
"\"Thank you, citizen. Your help will be most appreciated as I can not "
"mobilize our entire fleet for this escort mission. Many of our ships are "
"needed to protect Lord Fatgun's planets from attacks.\n"
"I would like you to specially take the anti-bomber role. For that, I "
"recommend you to fly a light ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias, ciudadano. Tu ayuda será muy apreciada, ya que no puedo movilizar "
"a toda nuestra flota para esta misión de escolta. Muchas de nuestras naves "
"son necesarias para proteger los planetas del Señor Gordarma de los "
"ataques.\n"
"Me gustaría que tomaras especialmente el papel de anti-bombardero. Para "
"ello, te recomiendo que pilotes una nave ligera.\""

#. That's actually a pretext for the player to fly a ship that can run away when Okran decides to attack the player
#. Test acceptance
#. Mission details
#. ideally, escort ships should have permadeath...
#. Next: land on Zhiru
#. Next: move to next system
#. This is less of a death trap if the player is just behind the leader
#. Update mission details
#. He certainly has a doubtful motivation that has to be determined later
#. Update mission details
msgid "Dvaered Shopping"
msgstr "Compras Dvaered"

msgid ""
"You accepted to fly with a fleet of Dvaered ships that will escort a freshly-"
"bought Dvaered Goddard battlecruiser."
msgstr ""
"Has aceptado volar con una flota de naves Dvaered que escoltarán a un "
"crucero de batalla Dvaered Goddard recién comprado."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Protect the Dvaered cruiser."
msgstr "Protege al crucero Dvaered."

msgid "Jump to {sys}."
msgstr "Salta a {sys}."

msgid "Land on {pnt}."
msgstr "Aterriza en {pnt}."

#. Increment system
#. Player went to the wrong system
msgid "Wrong system"
msgstr "Sistema Equivocado"

msgid ""
"It appears you jumped in the wrong system somehow. You lost your convoy and "
"failed your mission."
msgstr ""
"Parece que saltaste al sistema equivocado de alguna manera. Perdiste tu "
"caravana y fallaste tu misión."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Protect the Dvaered battleship."
msgstr "Protege al acorazado Dvaered."

#. Player Jumps in for the rendezvous with the trickster
msgid "The Trickster"
msgstr "El Tramposo"

#. This time, he is alone
#. Test if player is not escaping a situation
#. Player makes it to Zhiru.
msgid ""
"After landing, Okran tells you and the rest of the escort pilots to wait for "
"him at the spaceport's bar. As a member of his crew, you are granted access "
"to the special VIP customers restricted bar.\n"
"The walls are covered with pictures of different versions of the Goddard "
"battlecruiser, each of which is accompanied by a small explicative text and "
"a series of important facts: \"Did you know that 365 Goddards Mk VII-DM were "
"constructed between UST-510 and UST-567? This model is the most successful "
"ever, and about 120 of them are reportedly still in use at date of UST-601.\""
msgstr ""
"Tras aterrizar, Okran te dice a ti y al resto de pilotos de escolta que le "
"esperéis en el bar del puerto espacial. Como miembro de su tripulación, "
"tienes acceso al bar restringido para clientes VIP.\n"
"Las paredes están cubiertas de fotos de diferentes versiones del crucero de "
"batalla Goddard, cada una de ellas acompañada de un pequeño texto "
"explicativo y una serie de datos importantes: \"¿Sabías que entre el UST-510 "
"y el UST-567 se construyeron 365 Goddard Mk VII-DM? Este modelo es el más "
"exitoso de la historia, y se dice que unos 120 de ellos siguen en uso a "
"fecha de UST-601.\""

msgid ""
"Some time later, Colonel Okran finally comes and shows you a fancy keychain "
"representing a crossed-eyed gorilla lifting a Goddard cruiser. \"They have "
"nice goodies!\" Before you have time to ask one for yourself, it is time to "
"depart."
msgstr ""
"Algún tiempo después, el Coronel Okran viene por fin y te enseña un llavero "
"de lujo que representa a un gorila bizco levantando un crucero Goddard. "
"\"¡Tienen bonitas cosas!\" Antes de que tengas tiempo de pedir uno para ti, "
"es hora de marcharse."

#. Player gets rewarded
#. Actually a lot of money
msgid ""
"While landing, you receive a message from the Dvaered military control:\n"
"\"Congratulations, citizen {player}. Our data suggests you have won your "
"first honourable fight against a gentleman. Please reach the spaceport's "
"military contact office for further information.\"\n"
"When you arrive at the said office, a soldier greets you."
msgstr ""
"Mientras aterrizas, recibes un mensaje del control militar Dvaered:\n"
"\"Enhorabuena, ciudadano {player}. Nuestros datos sugieren que has ganado tu "
"primer combate honorable contra un caballero. Por favor, dirígete a la "
"oficina de contacto militar del puerto espacial para más información\".\n"
"Cuando llegas a dicha oficina, un soldado te recibe."

msgid ""
"\"Good day, citizen. We got the information that you destroyed the Colonel "
"Okran in a fair space fight in the framework of a Warlords rivalry. This "
"achievement gives you the respect of the Dvaered High Command. Moreover, our "
"cleaning team did find a fancy keychain among the remains of Okran's ship. "
"As the customs requires it, this item is now yours, for what it's worth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Buenos días, ciudadano. Nos ha llegado la información de que has destruido "
"al Coronel Okran en un combate espacial justo en el marco de una rivalidad "
"entre Señores de la Guerra. Este logro te otorga el respeto del Alto Mando "
"Dvaered. Además, nuestro equipo de limpieza encontró un llavero de lujo "
"entre los restos de la nave de Okran. Como la aduana lo exige, este objeto "
"es ahora tuyo, por lo que valga.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Good day, citizen. We got the information that you destroyed the Colonel "
"Okran in a fair space fight in the framework of a Warlords rivalry. This "
"achievement gives you the respect of the Dvaered High Command. As such, you "
"will be allowed to purchase the Heavy Combat Vessel Licence. Moreover, our "
"cleaning team did find a fancy keychain among the remains of Okran's ship. "
"As the customs requires it, this item is now yours, for what it's worth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Buenos días, ciudadano. Nos ha llegado la información de que has destruido "
"al Coronel Okran en un combate espacial justo en el marco de una rivalidad "
"entre Señores de la Guerra. Este logro te otorga el respeto del Alto Mando "
"Dvaered. Como tal, se te permitirá adquirir la Licencia de Nave de Combate "
"Pesada. Además, nuestro equipo de limpieza ha encontrado un llavero de lujo "
"entre los restos de la nave de Okran. Como la aduana lo requiere, este "
"artículo es ahora tuyo, por lo que vale.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can now purchase the #bHeavy Combat Vessel Licence#0."
msgstr "Ya puedes comprar la #bLicencia de Nave de Combate Pesada#0."

msgid ""
"\"And finally, two Warlords, namely Lady Proserpina and Lord Richthofen, "
"required us to give you the sum of {credits} and their greetings. I wish you "
"to stay right, loyal and strong, citizen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Y por último, dos Señores de la Guerra, a saber, Dama Proserpina y Señor "
"Richthofen, nos pidieron que te entregáramos la suma de {credits} y sus "
"saludos. Deseo que permanezcas correcto, leal y fuerte, ciudadano.\""

#. Player already has the licence
msgid ""
"You were supposed to escort the Dvaered Colonel Okran who wanted to purchase "
"a battlecruiser for his Warlord. Instead, the Warlord got assassinated and "
"an imperial pilot convinced the Colonel Okran that you betrayed him. He "
"tried to kill you with the battlecruiser in question. You managed to destroy "
"Colonel Okran."
msgstr ""
"Se suponía que tenías que escoltar al Coronel Okran Dvaered, que quería "
"comprar un crucero de batalla para su Señor de la Guerra. En lugar de eso, "
"el señor de la guerra fue asesinado y un piloto imperial convenció al "
"coronel Okran de que le habías traicionado. Intentó matarte con el crucero "
"de batalla en cuestión. Conseguiste destruir al Coronel Okran."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You were supposed to escort the Dvaered Colonel Okran who wanted to purchase "
"a battlecruiser for his Warlord. Instead, the Warlord got assassinated and "
"an imperial pilot convinced the Colonel Okran that you betrayed him. He "
"tried to kill you with the battlecruiser in question. You managed to destroy "
"Colonel Okran and was rewarded with the ability to buy the Heavy Combat "
"Vessel Licence by Okran's enemies among the Dvaered."
msgstr ""
"Se suponía que tenías que escoltar al Coronel Okran Dvaered, que quería "
"comprar un crucero de batalla para su Señor de la Guerra. En lugar de eso, "
"el señor de la guerra fue asesinado y un piloto imperial convenció al "
"Coronel Okran de que le habías traicionado. Intentó matarte con el crucero "
"de batalla en cuestión. Conseguiste destruir al Coronel Okran y fuiste "
"recompensado con la posibilidad de comprar la Licencia de Nave de Combate "
"Pesada por los enemigos de Okran entre los Dvaered."

#. Tests to determine if the player is running away
msgid "You left the convoy"
msgstr "Abandonaste la caravana"

msgid ""
"You were supposed to escort the convoy, not to go away. You failed your "
"mission!"
msgstr ""
"Se suponía que escoltarías la caravana, no que te irías. ¡Has fallado en tu "
"misión!"

#. Add the Dvaered fleet
#. stolen from scripts/vn.lua
msgid "Escort"
msgstr "Escolta"

msgid ""
"You're not sure how this routine escort mission came to the point where a "
"cruiser was lost, but the result is there: you failed."
msgstr ""
"No estás seguro de cómo esta misión rutinaria de escolta llegó al punto de "
"perder un crucero, pero el resultado está ahí: has fallado."

msgid "Finally got him"
msgstr "Finalmente lo conseguí"

msgid ""
"The destruction of a battlecruiser is certainly an impressive sight. It is "
"like a small town being annihilated before your eyes, irradiating the whole "
"star system with light and heat. This is the Dvaered way of life, "
"apparently.\n"
"Now, it's time to land on a Dvaered planet to get recognized as the pilot "
"who killed Colonel Okran."
msgstr ""
"La destrucción de un crucero de batalla es sin duda un espectáculo "
"impresionante. Es como si una pequeña ciudad fuera aniquilada ante tus ojos, "
"irradiando todo el sistema estelar con luz y calor. Esta es la forma de vida "
"Dvaered, al parecer.\n"
"Ahora, es hora de aterrizar en un planeta Dvaered para ser reconocido como "
"el piloto que mató al Coronel Okran."

msgid "Land on any Dvaered planet"
msgstr "Aterriza en cualquier planeta Dvaered"

#. Move on to next system
msgid "Convoy landed"
msgstr "Caravana aterrizada"

msgid "Convoy jumped out"
msgstr "La caravana ha saltado"

msgid ""
"You get hailed by a Hyena and a communication channel is opened between you, "
"Colonel Okran and the Hyena in question."
msgstr ""
"Te llama una hiena y se abre un canal de comunicación entre tú, el Coronel "
"Okran y la hiena en cuestión."

msgid "\"Yo, Okran! How are you, mate? Enyoyin' your new toy? Hewhewhew!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Okran! ¿Cómo estás, amigo? ¿Disfrutando tu nuevo juguete? Hewhewhew!\""

msgid "\"I am sorry, but I do not know you, citizen.\""
msgstr "\"Lo siento, pero no lo conozco, ciudadano.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ya do not know me? Hewhewhew! Of course! But really, you were expectin' to "
"do all your shameful manoeuvring without ever meeting me? Ya all know that "
"you are still subjects to his Imperial Majesty, right? No! You forgot that! "
"Luckily, I'm here to remind that to you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿No me conoces? ¡Hewhewhew! Pues claro. Pero de verdad, ¿esperabais hacer "
"todas vuestras vergonzosas maniobras sin conocerme? Todos sabéis que aún "
"sois súbditos de su Majestad Imperial, ¿verdad? ¡No! ¡Lo habéis olvidado! "
"¡Por suerte, estoy aquí para recordároslo!\""

msgid ""
"\"I see. You are the… trickster, true? Lord Fatgun told me once I could run "
"into you at some point."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Eres el... tramposo, ¿verdad? El Señor Gordarma me dijo una vez "
"que podría encontrarme contigo en algún momento."

msgid ""
"\"Hewhewhew! Different people call me differently. You boars tend to use "
"that name indeed. So? Happy to finally meet me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hewhewhew! Diferentes personas me llaman de manera diferente. Los "
"jabalíes soléis usar ese nombre. ¿Entonces? ¿Contento de conocerme por fin?\""

msgid ""
"\"Look. I am running some serious business here. And I am not in need of a "
"buffoon right now, so please proceed getting lost.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mira. Estoy dirigiendo un negocio serio aquí. Y no estoy en necesidad de "
"un bufón en este momento, así que por favor proceda a perderse.\""

msgid "\"Your Fatgun bro got killed one period ago.\""
msgstr "\"Tu hermano Gordarma fue asesinado hace un período.\""

msgid "\"Ya all are jobless jerks, folks!"
msgstr "\"¡Sois todos unos gilipollas sin trabajo, amigos!"

msgid ""
"\"Hewhewhew! Proserpina and the other asshole, Richthofen, they conducted a "
"raid on Castellan III knowing that you were away. They managed to shoot a "
"volley of hypersonic bombs at his bunker. And… Kaboom! One less moronic "
"warlord in this galaxy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hewhewhew! Proserpina y el otro imbécil, Richthofen, llevaron a cabo una "
"incursión en Castellan III sabiendo que estabas fuera. Consiguieron disparar "
"una salva de bombas hipersónicas a su búnker. Y... ¡Kaboom! ¡Un señor de la "
"guerra imbécil menos en esta galaxia!\""

msgid "\"You… you must be kidding? Right, you are kidding!\""
msgstr "\"Tú... ¿tienes que estar bromeando? Seguro, ¡estás bromeando!\""

msgid ""
"\"I aint ever kidding when it's about hypersonic bombs. We got the "
"confirmation of the death by your Dvaered High Command. Your guy is down, "
"bro! Totally down. D.O.W.N.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nunca bromeo cuando se trata de bombas hipersónicas. Tenemos la "
"confirmación de la muerte por tu Alto Mando Dvaered. ¡Tu hombre ha caído, "
"hermano! Totalmente caído. D.O.W.N.\""

msgid "\"How did they get the information I was here?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo consiguieron la información de que estaba aquí?\""

msgid "\"{player} told them.\""
msgstr "\" {player} se los dijo.\""

msgid ""
"You scratch your head, trying to remember if you were part to a scheming to "
"kill Lord Fatgun when you notice Colonel Okran has been ejected from the "
"communication channel. It's only you and the wild newcomer now."
msgstr ""
"Te rascas la cabeza, intentando recordar si formaste parte de un plan para "
"matar al Señor Gordarma, cuando te das cuenta de que el Coronel Okran ha "
"sido expulsado del canal de comunicación. Ahora sólo quedáis tú y el salvaje "
"recién llegado."

msgid ""
"\"I hope you got an afterburner, mate! Hewhewhew!\n"
"So, seriously, what do you think of that? You chose the Dvaered way, we make "
"it the Dvaered way! Ya know what? Meet me in orbit of {pnt} in {sys} and "
"I'll explain to you why I actually just made you a huge favour!\n"
"Oh. If ya manage to kill Okran right now, you won't need to meet me. Just "
"land on any Dvaered planet and you'll understand everything! All ya got to "
"do is destroying a Dvaered Goddard! Piece of cake, right?\n"
"Bye, mate!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Espero que tengas un postquemador, amigo! ¡Hewhewhew!\n"
"En serio, ¿qué te parece? Tú elegiste el camino Dvaered, ¡nosotros lo "
"hacemos al estilo Dvaered! ¿Sabes qué? Reúnete conmigo en la órbita de {pnt} "
"en {sys} y te explicaré por qué acabo de hacerte un gran favor.\n"
"Oh. Si consigues matar a Okran ahora mismo, no necesitarás reunirte conmigo. "
"¡Sólo aterriza en cualquier planeta Dvaered y lo entenderás todo! ¡Todo lo "
"que tienes que hacer es destruir un Dvaered Goddard! Pan comido, ¿verdad?\n"
"¡Adiós, amigo!\""

msgid "The Hyena goes away, letting you alone with the group of angry Dvaered."
msgstr "La Hiena se va, dejándote a solas con el grupo de furiosos Dvaered."

msgid "Meet and hail the Trickster in orbit of {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "Encuentrate con el resto del equipo en {pnt} en {sys}"

msgid "Staying alive?"
msgstr "¿Sigues vivo?"

msgid ""
"The shopping mission has gone wild: you have to try to survive and encounter "
"a shady Imperial pilot who apparently might give you information"
msgstr ""
"La misión de compras se ha desmadrado: tienes que intentar sobrevivir y "
"encontrarte con un turbio piloto imperial que aparentemente podría darte "
"información"

msgid "\"Why did you tell Okran I had betrayed him?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué le dijiste a Okran que le había traicionado?\""

msgid "\"Who are you actually?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quién eres en realidad?\""

msgid "\"What is your motivation?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cuál es su motivación?\""

msgid "\"How am I supposed to destroy a Goddard now?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo se supone que voy a destruir un Goddard ahora?\""

msgid "\"Where am I supposed to find him?\""
msgstr "\"¿Dónde se supone que debo encontrarlo?\""

msgid "\"Aye, {player}, how do you do?\""
msgstr "\"Sí, {player}, ¿cómo está?\""

msgid "\"Very well, thank you. And you?\""
msgstr "\"Muy bien, gracias. ¿Y tu?\""

msgid "\"Very well for someone you just tried to get murdered\""
msgstr "\"Muy bien para alguien a quien acabas de intentar asesinar\""

msgid "\"I will feel much better once I'll have killed you\""
msgstr "\"Me sentiré mucho mejor una vez que te haya matado\""

msgid ""
"\"Kof kof kof! For real? You asked how I am? It's… It's the first time "
"someone cares about me.\n"
"Hewhewhew! You're a singular person, {player}, for sure! I wish you to never "
"end on the bad end of a firing gun. Oh yeah! Or at least the latest "
"possible!\n"
"So I guess you want to know why I told the pack of boars that you betrayed "
"them, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Kof kof kof! ¿De verdad? ¿Me has preguntado cómo estoy? Es... Es la "
"primera vez que alguien se preocupa por mí.\n"
"¡Hewhewhew! Eres una persona singular, {player}, ¡seguro! Deseo que nunca "
"termines en el lado malo de un arma de fuego. ¡Oh, sí! ¡O al menos el último "
"posible!\n"
"Así que supongo que quieres saber por qué le dije a la manada de jabalíes "
"que les habías traicionado, ¿verdad?\""

msgid ""
"\"Come on… Come on… You survived, right? I would not have put you in a "
"situation where you could have been killed! Never! We are good ol' friends, "
"after all, aren't we? Hewhewhew!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vamos... Vamos... Has sobrevivido, ¿verdad? ¡No te habría puesto en una "
"situación en la que te pudieran haber matado! ¡Nunca! Somos buenos amigos, "
"después de todo, ¿no? Hewhewhew!\""

msgid ""
"\"Hewhewhew! Aren't we overreacting a bit over there, {player}? Yes we are. "
"You won't kill me… I mean… I cannot exclude that ya kill me one day, but not "
"today. Instead, ya will rather kill good ol' Okran. You know why?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Jejeje! ¿No estamos exagerando un poco, {player}? Sí, lo estamos. No me "
"matarás... quiero decir... no puedo descartar que me mates algún día, pero "
"no hoy. En cambio, preferirás matar al bueno de Okran. ¿Sabes por qué?\""

msgid ""
"\"Guess what, mate? When I told Okran you betrayed him, I made you the "
"greatest favour possible! Yep for real!\n"
"You know how to work your way up among the Dvaereds? Hewhewhew! By killing "
"Dvaereds! Totally true! Hundred percent fact-checked! Dvaereds weirdos are "
"the only kind of weirdos that will love you more if you kill other Dvaered "
"weirdos.\n"
"But watch out, mate! For killing Dvaereds weirdos is a subtle art, ya know? "
"You can't just attack random Vendettas in space and win the High Command's "
"respect. You need to kill people in the context of a \"honourable fight "
"between two respectable gentlemen\". Yo, because Dvaered are for sure "
"respectable gentlemen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Adivina qué, amigo? Cuando le dije a Okran que le habías traicionado, ¡te "
"hice el mayor favor posible! ¡Sí, de verdad!\n"
"¿Sabes cómo abrirte camino entre los Dvaereds? ¡Hewhewhew! ¡Matando "
"Dvaereds! Totalmente cierto. ¡Cien por cien verificado! Los raros Dvaereds "
"son el único tipo de raros que te querrán más si matas a otros raros "
"Dvaered.\n"
"¡Pero cuidado, amigo! Matar bichos raros de Dvaereds es un arte sutil, "
"¿sabes? No puedes atacar Vendettas al azar en el espacio y ganarte el "
"respeto del Alto Mando. Necesitas matar gente en el contexto de una \"pelea "
"honorable entre dos caballeros respetables\". Oye, ¡porque los Dvaered "
"seguro que son caballeros respetables!\""

msgid ""
"\"So, I gave you the occasion to fight a respectable asshol… hem… gentleman. "
"And if you kill him, the Dvaered will fully accept you among them. You'll be "
"like their mate, ya know? Hewhewhew! For what it's worth. But you decided to "
"join them.\n"
"So here I am! Your white knight on his white horse. I give you not only the "
"occasion to fight one Colonel, but also one Colonel in a Goddard. Ya'll "
"never have any better occasion!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que te he dado la ocasión de luchar contra un respetable cap... hem... "
"caballero. Y si lo matas, los Dvaered te aceptarán plenamente entre ellos. "
"Serás como su compañero, ¿sabes? ¡Hewhewhew! Por si sirve de algo. Pero "
"decidiste unirte a ellos.\n"
"¡Así que aquí estoy! Tu caballero blanco en su caballo blanco. Te doy no "
"sólo la ocasión de luchar contra un Coronel, sino también contra un Coronel "
"en un Goddard. ¡Nunca tendrás mejor ocasión!\""

msgid "\"Thanks, genius. And how do I destroy a Goddard now?\""
msgstr "\"Gracias, genio. ¿Y cómo destruyo un Goddard ahora?\""

msgid ""
"\"Who I am actually? Hewhewhew! Kof kof kof! I am a loyal servant of our "
"Emperor! Some call me 'the flying clown', because I lead a squadron named "
"the 'flying circus'. People are funny, ya know? I'm presently Laughing My "
"Ass Off! And your Dvaered friends call me the trickster. No clue why, "
"Hewhewhew! Oh, and some call me 'Captain Hew Hew'.\n"
"But that's all bullshit! For I am a real human being, with a heart in my "
"chest. A heart that cries when people use mean words against me… Hewhewhew! "
"Did I make you sad? Don't lie! You were sympathizing! I saw you!\n"
"I'm so annoying! Am I not? Hewhewhew! Yep I totally am!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Quién soy en realidad? ¡Hewhewhew! ¡Kof kof kof! ¡Soy un leal servidor de "
"nuestro Emperador! Algunos me llaman 'el payaso volador', porque lidero un "
"escuadrón llamado el 'circo volador'. La gente es divertida, ¿sabes? ¡Ahora "
"mismo me estoy partiendo de risa! Y tus amigos Dvaered me llaman el "
"tramposo. ¡Ni idea de por qué, Hewhewhew! Ah, y algunos me llaman \"Capitán "
"Hew Hew\".\n"
"¡Pero todo eso son tonterías! Porque soy un ser humano real, con un corazón "
"en mi pecho. Un corazón que llora cuando la gente usa palabras mezquinas "
"contra mí... ¡Hewhewhew! ¿Te he puesto triste? ¡No mientas! ¡Estabas "
"simpatizando! ¡Ya te vi!\n"
"¡Soy tan molesto! ¿No lo soy? ¡Hewhewhew! Sí, ¡lo soy totalmente!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"C'mon! You're a adult, no? Ya know how to obliterate a Goddard. Don't you? "
"Oh, I'm dumb. Maybe you don't even have the Heavy Combat Vessel Licence! "
"Hewhewhew! Did I put you in a shitty situation? Kof kof kof!\n"
"No, of course not! Now that Lord Fatass… Fatgun died, all his soldiers have "
"been put to the Dvaered Military Reserve, and Okran don't command them "
"anymore. Officially, he was also sent to the Reserve, but custom needs him "
"to avenge his lord first, by at least killing one person (you). So he will "
"be flying an unescorted Goddard.\n"
"And as they teach at school, an unescorted capship is a dead capship. I "
"recommend using a corvette with torpedoes. Unless of course you have another "
"capship stronger than a Dvaered Goddard. Of course. Hewhewhew!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Vamos! Eres un adulto, ¿no? Ya sabes cómo arrasar un Goddard. ¿Tú no? Oh, "
"soy tonto. ¡Quizás ni siquiera tienes la licencia de nave de combate pesada! "
"¡Hewhewhew! ¿Te puse en una situación de mierda? ¡Kof kof kof!\n"
"¡No, claro que no! Ahora que el Señor Culordo... Gordarma murió, todos sus "
"soldados han sido puestos en la Reserva Militar Dvaered, y Okran ya no los "
"comanda. Oficialmente, él también fue enviado a la Reserva, pero la "
"costumbre necesita que vengue a su señor en primer lugar, por lo menos "
"matando a una persona (tú). Así que volará un Goddard sin escolta.\n"
"Y como enseñan en la escuela, una nave sin escolta es una nave muerta. "
"Recomiendo usar una corbeta con torpedos. A menos, por supuesto, que tenga "
"otra nave más fuerte que un Goddard. Por supuesto. ¡Hewhewhew!\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah! Good question! Okran wants to kill you. I am pretty sure he will stay "
"at Zhiru and try to intercept you each time you enter the system. I would "
"totally do that if I was him. The Goddard system is a very central place in "
"our galaxy. And it's a good spot for the maintenance of his ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ah! ¡Buena pregunta! Okran quiere matarte. Estoy bastante seguro de que "
"se quedará en Zhiru e intentará interceptarte cada vez que entres en el "
"sistema. Yo lo haría sin duda si fuera él. El sistema Goddard es un lugar "
"muy central en nuestra galaxia. Y es un buen lugar para el mantenimiento de "
"su nave.\""

msgid ""
"\"My motivation? But… I just wanted to be kind to you. I am a "
"philanthropist, you know? Hewhewhew!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Mi motivación? Pero... sólo quería ser amable contigo. Soy un filántropo, "
"¿sabes? ¡Hewhewhew!\""

msgid "Encounter and kill Okran in {sys}"
msgstr "Encuentra y mata a Okran en {sys}"

msgid ""
"The shopping mission has gone wild: you have to destroy the freshly bought "
"Goddard battlecruiser."
msgstr ""
"La misión de compras se ha vuelto salvaje: tienes que destruir el recién "
"comprado crucero de batalla Goddard."

#. Just get pple tell things
msgid "Aaah. I feel so good! Nothing is like flying a Goddard."
msgstr "Aaah. ¡Me siento tan bien! No hay nada como pilotar un Goddard."

msgid "Hewhewhew!"
msgstr "¡Hewhewhew!"

#. Remove the Pirates form the equation
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Collective Scouting">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>var.peek("es_cargo") == true and faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5</cond>
#. <chance>40</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
