#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Scout
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Starts the collective mini campaign.
#.
#. You must inspect a stray drone.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Non-persistent state
msgid "Lt. Commander"
msgstr "Teniente Comandante"

msgid ""
"You see an Empire Lt. Commander who seems to be motioning you over to the "
"counter."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un Teniente Comandante del Imperio que parece indicarte que te "
"acerques al mostrador."

msgid ""
"You approach the Lt. Commander.\n"
"\"Hello, {player}; we have a reconnaissance mission you might be interested "
"in. Commander Soldner said you'd make a good candidate for the mission. You "
"up for the challenge?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I don't think we've met. I'm Lt. Commander Dimitri. If all goes well, "
"you'll be reporting to me for the next assignments.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You've heard about the Collective, right? From what we know, the "
"Collective seems to be a sort of 'hive' of robots. They're a recent menace; "
"had the timing to arrive more or less when the Incident occurred, otherwise "
"they would have been wiped out by the Emperor's Armada without a sweat.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"They completely wiped out all human life on {planet} and the other worlds "
"they hit. We managed to stop them here, in {sys}, and constructed this base. "
"Since then, it's been more or less a stalemate.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Lt. Commander Dimitri informed you about the Collective, a \"hive\" of "
"robotic drones that have been menacing the {sys} system."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Collective activity has increased heavily the last few decaperiods. We've "
"been trying to contain them, but a scout broke through to the jump point. It "
"was last detected by a patrol in {misn_nearby}, which saw it jumping out to "
"{misn_target}.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You are to locate the scout and report back to {pnt} in the {sys} system. "
"It seems like the Collective is planning something, and we want to follow "
"their game a little more closely.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"It is of vital importance that you do not engage the drone. Report back as "
"soon as you locate it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Accept mission
#. Mission details
msgid "Collective Scout"
msgstr "Explorador del Colectivo"

msgid "Find a scout last seen in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Encontrar un explorador visto por última vez en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Locate the Collective drone, but do not engage."
msgstr "Localiza el dron del Colectivo, pero no te enfrentes a él."

msgid "Report back to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Informar a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. Force Collective music (note: must clear these later on).
#. TODO: Use heavier Collective ships here
#. Jump in support
msgid "Collective Drone"
msgstr "Dron del Colectivo"

#. update mission
msgid "Drone spotted!"
msgstr "¡Dron avistado!"

msgid "Travel back to {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "Regresa a {pnt} en {sys}"

msgid ""
"After landing, you head to the Empire military headquarters and find Lt. "
"Commander Dimitri there."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Well, it seems like the drone has some strange fixation on {sys}. We "
"aren't quite sure what to make of it, but intelligence is working on it. "
"Report back to the bar in a bit and we'll see what we can do about the "
"Collective.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You scouted out a Collective drone on behalf of the Empire. Lt. Commander "
"Dimitri told you to report back to the bar on {pnt} for your next mission."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mission failed; you weren't supposed to kill the drone!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You killed the Collective drone you were supposed to scout out and failed "
"your mission for the Empire as a result."
msgstr ""
"Has matado al dron del Colectivo que debías explorar y, como resultado, has "
"fracasado en tu misión para el Imperio."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Collective Espionage 1">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("collective_fail") ~= true</cond>
#. <done>Collective Scouting</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Espionage I
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Second mission in the mini collective campaign.
#.
#. You must inspect a system for wireless communications.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
msgid "You notice Lt. Commander Dimitri motioning for you to come over to him."
msgstr "El Teniente Comandante Dimitri te indica que te acerques a él."

msgid ""
"You meet up with Lt. Commander Dimitri.\n"
"\"We managed to capture the drone after you located it. It didn't seem to be "
"in good health. Our scientists are studying it as we speak, but we've found "
"something strange in it. Some sort of weird wireless module. We'd like you "
"to do a deep scan of the nearby Collective systems to see if you can pick up "
"any strange wireless communications.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This will be a dangerous mission, because you'll need to stay in the system "
"long enough for the scan to complete. I recommend a fast ship to outrun the "
"drones. Are you interested in doing this now?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"You need to jump to each of the systems indicated on your map, and stay in "
"the system until the scan finishes. If you jump out prematurely, you'll have "
"to restart the scan from scratch when you return.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Of course, we're not sending you in unprepared. I have updated your ship's "
"computer with a map of the Collective systems, at least the part we know "
"about. I'm afraid it's not very complete intel, but it should be enough.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Like I said, it's best if you tried to avoid the drones, but if you think "
"you can take them, go for it! Good luck.\""
msgstr ""

#. Accept mission
#. Number of Collective systems visited
#. Mission details
#. Accept the mission
#. Mission details
msgid "Collective Espionage"
msgstr "Espionaje al Colectivo"

msgid "Scan the Collective systems for wireless communications"
msgstr ""
"Escanea los sistemas del Colectivo en busca de comunicaciones inalámbricas"

#. End any ongoing scans.
#. seconds
msgid "Scanning... {seconds}s remaining."
msgstr "Escaneando... {seconds}s restantes."

msgid "After landing, Lt. Commander Dimitri greets you on the landing pad."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I suppose all went well? Those drones can really give a beating. We'll "
"have the researchers start looking at your logs right away. Meet me in the "
"bar again in a while.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You helped gather intel on the Collective by scanning Collective systems. "
"Lt. Commander Dimitri told you to meet him in the bar again on {pnt}."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Collective Espionage 2">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("collective_fail") ~= true</cond>
#. <done>Collective Espionage 1</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Espionage II
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Third mission in the collective mini campaign.
#.
#. You must land on an ex-empire planet in collective territory and return.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission consstants
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid ""
"You head over to Lt. Commander Dimitri to see what the results are.\n"
"\"Hello there again, {player}. Bad news on your latest run: you got nothing "
"other than the usual robotic chatter. We'll have to send you out again, but "
"this time we'll follow a different approach. Interested in giving it another "
"shot?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"On your last run, you were monitoring while out in the open. While you do "
"get better signals, upon noticing your presence, the drones will go into "
"combat mode, and yield only combat transmissions. This mission will consist "
"of hiding and monitoring from a safer spot, hopefully catching them more "
"relaxed.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"When the Collective struck, they quickly took many systems; one of the "
"bigger losses was {pnt}, an important gas giant rich in methane. They "
"destroyed the gas refineries and slaughtered the humans. There was nothing "
"we could do. The turbulence and dense atmosphere there should be able to "
"hide your ship.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The plan is to have you infiltrate Collective space alone to not arouse "
"too much suspicion. Once inside, you should head to {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system. Stay low and monitor all frequencies in the system. If anything is "
"suspicious, we'll surely catch it then.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Don't forget to make sure you have the four jumps of fuel to be able to "
"get there and back in one piece. Good luck; I'll be waiting for you on your "
"return.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Land on {pnt} in the {sys} system to monitor Collective communications"
msgstr ""
"Aterriza en {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para supervisar las comunicaciones del "
"Colectivo"

msgid "Fly to {sys} and land on {pnt}"
msgstr "Vuela a {sys} y aterriza en {pnt}"

msgid "Return to {pnt} with your findings"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} con tus hallazgos"

#. You land on the planet, but you also immediately take off again.
#. Initiate cutscene
#. Stop the default music change from taking off.
#. Return bit
msgid ""
"As your ship touches ground, you see Lt. Commander Dimitri come out to greet "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"How was the weather?\" he asks jokingly. \"Glad to see you're still in one "
"piece. We'll get right on analysing the data acquired. Those robots have to "
"be up to something. Meet me in the bar later.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Meanwhile, give yourself a treat; you've earned it. We've made a deposit "
"into your bank account. Enjoy it.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You monitored Collective communications for the Empire again, this time "
"while landed on {target}. Lt. Commander Dimitri told you to meet him in the "
"bar on {pnt} again later."
msgstr ""

#. Build the actual cutscene
#. Sinister music landing
#. Can't use vn.music() because we want it to keep playing until the cutscene is over.
msgid ""
"You quickly land on {pnt} and hide in its deep, dense methane atmosphere. "
"Your monitoring gear flickers into action, hopefully catching something of "
"some use. With some luck, there won't be too many Collective drones when you "
"take off."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas rápidamente en {pnt} y te escondes en su profunda y densa "
"atmósfera de metano. Tu equipo de vigilancia entra en acción, con la "
"esperanza de captar algo de utilidad. Con un poco de suerte, no habrá "
"demasiados drones Colectivos cuando despegues."

msgid "Collective Heavy Drone"
msgstr "Drone Pesado del Colectivo"

msgid "That should be enough. Time to report your findings."
msgstr "Eso debería ser suficiente. Es hora de informar de tus hallazgos."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Collective Distraction">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("collective_fail") ~= true</cond>
#. <done>Collective Espionage 2</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Distraction
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Fourth mission in the collective mini campaign.
#.
#. You must distract the collective forces by breaching into their systems
#. while a commando lands to monitor wireless.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. The amount of drones the player must whack to win
#, lua-format
msgid "Destroy at least %d drone"
msgid_plural "Destroy at least %d drones"
msgstr[0] "Destruye al menos %d dron"
msgstr[1] "Destruye al menos %d drones"

#, lua-format
msgid "%d remaining"
msgid_plural "%d remaining"
msgstr[0] "queda %d"
msgstr[1] "quedan %d"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
msgid "You see Lt. Commander Dimitri at the bar, as usual."
msgstr "Ves al Teniente Comandante Dimitri en el bar, como siempre."

msgid ""
"As you approach Lt. Commander Dimitri, you notice he seems somewhat "
"excited.\n"
"\"It looks like you got something! It's not very clear because of {pnt}'s "
"atmosphere creating a lot of noise, but it does seem to be similar to Empire "
"transmissions. We've got another plan to try for a cleaner signal. It'll be "
"uglier then the last one. You in?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Here's the plan: we want to drop a commando team on {pnt} to set up more "
"sophisticated surveillance. We've already got a team assembled. Your job "
"will be to provide a distraction.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The idea would be to have you fly deep into Collective territory and kick "
"up some trouble. A few dead drones should draw their attention. This is no "
"suicide mission, so you'll have to fly back when things start getting ugly. "
"Meanwhile, we'll send a fast convoy with the commandos to {pnt}, to start "
"monitoring.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"If all goes well, the commandos will return here with the results after 10 "
"periods. Then we'll have a definitive answer on the communications issues. "
"We aren't anticipating problems on the return, but we'll have some ships "
"ready just in case they're pursued.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Good luck, and be careful out there,\" he adds, before saluting you off "
"onto your mission."
msgstr ""

#. Mission details
#. Handles jumping to target system
msgid "Collective Distraction"
msgstr "Distracción Colectiva"

msgid "Go to draw the Collective's attention in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Ve a llamar la atención del Colectivo en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Return to {pnt}"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt}"

#. Handles arrival back to base
msgid ""
"Your ship touches ground and you once again see the face of Lt. Commander "
"Dimitri."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"How was the trip? I trust you didn't have too many issues evading the "
"Collective. We won't hear from the commandos until 10 periods from now, when "
"they get back, but I believe everything went well.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Stay alert. We'll probably need your assistance when they get back. Take "
"the free time as a vacation. I heard the weather on Caladan is pretty nice "
"this time of year; maybe you should visit them. We'll keep in touch.\""
msgstr ""

#. Store time commando theoretically landed
msgid ""
"You provided a distraction while a commando team was inserted into {target} "
"for the Empire to set up more sophisticated surveillance of the Collective. "
"Lt. Commander Dimitri said that they should be back in about 10 periods and "
"that the Empire will probably need your assistance on {pnt} again at that "
"time."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Collective Extraction">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("emp_commando") ~= nil and time.cur() &gt; time.fromnumber( var.peek("emp_commando") )</cond>
#. <done>Collective Distraction</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Land</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Extraction
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Fifth mission in the collective mini campaign.
#.
#. You must go rescue a team of commandos after being attacked by collective
#. forces on a surveillance mission.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid ""
"As soon as you exit the landing pad, you see Lt. Commander Dimitri waiting "
"for you. He seems a bit more nervous than usual.\n"
"\"The commando team has sent us an SOS. They were discovered by the "
"Collective, and now they're under heavy fire. We need you to go and get them "
"out of there. Would you be willing to embark on another dangerous mission?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"We'll send extra forces to {sys} to try to give you a chance to break "
"through the blockade. You'll have to land on {pnt} and extract our team. Be "
"very careful. This is going to be no walk in the park.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Enviaremos fuerzas adicionales a {sys} para tratar de darte la oportunidad "
"de romper el bloqueo. Tendrás que aterrizar en {pnt} y extraer a nuestro "
"equipo. Ten mucho cuidado. Esto no va a ser un paseo por el parque.\""

#. Mission details
msgid "Collective Extraction"
msgstr "Extracción en el Colectivo"

msgid "Check for survivors on {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "Comprueba si hay supervivientes en {pnt} en {sys}"

msgid "Fly to {sys}"
msgstr "Vuela a {sys}"

#. Handles the Collective encounters.
#. This mission disables saving, which is dangerous. Should be turned back on ASAP.
#. Case jumped in before landing
msgid ""
"Okay, {player}, we'll flank the Collective force around the planet and try "
"to draw their fire. You punch right through and land on that planet!"
msgstr ""
"Bien, {player}, flanquearemos la fuerza del Colectivo alrededor del planeta "
"y trataremos de atraer su fuego. ¡Tu atraviesas el bloqueo y aterrizas en "
"ese planeta!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Empire flanking manoeuvre"
msgstr "Maniobra de flanqueo del Imperio"

#. Case taken off from the planet
msgid "There's too many of them! Fall back! Everyone to the jump point!"
msgstr "¡Son demasiados! ¡Retiraos! ¡Todos al punto de salto!"

#. Let's be lazy.
msgid "You can't land now! Get to the jump point!"
msgstr "¡No puedes aterrizar ahora! ¡Ve al punto de salto!"

#. Case jumped back out without landing
#. Case jumped out after landing
#. Preps the Empire ships for attack.
#. Makes the Empire ships run away.
#. Triggered when either Empire fleet is in attack range.
#. Handles arrival back to base
#. Just landing
#. This prevents the player from starting on Eiroik if he dies after taking off.
#. This seems like it might be an appropriate time for creepy music, maybe?
msgid ""
"The atmosphere once again starts giving your shields a workout as you land. "
"You spend a while flying low until your sensors pick up a reading of "
"possible life forms. The silhouette of the transport ship is barely visible."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As you fly closer, it becomes apparent that you arrived too late. Everyone "
"is already dead. You see if you can salvage the readings from their "
"equipment, but it seems like it's completely toasted."
msgstr ""

#. Add fuel if needed
msgid ""
"You notice you won't have enough fuel to get back so you salvage some from "
"the wrecked transport ship. Stealing from the dead isn't pleasant business, "
"but if it gets you out alive, you figure it's good enough."
msgstr ""
"Te das cuenta de que no tendrás suficiente combustible para volver, así que "
"rescatas un poco de la nave de transporte destrozada. Robar a los muertos no "
"es un negocio agradable, pero si te permite salir vivo, piensas que es "
"suficiente."

msgid ""
"You spend a while searching until you find a datapad on one of the corpses. "
"Ignoring the stench of burnt flesh, you grab it just as you hear the sirens "
"go off in your ship."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enemy reinforcements! Time to hit the afterburner. You've got one, right?"
msgstr ""

#. Add goods
msgid "Datapad"
msgstr "Datapad"

msgid "A dead soldier's datapad."
msgstr "El datapad de un soldado muerto."

msgid ""
"Lt. Commander Dimitri's face cannot hide his sadness as he sees you approach "
"with no commando members."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"No survivors, eh? I had that gut feeling. At least you were able to "
"salvage something? Good, at least it'll mean they didn't die in vain. Meet "
"me in the bar in a while. We're going to try to process this datapad. It'll "
"hopefully have the final results.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You attempted to rescue the commando team on {pnt}, but despite your best "
"efforts, they were already dead by the time you got there. However, you "
"managed to retrieve a datapad from the team's wrecked ship. Lt. Commander "
"Dimitri has asked you to meet him in the bar again in a while."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Operation Black Trinity">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("collective_fail") ~= true</cond>
#. <done>Collective Extraction</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. <tier>4</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Operation Black Trinity
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Sixth mission in the collective mini campaign.
#.
#. Notable campaign changes:
#. * Keer takes over command superseding Dimitri.
#. * First real combat begins.
#. * Most of the plot is unrevealed.
#.
#. Mission Objectives:
#. * Attempt to arrest Zakred.
#. * Kill Zakred.
#.
#. Mission Stages:
#. 0) Get to the Trinity
#. 1) Trinity Combat
#. 2) Trinity dead/run
#. 3) Ran away
#.
#. -- Not too happy with the text (it chews it all up for you), but then again,
#. -- I'm no writer. Hopefully someone can clean it up a bit someday.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "Dimitri?"
msgstr "¿Dimitri?"

msgid ""
"Dimitri should be around here, but you can't see him. You should probably "
"look for him."
msgstr ""
"Dimitri debería estar por aquí, pero no se le ve. Probablemente deberías "
"buscarlo."

#. Creates the mission
msgid ""
"You enter the bar, but you can't seem to find Lt. Commander Dimitri. As you "
"look around for him, you feel a heavy hand fall on your shoulder."
msgstr ""

#. Adds escorts
#. Handles arrival back to base
#. Just landing
msgid "Guard A"
msgstr "Guardia A"

msgid "Guard B"
msgstr "Guardia B"

msgid ""
"It seems like two armed soldiers are here to escort you somewhere, and from "
"the looks of their weapons, they mean business. You have no choice other "
"then to comply."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"They start leading you away from the bar through some hallways you've never "
"been through before. Must be all those 'Authorised Personnel Only' signs and "
"the armed guards that didn't make them too appealing."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Finally they toss you into what seems to be an interrogation room, simply "
"telling you to wait. After what seems to be a whole period, you hear the "
"door open."
msgstr ""

msgid "Door Guard A"
msgstr ""

msgid "Door Guard B"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You see a highly decorated woman walk in, with two soldiers standing guard "
"at the door. She seems to be a Commodore, from the insignia on her uniform."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Hello. I'm Commodore Keer. I've taken over the Collective issue. I have "
"heard about your success in the previous missions and would like to offer "
"you more work. However, further proceedings must be kept in strict "
"confidentiality for the interest of the Empire.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Are you willing to go all the way with this?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You accept and she dismisses both of the soldiers, who proceed to wait "
"outside."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"We've been following Lt. Commander Dimitri's progress since he started at "
"{pnt}. The datapad you brought back has confirmed what we have suspected: we "
"have an undercover Collective agent somewhere in the military who's been "
"feeding ex-Commodore Welsh data. You don't understand, right? Let me explain."
"\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The Collective was actually a project for the Empire. They were supposed "
"to be the ultimate weapon in flexibility and offense. Commodore Welsh was in "
"charge of the secret science facility on {pnt}. Shortly after the Incident, "
"we stopped hearing from them. We sent a recon and were met with hostile "
"Collective drones.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"It seems like the project had been a success, but the traitor, Welsh, went "
"rogue. Under normal circumstances we would have easily crushed the "
"Collective, but after the Incident, these are hardly normal circumstances.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"She goes on. \"Things have gotten out of hand. We have had chances to crush "
"Welsh, but he always seems to evade us and strike where we are weakest. We "
"always knew there must have been another traitor in our midst, but with the "
"datapad information we now know who he is.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Commodore Keer has taken over the Collective issue and explained more about "
"the Collective. \"The Collective was actually a project for the Empire. They "
"were supposed to be the ultimate weapon in flexibility and offense. "
"Commodore Welsh was in charge of the secret science facility on {pnt}. "
"Shortly after the Incident, we stopped hearing from them. We sent a recon "
"and were met with hostile Collective drones. It seems like the project had "
"been a success, but the traitor Welsh went rogue. Under normal circumstances "
"we would have easily crushed the Collective, but after the Incident, these "
"are hardly normal circumstances.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"She now clears her throat. \"This operation has been dubbed 'Operation Black "
"Trinity'. We have reason to believe that the ESS Trinity has been operating "
"with the traitor Welsh. The ESS Trinity is commanded by Captain Zakred. You "
"will form part of an assault team with the primary objective of arresting "
"Zakred. As a last resort, you are authorized to kill Zakred. He must not "
"escape.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"We'll be sending you with a small force. We expect you to hang back, but, "
"if any trouble arises, take the ESS Trinity down. Zakred is currently on "
"manoeuvre exercises in {sys}. You will have to find him there. The other "
"ships will follow your lead to {sys}. Good luck.\""
msgstr ""

#. Accept the mission
#. Mission data
#. Mission details
msgid "Operation Black Trinity"
msgstr "Operación Trinidad Negra"

msgid "Arrest the ESS Trinity in {sys}"
msgstr "Arrestar la Trinidad ESS en {sys}"

msgid "Apprehend or kill Zakred"
msgstr "Atrapa o mata a Zakred"

msgid "Report back to {pnt}"
msgstr "Informe en {pnt}"

#. Escorts
#. Handles jumping to target system
#. Only done for stage 1
#. Create some havoc
#. Escorts enter a while back
#. Just jumped
#. Disable spawning and clear pilots -> makes it more epic
#. Position trinity on the other side of the player
msgid "ESS Trinity"
msgstr "ESS Trinidad"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Trinity Escort"
msgstr "Escolta la Caravana"

#. Escorts should be in system by now
#. Player ran away from combat - big disgrace.
#. Got away
msgid "Mission failure; return to base."
msgstr ""

msgid "Return to base at {pnt} in {sys}"
msgstr "Regresa a la base en {pnt} en {sys}"

#. Little talk when ESS Trinity is encountered.
#. Empire talks about arresting
msgid "ESS Trinity: please turn off your engines and prepare to be boarded."
msgstr ""

msgid "You will never take me alive!"
msgstr "¡Nunca me cogerás vivo!"

#. Talk
msgid "Very well, then. All units: engage ESS Trinity."
msgstr ""

#. ESS Trinity becomes collective now.
msgid "It is too late! The plan is being put into motion!"
msgstr "¡Es demasiado tarde! ¡El plan se está poniendo en marcha!"

msgid "You have no idea who you're messing with!"
msgstr "¡No tienes ni idea de con quién te estás metiendo!"

#. Trinity runs away
msgid "My drones will make mincemeat of you!"
msgstr "¡Mis drones te harán picadillo!"

msgid "Incoming drones from hyperspace detected!"
msgstr "¡Drones entrantes desde el hiperespacio detectados!"

msgid "Guard C"
msgstr ""

msgid "Guard D"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You see Commodore Keer with a dozen soldiers waiting for you outside the "
"landing pad."
msgstr ""

#. Successfully killed
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations on the success, {player}. We never really expected to take "
"Zakred alive. Good riddance. The next step is to begin an all-out attack on "
"Collective territory. Meet up in the bar when you're ready. We'll need all "
"available pilots.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You successfully killed Zakred (a Collective spy) and destroyed the ESS "
"Trinity. Commodore Keer told you to meet her again at the bar on {pnt} for "
"an all-out attack on Collective territory."
msgstr ""

#. Failure to kill
msgid ""
"\"You weren't supposed to let the Trinity get away! Now we have no cards to "
"play. We must wait for the Collective response or new information before "
"being able to continue. We'll notify you if we have something you can do for "
"us, but for now we just wait.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You failed to destroy the ESS Trinity, putting a hitch in the Empire's "
"plans. You should meet back with Commodore Keer at the bar on {pnt}; she "
"said that they would notify you if they have something more that you can do."
msgstr ""

#. Trinity hooks
#. Got killed
msgid "Mission success; return to base."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Operation Cold Metal">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("collective_fail") ~= true</cond>
#. <done>Operation Black Trinity</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>emp_cap_ch01_lrg</tag>
#. </tags>
#. <notes>
#. <provides name="The Collective is dead and no one will miss them"/>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Operation Cold Metal
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Seventh and final mission in the Collective Campaign
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Non-persistent state
#. Creates the mission
msgid ""
"You join Commodore Keer at her table.\n"
"She begins, \"We're going to finally attack the Collective. We've gotten the "
"Emperor himself to bless the mission and send some of his better pilots. "
"Would you be interested in aiding in the destruction of the Collective?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The Operation has been dubbed 'Cold Metal'. We're going to mount an all-"
"out offensive in {target}. The systems up to {sys} are already secure and "
"under our control; all we need to do now is to take the final stronghold. "
"Should we encounter the Starfire at any stage, our goal will be to destroy "
"it and head back. The Imperial fleet will join you when you get there. See "
"you in combat, pilot.\""
msgstr ""

#. Accept the mission
#. Mission data
#. Mission details
msgid "Operation Cold Metal"
msgstr "Operación Metal Frío"

msgid "Fame and Glory"
msgstr "Fama y Gloria"

msgid "Neutralize enemy forces in {sys}"
msgstr "Neutralizar las fuerzas enemigas en {sys}"

msgid "Fly to {final_sys} via {sys} and meet up with the Imperial fleet"
msgstr "Vuela a {final_sys} vía {sys} y reúnete con la flota Imperial"

msgid "Defeat the Starfire"
msgstr "Derrota al Starfire"

msgid "Report back"
msgstr "Informa de ello"

msgid "Defeat the Starfire and the Trinity"
msgstr "Derrota al Starfire y al Trinidad"

#. Handles jumping to target system
#. Remove collective pilots in most dangerous systems
#. Entering target system?
#. Clear marker to previous system
#. Create big battle
msgid "Starfire"
msgstr "Starfire"

msgid ""
"To all pilots, this is mission control! We are ready to begin our attack! "
"Engage at will!"
msgstr ""
"¡A todos los pilotos, este es el control de misión! ¡Estamos listos para "
"comenzar nuestro ataque! ¡Ataquen a voluntad!"

msgid ""
"You receive a message signed by Commodore Keer:\n"
"\"There is no room for cowards in the Empire's fleet.\"\n"
"The signature does seem valid."
msgstr ""
"Recibes un mensaje firmado por la Comodoro Keer:\n"
"\"No hay lugar para los cobardes en la flota del Imperio.\"\n"
"La firma parece válida."

msgid ""
"You abandoned your mission to help the Empire destroy the Collective. "
"Commander Keer transmitted a message: \"There is no room for cowards in the "
"Empire's fleet.\""
msgstr ""
"Abandonaste tu misión de ayudar al Imperio a destruir al Colectivo. El "
"Comandante Keer transmitió un mensaje: \"No hay lugar para los cobardes en "
"la flota del Imperio.\""

msgid "Tanker in system; contact if in need of fuel."
msgstr ""

#. Create the pilot
msgid "Fuel Tanker"
msgstr "Depósito de Combustible"

#. max fuel!
#. Add some escorts
#. Broadcast spam
#. Handles collective death
#. Set marker back to base
#. Change back to normal AI
#. Handles arrival back to base
#. Final landing stage
msgid ""
"As you approach to land on {pnt}, you notice big banners placed on the "
"exterior of the station. They seem to be in celebration of the final defeat "
"of the Collective. Upon landing, you are saluted by the welcoming committee "
"in charge of honouring all the returning pilots."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You notice Commodore Keer. Upon greeting her, she says, \"You did a good job "
"out there. No need to worry about the Collective any more. Without Welsh, "
"the Collective won't stand a chance, since they aren't truly autonomous. "
"Right now we have some ships cleaning up the last of the Collective; "
"shouldn't take too long to be back to normal.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"She continues. \"As a symbol of appreciation, you should find a substantial "
"deposit in your account. There will be a celebration later today in the "
"officer's room, if you want to join in.\""
msgstr ""

#. This was the last mission in the minor campaign, so bump the reputation cap.
msgid "And so ends the Collective threat..."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You don't remember much of the after party, but you wake up groggily in your "
"ship clutching an Empire officer's boot."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You helped the Empire to finally destroy the Collective once and for all. "
"The Collective is now no more."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste al Imperio a destruir finalmente al Colectivo de una vez por todas. "
"El Colectivo ya no existe."

#. Run last
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Empire Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <cond>
#. if player.credits() &lt; 200e3 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Simple cargo mission that opens up the Empire cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#.
#.
#.
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. target destination
#. In case no suitable planets are in range.
msgid "Lieutenant"
msgstr "Teniente"

msgid "You see an Empire Lieutenant who seems to be looking at you."
msgstr "Ves a un Teniente del Imperio que parece estar mirándote."

msgid ""
"You approach the Empire Lieutenant.\n"
"\"Hello, I'm Lieutenant Czesc from the Empire Armada Shipping Division. "
"We're having another recruitment operation and would be interested in having "
"another pilot among us. Would you be interested in working for the Empire?\""
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al Teniente del Imperio.\n"
"\"Hola, soy el Teniente Czesc de la División de Navegación de la Armada del "
"Imperio. Estamos realizando otra operación de reclutamiento y nos "
"interesaría tener otro piloto entre nosotros. ¿Estaría usted interesado en "
"trabajar para el Imperio?\""

msgid ""
"\"Welcome aboard,\" says Czesc before giving you a firm handshake. \"At "
"first you'll just be tested with cargo missions while we gather data on your "
"flying skills. Later on, you could get called upon for more important "
"missions. Who knows? You could be the next Yao Pternov, the greatest pilot "
"we ever had in the armada.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bienvenido a bordo\", dice Czesc antes de darte un firme apretón de manos. "
"\"Al principio sólo se te pondrá a prueba con misiones de carga mientras "
"recopilamos datos sobre tus habilidades de vuelo. Más adelante, podrían "
"llamarte para misiones más importantes. ¿Quién sabe? Podrías ser el próximo "
"Yao Pternov, el mejor piloto que hayamos tenido en la armada.\""

msgid ""
"He hits a couple buttons on his wrist computer, which springs into action. "
"\"It looks like we already have a simple task for you. Deliver these parcels "
"to {pnt} in the {sys} system. The best pilots started by delivering papers "
"and ended up flying into combat against gigantic warships with the "
"Interception Division.\""
msgstr ""
"Pulsa un par de botones en su ordenador de muñeca, que entra en acción. "
"\"Parece que ya tenemos una tarea sencilla para ti. Entregar estos paquetes "
"a {pnt}. Los mejores pilotos empezaron entregando papeles y acabaron volando "
"en combate contra gigantescas naves de guerra con la División de "
"Interceptación.\""

#. Accept the mission
#. Mission details
#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid "Empire Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento del Imperio"

msgid "Deliver some parcels for the Empire to {pnt} in {sys}."
msgstr "Entrega algunos paquetes para el Imperio a {pnt} en {sys}."

#. Set up the goal
msgid "Parcels"
msgstr "Paquetes"

msgid "A bunch of boring Empire parcels."
msgstr "Un montón de aburridos paquetes del Imperio."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You deliver the parcels to the Empire Shipping station at the {pnt} "
"spaceport. Afterwards, they make you do some paperwork to formalize your "
"participation with the Empire. They tell you to keep an eye out for missions "
"labelled {label}, in the mission computer.\n"
"You aren't too sure of what to make of your encounter with the Empire. Only "
"time will tell…"
msgstr ""
"Entregas los paquetes en la estación de envíos del Imperio en el puerto "
"espacial de {pnt}. Después, te hacen hacer algunos trámites para formalizar "
"tu participación con el Imperio. Te dicen que estés atento a las misiones "
"con la etiqueta {label}, en el ordenador de misiones.\n"
"No estás muy seguro de qué pensar con tu encuentro con el Imperio. Sólo el "
"tiempo lo dirá…"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You were recruited into the Empire's shipping division and can now do "
"missions labelled {label}, which stands for Empire Shipping. You aren't too "
"sure of what to make of your encounter with the Empire. Only time will tell…"
msgstr ""
"Has sido reclutado por la división de envíos del Imperio y ahora puedes "
"hacer misiones con la etiqueta EI, que significa Envios del Imperio. No "
"estás muy seguro de qué pensar de tu encuentro con el Imperio. Sólo el "
"tiempo lo dirá…"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Empire Rehabilitation">
#. <priority>10</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0</cond>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Rehabilitation Mission
#. --
msgid ""
"The Empire is giving you a chance to rejoin society by paying a fine and "
"filling the appropriate paperwork. This will allow you to do business in the "
"Empire as a neutral pilot, however, you still have to recover the trust of "
"the Empire. Furthermore, ANY hostilities against the Empire will immediately "
"void the paperwork. Note that this rehabilitation only affects the Empire "
"itself, not any of the Houses."
msgstr ""
"El Imperio te da la oportunidad de reincorporarte a la sociedad pagando una "
"multa y rellenando el papeleo correspondiente. Esto te permitirá hacer "
"negocios en el Imperio como piloto neutral, sin embargo, aún tienes que "
"recuperar la confianza del Imperio. Además, CUALQUIER hostilidad contra el "
"Imperio anulará inmediatamente el papeleo. Ten en cuenta que esta "
"rehabilitación sólo afecta al propio Imperio, no a ninguna de las Casas."

msgid ""
"Your paperwork and payment has been processed. Imperial Patrols will no "
"longer attack you on sight, and you may travel freely in Imperial space. "
"However, remember that this does not clear you of your past responsibilities "
"with the Empire. Any violation of this treaty such as piracy will "
"immediately void the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Tu papeleo y pago han sido procesados. Las patrullas imperiales ya no te "
"atacarán en cuanto te vean y podrás viajar libremente por el espacio "
"imperial. Sin embargo, recuerda que esto no te libera de tus "
"responsabilidades pasadas con el Imperio. Cualquier violación de este "
"tratado, como la piratería, anulará inmediatamente el acuerdo."

msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have completed the requisites for becoming a productive "
"member of the Empire. With this final paperwork, your past offenses have "
"been erased."
msgstr ""
"Enhorabuena. Has completado los requisitos para convertirte en un miembro "
"productivo del Imperio. Con este trámite final, tus ofensas pasadas han sido "
"borradas."

msgid ""
"You have violated your agreement with the Empire! Your rehabilitation "
"procedure has been immediately revoked, and your reputation is once again "
"tarnished! You may start another rehabilitation procedure at a later time."
msgstr ""
"¡Has violado tu acuerdo con el Imperio! Tu procedimiento de rehabilitación "
"ha sido inmediatamente revocado y tu reputación se ve de nuevo empañada. "
"Podrás iniciar otro procedimiento de rehabilitación más adelante."

