#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Soromid Long Distance Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. if var.peek("es_cargo") ~= true then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <done_misn name="Empire Shipping">2 times or more</done_misn>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. First diplomatic mission to Soromid space that opens up the Empire long-distance cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: micahmumper
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Case requirement not met, inform the player to do missions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You approach Lieutenant Czesc, who seems a bit busy. \"Hey, {player}. I've "
"got some potential work for you. However, the Empire requires a minimum of "
"experience with shipping missions before I can entrust you with it. Try to "
"do a few Empire Shipping missions and get back to me. They should be "
"labelled {label} on the mission computer.\""
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al Teniente Czesc, parece un poco ocupado. \"Hola, {player}. "
"Tengo un posible trabajo para ti. Sin embargo, el Imperio requiere un mínimo "
"de experiencia en misiones de envío antes de que pueda confiártelo. Intenta "
"hacer unas cuantas misiones de Transporte Marítimo del Imperio (#gES#0) y "
"vuelve a llamarme.\""

#. codespell:ignore
#. Intro Text
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You approach Lieutenant Czesc. His demeanour brightens as he sees you. "
"\"Hello! I've been looking for you. You've done a great job with those "
"Empire Shipping missions, and we have a new exciting opportunity. You see, "
"the head office is looking to expand business with other factions, which has "
"enormous untapped potential. They need someone competent and trustworthy to "
"help them out. That's where you come in. Interested?\""
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al teniente Czesc. Su comportamiento se anima al verte. \"¡Hola! "
"Te he estado buscando. Has hecho un gran trabajo con las misiones de Envío "
"del Imperio y tenemos una nueva y emocionante oportunidad. Verás, la oficina "
"central está buscando ampliar los negocios con otras facciones, que tienen "
"un enorme potencial sin explotar. Necesitan a alguien competente y de "
"confianza para ayudarles. Ahí es donde entras tú. ¿Interesado?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"\"I knew I could count on you,\" Lieutenant Czesc exclaims. \"These missions "
"will be long distance, meaning that you'll usually have to go at least 3 "
"jumps to make the delivery. In addition, you'll often find yourself in the "
"territory of other factions, where the Empire may not be able to protect "
"you. In return, you will be nicely compensated.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sabía que podía contar contigo\", exclama el teniente Czesc. \"Estas "
"misiones serán de larga distancia, lo que significa que normalmente tendrás "
"que dar al menos 3 saltos para hacer la entrega. Además, a menudo te "
"encontrarás en territorio de otras facciones, donde es posible que el "
"Imperio no pueda protegerte. A cambio, recibirás una buena compensación.\""

msgid ""
"He hits a couple buttons on his wrist computer. \"First, we need to set up "
"operations with the other factions. We'll need a bureaucrat to handle the "
"red tape and oversee the operations. We will begin with the Soromid. I know "
"those genetically modified beings are kind of creepy, but business is "
"business. Please transport a bureaucrat to {pnt} in the {sys} system. He "
"will report back to me when this mission is accomplished. I tend to travel "
"within Empire space handling minor trade disputes, so keep an eye out for me "
"in the bar on Empire controlled planets.\""
msgstr ""
"Pulsa un par de botones en su ordenador de muñeca. \"En primer lugar, "
"tenemos que establecer las operaciones con las otras facciones. "
"Necesitaremos un burócrata que se encargue de los trámites y supervise las "
"operaciones. Empezaremos con los Sorómida. Sé que esos seres genéticamente "
"modificados son un poco espeluznantes, pero los negocios son los negocios. "
"Por favor, transporte a un burócrata a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Él me "
"informará cuando esta misión esté cumplida. Suelo viajar dentro del espacio "
"del Imperio manejando disputas comerciales menores, así que mantén un ojo "
"sobre mí en el bar de los planetas controlados por el Imperio.\""

#. Accept the mission
#. Description is visible in OSD and the onboard computer, it shouldn't be too long either.
msgid "Soromid Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento a Larga Distancia Soromida"

msgid "Deliver a shipping diplomat for the Empire to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr ""
"Entrega un diplomático de envío del Imperio a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. Set up the goal
msgid "Diplomat"
msgstr "Diplomático"

msgid "An Imperial trade representative."
msgstr "Un representante comercial del Imperio."

#. More flavour text
msgid "Mission Accomplished"
msgstr "Misión Cumplida"

msgid ""
"You drop the bureaucrat off at {pnt}, and he hands you a credit chip. "
"Lieutenant Czesc told you to keep an eye out for him in Empire space to "
"continue the operation."
msgstr ""
"Dejas al burócrata en {pnt} y te entrega una ficha de crédito. El teniente "
"Czesc te dijo que estuvieras atento a él en el espacio del Imperio para "
"continuar la operación."

msgid ""
"You delivered a shipping bureaucrat to {pnt} for the Empire. Lieutenant "
"Czesc told you to keep an eye out for him in Empire space to continue the "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado un burócrata de envio a {pnt} para el Imperio. El Teniente "
"Czesc te dijo que lo buscaras en el espacio del Imperio para continuar la "
"operación."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Dvaered Long Distance Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>75</chance>
#. <done>Soromid Long Distance Recruitment</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Second diplomatic mission to Dvaered space that opens up the Empire long-distance cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: micahmumper
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. -Intro Text
msgid ""
"Lieutenant Czesc waves you over when he notices you enter the bar. \"I knew "
"we would run into each other soon enough. Great job delivering that "
"bureaucrat. We should be up and running in Soromid space in no time!\" He "
"presses a button on his wrist computer. \"We're hoping to expand to Dvaered "
"territory next. Can I count on your help?\""
msgstr ""
"El Teniente Czesc te saluda con la mano cuando se da cuenta de que entras en "
"el bar. \"Sabía que nos encontraríamos pronto. Gran trabajo en la entrega de "
"ese burócrata. Deberíamos estar en marcha en el espacio Soromida en poco "
"tiempo\". Pulsa un botón en su ordenador de muñeca. \"Esperamos expandirnos "
"al territorio Dvaered a continuación. ¿Puedo contar con tu ayuda?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"\"Great!\" says Lieutenant Czesc. \"I'll send a message to the bureaucrat to "
"meet you at the hanger. The Dvaered are, of course, allies of the Empire. "
"Still, they offend easily, so try not to talk too much. Your mission is to "
"drop the bureaucrat off on {pnt} in the {sys} system. He will take it from "
"there and report back to me when the shipping contract has been established. "
"Afterwards, keep an eye out for me in Empire space, and we can continue the "
"operation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial!\", dice el Teniente Czesc. \"Enviaré un mensaje al burócrata para "
"que se reúna con usted en el hangar. Los Dvaered son, por supuesto, aliados "
"del Imperio. Aun así, se ofenden con facilidad, así que intenta no hablar "
"demasiado. Tu misión es dejar al burócrata en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Él "
"se encargará a partir de ahí y me informará cuando se haya establecido el "
"contrato de transporte. Después, manténgase atento a mí en el espacio del "
"Imperio y podremos continuar la operación.\""

#. -Accept the mission
#. Description is visible in OSD and the onboard computer, it shouldn't be too long either.
msgid "Dvaered Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento a Larga Distancia Dvaered"

msgid ""
"You drop the bureaucrat off on {pnt}, and he hands you a credit chip. You "
"remember Lieutenant Czesc told you to look for him on Empire controlled "
"planets after you finish."
msgstr ""
"Dejas al burócrata en {pnt} y te entrega una ficha de crédito. Recuerdas que "
"el Teniente Czesc te dijo que lo buscaras en los planetas controlados por el "
"Imperio cuando terminaras."

msgid ""
"You delivered a shipping bureaucrat to {pnt} for the Empire. Lieutenant "
"Czesc told you to look for him on Empire controlled planets after you finish."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado un burócrata de envio a {pnt} para el Imperio. El Teniente "
"Czesc te ha dicho que lo busques en los planetas controlados por el Imperio "
"cuando termines."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Long Distance Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>75</chance>
#. <done>Dvaered Long Distance Recruitment</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Third diplomatic mission to Za'lek space that opens up the Empire long-distance cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: micahmumper
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Intro Text
msgid ""
"Lieutenant Czesc sits at the bar. He really does seem to handle business all "
"across the Empire. You take the seat next to him. \"Thanks to your help, the "
"Empire Armada Shipping Division will soon operate across the galaxy. Our "
"next mission is to get House Za'lek on board. Interested in helping out "
"again?\""
msgstr ""
"El Teniente Czesc se sienta en el bar. Parece que realmente maneja los "
"negocios en todo el Imperio. Tú tomas asiento junto a él. \"Gracias a tu "
"ayuda, la División de Envio de la Armada del Imperio pronto operará en toda "
"la galaxia. Nuestra próxima misión es conseguir que la Casa Za'lek esté a "
"bordo. ¿Interesado en volver a ayudar?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"\"I had a feeling you would!\" says Lieutenant Czesc. \"I've got another "
"bureaucrat ready to establish trade ties. The Za'lek are rather mysterious, "
"so keep your wits about you. The diplomat only needs to go to the {pnt} in "
"the {sys} system. He will let me know when trade relations have been "
"established. There is still more work to be done, so I expect to see you "
"again soon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Tenía el presentimiento de que lo harías!\", dice el Teniente Czesc. "
"\"Tengo otro burócrata listo para establecer lazos comerciales. Los Za'lek "
"son bastante misteriosos, así que mantén tu ingenio para tí. El diplomático "
"sólo tiene que ir al {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Él me hará saber cuando se "
"hayan establecido relaciones comerciales. Todavía hay más trabajo por hacer, "
"así que espero volver a verte pronto.\""

#. -Accept the mission
#. Description is visible in OSD and the onboard computer, it shouldn't be too long either.
msgid "Za'lek Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento a Larga Distancia Za'lek"

msgid ""
"You drop the diplomat off on {pnt}, and she hands you a credit chip. "
"Lieutenant Czesc mentioned more work, so you figure you'll run into him at a "
"bar again soon."
msgstr ""
"Dejas a la diplomática en {pnt}, y te entrega una ficha de crédito. El "
"Teniente Czesc mencionó más trabajo, así que te imaginas que pronto te lo "
"encontrarás de nuevo en un bar."

msgid ""
"You delivered a shipping bureaucrat to {pnt} for the Empire. Lieutenant "
"Czesc mentioned more work, so you figure you'll run into him at a bar again "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Entregaste un burócrata de envio a {pnt} para el Imperio. El Teniente Czesc "
"mencionó más trabajo, así que te imaginas que pronto te lo encontrarás en un "
"bar."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Frontier Long Distance Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>75</chance>
#. <done>Za'lek Long Distance Recruitment</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Fourth diplomatic mission to Frontier space that opens up the Empire long-distance cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: micahmumper
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Intro Text
msgid ""
"\"We have to stop running into each other like this.\" Lieutenant Czesc "
"laughs at his joke. \"Just kidding, you know I owe you for helping set up "
"these contracts. So far, everything has been moving smoothly on our end. "
"We're hoping to extend our relations to the Frontier Alliance. You know the "
"drill by this point. Ready to help?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tenemos que dejar de cruzarnos así\". El Teniente Czesc se ríe de su "
"chiste. \"Es una broma, sabes que estoy en deuda contigo por ayudar a "
"establecer estos contratos. Hasta ahora, todo se ha movido sin problemas por "
"nuestra parte. Esperamos ampliar nuestras relaciones con la Alianza "
"Frontera. A estas alturas ya conoces el procedimiento. ¿Listo para ayudar?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"\"I applaud your commitment,\" Lieutenant Czesc says, \"and I know these "
"aren't the most exciting missions, but they're most useful. The frontier can "
"be a bit dangerous, so make sure you're prepared. You need to drop the "
"bureaucrat off at {pnt} in the {sys} system. After this, there should only "
"be one more faction to bring into the fold. I expect to see you again soon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aplaudo tu compromiso\", dice el Teniente Czesc, \"y sé que no son las "
"misiones más emocionantes, pero son muy útiles. La frontera puede ser un "
"poco peligrosa, así que asegúrate de estar preparado. Tienes que dejar al "
"burócrata en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Después de esto, sólo debería haber "
"una facción más que traer al redil. Espero volver a verte pronto.\""

#. Accept the mission
#. Description is visible in OSD and the onboard computer, it shouldn't be too long either.
msgid "Frontier Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento de Larga Distancia Frontera"

msgid "Frontier Alliance Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento de Larga Distancia de la Alianza Frontera"

msgid ""
"You deliver the diplomat to {pnt}, and she hands you a credit chip. "
"Thankfully, Lieutenant Czesc mentioned only needing your assistance again "
"for one more mission. This last bureaucrat refused to stay in her quarters, "
"preferring to hang out on the bridge and give you the ins and outs of Empire "
"bureaucracy. Only your loyalty to the Empire stopped you from sending her "
"out into the vacuum of space."
msgstr ""
"Entregas el diplomático a {pnt}, y ella te entrega una ficha de crédito. "
"Afortunadamente, la Teniente Czesc mencionó que sólo necesitaba tu ayuda "
"para una misión más. Esta última burócrata se negó a quedarse en sus "
"aposentos, prefiriendo pasar el rato en el puente y darte los entresijos de "
"la burocracia del Imperio. Sólo tu lealtad al Imperio te impidió enviarla al "
"vacío del espacio."

msgid ""
"You delivered a shipping bureaucrat to {pnt} for the Empire. Thankfully, "
"Lieutenant Czesc mentioned only needing your assistance again for one more "
"mission. This last bureaucrat refused to stay in her quarters, preferring to "
"hang out on the bridge and give you the ins and outs of Empire bureaucracy. "
"Only your loyalty to the Empire stopped you from sending her out into the "
"vacuum of space."
msgstr ""
"Entregaste un burócrata de envio a {pnt} para el Imperio. Afortunadamente, "
"la Teniente Czesc mencionó que sólo necesitaba tu ayuda de nuevo para una "
"misión más. Esta última burócrata se negó a quedarse en sus aposentos, "
"prefiriendo pasar el rato en el puente y darte los entresijos de la "
"burocracia del Imperio. Sólo su lealtad al Imperio te impidió enviarla al "
"vacío del espacio."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Sirius Long Distance Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>75</chance>
#. <done>Frontier Long Distance Recruitment</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Fifth diplomatic mission to Sirius space that opens up the Empire long-distance cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: micahmumper
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Intro Text
msgid ""
"Lieutenant Czesc approaches as you enter the bar. \"If it isn't my favourite "
"Empire Armada employee. We're on track to establish a deal with House "
"Sirius. This should be the last contract to be negotiated. Ready to go?\""
msgstr ""
"El Teniente Czesc se acerca al entrar en el bar. \"Si es mi empleado "
"favorito de la Armada del Imperio. Estamos en camino de establecer un "
"acuerdo con la Casa Sirio. Este debería ser el último contrato a negociar. "
"¿Listo para ir?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"\"You know how this goes by now.\" says Lieutenant Czesc, \"Drop the "
"bureaucrat off at {pnt} in the {sys} system. Sirius space is quite a "
"distance, so be prepared for anything. Afterwards, come find me one more "
"time, and we'll finalize the paperwork to get you all set up for these "
"missions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya sabes cómo va esto\", dice el Teniente Czesc, \"Deja al burócrata en "
"{pnt} en el sistema {sys}. El espacio Sirio está bastante lejos, así que "
"prepárate para cualquier cosa. Después, ven a buscarme una vez más y "
"finalizaremos el papeleo para que estés preparado para estas misiones.\""

#. Accept the mission
#. Description is visible in OSD and the onboard computer, it shouldn't be too long either.
msgid "Sirius Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento de Larga Distancia Sirio"

msgid ""
"You drop the diplomat off on {pnt}, and she hands you a credit chip. "
"Lieutenant Czesc said to look for him in an Empire bar for some paperwork. "
"Bureaucracy at its finest."
msgstr ""
"Dejas al diplomático en {pnt}, y te entrega una ficha de crédito. El "
"Teniente Czesc dijo que lo buscara en un bar del Imperio para hacer unos "
"trámites. La burocracia en su máxima expresión."

msgid ""
"You delivered a shipping bureaucrat to {pnt} for the Empire. Lieutenant "
"Czesc said to look for him in an Empire bar for some paperwork. Bureaucracy "
"at its finest."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado un burócrata de envio a {pnt} para el Imperio. El Teniente "
"Czesc dijo que lo buscara en un bar del Imperio por unos papeles. La "
"burocracia en su máxima expresión."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Empire Long Distance Recruitment">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. if spob.cur()==spob.get("Halir") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <done>Sirius Long Distance Recruitment</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>emp_cap_ch01_lrg</tag>
#. </tags>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Sixth (and final) mission that explains the Empire long-distance cargo missions.
#.
#. Author: micahmumper
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Intro Text
msgid ""
"Lieutenant Czesc slaps you on the back as you take a seat next to him at the "
"bar. \"We've done it! We have set up Empire Armada Shipping outposts across "
"quite a bit of the galaxy. I just have one more favour to ask. I need "
"transport back to {pnt} in the {sys} system. Once there, I can authorize you "
"to help out with the long-distance shipping missions. Can I count on you?\""
msgstr ""
"El Teniente Czesc te da una palmada en la espalda mientras tomas asiento "
"junto a él en la barra. \"¡Lo hemos conseguido! Hemos establecido puestos de "
"avanzada de la Armada del Imperio en gran parte de la galaxia. Sólo tengo "
"que pedirte un favor más. Necesito transporte de vuelta a {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}. Una vez allí, puedo autorizarte a ayudar en las misiones de "
"envio de larga distancia. ¿Puedo contar contigo?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"Internally you groan from the idea of having to do another haul across the "
"galaxy for more paperwork, but at least you'll have access to new missions. "
"Lieutenant Czesc excitedly gets up from the bar. \"Let's get going as soon "
"as possible. There's no place like home!\""
msgstr ""
"Internamente gimes ante la idea de tener que hacer otro viaje por la galaxia "
"para conseguir más papeleo, pero al menos tendrás acceso a nuevas misiones. "
"El Teniente Czesc se levanta entusiasmado de la barra. \"Pongámonos en "
"marcha cuanto antes. ¡No hay lugar como el hogar!\""

#. -Accept the mission
#. Description is visible in OSD and the onboard computer, it shouldn't be too long either.
msgid "Empire Long Distance Recruitment"
msgstr "Reclutamiento de Larga Distancia Imperio"

msgid "Deliver Lieutenant Czesc to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Entregar al Teniente Czesc a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. More flavour text
msgid ""
"Lieutenant Czesc exits your ship and takes a deep breath of air. \"I love "
"the smell of bureaucracy in the morning.\""
msgstr ""
"El teniente Czesc sale de su nave y toma una profunda bocanada de aire. \"Me "
"encanta el olor de la burocracia por la mañana.\""

msgid ""
"He shakes your hand. \"Thanks for all your help, Captain! Follow me to "
"headquarters, and we can do some paperwork to get you all set up. After that "
"you should start to receive long-distance shipping missions. They pay better "
"than our regular shipping missions, but often require traveling longer "
"distances and into territory controlled by other factions. You'll probably "
"be more likely to see them on the edges of Empire space where cargo is ready "
"to head out to other factions. Again, I can't thank you enough! The Empire "
"does not quickly forget such dedication.\""
msgstr ""
"Te estrecha la mano. \"¡Gracias por toda tu ayuda, capitán! Acompáñeme al "
"cuartel general y podremos hacer algunos trámites para ponerte en orden. "
"Después deberías empezar a recibir misiones de transporte de larga "
"distancia. Pagan mejor que nuestras misiones de transporte regulares, pero a "
"menudo requieren viajar distancias más largas y entrar en territorio "
"controlado por otras facciones. Es más probable que las veas en los límites "
"del espacio del Imperio, donde la carga está lista para salir hacia otras "
"facciones. De nuevo, ¡no puedo agradecertelo suficiente! El Imperio no "
"olvida rápidamente tal dedicación.\""

msgid ""
"You transported Lieutenant Czesc to {pnt} for some paperwork. You can now do "
"long-distance cargo missions for the Empire. They pay better than regular "
"Empire shipping missions, but often require traveling longer distances and "
"into territory controlled by other factions. You'll probably be more likely "
"to see them on the edges of Empire space where cargo is ready to head out to "
"other factions."
msgstr ""
"Has transportado al Teniente Czesc a {pnt} para realizar unos trámites. "
"Ahora puedes hacer misiones de carga de larga distancia para el Imperio. Se "
"pagan mejor que las misiones de transporte regulares del Imperio, pero a "
"menudo requieren viajar distancias más largas y entrar en territorio "
"controlado por otras facciones. Es más probable que las veas en los límites "
"del espacio del Imperio, donde la carga está lista para salir hacia otras "
"facciones."

#.
#. -- Empire shipping missions are always timed, but quite lax on the schedules
#. -- pays a bit more then the rush missions
#. --
#. Create the mission
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. target destination
#. mission generics
#. Allow extra time for refuelling stops.
#. Determine risk of piracy
#. Choose amount of cargo and mission reward. This depends on the mission tier.
msgid "Long distance cargo transport ({tonnes} of {cargo})"
msgstr "Transporte de carga de larga distancia ({tonnes} de {cargo})"

msgid ""
"Official Empire long distance cargo transport to {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Transporte oficial de carga de larga distancia del Imperio a {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}."

msgid "Long Distance Empire Shipping"
msgstr "Envío de Larga Distancia del Imperio"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Empire Shipping 1">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("Dvaered") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("FLF") &gt;= 10 then
#. return false
#. end
#. --return require("misn_test").reweight_active() -- Don't reweight as licences are important!
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <chance>35</chance>
#. <done>Soromid Long Distance Recruitment</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. <tier>2</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Empire Shipping Prisoner Exchange
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#.
#.
#.
#. Planet targets
#. Must claim system
#. Bar NPC
msgid "Commander"
msgstr "Comandante"

msgid "You see an Empire Commander. He seems to have noticed you."
msgstr "Ves a un Comandante del Imperio. Parece que se ha fijado en ti."

#. Intro text
msgid ""
"You approach the Empire Commander.\n"
"\"Hello, you must be {player}. I've heard about you from Lieutenant Czesc. "
"I'm Commander Soldner. We've got some harder missions for someone like you "
"in the Empire Shipping division. There would be some real danger involved in "
"these missions, unlike the ones you've recently completed for the division. "
"Would you be up for the challenge?\""
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al Comandante del Imperio.\n"
"\"Hola, usted debe ser {player}. He oído hablar de ti por el Teniente Czesc. "
"Soy el Comandante Soldner. Tenemos algunas misiones más difíciles para "
"alguien como tú en la división de Envíos del Imperio. Habría algún peligro "
"real en estas misiones, a diferencia de las que has completado recientemente "
"para la división. ¿Estarías dispuesto a aceptar el reto?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"\"We've got a prisoner exchange set up with the FLF to take place on "
"{dest_pnt} in the {dest_sys} system. They want a more 'neutral' pilot to do "
"the exchange. You would have to go to {dest_pnt} with some FLF prisoners "
"aboard your ship and exchange them for some of our own. You won't have "
"visible escorts, but we will use ships in nearby sectors to monitor your "
"status.\n"
"\"Once you get our captured people back, bring them over to {ret_pnt} in "
"{ret_sys} for debriefing. You'll be compensated for your troubles. Good luck."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tenemos un intercambio de prisioneros con la FLF que tendrá lugar en "
"{dest_pnt} en el sistema {dest_sys}. Quieren que un piloto más \"neutral\" "
"haga el intercambio. Tendrías que ir a {dest_pnt} con algunos prisioneros "
"del FLF a bordo de tu nave e intercambiarlos por algunos de los nuestros. No "
"tendrás escoltas visibles pero usaremos naves en sectores cercanos para "
"monitorear tu estado.\n"
"\"Una vez que recuperes a nuestra gente capturada, tráelos a {ret_pnt} en "
"{ret_sys} para interrogarlos. Serás compensado por tus problemas. Buena "
"suerte.\""

msgid ""
"The prisoners are loaded onto your ship along with a few marines to ensure "
"nothing untoward happens."
msgstr ""
"Los prisioneros son cargados en tu nave junto con algunos marines para "
"asegurar que no ocurra nada malo."

#. Accept mission
#. target destination
#. Mission details
msgid "Prisoner Exchange"
msgstr "Intercambio de Prisioneros"

msgid "Go to {pnt} in the {sys} system to exchange prisoners with the FLF"
msgstr ""
"Ve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para intercambiar prisioneros con el FLF"

#. Set up the goal
msgid "Prisoners"
msgstr "Prisioneros"

msgid "FLF prisoners."
msgstr "Prisioneros FLF."

#. Set hooks
#. Go on to next stage
#. Some text
msgid ""
"As you land, you notice the starport has been emptied. You also notice "
"explosives rigged on some of the columns. This doesn't look good. The "
"marines tell you to sit still while they go out to try to complete the "
"prisoner exchange.\n"
"From the cockpit you see the marines lead the prisoners in front of them "
"with guns to their backs. You see figures step out of the shadows with "
"weapons too; most likely the FLF."
msgstr ""
"Al aterrizar, observas que el puerto estelar ha sido vaciado. También "
"observas que hay explosivos colocados en algunas de las columnas. Esto no "
"tiene buena pinta. Los marines te dicen que te quedes quieto mientras ellos "
"salen a intentar completar el intercambio de prisioneros.\n"
"Desde la cabina ves que los marines llevan a los prisioneros delante de "
"ellos con las armas a la espalda. Ves a unas figuras salir de las sombras "
"con armas también; seguramente el FLF."

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"All of a sudden a siren blares and you hear shooting break out. You quickly "
"start your engines and prepare for take off. Shots ring out all over the "
"landing bay, and you can see a couple of corpses as you leave the starport. "
"You remember the explosives just as loud explosions go off behind you. This "
"doesn't look good at all."
msgstr ""
"De repente, suena una sirena y se oye un tiroteo. Rápidamente enciendes los "
"motores y te preparas para despegar. Los disparos suenan por toda la bahía "
"de aterrizaje y puedes ver un par de cadáveres mientras sales del puerto "
"estelar. Te acuerdas de los explosivos justo cuando se producen fuertes "
"explosiones detrás de ti. Esto no pinta nada bien."

msgid ""
"You start your climb out of the atmosphere and notice how you're picking up "
"many FLF and Dvaered ships. Looks like you're going to have quite a run to "
"get the hell out of here. This didn't go as you expected."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a salir de la atmósfera y te das cuenta de que estás detectando "
"muchas naves FLF y Dvaered. Parece que vas a tener una carrera de fondo para "
"salir de aquí. Esto no ha ido como esperabas."

msgid "Return to {pnt} in the {sys} system to report what happened."
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para informar de lo sucedido."

msgid "Return to {pnt} in the {sys} system to report what happened"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para informar de lo sucedido"

#. Prevent players from saving on the destination planet
#. We'll take off right away again
#. Saving should be disabled for as short a time as possible
#. Flavour text
msgid ""
"After you leave your ship in the starport, you meet up with Commander "
"Soldner. From the look on his face, it seems like he already knows what "
"happened."
msgstr ""
"Después de dejar tu nave en el puerto espacial, te reúnes con el comandante "
"Soldner. Por su cara, parece que ya sabe lo que ha pasado."

msgid ""
"\"It was all the Dvaered's fault. They just came in out of nowhere and "
"started shooting. What a horrible mess. We're already working on sorting out "
"the blame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo fue culpa de los Dvaered. Salieron de la nada y empezaron a disparar. "
"Qué desastre tan horrible. Ya estamos trabajando para repartir las culpas.\""

msgid ""
"He sighs. \"We had good people there. And we certainly didn't want you to "
"start with a mess like this, but if you're interested in more missions, meet "
"me up in the bar in a while. We get no rest around here. The payment has "
"already been transferred to your bank account.\""
msgstr ""
"Suspira. \"Teníamos buena gente allí. Y desde luego no queríamos que "
"empezaran con un lío como éste, pero si estás interesado en más misiones, "
"reúnete conmigo en el bar dentro de un rato. No tenemos descanso por aquí. "
"El pago ya ha sido transferido a tu cuenta bancaria.\""

msgid ""
"You took part in a prisoner exchange with the FLF on behalf of the Empire. "
"Unfortunately, the prisoner exchange failed. \"It was all the Dvaered's "
"fault. They just came in out of nowhere and started shooting.\" Commander "
"Soldner has asked you to meet him in the bar on Halir if you're interested "
"in more missions."
msgstr ""
"Participaste en un intercambio de prisioneros con el FLF en nombre del "
"Imperio. Por desgracia, el intercambio de prisioneros fracasó. \"Fue todo "
"culpa de los Dvaered. Llegaron de la nada y empezaron a disparar\". El "
"comandante Soldner te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en el bar de Halir si "
"estás interesado en más misiones."

#. Force FLF combat music (note: must clear this later on).
#. Get a random position near the player
#. Create some pilots to go after the player
#. Set hostile
#. Get a far away position for fighting to happen
#. We'll put the FLF first
#. Clear velocity
#. FLF Spawn around the Gawain
#. Storing the system the player jumped from.
#. More ships to pressure player from behind
msgid "FLF Ambusher"
msgstr "Emboscada FLF"

#. Now the Dvaered
#. Player should not be able to reland
msgid "The docking stabilizers have been damaged by weapons fire!"
msgstr ""
"¡Los estabilizadores de atraque han sido dañados por el fuego de las armas!"

#. Storing the system the player jumped from.
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Empire Shipping 2">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>
#. if system.cur():reputation("Empire") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("Dvaered") &lt; 0 or faction.reputationGlobal("FLF") &gt;= 10 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <done>Empire Shipping 1</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Halir</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Empire Shipping</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Empire Shipping Dangerous Cargo Delivery
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#.
#.
#.
#. Planet targets
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims
#. Bar NPC
#. See if accept mission
msgid ""
"You approach Commander Soldner, who seems to be waiting for you.\n"
"\"Ready for your next mission? We need you to do a pickup and delivery, "
"however, you are expected to encounter hostilities on the way. Interested?\""
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al Comandante Soldner, que parece estar esperándote.\n"
"\"¿Listo para tu próxima misión?\"Necesitamos que hagas una recogida y "
"entrega, sin embargo, se espera que encuentres hostilidades en el camino. "
"¿Interesado?\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid ""
"Commander Soldner begins, \"We have an important package that must get from "
"{pickup_pnt} in the {pickup_sys} system to {dropoff_pnt} in the "
"{dropoff_sys} system. We have reason to believe that it is also wanted by "
"external forces."
msgstr ""
"El Comandante Soldner comienza: \"Tenemos un paquete importante que debe "
"llegar desde {pickup_pnt} en el sistema {pickup_sys} hasta {dropoff_pnt} en "
"el sistema {dropoff_sys}. Tenemos razones para creer que también es buscado "
"por fuerzas externas."

msgid ""
"\"The plan is to send an advance convoy with guards to make the run in an "
"attempt to confuse possible enemies. You will then go in and do the actual "
"delivery by yourself. This way we shouldn't arouse suspicion. You are to "
"report here when you finish delivery, and you'll be paid {credits}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El plan es enviar una caravana de avanzada con guardias para hacer la "
"carrera en un intento de confundir a los posibles enemigos. A continuación, "
"irás y harás la entrega real por ti mismo. De esta manera no deberíamos "
"levantar sospechas. Debes reportarte aquí cuando termines la entrega y se te "
"pagarán {credits}.\""

msgid ""
"\"Avoid hostilities at all costs. The package must arrive at its "
"destination. Since you are undercover, Empire ships won't assist you if you "
"come under fire, so stay sharp. Good luck.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Evite las hostilidades a toda costa. El paquete debe llegar a su destino. "
"Como estás de incógnito, las naves del Imperio no te ayudarán si estás bajo "
"fuego, así que mantente alerta. Buena suerte.\""

#. target destination
#. Mission details
msgid "Empire Shipping Delivery"
msgstr "Entrega de Envíos del Imperio"

msgid "Pick up a package at {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Recoger un paquete en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. Set hooks
#. Make sure player has room.
msgid "Need More Space"
msgstr "Necesitas Más Espacio"

#, lua-format
msgid ""
"You do not have enough space to load the packages. You need to make room for "
"%d more tonne."
msgid_plural ""
"You do not have enough space to load the packages. You need to make room for "
"%d more tonnes."
msgstr[0] ""
"No tienes suficiente espacio para cargar los paquetes. Necesita hacer "
"espacio para %d tonelada más."
msgstr[1] ""
"No tienes suficiente espacio para cargar los paquetes. Necesitas hacer "
"espacio para %d toneladas más."

#. Update mission
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "Paquetes"

msgid "Several packages of \"food\"."
msgstr "Varios paquetes de \"comida\"."

msgid "Deliver the package to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Entrega el paquete a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. Load message
msgid "Loading Cargo"
msgstr "Cargando Carga"

msgid ""
"The packages labelled \"Food\" are loaded discreetly onto your ship. Now to "
"deliver them to {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Los paquetes etiquetados como \"Comida\" son cargados discretamente en tu "
"nave. Ahora hay que entregarlos a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

#. Some text
msgid "Cargo Delivery"
msgstr "Envio de Carga"

msgid ""
"Workers quickly unload the package as discreetly as it was loaded. You "
"notice that one of them gives you a note. Looks like you'll have to go to "
"{pnt} in the {sys} system to report to Commander Soldner."
msgstr ""
"Los trabajadores descargan rápidamente el paquete con la misma discreción "
"con la que fue cargado. Te das cuenta de que uno de ellos te da una nota. "
"Parece que tendrás que ir a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para presentarte al "
"Comandante Soldner."

#. Rewards
#. Flavour text
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You arrive at {pnt} and report to Commander Soldner. He greets you and "
"starts talking. \"I heard you encountered resistance. At least you were able "
"to deliver the package. Great work there. I've managed to get you cleared "
"for a Heavy Weapon Licence. You'll still have to pay the fee for getting it, "
"though."
msgstr ""
"Llegas a {pnt} y te presentas ante el Comandante Soldner. Te saluda y "
"empieza a hablar. \"He oído que has encontrado resistencia. Al menos has "
"podido entregar el paquete. Gran trabajo. He conseguido que te den la "
"Licencia de Armas Pesadas. Aunque todavía tendrás que pagar la cuota para "
"conseguirla."

msgid ""
"You arrive at {pnt} and report to Commander Soldner. He greets you and "
"starts talking. \"I heard you encountered resistance. At least you managed "
"to deliver the package.\""
msgstr ""
"Llegas a {pnt} y te presentas ante el Comandante Soldner. Te saluda y "
"empieza a hablar. \"He oído que has encontrado resistencia. Al menos has "
"conseguido entregar el paquete.\""

msgid ""
"\"If you're interested in more work, meet me in the bar in a bit. I've got "
"some paperwork I need to finish first.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si estás interesado en más trabajo, reúnete conmigo en el bar dentro de un "
"rato. Tengo algo de papeleo que terminar primero.\""

#. The goods
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You successfully completed a package delivery for the Empire. As a result, "
"you have been cleared for a Heavy Weapon Licence and can now buy it at an "
"outfitter. Commander Soldner said that you can meet him in the bar at Halir "
"if you're interested in more work."
msgstr ""
"Has completado con éxito una entrega de paquetes para el Imperio. Como "
"resultado, has sido autorizado para obtener una Licencia de Armas Pesadas y "
"ahora puedes comprarla en un armador. El Comandante Soldner dijo que puedes "
"reunirte con él en el bar de Halir si estás interesado en más trabajo."

msgid ""
"You successfully completed a package delivery for the Empire. Commander "
"Soldner said that you can meet him in the bar at Halir if you're interested "
"in more work."
msgstr ""
"Has completado con éxito una entrega de paquetes para el Imperio. El "
"comandante Soldner dice que puedes reunirte con él en el bar de Halir si te "
"interesa más trabajo."

