#. --
#.
#. Empire VIP Rescue
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. - Mission fixed to suit big systems (Anatolis, 11/02/2011)
#.
#. Rescue a VIP stranded on a disabled ship in a system while FLF and Dvaered are fighting.
#.
#. Stages:
#.
#. 0) Go to sector.
#. 1) Board ship and rescue VIP.
#. 2) Rescued VIP, returning to base.
#. 3) VIP died or jump out of system without VIP  --> mission failure.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
msgid ""
"You failed in your attempt to rescue a VIP for the Empire. Meet with "
"Commander Soldner on Halir to try again."
msgstr ""
"Has fallado en tu intento de rescatar a un VIP para el Imperio. Reúnete con "
"el Comandante Soldner en Halir para volver a intentarlo."

#. Planet targets
#. Must claim system
#. Bar NPC
msgid "Commander Soldner is waiting for you."
msgstr "El Comandante Soldner te está esperando."

#. Intro text
msgid ""
"You meet up once more with Commander Soldner at the bar.\n"
"\"Hello again, {player}. Still interested in doing another mission? We need "
"someone to rescue a VIP. This mission will be more dangerous than the last.\""
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras una vez más con el Comandante Soldner en el bar.\n"
"\"Hola de nuevo, {player}. ¿Sigues interesado en hacer otra misión? "
"Necesitamos a alguien para rescatar a un VIP. Esta misión será más peligrosa "
"que la anterior.\""

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Commander Soldner nods and continues, \"We've had reports that a transport "
"vessel came under attack while carrying a VIP. They managed to escape, but "
"the engine ended up giving out in the {sys} system. The ship is now "
"disabled, and we need someone to board the ship and rescue the VIP. There "
"have been many FLF ships detected near the sector, but we've managed to "
"organize a Dvaered escort for you."
msgstr ""
"El Comandante Soldner asiente y continúa: \"Nos han informado de que una "
"nave de transporte fue atacada mientras llevaba a un VIP. Lograron escapar, "
"pero el motor terminó por fallar en el sistema {sys}. La nave está ahora "
"incapacitada y necesitamos que alguien aborde la nave y rescate al VIP. Se "
"han detectado muchas naves FLF cerca del sector, pero hemos conseguido "
"organizar una escolta Dvaered para ti."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"You're going to have to fly to the {sys} system, find and board the "
"transport ship to rescue the VIP, and then fly back. The sector is most "
"likely going to be hot. That's where your Dvaered escorts will come in. "
"Their mission will be to distract and neutralize all possible hostiles. You "
"must not allow the transport ship to be destroyed before you rescue the VIP. "
"His survival is vital.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tendrás que volar al sistema {sys}, encontrar y abordar la nave de "
"transporte para rescatar al VIP, y luego volar de vuelta. Lo más probable es "
"que el sector esté caliente. Ahí es donde entrarán tus escoltas Dvaered. Tu "
"misión será distraer y neutralizar a todos los posibles hostiles. No debes "
"permitir que la nave de transporte sea destruida antes de rescatar al VIP. "
"Su supervivencia es vital.\""

msgid ""
"\"Be careful with the Dvaered; they can be a bit blunt, and might "
"accidentally destroy the transport ship. If all goes well, you'll be paid "
"{credits} when you return with the VIP. Good luck, pilot.\""
msgstr ""
"\" Ten cuidado con los Dvaered; pueden ser un poco bruscos, y podrían "
"destruir accidentalmente la nave de transporte. Si todo va bien, te pagarán "
"{credits} cuando vuelvas con el VIP. Buena suerte, piloto.\""

#. Accept the mission
#. Set marker
#. Mission details
msgid "Empire VIP Rescue"
msgstr "Rescatar Imperial VIP"

msgid "Rescue the VIP from a transport ship in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Rescata al VIP de una nave de transporte en el sistema {sys}"

#. Set hooks
#. Initiate mission variables (A.)
#. Successfully rescued the VIP
msgid ""
"You land at the starport. It looks like the VIP has already recovered. He "
"thanks you profusely before heading off. You proceed to pay Commander "
"Soldner a visit. He seems to be happy, for once."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en el puerto estelar. Parece que el VIP ya se ha recuperado. Te lo "
"agradece profusamente antes de marcharse. Procedes a visitar al Comandante "
"Soldner. Pareces estar contento, por una vez."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"It seems like you managed to pull it off. I had my doubts at first, but "
"you've proven to be a very skilled pilot. Oh, and I've cleared you for a "
"Heavy Combat Vessel Licence; congratulations! We have nothing more for you "
"now, but check in periodically in case something comes up for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que lo has conseguido. Al principio tenía mis dudas, pero has "
"demostrado ser un piloto muy hábil. Ah, y te he dado el visto bueno para la "
"Licencia de Naves de Combate Pesado; ¡felicidades! No tenemos nada más para "
"ti ahora, pero comprueba periódicamente por si surge algo.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You successfully rescued a VIP for the Empire and have been cleared for a "
"Heavy Combat Vessel Licence; you can now buy one at the outfitter."
msgstr ""
"Has rescatado con éxito a un VIP para el Imperio y has sido autorizado para "
"obtener una Licencia de Nave de Combate Pesada; ahora puedes comprar una en "
"el armador."

msgid ""
"\"It seems like you managed to pull it off. I had my doubts at first, but "
"you've proven to be a very skilled pilot. We have nothing more for you now, "
"but check in periodically in case something comes up for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que lo has conseguido. Al principio tenía mis dudas, pero has "
"demostrado ser un piloto muy hábil. No tenemos nada más para ti ahora, pero "
"comprueba periódicamente por si te surge algo.\""

msgid "You successfully rescued a VIP for the Empire."
msgstr "Has rescatado con éxito a un VIP para el Imperio."

#. Force FLF combat music (note: must clear this later on).
#. Put the VIP a ways off of the player but near the jump.
#. VIP boards
msgid "VIP"
msgstr "VIP"

#. To make it more interesting a vendetta will solely target the player.
#. If player is seen, have them target player
#. On purpose attack player
#. Now Dvaered
#. They will jump together with you in the system at the jump point. (A.)
#. Add more ships on a timer to make this messy
#. Pass to next stage
#. Can't run away from combat
#. Notify of mission failure
#. If aborted you'll also leave the VIP to fate. (A.)
msgid "You abandoned the VIP."
msgstr "Has abandonado al VIP."

msgid "A Very Important Person."
msgstr "Una persona muy importante (Very important Person)."

msgid "Disabled Ship"
msgstr "Nave Incapacitada"

msgid ""
"The ship's hatch opens, and immediately an unconscious VIP is brought aboard "
"by his bodyguard. Looks like there is no one else aboard."
msgstr ""
"La escotilla de la nave se abre e inmediatamente un VIP inconsciente es "
"llevado a bordo por su guardaespaldas. Parece que no hay nadie más a bordo."

#. Update mission details
msgid "Return to {pnt} in the {sys} system with the VIP"
msgstr "Volver a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} con el VIP"

#. Force unboard
#. Notify of death
msgid "VIP is dead."
msgstr "El VIP ha muerto."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Diversion from Raelid">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>60</chance>
#. <done>Disrupt a Dvaered Patrol</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <cond>spob.cur():reputation("FLF") &gt;= 10</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. <tier>4</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Diversion from Raelid.
#.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals success_text pay_text land (inherited from mission above, TODO remove horrible hack and make unique)
msgid ""
"You receive a transmission. It's from Benito. \"Operation successful!\" she "
"says. \"You should get back to the base now before you get killed! I'll be "
"waiting for you there.\""
msgstr ""
"Recibes una transmisión. Es de Benito. \"¡Operación con éxito!\", dice. "
"\"¡Debes volver a la base ahora antes de que te maten! Te estaré esperando "
"allí.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As you dock the station, Benito approaches you with a smile. \"Thank you for "
"your help,\" she says. \"The mission was a resounding success! What we've "
"accomplished will greatly help our efforts against the Dvaered in the future."
"\" She hands you a credit chip. \"That's your payment. Until next time!\" "
"Benito sees herself out as a number of additional FLF soldiers congratulate "
"you. It occurs to you that you never learned what the mission actually was. "
"Perhaps you will find out some other time."
msgstr ""
"Al atracar en la estación, Benito se acerca a ti con una sonrisa. \"Gracias "
"por tu ayuda\", dice. \"¡La misión ha sido un éxito rotundo! Lo que hemos "
"logrado ayudará mucho a nuestros esfuerzos contra los Dvaereds en el "
"futuro\". Te entrega una ficha de crédito. \"Este es tu pago. Hasta la "
"próxima vez\". Benito se despide mientras varios soldados adicionales de la "
"FLF te felicitan. Se te ocurre que nunca te enteraste de cuál era la misión "
"en realidad. Tal vez lo descubras en otra ocasión."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="The FLF Split">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <done>Assault on Haleb</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <cond>spob.cur():reputation("FLF") &gt;= 90</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. The FLF Split
#.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals land_flf (inherited from mission above, TODO get rid of)
msgid "Benito"
msgstr "Benito"

msgid "Benito seems to want to speak with you."
msgstr "Parece que Benito quiere hablar contigo."

msgid "Taking One for the Team"
msgstr "Tomando una por el equipo"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Benito smiles as you approach her. \"Hello again, {player}!\" she says. \"I "
"have another mission for you, should you choose to accept it. See, we "
"have... an important covert operation we need to launch in Raelid. I won't "
"bore you with the details of that operation, but I need someone to distract "
"the Dvaered forces while we do this. You'll basically need to travel to the "
"{sys} system and wreak havoc there so that the Dvaered go after you and not "
"the soldiers conducting the operation.\n"
"   \"Of course, this will be a highly dangerous mission, and I can't "
"guarantee any backup for you. You will be paid substantially, however, and "
"this will surely earn you more respect among our ranks. Would you be "
"interested?\""
msgstr ""
"Benito sonríe cuando te acercas a ella. \"¡Hola de nuevo, {player}!\", dice. "
"\"Tengo otra misión para ti, si decides aceptarla. Verás, tenemos... una "
"importante operación encubierta que debemos lanzar en Raelid. No te aburriré "
"con los detalles de esa operación, pero necesito a alguien que distraiga a "
"las fuerzas Dvaered mientras lo hacemos. Básicamente tendrás que viajar al "
"sistema {sys} y causar estragos allí para que los Dvaereds vayan a por ti y "
"no a por los soldados que dirigen la operación.\n"
"\"Por supuesto, esta será una misión altamente peligrosa, y no puedo "
"garantizarte ningún respaldo. Sin embargo, se te pagará sustancialmente, y "
"esto seguramente te hará ganar más respeto entre nuestras filas. ¿Estarías "
"interesado?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! The team in charge of the operation will be hiding out around "
"Raelid until they get an opening from your efforts. I will message you when "
"they succeed. Good luck, and try not to get yourself killed!\" She grins, "
"and you grin back. Now to cause some mayhem..."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! El equipo a cargo de la operación se esconderá en los alrededores "
"de Raelid hasta que consigan un hueco gracias a tus esfuerzos. Te enviaré un "
"mensaje cuando lo consigan. Buena suerte, e intenta que no te maten\". Ella "
"sonríe, y tú le devuelves la sonrisa. Ahora a causar algo de caos..."

msgid "FLF Diversion"
msgstr "Distracción FLF"

msgid "Diversion from Raelid"
msgstr "Distracción de Raelid"

msgid ""
"A covert operation is being conducted in Raelid. You are to create a "
"diversion from this operation by wreaking havoc in the nearby {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Se está llevando a cabo una operación encubierta en Raelid. Debes crear una "
"distracción de esta operación causando estragos en el sistema {sys} cercano."

msgid "Substantial pay and a great amount of respect"
msgstr "Paga considerable y un gran respeto"

msgid "Maybe Another Time"
msgstr "Tal vez en otro momento"

msgid "\"OK, then. Feel free to come back later if you change your mind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De acuerdo. Siéntete libre de volver más tarde si cambias de opinión.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You helped the FLF conduct some kind of operation in Raelid by distracting "
"the Dvaered in another system."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste al FLF a realizar algún tipo de operación en Raelid distrayendo a "
"los Dvaereds en otro sistema."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="FLF Pirate Alliance">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <done>Diversion from Raelid</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <cond>spob.cur():reputation("FLF") &gt;= 30</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Pirate Alliance
#.
#. --
#. Non-persistent state
#. TODO this mission needs to be adapted to the new pirate clan stuff
#. for now I just swapped "Pirate" for "Dreamer Clan"
msgid "You call those weapons? They look more like babies' toys to me!"
msgstr "¿Llamas a eso armas? ¡A mí me parecen más bien juguetes para bebés!"

msgid "What a hopeless weakling!"
msgstr "¡Qué débil sin esperanza!"

msgid "What, did you really think I would be impressed that easily?"
msgstr "¿Qué, realmente pensaste que me impresionarías tan fácilmente?"

msgid "Keep hailing all you want, but I don't listen to weaklings!"
msgstr "¡Sigue llamando todo lo que quieras, que no escucho a los débiles!"

msgid "We'll have your ship plundered in no time at all!"
msgstr "¡Tendremos tu nave saqueada en un abrir y cerrar de ojos!"

msgid "Find pirates and try to talk to (hail) them"
msgstr "Encuentra a los piratas y trata de hablar con ellos (llamar)"

msgid "Return to FLF base"
msgstr "Regresa a la base FLF"

msgid ""
"It seems Benito wants something from you again. Something about her looks a "
"little off this time around."
msgstr ""
"Parece que Benito quiere algo de ti otra vez. Algo en ella parece un poco "
"fuera de lugar esta vez."

msgid "The enemy of my enemy..."
msgstr "El enemigo de mi enemigo..."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Benito motions for you to sit. She doesn't seem quite as calm and relaxed as "
"she usually is.\n"
"   \"Hello again, {player}. Look: we have a pretty bad situation here. As "
"you may have guessed, we rely on... unconventional sources for supplies. "
"Unfortunately, we seem to have hit a bit of a snag. See, one of our "
"important sources has stopped supplying us, and I fear we may be cut off and "
"no longer able to carry out our operations before long if we don't do "
"something.\n"
"   \"But that being said, I think I may have found a solution. See, we have "
"reason to believe that we are actually neighbouring a pirate stronghold. "
"We're not entirely sure, but we have detected some evidence of occasional "
"pirate activity in the nearby {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"Benito te indica que te sientes. No parece tan tranquila y relajada como "
"suele estar.\n"
"    \"Hola de nuevo, {player}. Mira: tenemos una situación bastante mala "
"aquí. Como habrás adivinado, dependemos de... fuentes no convencionales para "
"los suministros. Desgraciadamente, parece que nos hemos topado con un "
"pequeño obstáculo. Verás, una de nuestras fuentes importantes ha dejado de "
"abastecernos, y me temo que podemos quedar aislados y no ser capaces de "
"llevar a cabo nuestras operaciones en poco tiempo si no hacemos algo.\n"
"    \"Pero dicho esto, creo que he encontrado una solución. Verás, tenemos "
"razones para creer que en realidad estamos cerca de un bastión pirata. No "
"estamos del todo seguros, pero hemos detectado algunas evidencias de "
"actividad pirata ocasional en el sistema cercano.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You raise an eyebrow. It seems rather odd that pirates would be in such a "
"remote system. Perhaps it could be a gateway of some sort?\n"
"   \"You must be thinking the same thing,\" Benito pipes up. \"Yes, that is "
"a very strange system to see pirates in, even occasionally. That's why we "
"think there is a secret pirate stronghold nearby. It may even be the one "
"associated with piracy in the Frontier.\n"
"   \"We must establish trading relations with that stronghold at once. This "
"could give us just the edge we need against the Dvaereds. I honestly don't "
"know how you can go about doing it, but my recommendation would be to go to "
"the {sys} system and see if you find any pirates. Tell them you're on "
"official FLF business, and that we're seeking to become trade partners with "
"them. Are you in?\""
msgstr ""
"Levantas una ceja. Parece bastante extraño que haya piratas en un sistema "
"tan remoto. ¿Tal vez podría ser un portal de algún tipo?\n"
"    \"Debes estar pensando lo mismo\", dice Benito. \"Sí, es un sistema muy "
"extraño para ver piratas, aunque sea ocasionalmente. Por eso creemos que hay "
"una fortaleza secreta de piratas cerca. Incluso puede ser uno asociado a la "
"piratería en la Frontera.\n"
"    \"Debemos establecer relaciones comerciales con esa fortaleza de "
"inmediato. Esto podría darnos la ventaja que necesitamos contra los "
"Dvaereds. Sinceramente, no sé cómo puedes hacerlo, pero mi recomendación "
"sería ir al sistema {sys} y ver si encuentras algún pirata. Diles que estás "
"en un asunto oficial de la FLF, y que estamos buscando convertirnos en "
"socios comerciales con ellos. ¿Te apuntas?\""

msgid "...is my friend."
msgstr "...es mi amigo."

msgid ""
"\"Excellent! I knew you would do it.\" Benito becomes visibly more relaxed, "
"almost her usual self. \"Now, {player}, I'm sure you're well aware of this, "
"but please remember that pirates are extremely dangerous. They will probably "
"attack you, and they may have demands. I'm counting on you to overcome "
"any... obstacles you may encounter and secure a deal.\" You nod in "
"understanding. \"Good,\" she says. \"Report back here with your results.\" "
"Benito then excuses herself, presumably to take care of other things."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Excelente! Sabía que lo harías\". Benito se vuelve visiblemente más "
"relajada, casi como siempre. \"Ahora, {player}, estoy seguro de que eres muy "
"consciente de esto, pero por favor recuerda que los piratas son "
"extremadamente peligrosos. Es probable que te ataquen, y puede que tengan "
"exigencias. Cuento con usted para superar cualquier... obstáculo que puedas "
"encontrar y asegurar un trato\". Asientes en señal de comprensión. \"Bien\", "
"dice ella. \"Vuelve aquí con tus resultados\". Entonces Benito se excusa, "
"presumiblemente para ocuparse de otras cosas."

msgid "Pirate Alliance"
msgstr "Alianza Pirata"

msgid ""
"You are to seek out pirates in the {sys} system and try to convince them to "
"become trading partners with the FLF."
msgstr ""
"Debes buscar piratas en el sistema {sys} y tratar de convencerlos de que se "
"conviertan en socios comerciales de la FLF."

msgid "Supplies for the FLF"
msgstr "Suministros para la FLF"

msgid "...is still my enemy."
msgstr "...sigue siendo mi enemigo."

msgid ""
"\"That's too bad. I understand where you're coming from, though. Please feel "
"free to return if you are willing to take on this mission at a later date.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es una pena. Sin embargo, entiendo de dónde vienes. Por favor, siéntete "
"libre de volver si estás dispuesto a asumir esta misión en una fecha "
"posterior.\""

msgid ""
"Har, har, har! You're hailing the wrong ship, buddy. Latest word from the "
"boss is you're a weakling just waiting to be plundered!"
msgstr ""
"¡Har, har, har! Estás llamando a la nave equivocada, amigo. ¡Lo último que "
"ha dicho el jefe es que eres un debilucho que espera ser saqueado!"

msgid "I guess you're not so bad after all!"
msgstr "¡Supongo que no eres tan malo después de todo!"

msgid "Not So Weak After All"
msgstr "No Tan Débil Después de Todo"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The pirate comes on your view screen once again, but his expression has "
"changed this time. He's hiding it, but you can tell that he's afraid of what "
"you might do to him. You come to the realization that he is finally willing "
"to talk and suppress a sigh of relief.\n"
"   \"L-look, we got off on the wrong foot, eh? I've misjudged you lot. I "
"guess FLF pilots can fight after all.\""
msgstr ""
"El pirata vuelve a aparecer en tu pantalla, pero esta vez su expresión ha "
"cambiado. Lo disimula, pero te das cuenta de que tiene miedo de lo que "
"puedas hacerle. Te das cuenta de que por fin está dispuesto a hablar y "
"reprimes un suspiro de alivio.\n"
"    \"Mira, hemos empezado con mal pie, ¿eh? Os he juzgado mal. Supongo que "
"los pilotos de la FLF pueden luchar después de todo.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You begin to talk to the pirate about what you and the FLF are after, and "
"the look of fear on the pirate's face fades away. \"Supplies? Yeah, we've "
"got supplies, alright. But it'll cost you! Heh, heh, heh...\" You inquire as "
"to what the cost might be. \"Simple, really. We want to build another base "
"in the {sys} system. We can do it ourselves, of course, but if we can get "
"you to pay for it, even better! Specifically, we need another {tonnes} of "
"ore to build the base. So you bring it back to the Anger system, and we'll "
"call it a deal!\n"
"   \"Oh yeah, I almost forgot; you don't know how to get to the Anger "
"system, now, do you? Well, since you've proven yourself worthy, I suppose "
"I'll let you in on our little secret.\" He transfers a file to your ship's "
"computer. When you look at it, you see that it's a map showing a single "
"hidden jump point. \"Now, away with you! Meet me in the {sys} system when "
"you have the loot.\""
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a hablar con el pirata sobre lo que tú y el FLF buscáis, y la "
"mirada de miedo en el rostro del pirata se desvanece. \"¿Suministros? Sí, "
"tenemos suministros, de acuerdo. Pero te costará. Je, je, je...\" Preguntas "
"cuál es el coste. \"Es sencillo, en realidad. Queremos construir otra base "
"en el sistema {sys}. Podemos hacerlo nosotros mismos, por supuesto, pero si "
"podemos conseguir que lo paguéis vosotros, ¡aún mejor! En concreto, "
"necesitamos otras {tonnes} de mineral para construir la base. Así que "
"traedlo al sistema Cólera, y lo consideramos un trato.\n"
"\"Oh sí, casi lo olvido; no sabes cómo llegar al sistema Cólera, ahora, "
"¿verdad? Bueno, ya que has demostrado ser digno, supongo que te dejaré "
"entrar en nuestro pequeño secreto\". Transfiere un archivo a la computadora "
"de tu nave. Cuando lo miras, ves que es un mapa que muestra un único punto "
"de salto oculto. \"¡Ahora, fuera de aquí! Reúnete conmigo en el sistema "
"{sys} cuando tengas el botín.\""

msgid "Bring {tonnes} of Ore to the Pirate Kestrel in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Lleva {tonnes} de Menas al Cernícalo Pirata en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Who are you calling a weakling?"
msgstr "¿A quién llamas debilucho?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A scraggly-looking pirate appears on your viewscreen. You realize this must "
"be the leader of the group. \"Bwah ha ha!\" he laughs. \"That has to be the "
"most pathetic excuse for a ship I've ever seen!\" You try to ignore his rude "
"remark and start to explain to him that you just want to talk. \"Talk?\" he "
"responds. \"Why would I want to talk to a normie like you? Why, I'd bet my "
"mates right here could blow you out of the sky even without my help!\"\n"
"   The pirate immediately cuts his connection. Well, if these pirates won't "
"talk to you, maybe it's time to show him what you're made of. Destroying "
"just one or two of his escorts should do the trick."
msgstr ""
"Un pirata de aspecto desaliñado aparece en tu pantalla. Te das cuenta de que "
"debe ser el líder del grupo. \"¡Bwah ha ha!\" se ríe. \"¡Esa tiene que ser "
"la excusa más patética para una nave que he visto nunca!\" Intentas ignorar "
"su grosero comentario y empiezas a explicarle que sólo quieres hablar. "
"\"¿Hablar?\", responde. \"¿Por qué querría hablar con un normalito como tú? "
"¡Apuesto a que mis compañeros de aquí podrían hacerte volar por los aires "
"incluso sin mi ayuda!\"\n"
"    El pirata corta inmediatamente su conexión. Bueno, si estos piratas no "
"quieren hablar contigo, tal vez sea el momento de mostrarle de qué estás "
"hecho. Destruir sólo uno o dos de sus escoltas debería ser suficiente."

msgid ""
"Destroy some of the weaker pirate ships, then try to hail the Kestrel again"
msgstr ""
"Destruye algunos de las naves piratas más débiles, y luego intenta llamar al "
"Cernícalo de nuevo"

msgid "Still Not Impressed"
msgstr "Todavía No Estoy Impresionado"

msgid ""
"The pirate leader comes on your screen once again. \"Lucky shot, normie!\" "
"he says before promptly terminating the connection once again. Perhaps you "
"need to destroy some more of his escorts so he can see you're just a bit "
"more than a \"normie\"."
msgstr ""
"El líder pirata vuelve a aparecer en tu pantalla. \"¡Un golpe de suerte, "
"normalito!\", dice antes de volver a interrumpir la conexión. Tal vez tengas "
"que destruir a algunos de sus escoltas para que vea que eres algo más que un "
"\"normalito\"."

msgid "I knew we could work something out"
msgstr "Sabía que podíamos llegar a un acuerdo"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Ha, you came back after all! Wonderful. I'll just take that ore, then.\" "
"You hesitate for a moment, but considering the number of pirates around, "
"they'll probably take it from you by force if you refuse at this point. You "
"jettison the cargo into space, which the Kestrel promptly picks up with a "
"tractor beam. \"Excellent! Well, it's been a pleasure doing business with "
"you. Send your mates over to the new station whenever you're ready. It "
"should be up and running in just a couple periods or so. And in the "
"meantime, you can consider yourselves one of us! Bwa ha ha!\"\n"
"   You exchange what must, for lack of a better word, be called pleasantries "
"with the pirate, with him telling a story about a pitifully armed Mule he "
"recently plundered and you sharing stories of your victories against Dvaered "
"scum. You seem to get along well. You then part ways. Now to report to "
"Benito...."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ja, has vuelto después de todo! Maravilloso. Entonces me llevaré ese "
"mineral\". Dudas por un momento, pero teniendo en cuenta el número de "
"piratas que hay, probablemente te lo quitarán por la fuerza si te niegas en "
"este momento. Lanzas la carga al espacio, que el Cernícalo recoge "
"rápidamente con un rayo tractor. \"¡Excelente! Ha sido un placer hacer "
"negocios con usted. Envíe a sus compañeros a la nueva estación cuando esté "
"lista. Debería estar en funcionamiento en un par de periodos más o menos. Y "
"mientras tanto, ¡puedes considerarte uno de los nuestros! Bwa ha ha!\"\n"
"    Intercambias con el pirata lo que, a falta de una palabra mejor, debe "
"llamarse cortesía, con él contando una historia sobre una mula "
"lamentablemente armada que ha saqueado recientemente y tú compartiendo "
"historias de tus victorias contra la escoria Dvaered. Parece que os lleváis "
"bien. Luego os separáis. Ahora a informar a Benito...."

msgid "Don't be bothering me without the loot, you hear?"
msgstr "No me molestes sin el botín, ¿me oyes?"

msgid ""
"As the Pirate Kestrel is blown out of the sky, it occurs to you that you "
"have made a terrible mistake. Having killed off the leader of the pirate "
"group, you have lost your opportunity to negotiate a trade deal with the "
"pirates. You shamefully transmit your result to Benito via a coded message "
"and abort the mission. Perhaps you will be given another opportunity later."
msgstr ""
"Mientras el Cernícalo Pirata es volado del cielo, se te ocurre que has "
"cometido un terrible error. Al haber matado al líder del grupo pirata, has "
"perdido la oportunidad de negociar un acuerdo comercial con los piratas. "
"Transmites vergonzosamente tu resultado a Benito a través de un mensaje "
"codificado y abortas la misión. Tal vez se te dé otra oportunidad más "
"adelante."

msgid "Just The Edge We Need"
msgstr "Justo Lo Que Necesitamos"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You greet Benito in a friendly manner as always, sharing your story and "
"telling her the good news before handing her a chip with the map data on it. "
"She seems pleased. \"Excellent,\" she says. \"We'll begin sending our "
"trading convoys out right away. We'll need lots of supplies for our next "
"mission! Thank you for your service, {player}. Your pay has been deposited "
"into your account. It will be a while before we'll be ready for your next "
"big mission, so you can do some missions on the mission computer in the "
"meantime. And don't forget to visit the Pirate worlds yourself and bring "
"your own ship up to par!\n"
"   \"Oh, one last thing. Make sure you stay on good terms with the pirates, "
"yeah? The next thing you should probably do is buy a Skull and Bones ship; "
"pirates tend to respect those who use their ships more than those who don't. "
"And make sure to destroy Dvaered scum with the pirates around! That should "
"keep your reputation up.\" You make a mental note to do what she suggests as "
"she excuses herself and heads off."
msgstr ""
"Saludas a Benito de forma amistosa como siempre, compartiendo tu historia y "
"contándole las buenas noticias antes de entregarle un chip con los datos del "
"mapa. Ella parece complacida. \"Excelente\", dice. \"Comenzaremos a enviar "
"nuestras caravanas comerciales de inmediato. Necesitaremos muchos "
"suministros para nuestra próxima misión. Gracias por tu servicio, {player}. "
"Tu paga ha sido depositada en tu cuenta. Pasará un tiempo antes de que "
"estemos listos para tu próxima gran misión, así que puedes hacer algunas "
"misiones en el ordenador de misiones mientras tanto. Y no olvides visitar tú "
"mismo los mundos piratas y poner a punto tu propia nave.\n"
"    \"Oh, una última cosa. Asegúrate de mantenerte en buenos términos con "
"los piratas, ¿sí? Lo siguiente que deberías hacer es comprar una nave Cráneo "
"y Huesos; los piratas tienden a respetar más a los que usan sus naves que a "
"los que no lo hacen. Y asegúrate de destruir a la escoria Dvaered con los "
"piratas cerca. Eso debería mantener tu reputación alta\". Haces una nota "
"mental para hacer lo que ella sugiere mientras te excusas y te vas."

msgid ""
"You helped the Pirates to build a new base in the Anger system and "
"established a trade alliance between the FLF and the Pirates. Benito "
"suggested that you should buy a Skull and Bones ship from the pirates and "
"destroy Dvaered ships in areas where pirates are to keep your reputation "
"with the pirates up. She also suggested you may want to upgrade your ship "
"now that you have access to the black market."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a los Piratas a construir una nueva base en el sistema Cólera y "
"estableciste una alianza comercial entre la FLF y los Piratas. Benito "
"sugirió que compraras una nave Calavera y Huesos a los piratas y que "
"destruyeras las naves Dvaered en las zonas donde están los piratas para "
"mantener tu reputación con ellos. También sugirió que tal vez quieras "
"mejorar tu nave ahora que tienes acceso al mercado negro."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Assault on Raelid">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <done>FLF Pirate Alliance</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <cond>spob.cur():reputation("FLF") &gt;= 50</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <provides name="The Empire and the FLF are enemies">Because they're caught in the battle</provides>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Assault on Raelid
#.
#. --
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "Wait until the coast is clear, then hail one of your wingmates"
msgstr ""
"Espera hasta que no haya moros en la costa, entonces llama a uno de tus "
"compañeros de vuelo"

msgid "Attack Fort Raelid until it is destroyed"
msgstr "Ataca al Fuerte Raelid hasta destruirlo"

msgid ""
"Benito is seated at a table with several other FLF soldiers. She motions for "
"you to come over."
msgstr ""
"Benito está sentado en una mesa con varios otros soldados del FLF. Te hace "
"un gesto para que te acerques."

msgid "The Next Level"
msgstr "El Próximo Nivel"

msgid ""
"\"Hello there, {player}! You're just in time. We were just discussing our "
"next operation against the Dvaered oppressors! Do you want in?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola, {player}! Llegas justo a tiempo. ¡Estábamos discutiendo nuestra "
"próxima operación contra los opresores Dvaered! ¿Quieres participar?\""

msgid "A Decisive Strike"
msgstr "Un Golpe Decisivo"

msgid ""
"You take a seat among the group. \"Fantastic!\" says Benito. \"Let me get "
"you caught up, then. Do you remember that mission in Raelid you helped with "
"a while back?\" You nod. You were wondering what you were actually creating "
"a diversion from. \"Yes, well, I never got around to telling you what we "
"actually did there. See, we've been wanting to destroy Fort Raelid for some "
"time, mostly because it's often used as a front for trying to scout us out. "
"So while you were getting the attention of those Dvaereds, we rigged a "
"special bomb and covertly installed it onto the outpost!\""
msgstr ""
"Toma asiento entre el grupo. \"¡Fantástico!\", dice Benito. \"Deja que te "
"ponga al día, entonces. ¿Recuerdas aquella misión en Raelid en la que "
"ayudaste hace tiempo?\" Asientes con la cabeza. Te preguntas de qué estás "
"creando una distracción. \"Sí, bueno, nunca llegué a contarte lo que "
"realmente hicimos allí. Verás, llevamos un tiempo queriendo destruir el "
"Fuerte Raelid, sobre todo porque a menudo se utiliza como fachada para "
"intentar explorarnos. Así que, mientras tú llamabas la atención de esos "
"Dvaereds, ¡preparamos una bomba especial y la instalamos de forma encubierta "
"en el puesto de avanzada!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Now, the bomb is not perfect. Given how hastily we had to install the "
"thing, we could not make it so that it could be detonated remotely. Instead, "
"it has to be detonated manually, by blasting the station repeatedly. "
"Shooting it down, in other words.\n"
"   \"So here's the plan. We have hired a large group of pirates to help us "
"out by creating a massive disturbance far away from our target. You are to "
"wait until the coast is clear, then swarm in and attack the outpost with all "
"you've got. You, {player}, will lead the charge. You have to determine the "
"optimal time, when the Dvaereds are far enough away for you to initiate the "
"attack, but before the pirates are inevitably overwhelmed. Simply hail one "
"of the others when it's time to attack, then make a beeline for Fort Raelid "
"and shoot at it with all you've got!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ahora, la bomba no es perfecta. Dada la premura con la que tuvimos que "
"instalarla, no pudimos hacerla para que pudiera ser detonada a distancia. En "
"su lugar, tiene que ser detonada manualmente, haciendo estallar la estación "
"repetidamente. Disparándola, en otras palabras.\n"
"    \"Así que este es el plan. Hemos contratado a un gran grupo de piratas "
"para que nos ayuden creando una perturbación masiva lejos de nuestro "
"objetivo. Deben esperar hasta que la costa esté despejada, luego entrar en "
"tropel y atacar el puesto de avanzada con todo lo que tienen. Tú, {player}, "
"liderarás la carga. Tienes que determinar el momento óptimo, cuando los "
"Dvaereds estén lo suficientemente lejos para que puedas iniciar el ataque, "
"pero antes de que los piratas sean inevitablemente abrumados. ¡Simplemente "
"llama a uno de los otros cuando sea el momento de atacar, y luego dirígete "
"al fuerte Raelid y dispárale con todo lo que tengas!\""

msgid ""
"\"You guys are some of our best pilots, so try not to get killed, eh? A "
"moment of triumph is upon us! Down with the oppressors!\" The last line "
"earns Benito a cheer from the crowd. Well, time to get your ship ready for "
"the battle."
msgstr ""
"\"Sois algunos de nuestros mejores pilotos, así que intentad que no os "
"maten, ¿eh? ¡El momento del triunfo ha llegado! ¡Abajo los opresores!\" La "
"última línea hace que Benito se gane una ovación de la multitud. Bueno, es "
"hora de preparar tu nave para la batalla."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Assault on Haleb">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <done>Alliance of Inconvenience</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <cond>spob.cur():reputation("FLF") &gt;= 80</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Assault on Haleb
#.
#. --
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "Fly to the {sys} system and meet with the group of FLF ships"
msgstr "Vuela al sistema {sys} y reúnete con el grupo de naves FLF"

msgid "Assault on Raelid"
msgstr "Asalto a Raelid"

msgid "Join with the other FLF pilots for the assault on Fort Raelid."
msgstr "Únete a los demás pilotos de la FLF para el asalto al Fuerte Raelid."

msgid "A great victory against the Dvaereds"
msgstr "Una gran victoria contra los Dvaereds"

msgid "Not This Time"
msgstr "No Esta Vez"

msgid "\"Okay. Just let me know if you change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"De acuerdo. Sólo hazme saber si cambias de opinión.\""

#. Spawn Fort Raelid ship
#. Spawn Dvaered and Empire ships
#. Spawn FLF ships
#. Spawn Fort Raglan ship
#. Spawn Dvaered ships
#. Spawn FLF ships
msgid "You're just in time, {player}! The chaos is just about to unfold."
msgstr "¡Llegas justo a tiempo, {player}! El caos está a punto de desatarse."

msgid "Help! SOS! We are under attack! In need of immediate assistance!"
msgstr "¡Ayuda! ¡SOS! ¡Estamos bajo ataque! ¡Necesitamos ayuda inmediata!"

msgid "You heard the boss! Let's grind that station to dust!"
msgstr "¡Ya habéis oído al jefe! ¡Vamos a hacer polvo esa estación!"

msgid "Ominous Foretelling"
msgstr "Predicción Ominosa"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As Fort Raelid erupts into a fantastic explosion before your very eyes, your "
"comrades cheer. But then, you see something odd. Someone is hailing you... "
"an Empire ship? Surely this can't be. Cautiously, you answer. The man whose "
"face comes up on your view screen wastes no time.\n"
"   \"So, you actually showed your face. I half expected you to run away and "
"hide. But no matter.\" You try not to show any reaction to his icy stare. He "
"continues."
msgstr ""
"Mientras el Fuerte Raelid estalla en una fantástica explosión ante tus ojos, "
"tus compañeros te aclaman. Pero entonces, ves algo extraño. Alguien te está "
"llamando... ¿una nave del Imperio? Seguramente esto no puede ser. Con "
"cautela, respondes. El hombre cuya cara aparece en tu pantalla no pierde el "
"tiempo.\n"
"    \"Así que has dado la cara. Casi esperaba que huyeras y te escondieras. "
"Pero no importa\". Intentas no mostrar ninguna reacción ante su gélida "
"mirada. Continúa."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Terrorist, I'd bet you think this latest act of yours is a victory for "
"you. Perhaps, for now, it is. But I assure you that the Empire will not "
"ignore your activities any longer. I have already sent word to the Emperor, "
"and he has authorized a declaration of your organization, the FLF, as an "
"enemy of the Empire. Count the minutes on your fingers, terrorist. Your days "
"are numbered.\"\n"
"   The Empire officer then immediately ceases communication, and you "
"suddenly feel a chill down your spine. But one of your wingmates snaps you "
"out of it. \"Pay the Empire no mind,\" he says. \"More importantly, we have "
"to get out of here! We'll meet you at Sindbad.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Terrorista, apuesto a que crees que este último acto tuyo es una victoria "
"para ti. Quizás, por ahora, lo sea. Pero te aseguro que el Imperio no "
"ignorará tus actividades por más tiempo. Ya he enviado un mensaje al "
"Emperador, y él ha autorizado la declaración de tu organización, el FLF, "
"como enemigo del Imperio. Cuenta los minutos con tus dedos, terrorista. Tus "
"días están contados\".\n"
"    El oficial del Imperio interrumpe inmediatamente la comunicación, y tú "
"sientes de repente un escalofrío en la columna vertebral. Pero uno de tus "
"compañeros de ala te saca de dudas. \"No hagas caso al Imperio\", dice. \"Lo "
"más importante es que tenemos que salir de aquí. Nos encontraremos en "
"Sindbad.\""

msgid "Victory on the Horizon"
msgstr "Victoria en el Horizonte"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As you return to the base, you are welcomed with all manner of cheers and "
"enthusiasm. You can understand why, too; this is a huge victory for the FLF, "
"and surely just one of many victories to come. But still...\n"
"   You manage to make your way over to Benito, who is clearly pleased with "
"the outcome. \"Outstanding job!\" she says. \"That base has been a burden on "
"us for so long. Now it is gone, 100% gone! I don't think I need to tell you "
"how fantastic a triumph this is. Victory is within our grasp!\" That's when "
"all doubt is erased from your mind. She's right; so what if the Empire is "
"against you now? You exchange some more words with Benito, after which she "
"hands you your pay for a job well done and excuses herself. You, on the "
"other hand, stay behind to celebrate for a few more periods before finally "
"excusing yourself."
msgstr ""
"Cuando regresas a la base, te reciben con todo tipo de vítores y entusiasmo. "
"También puedes entender por qué; esta es una gran victoria para el FLF, y "
"seguramente sólo una de las muchas victorias que vendrán. Pero aún así...\n"
"Consigues acercarte a Benito, que está claramente satisfecha con el "
"resultado. \"¡Excelente trabajo!\", dice. \"Esa base ha sido una carga para "
"nosotros durante mucho tiempo. Ahora ha desaparecido, ¡al 100%! Creo que no "
"hace falta que te diga lo fantástico que es este triunfo. La victoria está a "
"nuestro alcance\". Es entonces cuando toda duda se borra de tu mente. Tiene "
"razón; ¿y qué pasa si el Imperio está ahora en tu contra? Intercambias "
"algunas palabras más con Benito, tras lo cual ella te entrega tu paga por el "
"trabajo bien hecho y se excusa. Tú, por el contrario, te quedas celebrando "
"unos cuantos periodos más antes de excusarte finalmente."

msgid ""
"You led the effort to destroy the hated Dvaered base, Fort Raelid, a major "
"victory for the FLF. This act led to the Empire listing you and the FLF as "
"an enemy of the Empire."
msgstr ""
"Dirigiste los esfuerzos para destruir la odiada base Dvaered, el Fuerte "
"Raelid, una gran victoria para el FLF. Este acto hizo que el Imperio os "
"incluyera a ti y a la FLF en la lista de enemigos del Imperio."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Diversion from Haleb">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>40</chance>
#. <done>Assault on Raelid</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <cond>spob.cur():reputation("FLF") &gt;= 70</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Diversion from Haleb
#.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals success_text pay_text land (overwriting main mission, TODO get rid of this hack)
msgid ""
"You receive a transmission from Benito. \"Operation successful!\" she says. "
"\"I've got your pay waiting for you back at home, so don't get yourself "
"blown up on the way back!\""
msgstr ""
"Recibe una transmisión de Benito. \"¡Operación exitosa!\", dice. \"¡Tengo tu "
"paga esperándote en casa, así que no te hagas explotar en el camino de "
"vuelta!\""

msgid ""
"When you return, Benito hands you the agreed-upon payment, after which you "
"exchange some pleasantries before parting ways once again."
msgstr ""
"Cuando vuelves, Benito te entrega el pago acordado, después de lo cual "
"intercambiáis algunas palabras de cortesía antes de despediros de nuevo."

msgid ""
"Benito looks in your direction and waves you over. It seems your services "
"are needed again."
msgstr ""
"Benito mira en tu dirección y te hace señas para que te acerques. Parece que "
"sus servicios son necesarios de nuevo."

msgid "This looks familiar..."
msgstr "Esto me resulta familiar..."

msgid ""
"Benito greets you as always. After a few pleasantries, she gets down to "
"business. \"I've been looking for you, {player}!\" she says. \"I have "
"another special diversion operation for you. This time, it's a diversion in "
"the {sys} system, so we can get some important work done in the Haleb "
"system. It's the same deal as the diversion from Raelid you did some time "
"ago.\" Aha, preparation for destruction of another Dvaered base! \"You'll be "
"paid {credits} if you accept. Would you like to help with this one?\""
msgstr ""
"Benito te saluda como siempre. Después de unas cuantas galanterías, va al "
"grano. \"¡Te he estado buscando, {player}!\", dice. \"Tengo otra operación "
"especial de distracción para ti. Esta vez se trata de una distracción en el "
"sistema {sys}, para que podamos realizar un trabajo importante en el sistema "
"Haleb. Es el mismo trato que la distracción de Raelid que hiciste hace un "
"tiempo\". Aha, ¡preparación para la destrucción de otra base Dvaered! \"Se "
"te pagarán {credits} si aceptas. ¿Te gustaría ayudar con este?\""

msgid ""
"Benito grins. \"I knew you would want to do it. As always, the team will be "
"waiting for a chance to do their work and hail you when they finish. Good "
"luck, not like a pilot as great as you needs it!\" You grin, and Benito "
"excuses herself. Time to cause some mayhem again!"
msgstr ""
"Benito sonríe. \"Sabía que querrías hacerlo. Como siempre, el equipo estará "
"esperando una oportunidad para hacer tu trabajo y te llamarán cuando "
"terminen. Buena suerte, ¡no como la necesita un piloto tan grande como tú!"
"\". Sonríes, y Benito se excusa. ¡Es hora de volver a causar un poco de caos!"

msgid "Diversion from Haleb"
msgstr "Distracción de Haleb"

msgid ""
"A covert operation is being conducted in Haleb. You are to create a "
"diversion from this operation by wreaking havoc in the nearby {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Se está llevando a cabo una operación encubierta en Haleb. Debes crear una "
"distracción de esta operación causando estragos en el sistema {sys} cercano."

msgid ""
"You diverted Dvaered forces away from Haleb so that other FLF agents could "
"complete an important operation there, most likely planting a bomb on "
"another Dvaered base."
msgstr ""
"Distrae las fuerzas Dvaered lejos de Haleb para que otros agentes del FLF "
"pudieran completar una importante operación allí, probablemente colocando "
"una bomba en otra base Dvaered."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Alliance of Inconvenience">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <done>Diversion from Haleb</done>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Save the Frontier</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Alliance of Inconvenience
#.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals pay_text misn_title setDescription land_flf (inherited from mission above, TODO get rid of this hack)
msgid ""
"Upon your return, Benito seems pleased to hear that the mission was "
"successful. \"Excellent,\" she says. \"It's kind of an annoying detour, I "
"know, but I appreciate your help very much. I'll try to have a better "
"mission for you next time, eh?\" You both grin and exchange some "
"pleasantries before parting ways."
msgstr ""
"A su regreso, Benito parece alegrarse de saber que la misión ha sido un "
"éxito. \"Excelente\", dice. \"Es un desvío algo molesto, lo sé, pero "
"agradezco mucho tu ayuda. Intentaré tener una misión mejor para ti la "
"próxima vez, ¿eh?\". Los dos sonreís y os intercambiáis algunas palabras de "
"cortesía antes de separaros."

msgid ""
"Benito is shuffling around papers and overall appearing a bit stressed. "
"Perhaps you should see what is the matter."
msgstr ""
"Benito está revolviendo papeles y en general parece un poco estresado. Tal "
"vez debería ver qué le pasa."

msgid "Inconvenient happenings"
msgstr "Acontecimientos incómodos"

msgid ""
"Benito glances up and immediately looks relieved to see you. It seems she "
"has a problem she's dealing with. \"Well met, {player},\" she says. \"I've "
"just been thinking of how to deal with a problem for a while now, and, "
"seeing you, that makes the solution so much simpler! Can you help me? It's "
"nothing too huge, just destroying some more ships. We're prepared to give "
"you {credits} in exchange.\""
msgstr ""
"Benito levanta la vista e inmediatamente parece aliviado de verte. Parece "
"que tiene un problema con el que lidiar. \"Bien visto, {player}\", dice. "
"\"Llevo un rato pensando en cómo solucionar un problema y, al verte, ¡la "
"solución es mucho más sencilla! ¿Puedes ayudarme? No es nada demasiado "
"grande, sólo destruir algunas naves más. Estamos dispuestos a darte "
"{credits} a cambio.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Thanks! As always, you're a life saver. Well, for us, that is.\" Benito "
"smirks before continuing. \"See, a few pirates have decided to be "
"opportunistic, going against the clans we are allied with, and attacking our "
"ships. Now, we expected this to happen at some point, but this puts us in an "
"annoying pickle: we need to dispatch the aggressors, which the pirate clans "
"have already agreed is perfectly acceptable, but we can't go diverting our "
"forces from more important tasks to fight rogue pirates. So that's where you "
"come in: I need you to go to the {sys} system and dispatch this group of "
"pirates that's causing us trouble. Like I said, the clans are okay with it, "
"so you won't get into trouble with the pirates as a whole.\"\n"
"   Fighting pirates, huh? This sounds like it'll be almost like old times, "
"before you joined the FLF. Interesting. Well, it's about time to get going, "
"then."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias! Como siempre, eres un salvavidas. Bueno, para nosotros, eso "
"es\". Benito sonríe antes de continuar. \"Verás, unos cuantos piratas han "
"decidido ser oportunistas, yendo en contra de los clanes con los que estamos "
"aliados, y atacando nuestras naves. Ahora bien, esperábamos que esto "
"ocurriera en algún momento, pero esto nos pone en un molesto aprieto: "
"tenemos que despachar a los agresores, lo que los clanes piratas ya han "
"acordado que es perfectamente aceptable, pero no podemos ir desviando "
"nuestras fuerzas de tareas más importantes para luchar contra los piratas "
"renegados. Así que ahí es donde entras tú: Necesito que vayas al sistema "
"{sys} y despaches a este grupo de piratas que nos está causando problemas. "
"Como he dicho, los clanes están de acuerdo, así que no te meterás en "
"problemas con los piratas en general\".\n"
"    Luchar contra los piratas, ¿eh? Esto suena como si fuera casi como en "
"los viejos tiempos, antes de que te unieras a la FLF. Interesante. Bueno, ya "
"es hora de ponerse en marcha, entonces."

#. Set mission details
msgid "Pirate Disturbance"
msgstr "Molestia Pirata"

msgid "Attack Fort Raglan until it is destroyed"
msgstr "Atacar al Fuerte Raglan hasta destruirlo"

msgid "Here we go again"
msgstr "Aquí vamos de nuevo"

msgid ""
"\"{player}, we were just saying you should join in on this one! It's another "
"great assault against the Dvaered oppressors, and we'd like you to lead the "
"way to victory once again! Are you in?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{player}, ¡decíamos que deberías unirte a esta! Es otro gran asalto contra "
"los opresores Dvaered, ¡y nos gustaría que lideraras el camino a la victoria "
"una vez más! ¿Te apuntas?\""

msgid "Another Decisive Strike"
msgstr "Otro Golpe Decisivo"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Excellent!\" You take a seat. \"So once again, our mission today is the "
"destruction of a loathed Dvaered base: Fort Raglan! The plan is pretty much "
"the same as before: we have tasked a group of pirates with creating a "
"disturbance nearby, and we have planted a bomb within the outpost to aid in "
"its destruction. You just need to decide when to strike and let your "
"teammates know.\n"
"   The one thing that will be different, though, is that you're likely to "
"find more Dvaered ships guarding Fort Raglan compared to Fort Raelid, and it "
"might be a little harder to destroy. So be extra careful!\" Time to get your "
"ship ready for battle, then."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Excelente!\" Toma asiento. \"Así que una vez más, nuestra misión de hoy "
"es la destrucción de una base Dvaered detestable: ¡El Fuerte Raglan! El plan "
"es más o menos el mismo que antes: hemos encargado a un grupo de piratas que "
"creen una perturbación en las cercanías, y hemos colocado una bomba dentro "
"del puesto de avanzada para ayudar a su destrucción. Sólo tienes que decidir "
"cuándo atacar y avisar a tus compañeros de equipo.\n"
"    La única cosa que será diferente, sin embargo, es que es probable que "
"encuentres más naves Dvaered custodiando el fuerte Raglan en comparación con "
"el fuerte Raelid, y podría ser un poco más difícil de destruir. Así que ten "
"mucho cuidado\". Es hora de preparar tu nave para la batalla, entonces."

msgid "Assault on Haleb"
msgstr "Asalto a Haleb"

msgid "Join with the other FLF pilots for the assault on Fort Raglan."
msgstr "Únete a los demás pilotos de la FLF para el asalto al Fuerte Raglan."

msgid "Another great victory against the Dvaereds"
msgstr "Otra gran victoria contra los Dvaereds"

msgid "Another Day, Another Victory"
msgstr "Otro Día, Otra Victoria"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If your comrades were happy about your success at Raelid, they are ecstatic "
"about your victory at Haleb. As you enter the station, you are met with "
"cheers from what seems to be everyone. As a result, it takes you longer than "
"usual to make it to Benito. \"Congratulations,\" she says. \"That was an "
"astounding victory, sure to set back the Dvaered oppressors substantially! "
"This is the first time we've pushed them out of Frontier space, and for "
"that, we all thank you. If you haven't noticed, you've made yourself into a "
"bit of a hero!\n"
"   \"Here is your pay, {player}. May we have another daring operation later "
"on! Down with the oppressors!\" You exchange some more words with Benito, "
"party with the others for a period or two, and then make your way back to "
"your ship for some much-needed rest."
msgstr ""
"Si tus compañeros se alegraron de tu éxito en Raelid, están extasiados por "
"tu victoria en Haleb. Cuando entras en la estación, eres recibido con "
"vítores de lo que parece ser todo el mundo. Por ello, tardas más de lo "
"habitual en llegar hasta Benito. \"Enhorabuena\", dice. \"¡Ha sido una "
"victoria asombrosa, que seguramente hará retroceder a los opresores Dvaered "
"de forma sustancial! Es la primera vez que los expulsamos del espacio de la "
"Frontera, y por ello, todos te damos las gracias. Si no lo has notado, te "
"has convertido en un héroe.\n"
"    \"Aquí está tu paga, {player}. ¡Que tengamos otra atrevida operación más "
"adelante! Abajo los opresores!\" Intercambias algunas palabras más con "
"Benito, festejas con los demás durante un par de horas y luego te diriges a "
"tu nave para un muy necesario descanso."

msgid ""
"You led the charge to destroy Fort Raglan, a source of deep penetration of "
"Dvaered forces into the Frontier. As a result, Dvaered forces have started "
"to be pushed out of Frontier space, the first time the FLF has ever done so "
"and a major victory for the Frontier."
msgstr ""
"Has liderado la carga para destruir al Fuerte Raglan, una fuente de "
"penetración profunda de las fuerzas Dvaered en la Frontera. Como resultado, "
"las fuerzas Dvaered han comenzado a ser empujadas fuera del espacio de la "
"Frontera, la primera vez que la FLF lo ha hecho y una importante victoria "
"para la Frontera."

msgid "Benito seems to be frantically searching for a pilot."
msgstr "Benito parece estar buscando frenéticamente un piloto."

msgid "The Split"
msgstr "La Escisión"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As you approach, you notice that Benito has an unusually annoyed expression. "
"But when she sees you, she calms down somewhat. \"Ah, {player}.\" She sighs. "
"\"No one is willing to take up this mission, and while I can understand it's "
"a tough one, it really has to be taken care of.\n"
"   \"See, for some reason, a group of FLF pilots has decided to turn traitor "
"on us. They're hanging around outside of Sindbad and shooting us down. They "
"need to be stopped, but no one wants to get their hands dirty killing fellow "
"FLF pilots. But they're not FLF pilots anymore! They betrayed us! Can't "
"anyone see that?\" She takes a deep breath. \"Will you do it, please? You'll "
"be paid for the service, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"Al acercarte, notas que Benito tiene una expresión inusualmente molesta. "
"Pero cuando te ve, se calma un poco. \"Ah, {player}\". Suspira. \"Nadie está "
"dispuesto a aceptar esta misión, y aunque puedo entender que es una misión "
"difícil, realmente hay que ocuparse de ella.\n"
"    \"Verás, por alguna razón, un grupo de pilotos de la FLF ha decidido "
"volverse traidor a nosotros. Están merodeando por las afueras de Sindbad y "
"disparándonos. Hay que detenerlos, pero nadie quiere ensuciarse las manos "
"matando a otros pilotos de la FLF. ¡Pero ya no son pilotos de la FLF! Nos "
"han traicionado. ¿Nadie puede ver eso?\" Respira profundamente. \"¿Lo harás, "
"por favor? Se te pagará por el servicio, por supuesto.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yes, finally!\" It's as if a massive weight has been lifted off of "
"Benito's shoulders. \"Everyone trusts you a lot, so I'm sure this will "
"convince them that, yes, killing traitors is the right thing to do. They're "
"no better than Dvaereds, or those Empire scum who started shooting at us "
"recently! Thank you for accepting the mission. Now I should at least be able "
"to get a couple more pilots to join in and help you defend our interests "
"against the traitors. Good luck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Sí, por fin!\" Es como si Benito se hubiera quitado un enorme peso de "
"encima. \"Todos confían mucho en ti, así que estoy seguro de que esto les "
"convencerá de que, sí, matar a los traidores es lo correcto. No son mejores "
"que los Dvaereds, o esa escoria del Imperio que empezó a dispararnos hace "
"poco. Gracias por aceptar la misión. Ahora al menos debería poder conseguir "
"que un par de pilotos más se unan y te ayuden a defender nuestros intereses "
"contra los traidores. ¡Buena suerte!\""

msgid "A fleet of FLF soldiers has betrayed the FLF. Destroy this fleet."
msgstr ""
"Una flota de soldados de la FLF ha traicionado a la FLF. Destruye esta flota."

msgid "Getting rid of treacherous scum"
msgstr "Deshacerse de la escoria traidora"

msgid "Rogue FLF"
msgstr "FLF Traidor"

msgid ""
"\"Ugh, this is so annoying... I understand, though. Just let me know if you "
"change your mind, okay?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ugh, esto es tan molesto... Pero lo entiendo. Sólo hazme saber si cambias "
"de opinión, ¿de acuerdo?\""

msgid ""
"Upon your return to the station, you are greeted by Benito. \"Thanks once "
"again for a job well done. I really do appreciate it. Not only have those "
"traitors been taken care of, the others have become much more open to the "
"idea that, hey, traitors are traitors and must be eliminated.\" She hands "
"you a credit chip. \"Here is your pay. Thank you again.\""
msgstr ""
"A tu regreso a la estación, te recibe Benito. \"Gracias una vez más por un "
"trabajo bien hecho. Realmente lo aprecio. No sólo te has encargado de esos "
"traidores, sino que los demás se han abierto mucho más a la idea de que, "
"oye, los traidores son traidores y deben ser eliminados.\" Te entrega una "
"ficha de crédito. \"Aquí tienes tu paga. Gracias de nuevo.\""

msgid ""
"Regrettably, some rogue FLF pilots have turned traitor, forcing you to "
"destroy them. Your action helped to assure fellow FLF pilots that "
"treacherous FLF pilots who turn on their comrades are enemies just like any "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Lamentablemente, algunos pilotos de la FLF se han vuelto traidores, lo que "
"te ha obligado a destruirlos. Tu acción ayudó a asegurar a los compañeros de "
"la FLF que los pilotos traidores de la FLF que se vuelven contra sus "
"camaradas son enemigos como cualquier otro."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="FLF Commodity Run">
#. <priority>5</priority>
#. <cond>var.peek("commodity_runs_active") == nil or var.peek("commodity_runs_active") &lt; 3</cond>
#. <chance>90</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <done_misn name="Deal with the FLF agent"/>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. FLF Commodity Delivery Mission
#.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals cargo_land commchoices (inheriting variables, TODO get rid of)
msgid "FLF: {cargo} Supply Run"
msgstr "FLF: {cargo} Carrera de suministros"

msgid ""
"There is a need to supply {pnt} with more {cargo}. Find a planet where you "
"can buy this commodity and bring as much of it back as possible."
msgstr ""
"Es necesario suministrar a {pnt} más {cargo}. Busca un planeta en el que "
"puedas comprar este producto y trae la mayor cantidad posible."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are carried out of your ship and tallied. After "
"making sure nothing was missed from your cargo hold, you are paid {credits}, "
"thanked for assisting the FLF's operations, and dismissed."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son sacados de tu nave y contados. Después de "
"asegurarse de que no se ha perdido nada de tu bodega, se te pagan {credits}, "
"se te da las gracias por ayudar a las operaciones de la FLF y se te despide."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are quickly and efficiently unloaded and "
"transported to the storage facility. The FLF officer in charge thanks you "
"with a credit chip worth {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son descargados y transportados de forma rápida "
"y eficaz al almacén. El funcionario de FLF encargado le agradece con una "
"ficha de crédito por valor de {credits}."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are unloaded from your vessel by a team of FLF "
"soldiers who are in no rush to finish, eventually delivering {credits} after "
"the number of tonnes is determined."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son descargados de tu nave por un equipo de "
"soldados de la FLF que no tienen prisa por terminar, entregándote finalmente "
"{credits} después de que se determine el número de toneladas."

msgid "FLF Supply Run"
msgstr "Carrera de Suministros FLF"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Divert the Dvaered Forces">
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>550</chance>
#. <done>Diversion from Raelid</done>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <faction>Frontier</faction>
#. <cond>not diff.isApplied( "flf_dead" )</cond>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. FLF diversion mission.
#.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals success_text pay_text (inherited by missions that require this one, TODO get rid of this hack)
msgid ""
"You receive a transmission from an FLF officer saying that the operation was "
"completed, and you can now return to the base."
msgstr ""
"Recibes una transmisión de un oficial de la FLF diciendo que la operación se "
"ha completado y que ya puedes volver a la base."

msgid ""
"The FLF officer in charge of the primary operation thanks you for your "
"contribution and hands you your pay."
msgstr ""
"El oficial de la FLF a cargo de la operación principal te agradece tu "
"contribución y te entrega tu paga."

msgid ""
"You greet the FLF officer in charge of the primary operation, who seems "
"happy that the mission was a success. You congratulate each other and the "
"officer hands you your pay."
msgstr ""
"Saludas al oficial de la FLF a cargo de la operación principal, que parece "
"contento de que la misión haya sido un éxito. Os felicitáis mutuamente y el "
"oficial te entrega tu paga."

msgid "Engage and destroy Dvaered ships to get their attention"
msgstr "Enfréntate y destruye las naves Dvaered para llamar tu atención"

#. Set mission details
msgid "FLF: Diversion in {sys}"
msgstr "FLF: Diversión en {sys}"

msgid ""
"A fleet of FLF ships will be conducting an operation against the Dvaered "
"forces. Create a diversion from this operation by wreaking havoc in the "
"nearby {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Una flota de naves de la FLF llevará a cabo una operación contra las fuerzas "
"Dvaered. Crea una distracción de esta operación causando estragos en el "
"sistema {sys} cercano."

msgid "Dvaered Small Patrol"
msgstr "Patrulla Pequeña Dvaered"

msgid "Dvaered Big Patrol"
msgstr "Patrulla Grande Dvaered"

msgid "{fleet} has warped in!"
msgstr "¡{fleet} ha llegado!"

