msgid "Gregar leaves the party"
msgstr "Gregar deja el grupo"

msgid ""
"You and Gregar step out of your airlock and onto Sindbad. You are greeted by "
"a group of five or six FLF soldiers. They seem relieved to see Gregar, but "
"they clearly regard you with distrust. You are taken to meet with a senior "
"officer of the base. Gregar doesn't come with you, as he seems to have "
"urgent matters to attend to - away from prying ears like your own.\n"
"   \"Alright, {player},\" the officer begins. \"I don't know who you are or "
"what you think you're doing here, but you shouldn't kid yourself. The only "
"reason you are in my office and not in a holding cell is because one of my "
"trusted colleagues is vouching for you.\" The officer leans a little closer "
"to you and pins you with a level stare. \"I don't think you're a Dvaered "
"spy. The Dvaered don't have the wit to pull off decent espionage. But you "
"shouldn't get any ideas of running to the Dvaered and blabbing about our "
"presence here. They're neither a trusting nor a grateful sort, so they'd "
"probably just arrest you and torture you for what you know. So, I trust you "
"understand that your discretion is in both our interests.\""
msgstr ""
"Gregar y tú salís de la esclusa y entráis en el Sindbad. Os recibe un grupo "
"de cinco o seis soldados de la FLF. Parecen aliviados de ver a Gregar, pero "
"te miran claramente con desconfianza. Te llevan a reunirte con un oficial "
"superior de la base. Gregar no te acompaña, ya que parece tener asuntos "
"urgentes que atender, lejos de oídos indiscretos como los tuyos.\n"
"    \"Muy bien, {player}\", comienza el oficial. \"No sé quién eres ni qué "
"crees que haces aquí, pero no deberías engañarte. La única razón por la que "
"estás en mi despacho y no en una celda es porque uno de mis colegas de "
"confianza responde por ti\". El oficial se inclina un poco más hacia ti y te "
"mira fijamente. \"No creo que seas un espía de los Dvaered. Los Dvaered no "
"tienen el ingenio necesario para realizar un espionaje decente. Pero no se "
"te ocurra ir corriendo a los Dvaered a contarles nuestra presencia aquí. No "
"son ni confiados ni agradecidos, así que probablemente te arrestarían y te "
"torturarían por lo que sabes. Así que, confío en que entiendas que tu "
"discreción nos beneficia a ambos.\""

msgid ""
"The moment of tension passes, and the officer leans back in his chair.\n"
"   \"That threat delivered, I should at least extend my gratitude for "
"helping one of ours in his time of need, though you had no reason to do so. "
"That's why I will allow you to move freely on this station, at least to some "
"extent, and I will allow you to leave when you please, as well as to return "
"if you see the need. Who knows, maybe if you hit it off with the personnel "
"stationed here, we might even come to consider you a friend.\"\n"
"   You exchange a few more polite words with the officer, then leave his "
"office. As you head back to your ship, you consider your position. You have "
"gained access to a centre of FLF activity. Should you want to make an enemy "
"of House Dvaered, perhaps this would be a good place to start..."
msgstr ""
"El momento de tensión pasa y el oficial se reclina en su silla.\n"
"\" Dicha la amenaza, debería al menos extender mi gratitud por haber ayudado "
"a uno de los nuestros en su momento de necesidad, aunque no tenías ninguna "
"razón para hacerlo. Por eso te permitiré moverte libremente por esta "
"estación, al menos hasta cierto punto, y te permitiré salir cuando te "
"plazca, así como volver si lo ves necesario. Quién sabe, tal vez si haces "
"buenas migas con el personal destinado aquí, incluso podríamos llegar a "
"considerarte un amigo\".\n"
"    Intercambias unas cuantas palabras más de cortesía con el oficial y "
"sales de su despacho. Mientras regresas a tu nave, consideras tu posición. "
"Has accedido a un centro de actividad de la FLF. Si quieres enemistarte con "
"la Casa Dvaered, quizás este sea un buen lugar para empezar..."

msgid ""
"You helped escort FLF Lt. Gregar Fletcher to the secret FLF base, Sindbad. "
"This has earned you a small level of trust from the FLF and enabled you to "
"freely access the FLF base."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a escoltar al Teniente Gregar Fletcher de la FLF a la base "
"secreta de la FLF, Sindbad. Esto te ha hecho ganar un pequeño nivel de "
"confianza por parte de la FLF y te ha permitido acceder libremente a la base "
"de la FLF."

#. Case Dvaered planet
msgid "An opportunity to uphold the law"
msgstr "Una oportunidad para defender la ley"

msgid ""
"You have arrived at a Dvaered controlled world, and you are harbouring a FLF "
"fugitive on your ship. Fortunately, Gregar is still asleep. You could choose "
"to alert the authorities and turn him in, and possibly collect a reward.\n"
"   Would you like to do so?"
msgstr ""
"Has llegado a un mundo controlado por Dvaered, y estás albergando a un "
"fugitivo del FLF en tu nave. Afortunadamente, Gregar sigue dormido. Podrías "
"optar por alertar a las autoridades y entregarlo, y posiblemente cobrar una "
"recompensa.\n"
"    ¿Te gustaría hacerlo?"

msgid "Another criminal caught"
msgstr "Otro delincuente capturado"

msgid ""
"It doesn't take Dvaered security long to arrive at your landing bay. They "
"board your ship, seize Gregar, and take him away before he even comprehends "
"what's going on.\n"
"   \"You have served House Dvaered adequately, citizen,\" the stone-faced "
"captain of the security detail tells you. \"In recognition of your service, "
"we may allow you to participate in other operations regarding the FLF "
"terrorists. If you have further questions, direct them to our public liaison."
"\"\n"
"   The officer turns and leaves without waiting for an answer, and without "
"rewarding you in any tangible way. You wonder if you should scout out this "
"liaison, in hopes of at least getting something out of this whole situation."
msgstr ""
"La seguridad Dvaered no tarda en llegar a tu muelle de aterrizaje. Abordan "
"tu nave, cogen a Gregar y se lo llevan antes de que comprendas lo que está "
"pasando.\n"
"    \"Has servido adecuadamente a la Casa Dvaered, ciudadano\", te dice el "
"capitán de la seguridad con cara de piedra. \"En reconocimiento a tu "
"servicio, podemos permitirte participar en otras operaciones relacionadas "
"con los terroristas del FLF. Si tiene más preguntas, diríjalas a nuestro "
"enlace público\".\n"
"    El oficial se da la vuelta y se marcha sin esperar una respuesta, y sin "
"recompensarte de ninguna manera tangible. Te preguntas si deberías explorar "
"este enlace, con la esperanza de al menos sacar algo de toda esta situación."

msgid ""
"You turned in FLF Lt. Gregar Fletcher to Dvaered authorities. The Dvaered "
"captain who took him off your hands said that you could join in on a "
"campaign against the FLF terrorists; you can direct questions to a Dvaered "
"public liaison. You may want to scout out this liaison."
msgstr ""
"Entregaste al teniente del FLF Gregar Fletcher a las autoridades Dvaered. El "
"capitán Dvaered que te lo quitó de las manos dijo que podías unirte a una "
"campaña contra los terroristas del FLF; puedes dirigir tus preguntas a un "
"enlace público Dvaered. Es posible que quieras explorar este contacto."

msgid ""
"Nothing personal, mate, but we're expecting someone and you ain't him. No "
"witnesses!"
msgstr ""
"No es nada personal, amigo, pero estamos esperando a alguien y tú no eres "
"él. ¡No hay testigos!"

#. Gregar wakes up and calls off the FLF attackers. They agree to guide you to their hidden base.
#. If the player has destroyed the FLF ships, nothing happens and a flag is set. In this case, the player can only do the Dvaered side of the mini-campaign.
#. Prevents failure if ALL the ships are dead.
msgid "Gregar puts an end to hostilities"
msgstr "Gregar pone fin a las hostilidades"

msgid ""
"\"Wha- hey! What's going on!\"\n"
"   You were too busy dodging incoming fire, rebalancing your shields, and "
"generally trying to kill your attackers before they kill you to notice that "
"Gregar, your passenger, has roused from his slumber. Clearly the noise and "
"the rocking have jolted him awake. You snap at him not to distract you from "
"this fight, but he desperately interrupts.\n"
"   \"These guys are my contacts, my friends! I was supposed to meet them "
"here! Oh crap, this is not good. I didn't realize I'd be out this long! "
"Look, I need to use your comm array right now. Trust me!\"\n"
"   Before you have a chance to ask him what he thinks he's doing, Gregar "
"begins tuning your communications array, and soon finds the frequency he "
"wants.\n"
"   \"FLF sentinel formation, this is Lt. Gregar Fletcher, authorization code "
"six-six-niner-four-seven-Gamma-Foxtrot! Cease fire, I repeat, cease fire!\" "
"He then turns to you. \"Same to you. Stop shooting. This is a "
"misunderstanding, they're not your enemies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué...? ¡Oye! ¿Qué está pasando?\"\n"
"    Estabas demasiado ocupado esquivando el fuego entrante, reequilibrando "
"tus escudos y, en general, intentando matar a tus atacantes antes de que "
"ellos te maten a ti, como para darte cuenta de que Gregar, tu pasajero, se "
"ha despertado de su sueño. Está claro que el ruido y el balanceo le han "
"despertado. Le gritas que no te distraiga del combate, pero él te interrumpe "
"desesperadamente.\n"
"    \"¡Estos tipos son mis contactos, mis amigos! ¡Se suponía que iba a "
"encontrarme con ellos aquí! Oh, mierda, esto no es bueno. ¡No me di cuenta "
"de que iba a estar fuera tanto tiempo! Mira, necesito usar tu matriz de "
"comunicaciones ahora mismo. Confía en mí\".\n"
"    Antes de que tengas la oportunidad de preguntarle qué cree que está "
"haciendo, Gregar empieza a sintonizar tu matriz de comunicaciones, y pronto "
"encuentra la frecuencia que quiere.\n"
"\"¡Formación centinela FLF, aquí el Teniente Gregar Fletcher, código de "
"autorización seis-seis-nueve-cuatro-siete-Gamma-Foxtrot! ¡Alto el fuego, "
"repito, alto el fuego!\" Luego se dirige a ti. \"Lo mismo para ti. Deja de "
"disparar. Esto es un malentendido, no son tus enemigos.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are sceptical at first, but a few seconds later it becomes apparent that "
"the FLF fighters have indeed ceased firing. Then, there is an incoming comm "
"from the lead ship.\n"
"   \"This is FLF sentinel Alpha. Lt. Fletcher, authorization code verified. "
"Why are you with that civilian? Where is your ship? And why didn't you "
"contact us right away?\"\n"
"   \"Apologies, Alpha. It's a long story. For now, let me just tell you that "
"you can trust the pilot of this ship. This pilot kindly helped me out of a "
"desperate situation, and without that help I probably would never have "
"returned alive. Request you escort us to Sindbad.\"\n"
"   \"Copy that Lt. Fletcher.\" Alpha then addresses you. \"Please follow us. "
"We will guide you to our base. Stay close. Sensor range is lousy in these "
"parts, and if you get separated from us, we won't be able to find you again, "
"and you won't be able to find us or our base.\"\n"
"   With that, Alpha breaks the connection. It seems you have little choice "
"but to do as he says if you ever want to take Gregar to his destination."
msgstr ""
"Al principio se muestra escéptico, pero unos segundos después se hace "
"evidente que los cazas FLF han dejado de disparar. Entonces, hay una "
"comunicación entrante desde la nave líder.\n"
"    \"Aquí centinela FLF Alfa. Teniente Fletcher, código de autorización "
"verificado. ¿Por qué está con ese civil? ¿Dónde está su nave? ¿Y por qué no "
"contactó con nosotros de inmediato?\"\n"
"    \"Mis disculpas, Alfa. Es una larga historia. Por ahora, déjame decirte "
"que puedes confiar en el piloto de esta nave. Este piloto me ayudó "
"amablemente a salir de una situación desesperada, y sin esa ayuda "
"probablemente nunca habría vuelto con vida. Solicito que nos escolte hasta "
"Sindbad\".\n"
"\"Recibido, Teniente Fletcher\". Alpha se dirige entonces a usted. \"Por "
"favor, sígannos. Les guiaremos hasta nuestra base. Manténgase cerca. El "
"alcance de los sensores es pésimo en estos lugares, y si se separan de "
"nosotros, no podremos encontrarlos de nuevo, y ustedes no podrán "
"encontrarnos a nosotros ni a nuestra base.\"\n"
"    Con eso, Alfa rompe la conexión. Parece que no tienes más remedio que "
"hacer lo que dice si quieres llevar a Gregar a su destino."

msgid "Follow the FLF ships to their secret base. Do not lose them!"
msgstr "Sigue a las naves de la FLF hasta su base secreta. ¡No los pierdas!"

