msgid "You have lost contact with your escorts!"
msgstr "¡Has perdido el contacto con tus escoltas!"

msgid ""
"Your escorts have disappeared from your sensor grid. Unfortunately, it seems "
"you have no way of knowing where they went.\n"
"   You notice that Gregar has disappeared from your cockpit. You search "
"around your ship, but he's nowhere to be found. Seeing no other option, you "
"give up on your search. Perhaps he'll turn up somewhere later."
msgstr ""
"Tus escoltas han desaparecido de tu red de sensores. Desgraciadamente, "
"parece que no tienes forma de saber dónde han ido.\n"
"    Te das cuenta de que Gregar ha desaparecido de tu cabina. Buscas "
"alrededor de tu nave, pero no está en ninguna parte. Al no ver otra opción, "
"abandonas la búsqueda. Tal vez aparezca en algún lugar más tarde."

msgid "Return to the FLF base"
msgstr "Regresa a la base FLF"

msgid "FLF petty officer"
msgstr "Suboficial del FLF"

msgid ""
"There is a low-ranking officer of the Frontier Liberation Front sitting at "
"one of the tables. She seems somewhat more receptive than most people in the "
"bar."
msgstr ""
"Hay una oficial de bajo rango del Frente de Liberación de la Frontera "
"sentada en una de las mesas. Parece algo más receptiva que la mayoría de la "
"gente del bar."

msgid "A chance to prove yourself"
msgstr "Una oportunidad para probarte"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The FLF officer doesn't seem at all surprised that you approached her. On "
"the contrary, she looks like she expected you to do so all along.\n"
"   \"Greetings,\" she says, nodding at you in curt greeting. \"I am Corporal "
"Benito. And you must be {player}, the one who got Lt. Fletcher back here in "
"one piece.\" Benito's expression becomes a little more severe. \"I'm not "
"here to exchange pleasantries, however. You probably noticed, but people "
"here are a little uneasy about your presence. They don't know what to make "
"of you, see. You helped us once, it is true, but that doesn't tell us much. "
"We don't know you.\""
msgstr ""
"La funcionaria del FLF no parece en absoluto sorprendida de que te hayas "
"acercado a ella. Al contrario, parece que esperaba que lo hicieras desde el "
"principio.\n"
"    \"Saludos\", dice, asintiendo con la cabeza a modo de saludo. \"Soy la "
"Cabo Benito. Y tú debes ser {player}, el que trajo al teniente Fletcher de "
"vuelta aquí de una pieza\". La expresión de Benito se vuelve un poco más "
"severa. \"Sin embargo, no estoy aquí para intercambiar bromas. Seguramente "
"lo habrás notado, pero la gente de aquí está un poco incómoda con tu "
"presencia. No saben qué hacer contigo. Es cierto que nos ayudaste una vez, "
"pero eso no nos dice mucho. No te conocemos.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Indeed, you are constantly aware of the furtive glances the other people in "
"this bar are giving you. They don't seem outright hostile, but you can tell "
"that if you don't watch your step and choose your words carefully, things "
"might quickly take a turn for the worse.\n"
"   Benito waves her hand to indicate you needn't pay them any heed. \"That "
"said, the upper ranks have decided that if you are truly sympathetic to our "
"cause, you will be given an opportunity to prove yourself. Of course, if "
"you'd rather not get involved in our struggle, that's understandable. But if "
"you're in for greater things, if you stand for justice... Perhaps you'll "
"consider joining with us?\""
msgstr ""
"De hecho, eres consciente en todo momento de las miradas furtivas que te "
"dirigen las demás personas de este bar. No parecen abiertamente hostiles, "
"pero te das cuenta de que si no te andas con cuidado y eliges bien tus "
"palabras, las cosas podrían empeorar rápidamente.\n"
"    Benito hace un gesto con la mano para indicarte que no les hagas caso. "
"\"Dicho esto, los rangos superiores han decidido que si realmente simpatizas "
"con nuestra causa, se te dará la oportunidad de demostrar tu valía. Por "
"supuesto, si prefieres no involucrarte en nuestra lucha, es comprensible. "
"Pero si estás por cosas mayores, si defiendes la justicia... ¿Quizás "
"consideres unirte a nosotros?\""

msgid "Patrol-B-gone"
msgstr "Patrulla-B-desaparecida"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I'm happy to hear that. It's good to know we still have the support from "
"the common pilot. Anyway, let me fill you in on what it is we want you to "
"do. As you may be aware, the Dvaered have committed a lot of resources to "
"finding us and flushing us out lately. And while our base is well hidden, "
"those constant patrols are certainly not doing anything to make us feel more "
"secure! I think you can see where this is going. You will go out there and "
"eliminate one of those patrols in the {sys} system.\"\n"
"   You object, asking the Corporal if all recruits have to undertake "
"dangerous missions like this to be accepted into the FLF ranks. Benito "
"chuckles and makes a pacifying gesture.\n"
"   \"Calm down, it's not as bad as it sounds. You only have to take out one "
"small patrol; I don't think you will have to fight more than 3 ships, 4 if "
"you're really unlucky. If you think that's too much for you, you can abort "
"the mission for now and come to me again later. Otherwise, good luck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegra oírlo. Es bueno saber que todavía tenemos el apoyo del piloto "
"común. De todos modos, déjame ponerte al corriente de lo que queremos que "
"hagas. Como ya sabrás, los Dvaered han destinado muchos recursos a "
"encontrarnos y hacernos salir últimamente. Y aunque nuestra base está bien "
"escondida, esas patrullas constantes no están haciendo nada para que nos "
"sintamos más seguros. Creo que puedes ver a dónde va esto. Saldrás y "
"eliminarás una de esas patrullas en el sistema {sys}\".\n"
"    Te opones, preguntando al Cabo si todos los reclutas tienen que realizar "
"misiones peligrosas como ésta para ser aceptados en las filas de la FLF. "
"Benito se ríe y hace un gesto pacificador.\n"
"    \"Tranquilo, no es tan malo como parece. Sólo tienes que acabar con una "
"pequeña patrulla; no creo que tengas que luchar contra más de 3 naves, 4 si "
"tienes muy mala suerte. Si crees que es demasiado para ti, puedes abortar la "
"misión por ahora y volver a buscarme más tarde. Si no, ¡buena suerte!\""

msgid ""
"To prove yourself to the FLF, you must take out one of the Dvaered security "
"patrols."
msgstr ""
"Para probarte a ti mismo ante el FLF, debes acabar con una de las patrullas "
"de seguridad Dvaered."

msgid "FLF: Small Dvaered Patrol in {sys}"
msgstr "FLF: Patrulla Dvaered Pequeña en {sys}"

msgid "A chance to make friends with the FLF."
msgstr "Una oportunidad para hacer amigos con la FLF."

msgid "Some other time perhaps"
msgstr "Tal vez en otro momento"

msgid ""
"\"I see. That's a fair answer, I'm sure you have your reasons. But if you "
"ever change your mind, I'll be around on Sindbad. You won't have trouble "
"finding me, I'm sure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Es una respuesta justa, estoy seguro de que tienes tus razones. "
"Pero si alguna vez cambias de opinión, estaré por aquí en Sindbad. No "
"tendrás problemas para encontrarme, estoy seguro.\""

#. Check for defection possibility
msgid "A tempting offer"
msgstr "Una oferta tentadora"

msgid ""
"Your viewscreen shows a Dvaered Colonel. He looks tense. Normally, a tense "
"Dvaered would be bad news, but then this one bothered to hail you in the "
"heat of battle, so perhaps there is more here than meets the eye."
msgstr ""
"Tu pantalla muestra a un Coronel Dvaered. Parece tenso. Normalmente, un "
"Dvaered tenso sería una mala noticia, pero este se molestó en llamarte en el "
"fragor de la batalla, así que quizás haya más de lo que parece."

msgid ""
"\"I am Colonel Urnus of the Dvaered Fleet, anti-terrorism division. I would "
"normally never contact an enemy of House Dvaered, but my intelligence "
"officer has looked through our records and found that you were recently a "
"law-abiding citizen, doing honest freelance missions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Soy el Coronel Urnus de la Flota Dvaered, división antiterrorista. "
"Normalmente nunca me pondría en contacto con un enemigo de la Casa Dvaered, "
"pero mi oficial de inteligencia ha revisado nuestros registros y ha "
"descubierto que recientemente eras un ciudadano respetuoso con la ley, que "
"realizaba honradas misiones por libre.\""

msgid ""
"\"I know your type, {player}. You take jobs where profit is to be had, and "
"you side with the highest bidder. There are many like you in the galaxy, "
"though admittedly not so many with your talent. That's why I'm willing to "
"make you this offer: you will provide us with information on the FLF's base "
"of operations and their combat strength. In return, I will convince my "
"superiors that you were working for me all along, so you won't face any "
"repercussions for assaulting Dvaered ships. Furthermore, I will transfer a "
"considerable amount of credits in your account, as well as put you into a "
"position to make an ally out of House Dvaered. If you refuse, however, I "
"guarantee you that you will never again be safe in Dvaered space. What say "
"you? Surely this proposition beats anything that rabble can do for you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Conozco tu tipo, {player}. Aceptas los trabajos en los que hay beneficios "
"y te pones del lado del mejor postor. Hay muchos como tú en la galaxia, "
"aunque hay que reconocer que no hay muchos con tu talento. Por eso estoy "
"dispuesto a hacerte esta oferta: nos proporcionarás información sobre la "
"base de operaciones del FLF y su fuerza de combate. A cambio, convenceré a "
"mis superiores de que has estado trabajando para mí todo el tiempo, por lo "
"que no te enfrentarás a ninguna repercusión por asaltar las naves de "
"Dvaered. Además, transferiré una cantidad considerable de créditos en tu "
"cuenta, así como te pondré en posición de hacerte un aliado de la Casa "
"Dvaered. Sin embargo, si te niegas, te garantizo que nunca más estarás a "
"salvo en el espacio Dvaered. ¿Qué dices? Seguro que esta propuesta es mejor "
"que cualquier cosa que la chusma pueda hacer por ti.\""

msgid "Remain loyal to the FLF"
msgstr "Permanece leal a la FLF"

msgid "Opportunism is an art"
msgstr "El oportunismo es un arte"

msgid ""
"Colonel Urnus smiles broadly. \"I knew you'd make the right choice, citizen!"
"\" He addresses someone on his bridge, out of the view of the camera. "
"\"Notify the flight group. This ship is now friendly. Cease fire.\" Then he "
"turns back to you. \"Proceed to {pnt} in the {sys} system, citizen. I will "
"personally meet you there.\""
msgstr ""
"El coronel Urnus sonríe ampliamente. \"¡Sabía que tomarías la decisión "
"correcta, ciudadano!\" Se dirige a alguien en su puente, fuera de la vista "
"de la cámara. \"Avisa al grupo de vuelo. Esta nave es ahora amistosa. Cesen "
"el fuego\". Luego se vuelve hacia ti. \"Proceda a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}, "
"ciudadano. Me reuniré personalmente con usted allí.\""

msgid "Fly to the {sys} system and land on {pnt}"
msgstr "Vuela al sistema {sys} y aterriza en {pnt}"

msgid "End of negotiations"
msgstr "Fin de las Negociaciones"

msgid ""
"Colonel Urnus is visibly annoyed by your response. \"Very well then,\" he "
"bites at you. \"In that case you will be destroyed along with the rest of "
"that terrorist scum. Helm, full speed ahead! All batteries, fire at will!\""
msgstr ""
"El Coronel Urnus está visiblemente molesto por tu respuesta. \"Muy bien "
"entonces\", te suelta. \"En ese caso serás destruido junto con el resto de "
"esa escoria terrorista. Timón, ¡a toda velocidad! Todas las baterías, ¡fuego "
"a discreción!\""

msgid "We have your back, {player}!"
msgstr "¡Te cubrimos la espalda, {player}!"

msgid "{player} is selling us out! Eliminate the traitor!"
msgstr "¡{player} nos está vendiendo! ¡Eliminad al traidor!"

msgid "Let's get out of here, {player}! We'll meet you back at the base."
msgstr "¡Salgamos de aquí, {player}! Nos encontraremos en la base."

msgid "Breaking the ice"
msgstr "Rompiendo el hielo"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When you left Sindbad Station, it was a cold, lonely place for you. The FLF "
"soldiers on the station avoided you whenever they could, and basic services "
"were harder to get than they should have been.\n"
"   But now that you have returned victorious over the Dvaered, the place has "
"become considerably more hospitable. There are more smiles on people's "
"faces, and some even tell you you did a fine job. Among them is Corporal "
"Benito. She walks up to you and offers you her hand."
msgstr ""
"Cuando dejaste la Estación Sindbad, era un lugar frío y solitario para ti. "
"Los soldados de la FLF de la estación te evitaban siempre que podían, y los "
"servicios básicos eran más difíciles de conseguir de lo que deberían.\n"
"    Pero ahora que has vuelto victorioso sobre los Dvaered, el lugar se ha "
"vuelto considerablemente más hospitalario. Hay más sonrisas en los rostros "
"de la gente, y algunos incluso te dicen que has hecho un buen trabajo. Entre "
"ellos está el Cabo Benito. Se acerca a ti y te ofrece su mano."

msgid ""
"\"Welcome back, {player}, and congratulations. I didn't expect the Dvaered "
"to send reinforcements, much less a Vigilance. I certainly wouldn't have "
"sent you alone if I did, and I might not have sent you at all. But then, "
"you're still in one piece, so maybe I shouldn't worry so much, eh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bienvenido de nuevo, {player}, y enhorabuena. No esperaba que los Dvaered "
"enviaran refuerzos, y mucho menos una Vigilante. Desde luego, no te habría "
"enviado solo si lo hiciera, y puede que no te enviara en absoluto. Pero "
"bueno, sigues de una pieza, así que quizás no debería preocuparme tanto, ¿eh?"
"\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Benito takes you to the station's bar and buys you what, for lack of a "
"better word, must be called a drink.\n"
"   \"We will of course reward you for your service,\" she says once you are "
"seated. \"Though you must understand the FLF doesn't have that big a budget. "
"Financial support is tricky, and the Frontier doesn't have that much to "
"spare themselves to begin with. Nevertheless, we are willing to pay for good "
"work, and your work is nothing but. What's more, you've ingratiated yourself "
"with many of us, as you've undoubtedly noticed. Our top brass are among "
"those you've impressed, so from today on, you can call yourself one of us! "
"How about that, huh?\""
msgstr ""
"Benito te lleva al bar de la estación y te invita a lo que, a falta de una "
"palabra mejor, debe llamarse una bebida.\n"
"    \"Por supuesto que te recompensaremos por tu servicio\", dice una vez "
"que estás sentado. \"Aunque debes entender que la FLF no tiene un "
"presupuesto tan grande. El apoyo financiero es complicado y, para empezar, "
"la Frontera no dispone de mucho dinero. Sin embargo, estamos dispuestos a "
"pagar por un buen trabajo, y el tuyo es más que eso. Además, te has "
"congraciado con muchos de nosotros, como sin duda has notado. Nuestros altos "
"mandos están entre los que has impresionado, así que a partir de hoy, "
"¡puedes llamarte uno de los nuestros! ¿Qué te parece, eh?\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Of course, our work is only just beginning. No rest for the weary; we must "
"continue the fight against the oppressors. I'm sure the road is still long, "
"but I'm encouraged by the fact that we gained another valuable ally today. "
"Check the mission computer for more tasks you can help us with. Please take "
"this Pentagram of Valor as a token of appreciation. I'm sure you'll play an "
"important role in our eventual victory over the Dvaered!\"\n"
"   That last part earns a cheer from the assembled FLF soldiers. You decide "
"to raise your glass with them, making a toast to the fortune of battle in "
"the upcoming campaign - and the sweet victory that lies beyond."
msgstr ""
"\"Por supuesto, nuestro trabajo no ha hecho más que empezar. No hay descanso "
"para los cansados; debemos continuar la lucha contra los opresores. Estoy "
"seguro de que el camino es todavía largo, pero me anima el hecho de que hoy "
"hemos ganado otro valioso aliado. Comprueba en el ordenador de la misión si "
"hay más tareas en las que puedas ayudarnos. Por favor, toma este Pentagrama "
"de Valor como muestra de agradecimiento. Estoy seguro de que jugarás un "
"papel importante en nuestra eventual victoria sobre los Dvaered\".\n"
"    Esa última parte se gana una ovación de los soldados de la FLF reunidos. "
"Decides levantar tu copa con ellos, haciendo un brindis por la fortuna de la "
"batalla en la próxima campaña - y la dulce victoria que está más allá."

msgid ""
"You earned the complete trust of the FLF by eliminating a Dvaered patrol and "
"then refusing to change sides when the Dvaereds pressured you to. You can "
"now consider yourself to be one of the FLF."
msgstr ""
"Te has ganado la total confianza del FLF al eliminar una patrulla Dvaered y "
"luego negarte a cambiar de bando cuando los Dvaered te presionaron para "
"hacerlo. Ahora puedes considerarte uno de los FLF."

msgid "A reward for a job well botched"
msgstr "Una recompensa por un trabajo bien hecho"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Soon after docking, you are picked up by a couple of soldiers, who escort "
"you to Colonel Urnus's office. Urnus greets you warmly, and offers you a "
"seat and a cigar. You take the former, not the latter.\n"
"   \"I am most pleased with the outcome of this situation, citizen,\" Urnus "
"begins. \"To be absolutely frank with you, I was beginning to get "
"frustrated. My superiors have been breathing down my neck, demanding results "
"on those blasted FLF, but they are as slippery as eels. Just when you think "
"you've cornered them, poof! They're gone, lost in that nebula. Thick as "
"soup, that thing. I don't know how they can even find their own way home!\""
msgstr ""
"Poco después de atracar, te recogen un par de soldados, que te escoltan "
"hasta el despacho del Coronel Urnus. Urnus te saluda cordialmente y te "
"ofrece un asiento y un cigarro. Aceptas lo primero, pero no lo segundo.\n"
"    \"Estoy muy satisfecho con el resultado de esta situación, ciudadano\", "
"comienza Urnus. \"Para serle absolutamente sincero, estaba empezando a "
"frustrarme. Mis superiores me han estado presionando, exigiendo resultados "
"sobre esos malditos del FLF, pero son tan escurridizos como las anguilas. "
"Justo cuando crees que los has acorralado, ¡puf! Se van, se pierden en esa "
"nebulosa. Espesa como la sopa, esa cosa. ¡No sé cómo pueden encontrar su "
"propio camino a casa!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Urnus takes a puff of his cigar and blows out a ring of smoke. It doesn't "
"take a genius to figure out you're the best thing that's happened to him in "
"a long time.\n"
"   \"Anyway. I promised you money, status, and opportunities, and I intend "
"to make good on those promises. Your money is already in your account. Check "
"your balance later. As for status, I can assure you that no Dvaered will "
"find out what you've been up to. As far as the military machine is "
"concerned, you have nothing to do with the FLF. In fact, you're known as an "
"important ally in the fight against them! Finally, opportunities. We're "
"analysing the data from your flight recorder as we speak, and you'll be "
"asked a few questions after we're done here. Based on that, we can form a "
"new strategy against the FLF. Unless I miss my guess by a long shot, we'll "
"be moving against them in force very soon, and I will make sure you'll be "
"given the chance to be part of that. I'm sure it'll be worth your while.\""
msgstr ""
"Urnus da una calada a su cigarro y expulsa un anillo de humo. No hace falta "
"ser un genio para darse cuenta de que eres lo mejor que leñ ha pasado en "
"mucho tiempo.\n"
"    \"En fin. Te prometí dinero, estatus y oportunidades, y pienso cumplir "
"esas promesas. Tu dinero ya está en tu cuenta. Comprueba tu saldo más tarde. "
"En cuanto al estatus, puedo asegurarte que ningún Dvaered se enterará de lo "
"que has estado haciendo. En lo que respecta a la maquinaria militar, no "
"tienes nada que ver con la FLF. De hecho, eres conocido como un importante "
"aliado en la lucha contra ellos. Por último, las oportunidades. Estamos "
"analizando los datos de tu registrador de vuelo mientras hablamos, y se te "
"harán algunas preguntas cuando terminemos aquí. Basándonos en eso, podemos "
"formar una nueva estrategia contra el FLF. A menos que me equivoque por "
"mucho, nos moveremos contra ellos con fuerza muy pronto, y me aseguraré de "
"que tengas la oportunidad de formar parte de ello. Estoy seguro de que "
"valdrá la pena.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Urnus stands up, a sign that this meeting is drawing to a close. \"Keep your "
"eyes open for one of our liaisons, citizen. He'll be your ticket into the "
"upcoming battle. Now, I'm a busy man so I'm going to have to ask you to "
"leave. But I hope we'll meet again, and if you continue to build your career "
"like you have today, I'm sure we will. Good day to you!\"\n"
"   You leave the Colonel's office. You are then taken to an interrogation "
"room, where Dvaered petty officers question you politely yet persistently, "
"about your brief stay with the FLF. Once their curiosity is satisfied, they "
"let you go, and you are free to return to your ship."
msgstr ""
"Urnus se levanta, señal de que esta reunión está llegando a su fin. \"Mantén "
"los ojos abiertos para uno de nuestros enlaces, ciudadano. Será tu entrada "
"en la próxima batalla. Ahora, soy un hombre ocupado, así que voy a tener que "
"pedirte que te vayas. Pero espero que nos volvamos a encontrar, y si sigues "
"construyendo tu carrera como lo has hecho hoy, estoy seguro de que lo "
"haremos. Que tengas un buen día\".\n"
"    Abandonas el despacho del Coronel. A continuación, te llevan a una sala "
"de interrogatorios, donde los suboficiales Dvaered te interrogan de forma "
"educada pero persistente, sobre tu breve estancia en la FLF. Una vez "
"satisfecha su curiosidad, te dejan ir y eres libre de volver a tu nave."

msgid ""
"As you were conducting a mission to earn the trust of the FLF, Dvaered "
"Colonel Urnus offered you a deal: you could betray the FLF and provide "
"information on the location of the hidden FLF base in exchange for a "
"monetary reward and immunity against any punishment. You accepted the deal, "
"leading to an enraged wing of FLF pilots attacking you in retaliation. The "
"FLF terrorists were repelled, however, and Urnus told you to keep an eye out "
"for one of the Dvaered liaisons so you can join the Dvaered in the upcoming "
"mission to destroy Sindbad."
msgstr ""
"Mientras realizabas una misión para ganarte la confianza del FLF, el Coronel "
"Dvaered Urnus te ofreció un trato: podías traicionar al FLF y proporcionar "
"información sobre la ubicación de la base oculta del FLF a cambio de una "
"recompensa monetaria e inmunidad contra cualquier castigo. Aceptaste el "
"trato, lo que provocó que un ala enfurecida de pilotos del FLF te atacara en "
"represalia. Sin embargo, los terroristas del FLF fueron repelidos y Urnus te "
"dijo que estuvieras atento a uno de los enlaces de los Dvaered para que "
"pudieras unirte a ellos en la próxima misión de destruir a Sindbad."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="FLF Rehabilitation">
#. <priority>10</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("FLF") &lt; 0</cond>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <faction>Frontier</faction>
#. <faction>FLF</faction>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Rehabilitation Mission
#. --
msgid ""
"Although you have crossed the Frontier Liberation Front, the organization is "
"willing to offer a chance to redeem yourself through a significant donation. "
"If you accept, your reputation will be temporarily changed to neutral until "
"you recover all the lost standing. Any hostile action during this time "
"against the FLF will immediately void the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Aunque has traicionado al Frente de Liberación de la Frontera, la "
"organización está dispuesta a ofrecerte una oportunidad de redimirte "
"mediante una donación importante. Si aceptas, tu reputación cambiará "
"temporalmente a neutral hasta que recuperes todo el prestigio perdido. "
"Cualquier acción hostil durante este tiempo contra el FLF anulará "
"inmediatamente el acuerdo."

msgid ""
"You need to donate at least {credits} for the FLF to temporarily forgive you."
msgstr ""
"Necesitas donar al menos {credits} para que la FLF te perdone temporalmente."

msgid ""
"Thank you for supporting the FLF. Remember that any collaboration with the "
"dirty Dvaered or actions against the FLF will immediately void this "
"agreement. During this time if you gain enough standing with the FLF, your "
"past offenses will be erased from our records."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por apoyar al FLF. Recuerde que cualquier colaboración con los "
"sucios Dvaered o acciones contra la FLF anulará inmediatamente este acuerdo. "
"Durante este tiempo, si ganas suficiente prestigio con la FLF, tus ofensas "
"pasadas serán borradas de nuestros registros."

msgid ""
"You have successfully cleared past negative record with the FLF and are in "
"good standing again."
msgstr ""
"Has limpiado con éxito tu historial negativo con la FLF y estás de nuevo en "
"buena posición."

msgid ""
"You have once again crossed the FLF! The truce agreement is void and you are "
"once again in bad standing. You may do another donation to restart the "
"procedure at a later time."
msgstr ""
"Has vuelto a traicionar al FLF. El acuerdo de tregua queda anulado y vuelves "
"a estar en mala situación. Puedes hacer otra donación para reiniciar el "
"procedimiento más adelante."

#.
