#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Minerva Finale 1">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>1</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Jade Court</spob>
#. <done>Minerva Judgement</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Minerva</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Escape the Jade Court and rendezvous with the Pink Demon.
#. --
#. Assumes the trialsys -> Kobopos -> Logania systems are connected
msgid "Escape the Courts"
msgstr "Escapa de los Tribunales"

#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not accepted yet
#. 1. escape jade court
msgid "Meet up with Zuri at her hiding spot?"
msgstr "¿Reunete con Zuri en tu escondite?"

msgid ""
"A wounded Zuri needs to rendezvous with her colleagues in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Zuri herida necesita reunirse con sus colegas en el sistema {sys}."

#. Can't use flow.recalculate() because this is run while the outfit is
#. still equipped. So we just disable the internals.
#. Doesn't become active
msgid "??"
msgstr "??"

msgid ""
"You find Zuri clutching her wound in one hand and holding Kex with the "
"other. Although she's in really rough shape she flashes you a grin as you "
"approach."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zuri agarrándose la herida con una mano y sujetando a Kex con "
"la otra. Aunque está en muy mal estado, te sonríe cuando te acercas."

msgid ""
"\"Hey {player}, ready to get out of here? My colleague should be waiting for "
"us in the {sys} system.\"\n"
"She coughs a bit, and although she tries to hide it, you notice speckles of "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"\"Eh {player}, ¿preparado para salir de aquí? Mi colega debería estar "
"esperándonos en el sistema {sys}\".\n"
"Tose un poco y, aunque intenta ocultarlo, notas motas de sangre."

msgid "Save Zuri"
msgstr "Salva a Zuri"

msgid "Prepare more"
msgstr "Prepara más"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I'll be waiting.\"\n"
"She sort of slumps at the wall, you're not sure if she's still conscious."
msgstr ""
"\"Te estaré esperando.\"\n"
"Se desploma contra la pared, no sabes si sigue consciente."

msgid ""
"You manage to help get Zuri up to her feet, and begin to drag her to the "
"spaceport."
msgstr ""
"Consigues ayudar a Zuri a ponerse en pie y empiezas a arrastrarla hasta el "
"puerto espacial."

msgid ""
"With all the commotion going on the Jade Court, most of the security is "
"preoccupied and barely give you a second glance as they run around following "
"orders."
msgstr ""
"Con todo el alboroto que hay en la Corte de Jade, la mayoría de los miembros "
"de seguridad están preocupados y apenas te dedican una segunda mirada "
"mientras corren de un lado a otro siguiendo órdenes."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eventually you make it unnoticed to the spaceport and manage to sneak both "
"Zuri, who seems to be breathing very hard, and Kex into the ship. As soon as "
"you help her into a bunk bed, her body seems to lose tension as her "
"consciousness fades away."
msgstr ""
"Al final logras llegar al puerto espacial sin que nadie se dé cuenta y "
"consigues colar en la nave tanto a Zuri, que parece respirar con dificultad, "
"como a Kex. En cuanto la ayudas a instalarse en una litera, su cuerpo parece "
"perder tensión y su conciencia se desvanece."

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"Suddenly, an alarm starts blaring. It seems like the situation is getting "
"worse and the station is headed for a lock down."
msgstr ""
"De repente, empieza a sonar una alarma. Parece que la situación está "
"empeorando y la estación se encamina hacia un bloqueo."

msgid ""
"As the station gates begin to close, you deftly activate your ship, hit the "
"accelerator and aim for free space. It's a close call with the spaceport "
"almost clamping down on your ship, but you break through."
msgstr ""
"Cuando las puertas de la estación empiezan a cerrarse, activas hábilmente tu "
"nave, pisas el acelerador y apuntas al espacio libre. Por los pelos, el "
"puerto espacial casi aprisiona tu nave, pero la sobrepasas."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You almost begin to celebrate, but it seems like in a short while you won't "
"be alone anymore. There are bogeys on your tail!"
msgstr ""
"Casi empiezas a celebrarlo, pero parece que dentro de poco ya no estarás "
"solo. ¡Hay enemigos pisándote los talones!"

#. If not accepted, mem.state will still be nil
msgid "Zuri and Kex"
msgstr "Zuri y Kex"

msgid "A heavily wounded Zuri holding Kex. They are both unconscious."
msgstr ""
"Un Zuri fuertemente herido sosteniendo a Kex. Ambos están inconscientes."

msgid "Go to the {sys} system"
msgstr "Ve al sistema {sys}"

msgid "Rendezvous with Zuri's Colleague"
msgstr "Cita con un colega de Zuri"

#. Soft clearing should make things feel a bit more alive
#. No relanding
msgid "You can't land right now!"
msgstr "¡No puedes aterrizar ahora mismo!"

#. Slightly towards the system centre
#. Create blockades on all jump points except the one we want
#. Tiny blockade on the target system, player should be able to plow through
#. Just some random patrols here and there, player can stealth or brute force through
#. TODO probably too similar to pirate5 that was quite recent, maybe make it less of an overt stealth mission
#. We are nice and make the ships easier to see for this mission
#. Tell the player to f off
#. All's quiet on the front
#. Non-hostile faction
msgid "Unauthorized departure. Fleets engage {player}!"
msgstr "Salida no autorizada. ¡Las flotas se enfrentan a {player}!"

#. They will naturally go to the jump point and attack the player
#. Spam stuff every time they spawn
msgid "Engaging {player}!"
msgstr "¡Atacando {player}!"

#. They keep on coming!
msgid ""
"Following Imperial Decree ED-17838, {sys} is under lockdown for military "
"exercises. All non-affiliated personal must evacuate the system."
msgstr ""
"Siguiendo el Decreto Imperial ED-17838, {sys} está bajo bloqueo por "
"ejercicios militares. Todo el personal no afiliado debe evacuar el sistema."

msgid ""
"\"I see you made it past the patrols in {sys}. Talk about bad timing for "
"them to be doing military exercises. Luck is not in our favour.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Veo que lograste pasar las patrullas en {sys}. Hablando de mal momento "
"para que estén haciendo ejercicios militares. La suerte no está a nuestro "
"favor.\""

msgid "\"It was a drag.\""
msgstr "\"Fue una molestia.\""

msgid "\"You're Zuri's colleague?\""
msgstr "\"¿Eres colega de Zuri?\""

msgid "\"Glad to be here.\""
msgstr "\"Me alegro de estar aquí.\""

msgid "\"Come here and board and we can talk.\""
msgstr "\"Ven aquí y sube a bordo para que podamos hablar.\""

msgid "Board the {ship}"
msgstr "Aborda la {ship}"

msgid "Pirate A"
msgstr "Pirata A"

msgid "Pirate B"
msgstr "Pirata B"

msgid ""
"You dock with the {ship}, and as soon as the airlock opens, you are greeted "
"with a swarm of pirates with weapons in front of them."
msgstr ""
"Te acoplas a la {ship} y, en cuanto se abre la esclusa, te reciben un "
"enjambre de piratas con las armas apuntándote."

msgid "Throw your hands in the air."
msgstr "Pon las manos en alto."

msgid "Try to tackle the pirates."
msgstr "Intentar enfrentarte a los piratas."

msgid "Draw your weapon."
msgstr "Preparar tus armas."

#. love_audio.setEffect( "reverb_sad", reverb_preset.drugged() )
#. vn.music( minerva.loops.pirate, {pitch=0.6, effect="reverb_sad"} )
#. TODO more aggressive
msgid ""
"\"STOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOP!\"\n"
"A powerful booming voice echoes through your ship, instantly defusing the "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"\"¡QUIETOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!\"\n"
"Una potente voz retumbante resuena en tu nave, desactivando instantáneamente "
"la situación."

#. Move the pirates out of the way
msgid ""
"The pirates give way and the source of the powerful voice appears before "
"you. It's a small recognizable figure that you know quite well."
msgstr ""
"Los piratas ceden el paso y la fuente de la poderosa voz aparece ante ti. Es "
"una pequeña figura reconocible que conoces bastante bien."

msgid "\"Maikki?\""
msgstr "\"¿Maikki?\""

msgid "\"Pirate?\""
msgstr "\"¿Pirata?\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah ha ha! Surprised to see me in my true form? Never thought a Pirate Lord "
"could enjoy parfaits? Arrr!\"\n"
"She winks at you."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ah, ja, ja! ¿Te sorprende verme en mi verdadera forma? ¿Nunca pensaste "
"que un Señor Pirata pudiera disfrutar de los postres helados? Arrr!\"\n"
"Te guiña un ojo."

msgid "\"Speaking of which, where's Zuri?\""
msgstr "\"Hablando de eso, ¿dónde está Zuri?\""

msgid "\"She's seen better days.\""
msgstr "\"Ella ha visto días mejores.\""

msgid "\"She's bleeding out.\""
msgstr "\"Ella se está desangrando.\""

msgid ""
"You quickly explain the situation and Maikki quickly orders her troops to "
"pick up Zuri and Kex and take them to the infirmary aboard the {ship}, which "
"seems to be surprisingly state of the art. The pirate head surgeon quickly "
"gets Zuri prepped up and starts running analysis."
msgstr ""
"Explicas rápidamente la situación y Maikki ordena rápidamente a sus tropas "
"que recojan a Zuri y Kex y los lleven a la enfermería a bordo del {ship}, "
"que parece ser sorprendentemente de última generación. El cirujano jefe "
"pirata prepara rápidamente a Zuri y empieza a hacerle análisis."

msgid ""
"As Kex does not seem to have life threatening issues, you are left with him "
"and Maikki in the waiting room."
msgstr ""
"Como Kex no parece tener problemas vitales, te quedas con él y Maikki en la "
"sala de espera."

msgid ""
"Maikki looks fondly at Kex and speaks softly, \"Oh father, why did it have "
"to be this way?\""
msgstr ""
"Maikki mira con cariño a Kex y habla en voz baja: \"Ay, padre, ¿por qué tuvo "
"que ser así?\""

msgid "\"You knew?\""
msgstr "\"¿Lo sabías?\""

msgid "\"Father?\""
msgstr "\"¿Padre?\""

msgid ""
"She abruptly changes back to her piratey self.\n"
"\"I knew you were thick, but you're thicker than molasses!\""
msgstr ""
"Vuelve bruscamente a ser una pirata.\n"
"\"¡Sabía que eras espeso, pero eres más espeso que la melaza!\""

msgid ""
"\"The unlucky fowl is my father! Of course he wasn't always this way, but "
"you should know that better than I.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡El desgraciado es mi padre! Claro que no siempre fue así, pero tú "
"deberías saberlo mejor que yo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Just my luck to cross the entire galaxy chasing my fool of a father, and "
"when I finally find them, they've been transformed into a fowl, and, and, to "
"make things WORSE, I can't even talk to them because they seem be offline or "
"some shit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tuve la suerte de cruzar toda la galaxia persiguiendo al tonto de mi "
"padre, y cuando por fin lo encuentro, se ha transformado en un ave, y, y, "
"para empeorar las cosas, ni siquiera puedo hablar con él porque parece que "
"está desconectado o alguna mierda.\""

msgid ""
"\"What's a girl gotta do to bloody enjoy a normal family, just for ONCE!\"\n"
"She closes her eyes and rubs her temples."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Qué tiene que hacer una chica para disfrutar de una familia normal, sólo "
"por UNA VEZ!\"\n"
"Cierra los ojos y se frota las sienes."

msgid ""
"\"And Zuri, my poor, dear, Zuri, is yet again under life-saving surgery. At "
"this rate, I don't think she's going to have a single one of her original "
"organs...\""
msgstr ""
"\"Y Zuri, mi pobre, querida, Zuri, está de nuevo bajo cirugía para salvarle "
"la vida. A este paso, no creo que vaya a tener ni uno solo de sus órganos "
"originales...\""

msgid ""
"\"This whole ordeal has become quite a mess. I'm really glad I was finally "
"able to find my father, but things haven't really been going our way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo este calvario se ha convertido en un lío. Me alegro mucho de haber "
"podido encontrar por fin a mi padre, pero las cosas no han ido como "
"queríamos.\""

msgid ""
"\"At least the judge didn't assign Minerva Station to the Dvaered brutes or "
"Za'lek popsicles, however, with the current situation, I don't think it "
"helps much.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al menos el juez no asignó la estación Minerva a los brutos Dvaered o a "
"los paletos Za'lek, sin embargo, con la situación actual, no creo que ayude "
"mucho.\""

msgid ""
"\"Not to mention the bloody judge assigned Minerva Station to the damn "
"{badguys}. Not that it matters much, but it's just salting the wounds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por no mencionar que el maldito juez asignó la estación Minerva a los "
"malditos {badguys}. No es que importe mucho, pero es sólo echar sal a las "
"heridas.\""

msgid "Ask about Zuri's health"
msgstr "Preguntar por la salud de Zuri"

#. Normal chitchat
msgid "Ask about her father"
msgstr "Pregunta por su padre"

msgid "Ask about next plans (continue)"
msgstr "Preguntar por los próximos planes (continuar)"

msgid ""
"\"She's a tough cookie to crack. We've been together through much harder "
"times. Pirate doctors are second to none when it comes to experience.\"\n"
"You sense some worry and uneasiness despite the strong words."
msgstr ""
"\"Ella es una hueso duro de roer. Hemos pasado juntos momentos mucho más "
"duros. Los médicos piratas no tienen rival en cuanto a experiencia.\"\n"
"Percibes cierta preocupación e inquietud a pesar de las fuertes palabras."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"One time, we were doing your standard hit operation in Delta Pavonis, some "
"Empire Combat Bureaucrat had a bounty on their head, and I figure we might "
"as well cash in. Sources said they would be flying a Pacifier, no deal, "
"right? Turns out it was a bloody Peacemaker with a full entourage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Una vez, estábamos haciendo una operación de golpe estándar en Delta "
"Pavonis, algún Burócrata de Combate del Imperio tenía una recompensa por su "
"cabeza, y pensé que podríamos cobrarla. Las fuentes dijeron que volarían en "
"un Pacificador, ningún problema, ¿verdad? Resulta que era un maldito "
"Mediador con un séquito completo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Was about to back off when a second Peacemaker jumped in behind us. The "
"bastards set us up for a trap. With no way out, we charged the Bureaucrat "
"asshole and smashed the captain's bridge right into the fighter bay, and "
"went to fight our way through the ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estaba a punto de retroceder cuando un segundo Mediador saltó detrás de "
"nosotros. Los cabrones nos tendieron una trampa. Sin salida, cargamos contra "
"el imbécil del Burócrata y destrozamos el puente del capitán justo en la "
"bahía de cazas, y fuimos a abrirnos paso a través de la nave.\""

msgid ""
"\"While we were trying to take hold of the hangar, Zuri grabbed a bunch of "
"weapons and charged basically charged through the ship. When we found her in "
"the bridge, she had somehow managed to single-handedly cross the entire ship "
"and capture it by herself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mientras intentábamos apoderarnos del hangar, Zuri cogió un montón de "
"armas y se lanzó básicamente a la carga por toda la nave. Cuando la "
"encontramos en el puente, ¡de alguna manera se las había arreglado sola para "
"cruzar toda la nave y capturarla ella sola!\""

msgid ""
"\"Of course, she had nearly blown herself into two, and was riddled with "
"laser holes, but we were lucky that the field surgeon was with us and was "
"able to somehow stabilize her while I rammed the peacemaker into the second "
"one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por supuesto, había estado a punto de estallar en dos, y estaba "
"acribillada de agujeros de láser, pero tuvimos suerte de que el cirujano de "
"campo estuviera con nosotros y pudiera estabilizarla de algún modo mientras "
"yo embestía al segundo mediador.\""

msgid ""
"\"We ended up escaping with 17 people crammed in a Lancelot, and somehow "
"made it back to New Haven. It took Zuri nearly a cycle to recover, but then "
"she was better than ever. She's got be fine this time too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Acabamos escapando con 17 personas hacinadas en un Lancelot, y de algún "
"modo conseguimos volver a Nuevo Refugio. A Zuri le costó casi un ciclo "
"recuperarse, pero luego estuvo mejor que nunca. ¡Esta vez también tiene que "
"estar bien!\""

msgid ""
"\"He wasn't really with us when I was a child. He'd always be searching for "
"artefacts in the nebula or whatnot. But, he would have the best stories when "
"he would come back. He always was the life of the party. It's what made me "
"become a pilot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Él no estaba realmente con nosotros cuando yo era un pequeña. Siempre "
"estaba buscando artefactos en la nebulosa o lo que fuera. Pero tenía las "
"mejores historias cuando volvía. Siempre era el alma de la fiesta. Es lo que "
"me hizo convertirme en piloto.\""

msgid ""
"\"Then, one day, he didn't come back. Eaten by the Nebula, killed by "
"scavengers, taken prisoner by the Dvaered, blah blah blah. The rumours were "
"awful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Entonces, un día, no volvió. Comido por la Nebulosa, asesinado por "
"carroñeros, hecho prisionero por los Dvaered, bla bla bla. Los rumores eran "
"horribles.\""

msgid ""
"\"My mother took it really poorly, her health deteriorated fast. When she "
"died, I decided I would try to find my father and find out why he did that, "
"you know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi madre se lo tomó muy mal, su salud se deterioró rápidamente. Cuando "
"murió, decidí que intentaría encontrar a mi padre y averiguar por qué lo "
"hizo, ¿sabes?\""

msgid "\"Took me long enough, but I never expected to find him like this...\""
msgstr "\"Tardé bastante, pero nunca esperé encontrarlo así...\""

msgid ""
"\"I guess you can sort of expect that whatever plans I had are probably moot "
"at this point. Too many unknowns at this point, we should head to a haven "
"and recoup a bit. Have to figure out what happened to my father and also "
"wait until Zuri wakes up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que puedes esperar que los planes que tenía probablemente sean "
"discutibles en este momento. Demasiadas incógnitas en este momento, "
"deberíamos ir a un refugio y recuperarnos un poco. Tengo que averiguar qué "
"le pasó a mi padre y también esperar a que Zuri despierte.\""

msgid ""
"\"For now, we should get out of here, lest the Imperials come down from "
"{badsys}. I know some people at {spob} in the {sys} system. We can head "
"there for now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por ahora, debemos salir de aquí, no sea que los imperiales bajen de "
"{badsys}. Conozco a algunas personas en {spob} en el sistema {sys}. Podemos "
"dirigirnos hacia allí por ahora.\""

msgid ""
"You tell {shipai} to set your ship's autonav to follow the Pink Demon and "
"ride with Maikki to {spob}.\n"
"\n"
"During the ride, you talk with her about the entire experience up until now, "
"without missing any details of your interactions with Kex and the dealings "
"with Dr. Strangelove. She is enthralled in all talk of Kex and inquisitive "
"asking many questions the entire time while flying the ship.\n"
"\n"
"The ride is fairly smooth, surprising you with how effortlessly Maikki seems "
"to avoid patrols on the way to your destination."
msgstr ""
"Le dices a {shipai} que configure el navegador automático de tu nave para "
"seguir al Demonio Rosa y viajas con Maikki hasta {spob}.\n"
"\n"
"Durante el trayecto, hablas con ella sobre toda la experiencia vivida hasta "
"el momento, sin perder detalle de tus interacciones con Kex y los tratos con "
"el Dr. Strangelove. Ella se muestra embelesada en todo lo que se habla de "
"Kex e inquisitiva haciendo muchas preguntas todo el tiempo mientras pilota "
"la nave.\n"
"\n"
"El viaje es bastante tranquilo, sorprendiéndole la facilidad con la que "
"Maikki parece evitar las patrullas de camino a su destino."

#. Simulate the elapsed time for moving over
#. Land on the spob
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You land with Maikki on {spob} through what seems to be a hidden landing "
"pad, away from the main spaceport."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas con Makki en {spob} a través de lo que parece ser una pista de "
"aterrizaje oculta, lejos del puerto espacial principal."

msgid ""
"Despite being quite flustered with the situation, Maikki seems intent on "
"trying to manage the situation.\n"
"\"I'm going to get a full briefing and diagnostic on both Zuri and Kex. "
"Since this will take a while, meet up with me at the bar and I'll fill you "
"out with the important details.\""
msgstr ""
"A pesar de estar bastante alterada por la situación, Maikki parece decidida "
"a intentar manejar la situación.\n"
"\"Voy a hacer un informe completo y un diagnóstico tanto de Zuri como de "
"Kex. Como esto llevará un rato, reúnete conmigo en el bar y te informaré de "
"los detalles importantes.\""

#. Since it was triggered by talking to an NPC, we have to trigger the next mission so the next NPC appears
msgid ""
"You managed to rescue the wounded Zuri and unconscious Kex from {spb} and "
"bring her safely to her colleague in {safespb} who turned out to be none "
"other than Maikki, who turned out to be a Wild Ones clan Pirate Lord. You "
"synced up with Maikki on the current situation and she took you to "
"{recoupspob} in the {recoupsys} to plan on how to save both Zuri and Kex."
msgstr ""
"Conseguiste rescatar a la herida Zuri y al inconsciente Kex de {spb} y "
"llevarla sana y salva hasta su colega en {safespb}, que resultó ser nada "
"menos que Maikki, que resultó ser un Señor Pirata del clan de los Salvajes. "
"Sincronizaste con Maikki la situación actual y ella te llevó al {recoupspob} "
"en el {recoupsys} para planear cómo salvar tanto a Zuri como a Kex."

