#. --
#.
#. Final mission having to revisit and break into Minerva Station
#. --
msgid "Minerva Station Redux"
msgstr "Estación Minerva Redux"

#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not accepted yet
#. 1. Get to Minerva Station
#. 2. Infiltrated
#. 3. Finish
msgid "Maikki seems to be waiting for you in her regular clothes."
msgstr "Maikki parece estar esperándote con su ropa normal."

msgid ""
"Maikki has entrusted you with raiding the weapons laboratory at Minerva "
"Station to obtain anything that can help Kex, while also plundering anything "
"you find of value. Afterwards she has told you to meet her up at {returnspb} "
"in the {returnsys} system."
msgstr ""
"Maikki te ha encomendado que asaltes el laboratorio de armas de la estación "
"Minerva para obtener cualquier cosa que pueda ayudar a Kex, al tiempo que "
"saqueas todo lo que encuentras de valor. Después te ha dicho que te reúnas "
"con ella en {returnspb}, en el sistema {returnsys}."

msgid "Saving Kex!"
msgstr "¡Salvando a Kex!"

#. Apply diff if necessary
#. Reset when loads
msgid ""
"You join Maikki at her table. Although she has changed into her civilian "
"clothes, her composure and facial expression is quite unlike when you first "
"met her."
msgstr ""
"Te reúnes con Maikki en su mesa. Aunque se ha puesto la ropa de paisano, su "
"compostura y expresión facial son muy distintas a las de la primera vez que "
"la viste."

msgid ""
"\"I've talked with the pirate head surgeon, and there's both good news and "
"bad news.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He hablado con el cirujano jefe pirata y hay buenas y malas noticias.\""

msgid "\"Good news?\""
msgstr "\"¿Buenas noticias?\""

msgid "\"Bad news?\""
msgstr "\"¿Malas noticias?\""

#. Just change the order she says stuff in
msgid ""
"\"The good news is that Zuri is somewhat stable. It's still not clear if "
"she's going to pull it off, but we have to trust her fortitude. We'll have "
"to fly her back to get some more proper follow-up care. However, at least "
"the worst has been avoided for now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La buena noticia es que Zuri está algo estable. Aún no está claro si va a "
"salir adelante, pero tenemos que confiar en su fortaleza. Tendremos que "
"llevarla de vuelta para que le hagan un seguimiento más adecuado. Sin "
"embargo, al menos se ha evitado lo peor por ahora.\""

msgid ""
"\"The bad news is that we don't know what the deal is with my father. He "
"seems to be alive, however, the surgeon had no idea what to do. I guess this "
"is a first for them. We got a second look by the lead engineer who told us "
"that it seems like some of his circuitry was damaged.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La mala noticia es que no sabemos qué le pasa a mi padre. Parece que está "
"vivo, pero el cirujano no tiene ni idea de qué hacer. Supongo que es la "
"primera vez para ellos. El ingeniero jefe nos ha dicho que parece que "
"algunos de sus circuitos están dañados.\""

msgid ""
"\"Damn it, I should have brought my squad with me, but I erred on the side "
"of caution. How unlike me! But with Zuri and Kex's state, we're going to "
"have to take them to a proper medical facility. That doesn't mean we can "
"leave Minerva Station as it is, after all we've been through!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, debería haber traído a mi escuadrón conmigo, pero me "
"equivoqué por el lado de la precaución. No es propio de mí. Pero dado el "
"estado de Zuri y Kex, vamos a tener que llevarlos a un centro médico "
"adecuado. Eso no significa que podamos dejar la estación Minerva como está, "
"¡después de todo lo que hemos pasado!\""

msgid ""
"\"Minerva Station is going to be swarming with Dvaereds brutes in no time "
"when it gets handed over. "
msgstr ""
"\"La estación Minerva va a estar plagada de brutos Dvaereds en poco tiempo "
"cuando sea entregada. "

msgid ""
"\"Minerva Station is going to be swarming with Za'leks and their pesky "
"drones in no time when it gets handed over. "
msgstr ""
"\"La estación Minerva va a estar plagada de Za'leks y sus molestos drones en "
"poco tiempo cuando sea entregada. "

#. "independent"
msgid ""
"\"We don't know what's going to happen to the station after the trial ended "
"as it did. I wouldn't be surprised if it would be flooded with Imperials in "
"a short time. "
msgstr ""
"\"No sabemos qué va a pasar con la estación después de que el juicio acabara "
"como acabó. No me sorprendería que se inundara de imperiales en poco tiempo. "

msgid ""
"We have to infiltrate the weapons facility at the station and not only "
"plunder some nice weapon prototypes and blueprints, but now we also have to "
"see if we can find anything that can help my father! It's a bit of a long "
"shot, but it's our best bet.\""
msgstr ""
"Tenemos que infiltrarnos en las instalaciones armamentísticas de la estación "
"y no sólo saquear algunos bonitos prototipos de armas y planos, ¡sino que "
"ahora también tenemos que ver si encontramos algo que pueda ayudar a mi "
"padre! Es un poco arriesgado, pero es nuestra mejor apuesta.\""

msgid "\"Wait, you knew about the station?\""
msgstr "\"Espera, ¿sabías lo de la estación?\""

msgid "\"Anything for Kex!\""
msgstr "\"¡Cualquier cosa por Kex!\""

msgid ""
"\"A pirate has to be efficient: finding my father, and infiltrating a "
"weapons facility. Two birds with one stone! I wasn't entirely sure, but I "
"had a good lead on the fact that the Minerva CEO was doing quite a bit more "
"than gambling.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un pirata tiene que ser eficiente: encontrar a mi padre e infiltrarse en "
"una instalación de armas. Dos pájaros de un tiro. No estaba del todo seguro, "
"pero tenía una buena pista de que el director general de Minerva hacía "
"bastante más que apostar.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yes. You have no idea how much shit I've had to put up with to find him. "
"There is no way I'm going to lose him now! The rest can wait!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí. No tienes ni idea de toda la mierda que he tenido que aguantar para "
"encontrarle. ¡No hay manera de que lo pierda ahora! ¡El resto puede esperar!"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Although I'm really tempted to storm Minerva Station myself, and plunder "
"the weapons facility like any pirate dreams of, but it pisses me off that "
"I'm going to have to leave it to you. Damn responsibilities.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque estoy muy tentado de asaltar yo mismo la estación Minerva y saquear "
"la instalación de armamento como sueña cualquier pirata, me jode tener que "
"dejártelo a ti. Malditas responsabilidades.\""

msgid ""
"\"Zuri got most of the information and should be the one to brief you on the "
"weapons facility, but that's not going to work out now.\"\n"
"She lets out a sigh.\n"
"\"I'll try to give you a short rundown on what we know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Zuri obtuvo la mayor parte de la información y debería ser quien te "
"informara sobre la instalación de armas, pero eso no va a ser posible ahora."
"\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro.\n"
"\"Trataré de darte un breve resumen de lo que sabemos.\""

msgid ""
"She clears her throat.\n"
"\"So, our intel hints that they are working on an experimental energy weapon "
"of some time at the station. Should be quite a preliminary design, but we "
"don't have much info on the current state of development. Either way, it's "
"going to be useful and/or worth a fortune!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Apparently, the laboratory is located in a penthouse to not raise "
"suspicion. Security is quite tight around the area, but we've got the likely "
"location narrowed down. I forget where it was, but I'll send you the "
"documents we have on it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al parecer, el laboratorio se encuentra en un ático para no levantar "
"sospechas. La seguridad es bastante estricta en la zona, pero tenemos "
"acotada la ubicación probable. Olvidé dónde estaba, pero te enviaré los "
"documentos que tenemos al respecto.\""

msgid ""
"\"We don't really know what we'll find there, but I guess you'll have to "
"improvise? It's pretty much now or never, and we won't get a second chance "
"once the station gets locked down.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Realmente no sabemos lo que encontraremos allí, pero supongo que habrá que "
"improvisar... Es ahora o nunca, y no tendremos una segunda oportunidad una "
"vez que la estación esté cerrada.\""

msgid ""
"\"You'll have to make it to the station on your own, but once you get there, "
"some pirate operatives should be there to help you ransack the place. You "
"won't have too much time, so just try to grab whatever you can and get out "
"of there. Make sure to keep an eye out for any sort of thing that can help "
"Kex. I'm not sure our engineers will be able to figure it out by themselves."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tendrás que llegar a la estación por tu cuenta, pero una vez allí, algunos "
"operativos piratas deberían estar allí para ayudarte a saquear el lugar. No "
"tendrás mucho tiempo, así que intenta coger todo lo que puedas y salir de "
"allí. Asegúrate de estar atento a cualquier cosa que pueda ayudar a Kex. No "
"estoy seguro de que nuestros ingenieros sean capaces de averiguarlo por sí "
"mismos.\""

msgid ""
"She gives a solemn nod.\n"
"\"Are you ready to infiltrate Minerva Station one last time?\""
msgstr ""
"Ella asiente solemnemente.\n"
"\"¿Estás listo para infiltrarte en la estación Minerva por última vez?\""

msgid "\"Are you ready now to infiltrate Minerva Station?\""
msgstr "\"¿Estás listo ahora para infiltrarte en la estación Minerva?\""

msgid "Accept the Undertaking"
msgstr "Aceptar el Compromiso"

msgid ""
"Maikki gives you some time to prepare more. Return to her when you are ready."
msgstr ""
"Maikki te da algo de tiempo para prepararte más. Vuelve con ella cuando "
"estés listo."

msgid "\"Great! I knew I could count on you.\""
msgstr "\"¡Genial! Sabía que podía contar contigo.\""

msgid ""
"\"I want to take Kex and Zuri to {spb} in the {sys} system, where I know a "
"gal that should help patch them up. Not as good as the surgeons back at New "
"Haven, but it'll have to do. We don't have the time to make the full trip at "
"the moment, once you join us, we can figure out if we can make the trip.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Quiero llevar a Kex y Zuri a {spb} en el sistema {sys}, donde conozco a "
"una chica que debería ayudar a curarlos. No es tan buena como los cirujanos "
"de Nuevo Refugio, pero tendrá que servir. No tenemos tiempo para hacer el "
"viaje completo en este momento, una vez que se unan a nosotros, podemos "
"averiguar si podemos hacer el viaje.\""

msgid ""
"\"You infiltrate the station, get what you can, and meet up with us at "
"{spb}. We'll then figure out what to do. Best of luck!\"\n"
"Maikki gives you a weird two finger salute and takes off to her ship, "
"leaving you to do your part on your own."
msgstr ""
"\"Infíltrate en la estación, consigue lo que puedas y reúnete con nosotros "
"en {spb}. Entonces veremos qué hacer. Mucha suerte\".\n"
"Maikki te hace un extraño saludo con dos dedos y se marcha a su nave, "
"dejándote hacer tu parte por tu cuenta."

#. If not accepted, mem.state will still be nil
msgid "Land on {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Aterriza en {spb} (sistema {sys})"

msgid "Ransack the weapon laboratory"
msgstr "Saquea el laboratorio de armas"

msgid "Meet up with Maikki at {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Reúnete con Maikki en {spb} ({sys} system)"

msgid "\"Special authorization needed.\""
msgstr "\"Autorización especial necesaria.\""

#. Clean up some stuff if applicable
msgid "Communication channel is closed."
msgstr "Canal de comunicación cerrado."

msgid "Proceed to land."
msgstr "Proceda a aterrizar."

msgid "Please bring the documents in person."
msgstr "Por favor, traiga los documentos en persona."

msgid ""
"You try to open a communication channel with {spb}, but get rerouted to an "
"Imperial ship."
msgstr ""
"Intentas abrir un canal de comunicación con {spb}, pero te desvían a una "
"nave imperial."

msgid ""
"\"What do you want again? I told you Minerva Station is locked down until "
"further notice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué quieres otra vez? Te dije que la estación Minerva está cerrada hasta "
"nuevo aviso.\""

msgid ""
"\"What do you want? Minerva Station is locked down until further notice.\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué quieres? La estación Minerva está cerrada hasta nuevo aviso.\""

msgid "\"Why is it locked down?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué está cerrada?\""

msgid "\"I'm here to do cleaning.\""
msgstr "\"Estoy aquí para la limpieza.\""

msgid "\"Please, let me land!\""
msgstr "\"¡Por favor, dejame aterrizar!\""

msgid "\"It's a matter of life and death!\""
msgstr "\"¡Es un asunto de vida o muerte!\""

msgid "\"What I left is really important!\""
msgstr "\"¡Lo que he dejado es realmente importante!\""

msgid "\"I left something at the station.\""
msgstr "\"Dejé algo en la estación.\""

msgid "\"I brought Imperial clearance.\""
msgstr "\"Traje la autorización del Imperio.\""

msgid ""
"\"Imperial Decree 28701-289 is why. No access without proper Imperial "
"clearance. No exceptions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El Decreto Imperial 28701-289 es el por qué. No hay acceso sin la debida "
"autorización Imperial. Sin excepciones.\""

msgid ""
"\"Tough luck buddy. Judge's orders. Not going to risk a pay cut for someone "
"I don't know. File an EB-89212-9 with information on it and you may be able "
"to get it back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mala suerte amigo. Órdenes del juez. No voy a arriesgarme a un recorte de "
"sueldo por alguien que no conozco. Presenta un EB-89212-9 con información "
"sobre él y tal vez puedas recuperarlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Everyone thinks everything is important to them, buddy. The richest man is "
"he who needs nothing, but just go file an EB-89212-9 if you want it back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo el mundo piensa que todo es importante para ellos, amigo. El hombre "
"más rico es el que no necesita nada, pero ve a presentar un EB-89212-9 si "
"quieres recuperarlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Why, you should have have said so at the beginning! No, seriously, buddy. "
"File the EB-89312-9. What, or was it EB-89213-9? Anyway, you're not getting "
"through. Don't push your luck.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Por qué, deberías haberlo dicho al principio! No, en serio, amigo. "
"Archiva el EB-89312-9. ¿Qué, o era EB-89213-9? De todas formas, no lo vas a "
"conseguir. No tientes a la suerte.\""

msgid ""
"\"Would have preferred to have an office job instead of having to deal with "
"punks...\"\n"
"They let out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"Hubiera preferido tener un trabajo de oficina en vez de tener que tratar "
"con gamberros...\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid ""
"\"Great! We were expecting you, it's a mess down there. Proceed to land.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Os estábamos esperando, es un desastre ahí abajo. Proceda a "
"aterrizar.\""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, why are you in a {ship}? Cleaning crew usually comes in a Koala or "
"Mule? Show me your credentials!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, ¿por qué estás en un {nave}? ¿El equipo de limpieza suele venir en "
"una Koala o una Mula? ¡Muéstrame tus credenciales!\""

msgid "\"Company is doing a fleet renewal.\""
msgstr "\"La empresa está haciendo una renovación de la flota.\""

msgid "\"Left it at the office.\""
msgstr "\"La dejé en la oficina.\""

msgid ""
"\"What's the deal with all the weapons you're sporting then? You look like "
"you're looking for trouble, but the Empire always takes out the trash!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué pasa entonces con todas las armas que llevas? Parece que busques "
"problemas, ¡pero el Imperio siempre saca la basura!\""

msgid ""
"\"Go get them then. You are not getting landing access without your "
"credentials.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ve a buscarlas entonces. No vas a tener acceso de aterrizaje sin tus "
"credenciales.\""

msgid "The communication channel cuts off."
msgstr "El canal de comunicación se corta."

msgid "\"OK, please send the clearance codes.\""
msgstr "\"OK, por favor envíe los códigos de autorización.\""

msgid "Send a meme."
msgstr "Envíar un meme."

msgid "Send random data."
msgstr "Envíar datos aleatorios."

msgid ""
"You hear a chuckle before they clear their throat.\n"
"\"You do know that impersonation is an Imperial felony, right?\""
msgstr ""
"Se oye una risita antes de que se aclaren la garganta.\n"
"\"Sabes que la suplantación de identidad es un delito Imperial, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "\"That chuckle means I can land right?\""
msgstr "\"Esa risita significa que puedo aterrizar, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "Apologize."
msgstr "Disculparte."

msgid "\"You brought this upon yourself!\""
msgstr "\"¡Te lo has buscado!\""

msgid "You apologize profusely."
msgstr "Pides disculpas profusamente."

msgid ""
"\"Make sure it doesn't happen again. I'll be writing a report on this, next "
"time, expect no leniency.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Asegúrate de que no vuelva a ocurrir. Escribiré un informe sobre esto, la "
"próxima vez, no esperes indulgencia.\""

msgid "The communication channel closes."
msgstr "El canal de comunicación se cierra."

msgid "You stream a large block of random data to {boss}."
msgstr "Envías un gran bloque de datos aleatorios a {boss}."

msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, but it seems like the communication channel is corrupting. "
"Please bring the documents in person.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo siento, pero parece que el canal de comunicación se está corrompiendo. "
"Por favor, traiga los documentos en persona.\""

msgid ""
"The communication channel cuts off as your sensors pick up signals of "
"weapons powering up."
msgstr ""
"El canal de comunicación se corta cuando tus sensores captan señales de "
"armas encendiéndose."

msgid ""
"Your navigation system lights up green as you receive a confirmation of "
"landing access to Minerva Station."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema de navegación se ilumina en verde cuando recibes una confirmación "
"de acceso al aterrizaje en la estación Minerva."

msgid "You close the communication channel."
msgstr "Cierras el canal de comunicación."

msgid ""
"With the blocking ship out of the way, you should be able to land on {spb} "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Con la nave de bloqueo fuera del camino, ahora deberías poder aterrizar en "
"{spb}."

msgid ""
"You approach the {plt} to dock. The {plt} has their shields down for "
"boarding, it would be a good time to try to make use uf the situation."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al {plt} para atracar. El {plt} tiene los escudos bajados para el "
"abordaje, sería un buen momento para intentar aprovechar la situación."

msgid "Board normally."
msgstr "Abordar con normalidad."

msgid "Open fire on the {plt} at point blank."
msgstr "Abrir fuego contra el {plt} a quemarropa."

msgid "Ram the {plt}."
msgstr "Embestir al {plt}."

#. Clear landing status
msgid ""
"You quickly power up your weapons and aim at critical ship infrastructure "
"right as the boarding clamps begin to extend. Catching the {plt} off guard, "
"your weapons are able to do significant damage, even knocking several "
"systems offline. However, you have no choice now but to finish the job. Time "
"to power on your weapons."
msgstr ""
"Activas rápidamente tus armas y apuntas a la infraestructura crítica de la "
"nave justo cuando las pinzas de abordaje comienzan a extenderse. Al pillar "
"al {plt} desprevenido, tus armas son capaces de causar daños significativos, "
"incluso desconectando varios sistemas. Sin embargo, ahora no tienes otra "
"opción que terminar el trabajo. Es hora de encender tus armas."

#. not permanent
#. Clear landing status
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Right before boarding, you power on your shields and slam on your ship "
"thrusters. Catching the {plt} completely off guard with your manoeuvre, your "
"ship smashes into their hull causing massive damage. Time to power on your "
"weapons."
msgstr ""
"Justo antes del abordaje, activas tus escudos y enciendes los propulsores de "
"tu nave. Al pillar al {plt} completamente desprevenido con tu maniobra, tu "
"nave choca contra su casco causando daños masivos. Es hora de encender tus "
"armas."

#. Clear landing status
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Right before boarding, you power on your shields and slam on your ship "
"thrusters. Catching the {plt} completely off guard with your manoeuvre, your "
"ship smashes into their hull causing significant damage. Time to power on "
"your weapons."
msgstr ""
"Justo antes del abordaje, activas tus escudos y enciendes los propulsores de "
"tu nave. Al pillar al {plt} completamente desprevenido con tu maniobra, tu "
"nave choca contra su casco causando daños significativos. Es hora de "
"encender tus armas."

msgid ""
"You board the ship and are escorted to the command room where the captain is "
"waiting. Getting this far and not having any other choice, you give them a "
"holodrive with some randomly generated contents. They plug in the drive and "
"try to authorize it, however, an error appears as expected."
msgstr ""
"Subes a bordo de la nave y te escoltan hasta la sala de mando, donde te "
"espera el capitán. Al llegar hasta aquí y no tener otra opción, les entregas "
"un holodrive con unos contenidos generados aleatoriamente. Conectan la "
"unidad e intentan autorizarla, sin embargo, aparece un error como era de "
"esperar."

msgid ""
"The first officer attempts percussive maintenance on the main system, "
"however, as expected, the error does not go away. The captain is unfazed by "
"the situation, and, muttering something about the new Imperial Operating "
"System update, says something about verifying it later on your way out. "
"Surprisingly enough, you are given permission to land."
msgstr ""
"El primer oficial intenta realizar un mantenimiento de percusión en el "
"sistema principal, sin embargo, como era de esperar, el error no desaparece. "
"El capitán no se inmuta por la situación y, murmurando algo sobre la nueva "
"actualización del Sistema Operativo Imperial, dice algo sobre verificarlo "
"más tarde al salir. Sorprendentemente, se te da permiso para aterrizar."

msgid ""
"You quickly make your way back to your ship to prepare to land before they "
"see through your bullshit."
msgstr ""
"Rápidamente te diriges a tu nave para prepararte para aterrizar antes de que "
"se den cuenta de tus patrañas."

#. Update minerva
msgid "Pirate?"
msgstr "¿Pirata?"

msgid "A pirate-ish individual. Maybe this is one of Maikki's crew?"
msgstr "Un individuo pirata. ¿Quizás es uno de la tripulación de Maikki?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You land and are immediately greeted by Maikki. How did she track your ship?"
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas e inmediatamente te recibe una Maikki. ¿Cómo ha rastreado tu nave?"

msgid "\"What did you find? Did you meet Marley and Sage?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué has encontrado? ¿Conociste a Marley y Sage?\""

msgid ""
"She takes you to an impromptu installation on her ship, the Pink Demon. "
"There you give Maikki the holodrives that she promptly passes off to her "
"engineers to inspect the contents, while you explain to her the ordeal you "
"went through. She shows sorrow when you explain the fates of Marley and "
"Sage, the two pirates you met, but such is the way of pirates."
msgstr ""
"Te lleva a una instalación improvisada en su nave, la Demonio Rosa. Allí le "
"entregas a Maikki los holodiscos, que ella entrega rápidamente a sus "
"ingenieros para que inspeccionen el contenido, mientras le explicas el "
"calvario por el que has pasado. Se muestra apenada cuando le explicas el "
"destino de Marley y Sage, los dos piratas que conociste, pero así son los "
"piratas."

msgid ""
"She explains to you the situation of Zuri and Kex, while Kex hasn't changed "
"at all, Zuri hasn't improved significantly and is under a deep coma. While "
"the installations at {spb} are not bad, they are far from being the "
"forefront in medical technology."
msgstr ""
"Te explica la situación de Zuri y Kex, mientras que Kex no ha cambiado en "
"absoluto, Zuri no ha mejorado significativamente y se encuentra en coma "
"profundo. Aunque las instalaciones de {spb} no están mal, distan mucho de "
"ser la vanguardia en tecnología médica."

msgid ""
"Eventually an engineer comes back to report on the situation. It seems like "
"some schematics of Kex's design were recovered, along with some other "
"blueprints that could prove to be useful, or at least in the worst case, "
"worth a pretty penny on the black market. Maikki looks ecstatic at the "
"possibility, albeit remote, of being able to repair her father."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, un ingeniero vuelve para informar de la situación. Parece que se "
"han recuperado algunos esquemas del diseño de Kex, junto con otros planos "
"que podrían resultar útiles o, al menos en el peor de los casos, valer un "
"buen dinero en el mercado negro. Maikki parece extasiada ante la "
"posibilidad, aunque remota, de poder reparar a su padre."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Great job! I knew we could pull this off. If we have the blueprints or "
"schematics or whatever they are, they should be able to repair my father! "
"{spb} may have shitty medical installations, but the engineers here should "
"be top-notch!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gran trabajo! Sabía que podríamos lograrlo. Si tenemos los planos o "
"esquemas o lo que sean, ¡deberían ser capaces de reparar a mi padre! {spb} "
"puede tener instalaciones médicas de mierda, ¡pero los ingenieros de aquí "
"deben ser de primera!\""

msgid ""
"The engineers get the OK from Maikki to proceed, and begin working on "
"whatever they have to do on Kex. Given the importance of the operation, you "
"and Maikki leave it to the specialists while you fret together in the nearby "
"waiting room until the procedure is finished."
msgstr ""
"Los ingenieros reciben el visto bueno de Maikki para proceder, y comienzan a "
"trabajar en lo que tengan que hacer en Kex. Dada la importancia de la "
"operación, Maikki y tú la dejáis en manos de los especialistas mientras os "
"preocupáis juntos en la sala de espera cercana hasta que termine el "
"procedimiento."

msgid ""
"\"This is nerve-wracking. I'm a pirate for hell's sake, not supposed to be "
"worrying about lives, just booty!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto es estresante. Soy un pirata por el amor de Dios, se supone que no "
"debo preocuparme por las vidas, ¡sólo por el botín!\""

msgid "\"Is life but not another booty?\""
msgstr "\"¿No es la vida sino otro botín?\""

msgid "\"Pirates care about lives too!\""
msgstr "\"¡A los piratas también les importan las vidas!\""

msgid "\"It's only human.\""
msgstr "\"Es sólo humano.\""

msgid ""
"\"That is an interesting way of seeing it. I guess treasuring one's comrades "
"and family isn't much different from treasuring hordes of stolen values.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es una forma interesante de verlo. Supongo que atesorar a los camaradas y "
"a la familia no es muy diferente de atesorar hordas de valores robados.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's hard to care about lives when they are worth so little in this "
"universe. One day you meet a nice pirate, the next day you find out they're "
"dead. It sort of desensitizes you to life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es difícil preocuparse por las vidas cuando valen tan poco en este "
"universo. Un día conoces a un pirata simpático y al día siguiente descubres "
"que está muerto. En cierto modo te insensibiliza a la vida.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yes, but normal humans are a droll. They spend all day worrying about "
"taxes and commuting to and back from work. Freedom is what a pirate seeks, "
"and worrying seems to be exactly the opposite!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, pero los humanos normales son un rollo. Se pasan el día preocupándose "
"por los impuestos y yendo y viniendo del trabajo. La libertad es lo que "
"busca un pirata, ¡y preocuparse parece ser exactamente lo contrario!\""

msgid ""
"\"I don't know. I guess It's just weird having my father in my life again. "
"Plus, it's not like Zuri, who can do well on her own, he's like... you "
"know... a fowl! If I don't watch out for him a stray cat or whatever will "
"have a banquet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No lo sé. Supongo que es raro volver a tener a mi padre en mi vida. "
"Además, no es como Zuri, que puede arreglárselas sola, él es como... ya "
"sabes... ¡una ave! Si no me cuido de él, ¡un gato callejero o lo que sea se "
"dará un banquete!\""

msgid ""
"\"I feel like I have to protect him, you know? Even though the asshole has "
"been missing my entire life, he's still family. All I have left now! If I "
"lose him, there's nothing left...\""
msgstr ""
"\"Siento que tengo que protegerlo, ¿sabes? Aunque el gilipollas lleve "
"desaparecido toda mi vida, sigue siendo de mi familia. ¡Lo único que me "
"queda ahora! Si lo pierdo, no me queda nada...\""

msgid "\"He's a cyborg fowl superweapon, he's not helpless.\""
msgstr "\"Es una ave superarma ciborg, no está indefenso.\""

msgid "\"You have to protect him.\""
msgstr "\"Tienes que protegerle.\""

msgid "\"He'll be alright.\""
msgstr "\"Se pondrá bien.\""

msgid ""
"\"I know but, still, he's soo small!\"\n"
"She lets out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"Lo sé, pero aún así, ¡es tan pequeño!\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid ""
"\"I know right! He's so small and feeble looking. Makes you want to cuddle "
"with him and keep all the danger away.\"\n"
"She lets out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ya lo sé! Es tan pequeño y débil. Dan ganas de acurrucarse con él y "
"alejar todo el peligro.\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid ""
"\"I hope you're right. I mean, there's no other possibility is there not?\"\n"
"She lets out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"Espero que tengas razón. Quiero decir, no hay otra posibilidad ¿no?\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid ""
"\"This is going to take a while to get used to. Guess it's best not to "
"overthink it for now and go with the flow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Va a llevar un tiempo acostumbrarse a esto. Supongo que es mejor no "
"pensarlo demasiado por ahora y dejarse llevar.\""

msgid ""
"You are interrupted by an engineer that comes in to inform that it was "
"likely a success and they would try to wake up Kex."
msgstr ""
"Te interrumpe un ingeniero que entra para informar de que probablemente fue "
"un éxito y que intentarían despertar a Kex."

msgid ""
"Maikki closes her eyes for a second and takes a deep breath.\n"
"\"Let's go!\""
msgstr ""
"Maikki cierra los ojos un segundo y respira hondo.\n"
"\"¡Vamos!\""

msgid ""
"You are led to a makeshift surgery room covered in devices and screens. On "
"the operating table you see a tiny-looking Kex who's hooked up to some "
"electrical gear."
msgstr ""
"Te conducen a un quirófano improvisado cubierto de aparatos y pantallas. En "
"la mesa de operaciones ves a un Kex de aspecto diminuto que está conectado a "
"un equipo eléctrico."

msgid "\"It's now or never. Let's go this!\""
msgstr "\"Es ahora o nunca. ¡Hagámoslo!\""

msgid ""
"The engineers hit a key on a console, and everyone goes silent in "
"anticipation."
msgstr ""
"Los ingenieros pulsan una tecla en una consola y todo el mundo se queda en "
"silencio."

msgid ""
"Looking over, Maikki seems to be holding her breath while the engineers "
"scratch their heads. Did it not work?"
msgstr ""
"Maikki parece contener la respiración mientras los ingenieros se rascan la "
"cabeza. ¿No ha funcionado?"

msgid "."
msgstr "."

msgid " ."
msgstr " ."

#. Time to bring back Kex!!!
msgid ""
"Suddenly you hear a loud BEEP and the light in Kex's cyborg eye turns on."
msgstr ""
"De repente oyes un fuerte BEEP y la luz del ojo ciborg de Kex se enciende."

msgid "\"INITIALIZING STRANGELOVE OS VERSION 0.18-alpha.239."
msgstr "INICIALIZANDO STRANGELOVE OS VERSION 0.18-alpha.239."

msgid ""
"\n"
"INITIALIZATION COMPLETE.\""
msgstr ""
"\n"
"INICIALIZACIÓN COMPLETADA.\""

msgid "Kex blinks several times before letting out a large SQUAWK."
msgstr "Kex parpadea varias veces antes de soltar un gran SQUAWK."

msgid ""
"Likely out of shock, Maikki quickly slaps and surely slaps Kex across the "
"cheek."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente en estado de shock, Maikki abofetea rápidamente y con "
"seguridad a Kex en toda la mejilla."

msgid "Kex blinks several times again."
msgstr "Kex vuelve a parpadear varias veces."

msgid ""
"\"You better not squawk again.\"\n"
"She looks ready to slap him again."
msgstr ""
"\"Será mejor que no vuelvas a graznar\".\n"
"Parece dispuesta a abofetearle de nuevo."

msgid "Kex looks around the room once before staring at you."
msgstr "Kex echa un vistazo a la habitación antes de mirarte fijamente."

msgid "\"Go on, say something.\""
msgstr "\"Vamos, di algo.\""

msgid "\"Welcome back!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bienvenido de nuevo!\""

msgid "\"SQUAWK!\""
msgstr "\"¡SQUAWK!\""

msgid ""
"He jumps a bit in surprise.\n"
"\"Crikey! You scared me.\""
msgstr ""
"Salta un poco sorprendido.\n"
"\"¡Caramba! Me has asustado.\""

msgid "\"Now you know how I feel!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ahora sabes cómo me siento!\""

msgid ""
"\"Where... Where am I?\"\n"
"He looks quite nervous."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Dónde... ¿Dónde estoy?\"\n"
"Parece bastante nervioso."

msgid "\"We're on the Pink Demon, stationed at {spb}.\""
msgstr "\"Estamos en el Demonio Rosa, estacionados en {spb}.\""

msgid ""
"\"Pink... Demon?\"\n"
"He squints a bit looking at Maikki, then suddenly seems to get a bit "
"agitated. He turns again to you."
msgstr ""
"\" Demonio... ¿Rosa?\"\n"
"Entrecierra un poco los ojos mirando a Maikki, y de repente parece agitarse "
"un poco. Se vuelve de nuevo hacia ti."

msgid "\"Glad to have you back!\""
msgstr "\"¡Me alegro de tenerte de vuelta!\""

msgid "\"How many fingers am I holding up?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cuántos dedos tengo levantados?\""

msgid "\"How's daddy feeling?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo se siente papá?\""

msgid ""
"He still seems a bit fuzzy.\n"
"\"I remember... a courtroom? What happened?\""
msgstr ""
"Todavía parece un poco confuso.\n"
"\"Recuerdo... ¿un juzgado? ¿Qué pasó?\""

msgid "\"I'm fine. I remember... a courtroom? What happened?\""
msgstr "\"Estoy bien. Recuerdo... ¿un juzgado? ¿Qué pasó?\""

msgid "Kex freezes in place."
msgstr "Kex se congela en el lugar."

msgid ""
"Maikki elbows you in the ribs, almost sending you sprawling to the floor.\n"
"\"How are you feeling?\""
msgstr ""
"Maikki te da un codazo en las costillas que casi te hace caer al suelo.\n"
"\"¿Cómo te sientes?\""

msgid ""
"He still seems quite tense, but it doesn't seem like he's very focused.\n"
"\"I remember... a courtroom? What happened?\""
msgstr ""
"Todavía parece bastante tenso, pero no parece que esté muy concentrado.\n"
"\"Recuerdo... ¿un juzgado? ¿Qué pasó?\""

msgid ""
"You roughly give him an overview of what happened at the courtroom without "
"going into too much depth, and some of the posterior challenges leading up "
"until the current moment."
msgstr ""
"A grandes rasgos, le das una visión general de lo sucedido en la sala sin "
"entrar en demasiada profundidad, y algunos de los retos posteriores que han "
"conducido hasta el momento actual."

msgid ""
"\"I see...\"\n"
"He still doesn't seem to have relaxed significantly."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo...\"\n"
"Todavía no parece haberse relajado significativamente."

msgid ""
"\"Well then.\"\n"
"Maikki makes emphasizes her presence to Kex."
msgstr ""
"\"Pues bien.\"\n"
"Maikki hace énfasis en su presencia a Kex."

msgid ""
"He still seems to avoid eye contact with Maikki and looks at you.\n"
"\"What are you going to do now?\""
msgstr ""
"Todavía parece evitar el contacto visual con Maikki y te mira a ti.\n"
"\"¿Qué vas a hacer ahora?\""

msgid ""
"Before you can answer, Maikki butts in.\n"
"\"Isn't there something more important right now?\""
msgstr ""
"Antes de que puedas responder, Maikki se entromete.\n"
"\"¿No hay algo más importante en este momento?\""

msgid ""
"His voice trembles a bit.\n"
"\"Ummmmm, I guess... something...\"\n"
"His voice becomes smaller and smaller and ends up trailing off."
msgstr ""
"Le tiembla un poco la voz.\n"
"\"Ummmmm, supongo que... algo...\"\n"
"Su voz se hace cada vez más pequeña y termina por cortarse."

msgid ""
"\"You do recognize me, you bastard!\"\n"
"The engineers have to hold Maikki back from Kex as she lets her temper take "
"the best of her."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Sí que me reconoces, cabrón!\"\n"
"Los ingenieros tienen que mantener Maikki atrás de Kex mientras ella deja "
"que su temperamento tome lo mejor de ella."

msgid ""
"\"Let me at the fowl! I spend 5 bloody cycles tracking him down thinking "
"that he must have forgotten about me or whatever when he turned into a bird, "
"and he remembered all along!\"\n"
"She struggles against the engineers."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Déjame al ave! Me paso 5 malditos ciclos rastreándolo pensando que se "
"habrá olvidado de mí o lo que sea cuando se convirtió en pájaro, ¡y se "
"acordó todo el tiempo!\"\n"
"Forcejea con los ingenieros."

msgid ""
"\"He could have been all like 'It's good to see you daughter!' or 'I'm sorry "
"I wasn't there!', but the bloody fowl was just running away from his "
"problems and avoiding facing reality like all along!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Podría haber sido todo un 'me alegro de verte hija!' o '¡siento no haber "
"estado allí!', pero el muy puñetero estaba huyendo de sus problemas y "
"evitando enfrentarse a la realidad como si nada!\""

msgid ""
"\"You haven't changed at all!\"\n"
"She breaks free from the engineers and jumps at Kex. Fearing the worst, you "
"try to jump to intercept, but Maikki's alacrity surprises you."
msgstr ""
"\"¡No has cambiado nada!\"\n"
"Se libera de los ingenieros y salta hacia Kex. Temiendo lo peor, intentas "
"saltar para interceptarla, pero la presteza de Maikki te sorprende."

msgid ""
"Maikki tackles Kex, and for a second you think it's the end of the cyborg "
"duck, but, despite the tumultuousness, you find Maikki hugging Kex. She "
"whispers softly,\n"
"\"I missed you, you bastard...\""
msgstr ""
"Maikki aborda a Kex, y por un segundo piensas que es el fin del pato ciborg, "
"pero, a pesar del tumulto, encuentras a Maikki abrazando a Kex. Susurra "
"suavemente,\n"
"\"Te he echado de menos, cabrón...\""

msgid "\"I'm sorry, Maikki... I'm sorry for everything... I failed you...\""
msgstr "\"Lo siento, Maikki... Lo siento por todo... Te fallé...\""

msgid ""
"With the emotional meeting out of the way, and knowing Kex is safe and "
"sound, the engineers clean up things a bit, and you decide to leave the two "
"a bit of privacy, while you go grab a drink to try to recoup after such a "
"tumultuous chain of events."
msgstr ""
"Una vez superado el emotivo encuentro y sabiendo que Kex está sano y salvo, "
"los ingenieros limpian un poco las cosas y tú decides dejarles un poco de "
"intimidad, mientras vas a tomar algo para intentar recuperarte después de "
"tan tumultuosa cadena de acontecimientos."

msgid ""
"Eventually you get a message from Maikki that she is waiting for you on the "
"bridge of the Pink Demon and you head back to meet the two."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente recibes un mensaje de Maikki diciéndote que te está esperando en "
"el puente del Demonio Rosa y vuelves a reunirte con los dos."

msgid ""
"You find Maikki in her pirate attire, and surprisingly enough, Kex is also "
"in a matching outfit."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Maikki con su atuendo pirata y, sorprendentemente, Kex también "
"lleva un traje a juego."

msgid "\"All caught up I guess?\""
msgstr "\"¿Todo al día, supongo?\""

msgid "\"Nice look!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bonito aspecto!\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks! I owe it to you to finally be able to be able to talk to my "
"father. We have a ton of catching up to do still!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias! Te debo el poder finalmente hablar con mi padre. ¡Todavía "
"tenemos que ponernos al día!\""

msgid ""
"\"I feel the same. Thank you for helping me out, despite my current "
"appearance. Maybe this time I will be able to amend my past and break the "
"loop.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Siento lo mismo. Gracias por ayudarme, a pesar de mi aspecto actual. Quizá "
"esta vez pueda enmendar mi pasado y romper el bucle.\""

msgid "\"Amend the past? That's impossible. You were a complete asshole.\""
msgstr ""
"¿\"Enmendar el pasado\"? Eso es imposible. Fuiste un completo imbécil.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "He looks a bit dejected and sad."
msgstr "Parece un poco abatido y triste."

msgid ""
"\"Don't be sad. You have to learn to live with your past, and learn from it "
"to have a good future! What's done is done, but you can still decide what's "
"yet to come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No estés triste. Tienes que aprender a vivir con tu pasado y aprender de "
"él para tener un buen futuro. Lo hecho, hecho está, pero aún puedes decidir "
"lo que está por venir.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's still hard. Although I've had a lot of time to think since I lost my "
"body. This time I have no excuses.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sigue siendo duro. Aunque he tenido mucho tiempo para pensar desde que "
"perdí mi cuerpo. Esta vez no tengo excusas.\""

msgid ""
"She beams a smile at Kex.\n"
"\"Ah, {playername}, my father decided to join me and my crew aboard the Pink "
"Demon. We'll be heading back to New Haven after this. Zuri is still in need "
"of good treatment. What are you going to do? Care to join us?\""
msgstr ""
"Sonríe a Kex.\n"
"\"Ah, {playername}, mi padre decidió unirse a mí y a mi tripulación a bordo "
"del Demonio Rosa. Volveremos a Nuevo Refugio después de esto. Zuri sigue "
"necesitando un buen tratamiento. ¿Qué vas a hacer? ¿Quieres unirte a "
"nosotros?\""

msgid ""
"You thank Maikki for her offer, but say that you want to forge your own "
"path. That doesn't mean you won't be able to join her on new adventures, but "
"that you want to keep your autonomy."
msgstr ""
"Agradeces a Maikki su oferta, pero le dices que quieres forjar tu propio "
"camino. Eso no significa que no puedas unirte a ella en nuevas aventuras, "
"sino que quieres mantener tu autonomía."

msgid ""
"\"Hah! One would think you are the pirate instead of me!\"\n"
"She gives you a sly look."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ja! ¡Cualquiera diría que eres tú el pirata en vez de yo!\"\n"
"Te lanza una mirada socarrona."

msgid ""
"\"To be honest, unless hell froze over, I knew there was no chance of you "
"joining us. Wild Ones aren't for everyone, and you've got things you want to "
"do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Para ser honesto, a menos que el infierno se congelara, sabía que no había "
"ninguna posibilidad de que te unieras a nosotros. Los Salvajes no son para "
"todos, y tú tienes cosas que quieres hacer.\""

msgid "\"But make sure to visit us! I'm not sure how to thank you enough.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Pero asegúrate de visitarnos! No sé cómo agradecértelo lo suficiente.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah, I almost forgot. What is a good adventure without a good reward?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, casi lo olvido. ¿Qué es una buena aventura sin una buena recompensa?\""

msgid "\"A good learning experience?\""
msgstr "\"¿Una buena experiencia de aprendizaje?\""

msgid ""
"\"That was a rhetorical question! You have to..\n"
"Oh never mind. Here, take this credit stick, it's the least that I can do "
"for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Era una pregunta retórica! Tienes que..\n"
"Oh, no importa. Toma, coge este usb de crédito, es lo menos que puedo hacer "
"por ti.\""

msgid ""
"\"Wow, that's a lot of credits! I also want to thank you. but I've lost "
"everything I had. I'll find a way to pay you back, I promise!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Vaya, son muchos créditos! Yo también quiero darte las gracias, pero he "
"perdido todo lo que tenía. Encontraré la manera de devolvértelo, ¡lo prometo!"
"\""

msgid ""
"You wish the two best on their trip back, and promise you will go visit them "
"sometime. You then head back after the long ordeal with the knowledge you "
"were able to reunite a daughter and father."
msgstr ""
"Les deseas lo mejor en su viaje de vuelta y les prometes que irás a "
"visitarles alguna vez. Después de la larga experiencia, regresas con la "
"certeza de haber reunido a una hija y a su padre."

msgid ""
"You managed to infiltrate the weapon laboratory on Minerva Station, "
"obtaining important document including schematics related to Kex's cyborg "
"parts. Despite being blown out into space and rescued by your ship AI, you "
"were able to reach {returnspb} and hand over the documents. This allowed "
"Maikki's engineers to resuscitate Kex and you were able to witness an "
"emotional reunion between Kex and Maikki. They then took off to New Haven "
"and you promised you would visit them sometime."
msgstr ""
"Lograste infiltrarte en el laboratorio de armamento de la estación Minerva, "
"obteniendo un importante documento que incluía esquemas relacionados con las "
"piezas ciborg de Kex. A pesar de salir despedido al espacio y ser rescatado "
"por la IA de tu nave, pudiste llegar a {returnspb} y entregar los "
"documentos. Esto permitió a los ingenieros de Maikki resucitar a Kex y "
"pudiste presenciar un emotivo reencuentro entre Kex y Maikki. Después se "
"marcharon a Nuevo Refugio y les prometiste que les visitarías alguna vez."

msgid ""
"You approach the shady character, who seems to be sitting idly around until "
"they notice you."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al turbio personaje, que parece estar de brazos cruzados hasta "
"que repara en ti."

msgid ""
"They take a good look at you first before deciding you must be the person "
"they are waiting for.\n"
"\"Maikki sent you right? I've been expecting you.\""
msgstr ""
"Primero te miran bien antes de decidir que debes ser la persona que están "
"esperando.\n"
"\"Maikki te envió, ¿verdad? Te estaba esperando.\""

msgid ""
"\"We don't have too much time, the place is starting to get full of "
"bureaucrats and it's only a question of time before they start locking "
"things down and asking questions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No tenemos demasiado tiempo, el lugar está empezando a llenarse de "
"burócratas y es sólo cuestión de tiempo que empiecen a bloquear las cosas y "
"a hacer preguntas.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"You're up-to-date with everything right? We're pretty sure that the weapon "
"laboratory is in penthouse number 5. It just doesn't match the station "
"blueprints and there seems to be excess power routed there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estás al día de todo, ¿verdad? Estamos bastante seguros de que el "
"laboratorio de armas está en el ático número 5. Sólo que no coincide con los "
"planos de la estación y parece que hay un exceso de energía dirigido hacia "
"allí.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've got us some disguises prepared that should let us get close enough to "
"break it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo preparados algunos disfraces que nos permitirán acercarnos lo "
"suficiente para romperlo.\""

msgid ""
"You head to the lavatory and get changed into the outfit. It seems to be "
"some sort of mix between a jumpsuit and a labcoat, and the size is quite "
"off, making you look a bit funny. After getting changed you meet up with the "
"pirate who is also now in a similar attire."
msgstr ""
"Te diriges al lavabo y te pones el traje. Parece una especie de mezcla entre "
"un mono y una bata de laboratorio, y la talla está bastante desajustada, lo "
"que te da un aspecto un poco raro. Después de cambiarte te reúnes con el "
"pirata, que también lleva un atuendo similar."

msgid "\"Not the best fit, but we have no choice to try. Let's get headed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No es la mejor opción, pero no tenemos más remedio que intentarlo. "
"Pongámonos en marcha.\""

msgid ""
"You follow them through the winding corridors of the station. Except for "
"passing a couple distracted bureaucrats, it is quite uneventful. Eventually "
"you find yourself near a door that seems to have a guard posted."
msgstr ""
"Les sigues por los sinuosos pasillos de la estación. Salvo por un par de "
"burócratas distraídos, el camino es bastante tranquilo. Finalmente te "
"encuentras cerca de una puerta en la que parece haber un guardia."

msgid "\"Act natural.\""
msgstr "\"Actúa con naturalidad.\""

msgid ""
"They go to the door and give a nod to the guard before entering the room. "
"You follow their step and imitate their actions."
msgstr ""
"Se dirigen a la puerta y saludan con la cabeza al guardia antes de entrar en "
"la sala. Sigues sus pasos e imitas sus acciones."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You find yourself with the pirate inside what seems to be a laboratory "
"packed with racks full of boxes and weird gadgets. Other than you and the "
"pirate, there are some bureaucrats that seem to be performing inventory "
"while a pair of guards watches. It's going to be tricky to do anything with "
"so many people in the room."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras con el pirata dentro de lo que parece ser un laboratorio "
"repleto de estanterías llenas de cajas y artilugios extraños. Aparte de ti y "
"el pirata, hay algunos burócratas que parecen estar haciendo inventario "
"mientras un par de guardias vigilan. Va a ser complicado hacer algo con "
"tanta gente en la sala."

msgid ""
"You and the pirate split up, acting as if you belong there while you inspect "
"the rest of the room. Past the racks there seems to be a small clearing with "
"what looks like some laser weapon prototype. You are looking around when you "
"notice the pirate is talking to a bureaucrat."
msgstr ""
"El pirata y tú os separáis, actuando como si fuerais de allí mientras "
"inspeccionáis el resto de la sala. Pasados los estantes parece haber un "
"pequeño claro con lo que parece algún prototipo de arma láser. Estáis "
"mirando alrededor cuando os dais cuenta de que el pirata está hablando con "
"un burócrata."

msgid "Fiddle with the laser weapon prototype."
msgstr "Juguetear con el prototipo de arma láser."

msgid "Look around more."
msgstr "Mirar más a tu alrededor."

msgid ""
"As you walk around looking more, you accidentally trip on some cable that "
"gets pulled out of the socket. You hear some beeping that seems to draw some "
"of the attention of the guards."
msgstr ""
"Mientras caminas buscando más, tropiezas accidentalmente con algún cable que "
"se sale del enchufe. Oyes unos pitidos que parecen atraer parte de la "
"atención de los guardias."

msgid "Plug the cable back in."
msgstr "Conectas de nuevo el cable."

msgid "Pretend nothing happened."
msgstr "Finge que no ha pasado nada."

msgid ""
"You fumble with the cable as you try not to draw extra attention and plug it "
"in the wall, which seems to reboot something and trigger the prototype."
msgstr ""
"Tanteas con el cable mientras intentas no llamar la atención y lo enchufas a "
"la pared, lo que parece reiniciar algo y activar el prototipo."

msgid ""
"You pretend nothing happens, and walk away as the incessant beeping "
"continues. The guards eventually stop paying attention, and a group of "
"bureaucrats comes to look at it instead, as you pretend to tally things at a "
"safe distance."
msgstr ""
"Finges que no pasa nada y te alejas mientras continúa el incesante pitido. "
"Los guardias acaban por dejar de prestarle atención, y un grupo de "
"burócratas viene a mirarlo en su lugar, mientras tú haces como que cuentas "
"las cosas a una distancia prudencial."

msgid ""
"Suddenly the beeping stops and there is finally some peaceful silence, an "
"instant before one of the prototypes capacitors near the bureaucrats "
"ruptures in a violent explosion!"
msgstr ""
"De repente, el pitido se detiene y por fin se hace el silencio, ¡un instante "
"justo antes de que uno de los condensadores del prototipo, cerca de los "
"burócratas, estalle en una violenta explosión!"

msgid ""
"You look at the laser weapon prototype that is placed on a pedestal. It is "
"connected to all sorts of wires with many of the internals exposed, and an "
"assortment of what seem to be buttons. One particularly large red button "
"seems to call your attention."
msgstr ""
"Miras el prototipo de arma láser que está colocado sobre un pedestal. Está "
"conectado a todo tipo de cables, con muchas de sus partes internas al "
"descubierto, y un surtido de lo que parecen ser botones. Un botón rojo "
"especialmente grande parece llamar tu atención."

msgid "Press the button."
msgstr "Pulsar el botón."

msgid "Investigate the prototype in more detail."
msgstr "Investigar el prototipo con mayor detalle."

msgid "Do something else."
msgstr "Hacer otra cosa."

msgid ""
"You look around and try to make sense of the prototype. It's highly "
"connected to the laboratory so it does not look like you would be able to "
"remove it easily. Furthermore, it's not even clear if it is truly functional "
"or just a heap of scrap metal. Sadly, you lack the expertise to do a full "
"proper evaluation. The only thing you know is that it looks pretty damn cool."
msgstr ""
"Miras a tu alrededor e intentas encontrarle sentido al prototipo. Está muy "
"conectado al laboratorio, por lo que no parece que puedas desmontarlo "
"fácilmente. Además, ni siquiera está claro si es realmente funcional o sólo "
"un montón de chatarra. Por desgracia, careces de los conocimientos "
"necesarios para hacer una evaluación completa. Lo único que sabes es que "
"tiene muy buena pinta."

msgid ""
"You press the big red button, noticing out of the corner of your eye a 'DO "
"NOT PRESS' button a bit too late."
msgstr ""
"Pulsas el gran botón rojo y, con el rabillo del ojo, te das cuenta un poco "
"tarde de que hay un cartel que dice \"NO PULSAR\"."

#. TODO potentially change
msgid ""
"There's a resounding brrrruunnggzzzzz as the prototype fires, with a shock "
"wave launching you to the ground, and the blast misses the target in front "
"of it, partially ricocheting off the laboratory walls until it smashes into "
"a group of bureaucrats, immediately sending them off in pieces."
msgstr ""
"Se oye un sonoro brrrruunnggzzzzz cuando el prototipo se dispara, con una "
"onda expansiva que te lanza al suelo, y la explosión falla el objetivo que "
"tenía delante, rebotando parcialmente en las paredes del laboratorio hasta "
"que se estrella contra un grupo de burócratas, haciéndolos saltar "
"inmediatamente en pedazos."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The room breaks into chaos when the pirate sucker punches the bureaucrat he "
"was talking to, and you try to recover your breath. The two guards quickly "
"draw their weapons and you and the pirate find yourselves looking at the end "
"of a rifle. Things aren't looking too hot."
msgstr ""
"La habitación se convierte en un caos: el pirata golpea al burócrata con el "
"que estaba hablando y tú intentas recuperar el aliento. Los dos guardias "
"desenfundan rápidamente sus armas y tú y el pirata os encontráis mirando el "
"extremo de un rifle. Las cosas no pintan muy bien."

msgid "\"Shit.\""
msgstr "\"Mierda.\""

msgid "\"Put your hands where I can see them!\""
msgstr "\"¡Poned las manos donde pueda verlas!\""

msgid ""
"You and the pirate exchange looks, but have no choice but to raise your "
"hands as the guards slowly approach with their weapons raised and ready."
msgstr ""
"El pirata y tú intercambiáis miradas, pero no tenéis más remedio que "
"levantar las manos cuando los guardias se acercan lentamente con las armas "
"en alto y preparadas."

msgid ""
"Suddenly you hear the door open, the outside guard must have been drawn to "
"the commotion. Seeing this as a last chance, the pirate tackles one of the "
"guards and you duck for cover as you hear several shots being fired."
msgstr ""
"De repente oyes abrirse la puerta, el guardia exterior debe de haber sido "
"atraído por la conmoción. Viendo en ello una última oportunidad, el pirata "
"aborda a uno de los guardias y tú te agachas para ponerte a cubierto "
"mientras oyes varios disparos."

msgid ""
"As the dust settles, you notice there is only one other person left standing."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el polvo se asienta, te das cuenta de que sólo queda otra persona en "
"pie."

msgid "Outside Guard"
msgstr "Guardia Externo"

msgid ""
"The guard from the outside looms before you, with smoke pouring out of their "
"weapon. You tentatively raise your hands again in hopes of not getting shot."
msgstr ""
"El guardia del exterior se cierne ante ti, con humo saliendo de su arma. "
"Vuelves a levantar las manos tímidamente con la esperanza de que no te "
"dispare."

msgid ""
"The guard goes over to the pirate and rolls over the body, revealing a large "
"gaping hole in their chest.\n"
"\"Damnit, they got Marley! Them bastards.\""
msgstr ""
"El guardia se acerca al pirata y le da la vuelta al cuerpo, revelando un "
"gran agujero en el pecho.\n"
"\"¡Maldita sea, se cargaron a Marley! Esos bastardos.\""

msgid "\"Wait... You're with Maikki?\""
msgstr "\"Espera... ¿Estás con Maikki?\""

msgid ""
"\"Aye, I'm with Maikki. So was Marley before they got a hole in them. Poor "
"feller.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, estoy con Maikki. También lo estaba Marley antes de que le hicieran un "
"agujero. Pobre tipo.\""

msgid "\"It's 'lright. I'm with Maikki.\""
msgstr "\"Relájate. Estoy con Maikki.\""

msgid ""
"\"What a mess in 'ere. Worse than that time on Caladan. We're goin'ta have "
"to move fast. I've blocked the door, but not sure how we're gonna get out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Qué desastre. Peor que aquella vez en Caladan. Vamos a tener que movernos "
"rápido. He bloqueado la puerta, pero no estoy seguro de cómo vamos a salir.\""

msgid ""
"Despite the mess, you follow the disguised pirate's lead and try to find "
"things that can be of use. You manage to find some holodrives that you stuff "
"into your jumpsuit pockets. Hopefully they'll contain something of use."
msgstr ""
"A pesar del follón, sigues las indicaciones del pirata disfrazado e intentas "
"encontrar cosas que puedan serte útiles. Consigues encontrar algunos "
"holodiscos que te metes en los bolsillos del mono. Con suerte contendrán "
"algo de utilidad."

msgid ""
"As you hastily scour the laboratory for anything of use, you hear some "
"banging on the door. It looks like backup has made it here. You're not sure "
"how long the door is going to last."
msgstr ""
"Mientras rebuscas apresuradamente en el laboratorio en busca de algo útil, "
"oyes unos golpes en la puerta. Parece que han llegado refuerzos. No estás "
"seguro de cuánto va a durar la puerta."

msgid ""
"\"Shit, sounds like alotta 'em. Don't think we have the firepower to hold "
"'em off.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mierda, suenan a muchos. No creo que tengamos el poder de fuego para "
"contenerlos.\""

msgid "Attempt to aim the prototype at the door."
msgstr "Intentar apuntar el prototipo a la puerta."

msgid "Try to blockade the door."
msgstr "Intentar bloquear la puerta."

msgid ""
"You begin to try to aim the prototype at the door, when you noticed that it "
"seems like the entire prototype power system has gone down. You fumble to "
"try to power the system but it seems futile. You are running out of time."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a intentar apuntar con el prototipo a la puerta, cuando te das "
"cuenta de que parece que todo el sistema de alimentación del prototipo se ha "
"averiado. Intentas encender el sistema a tientas, pero parece ser inútil. Se "
"te acaba el tiempo."

msgid ""
"You try to blockade the door with the largest furniture you can find, but "
"soon enough you find your efforts are in vain: they are using a laser cutter "
"to break down the door. You are running out of time."
msgstr ""
"Intentas bloquear la puerta con los muebles más grandes que encuentras, pero "
"pronto descubres que tus esfuerzos son en vano: están utilizando un cortador "
"láser para derribar la puerta. Se te acaba el tiempo."

msgid ""
"You suddenly notice that the disguised pirate was doing something near the "
"back of the room."
msgstr ""
"De repente te das cuenta de que el pirata disfrazado estaba haciendo algo "
"cerca del fondo de la sala."

msgid "\"'elp me! We ain't got time!\""
msgstr "\"'¡ayúdame! ¡No tenemos tiempo!\""

msgid ""
"Not really knowing what they're doing, you help them move some canisters to "
"a wall."
msgstr ""
"Sin saber muy bien lo que hace, le ayudas a trasladar unos botes a una pared."

msgid "\"Git down!\""
msgstr "\"¡Al suelo!\""

msgid ""
"Without much of a warning, they open fire on the canisters, as you duck for "
"cover. Suddenly, you hear a chain of multiple explosions, and without being "
"able to react, you are sucked up into outer space. They must have blown a "
"breach in the station hull!"
msgstr ""
"Sin previo aviso, abres fuego contra los bidones, mientras te agachas para "
"ponerte a cubierto. De repente, oyes una cadena de explosiones múltiples y, "
"sin poder reaccionar, eres absorbido hacia el espacio exterior. ¡Han debido "
"de abrir una brecha en el casco de la estación!"

#. TODO something better I guess?
msgid ""
"As everything gets cold, you fumble around your jumpsuit, maybe there is an "
"emergency breather there."
msgstr ""
"Mientras todo se enfría, rebuscas en tu mono, quizá haya allí un respirador "
"de emergencia."

msgid "So..."
msgstr "Mientras tanto..."

msgid "   cold..."
msgstr "     frio..."

msgid "... ..."
msgstr "... ..."

#. Fades in shader from black
msgid "Minerva Holodrives"
msgstr "Holodiscos Minerva"

msgid ""
"A set of holodrives you were able to break out of Minerva Station. Hopefully "
"they have something important in them."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de holodiscos que pudiste sacar de la estación Minerva. Con "
"suerte tienen algo importante en ellos."

msgid ""
"You awake to a throbbing headache and a {shipai} hologram staring down at "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas con un dolor de cabeza palpitante y un holograma {shipai} "
"mirándote fijamente."

msgid "\"Oh wow, it looks like humans can survive that long in a vacuum.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vaya, parece que los humanos pueden sobrevivir mucho tiempo en el vacío.\""

msgid "\"My head...\""
msgstr "\"Mi cabeza...\""

msgid "\"What... happened?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué... ocurrió?\""

msgid "\"...is this hell?\""
msgstr "\"...¿es esto el infierno?\""

msgid ""
"\"This is the {shipname}. Maybe you will need a health check after all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Este es el {shipname}. Tal vez necesites un chequeo médico después de todo."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"There was a large explosion at Minerva Station, and since your vital signs "
"were tanking, I took the liberty of flying the ship to check what happened. "
"Now, how many fingers am I holding up?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hubo una gran explosión en la estación Minerva, y como tus constantes "
"vitales estaban bajando, me tomé la libertad de pilotar la nave para "
"comprobar qué había pasado. Ahora, ¿cuántos dedos estoy sosteniendo?\""

msgid "\"Vital signs?\""
msgstr "\"¿Signos vitales?\""

msgid "\"Fingers?\""
msgstr "\"¿Dedos?\""

msgid "MilSpec"
msgstr "MilSpec"

msgid "Unicorp"
msgstr "Unicorp"

msgid "TeraCom"
msgstr "TeraCom"

msgid "Enygma"
msgstr "Enygma"

msgid "S&K"
msgstr "S&K"

msgid "Melendez"
msgstr "Melendez"

msgid "Red Star"
msgstr "Estrella Roja"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Your {brand} underwear has built-in reporting functionality. It's useful "
"to tell if you are alive and healthy, or if you soiled yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tu ropa interior de {brand} tiene incorporada una función de información. "
"Es útil para saber si estás vivo y sano, o si te has ido al baño con la ropa "
"puesta.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "\"Oh, I forgot. I do not have fingers any more.\""
msgstr "\"Oh, se me olvidaba. Ya no tengo dedos.\""

msgid "You decide against asking further as your head continues throbbing."
msgstr "Decides no seguir preguntando mientras tu cabeza sigue palpitando."

msgid ""
"\"You do not look too good. However, the health inspection will have to "
"wait, we must get out of here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No tienes muy buena pinta. Sin embargo, la inspección sanitaria tendrá que "
"esperar, ¡debemos salir de aquí!\""

msgid ""
"\"Maikki told us she would be waiting on {spb} in the {sys} system. We "
"should head there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maikki nos dijo que estaría esperando en {spb} en el sistema {sys}. "
"Deberíamos dirigirnos hacia allí.\""

msgid ""
"With a heavy sigh and a horrible headache, you take the controls of you "
"ship. Time to meet up with Maikki, however, you'll have to take care that "
"you don't get scanned on the way there as the cargo you have is likely "
"sought after by the Empire."
msgstr ""
"Con un fuerte suspiro y un horrible dolor de cabeza, tomas los mandos de tu "
"nave. Hora de reunirte con Maikki, sin embargo, tendrás que tener cuidado de "
"que no te escaneen por el camino, ya que la carga que llevas probablemente "
"sea buscada por el Imperio."

