#. --
#.
#. * Player's testimony gets called into question if killed harper or let scavengers live
#. * Kex deciphers final stuff and blurts out important thing to get CEO convicted at the end, but by doing that shows off he is an intelligent being and gets sentenced to dissection by the Za'lek.
#. --
msgid "Minerva Judgement"
msgstr "Juicio de Minerva"

#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not accepted yet
#. 1. fly to Jade Court
#. Zuri gives the mission to go to court at minerva
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The future of Minerva Station is at stake with deliberations being held at "
"{spb} in the {sys} system. Zuri has asked you to take her to the courtroom "
"to see if it is possible to influence the case."
msgstr ""
"El futuro de la Estación Minerva está en juego con las deliberaciones que se "
"celebran en {spb} en el sistema {sys}. Zuri te ha pedido que la lleves a la "
"sala para ver si es posible influir en el caso."

msgid "The future of Minerva Station!"
msgstr "¡El futuro de la Estación Minerva!"

msgid ""
"You find Zuri waving to you at the bar. It seems like she finished whatever "
"she had to do."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zuri saludándote en el bar. Parece que ha terminado lo que "
"tenía que hacer."

msgid ""
"\"OK, I've got some help, they'll meet up with us on {spb}. I have no idea "
"what to expect out of all of this, but it seems like a pretty good damn "
"chance to clear up Minerva Station if we play our cards right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bien, conseguí ayuda, se reunirán con nosotros en {spb}. No tengo ni idea "
"de qué esperar de todo esto, pero parece una maldita buena oportunidad de "
"limpiar la estación Minerva si jugamos bien nuestras cartas.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'll be going with you on your ship to {spb}. We don't really have much of "
"a plan but to show up, and hope that all the data collected will be useful "
"for us. You ready to take us to the {sys} system and do this?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Iré contigo en tu nave a {spb}. En realidad no tenemos mucho más plan que "
"presentarnos y esperar que todos los datos recogidos nos sean útiles. ¿Estás "
"listo para llevarnos al sistema {sys} y hacer esto?\""

msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr "¡Vamos!"

msgid ""
"You tell Zuri to give you a bit of time to prepare and leave her waiting at "
"the bar."
msgstr ""
"Le dices a Zuri que te dé un poco de tiempo para prepararte y la dejas "
"esperando en el bar."

msgid "\"Great! Take us to {spb} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr "\"¡Genial! Llévanos a {spb} en el sistema {sys}.\""

msgid "Zuri"
msgstr "Zuri"

msgid ""
"A mysterious character that has been hiring you to 'free' Minerva Station."
msgstr ""
"Un misterioso personaje que te ha contratado para \"liberar\" la Estación "
"Minerva."

msgid "Go to {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Ve a {spb} (sistema {sys})"

#.
#. - minerva_altercation_helped ("dvaered", "zalek", nil)
#. - maikki_gave_drink (true, nil)
#. - maikki_response ("yes", "no", nil)
#. - maikki_scavengers_alive (true, nil)
#. - harper_ticket ("credits", "tokens", "free", "stole" )
#. - strangelove_death ("unplug", "comforted", "shot", nil)
#. --
#. Main characters
msgid "Judge Holmes"
msgstr "Juez Holmes"

msgid "Za'lek Lawyer"
msgstr "Abogado Za'lek"

msgid "Dvaered Representative"
msgstr "Representante Dvaered"

msgid "You meet up with Zuri who is stretching her legs."
msgstr "Te encuentras con Zuri, que está estirando las piernas."

msgid ""
"\"Ready to go to court? It's my first time not going as a defendant! "
"Although I do feel quite like one. We must ensure the best for Minerva "
"Station.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Listo para ir al tribunal? Es la primera vez que no voy como acusado. "
"Aunque me siento como tal. Debemos asegurar lo mejor para la Estación "
"Minerva.\""

msgid "Go to the courtroom."
msgstr "Ir a la sala del tribunal."

msgid "You decide to postpone deciding the future of Minerva Station."
msgstr "Decides aplazar la decisión sobre el futuro de la Estación Minerva."

msgid ""
"The station seems to be crowded with the many simultaneous trials and "
"ongoings. Watching people bustling around with unpredictable patterns is "
"surprisingly entertaining, however, you remember your purpose and follow "
"Zuri to the assigned courtroom."
msgstr ""
"LLa comisaría parece abarrotada por los numerosos juicios simultáneos que se "
"celebran. Viendo a la gente bullir con patrones impredecibles es "
"sorprendentemente entretenido, sin embargo, recuerdas tu propósito y sigues "
"a Zuri a la sala de audiencias asignada."

#. TODO trial music
#. TODO background?
msgid ""
"After getting lost in the corridors overflowing with people several times, "
"you make it to the courtroom. It seems to be quite packed and the ambience "
"electric, with uncertainty about how the upcoming legal drama would unfold."
msgstr ""
"Tras perderte varias veces por los pasillos rebosantes de gente, llegas a la "
"sala del tribunal. Parece bastante abarrotada y el ambiente esta cargado de "
"tensión, con la incertidumbre de cómo se desarrollará el drama jurídico que "
"se avecina."

msgid ""
"Zuri turns to you.\n"
"\"I'll be right back, I have to prepare some things. Take a set and hold on "
"tight! I have a feeling this trial is going to be wild.\""
msgstr ""
"Zuri se vuelve hacia ti.\n"
"\"Vuelvo enseguida, tengo que preparar algunas cosas. ¡Prepárate!. Tengo la "
"sensación de que este juicio va a ser salvaje.\""

msgid ""
"Zuri leaves you and not having anything better to do in the clamorous room, "
"you find an empty seat and sit down."
msgstr ""
"Zuri te deja y, al no tener nada mejor que hacer en la clamorosa sala, "
"buscas un asiento vacío y te sientas."

msgid ""
"Without anything better to do, you begin to observe your surroundings. "
"Looking around the public you could make out quite a few figures you know."
msgstr ""
"Sin nada mejor que hacer, empiezas a observar tu entorno. Mirando alrededor "
"del público puedes distinguir bastantes figuras conocidas."

msgid ""
"The Minerva CEO is near the front of the crowd, he seems to be quite pale "
"and not looking very well."
msgstr ""
"El Director General de Minerva está cerca de la parte delantera de la "
"multitud, parece estar bastante pálido y no tiene muy buen aspecto."

msgid ""
"To the left is the Za'lek crowd. They seem to be intently comparing notes "
"and discussing amongst themselves."
msgstr ""
"A la izquierda está la multitud Za'lek. Parecen estar comparando notas y "
"discutiendo entre ellos."

msgid ""
"To the right are the Dvaered officials. They seem to boisterously arguing "
"with each other."
msgstr ""
"A la derecha están los funcionarios Dvaered. Parecen discutir "
"bulliciosamente entre ellos."

msgid "Wait, what is Maikki doing here?"
msgstr "Espera, ¿qué está haciendo Maikki aquí?"

msgid ""
"Even weirder, it seems like Kex is also at the court... How did they get "
"here?"
msgstr ""
"Aún más extraño, parece que Kex también está en la corte... ¿Cómo llegaron "
"aquí?"

msgid ""
"Before you can try to do anything, suddenly a hush fills the room. It seems "
"like the show is about to start."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que puedas intentar hacer nada, de repente un silencio llena la "
"sala. Parece que el espectáculo está a punto de comenzar."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A judge floats up to the centre of the room.\n"
"\"Order! Order!\"\n"
"She hits her gavel."
msgstr ""
"Un juez flota hasta el centro de la sala.\n"
"\"¡Orden! Orden!\"\n"
"Golpea con su mazo."

msgid "Except for the odd cough, silence envelops the room."
msgstr "Salvo alguna que otra tos, el silencio envuelve la habitación."

msgid ""
"\"We are gathered here to day to deliberate over the future of Minerva "
"Station, which has been accused of falling into debauchery and lawlessness. "
"These are very serious accusation that question the sovereignty of Minerva "
"Station, which currently enjoys the privilege of independent rule.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nos hemos reunido hoy aquí para deliberar sobre el futuro de la Estación "
"Minerva, que ha sido acusada de caer en el libertinaje y la anarquía. Son "
"acusaciones muy graves que cuestionan la soberanía de la Estación Minerva, "
"que actualmente goza del privilegio de un gobierno independiente.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"According to Principle of System Sovereignty, the parties who have claims on "
"the system have the right for equal, fair, and honest deliberations that "
"partake in the distribution of powers."
msgstr ""
"Según el Principio de Soberanía del Sistema, las partes que tienen "
"pretensiones sobre el sistema tienen derecho a deliberaciones equitativas, "
"justas y honestas sobre la participación en la distribución de poderes."

msgid ""
"\"In the case of Minerva Station, the three parties involved are House "
"Za'lek...\""
msgstr ""
"\"En el caso de la Estación Minerva, las tres partes implicadas son la Casa "
"Za'lek...\""

msgid ""
"The Za'lek lawyer does a short concise bow.\n"
"\"Your honour.\""
msgstr ""
"El abogado Za'lek hace una breve y concisa reverencia.\n"
"\"Su Señoría.\""

msgid "\"...House Dvaered...\""
msgstr "\"...Casa Dvaered...\""

msgid ""
"The Dvaered representative does an exaggerated deep bow.\n"
"\"Your honour.\""
msgstr ""
"El representante Dvaered hace una exagerada y profunda reverencia.\n"
"\"Su Señoría.\""

msgid "\"..and the CEO of Minerva Station.\""
msgstr "\"... y el director general de la estación Minerva.\""

msgid ""
"A pale feverishly sweating Minerva CEO stands up.\n"
"\"Your h...\"\n"
"...and promptly collapses in a puddle of their sweat."
msgstr ""
"Un pálido sudor febril Director General de Minerva se levanta.\n"
"\"Su s...\"\n"
"...y enseguida se desploma en un charco de su sudor."

msgid ""
"A collective gasp is let out in the courtroom. Not the best way to start the "
"deliberations."
msgstr ""
"En la sala se oye un grito ahogado. No es la mejor manera de empezar las "
"deliberaciones."

msgid ""
"The judge clicks her tongue in annoyance.\n"
"\"Passing out without filing an EJ-2891? Unheard of.\""
msgstr ""
"La juez chasquea la lengua, molesta.\n"
"\"¿Desmayarse sin presentar un EJ-2891? Inaudito.\""

msgid "Suddenly, Maikki stands up and raises a wad of papers."
msgstr "De repente, Maikki se levanta y alza un fajo de papeles."

msgid ""
"\"Is that the EJ-2891? Go on.\"\n"
"The judge nods towards Maikki, giving her permission to speak."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Es ese el EJ-2891? Adelante.\"\n"
"El juez asiente hacia Maikki, dándole permiso para hablar."

msgid ""
"\"Your honour.\"\n"
"Maikki gives an impeccable formal bow."
msgstr ""
"\"Su Señoría.\"\n"
"Maikki hace una impecable reverencia formal."

msgid ""
"\"I would like to submit an EJ-7777 motion to substitute the Minerva CEO.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría presentar una moción EJ-7777 para sustituir al Director "
"General de Minerva.\""

msgid ""
"The judge makes a curious expression and hovers down to collect the papers "
"from Maikki. She quickly skims over it, and gives a sly grin."
msgstr ""
"El juez hace una expresión curiosa y se agacha para recoger los papeles de "
"Maikki. Los hojea rápidamente y esboza una sonrisa socarrona."

msgid ""
"\"Well it seems like the deliberations will be able to proceed today. "
"Replacing the previous individual, we have Maisie McPherson, who will be "
"representing the independent interests of Minerva Station. Please sit down.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, parece que las deliberaciones podrán proceder hoy. Reemplazando al "
"individuo anterior, tenemos a Maisie McPherson, que representará los "
"intereses independientes de la Estación Minerva. Por favor, tomen asiento.\""

msgid ""
"You see Zuri out of the corner of your eye dragging away the body of the "
"Minerva CEO. Is that even legal?"
msgstr ""
"Ves a Zuri por el rabillo del ojo arrastrando el cuerpo del Director General "
"de Minerva. ¿Es eso legal?"

msgid ""
"\"All parties are present and accounted for. Let us proceed to the "
"deliberations. Given the order of the filing, House Za'lek shall be the "
"first to begin deliberations on the subject at hand. House Za'lek, please "
"begin with your exposition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todas las partes están presentes. Procedamos a las deliberaciones. Dado el "
"orden de presentación, la Casa Za'lek será la primera en comenzar las "
"deliberaciones sobre el tema que nos ocupa. Casa Za'lek, por favor comience "
"con su exposición.\""

msgid "You hear some flutter of papers as the process begins its ascent."
msgstr "Se oye un revoloteo de papeles cuando el proceso comienza su ascenso."

#. Reset positions
msgid ""
"The Za'lek Lawyer stands up, clears their throat and begins.\n"
"\"Ladies and gentlemen, it is long known that Minerva Station is a stain on "
"the galactic map. Despite all the excellent potential, it has been "
"squandered away during cycles neither benefiting the Empire nor the Great "
"Houses.\""
msgstr ""
"El Abogado Za'lek se levanta, se aclara la garganta y comienza.\n"
"\"Damas y caballeros, hace tiempo que se sabe que la Estación Minerva es una "
"mancha en el mapa galáctico. A pesar de su excelente potencial, ha sido "
"dilapidada durante ciclos que no han beneficiado ni al Imperio ni a las "
"Grandes Casas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Today, I stand before you as the representative of House Za'lek, armed not "
"only with legal expertise, but intellect that has guided our House to "
"prosperity throughout the Empire. I shall present a compelling case as to "
"why Minerva Station rightfully belongs to House Za'lek.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hoy me presento ante ustedes como representante de la Casa Za'lek, armado "
"no sólo con experiencia legal, sino con el intelecto que ha guiado a nuestra "
"Casa a la prosperidad en todo el Imperio. Presentaré un caso convincente de "
"por qué la Estación Minerva pertenece legítimamente a la Casa Za'lek.\""

msgid "Narrator"
msgstr "Narrador"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Za'lek Lawyer gives a meticulously prepared and organized speech "
"regarding the plans and benefits that House Za'lek can bring to Minerva "
"Station with a focus on the track record of House Za'lek and the potential "
"for refocussing the station as a cultural enlightenment centre to improve "
"collaboration amongst the great houses."
msgstr ""
"El Abogado Za'lek pronuncia un discurso meticulosamente preparado y "
"organizado sobre los planes y beneficios que la Casa Za'lek puede aportar a "
"la Estación Minerva, centrándose en el historial de la Casa Za'lek y en el "
"potencial de reorientar la estación como centro de iluminación cultural para "
"mejorar la colaboración entre las grandes casas."

msgid ""
"\"...In conclusion, I am confident that your wisdom and discernment will "
"lead you to make the just and informed decision, aligning the fate of this "
"space station with the unmatched expertise and vision of House Za'lek.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...En conclusión, confío en que su sabiduría y discernimiento le lleven a "
"tomar la decisión justa e informada, alineando el destino de esta estación "
"espacial con la incomparable experiencia y visión de la Casa Za'lek.\""

msgid "\"Let us continue with House Dvaered.\""
msgstr "\"Sigamos con la Casa Dvaered.\""

msgid ""
"The Dvaered Representative briskly stands up and begins to talk with a loud "
"voice that echoes in the room.\n"
"\"Ladies and gentlemen of the court, esteemed Judges, and respected "
"attendees,\""
msgstr ""
"El Representante Dvaered se levanta enérgicamente y comienza a hablar con "
"una voz fuerte que resuena en la sala.\n"
"\"Señoras y señores de la corte, estimados jueces y respetados asistentes,\""

msgid ""
"\"Today, I stand before you as the representative of House Dvaered, a house "
"known for its strength, determination, and unwavering pursuit of victory. I "
"come before you with passion and conviction. I will argue why the ownership "
"of Minerva Station belongs to House Dvaered.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hoy me presento ante ustedes como representante de la Casa Dvaered, una "
"casa conocida por su fuerza, determinación e inquebrantable búsqueda de la "
"victoria. Me presento ante ustedes con pasión y convicción. Argumentaré por "
"qué la propiedad de la Estación Minerva pertenece a la Casa Dvaered.\""

msgid ""
"The Dvaered Representative goes on about how only House Dvaered can crush "
"weakness, disobedience, and insubordination through rigorous discipline and "
"punishment. They argue how this has worked for many of their planets, "
"turning them from dens of piracy, to beacons of order."
msgstr ""
"El representante Dvaered habla de cómo sólo la Casa Dvaered puede aplastar "
"la debilidad, la desobediencia y la insubordinación mediante una disciplina "
"y un castigo rigurosos. Argumentan que esto ha funcionado en muchos de sus "
"planetas, convirtiéndolos de guaridas de piratas en faros del orden."

msgid ""
"\"...In conclusion, I ask you to embrace the spirit of House Dvaered. Our "
"strength, our desire for conquest, our loyalty, and our commitment to "
"justice make us the natural choice for owning Minerva Station.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...En conclusión, les pido que abracen el espíritu de la Casa Dvaered. "
"Nuestra fuerza, nuestro deseo de conquista, nuestra lealtad y nuestro "
"compromiso con la justicia nos convierten en la elección natural para poseer "
"la Estación Minerva.\""

msgid "\"Last is the independent exposition.\""
msgstr "\"La última es la exposición independiente.\""

msgid ""
"Maikki stands up to begin her exposition.\n"
"\"Your honour.\""
msgstr ""
"Maikki se levanta para comenzar su exposición.\n"
"\"Su Señoría.\""

msgid ""
"\"Today, we gather here to determine the fate of a celestial jewel, a "
"bastion of hope, and a symbol of untethered possibility—the sovereignty of "
"Minerva Station. I stand before you as an advocate for the voice of freedom, "
"the embodiment of autonomy, and the guardian of neutrality.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hoy nos reunimos aquí para determinar el destino de una joya celestial, un "
"bastión de esperanza y un símbolo de posibilidades sin ataduras: la "
"soberanía de la estación Minerva. Me presento ante ustedes como defensor de "
"la voz de la libertad, encarnación de la autonomía y guardián de la "
"neutralidad.\""

msgid ""
"\"We find ourselves in the midst of a clash between the titans of power and "
"influence: the sly House Za'lek and the aggressive House Dvaered. They seek "
"dominion over this station, driven by their thirst for control and their "
"insatiable desire for conquest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nos encontramos en medio de un enfrentamiento entre los titanes del poder "
"y la influencia: la astuta Casa Za'lek y la agresiva Casa Dvaered. Buscan el "
"dominio de esta estación, impulsados por su sed de control y su insaciable "
"deseo de conquista.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yet, amidst this power struggle, we must not lose sight of the value "
"inherent in independence. Minerva Station, free from the shackles of "
"allegiance, stands as a sanctuary away from the clutches of power-hungry "
"houses. In its independence, Minerva Station supports trade and diplomacy "
"throughout the Empire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, en medio de esta lucha por el poder, no debemos perder de "
"vista el valor inherente a la independencia. La estación Minerva, libre de "
"los grilletes de la lealtad, se erige como un santuario alejado de las "
"garras de las casas ávidas de poder. En su independencia, la Estación "
"Minerva apoya el comercio y la diplomacia en todo el Imperio.\""

msgid ""
"\"To subject this station to the dominion of either House Za'lek or House "
"Dvaered would be to shackle it, to stifle the boundless potential that has "
"blossomed under its independent governance. Although foreign interference "
"has created instability in the system, this is nothing that can not be "
"solved by an independent government once free of Great House interference.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Someter esta estación al dominio de la Casa Za'lek o de la Casa Dvaered "
"sería encadenarla, sofocar el ilimitado potencial que ha florecido bajo su "
"gobierno independiente. Aunque la interferencia extranjera ha creado "
"inestabilidad en el sistema, esto no es nada que no pueda resolver un "
"gobierno independiente una vez libre de la interferencia de las Grandes "
"Casas.\""

msgid ""
"\"The choice is clear: we must uphold the independence of this station, for "
"the stability of the Empire, for the advancement of science and knowledge, "
"and for the preservation of our shared ideals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La elección es clara: debemos mantener la independencia de esta estación, "
"por la estabilidad del Imperio, por el avance de la ciencia y el "
"conocimiento, y por la preservación de nuestros ideales compartidos.\""

msgid "\"Let us proceed with the presentation of evidence.\""
msgstr "\"Procedamos con la presentación de pruebas.\""

msgid ""
"First House Za'lek begins to present evidence, presenting results of "
"economical and social growth in systems that were handed-over to the House "
"in the original days. They also call in an expert who presents testimony and "
"highlights the differences with House Dvaered. The Dvaered Representative "
"raises objections, but they are overruled. Overall it is quite a scientific "
"and dry exposition, albeit sound and well established on facts. "
msgstr ""
"En primer lugar, la Casa Za'lek comienza a presentar pruebas, presentando "
"los resultados del crecimiento económico y social en los sistemas que fueron "
"entregados a la Casa en los días originales. También llaman a un experto que "
"presenta su testimonio y destaca las diferencias con la Casa Dvaered. El "
"representante Dvaered plantea objeciones, pero son desestimadas. En general, "
"se trata de una exposición bastante científica y árida, aunque sólida y bien "
"fundamentada en hechos. "

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Next comes House Dvaered that presents a more emotional defence of Dvaered "
"prosperity, instead of relying on economic indicators, they use social "
"analysis and questionnaire results to show increased levels of relative "
"happiness compared to Za'lek territory, where objections by the Za'lek "
"Lawyer are overruled. Finally, they bring a Dvaered expert to testify on how "
"House Dvaered has a curtailing effect on piracy and unwanted behaviours. All "
"in all, as expected from House Dvaered."
msgstr ""
"A continuación llega la Casa Dvaered que presenta una defensa más emocional "
"de la prosperidad Dvaered, en lugar de basarse en indicadores económicos, "
"utilizan el análisis social y los resultados de cuestionarios para demostrar "
"el aumento de los niveles de felicidad relativa en comparación con el "
"territorio Za'lek, donde las objeciones del Abogado Za'lek son desestimadas. "
"Por último, traen a un experto Dvaered para que testifique sobre cómo la "
"Casa Dvaered tiene un efecto restrictivo sobre la piratería y los "
"comportamientos no deseados. En definitiva, lo esperado de la Casa Dvaered."

msgid "Next is Maikki's turn..."
msgstr "A continuación es el turno de Maikki..."

msgid ""
"\"Your honour, I do not believe House Za'lek and House Dvaered are being "
"honest with the courtroom. They paint a picture of roses and hearts, when "
"the reality of their proposal is uniformity and subjugation. I would like to "
"call {playername} to the stand as my witness to set the record straight on "
"the unscrupulous behaviour and depravity of House Za'lek and Dvaered.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Señoría, no creo que la Casa Za'lek y la Casa Dvaered estén siendo "
"honestas con la sala. Pintan un cuadro de rosas y corazones, cuando la "
"realidad de su propuesta es la uniformidad y el sometimiento. Me gustaría "
"llamar a {playername} al estrado como testigo para aclarar el comportamiento "
"sin escrúpulos y la depravación de la Casa Za'lek y Dvaered.\""

msgid ""
"There is an audible gasp among the crowd with both the Za'lek lawyer and "
"Dvaered representative pushing for objectives that quickly get overruled."
msgstr ""
"Tanto el abogado Za'lek como el representante Dvaered protestan aunque son "
"rápidamente rechazadas."

msgid ""
"Before you have a chance to process what happened, you are ushered to a "
"podium with a live microphone in front of you. The Empire rule codex is "
"thrust under your hands, and you are forced to swear an oath of "
"truthfulness. What could Maikki be thinking?"
msgstr ""
"Antes de que puedas procesar lo ocurrido, te conducen a un podio con un "
"micrófono delante. Te ponen en las manos el códice del Imperio y te obligan "
"a jurar fidelidad. ¿Qué estará pensando Maikki?"

msgid ""
"{playername}, you can attest for the constant bickering and fighting between "
"House Za'lek and House Dvaered at Minerva Station. Is it not true that you "
"were dragged into a firefight right outside Minerva Station."
msgstr ""
"{playername}, puedes dar fe de las constantes riñas y peleas entre la Casa "
"Za'lek y la Casa Dvaered en la Estación Minerva. ¿No es cierto que fuiste "
"arrastrado a un tiroteo justo fuera de la estación Minerva."

msgid "\"House Za'lek provoked House Dvaered.\""
msgstr "\"La Casa Za'lek provocó a la Casa Dvaered.\""

msgid "\"House Dvaered attacked House Za'lek.\""
msgstr "\"La Casa Dvaered atacó a la Casa Za'lek.\""

msgid "\"Both houses were picking fights.\""
msgstr "\"Ambas casas estaban buscando pelea.\""

#. Set positions
msgid ""
"\"Objection! {playername} sided with the Dvaered and brutishly helped "
"destroy a House Za'lek vessel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Protesto! {playername} se puso del lado de los Dvaered y ayudó "
"brutalmente a destruir una nave de la Casa Za'lek!\""

msgid "Maikki frowns a bit."
msgstr "Maikki frunce un poco el ceño."

msgid ""
"\"Objection! {playername} joined the fight with House Za'lek and backstabbed "
"the Dvaered vessel!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Protesto! {playername} se unió a la lucha con la Casa Za'lek y apuñaló "
"por la espalda a la nave Dvaered!\""

msgid ""
"\"What is important is that such fighting creates uncertainty, and "
"insecurity at Minerva Station.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo importante es que esos enfrentamientos crean incertidumbre e "
"inseguridad en la estación Minerva.\""

msgid ""
"\"Was or was not Minerva Station infiltrated by House Dvaered, who went so "
"far to plant a mole employee in the gambling operations?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Fue o no fue la Estación Minerva infiltrada por la Casa Dvaered, que "
"llegó a plantar un empleado topo en las operaciones de juego?\""

msgid ""
"You state the facts you remember, avoiding mentioning the fact you helped "
"kidnap them and so forth."
msgstr ""
"Expones los hechos que recuerdas, evitando mencionar el hecho de que "
"ayudaste a secuestrarlos y demás."

msgid ""
"\"Your honour, this establishes that House Dvaered was actively attempting "
"to undermine Minerva Station even though it is under independence rule!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Su Señoría, esto establece que la Casa Dvaered intentaba activamente "
"socavar la Estación Minerva a pesar de estar bajo el gobierno de la "
"independencia!\""

msgid ""
"\"Furthermore, {playername}, is it true or not that House Za'lek established "
"listening post in order to capture communications near Minerva Station and "
"thus violate the sovereignty of the independent space?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Además, {playername}, ¿es cierto o no que la Casa Za'lek estableció un "
"puesto de escucha con el fin de captar las comunicaciones cerca de la "
"Estación Minerva y violar así la soberanía del espacio independiente?\""

msgid ""
"You once again state the facts, avoiding mentioning you were the one who "
"blew it all up."
msgstr ""
"Una vez más expones los hechos, evitando mencionar que fuiste tú quien lo "
"reventó todo."

msgid ""
"\"See, Your Honour, not only can we put in doubt House Dvaered's ill "
"intentions, House Za'lek was also undermining the independence of Minerva "
"Station!\""
msgstr ""
"\" Verá, Su Señoría, no sólo podemos poner en duda las malas intenciones de "
"la Casa Dvaered, ¡la Casa Za'lek también estaba socavando la independencia "
"de la Estación Minerva!\""

msgid ""
"\"House Dvaered and House Za'lek can not be trusted, and the only way to "
"ensure the local prosperity is to ensure the independence of Minerva Station."
"\"\n"
"Having finished her interrogation, Maikki sits down."
msgstr ""
"\"La Casa Dvaered y la Casa Za'lek no son de fiar, y la única forma de "
"garantizar la prosperidad local es asegurar la independencia de la Estación "
"Minerva.\"\n"
"Habiendo terminado su interrogatorio, Maikki se sienta."

msgid ""
"\"{playername}, although we already know you have a taste for House Dvaered, "
"let us see how trustworthy you really are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{playername}, aunque ya sabemos que te gusta la Casa Dvaered, veamos cuán "
"digno de confianza eres realmente.\""

msgid "\"{playername}, let us see how trustworthy you really are.\""
msgstr "\"{playername}, veamos cuán digno de confianza eres realmente.\""

msgid ""
"\"There have been reports of scavengers missing at the {stealthsys} system, "
"you wouldn't know anything about that, would you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ha habido informes de carroñeros desaparecidos en el sistema {stealthsys}, "
"no sabrás nada de eso, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "\"I have no idea what you are talking about.\""
msgstr "\"No tengo ni idea de lo que estás hablando.\""

msgid "\"I remember blowing up scavengers there.\""
msgstr "\"Recuerdo haber volado carroñeros allí.\""

msgid "\"I met some, but nothing happened.\""
msgstr "\"Conocí a algunos, pero no pasó nada.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Not only did {playername} meet up with the scavengers, they blew them up, "
"and left their remains in the Nebula!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡No sólo {playername} se encontró con los carroñeros, sino que los volaron "
"por los aires y dejaron sus restos en la Nebulosa!\""

msgid "\"We're not dead!\""
msgstr "\"¡No estamos muertos!\""

msgid "Murmurs spread across the room as the Dvaered Representative frowns."
msgstr ""
"Los murmullos se extienden por la sala mientras el representante Dvaered "
"frunce el ceño."

msgid ""
"\"Here is the proof in the black box we recovered from the scavenger ships. "
"We can see that the last moments clearly log {playername}'s ship attacking "
"them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aquí está la prueba en la caja negra que recuperamos de las naves "
"carroñeras. Podemos ver que los últimos momentos registran claramente la "
"nave de {playername} atacándolos.\""

msgid ""
"\"So you admit to destroying civilian vessels in the Nebula, does this not "
"make you a pirate? We ought to have a trial about your infamy, rather than "
"the future of Minerva Station!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que admites haber destruido naves civiles en la Nebulosa, ¿no te "
"convierte esto en un pirata? ¡Deberíamos tener un juicio sobre tu infamia, "
"en vez de sobre el futuro de la Estación Minerva!\""

msgid ""
"The Dvaered representative looks puzzled.\n"
"\"{playername} may have not destroyed the scavengers as we have thought, but "
"this does show that they do not speak the truth.\""
msgstr ""
"El representante Dvaered parece desconcertado.\n"
"\"Puede que {playername} no haya destruido a los carroñeros como habíamos "
"pensado, pero esto demuestra que no dicen la verdad.\""

msgid ""
"\"I would like to ask about your relationship with the Independent Counsel, "
"Maisie McPherson. What is your relationship?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría preguntarle sobre su relación con la Consejera Independiente, "
"Maisie McPherson. ¿Cuál es su relación?\""

msgid "Maikki objects, but is overruled."
msgstr "Maikki protesta, pero es rechazada."

msgid "\"Just met her.\""
msgstr "\"Acabo de conocerla.\""

msgid "\"We are friends.\""
msgstr "\"Somos amigos.\""

msgid "\"I have seen her at Minerva Station.\""
msgstr "\"La he visto en la Estación Minerva.\""

msgid "\"Then I would like to ask the witness what is this.\""
msgstr "\"Entonces me gustaría preguntar al testigo qué es esto.\""

msgid ""
"They show a clear picture of you buying Maikki a drink on Minerva station."
msgstr ""
"Muestran una imagen clara de ti invitando a Maikki a una copa en la estación "
"de Minerva."

msgid ""
"\"I would like to question the impartiality of the witness. With such a "
"close relationship with the independent counsel, it is likely they have "
"ulterior motivations regarding their declarations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría cuestionar la imparcialidad del testigo. Con una relación tan "
"estrecha con el abogado independiente, es probable que tengan motivaciones "
"ocultas respecto a sus declaraciones.\""

msgid "\"I have no further questions for the witness.\""
msgstr "\"No tengo más preguntas para el testigo.\""

msgid "Finally, it is House Za'lek's interrogation."
msgstr "Por último, es el interrogatorio de la Casa Za'lek."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"{playername}, although you seem to have a preference for joining House "
"Dvaered in brutish ways against House Za'lek. Let us put that aside to "
"analyse your personality and lack of trustworthiness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{playername}, aunque pareces tener preferencia por unirte a la Casa "
"Dvaered en formas brutas contra la Casa Za'lek. Dejemos eso a un lado para "
"analizar tu personalidad y tu falta de credibilidad.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"{playername}, let us analyse your personality and lack of trustworthiness."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"{playername}, analicemos tu personalidad y tu falta de credibilidad.\""

#. "credits", "tokens", "free", "stole"
msgid "\"Do you know an individual know as Harper Bowdown?\""
msgstr "\"¿Conoces a un individuo conocido como Harper Bowdown?\""

msgid "\"Never met them.\""
msgstr "\"Nunca lo conocí.\""

msgid "\"They gave me their winning ticket.\""
msgstr "\"Me dio su billete ganador.\""

msgid "\"I took their winning ticket.\""
msgstr "\"Le quité su boleto ganador.\""

msgid ""
"\"Not only do we have a testimony from Harper Bowdown that you met them, but "
"that you forcibly took their possessions, a winning ticket from a Minerva "
"Station raffle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No sólo tenemos un testimonio de Harper Bowdown de que te encontraste con "
"él, sino de que te llevaste por la fuerza su posesión, ¡un boleto ganador de "
"una rifa de la Estación Minerva!\""

msgid ""
"\"You say they gave you their winning ticket, but we have a testimony from "
"Harper Bowdown where they say you intimidated and took the ticket by force!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Dices que te dio su boleto ganador, pero tenemos un testimonio de Harper "
"Bowdown donde dicen que lo intimidaste y tomaste el boleto a la fuerza!\""

msgid ""
"\"Let it be noted that {playername} admits to using intimidation and force "
"to deprive a legal Imperial citizen of their possessions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Que conste que {playername} admite haber usado la intimidación y la "
"fuerza para privar de sus posesiones a un ciudadano imperial legal!\""

#. "unplug", "comforted", "shot", nil
msgid ""
"The Za'lek Lawyer looks at their notes.\n"
"\"Let us see, {playername}, you wouldn't know what happened to the Za'lek "
"Scientist Dr. Strangelove?\""
msgstr ""
"El Abogado Za'lek mira sus notas.\n"
"\"Veamos, {playername}, ¿no sabrás lo que le pasó al científico Za'lek Dr. "
"Strangelove?\""

msgid "\"He got what he deserved.\""
msgstr "\"Tuvo lo que se merecía.\""

msgid "\"I killed him.\""
msgstr "\"Yo lo maté.\""

msgid "\"He passed away.\""
msgstr "\"Él falleció.\""

msgid ""
"\"You see, {playername}, we were able to recover the black box from Dr. "
"Strangelove's ship. The audio log is not clear, but it seems like you were "
"there at that moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Verás, {playername}, pudimos recuperar la caja negra de la nave del Dr. "
"Strangelove. El registro de audio no es claro, pero parece que estabas allí "
"en ese momento.\""

msgid ""
"\"You see, {playername}, we were able to recover the black box from Dr. "
"Strangelove's ship. The audio log makes it clear that you were the one to "
"end their life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Verás, {playername}, pudimos recuperar la caja negra de la nave del Dr. "
"Strangelove. El registro de audio deja claro que fuiste tú quien acabó con "
"su vida.\""

