#. end )
#. end
#. --
msgid ""
"\"Your honour, {playername} confesses to the murder of Dr. Strangelove.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Su Señoría, {playername} confiesa el asesinato del Dr. Strangelove.\""

msgid ""
"\"Although the exact details of what happened between {playername} and Dr. "
"Strangelove is not clear, that should be subject to another trial, what is "
"clear is that {playername} can not be trusted, and their testimony should be "
"invalidated.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque los detalles exactos de lo que ocurrió entre {playername} y el Dr. "
"Strangelove no están claros, eso debería ser objeto de otro juicio, lo que "
"está claro es que {playername} no es de fiar, y su testimonio debe ser "
"invalidado.\""

msgid ""
"\"That is all I have to say.\"\n"
"The Za'lek Lawyer sits down."
msgstr ""
"\"Eso es todo lo que tengo que decir.\"\n"
"El Abogado Za'lek se sienta."

msgid "\"{playername}, you may return to your seat.\""
msgstr "\"{playername}, puede volver a tu asiento.\""

msgid ""
"The dispositions continue with more formalities with all sides calling for "
"motions and objecting, however, it does not seem like much is being added to "
"the arguments.\n"
"\n"
"House Za'lek and House Dvaered seem to be generally on the passive, while "
"Maikki is very aggressive pressing the houses without giving them much room "
"to breathe.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually when all argumentation is exhausted the different representatives "
"repeat their main points before judgement is passed."
msgstr ""
"Las disposiciones continúan con más formalidades con todas las partes "
"pidiendo mociones y objetando, sin embargo, no parece que se esté añadiendo "
"mucho a los argumentos.\n"
"\n"
"La Casa Za'lek y la Casa Dvaered parecen en general pasivas, mientras que "
"Maikki se muestra muy agresiva presionando a las casas sin darles mucho "
"espacio para respirar.\n"
"\n"
"Finalmente, cuando se agota toda la argumentación, los diferentes "
"representantes repiten sus puntos principales antes de que se dicte "
"sentencia."

#.
#. The total points the player can get are below:
#.
#. zl_points in [-2,+2]
#. dv_points in [-1,+2]
#. pir_points in [-3,+2]
#. --
#. Case House Za'lek "wins"
#. Case House Dvaered "wins"
#. Last case "pirates" win
msgid "\"With the deliberations over, it is time to pass judgement.\""
msgstr "\"Concluidas las deliberaciones, es hora de dictar sentencia.\""

msgid ""
"\"After carefully hearing the arguments presented by the different parties, "
"sovereignty of Minerva Station shall be given to House Za'lek. It is a tough "
"decision, however, House Za'lek offers the best guarantees to stability and "
"prosperity for the station and the system.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tras escuchar atentamente los argumentos presentados por las diferentes "
"partes, la soberanía de la estación Minerva será otorgada a la Casa Za'lek. "
"Es una decisión difícil, sin embargo, la Casa Za'lek ofrece las mejores "
"garantías de estabilidad y prosperidad para la estación y el sistema.\""

msgid ""
"\"After carefully hearing the arguments presented by the different parties, "
"sovereignty of Minerva Station shall be given to House Dvaered. It is a "
"tough decision, however, House Dvaered offers the best guarantees for "
"security and stability for Minerva station and the system.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tras escuchar atentamente los argumentos presentados por las diferentes "
"partes, la soberanía de la estación Minerva será otorgada a la Casa Dvaered. "
"Es una decisión difícil, sin embargo, la Casa Dvaered ofrece las mejores "
"garantías de seguridad y estabilidad para la estación Minerva y el sistema.\""

msgid ""
"\"After carefully hearing the arguments presented by the different parties, "
"sovereignty of Minerva Station shall be kept independent. It is a tough "
"decision, however, independence offers the best continuity for Minerva "
"Station. Additional supervision will be provided by the Empire until the "
"situation improves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tras escuchar atentamente los argumentos presentados por las distintas "
"partes, la soberanía de la estación Minerva se mantendrá independiente. Es "
"una decisión difícil, sin embargo, la independencia ofrece la mejor "
"continuidad para la Estación Minerva. El Imperio proporcionará supervisión "
"adicional hasta que la situación mejore.\""

msgid "\"This concludes...\""
msgstr "\"Esto concluye...\""

msgid ""
"Suddenly, Kex flies up to the roof and perches himself on a small "
"indentation."
msgstr ""
"De repente, Kex vuela hasta el tejado y se posa en una pequeña hendidura."

msgid "\"It's all a scam! Fraud! Fraud! Fraud! Fraud!\""
msgstr "\"¡Todo es una estafa! ¡Un fraude! ¡Fraude! ¡Fraude! ¡Fraude!\""

msgid ""
"The people in the room gasp, but don't know how to react to the abrupt "
"development. Security guards draw their weapons, but are hesitant to shoot."
msgstr ""
"Los presentes se quedan boquiabiertos, pero no saben cómo reaccionar. Los "
"guardias de seguridad desenfundan sus armas, pero dudan en disparar."

msgid ""
"\"All this bickering and arguing, yet nothing really changes. Just greedy "
"bastards trying to get their cut of the pie!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todas estas peleas y discusiones, pero nada cambia realmente. ¡Solo "
"bastardos codiciosos intentando conseguir su parte del pastel!\""

msgid ""
"\"You really think this is about Minerva Station? And not the experimental "
"weapon laboratory hidden within?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿De verdad crees que se trata de la Estación Minerva? ¿Y no del "
"laboratorio de armas experimentales que se esconde en su interior?\""

msgid ""
"You can see the judge and House representatives shift around uncomfortably."
msgstr ""
"Se puede ver al juez y a los representantes de la Cámara moverse incómodos."

msgid "\"Well, it all ends here!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bueno, todo termina aquí!\""

#. activation sound
msgid ""
"Kex's eyes glow red and you hear the activation sound of some sort of weapon."
msgstr ""
"Los ojos de Kex brillan en rojo y se oye el sonido de activación de algún "
"tipo de arma."

#. some yelling
msgid ""
"As people start scrambling and yelling, you hear a shot and Kex falls down "
"as chaos unfolds."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la gente empieza a revolverse y a gritar, se oye un disparo y Kex cae "
"al suelo mientras se desata el caos."

#. autocannon
msgid ""
"You hear shots being fired left and right as you duck for cover. The Judge's "
"levitating desk crashes in the background creating a small explosion as "
"things take a turn for the worst."
msgstr ""
"Oyes disparos a diestro y siniestro mientras te agachas para ponerte a "
"cubierto. El escritorio levitante del Juez se estrella en el fondo creando "
"una pequeña explosión mientras las cosas toman un giro para peor."

msgid "Go for the door."
msgstr "Ir hacia la puerta."

msgid "Try to find Kex."
msgstr "Intentar encontrar a Kex."

msgid ""
"You try to make your way to where Kex fell, but don't find them. As the "
"smoke keeps on filling the room, you have no choice but to head towards to "
"the door and try to save yourself. You jump over bodies and try to push "
"yourself out of the room."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As smoke fills the room, you jump over bodies and try to push yourself out "
"of the room."
msgstr ""
"Mientras el humo llena la habitación, saltas por encima de los cuerpos e "
"intentas empujarte para salir de la habitación."

msgid ""
"You hug the corridors and try to get away from the mayhem, trying to stick "
"low so that you don't get caught by Imperial soldiers that are starting to "
"swarm the area."
msgstr ""
"Abrazas los pasillos e intentas alejarte del caos, tratando de mantenerte "
"agachado para que no te atrapen los soldados imperiales que empiezan a "
"pulular por la zona."

msgid ""
"You are almost at the spaceport when suddenly you hear a rasping voice "
"coming out from a side corridor."
msgstr ""
"Estás casi en el puerto espacial cuando de repente oyes una voz ronca que "
"sale de un pasillo lateral."

#. Music is a bit slower and sadder
msgid ""
"\"Hey {playername}...\"\n"
"Zuri coughs a bit, she doesn't look like she's in good shape and seems to be "
"clutching something."
msgstr ""
"\"Hey {playername}...\"\n"
"Zuri tose un poco, no parece estar en buena forma y parece estar agarrando "
"algo."

msgid ""
"You get closer and you see that she is covered in a fair amount of blood and "
"seems to be holding onto Kex!"
msgstr ""
"¡Te acercas y ves que está cubierta de una buena cantidad de sangre y parece "
"estar agarrada a Kex!"

msgid ""
"\"Things didn't turn out quite how I expected...\"\n"
"She grimaces in pain as she talks."
msgstr ""
"\"Las cosas no salieron como esperaba...\"\n"
"Hace una mueca de dolor mientras habla."

msgid ""
"You shush her and try to help her stop her bleeding. This doesn't look too "
"good."
msgstr ""
"La haces callar e intentas ayudarla a parar la hemorragia. Esto no tiene muy "
"buena pinta."

msgid ""
"\"I'm going to have to ask another favour of you...\"\n"
"She tries to adjust her position a bit to breath more easily, the pain is "
"clear in her eyes."
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a tener que pedirte otro favor...\"\n"
"Intenta ajustar un poco su posición para respirar con más facilidad, el "
"dolor es claro en sus ojos."

msgid "\"Give me a second to catch my breath and we can go.\""
msgstr "\"Dame un segundo para recuperar el aliento y podemos irnos.\""

#. Since it was triggered by talking to an NPC, we have to trigger the next mission so the next NPC appears
msgid " The judge ended up conceding Minerva Station to House Za'lek."
msgstr " El juez acabó concediendo la Estación Minerva a la Casa Za'lek."

msgid " The judge ended up conceding Minerva Station to House Dvaered."
msgstr " El juez acabó concediendo la estación de Minerva a la Casa Dvaered."

msgid " The judge ended up allowing Minerva Station to remain independent."
msgstr ""
" El juez acabó permitiendo que la estación de Minerva siguiera siendo "
"independiente."

msgid ""
"You went with Zuri to participate in a trial to decide the future of Minerva "
"Station. Maikki took the role of the Minerva Station defendant when the CEO "
"passed out. You were called as a witness and your integrity was question."
"{winnerstr} Suddenly, Kex interrupted claimed that Minerva Station was a "
"secret weapon laboratory, before trying to activate a weapon. This caused "
"panic and a firefight to break out. You managed to escape with your life and "
"found a seriously injured Zuri with an unconscious Kex who now need help "
"getting off of {spb}."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste con Zuri a participar en un juicio para decidir el futuro de la "
"estación Minerva. Maikki asumió el papel de acusado de la estación Minerva "
"cuando el director general se desmayó. Fuiste llamado como testigo y tu "
"integridad fue cuestionada. De repente, Kex interrumpió afirmando que la "
"Estación Minerva era un laboratorio secreto de armas, antes de intentar "
"activar un arma. Esto provocó el pánico y se desató un tiroteo. Lograste "
"escapar con vida y encontraste a una Zuri gravemente herida con un Kex "
"inconsciente que ahora necesitan ayuda para salir de {spb}."

