msgid "A step closer to Kex's freedom"
msgstr "Un paso más cerca de la libertad de Kex"

#. Advance the state
#. Advance
msgid "Freeing Kex"
msgstr "Liberar a Kex"

msgid ""
"Kex wants you to help him find dirt on the Minerva CEO by raiding a "
"transport headed to Minerva Station."
msgstr ""
"Kex quiere que le ayudes a encontrar los trapos sucios del Director General "
"de Minerva asaltando un transporte que se dirige a la Estación Minerva."

#. We avoid creating a giver NPC and directly use "normal NPC"
#. Have to make sure to check if misn.accept() works
msgid "You find Kex taking a break at his favourite spot at Minerva station."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Kex tomando un descanso en tu lugar favorito en la estación "
"Minerva."

msgid ""
"You tell Kex about your encounter with the transports and how you weren't "
"able to find the supposed cargo."
msgstr ""
"Le cuentas a Kex tu encuentro con los transportes y cómo no fuiste capaz de "
"encontrar la supuesta carga."

msgid ""
"\"Damn it. That must have been a decoy. These delivery logs are always a "
"mess, and they always seem to be full of nearly identical entries. I picked "
"the most likely, but there was also another at the same time, and it could "
"have been that one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea. Debe haber sido un señuelo. Estos registros de entrega son "
"siempre un desastre, y siempre parecen estar llenos de entradas casi "
"idénticas. Elegí la más probable, pero también había otra a la misma hora, y "
"podría haber sido esa.\""

msgid ""
"You suddenly hear a large thump. You are only able to catch a glimpse of a "
"shadow before it runs away."
msgstr ""
"De repente oyes un gran golpe. Sólo eres capaz de vislumbrar una sombra "
"antes de que huya."

msgid ""
"You go investigate what happened and find a secured crate. Kex quietly "
"follows and looks surprised when he sees the crate."
msgstr ""
"Vas a investigar lo sucedido y encuentras una caja asegurada. Kex te sigue "
"en silencio y parece sorprendido cuando ve la caja."

msgid ""
"\"This is one of the secured crates that I was talking about! How the hell "
"did it get here?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Esta es una de las cajas aseguradas de las que hablaba! ¿Cómo demonios ha "
"llegado aquí?\""

msgid ""
"You look around but there seems to be nobody else other than the two of you."
msgstr ""
"Miras a tu alrededor pero parece que no hay nadie más que vosotros dos."

msgid ""
"Kex looks at you in the eyes.\n"
"\"In cases like this it's probably best not to ask questions, and just take "
"it as some kind of blessing. I've had things like this happen all the time "
"in the nebula and nothing good ever came from investigating. Just remember "
"to keep an eye open.\""
msgstr ""
"Kex te mira a los ojos.\n"
"\"En casos como éste, probablemente sea mejor no hacer preguntas y tomarlo "
"como una especie de bendición. En la nebulosa siempre me han pasado cosas "
"así y nunca ha salido nada bueno de la investigación. Sólo recuerda mantener "
"un ojo abierto.\""

msgid ""
"He now looks at the crate.\n"
"\"Let me see if I can get this open. Mmmm… fairly shoddy Nexus lock. I don't "
"think they make these anymore. Shouldn't be a problem for my implant system."
"\""
msgstr ""
"Ahora mira la caja.\n"
"\"Déjame ver si puedo abrir esto. Mmmm... una cerradura Nexus bastante "
"chapucera. Creo que ya no las fabrican. No debería ser un problema para mi "
"sistema de implantes.\""

msgid ""
"He puts his wing on the lock and you hear some sort of click. His eyes close "
"and he begins to hum an old tune.  It almost sounds like a nursery rhyme. "
"This goes on for a while before he suddenly jolts back with his eyes open."
msgstr ""
"Pone su ala en la cerradura y se oye una especie de clic. Sus ojos se "
"cierran y comienza a tararear una vieja melodía.  Casi parece una canción "
"infantil. Esto dura un rato antes de que de repente se sobresalta con los "
"ojos abiertos."

msgid ""
"\"OK, let us see what we have here.\"\n"
"The crate opens unceremoniously and Kex peers.\n"
"\"Damn, looks like we have no incriminating evidence, however, it does seem "
"like we can use this as a starting point.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bien, veamos qué tenemos aquí.\"\n"
"La caja se abre sin contemplaciones y Kex mira.\n"
"\"Maldita sea, parece que no tenemos pruebas incriminatorias, sin embargo, "
"parece que podemos usar esto como punto de partida.\""

msgid ""
"He passes you the document which reads:\n"
"\"The next shipment will be larger than expected, but I presume you will be "
"able to deal with it as usual. Please take this commission and do whatever "
"you like with it.\"\n"
"It is signed \"Baroness Eve\"."
msgstr ""
"Te pasa el documento que dice:\n"
"\"El próximo envío será más grande de lo esperado, pero supongo que podrás "
"ocuparte de él como siempre. Por favor, toma este encargo y haz lo que "
"quieras con él.\"\n"
"Está firmado \"Baronesa Eva\"."

msgid ""
"\"I'm not too sure who this 'Baroness Eve' is, but let me see if I can get "
"some information on them and we can see what we can do from there on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No estoy muy seguro de quién es esta 'Baronesa Eva', pero déjame ver si "
"puedo conseguir algo de información y ver qué podemos hacer a partir de ahí."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, I almost forgot. There's quite a few credits in the crate too, I think "
"it's only fair to give you most of them as a reward for your help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, casi lo olvido. También hay bastantes créditos en la caja, creo que es "
"justo darte la mayor parte como recompensa por tu ayuda.\""

msgid ""
"\"Meet me up here again in a bit, I'm going to go get some information.\"\n"
"Kex runs off and disappears into the station."
msgstr ""
"\"Encuéntrame aquí de nuevo en un rato, voy a ir a buscar información.\"\n"
"Kex sale corriendo y desaparece en la estación."

msgid ""
"You managed to find a crate destined to the Minerva CEO through luck, and "
"found that it was sent by Baroness Eve."
msgstr ""
"Has conseguido encontrar una caja destinada al Director General de Minerva "
"gracias a la suerte, y has descubierto que la enviaba la Baronesa Eva."

#. Remove unnecessary variables to keep it clean
msgid "\"What's up kid?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué pasa chico?\""

msgid "Ask about the station"
msgstr "Pregunta por la estación"

msgid "Ask about the CEO"
msgstr "Pregunta por el Director General"

msgid "Ask about the job"
msgstr "Pregunta por el trabajo"

msgid ""
"\"Nothing really great about this place. Don't know why it brings so many "
"people from all over the universe, most of whom end up returning broke and "
"in rags. This station is a graveyard of hopes and dreams.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No hay nada realmente bueno en este lugar. No sé por qué atrae a tanta "
"gente de todo el universo, la mayoría de los cuales acaban volviendo "
"arruinados y en harapos. Esta estación es un cementerio de esperanzas y "
"sueños.\""

msgid ""
"\"This cycle, a kid, who was engaged to his childhood sweetheart, came to "
"celebrate his engagement. They got absorbed into the game and decided to bet "
"the money they'd saved for their wedding.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Este ciclo, un chico, que estaba comprometido con su novia de la infancia, "
"vino a celebrar su compromiso. Se dejaron absorber por el juego y decidieron "
"apostar el dinero que habían ahorrado para su boda.\""

msgid ""
"\"He wouldn't listen to reason, and eventually lost all of his savings. He "
"ended up getting into a fight with station security and they took him away "
"in a stretcher with a broken back. Not very pretty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No atendía a razones y acabó perdiendo todos sus ahorros. Acabó peleándose "
"con la seguridad de la estación y se lo llevaron en camilla con la espalda "
"rota. No muy bonito.\""

msgid ""
"\"Despite a life destroyed, management was fairly happy. It seems like he "
"had quite a lot saved up until he came here. Just another day at the station."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"A pesar de una vida destruida, la dirección estaba bastante contenta. "
"Parece que tenían bastante ahorrado hasta que llegaron aquí. Un día más en "
"la estación.\""

msgid ""
"\"When you've been here as long as I have, you tend to see the rhythm of the "
"station, and it isn't very good. Brings out the worst in people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando llevas aquí tanto tiempo como yo, tiendes a ver el ritmo de la "
"estación, y no es muy bueno. Saca lo peor de la gente.\""

msgid ""
"\"Most of the problem lies in the management, they're all a bunch of "
"assholes led by the CEO, who is an even bigger asshole.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La mayor parte del problema radica en la dirección, son todos una panda de "
"gilipollas dirigidos por el Director General, que es un gilipollas aún mayor."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"They've been running this joint since before I got here. There are enough "
"rumours of them doing shady stuff that some are bound to be true.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Llevan dirigiendo este local desde antes de que yo llegara. Hay "
"suficientes rumores de que hacen cosas turbias que algunas están obligados a "
"ser verdad.\""

msgid ""
"\"The station is lively enough that it is fairly hard to keep track of what "
"is going on, but there are some patterns like mysterious packages and "
"unaccounted amounts of credits disappearing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La estación está lo suficientemente animada como para que sea bastante "
"difícil seguir la pista de lo que ocurre, pero hay algunos patrones como "
"paquetes misteriosos y desaparición de cantidades de créditos no "
"contabilizadas.\""

msgid ""
"\"The only thing keeping me from my freedom is the fact that the CEO legally "
"owns me. They don't believe I am fully sentient, but I'm sure if they knew "
"it would just make everything harder for me, so I have to lay low.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo único que me impide ser libre es el hecho de que el Director General me "
"posee legalmente. No creen que sea totalmente sintiente, pero estoy seguro "
"de que si lo supieran, todo sería más difícil para mí, así que tengo que "
"pasar desapercibido.\""

msgid "You ask about where you can find the CEO."
msgstr "Pregunta dónde puede encontrar al Director General."

msgid ""
"\"He shouldn't be too hard to find. Given his drinking habits, you can "
"usually find him around the bar lounge on the 7th floor. You aren't going to "
"go talk to him, are you? There's no way that anything like that could work."
"\"\n"
"He lets out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"No debería ser muy difícil de encontrar. Teniendo en cuenta sus hábitos de "
"consumo de alcohol, por lo general se le puede encontrar en torno a la sala "
"de bar en el séptimo piso. No vas a ir a hablar con él, ¿verdad? Es "
"imposible que algo así funcione.\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, you already talked to him? How did it go?\"\n"
"He looks at you expectantly."
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, ¿ya has hablado con él? ¿Cómo fue?\"\n"
"Te mira expectante."

msgid "You mention that you got nowhere."
msgstr "Mencionas que no has conseguido nada."

msgid ""
"He looks a bit glum.\n"
"\"Yeah, I don't think there's talking any sense into that one… Maybe if we…"
"\"\n"
"He stops to think a bit."
msgstr ""
"Parece un poco desanimado.\n"
"\"Sí, no creo que se pueda hablar con sentido... Tal vez si...\"\n"
"Se detiene a pensar un poco."

msgid ""
"\"This may sound crazy, but I think it might work. You're a good pilot from "
"what I hear, right?\"\n"
"He looks at you with determination.\n"
"\"Given that the issue is the CEO, if we can somehow get rid of the CEO, "
"there should be no issue, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto puede parecer una locura, pero creo que podría funcionar. Eres un "
"buen piloto por lo que he oído, ¿verdad?\"\n"
"Te mira con determinación.\n"
"\"Dado que el problema es el Director General si podemos deshacernos de "
"alguna manera del Director General, no debería haber ningún problema, "
"¿verdad?\""

msgid ""
"\"Since I know for certain that he is involved in, let's call it, "
"\"unsavoury business\", all we have to do is get him busted and in the "
"confusion it should be more than easy for me to go free.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Como sé con certeza que está involucrado en, llamémosle, \"negocios "
"indeseables\", todo lo que tenemos que hacer es atraparlo y en la confusión "
"debería ser más que fácil para mí salir libre.\""

msgid ""
"He looks down at the floor.\n"
"\"I know we've known each other for a relatively short time, but would you "
"help a duck out? I might be able to make it worth your while afterwards.\""
msgstr ""
"Mira al suelo.\n"
"\"Sé que nos conocemos desde hace relativamente poco tiempo, pero ¿podrías "
"ayudar a un pato? Tal vez pueda hacer que merezca la pena después.\""

msgid "Help a duck out."
msgstr "Ayuda a un pato."

msgid ""
"\"Great! I managed to look at the station delivery logs and it seems like "
"there is a shady delivery heading here. If you could go to the {sys} system. "
"All you have to do is intercept it and get the incriminating evidence and it "
"should be easy as pie! I'll send you the precise information later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! He conseguido mirar los registros de entrega de la estación y "
"parece que hay una entrega sospechosa que se dirige hacia aquí. Si pudieras "
"ir al sistema {sys}. Todo lo que tienes que hacer es interceptarlo y "
"conseguir las pruebas incriminatorias y debería ser muy fácil. Te enviaré la "
"información precisa más tarde.\""

msgid ""
"\"It would be ideal if you can disable the ship and find the evidence "
"itself, however, given that it is always delivered in secured vaults, you "
"should be able to recover the vault from the debris if you roll that way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo ideal sería poder inutilizar la nave y encontrar las pruebas en sí, sin "
"embargo, dado que siempre se entregan en bóvedas seguras, se debería poder "
"recuperar la bóveda de los escombros si tiras por ahí.\""

msgid ""
"You agreed to help Kex to find dirt on the Minerva Station CEO to try to get "
"him free."
msgstr ""
"Aceptaste ayudar a Kex a encontrar los trapos sucios del Director General de "
"la Estación Minerva para intentar liberarlo."

msgid "Intercept the transport at {sys}"
msgstr "Intercepta el transporte en {sys}"

msgid "Return to Kex at Minerva Station"
msgstr "Regreso a Kex en la Estación de Minerva"

msgid ""
"He looks dejected.\n"
"\"I see. If you change your mind, I'll be around.\""
msgstr ""
"Parece abatido.\n"
"\"Ya veo. Si cambias de opinión, estaré por aquí.\""

msgid ""
"\"We have to find dirt on the CEO and get him removed. It is the only chance "
"I have for freedom.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tenemos que encontrar la corrupción en el Director General y hacer que lo "
"destituyan. Es la única oportunidad que tengo de ser libre.\""

msgid ""
"They should be receiving a delivery. You should go intercept it at the {sys} "
"system before it gets here. I have sent you all the precise information. It "
"should be a breeze what with your piloting skills."
msgstr ""
"Deberían estar recibiendo una entrega. Deberías ir a interceptarla en el "
"sistema {sys} antes de que llegue. Te he enviado toda la información "
"precisa. Debería ser una molestia con tus habilidades de pilotaje."

msgid ""
"You find the Minerva CEO drinking alone. He looks somewhat drunk. You "
"approach him and start a conversation."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras al Director General de Minerva bebiendo solo. Parece algo "
"borracho. Te acercas a él e inicias una conversación."

msgid ""
"\"Is that you Fred?\"\n"
"He looks at you and squints.\n"
"\"You're not Fred.\"\n"
"He takes a large swig of his drink."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Eres tú Fred?\"\n"
"Te mira y entorna los ojos.\n"
"\"Tú no eres Fred\".\n"
"Toma un gran trago de su bebida."

msgid "\"Well, what do you want?\""
msgstr "\"Bueno, ¿qué quieres?\""

msgid "You ask about the cyborg chicken."
msgstr "Preguntas sobre el pollo cyborg."

msgid ""
"\"The crown jewel of Minerva station? The goose that lays golden eggs? The, "
"uh… pineapple on the pizza?\"\n"
"He furrows his brows a bit."
msgstr ""
"\"¿La joya de la corona de la estación Minerva? ¿La gallina de los huevos de "
"oro? ¿La... piña de la pizza?\"\n"
"Frunce un poco las cejas."

msgid ""
"\"Ever since I got that absurd chicken, business has been booming. I "
"wouldn't sell the beast for all the credits in the world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Desde que conseguí esa absurda gallina, el negocio se ha disparado. ¡No "
"vendería la bestia ni por todos los créditos del mundo!\""

msgid "You mention that everything must have its price."
msgstr "Tú mencionas que todo debe tener su precio."

msgid ""
"He squints again at you.\n"
"\"I like your guts, but your guts aren't getting your hands on my chicken. "
"Damn, that sounded better in my head.\"\n"
"He takes another swig from his drinks."
msgstr ""
"Vuelve a entornar los ojos hacia ti.\n"
"\"Me gustan tus agallas, pero tus agallas no van a poner tus manos en mi "
"pollo. Maldita sea, eso sonaba mejor en mi cabeza\".\n"
"Da otro trago a su bebida."

msgid "\"Now unless you are getting me another drink you can scoot off.\""
msgstr "\"Ahora, a menos que me traigas otra bebida, puedes irte.\""

msgid "It doesn't look like you are getting anywhere. You take your leave."
msgstr "No parece que vayas a llegar a ninguna parte. Te vas a ir."

msgid "You were supposed to raid the transport!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que debías asaltar el transporte!"

#. Tier 1
#. mem.tier==1
#. Use a dynamic faction so pirates don't destroy them
#. Only interested at first
#. Determine what system we are in
#. Create the mule and change faction
#. First ship is the convoy ship that has special stuff
msgid "Convoy"
msgstr "Caravana"

msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Transporte"

msgid "The transport got away!"
msgstr "¡El transporte se ha escapado!"

msgid "Transport under attack! Help requested immediately!"
msgstr "¡Transporte bajo ataque! ¡Solicitando ayuda inmediatamente!"

msgid ""
"You storm the transport and head towards the cargo bay, however, once you "
"get there you find it is empty. You proceed to explore the rest of the ship "
"to see if there is anything of interest."
msgstr ""
"Asaltas el transporte y te diriges a la bahía de carga, sin embargo, una vez "
"que llegas allí te das cuenta de que está vacía. Procedes a explorar el "
"resto de la nave para ver si hay algo de interés."

msgid ""
"You are not able to find what you were looking for, but you were able to "
"find {credits} that likely won't be necessary to the crew anymore."
msgstr ""
"No has podido encontrar lo que buscabas, pero has podido encontrar {credits} "
"que probablemente ya no sean necesarios para la tripulación."

msgid ""
"It might be best to report back to Kex to see if his information was correct."
msgstr "Lo mejor sería informar a Kex para ver si su información era correcta."

#. Permanently disable mainguy
#. Message update
msgid ""
"You boarded a transport destined for the Minerva CEO, but didn't find "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"Abordaste un transporte con destino al Director General de Minerva, pero no "
"encontraste nada."

msgid ""
"You scan the debris of the transport for any potential cargo, but can't find "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"Exploras los restos del transporte en busca de alguna carga potencial, pero "
"no encuentras nada."

msgid ""
"You destroyed a transport destined for the Minerva CEO, but didn't find "
"anything in the debris."
msgstr ""
"Has destruido un transporte destinado al Director General de Minerva, pero "
"no has encontrado nada en los escombros."

msgid ""
"You have been entrusted with stealing information from Baroness Eve at {pnt} "
"in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Se te ha encomendado robar información de la Baronesa Eva en {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}."

#. If not accepted, mem.misn_state will still be nil
msgid "You have agreed to help Kex steal information from Baroness Eve."
msgstr "Has aceptado ayudar a Kex a robar información de la Baronesa Eva."

msgid "Go to {pnt} in the {sys} system and hack the main database"
msgstr "Ve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y hackea la base de datos principal"

#. Reset state on load if player got killed when trying to flee
#. Pink :D
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal"

msgid ""
"A discrete terminal in the corner of the landing bay, you should be able to "
"use it to load the program Kex gave you."
msgstr ""
"Un discreto terminal en la esquina de la bahía de aterrizaje, deberías poder "
"usarlo para cargar el programa que te dio Kex."

msgid ""
"You land on {pnt} and discretely approach one of the terminals.  You upload "
"the program that Kex gave you."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en {pnt} y te acercas discretamente a uno de los terminales.  "
"Cargas el programa que te dio Kex."

msgid ""
"The terminal dimly lights up and begins to compute whatever was in the "
"program. After a while it seems to begin downloading large amounts of data "
"while you nervously wait."
msgstr ""
"El terminal se ilumina tenuemente y comienza a calcular lo que sea que haya "
"en el programa. Al cabo de un rato parece que empieza a descargar grandes "
"cantidades de datos mientras tú esperas nerviosamente."

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"Suddenly, an alarm begins to blare. Before the security screen appears on "
"the terminal, you are able to grab the program as you make a run for your "
"ship. In the background, you hear people yelling and running around. It "
"seems like you have to get out of here as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"De repente, empieza a sonar una alarma. Antes de que aparezca la pantalla de "
"seguridad en el terminal, consigues coger el programa mientras corres hacia "
"tu nave. De fondo, oyes a la gente gritando y corriendo. Parece que tienes "
"que salir de aquí cuanto antes."

msgid ""
"This is probably what Kex meant about things going sour. It seems like you "
"have a head start on your pursuers, but you may not be able to count on it "
"for long."
msgstr ""
"Esto es probablemente a lo que se refería Kex con lo de que las cosas se van "
"a estropear. Parece que tienes una ventaja sobre tus perseguidores, pero "
"puede que no puedas contar con ella durante mucho tiempo."

#. Advance mission and get out of there
#. Mission is over
msgid ""
"Still tired from your escapade, you look for Kex at his favourite spot at "
"Minerva station."
msgstr ""
"Todavía cansado de tu escapada, buscas a Kex en su lugar favorito de la "
"estación Minerva."

msgid "\"You look like a mess kid. You alright?\""
msgstr "\"Pareces un desastre, chico. ¿Estás bien?\""

msgid ""
"You explain how you weren't able to get all the data before you had to bug "
"out of there, and hand him what data you were able to recover."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas que no pudiste obtener todos los datos antes de tener que salir "
"de allí, y le entregas los datos que pudiste recuperar."

msgid ""
"\"Damn, security was tighter than anticipated. I'm glad to see you made it "
"in one piece despite the opposition. Aristocrats always seem to have cards "
"up their sleeves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, la seguridad era más estricta de lo previsto. Me alegra ver "
"que has llegado de una pieza a pesar de la oposición. Los aristócratas "
"siempre parecen tener cartas bajo la manga.\""

msgid ""
"\"Let me take a brief look at the data you were able to collect.\"\n"
"He plugs in the program directly into a port under his wing and his eyes go "
"blank for a bit.\n"
"\"I see, looks like you were able to get quite a lot of data. However, their "
"database had much more than expected. It will probably take me quite a bit "
"longer to process this all and see what we got.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Déjame echar un breve vistazo a los datos que has podido recoger\".\n"
"Conecta el programa directamente en un puerto bajo su ala y sus ojos se "
"quedan en blanco durante un rato.\n"
"\"Ya veo, parece que fue capaz de obtener bastantes datos. Sin embargo, su "
"base de datos tenía mucho más de lo esperado. Probablemente me llevará "
"bastante tiempo procesar todo esto y ver lo que tenemos.\""

msgid ""
"\"In the meantime, it looks like we were also able to grab some credits. "
"I'll wire you a reward for your efforts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mientras tanto, parece que también pudimos conseguir algunos créditos. Te "
"enviaré una recompensa por tus esfuerzos.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm going to go process this data. It's going to take me a while, but come "
"back here in a period or so and I should hopefully have some more results.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a procesar estos datos. Me va a llevar un tiempo, pero vuelve aquí en "
"un periodo o así y espero tener más resultados.\""

msgid "You stole information from Baroness Eve for Kex."
msgstr "Robaste información de la Baronesa Eva para Kex."

msgid "Ask about being a duck"
msgstr "Pregunta sobre ser un pato"

msgid "Ask about Baroness Eve"
msgstr "Pregunta por la baronesa Eva"

msgid ""
"\"Glad you asked. It turns out she's apparently a big shot at {pnt} in the "
"{sys} system. She deals in all sorts of trade between the Empire and the "
"Za'lek, although there also seems to be some nasty rumours about her "
"floating around.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de que hayas preguntado. Resulta que aparentemente es un pez "
"gordo de {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Se ocupa de todo tipo de comercio entre "
"el Imperio y los Za'lek, aunque también parece que hay algunos rumores "
"desagradables sobre ella circulando.\""

msgid ""
"\"Although it's not very clear what exactly happened, there was a fairly big "
"incident that ended up in a large fight between mercenaries, Empire forces, "
"and pirates in the system. It disrupted the trade routes of the area for "
"quite a few periods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque no está muy claro qué pasó exactamente, hubo un incidente bastante "
"grande que acabó en una gran lucha entre mercenarios, fuerzas del Imperio y "
"piratas en el sistema. Interrumpió las rutas comerciales de la zona durante "
"bastantes períodos.\""

msgid ""
"\"I was able to get more information from some other documents in the crate, "
"and it seems like they were fairly sloppy with some of the security details. "
"I have managed to put together a small program that hopefully should be able "
"to access their main database, however, I'm going to need you to upload it "
"by hand.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"This job is probably going to be much trickier than the last. Even though "
"the documents had some security issues, it is likely that things will be "
"different once you get over to {pnt}. Still, I think you should be able to "
"handle this easily. Would you be up for the challenge?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Great! Let me get you set up with the program. All you have to do is land "
"on {pnt} and plug it into any terminal you find around the docks. That "
"should also make it easier for you to get out of there if things go sour.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"So the idea is to try to hack into the Baroness Eve's database and see if "
"we can get any dirt of the CEO of Minerva Station. Since we already know "
"that they have dealings with each other, it seems like there has to be "
"something there if we can access all the data.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que la idea es tratar de hackear la base de datos de la Baronesa Eva y "
"ver si podemos sacar algún trapo sucio del Director General de la Estación "
"Minerva. Como ya sabemos que tienen tratos entre ellos, parece que tiene que "
"haber algo allí si podemos acceder a todos los datos.\""

msgid ""
"\"All you have to do is land on {pnt} and upload the program I gave you to "
"any terminal, there should be plenty around the docks. That should also make "
"it easier for you to get out of there if things go sour.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"It's likely that there will be more security around this time, so make "
"sure you take a ship that can deal with trouble. Although, I don't think "
"that will be a problem for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es probable que haya más seguridad en esta época, así que asegúrate de "
"llevar una nave que pueda hacer frente a los problemas. Aunque no creo que "
"eso sea un problema para ti.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's as awful as you would expect it to be. I mean, sure I can float and "
"fly short distances, but I can't reach any tall places and have to "
"constantly avoid getting stepped on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es tan horrible como cabría esperar. Es decir, claro que puedo flotar y "
"volar distancias cortas, pero no puedo llegar a ningún sitio alto y tengo "
"que evitar constantemente que me pisen.\""

msgid ""
"\"The worst part is the lack of communication. I mean, I've sort of lost my "
"humanity and can't engage in all the activities I used to like. You know, "
"drinking with friends, going out, basic human empathy, shit like that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo peor es la falta de comunicación. Quiero decir que he perdido mi "
"humanidad y no puedo participar en todas las actividades que me gustaban. Ya "
"sabes, beber con los amigos, salir, la empatía humana básica, cosas así.\""

msgid ""
"\"I would like to think that I'm used to it after all these cycles, but you "
"never get used to it. There's a moment of bliss when I wake up first thing "
"in the morning, and I still haven't remembered I'm a duck, but it soon comes "
"crashing down. I just can't get used to it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría pensar que me he acostumbrado después de todos estos ciclos, "
"pero uno nunca se acostumbra. Hay un momento de felicidad cuando me "
"despierto a primera hora de la mañana, y todavía no me he acordado de que "
"soy un pato, pero enseguida se viene abajo. No puedo acostumbrarme.\""

msgid ""
"\"I do take it a bit better these days, but the beginning was especially "
"hard. You just lose all the will to live. There's like no going back, right? "
"All the things I used to have and cherish, they're all gone. My work, my "
"friends, my family…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hoy en día me lo tomo un poco mejor, pero el principio fue especialmente "
"duro. Simplemente pierdes todas las ganas de vivir. No hay vuelta atrás, "
"¿verdad? Todas las cosas que solía tener y apreciar, se han ido. Mi trabajo, "
"mis amigos, mi familia...\""

msgid ""
"\"I never chose to be in this state and often think that it would have been "
"better if I had never been saved from the wreckage, but here I am.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nunca elegí estar en este estado y a menudo pienso que habría sido mejor "
"que nunca me hubieran salvado del naufragio, pero aquí estoy.\""

msgid ""
"His expression darkens.\n"
"\"The only real thing that keeps me ticking is revenge on the bastard who "
"did this to me. Turning me into this is beyond humiliating and I intend to "
"have him suffer as much as I have.\""
msgstr ""
"Su expresión se ensombrece.\n"
"\"Lo único que realmente me mantiene activo es la venganza contra el "
"bastardo que me hizo esto. Convertirme en esto es más que humillante y "
"pienso hacerle sufrir tanto como yo.\""

msgid ""
"\"If you can avoid it, don't become a duck, kid.\"\n"
"He seems to lighten up a bit."
msgstr ""
"\"Si puedes evitarlo, no te conviertas en un pato, chico.\"\n"
"Parece que se aligera un poco."

#. Main stuff starts
msgid "Baroness Eve"
msgstr "Baronesa Eve"

msgid ""
"You have been assigned with obtaining information from Major Malik at {pnt} "
"in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Se le ha asignado la obtención de información del Mayor Malik en {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}."

#. If not accepted, mem.misn_state will still be nil
msgid "You have agreed to help Kex obtain information from Major Malik."
msgstr "Has aceptado ayudar a Kex a obtener información del Mayor Malik."

msgid "Go to {pnt} in the {sys} system to find Major Malik"
msgstr "Ve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para encontrar al Mayor Malik"

msgid ""
"You land and promptly proceed to try to find Major Malik and get the job "
"over with. After glancing over the map of the installations, you are able to "
"quickly locate his office and head down there."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y procedes a buscar al Mayor Malik para terminar el trabajo. Tras "
"echar un vistazo al mapa de las instalaciones, localizas rápidamente su "
"despacho y te diriges allí."

msgid ""
"You arrive and inquire about Major Malik, but are told he is apparently "
"enjoying some leisure time at {pnt} in the {sys} system. Looks like you have "
"no choice but to try to look for him there."
msgstr ""
"Llegas y preguntas por el Mayor Malik, pero te dicen que aparentemente está "
"disfrutando de un tiempo de ocio en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Parece que no "
"tienes más remedio que intentar buscarlo allí."

msgid "Look for Major Malik at {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Busca al Mayor Malik en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

msgid ""
"You see Major Malik who is fairly similar to the image shown to you by Kex."
msgstr ""
"Ves al Mayor Malik que es bastante parecido a la imagen que te mostró Kex."

msgid ""
"You disconnect from the virtual reality of the Crimson Gauntlet and look "
"around the private room you were in. There is a distinct odour of sweat "
"permeating the room. Furthermore, it looks like someone left in a hurry, but "
"at least it seems like Major Malik is still at his terminal."
msgstr ""
"Desconectas de la realidad virtual del Guantelete Carmesí y miras alrededor "
"de la habitación privada en la que estabas. Hay un claro olor a sudor que "
"impregna la habitación. Además, parece que alguien se ha marchado a toda "
"prisa, pero al menos parece que el comandante Malik sigue en su terminal."

msgid ""
"You approach Major Malik and notice immediately that something is off. You "
"remove the headgear from him and immediately see that his eyes are glazed "
"over and there is some white froth coming out of his mouth. Seems like some "
"sort of mental shock killed him."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al Mayor Malik y notas inmediatamente que algo no va bien. Le "
"quitas el casco y enseguida ves que tiene los ojos vidriosos y que le sale "
"espuma blanca de la boca. Parece que algún tipo de shock mental lo ha matado."

msgid ""
"From the corner of your eye you see that the terminal is still logged in. "
"Since there is nothing you can do anymore for Major Malik, you rotate the "
"screen to you and try to see if you can find any of the information that Kex "
"was looking for."
msgstr ""
"Por el rabillo del ojo ves que el terminal sigue conectado. Como ya no "
"puedes hacer nada por el Mayor Malik, giras la pantalla hacia ti y tratas de "
"ver si encuentras algo de la información que buscaba Kex."

msgid ""
"The directories are nicely organized and it doesn't take long before you "
"find what seems to be the correct files. You copy them over to your "
"holodrive. You hope the files satisfy Kex this time."
msgstr ""
"Los directorios están bien organizados y no tardas en encontrar lo que "
"parecen ser los archivos correctos. Los copias en tu holodrive. Esperas que "
"los archivos satisfagan a Kex esta vez."

msgid ""
"You survey the room one last time before you leave. You notice that the "
"chassis covering some of the terminal has been pried open, exposing some "
"internal connections. There is no doubt that someone jacked into your "
"Crimson Gauntlet session. However, given the dead body in the room, you "
"decide to take your leave before it attracts attention."
msgstr ""
"Examinas la sala por última vez antes de salir. Te das cuenta de que el "
"chasis que cubre parte del terminal ha sido forzado, dejando al descubierto "
"algunas conexiones internas. No hay duda de que alguien ha entrado en tu "
"sesión del Guantelete Carmesí. Sin embargo, dado el cadáver que hay en la "
"habitación, decides marcharte antes de que atraigas la atención."

msgid ""
"You better head back to Minerva Station to relay the information to Kex."
msgstr ""
"Será mejor que vuelvas a la Estación Minerva para transmitir la información "
"a Kex."

#. We're done here, go back to kex:)
#. Mission is over
msgid ""
"Still exhausted from the entire ordeal, and with Major Malik's dead eyes "
"still ingrained in your memory, you approach Kex."
msgstr ""
"Todavía agotado por toda la prueba, y con los ojos muertos del Mayor Malik "
"aún grabados en tu memoria, te acercas a Kex."

msgid "\"You look like a mess, kid. What happened?\""
msgstr "\"Pareces perdido, chico. ¿Qué ha pasado?\""

msgid ""
"You explain what happened in the Crimson Gauntlet server and how you barely "
"escaped with your life, and hand him the holodrive with the data you were "
"able to collect."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas lo que ocurrió en el servidor del Guantelete Carmesí y cómo "
"escapaste con vida por los pelos, y le entregas el holodrive con los datos "
"que pudiste recoger."

msgid ""
"\"Damn. When I was still a human, we didn't have that fancy Virtual Reality "
"shit. It's wild. Don't think I want to try it after hearing about your "
"experience though. I'm glad you made it out of there alive. Don't know what "
"I would do without you now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea. Cuando todavía era un humano, no teníamos esa mierda de la "
"realidad virtual. Es una locura. Aunque no creo que quiera probarla después "
"de escuchar tu experiencia. Me alegro de que hayas salido de allí con vida. "
"No sé qué haría ahora sin ti.\""

msgid ""
"\"Let me take a look at the data.\"\n"
"He once again plugs the drive into a port somewhere under his wing and his "
"eyes go blank.\n"
"\"Seems like that Major Malik was into some major shit.\"\n"
"He seems amused by his pun."
msgstr ""
"\"Déjame echar un vistazo a los datos\".\n"
"Vuelve a conectar la unidad a un puerto en algún lugar bajo su ala y sus "
"ojos se quedan en blanco.\n"
"\"Parece que ese Mayor Malik estaba metido en una mierda mayor.\"\n"
"Parece divertido por su juego de palabras."

msgid ""
"He snaps out of his stupor and looks at you again.\n"
"\"Seems like you got much more than I expected. It's going to take me a "
"while to go over this. Meet me back here in a period or so after I process "
"all this data.\""
msgstr ""
"Sale de su estupor y te mira de nuevo.\n"
"\"Parece que tienes mucho más de lo que esperaba. Me va a llevar un rato "
"revisar esto. Reúnete conmigo aquí en un período o así después de que "
"procese todos estos datos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah yes, before I get absorbed by the data processing, here, let me reward "
"you for your troubles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, sí, antes de que me absorba el procesamiento de datos, aquí, déjame "
"recompensarte por tus molestias.\""

msgid ""
"As you take your leave you hear Kex beginning to hum an ancient-sounding "
"tune."
msgstr ""
"Cuando te despides, oyes que Kex empieza a tararear una melodía que suena "
"antigua."

msgid ""
"You defeated Major Malik in a lopsided duel in the Crimson Gauntlet, and "
"acquired information related to money laundering at Minerva Station."
msgstr ""
"Has derrotado al Mayor Malik en un duelo desigual en el Guantelete Carmesí y "
"has conseguido información relacionada con el blanqueo de dinero en la "
"Estación Minerva."

msgid ""
"You find Kex taking a break at his favourite spot at Minerva station. His "
"eyes light up when he sees you and he runs over to you."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Kex descansando en su lugar favorito de la estación de Minerva. "
"Sus ojos se iluminan al verte y corre hacia ti."

msgid ""
"\"Good news kid! It looks like the information we obtained from Baroness Eve "
"had some dirt on the CEO. Looks like they're involved in some sort of money "
"laundering, but this alone won't get us anywhere, we need more intel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Buenas noticias chico! Parece que la información que obtuvimos de la "
"Baronesa Eva tenía algunos trapos sucios sobre el Director General. Parece "
"que están involucrados en algún tipo de lavado de dinero, pero esto solo no "
"nos llevará a ninguna parte, necesitamos más información.\""

msgid ""
"\"We have a lead on another co-conspirator, this time in Dvaered space. Some "
"individual, named Major Malik, seems to also be in the money laundering. "
"Would you be up for paying him a visit and seeing what you can get out of "
"him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tenemos una pista sobre otro co-conspirador, esta vez en el espacio "
"Dvaered. Un individuo, llamado Mayor Malik, parece estar también en el "
"lavado de dinero. ¿Estarías dispuesto a hacerle una visita y ver qué puedes "
"sacar de él?\""

msgid ""
"\"This time I'm hoping it's a cinch. Major Malik should be at {pnt} in the "
"{sys} system. He should be fairly old, so it should be enough to just "
"outright confront him and get him to talk. I'll give you a note to help "
"convince him you mean business. I'll also send you his picture so you can "
"easily recognize him when you see him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esta vez espero que sea pan comido. El Mayor Malik debería estar en {pnt} "
"en el sistema {sys}. Debería ser bastante viejo, así que debería bastar con "
"enfrentarse a él y hacerle hablar. Te daré una nota para que lo convenzas de "
"que vas en serio. También te enviaré su foto para que puedas reconocerlo "
"fácilmente cuando lo veas.\""

msgid ""
"\"The note? It's just your run-of-the-mill blackmail. We don't really care "
"about Major Malik himself, what we want is dirt on the CEO. Hopefully he'll "
"be sensible and give us what we want. However, I trust you will do what it "
"takes in case he doesn't.\"\n"
"He winks his cyborg eye at you."
msgstr ""
"\"¿La nota? Es un chantaje común y corriente. Realmente no nos importa el "
"Mayor Malik, lo que queremos es la suciedad del Director General. Esperemos "
"que sea sensato y nos dé lo que queremos. Sin embargo, confío en que harás "
"lo necesario en caso de que no lo haga.\"\n"
"Te guiña su ojo ciborg."

msgid "Ask about his past"
msgstr "Pregunta sobre su pasado"

msgid ""
"\"The job is pretty straightforward. We need Major Malik to talk about his "
"dealings with the Minerva CEO. If you hand him the note I gave you it should "
"be enough to convince him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El trabajo es bastante sencillo. Necesitamos que el Mayor Malik hable de "
"sus tratos con el Director General de Minerva. Si le entregas la nota que te "
"di debería ser suficiente para convencerlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"You should be able to find him at {pnt} in the {sys} system. I don't think "
"he should give much trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Deberías poder encontrarlo en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. No creo que dé "
"muchos problemas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, so Major Malik wasn't at {targetplanet}? That is really weird. Let's "
"hope you can find him at {pnt} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, ¿así que el Mayor Malik no estaba en {targetplanet}? Eso es realmente "
"extraño. Esperemos que puedas encontrarlo en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}.\""

msgid ""
"\"You are quite the curious kid. At the time I didn't think my life was all "
"that great and exciting, but lately I yearn to take to the skies like the "
"good old times. Did I ever tell you about the story of when I spent a kilo-"
"period drifting in the Nebula?\"\n"
"\"No? Great!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Eres un chico muy curioso. En su momento no pensé que mi vida fuera tan "
"grande y emocionante, pero últimamente anhelo surcar los cielos como en los "
"buenos tiempos. ¿Te he contado alguna vez la historia de cuando pasé un kilo-"
"periodo a la deriva en la Nebulosa?\"\n"
"\"¿No? ¡Genial!\""

msgid ""
"\"It was not uncommon for things to break down and get weird fast when going "
"deep into the Nebula. The radiation is really damaging to ship armour, so "
"you have to maximize energy to shields. It makes it hard to bring firepower, "
"but it's not like it'll do you any good in the deep Nebula. Nothing is alive "
"there, or at least, not in the sense we sort of think of as being alive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No era raro que las cosas se estropearan y se volvieran raras rápidamente "
"al adentrarse en la Nebulosa. La radiación es realmente dañina para el "
"blindaje de las naves, así que hay que maximizar la energía en los escudos. "
"Esto hace que sea difícil llevar potencia de fuego, pero no es que te sirva "
"de nada en la Nebulosa profunda. Nada está vivo allí, o al menos, no en el "
"sentido que nosotros pensamos que está vivo.\""

msgid ""
"\"So me and Mireia had picked up a tip about some sort of weird wreck deep "
"past Arandon. Some poor fools had gone to search for it and hadn't come back "
"for a few hecto-periods and one of their husbands was beginning to lose it, "
"so they came to us. Now, we weren't interested in trying to save them -- "
"once you enter the Nebula, you forfeit all chance of rescue. Search parties "
"tend to only count up the bodies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que Mireia y yo habíamos recogido un chivatazo sobre una especie de "
"naufragio extraño en las profundidades de Arandon. Unos pobres locos habían "
"ido a buscarlo y no habían vuelto en unos cuantos hectoperiodos y uno de sus "
"maridos estaba empezando a perder la cabeza, así que acudieron a nosotros. "
"Ahora bien, no estábamos interesados en intentar salvarlos -- una vez que "
"entras en la Nebulosa, pierdes toda posibilidad de rescate. Los grupos de "
"búsqueda tienden a contar sólo los cuerpos.\""

msgid ""
"\"However, from the looks of it, it was a very interesting find. Sometimes "
"you find really weird things in the Nebula.\"\n"
"He leans closer to you and whispers.\n"
"\"…things that shouldn't exist. Or better said, things that can't possibly "
"exist.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, por lo que parece, fue un hallazgo muy interesante. A veces "
"se encuentran cosas muy raras en la Nebulosa.\"\n"
"Se inclina más hacia ti y susurra.\n"
"\"...cosas que no deberían existir. O mejor dicho, cosas que no pueden "
"existir.\""

msgid ""
"\"So we loaded up our trusty Mule with all the shield generators and "
"survival gear we could fit, and headed out towards the last known location "
"of the wreck. At first it was fairly standard, our shields and radiators "
"running at maximum power. You get used to the hum and the chaos of the "
"Nebula, but you can never relax. It sort of gets into your bones and makes "
"you lose your sleep.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que cargamos nuestra fiel Mula con todos los generadores de escudos y "
"el equipo de supervivencia que nos cabía, y nos dirigimos hacia la última "
"ubicación conocida del naufragio. Al principio fue bastante normal, nuestros "
"escudos y radiadores funcionando a máxima potencia. Te acostumbras al "
"zumbido y al caos de la Nebulosa, pero nunca puedes relajarte. Se te mete en "
"los huesos y te hace perder el sueño.\""

msgid ""
"\"We continued like that for what seemed ages. Sensors get a bit fuzzy in "
"there, but they'd been scanning for about a deca-period when we saw it. It "
"was part of something very big, almost like some sort of metallic skeleton. "
"We approached it cautiously because the radiation was off the charts. The "
"more you looked at it, the more it felt like it was burning into the back of "
"your retina.\""
msgstr ""
" \"Continuamos así durante lo que parecieron años. Los sensores se vuelven "
"un poco borrosos allí, pero habían estado escaneando durante un decaperiodo "
"cuando lo vimos. Era parte de algo muy grande, casi como una especie de "
"esqueleto metálico. Nos acercamos con cautela porque la radiación se salía "
"de lo normal. Cuanto más lo mirabas, más parecía que te quemaba la parte "
"posterior de la retina.\""

msgid ""
"\"After our cursory analysis, we went to grab a sample. However, when we "
"tried to extend the robotic arm to it, it never seemed to get closer. It was "
"at some sort of constant distance from us no matter what we tried. We only "
"had a small laser turret, but we even tried shooting at it and nothing. Zip-"
"O.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tras nuestro análisis superficial, fuimos a coger una muestra. Sin "
"embargo, cuando intentamos extender el brazo robótico hacia ella, nunca "
"pareció acercarse. Se mantenía a una distancia constante de nosotros sin "
"importar lo que intentáramos. Sólo teníamos una pequeña torreta láser, pero "
"incluso intentamos dispararle y nada. Zip-O.\""

msgid ""
"\"It could have been the exhaustion or something else, I don't know, but we "
"decided to try to ram it. So we accelerated at maximum velocity, and that's "
"when it happened. Suddenly there was some horrible screeching sound and "
"everything shook. Next thing we know, it felt like we were getting pulled "
"through the eye of a needle, like hyperspace sickness but much worse. And we "
"passed out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pudo ser el agotamiento u otra cosa, no lo sé, pero decidimos intentar "
"embestirlo. Así que aceleramos a la máxima velocidad, y fue entonces cuando "
"ocurrió. De repente se oyó un chirrido horrible y todo tembló. Lo siguiente "
"que sentimos fue como si nos arrastraran por el ojo de una aguja, como el "
"mareo del hiperespacio pero mucho peor. Y nos desmayamos.\""

msgid ""
"\"When we woke up, there was nothing around us. Only Nebula. One of the "
"shield generators had gone offline. We weren't going to last long. We did "
"some emergency repairs and hauled our asses out of there. When we got out, "
"our systems said that we had only been gone for about 22 periods, but when "
"we hailed a ship, we found out there was a 1087 period difference between "
"our system clock and theirs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando despertamos, no había nada a nuestro alrededor. Sólo la Nebulosa. "
"Uno de los generadores de escudos se había desconectado. No íbamos a durar "
"mucho. Hicimos algunas reparaciones de emergencia y sacamos nuestros culos "
"de allí. Cuando salimos, nuestros sistemas dijeron que sólo habíamos estado "
"fuera unos 22 periodos, pero cuando llamamos a una nave, descubrimos que "
"había una diferencia de 1087 periodos entre el reloj de nuestro sistema y el "
"suyo.\""

msgid ""
"\"The weird thing is we'd hardly used up our supplies, so there's no way "
"that could be true. I still scratch my head thinking about this today. I did "
"tend to lose track of time and lose hunger in the deep Nebula, but nothing "
"like that. We also had nothing from our encounter with the wreck or whatever "
"that was.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo raro es que apenas habíamos agotado nuestras provisiones, así que es "
"imposible que eso sea cierto. Todavía me rasco la cabeza pensando en esto "
"hoy. Sí que tendía a perder la noción del tiempo y a perder el hambre en la "
"Nebulosa profunda, pero nada de eso. Tampoco teníamos nada de nuestro "
"encuentro con el naufragio o lo que fuera.\""

msgid ""
"\"After that I headed back home and totally got chewed out by my wife. I had "
"to spend a few weeks sleeping on the couch and Maikki didn't speak to me for "
"ages.\"\n"
"He sighs wistfully.\n"
"\"That's the part I miss the most of my previous life. Having a place to go "
"after adventuring.\"\n"
"He looks a bit glum."
msgstr ""
"\"Después volví a casa y mi mujer me echó la bronca. Tuve que pasar unas "
"semanas durmiendo en el sofá y Maikki no me habló durante años.\"\n"
"Suspira con nostalgia.\n"
"\"Esa es la parte que más extraño de mi vida anterior. Tener un lugar al que "
"ir después de las aventuras.\"\n"
"Parece un poco desanimado."

