msgid "Jie de Luca"
msgstr "Jie de Luca"

msgid "You see an individual matching the description of Jie de Luca."
msgstr "Ves a un individuo que coincide con la descripción de Jie de Luca."

#. Mission is over
msgid "You head towards Kex's usual spot."
msgstr "Te diriges al lugar habitual de Kex."

msgid ""
"He looks fairly tired.\n"
"\"What's up, kid?\""
msgstr ""
"Parece bastante cansado.\n"
"\"¿Qué pasa, chico?\""

msgid ""
"You explain that you weren't able to get anything out of Jie and that this "
"time it was a failure."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas que no fuiste capaz de sacarle nada a Jie y que esta vez fue un "
"fracaso."

msgid "\"I see. That can't be helped. You win some, you lose some.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Eso no se puede evitar. Unas veces se gana y otras se pierde.\""

msgid ""
"\"While you were out I, think I got a lead on our next target, but it's not "
"something I really wanted to deal with right now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mientras estabas fuera yo, creo que tengo una pista sobre nuestro próximo "
"objetivo, pero no es algo de lo que quiera ocuparme ahora.\""

msgid ""
"\"Here, take some credits, and meet me up here in a period or so, I have to "
"finish double checking something.\"\n"
"He gives a sort of half-hearted grin and disappears into the shadows."
msgstr ""
"\"Toma, coge algunos créditos y reúnete conmigo aquí en un rato o así, tengo "
"que terminar de comprobar algo.\"\n"
"Hace una especie de sonrisa de medio lado y desaparece entre las sombras."

msgid "You take your leave and wander back to the main station."
msgstr "Te despides y regresas a la estación principal."

msgid ""
"You took down Jie de Luca, who seemed to be a close friend and associate of "
"the Minerva CEO."
msgstr ""
"Has eliminado a Jie de Luca, que parecía ser un amigo íntimo y socio del "
"Director General de Minerva."

msgid ""
"You approach Kex, who is once again taking a break at his favourite spot at "
"Minerva station."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a Kex, que una vez más se toma un descanso en su lugar favorito "
"de la estación de Minerva."

msgid ""
"He looks at you fairly somberly straight in the eyes.\n"
"\"You ever wonder what's the meaning of all this?\""
msgstr ""
"Te mira de forma bastante sombría directamente a los ojos.\n"
"\"¿Te has preguntado alguna vez cuál es el significado de todo esto?\""

msgid "\"Nice to see you again too.\""
msgstr "\"Yo también me alegro de volver a verte.\""

msgid "\"This?\""
msgstr "\"¿Esto?\""

msgid "\"What are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"¿De qué estás hablando?\""

msgid ""
"\"Well, I mean…\"\n"
"He seems at a loss of words.\n"
"\"You know…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, quiero decir...\"\n"
"Parece quedarse sin palabras.\n"
"\"Ya sabes...\""

msgctxt "you to Kex"
msgid "\"What?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué?\""

msgid ""
"He lets out a deep sigh.\n"
"\"It's just sort of pointless. Even if we somehow get rid of the CEO and I "
"get free, nothing really changes, you know? I'm still a damn duck. It's not "
"like I'm getting my life back. It's just sometimes it all seems so hopeless "
"and arbitrary. Like we're just some sort of random noise without any real "
"purpose.\""
msgstr ""
"Deja escapar un profundo suspiro.\n"
"\"Es un poco inútil. Incluso si de alguna manera nos deshacemos del Director "
"General y me libero, nada cambia realmente, ¿sabes? Sigo siendo un maldito "
"pato. No es que vaya a recuperar mi vida. Es sólo que a veces todo parece "
"tan desesperado y arbitrario. Como si fuéramos una especie de ruido "
"aleatorio sin ningún propósito real.\""

msgid ""
"Before you can speak, he keeps on going.\n"
"\"Anyway, don't let my silly thoughts bother you. Let us get back to topic."
"\"\n"
"His eyes don't seem to have changed."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que puedas hablar, él continúa.\n"
"\"De todos modos, no dejes que mis tontos pensamientos te molesten. Volvamos "
"al tema.\"\n"
"Sus ojos no parecen haber cambiado."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"So I was putting together the pieces and found a close collaborator of the "
"CEO, someone called Jie de Luca who seems to be situated in the Frontier. "
"They seem to go fairly far back with the CEO and probably have more "
"information. As this is our best lead for now, I hate to ask this of you, "
"but would you be able to check them out and see if we can get some more "
"information?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que estuve juntando las piezas y encontré a un colaborador cercano del "
"Director General, alguien llamado Jie de Luca que parece estar situado en la "
"frontera. Parece que se remonta bastante al Director General y probablemente "
"tenga más información. Como esta es nuestra mejor pista por ahora, odio "
"pedirte esto, pero ¿podrías investigarlo y ver si podemos obtener más "
"información?\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks. Jie de Luca should be located at {pnt} in the {sys} system. I "
"don't really know the relationship they have with the CEO, but unlike "
"Baroness Eve or Major Malik, Jie isn't that important of a figure so you "
"probably shouldn't have much of an issue dealing with them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias. Jie de Luca debería estar ubicada en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. "
"No sé realmente la relación que tienen con el Director General, pero a "
"diferencia de la Baronesa Eva o el Mayor Malik, Jie no es una figura tan "
"importante, así que probablemente no deberías tener muchos problemas para "
"tratar con él.\""

msgid ""
"\"There shouldn't be much trouble, but I do think that we may have caused "
"too much of a commotion, and I wouldn't be surprised if the CEO was starting "
"to have suspicions. Make sure to be careful out there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No debería haber muchos problemas, pero creo que podemos haber causado "
"demasiado revuelo, y no me sorprendería que el Director General empezara a "
"tener sospechas. Asegúrate de tener cuidado ahí fuera.\""

msgid "Ask if he's alright"
msgstr "Pregunta si está bien"

msgid ""
"\"Jie de Luca should be located at {pnt} in the {sys} system. I don't really "
"know the relationship they have with the CEO, but unlike Baroness Eve or "
"Major Malik, Jie isn't that important of a figure so you probably shouldn't "
"have much of an issue dealing with them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Jie de Luca debería estar localizado en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. No sé "
"realmente la relación que tienen con el Director General, pero a diferencia "
"de la Baronesa Eva o el Mayor Malik, Jie no es una figura tan importante así "
"que probablemente no deberías tener muchos problemas para tratar con él.\""

msgid ""
"\"Been better, kid. Just had some sleepless nights, staring at the ceiling, "
"unable to move, haunted by past regrets.\"\n"
"He looks visibly tired.\n"
"\"You ever do anything you regret, kid?\""
msgstr ""
"\"He estado mejor, chico. Sólo he tenido algunas noches de insomnio, mirando "
"al techo, sin poder moverme, perseguido por los remordimientos del pasado."
"\"\n"
"Parece visiblemente cansado.\n"
"\"¿Alguna vez has hecho algo de lo que te arrepientas, chico?\""

msgid "\"Of course\""
msgstr "\"Por supuesto\""

msgid "\"No, never\""
msgstr "\"No, nunca\""

msgid ""
"He nods solemnly.\n"
"\"We all have our inner demons, refusing to let go no matter how many cycles "
"pass.\""
msgstr ""
"Asiente solemnemente con la cabeza.\n"
"\"Todos tenemos nuestros demonios internos, que se niegan a abandonarnos sin "
"importar cuántos ciclos pasan.\""

msgid ""
"\"I envy you kid. My regrets seem to follow me no matter how much I try to "
"run away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Te envidio chico. Mis remordimientos parecen seguirme por mucho que "
"intente huir.\""

msgid ""
"\"Lately, my past seems to haunt me. When I am able to sleep, I have been "
"waking up in the middle of the night in cold sweat, well probably would if I "
"had some damn sweat glands, gasping for breath.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Últimamente, mi pasado parece perseguirme. Cuando puedo dormir, me he "
"estado despertando en medio de la noche con sudores fríos, bueno "
"probablemente lo haría si tuviera unas malditas glándulas sudoríparas, "
"jadeando.\""

msgid ""
"\"I haven't really paid attention to it much, but it's getting worse and "
"worse as time goes by. I'm sure it will all get better when this is over. I "
"mean, it has to, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"No le he prestado mucha atención, pero está empeorando a medida que pasa "
"el tiempo. Estoy seguro de que todo mejorará cuando esto termine. Quiero "
"decir, tiene que mejorar, ¿no?\""

msgid ""
"After a short pause he continues. \"You know, ever since I was a kid, I "
"always loved adventure: being at the centre of everything and braving "
"adversity. I loved the adrenaline rush and could never get enough of it all."
"\""
msgstr ""
"Tras una breve pausa, continúa. \"Sabes, desde que era un niño, siempre me "
"gustó la aventura: estar en el centro de todo y desafiar la adversidad. Me "
"encantaba el subidón de adrenalina y nunca me cansaba de todo eso.\""

msgid ""
"\"When I was getting older, I guess I tried to follow what everyone was "
"doing and sort of settle down, but I was never very good at staying still. "
"Whenever I stayed in the same place too long I got all itchy. It's like my "
"soul was yearning to go out and adventure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando me hice mayor, creo que intenté seguir lo que hacía todo el mundo y "
"asentarme, pero nunca fui muy bueno en quedarme quieto. Cada vez que me "
"quedaba mucho tiempo en el mismo sitio, me picaba todo. Es como si mi alma "
"estuviera anhelando salir y aventurarse.\""

msgid ""
"\"Even when I had my first child, I just couldn't stay put. I just had to go "
"out. But now…\"\n"
"His biological eye looks a bit hazy.\n"
"\"I guess you don't appreciate what you have until you lose it all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Incluso cuando tuve mi primer hijo, no podía quedarme quieto. Tenía que "
"salir. Pero ahora...\"\n"
"Su ojo biológico parece un poco borroso.\n"
"\"Supongo que no aprecias lo que tienes hasta que lo pierdes todo.\""

msgid ""
"You approach Jie de Luca who seems to be reading some sort of document while "
"nonchalantly sipping a drink."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a Jie de Luca, que parece estar leyendo algún tipo de documento "
"mientras bebe despreocupadamente."

msgid ""
"Without looking up they address you.\n"
"\"So you're the one causing a ruckus here and there. You look a bit "
"different from what I expected.\"\n"
"They look up at you."
msgstr ""
"Sin levantar la vista se dirigen a ti.\n"
"\"Así que tú eres el que está causando un alboroto aquí y allá. Tienes un "
"aspecto un poco diferente al que esperaba.\"\n"
"Levantan la vista hacia ti."

msgid ""
"\"Have you come to threaten me? Perhaps kill me?\"\n"
"They speak calmly, without so much as a tinge of urgency."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Has venido a amenazarme? ¿Quizás a matarme?\"\n"
"Habla con calma, sin ni siquiera un matiz de urgencia."

msgid "Ask about Minerva Station"
msgstr "Pregunta sobre la Estación Minerva"

msgid "Ask about the Minerva CEO"
msgstr "Pregunta por el Director General de Minerva"

msgid ""
"\"I see. I knew the day would come. Can't have a bunch of low-lives making a "
"decent living, now, can we?\"\n"
"They take a sip from their drink."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Sabía que llegaría el día. No se puede tener un grupo de "
"delincuentes que se ganen la vida decentemente, ¿verdad?\"\n"
"Bebe un sorbo de su bebida."

msgid ""
"\"Me and the guy you call the Minerva CEO, we were born here in Jorlan. Not "
"sure if we were orphaned or abandoned, but since a young age this world has "
"offered us nothing but cruelty and suffering. Forced to work in the ore "
"mines to survive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Yo y el tipo al que llamas Director General de Minerva, nacimos aquí en "
"Jorlan. No sé si fuimos huérfanos o abandonados, pero desde pequeños este "
"mundo no nos ha ofrecido más que crueldad y sufrimiento. Obligados a "
"trabajar en las minas de mineral para sobrevivir.\""

msgid ""
"\"This shithole taught us that nothing is given for free. You have to fight "
"with tooth and nail to get what you want! No that's not it, what we deserve!"
"\"\n"
"They hit the table for emphasis."
msgstr ""
"\"Este agujero de mierda nos enseñó que nada es gratis. ¡Hay que luchar con "
"uñas y dientes para conseguir lo que quieres! No, no eso, ¡lo que te mereces!"
"\"\n"
"Golpea la mesa para enfatizar."

msgid ""
"\"This universe is rotten to the core you know. If you don't want to wind up "
"as a husk of a human, toiling for the benefit of others, you have to take "
"what you damn want. I'm not going to wind up as another corpse deep down "
"underground.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Este universo está podrido hasta la médula, lo sabes. Si no quieres "
"terminar como una cáscara de humano, trabajando para el beneficio de otros, "
"tienes que tomar lo que malditamente quieres. No voy a terminar como otro "
"cadáver bajo tierra.\""

msgid ""
"\"I don't think a hired gun like you would truly understand the kind of "
"suffering of nearly working to death in the ore mines. You're just here to "
"do your master's bidding, like the loyal dog you are.\"\n"
"They give a small chuckle and lean forward."
msgstr ""
"\"No creo que un sicario como tú entienda realmente el tipo de sufrimiento "
"de trabajar casi hasta la muerte en las minas de mineral. Sólo estás aquí "
"para cumplir las órdenes de tu amo, como el perro leal que eres.\"\n"
"Da una pequeña risa y se inclina hacia adelante."

msgid ""
"\"Well honestly, I don't give a shit who your master is. The result is the "
"same, you are trying to take what we worked hard for with our blood, sweat, "
"and tears.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, honestamente, me importa una mierda quién es tu maestro. El "
"resultado es el mismo, estás tratando de quitarnos lo que hemos conseguido "
"con trabajo duro, con nuestra sangre, sudor y lágrimas.\""

msgid ""
"They clench their teeth.\n"
"\"I won't let you! Minerva Station is OURS! You have no idea of the hell we "
"went through to get here, and I'll be damned if I let that get taken away "
"from us!\""
msgstr ""
"Aprieta los dientes.\n"
"\"¡No te lo permitiré! ¡La Estación Minerva es nuestra! No tienes ni idea "
"del infierno que hemos pasado para llegar hasta aquí, ¡y que me cuelguen si "
"permito que nos la arrebaten!\""

msgid ""
"In the blink of an eye they fling their drink at you. You manage to dodge "
"most of it, but as you look back at them you see the table is empty. Shit, "
"that went well…\n"
"You rush to your ship to see if you can catch them in pursuit!"
msgstr ""
"En un abrir y cerrar de ojos te lanza la bebida. Consigues esquivar la mayor "
"parte, pero al volver a mirarles ves que la mesa está vacía. Mierda, eso ha "
"ido bien...\n"
"¡Te apresuras a ir a tu nave para ver si puedes alcanzarlo en una "
"persecución!"

msgid "Deal with Jie de Luca"
msgstr "Encargate de Jie de Luca"

#. Henchmen
#. Start the attack, should be close enough to aggro naturally
#. Make sure system isn't claimed, but we don't claim it (inclusive test)
#. Spawn near the centre, they home in on player
#. Timer
#. Start the attack, should be close enough to aggro naturally
msgid "Looks like we found our target!"
msgstr "¡Parece que hemos encontrado nuestro objetivo!"

msgid "Time to collect our bounty!"
msgstr "¡Es hora de recoger nuestra recompensa!"

msgid "Target locked. Engaging."
msgstr "Objetivo fijado. Apuntando."

msgid ""
"You board the ship with your weapons drawn and make your way to the command "
"centre. You don't encounter any resistance on the way there."
msgstr ""
"Subes a la nave con las armas desplegadas y te diriges al centro de mando. "
"No encuentras ninguna resistencia en el camino."

msgid ""
"Eventually you reach the command centre and cautiously enter. The room is "
"empty except for a chair in the centre with its back facing towards you."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, llegas al centro de mando y entras con precaución. La sala está "
"vacía excepto por una silla en el centro con el respaldo hacia ti."

msgid ""
"Slowly the chair turns to reveal Jie de Luca, holding their head from which "
"blood is gushing out. In their other hand they clutch a weapon, but it "
"doesn't really look like they are in any condition to use it."
msgstr ""
"Lentamente, la silla gira para revelar a Jie de Luca, sosteniendo su cabeza "
"de la que brota sangre. En su otra mano empuña un arma, pero no parece estar "
"en condiciones de utilizarla."

msgid ""
"\"Feeling proud of yourself dog? Wagging your tail thinking about getting a "
"prize from your master?\"\n"
"They cough and you can see some blood drip from the side of their mouth."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Te sientes orgulloso de ti mismo perro? ¿Moviendo la cola pensando en "
"recibir un premio de tu amo?\"\n"
"Tose y se puede ver cómo gotea algo de sangre de un lado de su boca."

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"\"This is why we can't have nice things…\"\n"
"As their head slouches down, you hear an alarm blaring, and a voice "
"announcing \"Self-destruct imminent!\"."
msgstr ""
"\"Por eso no podemos tener cosas bonitas...\"\n"
"Mientras su cabeza se inclina hacia abajo, se oye una alarma y una voz que "
"anuncia \"¡Autodestrucción inminente!\"."

msgid ""
"You leave Jie behind as you rush to get back to your ship to get away from "
"the explosion."
msgstr ""
"Dejas atrás a Jie mientras te apresuras a volver a tu nave para alejarte de "
"la explosión."

msgid "You aren't leaving this alive, dog!"
msgstr "¡No saldrás vivo de esto, perro!"

msgid ""
"As the debris of Jie's ship disperses you realize you never got around to "
"questioning them or getting any information at all…"
msgstr ""
"Cuando los restos de la nave de Jie se dispersan, te das cuenta de que nunca "
"llegaste a interrogarlo ni a obtener ninguna información…"

msgid "Might be best to head back to Kex for now and see what can be done."
msgstr "Tal vez sea mejor volver a Kex por ahora y ver qué se puede hacer."

msgid "Kex wants you to kill Dr. Strangelove at {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Kex quiere que mates al Dr. Strangelove en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"You approach Kex, who is sort of slumping at his usual spot. He doesn't seem "
"to be in very good condition."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a Kex, que está como desplomado en su lugar habitual. No parece "
"estar en muy buenas condiciones."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It takes a bit before Kex notices your presence. His feathers are rather "
"dishevelled.\n"
"\"Oh, hey kid.\""
msgstr ""
"Kex tarda un poco en darse cuenta de tu presencia. Sus plumas están bastante "
"despeinadas.\n"
"\"Oh, hola chico.\""

msgid ""
"It takes a while before he continues.\n"
"\"Compared to the vastness of all the universe, we are completely "
"insignificant. Our sorrows and glories go unheard and seemingly devoid of "
"all meaning.\""
msgstr ""
"Tarda un rato en continuar.\n"
"\"Comparados con la inmensidad de todo el universo, somos completamente "
"insignificantes. Nuestras penas y glorias pasan desapercibidas y "
"aparentemente carecen de todo significado.\""

msgid ""
"\"Coming to terms with one's own insignificance does give a clarity of mind "
"and makes clear one's deepest desires. What has to be done then becomes "
"clear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Llegar a un acuerdo con la propia insignificancia da claridad a la mente y "
"aclara los deseos más profundos de uno. Lo que hay que hacer entonces se "
"vuelve claro.\""

msgid "Without blinking Kex states \"I need you to kill Strangelove.\""
msgstr "Sin pestañear, Kex afirma: \"Necesito que mates a Strangelove.\""

msgid ""
"He looks even more dejected.\n"
"\"I see. I'll be around.\""
msgstr ""
"Parece aún más abatido.\n"
"\"Ya veo. Estaré por aquí.\""

msgid ""
"\"I should have realized it sooner. It was obvious from the start that "
"Strangelove would be involved in this travesty of a station. I found his "
"name when reviewing some of the documents you gave me, then it was all clear."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Debería haberme dado cuenta antes. Era obvio desde el principio que "
"Strangelove estaría involucrado en esta parodia de estación. Encontré su "
"nombre al revisar algunos de los documentos que me diste, entonces estaba "
"todo claro.\""

msgid ""
"\"There aren't too many trails to where he is right now, but I do think I "
"know where to find him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No hay demasiadas pistas para saber dónde está ahora mismo, pero creo que "
"sé dónde encontrarlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, you know where he is? How you know is not important now, all I need "
"you to do is go over there and end his rotten life once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, ¿sabes dónde está? Cómo lo sabes no es importante ahora, todo lo "
"que necesito es que vayas allí y acabes con su podrida vida de una vez por "
"todas.\""

msgid ""
"\"The universe will be a much better place with scum like him gone, and I'll "
"finally get my vengeance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El universo será un lugar mucho mejor con escoria como él muerto, y "
"finalmente obtendré mi venganza.\""

msgid ""
"Without saying anything else, Kex waddles off stumbling into the darkness of "
"the station. You feel like it is best to leave him alone right now and "
"decide to go see Strangelove. He should be in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Sin decir nada más, Kex se aleja dando tumbos en la oscuridad de la "
"estación. Crees que lo mejor es dejarlo solo en este momento y decides ir a "
"ver a Strangelove. Debería estar en el sistema {sys}."

#. If not accepted, mem.misn_state will still be nil
msgid "You have agreed to help Kex deal with Dr. Strangelove."
msgstr "Has aceptado ayudar a Kex a lidiar con el Dr. Strangelove."

msgid "Go find Dr. Strangelove in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Busca al Dr. Strangelove en el sistema {sys}"

#. Can't use spob.get() here for when the diff is removed
msgid ""
"You approach Kex who is sort of slumping at his usual spot. He doesn't seem "
"much better than last time you met him."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a Kex, que está desplomado en su lugar habitual. No parece estar "
"mucho mejor que la última vez que lo viste."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Hey kid.\"\n"
"He seems a bit nervous and speaks softer than usual.\n"
"\"Did you do what I asked?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola chico\".\n"
"Parece un poco nervioso y habla más suave que de costumbre.\n"
"\"¿Hiciste lo que te pedí?\""

msgid ""
"You explain to him how the mission went, handing him the drone you found in "
"the laboratory, and explain how you comforted the dying Dr. Strangelove as "
"he passed away from his mysterious illness in front of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas cómo fue la misión, entregándole el dron que encontraste en el "
"laboratorio, y le explicas cómo consolaste al moribundo Dr. Strangelove "
"mientras fallecía de su misteriosa enfermedad ante tus ojos."

msgid ""
"He looks at you after your explanation and furrows his brows a bit.\n"
"\"I can't believe you comforted him. Do you know all the shit he's done! The "
"shit he's put me through!\""
msgstr ""
"Te mira después de tu explicación y frunce un poco las cejas.\n"
"\"No puedo creer que lo hayas consolado. ¿Sabes toda la mierda que ha hecho? "
"¡La mierda que me ha hecho pasar!\""

msgid ""
"\"Damn it, not only am I not feeling any relief, but I can't even get angry "
"at you.\"\n"
"He looks down sadly at the floor for a while before looking at you again."
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, no sólo no siento ningún alivio, sino que ni siquiera puedo "
"enfadarme contigoe\"\n"
"Mira tristemente al suelo durante un rato antes de volver a mirarte."

msgid ""
"You explain to him how the mission went and go into graphic detail of how "
"you finished Dr. Strangelove off by shooting at him point-blank as Kex asked."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas cómo fue la misión y entras en detalles gráficos de cómo "
"acabaste con el Dr. Strangelove disparándole a bocajarro como te pidió Kex."

msgid ""
"You also hand him the droid you recovered. Kex looks at it briefly before "
"pocketing it somewhere inside his mat of feathers."
msgstr ""
"También le entregas el droide que has recuperado. Kex lo mira brevemente "
"antes de guardarlo en algún lugar de su alfombra de plumas."

msgid ""
"You explain to him how the mission went and go into details of how you "
"finished Dr. Strangelove off by unplugging him as Kex asked."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas cómo fue la misión y entras en detalles de cómo acabaste con el "
"Dr. Strangelove desenchufándolo como te pidió Kex."

msgid ""
"You explain to him how the mission went, handing him the drone you found in "
"the laboratory, and explain how Dr. Strangelove died of his mysterious "
"illness in front of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Le explicas cómo fue la misión, entregándole el dron que encontraste en el "
"laboratorio, y le explicas cómo el Dr. Strangelove murió de su misteriosa "
"enfermedad delante de tus ojos."

msgid ""
"He looks at you after your explanation and furrows his brows a bit.\n"
"\"I was expecting some sort of relief. You know, having Strangelove dead is "
"all I ever wanted since I escaped from the laboratory. All I ever dreamed "
"of, and when I finally get it… nothing?\""
msgstr ""
"Te mira después de tu explicación y frunce un poco las cejas.\n"
"\"Esperaba algún tipo de alivio. Sabes, tener a Strangelove muerto es todo "
"lo que siempre quise desde que escapé del laboratorio. Todo lo que he "
"soñado, y cuando por fin lo consigo... ¿nada?\""

msgid ""
"\"He's dead. He's completely toasted! Why aren't we celebrating?! Why aren't "
"we happy!?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Está muerto. ¡Está completamente tostado! ¡¿Por qué no estamos "
"celebrándolo?! ¿Por qué no estamos contentos?\""

msgid "\"We should be dancing!\""
msgstr "\"¡Deberíamos estar bailando!\""

msgid "\"We should be partying!\""
msgstr "\"¡Deberíamos estar de fiesta!\""

msgid "\"We should…\""
msgstr "\"Deberíamos...\""

msgid ""
"\"Shit, who am I kidding.\"\n"
"He looks as glum as ever.\n"
"\"You can't kill your way out of depression…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mierda, a quién quiero engañar\".\n"
"Se ve tan triste como siempre.\n"
"\"No puedes matar para salir de una depresión...\""

msgid ""
"\"Hey, kid, I'm really grateful for all you've done, but I don't think I can "
"go on. I just need some time alone to gather my thoughts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, chico, estoy muy agradecido por todo lo que has hecho, pero no creo "
"que pueda seguir. Necesito un tiempo a solas para ordenar mis pensamientos.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've scrounged up some cash, I don't think I'll be needing it. Here take "
"it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He conseguido algo de dinero, no creo que lo necesite. Toma, cógelo.\""

msgid ""
"Without saying another word, Kex slowly disappears into the shadows. It "
"doesn't seem like he'll recover soon. Maybe there is another way to help him "
"without getting him directly involved?"
msgstr ""
"Sin decir nada más, Kex desaparece lentamente entre las sombras. No parece "
"que vaya a recuperarse pronto. ¿Quizás haya otra forma de ayudarle sin "
"involucrarle directamente?"

msgid ""
"You reported back to Kex, who gave up on working for his freedom due to his "
"crippling depression. Maybe there is another way to help him indirectly?"
msgstr ""
"Informaste a Kex, que renunció a trabajar por su libertad debido a su "
"depresión paralizante. ¿Tal vez hay otra manera de ayudarlo indirectamente?"

msgid "You never met up with Dr. Strangelove."
msgstr "Nunca te reuniste con el Dr. Strangelove."

#. Try to make sure they meet up the player
#. No spawns nor anything in Westhaven
#. TODO better handling, maybe more fighting with drones and a close-up cinematic?
msgid "You are unable to land while the bounty hunters are still active."
msgstr "No puedes aterrizar mientras los cazarrecompensas sigan activos."

#. Broadcast after hostile
msgid "Looks like we have company!"
msgstr "¡Parece que tenemos compañía!"

#. Decrease chance
#. Reset autonav just in case
#. Only chase if not hidden
#. Keep on beating
msgid ""
"All that remains of the bounty hunters is floating debris. It seems like you "
"should be able to safely land and search for Dr. Strangelove at his "
"laboratory now."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que queda de los cazarrecompensas son restos flotantes. Parece que "
"ahora deberías poder aterrizar con seguridad y buscar al Dr. Strangelove en "
"su laboratorio."

msgid ""
"Your ship sensors indicate that Strangelove's laboratory is no longer "
"pressurized and without an atmosphere, so you don your space suit before "
"entering."
msgstr ""
"Los sensores de tu nave indican que el laboratorio de Strangelove ya no está "
"presurizado y sin atmósfera, así que te pones el traje espacial antes de "
"entrar."

msgid ""
"The first thing you notice is that the laboratory has been ravaged, likely "
"by the Bounty Hunters you encountered outside. The place was already a mess "
"the last time you came, but now you have to jump over obstacles as you "
"progress through the laboratory."
msgstr ""
"Lo primero que observas es que el laboratorio ha sido devastado, "
"probablemente por los cazarrecompensas que encontraste fuera. El lugar ya "
"era un desastre la última vez que viniste, pero ahora tienes que saltar "
"obstáculos mientras avanzas por el laboratorio."

msgid "Check the Living Quarters"
msgstr "Revisa los Alojamientos"

msgid "Check the Recreation Room"
msgstr "Revisa la Sala de Recreo"

msgid "Check the Back Room"
msgstr "Compruebe la Sala Trasera"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You make your way through a tight, nearly impassable passageway towards the "
"living quarters. Although it is a mess, you don't really see any signs of "
"anyone living here. It rather seems all abandoned."
msgstr ""
"Te abres paso a través de un pasillo estrecho y casi impracticable hacia la "
"vivienda. Aunque es un desorden, no ves realmente ningún signo de que "
"alguien viva aquí. Más bien parece todo abandonado."

msgid ""
"Eventually, you reach a very small room with a bed capsule. The ground and "
"bed are splattered with blood, but it seems very old and desiccated. Some "
"empty medical syringes and pouches are scattered on the floor."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, llegas a una habitación muy pequeña con una cápsula cama. El "
"suelo y la cama están salpicados de sangre, pero parece muy vieja y "
"desecada. Algunas jeringuillas y bolsas médicas vacías están esparcidas por "
"el suelo."

msgid "You turn over everything, but find nothing of interest."
msgstr "Lo revuelves todo, pero no encuentras nada de interés."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You head towards, and eventually reach, the recreation room, which has been "
"completely trashed. Even pieces of the wall have been ripped out, revealing "
"shoddy cable connections and lots of weird mould."
msgstr ""
"Te diriges hacia la sala de recreo, que ha sido completamente destrozada, y "
"llegas a ella. Incluso han arrancado trozos de la pared, revelando "
"conexiones de cables de mala calidad y un montón de moho extraño."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Looking around, you find that the hologram projector you used last time is, "
"unsurprisingly, completely wrecked. It doesn't seem like you'll be able to "
"use it to get in touch with Dr. Strangelove any more."
msgstr ""
"Mirando a tu alrededor, descubres que el proyector de hologramas que "
"utilizaste la última vez está, como era de esperar, completamente "
"destrozado. Parece que ya no podrás utilizarlo para ponerte en contacto con "
"el Dr. Strangelove."

msgid "Try as you might, you are unable to find anything of interest."
msgstr "Por mucho que lo intentes, no consigues encontrar nada de interés."

msgid ""
"You find a tunnel leading towards the back room. It seems to have been "
"blocked off once, but now has been torn wide open. You ignore the \"KEEP "
"OUT\" sign that is bent up underfoot and make your way through."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras un túnel que lleva a la sala de atrás. Parece que estuvo "
"bloqueada en su día, pero ahora ha sido abierta de par en par. Ignoras la "
"señal de \" MANTENGASE FUERA\" que está doblada bajo tus pies y te abres "
"paso."

msgid ""
"The tunnel twists and turns as it heads towards the centre of the asteroid. "
"There is no lighting along the way, so you rely on the lamps of your suit."
msgstr ""
"El túnel se retuerce y gira mientras te diriges al centro del asteroide. No "
"hay iluminación en el camino, por lo que dependes de las lámparas de tu "
"traje."

msgid ""
"Eventually you reach a room at the core of the asteroid. It is fairly large "
"compared to the rest of the laboratory, but is jammed with junk and rubbish, "
"lots of which has been recently moved around."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente llegas a una sala en el núcleo del asteroide. Es bastante grande "
"en comparación con el resto del laboratorio, pero está atestada de chatarra "
"y basura, mucha de la cual ha sido movida recientemente."

msgid ""
"You start to sift through the things to try to find something of interest, "
"but after a long time of looking around and not making significant progress, "
"you decide to take a break and sit on a fallen bookcase."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a rebuscar entre las cosas para tratar de encontrar algo de "
"interés, pero después de un buen rato de mirar y no hacer progresos "
"significativos, decides tomarte un descanso y sentarte en una librería caída."

msgid ""
"As you survey the room, you notice a small movement next to your feet. "
"Slowly and carefully you lift up some debris to uncover a small and heavily "
"damaged droid."
msgstr ""
"Mientras examinas la sala, notas un pequeño movimiento junto a tus pies. "
"Lentamente y con cuidado levantas algunos escombros para descubrir un "
"pequeño droide muy dañado."

msgid ""
"You pick up the droid and dust it off. Its primary lens and hover engine "
"seem completely destroyed, but it does seem like it still has power and "
"likely data in it. You try to interface to it, but it seems to be locked "
"with strong encryption. You pocket it as it seems like it might be something "
"of interest to Kex."
msgstr ""
"Recoges el droide y le quitas el polvo. Su lente principal y su motor de "
"vuelo parecen completamente destruidos, pero parece que aún tiene energía y "
"probablemente datos. Intentas conectarte a él, pero parece estar bloqueado "
"con una fuerte encriptación. Lo guardas en el bolsillo, ya que parece que "
"podría ser algo de interés para Kex."

msgid ""
"You get back to searching around the stuff and end up finding nothing else "
"of interest."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a buscar entre las cosas y terminas por no encontrar nada más de "
"interés."

msgid "You collected a small robot in Dr. Strangelove's laboratory."
msgstr "Has recogido un pequeño robot en el laboratorio del Dr. Strangelove."

msgid ""
"You spend your time carefully going through the entire station, but it ends "
"up being mostly in vain: Dr. Strangelove is nowhere to be found. At least "
"you found a droid that might be useful."
msgstr ""
"Dedicas tu tiempo a recorrer cuidadosamente toda la estación, pero acaba "
"siendo en su mayor parte en vano: El Dr. Strangelove no aparece por ningún "
"lado. Al menos has encontrado un droide que podría ser útil."

msgid ""
"You let out a sigh as you head outside. Maybe Dr. Strangelove escaped "
"somewhere else?"
msgstr ""
"Dejas escapar un suspiro mientras te diriges al exterior. ¿Quizás el Dr. "
"Strangelove se haya escapado a otro lugar?"

#. Take off
#. Disable landing, will get disabled on entering new system
msgid "You have better things to do right now."
msgstr "Tienes mejores cosas que hacer ahora mismo."

#. TODO small scene
msgid ""
"As you loiter around the system, you suddenly receive an unexpected incoming "
"transmission."
msgstr ""
"Mientras merodeas por el sistema, de repente recibes una transmisión "
"entrante inesperada."

msgid ""
"A hologram of Dr. Strangelove appears before you. He is laying down and his "
"body seems to be sapped of all energy. He seems to muster up energy to "
"vaguely look in your direction, although his eyes seem unnaturally clouded.\n"
"\"Is that you?\""
msgstr ""
"Un holograma del Dr. Strangelove aparece ante ti. Está tumbado y su cuerpo "
"parece estar desprovisto de toda energía. Parece reunir energía para mirar "
"vagamente en tu dirección, aunque sus ojos parecen anormalmente nublados.\n"
"\"¿Eres tú?\""

msgid ""
"\"I've been expecting you.\"\n"
"A coughing fit wracks his body.\n"
"\"There is not much time, come to my ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Te estaba esperando\".\n"
"Un ataque de tos sacude su cuerpo.\n"
"\"No hay mucho tiempo, ven a mi nave.\""

msgid "The communication channel closes and you receive coordinates to a ship."
msgstr ""
"El canal de comunicación se cierra y recibes las coordenadas de una nave."

#. Reset variable if player aborted mission after this for some reason
#. TODO small scene
msgid ""
"You cautiously board the ship, not sure what you are about to encounter. "
"Trusting your system's sensors indicating a proper atmosphere in the ship, "
"you board without your space suit. However, when you enter the ship, a "
"strong, pungent odour makes you regret your decision."
msgstr ""
"Subes a la nave con cautela, sin saber lo que te vas a encontrar. Confiando "
"en que los sensores de tu sistema indiquen una atmósfera adecuada en la "
"nave, subes sin tu traje espacial. Sin embargo, cuando entras en la nave, un "
"fuerte y penetrante olor te hace lamentar tu decisión."

msgid ""
"As you move to the command room, you notice small movements from the corner "
"of your eyes. Upon closer inspection you make out all sorts of small moving "
"objects, reminding you of cleaning droids on most ships, however, these move "
"in a fairly clunky fashion, as if they had some of their moving apparatus "
"damaged."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te diriges a la sala de mando, notas pequeños movimientos con el "
"rabillo del ojo. Al observar más de cerca, distingues todo tipo de pequeños "
"objetos en movimiento, que te recuerdan a los droides de limpieza de la "
"mayoría de las naves; sin embargo, estos se mueven de forma bastante torpe, "
"como si tuvieran algún aparato de movimiento dañado."

msgid ""
"You pay little attention to the small critters, which seem harmless, and "
"proceed through the ship. After a short walk you enter the command room."
msgstr ""
"Prestas poca atención a los pequeños bichos, que parecen inofensivos, y "
"avanzas por la nave. Tras un breve paseo, entras en la sala de mando."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You enter the room and meet Dr. Strangelove face-to-face for the first time. "
"Dr. Strangelove is laid out in a medical bed connected to a lot of weird "
"machines, with a medical droid attending him. If it weren't for the fact "
"that everything is fairly rundown and dirty, you would think you were in a "
"planetary hospital instead of a spaceship at the edge of the universe."
msgstr ""
"Entras en la habitación y conoces al Dr. Strangelove cara a cara por primera "
"vez. El Dr. Strangelove está tumbado en una cama médica conectada a un "
"montón de máquinas extrañas, con un droide médico atendiéndole. Si no fuera "
"porque todo está bastante deteriorado y sucio, pensarías que estás en un "
"hospital planetario en lugar de en una nave espacial al borde del universo."

msgid ""
"You take a close look at Dr. Strangelove, and he seems like a husk of what "
"might have once been a man. His cheekbones protrude from his pale face and "
"his laboratory coat seems to be a few sizes too large on his frail body. His "
"vitals monitor also confirms your suspicion that he is more dead than alive."
msgstr ""
"Miras de cerca al Dr. Strangelove y parece una cáscara de lo que podría "
"haber sido un hombre. Sus pómulos sobresalen de su pálido rostro y su bata "
"de laboratorio parece ser un par de tallas más grande que su frágil cuerpo. "
"Su monitor de signos vitales también confirma tu sospecha de que está más "
"muerto que vivo."

msgid ""
"\"I see you were able to make it.\"\n"
"He coughs violently.\n"
"\"Sorry, I haven't been feeling too well lately.\"\n"
"He doesn't seem to be focusing much on you and is just talking in your "
"general direction."
msgstr ""
"\"Veo que has podido llegar.\"\n"
"Tose violentamente.\n"
"\"Lo siento, no me he sentido muy bien últimamente.\"\n"
"No parece centrarse mucho en ti y se limita a hablar en tu dirección general."

msgid ""
"\"It is all going well. I think we are close to a breakthrough, the next "
"time I should be able to succeed. After all this time, finally I'll be able "
"to see the truth!\"\n"
"His vital monitor's warning light flashes on."
msgstr ""
"\"Todo va bien. Creo que estamos cerca de un avance, la próxima vez debería "
"ser capaz de tener éxito. Después de todo este tiempo, ¡por fin podré ver la "
"verdad!\"\n"
"La luz de aviso de su monitor vital se enciende."

msgid ""
"\"You were right. It was and is all connected. I should have listened to you "
"sooner, but I was foolish and naïve.\"\n"
"He lets out a sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"Tenías razón. Todo estaba y está conectado. Debí haberte escuchado antes, "
"pero fui tonto e ingenuo.\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid ""
"\"I thought I almost had it with the last specimen. It was all going so "
"smoothly… The zero-point bionimorphic interface connection went flawlessly, "
"and the entropy flux was nearly stable, but the connection was never "
"established.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pensé que casi lo tenía con el último espécimen. Todo iba tan bien... La "
"conexión de la interfaz bionimórfica de punto cero fue impecable, y el flujo "
"de entropía era casi estable, pero la conexión nunca se estableció.\""

msgid ""
"\"It could be the distance, but my calculations indicated that it shouldn't "
"matter. It should be everywhere. Everything is everywhere! Folding onto "
"itself and twisted around in higher dimensions. Measly Euclidean distances "
"shouldn't matter at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Podría ser la distancia, pero mis cálculos indican que no debería "
"importar. Debería estar en todas partes. ¡Todo está en todas partes! Se "
"pliega sobre sí mismo y se retuerce en dimensiones superiores. Las míseras "
"distancias euclidianas no deberían importar en absoluto.\""

msgid ""
"\"…but it didn't work. Almost as if making a mockery of science itself and "
"spitting in my face. Almost as if the universe itself is unwilling to give "
"up its secrets.\"\n"
"He coughs violently.\n"
"\"It failed. Like always. It failed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...pero no funcionó. Casi como si se burlara de la propia ciencia y me "
"escupiera en la cara. Casi como si el propio universo no quisiera entregar "
"sus secretos.\"\n"
"Tose violentamente.\n"
"\"Falló. Como siempre. Falló.\""

msgid ""
"\"Williams, why did you have to die? You know so much. You surpassed me in "
"everything I could possibly imagine. You would have been able to make it "
"work!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Williams, ¿por qué tuviste que morir? Sabes tanto. Me superaste en todo lo "
"que pude imaginar. ¡Habrías sido capaz de hacerlo funcionar!\""

msgid "Ask about Kex"
msgstr "Pregunta por Kex"

msgid "Say you are sorry"
msgstr "Di que lo sientes"

msgid "Mention he is delirious"
msgstr "Menciona que está delirando"

msgid ""
"He goes on.\n"
"\"You were always the brightest in the class. I always admired how fast you "
"were able to solve partial differential equations so elegantly.\""
msgstr ""
"Continúa.\n"
"\"Siempre fuiste el más brillante de la clase. Siempre admiré lo rápido que "
"eras capaz de resolver ecuaciones diferenciales parciales con tanta "
"elegancia.\""

msgid ""
"\"Remember that one time we nearly caused a subatomic implosion when the "
"hyperphased quantum auto-cycle hit the self-refractive frequency? Your quick "
"thinking saved us from turning the entire system into a sterile void.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Recuerdas aquella vez que casi provocamos una implosión subatómica cuando "
"el autociclo cuántico hiperfásico alcanzó la frecuencia de autorrefracción? "
"Tu rapidez mental nos salvó de convertir todo el sistema en un vacío estéril."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"If only you had been with me this entire time. We could have done so much "
"together.\"\n"
"His voice tears up slightly."
msgstr ""
"\"Si hubieras estado conmigo todo este tiempo. Podríamos haber hecho tanto "
"juntos.\"\n"
"La voz se le rompe ligeramente."

msgid "\"Why did you have to do it?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué tuviste que hacerlo?\""

msgid "\"Do what?\""
msgstr "\"¿Hacer qué?\""

msgid "Ask about Kex again"
msgstr "Vuelve a preguntar por Kex"

msgid ""
"\"Why did you have to kill yourself?\"\n"
"His sightless eyes look vacantly while tears flow down his face."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por qué tuviste que suicidarte?\"\n"
"Sus ojos sin vista miran con desgana mientras las lágrimas fluyen por su "
"rostro."

msgid ""
"You don't know how to answer and silence envelops the room. Finally, he "
"breaks the calmness.\n"
"\"I should have been the one to try to defuse the reactor core, not you. I "
"should have been the one vaporized in the resulting explosion, not you.\""
msgstr ""
"No sabes qué responder y el silencio envuelve la habitación. Finalmente, él "
"rompe la calma.\n"
"\"Debería haber sido yo quien intentara desactivar el núcleo del reactor, no "
"tú. Yo debería haber sido el que se vaporizó en la explosión resultante, no "
"tú.\""

msgid ""
"The vitals monitor starts flashing red, and the medical droid begins to "
"tweak and make adjustments to intravenous drips and other medical devices.\n"
"He coughs a bit and you can see blood flecks splatter onto his clothes."
msgstr ""
"El monitor de signos vitales empieza a parpadear en rojo y el droide médico "
"comienza a ajustar los goteos intravenosos y otros dispositivos médicos.\n"
"Tose un poco y se pueden ver motas de sangre que salpican tu ropa."

msgid ""
"\"If only our places had been switched, you would have been able to solve it "
"and find me again. I was so close and yet it still feels like there is some "
"sort of impenetrable wall between me and the solution. What did I miss, "
"where did I go wrong?\"\n"
"The vitals monitor is still flashing."
msgstr ""
"\"Si tan sólo nuestros lugares se hubieran intercambiado, habrías podido "
"resolverlo y encontrarme de nuevo. Estuve tan cerca y, sin embargo, sigue "
"pareciendo que hay una especie de muro impenetrable entre la solución y yo. "
"¿Qué me he perdido, en qué me he equivocado?\"\n"
"El monitor de signos vitales sigue parpadeando."

msgid "\"Everything.\""
msgstr "\"Todo.\""

msgid "\"It is already connected.\""
msgstr "\"Ya está conectado.\""

msgid "\"It never connected.\""
msgstr "\"Nunca se conecto.\""

msgid "Insist about Kex"
msgstr "Insistes sobre Kex"

msgid ""
"\"Everything? You mean I missed the fundamental nature of it? I see. What we "
"are seeing is just the lower dimensional projection of an intrinsically "
"higher dimension space. Then everything has to be rewritten.\"\n"
"He tries feebly to get up before coughs wrack his body and stain it further "
"with specks of blood. He falls back to the bed impotently."
msgstr ""
"¿\"Todo\"? ¿Quieres decir que me he perdido lo fundamental? Ya veo. Lo que "
"estamos viendo es sólo la proyección de una dimensión inferior de un espacio "
"de dimensión intrínsecamente superior. Entonces hay que reescribirlo todo."
"\"\n"
"Intenta débilmente levantarse antes de que la tos agite su cuerpo y lo "
"manche aún más con motas de sangre. Vuelve a caer en la cama con impotencia."

msgid ""
"\"Already connected? You mean that there was no need to force a connection, "
"we just weren't able to see it? Then there might be still time to redo the "
"last experiment. Maybe if I recalibrate the oscillator I could…\"\n"
"He tries feebly to get up before coughs wrack his body and stain it further "
"with specks of blood. He falls back to the bed impotently."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Ya está conectado? ¿Quieres decir que no era necesario forzar la "
"conexión, sólo que no éramos capaces de verla? Entonces puede que aún "
"estemos a tiempo de rehacer el último experimento. Tal vez si recalibro el "
"oscilador podría...\"\n"
"Trata de levantarse débilmente antes de que la tos agite su cuerpo y lo "
"manche aún más con motas de sangre. Vuelve a caer en la cama con impotencia."

msgid ""
"\"Even in the last experiment? The energy wasn't sufficient? Maybe if I "
"reroute the ship's power system and redo the experiment I might be able to "
"connect. I must redo the experiment…\"\n"
"He tries feebly to get up before coughs wrack his body and stain it further "
"with specks of blood. He falls back to the bed impotently."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Incluso en el último experimento? ¿La energía no era suficiente? Tal vez "
"si redirijo el sistema de energía de la nave y vuelvo a hacer el experimento "
"pueda conectarme. Debo rehacer el experimento...\"\n"
"Trata de levantarse débilmente antes de que la tos le agite el cuerpo y lo "
"manche aún más con motas de sangre. Vuelve a caer en la cama con impotencia."

msgid ""
"\"I am so close, I can't stop here in front of you. Recalibrating the "
"polymorphic tissue might stabilize the connection…\"\n"
"He tries feebly to get up before coughs wrack his body and stain it further "
"with specks of blood. He falls back to the bed impotently."
msgstr ""
"\"Estoy tan cerca que no puedo detenerme aquí, frente a ti. Recalibrar el "
"tejido polimórfico podría estabilizar la conexión...\"\n"
"Intenta débilmente levantarse antes de que la tos agite su cuerpo y lo "
"manche aún más con motas de sangre. Vuelve a caer en la cama con impotencia."

msgid ""
"He seems out of breath.\n"
"\"Today is not a good day. I just need a bit more rest and I can get started "
"again.\""
msgstr ""
"Parece estar sin aliento.\n"
"\"Hoy no es un buen día. Sólo necesito un poco más de descanso y puedo "
"volver a empezar.\""

msgid ""
"\"It was just like you said, the nebula is just a manifestation, not an "
"entity in itself, but establishing the connection is less straight-forward "
"than what you left in your notes. I've tried correcting the harmonic "
"equation, but it doesn't…\"\n"
"His talking is slowing down and starting to get muddled. You have trouble "
"making out what he's saying."
msgstr ""
"\"Fue tal como dijiste, la nebulosa es sólo una manifestación, no una "
"entidad en sí misma, pero establecer la conexión es menos sencillo que lo "
"que dejaste en tus notas. He intentado corregir la ecuación armónica, pero "
"no...\"\n"
"Su discurso se ralentiza y empieza a ser confuso. Te cuesta entender lo que "
"dice."

msgid "\"You are dying.\""
msgstr "\"Te estás muriendo.\""

msgid "\"It is over.\""
msgstr "\"Se ha acabado.\""

msgid ""
"His lips begin moving and you can hear some sort of rasping sound coming "
"out, however, you can no longer make out what he is saying. You glance at "
"the monitors and you see his vitals are tanking. It looks like he has run "
"out of time."
msgstr ""
"Sus labios comienzan a moverse y se oye una especie de sonido áspero, pero "
"ya no se puede entender lo que dice. Miras los monitores y ves que sus "
"constantes vitales están cayendo. Parece que se le ha acabado el tiempo."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"He slowly lifts up an arm as if trying to reach out and grasp something. It "
"is extremely thin and pale, almost transparent. His lips move as if trying "
"to say something, but you can't make out a single sound. You see the "
"strength slowly ebb out of him as he collapses one last time and his pulse "
"flat lines."
msgstr ""
"Levanta lentamente un brazo como si tratara de alcanzar algo. Es "
"extremadamente fino y pálido, casi transparente. Sus labios se mueven como "
"si intentara decir algo, pero no se puede distinguir ningún sonido. Ves cómo "
"se le van quitando las fuerzas mientras se desploma por última vez y su "
"pulso se desploma."

#. played backwards so should be down
#. Stop music
msgid ""
"Silence once again envelops the room. You look around and decide to try to "
"access the command console to see if there is any information left. It is a "
"bit unsettling with a corpse nearby, but you try to focus on getting the "
"grime off the console and interfacing with it. "
msgstr ""
"El silencio vuelve a envolver la sala. Miras a tu alrededor y decides "
"intentar acceder a la consola de mando para ver si queda alguna información. "
"Es un poco inquietante con un cadáver cerca, pero tratas de concentrarte en "
"quitar la mugre de la consola e interactuar con ella. "

msgid ""
"You notice that everything seems to be heavily encrypted, much more so than "
"the standard on even military Za'lek vessels, and try to break into the "
"system. After a few unsuccessful attempts you manage to find what looks like "
"a flaw in the cryptographic armour and try to access it."
msgstr ""
"Te das cuenta de que todo parece estar fuertemente encriptado, mucho más de "
"lo habitual incluso en las naves militares Za'lek, e intentas entrar en el "
"sistema. Tras varios intentos infructuosos, consigues encontrar lo que "
"parece un fallo en el blindaje criptográfico e intentas acceder a él."

msgid ""
"Suddenly a bright message starts flashing on all the monitors:\n"
"#rHONEYPOT ##329 ACTIVATED\n"
"SELF-DESTRUCT SEQUENCE ENGAGED\n"
"30 SECONDS REMAINING#0"
msgstr ""
"De repente, un mensaje brillante comienza a parpadear en todos los "
"monitores:\n"
"#rHONEYPOT ##329 ACTIVADO\n"
"SECUENCIA DE AUTODESTRUCCIÓN ACTIVADA\n"
"30 SEGUNDOS RESTANTES#0"

msgid ""
"Cursing to yourself, you realize you don't have enough time to override the "
"console and you make a dash for your ship. As the airlock closes behind you "
"you can hear explosions starting to rip Dr. Strangelove's ship apart."
msgstr ""
"Maldiciendo para ti mismo, te das cuenta de que no tienes tiempo suficiente "
"para anular la consola y corres hacia tu nave. Cuando la esclusa se cierra "
"tras de ti, oyes las explosiones que empiezan a destrozar la nave del Dr. "
"Strangelove."

#. Player insists and goes to kex arc
msgid ""
"He suddenly seems to regain a bit of lucidity.\n"
"\"Kex? Kex… where have I heard that name before… Wait… You mean Experiment "
"#085? The one taken from the nebula wreck?\""
msgstr ""
"De repente parece recuperar un poco de lucidez.\n"
"\"¿Kex? Kex... dónde he oído ese nombre antes... Espera... ¿Te refieres al "
"Experimento #085? ¿El que se sacó del naufragio de la nebulosa?\""

msgid ""
"\"Someone also came asking about that awhile back, but my memory is all "
"fuzzy. I don't recall much of the encounter. Must have not been interesting "
"anyway. Most non-research talk is boring.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Alguien también vino a preguntar por eso hace tiempo, pero mi memoria es "
"borrosa. No recuerdo mucho del encuentro. De todos modos, no debe haber sido "
"interesante. La mayoría de las conversaciones no relacionadas con la "
"investigación son aburridas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, the subject of that experiment is long gone. It was a failure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, el sujeto de ese experimento hace tiempo que se fue. Fue "
"un fracaso.\""

msgid "\"Failure?\""
msgstr "\"¿Fracaso?\""

msgid "Ask why he did it."
msgstr "Pregúnta por qué lo hizo."

msgid "\"Kex sends you his regards.\" (draw weapon)"
msgstr "\"Kex te envía saludos.\" (desenfundas el arma)"

msgid ""
"\"Why would I not go on with that perfect experiment? The subjects found in "
"the wreck were already long dead by the modern definition of the world. You "
"don't need any ethics committee approval for experimenting on cadavers, not "
"that I am subject to that oversight anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por qué no iba a seguir con ese experimento perfecto? Los sujetos "
"encontrados en el naufragio ya estaban muertos desde hace tiempo según la "
"definición moderna del mundo. No se necesita la aprobación de ningún comité "
"de ética para experimentar con cadáveres, aunque ya no estoy sujeto a esa "
"supervisión.\""

msgid ""
"\"Having spent so long in that wreck, whey were the perfect candidates for "
"testing. Had I not performed it, it would have been a crime against science! "
"It was my moral obligation to do it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al haber pasado tanto tiempo en ese naufragio, era el candidato perfecto "
"para las pruebas. Si no la hubiera realizado, ¡habría sido un crimen contra "
"la ciencia! ¡Era mi obligación moral hacerlo!\""

msgid ""
"\"Yes, it was a failure. It never became a vessel to the void. It was just a "
"husk of what it should have been. So much potential, all wasted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, fue un fracaso. Nunca se convirtió en un recipiente para el vacío. Fue "
"sólo una cáscara de lo que debería haber sido. Tanto potencial, todo "
"desperdiciadoe\""

msgid ""
"\"Even though the vitals and neural responses seemed nominal, it didn't "
"really seem to display any standard conscious responses. It even failed the "
"LEVEL II test, a sign of a weak mind. An utter failure.\"\n"
"He coughs violently again, spasms overtaking his body. The medical robot "
"seems to inject him with something and he calms down again."
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque los signos vitales y las respuestas neuronales parecían nominales, "
"no parecía mostrar ninguna respuesta consciente estándar. Incluso falló la "
"prueba de NIVEL II, un signo de una mente débil. Un fracaso total\".\n"
"Vuelve a toser violentamente, los espasmos se apoderan de su cuerpo. El "
"robot médico parece inyectarle algo y se calma de nuevo."

msgid "\"Kex sends you his regards\" (draw weapon)\""
msgstr "\"Kex te envía saludos\" (sacas el arma)\""

msgid "Unplug his life support."
msgstr "Desconecta su soporte vital."

msgid "Comfort him."
msgstr "Confórtarlo."

msgid ""
"You unplug his life support and see the little colour left in his face fade "
"away. His lips begin moving and you can hear some sort of rasping sound "
"coming out, however, you can no longer make out what he is saying."
msgstr ""
"Desconectas su soporte vital y ves que el poco color que queda en su rostro "
"se desvanece. Sus labios comienzan a moverse y puedes oír una especie de "
"sonido rasposo, pero ya no puedes entender lo que está diciendo."

msgid ""
"Seeing him in his last stages brings out your compassion. Whether Dr. "
"Strangelove is a monster or not is not something that you are meant to "
"judge. You get close to him and hold his hand. It feels very cold to the "
"touch."
msgstr ""
"Verlo en su última etapa hace que surja tu compasión. Si el Dr. Strangelove "
"es un monstruo o no, no es algo que debas juzgar. Te acercas a él y le coges "
"la mano. La sientes muy fría al tacto."

msgid ""
"\"I can feel it… getting close…\"\n"
"He seems to be looking at something in the distance."
msgstr ""
"\"Puedo sentirlo... acercándose...\"\n"
"Parece estar mirando algo en la distancia."

msgid ""
"Suddenly, he opens his eyes wide, but his expression is less of terror and "
"more of curiosity and awe.\n"
"\"It's more beautiful… than I… thought.\""
msgstr ""
"De repente, abre mucho los ojos, pero su expresión es menos de terror y más "
"de curiosidad y asombro.\n"
"\"Es más hermoso... de lo que... pensaba.\""

msgid ""
"You look into his nearly opaque eyes and, for a second, you think you can "
"see the nebula in all its fury and glory reflected in them. You look around "
"the room but nothing has changed."
msgstr ""
"Miras sus ojos casi opacos y, por un segundo, crees ver la nebulosa en toda "
"su furia y gloria reflejada en ellos. Miras alrededor de la habitación pero "
"nada ha cambiado."

msgid ""
"You draw your weapon and press it against Dr. Strangelove's forehead. He "
"doesn't seem to flinch when the cold barrel makes contact with his skin. In "
"fact, he seems very oblivious to everything around him."
msgstr ""
"Desenfundas tu arma y la presionas contra la frente del Dr. Strangelove. No "
"parece inmutarse cuando el frío cañón hace contacto con su piel. De hecho, "
"parece muy ajeno a todo lo que le rodea."

msgid ""
"You look at yourself and think of what you are about to do. Even if this is "
"what Kex thinks he wants, is there any point in violently ending the life of "
"someone who doesn't look like they will survive the next period? Dr. "
"Strangelove seems unresponsive to your actions."
msgstr ""
"Te miras a ti mismo y piensas en lo que estás a punto de hacer. Incluso si "
"esto es lo que Kex cree que quiere, ¿tiene algún sentido acabar "
"violentamente con la vida de alguien que no parece que vaya a sobrevivir al "
"siguiente periodo? El Dr. Strangelove parece no responder a tus acciones."

msgid "Pull the trigger."
msgstr "Apretar el gatillo."

#. played backwards so should be down
msgid ""
"You pull the trigger and Dr. Strangelove's body goes completely limp and "
"lifeless. The vitals monitor sounds an alarm before becoming silent, "
"confirming his death. You did the task and you can only hope this will bring "
"Kex peace of mind, although you somehow doubt it."
msgstr ""
"Aprietas el gatillo y el cuerpo del Dr. Strangelove queda completamente "
"inerte y sin vida. El monitor de signos vitales emite una alarma antes de "
"silenciarse, confirmando su muerte. Has hecho la tarea y sólo puedes esperar "
"que esto traiga tranquilidad a Kex, aunque de alguna manera lo dudas."

#. Remove station
#. Advance mission
msgid "You shot a dying Dr. Strangelove in cold blood, fulfilling Kex's wish."
msgstr ""
"Disparaste a un moribundo Dr. Strangelove a sangre fría, cumpliendo el deseo "
"de Kex."

msgid ""
"You unplugged the life support system of Dr. Strangelove who quickly passed "
"away."
msgstr ""
"Desenchufaste el sistema de soporte vital del Dr. Strangelove, que falleció "
"rápidamente."

msgid "You comforted a dying Dr. Strangelove before he passed away."
msgstr "Has confortado a un Dr. Strangelove moribundo antes de que falleciera."

msgid "You watched Dr. Strangelove die before your eyes."
msgstr "Has visto morir al Dr. Strangelove ante tus ojos."

#. And that's all folks
msgid ""
"The explosions clear and the system is once again silent except for your "
"heavy breathing from running back to the ship."
msgstr ""
"Las explosiones se disipan y el sistema vuelve a quedar en silencio, salvo "
"por tu pesada respiración al correr de vuelta a la nave."

msgid ""
"As you survey the system again, you notice that you are no longer able to "
"detect Dr. Strangelove's laboratory. Even pointing your sensors to the "
"position where it should be, you are not able to find anything other than "
"inert asteroids. It is possible that the self-destruct sequence didn't "
"affect only the ship…"
msgstr ""
"Cuando vuelves a inspeccionar el sistema, te das cuenta de que ya no eres "
"capaz de detectar el laboratorio del Dr. Strangelove. Incluso apuntando con "
"tus sensores a la posición donde debería estar, no eres capaz de encontrar "
"nada más que asteroides inertes. Es posible que la secuencia de "
"autodestrucción no haya afectado sólo a la nave…"

msgid ""
"As your mind wanders to all you just experienced, you realize that you "
"should get back to Kex to report what happened. Is this what Kex wanted? You "
"feel like not even he will know the answer to that question."
msgstr ""
"Mientras tu mente divaga por todo lo que acabas de vivir, te das cuenta de "
"que debes volver a Kex para informarle de lo sucedido. ¿Es esto lo que Kex "
"quería? Sientes que ni siquiera él sabrá la respuesta a esa pregunta."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Maikki's Father 1">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Minerva Station</spob>
#. <cond>var.peek("minerva_altercation_probability")~=nil</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Minerva</campaign>
#. <requires name="Minerva Altercation 1" />
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. -- Maikki (Maisie McPherson) asks you to find her father, the famous pilot Kex
#. -- McPherson. She heard rumours he was still alive and at Minerva station.
#. --
#. -- 1. Player is sent to Doeston to try to find the whereabouts.
#. -- 2. Guys in the bar talk about how he never came back from the Nebula,
#. -- 3. Player sent to explore Arandon, finds some scavengers, they run away.
#. -- 4. Player goes back to bar, comment how some have been trying to sell some ship scrap, apparently from Zerantix. Player told to follow scavengers.
#. -- 5. Scavengers show up and talk about sensors not working well, talk through broadcast. Player has to follow without getting too close (maybe needs outfits to improve sensor range in nebula?)
#. -- 6. They lead the player to some debris and start looting. Player gets to talk to them and convince to leave, or kill them. Learns that Za'lek have been buying the goods.
#. -- 7. Player finds a picture among the debris.
#. -- 8. Return to Maikki
#. --
#. -- Some dates for lore purposes:
#. --  591ish - maikki is born
#. --  593:3726.4663 - the Incident
#. --  596ish - Kex disappears (maikki is 8ish)
#. --  598ish - Kex is found
#. --  603ish - game start (~15 years after incident, maikki is 18ish)
#. --
#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not accepted yet
#. -1: mission started, have to talk to maikki
#. 0: going to doeston
#. 1: talked to old man, going to arandon
#. 2: saw scavengers, go back to doeston
#. 3: talked to old man again
#. 4: talk to scavengers, going to zerantix
#. 5: looted ship
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "Distraught Young Woman"
msgstr "Mujer Joven Angustiada"

msgid ""
"You see a small young woman sitting by herself. She has a worried expression "
"on her face."
msgstr ""
"Ves a una pequeña mujer joven sentada sola. Tiene una expresión de "
"preocupación en su rostro."

#. Move target back to origin
msgid "Finding Maikki's Father"
msgstr "Encontrar al padre de Maikki"

msgid "Maikki wants you to help her find her father."
msgstr "Maikki quiere que la ayudes a encontrar a su padre."

#. If not accepted, mem.misn_state will still be nil
#. Clear just in case
#. Re-add Maikki if accepted
#. Can't run it in the VN or it causes an error
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="The Search for Cynthia">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <done>The Runaway</done>
#. <chance>31</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <system>Goddard</system>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. This is the second half of "The Runaway"
#. Here, Cynthia's father pays you to track down his daughter.
#. It is alluded to that Cynthia ran away due to her abusive mother.
#. The father has been named after me, Old T. Man.
#. I'm joking about the last line a little. If you want to name him, feel free.
#.
#. [JEB] split mission into stages as follows:
#. 1. Search "targetworlds" for clues. (Unchecked locations are kept in mem.search_pnts.)
#. 2. Follow a clear lead to "catchworld".
#. 3. Return to "homeworld".
#. --
msgid "Old Man"
msgstr "Hombre Viejo"

msgid "You see a nonchalant old man sipping on his drink with a carefree aura."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un anciano despreocupado que sorbe su bebida con un aura despreocupada."

#. Start mission
msgid ""
"You approach a young woman who seems somewhat distraught. It looks like she "
"has something important on her mind."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a una mujer joven que parece algo angustiada. Parece que tiene "
"algo importante en mente."

msgid ""
"\"You wouldn't happen to be from around here? I'm looking for someone. I was "
"told they would be here, but I never expected this place to be so…\"\n"
"She trails off."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por casualidad no serás de por aquí? Estoy buscando a alguien. Me dijeron "
"que estarían aquí, pero nunca esperé que este lugar fuera tan...\"\n"
"Se queda sin palabras."

msgid "\"spacious?\""
msgstr "\"¿espacioso?\""

msgid "\"grubby?\""
msgstr "\"¿mugriento?\""

msgid ""
"She frowns a bit.\n"
"\"…unsubstantial. Furthermore, it is all so tacky! I thought such a famous "
"gambling world would be much more cute!\""
msgstr ""
"Frunce un poco el ceño.\n"
"\"...insustancial. Además, ¡es todo tan hortera! ¡Pensé que un mundo de "
"juego tan famoso sería mucho más bonito!\""

msgid ""
"She suddenly remembers why she came here and your eyes light up.\n"
"\"You wouldn't happen to be familiar with the station? I'm looking for "
"someone.\""
msgstr ""
"De repente recuerda por qué ha venido aquí y sus ojos se iluminan.\n"
"\"¿Por casualidad no conoces la estación? Estoy buscando a alguien.\""

msgid "Offer to help her"
msgstr "Ofrécete a ayudarla"

msgid "Decline to help"
msgstr "Negarte a ayudar"

msgid ""
"You feel it is best to leave her alone for now and disappear into the crowds "
"leaving her once again alone to her worries."
msgstr ""
"Crees que lo mejor es dejarla sola por ahora y desaparecer entre la multitud "
"dejándola una vez más sola con sus preocupaciones."

msgid "You have agreed to help Maikki find her father (Kex)."
msgstr "Has aceptado ayudar a Maikki a encontrar a su padre (Kex)."

msgid ""
"\"I was told he would be here, but I've been here for ages and haven't "
"gotten anywhere.\"\n"
"She gives out a heavy sigh."
msgstr ""
"\"Me dijeron que estaría aquí, pero llevo años aquí y no he llegado a "
"nada\".\n"
"Da un fuerte suspiro."

msgid "\"My name is Maisie, but you can call me Maikki.\""
msgstr "\"Me llamo Maisie, pero puedes llamarme Maikki.\""

msgid "Offer her a drink ({tokens})"
msgstr "Ofrecerle una bebida ({tokens})"

msgid "Ask her who she is looking for"
msgstr "Pregúntale a quién está buscando"

msgid ""
"You offer her a drink. After staring intently at the drink menu, she orders "
"a strawberry cheesecake caramel parfait with extra berries. Wait, was that "
"even on the menu?"
msgstr ""
"Le ofreces una bebida. Después de mirar atentamente la carta de bebidas, "
"pide un parfait de tarta de queso y fresas con extra de bayas. Espera, "
"¿estaba eso en el menú?"

msgid ""
"\"Thank you! At least the food isn't bad here!\"\n"
"She starts eating the parfait, which seems to be larger than her head."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias! Al menos la comida no es mala aquí\".\n"
"Comienza a comer el parfait, que parece ser más grande que su cabeza."

msgid "You do not have enough Minerva Tokens to buy her a drink."
msgstr "No tienes suficientes Fichas Minerva para comprarle una bebida."

msgid ""
"\"The truth is I am looking for my father. He disappeared when I was a "
"little girl and I don't even remember a single memory of him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La verdad es que estoy buscando a mi padre. Desapareció cuando yo era una "
"niña y no recuerdo nada de él.\""

msgid "You approach Maikki who seems to be enjoying a parfait."
msgstr "Te acercas a Maikki que parece estar disfrutando de un parfait."

msgid "Show her the picture"
msgstr "Muéstrale la foto"

msgid ""
"\"I don't remember him at all. He disappeared when I was only 5 cycles old. "
"Before my mother died, she told me he was a famous space pilot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No lo recuerdo en absoluto. Desapareció cuando yo tenía sólo 5 ciclos. "
"Antes de que mi madre muriera, me dijo que era un famoso piloto espacial.\""

msgid ""
"\"She used to tell me stories about how he would go on all sorts of brave "
"adventures in the nebula to recover artefacts of human history.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Solía contarme historias sobre cómo se embarcaba en todo tipo de valientes "
"aventuras en la nebulosa para recuperar artefactos de la historia humana.\""

msgid "\"He was a scavenger?\""
msgstr "\"¿Era un carroñero?\""

msgid "\"He was a scholar?\""
msgstr "\"¿Era un erudito?\""

msgid ""
"\"I like to think that he was a scholar, but most people would call him a "
"scavenger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gusta pensar que era un erudito, pero la mayoría de la gente lo "
"llamaría un carroñero.\""

msgid ""
"\"My mother died without telling me, but, after her death, while going "
"through her stuff, I found out that my father was the famous Kex McPherson!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi madre murió sin decírmelo, pero, después de su muerte, al revisar sus "
"cosas, ¡descubrí que mi padre era el famoso Kex McPherson!\""

msgid ""
"\"Apparently, one day he went into the nebula with his business partner "
"Mireia and they were never seen again. All attempts to find them failed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al parecer, un día se adentró en la nebulosa con su socia Mireia y no se "
"les volvió a ver. Todos los intentos de encontrarlos fracasaron.\""

msgid ""
"\"Most people believe they are dead, but I think he was kidnapped and is "
"being held here. Maybe he hit his head and even forgot who he was!\""
msgstr ""
"\"La mayoría de la gente cree que están muertos, pero yo creo que fue "
"secuestrado y está retenido aquí. ¡Quizá se golpeó la cabeza y hasta olvidó "
"quién era!\""

msgid ""
"\"I don't have a spaceship, but while I look around here, could you try to "
"look for hints around where he went missing? I heard he was very fond of the "
"Cerberus Outpost bar in Doeston. Maybe there is a hint there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No tengo una nave espacial, pero mientras miro por aquí, ¿podrías intentar "
"buscar pistas alrededor de donde desapareció? He oído que le gustaba mucho "
"el bar del Puesto de Avanzada Cerbero en Doeston. Tal vez haya una pista "
"allí.\""

msgid "Look around {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Mira alrededor de {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

msgid "You were told her father could be near Doeston."
msgstr "Te dijeron que su padre podría estar cerca de Doeston."

msgid "You show her the picture you found in Zerantix of her and her parents."
msgstr "Le enseñas la foto que encontraste en Zerantix de ella y sus padres."

#. TODO show picture
msgid "As she stares deeply at the picture, her eyes tear up."
msgstr "Mientras mira fijamente la imagen, sus ojos se llenan de lágrimas."

msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, I shouldn't be crying. I hardly even know the man. It's just "
"seeing us together just brings back some memories which I had thought I had "
"forgotten.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo siento, no debería estar llorando. Apenas conozco al hombre. Es que "
"vernos juntos me trae algunos recuerdos que creía haber olvidado.\""

msgid ""
"\"He looks so goofy in this picture, and my mother looks so happy… This is "
"what should have been my childhood…\"\n"
"She reminisces."
msgstr ""
"\"Parece tan bobo en esta foto, y mi madre parece tan feliz... Esto es lo "
"que debería haber sido mi infancia...\"\n"
"Rememora."

#. TODO flashback with her family
msgid ""
"You give a few moments to recover before explaining to her what you saw in "
"the wreck and your encounter with the scavengers."
msgstr ""
"Le das unos momentos para recuperarse antes de explicarle lo que viste en el "
"naufragio y tu encuentro con los carroñeros."

msgid ""
"She dries her eyes with a handkerchief trying unsuccessfully not to smear "
"her makeup.\n"
"\"From what you tell me, it seems like it wasn't an accident…\"\n"
"She looks up expectantly."
msgstr ""
"Se seca los ojos con un pañuelo tratando infructuosamente de no manchar su "
"maquillaje.\n"
"\"Por lo que me cuentas, parece que no fue un accidente...\"\n"
"Levanta la mirada expectante."

msgid ""
"\"If you didn't find a body I'm sure he survived! He wouldn't be someone who "
"dies that easily!\"\n"
"She looks clearly excited at the possibility."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Si no encontraron un cuerpo estoy seguro de que sobrevivió! ¡No sería "
"alguien que muere tan fácilmente!\"\n"
"Parece claramente emocionada ante la posibilidad."

msgid ""
"She furrows her brows.\n"
"\"The scavengers were selling to the Za'lek right? What could the Za'lek "
"have to do with my father? I always thought those creeps couldn't be up to "
"anything good.\""
msgstr ""
"Frunce las cejas.\n"
"\"Los carroñeros estaban vendiendo a los Za'lek, ¿verdad? ¿Qué podrían tener "
"que ver los Za'lek con mi padre? Siempre pensé que esos asquerosos no podían "
"estar tramando nada bueno.\""

msgid ""
"Her face glows.\n"
"\"I think I have an idea for our next steps. Meet me up here in a bit. I "
"have to get some information first.\""
msgstr ""
"Su cara brilla.\n"
"\"Creo que tengo una idea para nuestros próximos pasos. Reúnete conmigo aquí "
"dentro de un rato. Tengo que conseguir algo de información en primer lugar.\""

#. no reward, yet...
msgid ""
"You gave Maikki the information you found in the nebula about her father."
msgstr ""
"Le diste a Maikki la información que encontraste en la nebulosa sobre su "
"padre."

msgid "\"Is there anything you would like to know about?\""
msgstr "\"¿Hay algo que quieras saber?\""

msgid "You take your leave to continue the search for her father."
msgstr "Te despides para continuar la búsqueda de su padre."

msgid ""
"You see an old man casually drinking at the bar. He has a sort of distant, "
"bored look on his face."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un anciano bebiendo despreocupadamente en el bar. Tiene una especie de "
"mirada distante y aburrida."

msgid "Ask about Kex McPherson"
msgstr "Preguntar por Kex McPherson"

msgid "Ask about Doeston"
msgstr "Preguntar por Doeston"

msgid "Ask about the Nebula"
msgstr "Preguntar por la Nebulosa"

msgid "Ask about scavengers you saw"
msgstr "Preguntar por los carroñeros que vistes"

msgid "Ask about {sys}"
msgstr "Preguntar por {sys}"

msgid "Show him the picture"
msgstr "Muéstrale la imagen"

msgid ""
"\"Kex? Now that is not a name I've heard in a while.\"\n"
"He nods reflectively."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Kex? Ese no es un nombre que haya escuchado en mucho tiempo.\"\n"
"Asiente reflexivamente."

msgid ""
"\"Kex was a great guy. He used to hang out here before venturing into the "
"nebula, spending his time with the useless lot of us. Shame that he went "
"missing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Kex era un gran tipo. Solía pasar el rato aquí antes de aventurarse en la "
"nebulosa, pasando su tiempo con los inútiles de nosotros. Es una pena que "
"haya desaparecido.\""

msgid ""
"\"Since they never found his ship, I like to think that he made it to the "
"other side of the nebula, if there is one.\"\n"
"He takes a long swig from his drink."
msgstr ""
"\"Como nunca encontraron su nave, me gusta pensar que llegó al otro lado de "
"la nebulosa, si es que existe\".\n"
"Da un largo trago a su bebida."

msgid ""
"\"Still that doesn't stop the odd folk here and there from trying to find "
"it, they usually don't end up much past Arandon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aun así, eso no impide que alguna gente de aquí y de allá intente "
"encontrarlo, normalmente no acaban mucho más allá de Arandon.\""

msgid ""
"\"Not much to do in Doeston. Mainly a stopping place for all them crazy folk "
"heading into the nebula. Maybe if I were younger I would be with them "
"exploring, but can't with this bad knee.\"\n"
"He pats his left knee."
msgstr ""
"\"No hay mucho que hacer en Doeston. Principalmente un lugar de parada para "
"todos los locos que se dirigen a la nebulosa. Quizá si fuera más joven "
"estaría con ellos explorando, pero no puedo con esta rodilla maltrecha\".\n"
"Se palpa la rodilla izquierda."

msgid ""
"\"It used to be a more popular place, but with most of the easy pickings "
"getting scavenged out of the nebula, not many people come here any more. "
"Especially not after the disappearance of famous scavengers like Kex and "
"Mireia.\"\n"
"He muses thoughtfully."
msgstr ""
"\"Solía ser un lugar más popular, pero con la mayor parte de las presas "
"fáciles sacadas de la nebulosa, ya no viene mucha gente. Sobre todo después "
"de la desaparición de famosos carroñeros como Kex y Mireia.\"\n"
"Se queda pensativo."

msgid ""
"\"To better times.\"\n"
"He downs his drink and orders another."
msgstr ""
"\"Por tiempos mejores.\"\n"
"Se toma su bebida y pide otra."

msgid ""
"He whistles casually.\n"
"\"The nebula's a real piece of work. It's almost mesmerizing to fly through "
"it, however, it do got quite a character. If you try to go too deep into 'er "
"you can't easily get back. Many a soul has been lost in there.\""
msgstr ""
"Silba despreocupadamente.\n"
"\"La nebulosa es una verdadera obra. Es casi hipnotizante volar a través de "
"ella, sin embargo, tiene bastante carácter. Si intentas adentrarte demasiado "
"en ella, no puedes volver fácilmente. Muchas almas se han perdido ahí.\""

msgid ""
"He goes a bit quieter and leans towards you.\n"
"\"Rumour has it that there are ghosts lurking in the depths. I've seen "
"people come back, pale as snow, claiming they seen them.\""
msgstr ""
"Se queda un poco más tranquilo y se inclina hacia ti.\n"
"\"Se rumorea que hay fantasmas acechando en las profundidades. He visto a "
"gente volver, pálida como la nieve, diciendo que los han visto.\""

msgid ""
"\"I believe it be the boredom getting to their heads. Likely naught but "
"another scavenger or some debris.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Creo que el aburrimiento se les ha subido a la cabeza. Probablemente no "
"sea más que otro carroñero o algún resto.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's not uncommon to see scavengers around here. Although there are "
"nowhere near as many as there were in Kex's time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No es raro ver carroñeros por aquí. Aunque no hay ni de lejos tantos como "
"en la época de Kex.\""

msgid ""
"He takes a long sip, gets close and whispers.\n"
"\"You wouldn't suppose they found something interesting?\""
msgstr ""
"Toma un largo sorbo, se acerca y susurra.\n"
"\"¿No crees que han encontrado algo interesante?\""

msgid ""
"\"Suppose not. However, you could ask them over there. Those two look like "
"they could be scavengers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que no. Sin embargo, podrías preguntar a esos de ahí. Esos dos "
"parecen que podrían ser carroñeros.\""

msgid "He points to a table with two fairly drunk people."
msgstr "Señala una mesa con dos personas bastante borrachas."

msgid ""
"\"{stealthsys}? That should be just past {cutscenesys}. Do you think the "
"scavengers could have found something there?\""
msgstr ""
"¿{Stealthsys}? Eso debería estar justo después de {cutscenesys}. ¿Crees que "
"los carroñeros podrían haber encontrado algo allí?\""

msgid ""
"\"If you plan to go, you should bring your best sensors. It's very hard to "
"see anything due to the density of the nebula there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si planeas ir, deberías llevar tus mejores sensores. Es muy difícil ver "
"algo debido a la densidad de la nebulosa allí.\""

msgid ""
"\"Wow! Where did you find that picture of Kex? He looks younger than I "
"remember him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Vaya! ¿Dónde has encontrado esa foto de Kex? ¡Parece más joven de lo que "
"recuerdo!\""

msgid ""
"He gives you a bored look as he takes a sip from his drink.\n"
"\"Is there anything else you would like to know about?\""
msgstr ""
"Te mira con aburrimiento mientras da un sorbo a su bebida.\n"
"\"¿Hay algo más que quieras saber?\""

msgid ""
"You see some scavengers at the bar. They are clearly plastered. They don't "
"really seem to be aware of your presence."
msgstr ""
"Ves a algunos carroñeros en el bar. Están claramente borrachos. No parecen "
"darse cuenta de tu presencia."

#. Already got mission, just give player a refresher
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you drinking too much? Don't forget to fix my sensors before we "
"leave to Zerantix tomorrow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿No estás bebiendo demasiado? No te olvides de arreglar mis sensores antes "
"de irnos a Zerantix mañana.\""

msgid ""
"\"Meee? Drinkinging tooo mich? Thatss sshtoopid.\"\n"
"He takes another long swig of his drink and burps."
msgstr ""

#. Blabber target to player
msgid ""
"\"…and then I said to him 'while that may look like a hamster, it's got a "
"bite like a moose!'\""
msgstr ""
"\"...y entonces le dije '¡aunque parezca un hámster, tiene una mordida de "
"alce!'\""

msgid "The scavengers hoot with laughter."
msgstr "Los carroñeros se ríen a carcajadas."

msgid "\"That's a great story. Them space hamsters be wicked.\""
msgstr "\"Eso es una gran historia. Esos hámsters espaciales son malvados.\""

msgid ""
"\"About tomorrow, you sure the info is correct? Going that deep into the "
"nebula always gives me the chills.\"\n"
"He shivers exaggeratedly."
msgstr ""
"\"Sobre mañana, ¿estás seguro de que la información es correcta? Ir tan "
"profundo en la nebulosa siempre me da escalofríos.\"\n"
"Se estremece exageradamente."

msgid ""
"\"Yeah! I saw it with my own eyes. That shit is legit. Seems to be the wreck "
"of a scavenger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Sí! Lo vi con mis propios ojos. Esa mierda es legítima. Parecen ser los "
"restos de un carroñero.\""

msgid ""
"\"Why didn't you haul it back then? We might not be able to find it again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por qué no lo arrastraste entonces? ¡Puede que no lo encontremos de nuevo!"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"How many times do I have to tell you? My sensors were acting up, didn't "
"want to spend too long in Zerantix with all them ghosts around.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cuántas veces tengo que decírtelo? Mis sensores estaban actuando, no "
"quería pasar mucho tiempo en Zerantix con todos esos fantasmas alrededore\""

msgid ""
"\"I'll take a look at fixing your sensors. Ain't nothing these brutes can't "
"fix!\"\n"
"He pats his biceps in a fairly uninspiring way."
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a echar un vistazo a la fijación de tus sensores. ¡No hay nada que "
"estos brutos no puedan arreglar!\"\n"
"Se da unas palmaditas en el bíceps de una manera bastante poco inspiradora."

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, let's do that after one more round of drinks. Got to get there "
"before other scroungers do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, hagamos eso después de una ronda más de bebidas. Tenemos que llegar "
"antes de que lo hagan otros gorrones.\""

msgid "\"To our future success in Zerantix!\""
msgstr "\"¡Por nuestro futuro éxito en Zerantix!\""

msgid ""
"They cheer, down their drinks, and order another round. Perhaps the wreck in "
"Zerantix is related to Kex somehow."
msgstr ""
"Aplauden, bajan sus bebidas y piden otra ronda. Tal vez el naufragio en "
"Zerantix esté relacionado con Kex de alguna forma."

msgid "Follow the scavengers in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Sigue a los carroñeros en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "You overheard some scavengers talking about a wreck in Zerantix."
msgstr "Escuchaste a unos carroñeros hablando de un naufragio en Zerantix."

msgid "You take your leave without them noticing you."
msgstr "Te despides sin que se den cuenta."

#. Set up system
#. Cutscene with scavengerB
#. Scavenger is flying to doeston from arandon (near the middle)
#. cutscene
#. annoying to handle the case the player kills them
#. Timer in case the player doesn't find them in a long while
#. 2 minutes
#. Set up system
#. Have to follow scavengers
#. 7200 dist or 36s
#. 6400 dist or 32s
#. 5800 dist or 29s
msgid "Scavenger"
msgstr "Carroñero"

msgid "Scavenger Vendetta"
msgstr "Vendetta Carroñera"

#. Lower their detection
msgid "Sensors damaged. Requesting assistance."
msgstr "Sensores dañados. Solicitando asistencia."

msgid "S.O.S. Scavenger here, sensors damaged."
msgstr "S.O.S. Carroñero aquí, sensores dañados."

msgid "Is anybody out there? Sensors damaged, requesting assistance."
msgstr "¿Hay alguien ahí fuera? Sensores dañados, solicitando ayuda."

msgid "Mayday! Requesting assistance. Wait, what was that?"
msgstr "¡Auxilio! Solicitando ayuda. Espera, ¿qué fue eso?"

#. Get rid of the timeout hook
msgid ""
"Your ship has detected a curious signal originating from inside the system."
msgstr ""
"Su nave ha detectado una curiosa señal procedente del interior del sistema."

msgid "Curious Signal"
msgstr "Señal Curiosa"

msgid ""
"The comm flickers as a scavenger appears into view. He looks a bit pale."
msgstr ""
"El comunicador parpadea mientras un carroñero aparece a la vista. Parece un "
"poco pálido."

msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I thought I was a goner. My sensors failed me at the worst time "
"and it's impossible to see shit in this nebula.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias. Pensé que estaba perdido. Mis sensores me fallaron en el peor "
"momento y es imposible ver una mierda en esta nebulosa.\""

msgid ""
"\"Could you tell me the way to {sys}? I have to get out of here as soon as "
"possible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Podría decirme el camino a {sys}? Tengo que salir de aquí lo antes "
"posible.\""

msgid "Give him directions"
msgstr "Darle indicaciones"

msgid "You close the comm and leave the scavenger to his fate."
msgstr "Cierras la comunicación y dejas al carroñero a su suerte."

msgid "\"Thanks! I can't wait to get out of this hellhole.\""
msgstr "\"¡Gracias! No puedo esperar a salir de este infierno\""

msgid ""
"\"Don't tell me you've also come here to scavenge? I'm telling you, this "
"place is haunted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿No me digas que también has venido aquí a escarbar? Te digo que este "
"lugar está embrujado.\""

msgid ""
"\"I was told this would be easy money on the blackmarket, but this wasn't "
"what I expected at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me dijeron que sería dinero fácil en el mercado negro, pero esto no era lo "
"que esperaba en absoluto.\""

msgid "\"Anyway, good luck scavenging.\""
msgstr "\"De todos modos, buena suerte en la búsqueda de tesoros.\""

msgid "The scavenger disappears from view."
msgstr "El carroñero desaparece de la vista."

#. Close comm immediately
#. Was player an asshole?
msgid "Asshole!"
msgstr "¡Imbécil!"

#. reset timer
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "¡Gracias!"

#. reset timer
msgid "You helped a scavenger in Arandon."
msgstr "Ayudaste a un carroñero en Arandon."

#. Start the cinematics
msgid "Damnit! I thought I told you to fix the sensors."
msgstr "¡Maldita sea! Pensé que te había dicho que arreglaras los sensores."

msgid ""
"Hey! I fixed them, it's this damn nebula that must have broken them again."
msgstr ""
"¡Oye! Los arreglé, es esta maldita nebulosa la que debe haberlos roto de "
"nuevo."

msgid ""
"Damnit. I really dislike broadcasting, but my encryption also seems damaged "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Maldita sea. Realmente me disgusta la emisión, pero mi encriptación también "
"parece dañada ahora."

msgid "Don't worry, it's not like there's anybody else here."
msgstr "No te preocupes, no hay nadie más aquí."

msgid "Let's just get this over with."
msgstr "Acabemos con esto."

#. Back to player
msgid "This place always gives me the creeps."
msgstr "Este lugar siempre me da escalofríos."

msgid "C'mon, the guy said that this was a great wreck."
msgstr "Vamos, el tipo dijo que era un gran naufragio."

msgid "You know the Za'lek pay premium for this sort of shit, right?"
msgstr "Sabes que los Za'lek pagan una prima por este tipo de cosas, ¿verdad?"

msgid "Yeah, yeah…  just hope we don't see any ghosts."
msgstr "Sí, sí... sólo espero que no veamos ningún fantasma."

msgid "You don't really believe in them do you?"
msgstr "No crees realmente en ellos, ¿verdad?"

msgid "Dude, there's really freaky shit out there."
msgstr "Tío, hay cosas muy raras por ahí."

msgid "Yeah, but most of that freaky shit are Soromid bioengineered crap."
msgstr ""
"Sí, pero la mayoría de esas cosas raras es la basura de bioingeniería "
"Soromida."

msgid "Ugh, Soromids give me the creeps."
msgstr "Uf, los Sorómidas me dan escalofríos."

msgid ""
"I'd take them over Za'leks any day. I have no idea what Za'leks are thinking."
msgstr ""
"Los prefiero a los Za'leks cualquier día. No tengo ni idea de lo que los "
"Za'leks están pensando."

#. 37 seconds
msgid "Hey, did you see something?"
msgstr "Oye, ¿has visto algo?"

msgid ""
"How the hell am I supposed to see anything with my sensors broken, dipshit?"
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo diablos se supone que voy a ver algo con mis sensores rotos, imbécil?"

msgid "I already said I was sorry!"
msgstr "¡Ya dije que lo sentía!"

msgid "This is coming out of your cut."
msgstr "Esto sale de tu parte."

#. 53 seconds
msgid "C'mon!"
msgstr "¡Venga!"

#. Cut off point here, restarts at heading to waypoint[4]
msgid "We should be there soon."
msgstr "Deberíamos llegar pronto."

msgid "I swear I'll never come to the nebula again after this…"
msgstr "Juro que nunca más vendré a la nebulosa después de esto…"

msgid "That's what you said last time too!"
msgstr "¡Eso es lo que dijiste la última vez también!"

#. Player beat the guys to it
msgid "You are about to be discovered!"
msgstr "¡Estás a punto de ser descubierto!"

msgid "Run!"
msgstr "¡Corre!"

msgid "There's definitely something there! Scram!"
msgstr "¡Definitivamente hay algo ahí! ¡Largo!"

msgid "You have been detected! Stealth failed!"
msgstr "¡Has sido detectado! ¡El Sigilo ha fallado!"

msgid "You are about to lose track of the scavengers!!"
msgstr "¡¡Estas a punto de perder la pista de los carroñeros!!"

msgid "You lost track of the scavengers! Stealth failed!"
msgstr "¡Has perdido el rastro de los carroñeros! ¡Sigilo falló!"

#. Starting out
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "Continuemos."

#. Check if made it to next target
#. Finished current target, go to next
#. Made it to target
#. pscavA is following pscavB
msgid "Did you see something?"
msgstr "¿Viste algo?"

#. Should trigger another catch
msgid "It's your imagination. Let's get this over with."
msgstr "Es tu imaginación. Terminemos con esto."

#. Spawn the wreck
msgid "Ship Wreck"
msgstr "Naufragio de Nave"

#. Else, still travelling to target
msgid "Looks like we made it!"
msgstr "¡Parece que lo hemos conseguido!"

msgid "We came all the way for this wreck? It better be worth it…"
msgstr ""
"¿Hemos hecho todo el camino para este naufragio? Más vale que valga la pena…"

msgid "They said it was whatshisname… Xex? Vex? Some famous guy's wreck."
msgstr ""
"Dijeron que era como se llamaba... ¿Xex? ¿Vex? La ruina de algún famoso."

msgid "Wait, someone is there!"
msgstr "Espera, ¡hay alguien ahí!"

msgid "Two angry scavengers appear on your screen."
msgstr "Dos furiosos carroñeros aparecen en tu pantalla."

msgid "\"You better beat it, punk. We are doing business here.\""
msgstr "\"Será mejor que te vayas, gamberro. Estamos haciendo negocios aquí.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, the Za'lek wouldn't like it if we weren't able to deliver the goods "
"they want.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, a los Za'lek no les gustaría que no fuéramos capaces de entregar la "
"mercancía que quieren.\""

msgid ""
"He scowls at his partner before staring you down again.\n"
"\"This ain't no place for people like you. Get lost or we'll leave you in a "
"worse state than that wreck over there.\"\n"
"He points at the wreck nearby."
msgstr ""
"Frunce el ceño a su compañero antes de volver a mirarte fijamente.\n"
"\"Este no es lugar para gente como tú. Piérdete o te dejaremos en un estado "
"peor que el de esa ruina de allí\".\n"
"Señala los restos que hay cerca."

msgid "\"What is that about the Za'lek?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué es eso de los Za'lek?\""

msgid "Lock your weapon systems on their ships"
msgstr "Fija tus sistemas de armas a sus naves"

msgid ""
"He glares at his partner.\n"
"\"This is why I always tell you to keep your mouth shut!\""
msgstr ""
"Mira fijamente a su compañero.\n"
"\"¡Por eso siempre te digo que mantengas la boca cerrada!\""

msgid ""
"\"Damnit, why can't shit go right for a change?\"\n"
"He seems to be clutching his head. A headache perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, ¿por qué la mierda no puede ir bien para variar?\"\n"
"Parece que se agarra la cabeza. ¿Un dolor de cabeza quizás?"

msgid "\"Look I just want to talk\""
msgstr "\"Mira, sólo quiero hablar\""

msgid "Try to bribe them ({credits})"
msgstr ""

#. TODO possibly add a pacifist option here too
msgid "\"What do you want to talk about asshole? This is our job.\""
msgstr "\"¿De qué quieres hablar, gilipollas? Este es nuestro trabajo.\""

msgid "You found a wreck and bribed scavengers so that they left."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un naufragio y sobornado a los carroñeros para que se vayan."

msgid "You wire them {credits}."
msgstr "Les transfieres {credits}."

msgid ""
"\"I guess this isn't worth our trouble. We already got enough stuff for the "
"Za'leks already.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que este no merece la pena. Ya tenemos suficientes cosas para los "
"Za'leks.\""

msgid ""
"\"C'mon, let's get out of here. This place gives me the creeps. Feel like a "
"ghost is going to pop out any minute.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vamos, salgamos de aquí. Este lugar me da escalofríos. Siento que un "
"fantasma va a salir en cualquier momento.\""

msgid "\"Next round in Doeston is on me.\""
msgstr "\"La próxima ronda en Doeston la pago yo.\""

msgid ""
"The scavengers disappear from your screen as you see their ships start to "
"head back to Arandon."
msgstr ""
"Los carroñeros desaparecen de tu pantalla mientras ves que sus naves "
"comienzan a regresar a Arandon."

#. Fight to the death :D
msgid "You don't have enough money to bribe them and fumble with words."
msgstr "No tienes suficiente dinero para sobornarles y tentarlos con palabras."

msgid "\"He's stalling for time! He must have reinforcements coming!\""
msgstr "\"¡Está ganando tiempo! ¡Debe tener refuerzos en camino!\""

msgid "\"Shit man! I knew we shouldn't have come here.\""
msgstr "\"¡Mierda, hombre! Sabía que no deberíamos haber venido aquí.\""

msgid "\"Shut up and follow my lead!\""
msgstr "\"¡Cállate y sígueme la corriente!\""

msgid "You detect they are powering up their weapon systems."
msgstr "Detectas que están potenciando sus sistemas de armas."

#. TODO add angry messages
msgid "You found a wreck and were attacked by scavengers."
msgstr "Encontraste un naufragio y fuiste atacado por carroñeros."

msgid "Scavenger attacked."
msgstr "Carroñero atacó."

msgid ""
"You can see clear laser burns on the hull of the wreck as you approach the "
"ship and prepare to board. This doesn't look like it was an accident."
msgstr ""
"Se pueden ver claras quemaduras de láser en el casco del naufragio al "
"acercarte a la nave y prepararte para abordar. No parece que haya sido un "
"accidente."

msgid ""
"You board the wreck in your space suit and begin to investigate the insides "
"of the ship."
msgstr ""
"Abordas el naufragio con tu traje espacial y empiezas a investigar el "
"interior de la nave."

#. Give player the illusion of choice
msgid "Investigate the bridge"
msgstr "Investiga el puente"

msgid "Investigate the dormitories"
msgstr "Investiga los dormitorios"

msgid "Investigate the engine room"
msgstr "Investiga la sala de máquinas"

msgid ""
"You make your way to what is left of the bridge. You can see what appears to "
"be very old space-weathered bloodstains over most of the controls. However, "
"there are no bodies to be seen."
msgstr ""
"Te diriges a lo que queda del puente. Puedes ver lo que parecen ser manchas "
"de sangre muy antiguas y desgastadas por el espacio sobre la mayoría de los "
"controles. Sin embargo, no se ve ningún cuerpo."

msgid ""
"The dormitories are the part of the ship that appear to have been kept in "
"best shape, if you don't count all the damage that seems to have been done "
"by scavengers trying to find parts to sell."
msgstr ""
"Los dormitorios son la parte de la nave que parece haberse mantenido en "
"mejor estado, si no se cuentan todos los daños que parecen haber causado los "
"carroñeros que intentaban encontrar piezas para vender."

msgid ""
"Although there seems to be nothing of value left, a small piece of paper "
"catches your eye. You grab what appears to be a picture of two adults and a "
"child. The child looks very familiar."
msgstr ""
"Aunque parece que no queda nada de valor, un pequeño trozo de papel te llama "
"la atención. Coges lo que parece ser una foto de dos adultos y un niño. El "
"niño te resulta muy familiar."

msgid ""
"You turn the picture around and you see that 'Maikki 596:0928' is written in "
"the corner. You should probably bring this back to Maikki."
msgstr ""
"Das la vuelta a la foto y ves que en la esquina está escrito \"Maikki "
"596:0928\". Probablemente deberías devolverle esto a Maikki."

msgid ""
"The engine room seems to be the part that took most of the beating. It seems "
"like most of it was sliced off by some powerful beam weapon. Someone really "
"didn't want this ship getting away."
msgstr ""
"La sala de máquinas parece ser la parte que recibió la mayor parte de la "
"paliza. Parece que la mayor parte fue cortada por algún arma de rayos "
"poderosa. Alguien realmente no quería que esta nave se escapara."

msgid ""
"After your thorough investigation, you leave the wreck behind and get back "
"into your ship."
msgstr ""
"Después de tu minuciosa investigación, dejas atrás el pecio y vuelves a tu "
"nave."

msgid ""
"You boarded the wreck which seems to be Kex's ship. You found a picture of "
"his family and signs that this was not an accident with possible Za'lek "
"involvement."
msgstr ""
"Abordaste los restos de lo que parece ser la nave de Kex. Has encontrado una "
"foto de su familia y señales de que no fue un accidente con una posible "
"implicación de los Za'lek."

msgid "Return to {name} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Volver a {name} en el sistema {sys}"

