msgstr "Prof. Sato"

#. Computer Science / Mathematics
msgid "Prof. Stova"
msgstr "Prof. Stova"

#. Material Science
msgid "Prof. Hsu"
msgstr "Prof. Hsu"

#. Dr. Shrimp
#. Coincides with "Strangelove Lab"
#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not yet accepted
