msgid "Verner"
msgstr "Verner"

msgid ""
"A bored individual that seems to be looking for someone to do a task for him."
msgstr "Un individuo aburrido parece buscar a alguien para cumplir un trabajo."

msgid ""
"\"You look like a pilot in need of a job. I'm looking for someone to take me "
"and {amount} of my equipment to {pnt} in the {sys} system. Do you think you "
"could transport me there? I'll make it worth your time with {creds}. What do "
"you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pareces un piloto que necesita un trabajo. Estoy buscando a alguien que me "
"lleve a mí y {amount} de mi equipo a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. ¿Crees que "
"podrías transportarme hasta allí? Haré que valga la pena tu tiempo con "
"{creds}. ¿Qué dices?\""

msgid "\"That's a shame. I'll be here if you change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"Es una pena. Estaré aquí si cambias de opinión.\""

msgid ""
"\"You only have {freespace} of free space. You need to be able to carry at "
"least {neededspace}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sólo tienes {freespace} de espacio libre. ¡Necesitas poder llevar al menos "
"{neededspace}!\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! My name is Verner. Let me load my equipment on your ship and let's "
"be off!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Me llamo Verner. ¡Deja que cargue mi equipo en tu nave y partamos!"
"\""

msgid "Some fancy equipment. You are not sure what it is for."
msgstr "Algún equipamiento elegante. No estás seguro de para qué sirve."

msgid "Verner's Request"
msgstr "Petición de Verner"

msgid "Verner asked you to take him to {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Verner te pidió que lo llevaras a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

msgid "Take Verner to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Lleva a Verner a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Land hook.
msgid ""
"You land on the barren moon, not really understanding what Verner is going "
"to do here, since there really isn't anything but dust and rocks. You and "
"Verner don space suits and unload the cargo."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en la luna estéril, sin entender realmente qué va a hacer Verner "
"aquí, ya que realmente no hay nada más que polvo y rocas. Verner y tú os "
"ponéis los trajes espaciales y descargáis la carga."

msgid ""
"After getting off the ship he reaches down and swipes his finger across the "
"lunar surface before bringing it up to inspect it.\n"
"\"More silica content than expected. This is perfect!\", he mumbles to "
"himself."
msgstr ""
"Tras bajar de la nave, se agacha y pasa el dedo por la superficie lunar "
"antes de levantarlo para inspeccionarlo.\n"
"\"Más contenido de sílice del que esperaba. Esto es perfecto\", murmura para "
"sí mismo."

msgid ""
"He turns to you and speaks.\n"
"\"Thank you for bringing me here. This is much better than expected. You are "
"probably wondering what I've come to do to such an inhospitable place, but "
"it should be obvious. I'm going to terraform this wonderful place into a "
"paradise!\""
msgstr ""
"Se vuelve hacia ti y habla.\n"
"\"Gracias por traerme aquí. Esto es mucho mejor de lo que esperaba. "
"Probablemente te estés preguntando qué he venido a hacer a un lugar tan "
"inhóspito, pero debería ser obvio. ¡Voy a terraformar este maravilloso lugar "
"en un paraíso!\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm going to be setting up camp, but come back in a bit, and I'll have "
"more work for you. This is going to be very exciting indeed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a montar el campamento, pero vuelve dentro de un rato y tendré más "
"trabajo para ti. ¡Esto va a ser muy emocionante!\""

#. Apply first diff
#. Refuel
msgid ""
"You escorted Verner to {pnt}. He may have more work for you for his "
"terraforming project."
msgstr ""
"Acompañaste a Verner a {pnt}. Puede que tenga más trabajo para ti en su "
"proyecto de terraformación."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Terraforming Antlejos 2">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Land</location>
#. <spob>Antlejos V</spob>
#. <done>Terraforming Antlejos 1</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Terraforming Antlejos</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Campaign to Terraform Antlejos V
#.
#. Verner needs you to bring in heavy machinery from the Dvaered.
#. --
msgid "heavy machinery"
msgstr "maquinaria pesada"

#. Amount in mass
msgid "You land and are immediately greeted by Verner."
msgstr "Aterrizas y te recibe inmediatamente Verner."

msgid ""
"\"The camp has been set up and terraforming is underway! However, it seems "
"like we'll need much heavier machinery to be able to penetrate the thick "
"surface and accelerate the terraforming. I need you to go to {pnt} in the "
"{sys} system to pick up {amount} of {cargo}. I'll pay you {creds} for your "
"troubles. What do you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡El campamento ha sido instalado y la terraformación está en marcha! Sin "
"embargo, parece que necesitaremos maquinaria mucho más pesada para poder "
"penetrar en la gruesa superficie y acelerar la terraformación. Necesito que "
"vayas a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para recoger {amount} de {cargo}. Te "
"pagaré {creds} por tus molestias. ¿Qué dices?\""

msgid ""
"\"OK… I'll keep on terraforming here. Come back if you change your mind "
"about helping.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De acuerdo... seguiré terraformando aquí. Vuelve si cambias de opinión "
"sobre ayudar.\""

msgid "\"Awesome. The {cargo} should be of great help.\""
msgstr "\"Impresionante. La {cargo} debería ser de gran ayuda.\""

#. Not accepted
msgid "Terraforming Antlejos"
msgstr "Terraformando Antlejos"

msgid ""
"Pick up the {cargo} at {pnt} in the {sys} system and deliver it to {retpnt}."
msgstr ""
"Recoge {cargo} en {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y haz la entrega en {retpnt}."

msgid "Terraforming Antlejos V"
msgstr "Terraformando Antlejos V"

msgid "Pick up the {cargo} at {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Recoge {cargo} en {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

msgid "Deliver the cargo to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Entrega la carga en {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Land hook.
msgid "Insufficient Space"
msgstr "Espacio Insuficiente"

msgid ""
"You have insufficient free cargo space for the {cargo}. You only have "
"{freespace} of free space, but you need at least {neededspace}."
msgstr ""
"No tienes suficiente espacio libre para la {cargo}. Sólo tienes {freespace} "
"de espacio libre, pero necesitas al menos {neededspace}."

msgid "Cargo Loaded"
msgstr "Cargamento Cargado"

msgid "The dockworkers load the {amount} of {cargo} onto your ship."
msgstr "Los trabajadores del muelle cargan la {amount} de {cargo} en tu nave."

msgid "Heavy Machinery"
msgstr "Maquinaria Pesada"

msgid ""
"Heavy machinery of Dvaered manufacture. Seems like it could be fairly useful "
"for terraforming."
msgstr ""
"Maquinaria pesada de fabricación Dvaered. Parece que podría ser bastante "
"útil para la terraformación."

msgid ""
"You land and Verner, who now seems to be accompanied by a small team, "
"quickly unloads the {cargo} and starts putting it to use."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y Verner, que ahora parece estar acompañado por un pequeño equipo, "
"descarga rápidamente la {cargo} y comienza a ponerla en funcionamiento."

msgid ""
"\"That was faster than expected.\"\n"
"He slaps the hull of a heavy machine.\n"
"\"With these beauties we'll be able to make progress ten times faster now. "
"That said, it does seem like this might not be enough. Come back to me once "
"I get the {cargo} set up, and I should have another task for you if you are "
"interested.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Eso fue más rápido de lo esperado.\"\n"
"Golpea la nave de una máquina pesada.\n"
"\"Con estas bellezas ahora podremos avanzar diez veces más rápido. Dicho "
"esto, parece que esto podría no ser suficiente. Vuelve a verme cuando tenga "
"la {cargo} preparada y tendré otra tarea para ti si te interesa.\""

#. Apply first diff
msgid ""
"You brought heavy Dvaered machinery to {pnt} to help Verner terraform it."
msgstr ""
"Has traído maquinaria pesada Dvaered a {pnt} para ayudar a Verner a "
"terraformarla."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Terraforming Antlejos 3">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Land</location>
#. <spob>Antlejos V</spob>
#. <done>Terraforming Antlejos 2</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Terraforming Antlejos</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Campaign to Terraform Antlejos V
#.
#. Verner needs you to bring in an atmospheric generator from the Za'lek.
#. --
msgid "atmosphere generator"
msgstr "generador de atmósfera"

#. Amount in mass
msgid "As soon as you land, Verner comes bouncing up to you."
msgstr "En cuanto aterrizas, Verner se acerca rebotando hacia ti."

msgid ""
"\"Everything is going great, thanks to you! However, the debris we are "
"creating is getting very abrasive, and we need to start setting up an "
"atmosphere. I've found a Za'lek factory that seems to provide exactly what "
"we need. Would you go to {pnt} in the {sys} system to pick up an atmosphere "
"generator? It should be {amount}. If you do me this favour I'll pay you "
"{creds}. What do you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Todo va de maravilla, gracias a ti! Sin embargo, los escombros que "
"estamos creando se están volviendo muy abrasivos y tenemos que empezar a "
"crear una atmósfera. He encontrado una fábrica Za'lek que parece "
"proporcionar exactamente lo que necesitamos. ¿Podrías ir a {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys} para recoger un generador de atmósfera? Debería ser {amount}. "
"Si me haces este favor te pagaré {creds}. ¿Qué dices?\""

msgid "\"Perfect! We're starting to make true progress!\""
msgstr "\"¡Perfecto! Estamos empezando a hacer verdaderos progresos!\""

msgid "The automated cargo drones load the {amount} of {cargo} onto your ship."
msgstr ""
"Los drones de carga automatizados cargan la {amount} de {cargo} en tu nave."

msgid "Atmosphere Generator"
msgstr "Generador de Atmósfera"

msgid ""
"A large industrial device of Za'lek origin used for generating atmospheric "
"conditions on barren planets."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As soon as your ship alights, Verner and his gang scramble to carefully "
"unload the {cargo} and start setting it up."
msgstr ""
"En cuanto tu nave aterriza, Verner y su pandilla se apresuran a descargar "
"cuidadosamente la {cargo} y empezar a prepararla."

msgid ""
"\"Wow, great work! You sure are proving to be invaluable to the project. "
"Once we start getting an atmosphere we should almost be there. It seems like "
"my calculations were all spot on!\"\n"
"You can see glee in his eyes.\n"
"\"If you're still interested, I have another important task for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Vaya, un gran trabajo! Estáis demostrando ser muy valioso para el "
"proyecto. Una vez que empecemos a conseguir una atmósfera deberíamos estar "
"casi listos. Parece que mis cálculos han dado en el clavo.\"\n"
"En sus ojos se nota el regocijo.\n"
"\"Si todavía estás interesado, tengo otra tarea importante para ti.\""

#. Apply first diff
msgid ""
"You brought a Za'lek atmosphere generator to {pnt} to help Verner further "
"terraform it."
msgstr ""
"Has traído un generador de atmósfera Za'lek a {pnt} para ayudar a Verner a "
"terraformarla."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Terraforming Antlejos 4">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Land</location>
#. <spob>Antlejos V</spob>
#. <done>Terraforming Antlejos 3</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Terraforming Antlejos</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Campaign to Terraform Antlejos V
#.
#. Verner needs you to bring in morphogenic archaea
#. Introduces the Pilots United Against Atmosphere Anthropocentrism (PUAAA)
#. --
msgid "morphogenic archaea"
msgstr "arqueas morfogénicas"

#. Amount in mass
#. We claim Antlejos V
msgid "Your ship touches ground and Verner comes to greet you."
msgstr "Tu nave toca tierra y Verner viene a recibirte."

msgid ""
"He beams a smile at you.\n"
"\"The atmosphere is starting to take shape. We're almost ready for the next "
"step. We can now try to introduce some sort of stable form of life and "
"bootstrap the final terraforming stages. I've found a supplier of "
"Morphogenic Archaea that should be able to do the job. Would you be able to "
"go to {pnt} in the {sys} system to bring some {amount} of archaea over? "
"You'll get {creds} for your troubles. Are you interested?\""
msgstr ""
"Te dirige una sonrisa.\n"
"\"El ambiente está empezando a tomar forma. Estamos casi listos para el "
"siguiente paso. Ahora podemos intentar introducir algún tipo de forma de "
"vida estable y arrancar las últimas etapas de terraformación. He encontrado "
"un proveedor de Arqueas Morfogénicas que deberían ser capaz de hacer el "
"trabajo. ¿Podrías ir a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para traer alguna {amount} "
"de arqueas? Recibirás {creds} por tus problemas. ¿Estás interesado?\""

msgid "\"Awesome! We're so close!\""
msgstr "\"¡Impresionante! Estamos tan cerca!\""

msgid "Morphogenic Archaea"
msgstr "Arqueas Morfogénicas"

msgid ""
"Containers filled to the brim with organisms that are suitable for creating "
"life from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Contenedores llenos hasta los topes de organismos aptos para crear vida "
"desde cero."

msgid ""
"You land your planet after all the commotion going on outside, and find "
"Verner waiting for you. His gang unloads the {cargo} while he talks to you."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en el planeta después de toda la conmoción que se produce en el "
"exterior, y encuentras a Verner esperándote. Su banda descarga la {cargo} "
"mientras él habla contigo."

msgid ""
"\"I see you met them. They are part of the #oPilots United Against "
"Atmosphere Anthropocentrism#0 or #oPUAAA#0 for short. What they are is a "
"bunch of assholes that reject progress and terraforming barren moons like "
"this one into places suitable for human living.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Veo que los has conocido. Son parte de los #oPilotos Unidos Contra el "
"Antropocentrismo Atmosférico#0 o #oPUCAA#0 para abreviar. Lo que son es una "
"panda de gilipollas que rechazan el progreso y la terraformación de lunas "
"estériles como ésta en lugares aptos para la vida humana.\""

msgid ""
"\"They must have noticed when the paperwork I filed at the Empire for "
"terraforming permission was made public. I thought we would have a lot more "
"time before they started messing things up. Looks like we'll have to be "
"careful from now on as they'll only get more aggressive as they see our "
"wonderful progress.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Debieron darse cuenta cuando se hizo público el papeleo que presenté en el "
"Imperio para obtener el permiso de terraformación. Pensé que tendríamos "
"mucho más tiempo antes de que empezaran a estropear las cosas. Parece que "
"tendremos que tener cuidado a partir de ahora, ya que sólo se volverán más "
"agresivos al ver nuestros maravillosos progresos.\""

msgid ""
"\"The archaea look like they're in tip-top shape. We'll get to spreading "
"them around right away. Things should start looking much better now that "
"life will start to take a hold on this moon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las arqueas parecen estar en plena forma. Nos pondremos a esparcirlas de "
"inmediato. Las cosas deberían comenzar a verse mucho mejor ahora que la vida "
"comenzará a afianzarse en esta luna.\""

msgid ""
"\"We still have a ton of things for you to do. If you are interested, please "
"meet me up here again after I organize things a bit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todavía tenemos un montón de cosas que hacer. Si estas interesado, vuelve "
"a encontrarte conmigo aquí arriba después de que organice un poco las cosas."
"\""

#. Apply first diff
msgid ""
"You delivered some Soromid morphogenic archaea to {pnt} to help Verner "
"further terraform it."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado algunas arqueas morfogénicas Soromida a {pnt} para ayudar a "
"Verner a seguir terraformándola."

#. They will just go to Antlejos V and attack any hostiles on their way, including the player.
#. Get rid of those we can
#, fuzzy
msgid "Protester"
msgstr "Manifestante"

#. See surviving pilots
msgid "Hey! That ship is helping to terraform {pnt}! Get them!"
msgstr "¡Eh! ¡Esa nave está ayudando a terraformar {pnt}! ¡Atrapenla!"

#. Say some protest slogan
#. Protest again
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Terraforming Antlejos 5">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Land</location>
#. <spob>Antlejos V</spob>
#. <done>Terraforming Antlejos 4</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Terraforming Antlejos</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Campaign to Terraform Antlejos V
#.
#. Defend ships bringing volunteers from the PUAAA
#. --
msgid "Verner is waiting for you as your ship touches ground."
msgstr "Verner te está esperando cuando tu nave toca tierra."

msgid ""
"\"It seems like the PUAAA have started to get brave and are going to make "
"things hard for us. I have some supply ships coming in from {sys}, and it "
"looks like they will be facing hostilities before they get here. Would you "
"be willing to guard through {cursys}? I would be able to pay you {creds} for "
"your troubles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que los PUCAA han empezado a armarse de valor y nos van a poner las "
"cosas difíciles. Tengo algunas naves de suministro que vienen de {sys}, y "
"parece que se enfrentarán a hostilidades antes de llegar aquí. ¿Estarías "
"dispuesto a hacer guardia a través de {cursys}? Podría pagarte {creds} por "
"tus problemas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! The supply ships will be jumping in from {jumpsys}. Make sure to "
"guard them and try to ensure they all make it safe and sound here. Best of "
"luck, we are counting on you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Las naves de suministro saltarán desde {jumpsys}. Asegúrate de "
"vigilarlas y de que todas lleguen sanas y salvas hasta aquí. Mucha suerte, "
"¡contamos contigo!\""

msgid "Defend the supply ships coming to {pnt} from the PUAAA."
msgstr "Defienda las naves de suministro que llegan a {pnt} desde la PUCAA."

msgid "Go to the jump point from {sys} and wait for the supply ships"
msgstr "Ve al punto de salto desde {sys} y espera a las naves de suministro"

msgid "Guard the supply ships from the PUAAA"
msgstr "Proteger las naves de suministro de la PUCAA"

#. Land hook.
msgid ""
"\"That was incredible! All the ships made it through in one piece. You're a "
"real lifesaver!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ha sido increíble! Todas las naves han llegado de una pieza. ¡Eres un "
"verdadero salvavidas!\""

msgid ""
"\"Almost all the ships made it! Against those odds I think we did very good."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Casi todos las naves lo consiguieron! Contra las probabilidades, creo que "
"lo hicimos muy bien.\""

msgid ""
"\"I guess that was better than nothing. With so few supplies making it "
"through it seems like terraforming will take longer than I was hoping for.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que fue mejor que nada. Con tan pocos suministros, parece que la "
"terraformación tardará más de lo que esperaba.\""

msgid ""
"\"With these supplies, I think we will be able to start the next important "
"step on scaling up the terraforming operation. We're almost there, but we'll "
"still need more assistance. The mission terminal should be up and working, "
"and you should be able to find new supply requests there if you want to "
"help. We still need all the hands we can get!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Con estos suministros, creo que podremos iniciar el siguiente paso "
"importante en la ampliación de la operación de terraformación. Ya casi lo "
"tenemos, pero aún necesitaremos más ayuda. El terminal de la misión debería "
"estar funcionando y deberíais poder encontrar nuevas solicitudes de "
"suministros ahí si queréis ayudar. ¡Todavía necesitamos todas las manos que "
"podamos conseguir!\""

#. Apply first diff
#. Give supplies based on how many ships were able to land
#. Should get just 1000 if all make it
msgid "You guarded supply ships from the PUAAA delivering cargo to {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Has custodiado naves de suministro de la PUCAA que llevaban carga a {pnt}."

msgid "You were supposed to guard the supply ships!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que ibas a vigilar las naves de suministros!"

msgid "Supply Ship"
msgstr "Nave de Suministros"

msgid "Supply ship under attack! Help requested!"
msgstr "¡Ataque a una nave de suministros! ¡Solicito ayuda!"

#. Nothing to do here
#. Wrong system
msgid "You were not supposed to leave {sys}!"
msgstr "¡No se suponía que dejaras {sys}!"

msgid "Supply Ship Entry Point"
msgstr "Punto de Entrada de Naves de Suministros"

msgid "The supply ships will be incoming shortly!"
msgstr "¡Las naves de suministros llegarán en breve!"

#. Initialize ship stuff
msgid "Supplier"
msgstr "Suministrador"

msgid "The last supply ships have entered the system!"
msgstr "¡Las últimas naves de suministro han entrado en el sistema!"

#. See surviving pilots
#. Say some protest slogan
#. Protest again
msgid "No supply ships made it through!"
msgstr "¡Ningúna nave de suministros logró pasar!"

msgid ""
"You find Verner relaxing at the bar. He calls you towards him the moment he "
"sees you."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Verner descansando en el bar. Llama tu atención en cuanto te ve."

msgid ""
"While you walk towards him, you suddenly hear a commotion towards the "
"entrance of the bar. You hear what sounds like an anti-terraforming slogan "
"when Verner suddenly runs past you towards disturbance. You crouch as you "
"hear a shot being fired and can see Verner grabbing an individual before "
"flinging them across the bar where they crash into the wall and fall down to "
"the ground."
msgstr ""
"Mientras caminas hacia él, oyes de repente un alboroto en la entrada del "
"bar. Oyes lo que parece un eslogan antiterrorista cuando Verner pasa "
"corriendo de repente junto a ti hacia el alboroto. Te agachas al oír un "
"disparo y puedes ver cómo Verner agarra a un individuo antes de lanzarlo al "
"otro lado del bar, donde se estrella contra la pared y cae al suelo."

msgid ""
"Quickly a security team runs over and apprehends the guy, while Verner walks "
"over to you barely breaking a sweat."
msgstr ""
"Rápidamente, un equipo de seguridad corre y detiene al tipo, mientras Verner "
"se acerca a ti sin apenas sudar."

msgid ""
"\"It seems like the PUAAA is getting braver these days. We heard of a supply "
"ship in {sys} providing them with more resources to continue their senseless "
"violence, it's not the first time we have something like that.\"\n"
"He points to the unconscious individual being carried away."
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que la PUCAA se está volviendo más valiente estos días. Nos "
"enteramos de que una nave de abastecimiento en {sys} les proporciona más "
"recursos para continuar con su violencia sin sentido, no es la primera vez "
"que tenemos algo así.\"\n"
"Señala al individuo inconsciente que se llevan."

msgid ""
"\"Would you be willing to go over to {sys} and take out the supply ship? I "
"would be able to pay you {credits} for your trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Estarías dispuesto a ir a {sys} y eliminar la nave de suministros? Podría "
"pagarte {credits} por las molestias.\""

msgid ""
"\"Have you changed your mind about dealing with the PUAAA supply ship?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Has cambiado de opinión sobre el trato con la nave de suministros de la "
"PUAAA?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! Just take out the supply ship with any means necessary, and we "
"should be all good. I've got to go take care of this now.\"\n"
"He points towards a glancing burn mark on his abdomen. It looks like the "
"shot fired during the commotion grazed him, but it doesn't look life-"
"threatening. He chugs down his drink, and gets up before heading off.\n"
"\"Take care!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Sólo hay que sacar la nave de suministros con los medios "
"necesarios y deberíamos estar bien. Tengo que ir a ocuparme de esto ahora."
"\"\n"
"Señala una quemadura de refilón en su abdomen. Parece que el disparo "
"efectuado durante la conmoción le ha rozado, pero no parece que ponga en "
"peligro su vida. Se bebe un trago y se levanta antes de salir.\n"
"\" ¡Cuídate!\""

#. Not accepted
msgid "Eliminate the PUAAA Supply Ship"
msgstr "Elimina la nave de suministros PUCAA"

msgid "Eliminate the PUAAA supply ship at {sys}."
msgstr "Elimina la nave de suministros PUCAA en {sys}."

msgid "Go to {sys}"
msgstr "Ve a {sys}"

msgid "Destroy the PUAAA supply ship"
msgstr "Destruye la nave de suministros de la PUCAA"

msgid "Return to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Land hook.
msgid ""
"You land and go meet up with Verner, who is overseeing the terraforming."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y te reúnes con Verner, que está supervisando la terraformación."

msgid ""
"\"You got rid of the pesky supply ship? Great to hear that. Hopefully with "
"fewer supplies the PUAAA will less active, and we'll be able to progress "
"more. It's almost starting to look like a place I can call home.\"\n"
"He looks over the terraforming site, and you can see a mix of happiness and "
"sorrow on his face."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Te has librado de la molesta nave de suministros? Me alegro de oírlo. "
"Esperemos que con menos suministros la PUCAA sea menos activa y podamos "
"progresar más. Casi empieza a parecer un lugar al que puedo llamar hogar.\"\n"
"Mira el sitio de terraformación y se puede ver una mezcla de felicidad y "
"tristeza en su rostro."

msgid ""
"Without turning to you, he continues.\n"
"\"It's going to be great. Thanks for your hard work.\""
msgstr ""
"Sin volverse hacia ti, continúa.\n"
"\"Va a ser genial. Gracias por tu trabajo.\""

#. Done
msgid "You eliminated a PUAAA supply ship bringing more security to {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Has eliminado una nave de suministros de la PUCAA aportando más seguridad a "
"{pnt}."

#. Initialize ship stuff
msgid "PUAAA Supply Ship"
msgstr "Nave de Suministros PUCAA"

msgid "PUAAA Escort"
msgstr "Escolta PUCAA"

msgid "You eliminated the target!"
msgstr "¡Has eliminado al objetivo!"

msgid "No more supplies"
msgstr "Se acabaron los suministros"

msgid ""
"You board the ship and blast out the entire control panel rendering the ship "
"unrepairable and not operational. That should satisfy Verner."
msgstr ""
"Abordas la nave y destruyes todo el panel de control haciendo que la nave no "
"pueda ser reparada ni operada. Eso debería satisfacer a Verner."

msgid "You meet up with Verner at the spaceport bar."
msgstr "Te encuentras con Verner en el bar del puerto espacial."

msgid ""
"\"How's it going? {pnt} is starting to take off, but the PUAAA don't cut us "
"any slack. I tried to see if the Empire would do anything about it, and they "
"just send me running around filing paperwork to no avail. Damn useless. "
"However, I've started getting in contact with other independent worlds, and "
"it seems like we could form a trade alliance, hopefully bringing stability "
"to {pnt}. Would you be willing to go to {destpnt} in the {destsys} system to "
"seal an agreement for me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo va todo? {pnt} está empezando a despegar, pero los PUCAA no nos dan "
"tregua. Intenté ver si el Imperio hacía algo al respecto y sólo me mandan a "
"dar vueltas archivando papeles en vano. Malditos inútiles. Sin embargo, he "
"empezado a contactar con otros mundos independientes, y parece que podríamos "
"formar una alianza comercial, con la esperanza de traer estabilidad a {pnt}. "
"¿Estarías dispuesto a ir a {destpnt} en el sistema {destsys} para sellar un "
"acuerdo por mí?\""

msgid ""
"\"Glad to hear that. So, I've been talking with the traders running "
"{destpnt}, and it seems like they would be willing to enter a trade deal "
"where we would provide them with some processed goods for stuff that we "
"can't easily get here. Especially stuff that requires high gravity for "
"processing is our weakness. The deal is almost set, but as a sign of good "
"faith I just need someone to go and do the final signing ceremony. It should "
"be fairly straight-forward.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de oírlo. He estado hablando con los comerciantes que dirigen "
"{destpnt}, y parece que estarían dispuestos a entrar en un acuerdo comercial "
"en el que les proporcionaríamos algunos productos procesados para cosas que "
"no podemos conseguir fácilmente aquí. Especialmente las cosas que requieren "
"alta gravedad para su procesamiento son nuestra debilidad. El acuerdo está "
"casi listo, pero como señal de buena fe sólo necesito que alguien vaya a "
"hacer la ceremonia final de la firma. Debería ser bastante sencillo.\""

msgid ""
"\"I would want to go do the signing myself, but with the latest incidents "
"and the workload I have here, my hands are all tied. Now, with the last hit "
"you did on the PUAAA supply ship, I'm not expecting any trouble, but you "
"never know. If they knew we were about to strike a trade deal, I'm sure "
"they'd try to stop it. Just in case, make sure to go to {destpnt} armed. "
"Best of luck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría ir a firmar yo mismo, pero con los últimos incidentes y la "
"carga de trabajo que tengo aquí, tengo las manos atadas. Ahora bien, con el "
"último golpe que diste a la nave de suministros de la PUCAA, no espero "
"ningún problema, pero nunca se sabe. Si supieran que estamos a punto de "
"llegar a un acuerdo comercial, estoy seguro de que tratarían de detenerlo. "
"Por si acaso, asegúrate de ir a {destpnt} armado. Mucha suerte.\""

#. Not accepted
msgid "Antlejos V Trade Deal"
msgstr "Acuerdo Comercial de Antlejos V"

msgid ""
"Go to {pnt} in the {sys} system to try to forge an alliance with the "
"government at {pnt} to support {retpnt}."
msgstr ""
"Ve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para intentar forjar una alianza con el "
"gobierno de {pnt} para ayudar a {retpnt}."

msgid "Go to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Ve a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Land hook.
msgid "You land and head towards the planet hall to do the signing."
msgstr "Aterrizas y te diriges al recibidor del planeta para hacer la firma."

msgid ""
"After confirming your appointment at the reception, you are led to an "
"extravagant waiting room filled with famous craftsmanship from all over the "
"universe. There are elegant carpets, ceremonial pottery, and lavish holoart "
"displays. You are ogling them when an assistant comes to take you to another "
"room."
msgstr ""
"Tras confirmar tu cita en la recepción, te conducen a una extravagante sala "
"de espera repleta de famosa artesanía de todo el universo. Hay elegantes "
"alfombras, cerámica ceremonial y lujosas muestras de holoarte. Estás "
"contemplándolos cuando un asistente viene a llevarte a otra sala."

msgid ""
"You meet up with a trader who is surprised you aren't Verner, but quickly "
"adjusts to the situation. They discuss trivial topics with you at first "
"before entering the trade details. They seem to be all in order, and you "
"sign as a representative of {pnt}. After shaking hands, you are sent on your "
"way. Dealing with traders is much more efficient than the Empire bureaucracy."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras con un comerciante que se sorprende de que no seas Verner, "
"pero se adapta rápidamente a la situación. Al principio discuten contigo "
"temas triviales antes de introducir los detalles de la operación. Parece que "
"todo está en orden y firmas como representante de {pnt}. Después de "
"estrechar la mano, se te envía a casa. El trato con los comerciantes es "
"mucho más eficiente que la burocracia del Imperio."

msgid ""
"As you leave the planet hall, you notice some figures that seem to be "
"trailing you. It looks like you might have company."
msgstr ""
"Al salir de la sala del planeta, observas unas figuras que parecen seguirte. "
"Parece que tienes compañía."

#. Advance mission
msgid "You land and find Verner waiting for you right outside the space docks."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y encuentras a Verner esperándote justo fuera de los muelles "
"espaciales."

msgid ""
"\"How did it go? I see, the PUAAA haven't been discouraged by their supply "
"ship getting taken out… This must mean they have someone or something else "
"supporting them… It might also be worth trying to set up our own defence "
"force. As the stakes get higher we can't keep on letting the PUAAA boss us "
"around. I'll have to think of what we can do. In the meantime, we still have "
"lots of things to do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo ha ido? Veo que los PUCAA no se han desanimado por la eliminación de "
"su nave de suministros... Esto debe significar que tienen a alguien o algo "
"más que los apoya... También podría valer la pena intentar crear nuestra "
"propia fuerza de defensa. A medida que lo que está en juego aumenta, no "
"podemos seguir dejando que los PUCAA nos manden. Tendré que pensar qué "
"podemos hacer. Mientras tanto, todavía tenemos muchas cosas que hacer.\""

#. See surviving pilots
#. Say some protest slogan
#. Protest again
#, fuzzy
msgid "PUAAA Protester"
msgstr "Manifestante PUCAA"

msgid "You find Verner enjoying a horrible smelling drink."
msgstr "Encuentras a Verner disfrutando de una bebida que huele fatal."

msgid ""
"\"Hey, have you seen how everything is chugging along? This beats my wildest "
"expectations. However, we've recently run into a small setback. We're trying "
"to strengthen the gravitational field to minimize the effect of space "
"adaptation syndrome, however, the core seems to be much harder than "
"expected, and our current machinery is unable to cut it. Our contacts at "
"Gordon's Exchange will loan us a Melendez Zebra that has been adapted as a "
"core miner, but given the recent PUAAA activity, I need someone to escort it "
"over here from {pnt} in the {sys} system. Would you be willing to do me the "
"favour?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, ¿has visto cómo avanza todo? Esto supera mis expectativas más "
"salvajes. Sin embargo, recientemente nos hemos encontrado con un pequeño "
"contratiempo. Estamos intentando reforzar el campo gravitatorio para "
"minimizar el efecto del síndrome de adaptación al espacio, sin embargo, el "
"núcleo parece ser mucho más duro de lo esperado y nuestra maquinaria actual "
"es incapaz de cortarlo. Nuestros contactos en el Intercambio de Gordon nos "
"prestarán una Cebra Meléndez que ha sido adaptada como minera del núcleo, "
"pero dada la reciente actividad de la PUCAA, necesito que alguien la escolte "
"hasta aquí desde {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. ¿Estarías dispuesto a hacerme el "
"favor?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! The core miner isn't really equipped with proper defences, so it's "
"somewhat of a sitting duck. It was recently doing some operations on the "
"Sander seafloor, but I gave them an offer they can't refuse, and they're "
"willing to come immediately if they get some protection given the recent… "
"incidents. I've been feeding some fake data to the PUAAA to hopefully "
"distract them a bit, but I don't think we'll be able to sneak in such a "
"large ship, so prepare for the worst. Try to protect the core miner at all "
"costs on the way here from {pnt}! It'll be nearly impossible to replace if "
"lost.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! El minero de núcleo no está realmente equipado con defensas "
"apropiadas, por lo que es algo así como un blanco fácil. Recientemente "
"estaba realizando algunas operaciones en el fondo marino de Sander, pero les "
"hice una oferta que no pueden rechazar y están dispuestos a venir "
"inmediatamente si consiguen algo de protección dados los recientes... "
"incidentes. He estado alimentando con algunos datos falsos a la PUCAA para, "
"con suerte, distraerlos un poco, pero no creo que seamos capaces de colar "
"una nave tan grande, así que prepárate para lo peor. Intenta proteger el "
"minero de núcleo a toda costa en el camino de {pnt}. Será casi imposible de "
"reemplazar si se pierde.\""

#. Not accepted
msgid "Antlejos Miner Escort"
msgstr "Escolta Minero a Antlejos"

msgid ""
"Verner needs you to escort a core miner from {pnt} in the {sys} system to "
"{retpnt} to help with the terraforming efforts."
msgstr ""
"Verner necesita que escoltes a un minero de núcleo de {pnt} en el sistema "
"{sys} a {retpnt} para ayudar con los esfuerzos de terraformación."

msgid "Escort the miner to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Acompaña al minero a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Land hook.
msgid ""
"You land and are promptly greeted by the captain of the core miner \"GE "
"Talpini\". After an exchange of some pleasantries, they show you around "
"their ship. It is in an impressive behemoth loaded with an array of fearsome "
"looking drills. However, you can see that the heavy modifications on the "
"ship make it much less suited for movement in space than underground or "
"underwater. Looks like it will be mainly up to you to keep it in one piece "
"on the way to {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y eres recibido rápidamente por el capitán del núcleo minero \"GE "
"Talpini\". Tras intercambiar algunas palabras de cortesía, te muestra su "
"nave. Se trata de un impresionante gigante cargado con una serie de taladros "
"de aspecto temible. Sin embargo, puedes ver que las fuertes modificaciones "
"de la nave la hacen mucho menos adecuada para moverse en el espacio que bajo "
"tierra o bajo el agua. Parece que dependerá principalmente de ti mantenerla "
"de una pieza en el camino hacia {pnt}."

msgid ""
"The captain mentions that they will not be making any stops on the way to "
"{pnt}, so you should make sure you have enough fuel for the entire trip. "
"Furthermore, in order to ensure the safety of the GE Talpini, you must jump "
"and land only after the GE Talpini has done so."
msgstr ""
"El capitán menciona que no harán ninguna parada en el camino a {pnt}, por lo "
"que debes asegurarte de tener suficiente combustible para todo el viaje. "
"Además, para garantizar la seguridad del GE Talpini, debes saltar y "
"aterrizar sólo después de que el GE Talpini lo haya hecho."

#. Advance mission
#. Don't give any weapons
#. luacheck: globals escort_success
msgid ""
"You land and are met with an awe-struck Verner, who seems earnestly "
"impressive by the massive GE Talpini that dwarfs most of the spaceport."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y te encuentras con un asombrado Verner, que parece seriamente "
"impresionado por el enorme GE Talpini que empequeñece la mayor parte del "
"puerto espacial."

msgid ""
"\"Damn, look at all those drills! It's much more impressive in person that "
"what you see on the holograms. This should make the core mining look like "
"child's play! Thanks a bunch for bringing it over here in one piece.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Maldita sea, mira todos esos taladros! Es mucho más impresionante en "
"persona que lo que se ve en los hologramas. ¡Esto hará que la minería del "
"núcleo parezca un juego de niños! Muchas gracias por traerlo de una pieza.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, by the way, in one of our routine patrols around the system, we "
"recently found a really curious peculiarity. It seems like there is a very "
"faint jump lane leading out of Antlejos. It doesn't seem like it goes "
"anywhere really interesting, but you might want to take a look. I've updated "
"your system navigation, so you should be able to use it now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por cierto, en una de nuestras patrullas rutinarias por el sistema, hemos "
"encontrado recientemente una peculiaridad muy curiosa. Parece que hay un "
"carril de salto muy tenue que sale de Antlejos. No parece que vaya a ningún "
"sitio realmente interesante, pero quizá quieras echarle un vistazo. He "
"actualizado tu sistema de navegación, así que deberías poder usarlo ahora.\""

msgid ""
"\"If you're still interested, we still need all the help we can get with "
"terraforming. There are still a lot of tasks to do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si todavía estás interesado, seguimos necesitando toda la ayuda que "
"podamos conseguir con la terraformación. ¡Todavía hay muchas tareas por "
"hacer!\""

#. Done
msgid ""
"You helped escort the core mining ship GE Talpini to Antlejos V to continue "
"the terraforming efforts."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a escoltar la nave minera de núcleo GE Talpini a Antlejos V para "
"continuar con los esfuerzos de terraformación."

msgid "GE Talpini"
msgstr "GE Talpini"

msgid "I'm counting on you on the way to {pnt}!"
msgstr "¡Cuento contigo en el camino a {pnt}!"

#. luacheck: globals miner_create
#. luacheck: globals miner_attacked
msgid "Under attack! Support requested!"
msgstr "¡Bajo ataque! ¡Solicito apoyo!"

#. Yep, we use the same patrol points in the same sys as in ant07
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Terraforming Antlejos 9">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Antlejos V</spob>
#. <cond>require('common.antlejos').unidiffLevel() &gt;= 9</cond>
#. <done>Terraforming Antlejos 8</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Terraforming Antlejos</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Campaign to Terraform Antlejos V
#.
#. Deal the final major blow get rid of the PUAAA mothership harassing Antlejos
#. --
msgid "Planet Saviour"
msgstr "Planeta Salvador"

msgid ""
"You find a dust-covered Verner once again enjoying a horrible smelling drink "
"at the bar."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a un Verner cubierto de polvo que vuelve a disfrutar de una "
"bebida que huele fatal en la barra."

msgid ""
"\"Hello! The core drilling is going slow but great. The dust is a pain to "
"get off though, it seems to permeate into clothing. This was my favourite "
"set too. Oh, well.\"\n"
"\"Speaking of which, some of my scouts have recently been able to track down "
"some PUAAA activity to be originating from {sys}. It seems like there is a "
"mothership or something like that over there. I know it's quite a challenge, "
"but I would need you to take care of it. Would you be willing to help {pnt} "
"again?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola! La perforación del núcleo va lenta pero muy bien. Sin embargo, el "
"polvo es un dolor de cabeza, parece que se impregna en la ropa. Este era mi "
"conjunto favorito también. Oh, bueno.\"\n"
"\"Hablando de eso, algunos de mis exploradores han podido rastrear "
"recientemente alguna actividad de PUCAA que se origina en {sys}. Parece que "
"hay una nave nodriza o algo así por allí. Sé que es todo un reto, pero "
"necesitaría que te encargaras de ello. ¿Estarías dispuesto a ayudar a {pnt} "
"de nuevo?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! I know you're thinking about doing the same you did with the supply "
"ship you took out in the Knave system, but this time it won't be that easy. "
"This seems to be the source of almost all the PUAAA attacks. In particular, "
"I believe it's the notorious '{shipname}', which is well-known for having "
"stopped the terraforming of Em 2. Normally, we wouldn't have much of a "
"chance against the {shipname}, but in a stroke of luck, it seems like "
"they've had some trouble, and they're now stuck offline in {sys}, meaning "
"it's the perfect time to take it down once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Sé que estás pensando en hacer lo mismo que hiciste con la nave "
"de suministros que sacaste en el sistema Knave, pero esta vez no será tan "
"fácil. Este parece ser el origen de casi todos los ataques de la PUCAA. En "
"particular, creo que se trata de la tristemente célebre \"{shipname}\", "
"conocida por haber detenido la terraformación de Em 2. Normalmente, no "
"tendríamos muchas posibilidades contra {shipname}, pero en un golpe de "
"suerte, parece que han tenido algunos problemas y ahora están atrapados "
"fuera de línea en {sys}, lo que significa que es el momento perfecto para "
"acabar con él de una vez por todas.\""

msgid ""
"\"The plan is pretty straight forward: I've got some extra explosives we've "
"been using to terraform {pnt}, but I think they could be put to better use "
"\"terraforming\" the {shipname}. All you have to do is fly to the {sys} "
"system, get to the {shipname}, plant the explosives, and get back here. Now, "
"that's probably easier said than done, and the system is going to be "
"probably crawling with those asteroid huggers, but I've seen your flying "
"skills and have the faith you can pull it off.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El plan es bastante sencillo: Tengo algunos explosivos extra que hemos "
"estado usando para terraformar {pnt}, pero creo que podrían ser mejor "
"utilizados para \"terraformar\" el {shipname}. Todo lo que tienes que hacer "
"es volar al sistema {sys}, llegar al {shipname}, colocar los explosivos, y "
"volver aquí. Ahora, eso es probablemente más fácil de decir que de hacer, y "
"el sistema va a estar probablemente plagado de esos abrazaasteroides, pero "
"he visto tus habilidades de vuelo y tengo fe en que puedes lograrlo.\""

#. Not accepted
msgid "Eliminate the PUAAA Mothership"
msgstr "Elimina la Nave Nodriza PUCAA"

msgid ""
"Eliminate the PUAAA mothership named {shipname} that is located in the {sys} "
"system. You have been provided explosives to detonate the mothership if you "
"are able to get close enough to it."
msgstr ""
"Elimina la nave nodriza de la PUCAA llamada {shipname} que se encuentra en "
"el sistema {sys}. Se te han proporcionado explosivos para detonar la nave "
"nodriza si eres capaz de acercarte lo suficiente a ella."

msgid "Plant explosives on the {shipname}"
msgstr "Coloca explosivos en el {shipname}"

msgid "Terraforming Explosives"
msgstr "Explosivos Terraformadores"

msgid ""
"Terraforming explosives meant to perform drastic changes to planet topology."
msgstr ""
"Explosivos de terraformación destinados a realizar cambios drásticos en la "
"topología del planeta."

#. Land hook.
msgid "You land and are promptly greeted by the always enthusiastic Verner."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y eres recibido rápidamente por el siempre entusiasta Verner."

msgid ""
"\"How did it go? … I see, better than expected! This calls for a "
"celebration, now where did I put it? Ah, there it is.\"\n"
"Verner picks up what seems to be an industrial barrel labelled 'Ammonia' and "
"sloppily dumps it into two steel mugs. He notices you giving him a following "
"look.\n"
"\"Ah, don't worry about that, I cleaned the barrel before filling it. This "
"is the bartender's speciality \"Antlejos Brew'! It's made with all natural "
"ingredients found exclusively here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo ha ido? ... Ya veo, ¡mejor de lo esperado! Esto merece una "
"celebración, ¿dónde lo he puesto? Ah, ahí está\".\n"
"Verner coge lo que parece ser un barril industrial etiquetado como "
"\"Amoníaco\" y lo vierte descuidadamente en dos tazas de acero. Se da cuenta "
"de que le echas una mirada de seguimiento.\n"
"\"Ah, no te preocupes por eso, he limpiado el barril antes de llenarlo. Esta "
"es la especialidad del camarero, el \"Brebaje de Antlejos\". Está hecho con "
"todos los ingredientes naturales que se encuentran exclusivamente aquí.\""

msgid ""
"Quickly a really strong stench fills the docks, almost like some sort of "
"bleach. He offers you a drink, what do you do?"
msgstr ""
"Rápidamente, un hedor muy fuerte llena los muelles, casi como una especie de "
"lejía. Te ofrece un trago, ¿qué haces?"

msgid "Carefully try the drink."
msgstr "Pruebas la bebida con cuidado."

msgid "Chug the drink."
msgstr "Tragas la bebida."

msgid "Refuse the drink."
msgstr "Rechazas la bebida."

msgid ""
"You carefully bring the drink up to your mouth and first take a whiff. It's "
"awful. It's horrible and much worse up close. Giving Verner the benefit of "
"the doubt, you bring it up to your lips and take a small sip, it could taste "
"better than what it smells like, right?"
msgstr ""
"Acercas con cuidado la bebida a tu cabeza y primero la hueles. Es horrible. "
"Es horrible y mucho peor de cerca. Dando a Verner el beneficio de la duda, "
"te lo llevas a los labios y tomas un pequeño sorbo, podría saber mejor de lo "
"que huele, ¿no?"

msgid ""
"Immediately the indescribable taste invades your mouth, overloading your "
"sensory system. Your body reflexively curls up, and you almost struggle to "
"keep consciousness. You spend a while trying to regain your senses and catch "
"your breath, all the while under Verner's sly grin."
msgstr ""
"Inmediatamente el indescriptible sabor invade tu boca, sobrecargando tu "
"sistema sensorial. Tu cuerpo se encoge por reflejo y casi luchas por "
"mantener la consciencia. Pasas un rato intentando recuperar tus sentidos y "
"recuperar el aliento, todo el tiempo bajo la astuta sonrisa de Verner."

msgid ""
"\"I've never seen that reaction on first taste! Maybe it's still a bit too "
"soon for you to be able to savour Antlejos delicacies.\"\n"
"He takes a long swig and finishes his mug.\n"
"\"Uuuaaaaaaaahh! Now that's the stuff. It gets better the more you try it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Nunca he visto esa reacción a la primera! Tal vez aún sea demasiado "
"pronto para que puedas saborear las delicias de Antlejos.\"\n"
"Da un largo trago y se termina la taza.\n"
"\"¡Uuuaaaaaahh! Esto es lo que hay. Se pone mejor cuanto más lo pruebas.\""

msgid ""
"You grab the mug, and in an extreme act of determination, ignore all the "
"warning signs your body screams at you, and you begin to chug the drink. "
"With the first sip, your body convulses briefly, but you continue to drink "
"until nothing is left. Or at least that's what you think happened before you "
"passed out."
msgstr ""
"Coges la taza y, en un acto de extrema determinación, ignoras todas las "
"señales de advertencia que te grita tu cuerpo y empiezas a dar un trago a la "
"bebida. Con el primer sorbo, tu cuerpo se convulsiona brevemente, pero "
"sigues bebiendo hasta que no queda nada. O al menos eso es lo que crees que "
"ocurrió antes de desmayarte."

msgid ""
"Time stops. You try to move your body, but nothing responds, you are lost in "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"El tiempo se detiene. Intentas mover tu cuerpo, pero nada responde, estás "
"perdido en la oscuridad."

msgid ""
"You struggle in vain until you realize you aren't feeling anything. You feel "
"no sensory input, it's like your body doesn't exist."
msgstr ""
"Luchas en vena hasta que te das cuenta de que no sientes nada. No sientes "
"ninguna entrada sensorial, es como si tu cuerpo no existiera."

msgid ""
"You try to focus and see what's going on, but realize something is really "
"amiss. You have a really subtle feeling of movement, like many little things "
"vibrating. Could this be the vibrations of the cells of your body? The "
"vibration of your atoms?"
msgstr ""
"Intentas concentrarte y ves qué está pasando, pero te das cuenta de que algo "
"está muy mal. Tienes una sensación muy sutil de movimiento, como si muchas "
"cosas pequeñas vibraran. ¿Podrían ser las vibraciones de las células de tu "
"cuerpo? ¿La vibración de tus átomos?"

msgid ""
"You are awoken to a splash of water and a strong burning sensation "
"throughout your entire body. As if your internal organs had caught on fire "
"and were relentlessly burning."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas con un chapoteo de agua y una fuerte sensación de ardor en "
"todo tu cuerpo. Como si tus órganos internos se hubieran incendiado y "
"ardieran sin cesar."

msgid ""
"\"Glad to have you back with us. I'm pretty sure your heart stopped beating "
"for a few seconds. Maybe I should have warned you about the Antlejos "
"delicacies.\"\n"
"He takes a long swig and finishes his mug.\n"
"\"Uuuaaaaaaaahh! Now that's the stuff. It gets better the more you try it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de tenerte de vuelta con nosotros. Estoy seguro de que tu "
"corazón dejó de latir durante unos segundos. Tal vez debería haberte "
"advertido sobre las delicias de Antlejos.\"\n"
"Da un largo trago y se termina la taza.\n"
"\"¡Uuuaaaaaahh! Esto es lo que hay. Mejora cuanto más lo pruebas.\""

msgid ""
"You spend a few minutes on the ground, with Verner patiently waiting, before "
"you finally feel like you can sit up and follow a conversation."
msgstr ""
"Pasas unos minutos en el suelo, con Verner esperando pacientemente, antes de "
"que finalmente sientas que puedes sentarte y seguir una conversación."

msgid "You refuse the drink and Verner chuckles."
msgstr "Rechazas la bebida y Verner se ríe."

msgid ""
"\"I guess it may be a bit much if you aren't used to it. It's especially "
"good at clearing terraforming dust that gets caught in your throat! Maybe "
"next time you'll give it a shot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que puede ser un poco excesivo si no estás acostumbrado. Es "
"especialmente bueno para limpiar el polvo de terraformación que se te queda "
"en la garganta. Tal vez la próxima vez le des una oportunidad.\""

msgid ""
"\"You've been such a help with the PUAAA, now with the {shipname} out of "
"commission, and the end of the terraforming, we'll finally be able to get "
"some peace and quiet here. It's almost like a dream come true. Honestly, I "
"never expected to get this far, and if it weren't for you, I probably never "
"would have. Cheers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Has sido de gran ayuda con la PUCAA, ahora con la {shipname} fuera de "
"servicio, y el fin de la terraformación, por fin podremos tener algo de paz "
"y tranquilidad aquí. Es casi como un sueño hecho realidad. Honestamente, "
"nunca esperé llegar tan lejos, y si no fuera por ti, probablemente nunca lo "
"habría hecho. ¡Salud!\""

msgid ""
"\"I have to take care of some other things now. You make sure to take some "
"rest, OK? I think you've more than deserved it. Here, even though it's much "
"less than you deserve, take this credit stick for all you've done for us "
"here at {pnt}. You sure you don't want to take a barrel of Antlejos brew "
"with you? No? Alright.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo que ocuparme de otras cosas ahora. Asegúrate de descansar un poco, "
"¿vale? Creo que lo tienes más que merecido. Toma, aunque es mucho menos de "
"lo que te mereces, coge este palo de créditos por todo lo que has hecho por "
"nosotros aquí en {pnt}. ¿Seguro que no quieres llevarte un barril de cerveza "
"de Antlejos? ¿No? De acuerdo.\""

msgid ""
"He gives you a strong handshake and is off, busy as ever. Alone, you now "
"spend awhile roaming around the base, more like a small city now, and make "
"note of all the incredible progress that has gone on this small moon in such "
"a small amount of time."
msgstr ""
"Te da un fuerte apretón de manos y se marcha, tan ocupado como siempre. A "
"solas, pasas un rato recorriendo la base, que ahora es más bien una pequeña "
"ciudad, y tomas nota de todos los increíbles progresos que ha hecho esta "
"pequeña luna en tan poco tiempo."

msgid "You eliminated the PUAAA mothership bringing more security to {pnt}."
msgstr "Has eliminado la nave nodriza PUCAA aportando más seguridad a {pnt}."

#. Main positions
#. Define the routes
#. TODO: check nil is not in a route
#. Initialize ship stuff
#. Can't detect anything
#. Much more bulky than normal
#. Can board them to blow them up
msgid "PUAAA Fighter"
msgstr "Caza PUCAA"

#. route0 and route1 can't be random or it might spawn directly on the player
#. route0 in reverse
msgid "You eliminated the mothership!"
msgstr "¡Has eliminado la nave nodriza!"

msgid "Terraforming {shipname}"
msgstr "Terraformar {shipname}"

msgid ""
"Without boarding the ship you quickly clamp the terraforming explosives on "
"the hull, set the timer, and detach. Time to get away from there before it "
"blows!"
msgstr ""
"Sin abordar la nave, sujetas rápidamente los explosivos de terraformación en "
"el casco, activas el temporizador y te separas. ¡Es hora de salir de allí "
"antes de que explote!"

msgid ""
"You find Verner drinking his usual foul Antlejos Brew at the bar. You can't "
"help to wince and gag a bit upon the smell pervading your nostrils."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Verner bebiendo su habitual y asqueroso brebaje de Antlejos en "
"la barra. No puedes evitar hacer una mueca de asco y tener una pequeña "
"arcada por el olor que te llega a las fosas nasales."

msgid ""
"You find Verner drinking his usual foul Antlejos Brew at the bar. He seems "
"glad to see you."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Verner bebiendo su habitual cerveza de Antlejos en el bar. "
"Parece alegrarse de verte."

msgid ""
"\"Hey, glad to see you around again. You feel that? We finally breached the "
"planet core and were able to install the final gravitational wave "
"generators. It feels much better now!\"\n"
"He does a little jump to make a point. It does look like there is less "
"buoyancy than before."
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, me alegro de verte de nuevo por aquí. ¿Sientes eso? Por fin hemos "
"entrado en el núcleo del planeta y hemos podido instalar los últimos "
"generadores de ondas gravitacionales. ¡Ahora se siente mucho mejor!\"\n"
"Da un pequeño salto para hacer una observación. Parece que hay menos "
"flotabilidad que antes."

msgid ""
"\"We also finally got the paperwork done to be accepted as an independent "
"trading world by the Empire. With this, most of the PUAAA should be out of "
"the way, with only maybe a few confused stragglers still coming to harass "
"us. All in all a great improvement! I never want to go through that "
"paperwork again, if I have to submit another triple signed verified "
"EW-104-3920 I'll jump out an airlock.\""
msgstr ""
"\"También conseguimos por fin el papeleo para ser aceptados como mundo "
"comercial independiente por el Imperio. Con esto, la mayor parte de la PUCAA "
"debería estar fuera del camino, con sólo unos pocos rezagados confundidos "
"que todavía vienen a acosarnos. En definitiva, ¡una gran mejora! No quiero "
"volver a pasar por ese trámite, si tengo que presentar otro EW-104-3920 "
"verificado con triple firma saltaré por una esclusa.\""

msgid ""
"\"We're going to have a small event to celebrate all the good happenings. As "
"the hero of Antlejos V, it would be my honour to invite you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vamos a hacer un pequeño evento para celebrar todos los buenos "
"acontecimientos. Como héroe de Antlejos V, será un honor para mí invitarte.\""

msgid "Seeing you aren't really given a choice, you accept Verner's offer."
msgstr "Viendo que no te dan opción, aceptas la oferta de Verner."

msgid ""
"He leads you to the largest room at the base, which is the not very elegant "
"cafeteria. He opens the door, and you are greeted by a myriad of faces, some "
"which you recognize as colonists you helped bring over to Antlejos V from "
"different parts of the galaxy. A cheer erupt from the crowd as you go to the "
"centre of the room."
msgstr ""
"Te conduce a la sala más grande de la base, que es la cafetería, no muy "
"elegante. Abre la puerta y te recibe una miríada de rostros, algunos de los "
"cuales reconoces como colonos que ayudaste a traer a Antlejos V desde "
"distintas partes de la galaxia. Una ovación brota de la multitud cuando te "
"diriges al centro de la sala."

msgid ""
"Verner almost slips when he jumps onto a table, likely not entirely used to "
"the new gravity, and then helps you up. People start pouring and sharing "
"foul smelling drinks, but Verner hands you a glass with something that "
"smells much better and winks at you. After a bit it seems like everyone has "
"got their drinks, and Verner directs himself to the crowd."
msgstr ""
"Verner casi se resbala cuando salta sobre una mesa, probablemente no "
"acostumbrado del todo a la nueva gravedad, y luego te ayuda a levantarte. La "
"gente empieza a servirse y a compartir bebidas que huelen mal, pero Verner "
"te da un vaso con algo que huele mucho mejor y te guiña un ojo. Después de "
"un rato parece que todo el mundo ha conseguido sus bebidas, y Verner se "
"dirige a la multitud."

msgid ""
"\"Thank you everyone for coming. It's been a long journey that has led us up "
"to this moment. I used to have a place that I could call home, but that was "
"lost, like a great many other things in that fateful day when everything "
"went to shit. The Incident took a great many things from me, and I thought I "
"would never be complete again: just a husk of a human doomed to venture "
"space until their demise. For many periods, that is all I knew. I know I am "
"not alone. Many of you were just like me. Lost souls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias a todos por venir. Ha sido un largo viaje que nos ha llevado hasta "
"este momento. Antes tenía un lugar al que podía llamar hogar, pero eso se "
"perdió, como muchas otras cosas en aquel fatídico día en que todo se fue a "
"la mierda. El Incidente me arrebató muchas cosas, y pensé que nunca volvería "
"a estar completo: sólo una cáscara de humano condenada a aventurarse en el "
"espacio hasta su desaparición. Durante muchos periodos, eso es todo lo que "
"sabía. Sé que no estoy solo. Muchos de vosotros erais como yo. Almas "
"perdidas.\""

msgid ""
"\"However, thanks to {playername}, we have finally been able to find that "
"which we had thought was lost forever. We have finally been able to find a "
"place that we can call home.\"\n"
"He raises his stein into the air, with you and everyone else following his "
"lead.\n"
"\"To {playername}, the Hero of Antlejos, and the prosperity of Antlejos V. "
"Our future begins now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, gracias a {playername}, hemos podido encontrar por fin lo que "
"creíamos perdido para siempre. Por fin hemos podido encontrar un lugar al "
"que podemos llamar hogar\".\n"
"Levanta su jarra en el aire, y tú y los demás lo acompañáis.\n"
"\"Por {playername}, el Héroe de Antlejos, y la prosperidad de Antlejos V. "
"¡Nuestro futuro comienza ahora!\""

msgid "The crowd begins cheering and the festivities commence…"
msgstr "La multitud comienza a animar y los festejos comienzan…"

msgid ""
"The party is a blur, and you don't recall much other than Verner insists "
"that you take a commemorative stein as the Hero of Antlejos. While wondering "
"what the future holds for Antlejos V, you return to your ship, ready to take "
"once again to the skies…"
msgstr ""
"La fiesta es un borrón, y no recuerdas mucho más allá de que Verner insiste "
"en que te lleves una jarra conmemorativa como Héroe de Antlejos. Mientras te "
"preguntas qué le depara el futuro a Antlejos V, vuelves a tu nave, dispuesto "
"a surcar de nuevo los cielos…"

msgid ""
"You were given a Commemorative Stein from Verner for helping terraform "
"Antlejos V."
msgstr ""
"Has recibido una Jarra Conmemorativa de Verner por ayudar a terraformar "
"Antlejos V."

msgid "New Independent Spaceport Antlejos V"
msgstr "Nuevo Puerto Espacial Independiente Antlejos V"

msgid ""
"Through a long process of terraforming, the once barren moon Antlejos V has "
"become officially been recognized as a new trading independent spaceport by "
"the Great Houses."
msgstr ""
"A través de un largo proceso de terraformación, la antaño estéril luna "
"Antlejos V ha sido reconocida oficialmente como un nuevo puerto espacial "
"comercial independiente por las Grandes Casas."

