#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. creates the NPC at the bar to create the mission
msgid ""
"You see an aristocrat sitting at a table in the middle of the bar, drinking "
"a swirling concoction in a martini glass with a disappointed look on his "
"face every time he takes a sip."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un aristócrata sentado en una mesa en el centro del bar, bebiendo un "
"brebaje en una copa de martini con una mirada de decepción cada vez que da "
"un sorbo."

#. chooses the planet
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You begin to approach the aristocrat. Next to him stands a well dressed and "
"muscular man, perhaps his assistant, or maybe his bodyguard, you're not "
"sure. When you get close to his table, he begins talking to you as if you "
"work for him. \"This simply will not do. When I ordered this 'drink', if you "
"can call it that, it seemed interesting. It certainly doesn't taste "
"interesting. It's just bland. The only parts of it that are in any way "
"interesting are not at all pleasing. It just tastes so… common.\n"
"   You know what I would really like? There was this drink at a bar on, what "
"planet was that? Damien, do you remember? The green drink with the red fruit "
"shavings.\" Damien looks down at him and seems to think for a second before "
"shaking his head. \"I believe it might have been {pnt} in the {sys} system. "
"The drink was something like an Atmospheric Re-Entry or Gaian Bombing or "
"something. It's the bar's speciality. They'll know what you're talking "
"about. You should go get me one. Can you leave right away?\""
msgstr ""
"Comienzas a acercarte al aristócrata. Junto a él se encuentra un hombre bien "
"vestido y musculoso, tal vez su asistente, o tal vez su guardaespaldas, no "
"estás seguro. Cuando te acercas a su mesa, empieza a hablarte como si "
"trabajaras para él. \"Esto simplemente no servirá. Cuando pedí esta "
"\"bebida\", si se puede llamar así, parecía interesante. Desde luego, no "
"tiene un sabor interesante. Es simplemente insípido. Las únicas partes que "
"son de alguna manera interesantes no son para nada agradables. Tiene un "
"sabor tan… común.\n"
"    ¿Sabes lo que realmente me gustaría? Había una bebida en un bar en, ¿qué "
"planeta era? Damien, ¿te acuerdas? La bebida verde con virutas de frutas "
"rojas\". Damien lo mira y parece pensar un segundo antes de negar con la "
"cabeza. \"Creo que podría haber sido {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. La bebida "
"era algo así como una Re-Entrada Atmosférica o un Bombardeo Gaiano o algo "
"así. Es la especialidad del bar. Ellos sabrán de qué hablas. Deberías ir a "
"buscarme uno. ¿Puedes irte ahora mismo?\""

msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, you can't leave right away? Then why even bother? Remove "
"yourself from my sight.\" The aristocrat makes a horrible face, and sips his "
"drink, only to look even more disgusted. Ignoring you, he puts his drink "
"back on the table and motions to the bartender."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué quieres decir con que no puedes irte de inmediato? Entonces, ¿por qué "
"me molestas? Quítate de mi vista\". El aristócrata pone una cara horrible y "
"da un sorbo a su bebida, para poner aún más cara de asco. Ignorándote, "
"vuelve a dejar su bebida sobre la mesa y le hace un gesto al camarero."

msgid ""
"\"Oh good! Of course you will be paid handsomely for your efforts. I trust "
"you can figure out how to get it here intact on your own.\" Ignoring you, "
"the aristocrat goes back to sipping his drink, making an awful face every "
"time he tastes it. You walk away, a bit confused."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Oh, bien! Por supuesto, se te pagará generosamente por tus esfuerzos. "
"Confío en que puedas averiguar cómo llegar aquí intacto por tu cuenta\". "
"Ignorándote, el aristócrata vuelve a sorber su bebida, poniendo una cara "
"horrible cada vez que la prueba. Te alejas, un poco confundido."

msgid "He will pay handsomely."
msgstr "Pagará generosamente."

msgid "Go find a specific drink for an aristocrat."
msgstr "Ve a buscar una bebida específica para un aristócrata."

#. how many systems you'll have to run through
#. final bartender data
#. hooks
#. first clue
#. next planet
msgid "Clue"
msgstr "Pista"

msgid ""
"You walk into the bar and approach the bartender. You describe the drink, "
"but the bartender doesn't seem to know what you're talking about. There is "
"another bartender that they think may be able to help you though, at {pnt} "
"in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Entras en el bar y te acercas al camarero. Describes la bebida, pero el "
"camarero no parece saber de qué estás hablando. Sin embargo, hay otro "
"camarero que creen que puede ayudarte, en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

#. find out that it's a bartender's speciality
#. next planet
msgid "A bit more info…"
msgstr "Un poco más de información…"

#. find another bar that the bartender used to work at
#. next planet
msgid "Is this it?"
msgstr "¿Es esto?"

msgid ""
"You walk into the bar fully confident that this is the bar. You walk up to "
"the bartender and ask for a Swamp Bombing. \"A wha???\" Guess this isn't the "
"right bar. You get another possible clue, {pnt} in the {sys} system, and "
"head on your way."
msgstr ""
"Entras en el bar con la plena seguridad de que éste es el bar. Te acercas al "
"camarero y le pides un \" Bomba de Pantano\". \"¿Un qué?\" Supongo que este "
"no es el bar correcto. Consigues otra posible pista, {pnt} en el sistema "
"{sys}, y sigues tu camino."

msgid ""
"A rare cocktail favoured by some aristocrats. Seems a bit overrated though."
msgstr ""

msgid "This is it!"
msgstr "¡Aquí está!"

msgid ""
"\"Ahh! I was just thinking how much I wanted one of those drinks! I'm so "
"glad that you managed to find it. You sure seemed to take your time though."
"\" You give him his drink and tell him that it wasn't easy, and how many "
"systems you had to go through. \"Hmm. That is quite a few systems. No reason "
"for you to be this late though.\" He takes a sip from his drink. \"Ahh! That "
"is good though. I suppose you'll be wanting to get paid for your efforts. "
"You did go through a lot of trouble. Then again, you did take quite a long "
"time. I suppose {credits} should be appropriate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ah! ¡Estaba pensando en lo mucho que quería una de esas bebidas! Me "
"alegro de que hayas conseguido encontrarla. Aunque parece que te has tomado "
"tu tiempo.\" Le das su bebida y le dices que no fue fácil, y cuántos "
"sistemas tuviste que atravesar. \"Hmm. Son bastantes sistemas. Pero no hay "
"razón para que llegues tan tarde.\" Toma un sorbo de su bebida. \"¡Ah! Pero "
"es bueno. Supongo que querrás que te paguen por tus esfuerzos. Te has tomado "
"muchas molestias. Por otra parte, has tardado mucho tiempo. Supongo que los "
"{credits} deberían ser apropiados.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Considering the amount of effort that you went through, you feel almost "
"cheated. You don't feel like arguing with the snobby aristocrat though, so "
"you just leave him to his drink without another word. It's probably the most "
"that anyone's ever paid for a drink like that anyway.\n"
"   When you get back to your ship you realize you have a drink left over. It "
"might look good like an ornament?"
msgstr ""
"Teniendo en cuenta el esfuerzo que te ha costado, te sientes casi engañado. "
"Pero no te apetece discutir con el aristócrata snob, así que le dejas con su "
"bebida sin decir nada más. Probablemente es lo máximo que alguien ha pagado "
"por una bebida así.\n"
"     Cuando vuelves a tu nave te das cuenta de que te ha sobrado una bebida. "
"¿Quizá quede bien como adorno?"

msgid "You delivered a special drink called a Swamp Bombing to an aristocrat."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado a un aristócrata una bebida especial llamada Bomba de Pantano."

msgid "Find the Drink"
msgstr "Encuentre la Bebida"

msgid "Return the drink to the Aristocrat at {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Devuelve la bebida al Aristócrata en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"Go to {pnt} in the {sys} system and look for the special drink that the "
"Aristocrat wants"
msgstr ""
"Ve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y busca la bebida especial que quiere el "
"Aristócrata"

