#. =Landing=--
msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are carried out of your ship by a sullen group of "
"workers. The job takes inordinately long to complete, and the leader pays "
"you {credits} without speaking a word."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Shortly after you land, a team rushes the containers of {cargo} out of your "
"vessel. Before you can even collect your thoughts, one of the workers "
"presses a credit chip worth {credits} in your hand and departs."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are unloaded by an exhausted-looking bunch of "
"dockworkers. Still, they make fairly good time, delivering your pay of "
"{credits} upon completion of the job."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are unloaded by a team of robotic drones "
"supervised by a human overseer, who hands you your pay of {credits} when "
"they finish."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are carried out of your ship by a sullen group of "
"workers. They are not happy that they have to work overtime because you were "
"late. You are paid only {credits} of the {reward} you were promised."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son sacados de tu nave por un grupo de "
"trabajadores hoscos. No están contentos de tener que trabajar horas extras "
"porque tú llegaste tarde. Sólo te pagan {credits} de la {reward} que te "
"prometieron."

msgid ""
"Shortly after you land, a team rushes the containers of {cargo} out of your "
"vessel. Your late arrival is stretching quite a few schedules! Your pay is "
"only {credits} instead of {reward} because of that."
msgstr ""
"Poco después de aterrizar, un equipo saca a toda prisa los contenedores de "
"{cargo} de tu nave. Tu llegada tardía está estirando los horarios de "
"bastantes personas. Tu paga es sólo de {credits} en lugar de {reward} por "
"eso."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are unloaded by an exhausted-looking bunch of "
"dockworkers. You missed the deadline, so your reward is only {credits} "
"instead of the {reward} you were hoping for."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son descargados por un grupo de trabajadores "
"portuarios que parecen agotados. Se te ha pasado el plazo, así que tu "
"recompensa es sólo de {credits} en lugar de la {reward} que esperabas."

msgid "Unknown route"
msgstr "Ruta desconocida"

msgid ""
"The fastest route to {pnt} is not currently known to you. Landing to buy "
"maps, spending time searching for unknown jumps, or taking a route longer "
"than {jumps} may cause you to miss the deadline. Accept the mission anyway?"
msgstr ""
"La ruta más rápida a {pnt} no la conoces actualmente. Aterrizar para comprar "
"mapas, gastar tiempo buscando saltos desconocidos o tomar una ruta más larga "
"que la de {jumps} puede hacer que se pase el plazo. ¿Aceptar la misión de "
"todos modos?"

msgid "Rush cargo mission"
msgstr "Misión de carga apresurada"

#. Case missed second deadline
#, fuzzy
msgid "The delivery to {sys} has been cancelled! You were too late."
msgstr "¡La entrega a {sys} ha sido cancelada! Has llegado demasiado tarde."

#. Case missed first deadline
msgid ""
"Fly to {pnt} in the {sys} system\n"
"(deadline missed, but you can still make a late delivery if you hurry)"
msgstr ""
"Vuela a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}\n"
"(no se cumple el plazo, pero aún puedes hacer una entrega tardía si te das "
"prisa)"

