#. Mission Details
msgid "{cargo} Delivery"
msgstr "Entrega {cargo}"

msgid ""
"{pnt} has an insufficient supply of {cargo} to satisfy the current demand. "
"Go to any planet which sells this commodity and bring as much of it back as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"{pnt} tiene un suministro insuficiente de {cargo} para satisfacer la demanda "
"actual. Ve a cualquier planeta que venda este producto y trae la mayor "
"cantidad posible."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are carried out of your ship and tallied. After "
"several different workers double-check the register to confirm the amount, "
"you are paid {credits} and summarily dismissed."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son sacados de tu nave y contados. Después de "
"que varios trabajadores vuelvan a comprobar el registro para confirmar la "
"cantidad, se te pagan {credits} y se te despide sumariamente."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are quickly and efficiently unloaded, labelled, "
"and readied for distribution. The delivery manager thanks you with a credit "
"chip worth {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} se descargan rápida y eficazmente, se etiquetan "
"y se preparan para su distribución. El encargado de la entrega te agradece "
"con una ficha de crédito por valor de {credits}."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are unloaded from your vessel by a team of "
"dockworkers who are in no rush to finish, eventually delivering {credits} "
"after the number of tonnes is determined."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son descargados de tu nave por un equipo de "
"estibadores que no tienen prisa por terminar, entregando finalmente "
"{credits} una vez determinado el número de toneladas."

msgid ""
"The containers of {cargo} are unloaded by robotic drones that scan and tally "
"the contents. The human overseer hands you {credits} when they finish."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de {cargo} son descargados por drones robóticos que "
"escanean y cuentan el contenido. El supervisor humano te entrega {credits} "
"cuando terminan."

msgid "Commodity Delivery"
msgstr "Entrega de Productos"

