#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Nebula Satellite">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>10</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Dvaered</faction>
#. <faction>Empire</faction>
#. <faction>Goddard</faction>
#. <cond>
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>2</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Nebula Satellite
#.
#. One-shot mission
#.
#. Help some independent scientists put a satellite in the nebula.
#.
#.
#.
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "Scientists Launch Research Probe Into Nebula"
msgstr "Científicos Lanzan una Sonda de Investigación a la Nebulosa"

msgid ""
"A group of scientists successfully launched a science probe into the Nebula. "
"The probe was specifically designed to be resistant to the corrosive "
"environment of the Nebula and is supposed to find new clues about the nature "
"of the gas and where it's from."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo de científicos ha lanzado con éxito una sonda científica a la "
"Nebulosa. La sonda fue diseñada específicamente para resistir el ambiente "
"corrosivo de la Nebulosa y se supone que debe encontrar nuevas pistas sobre "
"la naturaleza del gas y su procedencia."

msgid "Scientists"
msgstr "Cientificos"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Set up mission variables
#. Not too unstable
#. Set stuff up for the spaceport bar
msgid "A bunch of scientists seem to be chattering nervously among themselves."
msgstr "Un grupo de científicos parece charlar nerviosamente entre ellos."

msgid ""
"You approach the scientists. They seem a bit nervous and one mutters "
"something about whether it's a good idea or not. Eventually one of them "
"comes up to you.\n"
"\"Hello Captain, we're looking for a ship to take us into the Sol Nebula. "
"Would you be willing to take us there?\""
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a los científicos. Parecen un poco nerviosos y uno murmura algo "
"sobre si es una buena idea o no. Finalmente, uno de ellos se acerca a ti.\n"
"\"Hola capitán, estamos buscando una nave que nos lleve a la nebulosa de "
"Sol. ¿Estarías dispuesto a llevarnos allí?\""

msgid ""
"\"You need an additional {space} of free cargo space to accept this mission!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Necesitas {space} adicional de espacio de carga libre para aceptar esta "
"misión!\""

msgid ""
"\"We had a trip scheduled with a space trader, but they backed out at the "
"last minute. So we were stuck here until you came. We've got a research "
"probe that we want to release into the {sys} system to monitor the Nebula's "
"growth rate. The probe launch procedure is pretty straightforward and "
"shouldn't have any complications.\"\n"
"He takes a deep breath, \"We hope to be able to find out more secrets of the "
"Sol Nebula so mankind can once again regain its lost heritage. So far, the "
"radiation and volatility of the deeper areas haven't been very kind to our "
"instruments. That's why we designed this probe we're going to launch.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Teníamos un viaje programado con un comerciante espacial, pero se echó "
"atrás en el último momento. Así que nos quedamos atrapados aquí hasta que tú "
"llegaste. Tenemos una sonda de investigación que queremos lanzar al sistema "
"{sys} para monitorizar el ritmo de crecimiento de la Nebulosa. El "
"procedimiento de lanzamiento de la sonda es bastante sencillo y no debería "
"tener ninguna complicación.\"\n"
"Respira profundamente: \"Esperamos poder descubrir más secretos de la "
"Nebulosa del Sol para que la humanidad pueda volver a recuperar su "
"patrimonio perdido. Hasta ahora, la radiación y la volatilidad de las zonas "
"más profundas no han sido muy amables con nuestros instrumentos. Por eso "
"hemos diseñado esta sonda que vamos a lanzar.\""

msgid ""
"\"The plan is for you to take us to {sys} so we can launch the probe, and "
"then return us to our home at {home_pnt} in the {home_sys} system. If all "
"goes well, the probe will automatically send us the data we need. You'll be "
"paid {credits} when we arrive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El plan es que nos lleves a {sys} para que podamos lanzar la sonda, y "
"luego regresemos a nuestro hogar en {home_pnt} en el sistema {home_sys}. Si "
"todo va bien, la sonda nos enviará automáticamente los datos que "
"necesitamos. Se te pagarán {credits} cuando lleguemos.\""

#. Add cargo
msgid "Satellite"
msgstr "Satélite"

msgid ""
"A small space probe loaded with sensors for exploring the depths of the "
"nebula."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña sonda espacial cargada de sensores para explorar las "
"profundidades de la nebulosa."

#. Set up mission information
#. Add mission
msgid "Nebula Satellite"
msgstr "Satélite de Nebulosa"

msgid "Go to the {sys} system to launch the probe."
msgstr "Ve al sistema {sys} para lanzar la sonda."

#. Set up hooks
#. Mission success
msgid ""
"The scientists thank you for your help before going back to their home to "
"continue their nebula research. As a keepsake, one of them gives you a mock-"
"up of the probe you helped them launch."
msgstr ""
"Los científicos te agradecen tu ayuda antes de volver a su casa para seguir "
"investigando la nebulosa. Como recuerdo, uno de ellos te da una maqueta de "
"la sonda que les has ayudado a lanzar."

msgid ""
"You helped a group of scientists launch a research probe into the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a un grupo de científicos a lanzar una sonda de investigación en "
"la Nebulosa."

#. Launch satellite
#.
#. Launch process
#. --
msgid "Preparing to launch space probe…"
msgstr "Preparando el lanzamiento de la sonda espacial…"

msgid "Launch in 5…"
msgstr "Lanzamiento en 5…"

#, lua-format
msgid "%d…"
msgstr "%d…"

msgid "Space probe launch successful!"
msgstr "¡Lanzamiento de sonda espacial con éxito!"

msgid "Drop off the scientists at {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Deja a los científicos en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="New Europe Refugees">
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <spob>New Europe</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
msgid "Refugee Evacuation"
msgstr "Evacuación de Refugiados"

msgid ""
"Nebula refugees want you to get them off world to {spob} in the {sys} "
"system.\n"
"\n"
"#nCargo:#0 as many refugees as you can carry\n"
"{jumps}"
msgstr ""
"Los refugiados de la Nebulosa quieren que los saques del mundo hacia {spob} "
"en el sistema {sys}.\n"
"\n"
"#nCarga:#0 tantos refugiados como puedas llevar\n"
"{jumps}"

msgid "{credits} per tonne of refugees"
msgstr "{credits} por tonelada de refugiados"

msgid "You don't have enough room on your ship to take any refugees!"
msgstr ""
"¡No tienes suficiente espacio en tu nave para acoger a ningún refugiado!"

#. Store total amount of refugees moved
msgid "Nebula Refugees"
msgstr "Refugiados de la Nebulosa"

msgid "A bunch of poor and ragged looking refugees looking for a better life."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo de refugiados pobres y harapientos en busca de una vida mejor."

msgid "Take the refugees to {spob} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Llevar a los refugiados a {spob} ({sys} sistema)"

msgid ""
"The procession of refugees slowly boards your ship, with more than one "
"person looking back at the dying planet they used to call home. They make "
"themselves as comfortable as they can in your cargo holds and seem to "
"resigned to hoping what they will find at {spob} is better than what they "
"are leaving behind at {home}."
msgstr ""
"La procesión de refugiados sube lentamente a tu nave, con más de una persona "
"mirando hacia el planeta moribundo al que solían llamar hogar. Se acomodan "
"como pueden en tus bodegas de carga y parecen resignados a esperar que lo "
"que encontrarán en {spob} será mejor que lo que dejan atrás en {home}."

msgid ""
"You open your cargo holds, and the Nebula refugees make their way off your "
"ship and are promptly greeted by an immigration officer. It looks like "
"hardships are not yet over for the refugees. On the positive side, it can "
"only get better, right?"
msgstr ""
"Abres tus bodegas de carga y los refugiados de la Nebulosa salen de tu nave "
"y son recibidos por un oficial de inmigración. Parece que las dificultades "
"aún no han terminado para los refugiados. En el lado positivo, sólo puede ir "
"a mejor, ¿verdad?"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="An old woman">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>3</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Dvaered</faction>
#. <cond>return require("misn_test").reweight_active()</cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#. Note: additional conditionals present in mission script!
#.
#. --
#. -- MISSION: The complaining grandma
#. -- DESCRIPTION: The player is taking an old woman from Dvaered space to Sirius space.
#. -- The old woman keeps muttering about how the times have changed and how it used to be when she was young.
#. --
#. --
msgid ""
"\"You youngsters and your newfangled triple redundancy plasma feedback "
"shunts. In my day, we had to use simple monopole instaconductors to keep our "
"hyperdrives running!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vosotros, jóvenes, y vuestras novedosas derivaciones de retroalimentación "
"de plasma de triple redundancia. En mis tiempos, ¡teníamos que usar simples "
"instaconductores monopolares para mantener nuestros hiperimpulsores en "
"funcionamiento!\""

msgid ""
"\"Tell me, youngster, why is everyone so preoccupied with Soromid "
"enhancements these days? Cybernetic implants were good enough for us, why "
"can't they be for you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Dime, jovencito, ¿por qué todo el mundo está tan preocupado por las "
"mejoras Soromida en estos días? Los implantes cibernéticos fueron lo "
"suficientemente buenos para nosotros, ¿por qué no pueden serlo para ti?\""

msgid ""
"\"My mother was from Earth, you know. She even took me there once, when I "
"was a little girl. I still remember it like it happened yesterday. They "
"don't make planets like that any more these days, oh no.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"What did you say this thing was? A microblink reinforced packet "
"transmitter? No, no, don't try to explain how it works. I'm too old for "
"this. Anything more complex than a subspace pseudo-echo projector is beyond "
"my understanding.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué dijiste que era esta cosa? ¿Un transmisor de paquetes reforzado con "
"microblink? No, no, no intentes explicar cómo funciona. Soy demasiado viejo "
"para esto. Cualquier cosa más compleja que un proyector de pseudo-eco "
"subespacial está más allá de mi comprensión.\""

msgid ""
"\"You don't know how good you have it these days. When I was young, we "
"needed to reprogram our own electronic countermeasures to deal with custom "
"pirate tracking systems.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No sabes lo bien que lo tienes hoy en día. Cuando yo era joven, "
"necesitábamos reprogramar nuestras propias contramedidas electrónicas para "
"hacer frente a los sistemas de rastreo de los piratas.\""

msgid "\"Time passes by so quickly. I remember when this was all space.\""
msgstr "\"El tiempo pasa tan rápido. Recuerdo cuando todo esto era espacio.\""

msgid ""
"\"All this automation is making people lax, I tell you. My uncle ran a tight "
"ship. If he caught you cutting corners, you'd be defragmenting the sub-ion "
"matrix filters for a week!\""
msgstr "\"El tiempo pasa tan rápido. ¡Recuerdo cuando todo esto era espacio!\""

msgid "An old woman"
msgstr "Una mujer vieja"

#. In case no suitable planets are in range.
msgid ""
"You see a wrinkled old lady, a somewhat unusual sight in a spaceport bar. "
"She's purposefully looking around."
msgstr ""
"Ves a una anciana arrugada, algo inusual en un bar de un puerto espacial. "
"Está mirando a propósito a Tu alrededor."

msgid ""
"You decide to ask the old woman if there's something you can help her with.\n"
"   \"As a matter of fact, there is,\" she creaks. \"I want to visit my "
"cousin. She lives on {pnt}, you know, in the {sys} system, it's a Sirian "
"place. But I don't have a ship and those blasted passenger lines around here "
"don't fly to Sirius space! I tell you, customer service really has gone down "
"the tubes over the years. In my space faring days, there would always be "
"some transport ready to take you anywhere! But now look at me, I'm forced to "
"head to the spaceport bar to see if there's a captain willing to take me! "
"It's a disgrace, that's what it is. What a galaxy we live in! But I ramble. "
"You seem like you've got time on your hands. Fancy making a trip down to "
"{pnt}? I'll pay you a decent fare, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"Decides preguntar a la anciana si hay algo en lo que puedas ayudarla.\n"
"   \"De hecho, sí lo hay\", dice ella. \"Quiero visitar a mi prima. Vive en "
"{pnt}, ya sabes, en el sistema {sys}, es un lugar Sirio. Pero no tengo una "
"nave y esas malditas líneas de pasajeros de aquí no vuelan al espacio Sirio. "
"Te digo, el servicio al cliente realmente se ha ido a pique con los años. En "
"mis días de navegación espacial, siempre había algún transporte listo para "
"llevarte a cualquier parte. Pero ahora mírame, ¡me veo obligado a dirigirme "
"al bar del puerto espacial para ver si hay un capitán dispuesto a llevarme! "
"Es una vergüenza, eso es lo que es. ¡Qué galaxia en la que vivimos! Pero "
"divago. Parece que tienes tiempo libre. ¿Te gustaría hacer un viaje a {pnt}? "
"Te pagaré un precio decente, por supuesto.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's good of you.\" The old woman gives you a wrinkled smile. \"I "
"haven't seen my cousin in such a long time, it'll be great to see how she's "
"doing, and we can talk about old times. Ah, old times. It was all so "
"different then. The space ways were much safer, for one. And people were "
"more polite to each other too, oh yes!\"\n"
"You escort the old lady to your ship, trying not to listen to her rambling. "
"Perhaps it would be a good idea to get her to her destination as quickly as "
"you can."
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, es bueno de tu parte\". La anciana te dedica una sonrisa arrugada. "
"\"Hace mucho tiempo que no veo a mi prima, será estupendo ver cómo está, y "
"podremos hablar de los viejos tiempos. Ah, los viejos tiempos. Todo era tan "
"diferente entonces. Las vías espaciales eran mucho más seguras, para "
"empezar. Y la gente era más educada entre sí, ¡oh sí!\"\n"
"Acompañas a la anciana a tu nave, intentando no escuchar sus divagaciones. "
"Tal vez sea una buena idea llevarla a su destino lo más rápido posible."

msgid "Old Woman"
msgstr "Mujer Vieja"

msgid "A grumbling old woman."
msgstr "Una vieja gruñona."

msgid "The Old Woman"
msgstr "La Anciana"

msgid "An ageing lady has asked you to ferry her to {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Una señora mayor te ha pedido que la lleves a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

msgid "Fair monetary compensation"
msgstr "Compensación monetaria justa"

msgid "Take the old woman to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Lleva a la anciana a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Date hook.
msgid "Grumblings from the old lady"
msgstr "Refunfuños de la anciana"

#. Uh... yeah.
#. Land hook.
msgid ""
"You help the old lady to the spacedock elevator. She keeps grumbling about "
"how spaceports these days are so inconvenient and how advertisement "
"holograms are getting quite cheeky of late. They wouldn't allow that sort of "
"thing in her day. But once you deliver her to the exit terminal, she smiles "
"at you."
msgstr ""
"Ayudas a la anciana a subir al ascensor del muelle espacial. Sigue "
"refunfuñando sobre lo incómodos que son los puertos espaciales hoy en día y "
"sobre cómo los hologramas publicitarios se están volviendo bastante "
"descarados últimamente. En su época no permitían ese tipo de cosas. Pero una "
"vez que la llevas a la terminal de salida, te sonríe."

msgid ""
"\"Thank you, young captain, I don't know what I would have done without you. "
"It seems there are still decent folk out there even now. Take this, as a "
"token of my appreciation.\"\n"
"The lady hands you a credit chip. Then she disappears through the terminal. "
"Well, that was quite a passenger!"
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias, joven capitán, no sé qué habría hecho sin usted. Parece que "
"todavía hay gente decente por ahí, incluso ahora. Toma esto, como muestra de "
"mi agradecimiento.\"\n"
"La señora le entrega una ficha de crédito. Luego desaparece por la terminal. "
"¡Vaya, qué pasajero!"

msgid ""
"You escorted an old woman to her cousin in Sirian space. She was nice, "
"albeit somewhat overly chatty."
msgstr ""
"Acompañaste a una anciana hasta su primo en el espacio Sirio. Era simpática, "
"aunque algo parlanchina."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
