msgid "Let's do this!"
msgstr "¡Vamos a hacer esto!"

msgid "Wooo!"
msgstr "¡Wooo!"

msgid "Time to Shake 'n Bake"
msgstr "Hora de Agitar y Hornear"

msgid "A laid back person"
msgstr "Una persona relajada"

msgid ""
"You see a laid back person, who appears to be one of the locals, looking "
"around the bar."
msgstr ""
"Ves a una persona relajada, que parece ser uno de los lugareños, mirando "
"alrededor del bar."

msgid "Looking for a 4th"
msgstr "Buscando un 4º"

msgid ""
"\"Hiya there! We're having a race around this system soon and need a 4th "
"person to participate. You have to bring a Yacht class ship, and there's a "
"prize of {credits} if you win. Interested?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola! Pronto tendremos una carrera por este sistema y necesitamos que una "
"cuarta persona participe. Tienes que traer una nave de clase Yate, y hay un "
"premio de {credits} si ganas. ¿Interesado?\""

msgid "You're participating in a race!"
msgstr "¡Estás participando en una carrera!"

msgid "Racing Skills 1"
msgstr "Destreza en Carreras 1"

msgid "Board checkpoint 1"
msgstr "Punto de control 1"

msgid "Board checkpoint 2"
msgstr "Punto de control 2"

msgid "Board checkpoint 3"
msgstr "Punto de control 3"

msgid "Land at {pnt}"
msgstr "Aterriza en {pnt}"

msgid "Awesome"
msgstr "Impresionante"

msgid ""
"\"That's great! Here's how it works: We will all be in Yacht class ships. "
"Once we take off from {pnt}, there will be a countdown, and then we will "
"proceed to the various checkpoints in order, boarding them before going to "
"the next checkpoint. After the last checkpoint has been boarded, head back "
"to {pnt} and land. Let's have some fun!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Eso es genial! Así es como funciona: Todos estaremos en naves de clase "
"Yate. Una vez que despeguemos de {pnt}, habrá una cuenta atrás, y entonces "
"procederemos a los distintos puntos de control en orden, abordándolos antes "
"de ir al siguiente punto de control. Una vez abordado el último punto de "
"control, volveremos a {pnt} y aterrizaremos. ¡Vamos a divertirnos!\""

msgid "\"I guess we'll need to find another pilot.\""
msgstr "\"Supongo que tendremos que encontrar otro piloto.\""

msgid "Illegal ship!"
msgstr "¡Una nave ilegal!"

msgid ""
"\"You have switched to a ship that's not allowed in this race. Mission "
"failed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Has cambiado a una nave que no está permitida en esta carrera. Misión "
"fallida.\""

msgid "Checkpoint {n}"
msgstr "Punto de Control {n}"

msgid "Racer {n}"
msgstr "Corredor {n}"

msgid "{plt} just reached checkpoint {n}"
msgstr "{plt} acaba de alcanzar el punto de control {n}"

msgid "Checkpoint {n} baby!"
msgstr "¡Punto de control {n} colega!"

msgid "Hooyah"
msgstr "Yuuhuuu"

msgid "Next!"
msgstr "¡Siguiente!"

msgid "Checkpoint {n} reached"
msgstr "Punto de control {n} alcanzado"

msgid "Proceed to Checkpoint {n}"
msgstr "Procede al Punto de Control {n}"

msgid "You left the race!"
msgstr "¡Has abandonado la carrera!"

msgid "\"Because you left the race, you have been disqualified.\""
msgstr "\"Como has abandonado la carrera, has sido descalificado.\""

msgid "{plt} just landed at {pnt} and finished the race"
msgstr "{plt} acaba de aterrizar en {pnt} y ha terminado la carrera"

msgid "You Won!"
msgstr "¡Ganaste!"

msgid ""
"The laid back person comes up to you and hands you a credit chip.\n"
"   \"Nice racing! Here's your prize money. Let's race again sometime soon!\""
msgstr ""
"La persona relajada se acerca a ti y te da una ficha de crédito.\n"
"   \"¡Buena carrera! Aquí tienes el dinero del premio. ¡Volvamos a correr "
"pronto!\""

msgid "You failed to win the race."
msgstr "Perdistes la carrera."

msgid ""
"As you congratulate the winner on a great race, the laid back person comes "
"up to you.\n"
"   \"That was a lot of fun! If you ever have time, let's race again. Maybe "
"you'll win next time!\""
msgstr ""
"Mientras felicitas al ganador por una gran carrera, la persona relajada se "
"acerca a ti.\n"
"   \"¡Ha sido muy divertido! Si alguna vez tienes tiempo, volvamos a correr. "
"¡Quizá ganes la próxima vez!\""

msgid ""
"You see a laid back person, who appears to be one of the locals, looking "
"around the bar, apparently in search of a suitable pilot."
msgstr ""
"Ves a una persona relajada, que parece ser uno de los lugareños, mirando "
"alrededor del bar, aparentemente en busca de un piloto adecuado."

msgid "Another race"
msgstr "Otra carrera"

msgid "\"Hey there, great to see you back! You want to have another race?\""
msgstr "\"¡Hola, me alegro de verte de vuelta! ¿Quieres hacer otra carrera?\""

msgid "You're participating in another race!"
msgstr "¡Participas en otra carrera!"

msgid "Racing Skills 2"
msgstr "Destreza en Carreras 2"

msgid ""
"\"There are two races you can participate in: an easy one, which is like the "
"first race we had, or a hard one, with smaller checkpoints and no "
"afterburners allowed. The easy one has a prize of {credits1}, and the hard "
"one has a prize of {credits2}. Which one do you want to do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hay dos carreras en las que puedes participar: una fácil, que es como la "
"primera carrera que tuvimos, o una difícil, con puntos de control más "
"pequeños y sin permitir la postcombustión. La fácil tiene un premio de "
"{credits1}, y la difícil tiene un premio de {credits2}. ¿Cuál quieres hacer?"
"\""

msgid "Choose difficulty"
msgstr "Elige la dificultad"

msgid "Easy Mode "
msgstr "Modo Fácil "

msgid "\"Let's go have some fun then!\""
msgstr "\"¡Vamos a divertirnos entonces!\""

msgid ""
"\"You want a challenge huh? Remember, no afterburners on your ship or you "
"will not be allowed to race. Let's go have some fun!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Quieres un reto, eh? Recuerda, nada de postcombustión en tu nave o no se "
"te permitirá competir. ¡Vamos a divertirnos!\""

msgid ""
"\"You have outfits on your ship which is not allowed in this race in hard "
"mode. Mission failed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tienes equipos en tu nave que no están permitidos en esta carrera en modo "
"difícil. Misión fallida.\""

msgid ""
"This race is sponsored by Melendez Corporation. Problem-free ships for "
"problem-free voyages!"
msgstr ""
"Esta carrera está patrocinada por Corporación Melendez. ¡Naves sin problemas "
"para viajes sin problemas!"

msgid "Proceed to land at {pnt}"
msgstr "Procede a aterrizar en {pnt}"

msgid ""
"A man in a suit and tie takes you up onto a stage. A large name tag on his "
"jacket says 'Melendez Corporation'. \"Congratulations on your win,\" he "
"says, shaking your hand, \"that was a great race. On behalf of Melendez "
"Corporation, I would like to present to you #gyour trophy#0 and prize money "
"of {credits}!\" He hands you one of those fake oversized cheques for the "
"audience, and then a credit chip with the actual prize money on it. At least "
"the trophy looks cool."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A man in a suit and tie takes you up onto a stage. A large name tag on his "
"jacket says 'Melendez Corporation'. \"Congratulations on your win,\" he "
"says, shaking your hand, \"that was a great race. On behalf of Melendez "
"Corporation, I would like to present to you your prize money of {credits}!\" "
"He hands you one of those fake oversized cheques for the audience, and then "
"a credit chip with the actual prize money on it."
msgstr ""
"Un hombre con traje y corbata te sube a un escenario. Una gran etiqueta con "
"su nombre en la chaqueta dice \"Corporación Melendez\". \"Enhorabuena por tu "
"victoria\", dice, estrechando tu mano, \"ha sido una gran carrera. En nombre "
"de Corporación Melendez, me gustaría entregarte tu premio en metálico de "
"{credits}\". Te entrega uno de esos cheques falsos de gran tamaño para el "
"público, y luego un chip de crédito con el dinero real del premio."

