#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid ""
"The passengers disembark with a new appreciation for the wonders of the "
"universe."
msgstr ""
"Los pasajeros desembarcan con una nueva apreciación de las maravillas del "
"universo."

msgid "Going off-world has renewed your passengers sense of adventure."
msgstr ""
"Salir del mundo ha renovado el sentido de la aventura de tus pasajeros."

msgid ""
"The passengers burst into cheers upon returning to the hangar. What a "
"wonderful experience."
msgstr ""

msgid "The passengers enjoyed their time aboard your vessel."
msgstr "Los pasajeros disfrutaron de tu tiempo a bordo de tu nave."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The passengers appreciate that you took them in a luxury vessel after all. "
"You are paid the original fare rather than the reduced fare."
msgstr ""
"Los pasajeros aprecian que los hayas llevado a una nave de clase Yate de "
"Lujo, después de todo. Te pagan la tarifa original en lugar de la reducida."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your passengers were thrilled that they were able to ride in a luxury vessel "
"after all. They insist on paying the originally offered fare as a show of "
"appreciation."
msgstr ""
"Tus pasajeros están encantados de haber podido viajar en un Yate de Lujo "
"después de todo. Insisten en pagar la tarifa originalmente ofrecida como "
"muestra de agradecimiento."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As your passengers disembark, one wealthy passenger personally thanks you "
"for taking them on a luxury vessel after all and gives you a tip amounting "
"to the difference between the original fare and what your passengers paid."
msgstr ""
"Cuando tus pasajeros desembarcan, un pasajero adinerado te agradece "
"personalmente que los hayas llevado en un Yate de Lujo después de todo y te "
"da una propina que asciende a la diferencia entre la tarifa original y lo "
"que tus pasajeros pagaron."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When it comes time to collect your fare, the passengers collectively "
"announce that they will be paying the original fare offered, since you took "
"them on a luxury vessel after all."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llega el momento de cobrar la tarifa, los pasajeros anuncian "
"colectivamente que pagarán la tarifa original ofrecida, ya que, al fin y al "
"cabo, les has llevado en un Yate de Lujo."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Several passengers are furious that you did not take them on your luxury "
"vessel class ship after all. They refuse to pay, leaving you with much less "
"overall payment."
msgstr ""
"Varios pasajeros están furiosos porque, después de todo, tu no los has "
"llevado en tu nave de clase Yate de Lujo. Se niegan a pagar, lo que te deja "
"con un pago total mucho menor."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While your passengers enjoyed the trip, they are not happy that you didn't "
"take them on your luxury vessel class ship the entire way. They refuse to "
"pay the full fare."
msgstr ""
"Aunque tus pasajeros han disfrutado del viaje, no están contentos de que no "
"los hayas llevado en tu nave de clase Yate de Lujo durante todo el trayecto. "
"Se niegan a pagar la tarifa completa."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Most of the passengers enjoyed your tour, but one particularly loud "
"passenger complains that you tricked them into paying full price even though "
"you did not take them on a luxury vessel. To calm this passenger down, you "
"offer to reduce everyone's fare. Some passengers refuse the offer, but you "
"still end up being paid much less than you otherwise would have been."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los pasajeros disfrutan de la excursión, pero un pasajero "
"especialmente ruidoso se queja de que le has engañado para que pague el "
"precio completo a pesar de que no le has llevado en un Yate de Lujo. Para "
"calmar a este pasajero, le ofreces reducir la tarifa a todos. Algunos "
"pasajeros rechazan la oferta, pero al final te pagan mucho menos de lo que "
"habrías pagado de otra manera."

#. Sightseeing Messages
msgid "The passengers are loving it."
msgstr "Los pasajeros están encantados."

msgid "The wide-eyed passengers mutter with astonishment."
msgstr "Los pasajeros, con los ojos muy abiertos, murmuran con asombro."

msgid "The passengers faces are pressed up against the windows of your ship."
msgstr "Los rostros de los pasajeros se apoyan en las ventanas de tu nave."

msgid "Everyone seems like they're having a good time."
msgstr "Parece que todo el mundo se lo está pasando bien."

msgid "A collective gasp of wonder travels through the cabin."
msgstr "Un grito colectivo de asombro recorre la cabina."

msgid ""
"A sense of awe and mystery engulfs the passengers as they contemplate their "
"existence above the skies."
msgstr ""

msgid "Truly a sight to behold for the passengers."
msgstr "Un verdadero espectáculo para los pasajeros."

#. Set mission details
msgid "Sightseeing in the {sys} System"
msgstr "Visita turística al sistema {sys}"

#. TODO should probably not just mention luxury yachts, but since they're the only luxury type ship, I guess it works for now.
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Several passengers wish to go off-world and go on a sightseeing tour. "
"Navigate to specified {amount} different attractions in the {sys} system. "
"Once done with the visit, return the passengers to {retspob} ({retsys} "
"system). Payment will be reduced if not in a preferred ship.\n"
"\n"
"#nAttractions:#0 {amount}\n"
"#nPreferred Ship:#0 luxury vessel"
msgstr ""
"Varios pasajeros desean salir del mundo y hacer un recorrido turístico. "
"Navega a {amount} diferentes atracciones especificadas en el sistema {sys}. "
"Una vez terminada la visita, devuelve a los pasajeros a {retspob} (sistema "
"{retsys}). El pago se reducirá si no se encuentra en una nave preferente.\n"
"\n"
"#nAtracciones:#0 {amount}\n"
"#nNave preferida:#0 Clase Yate de lujo"

msgid "Not Very Luxurious"
msgstr "No Muy Lujoso"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since your ship is not a luxury vessel, you will only be paid {credits}. "
"Accept the mission anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Como tu nave no es de clase Yate de Lujo, sólo se te pagarán {credits}. "
"¿Aceptar la misión de todos modos?"

msgid "Sightseeing"
msgstr "Visita turística"

msgid "Go to all indicated points"
msgstr "Ve a todos los puntos indicados"

msgid "Return to {pnt} in the {sys} system and collect your pay"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y recoge tu paga"

msgid "Sightseers"
msgstr "Visitantes"

msgid "A bunch of sightseeing civilians."
msgstr "Un grupo de visitantes de turismo."

msgid "Disappointment"
msgstr "Decepcionados"

msgid "Unexpected Bonus"
msgstr "Bonificación Inesperada"

#. Another check since the previous block could change the result
msgid "All attractions visited. Return to {pnt} and collect your pay."
msgstr "Todas las atracciones visitadas. Regresa a {pnt} y recoge tu paga."

