msgstr "Atracción"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="The Space Family">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>None</location>
#. <notes>
#. <done_evt name="Shipwreck">If you make the mistake to help Harrus</done_evt>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. This is the mission part of the shipwrecked Space Family mission, started from a random event.
#. See dat/events/neutral/shipwreck
#. --
msgid ""
"\"I know just the place,\" Harrus tells you. \"Take us to planet {pnt} in "
"the {sys} system. I'm sure a man of my calibre can find everything he needs "
"there. Captain, please notify me when we arrive.\" With that, Harrus turns "
"and rejoins his family. The kids seem in the process of redecorating (if not "
"wrecking) your quarters, and despite the apologetic glance the woman gives "
"you you can't help but wonder if you did the right thing responding to that "
"SOS."
msgstr ""
"\"Conozco el lugar adecuado\", te dice Harrus. \"Llévanos al planeta {pnt} "
"en el sistema {sys}. Estoy seguro de que un hombre de su calibre puede "
"encontrar todo lo que necesita allí. Capitán, por favor, avíseme cuando "
"lleguemos\". Con eso, Harrus se da la vuelta y se reúne con su familia. Los "
"chicos parecen estar en proceso de redecorar (si no de destrozar) tus "
"aposentos, y a pesar de la mirada de disculpa que te dedica la mujer no "
"puedes evitar preguntarte si hiciste lo correcto al responder a ese SOS."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Harrus steps out of your ship and takes a look around the spaceport you "
"docked at. \"No, no. This won't do at all,\" he says disapprovingly. \"This "
"place is a mess! Look at the dust and grime!\" He rounds on you. \"How are "
"we supposed to make a decent living in a dump like this? You've brought us "
"to the wrong place altogether. I must say I'm disappointed. I demand you "
"take us away from this abysmal hole this minute! Let's see... Yes, {pnt} in "
"{sys} will do. At least they're civilized there!\"\n"
"   You attempt to remind Harrus that it was in fact he who asked you to take "
"him to this system in the first place, and that the spaceport is hardly a "
"representation of the entire world, but the man doesn't want to hear it. He "
"stalks back into your ship without another word, leaving you annoyed and "
"frustrated. Harrus's wife worriedly peeks around the corner of the hatch, a "
"look of sympathy etched on her face.\n"
"   You heave a sigh, and proceed to the registration desk to get the docking "
"formalities out of the way."
msgstr ""
"Harrus sale de tu nave y echa un vistazo al puerto espacial en el que has "
"atracado. \"No, no. Esto no sirve para nada\", dice con desaprobación. "
"\"¡Este lugar es un desastre! Mira el polvo y la suciedad\". Se acerca a ti. "
"\"¿Cómo se supone que vamos a ganarnos la vida decentemente en un basurero "
"como éste? Nos has traído al lugar equivocado por completo. Debo decir que "
"estoy decepcionado. ¡Exijo que nos saques de este agujero abismal ahora "
"mismo! Veamos... Sí, {pnt} en {sys} servirá. ¡Al menos allí son civilizados!"
"\"\n"
"    Intentas recordarle a Harrus que fue él quien te pidió que lo llevaras a "
"este sistema en primer lugar, y que el puerto espacial no es una "
"representación del mundo entero, pero el hombre no quiere oírlo. Vuelve a "
"entrar en tu nave sin decir nada más, dejándote molesto y frustrado. La "
"esposa de Harrus se asoma preocupada por la esquina de la escotilla, con una "
"mirada de simpatía grabada en su rostro.\n"
"    Suspiras y te diriges al mostrador de registro para realizar los "
"trámites de atraque."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"The sky! Have you LOOKED at it?\"\n"
"   Harrus rounds on you with a furious expression. Your keen understanding "
"of human body language tells you he isn't happy. You thought he might be "
"satisfied with the state of the spacedock, since it's kept in prime "
"condition, and indeed he was. That changed as soon as he looked up.\n"
"   \"It's com-plete-ly the wrong colour!\" Harrus fumes. \"It's a mockery of "
"our standards of living, and it's right there overhead! Do you want my "
"children to grow up believing the sky is supposed to look like, like... like "
"THAT?\" Harrus again looks up at the heavens that offend him so. \"No, "
"Captain, my patience is at an end. I expect you to take me and my family to "
"{pnt} in the {sys} system. We've got relatives there who will take us in. I "
"will waste my time with this pointless endeavour no longer!\"\n"
"   Before you get a chance at making a snappy retort, Harrus storms back to "
"his (your) quarters, leaving you to either vent your anger on his wife, who "
"is hovering nearby, or keep it to yourself. Since the poor woman has done "
"nothing wrong, you grimly return to the bridge."
msgstr ""
"\"¡El cielo! ¿Lo has MIRADO?\"\n"
"    Harrus se acerca a ti con una expresión furiosa. Tu aguda comprensión "
"del lenguaje corporal humano te dice que no está contento. Pensabas que "
"podría estar satisfecho con el estado de la nave espacial, ya que se "
"mantiene en óptimas condiciones, y de hecho lo estaba. Eso cambió en cuanto "
"levantó la vista.\n"
"    \"¡Es un color completamente equivocado!\" Harrus se queja. \"¡Es una "
"burla a nuestro nivel de vida, y está justo ahí arriba! ¿Quieres que mis "
"hijos crezcan creyendo que el cielo debe ser como... como ESO?\" Harrus "
"vuelve a mirar al cielo que tanto le ofende. \"No, capitán, mi paciencia ha "
"llegado a su fin. Espero que nos lleve a mí y a mi familia a {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}. Tenemos parientes allí que nos acogerán. No perderé más mi "
"tiempo con este esfuerzo inútil.\"\n"
"Antes de que tengas la oportunidad de replicar, Harrus regresa a tus "
"aposentos, dejando que descargues tu ira contra su mujer, que está cerca, o "
"que te la guardes para ti. Como la pobre mujer no ha hecho nada malo, "
"vuelves al puente de mando."

#. In case no systems were found.
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. You boarded their ship, now you're stuck with them.
#. NPC telling you where to go
msgid "The Space Family"
msgstr "La Familia Especial"

msgid "A clear conscience."
msgstr "Una conciencia tranquila."

msgid ""
"A shipwrecked space family has enlisted your aid. Can you take them to "
"safety?"
msgstr ""
"Una familia espacial naufragada ha solicitado tu ayuda. ¿Puedes llevarlos a "
"un lugar seguro?"

#. First stop; subsequent stops will be handled in the land function
#. Intro text, player meets family
msgid ""
"The airlock opens, and you are greeted by a nervous-looking man, a shy "
"woman, and three neurotic children.\n"
"\"Thank god you are here,\" the man says. \"I don't know how much longer we "
"could've held out. They left us for dead, you know. No fuel, no food, and "
"only auxiliary power to sustain us.\" He then begins to incoherently tell "
"you how much his family has suffered in the past few periods, but you cut "
"him short, not willing to put up with his endless babbling.\""
msgstr ""
"La esclusa se abre y te recibe un hombre de aspecto nervioso, una mujer "
"tímida y tres niños neuróticos.\n"
"\"Gracias a Dios que estás aquí\", dice el hombre. \"No sé cuánto tiempo más "
"podríamos haber aguantado. Nos dieron por muertos. Sin combustible, sin "
"comida y sólo con energía auxiliar para mantenernos.\" A continuación, "
"comienza a contarte de forma incoherente lo mucho que ha sufrido su familia "
"en los últimos periodos, pero tú le cortas, no dispuesto a aguantar sus "
"interminables balbuceos."

msgid ""
"With a few to-the-point questions, you learn that the man's name is Harrus, "
"and that he and his wife and children live, or at least used to live, aboard "
"their trading vessel. \"It was a good life, you know,\" Harrus tells you. "
"\"You get to see the galaxy, meet people, and see planets, and all that "
"while working from home because, haha, you take your home with you!\"\n"
"You can't help but glance at Harrus's kids, who have begun enthusiastically "
"stampeding through your ship, pressing any buttons low enough for them to "
"reach, despite their mother's hopeless attempts to keep them under control."
msgstr ""
"Con unas cuantas preguntas directas, te enteras de que el hombre se llama "
"Harrus, y que él, su mujer y sus hijos viven, o al menos vivían, a bordo de "
"su nave comercial. \"Era una buena vida, sabes\", te dice Harrus. \"Puedes "
"ver la galaxia, conocer gente y ver planetas, y todo eso mientras trabajas "
"desde casa porque, jaja, ¡te llevas tu casa contigo!\"\n"
"No puedes evitar mirar a los hijos de Harrus, que han empezado a correr con "
"entusiasmo por tu nave, pulsando cualquier botón lo suficientemente bajo "
"como para que lo alcancen, a pesar de los desesperados intentos de su madre "
"por mantenerlos bajo control."

msgid ""
"Harrus is about to launch into another anecdote about his life as a trader, "
"but you manage to forestall him. You soon learn that his family's lifestyle "
"has come to an abrupt change at the hands of a minor gang of pirates. Though "
"the {plt} had some weaponry and shielding systems, the attackers were too "
"much for a single cargo ship.\n"
"\"I never thought it would end like this,\" Harrus sighs. \"I mean, I knew "
"space was dangerous, but I stayed clear of the unsafe areas. Stuck to the "
"patrolled lanes. Didn't take any risks. I've got a family, you know.\""
msgstr ""
"Harrus está a punto de lanzar otra anécdota sobre tu vida como comerciante, "
"pero consigues adelantarte a él. Pronto te enteras de que el estilo de vida "
"de su familia ha sufrido un brusco cambio a manos de una pequeña banda de "
"piratas. Aunque el {plt} tenía algunas armas y sistemas de blindaje, los "
"atacantes eran demasiado para un solo carguero.\n"
"\"Nunca pensé que acabaría así\", suspira Harrus. \"Sabía que el espacio era "
"peligroso, pero me mantuve alejado de las zonas inseguras. Me mantuve en los "
"carriles patrullados. No corrí ningún riesgo. Tengo una familia, ya sabes.\""

msgid ""
"Then Harrus brightens up, apparently putting his recent misfortune behind "
"him in the blink of an eye. \"Everything's going to be fine now,\" he says "
"cheerfully. \"We've been rescued, and all we need now is for you to take us "
"to a suitable world where we can build a new life.\"\n"
"Without further ado, and without so much as formally asking for the favour, "
"Harrus and his family proceed onto your ship and install themselves into "
"your living quarters. They do not seem about to leave."
msgstr ""
"Entonces Harrus se anima, aparentemente dejando atrás su reciente desgracia "
"en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. \"Todo va a estar bien ahora\", dice "
"alegremente. \"Hemos sido rescatados, y todo lo que necesitamos ahora es que "
"nos lleves a un mundo adecuado donde podamos construir una nueva vida.\"\n"
"Sin más preámbulos, y sin siquiera pedir formalmente el favor, Harrus y su "
"familia suben a tu nave y se instalan en tus dependencias. No parece que "
"vayan a marcharse."

#. NPC telling you where to go
msgid "Space Family"
msgstr "Familia Espacial"

msgid "A family who you rescued in space."
msgstr "Una familia que rescataste en el espacio."

msgid "Take the space family to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Lleva la familia espacial a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. Force unboard
#. We've arrived!
#. This is the last stop
msgid ""
"You land at your final stop in your quest to take the space family home, and "
"not a moment too soon, for both you and Harrus. Harrus stomps off your ship "
"without so much as a farewell, his wife and children in tow, and you are "
"just as happy to see them gone."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Surveying your now deserted quarters, you are appalled at how much damage "
"the temporary inhabitants have managed to do along the way. You console "
"yourself with the thought that at least you'll have something to do during "
"the dull periods in hyperspace and turn to tend to your ships needs, when "
"your eye falls on a small box that you don't remember seeing here before."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en tu última parada en tu búsqueda para llevar a la familia "
"espacial a casa, y no un momento demasiado pronto, tanto para ti como para "
"Harrus. Harrus abandona la nave sin despedirse, con su mujer y sus hijos a "
"cuestas, y tú te alegras de que se vayan.\n"
"    Al inspeccionar tus aposentos, ahora desiertos, te horroriza el daño que "
"los habitantes temporales han causado en el camino. Te consuelas pensando "
"que al menos tendrás algo que hacer durante los periodos aburridos en el "
"hiperespacio y te vuelves para atender las necesidades de tu nave, cuando tu "
"vista se posa en una pequeña caja que no recuerdas haber visto aquí antes."

msgid ""
"Inside the box, you find a sum of credits and a note written in neat, "
"feminine handwriting that says, \"Sorry for the trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"Dentro de la caja, encuentra una suma de créditos y una nota escrita con "
"letra femenina y pulcra que dice: \"Lo siento por las molestias.\""

#. Final message
msgid ""
"You rescued a bad-tempered man and his family who were stranded aboard their "
"ship. After a lot of annoying complaints, the man and his family finally "
"left your ship on {pnt} ({sys}), the man's wife leaving a generous payment "
"for the trouble."
msgstr ""
"Has rescatado a un hombre malhumorado y a su familia que estaban varados a "
"bordo de su nave. Tras un montón de molestas quejas, el hombre y su familia "
"finalmente abandonaron tu nave en {pnt} ({sys}), dejando la mujer del hombre "
"un generoso pago por las molestias."

msgid "Next stop"
msgstr "Siguiente parada"

msgid ""
"You are going over a routine navigation check when Harrus enters your cabin "
"unannounced. He seems to have recovered from his distressed state, and now "
"radiates confidence.\n"
"\"Captain,\" he says to you. \"I hope I don't have to remind you that we "
"must get to our destination as soon as possible. I have a wife and children "
"to think of and frankly I find your, ah, facilities a bit lacking.\""
msgstr ""
"Estáis repasando una revisión rutinaria de la navegación cuando Harrus entra "
"en tu camarote sin avisar. Parece haberse recuperado de su estado de "
"angustia y ahora irradia confianza.\n"
"\"Capitán\", te dice. \"Espero no tener que recordarle que debemos llegar a "
"nuestro destino lo antes posible. Tengo una esposa e hijos en los que pensar "
"y francamente encuentro tus, ah, facilidades un poco escasas.\""

msgid ""
"You consider ordering Harrus off your bridge, but he doesn't seem the kind "
"of man to back off, so the only thing you would accomplish is to sour the "
"mood on your ship. You inform Harrus that you're making every effort to get "
"his family to a safe haven, which seems to satisfy him. Finally alone again, "
"you take a moment to subside before completing that check."
msgstr ""
"Consideras la posibilidad de ordenar a Harrus que abandone tu puente, pero "
"no parece el tipo de hombre que se echa atrás, así que lo único que "
"conseguirías es agriar el ambiente en tu nave. Informas a Harrus de que "
"estás haciendo todo lo posible para llevar a su familia a un lugar seguro, "
"lo que parece satisfacerle. Por fin solo de nuevo, te tomas un momento para "
"tranquilizarte antes de completar esa comprobación."

msgid "A parting of ways"
msgstr "Una separación de caminos"

msgid ""
"You unceremoniously shove your passengers out of the airlock and into the "
"coldness of space. You're done playing taxi; it's time to get back to "
"important things!"
msgstr ""
"Empujas sin contemplaciones a tus pasajeros fuera de la esclusa, hacia la "
"frialdad del espacio. Ya has terminado de jugar al taxi; ¡es hora de volver "
"a las cosas importantes!"

msgid ""
"You rescued a bad-tempered man and his family who were stranded aboard their "
"ship. After a lot of annoying complaints, you dumped the family out of the "
"airlock in {sys}!"
msgstr ""
"Has rescatado a un hombre malhumorado y a su familia que estaban varados en "
"su nave. Tras un montón de molestas quejas, ¡has echado a la familia por la "
"esclusa de aire en {sys}!"

msgid ""
"You unceremoniously shove your passengers out of the airlock, leaving them "
"to their fate on this planet. You're done playing taxi; it's time to get "
"back to important things!"
msgstr ""
"Empujas sin contemplaciones a tus pasajeros fuera de la esclusa, dejándolos "
"a su suerte en este planeta. Ya has terminado de jugar al taxi; ¡es hora de "
"volver a las cosas importantes!"

msgid ""
"You rescued a bad-tempered man and his family who were stranded aboard their "
"ship. After a lot of annoying complaints, you turfed the family out on {pnt} "
"({sys})!"
msgstr ""
"Has rescatado a un hombre malhumorado y a su familia que estaban varados en "
"su nave. ¡Después de un montón de molestas quejas, ¡has echado a la familia "
"en {pnt} ({sys})!"

