"The local authoraties of the {sys} system have requested aid from the Astra "
"Vigilis guild members to help deal with increased pirate raids. Payment will "
"be per pirate ship destroyed or permanently incapacitated.\n"
"\n"
"#nReputation Gained:#0 {fct}"
msgstr ""

