msgstr ""
"Aterrizas discretamente en {spob} y eres capaz de localizar lo que parece "
"ser el laboratorio en el que tienes que entrare.\""

msgid ""
"Rerouting all ship power to sensors, you perform a scan of the surrounding "
"area and are able to find a small capsule."
