msgid ""
"The waste containers are loaded onto your ship and you are paid {credits}. "
"You begin to wonder if accepting this job was really a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Los contenedores de basura se cargan en tu nave y te paga {credits}. "
"Comienzas a preguntarte si aceptar este trabajo fue realmente una buena idea."

msgid ""
"Workers pack your cargo hold full of as much garbage as it can carry, then "
"hastily hand you a credit chip containing {credits}. Smelling the garbage, "
"you immediately regret taking the job."
msgstr ""
"Los trabajadores llenan la bodega de carga con toda la basura que pueden "
"transportar, y luego te entregan apresuradamente una ficha de crédito que "
"contiene {credits}. Al oler la basura, te arrepientes inmediatamente de "
"haber aceptado el trabajo."

msgid ""
"Your hold is crammed full with garbage and you are summarily paid {credits}. "
"By the time the overpowering stench emanating from your cargo hold reaches "
"you, it's too late to back down; you're stuck with this garbage until you "
"can find some place to get rid of it."
msgstr ""
"Tu bodega está repleta de basura y te pagan sumariamente {credits}. Cuando "
"el hedor que emana de la bodega de carga te alcanza, es demasiado tarde para "
"echarte atrás; estás atrapado con esta basura hasta que encuentres algún "
"lugar donde deshacerte de ella."

msgid "You drop the garbage off, relieved to have it out of your ship."
msgstr "Dejas la basura, aliviado de tenerla fuera de tu nave."

msgid ""
"You finally drop off the garbage and proceed to disinfect yourself and your "
"cargo hold to the best of your ability."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente dejas la basura y procedes a desinfectarte y a desinfectar la "
"bodega lo mejor posible."

msgid "Finally, the garbage leaves your ship and you breathe a sigh of relief."
msgstr "Finalmente, la basura abandona tu nave y respiras aliviado."

msgid ""
"Wrinkling your nose in disgust, you finally rid yourself of the waste "
"containers you have been charged with disposing of."
msgstr ""
"Arrugando la nariz con disgusto, te deshaces por fin de los contenedores de "
"basura de los que te han encargado que te deshagas."

msgid ""
"Sick and tired of smelling garbage, you illegally jettison the waste "
"containers into space, hoping that no one notices."
msgstr ""
"Harto de oler a basura, lanzas ilegalmente los contenedores de residuos al "
"espacio, esperando que nadie se dé cuenta."

msgid ""
"You decide that the nearest waste dump location is too far away for you to "
"bother to go to and simply jettison the containers of waste. You hope you "
"don't get caught."
msgstr ""
"Decides que el vertedero más cercano está demasiado lejos como para "
"molestarte en ir y simplemente te deshaces de los contenedores de basura. "
"Esperas que no te pillen."

msgid ""
"You dump the waste containers into space illegally, noting that you should "
"make sure not to get caught by authorities."
msgstr ""
"Viertes los contenedores de basura en el espacio de forma ilegal, teniendo "
"en cuenta que debes asegurarte de que no te pillen las autoridades."

#. List of possible waste dump planets.
#. failed to create
#. Note: this mission makes no system claims
#. Set mission details
msgid "Waste Dump"
msgstr "Vertedero de Residuos"

msgid ""
"Take as many waste containers as your ship can hold and drop them off at any "
"authorized garbage collection facility. You will be paid immediately, but "
"any attempt to illegally get rid of the waste will be severely punished if "
"you are caught."
msgstr ""
"Lleva tantos contenedores de residuos como quepan en tu nave y deposítalos "
"en cualquier instalación autorizada de recogida de basuras. Te pagarán de "
"inmediato, pero cualquier intento de deshacerte ilegalmente de los residuos "
"será severamente castigado si te pillan."

msgid "Not Enough Cargo Space"
msgstr "No hay suficiente espacio de carga"

msgid ""
"You need to actually have cargo space available to be able to accept waste "
"containers."
msgstr ""

msgid "Waste Containers Loaded"
msgstr "Contenedores de Residuos Cargados"

msgid "Waste Containers"
msgstr "Contenedores de Residuo"

msgid ""
"A bunch of waste containers leaking all sorts of indescribable liquids. You "
"hope they don't leak onto your ship."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de contenedores de residuos goteando todo tipo de líquidos "
"indescriptibles. Esperas que no se filtren en tu nave."

msgid ""
"Land on any garbage collection facility (indicated on your map) to drop off "
"the Waste Containers"
msgstr ""
"Aterriza en cualquier instalación de recogida de basura (indicada en tu "
"mapa) para dejar los Contenedores de Residuos"

msgid "No More Garbage"
msgstr "Basta de Basura"

msgid ""
"You eject your waste pods while landed at {spob} without any interference. "
"Environmentalism be damned!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In your desperation to rid yourself of the garbage, you clumsily eject it "
"from your cargo pod while you are still landed. Garbage spills all over the "
"hangar and local officials immediately take notice. After you apologize "
"profusely and explain the situation was an accident, the officials let you "
"off with a fine of {credits}."
msgstr ""
"En tu desesperación por librarte de la basura, la expulsas torpemente de tu "
"cápsula de carga cuando aún estás aterrizando. La basura se derrama por todo "
"el hangar y los funcionarios locales se dan cuenta inmediatamente. Después "
"de que te disculpes profusamente y expliques que la situación fue un "
"accidente, los funcionarios te dejan libre con una multa de {credits}."

#. it's better than dumping in an inhabited place anyway
msgid ""
"Thinking {spob} to be devoid of people, you eject your cargo pod while "
"landed. To your surprise, you find a wandering environmentalist knocking on "
"your ship airlock. You make the mistake of opening the airlock and letting "
"them in. After having to hear a tirade about how you are polluting pristine "
"locations around the galaxy, you end up paying them {credits} to leave and "
"clean up the mess you made."
msgstr ""
"Pensando que {spob} estaba desprovisto de gente, expulsas tu cápsula de "
"carga mientras aterrizas. Para tu sorpresa, encuentras a un ecologista "
"errante llamando a la esclusa de tu nave. Cometes el error de abrir la "
"esclusa y dejarle entrar. Después de escuchar una perorata sobre cómo estás "
"contaminando lugares vírgenes de la galaxia, acabas pagándoles {credits} "
"para que se vaya y limpien el desastre que has hecho."

#. Hit all the presences in the system
msgid "Dirty Deed"
msgstr "Acción Sucia"

