"to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr ""
"Pequeño envío de de de dede de\n"
"a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Small Box"
msgstr "Pequeño Caja"

msgid "Mission Accepted?"
msgstr "¿Misión Aceptada?"

msgid ""
"You try to accept the mission again, but the mission computer seems to lock "
"up. After a while, it starts spamming errors, but it seems like you somehow "
"managed to accept it."
msgstr ""
"Intentas aceptar la misión de nuevo, pero el ordenador de la misión parece "
"bloquearse. Al cabo de un rato, empieza a dar errores, pero parece que de "
"algún modo has conseguido aceptarla."

msgid ""
"You return to your ship to find a puzzled dockworker scratching their head. "
"They say it looks like the system is acting weirdly, but since it's not "
"their job to figure it out, they end up handing you a small box. You guess "
"this is the cargo you have to take to {pnt}?"
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a tu nave y te encuentras con un trabajador portuario que se está "
"rascando la cabeza. Dice que parece que el sistema está actuando de forma "
"extraña, pero como no es su trabajo averiguarlo, acaba entregándote una "
"pequeña caja. ¿Supongo que es la carga que tengo que llevar a {pnt}?"

msgid ""
"The box is sealed tight. You think you can hear a faint beeping sound "
"occasionally."
msgstr ""
"La caja está bien cerrada. Te parece oír un leve pitido de vez en cuando."

#. local variable so it happens again after loading
#. Want to allow inclusive claims
#. total animation length
#. Only clear this if they were not landed
#. Update onions
#. See if we add a new one
msgid ""
"You get off your ship with the small box in hand, and go to deliver it to "
"the spacedock cargo office. However, when you go to pull up the delivery "
"information, it seems to be missing from your computer logs. Puzzled, you "
"hand over the small box anyway, which they proceed to do the routine scan."
msgstr ""
"Bajas de tu nave con la pequeña caja en la mano y vas a entregarla a la "
"oficina de carga del muelle espacial. Sin embargo, cuando vas a buscar la "
"información de la entrega, parece que no aparece en los registros de tu "
"ordenador. Desconcertado, entregas la cajita de todos modos, que proceden a "
"escanear rutinariamente."

msgid ""
"The moment the box is scanned, the lights slightly flicker, and you hear the "
"inspector performing some improvised percussive maintenance on the scanning "
"equipment. They give a puzzled look and tell you there's an issue with the "
"system, and it might take a while to get it solved."
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que se escanea la caja, las luces parpadean ligeramente y "
"oyes al inspector realizando algún mantenimiento improvisado de percusión en "
"el equipo de escaneado. Te mira perplejo y te dice que hay un problema con "
"el sistema y que puede tardar un rato en solucionarse."

msgid "With nothing better to do, you walk around the station to kill time."
msgstr "Sin nada mejor que hacer, paseas por la estación para matar el tiempo."

msgid ""
"Suddenly, all the lights go off and all the holoscreens throughout the "
"station flash into activity.\n"
"\"How are you gentlemen?\""
msgstr ""
"De repente, todas las luces se apagan y todas las holopantallas de la "
"estación se activan.\n"
"\"¿Cómo están, caballeros?\""

msgid ""
"\"Tsk tsk tsk. Such sloppy security. You should be ashamed of yourselves. \""
msgstr ""
"\"Tsk tsk tsk. Qué seguridad tan descuidada. Debería daros vergüenza.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, look at all these finance records. Shame if something were to happen "
"to them...\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, mira todos estos registros financieros. Qué pena si les pasara algo..."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Oops, I accidentally crashed the database. They don't make them how they "
"used to. Quite a mess I'm making here. Can't be helped, I'm Ogre.\""
msgstr ""
" \" Ups, accidentalmente colgué la base de datos. Ya no las hacen como "
"antes. Menudo lío estoy montando. No se puede evitar, soy un Ogro.\""

msgid "Ogre"
msgstr "Ogro"

#. oni(_([["Anyway, it was fun crashing this place. Lots of interesting things to see. Got to get going. By the way, you guys should do something about the life control systems, it seems like they're going critical. Toodaloo〜♪."]]))--
#. Probably better to use the Toodaloo with another less script-kiddy one.
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, it was fun crashing this place. Lots of interesting things to see. "
"Got to get going. By the way, you guys should do something about the life "
"control systems, it seems like they're going critical.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, fue divertido colarme en este lugar. Muchas cosas "
"interesantes para ver. Me tengo que ir. Por cierto, deberíais hacer algo con "
"los sistemas de control de vida, parece que están en estado crítico.\""

#. Does music stuff
msgid ""
"The hologram fades and the alarms start blaring, probably indicating that "
"life control systems are critical. People begin to scramble like wild trying "
"to save themselves, and it looks like you're about to get dragged into it.\n"
"\n"
"What do you do?"
msgstr ""
"El holograma se desvanece y las alarmas empiezan a sonar, probablemente "
"indicando que los sistemas de control de vida están en estado crítico. La "
"gente empieza a revolverse como loca intentando salvarse, y parece que tú "
"estás a punto de verte arrastrado a ello.\n"
"\n"
"¿Qué haces?"

msgid "Run to your ship"
msgstr "Correr hacia tu nave"

msgid "Try to get to the station control room"
msgstr "Tratar de llegar a la sala de control de la estación"

msgid ""
"You follow the flow of people streaming towards the docks, however, the "
"sheer amount of people makes progress slow. Eventually you get stuck in the "
"hallway, with people pressing on all sides. The stench of pure fear is "
"almost unbearable, and you do your best to not suffocate."
msgstr ""
"Sigues el flujo de gente hacia los muelles, pero la cantidad de gente hace "
"que el avance sea lento. Al final te quedas atascado en el pasillo, con "
"gente apretándote por todos lados. El hedor del miedo es casi insoportable y "
"haces todo lo posible por no asfixiarte."

msgid ""
"Time seems to freeze as the yelling gets louder. You think you feel the "
"oxygen thinning, is this the end? Not going out in a bang, but in a whimper, "
"crushed by humans as the life support system fails?"
msgstr ""
"El tiempo parece congelarse mientras los gritos se hacen más fuertes. Crees "
"sentir que el oxígeno disminuye, ¿es este el final? ¿No se apagará con un "
"estallido, sino con un gemido, aplastado por los humanos al fallar el "
"sistema de soporte vital?"

msgid ""
"You try to work yourself to the centre of the station to see if you can "
"somehow solve the issue. You see people all around you trying to run towards "
"the spacedocks, bumping into you and slowing your progress. "
msgstr ""
"Intentas dirigirte hacia el centro de la estación para ver si puedes "
"resolver el problema. Ves gente a tu alrededor que intenta correr hacia las "
"muelles, chocando contigo y ralentizando tu avance. "

msgid ""
"After what seems like an eternity, you manage to make it to the station "
"terminal room. The door is wide open, and you see a frenzy of commotion "
"inside. You try to figure out what is going on, but there is only chaos. "
msgstr ""
"Después de lo que parece una eternidad, consigues llegar a la sala de la "
"terminal de la estación. La puerta está abierta de par en par y en el "
"interior reina un frenesí de conmoción. Intentas averiguar qué está pasando, "
"pero sólo hay caos. "

msgid ""
"As you struggle to make sense of the controls and what can be done, you "
"start to have a sinking feeling that it may have not been the best idea to "
"come to the control room."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te esfuerzas por entender los controles y lo que se puede hacer, "
"empiezas a tener la sensación de que quizá no haya sido la mejor idea acudir "
"a la sala de control."

msgid ""
"Suddenly, the alarm goes quiet, lights are restored, and the holograms flash "
"back into life."
msgstr ""
"De repente, la alarma se silencia, se restablecen las luces y los hologramas "
"vuelven a la vida."

msgid "\"Psyche! But seriously though, your database is toast.\""
msgstr "\"¡Era una broma! Pero en serio, tu base de datos está acabada.\""

#. Back to normal
msgid ""
"Despite the apparently reassuring message, the chaos continues for quite a "
"while. Eventually, you manage to make it back to your ship, extremely worn "
"out and tired, but at least in one piece. That so-called \"Ogre\" seems like "
"quite a pain in the ass."
msgstr ""
"A pesar del mensaje aparentemente tranquilizador, el caos continúa durante "
"un buen rato. Finalmente, consigues volver a tu nave, muy agotado y cansado, "
"pero al menos de una pieza. Ese supuesto \"Ogro\" parece ser todo un grano "
"en el culo."

msgid ""
"As you let out a big sigh, you suddenly notice you have an unnoticed "
"message. It seems like you have an anonymous transfer to your account."
msgstr ""
"Mientras dejas escapar un gran suspiro, de repente te das cuenta de que "
"tienes un mensaje que te ha pasado desapercibido. Parece que tienes una "
"transferencia anónima a tu cuenta."

msgid "Chaos on {spb}"
msgstr "Caos en {spob}"

msgid ""
"{spb} in the {sys} system devolved into chaos on {date} when a hacker who "
"identifies as 'Ogre' broke into the station control system. Local "
"authorities estimate the damages in the order of billions of credits, and "
"have issued a reward for any information that will lead to the capture of "
"the saboteur."
msgstr ""
"{spb} en el sistema {sys} se sumió en el caos el {fecha} cuando un hacker "
"que se identifica como 'Ogro' irrumpió en el sistema de control de la "
"estación. Las autoridades locales calculan los daños en miles de millones de "
"créditos y han ofrecido una recompensa por cualquier información que permita "
"capturar al saboteador."

msgid ""
"You accepted a mysterious and buggy mission from the local mission computer, "
"and delivered a package to {spb} in the {sys} system. To your dismay, this "
"triggered a hack on the station, a lot of chaos, and more stress than is "
"healthy. In the end, you got rewarded for your troubles, but you are not "
"sure it was worth it."
msgstr ""
"Has aceptado una misión misteriosa y llena de errores del ordenador de "
"misiones local y has entregado un paquete a {spb} en el sistema {sys}. Para "
"tu desgracia, esto provocó un hackeo en la estación, mucho caos y más "
"nervios de lo saludable. Al final, recibes una recompensa por tus problemas, "
"pero no estás seguro de que haya merecido la pena."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Onion Society 02">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>0</priority>
#. <chance>0</chance>
#. <location>None</location>
#. <notes>
#. <done_evt>Onion Society 02 Trigger</done_evt>
#. <campaign>Onion Society</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Onion02
#. --
msgid "Onion Delivery"
msgstr "Reparto Cebolla"

msgid "Onion's Revenge"
msgstr "Venganza de Cebolla"

#.
#. Mission States
#. 0: mission accepted
#. 1: item picked up
#. 2: landed on destspb2
#. --
#. Create the mission
#. Automatically accepted
msgid ""
"You have been tasked with picking up something from {spb1} ({sys1} system) "
"and delivering it to {spb2} ({sys2} system)."
msgstr ""
"Se te ha encargado recoger algo de {spb1} (sistema {sys1}) y entregarlo en "
"{spb2} (sistema {sys2})."

msgid "Pick up the cargo at {spb} ({sys})"
msgstr "Recoge la carga en {spb} ({sys})"

msgid "Deliver the cargo to {spb} ({sys})"
msgstr "Entregar la carga en {spb} ({sys})"

msgid ""
"You land on the {spb1} spacedock and find a puzzled dockworker holding a "
"small package outside your ship. It seems like something is confusing them, "
"but they quickly give you the package and disappear before you can answer "
"anything. Looks like they just wanted to get it over with."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en el muelle espacial {spb1} y te encuentras con un trabajador "
"portuario desconcertado que sostiene un pequeño paquete fuera de tu nave. "
"Parece que algo les confunde, pero rápidamente te dan el paquete y "
"desaparecen antes de que puedas responder nada. Parece que sólo querían "
"acabar de una vez."

msgid ""
"The box looks similar to the one you delivered to {spb}. It seems to be "
"sealed tight and emits some sort of faint beep at somewhat random intervals."
msgstr ""
"La caja es similar a la que entregaste en {spb}. Parece estar sellada "
"herméticamente y emite una especie de pitido débil a intervalos algo "
"aleatorios."

msgid "Get on your ship"
msgstr "Sube a tu nave"

msgid "Try to open the box"
msgstr "Intentar abrir la caja"

msgid ""
"You decide it's best to leave sleeping dogs lie, and take the box with you "
"to the ship. Time to head to {spb2} to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"Decides que es mejor dejar dormir al perro y te llevas la caja a la nave. Es "
"hora de ir a {spb2} para terminar el trabajo."

msgid ""
"You try to open the box by hand, but find out it's too hard to open. Looks "
"like whoever packed it really did not want it to be opened. You try to use "
"several utensils to open it, but figure there's no easy way to open it "
"without damaging it. It may be best to just get this over with. Time to head "
"to {spb2} to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"Intentas abrir la caja con la mano, pero descubres que es demasiado difícil "
"de abrir. Parece que quien la empaquetó realmente no quería que se abriera. "
"Intentas utilizar varios utensilios para abrirla, pero te das cuenta de que "
"no hay forma fácil de abrirla sin dañarla. Puede que sea mejor acabar con "
"esto de una vez. Es hora de ir a {spb2} para terminar el trabajo."

msgid "Another Small Box"
msgstr "Otra Pequeña Caja"

msgid ""
"Another suspicious box sealed tight. You think you can hear a faint beeping "
"sound occasionally."
msgstr ""
"Otra caja sospechosa sellada herméticamente. Te parece oír un leve pitido de "
"vez en cuando."

msgid ""
"You land on {spb}, however, before you can get off your ship, your "
"holoscreen flashes on."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en {spb}, sin embargo, antes de que puedas bajar de tu nave, tu "
"holopantalla se enciende."

msgid "\"How are you gentlemen?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo estas, caballero?\""

msgid "\"I haven't even got off the ship...\""
msgstr "\"Ni siquiera he bajado de la nave...\""

msgid "\"I'm not a gentleman!\""
msgstr "\"¡No soy un caballero!\""

msgid "Give out a big sigh."
msgstr "Sueltas un gran suspiro."

msgid "\"Err, is this plugged in? Wait...\""
msgstr "\"Err, ¿esto está enchufado? Espera...\""

msgid "New Onion?"
msgstr "¿Nueva cebolla?"

msgid ""
"\"And we're live!\"\n"
"They pause for emphasis."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Y estamos en directo!\"\n"
"Hace una pausa para enfatizar."

msgid ""
"\"How are you doing Ogre? Enjoying your free trial of l337 b01's script "
"kiddy's deck?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo te va Ogro? ¿Disfrutando de tu prueba gratuita de la baraja de "
"script kiddy de l337 b01?\""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, what!?! How did you!\"\n"
"You hear the sound of mashing keys on a console.\n"
"\"Shit, it's not disconnecting. What have you done?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, ¿qué? ¿Cómo lo has hecho?\"\n"
"Se oye el sonido de machacar teclas en una consola.\n"
"\"Mierda, no se desconecta. ¿Qué has hecho?\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah, to be naïve once again like our dear Ogre. It's elemental, did you not "
"care to check for back doors? Quite brave, as expected from House Dvaered\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, ser ingenuo una vez más como nuestro querido Ogro. Es elemental, ¿no "
"te importó comprobar si había puertas traseras? Bastante valiente, como se "
"esperaba de la Casa Dvaered\""

msgid "\"Shit shit shit!\""
msgstr "\"¡Mierda, mierda, mierda!\""

msgid ""
"\"So much profanity. A bit flustered are we not? But of course, we were "
"caught impersonating the Onion Society, were we not?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tanta grosería. Estamos un poco nerviosos, ¿no? Pero claro, nos han "
"pillado haciéndonos pasar por la Sociedad de la Cebolla, ¿no?\""

msgid "You hear yelling over the channel."
msgstr "Se oye gritar por el canal."

msgid ""
"\"Wow, quite noisy today. Might as well get this over with before I get "
"another headache.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vaya, qué ruidoso está hoy. Será mejor acabar con esto antes de que me dé "
"otro dolor de cabeza.\""

msgid "\"Graeme Tildor of Haldr, consider yourself peeled!\""
msgstr "\"¡Graeme Tildor de Haldr, considérate despellejado!\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah bollocks, they've run out of their room. Not a good idea. "
"notasockpuppet is going to have them for lunch. Oh well. Might as well close "
"their connection.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah cojones, se han quedado sin habitación. No es una buena idea. "
"nounamarionetacalcetin va a tenerlo para el almuerzo. Ah, bueno. Mejor le "
"cierro la conexión.\""

msgid "\"What was that?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué fue eso?\""

msgid "\"Where's Ogre?\""
msgstr "\"¿Dónde está Ogro?\""

msgid "\"Onion Society?\""
msgstr "\"¿Sociedad Cebolla?\""

msgid ""
"\"You really had no idea what you were getting dragged into, did you? I'm "
"l337 b01.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Realmente no tenías ni idea de en donde te estabas metiendo, ¿verdad? Soy "
"I337 b01.\""

#. Create a cache, unique per player
#.
#. Common stuff for the Onion Society campaign
#. --
msgid "l337 b01"
msgstr "l337 b01"

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, tl;dr, Ogre was a Dvaered stump, trying to mess with the Frontier "
"and posing as part of the Onion Society. That's a big no-no.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, tl;dr, Ogro era un ceporro Dvaered, tratando de meterse "
"con la Frontera y haciéndose pasar por parte de la Sociedad Cebolla. Eso es "
"un gran no-no.\" "

msgid ""
"\"They've been peeled, err, have had their personal information dumped on "
"the darkwebs. Quite dangerous for them. Pretty sure notasockpuppet has dealt "
"with them already. They have no tolerance for people messing with the Onion "
"Society.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Han sido despellejados, err, han tenido su información personal volcada en "
"las darkwebs. Bastante peligroso para ellos. Estoy seguro de que "
"nounamarionetacalcetin ya se ha ocupado de ellos. No toleran que la gente se "
"meta con la Sociedad Cebolla.\""

msgid ""
"\"Now all that's left is to do the opposite of what Ogre wanted to do. Jam "
"and mess with the frontier? Sounds like it's time to say hello to our "
"friends at the Dvaered mass media.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ahora sólo queda hacer lo contrario de lo que Ogro quería hacer. "
"¿Atascarse y meterse con la frontera? Parece que es hora de saludar a "
"nuestros amigos de los medios de comunicación Dvaered.\""

msgid ""
"The transmitter you're carrying should be enough for me to work with. On to "
"{spb}!\""
msgstr ""
"El transmisor que llevas debería bastarme para trabajar. ¡Vamos a {spb}!\""

msgid ""
"You have no idea what you're getting into, but it seems like you have no "
"choice now but to play along."
msgstr ""
"No tienes ni idea de dónde te estás metiendo, pero parece que ahora no te "
"queda más remedio que seguir jugando."

msgid ""
"You land on {spb} and get off your ship with the box in hand to deliver it "
"as told."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en {spb} y bajas de tu nave con la caja en la mano para entregarla "
"como te han dicho."

msgid ""
"Before you reach the drop-off point, as you are crossing the spacedocks, the "
"lights start to flicker a bit. That was fast."
msgstr ""
"Antes de llegar al punto de entrega, cuando estás cruzando los muelles "
"espaciales, las luces empiezan a parpadear un poco. Eso fue rápido."

#. TODO 8-bit news?
msgid "\"We interrupt you to bring you a recent news flash!\""
msgstr "\"¡Les interrumpimos para traerles una noticia reciente!\""

msgid ""
"\"House Dvaered economy hit a new low as {warlord1} and {warlord2} have been "
"found to be hoarding gauss guns and railguns, which will likely cause a "
"shortage across House Dvaered.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La economía de la Casa Dvaered ha alcanzado un nuevo mínimo, ya que "
"{warlord1} y {warlord2} han sido descubiertos acaparando cañones gauss y "
"cañones de riel, lo que probablemente causará una escasez a lo largo de la "
"Casa Dvaered.\""

msgid ""
"\"Supplies are forecasted to only last 10 periods as Warlords scramble to "
"supply their endless feuds. Dvaered High Command has denied the situation, "
"claiming that the free market will regulate itself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se prevé que los suministros sólo duren 10 periodos, ya que los Señores de "
"la Guerra se pelean por abastecer sus interminables feudos. El Alto Mando "
"Dvaered ha negado la situación, alegando que el libre mercado se regulará "
"solo.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"{warlord} has called the statement by Dvaered High Command, 'bollocks', "
"and threatened to fly over there themself and shell the station until it "
"becomes a ball of molten steel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{warlord} ha calificado la declaración del Alto Mando Dvaered de "
"'gilipolleces', y ha amenazado con volar ellos mismos hasta allí y "
"bombardear la estación hasta convertirla en una bola de acero fundido.\""

msgid ""
"\"Until the situation clears up, we can only recommend you to acquire as "
"many weapons as possible, and remember, don't panic. That was all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hasta que la situación se aclare, sólo podemos recomendarles que adquieran "
"tantas armas como sea posible, y recuerden, que no cunda el pánico. Eso es "
"todo.\""

msgid ""
"As expected, chaos erupts around you as everyone tries to get in their ship "
"to fly to the nearest outfitter to acquire more weapons, lest they be "
"relegated to a life of pacifism."
msgstr ""
"Como era de esperar, el caos estalla a tu alrededor mientras todo el mundo "
"intenta subir a su nave para volar al armero más cercano y adquirir más "
"armas, no sea que se vean relegados a una vida de pacifismo."

msgid ""
"You return to your ship to try to wait for things to settle down, as you "
"hear a large explosion in the distance and the station seems to tilt "
"slightly. It seems like l337 b01 really knows how to rile up the Dvaered."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a tu nave para intentar esperar a que las cosas se calmen, mientras "
"oyes una gran explosión a lo lejos y la estación parece inclinarse "
"ligeramente. Parece que I337 B01 sabe muy bien cómo provocar a los Dvaered."

msgid ""
"You are sitting at your console, overviewing the frenzy outside, when your "
"holodeck starts up."
msgstr ""
"Estás sentado en tu consola, observando el frenesí exterior, cuando tu "
"holocubierta se pone en marcha."

msgid ""
"\"Hahaha! Man, what a rush! Can't believe they made it so easy to "
"communicate with all the boar space. I would have kept going, but they "
"apparently blew up the entire DVNN mainframe to stop the transmission. What "
"barbarism! Quite effective though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Jajaja! Tío, ¡qué subidón! No puedo creer que hayan hecho tan fácil la "
"comunicación con todo el espacio jabalí. Hubiera seguido, pero por lo visto "
"volaron todo el ordenador central de RDNV para detener la transmisión. ¡Qué "
"barbaridad! Aunque bastante efectivo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Hope the boar intelligence will get the message to not mess with the Onion "
"Society. Although I worry they're too thick-headed for it to get across.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espero que la inteligencia jabalí reciba el mensaje de no meterse con la "
"Sociedad Cebolla. Aunque me preocupa que sean demasiado testarudos para que "
"les llegue.\""

msgid ""
"\"You should also learn to trust people less, that Ogre was playing you as a "
"tool. Nobody is what they seem on the grid.\""
msgstr ""
"\"También deberías aprender a confiar menos en la gente, ese Ogro estaba "
"jugando contigo como una herramienta. Nadie es lo que parece en la red.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've been looking for a hand to help me out off grid. You look like you "
"feel the job.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He estado buscando una mano que me ayude fuera de la red. Parece que te "
"gusta el trabajo.\""

msgid "\"Until we meet again. Toodaloo〜♪.\""
msgstr "\"Hasta que nos volvamos a encontrar. Toodaloo〜♪.\""

msgid ""
"The holodeck goes still, and you receive a notification of a credit transfer."
msgstr ""
"La holocubierta se queda quieta y recibes una notificación de transferencia "
"de crédito."

msgid ""
"You were entrusted by a hacker named Ogre to once again do a simple "
"delivery, however, it turned out that they were an imposter posing to be a "
"member of the Onion Society. After delivering your package, Ogre was ousted "
"to be a Dvaered spy by a member of the Onion Society called l337_b01 and "
"\"peeled\", that is, made their details publicly available, so that they got "
"promptly eliminated by other hackers. You were then sent out by l337_b01 to "
"disrupt the Dvaered Mass Media which ended in mass chaos in Dvaered space."
msgstr ""
"Un hacker llamado Ogro te encargó una vez más que hicieras una simple "
"entrega, sin embargo, resultó ser un impostor que se hacía pasar por miembro "
"de la Sociedad Cebolla. Tras entregar tu paquete, Ogro fue descubierto como "
"espía Dvaered por un miembro de la Sociedad Cebolla llamado l337_b01 y "
"\"despellejado\", es decir, hizo sus datos publicados, por lo que fue "
"rápidamente eliminado por otros hackers. A continuación, l337_b01 te envió a "
"desbaratar los medios de comunicación Dvaered, lo que terminó en un caos "
"masivo en el espacio Dvaered."

msgid "\"Do you know what you're doing?\""
msgstr "\"¿Sabes lo que estás haciendo?\""

msgid "\"You're just being used, a mere tool.\""
msgstr "\"Sólo estás siendo utilizado, una mera herramienta.\""

msgid "\"Ugh, I'm going to have to do this the hard way, ain't I.\""
msgstr "\" Uf, voy a tener que hacer esto de la manera difícil, ¿no es así.\""

msgid "\"Why does everyone have to be a pain in the ass?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué todo el mundo tiene que ser un grano en el culo?\""

msgid ""
"\"I didn't develop this software to be crapped onto by script kiddies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No desarrollé este software para que se cagaran en él los script kiddies.\""

msgid "\"Not looking forward to having to clean this up.\""
msgstr "\"No tengo ganas de tener que limpiar esto.\""

msgid "\"I've got my eyes on you, see you on {spb}.\""
msgstr "\"Tengo mis ojos puestos en ti, nos vemos en {spb}.\""

msgid "Once again an onion hologram appears before you."
msgstr "De nuevo aparece ante ti un holograma cebolla."

msgid "As soon as you receive the message, the channel cuts out."
msgstr "En cuanto recibes el mensaje, el canal se corta."

