msgid "l337_b01"
msgstr "l337_b01"

msgid "You seem to have an incoming connection from the Onion Society."
msgstr "Parece que tienes una conexión entrante de la Sociedad Cebolla."

msgid ""
"Help l337_b01 short the Empire-Dvaered Nexus connection near the {sys} "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Ayuda a l337_b01 a cortocircuitar la conexión Nexo Imperio-Dvaered cerca del "
"sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"You accept the incoming connection and a familiar hologram appears on-screen."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Hey {player}, how's it going? Anyway, enough small chat. One of my relay "
"backdoors seems to be down, and I need you to short the Empire-Dvaered "
"connection for me in {sys}. You're up for the task, right?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"What does that even mean?\""
msgstr "\"¿Pero qué significa eso?\""

msgid "\"Shouldn't you flim-flam the wurglebump?\""
msgstr "\"¿No deberías flim-flamear el wurglebump?\""

msgid "\"Count on me!\""
msgstr "\"¡Cuenta conmigo!\""

msgid "\"Maybe next time.\""
msgstr "\"Quizás la próxima vez.\""

msgid ""
"\"Flim-flam the wurglebump? Wait... I see. It all flew over your head, "
"didn't it? Cute, but you could have just said you understood nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"¿\"Flim-flam el wurglebump\"? Espera... Ya veo. Todo te pasó por alto, ¿no? "
"Lindo, pero podrías haber dicho que no entendías nada.\""

msgid ""
"\"Let me see if I can explain this for you to understand. It's quite simple, "
"actually.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Déjame ver si puedo explicártelo para que lo entiendas. Es bastante "
"simple, en realidad.\""

msgid ""
"\"You familiar with the Nexus right? It's the digital hodgepodge that "
"connects everyone together. Lets you send messages and data all over a "
"galaxy, it's how news and information gets around. Really nice to get in "
"touch with people, as long as you can afford it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Conoces el Nexo, verdad? Es el batiburrillo digital que conecta a todo el "
"mundo. Te permite enviar mensajes y datos a toda una galaxia, así es como "
"circulan las noticias y la información. Muy bueno para estar en contacto con "
"la gente, siempre que te lo puedas permitir.\""

msgid ""
"\"The only way to go faster than the speed of light and actually make the "
"Nexus possible is to use jumpgate Nexus relays, that accumulate local data, "
"and then jump through the gate to transmit it to the other side. Voilà, "
"super light speed communication.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La única forma de ir más rápido que la velocidad de la luz y hacer "
"realmente posible el Nexo es utilizar relés de Nexo de puerta de salto, que "
"acumulan datos locales, y luego saltan a través de la puerta para "
"transmitirlos al otro lado. Voilà, comunicación a velocidad superlumínica.\""

msgid ""
"\"Of course, everyone wants in with this, so naturally, unless you pay, you "
"can spend ages trying to go through a relay. And normally, you want to go "
"through more than one relay to get anywhere. Meant to connect humanity, it's "
"now just another extension of our lovely class system.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por supuesto, todo el mundo quiere entrar en esto, así que naturalmente, a "
"menos que pagues, puedes pasarte siglos intentando pasar por un relé. Y "
"normalmente, quieres pasar por más de un relé para llegar a alguna parte. "
"Pensado para conectar a la humanidad, ahora no es más que otra extensión de "
"nuestro encantador sistema de clases.\""

msgid ""
"\"That's the explanation for normal people anyway, Onion Society doesn't "
"really play by the rules, and we just short the relays to communicate with "
"everyone, all the time, as it should be. In practice, it's not that pretty "
"though. Poorly maintained hardware is constantly failing, and nobody seems "
"to give a rat's ass about reliability these days.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esa es la explicación para la gente normal de todos modos, la Sociedad "
"Cebolla realmente no juega con las reglas, y nosotros sólo cortocircuitamos "
"los relés para comunicarnos con todo el mundo, todo el tiempo, como debe "
"ser. Sin embargo, en la práctica no es tan bonito. El hardware mal mantenido "
"falla constantemente, y a nadie parece importarle una mierda la fiabilidad "
"hoy en día.\""

msgid ""
"\"An Onion Society conclave is coming up in the Nexus, and just my bad luck, "
"the Empire-Dvaered connection seems to have had some critical hardware "
"repaired. I need you to be my hands in the, er, non-digital realm, and help "
"me short it so that all is good and information flows free.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se acerca un cónclave de la Sociedad Cebolla en el Nexo, y para mi mala "
"suerte, parece que la conexión Imperio-Dvaered ha sido reparada en algún "
"hardware crítico. Necesito que seas mis manos en el, er, reino no digital, y "
"me ayudes a cortocircuitarlo para que todo vaya bien y la información fluya "
"libremente.\""

msgid "\"Should be an easy job in the {sys} system. You in?\""
msgstr "\"Debería ser un trabajo fácil en el sistema {sys}. ¿Te apuntas?\""

msgid "Accept the job."
msgstr "Aceptar el trabajo."

msgid "Decline for now."
msgstr "Declinar por ahora."

msgid "You decline the work for now, and the hologram fades away."
msgstr "Rechaza el trabajo por ahora y el holograma se desvanece."

msgid ""
"\"I've hooked up into your ship, so you don't have to worry about anything, "
"just get me close and I'll jump through your ship systems. I should have "
"enough bandwidth for that. Anyway, head to {spob} in the {sys} system, and "
"we can fix this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me he conectado a tu nave, así que no tienes que preocuparte de nada, sólo "
"acércame y saltaré a través de los sistemas de tu nave. Debería tener "
"suficiente ancho de banda para eso. De todos modos, dirígete a {spob} en el "
"sistema {sys}, y podremos arreglar esto.\""

msgid ""
"You land and immediately l337_b01's hologram appears on your ship console."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas e inmediatamente aparece el holograma de l337_b01 en la consola de "
"tu nave."

msgid ""
"\"Time to get to work. Let's see, let's see.\"\n"
"You hear some clacking noises, but you have no idea what's going on as you "
"only see l337_b01's avatar."
msgstr ""
"\"Hora de ponerse a trabajar. A ver, a ver.\"\n"
"Oyes unos ruidos de tecleo, pero no tienes ni idea de lo que está pasando, "
"ya que sólo ves el avatar de l337_b01."

msgid ""
"\"Mmmm, I see. Seems like the relay has been replaced. Most of the relays in "
"Empire space are controlled by Nexus Shipyards. Going to have to check their "
"databases. One second.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mmmm, ya veo. Parece que el relé ha sido reemplazado. La mayoría de los "
"relés en el espacio Imperio están controlados por los Astilleros Nexo. Voy a "
"tener que comprobar sus bases de datos. Un segundo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Humph. Looks like there's some mistake in the logs. Shoddy job as always. "
"Can't say I blame them, Empire seems to just add more and more paperwork "
"that nobody knows how to fill.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Humph. Parece que hay algún error en los registros. Un trabajo chapucero, "
"como siempre. No puedo decir que les culpe, Imperio parece añadir más y más "
"papeleo que nadie sabe cómo rellenar.\""

msgid ""
"\"Looks like we are going to have to do some field work. If you can get near "
"the jump to the {sys} system, I can try to override the relay. Might be "
"trouble though. They don't take kindly to sabotage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que vamos a tener que hacer algo de trabajo de campo. Si puedes "
"acercarte al salto al sistema {sys}, puedo intentar anular el relé. Aunque "
"podría haber problemas. No les gusta el sabotaje.\""

msgid "Head to the jump to {sys2} in the {sys1} system"
msgstr "Dirígete al salto a {sys2} en el sistema {sys1}"

msgid "Establish communication with l337_b01?"
msgstr "¿Establecer comunicación con l337_b01?"

msgid ""
"l337_b01: \"head over to the jump, there should be a relay buoy there.\""
msgstr "l337_b01: \"dirígete al salto, debería haber una boya de relé allí.\""

#. Nexus ships
#. hawking, pacifier, admonisher, lancelot, shark
#. Don't save, as we saved before this event started
#. off we go
#. restore save flag
msgid "Nexus IT"
msgstr "IT Nexus"

#. Ambush set up
#. Took weapon fire when taking off, be kinder if they hacked
#. Don't let the player land until they jump out
#. Small patrol fleet to annoy the player
#. Clear up
#. has the cargo
msgid "Nexus {ship}"
msgstr "{ship} Nexus"

#. Give a message if new enemies coming in
msgid "l337_b01: \"jump signal detected!\""
msgstr "l337_b01: \"¡señal de salto detectada!\""

#. no more spawning
#. get rid of pilots
msgid "l337_b01 pops up on your system console."
msgstr "l337_b01 aparece en la consola del sistema."

msgid ""
"\"OK, time to do a scan. Yup, there's the scanner. Let's see if it's "
"configured like the late models... root root.\""
msgstr ""
"\"OK, hora de hacer un escaneo. Sí, ahí está el escáner. Veamos si está "
"configurado como los últimos modelos... root root.\""

msgid ""
"\"Nope? Mmmm, let's see admin 1234. Also, nope. High-tech security we have "
"here. Humph, time to pull a dictionary attack. Whelp, looks like they tried "
"to introduce some shorting countermeasures. It's going to take me some time "
"to crack the relay.\""
msgstr ""
"¿\"No\"? Mmmm, veamos admin 1234. Tampoco. Alta tecnología de seguridad "
"tenemos aquí. Humph, hora de hacer un ataque de diccionario. Parece que "
"intentaron introducir algunas contramedidas de cortocircuito. Me va a llevar "
"algún tiempo descifrar el relé.\""

msgid ""
"\"Hate to bubble your boat, but, looks like some incoming Nexus tech support "
"crew. Looks like it's your time to shine. Stay within {dist} {dstunit} of "
"the jump!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Odiaoria hundir tu nave, pero, parece que llega un equipo de soporte "
"técnico de Nexus. Parece que es tu momento de brillar. ¡Mantente a {dist} "
"{dstunit} del salto!\""

msgid "Looks like it's time to show what {shipname} is capable of!"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que ha llegado el momento de demostrar de lo que es capaz {shipname}!"

#. Set up variables
#. 2.5 minutes
msgid "You strayed too far from the jump!"
msgstr "¡Te distanciaste demasiado del salto!"

msgid "You won?"
msgstr "¿Ganaste?"

msgid "l337_b01: \"Done! Wait, why isn't it working.\""
msgstr "l337_b01: \"¡Terminado! Espera, ¿por qué no funciona?\""

msgid ""
"Defend the Jump\n"
"Distance: {d} {dunit}\n"
"Time left: {left:.1f}"
msgstr ""
"Defender el Salto\n"
"Distancia: {d} {dunit}\n"
"Tiempo que queda: {left:.1f}"

msgid "Nexus RTFM"
msgstr "RTFM Nexus"

msgid "l337_b01: \"Another? Incoming jump signal. It's large!\""
msgstr "l337_b01: \"¿Otra? Señal de salto entrante. ¡Es grande!\""

msgid "l337_b01: \"That's the cause! Take down the {shipname}!\""
msgstr "l337_b01: \"¡Esa es la causa! ¡Destruye la nave {shipname}!\""

msgid "Defeat the {shipname}"
msgstr "Derrota a {shipname}"

#. Make all the enemies go away
msgid "An easily recognizable hologram pops up."
msgstr "Aparece un holograma fácil de reconocer."

msgid ""
"\"Man, you make it look so easy. Sorry I wasn't able to lend a hand, "
"bandwidth is still at a premium.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tío, haces que parezca tan fácil. Siento no haber podido echar una mano, "
"el ancho de banda sigue siendo escaso.\""

msgid ""
"\"With the destruction of {shipname}, I've created enough issues and bugs on "
"their internal trackers that they'll probably never notice the relay got "
"shorted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Con la destrucción de {shipname}, he creado suficientes problemas y fallos "
"en sus rastreadores internos que probablemente nunca se darán cuenta de que "
"el relé se cortocircuitó.\""

msgid ""
"\"The relay connection looks stable, however, it's best to not use bandwidth "
"out in open space. Too easy to track. Try landing somewhere, so I can mask "
"the communication bandwidth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La conexión de relé parece estable, sin embargo, es mejor no utilizar el "
"ancho de banda en espacios abiertos. Demasiado fácil de rastrear. Intenta "
"aterrizar en algún lugar, así puedo enmascarar el ancho de banda de "
"comunicación.\""

msgid "Land and talk communicate with l337_b01"
msgstr "Aterriza y habla con l337_b01"

#. spawn again
msgid "Before you board {shipname}, l337_b01's hologram pops up."
msgstr "Antes de embarcar en {shipname}, aparece el holograma de l337_b01."

msgid ""
"\"Got to say that was some incredible flying. Not that often you see a "
"{shipclass}-class ship's systems fried like that. So exciting I kept a video "
"recording.\""
msgstr ""
"\" Tengo que decir que fue un vuelo increíble. No es frecuente ver los "
"sistemas de una nave de clase {shipclass} fritos de esa manera. Fue tan "
"emocionante que grabé un video.\""

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, no need to worry more about {shipname} and the relay! With their "
"ship disabled and the firewall down, I was able to pick clean their main "
"data.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡De todos modos, no hay necesidad de preocuparse más por {shipname} y el "
"relé! Con su nave inutilizada y el cortafuegos caído, he podido recoger sus "
"datos principales.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've sent some anonymous tips to Nexus Shipyards HQ about the captain and "
"some irregularities, and they'll be fired and maybe even tried for treason. "
"The commotion will make it, so nobody will realize the relay was shorted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He enviado algunas pistas anónimas al Cuartel General de los Astilleros "
"Nexus sobre el capitán y algunas irregularidades, y serán despedidos y puede "
"que incluso juzgados por traición. El revuelo lo hará, así nadie se dará "
"cuenta de que el relé estaba en cortocircuito.\""

#. Others run away
#. Disable pilot permanently
#. spawn again
#. Mission end cutscene
msgid "You open up a channel with l337_b01."
msgstr "Abres un canal con l337_b01."

msgid ""
"\"Hey, I was benchmarking the relay connection, and it seems to be running "
"quite smoothly. Not even hitting a packet loss of 20%! Seems like Nexus "
"Shipyards has finally stepped up their hardware game.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, he estado comparando la conexión de retransmisión y parece que "
"funciona bastante bien. Ni siquiera llega a una pérdida de paquetes del 20%. "
"Parece que los Astilleros Nexus por fin han mejorado su hardware.\""

msgid ""
"\"With this, the Onion Society conclave should go without a hitch.\"\n"
"There is a slight pause.\n"
"\"Say, you want in?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Con esto, el cónclave de la Sociedad Cebolla debería transcurrir sin "
"problemas\".\n"
"Hay una ligera pausa.\n"
"\"Dime, ¿quieres unirte?\""

msgid ""
"You're not sure what happens, but before you can give a proper answer, "
"l337_b01 manages to drag you into participating."
msgstr ""
"No estás seguro de lo que ocurre, pero antes de que puedas dar una respuesta "
"adecuada, l337_b01 consigue involucrarte."

msgid ""
"\"Just remember, don't give any personal or identifying information, don't "
"encourage lonewolf4's antics, don't talk to notasockpuppet, wait, in fact, "
"it's probably better for you not to talk at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sólo recuerda, no des ninguna información personal o de identificación, no "
"alientes las payasadas de lobosolitario4, no hables con "
"nounamarionetacalcetín, espera, mejor no hables en absoluto.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, I'll just hook you up to a read-only feed with a default avatar. "
"That should probably work. Weirder things have gone on in the past.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, te conectaré a un feed de sólo lectura con un avatar por defecto. "
"Probablemente funcione. Cosas más raras se han visto.\""

msgid "\"Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"¿Estás preparado?\""

msgid "\"So about the Onion Society conclave, you ready?\""
msgstr "\"Acerca del cónclave de la Sociedad Cebolla, ¿estás listo?\""

msgid "\"Hell yes!\""
msgstr "\"¡Claro que sí!\""

msgid "\"Not yet.\""
msgstr "\"Todavía no.\""

msgid ""
"You say you need to prepare. l337_b01 seems to understand and tells you to "
"come back when you're ready for the Onion Society conclave."
msgstr ""
"Dices que necesitas prepararte. l337_b01 parece entender y te dice que "
"vuelvas cuando estés listo para el cónclave de la Sociedad Cebolla."

msgid ""
"\"{playername}, get strapped in, we're headed to the Nexus!\"\n"
"\n"
"Quite a fancy way of referring to connecting into a full sensorial holodeck."
msgstr ""
"\"{playername}, ponte el cinturón, ¡nos dirigimos al Nexo!\"\n"
"\n"
"Una forma bastante elegante de referirse a conectarse a una holocubierta "
"sensorial completa."

msgid ""
"The world lurches around you, and you are plunged into the Nexus. Ugh, "
"that's not a pleasant feeling."
msgstr ""
"El mundo se tambalea a tu alrededor y te sumerges en el Nexo. Uf, no es una "
"sensación agradable."

msgid "\"How are you feeling? Isn't it great? Nothing like home sweet home.\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo te sientes? ¿No es genial? Nada como el hogar dulce hogar.\""

msgid "\"I feel sick.\""
msgstr "\"Me siento enfermo.\""

msgid "\"Home?\""
msgstr "\"¿Casa?\""

msgid "\"Isn't this very empty?\""
msgstr "\"¿No está esto muy vacío?\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah, the good old Nexus syndrome. You'll get used to it, and after a while, "
"you'll look forward to it. It's not that bad.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, el viejo síndrome Nexo. Te acostumbrarás y, al cabo de un tiempo, te "
"hará ilusión. No es tan malo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Well I, erhm, spend way more time here than not. You can do anything you "
"want here, unburdened from physical shackles. The body is the tomb of the "
"mind, but you're free of your tomb in here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno yo, em, paso mucho más tiempo aquí que no. Aquí puedes hacer lo que "
"quieras, sin ataduras físicas. ¡El cuerpo es la tumba de la mente, pero aquí "
"eres libre de tu tumba!\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah, yeah, it only seems empty to you because you don't have developer mode "
"on, I wouldn't recommend it at first. It's usually too much information and "
"can cause your last meal to find its way out your mouth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, sí, sólo te parece vacío porque no tienes activado el modo "
"desarrollador, no te lo recomendaría al principio. Suele ser demasiada "
"información y puede hacer que tu última comida salga por tu boca.Z"

msgid ""
"\"The Nexus habitat was originally designed by pure speculative greed. With "
"normal goods and services, you have to do something right? However, if it's "
"all digital, then there are no limits, and the gears of capitalism can go "
"full speed. That's why it's so big and spacious.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El hábitat Nexus fue diseñado originalmente por pura codicia especulativa. "
"Con bienes y servicios normales, hay que hacer algo, ¿no? Sin embargo, si "
"todo es digital, entonces no hay límites, y los engranajes del capitalismo "
"pueden ir a toda velocidad. Por eso es tan grande y espacioso.\""

msgid ""
"\"Of course, you can guess it didn't turn out as they expected. Ended up as "
"abandonware, only recently was it rediscovered, and after a few deca-period "
"hacking sessions, we got some prototype running and onboard came the Onion "
"Society.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por supuesto, puedes suponer que no salió como esperaban. Terminó como "
"abandonware, sólo recientemente fue redescubierto, y después de unas cuantas "
"sesiones de decaperiodos de hacking, conseguimos un prototipo funcionando y "
"a bordo vino la Sociedad de Cebolla.\""

msgid ""
"\"The codebase is humongous too, you can even find mix of paradigms, it's a "
"true software archaeologists dream come true!\""
msgstr ""
"\" El código base también es enorme, incluso se pueden encontrar mezclas de "
"paradigmas, ¡es un auténtico sueño hecho realidad para los arqueólogos del "
"software!\""

msgid ""
"\"Did I tell you about the time... wait, we don't have time for this right "
"now. Before we head off to the conclave, I wanted to meet up with Trixie "
"first. They should be here anytime soon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Te he dicho lo de la hora... espera, ahora no tenemos tiempo para esto. "
"Antes de ir al cónclave, quería reunirme con Trixie primero. Debería estar a "
"punto llegar.\""

msgid "\"Trixie always appears on time, never late, nor early!\""
msgstr "\"¡Trixie siempre aparece a tiempo, nunca llega tarde, ni temprano!\""

msgid ""
"\"Hey! Impeccable timing, as usual. Did you get the cat video I sent you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola! Impecable puntualidad, como siempre. ¿Recibiste el video del gato "
"que te envié?\""

msgid ""
"\"It was entertaining as always. Cats never cease to amuse with their antics."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Fue entretenido como siempre. Los gatos nunca dejan de divertir con sus "
"travesuras.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, this is... mmmmm... darkkazoo.\"\n"
"They gesture towards you."
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, este es... mmmmm... zooscuro.\"\n"
"Te señalan."

msgid "...!"
msgstr "¡...!"

msgid "... .. ..."
msgstr "... .. ..."

msgid "\"Ah, yes. Forgot the read-only mode. Oh well, it shouldn't be long.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, sí. Olvidé el modo de sólo lectura. Oh bien, no debería llevar mucho "
"tiempo.\""

msgid "\"darkkazoo, that's a curious name. Quite ominous.\""
msgstr "\"zooscuro, es un nombre curioso. Bastante siniestro.\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks! Before I forget, let me wire you the files I promised. Opening "
"secure channel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias! Antes de que se me olvide, déjame enviarte los archivos que te "
"prometí. Abriendo canal seguro.\""

msgid "\"One sec... ... ...there, got it, thanks!\""
msgstr "\"Un segundo... ... ... ya está, lo tengo, ¡gracias!\""

msgid ""
"\"I see, so Ogre wasn't the one we were looking for. Just another fraud. "
"Seems to be many these days.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo, así que Ogro no era el que buscábamos. Sólo otro fraude. Parece "
"que hay muchos en estos días.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, taught them a lesson though. Could be someone closer, maybe in the "
"inner circle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, aunque le di una lección. Podría ser alguien más cercano, tal vez en "
"el círculo íntimo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Not something we can rule out yet. Wait... How much does darkkazoo know? "
"Are they to be trusted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No es algo que podamos descartar todavía. Espera... ¿Cuánto sabe zooscuro? "
"¿Es de fiar?\""

msgid ""
"\"They've proven their worth, but I haven't explained it yet. Just wanted to "
"drag them along a bit for now, see if we could get a better 3rd party "
"opinion. Us Nexus dwellers tend to be a bit of an echo chamber.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ha demostrado su valía, pero aún no se lo he explicado. Sólo quería "
"arrastrarlo un poco por ahora, mira si podemos conseguir una mejor opinión "
"de un tercero. Los habitantes del Nexo tendemos a ser un poco cámara de eco."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"You and your wild ideas. You should be more careful, for all we know, "
"darkkazoo could be one of them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tú y tus ideas descabelladas. Deberías tener más cuidado, por lo que "
"sabemos, zooscuro podría ser uno de ellos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Come on, life is too short to be stuck in an ivory tower all day! Anyway, "
"we've got to hurry, the conclave is going to start soon, and we should get "
"there to set up some protection before it starts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Vamos, la vida es demasiado corta para estar todo el día metido en una "
"torre de marfil! De todas formas, tenemos que darnos prisa, el cónclave va a "
"empezar pronto, y deberíamos llegar allí para establecer alguna protección "
"antes de que empiece.\""

msgid ""
"\"Um, darkkazoo, remember what I told you? Just watch, and try not to stick "
"your neck out, or it'll get chopped away. I'll be lifting you in my seal, so "
"unless someone pries too hard, you should be mainly out of sight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Um, zooscuro, ¿recuerdas lo que te dije? Sólo mira, y trata de no estirar "
"el cuello, o te lo cortarán. Te pondré en mi sello, así que a menos que "
"alguien se fije mucho, deberías pasar desapercibido.\""

msgid "\"Wait, let me make some adjustments.\""
msgstr "\"Espera, déjame hacer algunos ajustes.\""

msgid ""
"You notice the world, including l337_b01 and Trixie, seems to get larger "
"around you. Wait no, you're just getting smaller. Eventually you become a "
"small enough so that l337_b01 grabs you and puts you on their shoulder. You "
"can't seem to move much, but at least you get a good view of things."
msgstr ""
"Notas que el mundo, incluidos l337_b01 y Trixie, parece agrandarse a tu "
"alrededor. Espera no, sólo te haces más pequeño. Finalmente te vuelves lo "
"suficientemente pequeño como para que l337_b01 te agarre y te ponga sobre su "
"hombro. Parece que no puedes moverte mucho, pero al menos tienes una buena "
"vista de las cosas."

msgid "\"Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"¡Vamos!\""

msgid ""
"The world lurches once again, although this time it feels slightly duller "
"than before.\n"
"\n"
"You find yourself in a seemingly infinite field full of odd looking avatars. "
"Is that a sock?"
msgstr ""
"El mundo se tambalea una vez más, aunque esta vez resulta algo más aburrido "
"que antes.\n"
"\n"
"Te encuentras en un campo aparentemente infinito lleno de avatares de "
"aspecto extraño. ¿Es eso un calcetín?"

msgid ""
"\"...and then wanting to see some fireworks, I rerouted the offensive "
"firewalls to each other. The recursion was beautiful until the mainframe "
"dropped.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...y luego queriendo ver algunos fuegos artificiales, redireccioné los "
"firewalls ofensivos entre sí. La recursión fue hermosa hasta que el "
"ordenador central se cayó.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah, fellow technomancers, it seems like l337_b01 and Trixie have graced us "
"with their presence. We are all here for today's Conclave. Let us blur the "
"limits of possibility!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, compañeros tecnomantes, parece que l337_b01 y Trixie nos han honrado "
"con su presencia. Estamos todos aquí para el Cónclave de hoy. ¡Desdibujemos "
"los límites de la posibilidad!\""

msgid ""
"\"Always so grandiose lonewolf4. You managed to get a stable connection this "
"time?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Siempre tan grandioso lobosolitario4. ¿Has conseguido una conexión estable "
"esta vez?\""

msgid ""
"\"Why of course, I spare no expense on bandwidth to be together on such a "
"glorious occasion!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Por supuesto, no escatimo en gastos de ancho de banda para estar juntos "
"en una ocasión tan gloriosa!\""

msgid ""
"\"What's so glorious? Another fraud getting ousted? The relays are "
"languishing, mmmm.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué es tan glorioso? ¿Otro fraude pillado? Los relés languidecen, mmmm.\""

msgid ""
"\"If you're low on bandwidth, I could take some of your puppets off your "
"hand. Ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si tienes poco ancho de banda, podría quitarte algunas marionetas de la "
"mano. ¡Ja, ja!\""

msgid ""
"\"You complain, yet your puppets took down the peeled Ogre in less than a "
"period!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Te quejas, y sin embargo tus marionetas derribaron al Ogro despellejado "
"en menos que canta un gallo!\""

msgid ""
"notasockpuppet lets out a sigh.\n"
"\"It's easy for you sproutlings to make with scraps, you never knew the true "
"Nexus, before the Incident. We're lucky to see 5% of the bandwidth on a good "
"cycle!\""
msgstr ""
"nounamarionetacalcetín deja escapar un suspiro.\n"
"\"Es fácil para vosotros, retoños, haceros con las sobras, nunca conocisteis "
"el verdadero Nexus, antes del Incidente. ¡Tenemos suerte de ver el 5% del "
"ancho de banda en un buen ciclo!\""

msgid "\"Aaah, ah. There you go again. Get used to it already.\""
msgstr "\"Aaah, ah. Ya estás otra vez. Acostúmbrate ya.\""

msgid ""
"\"Tales of yore are naught but echoes in the digital void. The codes of "
"legend are naught forgotten, but at hand are the new dragons of our time. We "
"must cast aside the relics of the past and focus on the codes of the future."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los cuentos de antaño no son más que ecos en el vacío digital. Los códigos "
"de la leyenda no se han olvidado, pero están al alcance de la mano nuevos "
"dragones de nuestro tiempo. Debemos dejar a un lado las reliquias del pasado "
"y centrarnos en los códigos del futuro.\""

msgid ""
"While the others are talking, you notice that DOG seems to stare at you. "
"Have they figured you out? Either way, they seem to be intent on keeping "
"their thoughts to themselves."
msgstr ""
"Mientras los demás hablan, notas que DOG parece mirarte fijamente. ¿Te habrá "
"descubierto? En cualquier caso, parece que se guardan sus pensamientos para "
"sí mismos."

msgid ""
"\"lonewolf4 is right, we're not here to hear ramblings. There seems to be "
"some dark motion, dragons if you want to call them that, going on.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Yes, the packets are behaving abnormally.\""
msgstr "\"Sí, los paquetes se comportan anormalmente.\""

msgid ""
"\"Are you sure this isn't just Nexus Shipyards new relay models? They seem "
"to be running some weird firmware.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Estás seguro de que no son sólo los nuevos modelos de relés de los "
"Astilleros Nexus? Parecen tener un firmware extraño.\""

msgid "\"Unlikely, but not impossible.\""
msgstr "\"Improbable, pero no imposible.\""

msgid ""
"\"The Great Houses are bickering. It seems like the post-Incident peace is "
"coming to its end. My puppets are restless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las Grandes Casas están discutiendo. Parece que la paz post-Incidente está "
"llegando a su fin. Mis marionetas están inquietas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Meh, they're always bickering. Tell your puppets to calm down. We don't "
"want to make a scene.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Meh, siempre están discutiendo. Dile a tus marionetas que se calmen. No "
"queremos montar una escena.\""

msgid ""
"\"I hope it isn't anything worse. It's much harder to maintain these real-"
"time conversations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espero que no sea nada más grave. Es mucho más difícil mantener estas "
"conversaciones en tiempo real.\""

msgid ""
"\"The winds of fate are beginning to howl. We must play our cards wisely, "
"lest another rupture tears us apart. The fairies whisper of treason among "
"the ranks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los vientos del destino empiezan a aullar. Debemos jugar nuestras cartas "
"sabiamente, no sea que otra ruptura nos separe. Las hadas susurran traición "
"entre las filas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ha ha. Quite strong accusations. What do you think DOG? Is your connection "
"holding up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ja, ja. Acusaciones bastante fuertes. ¿Qué te parece DOG? ¿Se mantiene tu "
"conexión?.\""

msgid "\"It is.\""
msgstr "\"Lo es.\""

msgid "\"Such a way with words. As talkative as usual.\""
msgstr "\"Qué facilidad de palabra. Tan hablador como siempre.\""

msgid ""
"\"lonewolf4 is just playing his usual mind games. Always has to imagine "
"we're in some sort of great fantasy novel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"lobosolitario4 está jugando sus juegos mentales habituales. Siempre tiene "
"que imaginar que estamos en una especie de gran novela de fantasía.\""

msgid ""
"\"The signs are all there, yet the cobwebs of your own ineptitude cloud your "
"vision.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las señales están todas ahí, pero las telarañas de tu propia ineptitud "
"nublan tu visión.\""

msgid "\"U wot m4\""
msgstr "\"U wot m4\""

msgid ""
"lonewolf4 flickers briefly\n"
"\"Mortem Tenebrae Obscuritas Infernalis!\""
msgstr ""
"lobosolitario4 parpadea brevemente\n"
"\"¡Mortem Tenebrae Obscuritas Infernalis!\""

msgid "\"Bring it on!\""
msgstr "\"¡Adelante!\""

msgid ""
"Trixie and l337_b01 seem to mutter something and take cover as lonewolf4 and "
"underworlder seems to be engaging in some sort of digital combat. You can't "
"really follow what is going on, and all you can see are some rendering "
"glitches as the two run around each other."
msgstr ""
"Trixie y l337_b01 parecen murmurar algo y se ponen a cubierto mientras "
"lobosolitario4 y submundor parecen enzarzarse en una especie de combate "
"digital. En realidad no se puede seguir lo que está pasando, y todo lo que "
"se puede ver son algunos fallos de renderizado mientras los dos corren uno "
"alrededor del otro."

msgid "\"Exanimo Umbra Obscura Tenebrarum!\""
msgstr "\"¡Exanimo Umbra Obscura Tenebrarum!\""

msgid "underworlder seems to freeze in place."
msgstr "submundor parece quedarse inmóvil en su sitio."

msgid "\"Down.\""
msgstr "\"Caido.\""

#. easeOutElastic
msgid "Suddenly lonewolf4 and underworlder are splatted prone on the ground."
msgstr "De repente lobosolitario4 y submundor quedan desplomados en el suelo."

msgid "\"Screw this.\", underworlder gasps before flickering out of existence."
msgstr "\"Al diablo con esto\", jadea submundor antes de desaparecer."

msgid ""
"lonewolf4 stands up and seems to brush non-existent dust off their clothes.\n"
"\"Humph, such a vulgar character.\"\n"
"They seem much lower resolution than before."
msgstr ""
"lobosolitario4 se levanta y parece quitarse el polvo inexistente de la "
"ropa.\n"
"\"Humph, qué carácter tan vulgar\".\n"
"Parecen mucho menos resolutivos que antes."

msgid ""
"They flash a glare at notasockpuppet before fading out of existence too. "
"What happened?"
msgstr ""
"Dirige una mirada fulminante a nounamarionetacalcetín antes de desvanecerse "
"también. ¿Qué ha ocurrido?"

msgid ""
"\"Seems like today's conclave is at an end. Amusing as always, but short.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que el cónclave de hoy ha llegado a su fin. Divertido como siempre, "
"pero corto.\""

msgid "DOG abruptly flashes out of existence."
msgstr "DOG desaparece abruptamente."

msgid "Trixie lets out a sigh."
msgstr "Trixie deja escapar un suspiro."

msgid "The world warps abruptly."
msgstr "El mundo se distorsiona bruscamente."

msgid ""
"\"Better off in a new channel, too many zombie processes in the last one.\""
msgstr "\"Mejor en un nuevo canal, demasiados procesos zombis en el último.\""

msgid "\"Ugh, lonewolf4 might have hit the nail on the head.\""
msgstr "\"Uf, lobosolitario4 podría haber dado en el clavo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Maybe, but it's not like everyone is rowing on the same boat anyway. I "
"thought the only reason the Onion Society existed was sort of keeping "
"everyone from everyone's throats.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tal vez, pero no es como si todo el mundo estuviera remando juntos en el "
"mismo barco. Pensaba que la única razón por la que existía la Sociedad "
"Cebolla era para mantener a todo el mundo lejos de las gargantas de los "
"demás.\""

msgid "\"And yet, everyone is one step away from bloodshed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Y, sin embargo, todo el mundo está a un paso del derramamiento de sangre.\""

msgid ""
"They pick you up and put you on the floor.\n"
"\"Almost forgot.\""
msgstr ""
"Te levanta y te pone en el suelo.\n"
"\"Casi me olvido.\""

msgid "Slowly everything gets smaller until you are back to normal size."
msgstr ""
"Poco a poco todo se hace más pequeño hasta que vuelves a tu tamaño normal."

msgid "\"Go on, you can talk now. I'm sure you have questions.\""
msgstr "\"Vamos, ya puedes hablar. Seguro que tienes preguntas.\""

msgid "\"Technomancers?\""
msgstr "\"¿Tecnomantes?\""

msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué ocurrió?\""

msgid "\"Who were they?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quiénes eran ellos?\""

msgid "\"Is it always like that?\""
msgstr "\"¿Es siempre así?\""

msgid "\"What are you going to do now?\" (continue)"
msgstr "\"¿Qué vas a hacer ahora?\" (continuar)"

msgid ""
"\"Yet another bickering conclave. The conclaves are meant to keep people off "
"each other's toes and share weaknesses and strengths of the network, but "
"everyone is just always on the edge lately.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Otro cónclave de discusiones. Los cónclaves están pensados para mantener a "
"la gente alejada de los demás y compartir las debilidades y fortalezas de la "
"red, pero últimamente todo el mundo está siempre al límite.\""

msgid ""
"\"Can't really be helped. Bandwidth is at a premium, and it is a zero-sum "
"game. Nobody wants to give up any precious resources. Not to mention the big "
"egos.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No se puede evitar. El ancho de banda escasea y es un juego de suma cero. "
"Nadie quiere renunciar a ningún recurso valioso. Por no hablar de los "
"grandes egos.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's the first time I've seen such a display of offensive program casting. "
"Maybe it is the end.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es la primera vez que veo tal despliegue de ofensiva en el programa. Quizá "
"sea el final.\""

msgid ""
"\"The Onion Society has been through worse. We just have to figure out what "
"is going on, there seem to be darker motives behind this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La Sociedad Cebolla ha pasado por cosas peores. Sólo tenemos que averiguar "
"qué está ocurriendo, parece que hay motivos más turbios detrás de esto.\""

msgid ""
"\"All the core members were there today: DOG, notasockpuppet, lonewolf4, "
"underworlder, Trixie, and me. Technomancers are always an odd bunch, have to "
"be careful to not ruffle them the wrong way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todos los miembros principales estaban allí hoy: DOG, "
"nounamarionetacalcetín, lobosolitario4, submundor, Trixie, y yo. Los "
"tecnomantes siempre son un grupo extraño, hay que tener cuidado para no "
"molestarlos.\""

msgid ""
"\"DOG is one of the oldest members, I'm pretty sure they were a founding "
"member, but it's hard to tell. They are usually quite reserved, but have "
"some wild programs I've never seen before up their sleeves. Can't really "
"tell what they're thinking of.\""
msgstr ""
"\"DOG\" es uno de los miembros más antiguos, estoy casi seguro de que fue "
"uno de los fundadores, pero es difícil saberlo. Suele ser bastante "
"reservado, pero se guarda en la manga algunos programas salvajes que nunca "
"antes había visto. No sé muy bien en qué está pensando.\""

msgid ""
"\"notasockpuppet is also quite an old member, however, it's not really clear "
"who they are. They have a giant puppet net, and usually come connect via "
"multiple random puppets. Hard to tell if they are even the avatar most of "
"the time. You do not want to mess with them though. They're quite frivolous, "
"unpredictable, and dangerous.\""
msgstr ""
"\"nounamarionetacalcetín\" también es un miembro bastante antiguo, sin "
"embargo, no está muy claro quién es. Tiene una red de marionetas gigante y "
"suele conectarse a través de varias marionetas aleatorias. Es difícil saber "
"si son incluso su avatar la mayoría de las veces. Sin embargo, no conviene "
"que te metas con ellas. Son bastante frívolas, impredecibles y peligrosas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Other than that, there's lonewolf4, who is, as you probably guessed, a bit "
"dramatic and over the top. Still top-notch, but it's a bit hard to tell what "
"they're saying. Last, underworlder is a bit brash, but quite skilled. Can't "
"really tell what they're thinking either. Although, that's quite common "
"among technomancers.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"And you already know Trixie and I. Trixie has been around much longer than "
"I have, and has shown me a bit of the ropes here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Y ya nos conoces a Trixie y a mí. Trixie lleva aquí mucho más tiempo que "
"yo y me ha enseñado un poco cómo funciona esto.\""

msgid "\"Not that I really had to teach much, l337_b01 has got some skills!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No es que haya tenido que enseñar mucho, ¡l337_b01 tiene algunas "
"habilidades!\""

msgid ""
"\"No, I haven't seen anything like that, although it has been progressively "
"worse for a while now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No, no he visto nada parecido, aunque ha ido empeorando de forma "
"progresiva desde hace un tiempo.\""

msgid ""
"\"There have been some cases of direct confrontations in the past, some that "
"make today's events pale in comparison, but it's been ages since I've seen "
"shit like that, and it almost ended the Onion Society itself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ha habido algunos casos de enfrentamientos directos en el pasado, algunos "
"que hacen palidecer los sucesos de hoy, pero hacía siglos que no veía una "
"mierda así, ¡y estuvo a punto de acabar con la mismísima Sociedad Cebolla!\""

msgid "\"Wow, must have been wild.\""
msgstr "\"Wow, debe haber sido salvaje.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh it was. Things may be getting worse, but there's still a ways to go "
"before it falls apart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, lo fue. Las cosas pueden estar empeorando, pero todavía hay camino que "
"recorrer antes de que se desmorone.\""

msgid ""
"\"Technomancer, code wizards, sourcerers, hackzerkers, it's all the same. "
"Terms for those who do the impossible with technology. You've got to get a "
"knack for bending the code to your will and interfacing kernel functions "
"here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tecnomantes\", \"magos del código\", \"fuenteros\", \"hackzerkers\", todo "
"es lo mismo. Términos para los que hacen lo imposible con la tecnología. "
"Tienes que tener un don para doblar el código a tu voluntad e interconectar "
"las funciones del núcleo aquí.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"The Nexus and most systems are a horrible mess of barely working archaic "
"systems that nobody understands. We exploit vulnerabilities to do as we "
"please.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El Nexo y la mayoría de los sistemas son un lío horrible de sistemas "
"arcaicos que apenas funcionan y que apenas se entienden. Aprovechamos las "
"vulnerabilidades para hacer lo que nos da la gana.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's not all fun and games, it has lots of implications everywhere. It is "
"fun though. :)\""
msgstr ""
"\"No todo es diversión y juegos, tiene muchas implicaciones en todas partes. "
"Pero es divertido :)\""

msgid "\"That's a good question. What should we do?\""
msgstr "\"Esa es una buena pregunta. ¿Qué debemos hacer?\""

msgid ""
"\"Well, they always say follow the money, so how does a bank heist sound?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, siempre dicen que hay que seguir el dinero, ¿qué te parece un "
"atraco a un banco?\""

msgid "\"Excellent!\""
msgstr "\"¡Excelente!\""

msgid "\"I'm in!\""
msgstr "\"¡Me apunto!\""

msgid "\"Isn't that illegal?\""
msgstr "\"¿No es eso ilegal?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! It's always nice to have a skilled pilot. We can handle the data, "
"but there's only so much you can do through a constrained bandwidth "
"connection outside the Nexus.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Siempre es bueno contar con un piloto experto. Podemos manejar "
"los datos, pero no se puede hacer mucho a través de una conexión de ancho de "
"banda limitado fuera del Nexo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Illegal? It's an imperative correction to a broken system. These banks, "
"trust me I've been in their financial data, exist only to exploit the "
"regular people while funneling money to the pockets of the elite, bribing "
"officials, and doing mass media manipulation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Ilegal? Es una corrección imperativa a un sistema roto. Estos bancos, "
"créanme que he estado en sus datos financieros, sólo existen para explotar a "
"la gente normal mientras canalizan el dinero a los bolsillos de la élite, "
"sobornan a funcionarios y manipulan los medios de comunicación de masas.\""

msgid ""
"\"So when we do a bank heist, it's not theft, it's justice. It's a "
"redistribution of wealth away from the system that perpetuates injustices. "
"It's daring to challenge the status quo and reshape the world for the better!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Así que cuando asaltamos un banco, no es robo, es justicia. Es una "
"redistribución de la riqueza lejos del sistema que perpetúa las injusticias. "
"Es atreverse a desafiar el status quo y reformar el mundo para mejor!\""

msgid "\"And making a pretty credit while we're at it.\""
msgstr "\"Y de paso hacernos con un bonito crédito.\""

msgid "\"Damn right we're making a pretty credit!\""
msgstr "\"¡Realmente vamos a hacer un bonito crédito!\""

msgid ""
"\"OK, here's what we'll do... We'll work out the logistics a bit and get "
"back to you, {player}. Then it's time to do justice!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"We're going to make them cry!\""
msgstr "\"¡Vamos a hacerles llorar!\""

#. Leave the Nexus
msgid ""
"Your connection to the Nexus closes, and you find yourself back on {spob}. "
"You sit for a moment trying to process all that happened, when you suddenly "
"notice you are receiving a credit transfer from an anonymous account. You "
"can guess who it is from."
msgstr ""
"Tu conexión con el Nexo se cierra y te encuentras de nuevo en {spob}. Te "
"quedas sentado un momento intentando procesar todo lo ocurrido, cuando de "
"repente te das cuenta de que estás recibiendo una transferencia de crédito "
"de una cuenta anónima. Puedes adivinar de quién es."

msgid ""
"You helped l337_b01 short a Nexus relay in the {sys} system to give them a "
"better connection to the Nexus. Afterwards you were invited to a hectic "
"Onion Society Conclave that ended poorly. Trixie and l337_b01 mentioned they "
"will get in touch with you again to do a bank heist in the near future."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a l337_b01 a cortocircuitar un relé Nexus en el sistema {sys} para "
"ofrecerle una mejor conexión con el Nexo. Después te invitaron a un agitado "
"cónclave de la Sociedad Cebolla que acabó mal. Trixie y l337_b01 mencionaron "
"que volverían a ponerse en contacto contigo para llevar a cabo un atraco a "
"un banco en un futuro próximo."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Onion Society 04">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>50</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Onion Society 03</done>
#. <cond>
#. local c = spob.cur()
#. local f = c:faction()
#. if not f or not f:tags("generic") then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Onion Society</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Onion04
#.
#. Player has to take a one-time pad from a convoy, and then swap the cargo
#. with another convoy on the way there. Afterwards, they have to swap the
#. cargo with another another ship, and finally infiltrate the final place
#. before getting away.
#. --
#. Action happens on the jump from Action happens Overture to Dohriabi on the Overture side
msgid "Onion Heist"
msgstr "Atraco Cebolla"

msgid "Help l337_b01 and Trixie do a bank heist."
msgstr "Ayuda a l337_b01 y Trixie a atracar un banco."

msgid ""
"You accept the incoming connection and some familiar holograms appear on-"
"screen."
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Heyo, how's it going {player}?\""
msgstr "\"Heyo, ¿cómo te va {player}?\""

msgid "\"Yo.\""
msgstr "\"Yo.\""

msgid "\"Heyo.\""
msgstr "\"Heyo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Was poking at the Nexus Shipyards security with Trixie, and it seems like "
"we've got a path into the mainframe, although it's a bit convoluted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estaba hurgando en la seguridad de los Astilleros Nexus con Trixie, y "
"parece que tenemos un camino hacia el ordenador central, aunque es un poco "
"enrevesado.\""

msgid ""
"\"It seems like there's an important convoy coming from {startspb} to "
"{targetspb} with some of the new encryption protocols and one-time pads. "
"However, we can't really directly mess with them, or they'll redo the entire "
"encryption, and it's moot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que hay una caravana importante que viene de {startspb} a "
"{targetspb} con algunos de los nuevos protocolos de encriptación y claves de "
"un solo uso. Sin embargo, no podemos meternos directamente con ellos, o "
"reharán toda la encriptación y será inútil.\""

msgid ""
"l337_b01 butts in, \"but if we manage to swap the one-time pad with another, "
"we can get access there. We've found another suitable convoy that will be "
"going through the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 interviene: \"pero si conseguimos cambiar el código de un solo uso "
"por otro, podremos acceder allí sin problemas. Hemos encontrado otra "
"caravana adecuada que pasará por el sistema {sys}.\""

msgid ""
"Trixie counter-butts in, \"Yes, so we need you to raid the convoy in {sys} "
"system, and then deliver that to {swapspb} in the {swapsys} system, and we "
"can handle the rest!\""
msgstr ""
"Trixie replica: \"Sí, así que necesitamos que asaltes la caravana en el "
"sistema {sys}, y luego se la entregues a {swapspb} en el sistema {swapsys}, "
"¡y nosotros nos encargamos del resto!\""

msgid "You decline the work for now, and the holograms fade away."
msgstr "Rechazas el trabajo por ahora y los hologramas se desvanecen."

msgid ""
"\"Great! Trixie and I will be using your ship as a beacon, and should be "
"able to help you as bandwidth allows.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Trixie y yo usaremos tu nave como baliza y podremos ayudarte "
"cuando el ancho de banda lo permita.\""

msgid ""
"\"The convoy will be jumping from the {jmpsys} system to the {ambushsys} "
"system. It's our best bet due to the high bandwidth and few ships to capture "
"the cargo.\""
msgstr ""
"\" La caravana saltará del sistema {jmpsys} al sistema {ambushsys}. Es "
"nuestra mejor apuesta debido al gran ancho de banda y a que hay pocas naves "
"para capturar la carga.\""

msgid ""
"\"No need to fret, {player} is an excellent pilot and this will be no "
"challenge for the {shipname}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡No hay por qué preocuparse, {player} es un excelente piloto y esto no "
"será ningún desafío para {shipname}!\""

msgid "Steal one-time pads from the convoy in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Roba un código de un solo uso del convoy en el sistema {sys}"

#. Characters
#. Cargo swap cutscene
msgid "Spacedock Staff"
msgstr "Personal del Muelle Espacial"

#. last cutscene
msgid ""
"Your ship enters the docks, and the two Onion Society hackers make their "
"timely holographic appearance."
msgstr ""
"Tu nave entra en los muelles, y los dos hackers de la Sociedad Cebolla hacen "
"su oportuna aparición holográfica."

msgid "\"Quick, l337_b01, to action!\""
msgstr "\"¡Rápido, l337_b01, a la acción!\""

msgid "\"Aye aye captain!\""
msgstr "\"¡A la orden mi capitán!\""

msgid "You think you see what amounts to a grimace from Trixie's avatar."
msgstr "Te parece ver lo que equivale a una mueca del avatar de Trixie."

msgid "\"I'm on it!\""
msgstr "\"¡Estoy en ello!\""

msgid ""
"\"Damn, it seems denser than expected. We need a distraction. Quick, "
"{player}, do something!\""
msgstr ""
"\" Demonios, parece más denso de lo esperado. Necesitamos una distracción. "
"¡Rápido, {player}, haz algo!\""

msgid "Activate your ship's security alarm."
msgstr "Activa la alarma de seguridad de tu nave."

msgid "Bump the ship into the station structure."
msgstr "Choca la nave contra la estructura de la estación."

msgid "\"What should I do!?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué debería hacer?\""

msgid "\"I don't know! Run over a maintenance robot or something!\""
msgstr "\"¡No lo sé! ¡Atropella a un robot de mantenimiento o algo así!\""

msgid "\"Time to get busy!\""
msgstr "\"¡Hora de ponerse manos a la obra!\""

msgid "Run over a maintenance robot."
msgstr "Atropellar a un robot de mantenimiento."

msgid ""
"You fumble the controls of the ship a bit, just enough to make it barely "
"scratch the inner hull of the space dock. Although you expected it to make "
"some noise, you didn't foresee the ear-splitting screech caused by the metal "
"on metal interaction. With all the heads of everyone at the spacedocks "
"turned your way, it seems like you managed to get the attention of the inter "
"spacedock."
msgstr ""
"Manipulas un poco los controles de la nave, lo suficiente para que apenas "
"roce el casco interior del muelle espacial. Aunque esperabas que hiciera "
"algo de ruido, no habías previsto el chirrido ensordecedor causado por la "
"interacción del metal contra el metal. Con todas las cabezas del muelle "
"espacial giradas hacia ti, parece que has conseguido llamar la atención del "
"interior del muelle."

msgid ""
"You begrudgingly take the controls of the ship, and wait until a cleaner "
"robot strays near your landing gear. Wasting no time on the opportunity, you "
"do a precise manoeuvre to crush it with a resounding *CRUNCH*. Given the "
"amount of heads turned, it looks like you got the attention of the entire "
"spacedock."
msgstr ""
"Tomas a regañadientes los mandos de la nave y esperas a que un robot "
"limpiador se desvíe cerca de tu tren de aterrizaje. Sin perder tiempo, haces "
"una precisa maniobra para aplastarlo con un sonoro *CRUNCH*. Dada la "
"cantidad de cabezas que se giran, parece que has captado la atención de todo "
"el muelle espacial."

#. Just one loop
msgid ""
"You open the command console and trigger the ship's emergency alarm system. "
"The alarm system, designed for long-range planetary signalling, seems to be "
"amplified and echoed by the spacedock structure, resulting in an onslaught "
"of audible chaos. Everyone in the spacedock turns towards your ship: it "
"looks like you got the attention of the entire floor."
msgstr ""
"Abres la consola de mando y activas el sistema de alarma de emergencia de la "
"nave. El sistema de alarma, diseñado para la señalización planetaria de "
"largo alcance, parece amplificarse y hacerse eco en la estructura del muelle "
"espacial, lo que provoca una avalancha de caos audible. Todo el mundo en el "
"muelle espacial se vuelve hacia tu nave: parece que has captado la atención "
"de todo el mundo."

msgid ""
"Almost immediately, a high priority communication channel with the spacedock "
"command opens."
msgstr ""
"Casi inmediatamente, se abre un canal de comunicación de alta prioridad con "
"el mando del muelle espacial."

msgid ""
"\"What the hell are you thinking! I've dealt with a ton of pilots in my "
"time, but none as reckless as you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡En qué demonios estás pensando! He tratado con un montón de pilotos en mi "
"vida, ¡pero ninguno tan insensato como tú!\""

msgid "\"Sorry! It's my first time landing.\""
msgstr "\"¡Lo siento! Era mi primer aterrizaje.\""

msgid "\"What do you mean?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué quieres decir?\""

msgid "You call that landing? Who the hell taught you to fly?"
msgstr "¿Llamas a eso aterrizar? ¿Quién demonios te enseñó a volar?"

msgid ""
"It's a bloody spacedock, not a percussive instrument you have to bash your "
"ship against!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es un maldito muelle espacial, no un instrumento de percusión contra el que "
"tienes que golpear tu nave!"

msgid "The robot you crushed only had one cycle left until retirement!"
msgstr "¡Al robot que aplastaste sólo le quedaba un ciclo hasta la jubilación!"

msgid ""
"You can't just blast your alarm at the spacedocks! You know how much "
"tympanic reconstruction costs!"
msgstr ""
"¡No puedes hacer sonar tu alarma en los muelles! ¡Ya sabes cuánto cuesta la "
"reconstrucción del tímpano!"

msgid "\"{msg1} {msg2}\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"l337_b01 appears on a separate channel.\n"
"\"We're almost there, keep them distracted a bit longer.\""
msgstr ""
"l337_b01 aparece en un canal separado.\n"
"\"Ya casi estamos, mantenlos distraídos un poco más.\""

msgid "\"I have no idea of what you are talking about.\""
msgstr "\"No tengo ni idea de lo que estás hablando.\""

msgid "\"What you say?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué dices?\""

msgid "\"It was only a scratch!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bah, eso sólo fue un rasguño!\""

msgid ""
"\"The spacedock hull integrity may not be compromised, but I assure you the "
"traumatic auditive memories of the resulting caterwaul is not going to be "
"easy to recover from!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Puede que la integridad del casco del muelle espacial no se vea "
"comprometida, ¡pero te aseguro que los traumáticos recuerdos auditivos del "
"crujido resultante no se van a olvidar facilmente!\""

msgid ""
"\"Only a scratch? Scrubby is flat as a pancake! You've turned a great "
"cleaning robot into a stain on the spacedock floor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sólo un rasguño? ¡Scrubby está plano como una tortita! ¡Has convertido un "
"gran robot de limpieza en una mancha en el suelo del muelle espacial!\""

msgid ""
"\"Show me your credentials. I'm filing a report to the Empire. You do know "
"what happens if you don't comply, do you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Muéstrame tus credenciales. Voy a presentar un informe al Imperio. Sabes "
"lo que pasa si no obedeces, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "\"Wait, I can explain!\""
msgstr "\"¡Espera, puedo explicarlo!\""

msgid "\"Credentials? I don't even know who I am!\""
msgstr "\"¿Credenciales? ¡Ni siquiera sé quién soy!\""

msgid "\"No, *I'm* filing a complaint to the Empire!\""
msgstr "\"No, ¡*Yo* voy a presentar una queja al Imperio!\""

msgid ""
"\"Too late now! The spacedock recordings are all the explanation anyone will "
"need!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ya es demasiado tarde! ¡Las grabaciones del muelle espacial son toda la "
"explicación que cualquiera necesitará!\""

msgid ""
"\"File a complaint for what? Upholding the law? Taking care of the "
"spacedocks? Dealing with horrible pilots?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Presentar una denuncia por qué? ¿Por cumplir la ley? ¿Cuidar de los "
"muelles espaciales? ¿Tratar con pilotos horribles?\""

msgid ""
"\"Your flying days will be over. The Empire does not take kindly to this "
"kind of infraction. If you get lucky, you'll only be given a life sentence "
"on the lovely prison planet {spb}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tus días de vuelo se acabarán. El Imperio no ve con buenos ojos este tipo "
"de infracciones. ¡Si tienes suerte, sólo te darán cadena perpetua en el "
"encantador planeta prisión {spb}!\""

#. Finn is an Empire prison world
msgid "\"Not going to be so cocky when you are...\""
msgstr "\"No vas a ser tan engreído cuando...\""

msgid ""
"Suddenly l337_b01 shouts through the other channel.\n"
"\"Got them!\""
msgstr ""
"De repente l337_b01 grita a través del otro canal.\n"
"\"¡Los tengo!\""

msgid ""
"Suddenly the stations power goes out and the connection with spacedock "
"command is cut."
msgstr ""
"De repente se va la luz de la estación y se corta la conexión con el mando "
"del muelle espacial."

msgid ""
"\"Trixie, that was top-notch! I didn't even think of reversing the "
"polarization protocol to create a bandwidth backflow and overflow the router!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Trixie, eso ha sido de primera! Ni se me había ocurrido invertir el "
"protocolo de polarización para crear un reflujo de ancho de banda y "
"desbordar el router!\""

msgid "\"There are a lot more tricks where that came from!\""
msgstr "\"¡Hay muchos más trucos de donde vino ese!\""

msgid "\"Totally yoinking that one.\""
msgstr "\"Te robaré ese truco.\""

msgid ""
"\"{player}, to fill you out, we managed to swap the one-time pad onto the "
"local convoy. We've rebooted the station systems to cover our track, but the "
"job here is done!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{player}, para ponerte al día, hemos conseguido intercambiar el código de "
"un solo uso en la caravana local. Y hemos reiniciado los sistemas de la "
"estación para cubrir nuestro rastro, ¡el trabajo aquí está hecho!\""

msgid "\"What about the spacedock command?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué pasa con el mando del muelle espacial?\""

msgid "\"Will I be alright?\""
msgstr "\"¿Voy a estar bien?\""

msgid "\"Great job!\""
msgstr "\"¡Buen trabajo!\""

msgid "\"No need to worry about anything.\""
msgstr "\"No tienes que preocuparte por nada.\""

msgid "\"Just watch and see.\""
msgstr "\"Sólo mira y verás.\""

msgid ""
"The station lights flicker on and an angrier than ever spacedock command "
"appears promptly on your holoscreen."
msgstr ""
"Las luces de la estación parpadean y una orden de muelle espacial, más "
"enfadada que nunca, aparece rápidamente en tu holopantalla."

msgid ""
"\"You! You have something to do with this. When I add this to your list of "
"crimes, you'll be lucky to even breathe oxygen again!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Security! Seize the {shipname}!\""
msgstr "\"¡Seguridad! ¡Capturen {shipname}!\""

msgid "\"Wait, what are you doing? Criminal fraud? I haven't done anything.\""
msgstr "\"Espera, ¿qué estás haciendo? ¿Fraude criminal? Yo nohe hecho nada.\""

msgid "The connection with spacedock command abruptly cuts out."
msgstr "La conexión con el mando del muelle espacial se corta bruscamente."

msgid "\"And that was that.\""
msgstr "\"Y eso fue todo.\""

msgid "\"Nice clean job. I could get used to this.\""
msgstr "\"Buen y limpio trabajo. Podría acostumbrarme a esto.\""

msgid ""
"\"OK, now comes for the final part. {player}, we need you to go to {spb} in "
"the {sys} system, and we'll break into the system using the new security "
"code they'll be using.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vale, ahora viene la parte final. {player}, necesitamos que vayas a {spb} "
"en el sistema {sys}, y entraremos en el sistema usando el nuevo código de "
"seguridad que estarán usando.\""

msgid "\"If we've gotten this far, it should be a piece of cake. \""
msgstr "\"Si hemos llegado hasta aquí, debería ser pan comido.\""

msgid "\"Again? I told you to stop making me hungry!\""
msgstr "\"¿Otra vez? ¡Te dije que dejaras de darme hambre!\""

msgid "\"Didn't you just have cake?\""
msgstr "\"¿No acabas de comer pastel?\""

msgid "\"First cake yes, but what about second cake?\""
msgstr "\"El primer pastel sí, pero ¿y el segundo?\""

msgid "\"You should watch out for your blood sugar.\""
msgstr "\"Deberías vigilar tu azúcar en sangre.\""

msgid "You hear a muffled eating sound."
msgstr "Se escucha un sonido apagado de alguien comiendo."

msgid ""
"\"Ah well. I should get some cake too.\"\n"
"They pause a second.\n"
"\"Before I forget, {player}, on to {spb}!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Maybe you should get some cake too."
msgstr "A lo mejor tú también deberías comer tarta."

msgid "\"Stop making me hungry!\""
msgstr "\"¡Deja de darme hambre!\""

msgid "\"Sorry, forgot you had such a sweet tooth.\""
msgstr "\"Lo siento, olvidé que eras tan golosa.\""

msgid "You hear Trixie muttering something about cake."
msgstr "Oyes a Trixie murmurar algo sobre un pastel."

msgid "\"{player}, on to {spb}!\""
msgstr "\"{player}, ¡a {spb}!\""

msgid "Break into {spb} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Irrumpe en {spb} (sistema {sys})"

#. Small extra optional cutscene
msgid ""
"You land and go inspect the cargo you pulled off of the Nexus Convoy. It "
"seems like the two hackers hitch-hiking on your ship's systems take notice "
"and their holograms appear before you."
msgstr ""
"Aterriza e inspecciona la carga que sacaste de la caravana Nexus. Parece que "
"los dos hackers que hacían autostop en los sistemas de tu nave se dan cuenta "
"y sus hologramas aparecen ante ti."

msgid ""
"\"Nice flying out there! See, Trixie, I told you it would be a piece of cake "
"for {player}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Buen vuelo ahí fuera! ¡Ves, Trixie, te dije que sería pan comido para "
"{player}!\""

msgid ""
"\"Stop making me hungry!\"\n"
"They pause for a second.\n"
"\"I'm just worried that it seems like their security was really week... Too "
"weak.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Deja de darme hambre!\"\n"
"Se detiene por un segundo.\n"
"\"Sólo estoy preocupado porque parece que su seguridad era muy déb... "
"Demasiado débil.\""

msgid "\"Really? Aren't you just being overly paranoid?\""
msgstr "\"¿De verdad? ¿No estás siendo demasiado paranoico?\""

msgid ""
"\"The devil's in the details! At least it should be a while until they "
"notice that the convoy went missing while your script keeps running.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡El diablo está en los detalles! Al menos debería pasar un tiempo hasta "
"que se den cuenta de que la caravana desapareció mientras tu programa siga "
"funcionando.\""

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, the simulation is emulating the convoy, so we should have some time "
"to finish pulling off the plan. {player}, you ready to do the swap at {spb}?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, la simulación está emulando la caravana, así que deberíamos tener algo "
"de tiempo para terminar de llevar a cabo el plan. {player}, ¿estás listo "
"para hacer el intercambio en {spb}?\""

msgid "\"Piece of cake.\""
msgstr "\"Pan comido.\""

msgid "\"Security felt tough though...\""
msgstr "\"Aunque la seguridad se sentía fuerte...\""

msgid ""
"\"That does it! I'm ordering cake!\"\n"
"You hear Trixie muttering to themselves."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ya está! ¡Voy a pedir tarta!\"\n"
"Se oye a Trixie murmurar para sí misma."

msgid "\"You already ate the last one you got?\""
msgstr "\"¿Ya te comiste la última que te trajeron?\""

msgid "\"Not my fault I have a sweet tooth!\""
msgstr "\"¡No es culpa mía que sea golosa!\""

msgid ""
"\"Today, with our fairly limited bandwidth, we were able to break into and "
"override quite a few of their ships. Usually, it's hard enough to access a "
"spaceship's operating system, let alone override it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hoy, con nuestro ancho de banda bastante limitado, hemos podido entrar y "
"anular bastantes de sus naves. Normalmente, ya es bastante difícil acceder "
"al sistema operativo de una nave espacial, y mucho más anularlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"This has to be related to the weird patterns we're seeing on the Nexus!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Esto tiene que estar relacionado con los extraños patrones que estamos "
"viendo en el Nexo!\""

msgid "\"Correlation doesn't imply causation!\""
msgstr "\"¡Correlación no implica causalidad!\""

msgid "\"Indeed it does not, but coincidences are not very good omens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Efectivamente no es así, pero las coincidencias no son muy buenos augurios."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Superstitions! However, you tend to have good hunches, so let me see if I "
"can scrape some bandwidth together to launch some monitoring spells.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Never can be too careful. There is too much at stake here to mess up.\"\n"
"You hear a beep.\n"
"\"Ah, diagnostics finished, let's see...\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nunca se es demasiado cuidadoso. Hay demasiado en juego como para meter la "
"pata.\"\n"
"Oyes un pitido.\n"
"\"Ah, diagnóstico terminado, veamos...\""

msgid ""
"\"Cargo looks OK! Seems to be lots of encrypted documents, but there also is "
"a nice one-time pad. Exactly what we need. l337_b01, if you can spare the "
"resources, try to decrypt some of the documents. {player}, head to {swapspb} "
"in the {swapsys} system. We proceed with the plan!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Stop mocking me, the captain here is {player}!\""
msgstr "\"¡Deja de burlarte de mí, el capitán aquí es {player}!\""

msgid ""
"The holograms fade out, probably to conserve bandwidth, and you are left "
"with the task at hand."
msgstr ""
"Los hologramas se desvanecen, probablemente para ahorrar ancho de banda, y "
"te quedas con la tarea pendiente."

#. Advance internal state
msgid "Onion Society"
msgstr "Sociedad Cebolla"

msgid "Break into the Nexus Shipyards systems."
msgstr "Entra en los sistemas de los Astilleros Nexus."

msgid ""
"\"Glad to see you made it out alive {player}. That did not go as expected.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegra ver que saliste con vida {player}. Eso no fue como esperaba.\""

msgid ""
"\"Sorry about that, I panicked when they started upstreaming to me and cut "
"the connection. I should have listened to you Trixie, I guess I got cocky.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo siento, me asusté cuando empezaron a dirigirme paquetes y corté la "
"conexión. Debería haberte escuchado Trixie, creo que me puse chulo.\""

msgid "\"No sweat. There's always a next time.\""
msgstr "\"No te preocupes. Siempre hay una próxima vez.\""

msgid "\"Shame we weren't able to break into the system, we were so close.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lástima que no hayamos podido entrar en el sistema, estuvimos muy cerca.\""

msgid ""
"\"At least we all made it out alive. There's always more opportunities as "
"long as we're still alive and kicking.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al menos salimos todos vivos. Siempre hay más oportunidades mientras "
"sigamos vivitos y coleando.\""

msgid "\"Can't win them all.\""
msgstr "\"No se puede ganar todo el tiempo.\""

msgid "\"What were you able to get?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué has podido conseguir?\""

msgid ""
"\"I didn't have much time to choose, so I just randomly downloaded as much "
"as bandwidth allowed, still going through it. From the little I've seen, "
"there's some interesting account credentials, and some encrypted stuff that "
"we have to unlock. All in all, a pretty good haul.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No tenía mucho tiempo para elegir, así que descargué al azar todo lo que "
"me permitía el ancho de banda, y sigo revisándolo. Por lo poco que he visto, "
"hay algunas credenciales de cuentas interesantes, y algunas cosas "
"encriptadas que tenemos que desbloquear. En general, un buen botín.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Cool. Def share the titbits. I've got some spare computational power to "
"crack codes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Genial. Comparte los detalles. Tengo potencia de cálculo de sobra para "
"romper cifrados.\""

msgid "\"What are our next steps?\""
