msgid ""
"The black cat accidentally hit the ship restart button, but nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"El gato negro ha pulsado accidentalmente el botón de reinicio de la nave, "
"pero no pasa nada."

msgid "The black cat accidentally hit the ship restart button!"
msgstr ""
"¡El gato negro ha pulsado accidentalmente el botón de reinicio de la nave!"

#. Energy discharge
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The black cat managed to accidentally disconnect the energy capacitors, but "
"the back-up system takes over while you fix it."
msgstr ""
"El gato negro logró desconectar accidentalmente los condensadores de "
"energía, pero el sistema de respaldo se hace cargo mientras lo arreglas."

msgid "The black cat managed to accidentally disconnect the energy capacitors!"
msgstr ""
"¡El gato negro logró desconectar accidentalmente los condensadores de "
"energía!"

#. Larger chance of just random messages
msgid "The black cat stares at you ominously."
msgstr "El gato negro te mira siniestramente."

msgid "A waft of black cat hair flies around."
msgstr "Una ráfaga de pelo de gato negro vuela alrededor."

msgid "The black cat's tail fluffs up and it sprints away."
msgstr "La cola del gato negro se agita y se aleja corriendo."

msgid "The black cat scratches the airlock. It wants out?"
msgstr "El gato negro araña la esclusa. ¿Quiere salir?"

msgid "The black cat unceremoniously barfs up a hairball."
msgstr "El gato negro vomita sin contemplaciones una bola de pelo."

msgid "You hear weird noises from the black cat freaking out over nothing."
msgstr "Se oyen ruidos extraños del gato negro que se asusta por nada."

msgid "The black cat suddenly sprints through the ship."
msgstr "El gato negro corre de repente por la nave."

msgid "The black cat curls up and falls asleep on top of the control panel."
msgstr ""
"El gato negro se acurruca y se queda dormido encima del panel de control."

msgid ""
"The black cat shows you its belly, but bites you when you try to pet it."
msgstr ""
"El gato negro te enseña la barriga, pero te muerde cuando intentas "
"acariciarlo."

msgid "The black cat uses the commander chair as a scratching post."
msgstr "El gato negro utiliza la silla del comandante como poste de rascado."

msgid ""
"The black cat bumps into your ship's self-destruct button, but you manage to "
"abort it in time."
msgstr ""
"El gato negro choca con el botón de autodestrucción de tu nave, pero "
"consigues abortarlo a tiempo."

#. Proper (bad) events
#. This hook is run _BEFORE_ the enter hook.
#. Set up event ending
msgid "P-p-please bring them o-over."
msgstr "P-p-por favor, tráelos."

msgid "Nervous Individual"
msgstr "Individuo Nervioso"

msgid ""
"You open a communication channel with the {plt} and a hologram of a nervous-"
"looking individual materializes in front of you."
msgstr ""
"Abres un canal de comunicación con el {plt} y un holograma de un individuo "
"de aspecto nervioso se materializa frente a ti."

msgid "\"H-h-hello there. You w-w-wouldn't happen to have a c-cat onboard?\""
msgstr "\"H-h-hola ahí. ¿No t-t-tendrás por casualidad un g-gato a bordo?\""

msgctxt "blackcat"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"Sí.\""

msgctxt "blackcat"
msgid "\"No (lie).\""
msgstr "\"No (mentira).\""

msgid ""
"Just as you utter the word \"No\", the black cat drowns out your reply with "
"a resonating \"Meow\", that is clearly heard on the other side of the "
"communication channel."
msgstr ""
"Justo cuando pronuncia la palabra \"No\", el gato negro ahoga su respuesta "
"con un resonante \"Miau\", que se oye claramente al otro lado del canal de "
"comunicación."

msgid ""
"They let out a sigh of relief.\n"
"\"You f-f-found it! I thought I was a g-g-goner! I'll b-brake my ship so you "
"c-can bring it over.\""
msgstr ""
"Deja escapar un suspiro de alivio.\n"
"\"¡Lo e-e-encontraste! Creía que estaba p-p-perdido. F-frenaré mi nave para "
"que p-puedas traerlo.\""

msgid ""
"Given the streak of bad luck the feline has brought you, you figure it is in "
"your best interest to bring the cat over to the {plt}."
msgstr ""
"Dada la racha de mala suerte que te ha traído el felino, crees que te "
"conviene llevar al gato al {plt}."

msgid ""
"Your ship locks its boarding clamps on the {plt}, and the airlock opens up "
"revealing some strangely musty air and pitch black darkness. How odd."
msgstr ""
"Tu nave cierra sus pinzas de embarque en el {plt}, y la esclusa se abre "
"revelando un aire extrañamente mohoso y una oscuridad absoluta. Qué extraño."

msgid ""
"You realize the cat is nowhere to be seen and start to search for it to "
"bring it over. Funny how it always seems to be where you don't want it and "
"when you need it you can't find it."
msgstr ""
"Te das cuenta de que el gato no está en ningún sitio y empiezas a buscarlo "
"para traerlo. Es curioso que siempre parece estar donde no lo quieres y "
"cuando lo necesitas no lo encuentras."

msgid ""
"You scour the ship and end up going back to the commander chair. As you are "
"about to look behind it, you hear a sonorous meow and a black shadow flies "
"past you towards the airlock."
msgstr ""
"Recorres la nave y acabas volviendo a la silla del comandante. Cuando estás "
"a punto de mirar detrás de ella, oyes un maullido sonoro y una sombra negra "
"pasa volando junto a ti hacia la esclusa."

msgid ""
"You run to try to catch it, but hear the sound of the airlock closing and "
"detaching of the locking clamps. You run back to your command chair to see "
"what the other ship is doing, but you can not find it anywhere. They seem to "
"have a knack for fleeing."
msgstr ""
"Corres para intentar cogerlo, pero oyes el sonido de la esclusa cerrándose y "
"soltando las abrazaderas de cierre. Vuelves corriendo a tu sillón de mando "
"para ver qué hace la otra nave, pero no la encuentras por ninguna parte. "
"Parece que tienen la costumbre de huir."

msgid ""
"You sit resigned and outwitted at your command chair when you notice a "
"credit chip with {credits} on the floor. It looks like it has cat bite marks "
"too."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes resignado y burlado en tu silla de mando cuando observas una "
"ficha de crédito con {credits} en el suelo. Parece que también tiene marcas "
"de mordiscos de gato."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You then get around to cleaning up the copious amounts of cat hair invading "
"every last corner of your ship. With the amount collected you make a cute "
"black cat doll. It's like a tiny version of the real thing without the "
"assholeness."
msgstr ""
"Entonces te pones a limpiar las copiosas cantidades de pelo de gato que "
"invaden hasta el último rincón de tu nave. Con la cantidad recogida haces un "
"simpático muñeco de gato negro. Es como una versión en miniatura del gato "
"real, pero sin su maldad."

msgid ""
"You rescued a black cat from a derelict ship and safely delivered it to its "
"owner, who was flying a Wild Ones pirate ship."
msgstr ""
"Has rescatado un gato negro de un derrelicto y lo has entregado sano y salvo "
"a su dueño, que pilotaba una nave pirata de los Salvajes."

msgid "No cat in sight…"
msgstr "No hay gato a la vista…"

msgid ""
"You go to get rid of the black cat, but can not find it anywhere. After a "
"long search you reach the only logical conclusion; that it vanished into "
"thin air. Guess you can forget about it for now."
msgstr ""
"Vas a deshacerte del gato negro, pero no lo encuentras por ninguna parte. "
"Tras una larga búsqueda, llegas a la única conclusión lógica: que se ha "
"desvanecido en el aire. Supongo que puedes olvidarte de él por ahora."

msgid ""
"You rescued a black cat from a derelict ship only to have it disappear into "
"thin air in {sys}."
msgstr ""
"Has rescatado a un gato negro de un derrelicto para que desaparezca en el "
"aire en {sys}."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Pirate Smuggling">
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Pirate") &gt;= -100</cond>
#. <chance>960</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <done>Pirate Smuggle Cake</done>
#. <notes/>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Handles the randomly generated Pirate contraband missions. They can appear
#. anywhere and give better rewards with higher risk.
#.
#.
#.
#.
#. --   Pirates shipping missions are always timed, but quite lax on the schedules
#. --   and pays a lot more then the rush missions
#. --
#. This is in common.cargo, but we need to increase the range
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. Lower chance of appearing to 1/3 on non-pirate planets
#. Doesn't appear on Thurion and Proteron worlds for now
#. target destination. Override "always_available" to true.
#. We’re redefining the cargo
#. Serious stuff here
msgid "Stolen Goods"
msgstr "Bienes Robados"

msgid "A lot of goods obtained by illicit and illegal means."
msgstr "Una gran cantidad de bienes obtenidos por medios ilícitos e ilegales."

msgid "Hacked Electronics"
msgstr "Electrónica Hackeada"

msgid "An assortment of illegally modified electronic goods."
msgstr "Un surtido de artículos electrónicos modificados ilegalmente."

msgid "Illegal Waste"
msgstr "Residuos Ilegales"

msgid "A melange of highly illegal waste."
msgstr "Una mezcla de residuos altamente ilegales."

msgid "Powerful Stimulants"
msgstr "Estimulantes Potentes"

msgid "A bunch of illegal stimulants."
msgstr "Un montón de estimulantes ilegales."

msgid "Unmarked Boxes"
msgstr "Cajas Sin Marcar"

msgid ""
"A multitude of unmarked boxes containing what you can only assume to be "
"highly illegal items."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de cajas sin marcar que contienen lo que sólo se puede suponer "
"que son artículos altamente ilegales."

msgid "Exotic Animals"
msgstr "Animales Exóticos"

msgid "A collection of exotic animals that can not be legally traded."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de animales exóticos que no pueden ser comercializados "
"legalmente."

msgid "Radioactive Materials"
msgstr "Materiales Radiactivos"

msgid "Highly dangerous and illegal radioactive materials."
msgstr "Materiales radiactivos altamente peligrosos e ilegales."

msgid "Illegal Drugs"
msgstr "Drogas Ilegales"

msgid "A batch of drugs made illegal in most systems."
msgstr "Un lote de drogas ilegalizado en la mayoría de los sistemas."

msgid "Illegal Body Mods"
msgstr "Modificaciones Corporales Ilegales"

msgid "An array of illegal body modifications."
msgstr "Una serie de modificaciones corporales ilegales."

msgid "Unauthorized Weapons"
msgstr "Armas No Autorizadas"

msgid "An assemblage of illegal weapons."
msgstr "Un conjunto de armas ilegales."

msgid "Contraband"
msgstr "Contrabando"

msgid "A diverse assortment of illegal contraband goods."
msgstr "Un variado surtido de mercancías ilegales de contrabando."

msgid "Counterfeit Goods"
msgstr "Productos Falsificados"

msgid "An assortment of illegal counterfeit goods of many famous brands."
msgstr ""
"Un surtido de productos ilegales falsificados de muchas marcas famosas."

msgid "Stolen Art"
msgstr "Arte Robado"

msgid "Artwork that was illegally seized from a collector or gallery."
msgstr ""
"Obras de arte incautadas ilegalmente a un coleccionista o a una galería."

#. Below less serious stuff
msgid "User Databases"
msgstr "Bases de Datos de Usuarios"

msgid ""
"Stolen user databases with lots of personal information obtained illegally."
msgstr ""
"Bases de datos de usuarios robadas con mucha información personal obtenida "
"ilegalmente."

msgid "Smelly Fruits"
msgstr "Frutas Olorosas"

msgid ""
"Illegal fruits that have a strong smell that can stink up entire stations in "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"Frutas ilegales que tienen un fuerte olor que puede apestar estaciones "
"enteras en minutos."

msgid "Catnip"
msgstr "Hierba Gatera"

msgid "Highly illegal drug that is very attractive to cats."
msgstr "Droga altamente ilegal que resulta muy atractiva para los gatos."

msgid "Hypnotoads"
msgstr "Hipnosapos"

msgid "Illegal amphibian with some mind-control abilities."
msgstr "Anfibios ilegales con algunas habilidades de control mental."

msgid "Extra Spicy Burritos"
msgstr "Burritos Extra Picantes"

msgid "Burritos that are so spicy, they are illegal."
msgstr "Burritos tan picantes que son ilegales."

msgid "Pineapple Pizza"
msgstr "Pizza de Piña"

msgid "Pizza with pineapple on it. There is no way this is legal."
msgstr "Pizza con piña. No hay manera de que esto sea legal."

msgid "Illicit Shader Code"
msgstr "Código de Sombreado Ilícito"

msgid "Program used for rendering images with nefarious and illegal purposes."
msgstr ""
"Programa utilizado para renderizar imágenes con fines nefastos e ilegales."

msgid "Tax-evasion Documents"
msgstr "Documentos de Evasión Fiscal"

msgid "Illegal documents detailing tax evasion by high empire officials."
msgstr ""
"Documentos ilegales que detallan la evasión fiscal de altos funcionarios del "
"imperio."

msgid "Leaked Documents"
msgstr "Documentos Filtrados"

msgid "Documents illegally leaked from governmental entities."
msgstr "Documentos filtrados ilegalmente de entidades gubernamentales."

msgid "Incriminating Evidence"
msgstr "Pruebas Incriminatorias"

msgid "Illegally obtained evidence that incriminates high empire officials."
msgstr ""
"Pruebas obtenidas ilegalmente que incriminan a altos funcionarios del "
"imperio."

msgid "Unauthorized Office Supplies"
msgstr "Suministros de Oficina No Autorizados"

msgid ""
"Office supplies that don't meet the standards of the Empire bureaucracy, "
"including flimsy red staplers."
msgstr ""
"Material de oficina que no cumple las normas de la burocracia del Imperio, "
"incluidas las endebles grapadoras rojas."

msgid "Paper Deshredders"
msgstr "Reconstructoras de Papel"

msgid ""
"Devices that are able to reconstruct original documents from their shredded "
"remains."
msgstr ""
"Dispositivos capaces de reconstruir los documentos originales a partir de "
"sus restos triturados."

msgid "Self-help Books"
msgstr "Libros de Autoayuda"

msgid "Books for self-betterment made illegal by the Dvaered authorities."
msgstr ""
"Libros de superación personal ilegalizados por las autoridades Dvaered."

msgid "Pacifist Manifestos"
msgstr "Manifiestos Pacifistas"

msgid ""
"Documents making the case for pacifism, made illegal by the Dvaered "
"authorities."
msgstr ""
"Documentos que defienden el pacifismo, ilegalizado por las autoridades "
"Dvaered."

msgid "Zen Rock Gardens"
msgstr "Jardines de Roca Zen"

msgid ""
"Sand and rock gardens with special rakes you can use for meditative "
"purposes. Made illegal by the Dvaered authorities."
msgstr ""
"Jardines de arena y rocas con rastrillos especiales que se pueden utilizar "
"para meditar. Hechos ilegales por las autoridades Dvaered."

msgid "Scented Soap"
msgstr "Jabón Perfumado"

msgid ""
"Fragrant soaps that can lead you to have a peace of mind. Made illegal by "
"the Dvaered authorities."
msgstr ""
"Jabones perfumados que pueden llevarle a tener tranquilidad. Hechos ilegales "
"por las autoridades Dvaered."

msgid "Unstable DNA"
msgstr "ADN Inestable"

msgid "Illegal DNA with strong reactive properties."
msgstr "ADN ilegal con fuertes propiedades reactivas."

msgid "Bio-weapons"
msgstr "Bioarmas"

msgid "Highly dangerous, illegal biological weapons."
msgstr "Armas biológicas ilegales y altamente peligrosas."

msgid "Abducted Drosophila"
msgstr "Drosophila secuestrada"

msgid ""
"Genetically modified small fruit flies illegally stolen from a laboratory."
msgstr ""
"Pequeñas moscas de la fruta modificadas genéticamente y robadas ilegalmente "
"de un laboratorio."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Mislabelled Plasmids"
msgstr "Plásmidos Mal Etiquetados"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Independently replicating DNA that has been mislabelled and is no longer "
"clear what exactly it does. Illegal for its uncertain and dangerous nature."
msgstr ""
"ADN de replicación independiente que ha sido mal etiquetado y ya no está "
"claro qué hace exactamente. Ilegal por su carácter incierto y peligroso."

msgid "Soromid Cheese"
msgstr "Queso Soromida"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The 'don't ask, don't tell' of the cheese world. It is completely covered "
"with puffy green and blue mould."
msgstr ""
"El \"no preguntes, no digas\" del mundo del queso. Está completamente "
"cubierto de moho verde y azul."

msgid "Heretical Documents"
msgstr "Documentos Heréticos"

msgid "Illegal documents referring to heresy."
msgstr "Documentos ilegales que hacen referencia a la herejía."

msgid "Itch Powder"
msgstr "Polvo de Picor"

msgid "A banned substance with a history of disrupting robed processions."
msgstr ""
"Una sustancia prohibida con un historial de interrupción de las procesiones "
"con túnica."

msgid "Unauthorized Sirichana Merchandise"
msgstr "Mercancía No Autorizada de Sirichana"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Horribly tacky and outright bad merchandise with the Sirichana pasted all "
"over it. Sirichana toenail clipper anyone?"
msgstr ""
"Mercancía horriblemente hortera y francamente mala con Sirichana pegada por "
"todas partes. ¿Alguien quiere un cortaúñas de Sirichana?"

msgid "Tinfoil Caps"
msgstr "Gorros de Papel de Aluminio"

msgid "Tinfoil caps that do not look very stylish."
msgstr "Gorros de papel de aluminio que no tienen mucho estilo."

msgid "Scientific Preprints"
msgstr "Preimpresiones Científicas"

msgid "Non-paywalled illegal scientific papers."
msgstr "Artículos científicos ilegales no pagados."

msgid "Sentient AI"
msgstr "IA Consciente"

msgid "Highly illegal AI that is assumed to be sentient."
msgstr "Una IA altamente ilegal que se supone que es consciente."

msgid "Bogus Proofs"
msgstr "Pruebas Falsas"

msgid ""
"Mathematical proofs with almost imperceptible modifications to make them "
"illegally false."
msgstr ""
"Pruebas matemáticas con modificaciones casi imperceptibles para hacerlas "
"ilegalmente falsas."

msgid "p-Hacked Results"
msgstr "Resultados de Hackeados p"

msgid ""
"Scientific trial results obtained through unreliable and illegal uses of "
"statistics."
msgstr ""
"Los resultados de los ensayos científicos se obtienen mediante usos poco "
"fiables e ilegales de las estadísticas."

#. Add faction cargoes as necessary
#. Choose a random cargo and create it
#. TODO make this more nuanced
#. set it to name only
#. mission generics
#. Allow extra time for refuelling stops.
#. Choose amount of cargo and mission reward. This depends on the mission tier.
msgid "Smuggle {tonnes} of {cargo}"
msgstr "Contrabando de {tonnes} de {cargo}"

msgid "Smuggling contraband goods to {pnt} in the {sys} system.{msg}"
msgstr "Contrabando de mercancías a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}.{msg}"

msgid ""
"#rWARNING:#0 Contraband is illegal in most systems, and you will face "
"consequences if caught by patrols."
msgstr ""
"#rADVERTENCIA:#0 El contrabando es ilegal en la mayoría de los sistemas, y "
"te sufrirás las consecuencias si te atrapan las patrullas."

msgid "{tonnes} of {cargo} are loaded onto your ship."
msgstr "{tonnes} de {cargo} se cargan en tu nave."

#. only hook after accepting
#. 100STU per tick
#. set OSD
msgid ""
"A shifty, hasty bunch of dockworkers unload the {cargo} from your ship. One "
"of them hands you a credit stick worth #g{credits}#0 as they make their "
"leave."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You drop off the containers of {cargo} at an agreed-upon location and await "
"your payment. After some time, you receive an anonymous transfer of "
"#g{credits}#0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {cargo} packages are mixed in with legitimate deliveries to be handled "
"by a local agency. The overseer hands you #g{credits}#0 of their bribe."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {cargo} is unloaded at the docks by a drunken bunch of pirates. "
"#g{credits}#0 is left in your ship as they finish up."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The {cargo} is taken off your hands and away for further distribution, not "
"before you are given your payment of #g{credits}#0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As you land, a group comes over to your ship right away to take care of the "
"{cargo}. After it's unloaded, you're paid your fair share of #g{credits}#0."
msgstr ""

#. increase faction
#. Date hook
#. Case still in time
msgid "Smuggling {cargo}"
msgstr "Contrabando {cargo}"

#. Case missed deadline
msgid "You have failed to deliver the goods on time!"
msgstr "¡No has entregado la mercancía a tiempo!"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Pirate Smuggle Cake">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>20</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. if require("common.pirate").systemPresence() &lt;= 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#. if player.wealth() &lt; 400e3 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Opens up Pirate contraband missions. The player is asked to take a cake
#. (illegal) to a random system.
#.
#.
#.
#. TODO replace images with something meant for the VN
msgid "Sweaty Individual"
msgstr "Individuo Sudoroso"

msgid "Burly Individual"
msgstr "Individuo Corpulento"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. target destination. Override "always_available" to true.
#. Choose reward
msgid ""
"You see a nervous looking individual that seems to be sweating profusely."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un individuo de aspecto nervioso que parece estar sudando profusamente."

msgid "You approach the giddy looking character."
msgstr "Te acercas al personaje de aspecto aturdido."

msgid ""
"They are fairly absorbed in thought and take a while to notice you. "
"Suddenly, without warning, they jump out of their chair and almost fall to "
"the ground.\n"
"\"Crikes! You scared the shit out of me.\"\n"
"They clutch at their shirt as if trying to hold their heart in their ribcage."
msgstr ""
"Está bastante absorto en sus pensamientos y tarda en fijarse en ti. De "
"repente, sin previo aviso, salta de la silla y casi se cae al suelo.\n"
"\" ¡Rayos! Me has dado un susto de muerte.\"\n"
"Se agarra a la camisa como si tratara de parar su corazón en la caja "
"torácica."

msgid ""
"They pant for a while and then try to somewhat recover their composure as "
"they sit down once more. They seem sweatier than before.\n"
"\"Hey, say, you look like a pilot. You see, I was asked to deliver a "
"package, but I'm not feeling so well…\"\n"
"They cough to the side somewhat exaggeratedly while looking at you from the "
"corner of their eye."
msgstr ""
"Jadea un rato y luego intenta recuperar un poco la compostura al sentarte de "
"nuevo. Parece más sudoroso que antes.\n"
"\"Oye, di, pareces un piloto. Verás, me han pedido que entregue un paquete, "
"pero no me encuentro muy bien...\"\n"
"Tose hacia un lado de forma algo exagerada mientras te mira de reojo."

msgid ""
"They lean closer to you and lower their voice.\n"
"\"I was asked to deliver a… a…\"\n"
"They furrow their brows for a second.\n"
"\"…a cake! To {pnt} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"Se inclina más hacia ti y baja la voz.\n"
"\"Me pidieron que entregara un... un...\"\n"
"Arruga las cejas por un segundo.\n"
"\"...un pastel. Para {pnt} en el sistema {sys}.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's nothing out of the ordinary, I swear! Only that this cake you see, "
"it's got some special… icing that is really sensitive. Like super sensitive. "
"The slightest disturbance can melt it and lay it all to waste. In "
"particular, any radiation can easily melt it even though it is shielded. "
"Especially stuff like scanning radiation. You catch my drift?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡No es nada fuera de lo común, lo juro! Sólo que este pastel que ves, "
"tiene un glaseado especial... que es realmente sensible. Como súper "
"sensible. La más mínima perturbación puede derretirlo y echarlo todo a "
"perder. En particular, cualquier radiación puede derretirlo fácilmente "
"aunque esté blindado. Especialmente cosas como la radiación de escaneo. "
"¿Entiendes lo que digo?\""

msgid ""
"\"All you would have to do is take the cake and go to {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system, without getting any of that nasty scanning radiation on you.\"\n"
"They shiver with disgust to emphasize and you can see some of their sweat "
"fly off onto the bar floor.\n"
"\"Once you deliver it I'll split the money half and half with you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo único que tendrías que hacer es coger el pastel e ir a {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}, sin que te caiga ninguna de esas desagradables radiaciones de "
"escaneo.\"\n"
"Se estremece de asco al enfatizar y se puede ver cómo parte de su sudor "
"vuela al suelo del bar.\n"
"\"Una vez que lo entregues me repartiré el dinero mitad y mitad contigo.\""

msgid "You stare at them coldly."
msgstr "Los miras con frialdad."

msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine, take it all. It should be {credits}. Just remember no scanning "
"means no problems.\"\n"
"They extend their sweaty hand towards you.\n"
"\"So, are you in?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bien, bien, tómalo todo. Deberían ser {credits}. Sólo recuerda que no "
"escanear significa no tener problemas.\"\n"
"Extiende su mano sudorosa hacia ti.\n"
"\"Entonces, ¿estás dentro?\""

msgid "You decline their offer."
msgstr "Declinas su oferta."

msgid ""
"They slump down in the chair in defeat.\n"
"\"Shit, what am I going to do. Think, Sam, think!\""
msgstr ""
"Se desploma en la silla, derrotado.\n"
"\"Mierda, qué voy a hacer. Piensa, Sam, piensa.\""

msgid ""
"As you take your leave, you notice they have once again started to profusely "
"sweat."
msgstr ""
"Cuando te despides, te das cuenta de que ha vuelto a sudar profusamente."

msgid "You accept their mission without shaking their hand."
msgstr "Aceptas su misión sin darles la mano."

msgid ""
"\"You're a lifesaver!\"\n"
"They lean forward and get a bit more serious.\n"
"\"One thing though, you do know how to use stealth to get around scanning "
"right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Eres un salvavidas!\"\n"
"Se inclinan hacia delante y se ponen un poco más serios.\n"
"\"Una cosa, sin embargo, sabes cómo usar el sigilo para evitar el escaneo, "
"¿verdad?\""

msgid "Stealth?"
msgstr "¿Ocultarte?"

msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto!"

msgid ""
"\"Oh boy, you're not going to deliver this cake in one piece without "
"stealth. It's very simple. All ships have three main statistics: range they "
"are detected at, signature range, and stealth range. Detection determines "
"how far away ships can detect your presence, while signature range controls "
"how well they can target your ship and identify it. When within signature "
"range, ships can then scan you which does nasty things like melting cakes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, muchacho, no vas a entregar este pastel en una sola pieza sin sigilo. "
"Es muy sencillo. Todas las naves tienen tres estadísticas principales: el "
"rango al que son detectadas, el rango de firma y el rango de sigilo. La "
"detección determina la distancia a la que las naves pueden detectar tu "
"presencia, mientras que el rango de firma controla lo bien que pueden "
"apuntar a tu nave e identificarla. Cuando estáñ dentro del rango de firma, "
"las naves pueden escanearte, lo que hace cosas desagradables como fundir "
"pasteles.\""

msgid ""
"\"To avoid getting spotted and scanned, you can go into stealth with {key}. "
"When in stealth, you move much slower than normal, however, ships can only "
"detect you when they are within your stealth range. No detection, no "
"scanning, no problems. You can only use stealth if there are no ships "
"nearby, and it is easier to stealth in asteroids or systems with "
"interference. And if you get detected while in stealth, your cover will be "
"blown.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Para evitar ser detectado y escaneado, puedes entrar en sigilo con {key}. "
"Cuando estás en sigilo, te mueves mucho más lento de lo normal, sin embargo, "
"las naves sólo pueden detectarte cuando están dentro de tu rango de sigilo. "
"Sin detección, sin escaneo, no hay problemas. Solo puedes usar el sigilo si "
"no hay naves cerca, y es más fácil ser sigiloso en asteroides o sistemas con "
"interferencias. Y si te detectan mientras estás en sigilo, tu tapadera se "
"desvanecerá.\""

msgid ""
"\"So as long as you stealth with {key} and stay away from ships, you won't "
"be scanned and the cake will be alright.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que mientras sigas con {key} y te mantengas alejado de las naves, no "
"serás escaneado y el pastel estará bien.\""

msgid ""
"\"If a ship starts to scan you, it'll be marked on your radar and overlay "
"map. Furthermore, if you're carrying stuff that you don't want scanned, your "
"autonav system will automatically be paused so you react. Make sure to get "
"away and stealth so that they can't scan you any more. Don't want to spoil "
"the cake!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si una nave empieza a escanearte, quedará marcada en tu radar y en el mapa "
"superpuesto. Además, si llevas cosas que no quieres que escaneen, tu sistema "
"de navegación automática se pausará automáticamente para que reacciones. "
"Asegúrate de alejarte y pasar desapercibido para que no puedan escanearte "
"más. ¡No querrás estropear el pastel!\""

msgid ""
"\"Great. One second, let me get the cake.\"\n"
"They go to the restroom and come back holding a nondescript brown box that "
"seems to have 'Cake' hastily scribbled on it. They promptly hand it over to "
"you while looking both ways.\n"
"\"OK, so that's it. Make sure to take this to {pnt} in the {sys} system, and "
"watch out for scanning!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Genial. Un segundo, déjame coger la tarta.\"\n"
"Va al baño y vuelve con una caja marrón anodina en la que parece haber un "
"garabato de \"Tarta\". Te la entrega rápidamente mientras mira a ambos "
"lados.\n"
"\"Bien, eso es todo. Asegúrate de llevar esto a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}, "
"¡y ten cuidado con el escaneo!\""

msgid ""
"As you leave, behind you can hear them let out a big sigh of what you can "
"only assume is relief."
msgstr ""
"Cuando te vas, detrás de ti puedes oír cómo suelta un gran suspiro de lo que "
"sólo puedes suponer que es alivio."

msgid "Cake"
msgstr "Pastel"

msgid ""
"A cake that is supposedly sensitive to scanning radiation. Don't let anyone "
"scan it."
msgstr ""
"Un pastel que supuestamente es sensible a la radiación del escáner. No dejes "
"que nadie lo escanee."

msgid "Deliver Cake"
msgstr "Entrega Pastel"

msgid "Fly to {pnt} in the {sys} system without getting scanned"
msgstr "Vuela a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} sin ser escaneado"

msgid ""
"Deliver a cake to {pnt} in the {sys} system. Apparently it has a special "
"frosting and will be damaged if you are scanned. Use stealth to avoid "
"getting scanned."
msgstr ""
"Entrega un pastel a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Aparentemente tiene un "
"glaseado especial y se dañará si te escanean. Utiliza el sigilo para evitar "
"que te escaneen."

#. only hook after accepting
#. Land hook
msgid "After you land you are promptly greeted by a burly looking individual."
msgstr ""
"Tras el aterrizaje, un individuo de aspecto corpulento te recibe rápidamente."

msgid ""
"\"So you've been sent by Sam? That weasel, I knew they weren't cut out for "
"this work.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Así que han sido enviados por Sam? Esa comadreja, sabía que no estaban "
"hechos para este trabajo.\""

msgid ""
"You guess that this is the person you were supposed to deliver the cake to "
"and hand it over."
msgstr ""
"Adivinas que se trata de la persona a la que debías entregar el pastel y se "
"lo entregas."

msgid ""
"They take a look at the word 'Cake' written on the box and burst into "
"laughter. After a while they calm down and turn to you.\n"
"\"This was their idea, wasn't it? Always been a bit weird that one.\""
msgstr ""
"Miran la palabra \" Pastel \" escrita en la caja y se echa a reír. Al cabo "
"de un rato se calma y se dirigen a ti.\n"
"\"Esto no fue idea tuya, ¿no? Siempre ha sido un poco raro ese.\""

msgid ""
"\"I guess you're not naïve enough to think this is a cake right?\"\n"
"They chuckle.\n"
"\"Anyway, you did good work bringing it here. I'll get you your reward wired "
"and if you're interested in doing new jobs look into the mission computers. "
"I've white-listed you to act as a courier.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que no eres tan ingenuo como para pensar que esto es un pastel, "
"¿verdad?\"\n"
"Se ríen.\n"
"\"De todos modos, has hecho un buen trabajo trayéndola aquí. Te conseguiré "
"tu recompensa por cable y si estás interesado en hacer nuevos trabajos busca "
"en los ordenadores de misión. Te he puesto en la lista blanca para actuar "
"como mensajero.\""

msgid ""
"\"Take care.\"\n"
"As they lumber away, you suddenly notice that quite a few suspicious figures "
"in the background disappear and follow them away. What have you gotten into?"
msgstr ""
"\"Ten cuidado\".\n"
"Mientras se aleja, te das cuenta de repente de que unas cuantas figuras "
"sospechosas en el fondo desaparecen y se alejan. ¿En qué te has metido?"

msgid ""
"You helped deliver a 'cake' for some shady individuals. Your success has "
"opened up more 'special' delivery missions from the mission computer."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a entregar un \"pastel\" para unos individuos sospechosos. Tu "
"éxito ha abierto más misiones de entrega \"especiales\" desde el ordenador "
"de misiones."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Hitman">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>10</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <system>Alteris</system>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. </notes>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>pir_cap_ch01_med</tag>
#. </tags>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Pirate Hitman
#.
#. Corrupt Merchant wants you to destroy competition
#.
#. Author: nloewen
#.
#. --
#. Mission constants
#. TODO make it also appear in other systems?
#. Forward-declared functions
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Hitman 2">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <chance>10</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <system>Alteris</system>
#. <done>Hitman</done>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>pir_cap_ch01_med</tag>
#. </tags>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Pirate Hitman 2
#.
#. Corrupt Merchant wants you to destroy competition
#.
#. Author: nloewen
#.
#. --
#. Mission constants
msgid "Shifty Trader"
msgstr "Comerciante Sospechoso"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
msgid ""
"You see a shifty looking man sitting in a darkened corner of the bar. He is "
"trying to discreetly motion you to join him, but is only managing to make "
"himself look suspicious. Perhaps he's watched too many holovideos."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un hombre de aspecto sospechoso sentado en un rincón oscuro del bar. "
"Intenta invitarte discretamente a unirte a él, pero sólo consigue parecer "
"sospechoso. Quizá haya visto demasiados holovídeos."

#.
#. Mission entry point.
#. --
msgid ""
"The man motions for you to take a seat next to him. Voice barely above a "
"whisper, he asks, \"How'd you like to earn some easy money? If you're "
"comfortable with getting your hands dirty, that is.\""
msgstr ""
"El hombre te indica que tomes asiento a su lado. Con la voz apenas por "
"encima de un susurro, te pregunta: \"¿Te gustaría ganar dinero fácil? Si te "
"sientes cómodo ensuciándote las manos, claro.\""

msgid ""
"Apparently relieved that you've accepted his offer, he continues, \"There're "
"some new merchants edging in on my trade routes in {sys}. I want you to make "
"sure they know they're not welcome.\" Pausing for a moment, he notes, \"You "
"don't have to kill anyone, just rough them up a bit.\""
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente aliviado de que hayas aceptado su oferta, continúa: \"Hay "
"algunos nuevos mercaderes que se acercan a mis rutas comerciales en {sys}. "
"Quiero que te asegures de que sepan que no son bienvenidos\". Haciendo una "
"pausa, señala: \"No tienes que matar a nadie, sólo darles una paliza.\""

msgid "Some easy money"
msgstr "Un poco de dinero fácil"

msgid ""
"A shifty businessman has tasked you with chasing away merchant competition "
"in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Un empresario sospechoso te ha encargado que ahuyentes a la competencia "
"mercantil en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"Attack, but do not kill, Trader pilots in the {sys} system so that they run "
"away"
msgstr ""
"Ataca, pero no mates, a los pilotos Comerciantes en el sistema {sys} para "
"que huyan"

msgid "Return to {pnt} in the {sys} system for payment"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} para el pago"

#. Set hooks
#. Entering a system
#. Check to see if reaching target system
#. Attacked a trader
#. An attacked Trader Jumped
#. attack finished
#. Set hooks
#. Entering a system
#. Check to see if reaching target system
#. killed a trader
#. attack finished
msgid "MISSION SUCCESS! Return for payment."
msgstr "¡ÉXITO DE LA MISIÓN! Vuelve para el pago."

#. landed
msgid ""
"As you inform your acquaintance that you successfully scared off the "
"traders, he grins and transfers a sum of credits to your account. \"That "
"should teach them to stay out of my space.\""
msgstr ""
"Mientras informas a tu conocido de que has conseguido ahuyentar a los "
"comerciantes, él sonríe y transfiere una suma de créditos a tu cuenta. \"Eso "
"les enseñará a mantenerse fuera de mi espacio.\""

msgid ""
"You chased away a shifty merchant's competition and were paid a sum of "
"credits by the shifty merchant for your services."
msgstr ""
"Has ahuyentado a la competencia de un comerciante sospechoso y éste te ha "
"pagado una suma de créditos por tus servicios."

#. Forward-declared functions
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
msgid ""
"You see the shifty merchant who hired you previously. He looks somewhat "
"anxious, perhaps he has more business to discuss."
msgstr ""
"Ves al mercader sospechoso que te contrató anteriormente. Parece algo "
"ansioso, quizás tenga más asuntos que discutir."

#.
#. Mission entry point.
#. --
msgid ""
"As you approach, the man turns to face you and his anxiety seems to abate "
"somewhat. As you take a seat he greets you, \"Ah, so we meet again. My, "
"shall we say… problem, has recurred.\" Leaning closer, he continues, \"This "
"will be somewhat bloodier than last time, but I'll pay you more for your "
"trouble. Are you up for it?\""
msgstr ""
"Cuando te acercas, el hombre se gira para mirarte y tu ansiedad parece "
"disminuir un poco. Cuando tomas asiento, te saluda: \"Ah, así que nos "
"encontramos de nuevo. Mi, digamos... problema, ha reaparecido\". "
"Inclinándose más, continúa: \"Esto será algo más sangriento que la última "
"vez, pero te pagaré más por las molestias. ¿Estás dispuesto a ello?\""

msgid ""
"He nods approvingly. \"It seems that the traders are rather stubborn. They "
"didn't get the message last time and their presence is increasing.\" He lets "
"out a brief sigh before continuing, \"That simply won't do. It's bad for "
"business. Perhaps if a few of their ships disappear, they'll get the hint.\" "
"With the arrangement in place, he gets up. \"I look forward to seeing you "
"soon. Hopefully this will be the end of my problems.\""
msgstr ""
"Asiente con aprobación. \"Parece que los comerciantes son bastante "
"obstinados. No recibieron el mensaje la última vez y su presencia está "
"aumentando\". Deja escapar un breve suspiro antes de continuar: \"Eso "
"simplemente no servirá. Es malo para el negocio. Quizá si desaparecen "
"algunas de sus naves, capten la indirecta\". Una vez hecho el encargo, se "
"levanta. \"Espero verte pronto. Espero que esto sea el fin de mis problemas."
"\""

#. Some variables for keeping track of the mission
#. Set mission details
msgid "Assassin"
msgstr "Asesino"

msgid ""
"A shifty businessman has tasked you with killing merchant competition in the "
"{sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Un empresario sospechoso te ha encargado que acabes con la competencia "
"mercantil en el sistema {sys}."

msgid "Kill Trader pilots in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Mata a los pilotos Comerciante en el sistema {sys}"

#. landed
msgid ""
"You glance around, looking for your acquaintance, but he has noticed you "
"first, motioning for you to join him. As you approach the table, he smirks. "
"\"I hope the Empire didn't give you too much trouble.\" After a short pause, "
"he continues, \"The payment has been transferred. Much as I enjoy working "
"with you, hopefully this is the last time I'll require your services.\""
msgstr ""
"Miras a tu alrededor, buscando a tu conocido, pero él se ha fijado en ti "
"primero y te hace un gesto para que te unas a él. Cuando te acercas a la "
"mesa, sonríe. \"Espero que el Imperio no te haya dado muchos problemas\". "
"Tras una breve pausa, continúa: \"El pago ha sido transferido. Por mucho que "
"me guste trabajar contigo, espero que esta sea la última vez que requiera de "
"tus servicios.\""

msgid ""
"You assassinated some of the shifty merchant's competition and were paid a "
"sum of credits for your services. He said that he should hopefully not "
"require further services from you."
msgstr ""
"Has asesinado a algunos de los competidores del mercader y has recibido una "
"suma de créditos por tus servicios. Te dijo que, con suerte, no necesitaría "
"más tus servicios."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Lucas 01">
#. <unique />
#. <chance>20</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. -- Required to bribe Maanen's Moon
#. if spob.get("Maanen's Moon"):reputation() &lt; 0 then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. -- Should start at a normal planet
#. local t = spob.cur():tags()
#. if t.refugee or t.station or t.restricted then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. -- Within 6 jumps of a refugee spob
#. local dist = math.huge
#. for k,v in ipairs(spob.getAll()) do
#. if v:tags().refugee then
#. if v:system():jumpDist() &lt; 6 then
#. return require("misn_test").reweight_active()
#. end
#. end
#. end
#. return false
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. <campaign>Lucas</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Refugee Family
#.
#. A person who escaped the Incident is trying to get in touch with their family.
#. --
msgid "Refugee Family"
msgstr "Familia Refugiada"

#. Mission stages
#. 0: just started
#. 1: visited first spob
#. 2: visited last spob and got family
#. Get closest refugee planet
#. First spob is closest one, second one is fixed
msgid "The person looks stressed and worn out."
msgstr "La persona parece estresada y agotada."

msgid ""
"You approach the stressed-out individual gnawing at their nails at the bar."
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Any chance you could help me find my family? I'll pay, I promise!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "They go back to chewing their nails."
msgstr "Vuelve a morderse las uñas."

msgid ""
"\"My name is Lucas. I'm a Nebula refugee. When I was very young, my family "
"and I escaped the Incident, but I don't know what happened-we got separated."
"\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I never really thought about it; I just did what I was told and went with "
"the flow, until one day I couldn't anymore. You understand?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"They pause and clench their fists.\n"
"\"There was always something missing in me, like something fundamental the "
"Incident took away, but I didn't realize it, didn't understand.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Then something snapped. I had a dream that brought back what I'd buried—my "
"family. I guess I'd repressed it for so long. Survival instincts maybe?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"Since then I've been trying to find them with the credits I've managed to "
"scrape together. I don't think they were as lucky; they're probably stuck on "
"some refugee world. The governments don't care for us at all. They just toss "
"refugees onto barely habitable planets and look away. We're human too!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I've narrowed it down a bit: I think they're on {spb} in the {sys} system. "
"Please try to find them! I'll give you all the information I have. Here, "
"take this locket—it's the only thing I have from them.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"They hand you an old locket that looks like it's missing half. It's fairly "
"simple and made of some rugged metal alloy, but bears signs of heavy use."
msgstr ""

msgid "\"I'll be waiting here.\""
msgstr "\"Esperaré aquí.\""

msgid ""
"You promised to help Lucas, the ex-Nebula refugee, find his family who may "
"not have made it far from the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"Prometiste ayudar a Lucas, el ex refugiado de la Nebulosa, a encontrar a su "
"familia, que quizá no haya llegado lejos de la Nebulosa."

msgid "Old Pendant"
msgstr "Colgante Antiguo"

msgid "An old locket belonging to Lucas."
msgstr "Un viejo medallón perteneciente a Lucas."

msgid "Search for the family at {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Buscar la familia en {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

msgid ""
"You land and begin to ask around to see if there are any traces of Lucas' "
"family."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As you converse with many of the refugees at {spb}, you begin to appreciate "
"the calamity of the Incident. Many refugees are missing or searching for "
"family members, carrying deep psychological scars that won't heal."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Feeling like you're searching for a needle in a haystack, you're almost "
"ready to give up when you find an older one-armed refugee. They take a close "
"look at the locket and mention they used to share a cell with someone who "
"had the same locket on {spb} in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"From their story, {spb} sounds horribly traumatic, a refugee limbo where "
"atrocities are commonplace. The planet is locked down; you'll likely have to "
"bribe the authorities to access it."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"They give you the location of the cell where they were and wish you luck. "
"Looks like you finally have a lead."
msgstr ""

msgid "Search for the family at {pnt} ({sys} system, bribe if necessary)"
msgstr "Buscar a la familia en {pnt} (sistema {sys}, sobornar si es necesario)"

msgid ""
"You manage to land on {spb}. Although things are quite quiet and clean "
"around the spaceport, it all takes a turn for the worse once you pass the "
"checkpoints and head into the slums toward the location you were given."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The atmosphere is dark, almost oppressive, and you feel the locals' stares. "
"They clearly don't get many visitors."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Eventually you get to the cell you were told about. It seems to be locked. "
"You take a look to see if you can override it."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente llegas a la celda de la que te hablaron. Parece estar cerrada. "
"Echas un vistazo para ver si puedes anularla."

msgid "Lucas' Father"
msgstr "Padre de Lucas"

msgid "A very weakened old man."
msgstr "Un anciano muy debilitado."

msgid ""
"You open the cell to find a very weakened old man. At first they are "
"terrified, thinking you've come to take their meagre possessions or their "
"life, but when you mention Lucas sent you they ease for a moment before "
"collapsing from shock."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You quickly look around to see if there is anyone else there. Once you "
"confirm the man is alone, you pick him up and make your way back to the "
"spaceport. Likely due to malnourishment, the old man is a much lighter load "
"than you had expected. On the way back, surprisingly enough, people seem to "
"take less notice of you than when you came in."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Eventually you reach the spaceport checkpoint. The guards raise an eyebrow "
"at the old man you're carrying, but once you show them the receipt of your "
"spaceship, they let you through."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente llegas al puesto de control del puerto espacial. Los guardias "
"enarcan una ceja al ver al anciano que llevas, pero una vez que les enseñas "
"el recibo de tu nave espacial, te dejan pasar."

msgid ""
"The old man is in rough shape and falls into a deep slumber when you set him "
"aboard the ship. It would be best to head back to Lucas as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You fail to override the cell. As you are attracting too much suspicion, you "
"decide to head back to the spaceport area. You'll have to come back if you "
"want to try again."
msgstr ""
"No consigues anular la celda. Como estás atrayendo demasiadas sospechas, "
"decides volver a la zona del puerto espacial. Tendrás que volver si quieres "
"intentarlo de nuevo."

msgid ""
"You land and quickly go find Lucas, who then follows you back to your ship."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y vas rápidamente a buscar a Lucas, que te sigue hasta tu nave."

msgid ""
"When Lucas sees the old man, his eyes well up and he kneels to take a closer "
"look.\n"
"\"Dear old man, what did they do to you?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Still kneeling, Lucas shuffles forward and hugs the old man tightly. "
"Probably not the reunion he was looking for, but better than nothing "
"nonetheless."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"After a solemn while, Lucas kisses the old man on the cheek and turns to "
"you.\n"
"\"Thank you for everything. I can take it from here. I have to see what "
"happened to the others.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You help Lucas take the old man off the ship, and also return the locket. "
"Lucas thanks you fervently for all you've done and hands you a credit chip. "
"He then heads off with his father towards the nearest medical centre."
msgstr ""
"Ayudas a Lucas a sacar al anciano de la nave y también a devolverle el "
"medallón. Lucas te agradece fervientemente todo lo que has hecho y te "
"entrega una ficha de crédito. Después se dirige con su padre hacia el centro "
"médico más cercano."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Lucas 02">
#. <unique />
#. <chance>60</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. -- Must be 5 cycles after finishing Lucas 01
#. local t = var.peek("lucas01_done")
#. if t and time.cur() &lt; t + time.new( 0, 5, 0 ) then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. -- Should be "nearish" to Shangris Station, but not the station
#. local scur = spob.cur()
#. local ss, sys = spob.getS("Shangris Station")
#. if scur==ss or sys:jumpDist() &gt; 9 then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. -- Not be restricted and be generic faction
