#. <notes>
#. <tier>1</tier>
#. <campaign>Lucas</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Lucas 02
#. --
msgid "Leaving Society"
msgstr "Abandonar la Sociedad"

#. Mission stages
#. 0: just started
#. 1: talked to pirate
#. 2: looted / took from pirate and found jump (or already known)
msgid "Lucas looks more worn out than before."
msgstr "Lucas parece más agotado que antes."

#. Have to handle the case not only the spob is known (from clansworld map), but also the route!
msgid "Take Lucas to {spob} ({sys} system})"
msgstr "Lleva a Lucas a {spob} (sistema {sys})"

#. Change message first time you talk
msgid "Will you help Lucas become a pirate?"
msgstr "¿Ayudarás a Lucas a convertirse en un pirata?"

msgid "You approach Lucas, who seems even more on edge than before."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"He seems to be mumbling to himself.\n"
"\"I don't know why I trusted them…\""
msgstr ""
"Parece que murmura para sí mismo.\n"
"\"No sé por qué confié en ellos...\""

msgid "\"You OK?\""
msgstr "\"¿Estás bien?\""

msgid ""
"It takes a while for them to notice your presence, but when they do, they "
"give a half-hearted grin.\n"
"\"Hey {playername}.\""
msgstr ""
"Tarda un rato en percatarse de tu presencia, pero cuando lo hace, esboza una "
"media sonrisa.\n"
"\"Hey {playername}.\""

msgid ""
"\"Aw, screw it. I messed up. I put my faith in the system and got "
"steamrolled. They treat us like trash, useless garbage.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I thought we were at fault, like we'd done something wrong and had to be "
"punished. But we're not the ones who did the wronging.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "lucas02"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué ha pasado?\""

msgid "\"My family is dead. All of them. Kaput. Gone.\""
msgstr "\"Mi familia está muerta. Todos ellos. Kaput. Desaparecidos.\""

msgid ""
"\"My sister and mother died on Maanen's Moon, and my father—my poor father—"
"was denied any damn treatment in this so-called civilized society.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"The bureaucrats refuse to treat illegal Nebula refugees. They even wanted "
"to ship him back to Maanen's bloody Moon! Heartless bastards.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"When he died in my arms, I lost all hope. I thought my only option was to "
"repent and follow my family. But then I realized, why are we at fault? Isn't "
"civilization supposed to look out for humanity?\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I turned that despair into anger. I want revenge and to carve my own path."
"\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"This may surprise you, but I've decided to become a pirate.\""
msgstr "\"Esto puede sorprenderte, pero he decidido convertirme en pirata.\""

msgid "\"A pirate!?\""
msgstr "¿¡Un pirata!?"

msgid "\"Sounds great!\""
msgstr "\"¡Suena genial!\""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, you're not surprised?\"\n"
"They lean in and whisper to you.\n"
"\"Don't tell me you're a… Wait, no, it's probably better not to know.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"People think pirates are brutes unfit for society, but that's only the "
"bottom rung. The pirate clans are fully functional societies—less arbitrary "
"and oppressive than the Empire and the Houses.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Will you help me become a pirate?\""
msgstr "\"¿Me ayudarás a convertirme en pirata?\""

msgid "They sink back into anxious fidgeting and hope."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"They seem a bit taken aback.\n"
"\"I'm surprised you accepted so easily.\""
msgstr ""
"Parece un poco desconcertados.\n"
"\"Me sorprende que aceptaras tan fácilmente.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've been looking around, and apparently there's a nearby clan known as "
"the Raven Clan, which has many ex-Nebula refugees. I need you to take me to "
"their base, which is rumoured to be called {spob}, and isn't easily "
"accessible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He estado mirando por ahí, y al parecer hay un clan cercano conocido como "
"el Clan del Cuervo, que tiene muchos refugiados ex Nebulosa. Necesito que me "
"lleves a su base, que se rumorea que se llama {spob}, y no es de fácil "
"acceso.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've been told some pirates like to hang around {spob} in the {sys} "
"system. We should head over there to see if we can find a lead.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Lucas eagerly gets on your ship, ready to start a new life. You have a "
"feeling it's not going to be that easy though."
msgstr ""
"Lucas sube ansioso a tu nave, dispuesto a empezar una nueva vida. Sin "
"embargo, tienes la sensación de que no va a ser tan fácil."

msgid ""
"\"Wait, you know it already? You've been there?!? This sure makes things "
"much easier. Please take me to {spob}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, ¿ya lo conoces? ¿¡Has estado allí!? Esto seguro que facilita mucho "
"las cosas. Por favor, ¡llévame a {spob}!\""

msgid ""
"Lucas eagerly gets on your ship and is ready to start their new life on "
"{spob}. You have a feeling it's not going to be that easy though."
msgstr ""
"Lucas sube ansioso a tu nave y está listo para comenzar su nueva vida en "
"{spob}. Sin embargo, tienes la sensación de que no va a ser tan fácil."

msgid ""
"You promised to help Lucas, the ex-Nebula refugee who lost his family, "
"become a pirate."
msgstr ""
"Prometiste ayudar a Lucas, el ex refugiado de Nebulosa que perdió a su "
"familia, a convertirse en pirata."

#. The Junker doesn't like people
#. outfit.get("Berserk Chip"),
msgid "Lucas"
msgstr "Lucas"

msgid ""
"An individual who has given up on so-called 'civilized society' and wishes "
"to become a pirate."
msgstr ""
"Un individuo que ha renunciado a la llamada \"sociedad civilizada\" y desea "
"convertirse en pirata."

#. If known we skip most of the mission
msgid "Try to find hints about {target} at {spob} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Intenta encontrar pistas sobre {target} en {spob} (sistema {sys})"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Pirate Hit Intro">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <cond>
#. local scur = spob.cur()
#. if not scur:blackmarket() and not scur:tags().criminal then
#. if not require("misn_test").mercenary(true) then
#. return false
#. end
#. end
#.
#. -- Lower probability on non-pirate places
#. local pir = require "common.pirate"
#. if not pir.factionIsPirate( scur:faction() ) and rnd.rnd() &lt; 0.2 then
#. return false
#. end
#.
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <faction>Wild Ones</faction>
#. <faction>Black Lotus</faction>
#. <faction>Raven Clan</faction>
#. <faction>Dreamer Clan</faction>
#. <faction>Pirate</faction>
#. <faction>Free Trader</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. </notes>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>pir_cap_ch01_lrg</tag>
#. </tags>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Pirate Hit Intro
#.
#. Introductory mission to the pirate hits, opens up the generic version of the
#. missions.
#. --
#. Forward-declared functions
msgid "Shady Individual"
msgstr "Individuo Turbio"

msgid "You see a shady individual, maybe they know something about {spob}?"
msgstr "Ves a un individuo sospechoso, ¿quizás sepa algo sobre {spob}?"

msgid ""
"You land on {spob}, which strikes you as a surprisingly normal-looking "
"world. If you didn't know that it was the centre of the operations of the "
"Raven Pirate Clan, you would have thought it was just a regular trade world."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en {spob}, que te parece un mundo sorprendentemente normal. Si no "
"supieras que es el centro de operaciones del Clan Pirata del Cuervo, habrías "
"pensado que se trata de un mundo comercial normal y corriente."

msgid ""
"You get off your ship with Lucas, whose eyes are sparkling with hopes and "
"dreams."
msgstr "Bajas de la nave con Lucas, cuyos ojos brillan de esperanzas y sueños."

msgid "\"{spob} at last! I can almost taste the freedom!\""
msgstr "\"¡Por fin {spob}! Casi puedo saborear la libertad!\""

msgid ""
"\"Thank you for all your help getting me here! Here, let me give you some "
"credits for your troubles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias por toda tu ayuda trayéndome aquí! Déjame darte algunos créditos "
"por las molestias.\""

msgid ""
"Lucas seems euphoric to get away from the troubles of his past and begin "
"anew. The question that remains unanswered is whether pirate society is "
"truly more free than other societies. Or is the problem at the core of human "
"nature itself?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You wish him the best, and he tells you to look for him next time you are "
"near Raven space."
msgstr ""
"Le deseas lo mejor y él te dice que le busques la próxima vez que estés "
"cerca del espacio Cuervo."

msgid ""
"You approach the shady character, who clearly wants you gone, and make idle "
"conversation in hopes of drawing out information about {spob}."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The character is less than cooperative and seems more interested in shaking "
"you off than helping. It's an exercise in futility."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Eventually they start ignoring you and leave. Given the amount of people and "
"security on the station, there's not much you can do."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You look around, but the people here don't seem eager to help. You'll have "
"to find another way to get the information."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You meet up with Lucas, who also tried to get the information independently, "
"with the same lack of success."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"He lets out a long sigh.\n"
"\"It doesn't look like we're getting anywhere.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"His eyes suddenly light up.\n"
"\"Maybe it's a long shot, but the best way to become a pirate is probably to "
"pirate, is it not?\""
msgstr ""
"Sus ojos se iluminan de repente.\n"
"\"Tal vez sea una posibilidad remota, pero la mejor manera de convertirse en "
"pirata es probablemente piratear, ¿no?\""

msgid ""
"\"We should try to get on a pirate ship and parley as the pirates do. I "
"don't think Marauder ships will know anything, so we should try to board a "
"true pirate ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Deberíamos intentar subir a una nave pirata y parlamentar como lo hacen "
"los piratas. No creo que las naves merodeadoras sepan nada, así que "
"deberíamos intentar abordar una verdadera nave pirata.\""

msgid ""
"With the next plan of action decided, Lucas heads back to your ship with his "
"head full of dreams of piracy."
msgstr ""
"Con el siguiente plan de acción decidido, Lucas regresa a su nave con la "
"cabeza llena de sueños de piratería."

msgid "Obtain information about {spob} from boarding pirate ships"
msgstr "Obtener información sobre {spob} abordando naves piratas"

#. Not marauders
msgid "Explore Qorel Tunnel and find your way to {spob}."
msgstr "Explora el Túnel Qorel y encuentra el camino a {spob}."

#. just in case remove all
#. Already set up
#. create a local upvalue so it doesn't reference the global which will be out of scope
#. Done already
msgid "Ask about {spob}"
msgstr "Preguntar por {spob}"

msgid ""
"You think us pirates will just tell you anything for money? Well, ye're damn "
"right. I'll tell you for a measly {amount}. What do you say?"
msgstr ""
"¿Crees que los piratas te diremos cualquier cosa por dinero? Bueno, tienes "
"toda la razón. Te lo diré por una miserable {amount}. ¿Qué dices?"

msgid ""
"#rYou do not enough credits.#0\n"
"\"You think I'm going to accept less? Scram poor bum.\""
msgstr ""
"#rNo tienes suficientes créditos.#0\n"
"\"¿Crees que voy a aceptar menos? Lárgate pobre vagabundo.\""

msgid "\"Pleasure doing business with ya.\""
msgstr "\"Un placer hacer negocios contigo.\""

msgid "\"Like I'm going to tell you! You better plead for your life, punk!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Como si fuera a decírtelo! ¡Será mejor que ruegues por tu vida, gamberro!"
"\""

#. Should run just after the comm stuff is done
msgid ""
"You board the ship with Lucas and, through methods you're not proud of, pry "
"out information about a secret jump likely leading to the Qorel tunnel. "
"You're told {spob} is somewhere beyond."
msgstr ""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Pirate Patrol">
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>560</chance>
#. <location>Computer</location>
#. <faction>Wild Ones</faction>
#. <faction>Black Lotus</faction>
#. <faction>Raven Clan</faction>
#. <faction>Dreamer Clan</faction>
#. <faction>Pirate</faction>
#. <notes>
#. <tier>3</tier>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Pirate Patrol
#.
#. Pirate version of the patrol mission.
#. --
#. luacheck: globals abandon_text msg pay_text (from base mission neutral.patrol)
msgid "The crime boss grins and hands you your pay."
msgstr "El jefe del crimen sonríe y te entrega tu paga."

msgid ""
"The local crime boss pays what you were promised, though not before trying "
"(and failing) to pick your pocket."
msgstr ""
"El jefe del crimen local te paga lo prometido, aunque no antes de intentar "
"(y fracasar) hurgar en tu bolsillo."

msgid ""
"You are hit in the face with something and glare in the direction it came "
"from, only to see the crime boss waving at you. When you look down, you see "
"that it is your agreed-upon payment, so you take it and manage a grin."
msgstr ""
"Te golpean en la cara con algo y miras en la dirección de la que procede, "
"sólo para ver al jefe del crimen saludándote con la mano. Cuando bajas la "
"vista, ves que es el pago acordado, así que lo coges y consigues sonreír."

msgid ""
"You are handed your pay in what seems to be a million different credit chips "
"by the crime boss, but sure enough, it adds up to exactly the amount "
"promised."
msgstr ""
"El jefe del crimen te entrega tu paga en lo que parece ser un millón de "
"fichas de crédito diferentes, pero, en efecto, la suma asciende exactamente "
"a la cantidad prometida."

msgid ""
"You are sent a message informing you that landing in the middle of the job "
"is considered to be abandonment. As such, your contract is void and you will "
"not receive payment."
msgstr ""
"Se te envía un mensaje en el que se te informa de que aterrizar en mitad del "
"trabajo se considera un abandono. Como tal, tu contrato es nulo y no "
"recibirás el pago."

msgid "Outsiders detected. Eliminate all outsiders."
msgstr "Forasteros detectados. Elimina a todos los forasteros."

msgid "Outsiders eliminated."
msgstr "Forasteros eliminados."

msgid "Eliminate outsiders"
msgstr "Elimina a los forasteros"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A local crime boss has offered a job to patrol the {sys} system in an effort "
"to keep outsiders from discovering this Pirate stronghold. You will be "
"tasked with checking various points and eliminating any outsiders along the "
"way.\n"
"\n"
"#nPatrol System:#0 {sys}\n"
"#nPatrol Points:#0 {amount}"
msgstr ""
"Un jefe del crimen local te ha ofrecido un trabajo para patrullar el sistema "
"{sys} en un esfuerzo por evitar que los forasteros descubran esta fortaleza "
"pirata. Se te encomendará la tarea de controlar varios puntos y eliminar a "
"cualquier forastero que te encuentres por el camino."

#. mem.misn_desc gets fmt.f'd in the main script
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
