#. --
#.
#.
#. A dangerous cargo mission for Pirate players, where you are attacked. On
#. occasion.
#.
#. Author: bobbens                 (Empire Cargo 00)
#. minor edits by Infiltrator   (Empire Cargo 00)
#. major edits by Lukc
#.
#.
#.
#. local pir = require "common.pirate"
msgid "Pirate Lord"
msgstr "Señor Pirata"

#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#. target destination
msgid ""
"You see a pirate lord raving about something. A significant crowd has "
"gathered around."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un señor pirata delirando por algo. Una multitud importante se ha "
"reunido alrededor."

msgid ""
"It seems like this planet's clan is looking for a pilot to transport a "
"package to another pirate world. Obviously, quite a few mercenaries or even "
"fellow pirates would try to stop anyone transporting that package, and there "
"is probably no need to say the only ways to the other pirate worlds are "
"through hostile territory.\n"
"\n"
"Will you accept the mission?"
msgstr ""
"Parece que el clan de este planeta está buscando un piloto para transportar "
"un paquete a otro mundo pirata. Obviamente, bastantes mercenarios o incluso "
"compañeros piratas tratarían de impedir que alguien transportara ese "
"paquete, y probablemente no hace falta decir que los únicos caminos a los "
"otros mundos piratas son a través de territorio hostil.\n"
"\n"
"¿Aceptas la misión?"

msgid "You roll up your sleeves and head off to your ship."
msgstr "Te arremangas y te diriges a tu nave."

#. Accept the mission
#. Mission details
#. Hey, this mission is probably hell, after all.
msgid "Clans trade"
msgstr "Comercio entre Clanes"

msgid "Deliver some boxes to the pirate clan of {pnt}, in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Entrega unas cajas al clan pirata de {pnt}, en el sistema {sys}."

#. Flavour text and mini-briefing
msgid "Spaceport Bar"
msgstr "Barra del puerto espacial"

#. Set up the goal
msgid "Pirate Packages"
msgstr "Paquetes de Piratas"

msgid "A bunch of pirate packages. You don't want to know what's inside."
msgstr "Un montón de paquetes de piratas. No quieras saber lo que hay dentro."

msgid ""
"Your mission was a complete success! The clan you just gave the packages "
"have already paid you."
msgstr ""
"¡Tu misión ha sido un éxito total! El clan al que acabas de dar los paquetes "
"ya te ha pagado."

