#. Set up rewards
msgid "Raid a {adjective} {name} convoy in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Asaltar una caravana {adjetive} {name} en el sistema {sys}"

msgid ""
"A convoy carrying {cargo} will be passing through the {sys} system on the "
"way from {entersys} to {exitsys}. A local Pirate Lord wants you to assault "
"the convoy and bring back as many tonnes of {cargo} as possible. You will be "
"paid based on how much you are able to bring back.{reputation}"
msgstr ""
"Una caravana que transporta {cargo} pasará por el sistema {sys} en el camino "
"de {entersys} a {exitsys}. Un Señor Pirata local quiere que asaltes la "
"caravana y traigas de vuelta tantas toneladas de {cargo} como sea posible. "
"Se te pagará en función de la cantidad que seas capaz de traer de vuelta."
"{reputation}"

msgid "{rbase} and {rcargo} per ton of {cargo} recovered"
msgstr "{rbase} y {rcargo} por tonelada de {cargo} recuperada"

msgid "Plunder {cargo} from the convoy"
msgstr "Saquea {cargo} de la caravana"

msgid "Deliver the loot to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Entrega el botín a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "You did not recover any {cargo} from the convoy!"
msgstr "¡No recuperaste ninguna {cargo} de la caravana!"

#. Remove it
msgid "Mission Success"
msgstr "Misión Cumplida"

msgid ""
"The workers unload your {cargo} and take it away to somewhere you can't see. "
"As you wonder about your payment, you suddenly receive a message that "
"#g{reward}#0 was transferred to your account."
msgstr ""
"Los trabajadores descargan tu {cargo} y se la llevan a un lugar que no "
"puedes ver. Mientras te preguntas por tu pago, de repente recibes un mensaje "
"de que se ha transferido #g{reward}#0 a tu cuenta."

#. Faction hit
#. Mark as done
msgid ""
"You raided a {adjective} {name} convoy in the {sys} system and stole "
"{tonnes} of {cargo}."
msgstr ""
"Has asaltado una caravana de {adjetive} {name} en el sistema {sys} y has "
"robado {tonnes} de {cargo}."

msgid "Convoy Entry Point"
msgstr "Punto de Entrada de la Caravana"

msgid "Convoy Exit Point"
msgstr "Punto de Salida de la Caravana"

msgid "The convoy will be coming in from {sys} shortly!"
msgstr "¡La caravana llegará desde {sys} en breve!"

#. Only slow down leader, or it can be faster than other guys
#.
