#. --
#.
#.
#. Dead or Alive Proteron Dissident Bounty
#.
#. --
msgid ""
"You and your crew infiltrate the ship's pathetic security and subdue the "
"dissident. You transport them to your ship."
msgstr ""
"Tú y tu tripulación os infiltráis en la patética seguridad de la nave y "
"sometéis al disidente. Lo transportas a tu nave."

msgid ""
"Your crew has a difficult time getting past the ship's security, but "
"eventually succeeds and subdues the dissident."
msgstr ""
"Tu tripulación tiene dificultades para burlar la seguridad de la nave, pero "
"finalmente lo consigues y sometes al disidente."

msgid ""
"The ship's security system turns out to be no match for your crew. You "
"infiltrate the ship and capture the dissident."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de seguridad de la nave resulta no ser rival para tu tripulación. "
"Te infiltras en la nave y capturas al disidente."

msgid "Your crew infiltrates the ship and captures the dissident."
msgstr "Tu tripulación se infiltra en la nave y captura al disidente."

msgid ""
"Getting past this ship's security was surprisingly easy. Didn't this "
"dissident know that they were wanted?"
msgstr ""
"Pasar la seguridad de esta nave fue sorprendentemente fácil. ¿No sabía este "
"disidente que lo buscaban?"

msgid ""
"After verifying that you killed your target, an officer hands you your pay."
msgstr ""
"Tras comprobar que has matado a tu objetivo, un oficial te entrega tu paga."

msgid ""
"After verifying that the target is indeed dead, the tired-looking officer "
"smiles and hands you your pay."
msgstr ""
"Tras comprobar que el objetivo está efectivamente muerto, el agente, de "
"aspecto cansado, sonríe y te entrega tu paga."

msgid "The officer thanks you and promptly hands you your pay."
msgstr "El agente te da las gracias y te entrega rápidamente la paga."

msgid ""
"The officer takes you into a locked room, where the death of your target is "
"quietly verified. The officer then pays you and sends you off."
msgstr ""
"El oficial te lleva a una sala cerrada, donde se verifica en silencio la "
"muerte de tu objetivo. A continuación, el agente te paga y se despide de ti."

msgid ""
"The officer verifies the death of your target, goes through the necessary "
"paperwork, and hands you your pay, looking bored the entire time."
msgstr ""
"El oficial verifica la muerte de tu objetivo, revisa el papeleo necesario y "
"te entrega tu paga, con cara de aburrimiento todo el tiempo."

msgid "An officer takes the dissident into custody and hands you your pay."
msgstr "Un oficial se lleva al disidente bajo custodia y te entrega tu paga."

msgid ""
"The dissident puts up a fight as you take them to the officer, who then "
"hands you your pay."
msgstr ""
"El disidente se resiste a llevarlo ante el oficial, que te entrega tu paga."

msgid ""
"The officer you deal with seems to especially dislike dissidents. The one "
"you captured is taken off your hands and you are handed your pay without a "
"word."
msgstr ""
"Al oficial con el que tratas parece disgustarle especialmente los "
"disidentes. Te quitan de las manos al que has capturado y te entregan la "
"paga sin mediar palabra."

msgid ""
"An officer rushes the fearful-looking dissident into a secure hold, pays you "
"the appropriate bounty, and takes the dissident into custody."
msgstr ""
"Un oficial se apresura a llevar al disidente de aspecto temeroso a una "
"bodega segura, te paga la recompensa correspondiente y se lleva al disidente "
"bajo custodia."

msgid ""
"The officer you greet gives you a puzzled look when you say that you "
"captured your target alive. Nonetheless, they politely take the dissident "
"off of your hands and hand you your pay."
msgstr ""
"El oficial al que saludas te mira con desconcierto cuando dices que has "
"capturado a tu objetivo con vida. No obstante, te quitan amablemente al "
"disidente de las manos y te entregan la paga."

msgid ""
"\"Greetings. I can see that you were trying to collect a bounty. Well, as "
"you can see, I earned the bounty, but I don't think I would have succeeded "
"without your help, so I've transferred a portion of the bounty into your "
"account.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Saludos. Veo que estabas intentando cobrar una recompensa. Bueno, como "
"puedes ver, me gané la recompensa, pero no creo que hubiera tenido éxito sin "
"tu ayuda, así que he transferido una parte de la recompensa a tu cuenta.\""

msgid ""
"\"Sorry about getting in the way of your bounty. I don't really care too "
"much about the money, but I just wanted to make sure the galaxy would be rid "
"of that scum. So as an apology, I would like to offer you the portion of the "
"bounty you clearly earned. The money will be in your account shortly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Siento haberme interpuesto en el camino de tu recompensa. No me importa "
"demasiado el dinero, pero quería asegurarme de que la galaxia se librara de "
"esa escoria. Así que como disculpa, me gustaría ofrecerte la parte de la "
"recompensa que claramente has ganado. El dinero estará en tu cuenta en breve."
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Hey, thanks for the help back there. I don't know if I would have been "
"able to handle that dissident alone! Anyway, since you were such a big help, "
"I have transferred what I think is your fair share of the bounty to your "
"bank account.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, gracias por la ayuda allí atrás. No sé si habría sido capaz de "
"manejar a ese disidente solo. De todos modos, ya que fuiste de gran ayuda, "
"he transferido lo que creo que es tu parte justa de la recompensa a tu "
"cuenta bancaria.\""

msgid ""
"\"Heh, thanks! I think I would have been able to take out the target by "
"myself, but still, I appreciate your assistance. Here, I'll transfer some of "
"the bounty to you, as a token of my appreciation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Eh, gracias! Creo que habría podido acabar con el objetivo yo solo, pero "
"aun así, agradezco tu ayuda. Toma, te transferiré parte de la recompensa, "
"como muestra de mi agradecimiento.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, looks like I beat you to it this time, eh? Well, I don't do this "
"often, but here, have some of the bounty. I think you deserve it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ja, ja, ja, parece que esta vez me he adelantado, ¿eh? Bueno, no hago esto "
"a menudo, pero toma, ten algo de la recompensa. Creo que te lo mereces.\""

#. Messages
msgid "Your target got away."
msgstr "Tu objetivo se ha escapado."

msgid "Another pilot eliminated your target."
msgstr "Otro piloto eliminó tu objetivo."

msgid "Bounty Hunt"
msgstr "Caza de Recompensas"

msgid "Kill or capture your target"
msgstr "Mata o captura a tu objetivo"

msgid "Land in {fct} territory to collect your bounty"
msgstr "Aterriza en el territorio {fct} para cobrar tu recompensa"

#. luacheck: globals get_faction
msgid "Proteron Dissident"
msgstr "Disidente Proteron"

#. No dissidents nearby
msgid "Target Dissident"
msgstr "Disidente Objetivo"

#. Set mission details
msgid "PD: Dead or Alive Bounty in {sys}"
msgstr "DP: Recompensa Vivo o Muerto en {sys}"

msgid ""
"A political dissident was recently seen in the {sys} system. {fct} "
"authorities want this dissident dead or alive. The dissident may disappear "
"you take too long to reach the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Un disidente político fue visto recientemente en el sistema {sys}. Las "
"autoridades de {fct} quieren a este disidente vivo o muerto. El disidente "
"puede desaparecer si tardas demasiado en llegar al sistema {sys}."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Dark Shadow">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>None</location>
#. <notes>
#. <done_evt name="Shadowcomm2">Triggers</done_evt>
#. <campaign>Shadow</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. This is the third mission in the "shadow" series, featuring the return of SHITMAN.
#. --
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
#. Mission constants
#. Mission info stuff
msgid "Dark Shadow"
msgstr "Sombra Oscura"

msgid "Look for Jorek on {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Busca a Jorek en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. TODO character graphics?
msgid "Four Winds Member"
msgstr "Miembro de Cuatro Vientos"

msgid ""
"Suddenly, out of nowhere, one of the dormant panels in your cockpit springs "
"to life. It shows you a face you've never seen before in your life, but you "
"recognize the plain grey uniform as belonging to the Four Winds."
msgstr ""
"De repente, de la nada, uno de los paneles inactivos de tu cabina cobra "
"vida. Te muestra un rostro que no has visto en tu vida, pero reconoces el "
"uniforme gris liso como perteneciente a los Cuatro Vientos."

msgid ""
"\"Hello {player},\" the face says. \"You must be wondering who I am and how "
"it is I'm talking to you like this. Neither question is important. What is "
"important is that Captain Rebina has urgent need of your services. You are "
"to meet her on the Seiryuu, which is currently in orbit around {pnt} in the "
"{sys} system. Please don't ask any questions now. We expect to see you as "
"quickly as you can make your way here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola {player}\", dice la cara. \"Te estarás preguntando quién soy y cómo "
"es que estoy hablando contigo de esta manera. Ninguna de las dos preguntas "
"es importante. Lo importante es que la capitana Rebina necesita urgentemente "
"tus servicios. Debes reunirte con ella en el Seiryuu, que actualmente está "
"en órbita alrededor de {pnt} en el sistema {sys}. Por favor, no haga ninguna "
"pregunta ahora. Esperamos verte tan rápido como puedas llegar hasta aquí.\""

msgid ""
"The screen goes dead again. You decide to make a note of this in your log. "
"Perhaps it would be a good idea to visit the Seiryuu once more, if only to "
"find out how they got a private line to your ship!"
msgstr ""
"La pantalla vuelve a apagarse. Decides anotarlo en tu diario. Tal vez sea "
"buena idea volver a visitar al Seiryuu, ¡aunque sólo sea para averiguar cómo "
"consiguieron una línea privada con tu nave!"

msgid ""
"You have been summoned to the {sys} system, where the Seiryuu is supposedly "
"waiting for you in orbit around {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Has sido convocado al sistema {sys}, donde se supone que el Seiryuu te "
"espera en órbita alrededor de {pnt}."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Go to {sys} system and find the Seiryuu."
msgstr "Ve al sistema {sys} y encuentra el {plt}"

#. This is the "real" start of the mission. Get yer mission variables here!
msgid ""
"You have been tasked by Captain Rebina of the Four Winds to assist Jorek "
"McArthy."
msgstr ""
"El capitán Rebina de los Cuatro Vientos te ha encargado que ayudes a Jorek "
"McArthy."

msgid "A sum of money."
msgstr "Una suma de dinero."

#. Ensure NPCs appear at loading
#. Handle boarding of the Seiryuu
#. Briefing
msgid ""
"You make your way through the now familiar corridors of the Seiryuu. You "
"barely notice the strange environment anymore. It seems unimportant compared "
"to the strange events that surround your every encounter with these Four "
"Winds."
msgstr ""
"Avanzas por los ya familiares pasillos del Seiryuu. Ya apenas te fijas en el "
"extraño entorno. Parece carecer de importancia comparado con los extraños "
"sucesos que rodean cada uno de tus encuentros con estos Cuatro Vientos."

msgid ""
"You step onto the bridge where Captain Rebina is waiting for you. \"Welcome "
"back, {player},\" she says. \"I'm pleased to see that you decided to respond "
"to our communication. I doubt you would have come here if you weren't "
"willing to continue to aid us. Your presence here confirms that you are a "
"reliable partner, so I will treat you accordingly.\""
msgstr ""
"Entras en el puente, donde te espera la capitana Rebina. \"Bienvenido de "
"nuevo, {player}\", te dice. \"Me complace ver que has decidido responder a "
"nuestra comunicación. Dudo que hubieras venido aquí si no estuvieras "
"dispuesto a seguir ayudándonos. Tu presencia aquí confirma que eres un "
"compañero fiable, así que te trataré en consecuencia.\""

msgid ""
"The captain motions you to take a seat at what looks like a holotable in the "
"centre of the bridge. \"Before I tell you what I've called you here for, I "
"feel I should explain to you in full who we are, what we do, and what your "
"part in all this is.\" She takes a seat opposite from yours, and leans on "
"the holotable. \"As I've said before, we are the Four Winds. Our "
"organization is a very secretive one, as you've experienced firsthand. Very "
"few outside our ranks know of our existence, and now you're one of those few."
"\""
msgstr ""
"El capitán te indica que tomes asiento en lo que parece una holotabla en el "
"centro del puente. \"Antes de decirte para qué te he convocado, creo que "
"debo explicarte con todo detalle quiénes somos, qué hacemos y cuál es tu "
"papel en todo esto\". Toma asiento frente al tuyo y se apoya en la "
"holotabla. \"Como he dicho antes, somos los Cuatro Vientos. Nuestra "
"organización es muy secreta, como has podido comprobar de primera mano. Muy "
"pocos fuera de nuestras filas conocen nuestra existencia, y ahora tú eres "
"uno de esos pocos.\""

msgid ""
"\"The Four Winds are old, {player}. Very old indeed. The movement dates back "
"to old Earth, before the Space Age, even. We have been with human "
"civilization throughout the ages, at first only in the Eastern nations, "
"later establishing a foothold worldwide. Our purpose was to guide humanity "
"and prevent it from making mistakes it could not afford to make. We never "
"came out in the open, we always worked behind the scenes, from the shadows. "
"We were diplomats, scientists, journalists, politicians' spouses, sometimes "
"even assassins. We used any means necessary to gather information and avert "
"disaster, when we could."
msgstr ""
"\"Los Cuatro Vientos son viejos, {player}. Muy antiguos. El movimiento se "
"remonta a la antigua Tierra, incluso antes de la Era Espacial. Hemos estado "
"con la civilización humana a lo largo de los tiempos, al principio sólo en "
"las naciones orientales, para luego establecer un punto de apoyo en todo el "
"mundo. Nuestro propósito era guiar a la humanidad y evitar que cometiera "
"errores que no podía permitirse. Nunca salimos a la luz, siempre trabajamos "
"entre bastidores, desde las sombras. Éramos diplomáticos, científicos, "
"periodistas, cónyuges de políticos, a veces incluso asesinos. Utilizábamos "
"cualquier medio necesario para reunir información y evitar el desastre, "
"cuando podíamos."

msgid ""
"\"Of course, we didn't always succeed. We couldn't prevent the nuclear "
"strikes on Japan, though we managed to prevent several others. We foiled the "
"sabotage attempts on several of the colony ships launched during the First "
"Growth, but sadly failed to do so in Maelstrom's case. We failed to stop the "
"Faction Wars, though we managed to help the Empire gain the upper hand. Our "
"most recent failure is the Incident - we should have seen it coming, but we "
"were completely taken by surprise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por supuesto, no siempre tuvimos éxito. No pudimos evitar los ataques "
"nucleares en Japón, aunque conseguimos evitar varios otros. Frustramos los "
"intentos de sabotaje de varias de las naves coloniales lanzadas durante el "
"Primer Crecimiento, pero lamentablemente no pudimos hacerlo en el caso del "
"Maelstrom. No pudimos detener las Guerras de Facción, aunque conseguimos "
"ayudar al Imperio a ganar la partida. Nuestro fracaso más reciente es el "
"Incidente: deberíamos haberlo visto venir, pero nos cogió completamente por "
"sorpresa.\""

#. TODO change this ridiculously large log block
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Captain Rebina has further explained the organization she works for.\n"
"   \"As I've said before, we are the Four Winds. Our organization is a very "
"secretive one, as you've experienced firsthand. Very few outside our ranks "
"know of our existence, and now you're one of those few.\n"
"   \"The Four Winds are old, {player}. Very old indeed. The movement dates "
"back to old Earth, before the Space Age, even. We have been with human "
"civilization throughout the ages, at first only in the Eastern nations, "
"later establishing a foothold worldwide. Our purpose was to guide humanity "
"and prevent it from making mistakes it could not afford to make. We never "
"came out in the open, we always worked behind the scenes, from the shadows. "
"We were diplomats, scientists, journalists, politicians' spouses, sometimes "
"even assassins. We used any means necessary to gather information and avert "
"disaster, when we could.\n"
"   \"Of course, we didn't always succeed. We couldn't prevent the nuclear "
"strikes on Japan, though we managed to prevent several others. We foiled the "
"sabotage attempts on several of the colony ships launched during the First "
"Growth, but sadly failed to do so in Maelstrom's case. We failed to stop the "
"Faction Wars, though we managed to help the Empire gain the upper hand. Our "
"most recent failure is the Incident - we should have seen it coming, but we "
"were completely taken by surprise.\""
msgstr ""
"La capitana Rebina ha explicado con más detalle la organización para la que "
"trabaja.\n"
"    \"Como he dicho antes, somos los Cuatro Vientos. Nuestra organización es "
"muy secreta, como has podido comprobar de primera mano. Muy pocos fuera de "
"nuestras filas conocen nuestra existencia, y ahora tú eres uno de esos "
"pocos.\n"
"    \"Los Cuatro Vientos son viejos, {player}. Muy antiguos. El movimiento "
"se remonta a la antigua Tierra, incluso antes de la Era Espacial. Hemos "
"estado con la civilización humana a lo largo de los tiempos, al principio "
"sólo en las naciones orientales, para luego establecer un punto de apoyo en "
"todo el mundo. Nuestro propósito era guiar a la humanidad y evitar que "
"cometiera errores que no podía permitirse. Nunca salimos a la luz, siempre "
"trabajamos entre bastidores, desde las sombras. Éramos diplomáticos, "
"científicos, periodistas, cónyuges de políticos, a veces incluso asesinos. "
"Utilizábamos cualquier medio necesario para reunir información y evitar el "
"desastre, cuando podíamos.\n"
"    \"Por supuesto, no siempre tuvimos éxito. No pudimos evitar los ataques "
"nucleares en Japón, aunque conseguimos evitar varios otros. Frustramos los "
"intentos de sabotaje de varias de las naves coloniales lanzadas durante el "
"Primer Crecimiento, pero lamentablemente no pudimos hacerlo en el caso de "
"Maelstrom. No pudimos detener las Guerras de Facción, aunque conseguimos "
"ayudar al Imperio a ganar la partida. Nuestro fracaso más reciente es el "
"Incidente: deberíamos haberlo visto venir, pero nos cogió completamente por "
"sorpresa.\""

msgid ""
"Captain Rebina sits back in her chair and heaves a sigh. \"I think that may "
"have been when things started to change. We used to be committed to our "
"purpose, but apparently things are different now. No doubt you remember what "
"happened to the diplomatic exchange between the Empire and the Dvaered some "
"time ago. Well, suffice to say that increasing the tension between the two "
"is definitely not part of our mandate. In fact, it's completely at odds with "
"what we stand for. And that was not just an isolated incident either. Things "
"have been happening that suggest Four Winds involvement, things that bode "
"ill.\""
msgstr ""
"La capitana Rebina se sienta en su silla y lanza un suspiro. \"Creo que fue "
"entonces cuando las cosas empezaron a cambiar. Antes estábamos comprometidos "
"con nuestro propósito, pero aparentemente las cosas son diferentes ahora. "
"Sin duda, recuerdas lo que ocurrió con el intercambio diplomático entre el "
"Imperio y los Dvaered hace algún tiempo. Pues bien, basta con decir que "
"aumentar la tensión entre ambos no forma parte de nuestro mandato. De hecho, "
"está completamente en desacuerdo con lo que representamos. Y tampoco fue un "
"incidente aislado. Han sucedido cosas que sugieren la participación de "
"Cuatro Vientos, cosas que no auguran nada bueno.\""

msgid ""
"She activates the holotable, and it displays four cruisers, all seemingly "
"identical to the Seiryuu, though you notice subtle differences in the hull "
"designs."
msgstr ""
"Activa la holotabla, que muestra cuatro cruceros, todos ellos aparentemente "
"idénticos al Seiryuu, aunque se aprecian sutiles diferencias en el diseño de "
"los cascos."

msgid ""
"\"These are our flagships. Including this ship, they are the Seiryuu, "
"Suzaku, Byakko and Genbu. I'm given to understand that these names, as well "
"as our collective name, have their roots in ancient Asian mythology.\" The "
"captain touches another control and four portraits appear, superimposed over "
"the ships. \"These are the four captains of the flagships, which by "
"extension makes them the highest level of authority within the Four Winds. "
"You know me. The other three are called Giornio, Zurike and Farett.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estos son nuestros buques insignia. Incluyendo esta nave, son el Seiryuu, "
"Suzaku, Byakko y Genbu. Tengo entendido que estos nombres, así como nuestro "
"nombre colectivo, tienen sus raíces en la antigua mitología asiática\". El "
"capitán toca otro mando y aparecen cuatro retratos superpuestos sobre las "
"naves. \"Estos son los cuatro capitanes de las naves insignia, lo que por "
"extensión les convierte en el máximo nivel de autoridad dentro de los Cuatro "
"Vientos. Tú me conoces. Los otros tres se llaman Giornio, Zurike y Farett.\""

msgid ""
"\"It is my belief that one or more of my fellow captains have abandoned "
"their mission, and are misusing their resources for a different agenda. I "
"have been unable to find out the details of Four Winds missions that I did "
"not order myself, which is a bad sign. I am being stonewalled, and I don't "
"like it. I want to know what's going on, {player}, and you're going to help "
"me do it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Creo que uno o varios de mis compañeros capitanes han abandonado su misión "
"y están empleando mal sus recursos para una agenda diferente. He sido "
"incapaz de averiguar los detalles de las misiones de Cuatro Vientos que yo "
"mismo no ordené, lo cual es una mala señal. Me están dando largas y no me "
"gusta. Quiero saber qué está pasando {player} y vas a ayudarme en ello.\""

msgid ""
"The captain turns the holotable back off so she can have your undivided "
"attention. \"I have sent Jorek on a recon mission to the planet of {pnt} in "
"the {sys} system. He hasn't reported back to me so far, and that's bad news. "
"Jorek is a reliable agent. If he fails to meet a deadline, then it means he "
"is tied down by factors outside of his control, or worse. I want you to find "
"him. Your position as an outsider will help you fly below the radar of "
"potentially hostile Four Winds operatives. You must go to {pnt} and contact "
"Jorek if you can, or find out where he is if you can't.\""
msgstr ""
"La capitana apaga la holotabla para que puedas prestarle toda tu atención. "
"\"He enviado a Jorek en misión de reconocimiento al planeta {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}. Hasta ahora no me ha informado, y eso son malas noticias. "
"Jorek es un agente de confianza. Si no cumple un plazo, significa que está "
"atado por factores fuera de su control, o algo peor. Quiero que lo "
"encuentres. Tu posición como forastero te ayudará a volar por debajo del "
"radar de los operativos potencialmente hostiles a Cuatro Vientos. Debes ir a "
"{pnt} y contactar con Jorek si puedes, o averiguar dónde está si no puedes.\""

msgid ""
"Captain Rebina stands up, a signal that this briefing is over. You are seen "
"to your ship by a grey-uniformed crewman. You sit in your cockpit for a few "
"hectostu before disengaging the docking clamp. What Captain Rebina has told "
"you is a lot to take in. A shadowy organization that guides humanity behind "
"the scenes? And parts of that organization going rogue? The road ahead could "
"well be a bumpy one."
msgstr ""

#. Debriefing
msgid ""
"You find yourself back on the Seiryuu, in the company of Jorek and the Four "
"Winds informant. The informant is escorted deeper into the ship by grey-"
"uniformed crew members, while Jorek takes you up to the bridge for a meeting "
"with Captain Rebina."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras de nuevo en el Seiryuu, en compañía de Jorek y el informante "
"de Cuatro Vientos. El informante es escoltado al interior de la nave por "
"miembros de la tripulación de uniforme gris, mientras que Jorek te lleva al "
"puente para una reunión con la capitana Rebina."

msgid ""
"\"Welcome back, Jorek, {player},\" Rebina greets you on your arrival. \"I've "
"already got a preliminary report on the situation, but let's have ourselves "
"a proper debriefing. Have a seat.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bienvenido de nuevo, Jorek, {player}\", te saluda Rebina a tu llegada. "
"\"Ya tengo un informe preliminar de la situación, pero vamos a reunirnos "
"como es debido. Toma asiento,\""

msgid ""
"Jorek and you sit down at the holotable in the middle of the bridge, and "
"report on the events surrounding Jorek's retrieval. When you're done, "
"Captain Rebina calls up a schematic view of the Genbu from the holotable."
msgstr ""
"Jorek y tú os sentáis en la holotabla situada en el centro del puente e "
"informáis sobre los acontecimientos que rodearon la recuperación de Jorek. "
"Cuando termináis, la capitana Rebina muestra una vista esquemática del Genbu "
"desde la holotabla."

msgid ""
"\"It would seem that Giornio and his comrades have a vested interest in "
"keeping me away from the truth. It's a good thing you managed to get out of "
"that ambush and bring me that informant. I do hope he'll be able to shed "
"more light on the situation. I've got a bad premonition, a hunch that we're "
"going to have to act soon if we're going to avert disaster, whatever that "
"may be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que Giornio y sus camaradas tienen un gran interés en alejarme de "
"la verdad. Menos mal que he conseguido salir de esa emboscada y traerme a "
"ese informante. Espero que sea capaz de arrojar más luz sobre la situación. "
"Tengo un mal presentimiento, una corazonada de que vamos a tener que actuar "
"pronto si queremos evitar el desastre, sea cual sea.\""

msgid ""
"I trust that you will be willing to aid us again when that time comes, "
"{player}. We're going to need all the help we can get. For now, you will "
"find a modest amount of credits in your account. I will be in touch when "
"things are clearer.\""
msgstr ""
"Confío en que estarás dispuesto a ayudarnos de nuevo cuando llegue ese "
"momento, {player}. Necesitaremos toda la ayuda posible. Por ahora, "
"encontrarás una modesta cantidad de créditos en tu cuenta. Me pondré en "
"contacto cuando las cosas estén más claras.\""

msgid ""
"You return to your ship and undock from the Seiryuu. You reflect that you "
"had to run for your life this time around, and by all accounts, things will "
"only get worse with the Four Winds in the future. A lesser person might get "
"nervous."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a tu nave y desembarcas de la Seiryuu. Reflexionas que esta vez has "
"tenido que huir para salvar la vida y, por lo que parece, las cosas no harán "
"más que empeorar con los Cuatro Vientos en el futuro. Una persona menos "
"preparada podría ponerse nervioso."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You found Jorek and successfully retrieved his informant on behalf of "
"Captain Rebina. The Genbu ambushed you, but you managed to get away and dock "
"the Seiryuu. Captain Rebina remarked on the situation.\n"
"   \"It would seem that Giornio and his comrades have a vested interest in "
"keeping me away from the truth. It's a good thing you managed to get out of "
"that ambush and bring me that informant. I do hope he'll be able to shed "
"more light on the situation. I've got a bad premonition, a hunch that we're "
"going to have to act soon if we're going to avert disaster, whatever that "
"may be.\"\n"
"   She said she may need your services again in the future."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado a Jorek y has recuperado con éxito a su informante en nombre "
"de la capitana Rebina. Los Genbu te tendieron una emboscada, pero lograste "
"escapar y atracar el Seiryuu. El capitán Rebina comentó la situación.\n"
"    \"Parece que Giornio y sus camaradas tienen un gran interés en alejarme "
"de la verdad. Menos mal que he conseguido salir de esa emboscada y traerme a "
"ese informante. Espero que sea capaz de arrojar más luz sobre la situación. "
"Tengo un mal presentimiento, una corazonada de que vamos a tener que actuar "
"pronto si queremos evitar el desastre, sea cual sea.\"\n"
"   Dijo que podría necesitar tus servicios de nuevo en el futuro."

#. Board hook for Joe
msgid ""
"You board the Four Winds vessel, and as soon as the airlock opens a nervous "
"looking man enters your ship. He eyes you warily, but when he sees that "
"Jorek is with you his tension fades."
msgstr ""
"Subes a la nave de los Cuatro Vientos y, en cuanto se abre la esclusa, un "
"hombre de aspecto nervioso entra en tu nave. Te mira con recelo, pero cuando "
"ve que Jorek está contigo su tensión se desvanece."

msgid ""
"\"Come on, {player},\" Jorek says. \"Let's not waste any more time here. We "
"got what we came for. Now let's give these damn vultures the slip, eh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vamos, {player}\", dice Jorek. \"No perdamos más tiempo aquí. Tenemos lo "
"que hemos venido a buscar. Ahora vamos a dar esquinazo a estos malditos "
"buitres, ¿eh?\""

#. Meet Joe, our informant.
msgid "Four Winds Informant"
msgstr "Informante de Los Cuatro Vientos"

msgid "Jorek's informant."
msgstr "El informante de Jorek."

#. Jump-out hook
#. Keep track of which system the player came from
#. Enter hook
#. Capsule function for player.pilot():control(), for timer use
#. Also saves the player's velocity.
#. Poll for player proximity to a point in space. Will trigger when the player is NOT within the specified distance.
#. argument trigger: a table containing:
#. location: The target location
#. radius: The radius around the location
#. funcname: The name of the function to be called when the player is out of proximity.
#. Handle the unsuccessful end of the mission.
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Shadowrun">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>20</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. if system.get("Klantar"):jumpDist() &gt;= 3 then
#. return false
#. end
#. local misn_test = require("misn_test")
#. if not misn_test.heavy_weapons(true) then
#. return false
#. end
#. return misn_test.reweight_active()
#. </cond>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Shadow</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. This is the main script for the Shadowrun mission. It's started from the spaceport bar and tries to emulate spaceport bar conversation as part of the mission.
#. "shadowrun" stack variable:
#. 1 = player has met Rebina, but hasn't accepted the mission
#. 2 = player has accepted Rebina's mission, but has not talked to SHITMAN
#. 3 = player has talked to SHITMAN
#. --
#. Where SHITMAN lives (used to be Durea). Should be non-empire, but nearby
#. The system where the ship is
#. Random(?) pirate attacks when get closer to your system, and heavier ones when you fly away from it after meeting SHITMAN
#. Empire ships around planet
#. Handle the Seiryuu, the last stop on this mission
#. Fly to the diplomat rendezvous point.
#. Function hooked to takeoff.
#. We're taking off from refuelspob. Can't be anything else.
msgid "Seiryuu"
msgstr "Seiryuu"

msgid ""
"Landing permission denied. Our docking clamps are currently undergoing "
"maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Permiso de aterrizaje denegado. Nuestras abrazaderas de acoplamiento están "
"actualmente en mantenimiento."

#. Make everyone visible for the cutscene
#. The cutscene itself
msgid ""
"Jorek> \"That's my guy. We got to board his ship and get him off before we "
"jump.\""
msgstr ""
"Jorek> \"Ese es mi hombre. Tenemos que abordar su nave y sacarlo antes de "
"saltar.\""

msgid ""
"Jorek> \"Watch out for those patrols though. If they spot us, they'll be all "
"over us.\""
msgstr ""
"Jorek> \"Sin embargo, ten cuidado con esas patrullas. Si nos descubren, se "
"nos echarán encima.\""

msgid "Jorek> \"They're tougher than they look. Don't underestimate them.\""
msgstr "Jorek> \"Son más duros de lo que parecen. No los subestimes.\""

#. Hide everyone again
#. ...except the leaders.
msgid "You forgot the informant!"
msgstr "¡Olvidaste al informante!"

msgid ""
"Jorek is enraged. \"Dammit, {player}! I told you to pick up that informant "
"on the way! Too late to go back now. I'll have to think of somethin' else. "
"I'm disembarkin' at the next spaceport, don't bother taking me back to the "
"Seiryuu.\""
msgstr ""
"Jorek se enfurece. \"¡Maldita sea, {player}! ¡Te dije que recogieras a ese "
"informante en el camino! Demasiado tarde para volver ahora. Tendré que "
"pensar en otra cosa. Voy a desembarcar en el próximo puerto espacial, no te "
"molestes en llevarme de vuelta al Seiryuu.\""

msgid ""
"You failed to pick up Jorek's informant. As such, he refused to allow you to "
"take him to the Seiryuu."
msgstr ""
"No pudiste recoger al informante de Jorek. Como tal, se negó a permitir que "
"lo llevaras al Seiryuu."

#. Starts an inverse proximity poll for distance from the jump point.
#. stop spawning the Genbu
#. The Genbu follows you around, and will probably insta-kill you.
#. Start positions for the leaders
#. Leaders will patrol between their start position and this one
#. Shorthand notation for the leader pilots
msgid "Four Winds Patrol"
msgstr "Patrulla de los Cuatro Vientos"

#. Equip these fellas with unfair weaponry
#. Only need to control leader. Others will follow
#. Kickstart the patrol sequence
#. Set up the rest of the patrol sequence
#. Makes the squads either visible or hides them
#. Makes the leaders visible or hides them, also highlights them (or not)
#. Hook for hostile actions against a squad member
#. Hook for the idle status of the leader of a squad.
#. Makes the squads patrol their routes.
#. Check if any of the patrolling leaders can see the player, and if so intercept.
msgid "All pilots, we've detected McArthy on that ship! Break and intercept!"
msgstr ""
"¡Todos los pilotos, hemos detectado a McArthy en esa nave! ¡Rompan filas e "
"intercepten!"

#. Spawns the Genbu
msgid "Genbu"
msgstr "Genbu"

#. The initial ambush cutscene
#. The continuation of the ambush, for timer purposes
#. Spawns a wing of Lancelots that intercept the player.
msgid "Four Winds Lancelot"
msgstr "Lancelot Cuatro Vientos"

#. Equip these fellas with unfair weaponry
#. j:control()
#. j:attack(player.pilot())
#. Land hook
#. Thank you player, but our SHITMAN is in another castle.
msgid "No Jorek"
msgstr "No Jorek"

msgid ""
"You step into the bar, expecting to find Jorek McArthy sitting somewhere at "
"a table. However, you don't see him anywhere. You decide to go for a drink "
"to contemplate your next move. Then, you notice the barman is giving you a "
"curious look."
msgstr ""
"Entras en el bar, esperando encontrar a Jorek McArthy sentado en alguna "
"mesa. Sin embargo, no lo ves por ninguna parte. Decides ir a tomar una copa "
"para contemplar tu próximo movimiento. Entonces, te das cuenta de que el "
"camarero te mira con curiosidad."

#. Get the NPCs to appear
#. NPC hook
msgid "Barman"
msgstr "Camarero"

msgid "The barman seems to be eyeing you in particular."
msgstr "El camarero parece mirarte a ti en particular."

msgid "Jorek"
msgstr "Jorek"

msgid ""
"There he is, Jorek McArthy, the man you've been chasing across half the "
"galaxy. What he's doing on this piece of junk is unclear."
msgstr ""
"Ahí está, Jorek McArthy, el hombre que has perseguido por media galaxia. Lo "
"que está haciendo en este pedazo de chatarra no está claro."

msgid "You meet the barman's stare. He hesitates for a moment, then speaks up."
msgstr "Te quedas mirando al camarero. Duda un momento y luego habla."

msgid "\"Hey... Are you {player} by any chance?\""
msgstr "\"Hey... ¿Eres {player} por casualidad?\""

msgid "You tell him that yes, that's you, and ask how he knows your name."
msgstr "Le dices que sí, que eres tú, y le preguntas cómo sabe tu nombre."

msgid ""
"\"Well, your description was given to me by an old friend of mine. His name "
"is Jarek. Do you know him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, tu descripción me la dio un viejo amigo mío. Se llama Jarek. ¿Le "
"conoces?\""

msgid ""
"You tell him that you don't know anyone by the name of Jarek, but you do "
"know a man named Jorek. The barman visibly relaxes when he hears that name."
msgstr ""
"Le dices que no conoces a nadie llamado Jarek, pero sí a un hombre llamado "
"Jorek. El camarero se relaja visiblemente al oír ese nombre."

msgid ""
"\"Ah, good. You're the real deal then. Can't be too careful in times like "
"these, you know. Anyway, old Jorek was here, but he couldn't stay. He told "
"me to keep an eye out for you, said you'd be coming to look for him.\" The "
"barman glances around to make sure nobody is within earshot, even though the "
"bar's music makes it difficult to overhear anyone who isn't standing right "
"next to you. \"I have a message for you. Go to the {sys} system and land on "
"{pnt}. Jorek will be waiting for you there. But you better be ready for some "
"trouble. I don't know what kind of trouble it is, but Jorek is never in any "
"kind of minor trouble. Don't say I didn't warn you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, bien. Entonces eres el auténtico. No se puede ser demasiado cuidadoso "
"en tiempos como estos, ya sabes. De todos modos, el viejo Jorek estuvo aquí, "
"pero no pudo quedarse. Me dijo que te vigilara, que vendrías a buscarlo.\" "
"El camarero mira a su alrededor para asegurarse de que no hay nadie al "
"alcance del oído, aunque la música del bar hace difícil escuchar a alguien "
"que no esté al lado. \"Tengo un mensaje para ti. Ve al sistema {sys} y "
"aterriza en {pnt}. Jorek te estará esperando allí. Pero será mejor que estés "
"preparado para algunos problemas. No sé qué tipo de problema es, pero Jorek "
"nunca está en ningún tipo de problema menor. No digas que no te lo advertí.\""

msgid ""
"You thank the barman, pay for your drink, and prepare to head back to your "
"ship, wondering whether your armaments will be enough to deal with whatever "
"trouble Jorek is in."
msgstr ""
"Le das las gracias al camarero, pagas tu bebida y te preparas para regresar "
"a tu nave, preguntándote si tu armamento será suficiente para hacer frente a "
"cualquier problema en el que se encuentre Jorek."

#. NPC hook
msgid ""
"\"Well hello there {player},\" Jorek says when you approach his table. "
"\"It's about damn time you showed up. I've been wastin' credits on this "
"awful swill for days now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, {player}\", dice Jorek cuando te acercas a su mesa. \"Ya era hora de "
"que aparecieras. Llevo días malgastando créditos en esta horrible bebida.\""

msgid ""
"Not at all surprised that Jorek is still as disagreeable as the last time "
"you encountered him, you decide to ask him to explain the situation, "
"beginning with how he knew that it was you who would be coming for him. "
"Jorek laughs heartily at that."
msgstr ""
"No sorprendido en absoluto de que Jorek siga siendo tan desagradable como la "
"última vez que te lo encontraste, decides pedirle que te explique la "
"situación, empezando por cómo supo que eras tú quien vendría a por él. Jorek "
"se ríe a carcajadas."

msgid ""
"\"Ha! Of course it was going to be you. Who else would that lass Rebina "
"send? She's tough as nails, that girl, but I know how her mind works. She's "
"cornered, potential enemies behind every door in the organization. And you "
"have done us a couple of favours already. In fact, you're the only one she "
"can trust outside her own little circle of friends, and right now I'm not "
"too sure how far she trusts those. Plus, she really has a keen nose when it "
"comes to sniffin' out reliable people, and she knows it. Yeah, I knew she'd "
"send you to find me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ja! Por supuesto que ibas a ser tú. ¿A quién más enviaría Rebina? Es dura "
"como una roca, esa chica, pero sé cómo funciona su mente. Está acorralada, "
"con enemigos potenciales detrás de cada puerta de la organización. Y tú ya "
"nos has hecho un par de favores. De hecho, eres el único en quien puede "
"confiar fuera de su pequeño círculo de amigos, y ahora mismo no estoy muy "
"seguro de hasta qué punto confía en ellos. Además, tiene muy buen olfato "
"para detectar a la gente de confianza, y lo sabe. Sí, sabía que te enviaría "
"a buscarme.\""

msgid ""
"That answers one question. But you still don't know why Jorek hasn't been "
"reporting in like he should have."
msgstr ""
"Eso responde a una pregunta. Pero aún no sabes por qué Jorek no ha reportado "
"nada como debería."

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, right, about that. You know about the deal with the other branches "
"getting too big for their britches? Good. Well, I've been lookin' into that, "
"pokin' my nose into their business. Since I'm dealin' with my fellow Shadows "
"here, I couldn't afford to give myself away. So that's that. But there's "
"more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí, claro, sobre eso. ¿Sabes lo de las otras ramas que son demasiado "
"grandes para sus pantalones? Sí. Bueno, he estado investigando eso, metiendo "
"las narices en sus asuntos. Como estoy tratando con mis compañeros de las "
"Sombras, no podía permitirme el lujo de delatarme. Así que eso es todo. Pero "
"hay más.\""

msgid ""
"\"I dunno if you've seen them on your way here, but there's guys of ours "
"hangin' around in the system. And when I say guys of ours, I mean guys of "
"theirs, since they sure ain't our guys any more. They've been on my ass ever "
"since I left Manis, so I think I know what they want. They want to get me "
"and see what I know, or maybe they just want to blow me into space dust. "
"Either way, I need you to help me get out of this rathole.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No sé si los has visto de camino aquí, pero hay tipos nuestros merodeando "
"por el sistema. Y cuando digo chicos de los nuestros, quiero decir chicos de "
"los suyos, porque seguro que ya no son nuestros chicos. Han estado tras de "
"mí desde que dejé Manis, así que creo que sé lo que quieren. Quieren "
"atraparme y ver lo que sé, o tal vez sólo quieren convertirme en polvo "
"espacial. De cualquier forma, necesito que me ayudes a salir de esta "
"ratonera.\""

msgid ""
"You ask Jorek why he didn't just lie low on some world until the coast was "
"clear, instead of coming to this sink for the dregs of intergalactic society."
msgstr ""
"Le preguntas a Jorek por qué no se ocultó en algún mundo hasta que no "
"hubiera moros en la costa, en lugar de venir a este sumidero de escoria de "
"la sociedad intergaláctica."

msgid ""
"\"It ain't that simple,\" Jorek sighs. \"See, I got an inside man. A guy in "
"their ranks who wants out. I need to get him back to the old girl so he can "
"tell her what he knows firsthand. He's out there now, with the pack, so we "
"need to pick him up on our way out. Now, there's two ways we can do this. We "
"can either go in fast, grab the guy, get out fast before the wolves get us. "
"Or we can try to fight our way through. Let me warn you though, these guys "
"mean business, and they're not your average pirates. Unless you got a really "
"tough ship, I recommend you run.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No es tan sencillo\", suspira Jorek. \"Verás, tengo un infiltrado. Un tipo "
"en sus filas que quiere salir. Necesito que vuelva con la vieja para que le "
"cuente lo que sabe de primera mano. Él está ahí fuera ahora, con la manada, "
"así que tenemos que recogerlo en nuestro camino de salida. Ahora, hay dos "
"maneras de hacer esto. Podemos entrar rápido, agarrar al tipo, salir rápido "
"antes de que los lobos nos atrapen. O podemos intentar abrirnos paso "
"luchando. Déjame advertirte, estos tipos van en serio, y no son piratas "
"comunes. A menos que tengas una nave realmente resistente, te recomiendo que "
"huyas.\""

msgid ""
"Jorek sits back in his chair. \"Well, there you have it. I'll fill you in on "
"the details once we're spaceborne. Show me to your ship, buddy, and let's "
"get rollin'. I've had enough of this damn place.\""
msgstr ""
"Jorek vuelve a sentarse en su silla. \"Bueno, ahí lo tienes. Te contaré los "
"detalles cuando estemos en el espacio. Muéstrame tu nave, amigo, y "
"pongámonos en marcha. He tenido suficiente de este maldito lugar.\""

#. Generate portraits
msgid "An unpleasant man."
msgstr "Un hombre desagradable."

msgid "Fetch the Four Winds informant from his ship"
msgstr "Busca al informante de Cuatro Vientos en su nave"

msgid "Return Jorek and the informant to the Seiryuu in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Devuelve a Jorek y al informante a Seiryuu en el sistema {sys}"

#. Capsule function for camera.set, for timer use
#. Capsule function for player.msg, for timer use
#. Capsule function for vn, for timer use
msgid ""
"Suddenly, your long range sensors pick up a ship jumping in behind you. "
"Jorek checks the telemetry beside you. Suddenly, his eyes go wide and he "
"groans. The Four Winds informant turns pale."
msgstr ""
"De repente, tus sensores de largo alcance captan una nave que salta detrás "
"de ti. Jorek comprueba la telemetría a su lado. De repente, sus ojos se "
"abren de par en par y gime. El informante de Cuatro Vientos se pone pálido."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, damn it all,\" Jorek curses. \"{player}, that's the Genbu, Giornio's "
"flagship. I never expected him to take an interest in me personally! Damn, "
"this is bad. Listen, if you have anything to boost our speed, now would be "
"the time. We got to get outta here as if all hell was hot on our heels, "
"which it kinda is! If that thing catches us, we're toast. I really mean it, "
"you don't wanna get into a fight against her, not on your own. Get your ass "
"movin' to Sirius space. Giornio ain't gonna risk getting into a scrap with "
"the Sirius military, so we'll be safe once we get there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, maldita sea,\" maldice Jorek. \"{player}, ese es el Genbu, la nave "
"insignia de Giornio. ¡Nunca esperé que se interesara por mí personalmente! "
"Maldita sea, esto es malo. Escucha, si tienes algo para aumentar nuestra "
"velocidad, ahora sería el momento. Tenemos que salir de aquí como si todo el "
"infierno estuviera sobre nuestros talones, lo cual es un poco! Si esa cosa "
"nos atrapa, estamos fritos. Lo digo en serio, no quieres meterte en una "
"pelea contra ella, no por tu cuenta. Mueve tu culo al espacio de Sirius. "
"Giornio no se arriesgará a meterse en una pelea con los militares de Sirius, "
"así que estaremos seguros una vez que lleguemos allí.\""

msgid "\"Come on, what are you waitin' for? Step on it!\""
msgstr "\"Vamos, ¿a qué esperas? ¡Acelera!\""

#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
#. Developer note: changing these numbers may have consequences for translators (if we support more languages later on).
#. In STP
#. In STP
msgid "A dark-haired woman"
msgstr "Una mujer de pelo oscuro"

msgid ""
"You spot a dark-haired woman sitting at the bar. Her elegant features and "
"dress make her stand out, yet her presence here seems almost natural, as if "
"she's in the right place at the right time, waiting for the right person. "
"You wonder why she's all by herself."
msgstr ""
"Ves a una mujer de pelo oscuro sentada en la barra. Sus elegantes rasgos y "
"su vestimenta la hacen destacar, pero tu presencia aquí parece casi natural, "
"como si estuviera en el lugar adecuado en el momento adecuado, esperando a "
"la persona adecuada. Te preguntas por qué está sola."

msgid ""
"Rebina nods at you to acknowledge your existence. \"We meet again. I'm glad "
"to see you've not got yourself killed yet.\" She smiles meaningfully. \"As "
"it happens I haven't found anyone to take care of my business yet. Perhaps "
"you would reconsider? Allow me to remind you what this is about.\""
msgstr ""
"Rebina te asiente para reconocer tu existencia. \"Nos encontramos de nuevo. "
"Me alegra ver que aún no te has matado.\" Sonríe significativamente. "
"\"Resulta que aún no he encontrado a nadie que se ocupe de mis asuntos. "
"¿Quizás lo reconsideres? Permítame recordarte de qué se trata.\""

msgid ""
"The woman calmly watches you as you approach her, seemingly not at all "
"surprised to see you. Clad in a plain yet expensive-looking black dress and "
"sipping from her martini, she emits an aura of class that is almost "
"intimidating."
msgstr ""
"La mujer te observa tranquilamente mientras te acercas a ella, aparentemente "
"sin sorprenderse en absoluto de verte. Vestida con un sencillo pero caro "
"vestido negro y sorbiendo un martini, emite un aura de clase casi "
"intimidatoria."

msgid ""
"\"Hello,\" she greets you. \"I had a feeling you might want to talk to me. "
"You are different from most...\" she gestures at the other patrons of the "
"bar, \"And so am I. But where are my manners, I haven't introduced myself. "
"My name is Rebina. I am what you might call a talent hunter. I visit places "
"such as these to find people of exceptional skill. People such as you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola\", te saluda. \"Tenía la sensación de que querrías hablar conmigo. "
"Eres diferente a la mayoría...\", señala a los demás clientes del bar, \"Y "
"yo también. Pero dónde están mis modales, no me he presentado. Me llamo "
"Rebina. Soy lo que podría llamarse una cazadora de talentos. Visito lugares "
"como éste para encontrar gente con habilidades excepcionales. Gente como tú."
"\""

msgid ""
"You begin to introduce yourself, but Rebina waves it away, perhaps because "
"your name doesn't interest her, or possibly because she already knows who "
"you are. \"Let's not waste words on idle formalities,\" she says. \"I am "
"here to talk business, and I've got a proposition for you, if you're "
"interested.\""
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a presentarte, pero Rebina hace oídos sordos, quizá porque tu "
"nombre no le interesa o porque ya sabe quién eres. \"No malgastemos palabras "
"en formalidades\", dice. \"Estoy aquí para hablar de negocios, y tengo una "
"propuesta para ti, si te interesa.\""

msgid ""
"\"What I need is a pilot and a ship. Specifically, I need a skilled pilot "
"and a capable ship. Do you fit that description? I have a feeling you do. "
"You see, what I am about to propose to you is both profitable and dangerous."
"\" Rebina takes another sip of her drink before continuing, allowing what "
"she just said to fully register. \"I will not lie to you. There are... "
"rivalries out there, and working for me will mean you'll take sides in some "
"of them. People will take notice of you, and some of them will try to kill "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo que necesito es un piloto y una nave. Concretamente, necesito un piloto "
"experto y una nave capaz. ¿Encajas en esa descripción? Tengo la sensación de "
"que sí. Verás, lo que estoy a punto de proponerte es tan rentable como "
"peligroso\". Rebina da otro sorbo a su bebida antes de continuar, dejando "
"que lo que acaba de decir se asimile por completo. \"No te voy a mentir. "
"Hay... rivalidades ahí fuera, y trabajar para mí significará que tomarás "
"partido en algunas de ellas. La gente se fijará en ti, y algunos intentarán "
"matarte.\""

msgid ""
"You explain that taking risks comes with being an independent pilot and that "
"you took the captain's chair with appropriate resolve, but Rebina pins you "
"with a piercing gaze. \"These are no ordinary pirate raids we're talking "
"about,\" she admonishes you. \"If you take this assignment, you will be a "
"painted target. I want you to be well aware of this.\" There is another "
"pause, but then she continues in a milder tone of voice. \"That being said, "
"I can assure you that the reward is well worth the risk. Pull this off, and "
"you'll walk away considerably richer than you were.\""
msgstr ""
"Le explicas que asumir riesgos es propio de un piloto independiente y que "
"tomaste la silla de capitán con la resolución adecuada, pero Rebina te clava "
"una mirada penetrante. \"No estamos hablando de asaltos piratas "
"ordinarios\", te amonesta. \"Si aceptas esta misión, serás un objetivo "
"pintado. Quiero que seas muy consciente de ello.\" Hay otra pausa, pero "
"luego continúa con un tono de voz más suave. \"Dicho esto, puedo asegurarte "
"que la recompensa bien vale el riesgo. Si lo consigues, serás mucho más rico "
"de lo que eras.\""

msgid ""
"Rebina leans back, levelly meeting your gaze. \"That's all I can tell you at "
"this point. You'll get more details only once you accept this job. If you "
"accept this job. What say you?\""
msgstr ""
"Rebina se echa hacia atrás y te mira fijamente. \"Es todo lo que puedo "
"decirte por ahora. Tendrás más detalles cuando aceptes el trabajo. ¿Qué "
"dices?\""

msgid "Take the job."
msgstr "Aceptar el trabajo."

msgid ""
"\"I see. What a shame.\" Rebina's demeanour conveys that she's disappointed "
"but not upset. \"I can understand your decision. One should not bite off "
"more than one can chew, after all. It seems I will have to try to find "
"another candidate.\" She tilts her head slightly. Then, \"Although if you "
"change your mind before I do, you're welcome to seek me out again. I'll be "
"around.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Qué pena.\" El comportamiento de Rebina transmite que está "
"decepcionada pero no molesta. \"Puedo entender tu decisión. Después de todo, "
"uno no debe morder más de lo que puede masticar. Parece que tendré que "
"buscar otro candidato.\" Inclina ligeramente la cabeza. Luego, \"aunque si "
"cambias de opinión antes que yo, eres bienvenido a buscarme de nuevo. Estaré "
"por aquí.\""

msgid ""
"Rebina finishes her drink and gets up. Then, with a cordial wave of her, "
"hand she sweeps out of the door. You momentarily regret not taking her up on "
"her offer, but it passes. You've made the right decision, and that is that."
msgstr ""
"Rebina termina su bebida y se levanta. Luego, con un gesto cordial de la "
"mano, sale por la puerta. Por un momento te arrepientes de no haber aceptado "
"su oferta, pero se te pasa. Has tomado la decisión correcta y ya está."

#. For future appearances of this mission
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful!\" Rebina gives you a warm, sincere smile. \"I don't mind "
"admitting that it isn't easy finding pilots who measure up to my "
"expectations, and finding ones willing to take a risk is more difficult "
"still. I am pleased indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Maravilloso!\" Rebina te dedica una sonrisa cálida y sincera. \"No me "
"importa admitir que no es fácil encontrar pilotos que estén a la altura de "
"mis expectativas, y encontrar a los que estén dispuestos a arriesgarse es "
"aún más difícil. Me alegro mucho.\""

msgid ""
"Then Rebina's expression changes to that of a businesswoman about to ply her "
"trade. \"Now, listen up. Contrary to what you may have thought, this "
"assignment isn't about me. It's about a man who goes by the name of Jorek "
"McArthy. The current state of affairs is that Jorek is staying on {pnt} in "
"the {sys} system, and this is not where me and my associates want him to be. "
"Unfortunately, Jorek has attracted some unwanted attention, and we don't "
"want him to focus that attention to us.\""
msgstr ""
"Entonces la expresión de Rebina cambia a la de una mujer de negocios a punto "
"de ejercer su oficio. \"Ahora, escucha. Al contrario de lo que puedas "
"pensar, esta misión no es sobre mí. Se trata de un hombre llamado Jorek "
"McArthy. El estado actual de las cosas es que Jorek permanece en {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}, y no es aquí donde mis asociados y yo queremos que esté. Por "
"desgracia, Jorek ha atraído cierta atención no deseada, y no queremos que "
"centre esa atención en nosotros.\""

msgid ""
"Rebina takes a moment to sip from her drink. \"I think you can see where "
"this is going. You are to rendezvous with Jorek, take him aboard your ship, "
"lose whoever's tailing him, then bring him to the {sys2} system. There you "
"will dock with one of our ships, the {plt}, which will take Jorek to his "
"final destination. You will receive your reward from her captain once Jorek "
"is aboard.\""
msgstr ""
"Rebina da un sorbo a su bebida. \"Creo que ya ves por dónde va esto. Tienes "
"que reunirte con Jorek, llevarlo a bordo de tu nave, perder a quien le esté "
"siguiendo y llevarlo al sistema {sys2}. Allí atracarás con una de nuestras "
"naves, la {plt}, que llevará a Jorek a su destino final. Recibirás tu "
"recompensa de su capitán una vez que Jorek esté a bordo.\""

msgid ""
"\"It's a simple objective, but accomplishing it might require considerable "
"skill.\" She leans back and smiles. \"Still, I have utmost confidence that "
"you can do it. I seldom misjudge those I choose to trust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es un objetivo sencillo, pero lograrlo puede requerir una habilidad "
"considerable\". Se echa hacia atrás y sonríe. \"Aun así, confío plenamente "
"en que puedas hacerlo. Rara vez juzgo mal a aquellos en los que confío.\""

msgid ""
"\"You know what to do,\" Rebina tells you. \"You will find Jorek in the "
"spaceport bar on {pnt}. When you see him, tell him you've come to 'see to "
"his special needs'. Oh, and please be discreet. Don't talk about things you "
"don't need to; the walls have ears in that place. In particular, don't "
"mention any names.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya sabes lo que tienes que hacer\", te dice Rebina. \"Encontrarás a Jorek "
"en el bar del puerto espacial en {pnt}. Cuando le veas, dile que has venido "
"a 'atender sus necesidades especiales'. Ah, y por favor, sé discreto. No "
"hables de cosas que no necesites; las paredes tienen oídos en ese lugar. En "
"particular, no menciones ningún nombre.\""

#. Translator note: If the plural forms are a problem, assume the numbers here are 20 and 50.
msgid ""
"\"You will be on a time schedule. You must meet Jorek within {t1} periods, "
"or he will assume you are not coming and go back into hiding. You must also "
"be at the meeting point {t2} periods from now. If you fail to meet with "
"Jorek within the time limit or if you are prevented from taking him off-"
"world for any other reason, make your way to the {plt} and report what "
"happened. We'll take it from there. If you fail to show up at the designated "
"time, we will assume you have failed, and the {plt} will leave.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tendrás un horario. Debes reunirte con Jorek en un plazo de {t1}, o él "
"asumirá que no vienes y volverá a esconderse. También debes estar en el "
"punto de encuentro en {t2} períodos a partir de ahora. Si no te reúnes con "
"Jorek en el plazo establecido o si se te impide llevarlo fuera del mundo por "
"cualquier otra razón, dirígete al {plt} e informa de lo sucedido. Nosotros "
"nos encargaremos a partir de ahí. Si no te presentas a la hora señalada, "
"asumiremos que has fallado y el {plt} se irá.\""

msgid ""
"Rebina empties her glass and places it on the bar before rising to her feet. "
"\"That will be all. Good luck, and keep your wits about you.\""
msgstr ""
"Rebina vacía su vaso y lo deja en la barra antes de levantarse. \"Eso es "
"todo. Buena suerte, y mantén la cordura.\""

msgid ""
"Then Rebina takes her leave from you and gracefully departs the spaceport "
"bar. You order yourself another drink. You've got the feeling you're going "
"to need it."
msgstr ""
"Entonces Rebina se despide de ti y sale con elegancia del bar del puerto "
"espacial. Pides otra copa. Tienes la sensación de que la vas a necesitar."

#. Set deadlines
#. Deadline stuff
msgid "Shadowrun"
msgstr "Corredor de la sombra"

msgid "You were promised riches..."
msgstr "Te prometieron riquezas..."

msgid ""
"Fly to planet {pnt} in the {sys} system and talk to Jorek. Once Jorek has "
"boarded your ship, proceed to system {sys2} and board the {plt}."
msgstr ""
"Vuela al planeta {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y habla con Jorek. Una vez que "
"Jorek haya subido a tu nave, dirígete al sistema {sys2} y aborda la {plt}."

msgid "Fly to planet {pnt} in the {sys} system and pick up Jorek"
msgstr "Vuela al planeta {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y recoge a Jorek"

msgid ""
"A middle-aged, cranky looking man is sitting at a table by himself. You are "
"fairly certain that this is the fellow you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"Un hombre de mediana edad y aspecto malhumorado está sentado en una mesa "
"solo. Estás seguro de que es el hombre que buscas."

msgid "Officer at the bar"
msgstr "Oficial en el bar"

msgid ""
"You see a military officer with a drink at the bar. They don't seem to be "
"very interested in it, though..."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un militar con una bebida en el bar. Sin embargo, no parece estar muy "
"interesado en ella..."

msgid "Soldier at the news kiosk"
msgstr "Soldado en el quiosco de noticias"

msgid ""
"You see a soldier at a news kiosk. For some reason, they keep reading the "
"same articles over and over again."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un soldado en un quiosco de noticias. Por alguna razón, sigue leyendo "
"los mismos artículos una y otra vez."

msgid ""
"Two soldiers are sharing a table near the exit, playing cards. Neither of "
"them seems very into the game."
msgstr ""
"Dos soldados comparten una mesa cerca de la salida, jugando a las cartas. "
"Ninguno de los dos parece muy interesado en el juego."

msgid "Card-playing soldier"
msgstr "Soldado jugador de cartas"

#. Talking to Jorek
msgid ""
"You join the man at his table. He doesn't particularly seem to welcome your "
"company, though, because he gives you a look most people would reserve for "
"particularly unwelcome guests. Determined not to let that get to you, you "
"ask him if his name is indeed Jorek."
msgstr ""
"Te reúnes con él en su mesa. No parece muy contento con tu compañía, porque "
"te dirige una mirada que la mayoría de la gente reservaría para los "
"invitados no deseados. Decidido a no dejar que eso te afecte, le preguntas "
"si se llama Jorek."

msgid "\"Yeah, that's me,\" he replies. \"What'd ya want, kid?\""
msgstr "\"Sí, ese soy yo\", responde. \"¿Qué quieres, chico?\""

msgid ""
"You explain to him that you've come to see to his special needs. This earns "
"you a sneer from Jorek. \"Ha! So you're running errands for the little lady, "
"are you? Oh don't tell me, I've got a pretty good idea what it is you want "
"from me.\""
msgstr ""
"Le explicas que has venido a atender sus necesidades especiales. Jorek se "
"burla de ti. \"¡Ja! Así que estás haciendo recados para la señorita, ¿no? No "
"me lo digas, tengo una idea bastante buena de lo que quieres de mí.\""

msgid ""
"He leans onto the table, bringing his face closer to yours. \"Listen, buddy. "
"I don't know if you noticed, but people are watchin' me. And you too, now "
"that you're talkin' to me. Those goons over there? Yeah, they're here for "
"me. Used to be fancy undercover agents, but I've been sittin' on my ass here "
"for a long time and they figured out I was on to them, so they replaced 'em "
"with a bunch of grunts. Cheaper, see.\""
msgstr ""
"Se apoya en la mesa, acercando su cara a la tuya. \"Escucha, colega. No sé "
"si te has dado cuenta, pero la gente me observa. Y tú también, ahora que "
"hablas conmigo. ¿Esos matones de ahí? Sí, están aquí por mí. Solían ser "
"agentes encubiertos de lujo, pero he estado sentado en mi culo aquí durante "
"mucho tiempo y se dieron cuenta de que estaba sobre ellos, así que los "
"reemplazaron con un montón de matones. Más barato, ves.\""

msgid ""
"\"And it's not just them,\" Jorek continues. \"On your way here, did you see "
"the flotilla of 'patrol ships' hangin' around? You guessed it, they're "
"waitin' for me to split this joint. I'm HOT, kid. If I step onto your ship, "
"you'll be hot too. And you have absolutely no problem with that, is that "
"what you're tellin' me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Y no son sólo ellos\", continúa Jorek. \"De camino aquí, ¿has visto la "
"flotilla de 'naves patrulla' merodeando? Lo has adivinado, están esperando a "
"que me vaya de aquí. Estoy caliente, chico. Si entro en tu nave, tú también "
"estarás caliente. Y no tienes absolutamente ningún problema con eso, ¿es eso "
"lo que me estás diciendo?\""

msgid ""
"Jorek roars with laughter. \"Hah! Yeah, I'm sure you don't! I know what "
"you're thinkin', I do. You'll take me outta here, pull a heroic bust past "
"them Empire ships, save me, and the day while you're at it, then earn your "
"stripes with the lady, am I right? S'yeah, I bet you'd take on the world for "
"a pretty face and a coy smile.\" He doesn't so much as make an attempt to "
"keep the mocking tone out of his voice."
msgstr ""
"Jorek ruge de risa. \"¡Ja! ¡Sí, seguro que no! Sé lo que estás pensando, lo "
"sé. Me sacarás de aquí, harás una salida heroica entre las naves del "
"Imperio, me salvarás, y de paso salvarás el día, y luego te ganarás tus "
"galones con la dama, ¿tengo razón? Sí, apuesto a que te enfrentarías al "
"mundo por una cara bonita y una sonrisa tímida\". Ni siquiera intenta evitar "
"el tono burlón de su voz."

msgid ""
"\"Well, good for you. You're a real hero, right enough. But you know what? "
"I'm stayin' put. I don't care if you have the vixen's approval. I'm not "
"gettin' on some random Joe's boat just so he can get us both blasted to "
"smithereens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bien por ti. Eres todo un héroe. Pero, ¿sabes qué? Me quedo aquí. No me "
"importa si tienes la aprobación de la arpía. No voy a subirme a la nave de "
"Pepito sólo para que nos haga volar en pedazos.\""

msgid ""
"Your patience with Jorek's abuse is finally at an end, and you heatedly make "
"it clear to him that your abilities as a pilot you don't deserve of this "
"treatment. Jorek, however, seems unimpressed. He tells you to stick it where "
"the sun doesn't shine, gets up from his chair and squarely deposits himself "
"at another table. Unwilling to stoop to his level, you choose not to follow "
"him."
msgstr ""
"Tu paciencia con los abusos de Jorek llega por fin a su fin y le dejas claro "
"que tus habilidades como piloto no merecen este trato. Jorek, sin embargo, "
"no parece impresionado. Te manda a tomar por culo, se levanta de la silla y "
"se sienta en otra mesa. Reacio a rebajarte a su nivel, decides no seguirle."

msgid ""
"Jorek exhales derisively. \"No, I thought not. Probably thought this was "
"going to be a walk in the park, didn't you? But when the chips are down, you "
"back out. Wouldn't want to mess with be big scary Empire, would we?\" He "
"raises his voice for this, taunting the military personnel in the bar. They "
"don't show any sign of having even heard Jorek speak. Jorek snorts, then "
"focuses his attention back on you."
msgstr ""
"Jorek exhala burlonamente. \"No, pensé que no. Probablemente pensabas que "
"esto iba a ser un paseo por el parque, ¿no? Pero cuando las cosas se ponen "
"feas, te echas atrás. No querríamos meternos con un Imperio que da miedo, "
"¿verdad?\" Para ello levanta la voz, burlándose del personal militar del "
"bar. No muestran ningún signo de haber oído hablar de Jorek. Este resopla y "
"vuelve a centrar su atención en ti."

msgid ""
"\"I've got no use for wusses like yourself. Go on, get out of here. Go back "
"to your ship and beat it off this rock. Maybe you should consider gettin' "
"yourself a desk job, eh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"No me sirven los cobardes como tú. Vamos, vete de aquí. Vuelve a tu nave y "
"lárgate de esta roca. Tal vez deberías considerar conseguirte un trabajo de "
"escritorio, ¿eh?\""

msgid ""
"With that, Jorek leaves your table and sits down at a nearby empty one. "
"Clearly this conversation is over, and you're not going to get anything more "
"out of him."
msgstr ""
"Con eso, Jorek abandona tu mesa y se sienta en una cercana vacía. Está claro "
"que la conversación ha terminado y que no vas a sacarle nada más."

msgid ""
"Jorek pointedly ignores you. It doesn't seem like he's willing to give you "
"the time of day any longer. You decide not to push your luck."
msgstr ""
"Jorek te ignora de forma evidente. No parece que esté dispuesto a seguir "
"dándote la hora. Decides no tentar la suerte."

msgid ""
"You try to strike a conversation with the officer, but they don't seem "
"interested what you have to say, so you give up."
msgstr ""
"Intentas entablar una conversación con el agente, pero no parece interesarle "
"lo que tienes que decir, así que desistes."

msgid "\"Leave me alone. Can't you see I'm busy?\""
msgstr "\"Déjame en paz. ¿No ves que estoy ocupado?\""

msgid ""
"They don't seem to appreciate your company. You decide to leave them to "
"their game."
msgstr "No parecen apreciar tu compañía. Decides dejarles con su juego."

msgid "You could not persuade Jorek to come with you"
msgstr "No pudiste persuadir a Jorek para que viniera contigo"

msgid ""
"Fly to the {sys} system and dock with (board) {plt} to report your result"
msgstr "Vuele al sistema {sys} y aborda al {plt} para informar de tu resultado"

#. player reports in without SHITMAN
msgid ""
"You complete docking operations with the {plt}, well aware that your ship "
"isn't carrying the man they were expecting. At the airlock, you are greeted "
"by a pair of crewmen in grey uniforms. You explain to them that you were "
"unable to bring Jorek to them, and they receive your report in a dry, "
"businesslike manner. The meeting is short. The crewmen disappear back into "
"their ship, closing the airlock behind them, and you return to your bridge."
msgstr ""
"Completas las operaciones de atraque con el {plt}, consciente de que tu nave "
"no lleva al hombre que esperaban. En la esclusa, te reciben un par de "
"tripulantes con uniformes grises. Les explicas que no has podido llevar a "
"Jorek, y reciben tu informe de forma seca y comercial. La reunión es breve. "
"Los tripulantes desaparecen en su nave, cerrando la esclusa tras ellos, y tú "
"vuelves a tu puente."

msgid ""
"You prepare to undock from the {plt}, but before you complete the procedures "
"there is a sudden power spike in your primary systems. All panels go black. "
"In the darkness, the only thing that disturbs the silence is the sound of "
"the {plt} dislodging itself from your docking clamp."
msgstr ""
"Te preparas para desacoplarte del {plt}, pero antes de completar los "
"procedimientos se produce un repentino pico de energía en tus sistemas "
"primarios. Todos los paneles se vuelven negros. En la oscuridad, lo único "
"que perturba el silencio es el sonido del {plt} desprendiéndose de su pinza "
"de acoplamiento."

msgid ""
"Seconds later, the computer core reboots itself and your controls come back "
"online, but you find to your dismay that your OS has been reset to factory "
"defaults. All custom content has been lost - including your logs of meeting "
"the {plt}..."
msgstr ""
"Segundos después, el núcleo del ordenador se reinicia solo y tus controles "
"vuelven a estar en línea, pero descubres para tu consternación que tu "
"sistema operativo se ha restablecido a los valores predeterminados de "
"fábrica. Todo el contenido personalizado se ha perdido, incluidos tus "
"registros de encuentros con el {plt}..."

#. player reports in with SHITMAN
msgid ""
"You complete docking operations with the {plt}, well aware that your ship "
"isn't carrying the man they were expecting. When the airlock opens, you find "
"yourself face to face with a woman and two crewmen, all wearing grey, "
"featureless uniforms. It takes you a few moments to realize that the woman "
"is in fact Rebina. But this is not the elegant, feminine figure you met in "
"the spaceport bar not too long ago. This woman emits an aura of authority, "
"and you immediately understand that Rebina is in fact captain of the {plt}."
msgstr ""
"Completas las operaciones de atraque con el {plt}, consciente de que tu nave "
"no lleva al hombre que esperaban. Cuando se abre la esclusa, te encuentras "
"cara a cara con una mujer y dos tripulantes, todos vestidos con uniformes "
"grises y sin rasgos distintivos. Tardas unos instantes en darte cuenta de "
"que se trata de Rebina. Pero no es la figura elegante y femenina que "
"conociste en el bar del puerto espacial no hace mucho. Esta mujer emite un "
"aura de autoridad, e inmediatamente comprendes que Rebina es en realidad la "
"capitana de la {plt}."

msgid ""
"\"Well met, {player},\" she greets you. At the same time, the two crewmen "
"that accompanied her push their way past you and disappear in the direction "
"of your cargo hold. You open your mouth to protest, but Rebina raises a hand "
"to forestall you. \"There is no cause for concern,\" she says. \"My men are "
"only retrieving that which we sent you to fetch. I assure you that your ship "
"and its cargo will be left undisturbed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bienvenido, {player}\", te saluda. Al mismo tiempo, los dos tripulantes "
"que la acompañaban se abren paso a empujones y desaparecen en dirección a tu "
"bodega de carga. Abres la boca para protestar, pero Rebina levanta una mano "
"para impedirlo. \"No hay motivo de preocupación\", dice. \"Mis hombres sólo "
"están recuperando lo que les enviamos a buscar. Te aseguro que tu nave y su "
"carga permanecerán intactas.\""

msgid ""
"You explain to Rebina that although you met Jorek, he didn't accompany you "
"on your way here. Rebina gives you a grim smile in return. \"Oh, I know "
"that. I never expected you to bring him to us in the first place. You see, "
"it's not Jorek we wanted you to get. It was... that.\""
msgstr ""
"Le explicas a Rebina que, aunque conociste a Jorek, no te acompañó en tu "
"camino hasta aquí. Rebina te devuelve una sonrisa sombría. \"Oh, ya lo sé. "
"Para empezar, nunca esperé que nos lo trajeras. Verás, no era a Jorek a "
"quien queríamos que trajeras. Era... eso.\""

msgid ""
"You follow her gaze, and spot the crewmen making their way back to the "
"airlock, carrying between them a small but apparently rather heavy crate. "
"You are absolutely certain you've never seen it before."
msgstr ""
"Sigues su mirada y ves a los tripulantes que regresan a la esclusa, llevando "
"entre ellos una caja pequeña pero aparentemente bastante pesada. Estás "
"completamente seguro de que nunca la habías visto antes."

msgid ""
"\"That is what Jorek was keeping for us on {pnt}, and that is what we need,"
"\" Rebina explains. \"Jorek is nothing but a decoy to draw the Empire's "
"attention away from our real operations. While you were talking to him, his "
"subordinates secured our cargo aboard your ship. We chose not to inform you "
"about this because, well... It's best you didn't know what was in that "
"crate. I'm sure we understand each other.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Eso es lo que Jorek nos guardaba en {pnt}, y eso es lo que necesitamos\", "
"explica Rebina. \"Jorek no es más que un señuelo para desviar la atención "
"del Imperio de nuestras verdaderas operaciones. Mientras hablabas con él, "
"sus subordinados aseguraron nuestra carga a bordo de tu nave. Decidimos no "
"informarte de esto porque, bueno... Es mejor que no sepas lo que había en "
"esa caja. Estoy seguro de que nos entendemos.\""

msgid ""
"Rebina turns to follow her men back into the ship, but before she closes the "
"airlock hatch she looks back at you over her shoulder, shooting you a casual "
"glance that nevertheless seems to see right through you. \"I'm glad to see "
"my trust in you was not misplaced,\" she remarks. \"Perhaps we'll see each "
"other again someday, and when we do perhaps we can do some more business.\""
msgstr ""
"Rebina se da la vuelta para seguir a sus hombres al interior de la nave, "
"pero antes de cerrar la escotilla vuelve a mirarte por encima del hombro, "
"lanzándote una mirada despreocupada que, sin embargo, parece ver a través de "
"ti. \"Me alegra ver que no me equivoqué al confiar en ti\", comenta. \"Quizá "
"nos volvamos a ver algún día, y cuando lo hagamos quizá podamos hacer más "
"negocios.\""

msgid ""
"Then she is gone. You stare at the airlock hatch, then down at the credit "
"chip in your hand, first marvelling at the wealth it represents and then "
"astonished to realize you can't remember how it got there."
msgstr ""
"Entonces ella desaparece. Te quedas mirando la escotilla de la esclusa y "
"luego la ficha de crédito que llevas en la mano, primero maravillado por la "
"riqueza que representa y luego asombrado al darte cuenta de que no recuerdas "
"cómo ha llegado hasta ahí."

#. in case it was used
msgid ""
"You participated in an operation for Captain Rebina. You thought you were "
"rescuing a man named Jorek, but it turns out that you were actually helping "
"smuggle something onto Captain Rebina's ship, the Seiryuu. You know next to "
"nothing about Captain Rebina or who she works for."
msgstr ""
"Has participado en una operación para la capitana Rebina. Pensabas que "
"estabas rescatando a un hombre llamado Jorek, pero resulta que en realidad "
"estabas ayudando a introducir algo de contrabando en la nave de la capitana "
"Rebina, el Seiryuu. No sabes casi nada sobre la capitana Rebina ni para "
"quién trabaja."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
