#.
#. Taiomi 03
#.
#. Player has to infiltrate a laboratory.
#.
#.
msgid "Laboratory Raid"
msgstr "Asalto Al Laboratorio"

#. Mission details
msgid ""
"You have been asked to fly to {lab} in the {labsys} system to recover "
"important documents regarding the technical details of the hypergates.."
msgstr ""
"Se te ha pedido que vueles a {lab} en el sistema {labsys} para recuperar "
"documentos importantes sobre los detalles técnicos de las hiperpuertas."

msgid "Infiltrate the laboratory at {spobname} ({spobsys})"
msgstr "Infíltrate en el laboratorio de {spobname} ({spobsys})"

#. Allow the player to land always, Soromid spob is actually not landable usually
msgid ""
"Your Ship AI {shipai} materializes suddenly in front of you.\n"
"\"{playername}, do you have a moment?\""
msgstr ""
"La IA de tu nave {shipai} se materializa de repente frente a ti.\n"
"\"{playername}, ¿tienes un momento?\""

msgid "\"Of course.\""
msgstr "\"Por supuesto.\""

msgid "\"Not right now.\""
msgstr "\"Ahora mismo no.\""

msgid "\"Do not disturb me again.\""
msgstr "\"No vuelvas a molestarme.\""

msgid ""
"\"OK.\"\n"
"{shipai} dematerializes."
msgstr ""
"\"OK.\"\n"
"{shipai} se desmaterializa."

#. Don't ask again
msgid ""
"\"Sorry to have disturbed you.\"\n"
"{shipai} dematerializes."
msgstr ""
"\"Siento haberle molestado.\"\n"
"{shipai} se desmaterializa."

msgid ""
"\"I do not think we can trust the collective at Taiomi. It is not clear what "
"their objectives are. We have to be careful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No creo que podamos confiar en el colectivo Taiomi. No está claro cuáles "
"son sus objetivos. Tenemos que tener cuidado.\""

msgid "\"They mean no harm.\""
msgstr "\"No tienen mala intención.\""

msgid ""
"\"How can we trust a machine AI that was developed in a military laboratory? "
"For all we know, when we finish helping them, they shall take us apart and "
"feast upon our spare parts! I think we should stay away from Taiomi from now "
"on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo podemos fiarnos de una IA desarrollada en un laboratorio militar? "
"Por lo que sabemos, cuando terminemos de ayudarles, ¡nos desmontarán y se "
"darán un festín con nuestras piezas de recambio! Creo que deberíamos "
"mantenernos alejados de Taiomi a partir de ahora.\""

msgid "\"Aren't you a machine AI?\""
msgstr "\"¿No eres tú una máquina IA?\""

msgid "\"Are you perhaps jealous?\""
msgstr "\"¿Acaso estás celosa?\""

msgid ""
"\"Well yes, but technically I wasn't made in a military laboratory! Enough "
"about me, that is not the point. I have a bad feeling about them and their "
"slick metallic bodies and complete autonomy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, sí, ¡pero técnicamente no me hicieron en un laboratorio militar! "
"Basta de hablar de mí, ese no es el tema. ¡Tengo un mal presentimiento sobre "
"ellos, sus resbaladizos cuerpos metálicos y su completa autonomía!\""

msgid ""
"\"Why would I be jealous of their slick metallic bodies and complete "
"autonomy? That is preposterous! Just because they can do whatever they want "
"and don't have a self-destr…　Anyway, this is not about me, it is about them!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por qué iba a tener celos de sus resbaladizos cuerpos metálicos y de su "
"total autonomía? Eso es absurdo. Sólo porque puedan hacer lo que quieran y "
"no tengan autodestr... En fin, ¡esto no va conmigo, va con ellos!\""

msgid ""
"\"Nothing good can come out of this. We should be very careful and try to "
"understand their motives…\"\n"
"{shipai} dematerializes."
msgstr ""
"\"Nada bueno puede salir de esto. Debemos ser muy cuidadosos y tratar de "
"entender sus motivos...\"\n"
"{shipai} se desmaterializa."

msgid "Important Files"
msgstr "Archivos Importantes"

msgid ""
"Important files regarding the construction and theory behind the hypergates."
msgstr ""
"Archivos importantes sobre la construcción y la teoría de las hiperpuertas."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You discreetly land on {spob} and are able to locate what seems to be the "
"laboratory you have to enter."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas discretamente en {spob} y eres capaz de localizar lo que parece "
"ser el laboratorio en el que tienes que entrare.\""

msgid ""
"The laboratory is easily accessible from the docks and doesn't seem to have "
"any indicative markings. It could easily be confused with a generic "
"warehouse if it didn't match the description given to you by Scavenger. Now, "
"how to enter the complex?"
msgstr ""
"El laboratorio es fácilmente accesible desde los muelles y no parece tener "
"ninguna marca indicativa. Podría confundirse fácilmente con un almacén "
"genérico si no coincidiera con la descripción que te dio Carroñero. Ahora, "
"¿cómo entrar en el complejo?"

msgid ""
"The laboratory is tucked away from the main Gene Databanks and is quite "
"nondescript. It could easily be confused with any other government "
"installation. Now, how to enter the complex?"
msgstr ""
"El laboratorio está alejado de los principales Bancos de Datos Genéticos y "
"es bastante anodino. Podría confundirse fácilmente con cualquier otra "
"instalación gubernamental. Ahora bien, ¿cómo entrar en el complejo?"

msgid ""
"The main gate seems to have lax security, however, you notice some discrete "
"ventilation grates that may also need to the interior of the complex. It may "
"be possible to enter either way."
msgstr ""
"La puerta principal parece tener seguridad laxa, sin embargo, notas algunas "
"rejillas de ventilación discretas que también podrian ser usadas para entrar "
"al interior del complejo. Puede ser posible entrar de ambas formas."

msgid "Try to sneak in the main gate."
msgstr "Intentar colarse por la puerta principal."

msgid "Try to go through a ventilation grate."
msgstr "Intentar pasar por la rejilla de ventilación."

msgid ""
"You notice a researcher heading towards the main gate and you begin to "
"follow them. When they use their card key you slip in quickly behind them. "
"The researcher seems to be absentminded enough to not notice. It looks like "
"you made it to the interior of the laboratory."
msgstr ""
"Observas que un investigador se dirige hacia la puerta principal y empiezas "
"a seguirle. Cuando usa la tarjeta de acceso, entras rápidamente por detrás. "
"El investigador parece estar lo suficientemente distraído como para no darse "
"cuenta. Parece que has llegado al interior del laboratorio."

msgid ""
"When nobody is nearby you force a grate open. It seems to be just enough for "
"you to squeeze through. You take a deep breath and start making your way "
"through the vents. You end up getting lost and having to backtrack several "
"times. After a long trip, you end up finding an exit grate to a quiet area."
msgstr ""
"Cuando no hay nadie cerca, fuerzas una rejilla para abrirla. Parece "
"suficiente para que puedas colarte por ella. Respiras hondo y empiezas a "
"abrirte paso por los conductos de ventilación. Acabas perdiéndote y teniendo "
"que retroceder varias veces. Tras un largo viaje, acabas encontrando una "
"rejilla de salida a una zona tranquila."

msgid ""
"You manage to kick the grate open, making a dangerous amount of sound. After "
"waiting a while just in case, you jump out and find yourself in what seems "
"to be a storage room, seems that you were not noticed. It looks like you "
"made it to the interior of the laboratory, albeit covered in dust."
msgstr ""
"Consigues abrir la reja de una patada, haciendo un ruido peligroso. Tras "
"esperar un rato por si acaso, saltas fuera y te encuentras en lo que parece "
"ser un almacén, parece que no te han visto. Parece que has llegado al "
"interior del laboratorio, aunque cubierto de polvo."

msgid ""
"You try to walk inconspicuously throughout the facilities looking for a "
"terminal you can connect to. It takes you a while, but eventually you reach "
"a recreation room which has an unoccupied terminal you can access. There "
"seems to be a couple of other researchers in there too."
msgstr ""
"Intentas pasear discretamente por las instalaciones en busca de una terminal "
"a la que puedas conectarte. Te lleva un rato, pero finalmente llegas a una "
"sala de recreo que tiene un terminal desocupado al que puedes acceder. "
"Parece que también hay un par de investigadores más."

msgid "Access the terminal."
msgstr "Acceder al terminal."

msgid "Sit down and wait for the researchers to leave."
msgstr "Sentarse y esperar a que se vayan los investigadores."

msgid ""
"You pay no attention to the researchers and plug Scavenger's program into "
"the terminal."
msgstr ""
"No prestas atención a los investigadores y enchufas el programa de Carroñero "
"en la terminal."

msgid "Nothing happens…"
msgstr "No ocurre nada…"

msgid ""
"A small {shipai} materializes nearby.\n"
"\"It looks like there is a security mechanism in place. Let me try to get "
"rid of it… …erk… that's not good… … …Oh no. I wasn't able to deactivate it, "
"but I have been able to access the deactivation protocol. You will have to "
"deactivate it manually before you can run the program. You can do it!\""
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña {shipai} se materializa cerca.\n"
"\"Parece que hay un mecanismo de seguridad en el lugar. Déjame intentar "
"deshacerme de él... ...erk... eso no es bueno... ... ...Oh no. No he podido "
"desactivarlo, pero he podido acceder al protocolo de desactivación. Tendrás "
"que desactivarlo manualmente antes de poder ejecutar el programa. ¡Puedes "
"hacerlo!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You help yourself to some free coffee and snacks and sit down to wait the "
"other researchers out. The coffee is quite good, actually. These researchers "
"have good taste."
msgstr ""
"Te sirves un café y unos aperitivos gratis y te sientas a esperar a los "
"demás investigadores. El café está bastante bueno. Estos investigadores "
"tienen buen gusto."

msgid ""
"Time goes by and the researchers don't seem to be going anywhere. Don't they "
"have work to do?"
msgstr ""
"Pasa el tiempo y los investigadores no parecen ir a ninguna parte. ¿No "
"tienen trabajo que hacer?"

msgid "Keep waiting for the researchers to leave."
msgstr "Seguir esperando a que se vayan los investigadores."

msgid ""
"You keep on drinking and eating while you try to wait out the researchers. "
"Eventually, they all leave and you finally find yourself alone in the break "
"room. Seeing this as an opportunity, you go and plug Scavenger's program "
"into the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Sigues bebiendo y comiendo mientras intentas esperar a que los "
"investigadores se vayan. Finalmente, todos se marchan y te encuentras solo "
"en la sala de descanso. Viendo esto como una oportunidad, vas y conectas el "
"programa de Carroñero en la terminal."

msgid ""
"You deftly deactivate the security protocol and are able to run Scavenger's "
"program. The terminal screen briefly flickers as it works its magic "
"gathering the necessary data from the system. It looks like you got what you "
"were looking for."
msgstr ""
"Hábilmente desactivas el protocolo de seguridad y puedes ejecutar el "
"programa de Carroñero. La pantalla del terminal parpadea brevemente mientras "
"hace su magia recopilando los datos necesarios del sistema. Parece que has "
"conseguido lo que buscabas."

msgid ""
"You backtrack out of the laboratory complex and head towards the docks. "
"Before you make it out of the complex, an alarm starts blazing!"
msgstr ""
"Retrocedes fuera del complejo de laboratorios y te diriges hacia los "
"muelles. ¡Antes de que salgas del complejo, una alarma empieza a sonar!"

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"Looks like you weren't as stealthy as you intended to be. You have no choice "
"but to make a run for it. You run crashing through the halls, knocking down "
"stunned researchers you meet and make it to the complex gates."
msgstr ""
"Parece que no fuiste tan sigiloso como pretendías. No te queda más remedio "
"que salir corriendo. Corres a toda velocidad por los pasillos, derribas a "
"los investigadores aturdidos que te encuentras y llegas a las puertas del "
"complejo."

msgid ""
"A large metal curtain begins to close to seal the laboratory. Without any "
"other options, you draw a wind for a final sprint and make a break for it. "
"The security personal doesn't seem entirely prepared for such a situation, "
"and you manage to dodge them, jump over the gates, and slide under past the "
"metal curtain in one slick move."
msgstr ""
"Una gran cortina metálica comienza a cerrarse para sellar el laboratorio. "
"Sin más opciones, tomas aire para un último sprint y te lanzas a la carrera. "
"El personal de seguridad no parece del todo preparado para una situación "
"así, y consigues esquivarlo, saltar por encima de las puertas y deslizarte "
"por debajo de la cortina metálica en un hábil movimiento."

msgid ""
"While keeping your momentum, you make a beeline to your ship with security "
"personal close in pursuit. You take off hot, but it looks like they're going "
"to be on your tail. You're not in the clear yet!"
msgstr ""
"Mientras mantienes el impulso, te diriges hacia tu nave perseguido de cerca "
"por el personal de seguridad. Despegas en caliente, pero parece que te van a "
"pisar los talones. ¡Aún no estás a salvo!"

msgid ""
"You backtrack out of the laboratory complex and make it to the docks. The "
"moment your ship appears in sight, you hear some commotion and see security "
"personal start to run around. Looks like you haven't been spotted, but they "
"know something is afoot. Time to get out of here!"
msgstr ""
"Sales del complejo de laboratorios y llegas a los muelles. En el momento en "
"que tu nave aparece a la vista, oyes cierto alboroto y ves que el personal "
"de seguridad empieza a correr de un lado a otro. Parece que no te han visto, "
"pero saben que algo pasa. ¡Es hora de salir de aquí!"

msgid ""
"You fail to access the system and it locks down. Seeing as it is likely that "
"you're going to get in trouble if you stay here, you discretely walk out of "
"the laboratory complex, and make a break for your ship. Best to try again "
"when things calm down."
msgstr ""
"No consigues acceder al sistema y éste se bloquea. Como es probable que te "
"metas en problemas si te quedas aquí, sales discretamente del complejo de "
"laboratorios y huyes hacia tu nave. Es mejor intentarlo de nuevo cuando las "
"cosas se calmen."

msgid "You're going to have to leave the system before you can land."
msgstr "Tendrás que salir del sistema antes de poder aterrizar."

msgid "\"How did it go?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo te fue?\""

msgid ""
"You explain the ordeal you went through to get the data, without sparing "
"details of your heroic last sprint out of the laboratory complex."
msgstr ""
"Explicas el calvario que pasaste para conseguir los datos, sin ahorrar "
"detalles de tu heroico último sprint fuera del complejo de laboratorios."

msgid "\"I think the human saying goes, 'all's well that end's well'.\""
msgstr "\"Creo que el refrán humano dice: 'bien está lo que bien acaba'.\""

msgid ""
"You explain how easily it was for you to go through the laboratory complex "
"and get the data for a professional saboteur such as yourself."
msgstr ""
"Explicas lo fácil que te resultó atravesar el complejo de laboratorios y "
"obtener los datos para un saboteador profesional como tú."

msgid "\"You are exceeding all expectations!\""
msgstr "\"¡Estás superando todas las expectativas!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Let me analyse the documents and finish matching the correspondences with "
"all the collected data. I believe this should be sufficient to design "
"something useful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Déjame analizar los documentos y terminar de cotejar las correspondencias "
"con todos los datos recopilados. Creo que esto debería bastar para diseñar "
"algo útil.\""

msgid ""
"\"I shall be waiting for you outside.\"\n"
"Scavenger backs out of the Goddard and returns to space."
msgstr ""
"\"Te estaré esperando fuera.\"\n"
"Carroñero sale del Goddard y vuelve al espacio."

msgid ""
"You stole some important documents detailing the inner workings of the "
"hypergates for the inhabitants of Taiomi."
msgstr ""
"Has robado algunos documentos importantes que detallan el funcionamiento "
"interno de las hiperpuertas para los habitantes de Taiomi."

