#.
msgid "Therite for Scavenger"
msgstr "Terita Para Carroñero"

#. Mission details
msgid ""
"You have been asked to fly to obtain {resource} to help do an experiment. "
"{resource} can be found in the nearby {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Se te ha pedido que vueles para obtener {resource} para ayudar a hacer un "
"experimento. {resource} puede ser encontrado en el cercano sistema {sys}."

#. Conditions to update OSD
msgid "Obtain {amount} of {resource} (have {have})"
msgstr "Obtener {amount} de {resource} (tienes {have})"

#. Tell to go back
#. Small cutscene with the curious drones
#. Create small convoy that tries to leave
#. Centre of last asteroid field
msgid "Shady Miners"
msgstr "Mineros Turbios"

msgid "Shady Miner"
msgstr "Minero Turbio"

msgid "It looks like {namea} and {nameb} followed you!"
msgstr "¡Parece que {namea} y {nameb} te han seguido!"

msgid ""
"You open a transmission channel with the two curious drones following you."
msgstr ""
"Abres un canal de transmisión con los dos curiosos drones que te siguen."

msgid "\"Hello!\""
msgstr "\"¡Hola!\""

msgid "\"You found us!\""
msgstr "\"¡Nos has encontrado!\""

msgid "\"You should stay in {basesys}.\""
msgstr "\"Deberías quedarte en {basesys}.\""

msgid "\"It's dangerous out here!\""
msgstr "\"¡Es peligroso estar aquí fuera!\""

msgid "\"What are you doing out here?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué haces aquí fuera?\""

msgid "\"It's boring in {basesys}! They never let us out!\""
msgstr "\"¡Es aburrido estar en {basesys} ¡Nunca nos dejan salir!\""

msgid "\"We can help too! We always sneak out when nobody is watching!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Nosotros también podemos ayudar! ¡Siempre nos escabullimos cuando nadie "
"nos ve!\""

msgid "\"Sssh, you're not supposed to say that {namea}!\""
msgstr "\"¡Sssh, se supone que no debes decir ese {namea}!\""

msgid "\"Oops, don't tell anyone!\""
msgstr "\"¡Uy, no se lo digas a nadie!\""

msgid "\"You should go back.\""
msgstr "\"Deberíais volver,\""

msgid "\"We can play later, OK?\""
msgstr "\"Podemos jugar más tarde, ¿de acuerdo?\""

msgid "\"Fine, but make sure to stay hidden!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bien, pero asegúrate de permanecer escondido!\""

msgid ""
"\"Fine, we will go back, but you have to promise to play with us later!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Vale, volveremos, pero tienes que prometernos que jugarás con nosotros "
"más tarde!\""

msgid ""
"\"Yes! Swear by your auxiliary capacitor that you'll play with us later!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Sí! ¡Júra por tu condensador auxiliar que jugarás con nosotros más tarde!"
"\""

msgid "\"Humans don't have auxiliary capacitors do they?\""
msgstr "\"Los humanos no tienen condensadores auxiliares, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "\"Sure they do, that's the bumpy thing they have under their eyes no?\""
msgstr "\"Claro que sí, es el bulto que tienen debajo de los ojos ¿no?\""

msgid ""
"Chattering amongst theselves, the two young drones head back to {basesys}."
msgstr "Charlando entre ellos, los dos jóvenes drones regresan a {basesys}."

msgid "\"Really!?!\""
msgstr "\"¿¡En serio!?\""

msgid "\"You're awesome!\""
msgstr "\"¡Eres increíble!\""

msgid "\"We'll stay in the shadows, like, what were they called. Ninjas!\""
msgstr "\"Nos mantendremos en las sombras, como, como se llamaban. ¡Ninjas!\""

msgid "\"Ninjas! Ninjas!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ninjas! ¡Ninjas!\""

msgid ""
"Chattering amongst themselves, they begin to hide themselves along the stars."
msgstr "Parloteando entre ellos, comienzan a esconderse junto a las estrellas."

#. Shouldn't be targeted by other enemies since they are invincible
#. Move to the next stuff
#. Just allow dropping off a bit
msgid "Drop off {resource}?"
msgstr "¿Dejar {resource}?"

msgid ""
"Do you wish to drop off {have} of {resource}? You still need to get "
"{necessary} for Scavenger."
msgstr ""
"¿Deseas soltar {have} {resource}? Aún tienes que conseguir {necessary} para "
"Carroñero."

msgid "Resources dropped off"
msgstr "Recursos soltados"

msgid "You store the {amount} of {resource} at the {base}."
msgstr "Almacenas la {amount} de {resource} en la {base}."

#. Player should have the full amount now, we remove all of it
#. Give a nice bonus
msgid ""
"You bring the {resource} aboard the Goddard and find Scavenger waiting for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Llevas el {resource} a bordo del Goddard y encuentras a Carroñero "
"esperándote."

msgid ""
"\"I see you managed to bring more than all the needed resources. This will "
"be plenty for us to start working on our project. I will be outside getting "
"things set up. We may still need something else so make sure to check in "
"after you get some rest.\"\n"
"Scavenger backs out of the Goddard and returns to space."
msgstr ""
"\"Veo que has conseguido traer más recursos de los necesarios. Con esto "
"tendremos suficiente para empezar a trabajar en nuestro proyecto. Estaré "
"fuera preparando las cosas. Puede que aún necesitemos algo más, así que "
"asegúrate de venir después de descansar un poco.\"\n"
"Carroñero sale del Goddard y vuelve al espacio."

msgid ""
"\"I see you managed to bring all the needed resources. This will be enough "
"for us to start working on our project. I will be outside getting things set "
"up. We may still need something else so make sure to check in after you get "
"some rest.\"\n"
"Scavenger backs out of the Goddard and returns to space."
msgstr ""
"\"Veo que has conseguido traer todos los recursos necesarios. Esto nos "
"bastará para empezar a trabajar en nuestro proyecto. Estaré fuera preparando "
"todo. Puede que aún necesitemos algo más, así que asegúrate de comprobarlo "
"después de descansar un poco.\"\n"
"Carroñero sale del Goddard y vuelve al espacio."

msgid "You collected important resources for the inhabitants of Taiomi."
msgstr "Has recogido recursos importantes para los habitantes de Taiomi."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Taiomi 5">
#. <unique />
#. <chance>0</chance>
