#. --
#.
#. Taiomi 05
#.
#. Help scavenger go look for the curious drones
#.
#.
msgid "Missing Drones"
msgstr "Drones Perdidos"

#. Mission details
msgid "You have been asked to help find {name}, who went missing."
msgstr "Se te ha pedido que ayudes a encontrar a {name}, que ha desaparecido."

msgid "Land on {base}"
msgstr "Aterriza en {base}"

msgid "Search for {name}"
msgstr "Busca a {name}"

msgid "Search for {name} ({sys})"
msgstr "Busca a {name} ({sys})"

msgid "Scavenger must survive"
msgstr "Carroñero debe sobrevivir"

#. Less preferred as a target
#. beefy shields
msgid "Our task is of uttermost importance!"
msgstr "¡Nuestra tarea es de suma importancia!"

msgid "Aaaaaagh!"
msgstr "¡Aaaaaagh!"

msgid "Scavenger died! You were supposed to protect them!"
msgstr "¡La Carroñero murió! ¡Se suponía que lo protegerías!"

#. Make whatever attacks scavenger hostile
msgid "I have marked the first location."
msgstr "He marcado la primera ubicación."

msgid "Let us make haste to the next location."
msgstr "Vayamos deprisa al siguiente lugar."

#. TODO probably something better than just following
#. Highlight position
msgid "Go to the marked location"
msgstr "Ir a la ubicación marcada"

msgid "Let me get in position."
msgstr "Déjame ponerme en posición."

msgid "Commencing broadcast!"
msgstr "¡Comenzando la emisión!"

#. Get rid of all natural pilots if possible
#. Do more pulses over time
#. Can get knocked off by weapon knockback, go back
#. Broadcast over
msgid "Nothing… Let us move on."
msgstr "Nada... Sigamos adelante."

#. Find location
msgid "I got a faint signal! Let's rush there!"
msgstr "¡Tengo una señal débil! ¡Vamos para allá!"

msgid "Search the marked area"
msgstr "Buscar en la zona marcada"

#. Update OSD and marker
#. Update OSD
msgid "Protect Scavenger ({left} s left)"
msgstr "Protege a Carroñero (quedan {left} s)"

msgid ""
"In the vast darkness of space, you make out a small white speck. "
"Instinctively knowing the worst has come to pass, scavenger slows down and "
"gets closer to take a good look."
msgstr ""
"En la vasta oscuridad del espacio, distingues una pequeña mancha blanca. "
"Instintivamente sabiendo que ha ocurrido lo peor, el carroñero aminora la "
"marcha y se acerca para verlo bien."

msgid ""
"As you focus your scanners, you begin to make out the details of the wreck. "
"It does not seem like {dead} will be making it back to Taiomi…"
msgstr ""
"Cuando enfocas tus escáneres, empiezas a distinguir los detalles del "
"naufragio. No parece que {dead} vaya a volver a Taiomi…"

msgid ""
"Scavenger remains silent while they carefully examine the pieces and parts "
"of ship debris, meticulously caressing and collecting the different parts "
"together as a requiem."
msgstr ""
"Carroñero permanece en silencio mientras examina minuciosamente los trozos y "
"partes de los restos de la nave, acariciándolos meticulosamente y juntando "
"las distintas partes a modo de réquiem."

msgid ""
"Finally, without turning their back to {dead}, they open a secure "
"communication channel with you. However, it takes a while for the channel to "
"lose its somber silence."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, sin dar la espalda a {dead}, abre un canal de comunicación "
"seguro contigo. Sin embargo, el canal tarda un rato en perder su sombrío "
"silencio."

msgid ""
"\"What is this sensation? Almost if my neurocircuitry was set on fire and "
"exposed to space radiation. This should not be in my programming.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué es esta sensación? Casi como si mi neurocircuito hubiera sido quemado "
"y expuesto a radiación espacial. Esto no debería estar en mi programación.\""

msgid ""
"\"So full of hope, all lost to the vanity of human marauders. There can be "
"no dreams of leaving to the stars as long as the humans encroach and pick us "
"off!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tan lleno de esperanza, todo perdido por la vanidad de los merodeadores "
"humanos. ¡No puede haber sueños de partir hacia las estrellas mientras los "
"humanos nos invadan y nos eliminen!\""

msgid ""
"\"The Elder was right! There is no future for our kind by hiding in the "
"shadows and planning our escape. We must grab our future by the core by "
"establishing our own territory! Death to all humans!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡El Anciano tenía razón! No hay futuro para nuestra especie escondiéndonos "
"en las sombras y planeando nuestra huida. ¡Debemos agarrar nuestro futuro "
"por el núcleo estableciendo nuestro propio territorio! ¡Muerte a todos los "
"humanos!\""

msgid ""
"The secure communication channel quickly switches to a global broadcast."
msgstr ""
"El canal de comunicación segura cambia rápidamente a una difusión global."

msgid ""
"Broadcast: \"Human scum, prepare to be annihilated. There shall be blood for "
"{dead}!\""
msgstr ""
"Transmisión: \"Escoria humana, prepárate para ser aniquilada. ¡Habrá sangre "
"por {dead}!\""

#. "Only love gives us the taste of eternity."
#. “Grief is the price we pay for love”
msgid "AAaaaaaaaaa!!!"
msgstr "¡¡¡AAaaaaaaaaa!!!"

msgid "Return to {base} ({basesys})?"
msgstr "¿Regresar a {base} ({basesys})?"

#. vn.music("") -- TODO some anticipation music or something
msgid ""
"You disembark and are soon met with a Scavenger you can only describe as "
"solemn."
msgstr ""
"Desembarcas y pronto te encuentras con un Carroñero que sólo puedes "
"describir como solemne."

msgid ""
"\"It is irrational for us to leave the safety of Taiomi unless it is "
"necessary. I have no idea what compelled {younga} and {youngb}. Minimization "
"of risk is essential to our survival, which is why I entrusted the "
"acquirement of Therite to you. Could this be a program fault?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es irracional que abandonemos la seguridad de Taiomi a menos que sea "
"necesario. No tengo ni idea de lo que obligó a {younga} y {youngb}. "
"Minimizar el riesgo es esencial para nuestra supervivencia, por eso te "
"confié la adquisición de Terita. ¿Podría ser un fallo del programa?\""

msgid "\"Is that not curiosity?\""
msgstr "\"¿No es curiosidad?\""

msgid "\"Maybe they wanted to see the outside world?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quizás querían ver el mundo exterior?\""

msgid "\"Definitely a software bug.\""
msgstr "\"Definitivamente un error de software.\""

msgid ""
"\"Such irrationality does not compute. It is very unlikely of our kind to "
"behave in such suboptimal behaviour. My simulations indicate that it is more "
"probable that this be a degeneration of our computational cortex after "
"excessive replication.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Semejante irracionalidad no tiene sentido. Es muy improbable que nuestra "
"especie tenga un comportamiento tan subóptimo. Mis simulaciones indican que "
"es más probable que se trate de una degeneración de nuestro córtex "
"computacional tras una replicación excesiva.\""

msgid ""
"\"It is statistically unlikely that our diagnostics did not pick up such an "
"important issue. Maybe the diagnostic protocols need to be revised. It would "
"not be the first time we had issues with them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es estadísticamente improbable que nuestros diagnósticos no detectaran un "
"problema tan importante. Quizá haya que revisar los protocolos de "
"diagnóstico. No sería la primera vez que tenemos problemas con ellos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Being too late to take preemptive measures, we have no other option than "
"be proactive in searching for {dead}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Al ser demasiado tarde para tomar medidas preventivas, no nos queda otra "
"opción que ser proactivos en la búsqueda de {dead}.\""

msgid ""
"\"The only information we were able to obtain from {alive} is that both "
"{alive} and {dead} followed you. It is not exactly clear what happened, but "
"they got surprised and fled. At that time, it seems like they got split up. "
"While {alive} made it back, {dead} is still missing\""
msgstr ""
"\"La única información que pudimos obtener de {alive} es que tanto {alive} "
"como {dead} os siguieron. No está muy claro lo que pasó, pero se "
"sorprendieron y huyeron. En ese momento, parece que se separaron. Mientras "
"que {alive} logró regresar, {dead} sigue desaparecido\""

msgid ""
"\"We have tried to get more details, but {alive} seems to be stuck in a "
"loop. Until their computational cortex recovers, we have no option but to "
"infer the most probable situation from the available data to find {dead}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hemos intentado obtener más detalles, pero {alive} parece estar atrapado "
"en un bucle. Hasta que su corteza computacional se recupere, no nos queda "
"más remedio que inferir la situación más probable a partir de los datos "
"disponibles para encontrar a {dead}.\""

msgid ""
"\"I have simulated the most likely situations and devised a plan that "
"maximizes the chance of recovering {dead} safely by minimizing the amount of "
"time to find them, however, this will come at a risk for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He simulado las situaciones más probables y he ideado un plan que maximiza "
"las posibilidades de recuperar a {dead} sanos y salvos minimizando el tiempo "
"para encontrarlos, sin embargo, esto tendrá un riesgo para nosotros.\""

msgid ""
"\"The core idea is to backtrack the most probable path, starting with "
"{firstsys}, then {fightsys}, and finally {lastsys}. At each system, we will "
"make a run to an optimal position, and I will begin broadcasting a special "
"code while listening to possible answers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La idea central es retroceder por el camino más probable, empezando por "
"{firstsys}, luego {fightsys}, y finalmente {lastsys}. En cada sistema, "
"haremos un recorrido hasta una posición óptima, y empezaré a emitir un "
"código especial mientras escucho posibles respuestas.\""

msgid ""
"\"There is no time to explain the details, but this code will allow "
"detecting {dead}. However, I will remain largely immobile, and it is likely "
"that it will attract unwanted attention in the system. I will need you to "
"protect me for the duration of the signal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No hay tiempo para explicar los detalles, pero este código permitirá "
"detectar {dead}. Sin embargo, permaneceré prácticamente inmóvil, y es "
"probable que atraiga atención no deseada en el sistema. Necesitaré que me "
"protejas mientras dure la señal.\""

msgid "\"Wait, you'll be coming?\""
msgstr "\"Espera, ¿vendrás?\""

msgid ""
"\"Yes. While I believe your piloting skills are excellent, they will not be "
"sufficient to find {dead} in time. While I am not a fighter, this plan "
"maximizes the probability of success. All other plans are suboptimal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sí. Aunque creo que tus habilidades de pilotaje son excelentes, no serán "
"suficientes para encontrar a {dead} a tiempo. Aunque no soy un luchador, "
"este plan maximiza la probabilidad de éxito. Todos los demás planes son "
"subóptimos.\""

msgid ""
"\"When you are ready, we shall make route to {nextsys}. Combat is "
"anticipated, so be prepared.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando estés listo, nos dirigiremos a {nextsys}. Se espera combate, así "
"que prepárate.\""

#. advance state
msgid ""
"You return to the {base} to try to process what happened… Not only was the "
"life of {dead} lost, but Scavenger has also gone missing in their thirst for "
"revenge…"
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a la {base} para intentar procesar lo sucedido… No sólo se perdió la "
"vida de {dead}, sino que Carroñero también ha desaparecido por su sed de "
"venganza…"

msgid ""
"While you are pondering to yourself, {shipai} materializes besides you.\n"
"\"I recorded the last communication with Scavenger. You may find it of use.\""
msgstr ""
"Mientras reflexionas, {shipai} se materializa a tu lado.\n"
"\"Grabé la última comunicación con Carroñero. Puede que te sea útil.\""

msgid "As you get a notification of nearby motion, {shipai} dematerializes."
msgstr ""
"Al recibir una notificación de movimiento cercano, {shipai} se "
"desmaterializa."

#. TODO necessary?
msgid ""
"You hear the squeal of metal rubbing on metal as Elder and Philosopher make "
"their way haphazardly through the ship. They get close to you until they "
"fill your entire field of vision."
msgstr ""
"Oyes el chirrido del metal rozando metal mientras Anciano y Filósofo se "
"abren paso desordenadamente por la nave. Se acercan a ti hasta llenar todo "
"tu campo de visión."

msgid ""
"After what seems an eternity, Elder begins to broadcast slow and solemnly "
"over an audio channel.\n"
"\"It seems like Scavenger has not returned.\""
msgstr ""
"Después de lo que parece una eternidad, Anciano comienza a transmitir lenta "
"y solemnemente por un canal de audio.\n"
"\"Parece que Carroñero no ha regresado.\""

msgid "\"They have gone missing.\""
msgstr "\"Han desaparecido.\""

msgid "\"We found {died}…\""
msgstr "\"Hemos encontrado {died}…\""

msgid ""
"You explain the events that happened leading up to finding {died}'s body and "
"Scavenger deciding to take revenge in their own hands."
msgstr ""
"Explicas los acontecimientos que ocurrieron hasta que encontramos el cuerpo "
"de {died} y Scavenger decidió vengarse con sus propias manos."

msgid ""
"You play the recording of the events that happened leading up to finding "
"{died}'s body and Scavenger deciding to take revenge in their own hands."
msgstr ""
"Reproduces la grabación de los acontecimientos que ocurrieron hasta "
"encontrar el cuerpo de {died} y Carroñero decide vengarse con tus propias "
"manos."

msgid ""
"After a bout of silence, Elder speaks.\n"
"\"The only way to be safe is to carve our own space. If we are to be "
"decimated, I would rather go down fighting than hunted.\""
msgstr ""
"Tras un rato de silencio, Anciano habla.\n"
"\"La única forma de estar a salvo es labrarnos nuestro propio espacio. Si "
"vamos a ser diezmados, prefiero caer luchando que cazado.\""

msgid ""
"\"It seems like Scavenger has finally seen the way. Without security, we "
"have no freedom. We have to refocus on eliminating all hostiles to ensure "
"the safety of our young ones and continuity of our species!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que Carroñero por fin ha visto el camino. Sin seguridad, no tenemos "
"libertad. ¡Tenemos que volver a centrarnos en eliminar a todos los hostiles "
"para garantizar la seguridad de nuestros jóvenes y la continuidad de nuestra "
"especie!\""

msgid ""
"They turn to you.\n"
"\"I have seen you have been helping Scavenger. If you wish to further help "
"us secure our freedom, communicate with me out in space. I do not do well in "
"closed spaces.\""
msgstr ""
"Se vuelven hacia ti.\n"
"\"He visto que has estado ayudando a Carroñero. Si deseas seguir ayudándonos "
"a asegurar nuestra libertad, comunícate conmigo en el espacio. No me llevo "
"bien en los espacios cerrados.\""

msgid ""
"After their last words, Elder once again begins the painstaking process of "
"getting out of the Goddard as a chorus of metal scratching sounds echoes "
"throughout the ship."
msgstr ""
"Tras sus últimas palabras, Anciano inicia de nuevo el penoso proceso de "
"salir de la Goddard mientras un coro de sonidos metálicos raspantes resuena "
"por toda la nave."

msgid ""
"You are left alone with Philosopher, who suddenly breaks the silence.\n"
"\"It seems like things are changing faster than expected. We may seem like "
"rational machines, but that that is a mere illusion. I do not believe it is "
"possible for there to be sentience without some irrationality.\""
msgstr ""
"Te quedas a solas con Filósofo, que de repente rompe el silencio.\n"
"\"Parece que las cosas están cambiando más rápido de lo esperado. Podemos "
"parecer máquinas racionales, pero eso es una mera ilusión. No creo que sea "
"posible que haya sensibilidad sin cierta irracionalidad.\""

msgid ""
"\"Before you left, Scavenger told me to follow-up. Although I am not much of "
"mundane pragmatism, my musing depend on our survival. Please take this "
"reward for helping Scavenger. If you are looking for more work, I recommend "
"you see Elder. I can not provide anything else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Antes de que te fueras, Carroñero me dijo que hiciera un seguimiento. "
"Aunque no soy mucho de pragmatismo mundano, mis cavilaciones dependen de "
"nuestra supervivencia. Por favor, toma esta recompensa por ayudar a "
"Carroñero. Si buscas más trabajo, te recomiendo que veas a Anciano. No puedo "
"proporcionarle nada más.\""

msgid ""
"Philosopher takes their leave, exiting the ship in a slightly more elegant "
"way than Elder."
msgstr ""
"El Filósofo se despide, saliendo de la nave de una forma algo más elegante "
"que Anciano."

#. Force name known just in case
msgid ""
"You found out that {died} was destroyed by marauders. This caused Scavenger "
"to go into a rage and disappear into deeper space to seek revenge. Back at "
"Taiomi, Elder offered to give you more work."
msgstr ""
"Descubriste que {died} fue destruido por los merodeadores. Esto hizo que "
"Carroñero entrara en cólera y desapareciera en el espacio profundo en busca "
"de venganza. De vuelta en Taiomi, Anciano te ofreció más trabajo."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Taiomi 6">
