#. Amount of cargo to take
msgid "Za'lek Scientist"
msgstr "Científico Za'lek"

msgid ""
"You see a Za'lek scientist nervously sitting at the bar. It seems like they "
"might have a job for you."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un científico Za'lek nervioso sentado en la barra. Parece que podrían "
"tener un trabajo para ti."

msgid "You approach the Za'lek scientist who looks at you nervously."
msgstr "Te acercas al científico Za'lek que te mira nervioso."

msgid ""
"He musters up courage and begins to speak.\n"
"\"Say, you wouldn't happen to be a pilot that could take me to the {sys} "
"system? My colleagues at {pnt} have gone silent during their investigations "
"and I'm fearing maybe the worst happened to them. I would be able to pay you "
"{credits} for the trip.\""
msgstr ""
"Se arma de valor y comienza a hablar.\n"
"\"Dígame, ¿por casualidad no será usted un piloto que pueda llevarme al "
"sistema {sys}? Mis colegas de {pnt} han enmudecido durante sus "
"investigaciones y me temo que tal vez les haya pasado lo peor. Podría "
"pagarte {credits} por el viaje.\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks anyways.\"\n"
"He lets out a sigh and goes back to nervously looking for a pilot to take "
"him to the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias de todos modos.\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro y vuelve a buscar nerviosamente un piloto que le "
"lleve al sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"He lets out a long sigh of relief when you accept his task.\n"
"\"Thanks, my name is Zack Xiao. I've been asking pilots for ages and nobody "
"seems to want to go near the Anubis Black Hole. Too many bad rumours about "
"the area. I was also worried when my colleague went over there. They were "
"stubborn and decided to go for the research opportunity despite my protests. "
"And now, no response in almost half a cycle!\""
msgstr ""
"Deja escapar un largo suspiro de alivio cuando aceptas su cometido.\n"
"\"Gracias, me llamo Zack Xiao. Llevo años preguntando a los pilotos y nadie "
"parece querer acercarse al Agujero Negro de Anubis. Hay demasiados rumores "
"malos sobre la zona. También me preocupé cuando mi colega fue allí. Fueron "
"tercos y decidieron ir por la oportunidad de investigación a pesar de mis "
"protestas. Y ahora, ¡sin respuesta en casi medio ciclo!\""

msgid ""
"\"Even taking into account the ergosphere this is too much of a delay. "
"Something must have happened! I knew I should have stopped them.\"\n"
"He seems visibly distraught and you try to soothe him."
msgstr ""
"\"Incluso teniendo en cuenta la ergosfera esto es un retraso demasiado "
"grande. Debe haber ocurrido algo. Sabía que debía haberlos detenido.\"\n"
"Parece visiblemente angustiado y tratas de calmarlo."

msgid ""
"He goes on in a smaller shaky voice.\n"
"\"Please take me to {pnt}, so we can see it's all fine, and they just got "
"absorbed in their research again…\""
msgstr ""
"Continúa con una voz más débil y temblorosa.\n"
"\"Por favor, llévame a {pnt}, para que podamos ver que todo está bien, y que "
"sólo se han absorbido en su investigación de nuevo...\""

msgid "A worried Za'lek scientist."
msgstr "Un científico Za'lek preocupado."

#. mission details
msgid "Black Hole Research"
msgstr "Investigación de Agujeros Negros"

msgid ""
"Take Zach to see what happened to his colleagues at {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Lleva a Zach a ver lo que les pasó a sus colegas de {pnt} en el sistema "
"{sys}."

msgid "Take Zach to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Lleva a Zach a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. TODO new song? Also add to music.lua
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As you approach the station you can make out clear plasma blast craters on "
"the outer hull. Your ship has to push away floating debris as you make a "
"landing approach at the space docks while Zach is silent the entire time "
"with a dumbfounded look on his face. You don't think this is what he was "
"expecting. After what seems like an eternity, the ship's magnetic docking "
"clamps make contact with the station."
msgstr ""
"A medida que os acercáis a la estación podéis distinguir claros cráteres de "
"explosión de plasma en el casco exterior. Tu nave tiene que apartar los "
"restos flotantes mientras te acercas a los muelles espaciales mientras Zach "
"permanece en silencio todo el tiempo con una mirada de asombro. No creo que "
"esto sea lo que él esperaba. Después de lo que parece una eternidad, las "
"pinzas magnéticas de acoplamiento de la nave hacen contacto con la estación."

msgid ""
"\"This can't be happening. It was only supposed to be a two cycle post-doc…"
"\"\n"
"He looks pale."
msgstr ""
"\"Esto no puede estar pasando. Se suponía que sólo iba a ser un "
"postdoctorado de dos ciclos...\"\n"
"Esta pálido."

msgid "\"They have to be around somewhere\""
msgstr "\"Tienen que estar en alguna parte\""

msgid "\"Let's see what happened\""
msgstr "\"Veamos qué ha ocurrido\""

msgid "Begin to search"
msgstr "Empieza a buscar"

msgid ""
"You and Zach don your space suits and begin to search the atmosphere-less "
"breached station in eerie silence. A floating spoon, some dirty boots… It "
"seems like the station had inhabitants in it until quite recently. Although "
"the base is quite a mess, knowing the Za'lek, chances are that was the usual "
"state of affairs at the station. As you go through all the rooms one by one, "
"but are unable to find any signs of life. During the whole ordeal, Zach "
"remains silent and concentrated."
msgstr ""
"Tú y Zach os ponéis los trajes espaciales y empezáis a registrar la estación "
"sin atmósfera en un inquietante silencio. Una cuchara flotante, unas botas "
"sucias... Parece que la estación tuvo habitantes hasta hace poco. Aunque la "
"base está bastante desordenada, conociendo a los Za'lek, lo más probable es "
"que ese fuera el estado habitual de la estación. Recorres todas las "
"habitaciones una a una, pero es incapaz de encontrar señales de vida. "
"Durante todo el calvario, Zach permanece en silencio y concentrado."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You eventually make your way around the entire station and end up back at "
"the docks, near your ship, {shipname}. Zach seems to be staring at some of "
"the damage. As you struggle with how to break the silence, you notice that "
"Zach has become fixed on some structural damage."
msgstr ""
"Al final, recorres toda la estación y acabas de vuelta en los muelles, cerca "
"de tu nave, {shipname}. Zach parece estar mirando algunos de los daños. "
"Mientras luchas por romper el silencio, te das cuenta de que Zach se ha "
"fijado en algunos daños estructurales."

msgid "\"Say, doesn't that over there look like bite marks?\""
msgstr "Oye, ¿eso de ahí parecen marcas de mordiscos?\""

msgid ""
"You look over at where Zach is pointing, but can't really make out what he's "
"getting at. However, after a while of staring and squinting, you seem to "
"make out some damage that could indeed be bite marks, but what on earth "
"would bite a station?"
msgstr ""
"Miras hacia donde Zach está señalando, pero no puedes distinguir lo que "
"quiere decir. Sin embargo, después de un rato de mirar y entrecerrar los "
"ojos, te parece distinguir algunos daños que podrían ser marcas de "
"mordiscos, pero ¿qué diablos mordería una estación?"

msgid ""
"\"Something isn't right here.\"\n"
"He stops one second realizing what he just said and gives a puzzled look.\n"
"\"Well, besides the obvious, it just doesn't make sense. Why would anyone "
"want to do this to a basic research laboratory? There is nothing over here "
"other than the black hole…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algo no está bien aquí.\"\n"
"Se detiene un segundo al darse cuenta de lo que acaba de decir y lanza una "
"mirada de desconcierto.\n"
"\"Bueno, además de lo obvio, no tiene sentido. ¿Por qué querría alguien "
"hacer esto a un laboratorio de investigación básica? Aquí no hay nada más "
"que el agujero negro...\""

msgid ""
"He goes silent and seems to be lost in thought. Finally, he looks up and "
"looks around the ship, his gaze becoming determined. He then turns to you.\n"
"\"I think I'm going to stay here and try to continue the research. It "
"shouldn't be too hard to reactivate basic station functionality. I would "
"never forgive myself if I went back without finding out what happened to "
"them.\""
msgstr ""
"Se queda en silencio y parece estar perdido en sus pensamientos. Finalmente, "
"levanta la vista y mira alrededor de la nave, su mirada se vuelve decidida. "
"Luego se dirige a ti.\n"
"\"Creo que voy a quedarme aquí y tratar de continuar la investigación. No "
"debería ser muy difícil reactivar la funcionalidad básica de la estación. "
"Nunca me perdonaría si volviera sin averiguar qué les pasó.\""

msgid ""
"Zach goes back to your ship and brings his engineering toolkit and personal "
"drones with him. He starts floating around scanning the hull panels of the "
"station, apparently looking for something. Eventually, he seems to have "
"found what he was looking for, and he rips off a panel. He motions to the "
"drones and disappears with them into the depths of the station internals."
msgstr ""
"Zach vuelve a su nave y trae consigo su kit de herramientas de ingeniería y "
"sus drones personales. Empieza a flotar escaneando los paneles del casco de "
"la estación, aparentemente buscando algo. Finalmente, parece haber "
"encontrado lo que buscaba y arranca un panel. Hace un gesto a los drones y "
"desaparece con ellos en las profundidades del interior de la estación."

msgid ""
"You float close by and peer through but can't make much out in the dark "
"tangle of cables and electronics. Only occasional flashes of light indicate "
"the presence of Zach and his drones, with a drone occasionally coming out to "
"drop damaged electronics and procure new supplies. Knowing you won't be of "
"help, you wait at the docks wondering how long it'll take him, and begin to "
"nod off."
msgstr ""
"Flotas cerca y te asomas pero no puedes distinguir mucho en la oscura maraña "
"de cables y aparatos electrónicos. Sólo los destellos ocasionales de luz "
"indican la presencia de Zach y sus drones, con un dron que sale de vez en "
"cuando para dejar los componentes electrónicos dañados y conseguir nuevos "
"suministros. Sabiendo que no serás de ayuda, esperas en los muelles "
"preguntándote cuánto tiempo le llevará, y empiezas a dar cabezadas."

msgid ""
"Suddenly, you are awoken by the buzz, whirs, and groans of a station coming "
"back to life. Alarms blaze as the station begins to generate a breathable "
"atmosphere and weak gravitational field. While you are distracted by all the "
"commotion, you feel a tap on your shoulder and turn around to see a grinning "
"Zach, helmet in hand."
msgstr ""
"De repente, te despiertan los zumbidos, silbidos y gemidos de una estación "
"que vuelve a la vida. Las alarmas se disparan cuando la estación comienza a "
"generar una atmósfera respirable y un débil campo gravitatorio. Mientras "
"estás distraído por toda la conmoción, sientes un golpecito en el hombro y "
"te giras para ver a un Zach sonriente, con el casco en la mano."

msgid ""
"\"The gravitational flux quantifier was bust, but I managed to hot-wire it "
"with a reverse Fleuret capacitor. The station isn't in great shape, but it's "
"a good starting point to get things working like they should be. You can "
"take off your helmet now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El cuantificador de flujo gravitacional estaba estropeado, pero me las "
"arreglé para conectarlo en caliente con un condensador Fleuret inverso. La "
"estación no está en gran forma, pero es un buen punto de partida para que "
"las cosas funcionen como deberían. Ya puedes quitarte el casco.\""

msgid ""
"You unlatch your helmet, and take a breath of the new atmosphere. It smells "
"heavily of ionization but has a weird musty tang to it which makes you "
"grimace slightly."
msgstr ""
"Te quitas el casco y respiras la nueva atmósfera. Huele mucho a ionización, "
"pero tiene un extraño sabor mustio que te hace hacer una ligera mueca."

msgid ""
"\"You smell that too? I have no idea what it is, but it should go away once "
"the filters get cycled. Here, let me pay you for your services. I'll start "
"seeing if I can figure out what happened to this station and what exactly "
"they were researching. I'm afraid I'm currently in the dark and don't really "
"know much about the details. If you want to help, you should be able to find "
"me around the station while I finish up the repairs. I might have things for "
"you to help with.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Tú también hueles eso? No tengo ni idea de lo que es, pero debería "
"desaparecer una vez que los filtros se ciclen. Toma, déjame pagarte por tus "
"servicios. Empezaré a ver si puedo averiguar qué pasó con esta estación y "
"qué estaban investigando exactamente. Me temo que actualmente estoy en la "
"oscuridad y no sé mucho sobre los detalles. Si quieres ayudar, podrás "
"encontrarme en la estación mientras termino las reparaciones. Puede que "
"tenga cosas en las que puedas ayudar.\""

msgid ""
"You took Zach to {pnt} where he found that his colleagues had seemingly met "
"a gruesome fate. He vowed to look into what happened and continue the "
"research that was started. Using his engineering skills, he was able to "
"restore minimum functionality of the station."
msgstr ""
"Llevaste a Zach a {pnt}, donde descubrió que sus colegas habían corrido "
"aparentemente un horrible destino. Se comprometió a investigar lo sucedido y "
"a continuar la investigación iniciada. Utilizando sus conocimientos de "
"ingeniería, fue capaz de restablecer la funcionalidad mínima de la estación."

msgid "Zach: \"{pnt} should be towards the black hole.\""
msgstr "Zach: \"{pnt} debería estar hacia el agujero negro.\""

msgid "Zach: \"I hope they're all right.\""
msgstr "Zach: \"Espero que estén bien.\""

msgid "Zach: \"Everything looks too quiet.\""
msgstr "Zach: \"Todo está demasiado tranquilo.\""

msgid "Zach: \"Are those blast marks?\""
msgstr "Zach: \"¿Son marcas de disparos?\""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Black Hole 2">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <spob>Research Post Sigma-13</spob>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Za'lek Black Hole 1</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Za'lek Black Hole</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Za'lek Black Hole 02
#.
#. Player has to bring back supplies to Zach, first encounter with evil PI's lackeys and feral ship
#.
#.
msgid "Repair Supplies"
msgstr "Suministros de Reparación"

msgid ""
"You approach Zach who seems a bit tired out from all his work on repairing "
"the station."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a Zach, que parece un poco cansado de todo el trabajo de "
"reparación de la estación."

msgid ""
"\"Hey, I got most of the station working, but to get the rest, including the "
"shipyard, I'm going to need some additional supplies that I can't improvise "
"my way out of. If I could get {amount} of {cargo}, I should be able to get "
"it all operational. I was able to arrange a pick-up at {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system, however, I have to stay here and watch {curpnt}. Would you be "
"willing to bring the {cargo} from {pnt} for {credits}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, tengo la mayor parte de la estación funcionando, pero para conseguir "
"el resto, incluido el astillero, voy a necesitar algunos suministros "
"adicionales que no puedo improvisar. Si pudiera conseguir {amount} de "
"{cargo}, debería ser capaz de ponerlo todo en funcionamiento. Pude arreglar "
"una recogida en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}, sin embargo, tengo que quedarme "
"aquí y vigilar {curpnt}. ¿Estarías dispuesto a traer la {cargo} desde {pnt} "
"por {credits}?\""

msgctxt "Zach"
msgid "\"OK. I'll be here if you change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"De acuerdo. Estaré aquí si cambias de opinión.\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks again. Once we get this station fully up and running we should be "
"able to access all the memory logs and recorded data and try to make sense "
"of what the hell happened here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias de nuevo. Una vez que tengamos esta estación completamente en "
"funcionamiento deberíamos poder acceder a todos los registros de memoria y "
"datos grabados y tratar de dar sentido a qué demonios ha pasado aquí.\""

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "Repairing Sigma-13"
msgstr "Reparar Sigma-13"

msgid ""
"Pick up the necessary supplies at {pnt} in the {sys} system and bring them "
"back to Zach at {retpnt}."
msgstr ""
"Recoge los suministros necesarios en {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y tráelos de "
"vuelta a Zach en {retpnt}."

msgid "Pick up cargo at {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Recoge la carga en {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

msgid "Za'lek Individual"
msgstr "Individuo Za'lek"

msgid ""
"You land and quickly the automated loading drones begin to pack the {amount} "
"of {cargo} onto your ship. While you are waiting, someone comes up to you."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y rápidamente los drones de carga automatizados comienzan a cargar "
"la {amount} de {cargo} en tu nave. Mientras esperas, alguien se acerca a ti."

msgid ""
"They have an odd grin on their face and you can't help but to get a bad "
"feeling about them.\n"
"\"Say, you wouldn't be headed to the Anubis Black Hole? Lots of scary stuff "
"there.\""
msgstr ""
"Tiene una extraña sonrisa en la cara y no puedes evitar tener un mal "
"presentimiento sobre él.\n"
"\"Dime, ¿no te dirigirás al Agujero Negro de Anubis? Hay muchas cosas que "
"dan miedo allí.\""

msgctxt "to Evil PI 1"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"Sí.\""

msgctxt "to Evil PI 1"
msgid "\"No.\" (Lie)"
msgstr "\"No.\" (Mentir)"

msgid ""
"\"I see. Scary place, lots of things can go wrong there.\"\n"
"They seem to mentally take note of something."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Un lugar aterrador, muchas cosas pueden salir mal allí.\"\n"
"Parece que toman nota mentalmente de algo."

msgid ""
"\"I see. Where are you going to?\"\n"
"You say a random Za'lek planet but it doesn't seem like they are very "
"interested in your answer."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. ¿A dónde vas?\"\n"
"Dices que a un planeta Za'lek al azar, pero no parece que este muy "
"interesado en tu respuesta."

msgid ""
"\"You wouldn't happen to be interested in research. You know, helping "
"unravel the secrets of the universe, one step at a time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por casualidad, no estarás interesado en la investigación. Ya sabes, "
"ayudar a desentrañar los secretos del universo, paso a paso.\""

msgctxt "to Evil PI 2"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"Sí.\""

msgctxt "to Evil PI 2"
msgid "\"No.\""
msgstr "\"No.\""

msgid ""
"Suddenly the grin disappears from their face leaving a scowl in its place.\n"
"\"When you see Zach, tell him to get away from the black hole, or he won't "
"be going on to a third post-doc.\""
msgstr ""
"De repente, la sonrisa desaparece de su cara dejando un ceño fruncido en su "
"lugar.\n"
"\"Cuando veas a Zach, dile que se aleje del agujero negro, o no pasará a un "
"tercer postdoctorado.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh, and you're a shitty liar.\"\n"
"They walk away as you stand there dumbstruck."
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, y eres un mentiroso de mierda.\"\n"
"Se aleja mientras tú te quedas atónito."

msgid "They walk away as you stand there dumbstruck."
msgstr "Se aleja mientras tú te quedas boquiabierto."

msgid ""
"A miscellaneous assortment of Za'lek equipment that seems like it would be "
"pretty useful if needing to perform makeshift repairs on a space station."
msgstr ""
"Un surtido diverso de equipo Za'lek que parece ser bastante útil si se "
"necesitan reparaciones improvisadas en una estación espacial."

msgid ""
"The first thing you notice as your ship approaches the station is the lack "
"of debris floating around, which allows you to make a landing unhindered. "
"You land and are first greeted by drones that quickly begin to unpack the "
"{cargo} from your ship. Zach appears shortly after the unloading process is "
"underway,"
msgstr ""
"Lo primero que notas cuando tu nave se acerca a la estación es la ausencia "
"de escombros flotando alrededor, lo que te permite hacer un aterrizaje sin "
"obstáculos. Al aterrizar, eres recibido primero por los drones que "
"rápidamente comienzan a descargar la {cargo} de tu nave. Zach aparece poco "
"después de que el proceso de descarga esté en marcha,"

msgid ""
"\"I see you were able to bring everything I asked for.\"\n"
"They then notice your worried face and ask what is wrong. You explain the "
"encounter with the individual at {pnt} with the thinly veiled threat made at "
"Zach, and the weird ship you saw outside."
msgstr ""
"\"Veo que has podido traer todo lo que te pedí.\"\n"
"Entonces nota tu cara de preocupación y te preguntan qué pasa. Les explicas "
"el encuentro con el individuo de {pnt} con la amenaza apenas velada que le "
"hicieron a Zach, y la extraña nave que viste fuera."

msgid ""
"As you explain the details his expression darkens and he goes quiet for a "
"while before speaking.\n"
"\"This makes it clear that what happened here was not an accident, but a "
"deliberate act of destruction. This doesn't clear things up, but it is "
"obvious that we must continue to investigate until the end. I have to find "
"out what happened to my colleague and find out who did this.\"\n"
"He trembles slightly with barely contained anger."
msgstr ""
"Cuando le explicas los detalles, su expresión se ensombrece y guarda "
"silencio durante un rato antes de hablar.\n"
"\"Esto deja claro que lo que ocurrió aquí no fue un accidente, sino un acto "
"deliberado de destrucción. Esto no aclara las cosas, pero es evidente que "
"debemos seguir investigando hasta el final. Tengo que averiguar qué le pasó "
"a mi colega y descubrir quién lo hizo.\"\n"
"Tiembla ligeramente con una ira apenas contenida."

msgid ""
"He closes his eyes, mutters something you can't make out, and lets out a "
"deep breath.\n"
"\"I must not let myself get carried away in rage. We must analyse this and "
"proceed methodologically. There is no room for emotion-caused errors. "
"Science guides to glory.\"\n"
"He looks more determined than ever."
msgstr ""
"Cierra los ojos, murmura algo que no puedes descifrar y suelta un profundo "
"suspiro.\n"
"\"No debo dejarme llevar por la rabia. Debemos analizar esto y proceder "
"metodológicamente. No hay lugar para los errores provocados por las "
"emociones. La ciencia guía a la gloria.\"\n"
"Parece más decidido que nunca."

msgid ""
"\"We must proceed carefully. It is clear that someone or something does not "
"want us to be here. We also don't know what is going on around here and "
"we're finding more questions than answers. However, as I was told by my "
"first supervisor, to find answers you must first ask the right questions. I "
"will analyse our options, meet me up at the bar once you are ready for the "
"next steps.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Debemos proceder con cuidado. Está claro que alguien o algo no quiere que "
"estemos aquí. Tampoco sabemos qué está pasando aquí y encontramos más "
"preguntas que respuestas. Sin embargo, como me dijo mi primer supervisor, "
"para encontrar respuestas primero hay que hacer las preguntas adecuadas. "
"Analizaré nuestras opciones, reúnete conmigo en el bar cuando estés "
"preparado para los siguientes pasos.\""

msgid ""
"You helped Zach get more supplies to repair {pnt}, but were threatened by an "
"unknown individual, and also ran into an unknown ship leading to more "
"questions than answers."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a Zach a conseguir más suministros para reparar {pnt}, pero fuiste "
"amenazado por un individuo desconocido, y también te encontraste con una "
"nave desconocida que te llevó a tener más preguntas que respuestas."

#. Set up seeing the feral bioship on the way back
msgid "You thought you saw something!"
msgstr "¡Creíste haber visto algo!"

#. All gone
msgid "Sigma-13"
msgstr "Sigma-13"

msgid "Zach: Welcome back {playername}."
msgstr "Zach: Bienvenido de nuevo {playername}."

msgid ""
"You find Zach at the bar, he seems to be staring dreamily at a photograph. "
"When he notices your presence he quickly puts it away and sobers up."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zach en la barra, parece estar mirando soñadoramente una "
"fotografía. Cuando se da cuenta de tu presencia, la aparta rápidamente y se "
"pone sobrio."

msgid ""
"\"Damn, you nearly gave me a heart attack. I think I must be spending too "
"much time alone on this station. By the way, how do you like it? I wrote a "
"custom cleaning routine for all the droids and it seems to be turning out "
"much better than expected. Almost has a homey touch to it.\"\n"
"He runs his hand on the counter top."
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, casi me da un ataque al corazón. Creo que debo estar pasando "
"demasiado tiempo solo en esta estación. Por cierto, ¿qué te parece? Escribí "
"una rutina de limpieza personalizada para todos los droides y parece que "
"está resultando mucho mejor de lo esperado. Casi tiene un toque hogareño.\"\n"
"Pasa la mano por la encimera."

msgid "\"It's looking great!\""
msgstr "\"¡Se ve genial!\""

msgid "\"Could use more work.\""
msgstr "\"Podría necesitar más trabajo.\""

msgid "\"Looks awful.\""
msgstr "\"Se ve horrible.\""

msgid ""
"\"I know! Who would have thought that a standard research post model could "
"have so much character? Some of the decorations could use some work, but "
"that's just a matter of time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Lo sé! ¿Quién iba a pensar que un modelo de puesto de investigación "
"estándar podría tener tanto carácter? A algunos adornos les vendría bien un "
"poco de trabajo, pero eso es sólo cuestión de tiempo.\""

msgid ""
"\"I don't think it's that bad given the circumstances. If I had followed "
"Za'lek standard procedure, we would have had to completely rebuild the "
"station. That's not something that can be done without a proper fleet of "
"constructor drones.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No creo que sea tan malo dadas las circunstancias. Si hubiera seguido el "
"procedimiento estándar Za'lek, habríamos tenido que reconstruir "
"completamente la estación. Eso no es algo que pueda hacerse sin una flota "
"adecuada de drones constructores.\""

msgid ""
"\"So great that you're at a loss of words? My skills have that effect on "
"people sometimes.\"\n"
"He chuckles slightly."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Tan bueno que te quedas sin palabras? Mis habilidades tienen ese efecto "
"en la gente a veces.\"\n"
"Se ríe ligeramente."

msgid ""
"His expression becomes more serious.\n"
"\"I have been looking at recovering the station logs. Lots of the data has "
"been lost, but I'm hoping I'll be able to recover most of it, although it's "
"going to take quite a long time. In the meanwhile, it seems like the logs "
"were referring to some anomaly in the system. This could be related to the "
"unidentified object you saw when bringing supplies back. Due to a lack of "
"better options at the moment, could you do a patrol of {sys}? This might "
"give us a hint on what is going on here.\""
msgstr ""
"Su expresión se vuelve más seria.\n"
"\"He estado estudiando la recuperación de los registros de la estación. "
"Muchos de los datos se han perdido, pero espero poder recuperar la mayor "
"parte, aunque va a llevar bastante tiempo. Mientras tanto, parece que los "
"registros se referían a alguna anomalía en el sistema. Esto podría estar "
"relacionado con el objeto no identificado que viste al traer los "
"suministros. Debido a la falta de mejores opciones en este momento, ¿podrías "
"hacer una patrulla de {sys}? Esto podría darnos una pista sobre lo que está "
"pasando aquí.\""

msgid ""
"\"Great, just doing a quick circle of {sys} should suffice for now. Make "
"sure to keep your eyes out for anything strange. If you encounter the "
"unidentified object, try to approach it, but be cautious. We don't know what "
"to expect, and seeing all the damage to the station, it might be best to "
"assume the worst.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Genial, con hacer un círculo rápido de {sys} debería ser suficiente por "
"ahora. Asegúrate de estar atento a cualquier cosa extraña. Si te encuentras "
"con el objeto no identificado, trata de acercarte a él, pero sé cauteloso. "
"No sabemos qué esperar, y viendo todos los daños en la estación, sería mejor "
"asumir lo peor.\""

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "Black Hole Scouting"
msgstr "Explorando el Agujero Negro"

msgid "Patrol the {sys} system and report your observations to Zach at {pnt}."
msgstr "Patrulla el sistema {sys} y reporta tus observaciones a Zach en {pnt}."

msgid "Scout around ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Explora alrededor de ({sys} sistema)"

#. Set up the enemies
#, fuzzy
msgid "You were supposed to eliminate all hostiles!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que debías eliminar a los hostiles!"

msgid ""
"Zach is waiting for you at the docks as your ship lands. He immediately "
"comes over to you."
msgstr ""
"Zach te espera en el muelle cuando tu nave aterriza. Inmediatamente se "
"acerca a ti."

msgid ""
"\"Are you OK? What the hell were those guys? They were clearly Za'lek "
"vessels, but who could be in charge of them? The research here was approved "
"by Central Station, it makes no sense… They also knew I was here, this just "
"makes it all the more confusing. What could they be after? More questions "
"and more questions, but we aren't getting any answers.\"\n"
"He rubs his temples."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Estás bien? ¿Qué demonios eran esos tipos? Claramente eran naves Za'lek, "
"pero ¿quién podía estar a cargo de ellas? La investigación aquí fue aprobada "
"por la Estación Central, no tiene sentido... También sabían que yo estaba "
"aquí, esto sólo lo hace más confuso. ¿Qué podrían estar buscando? Más "
"preguntas y más preguntas, pero no obtenemos ninguna respuesta.\"\n"
"Se frota las sienes."

msgid ""
"\"I'm going to have to rethink everything from the beginning, and try to "
"make some sense out of this. Meet me up in the spaceport, I should hopefully "
"have some idea on our next steps.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a tener que repensar todo desde el principio, y tratar de darle algún "
"sentido a esto. Encuéntrame en el puerto espacial, espero tener alguna idea "
"sobre nuestros próximos pasos.\""

msgid ""
"During a patrol of the {sys} system, you were attacked by some unidentified "
"Za'lek forces. You were able to destroy them, but have not yet found out "
"what is going on at {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Durante una patrulla del sistema {sys}, fuistes atacados por unas fuerzas "
"Za'lek no identificadas. Fuisteis capaz de destruirlas, pero aún no has "
"averiguado qué está pasando en {pnt}."

#. Set up the enemies
msgid "You were supposed to eliminate the hostiles!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que debías eliminar a los hostiles!"

msgid "Zach: I've detected some incoming ships from {sys}!"
msgstr "Zach: ¡He detectado algunas naves entrantes desde {sys}!"

msgid "Zach: It looks like they are coming to {pnt}!"
msgstr "Zach: ¡Parece que vienen a {pnt}!"

msgid "This is {pnt}. Please state your purpose."
msgstr "Este es {pnt}. Por favor, indique su propósito."

msgid "You should have left when you had a chance Zach!"
msgstr "¡Deberías haberte ido cuando tuviste la oportunidad Zach!"

msgid "Zach: It looks like they're hostile, engage the enemy!"
msgstr "Parece que son hostiles, ¡enfréntate al enemigo!"

msgid "Eliminate hostiles in {sys}"
msgstr "Elimina a los hostiles en {sys}"

msgid "Zach: It looks like the coast is clear. Come back to {pnt}."
msgstr "Parece que no hay moros en la costa. Vuelve a {pnt}."

msgid ""
"You find Zach deep in thought, who takes a while to notice your presence."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zach sumido en sus pensamientos, quien tarda en darse cuenta de "
"tu presencia."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Ah, didn't notice you. Sometimes I get lost in here. Too many things "
"remind me of them.\"\n"
"He chugs his drink and seems to sober up.\n"
"\"I've been organizing the notes I've found around the station, and it seems "
"like there were anomalies or something going on around the station. Would "
"you be willing to take a look for me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, no me fijé en ti. A veces me pierdo por aquí. Demasiadas cosas me "
"recuerdan a ellos.\"\n"
"Da un trago a su bebida y parece estar sobrio.\n"
"\"He estado organizando las notas que he encontrado por la estación, y "
"parece que había anomalías o algo por el estilo. ¿Estarías dispuesto a echar "
"un vistazo por mí?\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks again. So, looking into the notes, I found mentions to some sort of "
"object around the station. It seems like it was a ship or some sort of "
"drone, but I haven't been able to restore all the data yet, so the initial "
"encounters are missing. I only mainly know the codename they gave it, which "
"is 'Icarus', although it's not clear why.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias de nuevo. Buscando en las notas, encontré menciones a algún tipo "
"de objeto alrededor de la estación. Parece que era una nave o algún tipo de "
"dron, pero aún no he podido restaurar todos los datos, así que faltan los "
"encuentros iniciales. Sólo sé principalmente el nombre en clave que le "
"dieron, que es 'Icaro', aunque no está claro por qué.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I have been able to recover lots of data regarding some sort of language, "
"which is pretty strange given that all standard ship AI have universal "
"translators, and languages haven't really been an issue outside pure "
"academic settings in ages. Quite a few details haven't really been recovered "
"yet, but hopefully the data recovery drone will get something useful in a "
"bit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He podido recuperar muchos datos relativos a algún tipo de idioma, lo cual "
"es bastante extraño dado que todas las IA de las naves estándar tienen "
"traductores universales, y los idiomas no han sido realmente un problema "
"fuera de los entornos puramente académicos en años. Todavía no se han "
"recuperado bastantes detalles, pero espero que el dron de recuperación de "
"datos consiga algo útil en un rato.\""

msgid ""
"\"Other than that, there's still the mystery of the ships that tried to "
"attack {pnt}. I have a feeling that they're not finished with business here. "
"You should keep an eye out for any suspicious ships. There shouldn't be "
"anyone here other than us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aparte de eso, aún queda el misterio de las naves que intentaron atacar "
"{pnt}. Tengo la sensación de que no han terminado con los negocios aquí. "
"Deberías estar atento a cualquier nave sospechosa. No debería haber nadie "
"más aquí que nosotros.\""

msgid ""
"Suddenly, one of Zach's drone starts flashing and announces that movement "
"detected in {sys}."
msgstr ""
"De repente, uno de los drones de Zach empieza a parpadear y anuncia que se "
"ha detectado movimiento en {sys}."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Shit, it looks like something is out there already! From the readings it "
"doesn't look like it's very large. Quick, go see what is out there!\"\n"
"He gets up and starts running to the command centre.\n"
"\"Looks like it's time to try the new scanner! I'll give you instructions "
"once you're out there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Mierda, parece que ya hay algo ahí fuera! Por las lecturas no parece que "
"sea muy grande. ¡Rápido, ve a ver qué hay ahí fuera!\"\n"
"Se levanta y empieza a correr hacia el centro de mando.\n"
"\"¡Parece que es hora de probar el nuevo escáner! ¡Kd daré instrucciones "
"cuando estés ahí fuera!\""

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Black Hole 9">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <spob>Research Post Sigma-13</spob>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Za'lek Black Hole 8</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Za'lek Black Hole</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Za'lek Black Hole 09
#.
#. Have to find the wormhole, go through it, and have an encounter with feral bioships
#. 1. Go to insys and find  wormhole (cutscene)
#. 2. Jump into outsys, have cutscene with feral bioships
#. 3. After some criteria, Icarus jumps in and brings peace
#. 4. Icarus leaves and the player goes back to sigma-13
#.
#.
msgid "Black Hole Mystery"
msgstr "Misterio del Agujero Negro"

msgid "You were supposed to follow the detected motion!"
msgstr "¡Se supone que debes seguir el movimiento detectado!"

msgid ""
"You land while the feral bioship waits cautiously outside the space docks. "
"It seems like it's not entirely sure what to do."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas mientras la bionave salvaje espera cautelosamente fuera de los "
"muelles espaciales. Parece que no está del todo seguro de qué hacer."

msgid ""
"Zach is peeking out of the airlock.\n"
"\"Damn, it's more impressive when it's up close. We have to be careful "
"though, it's not clear what its intentions are, although it does not seem to "
"be aggressive. Let me see if my drones can scan it and give us more details."
"\""
msgstr ""
"Zach se asoma por la esclusa.\n"
"\"Maldita sea, es más impresionante cuando se ve de cerca. Pero tenemos que "
"tener cuidado, no está claro cuáles son sus intenciones, aunque no parece "
"ser agresivo. Déjame ver si mis drones pueden escanearlo y darnos más "
"detalles.\""

msgid ""
"A couple of drones fly past you and head towards the feral bioship, which "
"reacts in fear and runs away until you can barely see it in the distance."
msgstr ""
"Un par de drones pasan volando junto a ti y se dirigen hacia la bionave "
"salvaje, que reacciona asustada y huye hasta que apenas puedes verla en la "
"distancia."

msgid ""
"\"Fear of drones? Something must have happened it to react this way. Very "
"interesting how it seems to behave almost like a normal animal. Let's see if "
"I can get it back here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Miedo a los drones? Algo debe haberle pasado para reaccionar así. Es muy "
"interesante cómo parece comportarse casi como un animal normal. Veamos si "
"puedo traerlo de vuelta aquí.\""

msgid ""
"He sits cross-legged on the floor and sets his cyberdeck on his lap, "
"spending a second to stretch, before engaging in a furious typing spree. The "
"drones come back and hover nearby him, patiently awaiting orders."
msgstr ""
"Se sienta con las piernas cruzadas en el suelo y coloca su ciberconsola "
"sobre el regazo, dedicando un segundo a estirarse, antes de dedicarse a "
"teclear furiosamente. Los drones regresan y revolotean cerca de él, "
"esperando pacientemente órdenes."

msgid ""
"He begins muttering to himself.\n"
"\"Let's see…  …  …maybe if I…  …  …not that line…\n"
"…that shouldn't be there…  …who the hell wrote this code?…\n"
"…oh wait, that was me wasn't it?…  …  …damn.\""
msgstr ""
"Comienza a murmurar para si mismo.\n"
"\"Veamos... ...tal vez si yo... ...no esa línea...\n"
"...que no debería estar ahí... ...¿quién diablos escribió este código?...\n"
"...oh, espera, fui yo, ¿no?... ...maldición.\""

msgid ""
"The muttering goes on for quite a long time, until he suddenly slams the "
"enter key, You can see a brief flicker around the drones as the station's "
"holographic project starts to overlay a hologram of cute cats on them. "
"However, given the size of the drones, they seem to be more like large "
"tigers that are rather quite intimidating. The cat hologram drones fly once "
"again out into space, and while staying near the station begin to broadcast "
"a message towards the feral bioship. "
msgstr ""
"El parloteo se prolonga durante un buen rato, hasta que, de repente, pulsa "
"la tecla \"Enter\". Se puede ver un breve parpadeo alrededor de los drones "
"cuando el proyecto holográfico de la estación empieza a superponer un "
"holograma de lindos gatos sobre si misma. Sin embargo, dado el tamaño de los "
"drones, parecen más bien grandes tigres que resultan bastante intimidantes. "
"Los drones con hologramas de gatos vuelven a volar al espacio y, mientras "
"permanecen cerca de la estación, comienzan a emitir un mensaje hacia la "
"bionave salvaje. "

msgid ""
"\"Friend. Peace. Play.\"\n"
"The message resonates throughout the station and out into space…"
msgstr ""
"\"Amigo. Paz. Juega.\"\n"
"El mensaje resuena en toda la estación y en el espacio…"

msgid ""
"After what seems like ages, the feral bioship starts approaching slowly, "
"apparently intrigued by the holographic projections. As the drones have been "
"programmed to keep their distance, they back away as the feral bioship "
"approaches. This makes the bioship more intrigued and it begins to chase the "
"cat drones around the exterior of the ship."
msgstr ""
"Después de lo que parece una eternidad, la bionave salvaje comienza a "
"acercarse lentamente, aparentemente intrigada por las proyecciones "
"holográficas. Como los drones han sido programados para mantener la "
"distancia, retroceden a medida que la bionave se acerca. Esto hace que la "
"bionave esté más intrigada y comience a perseguir a los drones felinos por "
"el exterior de la nave."

msgid ""
"As you are enjoying the playful spectacle, you see Zach staring intently at "
"all the collected data flashing on his cyberdeck screen."
msgstr ""
"Mientras disfrutas del espectáculo lúdico, ves a Zach mirando atentamente "
"todos los datos recogidos que parpadean en la pantalla de su ciberconsola."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Mmmm… this isn't looking very good. From a preliminary analysis of the "
"feral bioship, or shall I say #oIcarus#0, we can see there's some pretty "
"major structural damage that hasn't quite healed fully. Furthermore, I would "
"venture to say that it even seems to be what you would call 'malnourished'. "
"I'm much more familiar with normal technology than this biotechnology, so "
"I'll have to double-check with databases, but that's the only conclusion I "
"can come to right now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mmmm... esto no tiene muy buena pinta. A partir de un análisis preliminar "
"de la bionave salvaje, o debería decir #oIcaro#0, podemos ver que hay "
"algunos daños estructurales bastante importantes que no se han curado del "
"todo. Es más, me atrevería a decir que incluso parece estar lo que tú "
"llamarías \"desnutrida\". Estoy mucho más familiarizado con la tecnología "
"normal que con esta biotecnología, así que tendré que volver a comprobarlo "
"con la bases de datos, pero es la única conclusión a la que puedo llegar "
"ahora mismo.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm going to continue running a more in-depth scan, while I think of our "
"next steps. Meet up with me at the bar when you're ready to help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a seguir haciendo un escaneo más profundo, mientras pienso en nuestros "
"próximos pasos. Reúnete conmigo en el bar cuando estés listo para ayudar.\""

msgid ""
"You see Icarus still playing with the cat drones, although it looks more "
"like it is trying to eat them. Are those fangs?…"
msgstr ""
"Ves que Ícaro sigue jugando con los drones gato, aunque parece más bien que "
"intenta comérselos. ¿Esos son colmillos?…"

msgid ""
"You and Zach found a feral bioship wandering around {sys}. After Zach "
"managed to create a simple program to communicate with it, you were able to "
"get it to follow you back to {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Tú y Zach encontrasteis una bionave salvaje vagando por {sys}. Después de "
"que Zach consiguiera crear un sencillo programa para comunicarse con ella, "
"lograsteis que os siguiera hasta {pnt}."

msgid "Detected Motion"
msgstr "Movimiento Detectado"

msgid "Zach: I've detected some motion and sent you the coordinates!"
msgstr "Zach: ¡He detectado movimiento y te he enviado las coordenadas!"

msgid ""
"Zach: It looks like the positions changed. I've updated your coordinates!"
msgstr ""
"Zach: Parece que las posiciones han cambiado. ¡He actualizado tus "
"coordenadas!"

msgid "You were supposed to lead the feral bioship to {pnt}!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que ibas a guiar a la bionave salvaje a {pnt}!"

#. Get random points and sort so the bioship starts furthest away
#. local j = jump.get( outsys, "NGC-4771" )
#. nohinohi, taitamariki, kauweke,
#. Halfway towards NGC-4771
#. Empire Shipping
#. + "Heavy Weapons Combat Licence" permission
#. + "Heavy Combat Vessel Licence" permission
#. Long Distance Cargo
#. Collective Campaign
#. + "Left Boot" accessory
#.
#.
#. Feral Bioship Common Functions
#.
#. --
msgid "Feral Bioship"
msgstr "Bionave Salvaje"

msgid "Zach: What the hell was that noise?"
msgstr "Zach: ¿Qué demonios fue ese ruido?"

msgid "Zach: One second, let me calibrate the instruments."
msgstr "Zach: Un segundo, déjame calibrar los instrumentos."

msgid "Zach: OK, looks like we're ready to do a scan pulse."
msgstr "Zach: Bien, parece que estamos listos para hacer un pulso de escaneo."

#. Don't use velocity to avoid sound deformations
msgid "You found something!"
msgstr "¡Has encontrado algo!"

#. Have to do this AFTER aborting autonav
msgid "Zach: What the hell is that?"
msgstr "Zach: ¿Qué demonios es eso?"

msgid "Zach: Try opening a communication channel with it."
msgstr "Zach: Intenta abrir un canal de comunicación con ello."

#. Make leader head towards planet
#. Fleets should have leaders with different speeds or they clump together
#. Main boss gets hilighted
msgid "No response"
msgstr "No hay respuesta"

msgid ""
"You open a joint communication channel with the ship in front of you and "
"Zach back at {pnt}."
msgstr ""
"Abres un canal de comunicación conjunto con la nave que tienes delante y "
"Zach en {pnt}."

msgid ""
"\"Hey, this looks a lot like a Soromid Bioship. Ship AI, what is that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oye, esto se parece mucho a una bionave Soromida. AI de Nave, ¿qué es eso?"
"\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your ship AI materializes in front of you.\n"
"\"This appears to be a {shipname}. Although they are loosely based on a "
"Soromid Reaver Bio-Fighter, they have gone back to a more wild biological "
"state, rejecting most synthetic components. {shipname} are the smallest of "
"what are commonly referred to as #oferal bioships#0. I advise caution with "
"dealing with such ships as they lack any sort of ship AI.\""
msgstr ""
"La IA de tu nave se materializa frente a ti.\n"
"\"Esto parece ser un {shipname}. Aunque están vagamente basadas en una "
"Biocaza Segador Soromida, ha vuelto a un estado biológico más salvaje, "
"rechazando la mayoría de los componentes sintéticos. {shipname} son las más "
"pequeñas de lo que comúnmente se conocen como #obionaves salvajes#0. "
"Aconsejo tener cuidado al tratar con este tipo de naves, ya que carecen de "
"cualquier tipo de IA.\""

msgid ""
"\"I see. However, this doesn't explain how the hell it got down here, "
"There's no way it could have made the entire trip unnoticed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Sin embargo, esto no explica cómo diablos llegó hasta aquí, No hay "
"manera de que haya hecho todo el viaje sin ser detectado.\""

msgid ""
"You can tell the ship is trying to convey something, but don't understand "
"the meaning."
msgstr ""
"Se nota que la nave intenta transmitir algo, pero no se entiende el "
"significado."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Wait, wait, this wouldn't be Icarus? Wouldn't it? That would explain lots "
"of things. One second, I may be able to make use of these notes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, espera, ¿esto no será Ícaro? ¿No es así? Eso explicaría muchas "
"cosas. Un segundo, puedo ser capaz de hacer uso de estas notas.\""

msgid ""
"The feral bioship once again lets out a stream of electromagnetic radiation "
"that your ship AI translates as a sound."
msgstr ""
"La bionave salvaje vuelve a emitir un flujo de radiación electromagnética "
"que la IA de tu nave traduce como un sonido."

msgid ""
"\"One second, I'm getting there…\"\n"
"He starts muttering to himself.\n"
"\"…do an Laplace transform, carry the s over, then compute the envelope…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un segundo, estoy llegando...\"\n"
"Empieza a murmurar para sí mismo.\n"
"\"...hacer una transformada de Laplace, llevar la s, luego calcular la "
"envolvente...\""

msgid ""
"\"I think I got it! Let us see now.\"\n"
"The communication software flickers a second as it reboots."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Creo que lo tengo! Veamos ahora.\"\n"
"El software de comunicación parpadea un segundo mientras se reinicia."

msgid ""
"The feral bioship lets another cry and you can see whatever modification "
"Zach made to the communication kick into action.\n"
"\"Athaen9a. Ihnatsoeu. Xllaudtohennnoaehustoa.\""
msgstr ""
"La bionave salvaje suelta otro grito y puedes ver la modificación que Zach "
"hizo a la comunicación entrar en acción.\n"
"\"Athaen9a. Ihnatsoeu. Xllaudtohennnoaehustoa.\""

msgid ""
"\"Needs some more adjustments, one second. You don't get to translate an "
"unknown language from scratch notes every day. My minor in linguistics is "
"finally paying off!\"\n"
"The communication software once more flickers and reboots."
msgstr ""
"\"Necesito algunos ajustes más, un segundo. No se puede traducir un idioma "
"desconocido a partir de notas de cero todos los días. Mi licenciatura en "
"lingüística por fin está dando sus frutos.\"\n"
"El software de comunicación parpadea una vez más y se reinicia."

msgid "\"Elders. Alone… Scared. Elders. Where.\""
msgstr "\"Ancianos. Solos... Asustados. Ancianos. Dónde.\""

msgid ""
"\"I guess we won't be able to do much more than this for now. Let me see if "
"we can transmit something to get it to follow you back to {pnt}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Supongo que no podremos hacer mucho más que esto por ahora. Déjame ver si "
"podemos transmitir algo para que te siga de vuelta a {pnt}.\""

msgid ""
"Zach hits some buttons and transmits something similar to what you heard "
"coming from the feral bioship.\n"
"\"Follow. Safe.\""
msgstr ""
"Zach pulsa algunos botones y tramsmite algo similar a lo que se escuchaba "
"venir de la bionave salvaje.\n"
"\"Seguir. Seguro.\""

msgid ""
"Eventually, it seems like necessity overcomes fear, and the feral bioship "
"begins to follow your ship."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, parece que la necesidad vence al miedo, y la bionave salvaje "
"comienza a seguir a tu nave."

msgid "\"OK, it seems like it's following you. Try leading it back to {pnt}."
msgstr "\"OK, parece que te está siguiendo. Intenta guiarlo de vuelta a {pnt}."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Black Hole 5">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <spob>Research Post Sigma-13</spob>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Za'lek Black Hole 4</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Za'lek Black Hole</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Za'lek Black Hole 05
#.
#. Have to bring back supplies while warding off some drones here and there.
#.
#.
msgid "Special Supplies"
msgstr "Suministros Especiales"

#. Just in case the player abort sand redoes it
msgid ""
"Zach is browsing what looks like some charts on his cyberdeck. He notices "
"you right away when you enter, and turns to you."
msgstr ""
"Zach está mirando lo que parecen ser unos gráficos en su ciberconsola. Se da "
"cuenta de tu presencia en cuanto entras y se vuelve hacia ti."

msgid ""
"\"It looks like Icarus is in worse shape than I thought. I've tried figuring "
"out what it eats, but haven't really had too much luck with that. It would "
"be great to directly ask a Soromid engineer, but not only is it unlikely "
"they would disclose any secrets, Soromid and House Za'lek are not on the "
"best of terms. However, I was able to get in touch with someone who told me "
"they could get us with some bioship supplies. Would you be willing to bring "
"the supplies over from {pnt} in the {sys} system while I try to diagnose "
"Icarus?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que Ícaro está en peor estado de lo que pensaba. He intentado "
"averiguar qué come, pero no he tenido demasiada suerte. Sería estupendo "
"preguntar directamente a un ingeniero Soromida, pero no sólo es improbable "
"que revelen algún secreto, sino que Soromida y la Casa Za'lek no se llevan "
"bien. Sin embargo, pude ponerme en contacto con alguien que me dijo que "
"podría conseguirnos algunos suministros para la bionave. ¿Estarías dispuesto "
"a traer los suministros desde {pnt} en el sistema {sys} mientras intento "
"diagnosticar a Ícaro?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! {pnt} is not really one of the best places, but they do tend to "
"have access to pretty rare stuff, and more often than not it's easier to go "
"through the providers there than official channels. I wouldn't be surprised "
"if the Za'lek Chairwoman herself would want to avoid doing all the "
"ridiculous bureaucracy!\"\n"
"He chuckles."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! {pnt} no es realmente uno de los mejores lugares, pero suelen "
"tener acceso a cosas bastante raras, y la mayoría de las veces es más fácil "
"pasar por los proveedores de allí que por los canales oficiales. ¡No me "
"sorprendería que la propia Presidenta de Za'lek quisiera evitar toda la "
"ridícula burocracia!\"\n"
"Se ríe."

msgid "\"Well actually…\""
msgstr "\"Bueno, en realidad...\""

msgid "Say nothing about Noona."
msgstr "No digas nada de Noona."

msgid ""
"\"You sure about that? Isn't the Hawking radiation getting to your head? "
"There's no way Chairwoman Sanderaite would ever get involved with such dirty "
"dealings.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Estás seguro de eso? ¿No se te está subiendo a la cabeza la radiación de "
"Hawking? No hay manera de que la presidenta Sanderaite se involucre en esos "
"negocios sucios.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'll be taking care of Icarus here. There isn't too much of a hurry, as I "
"don't fear for Icarus's life, but it's probably better to try to get them "
"back to shape sooner than later. Best of luck!\"\n"
"You can see the glee on his face when he goes back to looking at the charts "
"on his cyberdeck. Nothing is more addictive to a Za'lek researcher than the "
"potential of exploring and learning new things."
msgstr ""
"\"Me ocuparé de Ícaro aquí. No hay demasiada prisa, ya que no temo por la "
"vida de Ícaro, pero probablemente sea mejor intentar ponerlo en forma cuanto "
"antes. ¡Mucha suerte!\"\n"
"Se puede ver el regocijo en su cara cuando vuelve a mirar las cartas de su "
"ciberconsola. Nada es más adictivo para un investigador za'lek que el "
"potencial de explorar y aprender cosas nuevas."

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "Saving Icarus"
msgstr "Salvar a Ícaro"

msgid ""
"Pick up the necessary supplies at {pnt} ({sys} system) and bring them back "
"to Zach at {retpnt} ({retsys} system)."
msgstr ""
"Recoge los suministros necesarios en {pnt} (sistema {sys}) y devuélveselos a "
"Zach en {retpnt} (sistema {retsys})."

msgid ""
"You check into the automated cargo booth with the ID code that Zach gave "
"you. Quickly some automated loading drones start bringing the {cargo} over "
"and loading your ship. The entire process finishes very quickly."
msgstr ""
"Te registras en la cabina de carga automatizada con el código de "
"identificación que te dio Zach. Rápidamente unos drones de carga "
"automatizados comienzan a traer la {cargo} y a cargar tu nave. Todo el "
"proceso termina muy rápidamente."

msgid ""
"An assortment of cryofrozen bioship materials. There are many stickers "
"indicating which side is up and to handle with care. Wait, isn't it upside "
"down?"
msgstr ""
"Un surtido de materiales de bioseguridad criocongelados. Hay muchas "
"pegatinas que indican qué lado está arriba y que hay que manipular con "
"cuidado. Espera, ¿no está al revés?"

msgid ""
"You land amidst a curious Icarus looping and dancing around your ship. "
"Loading drones quickly begin to make work of unloading all the cargo of the "
"ship under the watchful eyes of Icarus."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en medio de un curioso Ícaro que da vueltas y baila alrededor de "
"tu nave. Los drones de carga comienzan rápidamente a descargar toda la carga "
"de la nave bajo la atenta mirada de Ícaro."

msgid ""
"\"How'd it go? … Damn, you met some hostile drones nearby? That can't be a "
"good omen, and I wanted to think we were in the clear. At least you managed "
"to bring all the cargo safe in one piece. Now I have to see how Icarus "
"enjoys them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo ha ido? ... Maldición, ¿te encontraste con algunos drones hostiles "
"cerca? Eso no puede ser un buen presagio, y yo quería pensar que estábamos a "
"salvo. Al menos has conseguido traer toda la carga sana y salva. Ahora tengo "
"que ver cómo los disfruta Ícaro.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"He goes to a nearby container and opens it up, causing a cloud of frozen gas "
"to come rolling out.\n"
"\"Very interesting. Let's give this a try.\"\n"
"He picks up a thick glass cylindrical canister with metallic stoppers on "
"both ends. There seems to be a thick viscous liquid in it, reminding you of "
"some sort of primordial soup. Without much grace, he musters all his "
"strength and flings it towards space."
msgstr ""
"Te diriges a un contenedor cercano y lo abres, haciendo que salga una nube "
"de gas congelado.\n"
"\"Muy interesante. Vamos a probar esto.\"\n"
"Coge un grueso bote cilíndrico de cristal con tapones metálicos en ambos "
"extremos. Parece haber un líquido espeso y viscoso en él, que te recuerda a "
"una especie de sopa primordial. Sin mucha gracia, haces acopio de toda tu "
"fuerza y lo lanzas hacia el espacio."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The canister slowly rotates as it flies out the space dock. Icarus is still "
"doing weird loops and chasing nearby drones, when suddenly it stops moving, "
"and begins to look at the canister. In the blink of an eye, Icarus lunges at "
"it, opening what can only be described as a gaping maw, and crushes the "
"canister in a single impetuous chomp, with you and Zach staring dumbfounded."
msgstr ""
"El bote gira lentamente mientras sale volando del muelle espacial. Ícaro "
"sigue haciendo extraños bucles y persiguiendo a los drones cercanos, cuando "
"de repente deja de moverse y empieza a mirar el bote. En un abrir y cerrar "
"de ojos, Ícaro se abalanza sobre él, abriendo lo que sólo puede describirse "
"como unas enormes fauces, y aplasta el bote de un solo e impetuoso mordisco, "
"mientras tú y Zach os quedáis boquiabiertos."

msgid ""
"\"Holy shit! Did you just see what I did!?\"\n"
"Zach looks pale and goes stiff."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Santo cielo! ¿Acabas de ver lo que he hecho?\"\n"
"Zach se pone pálido y se queda tieso."

msgid "\"That… was…   …\""
msgstr "\"Eso... fue... ...\""

msgid ""
"\"AWESOME!\"\n"
"He points to Icarus excitedly.\n"
"\"Did you see that? Damn, I wish my drones could do that. Wait if…\"\n"
"He seems to be seriously considering how to modify his drones."
msgstr ""
"\"¡ASOMBROSO!\"\n"
"Señala a Ícaro con entusiasmo.\n"
"\"¿Has visto eso? Maldita sea, ojalá mis drones pudieran hacer eso. Espera "
"si...\"\n"
"Pareces estar considerando seriamente cómo modificar sus drones."

msgid ""
"\"It looks like hopefully there will be no problem with them enjoying their "
"treats. However, I still think we'll have to do some basic surgery to repair "
"some of Icarus's internal damage. I think I have an idea of how to pull it "
"off, but it's going to be tricky. Meet me at the bar when you're ready to "
"help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que, con suerte, no habrá problemas para que disfrute de sus "
"golosinas. Sin embargo, sigo pensando que tendremos que hacer algo de "
"cirugía básica para reparar algunos de los daños internos de Ícaro. Creo que "
"tengo una idea de cómo hacerlo, pero va a ser complicado. Encuéntrame en el "
"bar cuando estés listo para ayudar.\""

msgid ""
"You helped Zach get some supplies to help nourish the feral bioship Icarus "
"and prepare for surgery."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a Zach a conseguir algunos suministros para ayudar a alimentar la "
"bionave salvaje Ícaro y prepararla para cirugía."

#. autoaccepts
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You find Zach analysing what seems to be a blueprint of Icarus, likely "
"preparing for surgery."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zach analizando lo que parece ser un plano de Ícaro, "
"probablemente preparándose para la cirugía."

msgid ""
"\"It looks like deep down inside, bioships are not that different from your "
"standard ship. I've looked carefully over Icarus, and it seems like they "
"have what you could call a 'fracture' on the left module, that has healed "
"poorly. I'll have to cut through most of the armoured flesh to reach it and "
"do some welding to set the injury. Other than that, it seems like bioships "
"are really resilient, as most old wounds are just scars now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que, en el fondo, las bionaves no son tan diferentes de una nave "
"estándar. He examinado cuidadosamente la Ícaro, y parece que tiene lo que "
"podría llamarse una 'fractura' en el módulo izquierdo, que ha sanado mal. "
"Tendré que cortar la mayor parte de la carne blindada para llegar a ella y "
"hacer algunas soldaduras para fijar la lesión. Aparte de eso, parece que las "
"bionaves son realmente resistentes, ya que la mayoría de las viejas heridas "
"son ahora sólo cicatrices.\""

msgid ""
"\"What's curious is that most of the scars seem to be from Za'lek weaponry. "
"The fracture is also likely the result of a ferromagnetohydraulic explosion, "
"likely a hunter drone. However, I can not fathom who would want to kill a "
"bioship instead of take the opportunity to study and examine it. It's like a "
"crime against science itself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo curioso es que la mayoría de las cicatrices parecen ser de armamento "
"Za'lek. También es probable que la fractura sea el resultado de una "
"explosión ferromagnética, probablemente de un dron cazador. Sin embargo, no "
"puedo entender quién querría matar una bionave en lugar de aprovechar la "
"oportunidad para estudiarla y examinarla. ¡Es como un crimen contra la "
"propia ciencia!\""

msgid ""
"\"The main thing I'm not clear about is how to get Icarus to understand the "
"procedure and getting it prepped up. Since I don't have a brain mapping, I "
"can't manipulate the pain receptors either, however, I do have a rough idea "
"that might work.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo principal que no tengo claro es cómo hacer que Ícaro entienda el "
"procedimiento y que se prepare. Como no tengo un mapa cerebral, tampoco "
"puedo manipular los receptores del dolor, sin embargo, tengo una idea "
"aproximada que podría funcionar.\""

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"Suddenly a blazing alarm breaks Zach's musings.\n"
"\"ALERT: Hostile ships detected inbound from {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"De repente, una alarma fulminante rompe las cavilaciones de Zach.\n"
"\"ALERTA: Naves hostiles detectadas entrando desde {sys}.\""

msgid ""
"\"Shit! I guess we have to postpone the surgery. Wait, is Icarus still out "
"there?\"\n"
"Zach pulls up a hologram of Icarus who can be seen flying outside the "
"station."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Mierda! Supongo que tenemos que posponer la cirugía. Espera, ¿Ícaro sigue "
"ahí fuera?\"\n"
"Zach saca un holograma de Ícaro que se puede ver volando fuera de la "
"estación."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Damn, I don't think I can get Icarus in the station in time. Go out and "
"intercept the incoming hostiles, I'll see what I can do at the station!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldición, no creo que pueda llevar a Ícaro a la estación a tiempo. ¡Sal e "
"intercepta a los hostiles, yo veré lo que puedo hacer en la estación!\""

msgid ""
"Zach rushes out the bar and you follow in pursuit headed towards your ship."
msgstr ""
"Zach sale corriendo del bar y tú le sigues en su persecución hacia tu nave."

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "Defending Sigma-13"
msgstr "Defendiendo a Sigma-13"

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "The safety of {pnt}"
msgstr "La seguridad de {pnt}"

msgid "Defend {pnt} from hostiles inbound from {sys}."
msgstr "Defiende a {pnt} de los hostiles que llegan desde {sys}."

msgid "Eliminate hostiles coming from {sys}!"
msgstr "¡Elimina a los hostiles que vienen de {sys}!"

msgid "You land amidst an Icarus spinning around joyfully around the station."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en medio de un Ícaro que gira alegremente alrededor de la estación."

msgid ""
"\"That was great flying out there! They didn't stand a chance! Icarus is "
"also in one piece, so all is well. Not the best way to prepare for surgery, "
"huh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ha sido un gran vuelo ahí fuera! No tuvieron ninguna oportunidad. Ícaro "
"también está de una pieza, así que todo está bien. No la mejor manera de "
"prepararse para la cirugía, ¿eh?\""

msgid ""
"\"What's really puzzling is that someone or something is really bent on "
"covering up what happened here. Other than Icarus, we haven't really been "
"able to find anything that I could imagine would be worth killing an entire "
"Za'lek expedition for. Furthermore, we are constantly being attacked by "
"Za'lek vessels, which makes even less sense. In-fighting should be left to "
"the Dvaereds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo que es realmente desconcertante es que alguien o algo está realmente "
"empeñado en encubrir lo que pasó aquí. Aparte de Ícaro, no hemos sido "
"capaces de encontrar nada que pueda imaginar que valga la pena matar a toda "
"una expedición Za'lek. Además, estamos siendo constantemente atacados por "
"naves Za'lek, lo que tiene aún menos sentido. ¡Las peleas internas deberían "
"dejarse para los Dvaereds!\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm going to start preparations for the surgery. Once Icarus is in tiptop "
"shape, we can try to get to the bottom of the mysteries here. Meet me up at "
"the spaceport bar when you are ready.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a comenzar los preparativos para la cirugía. Una vez que la Ícaro esté "
"en plena forma, podremos intentar llegar al fondo de los misterios de este "
"lugar. Reúnete conmigo en el bar del puerto espacial cuando estés listo.\""

msgid "You defended {pnt} and Icarus from a hostile attack."
msgstr "Has defendido a {pnt} y a Ícaro de un ataque hostil."

msgid "Zach: Icarus is under attack! Protect Icarus!"
msgstr "¡Icarus está bajo ataque! ¡Protege a Ícaro!"

msgid "Icarus has been destroyed!"
msgstr "¡Icaro ha sido destruido!"

msgid "Zach: Hostiles are coming in hot from {sys}!"
msgstr "¡Los hostiles vienen desde {sys}!"

msgid "Zach: Icarus is still out there! Protect Icarus!"
msgstr "¡Icaro todavía está ahí fuera! ¡Protege a Ícaro!"

msgid ""
"You meet with Zach who seems to be doing the last preparations for the "
"surgery."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras con Zach, que parece estar haciendo los últimos preparativos "
"para la cirugía."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Heya. I think I got this finally figured out. So most of the anatomy is "
"like that of an arthropod, however, the inner scaffolding follows ship "
"designs. It's incredibly well-thought-out the entire layout, and it also "
"guarantees that no two ships will ever be exactly alike!\"\n"
"He seems fairly excited about the entire prospect."
msgstr ""
"\" Hola. Creo que finalmente lo he resuelto. Así que la mayor parte de la "
"anatomía es como la de un artrópodo, sin embargo, el andamiaje interior "
"sigue los diseños de las naves. Está increíblemente bien pensado todo el "
"diseño, ¡y también garantiza que nunca habrá dos naves exactamente iguales!"
"\"\n"
"Parece bastante entusiasmado con toda la perspectiva."

msgid ""
"\"There are still some rough details here and there, but I feel confident "
"enough to try to improvise live as necessary. No matter how many simulations "
"I run, I don't think it's going to be anything like the real thing. Although "
"Icarus isn't really showing signs of stress, my scans indicate that it's "
"probably better to try to operate sooner than later. Would you be willing to "
"assist me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todavía hay algunos detalles aproximados aquí y allá, pero me siento lo "
"suficientemente seguro como para intentar improvisar en directo lo que sea "
"necesario. Por muchas simulaciones que haga, no creo que se parezca en nada "
"a la realidad. Aunque Ícaro no está mostrando realmente signos de estrés, "
"mis escáneres indican que probablemente sea mejor operar cuanto antes. "
"¿Estarías dispuesto a ayudarme?\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Great! So let's get preparations started then. The tricky part will be "
"getting Icarus all set up. I think it is more trusting of us, so hopefully "
"we'll be able to do it without a hitch. You seem to get along pretty well "
"with Icarus, I still have to do some final runs on the surgery software and "
"prepare the drones. Could you try to get Icarus into the docks and calm "
"enough for surgery? I'll be back soon.\"\n"
"Before you have a chance to respond, Zach leaves to do the final "
"preparations."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Entonces, empecemos con los preparativos. La parte más complicada "
"será conseguir que Ícaro esté preparado. Creo que confía más en nosotros, "
"así que espero que podamos hacerlo sin problemas. Parece que te llevas muy "
"bien con Ícaro, todavía tengo que hacer algunas pruebas finales en el "
"software de cirugía y preparar los drones. ¿Podrías tratar de llevar a Ícaro "
"a los muelles y calmarlo lo suficiente para la cirugía? Volveré pronto.\"\n"
"Antes de que tengas la oportunidad de responder, Zach se va a hacer los "
"últimos preparativos."

msgid ""
"You head to the docks, where you can see Icarus lazily floating around at a "
"distance. Now the hard part begins, how to get Icarus to come inside and be "
"docile enough for getting ready for surgery. What do you do?"
msgstr ""
"Te diriges a los muelles, donde puedes ver a Ícaro flotando perezosamente a "
"distancia. Ahora comienza la parte difícil, cómo conseguir que Ícaro entre y "
"sea lo suficientemente dócil para prepararse para la operación. ¿Qué haces?"

msgid "Send drones to get Icarus"
msgstr "Envía drones a buscar a Ícaro"

msgid "Use snacks to attract Icarus"
msgstr "Utiliza los aperitivos para atraer a Ícaro"

msgid "Send a translated 'Come.' message"
msgstr "Envia un mensaje traducido de 'Ven.'"

msgid "Wait for Icarus"
msgstr "Espera a Ícaro"

msgid "Give up (#rFails Mission#0)"
msgstr "Ríndete (#rFalla la misión#0)"

#. Two routes to beat this
#. come -> wait -> wait
#. snacks -> come -> wait
#. Add two pointless labels to quiet runtime warnings
msgid ""
"Icarus keeps on lazily floating at a distance without a care in the world."
msgstr ""
"Ícaro sigue flotando perezosamente a distancia sin preocuparse por el mundo."

msgid ""
"Icarus keeps on floating at a distance. However, you could swear they are "
"starting to get closer."
msgstr ""
"Ícaro sigue flotando a distancia. Sin embargo, se podría jurar que empieza a "
"acercarse."

msgid ""
"You stand there in silence, locked in a staring contest with Icarus. "
"Eventually, as time passes, Icarus seems to relax a bit."
msgstr ""
"Te quedas en silencio, encerrado en un concurso de miradas con Ícaro. Al "
"final, con el paso del tiempo, Ícaro parece relajarse un poco."

msgid ""
"You grab one of the snacks that Zach had you bring over to the station. "
"Nothing like tasty \"Liquified Bioship Organic Slush Compounds\"? That "
"doesn't sound tasty… You toss the heavy cylinder over in Icarus's direction."
msgstr ""
"Coges uno de los aperitivos que Zach te hizo traer a la estación. ¿Nada como "
"los sabrosos \"Compuestos Orgánicos Licuados de Bionave\"? Eso no suena "
"sabroso... Lanzas el pesado cilindro en dirección a Ícaro."

msgid ""
"They seem to ignore it for a while, until they suddenly swoop in and devour "
"it in an impressive bite, before continuing to float nearby."
msgstr ""
"Parece ignorarlo durante un tiempo, hasta que de repente se abalanza sobre "
"él y lo devora de un impresionante bocado, antes de seguir flotando en las "
"proximidades."

msgid ""
"Icarus is too nervous to pay attention to you and keeps on eyeing you from a "
"distance."
msgstr ""
"Ícaro está demasiado nervioso para prestarte atención y sigue mirándote "
"desde la distancia."

msgid ""
"The moment Icarus sees the drones they run away to a safe distance from the "
"station, eyeing you warily. It looks they will need to be calmed down first."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Finally, Icarus seems to respond to your request and they slowly float into "
"the space docks. This is the first time Icarus has come so close and they "
"seem fairly relaxed. You feel like you've finally managed to bond with "
"Icarus."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, Icarus parece responder a tu petición y flota lentamente hacia "
"los muelles espaciales. Es la primera vez que Ícaro se acerca tanto y parece "
"bastante relajado. Sientes que por fin has conseguido establecer un vínculo "
"con Ícaro."

msgid ""
"While you are sharing your tender moment with Icarus, you suddenly notice "
"movement out of the corner of your eye. It seems like Zach is staring down "
"at the docks from the elevated observation back. He signals for you to back "
"up a bit and you do."
msgstr ""
"Mientras compartes tu tierno momento con Ícaro, de repente notas movimiento "
"por el rabillo del ojo. Parece que Zach está mirando los muelles desde la "
"parte trasera de observación elevada. Te hace una señal para que retrocedas "
"un poco y lo haces."

msgid ""
"Suddenly, you hear a high pitch drone of an energy capacitor draining. "
"Icarus who hears that to and scrambles to get out of the docks, however, "
"before they can, you are blinded by a flash and knocked off to the side."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You struggle to stand groggily as your eyes start recovering and colour "
"returns to the world. You find yourself amidst a flurry of drones led by "
"Zach who have quickly started to perform the surgery. Given that you are "
"still completely useless in your current state, you drag yourself out of the "
"way and lean against a wall. Time seems to fly by without you noticing, and "
"you close your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Te esfuerzas por mantenerte en pie, mientras tus ojos empiezan a recuperarse "
"y el color vuelve al mundo. Te encuentras en medio de una avalancha de "
"drones dirigidos por Zach, que rápidamente han comenzado a realizar la "
"operación. Dado que sigues siendo completamente inútil en tu estado actual, "
"te arrastras fuera del camino y te apoyas en una pared. El tiempo parece "
"pasar volando sin que te des cuenta y cierras los ojos."

msgid ""
"You nod off and begin to have concussion-induced dreams where you are "
"surrounded by mosquitoes that are buzzing around and making lots of noise. "
"Every so often one of the mosquito says an obscenity, while you sort of "
"float around with them."
msgstr ""
"Te quedas dormido y empiezas a tener sueños inducidos por una conmoción "
"cerebral en los que estás rodeado de mosquitos que zumban y hacen mucho "
"ruido. De vez en cuando, uno de los mosquitos dice una obscenidad, mientras "
"tú flotas con ellos."

msgid ""
"Now suddenly the mosquito buzz fades away and you see yourself in the middle "
"of a vortex of red, which spins you around and around, and fills up the "
"entire space around you. You fidget and struggle, but you can't go anywhere "
"or move, you are lost in the vastness."
msgstr ""
"Ahora, de repente, el zumbido del mosquito se desvanece y te ves en medio de "
"un vórtice de color rojo, que te hace girar sin parar y llena todo el "
"espacio que te rodea. Te agitas y luchas, pero no puedes ir a ninguna parte "
"ni moverte, estás perdido en la inmensidad."

msgid ""
"You are awoken by a pat on your shoulder and you open your eyes to a "
"triumphant Zach you lends you his hand, and pulls you up.\n"
"\"You doing alright? Great job out there. Sorry I had to keep you in the "
"cold on this, but I had a feeling you wouldn't have gone with the plan. "
"Given that we have to move fast, a large EMP pulse was the best option to "
"knock out so we could do the surgery on Icarus. By the way, the surgery went "
"much better than expected, we can expect Icarus to be stronger, faster, and "
"better than ever!\""
msgstr ""
"Te despierta una palmada en el hombro y abres los ojos ante un Zach "
"triunfante que te tiende la mano y te levanta.\n"
"\"¿Lo estás haciendo bien? Gran trabajo ahí fuera. Siento haber tenido que "
"ocultarte esto, pero tenía la sensación de que no habrías seguido el plan. "
"Dado que tenemos que movernos rápido, un gran pulso EMP era la mejor opción "
"para que pudiéramos hacer la cirugía a Ícaro. Por cierto, la cirugía salió "
"mucho mejor de lo esperado, ¡podemos esperar que Ícaro sea más fuerte, más "
"rápido y en mejor estado que nunca!\""

msgid "\"Glad to hear that!\""
msgstr "\"¡Me alegro de oír eso!\""

msgid "\"Next time warn me.\""
msgstr "\"La próxima vez avísame.\""

msgid "\"You're an asshole!\""
msgstr "\"¡Eres un capullo!\""

msgid "\"You could have killed Icarus!\""
msgstr "\"¡Podrías haber matado a Ícaro!\""

msgid ""
"\"Nothing like a plan well executed!\"\n"
"He grins happily."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Nada como un plan bien ejecutado!\"\n"
"Sonríe felizmente."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Well the entire plan relied on your natural reactions. If I had warned "
"you, Icarus would have likely sensed that and we would have had to go with "
"plan B.\"\n"
"The way he says plan B makes you feel glad plan A worked."
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, el plan completo dependía de tus reacciones naturales. Si te "
"hubiera advertido, Ícaro probablemente lo habría percibido y habríamos "
"tenido que ir con el plan B.\"\n"
"La forma en que dice el plan B hace que te sientas contento de que el plan A "
"haya funcionado."

msgid ""
"\"I get told that disturbingly often. However, I would like to point out it "
"was all perfectly calculated and will have no long-term effects on Icarus. "
"In fact, Icarus's response was much better than I originally anticipated!\"\n"
"Zach's words are unsurprisingly non-reassuring."
msgstr ""
"\"Me lo dicen inquietantemente a menudo. Sin embargo, me gustaría señalar "
"que todo estaba perfectamente calculado y que no tendrá efectos a largo "
"plazo en Ícaro. De hecho, la respuesta de Ícaro ha sido mucho mejor de lo "
"que había previsto en un principio.\"\n"
"Las palabras de Zach no son sorprendentemente tranquilizadoras."

msgid ""
"\"It's impossible, I had computed and simulated all the possible outcomes "
"even considering a 100% error in all parameters! There was no way anything… "
"wait a second…\"\n"
"He busts out his cyberdeck and starts running some computations. You see the "
"colour flush out of his face.\n"
"\"Well, damn. All's well that ends well?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Es imposible, había calculado y simulado todos los resultados posibles "
"incluso considerando un error del 100% en todos los parámetros! No había "
"forma de que nada... espera un segundo...\"\n"
"Saca su ciberconsola y empieza a realizar algunos cálculos. Se ve que se le "
"quita el color de la cara.\n"
"\"Bueno, maldita sea. ¿Bien está lo que bien acaba...no?\""

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, my drones were able to realign the internal support beams with "
"minimal damage to the organic tissue. My simulation of Icarus indicates "
"it'll be recovered completely within a couple of periods at most. "
"Furthermore, I took my time to add some Za'lek drone technology and "
"materials to replace the primitive Soromid underlying structure, which "
"should only make Icarus better in every sense. It's now an amalgamate of top "
"Soromid and Za'lek technology, and one of a kind!\"\n"
"He seems overly pleased with himself."
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, mis drones fueron capaces de realinear las vigas de "
"soporte internas con un daño mínimo en el tejido orgánico. Mi simulación de "
"la Ícaro indica que se recuperará completamente en un par de periodos como "
"máximo. Además, me tomé mi tiempo para añadir algo de tecnología de drones "
"Za'lek y materiales para reemplazar la primitiva estructura subyacente "
"Soromida, lo que sólo debería hacer que Ícaro mejore en todos los sentidos. "
"Ahora es una amalgama de la mejor tecnología Soromida y Za'lek, ¡y única en "
"su género!.\"\n"
"Parece muy satisfecho consigo mismo."

msgid ""
"You languorously look towards Icarus, which seems to be tucked away in the "
"corner of the docks. You can see some simple monitoring drones camouflaged "
"nearby controlling their vitals. You can't really tell that much has changed "
"other than some extremely large bandage-like sheets wrapped around several "
"parts of their body."
msgstr ""
"Miras lánguidamente hacia el Ícaro, que parece estar escondido en un rincón "
"de los muelles. Puedes ver algunos simples drones de monitorización "
"camuflados en las cercanías que controlan sus signos vitales. Realmente no "
"puedes decir que haya cambiado mucho, aparte de unas sábanas extremadamente "
"grandes como vendas envueltas en varias partes de su cuerpo."

msgid ""
"\"I'll be keeping an eye on Icarus. It might be a bit confused, so I'll try "
"to make sure it can't hurt itself. Once you feel a bit better, come meet me "
"at the spaceport bar, I have a task I would love you to help me with.\"\n"
"He skips towards the inside of the station, leaving you to recover yourself."
msgstr ""
"\"Vigilaré a Ícaro. Puede que esté un poco confundido, así que intentaré "
"asegurarme de que no se haga daño. Cuando te sientas un poco mejor, ven a "
"verme al bar del puerto espacial, tengo una tarea en la que me gustaría que "
"me ayudaras.\"\n"
"Se dirige hacia el interior de la estación, dejando que te recuperes."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You see Icarus seems to get fed up with the drones chasing it around and "
"flies away.\n"
"\n"
"#rMISSION FAILED#0"
msgstr ""
"Ves a Icaro, parece que se harta de los drones que le persiguen y sale "
"volando.\n"
"\n"
"#rMISIÓN FRACASADA\"0"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You lower your head in resignation and give up. This is worse than cat "
"herding.\n"
"\n"
"#rMISSION FAILED#0"
msgstr ""
"Bajas la cabeza con resignación y te rindes. Esto es peor que el pastoreo de "
"gatos.\n"
"\n"
"#rMISIÓN FRACASADA\"0"

#. Must be completed beyond this point
msgid ""
"You helped Zach perform surgery on the feral bioship Icarus. The surgery was "
"a success and Icarus is expected to make a speedy recovery."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a Zach a operar a la bionave salvaje Ícaro. La operación fue un "
"éxito y se espera que Ícaro se recupere rápidamente."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Black Hole 8">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <spob>Research Post Sigma-13</spob>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Za'lek Black Hole 7</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Za'lek Black Hole</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Za'lek Black Hole 08
#.
#. Have to bring back supplies while avoiding drones on the way back (or fighting through them)
#.
#.
msgid "Sensor Upgrades"
msgstr "Mejoras de Sensores"

msgid "You see Zach a bit more relaxed after the successful surgery."
msgstr "Ves a Zach un poco más relajado después de la exitosa cirugía."

msgid ""
"\"So glad that Icarus seems to be out in the clear. Now we can start "
"concentrating on the bigger picture again. We've been disrupted so many "
"times, but as I've mentioned before, the notes indicate that there is "
"something weird nearby. However, even though I've restored the station "
"functionality partially, the sensor system is still a shadow of its former "
"glory. I've been able to secure some decent supplies, but I would need you "
"to go to {pnt} in the {sys} system and pick up {amount} of {cargo}. Would "
"you be willing to do that for me for {creds}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de que Ícaro parezca estar fuera de peligro. Ahora podemos "
"volver a concentrarnos en el panorama general. Nos han interrumpido muchas "
"veces, pero como he mencionado antes, las notas indican que hay algo raro "
"cerca. Sin embargo, aunque he restaurado parcialmente la funcionalidad de la "
"estación, el sistema de sensores sigue siendo una sombra de su antigua "
"gloria. He podido conseguir algunos suministros decentes, pero necesitaría "
"que fueras a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y recogieras {amount} de {cargo}. "
"¿Estarías dispuesto a hacer eso por mí por {creds}?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! So the {cargo} should be already ready at {pnt}, all you have to do "
"is head there and bring it back and I should be able to upgrade Sigma-13's "
"sensors to scan nearby systems and up to the Anubis black hole. Just make "
"sure you keep out an eye for trouble. Losing the cargo would be a pretty "
"major setback. Best of luck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Así que la {cargo} debería estar ya lista en {pnt}, todo lo que "
"tienes que hacer es dirigirte allí y traerla de vuelta y yo debería ser "
"capaz de actualizar los sensores de Sigma-13 para escanear los sistemas "
"cercanos y hasta el agujero negro de Anubis. Sólo asegúrate de estar atento "
"a los problemas. Perder la carga sería un contratiempo bastante importante. "
"¡Mejor suerte!\""

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "Sigma-13 Sensors"
msgstr "Sensores de Sigma-13"

msgid ""
"Your ship touches ground and the loading drones identify your cargo and "
"swiftly load the {cargo} onto your ship."
msgstr ""
"Tu nave toca tierra y los drones de carga identifican tu carga y cargan "
"rápidamente la {cargo} de tu nave."

msgid ""
"An assortment of different components that seem to be useful in upgrading "
"deep-space sensorial systems."
msgstr ""
"Un surtido de diferentes componentes que parecen ser útiles para mejorar los "
"sistemas sensoriales de espacio profundo."

msgid ""
"You land and find Zach has come to greet you at the space port. You explain "
"your encounter in the {sys} system."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y ves que Zach ha venido a recibirte al puerto espacial. Le "
"explicas tu encuentro en el sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"\"Damn, all effort just to blockade the station? I guess they must be "
"preparing for another attack seeing the amount of forces deployed. They're "
"probably taking it carefully after their previous attack failed. This is "
"pretty worrisome. There's no way we're going to be able to defend against an "
"onslaught like that. We're going to have to move fast. I'll start upgrading "
"the sensors right away. Meet me up at the bar later and we can go to the "
"next step.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, ¿todo el esfuerzo sólo para bloquear la estación? Supongo que "
"deben estar preparándose para otro ataque viendo la cantidad de fuerzas "
"desplegadas. Probablemente se lo están tomando con cuidado después de que su "
"anterior ataque fracasara. Esto es bastante preocupante. No hay forma de que "
"podamos defendernos de un ataque así. Vamos a tener que movernos rápido. "
"Empezaré a actualizar los sensores de inmediato. Reúnete conmigo en el bar "
"más tarde y podremos dar el siguiente paso.\""

msgid ""
"You helped Zach get cargo important to upgrading the sensors of {pnt}, "
"despite heavy enemy patrols on the way."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a Zach a conseguir un cargamento importante para mejorar los "
"sensores de {pnt}, a pesar de las fuertes patrullas enemigas en el camino."

msgid "You once again approach Zach at the bar."
msgstr "Una vez más te acercas a Zach en el bar."

msgid ""
"\"Hey. I've finally set up the new sensors you brought back. The station was "
"running on the damaged back-up sensor system that I patched up to have some "
"minimal functionality. The new sensors basically change everything, and are "
"a strict upgrade to the standard functionality in these research posts. "
"Anyway, I was trying out the sensors and looking at the readings of the "
"black hole, when I noticed there seems to be an anomalous amount of tachyon "
"readings nearby. I haven't seen anything like this before, and I think we "
"should go check it out. Will you help me investigate the signal? \""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola. Por fin he configurado los nuevos sensores que trajiste. La estación "
"estaba funcionando con el sistema de sensores de reserva dañado que parcheé "
"para que tuviera una funcionalidad mínima. Los nuevos sensores básicamente "
"lo cambian todo, y son una mejora estricta de la funcionalidad estándar en "
"estos puestos de investigación. De todos modos, estaba probando los sensores "
"y mirando las lecturas del agujero negro, cuando me di cuenta de que parece "
"haber una cantidad anómala de lecturas de taquiones cerca. No he visto nada "
"parecido antes, y creo que deberíamos ir a comprobarlo. ¿Me ayudarás a "
"investigar la señal? \""

msgid ""
"\"Great! The anomaly has been detected in the nearby system of {sys}, It "
"seems to be almost like some sort of ship jumping signal, but unlike jump "
"signals, it's much more… how do I say this… consistent? It seems to just "
"flow constantly like a river or something like that. I've never seen "
"anything like this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! La anomalía ha sido detectada en el sistema cercano de {sys}, "
"parece ser casi como una especie de señal de salto de la nave, pero a "
"diferencia de las señales de salto, es mucho más... ¿cómo decir esto... "
"consistente? Parece fluir constantemente como un río o algo así. Nunca he "
"visto nada como esto.\""

#. Change text a bit depending if known
msgid "Tell them about the wormhole"
msgstr "Cuéntale sobre el agujero de gusano"

msgid ""
"\"Wait, you knew about this incredible space phenomena outside our doorstep "
"already!? Why didn't you tell me about it! We should have published a peer-"
"reviewed paper on this instead of all the shenanigans we did! Oh well, I "
"still want to see it with my own eyes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, ¿¡ya sabías de este increíble fenómeno espacial frente a nuestra "
"puerta!? ¿Por qué no me lo contaste? ¡Deberíamos haber publicado un artículo "
"revisado por pares sobre esto en lugar de todas las travesuras que hicimos! "
"Oh, bueno, todavía quiero verlo con mis propios ojos.\""

msgid ""
"\"I've run some standard tests and tried to match it with existing known "
"space objects, but it doesn't seem to be anything like them. We could be on "
"the edge of an amazing discovery! I can imagine it now, the Xiao-{name} "
"space phenomena! I might even get tenure!\""
msgstr ""
"\"He realizado algunas pruebas estándar y he intentado compararlo con los "
"objetos espaciales conocidos, pero no parece ser nada parecido a ellos. "
"¡Podríamos estar al borde de un descubrimiento asombroso! Ya me lo imagino, "
"¡el fenómeno espacial Xiao-{name}! ¡Puede que incluso consiga la titularidad!"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"Normally I would stay behind and monitor, but I'm a bit worried about my "
"safety here and will accompany you this time. It's not like I want to see "
"what's out there with my own eyes…\n"
"OK, maybe a little. Let's get going!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Normalmente me quedaría atrás vigilando, pero estoy un poco preocupado por "
"mi seguridad aquí y te acompañaré esta vez. No es que quiera ver lo que hay "
"ahí fuera con mis propios ojos...\n"
"OK, tal vez un poco. ¡Vámonos!\""

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid ""
"Investigate the mysterious signal coming from the {sys} system with Zach."
msgstr "Investiga la misteriosa señal procedente del sistema {sys} con Zach."

msgid "A Za'lek scientist."
msgstr "Un científico Za'lek."

msgid "Go track down the signal in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Ve a rastrear la señal en el sistema {sys}"

msgid ""
"Zach remains silent as you land, completely engrossed in thought. You make "
"your ship replay the land completed announcement to get him out of his "
"stupor."
msgstr ""
"Zach permanece en silencio mientras aterrizáis, completamente absorto en sus "
"pensamientos. Haces que tu nave reproduzca el anuncio de aterrizaje "
"completado para sacarlo de su estupor."

msgid ""
"He seems fairly concentrated on something, as he stumbles out of the ship "
"without really paying attention where he is going, you can hear him mumble "
"something to you.\n"
"\"…meet me up at the bar later. I have to think…\""
msgstr ""
"Parece bastante concentrado en algo, mientras sale a trompicones de la nave "
"sin fijarse bien a dónde va, se le oye murmurar algo.\n"
"\"...encuéntrate conmigo en el bar más tarde. Tengo que pensar...\""

msgid ""
"You travelled through a wormhole with Zach and met a family of feral "
"bioships. After a brief and intense exchange, Icarus came to make peace and "
"decided to return to their family."
msgstr ""
"Viajaste a través de un agujero de gusano con Zach y conociste a una familia "
"de bionaves salvajes. Tras un breve e intenso intercambio, Ícaro llegó a "
"hacer las paces y decidió volver con su familia."

msgid ""
"Icarus opens up a communication channel with you. It seems like he figured "
"out how to do that by himself."
msgstr ""
"Ícaro abre un canal de comunicación contigo. Parece que ha descubierto cómo "
"hacerlo por sí mismo."

msgid "\"Peace. Friend.\""
msgstr "\"Paz. Amigo.\""

msgid ""
"\"It looks like there's been a misunderstanding. Could this be from where "
"Icarus came from? I have no idea where we are, but the rough coordinates "
"seem to indicate we are near Soromid space.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que ha habido un malentendido. ¿Podría ser esto de donde vino "
"Ícaro? No tengo ni idea de dónde estamos, pero las coordenadas aproximadas "
"parecen indicar que estamos cerca del espacio Soromida.\""

msgid ""
"\"Elders. Ahaeosrc.\"\n"
"The translation system struggles with what Icarus is saying."
msgstr ""
"\"Ancianos. Ahaeosrc.\"\n"
"El sistema de traducción tiene problemas con lo que dice Ícaro."

msgid ""
"\"Mmmm, this seems to be a word that wasn't in the original notes. I'm not "
"sure how we're going to be able to translate it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mmmm, esta parece ser una palabra que no estaba en las notas originales. "
"No estoy seguro de que vayamos a ser capaces de traducirla.\""

msgid "\"Ahaeosrc. Zach.\""
msgstr "\"Ahaeosrc. Zach.\""

msgid ""
"\"Wait, what? How did my name get picked up in the translation system?… Does "
"this mean that…\"\n"
"He goes silent, lost in thought."
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, ¿qué? ¿Cómo se ha recogido mi nombre en el sistema de "
"traducción?... ¿Significa esto que...?\"\n"
"Se queda en silencio, perdido en sus pensamientos."

msgid ""
"\"Leave. Elders.\"\n"
"Icarus slightly motions to the other feral bioships. Does this mean they "
"won't be coming back?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Try to convince Icarus to stay."
msgstr "Intenta convencer a Ícaro de que se quede."

msgid "Wave goodbye to Icarus"
msgstr "Despídete de Ícaro"

msgid ""
"Icarus seems to shake its head. Where did it learn to do that?\n"
"\"Elders. Leave.\""
msgstr ""
"Ícaro parece sacudir la cabeza. ¿Dónde ha aprendido a hacer eso?\n"
"\"Ancianos. Idos.\""

msgid ""
"Icarus seems to do a motion that can only be interpreted as waving back at "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Icarus parece hacer un movimiento que sólo puede interpretarse como un "
"saludo hacia ti."

msgid ""
"Icarus turns around to leave when suddenly Zach seems to break out of his "
"trance."
msgstr ""
"Ícaro se da la vuelta para irse cuando de repente Zach parece salir de su "
"trance."

msgid "\"What did they tell you Icarus? What happened out there!?"
msgstr "\"¿Qué te han dicho Ícaro? ¿Qué ha pasado ahí fuera?"

msgid ""
"Icarus sends a last message before joining the pack of feral ships.\n"
"\"Dark. Wet. Eye.\""
msgstr ""
"Icarus envía un último mensaje antes de unirse a la manada de naves "
"salvajes.\n"
"\"Oscuro. Húmedo. Ojo.\""

msgid ""
"Zach slumps down as if all the energy left his body leaving a shrivelled "
"husk behind. In a small voice he mumbles\n"
"\"What could this mean…\""
msgstr ""
"Zach se desploma como si toda la energía abandonara su cuerpo dejando una "
"cáscara marchita. En voz baja murmura\n"
"\"¿Qué puede significar esto...?\""

msgid "You should probably get Zach back to {pnt}."
msgstr "Probablemente deberías llevar a Zach de vuelta a {pnt}."

#. Easier to spot
#, fuzzy
msgid "Zach is analysing the wormhole signal."
msgstr "Zach está analizando la señal del agujero de gusano."

msgid "Suspicious Signal"
msgstr "Señal Sospechosa"

msgid "Weird that Icarus didn't follow us through the jump…"
msgstr "Es raro que Ícaro no nos haya seguido en el salto…"

msgid "I've marked the location on your system map."
msgstr "He marcado la ubicación en el mapa de tu sistema."

msgid "The wormhole seems to have become too weak to go through."
msgstr ""
"El agujero de gusano parece haberse vuelto demasiado débil para atravesarlo."

#. in case the player does something silly like preemptively shoot torpedoes
msgid "Hot damn, that was weird. Ugh, I feel sick."
msgstr "Maldita sea, eso fue raro. Ugh, me siento mal."

msgid "I'm getting some ship readings. Wait, what is that?"
msgstr "Estoy recibiendo algunas lecturas de la nave. Espera, ¿qué es eso?"

msgid "It's a bit quiet without Icarus around any more…"
msgstr "Está todo un poco silencioso sin Ícaro alrededor…"

#. Don't allow boarding again
msgid "Zach: \"{msg}\""
msgstr "Zach: \"{msg}\""

msgid "It's… mesmerizing!"
msgstr "Es... ¡hipnotizante!"

msgid "It's safe right? Maybe we should send a drone first."
msgstr "Es seguro, ¿verdad? Tal vez deberíamos enviar un dron primero."

msgid "I guess we might as well try it. Experimental physics at its finest."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que podríamos probarlo. La física experimental en su máxima "
"expresión."

msgid "Try to go through it carefully!"
msgstr "¡Intenta revisarlo con cuidado!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Damn, what the hell is that?"
msgstr "Maldita sea, ¿qué demonios es eso?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "One second, let me analyse the data."
msgstr "Un segundo, déjame analizar los datos."

msgid "I can't make much sense out of this, but…"
msgstr "No le encuentro mucho sentido a esto, pero…"

msgid "It seems like some sort of space-time discontinuity…"
msgstr "Parece una especie de discontinuidad espacio-temporal…"

msgid "It doesn't seem dangerous, at least the readings seem strangely fine."
msgstr "No parece peligroso, al menos las lecturas parecen extrañamente bien."

msgid "The sensor readings are off the charts!"
msgstr "¡Las lecturas de los sensores se salen de lo normal!"

msgid "I think I see something!"
msgstr "¡Creo que veo algo!"

#. Was the last message
msgid "Go through the wormhole"
msgstr "Atraviesa el agujero de gusano"

#. Normalize time so it's independent of ship
msgid "What are those ships over there? They look a lot like Icarus!"
msgstr "¿Qué son esas naves de ahí? ¡Se parecen mucho a Ícaro!"

msgid "We should go greet them."
msgstr "Deberíamos ir a saludarlos."

msgid "Get near the feral bioships"
msgstr "Acércate a las naves biológicas salvajes"

msgid "Look at the size of that thing!"
msgstr "¡Mira el tamaño de esa cosa!"

msgid "Wait, it looks like it's picking up some signal on us."
msgstr "Espera, parece que estás captando alguna señal sobre nosotros."

msgid "Son. Revenge. Imposter. Die."
msgstr "Hijo. Venganza. Impostor. Muere."

msgid "Son. Revenge. Die."
msgstr "Hijo. Venganza. Muere."

msgid "Survive!"
msgstr "¡Sobrevive!"

msgctxt "Zach"
msgid "Watch out!"
msgstr "¡Cuidado!"

#. Where the defeated ships will wait
#. Check ending criteria
#. End criteria
msgid "Wait, is that Icarus? Run to them!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Go to Icarus!"
msgstr "¡Ve hacia Ícaro!"

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Black Hole 10">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>3</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <spob>Research Post Sigma-13</spob>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Za'lek Black Hole 9</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Za'lek Black Hole</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Za'lek Black Hole 10
#.
#. Final showdown vs evil PI
#.
#.
msgid "Sigma-13 Showdown"
msgstr "Enfrentamiento en Sigma-13"

msgid "Godheart"
msgstr "Corazón de Dios"

msgid ""
"You find Zach completely absorbed in thought at the bar. He feels really "
"distant despite being physically close."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zach completamente absorto en sus pensamientos en el bar. Se "
"siente muy distante a pesar de estar físicamente cerca."

msgid ""
"You can catch him muttering something under his breath. \"Wet… what could "
"that mean.\""
msgstr ""
"Se le oye murmurar algo en voz baja. \"Mojado... qué puede significar eso.\""

msgid ""
"You clear your throat to catch his attention, and after your third try, he "
"finally seems to recognize your presence."
msgstr ""
"Te aclaras la garganta para captar su atención y, tras tu tercer intento, "
"parece reconocer por fin tu presencia."

msgid ""
"\"Hey, how's it going? Wait… didn't I have something for you? One second.\"\n"
"He fumbles with his cyberdeck looking for something.\n"
"\"I've been looking over the scan analysis of the area and haven't really "
"found anything, however, the signal is weak towards the Anubis Black Hole. "
"It's a bit of a shot in the dark, but I think we should try to…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, ¿cómo va todo? Espera... ¿no tenía algo para ti? Un segundo.\"\n"
"Tantea con su ciberconsola buscando algo.\n"
"\"He estado revisando el análisis del escáner de la zona y realmente no he "
"encontrado nada, sin embargo, la señal es débil hacia el Agujero Negro de "
"Anubis. Es un poco arriesgado, pero creo que deberíamos intentar…\""

#. blaring alarm
msgid ""
"He gets suddenly cut off by the blaring siren.\n"
"\"ALERT: Large hostile ships detected inbound from {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"Te ves interrumpido de repente por el estruendo de una sirena.\n"
"\"ALERTA: Se detectan grandes naves hostiles entrando desde {sys}.\""

msgid ""
"\"Shit! Not again. At least they didn't catch us with our pants down. I've "
"prepared some defence drones, but I don't think they'll be much help. We "
"must not let {pnt} fall! Try to defend the station and I'll see what I can "
"do over here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Mierda! Otra vez no. Al menos no nos han pillado con los pantalones "
"bajados. He preparado algunos drones de defensa, pero no creo que sean de "
"mucha ayuda. ¡No debemos dejar que {pnt} caiga! ¡Intenta defender la "
"estación y yo veré lo que puedo hacer por aquí!\""

msgid ""
"Zach heads to the command centre, and you make your way to your ship while "
"mentally preparing you for the challenge to come.."
msgstr ""
"Zach se dirige al centro de mando, y tú te diriges a tu nave mientras te "
"preparas mentalmente para el reto que se avecina.."

msgid ""
"You land amidst a swarm of feral bioships circling the station. Zach seems a "
"bit distraught at the enormous behemoths visible from the docks."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas en medio de un enjambre de bionaves salvajes que rodean la "
"estación. Zach parece un poco angustiado ante los enormes colosos visibles "
"desde los muelles."

msgid ""
"\"I had somehow gotten used to Icarus, but this is a bit too much.\"\n"
"He laughs nervously.\n"
"\"I really hope they don't chew on the station.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De alguna manera me había acostumbrado a Ícaro, pero esto es demasiado.\"\n"
"Se ríe nerviosamente.\n"
"\"Realmente espero que no mastiquen la estación.\""

msgid "You follow Zach inside so he calms down a bit."
msgstr "Sigue a Zach dentro para que se calme un poco."

msgid ""
"With the bioships out of sight he seems to relax a bit.\n"
"\"That was some great flying out there! It all worked out much better than "
"expected. Sure beats ending up as part of a hunk of molten metal which all "
"my simulations predicted…\""
msgstr ""
"Con las bionaves fuera de la vista, parece relajarse un poco.\n"
"\"¡Ha sido un vuelo estupendo! Todo ha salido mucho mejor de lo que "
"esperaba. Seguro que es mejor que acabar como parte de un trozo de metal "
"fundido que todas mis simulaciones predijeron...\""

msgid ""
"\"While I was preparing to evacuate with the notes left, I found something "
"that might shine the light a bit on who they were. I believe that was Dr. "
"Slorn and their laboratory, who have been working on ethereal material "
"theory. My colleagues and I have always been pretty sceptical of their "
"findings, and no other group has been able to replicate any experiments from "
"what I know. In general, just pretty bad science if you ask me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mientras me preparaba para evacuar con las notas dejadas, encontré algo "
"que podría arrojar un poco de luz sobre quiénes eran. Creo que era el Dr. "
"Slorn y su laboratorio, que han estado trabajando en la teoría del material "
"etéreo. Mis colegas y yo siempre hemos sido bastante escépticos con sus "
"hallazgos, y ningún otro grupo ha sido capaz de replicar ningún experimento "
"por lo que sé. En general, una ciencia bastante mala si me preguntas.\""

msgid ""
"\"However, Dr. Slorn's group has always been very good at getting funding. "
"Suspiciously good to a point that some of us have doubted about their "
"authenticity of the work. Even with all the ethics counsels and obligatory "
"ethics courses, lots of shit gets through if you know what I mean.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, el grupo del Dr. Slorn siempre ha sido muy bueno para "
"conseguir financiación. Sospechosamente bueno hasta el punto de que algunos "
"de nosotros hemos dudado sobre la autenticidad de su trabajo. Incluso con "
"todos los consejos de ética y los cursos obligatorios de ética, se cuela "
"mucha mierda, si sabes a lo que me refiero.\""

msgid ""
"\"So, this is just my working hypothesis, but they must have found something "
"when doing research that casts doubts on Dr. Slorn's research, and probably "
"submitted it to the Journal on Advanced Physics, and I wouldn't be surprised "
"if someone in Dr. Slorn's group caught a whiff of it and tracked them down. "
"This all happens more than you would wish it did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Así que, esto es sólo mi hipótesis de trabajo, pero debieron encontrar "
"algo al hacer la investigación que pone en duda la investigación del Dr. "
"Slorn, y probablemente lo enviaron al Diario de Física Avanzada, y no me "
"sorprendería que alguien en el grupo del Dr. Slorn lo oliera y los "
"rastreara. Todo esto ocurre más de lo que uno desearía.\""

msgid ""
"\"What still is weird is how they went through all the effort to destroy the "
"research station, instead of a more indirect approach.\"\n"
"He lets out a sigh.\n"
"\"If it weren't for Icarus, we would have also joined my late colleagues as "
"research martyrs…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo que sigue siendo extraño es cómo se esforzaron por destruir la estación "
"de investigación, en lugar de un enfoque más indirecto.\"\n"
"Deja escapar un suspiro.\n"
"\"Si no fuera por Ícaro, también nos habríamos unido a mis últimos colegas "
"como mártires de la investigación...\""

msgid ""
"Suddenly, you are surprised by a large commotion coming from the docks. You "
"and Zach rush out to see what is going on."
msgstr ""
"De repente, os sorprende un gran alboroto procedente de los muelles. Tú y "
"Zach os apresuráis a ver qué está pasando."

msgid "\"Oh shit. Are they nibbling on the station?\""
msgstr "\"Oh, mierda. ¿Están mordisqueando la estación?\""

msgid ""
"You enter the docks again and are met with an incredibly close Icarus. After "
"the initial surprise, you can see they are carrying something in their mouth "
"and offering it to you. They seem oddly proud of themselves."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a entrar en los muelles y te encuentras con un Ícaro increíblemente "
"cercano. Tras la sorpresa inicial, ves que lleva algo en la boca y te lo "
"ofrece. Parece extrañamente orgulloso de sí mismo."

msgid "\"Is that… a drone?\""
msgstr "\"¿Es eso... un dron?\""

msgid ""
"Icarus gently releases the drone and a cautious Zach approaches it, like one "
"would approach a dead jellyfish on the beach."
msgstr ""
"Ícaro suelta suavemente el dron y un cauteloso Zach se acerca a él, como uno "
"se acercaría a una medusa muerta en la playa."

msgid ""
"\"Wait, this isn't one of my drones… could this be?…\"\n"
"Zach grabs the drone and runs into the station, leaving you alone face to "
"face with Icarus."
msgstr ""
"\"Espera, este no es uno de mis drones... ¿podría ser este?...\"\n"
"Zach coge el dron y corre hacia la estación, dejándote solo cara a cara con "
"Ícaro."

msgid ""
"Icarus seems to nod at you before taking off to rejoin his tribe. They let "
"out a strong electromagnetic impulse that resonates inside the space station "
"as they head off to the depths of space."
msgstr ""
"Icarus parece asentir antes de despegar para reunirse con su tribu. Deja "
"escapar un fuerte impulso electromagnético que resuena en el interior de la "
"estación espacial mientras se dirige a las profundidades del espacio."

msgid ""
"You are left alone to reflect on all the recent happenings. When you have "
"time you feel like you should probably check up on Zach to see how he is "
"doing."
msgstr ""
"Te quedas a solas reflexionando sobre todos los acontecimientos recientes. "
"Cuando tienes tiempo te parece que deberías ver a Zach para ver cómo está."

msgid ""
"You defended {pnt} from a hostile attack with the help of Icarus and their "
"kin."
msgstr ""
"Has defendido a {pnt} de un ataque hostil con la ayuda de Ícaro y sus "
"allegados."

msgid "Zach: "
msgstr "Zach: "

#. Make leader head towards planet
#. Fleets should have leaders with different speeds or they clump together
#. Main boss gets hilighted
msgid "Captain of the {shipname}"
msgstr "Capitán del {shipname}"

msgid ""
"You suddenly get a read-only transmission from {pnt}. You accept and a "
"hologram of Zach and an individual appears on your screen."
msgstr ""
"De repente recibes una transmisión de sólo lectura de {pnt}. Aceptas y "
"aparece en tu pantalla un holograma de Zach y un individuo."

msgid "\"You should have stayed out of this when you had a chance Zach.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Deberías haberte mantenido al margen cuando tuviste la oportunidad, Zach.\""

msgid ""
"\"What the hell?… wait… I know you… You're that professor working on the "
"ethereal matter hypothesis…\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué demonios?... espera... te conozco... eres ese profesor que trabaja en "
"la hipótesis de la materia etérea...\""

msgid "\"You won't be needing my name where you are going.\""
msgstr "\"No necesitarás mi nombre donde vas a ir.\""

msgid ""
"\"Why the hell are you doing this? Did you kill them all? This is just a "
"research post!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por qué demonios estás haciendo esto? ¿Los has matado a todos? ¡Esto es "
"sólo un puesto de investigación!\""

msgid ""
"He suddenly furrows his brows.\n"
"\"You either are playing a fool or a lot more obtuse than I originally "
"thought.\""
msgstr ""
"De repente frunce las cejas.\n"
"\"O te estás haciendo el tonto o eres mucho más obtuso de lo que pensaba en "
"un principio.\""

msgctxt "Zach to Evil PI"
msgid "\"What?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué?\""

msgid ""
"\"Even if you don't know anything, it is too late now. Prepare to be "
"eviscerated. For science!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque no sepas nada, ya es demasiado tarde. Prepárate para ser "
"eviscerado. ¡Por la ciencia!\""

msgid ""
"After the individual disappears, the transmission switches to read-write "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Tras la desaparición del individuo, la transmisión pasa al modo de lectura-"
"escritura."

msgid ""
"Zach turns to you.\n"
"\"Shit, we're pretty outgunned. He's flying a Mephisto… That's going to "
"wreck you pretty bad if you get close to it. I have no idea how we're going "
"to pull this off. At least try to buy me some time while I try to save what "
"I can from the station!\""
msgstr ""
"Zach se vuelve hacia ti.\n"
"\"Mierda, estamos bastante superados. Está volando una Mephisto... Eso te va "
"a destrozar bastante si te acercas a él. No tengo ni idea de cómo vamos a "
"sacar esto adelante. ¡Al menos intenta conseguirme algo de tiempo mientras "
"intento salvar lo que pueda de la estación!\""

msgid "Defend Sigma-13 and buy Zach some time"
msgstr "Defiende a Sigma-13 y gana tiempo para Zach"

#. Get nearest enemy
#. Deploy drones if close to the planet
msgid "Deploying defence drones!"
msgstr "¡Desplegando drones de defensa!"

msgid "Defence Drone"
msgstr "Dron de Defensa"

msgid "I'm detecting incoming ships… Wait, are those Icarus' kin?"
msgstr "Detecto naves entrantes... Espera, ¿son del tipo Icaro?"

#. All gone
msgid "Looks like the job is done. Come back to {pnt}."
msgstr "Parece que el trabajo está hecho. Vuelve a {pnt}."

msgid "Aaaargggh…"
msgstr "Aaaargggh…"

msgid ""
"You find Zach scrunched over his cyberdeck, endlessly pouring over the data "
"he obtained from the drone that Icarus brought over."
msgstr ""
"Encuentras a Zach en su ciberconsola, estudiando sin cesar los datos que "
"obtuvo del dron que trajo Ícaro."

msgid ""
"\"This is fascinating. My colleagues, foretelling their demise, were able to "
"load their research notes into drones, and launch them to try to save them. "
"Apparently there were several, although some seem to have been destroyed by "
"Dr. Slorn and his team. It looks like there should be one nearby, would you "
"be willing to help me go retrieve it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto es fascinante. Mis colegas, previendo su desaparición, pudieron "
"cargar sus notas de investigación en drones y lanzarlos para intentar "
"salvarlos. Al parecer había varios, aunque algunos parecen haber sido "
"destruidos por el Dr. Slorn y su equipo. Parece que debe haber uno cerca, "
"¿estarías dispuesto a ayudarme a ir a recuperarlo?\""

msgid ""
"\"The drone that Icarus brought over supplements greatly the notes I was "
"able to piece together and greatly surpasses them. Apparently, they were "
"really onto something given the depth of the documents. However, another "
"drone that is mentioned in the documents is even more interesting, and we "
"should spare no efforts to try to recover it as soon as possible, given the "
"expected location.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El dron que trajo Ícaro complementa en gran medida las notas que pude "
"reunir y las supera ampliamente. Por lo visto, tenían algo en mente, dada la "
"profundidad de los documentos. Sin embargo, otro dron que se menciona en los "
"documentos es aún más interesante, y no debemos escatimar esfuerzos para "
"intentar recuperarlo lo antes posible, dada la ubicación prevista.\""

msgid ""
"\"So, it seems like one of the drones they sent out, not only contains many "
"additional notes, but it was also performing one last experiment. However, "
"from some of the preliminary flight data, it seems like they were in too "
"much of a hurry and the drone ended up malfunctioning. I'm not certain it "
"was able to perform the task it was set to do, but hopefully it failed "
"afterwards. The tricky thing is where the drone is located: in an orbit of "
"the Anubis Black Hole.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que uno de los drones que enviaron, no sólo contiene muchas notas "
"adicionales, sino que también estaba realizando un último experimento. Sin "
"embargo, por algunos de los datos preliminares del vuelo, parece que tenían "
"demasiada prisa y el dron acabó funcionando mal. No estoy seguro de que "
"fuera capaz de realizar la tarea para la que estaba preparado, pero es de "
"esperar que fallara a continuación. Lo complicado es dónde se encuentra el "
"dron: en una órbita del Agujero Negro de Anubis.\""

msgid "\"You want to fly into the black hole?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quieres volar hacia el agujero negro?\""

msgid "\"That's suicidal!\""
msgstr "\"¡Eso es un suicidio!\""

msgid "\"How do we get there?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cómo llegamos hasta allí?\""

msgid "Stay silent."
msgstr "Permanece en silencio."

msgid ""
"\"It's not as bad as it sounds. We won't be travelling into the black hole, "
"just pretty close to it, but at a distance that the ship should be able to "
"easily avoid the gravitational pull. Nothing to worry about. However, we "
"will have to disable all the ship's built-in security jump systems to allow "
"it to make the jump.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No es tan malo como parece. No viajaremos dentro del agujero negro, sólo "
"muy cerca de él, pero a una distancia en la que la nave debería poder evitar "
"fácilmente la atracción gravitatoria. No hay que preocuparse. Sin embargo, "
"tendremos que incapacitar todos los sistemas de salto de seguridad "
"incorporados en la nave para permitirle realizar el salto.\""

msgid "\"Isn't that dangerous?\""
msgstr "\"¿No es eso peligroso?\""

msgid "\"Who needs security anyway?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quién necesita seguridad de todos modos?\""

msgid ""
"\"It should be in the acceptable parameters, and my simulations only give a "
"7% chance of disaster. Much better than the average of what we've been doing "
"up until now. There is no need to worry, the math is solid!…　Wait, did I "
"forget to carry the one again?\"\n"
"He furrows his brows a bit as he tries to remember."
msgstr ""
"\"Debería estar dentro de los parámetros aceptables, y mis simulaciones sólo "
"dan un 7% de posibilidades de desastre. Mucho mejor que la media de lo que "
"hemos hecho hasta ahora. No hay que preocuparse, ¡las matemáticas son "
"sólidas!... Espera, ¿me he olvidado de llevar el uno otra vez?\"\n"
"Frunce un poco las cejas mientras trata de recordar."

msgid ""
"\"According to some studies, pilots have 97% chance of meeting a horrible "
"fate without the security jump system. However, for responsible captains who "
"run all the simulations and properly compute the trajectories, there is only "
"a 13% chance of the ship hitting a large gravitational body. Wait, what "
"point was I making again?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Según algunos estudios, los pilotos tienen un 97% de posibilidades de "
"encontrar un destino horrible sin el sistema de salto de seguridad. Sin "
"embargo, para los capitanes responsables que realizan todas las simulaciones "
"y calculan correctamente las trayectorias, sólo hay un 13% de posibilidades "
"de que la nave choque con un gran cuerpo gravitatorio. Espera, ¿qué queria "
"decir?\""

msgid ""
"\"All you have to do is get to the optimal jump point, and a custom AI I've "
"written should handle all the jump intricacies for us. I'll also be joining "
"you in case anything goes wrong, but it should all be well within "
"parameters. Once we get there, I'll provide you with a rough estimate of the "
"drone location so we can go recover it. All we need is the data, the drone "
"itself is not necessary to recover.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo lo que tienes que hacer es llegar al punto de salto óptimo, y una IA "
"personalizada que he escrito debería manejar todas las complejidades del "
"salto por nosotros. También me uniré a vosotros en caso de que algo vaya "
"mal, pero todo debería estar bien dentro de los parámetros. Una vez que "
"lleguemos, te proporcionaré una estimación aproximada de la ubicación del "
"dron para que podamos ir a recuperarlo. Todo lo que necesitamos son los "
"datos, el dron en sí no es necesario recuperarlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"One important thing I forgot to mention, my calculations only work for "
"ships up to {mass} of mass. Anything larger and not getting sucked into the "
"black hole and crushed to the size of a hairpin becomes a rather complicated "
"affair.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Una cosa importante que olvidé mencionar, mis cálculos sólo funcionan para "
"naves de hasta {mass} de masa. Cualquier cosa más grande y que no sea "
"absorbida por el agujero negro y aplastada hasta el tamaño de una horquilla "
"se convierte en un asunto bastante complicado.\""

msgid ""
"\"The drone is in a decaying orbit around the black hole, so we do not have "
"much time to spare before it gets sucked in. Let us make haste to recover it."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"El dron está en una órbita decadente alrededor del agujero negro, así que "
"no tenemos mucho tiempo de sobra antes de que sea absorbido. Démonos prisa "
"en recuperarlo.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Perform a non-standard jump towards the Anubis Black hole to recover a "
"damaged scout drone."
msgstr ""
"Realiza un salto no vertical hacia el agujero negro de Anubis para recuperar "
"un dron explorador dañado."

msgid ""
"Your ship lands on the station. The moment you and Zach get out of the ship, "
"you hear a loud groan and amidst a shower of sparks, half the engine "
"sputters and falls down onto the ground. As you take cover, your now "
"imbalanced ship falls off to the side and slides on the metal floor in a "
"cacophony of clangs and groans."
msgstr ""
"Tu nave aterriza en la estación. En el momento en que tú y Zach salís de la "
"nave, oís un fuerte gemido y, entre una lluvia de chispas, la mitad del "
"motor chisporrotea y cae al suelo. Mientras os ponéis a cubierto, vuestra "
"nave, ahora desequilibrada, cae hacia un lado y se desliza sobre el suelo "
"metálico en una cacofonía de estruendos y gemidos."

msgid ""
"\"Maybe I should have increased the safety tolerance a bit more. Pretty "
"lucky that this happened now and not while we were travelling through "
"hyperspace. I guess we now know why the ships have security jump mechanisms."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tal vez debería haber aumentado la tolerancia de seguridad un poco más. Es "
"una suerte que esto haya ocurrido ahora y no mientras viajábamos por el "
"hiperespacio. Supongo que ya sabemos por qué las naves tienen los mecanismos "
"de salto de seguridad.\""

msgid "\"{shipname}! My ship!\""
msgstr "\"¡{shipname}! ¡Mi nave!\""

msgid "\"We're not doing that again are we…\""
msgstr "\"No vamos a hacer eso otra vez, ¿verdad?\""

msgid "\"About the repairs…\""
msgstr "\"Sobre las reparaciones...\""

msgid "Glare at him."
msgstr "Lo miras fijamente."

msgid ""
"He stops to think for a moment before speaking.\n"
"\"I do not think that would be advisable, no. I'll have to revise my "
"simulation, but I'm pretty sure it was an optimistic lower bound.\""
msgstr ""
"Se detiene a pensar un momento antes de hablar.\n"
"\"No creo que eso sea aconsejable, no. Tendré que revisar mi simulación, "
"pero estoy bastante seguro de que era un límite inferior optimista.\""

msgid ""
"\"Don't worry about the damage. I'll have the drones fix it up. A small "
"price to pay for all the experimental data we were able to recover!\"\n"
"He gives a sign to the drones that start working like ants to lift the ship "
"back up and stabilize it, and then starts to lead you into the station."
msgstr ""
"\"No te preocupes por los daños. Haré que los drones lo arreglen. Un pequeño "
"precio a pagar por todos los datos experimentales que hemos podido recuperar."
"\"\n"
"Hace una señal a los drones que empiezan a trabajar como hormigas para "
"levantar la nave de nuevo y estabilizarla, y luego empieza a guiarte hacia "
"la estación."

msgid ""
"\"One of the major issues of creating antimatter is the volatility and "
"energy requirements. Most of the time it is infeasible to generate in any "
"large amounts, which is why its use is restricted to very particular "
"experiments and military applications. You wouldn't imagine the amount of "
"paperwork you need to get a single nanogram of antimatter!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Uno de los principales problemas de la creación de antimateria es la "
"volatilidad y los requisitos energéticos. La mayoría de las veces es "
"inviable generarla en grandes cantidades, por lo que su uso está restringido "
"a experimentos muy particulares y aplicaciones militares. ¡No te imaginas la "
"cantidad de papeleo que necesitas para conseguir un solo nanogramo de "
"antimateria!\""

msgid ""
"\"Now normally, you slowly collect antimatter from nuclei collisions with "
"careful slowing down of the anti-protons to avoid volatility issues. While "
"this allows them to be generated anywhere, it's pretty impracticable with no "
"way of scaling it up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ahora bien, normalmente se recoge lentamente la antimateria de las "
"colisiones de los núcleos con una cuidadosa ralentización de los "
"antiprotones para evitar problemas de volatilidad. Si bien esto permite "
"generarlos en cualquier lugar, es bastante impracticable y no hay forma de "
"escalarlo.\""

msgid ""
"\"The beauty of my colleagues, of Mie's research, is to take a completely "
"different approach using hyper-relativistic acceleration in a Schwarzschild "
"frame such that the Birkhoff-Kerr radiation does the brunt of the work. It's "
"a really interesting novel take that was only theorized about. That is, up "
"until now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"La belleza de mis colegas, de la investigación de Mie, es adoptar un "
"enfoque completamente diferente utilizando la aceleración hiperrelativista "
"en un marco de Schwarzschild, de manera que la radiación de Birkhoff-Kerr "
"hace el grueso del trabajo. Es un enfoque novedoso realmente interesante "
"sobre el que sólo se había teorizado. Es decir, ¡hasta ahora!\""

msgid ""
"\"By using a reverse tachyon depolarizer, they were able to…\"\n"
"Zach realizes that he lost you a while back.\n"
"\"Ummm, long story short, we may have a way of generating much more "
"antimatter than was feasible up until now!\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Eventually he leads you to a room you don't recall seeing before, filled "
"with experimental devices and drones flying around. He hands you a book "
"titled \"Black Holes for Non-Za'leks\" and indicates you to take a seat. You "
"sit down, book in hand, and wait for whatever he's going to do."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente te conduce a una sala que no recuerdas haber visto antes, llena "
"de dispositivos experimentales y drones volando alrededor. Te entrega un "
"libro titulado \"Agujeros negros para No Za'leks\" y te indica que tomes "
"asiento. Te sientas, con el libro en la mano, y esperas lo que sea que vaya "
"a hacer."

msgid ""
"After what seems like an eternity of you trying to make sense of what is "
"written in the book, which seems to be purposely written to be hard to "
"understand, Zach appears once again and motions for you to follow. He leads "
"you to a room separated by a curtain where there seems to be a large device, "
"and beams a triumphant smile at you, eagerly waiting a reaction."
msgstr ""

msgid "\"It's awesome!\""
msgstr "\"¡Es impresionante!\""

msgid ""
"\"Loss of words, eh? I know it's pretty incredible. It's hard to know what "
"to say in front of such a beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pérdida de palabras\", ¿eh? Sé que es bastante increíble. Es difícil saber "
"qué decir ante semejante belleza.\""

msgid ""
"\"I know, right? I've been working on the outer design for quite a while "
"now. The bevel radius over here follows the golden ratio!\"\n"
"He points at a part that you can't tell what's different from any other "
"standard outfit available at most outfitters."
msgstr ""
"\"Lo sé, ¿verdad? He estado trabajando en el diseño exterior durante "
"bastante tiempo. ¡Aquí el radio del bisel sigue la proporción áurea!\"\n"
"Señala una parte que no se puede distinguir de cualquier otro equipo "
"estándar disponible en la mayoría de las tiendas."

msgid ""
"\"Behold, the first {outfit}! A new marvel of technology! I modified one of "
"the Orion lances with some of the collected antimatter to generate this "
"beauty. I had to redesign most of the internals to compensate. This is just "
"a prototype, but it's a taste of the things to come with abundant antimatter."
"\""
msgstr ""
"¡\"Contemplad la primera {outfit}! ¡Una nueva maravilla de la tecnología! He "
"modificado una de las lanzas de Orión con parte de la antimateria recogida "
"para generar esta belleza. Tuve que rediseñar la mayoría de las partes "
"internas para compensar. Esto es sólo un prototipo, pero es una muestra de "
"lo que vendrá con la antimateria abundante.\""

msgid ""
"\"For all your help, I want to give you the first prototype, which passed "
"all laboratory tests already. Hopefully you'll be able to put it to good "
"use. I'm going to remain here to advance and perfect this research. There is "
"still a ton of things to do. However, I think you've done everything I "
"needed and more. I will be grateful forever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por toda tu ayuda, quiero darte el primer prototipo, que ya ha pasado "
"todas las pruebas de laboratorio. Espero que puedas darle un buen uso. Me "
"voy a quedar aquí para avanzar y perfeccionar esta investigación. Todavía "
"hay un montón de cosas que hacer. Sin embargo, creo que has hecho todo lo "
"que necesitaba y más. Te lo agradeceré siempre.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm not much for emotions, but you should leave before I get teary. "
"Hopefully our paths will cross again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No me gustan mucho las emociones, pero deberías irte antes de que se me "
"salten las lágrimas. Espero que nuestros caminos se vuelvan a cruzar.\""

msgid ""
"You wish him the best and say farewell. You are certain he has a bright "
"future ahead of him."
msgstr ""
"Le deseas lo mejor y te despides. Está seguro de que le espera un futuro "
"brillante."

#. player.pay( reward )
msgid ""
"You helped Zach recover a drone containing notes and experiments from his "
"deceased colleagues by doing a non-standard jump to and from the Anubis "
"Black Hole. Zach was able to use the technology to create the first {outfit} "
"prototype which was given to you."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a Zach a recuperar un dron que contenía notas y experimentos de sus "
"colegas fallecidos realizando un salto no estándar hacia y desde el Agujero "
"Negro de Anubis. Zach pudo utilizar la tecnología para crear el primer "
"prototipo de {outfit} que te fue entregado."

msgid "Get into a ship with less than {mass} of mass"
msgstr "Entra en una nave con menos de {mass} de masa"

msgid ""
"The ship we are in is too heavy. We'll need a ship under {mass} to make the "
"jump."
msgstr ""
"La nave en la que estamos es demasiado pesada. Necesitaremos una nave de una "
"masa menor de {masa}, para dar el salto."

msgid "Perform a non-standard jump to the black hole from {sys}"
msgstr "Realiza un salto no estándar al agujero negro desde {sys}"

msgid "I've marked the safest point to try the non-standard jump on your map."
msgstr ""
"He marcado el punto más seguro para intentar el salto no estándar en tu mapa."

msgid "Non-standard doesn't mean non-safe though."
msgstr "Sin embargo, que no sea estándar no significa que no sea seguro."

msgid "Actually, in this case it does though…"
msgstr "En realidad, en este caso sí…"

msgid "Statistically, we're more likely to survive."
msgstr "Estadísticamente, tenemos más probabilidades de sobrevivir."

msgid "I'll shut up now."
msgstr "Me voy a callar ahora."

msgid "Safest Jump Point"
msgstr "Punto de Salto Más Seguro"

#. No music to make more omnious
msgid "Damaged Drone"
msgstr "Dron Dañado"

#. To allow reboarding
msgid "Damn! That was closer than I wanted."
msgstr "¡Maldición! Eso estuvo más cerca de lo que quería."

msgid "Stabilizers… check. Engine… check. Gravitational pull… acceptable."
msgstr ""
"Estabilizadores... comprobado. Motor... comprobado. Empuje gravitacional... "
"aceptable."

msgid "Looks like we're in the clear!"
msgstr "¡Parece que estamos a salvo!"

msgid "Wow, such a beauty."
msgstr "Vaya, qué belleza."

msgid "Let's see, I've marked the expected drone position on the map."
msgstr "Veamos, he marcado la posición esperada del dron en el mapa."

msgid "I wonder how close we can get…"
msgstr "Me pregunto qué tan cerca podemos llegar…"

msgid ""
"You hook up to the damaged drone and are able to access the control panel. "
"Since Zach seems to be distracted, it seems like you have to access it "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgid "Drone Control Panel"
msgstr "Panel de Control Dron"

msgid ""
"As you are finally able to access the data, you see Zach was peering over "
"your shoulder most of the time."
msgstr ""
"Cuando por fin puedes acceder a los datos, ves que Zach estuvo mirando por "
"encima de tu hombro la mayor parte del tiempo."

msgid ""
"\"Your form could use some work, but not bad for not having formal training. "
"Here, let me look at the data.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tu forma podría necesitar algo de trabajo, pero no está mal para no tener "
"un entrenamiento formal. Aquí, déjame ver los datos.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"He jacks his cyberdeck into the drone interface and begins inputting "
"commands at a dizzying speed. He begins to hum to himself as he blazes "
"across the file system, scouring every nook and cranny in every directory in "
"a semi-automated fashion. Finally, he seems happy with what he found."
msgstr ""
"Conecta su ciberconsola a la interfaz del dron y comienza a introducir "
"comandos a una velocidad vertiginosa. Comienza a tararear para sí mismo "
"mientras recorre el sistema de archivos, buscando en cada rincón de cada "
"directorio de forma semiautomática. Finalmente, parece satisfecho con lo que "
"ha encontrado."

msgid ""
"\"This is most peculiar, although there was a mistake in the calculations "
"which caused the drone to malfunction, the theoretical formulations seem to "
"be all correct. I'll have to think of the implications, but this does seem "
"to indicate that there is a lot of untapped potential.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto es muy peculiar, aunque hubo un error en los cálculos que hizo que el "
"dron funcionara mal, las formulaciones teóricas parecen ser todas correctas. "
"Tendré que pensar en las implicaciones, pero esto parece indicar que hay "
"mucho potencial sin explotar.\""

msgid ""
"\"If you can take the ship to the position I've marked on the map, the AI "
"should be able to take us back to {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si puedes llevar la nave a la posición que he marcado en el mapa, la IA "
"debería ser capaz de llevarnos de vuelta a {sys}.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Without saying anything else, he plops down on a chair and starts analysing "
"the data on his cyberdeck while spinning around slowly in the chair, once "
"again humming to himself."
msgstr ""
"Sin decir nada más, se sienta en una silla y empieza a analizar los datos de "
"su ciberconsola mientras gira lentamente en la silla, tarareando de nuevo "
"para sí mismo."

msgid "You failed to access the drone data."
msgstr "No has podido acceder a los datos del dron."

#. Didn't hack through
msgid "Jump Point"
msgstr "Punto de Salto"

msgid "The AI will take it from here."
msgstr "La IA se encargará a partir de ahora."

msgid "Don't worry about the warning lights, they're normal… I think."
msgstr "No te preocupes por las luces de aviso, son normales... creo."

msgid "WARNING: Hyperdrive security system disabled!"
msgstr "ADVERTENCIA: ¡Sistema de seguridad de hipermotor desactivado!"

msgid "The AI takes control of your ship to perform the jump."
msgstr "La IA toma el control de tu nave para realizar el salto."

