#.
#. Mission: Novice Nebula Research
#.
#. Description: A Za'lek student asks the player to help him with his research. The player has to visit Doeston and Iris.
#. Some minor complications on the way have to be expected.
#.
#. Difficulty: Easy
#.
#.
#. Mission Constants
#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not accepted yet
#. 0: go to doeston
#. 1: doeston scan done
#. 2: go to iris
#. 3: scan the iris system
#. 4: return to jorla
#. Spaceport bar stuff
msgid "A young scientist"
msgstr "Un joven científico"

msgid ""
"You see a young scientist talking with some pilots, apparently without "
"success."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un joven científico hablando con unos pilotos, aparentemente sin éxito."

msgid "Student"
msgstr "Estudiante"

#. Start mission
msgid ""
"After being turned down by the pilot he was talking to, the scientist "
"approaches you."
msgstr ""
"Tras ser rechazado por el piloto con el que hablaba, el científico se acerca "
"a ti."

msgid ""
"\"Hello there! You are a pilot, right? For my project I require a ship that "
"can go to the Nebula. Certainly you must be interested in the proposal of "
"researching the phenomenon that cut us off from mankind's patrimony.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hola! Eres un piloto, ¿verdad? Para mi proyecto necesito una nave que "
"pueda ir a la Nebulosa. Ciertamente debe estar interesado en la propuesta de "
"investigar el fenómeno que nos aisló del patrimonio de la humanidad.\""

#. Check for cargo space
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately it looks like your ship does not have enough free cargo "
"space.\"\n"
"He leaves the bar. It appears he has given up finding a pilot, at least for "
"now."
msgstr ""
"\"Por desgracia, parece que tu nave no tiene suficiente espacio de carga "
"libre.\"\n"
"Abandona el bar. Parece que ha renunciado a encontrar un piloto, al menos "
"por ahora."

msgid ""
"He pauses for a moment.\n"
"\"As this is the point where any other pilots I asked backed out, I should "
"start by mentioning that due to some unfortunate circumstances the payment "
"for this mission will be only {credits}.\""
msgstr ""
"Hace una pausa por un momento.\n"
"\"Como este es el punto en el que cualquier otro piloto al que le pregunté "
"se echó atrás, debo empezar mencionando que debido a algunas circunstancias "
"desafortunadas el pago por esta misión será sólo de {credits}.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"But rest assured, you will be mentioned in the acknowledgement section of "
"my next paper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pero ten por seguro que serás mencionado en la sección de agradecimientos "
"de mi próximo trabajo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Hold up! Look, the problem is that my grant was not permitted to the "
"extent that I asked for. Those assholes cut my funds because they just don't "
"understand the relevance of my research. Just because I'm still a student "
"they completely underestimate my abilities!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Espera! Mira, el problema es que mi subvención no fue permitida en la "
"medida que pedí. Esos imbéciles me cortaron los fondos porque no entienden "
"la relevancia de mi investigación. ¡Sólo porque todavía soy un estudiante "
"subestiman completamente mis capacidades!\""

msgid ""
"\"Now I've spent all my credits on this sensor suite without the ability to "
"use it. You must know how this feels. I mean, your ship obviously could use "
"some work. So why don't you just help me out here?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ahora he gastado todos mis créditos en esta serie de sensores sin poder "
"usarlos. Debes saber cómo se siente esto. Quiero decir, tu nave obviamente "
"necesita algo de trabajo. Así que, ¿por qué no me ayudas aquí?\""

msgid "Offer to help him"
msgstr "Ofrécete a ayudarle"

msgid ""
"You decline. Why would you accept such a dangerous job without a proper "
"payment?"
msgstr ""
"Te niegas. ¿Por qué aceptar un trabajo tan peligroso sin un pago adecuado?"

msgid ""
"\"So it is not a problem at all? I'm still a student and spent all funds I "
"got on the sensor suite. Thank you for helping me out here! I'll start to "
"load the sensors into your ship right away. We should be ready to take off "
"soon.\"\n"
"With that said he hurries and leaves the bar."
msgstr ""
"\"Entonces, ¿no es un problema en absoluto? Todavía soy estudiante y md he "
"gastado todos los fondos que tengo en el equipo de sensores. ¡Gracias por "
"ayudarme! Empezaré a cargar los sensores en tu nave ahora mismo. Deberíamos "
"estar listos para despegar prontoe\"\n"
"Dicho esto, se apresura a salir del bar."

msgid ""
"\"Great! I'll start loading the sensors into your ship right away. We should "
"be ready to take off soon.\"\n"
"With that said he hurries and leaves the bar."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Empezaré a cargar los sensores en tu nave ahora mismo. Deberíamos "
"estar listos para despegar prontoe\"\n"
"Dicho esto se apresura a salir del bar."

#. Add cargo
msgid "Nebula Sensor Suite"
msgstr "Equipo de Sensores Nebulosa"

msgid "A heavy suite with lots of fancy looking sensors."
msgstr "Un pesado equipo con muchos sensores de aspecto elegante."

#. Set up mission information
#. Add mission
msgid "Novice Nebula Research"
msgstr "Investigación de Nebulosa para Novatos"

msgid "{credits} and the gratitude of a student"
msgstr "{credits} y la gratitud de un estudiante"

msgid ""
"You have been asked by a Za'lek student to fly into the Nebula for some kind "
"of research."
msgstr ""
"Un estudiante Za'lek te ha pedido que vueles a la Nebulosa para realizar "
"algún tipo de investigación."

msgid ""
"The student has already removed all the cables and sensors inside your ship "
"during the flight back to {pnt}. Everything is packed into a couple of "
"crates by the time you land."
msgstr ""
"El estudiante ya ha retirado todos los cables y sensores de tu nave durante "
"el vuelo de vuelta a {pnt}. Todo está empaquetado en un par de cajas en el "
"momento de aterrizar."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Once again, thank you for your help. I still have to analyse the data, but "
"it looks promising so far. With these results no one is going to question my "
"theories any more! Also, I decided to increase your reward to compensate for "
"the trouble I caused.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Una vez más, gracias por tu ayuda. Todavía tengo que analizar los datos, "
"pero de momento parecen prometedores. Con estos resultados ya nadie va a "
"cuestionar mis teorías. Además, he decidido aumentarte la recompensa para "
"compensar las molestias que te he causado.\""

msgid ""
"He gives you a credit chip worth {credits} and heads off. The money is nice, "
"but not worth as much as the insight that working for the Za'lek will be "
"dangerous and tiresome."
msgstr ""
"Te da una ficha de crédito por valor de {credits} y se va. El dinero está "
"bien, pero no vale tanto como la idea de que trabajar para los Za'lek será "
"peligroso y agotador."

msgid "You helped a Za'lek student to collect sensor data in the Nebula."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a un estudiante Za'lek a recoger datos de sensores en la "
"Nebulosa."

msgid ""
"As you enter your ship you notice dozens of cables of various colours "
"stretched across your ship's corridors. It is a complete mess. You follow "
"the direction most of the cables seem to lead to and find the culprit."
msgstr ""
"Al entrar en su nave, observa que hay decenas de cables de diversos colores "
"tendidos por los pasillos de la nave. Es un completo desorden. Sigues la "
"dirección de la mayoría de los cables y encuentras al culpable."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, hello again, Captain! I'm done with my work here, so we can take off "
"whenever you're ready. I have to calibrate the sensors during the flight, so "
"there is no need to rush. Our first destination is {sys}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Oh, hola de nuevo, Capitán! Ya he terminado mi trabajo aquí, así que "
"podemos despegar cuando esté listo. Tengo que calibrar los sensores durante "
"el vuelo, así que no hay necesidad de apresurarse. Nuestro primer destino es "
"{sys}.\""

msgid ""
"You try to maintain composure as you ask him what he has done to your ship."
msgstr ""
"Intentas mantener la compostura mientras le preguntas qué le ha hecho a tu "
"nave."

msgid ""
"\"Oh, I just installed the sensors. It should have no unwanted side effects "
"on your ship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Acabo de instalar los sensores. No debería tener efectos secundarios no "
"deseados en tu nave.\""

msgid ""
"\"A mess, you say? Haven't you noticed the colour coding? Don't worry, I "
"know exactly what I'm doing!\"\n"
"His last words are supposed to be reassuring, but instead you start to think "
"that accepting this mission was not the best idea."
msgstr ""
"¿\"Un desorden\", dices? ¿No te has fijado en el código de colores? No te "
"preocupes, ¡sé exactamente lo que estoy haciendo!\"\n"
"Sus últimas palabras deben ser tranquilizadoras, pero en cambio empiezas a "
"pensar que aceptar esta misión no ha sido la mejor idea."

msgid ""
"The student enters your cockpit as you arrive in the {sys} system.\n"
"\"Greetings, Captain! I realize I forgot to introduce myself. My name is "
"Robert Hofer, student of Professor Voges himself! I'm sure you must have "
"heard of him?\""
msgstr ""
"El estudiante entra en tu cabina cuando llegas al sistema {sys}.\n"
"\"¡Saludos, capitán! Me doy cuenta de que me he olvidado de presentarme. Me "
"llamo Robert Hofer, alumno del mismísimo profesor Voges. Estoy seguro de que "
"debe haber oído hablar de él.\""

msgid ""
"You tell him that the name doesn't sound familiar to you.\n"
"\"How can that be? Well, you would understand if you were a Za'lek.\""
msgstr ""
"Le dices que el nombre no te suena.\n"
"\"¿Cómo puede ser eso? Bueno, lo entenderías si fueras un Za'lek.\""

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, I will now start with the measurements. The density of the nebula "
"is lower in this sector, so it's not particularly volatile. For the real "
"measurements we have to enter {sys}. I will let you know when we're done "
"here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, ahora empezaré con las mediciones. La densidad de la "
"nebulosa es menor en este sector, por lo que no es especialmente volátil. "
"Para las mediciones reales tenemos que entrar en {sys}. Te avisaré cuando "
"hayamos terminado aquí.\""

#. Cancel autonav.
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Suddenly you lose control of your ship. Apparently most core systems were "
"shut down. Something drains your ship's energy and there are black-outs in "
"several parts of your ship."
msgstr ""
"De repente, pierdes el control de tu nave. Al parecer, la mayoría de los "
"sistemas base se han apagado. Algo drena la energía de tu nave y hay "
"apagones en varias partes de la misma."

msgid ""
"You realize that your shields are down as well. In an environment like "
"this... That's it, you're going to die here! You knew accepting this mission "
"was a mistake from the very first moment."
msgstr ""
"Te das cuenta de que tus escudos también han caído. En un ambiente como "
"este... ¡Ya está, vas a morir aquí! Sabías que aceptar esta misión era un "
"error desde el primer momento."

msgid ""
"You breathe a sigh of relief. It seems you're still alive. You try not to "
"glare at Robert Hofer, but apparently aren't particularly successful, "
"considering his response."
msgstr ""
"Respiras aliviado. Parece que sigues vivo. Intentas no mirar a Robert Hofer, "
"pero parece que no lo consigues, teniendo en cuenta su respuesta."

msgid ""
"\"Sorry for causing trouble. I seem to have underestimated the polarity "
"feedback loop granularity. If it weren't for your Za'lek ship the problem "
"would have been much worse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Siento haber causado problemas. Parece que he subestimado la granularidad "
"del bucle de retroalimentación de la polaridad. ¡Si no fuera por tu nave "
"Za'lek el problema habría sido mucho peor!\""

msgid ""
"\"Sorry for causing trouble. I'm not quite familiar with the electronics of "
"this ship type. You really should fly a Za'lek ship instead. Those are so "
"much better!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Siento haber causado problemas. No estoy muy familiarizado con la "
"electrónica de este tipo de nave. Realmente deberías volar una nave Za'lek "
"en su lugar. ¡Esas son mucho mejores!\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I should investigate the damage it caused to the armour once we land. But "
"first we must go to the {sys} system. Don't worry, the blackout will not "
"occur again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Debería investigar el daño que causó a la armadura una vez que "
"aterricemos. Pero primero debemos ir al sistema {sys}. No te preocupes, ¡el "
"apagón no volverá a ocurrir!\""

msgid ""
"You arrive in the {sys} system and Robert Hofer tells you that he will let "
"you know when his scan is complete. This had better not cause another "
"blackout..."
msgstr ""
"Llegas al sistema {sys} y Robert Hofer te dice que te avisará cuando termine "
"su exploración. Será mejor que esto no cause otro apagón..."

msgid "\"OK, my measurements are complete! Let's go back to {pnt}.\""
msgstr "\"¡Bien, mis medidas están completas! Volvamos a {pnt}.\""

