#.
#.
#. Mission: Advanced Nebula Research
#.
#. Description: This time the postdoc asks the player for help. Reference data of further nebula are needed to understand the Sol nebula. The player has to escort a refitted transport ship through Pirate and Dvaered space.
#.
#. Difficulty: Medium
#.
#.
#.
#. Non-persistent state
#. Forward-declared functions
#. Mission info stuff
msgid "Escort the transport ship to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Escolta la nave de transporte a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Land on {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Aterriza en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Fly back to {pnt} in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Vuelve a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}"

#. 1
#. 2
#. 5
#. 7
#. 8
#. 9
#. 10
#. Spaceport bar stuff
#. Variable set up and clean up
#. Spaceport bar stuff
msgid "A scientist"
msgstr "Un científico"

msgid "You see a scientist who is apparently looking for someone."
msgstr "Ves a un científico que aparentemente está buscando a alguien."

msgid ""
"\"Captain {player} if I'm not mistaken? Well met. I heard you recently "
"helped one of our students. My name is Dr. Mensing and I am working for "
"professor Voges as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Capitán {player} si no me equivoco? Encantado de conocerte. He oído que "
"recientemente ayudó a uno de nuestros estudiantes. Mi nombre es Dr. Mensing "
"y también trabajo para el profesor Voges.\""

msgid ""
"\"Your timing is just perfect. You see, we planned an expedition but the "
"captain we hired to escort our transport ship backed out in the last minute. "
"It's quite bothersome being stranded right in {fct} space. Would you be "
"willing to assist us instead?\""
msgstr ""
"\" Tu tiempo es perfecto. Verás, planeamos una expedición pero el capitán "
"que contratamos para escoltar nuestra nave de transporte se echó atrás en el "
"último momento. Es bastante molesto estar varados justo en el espacio {fct}. "
"¿Estarías dispuesto a ayudarnos?\""

msgid ""
"You don't want to be involved again in a dangerous, poorly paid job so you "
"decline and leave the bar."
msgstr ""
"No quieres volver a involucrarte en un trabajo peligroso y mal pagado, así "
"que declinas y abandonas el bar."

msgid ""
"\"While the data recorded by Robert is of good quality, he seems to have "
"completely forgotten that we need reference data of similarly dense nebulae. "
"We have already installed his sensors on a transport ship. The nearby PSO "
"nebula should be a good candidate, but there are the pirate systems in "
"between. Also, the target systems are controlled by the Dvaered. Hard to say "
"whether the Dvaered or the pirates are more dangerous. So this is why we "
"need an escort.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aunque los datos registrados por Robert son de buena calidad, parece haber "
"olvidado por completo que necesitamos datos de referencia de nebulosas de "
"densidad similar. Ya hemos instalado sus sensores en una nave de transporte. "
"La cercana nebulosa PSO debería ser una buena candidata, pero hay sistemas "
"piratas en medio. También los sistemas objetivo son controlados por los "
"Dvaered. Es difícil decir si los Dvaered o los piratas son más peligrosos. "
"Por eso necesitamos una escolta.\""

msgid ""
"\"We will travel through {sys2}, {sys3}, and {sys4}. Just passing through "
"the systems should be sufficient. Also, I want to visit the {station} "
"station before returning to {pnt}. You have to make sure no one shoots us "
"down during our expedition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Viajaremos a través de {sys2}, {sys3} y {sys4}. Con pasar por los sistemas "
"debería ser suficiente. Además, quiero visitar la estación {station} antes "
"de volver a {pnt}. Tienes que asegurarte de que nadie nos derribe durante "
"nuestra expedición.\""

#. Set up mission information
#. This variable holds the system the player is supposed to jump to NEXT.
msgid "Advanced Nebula Research"
msgstr "Investigación de Nebulosa Avanzada"

msgid ""
"Escort the transport ship to the {station} in the {sys} system. Make sure to "
"stay close to the transport ship and wait until they jumped out of the "
"system safely."
msgstr ""
"Escolta a la nave de transporte hasta la {station} en el sistema {sys}. "
"Asegúrate de permanecer cerca de la nave de transporte y espera a que salgan "
"del sistema de forma segura."

msgid ""
"\"Please follow us, {player}. Make sure to jump to the next system after we "
"jumped out. We'll have to land on some planets on our way to refuel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por favor, síguenos, {player}. Asegúrate de saltar al siguiente sistema "
"después de que salgamos. Tendremos que aterrizar en algunos planetas en "
"nuestro camino para repostar.\""

msgid "You jumped into the wrong system. You failed science miserably!"
msgstr ""
"Te metiste en el sistema equivocado. ¡Has fallado miserablemente a la "
"ciencia!"

#. j:control(true)
#. j:attack(transporter)
msgid "You jumped before the transport ship you were escorting."
msgstr "Saltaste antes que la nave de transporte que estabas escoltando."

msgid "You abandoned your mission!"
msgstr "¡Has abandonado tu misión!"

msgid ""
"You have landed, abandoning your mission to escort the transport ship. You "
"failed science miserably!"
msgstr ""
"Has aterrizado, abandonando tu misión de escoltar la nave de transporte. "
"¡Has fallado miserablemente a la ciencia!"

msgid ""
"Once you are done with the refuel operations, you meet Dr. Mensing on her "
"way back to the transport ship."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que haya terminado con las operaciones de reabastecimiento, te "
"encuentras con la Dra. Mensing en tu camino de regreso a la nave de "
"transporte."

msgid ""
"\"I just met up with another 'scientist' working on this station. The "
"purpose of this station is to collect data about the PSO nebula, but their "
"scans are absolute garbage. Apparently the station is being run by an "
"independent university. They couldn't possibly keep up with the Za'lek "
"standards in terms of proper scientific methods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Acabo de encontrarme con otro 'científico' que trabaja en esta estación. "
"El propósito de esta estación es recoger datos sobre la nebulosa PSO, pero "
"sus escaneos son una absoluta basura. Al parecer, la estación está dirigida "
"por una universidad independiente. No podrían estar a la altura de los "
"estándares Za'lek en cuanto a métodos científicos adecuados.\""

msgid ""
"She is visibly upset about the apparent lack of dedication to science. "
"\"Let's head back to {pnt}. Our own measurements are completed by now.\""
msgstr ""
"Está visiblemente molesta por la aparente falta de dedicación a la ciencia. "
"\"Volvamos a {pnt}. Nuestras propias mediciones ya se han completado ahora.\""

msgid ""
"After leaving the ship, you meet up with Dr. Mensing who hands you a chip "
"worth {credits}, and thanks you for your help."
msgstr ""
"Tras abandonar la nave, te encuentras con el Dr. Mensing, que te entrega una "
"ficha por valor de {credits} y te agradece tu ayuda."

msgid ""
"\"We'll be able to return to Jorla safely from here on. You did science a "
"great favour today. I'm sure the data we collected will help us to "
"understand the cause for the Sol nebula's volatility.\""
msgstr ""
"\"A partir de ahora podremos volver a Jorla con seguridad. Hoy habéis hecho "
"un gran favor a la ciencia. Estoy seguro de que los datos recogidos nos "
"ayudarán a entender la causa de la volatilidad de la nebulosa de Sol.\""

msgid "You helped Dr. Mensing to collect sensor data of the PSO nebula."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste al Dr. Mensing a recoger datos de los sensores de la nebulosa PSO."

msgid "{plt} has jumped to {sys}."
msgstr "{plt} ha saltado a {sys}."

#. Set a new leader and tell them to move on
#. If they are not following the player, the player should protect them
#. Make attacker hostile
msgid "{plt} has landed on {pnt}."
msgstr "{plt} ha aterrizado en {pnt}."

msgid "We're under attack!"
msgstr "¡Nos atacan!"

#. Shuts him up for at least 5s.
msgid "Research Shuttle"
msgstr "Transbordador de Investigación"

#. Hack to make ambushes more reliable.
#. This happens in an unspecified Dvaered system.
#. don't care: will attack soon
#. j:control(true)
#. j:moveto(vec2.new(-4000,-12000))
msgid ""
"Suddenly, your comm system turns on, receiving a conversation between the "
"ship you are escorting and a Dvaered patrol ship."
msgstr ""
"De repente, tu sistema de comunicaciones se enciende, recibiendo una "
"conversación entre la nave que estás escoltando y una nave patrulla Dvaered."

msgid ""
"\"I assure you, we mean no harm. We are just a convoy of scientists passing "
"through Dvaered space.\" says Dr. Mensing."
msgstr ""
"\" Te aseguro que no tenemos ninguna intención de hacer daño. Sólo somos una "
"caravana de científicos de paso por el espacio Dvaered\", dice el Dr. "
"Mensing."

msgid ""
"The response sounds harsh. \"Do you think we're naïve? You're obviously a "
"spy scouting our systems' defences.\""
msgstr ""
"La respuesta suena dura. \"¿Crees que somos ingenuos? Es obvio que eres un "
"espía que explora las defensas de nuestros sistemas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Please calm down. I'm sure there is a diplomatic solution for our "
"misunderstanding.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por favor, cálmese. Estoy seguro de que hay una solución diplomática para "
"nuestro malentendido.\""

msgid ""
"The Dvaered officer replies \"We can see that your ship is stuffed with "
"sensors. Your intentions are obvious. Prepare for your ship to be boarded.\""
msgstr ""
"El oficial Dvaered responde \"Podemos ver que su nave está llena de "
"sensores. Sus intenciones son obvias. Prepárese para que su nave sea "
"abordada.\""

msgid ""
"Dr. Mensing  pauses, apparently choosing her words with care.\n"
"\"Fine, do whatever you want. Our reasoning is obviously beyond the "
"imagination of your degenerate intellect.\""
msgstr ""
"La Dra. Mensing hace una pausa, aparentemente eligiendo sus palabras con "
"cuidado.\n"
"\"Bien, hagan lo que quieran. Nuestro razonamiento está obviamente más allá "
"de la imaginación de su degenerado intelecto.\""

msgid ""
"With this answer the comm shuts off. Your sensors show that a Dvaered patrol "
"changed their course and is heading straight towards the transporter."
msgstr ""
"Con esta respuesta el comunicador se apaga. Tus sensores muestran que una "
"patrulla Dvaered ha cambiado su rumbo y se dirige directamente hacia el "
"transportador."

msgid ""
"\"The situation would have escalated anyway.\" argues Dr. Mensing, this time "
"directly speaking to you."
msgstr ""
"\"La situación se habría agravado de todos modos\", argumenta el Dr. "
"Mensing, esta vez dirigiéndose directamente a tí."

msgid ""
"\"I must admit, it is suspicious for a refitted transport ship with such "
"advanced sensor suites to show up in Dvaered space. I hadn't considered this "
"point.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Debo admitir que es sospechoso que una nave de transporte reacondicionada, "
"con conjuntos de sensores tan avanzados, aparezca en el espacio Dvaered. No "
"había considerado este punto.\""

msgid "\"I'm counting on you, {player}. Please help us.\""
msgstr "\"Cuento contigo, {player}. Por favor, ayúdanos.\""

#. Handle the destruction of the transporter. Abort the mission.
msgid "The transport was destroyed!"
msgstr "¡El transporte fue destruido!"

msgid ""
"The transport was destroyed and all scientists died! Even worse, you failed "
"science!"
msgstr ""
"¡El transporte fue destruido y todos los científicos murieron! Peor aún, "
"¡fallaste a la ciencia!"

