#. <campaign>Nebula Research</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Mission: Shielding Prototype Funding
#.
#. Description: The player has to help acquiring funds for the shielding prototype. This is going to be hilariously complicated.
#.
#. Difficulty: Easy to Medium
#.
#. --
#. Mission constants
#.
#. Stages
#. 0: mission start
#. 1: first land on Jurai done
#. 2: jumped in and hostile drones spawned
#. 3: landed on Jurai and head towards Ruadan
#. 4: can't land message
#. 5: landed and on Ruadan Terminal the way to Excelcior
#. 6: (second ambush, can be skipped )
#. 7: landed on Excelcior, on way back
#. --
#. Spaceport bar stuff
#. Orangish
msgid "Dr. Mensing"
msgstr "Dr. Mensing"

msgid "It appears she wants to talk with you."
msgstr "Parece que quiere hablar contigo."

msgid ""
"\"Well met, {player}! In fact, it's a lucky coincidence that we meet. You "
"see, I'm in dire need of your service.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Buenos días, {player}! De hecho, es una afortunada coincidencia que nos "
"encontremos. Verás, estoy en extrema necesidad de tu servicio.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm here on a... conference of sorts, not a real one. We are obligated to "
"present the newest results of our research to scientists of the Empire once "
"per period - even though these jokers lack the skills to understand our "
"work! It's just a pointless ritual anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estoy aquí en una especie de... conferencia, no en una real. Estamos "
"obligados a presentar los resultados más recientes de nuestras "
"investigaciones a los científicos del Imperio una vez por período - ¡aunque "
"estos bromistas carecen de las habilidades para entender nuestro trabajo! De "
"todos modos, es un ritual sin sentido.\""

msgid ""
"\"But I just got an ingenious idea on how to prevent the volatile Sol nebula "
"from disrupting ship shields! I will spare you with the details - to ensure "
"my idea is not going to be stolen, nothing personal. You can never be sure "
"who is listening.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Pero acabo de tener una idea ingeniosa sobre cómo evitar que la volátil "
"nebulosa de Sol interrumpa los escudos de las naves! Te ahorraré los "
"detalles, para asegurarme de que mi idea no vaya a ser robada, nada "
"personal. Nunca se puede estar seguro de quién está escuchando.\""

msgid ""
"\"Anyway, you have to take me back to my lab on {pnt} in the {sys} system "
"immediately! I'd also pay {credits} if necessary.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, ¡tienes que llevarme a mi laboratorio en {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys} inmediatamente! También te pagaré {credits} si es necesario.\""

msgid ""
"\"Splendid! I'd like to start with my work as soon as possible.\n"
"But before I forget, there's some issue...\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Espléndido! Me gustaría empezar con mi trabajo lo antes posible.\n"
"Pero antes de que se me olvide, hay un asunto...\""

msgid ""
"\"You see, I'm not allowed to leave officially. Therefore I'd rather let "
"them think that I was kidnapped. I'm sure it'll be fine! But don't let an "
"Empire ship scan your ship! I don't know how they would react finding me "
"onboard of your ship. Try to be stealthy and once we're in Za'lek territory "
"there will be no problem.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Verás, no se me permite salir oficialmente. Por lo tanto, prefiero dejar "
"que piensen que fui secuestrado. ¡Estoy seguro de que estará bien! ¡Pero no "
"dejes que una nave del Imperio escanee tu nave! No sé cómo reaccionarían al "
"encontrarme a bordo de tu nave. Intenta ser sigiloso y una vez que estemos "
"en territorio Za'lek no habrá problemas.\""

msgid "Take her to {sys}"
msgstr "Llévala a {sys}"

msgid "Leave her"
msgstr "Déjala"

msgid ""
"That sounds too risky for you. You'll probably end up dead or in prison."
msgstr ""
"Eso suena demasiado arriesgado para ti. Probablemente terminarás muerto o en "
"prisión."

#. Set up mission information
msgid "Emergency of Immediate Inspiration"
msgstr "Inspiración Inmediata de Emergencia"

msgid "Take Dr. Mensing to {pnt} in the {sys} system as fast as possible!"
msgstr ""
"¡Lleva al Dr. Mensing a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} lo más rápido posible!"

msgid ""
"You need to bring Dr. Mensing to her destination but the Empire will assume "
"you have kidnapped her if they scan you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Tienes que llevar a la Dra. Mensing a su destino pero el Imperio asumirá "
"que la has secuestrado si te escanean!"

msgid ""
"\"Finally! I can't await getting started. Before I forget -\" She hands you "
"a credit chip worth {credits}."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Por fin! No puedo esperar a empezar. Antes de que se me olvide...\" Te "
"entrega una ficha de crédito por valor de {credits}."

msgid ""
"\"There's actually another thing I've almost forgotten. I also have to "
"attend another conference very soon on behalf of professor Voges who "
"obviously is very busy with some project he would not tell me about. But I "
"don't want to go there - my research is far too important! So could you "
"instead bring Robert there? You remember the student you helped out "
"recently? I'm sure he will do the presentation just fine! I'll tell him to "
"meet you in the bar as soon as possible!\""
msgstr ""
"\"En realidad hay otra cosa que casi he olvidado. También tengo que asistir "
"a otra conferencia muy pronto en nombre del profesor Voges, que obviamente "
"está muy ocupado con algún proyecto del que no me quiere hablar. Pero no "
"quiero ir allí, ¡mi investigación es demasiado importante! Entonces, "
"¿podrías llevar a Robert? ¿Recuerdas al estudiante al que ayudaste hace "
"poco? Estoy seguro de que hará la presentación sin problemas. ¡Le diré que "
"se reúna contigo en el bar lo antes posible!\""

msgid ""
"With that being said, Dr. Mensing leaves you immediately without waiting for "
"your answer. It appears you should head to the bar to meet up with the "
"student."
msgstr ""
"Dicho esto, el Dr. Mensing te deja inmediatamente sin esperar tu respuesta. "
"Parece que debes dirigirte al bar para reunirte con el estudiante."

msgid "You brought Dr. Mensing back from a Empire scientific conference."
msgstr "Has traído al Dr. Mensing de una conferencia científica del Imperio."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="The Substitute Speaker">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <done>Emergency of Immediate Inspiration</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Jorla</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Nebula Research</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Mission: The Substitute Speaker
#.
#. Description: The player has to impersonate a scientist and give a scientific talk.
#.
#. Difficulty: Easy
#.
#. --
#. Mission constants
#. Forward-declared functions
#. mission variables
#. Spaceport bar stuff
msgid "Robert"
msgstr "Robert"

msgid "The student is already awaiting you."
msgstr "El estudiante ya te está esperando."

msgid ""
"You join the student and explain to him that Dr. Mensing actually hasn't "
"told you what you are supposed to do."
msgstr ""
"Te reúnes con el estudiante y le explicas que el Dr. Mensing en realidad no "
"te ha dicho lo que debes hacer."

msgid ""
"\"Ah, right. There is a conference on {pnt} in the {sys} system soon. "
"Actually she is supposed to be the substitute for professor Voges. He's been "
"absent for weeks by now. No one knows what he is doing on Ruadan. Anyway, "
"back to topic. You have to bring me there as ersatz-substitution for Dr. "
"Mensing as she got seriously ill. But you already know that as you brought "
"her here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, cierto. Hay una conferencia sobre {pnt} en el sistema {sys} pronto. En "
"realidad se supone que ella es la sustituta del profesor Voges. Lleva "
"semanas ausente. Nadie sabe qué está haciendo en Ruadan. De todos modos, "
"volviendo al tema. Tienes que llevarme allí como sustituto de la Dra. "
"Mensing, ya que está gravemente enferma. Pero eso ya lo sabes, ya que la "
"trajiste aquíe\""

msgid ""
"You tell him that she looked perfectly fine and said she wants to conduct "
"her research instead of going to the conference."
msgstr ""
"Le dices que se veía perfectamente bien y que quiere realizar su "
"investigación en lugar de ir a la conferencia."

msgid ""
"\"WHAT?? It was MY idea initially! She just wants to kick me out! I bet she "
"thinks she could just pull it off entirely without me and be the only "
"author! No way she could ever achieve that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿QUÉ? ¡Al principio fue mi idea! ¡Ella sólo quiere echarme! ¡Apuesto a que "
"piensa que podría llevarlo a cabo por completo sin mí y ser la única autora! "
"No hay manera de que ella pueda lograr eso!\""

msgid ""
"\"{player}, you have to go to the conference instead! What do you mean you "
"don't know anything about science? How about this, I just give you my "
"presentation and while you're on the way I type the exact speech I'd recite "
"during my talk and send it to you. Just recite it on my behalf and it'll go "
"fine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{player}, ¡tienes que ir a la conferencia en su lugar! ¿Cómo que no sabes "
"nada de ciencia? Qué te parece esto, te doy mi presentación y mientras estás "
"de camino tecleo el discurso exacto que recitaría durante mi charla y te lo "
"envío. Sólo tienes que recitarlo en mi nombre y todo irá bien.\""

msgid ""
"\"No time for discussions, sorry. While we're talking Dr. Mensing is trying "
"to get an advantage! I have no time to lose!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No hay tiempo para discusiones, lo siento. ¡Mientras hablamos el Dr. "
"Mensing está tratando de obtener una ventaja! ¡No tengo tiempo que perder!\""

msgid ""
"He stands up and searches his pockets for something.\n"
"\"Here, the presentation,\" he says and hands you a small data chip. He "
"further adds, \"And don't be too late!\" before rushing out of the bar in a "
"hurry."
msgstr ""
"Se levanta y busca algo en sus bolsillos.\n"
"\"Toma, la presentación\", dice y te entrega un pequeña ficha de datos. "
"Además, añade: \"¡Y no llegues tarde!\" antes de salir corriendo del bar a "
"toda prisa."

msgid "Wait a minute, you haven't agreed to accept the mission!"
msgstr "Espera un momento, ¡no has aceptado la misión!"

#. Set up mission information
msgid "The Substitute Speaker"
msgstr "El Portavoz Suplente"

msgid "a reputation as scientist (?)"
msgstr "una reputación como científico (?)"

msgid ""
"Fly to {pnt} in the {sys} system before {time} and give a scientific talk."
msgstr ""
"Vuela a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} antes de {time} y da una charla científica."

#. 100STU per tick
#. set OSD
msgid ""
"You arrived at {pnt} on time. There is even some time left to prepare your "
"talk. During the flight, you glanced at the presentation on the data chip, "
"but you haven't managed to figure out the meaning of it. How is this "
"supposed to work out??"
msgstr ""
"Has llegado a {pnt} a tiempo. Incluso te queda algo de tiempo para preparar "
"tu charla. Durante el vuelo, has echado un vistazo a la presentación en el "
"chip de datos, pero no has conseguido descifrar su significado. ¿Cómo se "
"supone que esto va a funcionar?"

msgid ""
"Your thoughts are interrupted by an incoming message from the student.\n"
"\"As promised I'm sending you the speech you have to recite. I hope you "
"appreciate the time I wasted on typing that out. I hadn't considered that "
"you'll have to answer questions after the talk, though. Do what every good "
"scientist does and just talk about some random stuff that sounds like it may "
"be related to the question. I'm sure you'll do it just fine. Good luck!\""
msgstr ""
"Tus pensamientos son interrumpidos por un mensaje entrante del alumno.\n"
"\"Como te prometí, te envío el discurso que tienes que recitar. Espero que "
"aprecies el tiempo que he perdido en escribirlo. Sin embargo, no había "
"considerado que tendrás que responder a preguntas después de la charla. Haz "
"lo que todo buen científico hace y habla de cosas al azar que parezcan estar "
"relacionadas con la pregunta. Estoy seguro de que lo harás bien. ¡Buena "
"suerte!\""

msgid ""
"This message is followed by what you assume is the speech you have to recite."
msgstr ""
"A este mensaje le sigue lo que supones que es el discurso que tienes que "
"recitar."

msgid "You wonder what to do."
msgstr "Te preguntas qué hacer."

msgid "Explore the spaceport"
msgstr "Explora el puerto espacial"

msgid "Take off immediately"
msgstr "Despega Inmediatamente"

msgid "Start learning your speech"
msgstr "Empieza a aprender tu discurso"

msgid "Buy a lab coat"
msgstr "Compra una bata de laboratorio"

msgid "Visit the electronics store"
msgstr "Visite la tienda de electrónica"

msgid "Go to the institute"
msgstr "Ve al instituto"

msgid ""
"This is too much! You better leave before doing anything embarrassing or "
"humiliating."
msgstr ""
"¡Esto es demasiado! Será mejor que te vayas antes de hacer algo vergonzoso o "
"humillante."

msgid ""
"You decide to learn your speech rather than simply reciting the text. It "
"turned out to be the right decision because you haven't ever seen most of "
"those words."
msgstr ""
"Decides aprender tu discurso en lugar de simplemente recitar el texto. "
"Resultó ser la decisión correcta porque no has visto nunca la mayoría de "
"esas palabras."

msgid "You return to your ship."
msgstr "Vuelves a tu nave."

msgid ""
"You decide to explore the spaceport. There are a couple of shops here which "
"may sell something useful for your mission."
msgstr ""
"Decides explorar el puerto espacial. Aquí hay un par de tiendas que pueden "
"vender algo útil para tu misión."

msgid ""
"You enter a shop that sells only lab coats. The assortment of lab coats is "
"impressive: lab coats of all colours, different materials, and cuts. There "
"are distinct sections for casual and working lab coats. Whatever the "
"difference is, it is too subtle for you to grasp. You settle on a "
"\"business\" lab coat because something formal is probably suitable for your "
"talk. The price tag reads {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Entras en una tienda que sólo vende batas de laboratorio. El surtido de "
"batas de laboratorio es impresionante: batas de laboratorio de todos los "
"colores, diferentes materiales y cortes. Hay secciones distintas para batas "
"de laboratorio informales y de trabajo. Cualquiera que sea la diferencia, es "
"demasiado sutil para que la entiendas. Te decides por una bata de "
"laboratorio \"de negocios\" porque probablemente algo formal sea adecuado "
"para tu charla. La etiqueta del precio dice {credits}."

msgid ""
"Apparently this is too expensive for you. Looks like you have to give your "
"talk without a lab coat. Is there anything else you want to do?"
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente esto es demasiado caro para ti. Parece que tienes que dar tu "
"charla sin bata de laboratorio. ¿Hay algo más que quieras hacer?"

msgid "Buy the lab coat"
msgstr "Comprar la bata de laboratorio"

msgid "Don't buy the lab coat"
msgstr "No compres la bata de laboratorio"

msgid ""
"You buy the lab coat and put it on. You almost feel like a real scientist. "
"Is there anything else you want to do?"
msgstr ""
"Te compras la bata de laboratorio y te la pones. Casi te sientes como un "
"verdadero científico. ¿Hay algo más que quieras hacer?"

msgid ""
"While walking through a store selling electronics, you notice a pair of "
"glasses with integrated displays. You could use them to display the text you "
"are supposed to recite. They are rather expensive though, {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Mientras caminas por una tienda de productos electrónicos, te fijas en unas "
"gafas con pantallas integradas. Podrías utilizarlas para visualizar el texto "
"que debes recitar. Sin embargo, son bastante caras, {credits}."

msgid ""
"Apparently this is too expensive for you. Is there anything else you want to "
"do?"
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente esto es demasiado caro para ti. ¿Hay algo más que quieras "
"hacer?"

msgid ""
"Apparently this is too expensive for you. Maybe you should start learning "
"your text?"
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente esto es demasiado caro para ti. ¿Tal vez deberías empezar a "
"aprender tu texto?"

msgid "Buy the glasses"
msgstr "Compra las gafas"

msgid "Don't buy the glasses"
msgstr "No compres las gafas"

msgid "They will surely come in handy. Is there anything else you want to do?"
msgstr "Seguro que te serán útiles. ¿Hay algo más que quieras hacer?"

msgid "It's time to go to the institute."
msgstr "Es hora de ir al instituto."

msgid "Wearing a lab coat, you blend in nicely with your audience."
msgstr "Llevando una bata de laboratorio, te mezclas muy bien con tu público."

msgid ""
"It is just now that you realize that you're the only person not wearing a "
"lab coat. This is a nightmare! Well, maybe it would be for a scientist?"
msgstr ""
"Es ahora cuando te das cuenta de que eres la única persona que no lleva bata "
"de laboratorio. ¡Esto es una pesadilla! Bueno, ¿tal vez lo sea para un "
"científico?"

msgid ""
"You start reciting the speech you got from the student. It turned out "
"learning your text was the right choice. Some of the occurring terms are "
"difficult to pronounce correctly."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a recitar el discurso que te ha dado el alumno. Resulta que "
"aprender el texto era la opción correcta. Algunos de los términos que "
"aparecen son difíciles de pronunciar correctamente."

msgid ""
"You start reciting the speech you got from the student. With the text being "
"displayed on your glasses you don't have to look down on a paper to read the "
"text, but some of the occurring terms are difficult to pronounce correctly."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a recitar el discurso que has recibido del alumno. Con el texto que "
"se muestra en tus gafas no tienes que mirar hacia abajo en un papel para "
"leer el texto, pero algunos de los términos que aparecen son difíciles de "
"pronunciar correctamente."

msgid ""
"You start reciting the speech you got from the student. You realize that you "
"should have learned the text as some of the occurring terms are difficult to "
"pronounce correctly."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a recitar el discurso que te ha dado el alumno. Te das cuenta de "
"que deberías haberte aprendido el texto, ya que algunos de los términos que "
"aparecen son difíciles de pronunciar correctamente."

msgid ""
"You make your way to the institute where you are supposed to give the talk, "
"following the signs. On arriving you ask around where you should head to for "
"your talk. Apparently you were already awaited. You are led to a rather "
"small seminar room. Finally, you are ready to give your talk and a few "
"scientists take seats. Actually you expected more than 17 listeners. Maybe "
"this talk is not such a big deal as you expected. They wouldn't just send "
"you to an important presentation, right?"
msgstr ""
"Te diriges al instituto donde debes dar la charla, siguiendo las señales. Al "
"llegar, preguntas dónde debes dirigirte para dar tu charla. Al parecer, ya "
"te esperaban. Te conducen a una sala de seminarios bastante pequeña. Por fin "
"estás preparado para dar tu charla y unos cuantos científicos toman asiento. "
"En realidad, esperabas más de 17 oyentes. Quizá esta charla no sea tan "
"importante como esperabas. No te enviarían sin más a una presentación "
"importante, ¿verdad?"

msgid ""
"You finish with your text and sigh in relief. After a brief applause, "
"someone raises his hand. Apparently, he wants to ask a question. What should "
"you do?\n"
"You haven't understood the question, not even a single word."
msgstr ""
"Terminas con tu texto y suspiras aliviado. Tras un breve aplauso, alguien "
"levanta la mano. Al parecer, quiere hacer una pregunta. ¿Qué debes hacer?\n"
"No has entendido la pregunta, ni una sola palabra."

msgid "This is a good question."
msgstr "Esta es una buena pregunta."

msgid "It's an open question."
msgstr "Es una pregunta pendiente."

msgid ""
"You try to avoid the question. The scientist seems to be upset. There are no "
"further questions. Apparently, there is another talk that starts very soon "
"so people hurry off. You manage to leave without gaining much attention and "
"return to your ship. Enough science for today!"
msgstr ""
"Intenta evitar la pregunta. El científico parece estar molesto. No hay más "
"preguntas. Al parecer, hay otra charla que comienza muy pronto, así que la "
"gente se apresura a marcharse. Consigues salir sin llamar mucho la atención "
"y vuelves a tu nave. ¡Suficiente ciencia por hoy!"

msgid ""
"You decide to run towards the closest door and leave the building as fast as "
"possible. You continue running until you reach the spaceport and enter your "
"ship. You can't be the first one running from a talk, right?"
msgstr ""
"Decides correr hacia la puerta más cercana y salir del edificio lo más "
"rápido posible. Sigues corriendo hasta llegar al puerto espacial y entrar en "
"tu nave. No puedes ser el primero en huir de una charla, ¿verdad?"

msgid ""
"You gave a scientific talk on {pnt}. Did anyone notice you're not a "
"scientist?"
msgstr ""
"Has dado una charla científica sobre {pnt}. ¿Alguien se ha dado cuenta de "
"que no eres un científico?"

#. Date hook
#. Case missed second deadline
msgid "You were too late. You're never going to be a great scientist!"
msgstr "Llegaste demasiado tarde. ¡Nunca serás un gran científico!"

msgid ""
"She probably has a new poorly-paid job for you. Maybe she won't notice you "
"if you leave now."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente tenga un nuevo trabajo mal pagado para ti. Tal vez no te note "
"si te vas ahora."

msgid ""
"\"It appears we keep running into each other, {player}. You may be happy to "
"hear that I finished my theoretical work on the nebula resistant shielding "
"technique. Of course I can't provide you a shielding system; we scientists "
"usually don't bother with engineering. However, in this case, I'd actually "
"like to build a prototype shielding device. The prospect of exploring the "
"Sol system is far too tempting.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que seguimos encontrándonos, {player}. Te alegrará saber que he "
"terminado mi trabajo teórico sobre la técnica de escudo resistente a la "
"nebulosa. Por supuesto, no puedo proporcionarte un sistema de blindaje; los "
"científicos no solemos preocuparnos por la ingeniería. Sin embargo, en este "
"caso, me gustaría construir un prototipo de dispositivo de blindaje. La "
"perspectiva de explorar el sistema Sol es demasiado tentadora.\""

msgid ""
"\"This is were you come into play. I need a few capable engineers and some "
"expensive hardware; my budget is too small though. This is why I have to "
"acquire additional funding. Your task will be to chauffeur me around. "
"Apparently it is sometimes required to show up in person. So annoying...\""
msgstr ""
"\"Aquí es donde tú entras en juego. Necesito unos cuantos ingenieros capaces "
"y un hardware caro; pero mi presupuesto es demasiado pequeño. Por eso tengo "
"que conseguir financiación adicional. Tu tarea consistirá en llevarme de un "
"lado a otro. Al parecer, a veces es necesario presentarse en persona. Tan "
"molesto...\""

msgid "\"Too bad. Maybe you will change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"Qué pena. Tal vez cambies de opinión.\""

msgid "\"Great! Our first destination is {pnt} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr "\"¡Genial! Nuestro primer destino es {pnt} en el sistema {sys}.\""

#. Set up mission information
msgid "Shielding Prototype Funding"
msgstr "Financiación de Prototipo de Escudos"

msgid "Help Dr. Mensing to get funding to construct a shielding prototype."
msgstr ""
"Ayuda al Dr. Mensing a conseguir financiación para construir un prototipo de "
"escudo."

msgid ""
"After landing on {cur_pnt}, Dr. Mensing tells you to wait until she returns. "
"\"Not more than a couple of periods.\" she said; in fact you had to wait for "
"only two periods until she returned. She comes back looking defeated."
msgstr ""
"Después de aterrizar en {cur_pnt}, la Dra. Mensing te dice que esperes hasta "
"que vuelva. \"No más de un par de periodos\", dice; de hecho, sólo hay que "
"esperar dos periodos hasta que ella vuelva. Vuelve con aspecto de estar "
"derrotada."

msgid ""
"\"This is the first time that one of my applications was rejected. That's "
"weird. I got positive feedback at first. It makes no sense that my "
"application was rejected at the last minute. I guess things like this "
"happen. Let's just go to {pnt} in the {sys} system next and try again.\""
msgstr ""
"\" Esta es la primera vez que se rechaza una de mis solicitudes. Es raro. Al "
"principio recibí una respuesta positiva. No tiene sentido que mi solicitud "
"haya sido rechazada en el último momento. Supongo que estas cosas pasan. "
"Vamos a ir a {pnt} en el sistema de {sys} a continuación y a intentarlo de "
"nuevo.\""

msgid ""
"\"Alright, I'm sure it will work out this time!\", Dr. Mensing said on "
"arriving on {cur_pnt}."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Muy bien, estoy seguro de que esta vez funcionará!\", dijo el Dr. Mensing "
"al llegar a {cur_pnt}."

msgid ""
"This time you have to wait even longer for her to return. The result is the "
"same as her first try."
msgstr ""
"Esta vez tienes que esperar aún más para que vuelva. El resultado es el "
"mismo que su primer intento."

msgid ""
"\"I don't get it. My presentation is flawless and my proposal is exciting. "
"Why wouldn't they grant me additional funds? I tell you, something is wrong "
"here! Hmm... Time to change tactics. I have to speak with Professor Voges "
"himself but he is currently on {pnt} in the {sys} system and just ignores "
"us. I guess we have to go there to speak with him face-to-face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No lo entiendo. Mi presentación es impecable y mi propuesta es "
"apasionante. ¿Por qué no me conceden fondos adicionales? Te digo, ¡algo está "
"mal aquí! Hmm... Es hora de cambiar de táctica. Tengo que hablar con el "
"profesor Voges en persona, pero en este momento está en {pnt} en el sistema "
"{sys} y simplemente nos ignora. Supongo que tenemos que ir allí para hablar "
"con él cara a cara.\""

msgid ""
"\"Good news! I asked around and found a way to contact Professor Voges. He "
"promised to show up to one of his colleague's parties. Something about his "
"wife, like they have gotten married, or she died, or something. Anyway, I "
"managed to get invited there as well. So let's go to {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Buenas noticias! He preguntado y he encontrado la forma de contactar con "
"el profesor Voges. Prometió aparecer en una de las fiestas de sus colegas. "
"Algo sobre su mujer, como que se han casado, o que ha muerto, o algo así. De "
"todos modos, me las arreglé para ser invitado allí también.¡ Así que vamos a "
"{pnt} en el sistema {sys}!\""

msgid "The two of you arrive at the location of the party."
msgstr "Los dos llegáis al lugar de la fiesta."

msgid ""
"\"Listen, this is probably your first party, so let me briefly explain to "
"you how it works. Your goal, usually, is to talk with all people, draw some "
"attention, let them know you attended the party. Efficiency is most "
"important here. The earlier you're done with demonstrating your presence and "
"making a good impression; the earlier you can leave and do something useful."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Escucha, probablemente sea tu primera fiesta, así que déjame explicarte "
"brevemente cómo funciona. Tu objetivo, por lo general, es hablar con toda la "
"gente, llamar la atención, que sepan que has asistido a la fiesta. Aquí lo "
"más importante es la eficacia. Cuanto antes termines de demostrar tu "
"presencia y causar una buena impresión, antes podrás marcharte y hacer algo "
"útil.\""

msgid ""
"\"You'll need an escape strategy to leave unnoticed though; It's gauche if "
"someone sees you leaving early. As you're a beginner, I'll give you a tip: "
"sneak out the window of the bathroom on the ground floor. No one will be "
"able to see you from inside the house if you climb over the fence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sin embargo, necesitarás una estrategia de escape para salir sin que te "
"vean; es una descortesía que alguien te vea salir pronto. Como eres "
"principiante, te daré un consejo: escápate por la ventana del baño de la "
"planta baja. Nadie podrá verte desde dentro de la casa si trepas por la "
"verja.\""

msgid ""
"You wonder if Dr. Mensing meant any of that seriously. Before you can ask, "
"Dr. Mensing runs off, engaging an older looking man, probably Professor "
"Voges. She does not waste any time and brings the issue straight on, visibly "
"discomforting him. It's time to explore the party."
msgstr ""
"Te preguntas si el Dr. Mensing hablaba en serio. Antes de que puedas "
"preguntar, la Dra. Mensing sale corriendo y se dirige a un hombre de aspecto "
"mayor, probablemente el profesor Voges. No pierde el tiempo y aborda el tema "
"directamente, incomodándolo visiblemente. Es hora de explorar la fiesta."

msgid ""
"You expect a Za'lek party to be much different from a regular party. In "
"fact, the first two things you notice are the classical music and the "
"absence of any alcoholic drinks. There is, however, a buffet. In particular, "
"there is a small fridge with ice cream. You spot a fair amount of people "
"eating ice cream. Is this the Za'lek equivalent of beer?"
msgstr ""
"Uno espera que una fiesta Za'lek sea muy diferente a una fiesta normal. De "
"hecho, las dos primeras cosas que notas son la música clásica y la ausencia "
"de bebidas alcohólicas. Sin embargo, hay un buffet. En concreto, hay una "
"pequeña nevera con helados. Ves a un buen número de personas comiendo "
"helado. ¿Es el equivalente de la cerveza en Za'lek?"

msgid ""
"Before you know it, you've engaged in a conversation with one of the "
"scientists; He saw you enter with Dr. Mensing, which motivates him to ask "
"the question of the hour… whether you and her are dating. In an attempt to "
"clear his misgivings about the situation you tell him that she hired you. "
"Hopefully he believes you…"
msgstr ""
"Antes de que te des cuenta, has entablado una conversación con uno de los "
"científicos; te ha visto entrar con la Dra. Mensing, lo que le motiva a "
"hacer la pregunta del momento... si tú y ella estáis saliendo. En un intento "
"de despejar sus dudas sobre la situación le dices que ella te contrató. Con "
"suerte te cree…"

msgid ""
"You continue your tour. As you come close to one of the windows from the "
"corner of your eye you see something fall outside, followed by a dull thump. "
"Looking out of the window you see a figure dressed in a lab coat trying to "
"stand up slowly. You're about to open the window and ask if he needs help, "
"but he notices you and gestures to be silent as he hobbles off. These Za'lek "
"are indeed trying to escape the party."
msgstr ""
"Continúas tu recorrido. Cuando te acercas a una de las ventanas, ves por el "
"rabillo del ojo que algo cae fuera, seguido de un golpe sordo. Al mirar por "
"la ventana ves una figura vestida con una bata de laboratorio que intenta "
"levantarse lentamente. Estás a punto de abrir la ventana y preguntarle si "
"necesita ayuda, pero se da cuenta de tu presencia y te hace un gesto de "
"silencio mientras se aleja cojeando. Efectivamente, estos Za'lek están "
"tratando de escapar de la fiesta."

msgid ""
"\"At least the ice cream is great!\" you think as you take another bite. "
"Suddenly someone grabs your arm."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Al menos el helado está muy bueno!\", piensas mientras das otro bocado. "
"De repente, alguien te agarra del brazo."

msgid ""
"\"We're done here. Bring me back to {pnt}!\" Dr. Mensing quietly tells you."
msgstr ""
"\"Hemos terminado aquí. Tráeme de vuelta a {pnt}\" El Dr. Mensing te dice en "
"voz baja."

msgid ""
"For a moment you wonder what she is doing as she drags you towards the "
"bathroom; finally you remember what she said about her 'escape strategy'. "
"She mentioned that you are supposed to leave the building through the window "
"of the bathroom."
msgstr ""
"Por un momento te preguntas qué está haciendo mientras te arrastra hacia el "
"baño; finalmente recuerdas lo que dijo sobre su \"estrategia de escape\". Ha "
"dicho que se supone que tienes que salir del edificio por la ventana del "
"baño."

msgid ""
"\"That took long enough! I'm glad Professor Voges promised to take care of "
"the funding. The problem was that my recent research is related to a secret "
"project and my funding was shut down - like some kind of conspiracy; can you "
"believe it! Actually I'm not supposed to tell you anything as you could "
"possibly get into a lot of trouble.. forget I said anything! I have much "
"work to do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Hemos tardado bastante! Me alegro de que el profesor Voges haya prometido "
"ocuparse de la financiación. El problema fue que mi reciente investigación "
"está relacionada con un proyecto secreto y me cerraron la financiación, como "
"una especie de conspiración; ¡puedes creerlo! En realidad, se supone que no "
"debo decirte nada, ya que podrías meterte en muchos problemas... ¡Olvídate "
"de lo que he dicho! Tengo mucho trabajo que hacer.\""

msgid "She gives you a credit chip worth {credits} and leaves."
msgstr "Te da una ficha de crédito por valor de {credits} y se va."

msgid ""
"You helped Dr. Mensing to acquire funding for a shielding prototype that "
"will enable to explore the Sol nebula."
msgstr ""
"Ayudas al Dr. Mensing a conseguir financiación para un prototipo de escudo "
"que permitirá explorar la nebulosa de Sol."

#. Just go towards the player position and attack if they are around
msgid "Caution!"
msgstr "¡Precaución!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You receive a system-wide broadcast. It appears to be a warning. \"Caution! "
"A drone squadron in the {sys} system went haywire! Proceed with care.\"\n"
"   Why is this happening so frequently in Za'lek space? A second glance at "
"your radar shows that a drone squadron is flying right towards your ship."
msgstr ""
"Recibes una emisión en todo el sistema. Parece ser una advertencia. "
"\"¡Precaución! ¡Un escuadrón de drones en el sistema {sys} se ha vuelto "
"loco! Proceda con cuidado\".\n"
"    ¿Por qué ocurre esto con tanta frecuencia en el espacio Za'lek? Un "
"segundo vistazo a tu radar muestra que un escuadrón de drones está volando "
"justo hacia tu nave."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The now familiar warning appears once again on your ship's screen. "
"\"Caution! A drone squadron in the {sys} system went haywire! Proceed with "
"care.\"\n"
"   Just how often is this going to happen?"
msgstr ""
"La ya conocida advertencia aparece de nuevo en la pantalla de tu nave. "
"\"¡Precaución! ¡Un escuadrón de drones en el sistema {sys} se ha vuelto "
"loco! Proceda con cuidado.\"\n"
"    ¿Con qué frecuencia va a ocurrir esto?"

#. Just go towards the player position and attack if they are around
msgid ""
"Apparently, you are not allowed to land on {cur_pnt} and explaining the "
"situation was futile. Dr. Mensing enters the cockpit asking why you aren't "
"landing."
msgstr ""
"Al parecer, no estáis autorizados a aterrizar en {cur_pnt} y explicar la "
"situación fue fútil. El Dr. Mensing entra en la cabina preguntando por qué "
"no aterrizas."

msgid "\"We're not allowed to? Let me try to talk with them.\""
msgstr "\"¿No se nos permite? Déjame intentar hablar con ellos.\""

msgid "After a heated discussion Dr. Mensing gives up."
msgstr "Tras una acalorada discusión, el Dr. Mensing se rinde."

msgid ""
"\"Right, they won't allow anyone to land on {cur_pnt}. That's so "
"frustrating. Let's land on {pnt} instead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cierto, no permiten que nadie aterrice en {cur_pnt}. Eso es muy "
"frustrante. Aterricemos en {pnt} en tu lugar.\""

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Expert Nebula Research">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <done>Shielding Prototype Funding</done>
#. <chance>30</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <cond>
#. if system.get("Regas"):jumpDist() &gt; 3 then
#. return false
#. end
#. return true
#. </cond>
#. <tags>
#. <tag>zlk_cap_ch01_med</tag>
#. </tags>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Nebula Research</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Mission: Expert Nebula Research
#.
#. Description: The nebula shielding prototype is ready and the player has to test it. The first stages go well, but in the final stage the prototype fails and the player is about to die in the Sol nebula. He gets rescued by an Empire carrier instead and is bought back into Empire space.
#.
#. Difficulty: Easy (requires at least a corvette class ship)
#.
#. --
#. Forward-declared functions
#. Mission constants
#. Give the player a Nebular Shielding Prototype only if they have none.
#. Set up mission information
msgid "Expert Nebula Research"
msgstr "Investigación de Nebulosa Experta"

msgid ""
"She looks happy. Maybe the work on the shielding prototype has finished?"
msgstr ""
"Parece feliz. ¿Tal vez el trabajo en el prototipo de escudo haya sido "
"terminado?"

msgid "Fly to the {sys} system and carry out the testing procedure"
msgstr "Vuela al sistema {sys} y realiza el procedimiento de prueba"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"{player}? Great timing! I need someone insane… eh… I meant brave enough to "
"test the nebula resistant shielding prototype in a realistic testing "
"environment. And there is no better place for these tests than the Sol "
"nebula itself!\""
msgstr ""
"¿\"{player}? ¡Grandioso momento! Necesito a alguien loco… eh… Quiero decir "
"lo suficientemente valiente como para probar el prototipo de escudo "
"resistente a la nebulosa en un entorno de pruebas realista. ¡Y no hay mejor "
"lugar para estas pruebas que la propia nebulosa de Sol!\""

msgid ""
"\"No no, it's absolutely safe! We ran some basic tests on the device in a "
"simulation chamber and tested it on a ship in space. It works absolutely "
"fine so far. The next step is to actually test it within the Sol nebula "
"itself. This is your chance to make history! Are you ready?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡No, no, es absolutamente seguro! Hemos hecho algunas pruebas básicas con "
"el dispositivo en una cámara de simulación y lo hemos probado en una nave en "
"el espacio. Hasta ahora funciona absolutamente bien. El siguiente paso es "
"probarlo en la propia nebulosa de Sol. Esta es tu oportunidad de hacer "
"historia. ¿Estás preparado?\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Too bad. I hope you will change your mind. Otherwise, some other pilot "
"will take the chance to make history.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Qué pena. Espero que cambies de opinión. Si no, algún otro piloto "
"aprovechará la oportunidad de hacer historia.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad to hear that you're in. First of all, - since our motto is "
"\"safety first\"… Wait, why are you rolling your eyes? Anyway, since your "
"current ship is very small, it's not a good idea to send you into the Sol "
"nebula. Please return with a larger ship. I'd say at least a Corvette class "
"ship. It will increase your chances to survive. Just in case, you know? I "
"don't actually expect that something goes wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegra saber que estás dentro. En primer lugar, ya que nuestro lema es "
"\"la seguridad ante todo\"... Espera, ¿por qué pones los ojos en blanco? De "
"todos modos, como tu nave actual es muy pequeña, no es buena idea enviarte a "
"la nebulosa de Sol. Por favor, vuelve con una nave más grande. Yo diría que "
"al menos una nave clase Corbeta. Aumentará tus posibilidades de sobrevivir. "
"Sólo por si acaso, ¿sabes? En realidad no espero que algo vaya mal.\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm glad to hear that you're in. First of all, - since our motto is "
"\"safety first\"… Wait, why are you rolling your eyes? Anyway, you'll "
"require at least a corvette class ship or preferably something larger and "
"please equip some additional shield boosters and shield capacitors. Just in "
"case there is a problem with the prototype.\""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"My team will bring the shielding prototype onboard your ship. Don't forget "
"to install it before departing! Your first destination will be {pnt} in the "
"{sys} system. Robert will be waiting there since he demanded to be involved "
"in this project.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi equipo traerá el prototipo de escudo a bordo de tu nave. No olvides "
"instalarlo antes de partir. Tu primer destino será {pnt} en el sistema "
"{sys}. Robert estará esperando allí, ya que exigió participar en este "
"proyecto.\""

msgid ""
"\"Please pick him up and head towards the {sys} system, but don't jump into "
"the {sol} system itself! We have no idea what could possibly happen. Also, I "
"wouldn't let any ship go that far without extensive testing of the prototype."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Por favor, recógelo y dirígete al sistema {sys}, pero no saltes al propio "
"sistema {sol}! No tenemos ni idea de lo que podría pasar. Además, yo no "
"dejaría que ninguna nave llegara tan lejos sin probar exhaustivamente el "
"prototipo.\""

msgid "Test the shielding prototype by flying into the Sol nebula."
msgstr "Pruebe el prototipo de escudo volando hacia la nebulosa de Sol."

msgid ""
"Shortly after landing you are greeted by the student.\n"
"\"That took long enough! Being stuck in a place like this… It's always us "
"students who have to do all the hard work!"
msgstr ""
"Poco después de aterrizar te saluda el estudiante.\n"
"\"¡Has tardado bastante! Estar atrapado en un lugar como este… ¡Siempre "
"somos los estudiantes los que tenemos que hacer todo el trabajo duro!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, I'm done here with my measurements. Since the shielding prototype "
"requires fine-tuning of some parameters these measurements are essential. I "
"just need a few minutes to configure the device. We can start anytime soon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"De todos modos, ya he terminado con mis mediciones. Como el prototipo de "
"escudo requiere un ajuste fino de algunos parámetros, estas mediciones son "
"esenciales. Sólo necesito unos minutos para configurar el dispositivo. "
"Podemos empezar en cualquier momento.\""

msgid "\"You did remember to install the shielding prototype, right?\""
msgstr "\"Te acordaste de instalar el prototipo de escudo, ¿verdad?\""

msgid ""
"\"I'm glad we're back and still in one piece. We were lucky to be saved like "
"this and I don't like depending on luck. I still have no idea what went "
"wrong, but I'll continue investigating. Even though the data I collected "
"makes just no sense to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de que hayamos vuelto y sigamos de una pieza. Tuvimos suerte de "
"salvarnos de esta forma y no me gusta depender de la suerte. Todavía no "
"tengo idea de lo que salió mal, pero seguiré investigando. Aunque los datos "
"que recogí no tienen ningún sentido para mí.\""

msgid ""
"Dr. Mensing rushes towards you.\n"
"\"Are you fine? I heard there were complications. What happened?\""
msgstr ""
"El Dr. Mensing se precipita hacia ti.\n"
"\" ¿Te encuentras bien? He oído que ha habido complicaciones. ¿Qué ha pasado?"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"We're fine but it was too close. The prototype suddenly stopped working "
"for no apparent reason, as far as I can tell. Everything appeared to be fine!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estamos bien, pero estuvo muy cerca. El prototipo dejó de funcionar de "
"repente sin razón aparente, por lo que puedo decir. ¡Todo parecía estar bien!"
"\""

msgid ""
"\"In that case the principles that our design is based on may be flawed. I'm "
"sorry, it's all my fault. I should have been more careful when checking "
"Robert's calculations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"En ese caso, los principios en los que se basa nuestro diseño pueden ser "
"defectuosos. Lo siento, todo es culpa mía. Debería haber tenido más cuidado "
"al comprobar los cálculos de Robert.\""

msgid "\"What, now it's my fault?! After you tried to steal all my ideas?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué, ahora es mi culpa? ¿Después de que intentaras robar todas mis ideas?"
"\""

msgid "Clear your throat."
msgstr "Aclara tu garganta."

msgid "Sigh."
msgstr "Suspira."

msgid "Ask about the payment."
msgstr "Pregunte por el pago."

msgid ""
"\"Ah right, let's postpone the scientific issues for a moment. You have "
"earned a reward for all the trouble.\"\n"
"With this she hands you a credit chip worth {credits}."
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, bien, pospongamos las cuestiones científicas por un momento. Te has "
"ganado una recompensa por todas las molestias.\"\n"
"Con esto te entrega una ficha de crédito por valor de {credits}."

msgid ""
"The two of them continue arguing shortly afterwards. You decide it is better "
"to leave now."
msgstr ""
"Los dos siguen discutiendo poco después. Tú decides que es mejor marcharse "
"ahora."

msgid ""
"You helped Dr. Mensing to test the nebula resistant shielding prototype by "
"flying deep into the Sol nebula. However, the prototype failed and you "
"almost died due to the volatility of the nebula. It is a major setback for "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste al Dr. Mensing a probar el prototipo de escudo resistente a las "
"nebulosas volando en las profundidades de la nebulosa de Sol. Sin embargo, "
"el prototipo falló y casi mueres debido a la volatilidad de la nebulosa. Es "
"un revés importante para el proyecto."

msgid ""
"The last time you were out here with the student you almost died due to his "
"tinkering with your ship's electronics and now you're doing something even "
"more dangerous. Was it really a good idea to accept this mission?"
msgstr ""
"La última vez que estuviste aquí con el estudiante casi moriste por culpa de "
"sus retoques en la electrónica de tu nave y ahora estás haciendo algo aún "
"más peligroso. ¿Fue realmente una buena idea aceptar esta misión?"

msgid ""
"\"Alright, let's go to the {sys} system. I'm going to monitor the prototype "
"to make sure everything is right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Muy bien, vamos al sistema {sys}. Voy a monitorizar el prototipo para "
"asegurarme de que todo está bien.\""

#. TODO: nag player if they somehow ditch the prototype after the above scene has played out?
#. Go back a stage
msgid "Fly to the checkpoint in the {sys} system"
msgstr "Vuela al punto de control en el sistema {sys}"

msgid "Checkpoint"
msgstr "Punto de Control"

msgid ""
"You arrived in the {sys} system and the student signals you that everything "
"works as expected."
msgstr ""
"Has llegado al sistema {sys} y el alumno te indica que todo funciona como se "
"espera."

msgid ""
"\"To proceed, please fly towards the checkpoint that I just marked on your "
"map. Afterwards we'll return to the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Para proceder, por favor vuela hacia el punto de control que acabo de "
"marcar en tu mapa. Después volveremos al sistema {sys}.\""

msgid "Wait…"
msgstr "Espera…"

msgid "Ghost Ship"
msgstr "Nave Fantasma"

#. ghost:follow(player.pilot())
msgid "Survive"
msgstr "Sobrevive"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Looking out of the window you see blurry shapes moving past your ship "
"vaguely resembling spaceships of unfamiliar design. Your sensors show "
"nothing out there, though. Maybe you started to imagine things that do not "
"exist. You wonder if you have spent too much time inside the nebula. Or "
"maybe the rumours about ghost ships are true after all…"
msgstr ""
"Al mirar por la ventana, ves formas borrosas que pasan junto a tu nave y que "
"se parecen vagamente a naves espaciales de diseño desconocido. Sin embargo, "
"tus sensores no muestran nada ahí fuera. Quizás has empezado a imaginar "
"cosas que no existen. Te preguntas si has pasado demasiado tiempo dentro de "
"la nebulosa. O tal vez los rumores sobre las naves fantasma sean ciertos "
"después de todo…"

msgid ""
"Suddenly, without a warning, your shield energy begins to drop at a rapid "
"pace. The shielding prototype must be broken! You hope it is just a "
"temporary problem and ask Robert what the problem is. His reply is simply "
"\"Busy!\""
msgstr ""
"De repente, sin previo aviso, la energía de tu escudo empieza a caer a gran "
"velocidad. ¡El prototipo de escudo debe estar roto! Esperas que sea sólo un "
"problema temporal y le preguntas a Robert cuál es el problema. Su respuesta "
"es simplemente \"¡Ocupado!\""

msgid "Retreat to {sys}"
msgstr "Retirada a {sys}"

msgid "Talk to Robert"
msgstr "Habla con Robert"

msgid ""
"You set course back to the jump point, even though you know that you won't "
"make it back. Your shields will be depleted before arriving."
msgstr ""
"Pones rumbo al punto de salto, aunque sabes que no conseguirás volver. Tus "
"escudos se agotarán antes de llegar."

msgid ""
"The rate at which your shields are drained is nearly constant so that you "
"can easily determine how much time is left until your death. Apparently, you "
"won't be able to reach the jump point. It's not even close."
msgstr ""
"El ritmo de drenaje de tus escudos es casi constante, por lo que puedes "
"determinar fácilmente cuánto tiempo queda hasta tu muerte. Aparentemente, no "
"podrás alcanzar el punto de salto. Ni siquiera está cerca."

msgid ""
"Even with the strong shields your Za'lek ship offers, the decay of the "
"shield energy is too fast to make it. It must be a side effect of the broken "
"shielding prototype."
msgstr ""
"Incluso con los fuertes escudos que ofrece tu nave Za'lek, el decaimiento de "
"la energía del escudo es demasiado rápido para lograrlo. Debe ser un efecto "
"secundario del prototipo de escudo averiado."

msgid ""
"Maybe you could make it with one of those Za'lek ships. Too bad you don't "
"have one!"
msgstr ""
"Tal vez podrías hacerlo con una de esas naves Za'lek. ¡Lástima que no tengas "
"una!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You ran out of ideas. Meanwhile, Robert's only reply was \"I'm still working "
"on it.\" Maybe, there is in fact no way to survive this?"
msgstr ""
"Te quedaste sin ideas. Mientras tanto, la única respuesta de Robert fue "
"\"Todavía estoy trabajando en ello\". ¿Quizás, de hecho no hay manera de "
"sobrevivir a esto?"

msgid ""
"You walk to the section in the cargo hold in a hurry where a control "
"terminal for the shielding prototype has been installed. On arriving you "
"find Robert hastily typing on a keyboard. He mutters some unfamiliar words "
"to himself that you identify as Za'lek curses even without prior knowledge."
msgstr ""
"Te diriges apresuradamente a la sección de la bodega de carga donde se ha "
"instalado un terminal de control para el prototipo de escudo. Al llegar "
"encuentras a Robert escribiendo apresuradamente en un teclado. Murmura "
"algunas palabras desconocidas para sí mismo que identificas como maldiciones "
"Za'lek incluso sin conocimiento previo."

msgid "Clear your throat"
msgstr "Aclara tu garganta"

msgid "Ask what the problem is"
msgstr "Pregunta cuál es el problema"

msgid "Lose your nerves"
msgstr "Pierde tus nervios"

msgid ""
"\"Oh, captain we have a few problems… It's the… Well, I'm not sure. To be "
"honest, I have no idea what happened. I guess we won't make it. There is no "
"reason to give up though, at least for me, but you may want to start praying "
"or whatever you non-scientists do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, capitán tenemos algunos problemas… Es el… Bueno, no estoy seguro. Para "
"ser honesto, no tengo idea de lo que pasó. Supongo que no lo lograremos. Sin "
"embargo, no hay razón para rendirse, al menos por mí, pero tal vez quieras "
"empezar a rezar o lo que sea que hagan los no científicos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Ah… Well, the problem is… uh… Well, I guess you're right. Please calm "
"down. Panic won't help us right now. At least I will continue to working on "
"the problem. You may want to start praying or whatever you non-scientists do."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah… Bueno, el problema es… uh… Bueno, supongo que tienes razón. Por favor, "
"cálmate. El pánico no nos ayudará en este momento. Al menos yo seguiré "
"trabajando en el problema. Puede que quieras empezar a rezar o lo que sea "
"que hagáis los no científicos.\""

msgid ""
"You return to the cockpit and set course back to the jump point even though "
"you know that you won't make it back. Your shields will be depleted before "
"arriving."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a la cabina y pones rumbo de vuelta al punto de salto aunque sabes "
"que no llegarás. Tus escudos se agotarán antes de llegar."

msgid ""
"Staring out of the window, you see the shadows swirling around your ship. "
"They became numerous by now, but you do not know how many there are. They "
"just vanish as fast as they appear out of nowhere. \"It's no surprise that "
"so many pilots are afraid of those ghost stories\" you think, but you have "
"no reason to fear them. You know it is the nebula that will destroy your "
"ship."
msgstr ""
"Mirando por la ventana, ves las sombras que se arremolinan alrededor de tu "
"nave. Ya son numerosas, pero no sabes cuántas hay. Desaparecen tan rápido "
"como aparecen de la nada. \"No es de extrañar que tantos pilotos tengan "
"miedo de esas historias de fantasmas\" piensas, pero no tienes ninguna razón "
"para temerlas. Sabes que es la nebulosa la que destruirá tu nave."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eventually all the shadows disappear one by one without reappearing "
"elsewhere again. You're afraid that they left you alone to die here. Your "
"shields are almost depleted when suddenly a large dark spot appears in front "
"of your ship, slowly growing in size. You realize that your ship's sensors "
"have recognized the ominous object."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, todas las sombras desaparecen una a una sin volver a aparecer en "
"otro lugar. Temes que te hayan dejado solo para morir aquí. Tus escudos "
"están casi agotados cuando de repente aparece una gran mancha oscura delante "
"de tu nave, que va creciendo lentamente. Te das cuenta de que los sensores "
"de tu nave han reconocido el ominoso objeto."

#. Just have it go to the player's position
#. peacemaker:follow(player.pilot())
#. peacemaker:hailPlayer()
msgid ""
"An empire Peacemaker emerged! The ship approaches slowly towards your "
"direction, as if they knew exactly your current position. Finally, you "
"receive a message from the Peacemaker. They command you to dock with their "
"ship so that their shields can protect your ship on the way back to the "
"{sys} system."
msgstr ""
"¡Un Mediador del Imperio surgió! La nave se acerca lentamente hacia tu "
"dirección, como si supiera exactamente tu posición actual. Finalmente, "
"recibes un mensaje del Mediador. Te ordenan que te acoples a su nave para "
"que sus escudos puedan proteger tu nave en el camino de vuelta al sistema "
"{sys}."

msgid "You have no time to lose!"
msgstr "¡No tienes tiempo que perder!"

#. Don't let the player jump out or mission breaks
msgid ""
"After docking to the Peacemaker its captain invited you on her ship. It "
"turned out that she is as curious about your rescue as you are. "
"Unfortunately, you are not able to answer any of her questions "
"satisfactorily."
msgstr ""
"Tras atracar en el Mediador su capitán te invita a subir a su nave. Resulta "
"que tiene tanta curiosidad por tu rescate como tú. Por desgracia, no eres "
"capaz de responder satisfactoriamente a ninguna de sus preguntas."

msgid ""
"She tells you that her crew received a distress signal and followed it to "
"your position. With the heavy interference of the nebula this should be "
"impossible, or at least extremely unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Te dice que su tripulación recibió una señal de socorro y la siguió hasta tu "
"posición. Con la fuerte interferencia de la nebulosa esto debería ser "
"imposible, o al menos extremadamente improbable."

msgid ""
"\"It is nearly impossible that a signal passes through the nebula out here. "
"So either there's something you're hiding or you had incredible luck. And "
"just what were you doing out there? I saw those Za'lek doing even more "
"ridiculous stuff, though.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ask for the logs related to the distress signal"
msgstr "Pides los registros relacionados con la señal de socorro"

msgid "Apologize"
msgstr "Discúlpate"

msgid ""
"You ask the captain for the sensor logs regarding the distress signal. At "
"first she refuses your request. While she ultimately declines to hand you "
"out the logs she allows you to at least take a look on them. You don't see "
"anything remarkable except the time stamp. The distress signal was received "
"shortly after you jumped into the {sys} system!"
msgstr ""
"Pides al capitán los registros de los sensores relativos a la señal de "
"socorro. Al principio se niega a hacerlo. Finalmente se niega a entregarte "
"los registros, pero te permite al menos echarle un vistazo. No ves nada "
"destacable, excepto la marca de tiempo. ¡La señal de socorro se recibió poco "
"después de que saltaras al sistema {sys}!"

msgid ""
"While that explains how the Empire ship reached you in time it raises "
"several new questions."
msgstr ""
"Aunque eso explica cómo la nave del Imperio llegó a tiempo, plantea varias "
"preguntas nuevas."

msgid ""
"\"Seeing anything interesting?\"\n"
"You decide that it's better not to tell her about your finding."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Ves algo interesante?\"\n"
"Decides que es mejor no contarle tu hallazgo."

msgid ""
"\"Well, it's part of my job to help out civilians. But please don't do "
"anything suicidal during my shift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Bueno, es parte de mi trabajo ayudar a los civiles. Pero, por favor, no "
"hagas nada suicida durante mi turno.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While she was just joking, you can't help but realize how lucky you were."
msgstr ""
"Aunque sólo estaba bromeando, no puedes evitar darte cuenta de la suerte que "
"has tenido."

msgid ""
"\"You may leave now, civilian. But be aware that we'll keep an eye on you.\""
msgstr "\"Puede irse ahora, civil. Pero tenga en cuenta que te vigilaremos.\""

msgid ""
"An officer leads you back onto your ship. Your journey to {sys} is "
"uneventful and you are ordered to depart after arriving."
msgstr ""
"Un oficial te conduce de vuelta a tu nave. Tu viaje a {sys} se desarrolla "
"sin incidentes y se te ordena partir después de llegar."

msgid ""
"You see a Za'lek scientist who seems to be looking for someone to do "
"something for them."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un científico Za'lek que parece estar buscando o alguien que haga algo "
"por ellos."

msgid ""
"You approach the Za'lek scientist who seems to be a bit relieved with your "
"presence."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas al científico Za'lek que parece estar un poco aliviado con tu "
"presencia."

msgid ""
"\"You wouldn't happen to be a pilot? I was supposed to get on a shuttle to "
"{pnt}, but they refused to take my equipment with me. Can you believe the "
"audacity?!\"\n"
"\"Would you be able to take me and {amount} of equipment to {pnt} in the "
"{sys} system? I will pay you {credits}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por casualidad no serás piloto? Se suponía que iba a subir a un "
"transbordador a {pnt}, pero se negaron a llevar mi equipo. ¿Puedes creer la "
"audacia?\"\n"
"\"¿Serías capaz de llevarme a mí y a la {amount} de equipo a {pnt} en el "
"sistema {sys}? Te pagaré {credits}.\""

msgid ""
"\"You too? How am I going to make it to {pnt}…\"\n"
"She furrows her brow."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Tú también? ¿Cómo voy a llegar a {pnt}...?\"\n"
"Ella frunce el ceño."

msgid ""
"\"You only have {freespace} of free cargo space. My equipment is "
"{neededspace}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Sólo tienes {freespace} de espacio de carga libre. ¡Mi equipo es "
"{neededspace}!\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! I'm supposed to start my residency at {pnt} soon for some particle "
"physics testing. They have a state-of-the-art testing facility there that "
"can perform all kinds of mind-boggling experiments. It's wild.\"\n"
"She pauses for a moment.\n"
"\"I forgot to introduce myself didn't I. I am Dr. Sanderaite, but everyone "
"calls me Noona.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! Se supone que pronto comenzaré mi residencia en {pnt} para "
"realizar algunas pruebas de física de partículas. Allí tienen una "
"instalación de pruebas de última generación que puede realizar todo tipo de "
"experimentos alucinantes. Es una locura.\"\n"
"Hace una pausa por un momento.\n"
"\"Me olvidé de presentarme, ¿no? Soy la Dra. Sanderaite, pero todos me "
"llaman Noona.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh my equipment? Don't worry about it. It's nothing dangerous, and it is "
"properly stored in radiation shielding. We just have to make sure it doesn't "
"overheat and we should be fine.\"\n"
"That doesn't sound very reassuring.\n"
"\"Anyway, onwards to {pnt}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Mi equipo? No te preocupes por él. No es nada peligroso, y está "
"debidamente guardado en un escudo contra la radiación. Sólo tenemos que "
"asegurarnos de que no se sobrecaliente y deberíamos estar bien.\"\n"
"Eso no suena muy tranquilizador.\n"
"\"De todos modos, ¡adelante a {pnt}!\""

msgid ""
"Automated drones at the space docks load up the particle physics equipment "
"and Noona gets on your ship."
msgstr ""
"Los drones automatizados de los muelles espaciales cargan el equipo de "
"física de partículas y Noona se sube a tu nave."

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
msgid "Noona and Equipment"
msgstr "Noona y su Equipamiento"

msgid "Za'lek scientist Noona and some particle physics-related equipment."
msgstr ""
"La científica Za'lek Noona y algunos equipos relacionados con la física de "
"partículas."

#. mission details
#. Must be accepted beyond this point
#. mission details
msgid "Particle Physics"
msgstr "Física de Partículas"

msgid "Take Noona and some equipment to {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Lleva a Noona y algunos equipos a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

msgid "Drop off Noona and the equipment at {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Deja a Noona y el equipo en {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

msgid ""
"Your ship touches down at the smaller-than-expected research centre and a "
"single loading drone begins to slowly unload your ship. Talk about "
"understaffed."
msgstr ""
"Tu nave aterriza en el centro de investigación, más pequeño de lo esperado, "
"y un único dron de carga comienza a descargar lentamente tu nave. Hablando "
"de falta de personal."

msgid ""
"Her eyes seem to be sparkling.\n"
"\"This… is… awesome! Did you see the testing site from the ship? I thought I "
"saw a flash! Maybe it was a Dirac-Bosemann supersymmetry feedback flare. "
"I've never seen one of those in person yet!\"\n"
"As she keeps on babbling she sort of wanders off into the base, and you make "
"no attempt to follow her."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos parecen brillar.\n"
"\"¡Esto... es... impresionante! ¿Viste el lugar de las pruebas desde la "
"nave? ¡Me pareció ver un destello! Quizás fue una llamarada de "
"retroalimentación de supersimetría Dirac-Bosemann. Nunca he visto uno de "
"esos en persona.\"\n"
"Mientras sigue parloteando, se aleja hacia la base y tú no intentas seguirla."

msgid ""
"You head back to your ship and wonder how you should get in touch with her "
"for your payment, when you notice a small letter with a credstick that she "
"seems to have left in your ship. It reads \"Please see your attached "
"payment. I may have more need of your services, please find me later. -n\". "
"She must have anticipated her overexcitement. You wonder if this happens a "
"lot."
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a tu nave y te preguntas cómo deberías ponerte en contacto con ella "
"para recibir tu pago, cuando te das cuenta de una pequeña carta con un "
"credencial que parece haber dejado en tu nave. Dice: \"Por favor, vea su "
"pago adjunto. Puede que necesite más de sus servicios, por favor, búsqueme "
"más tarde. -n\". Debe haber anticipado su sobreexcitación. Te preguntas si "
"esto ocurre a menudo."

msgid ""
"You helped deliver Noona and her equipment to {pnt}. It seems like she may "
"still have more work for you."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a entregar a Noona y su equipo a {pnt}. Parece que aún tiene más "
"trabajo para ti."

