#. Fullname: Noona Sanderaite
msgid "Noona"
msgstr "Noona"

msgid "You approach Noona, who seems to have a slight frown on her face."
msgstr "Te acercas a Noona, que parece tener el ceño ligeramente fruncido."

msgid ""
"\"It seems I overestimated the facilities here. I was hoping they would have "
"the XR-578 drone controller interfaces, but it seems like they are still on "
"XR-321. I found a colleague who can provide me with them, but I need someone "
"to go pick them up.\"\n"
"\"Would you be so kind to go to {pnt} in the {sys} system and bring {amount} "
"of drone interface controllers? I should be able to make it worth your time "
"with {credits}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que he sobrestimado las instalaciones aquí. Esperaba que tuvieran "
"las interfaces del controlador de drones XR-578, pero parece que todavía "
"están en el XR-321. He encontrado un colega que puede proporcionármelas, "
"pero necesito que alguien vaya a recogerlas\".\n"
"\"¿Serías tan amable de ir a {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y traer {amount} de "
"controladores de interfaz de drones? Debería poder hacer valer tu tiempo con "
"{credits}.\""

msgid ""
"\"I see. I'll have to figure out some way to get it over here…\"\n"
"She furrows her brow."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Tendré que buscar alguna forma de traerlo aquí...\"\n"
"Arruga la frente."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Thanks! Once I get the interface up and working, I should be able to start "
"my particle physics experiments. I'm so excited. While you're gone, I guess "
"I'll double-check all my code just to calm down. It's going to be great!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias! Una vez que tenga la interfaz en funcionamiento, podré empezar "
"mis experimentos de física de partículas. Estoy muy emocionada. Mientras te "
"vas, creo que voy a revisar todo mi código para calmarme. ¡Va a ser genial!\""

msgid ""
"Pick up some {cargo} from {pnt} in the {sys} system and deliver them to "
"{retpnt}."
msgstr ""
"Recoge {cargo} de {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y haz la entrega en {retpnt}."

msgid "Deliver to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Entrega a {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

msgid "Noona's Colleague"
msgstr "Colega de Noona"

msgid ""
"You see a Za'lek scientist who seems to fit the description of Noona's "
"colleague."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un científico Za'lek que parece encajar con la descripción del colega "
"de Noona."

msgid ""
"You land and the lone loading drone starts to slowly remove the cargo from "
"your ship. While waiting, you decide to look for Noona, who you quickly find "
"staring at the testing site at the observation deck of the base."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y el único dron de carga comienza a retirar lentamente la carga de "
"tu nave. Mientras esperas, decides buscar a Noona, a quien rápidamente "
"encuentras mirando el lugar de las pruebas en la plataforma de observación "
"de la base."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Look at it! Isn't it breathtaking?\"\n"
"She motions towards the testing site.\n"
"\"To think of all the brains that went into designing and preparing for "
"this. All the famous experiments run on that platform. The advancement of "
"humanity as a whole! What new technological wonders are waiting for us on "
"the other side of the particle physics conundrums?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Mira! ¿No es impresionante?\"\n"
"Señala hacia el lugar de las pruebas.\n"
"\"Pensar en todos los cerebros que se dedicaron a diseñar y preparar esto. "
"Todos los famosos experimentos realizados en esa plataforma. El avance de la "
"humanidad en su conjunto. ¿Qué nuevas maravillas tecnológicas nos esperan al "
"otro lado de los enigmas de la física de partículas?\""

msgid ""
"She breathes deeply and turns to you.\n"
"\"Did you get the interface controllers? That's great! Let me try to get "
"them hooked up and I'll finally be able to start my tests. I'm so excited!"
"\"\n"
"She starts to prance off, when she suddenly turns to you and tosses you a "
"credstick.\n"
"\"Almost forgot. See you around!\""
msgstr ""
"Respira profundamente y se vuelve hacia ti.\n"
"\"¿Conseguiste los controladores de la interfaz? ¡Qué bien! Deja que intente "
"conectarlos y por fin podré empezar mis pruebas. ¡Estoy muy emocionada!\"\n"
"Empieza a hacer cabriolas, cuando de repente se vuelve hacia ti y te lanza "
"un usb de créditos.\n"
"\"Casi lo olvido. ¡Nos vemos!\""

msgid ""
"You brought some drone interface controllers to Noona so that she can begin "
"her particle physics experiments."
msgstr ""
"Has traído algunos controladores de interfaz de drones a Noona para que "
"pueda empezar sus experimentos de física de partículas."

msgid "\"Ready to try again? Let me activate the memory interface for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Listo para intentarlo de nuevo? Déjame activar la interfaz de memoria "
"para tí\""

msgid ""
"You approach an individual that matches the contact information that Noona "
"gave you."
msgstr ""
"Te acercas a un individuo que coincide con la información de contacto que te "
"dio Noona."

msgid ""
"They raise an eyebrow as you approach.\n"
"\"You must be Dr. Sanderaite's acquaintance. I have the drone interface "
"controllers ready, but there was kind of a mishap and they're stuck now.\"\n"
"They scratch their head."
msgstr ""
"Levanta una ceja cuando te acercas.\n"
"\" Tú debes ser el conocido del Dr. Sanderaite. Tengo listos los "
"controladores de la interfaz de los drones, pero hubo una especie de "
"percance y ahora están atascados.\"\n"
"Se rascan la cabeza."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I tried to look at it myself, but wasn't able to figure out a damn thing, "
"and since my post-doc eloped to Rulk'ar, I don't have anyone to deal with "
"this sort of inconvenience. If you could give it a shot and get it apart, "
"you should be able to take the controllers with you. All you have to do is "
"align the memory by pushing the data boxes into data sockets. Please take a "
"shot at it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Intenté echarle un vistazo, pero no fui capaz de averiguar nada, y desde "
"que mi postdoc se fugó a Rulk'ar, no tengo a nadie que se ocupe de este tipo "
"de inconvenientes. Si pudieras echarle un vistazo y desmontarlo, deberías "
"poder llevarte los controladores. Todo lo que tienes que hacer es alinear la "
"memoria empujando las cajas de datos en los zócalos de datos. Por favor, "
"inténtalo.\""

msgid "Drone Memory Banks"
msgstr "Bancos de Memoria Dron"

msgid ""
"\"It seems like the interface hasn't been unlocked. Talk to me if you want "
"to try again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Parece que la interfaz no ha sido desbloqueada. Habla conmigo si quieres "
"volver a intentarlo.\""

msgid ""
"After you unlock the memory, they are able to quickly release the interface "
"controller which falls to the ground with a resounding clunk.\n"
"\"OK, that's perfect! Let me get the loading drones to get this on your ship "
"and you can be on your way.\""
msgstr ""
"Después de desbloquear la memoria, son capaces de liberar rápidamente el "
"controlador de la interfaz que cae al suelo con un sonoro clonk.\n"
"\"¡Bien, eso es perfecto! Déjenme traer los drones de carga para poner esto "
"en tu nave y podrás seguir tu camino.\""

msgid "\"Are you ready to take the cargo now?\""
msgstr "\"¿Estás preparado para tomar la carga ahora?\""

msgid "The automated dock drones load the {amount} of {cargo} onto your ship."
msgstr ""
"Los drones del muelle automatizado cargan {amount} de {cargo} en tu nave."

#. Failed to do the Sokoban
msgid "Drone Interface Controllers"
msgstr "Controladores de Interfaz de Drones"

msgid ""
"Special adapters that are able to connect modern drone controllers with "
"older drone connectors."
msgstr ""
"Adaptadores especiales capaces de conectar controladores de drones modernos "
"con conectores de drones antiguos."

msgid "You approach Noona, who doesn't seem too happy."
msgstr "Te acercas a Noona, que no parece muy contenta."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"I have no idea what went wrong.\"\n"
"She has trouble keeping her composure.\n"
"\"I double-checked everything and still it seems like the drones failed to "
"perform the procedure. It should have been a walk in the park!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No tengo ni idea de lo que ha salido mal.\"\n"
"Le cuesta mantener la compostura.\n"
"\"He comprobado todo dos veces y aún así parece que los drones no han "
"realizado el procedimiento. ¡Debería haber sido un paseo por el parque!\""

msgid ""
"She looks at you with hope gleaming in her eyes.\n"
"\"Say, could you fly out and see what happened? The drones shouldn't be far "
"from here and they don't seem to be moving. If you can, try to access the "
"black box by opening the hull component. Could you look into this for me?\""
msgstr ""
"Te mira con la esperanza brillando en sus ojos.\n"
"\"Oye, ¿podrías volar y ver qué ha pasado? Los drones no deben estar lejos "
"de aquí y no parecen moverse. Si puedes, intenta acceder a la caja negra "
"abriendo el componente del casco. ¿Podrías investigar esto por mí?\""

msgid ""
"\"I see. You must be busy with other things.\"\n"
"She goes back to ruminating on what to do."
msgstr ""
"\"Ya veo. Debes estar ocupado con otras cosas.\"\n"
"Vuelve a rumiar qué hacer."

msgid ""
"\"Thanks again. I'll give you the security password so you can access the "
"black box control panel. Depending on the damage, you may have to realign "
"the memory to be able to retrieve the data, but I heard that you mastered "
"that from my colleague. I've sent you the coordinates for the drones so you "
"should be able to easily find them. Best of luck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias de nuevo. Te daré la contraseña de seguridad para que puedas "
"acceder al panel de control de la caja negra. Dependiendo de los daños, es "
"posible que tengas que reajustar la memoria para poder recuperar los datos, "
"pero me he enterado de que dominas eso por mi colega. Te he enviado las "
"coordenadas de los drones para que puedas encontrarlos fácilmente. ¡Mucha "
"suerte!\""

msgid ""
"Investigate the issue with the drones near the particle physics testing site "
"at {sys}."
msgstr ""
"Investiga el asunto de los drones cerca del centro de pruebas de física de "
"partículas en {sys}."

msgid "Investigate the drones"
msgstr "Investiga los drones"

msgid "Return to Katar I"
msgstr "Vuelve a Katar I"

msgid "You land and find Noona waiting outside your ship expectantly."
msgstr "Aterrizas y encuentras a Noona esperando fuera de tu nave expectante."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"That was scary! I have no idea what happened with the drone powering up "
"and attacking you. I'm glad I sent you, I would have been fried with my "
"flying skills, even if I still had my flying licence. You got the black box "
"in one piece, right? Great! Let me look into it and see what happened.\"\n"
"She tosses you a credstick and runs to her room with the black box."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Eso fue aterrador! No tengo ni idea de lo que pasó con el dron que se "
"encendió y te atacó. Me alegro de haberte enviado, me habría quedado frito "
"con mis habilidades de pilotaje, aunque todavía tuviera mi licencia de "
"vuelo. Tienes la caja negra de una pieza, ¿verdad? Genial. Déjame investigar "
"y ver qué ha pasado.\"\n"
"Te lanza un usb de créditos y corre a su habitación con la caja negra."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Just before she disappears around the corner she turns back to you and "
"yells.\n"
"\"Oh, and by the way, I was able to pull some strings with my friend and you "
"should be cleared for the Heavy Weapon Licence now. Seeing the dangers you "
"face, it would be good for you to have bigger guns.\"\n"
"Without giving you time to process what she yelled, she vanishes."
msgstr ""
"Justo antes de que desaparezca por la esquina, se vuelve hacia ti y te "
"grita.\n"
"\"Ah, y por cierto, he podido mover algunos hilos con mi amigo y ya deberías "
"estar autorizado para la Licencia de Armas Pesadas. Viendo los peligros a "
"los que te enfrentas, sería bueno que tuvieras armas más grandes.\"\n"
"Sin darte tiempo a procesar lo que ha gritado, desaparece."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You helped Noona retrieve the black box from one of her drones that "
"malfunctioned. You're not exactly sure how, but she also managed to get you "
"cleared for the Heavy Weapon Licence."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a Noona a recuperar la caja negra de uno de sus drones que funcionó "
"mal. No estás muy seguro de cómo, pero también consiguió que te dieran la "
"Licencia de Armas Pesadas."

msgid ""
"You helped Noona retrieve the black box from one of her drones that "
"malfunctioned."
msgstr ""
"Has ayudado a Noona a recuperar la caja negra de uno de sus drones que ha "
"funcionado mal."

#. Spawn the drones
#. TODO better location once testing centre object is created
#. Disabled drone
#. Hostile drone
msgid "Malfunctioned Drone"
msgstr "Drone Defectuoso"

msgid "I've sent you the drone positions, please get close to investigate."
msgstr ""
"Te he enviado las posiciones de los drones, por favor acércate a investigar."

msgid ""
"That is weird, maybe a firmware bug? Wait… I'm detecting a power fluctuation!"
msgstr ""
"Eso es raro, ¿tal vez un bug en el firmware? Espera... ¡Estoy detectando una "
"fluctuación de energía!"

msgctxt "Noona"
msgid "Watch out!"
msgstr "¡Cuidado!"

msgid "Haywire Drone"
msgstr "Dron Averiado"

msgid "That was close. Can you try boarding the other drone?"
msgstr "Eso estuvo cerca. ¿Puedes intentar abordar el otro dron?"

msgid "The drone's black box has already been extracted."
msgstr "La caja negra del dron ya ha sido extraída."

msgid "You access the drone control panel and jack into the black box."
msgstr "Accedes al panel de control del dron y te conectas a la caja negra."

msgid "Drone Black Box"
msgstr "Caja Negra de Dron"

msgid ""
"You manage to recover the entire black box intact and load the information "
"on your ship."
msgstr ""
"Consigues recuperar la caja negra intacta y cargar la información en tu nave."

msgid "You failed to access the black box."
msgstr "No has podido acceder a la caja negra."

msgid "The recovered black box of a Za'lek drone."
msgstr "La caja negra recuperada de un dron Za'lek."

#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Za'lek Particle Physics 4">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>4</priority>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <spob>Katar I</spob>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <done>Za'lek Particle Physics 3</done>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Za'lek Particle Physics</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#. Za'lek Particle Physics 04
#.
#. Player has to go get some stuff from artefact hunters and gets attacked on way back
#.
#.
msgid "strange container"
msgstr "contenedor extraño"

msgid "You once again meet up with Noona."
msgstr "Vuelves a encontrarte con Noona."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"It's a worse setback than expected. I'm going to have to get new materials "
"to be able to do the experiments. Since they're usually pretty hard to get, "
"and I don't have time to fill in all the usual academic bureaucracy, I "
"decided to go the black market route. Would you be willing to go pick up the "
"materials at {pnt} in the {sys} system? The materials should only be "
"{amount}, so you should not have trouble fitting them on your ship. I would "
"be able to pay you {credits} for your troubles this time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Es un contratiempo peor de lo esperado. Voy a tener que conseguir nuevos "
"materiales para poder hacer los experimentos. Como suelen ser bastante "
"difíciles de conseguir, y no tengo tiempo para rellenar toda la burocracia "
"académica habitual, he decidido recurrir al mercado negro. ¿Estarías "
"dispuesto a ir a recoger los materiales a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}? Los "
"materiales sólo deberían ser {amount}, por lo que no deberías tener "
"problemas para instalarlos en tu nave. Podría pagarte {credits} por tus "
"problemas esta vez.\""

msgid ""
"\"OK. I'll try to figure something out…\"\n"
"She furrows her brow."
msgstr ""
"\"De acuerdo. Intentaré pensar en algo...\"\n"
"Frunce el ceño."

msgid ""
"\"Thanks again! I know {pnt} is not really a place you want to go, but there "
"really was no option this time around. By the time you get back I should "
"have finished all the other preparations and this time I'll finally be able "
"to complete the experiment!… I hope.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias de nuevo! Sé que {pnt} no es realmente un lugar al que quieres "
"ir, pero realmente no había opción esta vez. Para cuando vuelvas debería "
"haber terminado todos los demás preparativos y esta vez por fin podré "
"completar el experimento... espero.\""

msgid ""
"Pick up some cargo from {pnt} in the {sys} system and deliver them to "
"{retpnt}."
msgstr ""
"Recoge algunos productos de {pnt} en el sistema {sys} y entrégalos en "
"{retpnt}."

msgid "Shady Dealer"
msgstr "Comerciante Turbio"

msgid ""
"A fairly shady dealer seems to be staring at you and beckoning for you to "
"come over. Could this be the individual Noona told you to meet…?"
msgstr ""
"Un traficante bastante sospechoso parece mirarte fijamente y te hace señas "
"para que te acerques. ¿Podría ser este el individuo que Noona te dijo que "
"conocieras...?"

msgid ""
"You land and the lone cargo drone begins to unload the container. It seems "
"to have trouble balancing it and you amuse yourself by looking at its antics "
"until you are startled by Noona."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y el solitario dron de carga comienza a descargar el contenedor. "
"Parece tener problemas para equilibrarlo y te entretienes mirando sus "
"travesuras hasta que te sobresalta Noona."

msgid ""
"\"The drones sure are cute. I like to call that one Laboriosi.\"\n"
"She points at the lone cargo drone.\n"
"\"Thanks a lot for bringing me my materials. I don't know what I would do "
"without them. I was able to go over the drones, and I think it might be best "
"to not rely on them for the final experiment. I think the electromagnetic "
"radiation from Katar doesn't agree too well with them. If you could help me "
"do the experiments, I would be very grateful. Meet me up at the bar, I have "
"to do some small preparations.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los drones son muy bonitos. Me gusta llamar a ese Laboriosi\".\n"
"Señala al único dron de carga.\n"
"\"Muchas gracias por traerme mis materiales. No sé qué haría sin ellos. He "
"podido repasar los drones y creo que sería mejor no depender de ellos para "
"el experimento final. Creo que la radiación electromagnética de Katar no se "
"lleva muy bien con ellos. Si pudieras ayudarme a hacer los experimentos, te "
"estaría muy agradecido. Reúnete conmigo en el bar, tengo que hacer unos "
"pequeños preparativos.\""

msgid ""
"You helped Noona get some materials from a shady dealer in order for her to "
"pursue her research and perform experiments."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a Noona a conseguir algunos materiales de un comerciante sospechoso "
"para que pudiera continuar con su investigación y realizar experimentos."

msgid "You once again approach the shady dealer."
msgstr "Una vez más, te acercas al comerciante turbio."

msgid ""
"\"Have you made preparations for the cargo?\"\n"
"Their grin makes your feel uneasy."
msgstr ""
"\"¿Has hecho los preparativos para la carga?\"\n"
"Su sonrisa hace que te sientas incómodo."

msgid ""
"As you approach the shady dealer, you can barely make out some movement in "
"the background."
msgstr ""
"Al acercarte al mercader turbio, puedes distinguir apenas algo de movimiento "
"en el fondo."

msgid ""
"They start to grin and begin to speak with an almost serpent-like accent.\n"
"\"Ah, pleasure to meet you. You must be the one in charge of the delivery. "
"Your friend has quite a refined taste, too. It's not often we get a sample "
"as good as this one.\"\n"
"They lick their lips."
msgstr ""
"Comienzan a sonreír y a hablar con un acento casi de serpiente.\n"
"\"Ah, un placer conocerte. Debes ser el encargado del reparto. Su amiga "
"también tiene un gusto bastante refinado. No es frecuente que recibamos una "
"muestra tan buena como ésta.\"\n"
"Se relame los labios."

msgid ""
"\"The arrangements have all been made, and you'll soon have it aboard your "
"ship. If I were you, I would put it as far away from any personnel as "
"possible.\"\n"
"They then lean it to whisper to you.\n"
"\"You might want to watch your back, your friend is not the only one that "
"wants it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ya se han hecho todos los arreglos, y pronto lo tendrás a bordo de tu "
"nave. Si yo fuera tú, lo pondría lo más lejos posible de cualquier personal."
"\"\n"
"Luego se inclina para susurrarle.\n"
"\"Puede que quieras vigilar tu espalda, tu amigo no es el único que lo "
"quiere.\""

msgid ""
"When you get back to your ship, the cargo has already been taken care of and "
"is properly secured on your ship. As you get close to it, you hear a weird "
"running river sound that seems to come from the cargo container. What have "
"you gotten into?"
msgstr ""
"Cuando vuelves a tu nave, el cargamento ya ha sido recogido y está "
"debidamente asegurada en tu nave. Al acercarte a ella, oyes un extraño "
"sonido de río corriendo que parece provenir del contenedor de carga. ¿En qué "
"te has metido?"

msgid "Strange Container"
msgstr "Contenedor Extraño"

msgid ""
"A large strange container that seems oddly warm to the touch. You can swear "
"you hear weird sounds coming from inside it, almost like some sort of "
"running river."
msgstr ""
"Un gran y extraño contenedor que parece extrañamente cálido al tacto. "
"Jurarías que oyes ruidos extraños que provienen de su interior, casi como "
"una especie de río que corre."

msgid "That's the one! Get 'em!"
msgstr "¡Ese es! ¡Atrápenlo!"

msgid "You approach Noona who seems giddy with excitement."
msgstr "Te acercas a Noona, que parece estar emocionada."

msgid ""
"\"It's almost ready! Thanks to you, I finally have everything ready for the "
"test. However, after reviewing the drone firmware, I think it would be best "
"to perform this experiment manually. Sometimes, it's better not to rely on "
"all the fancy technology and instead do things the old-fashioned way. Would "
"you be willing to perform the experiment for me? Your ship should be sturdy "
"enough; I don't think there's any possibility of harm.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Está casi listo! Gracias a ti, por fin tengo todo listo para la prueba. "
"Sin embargo, después de revisar el firmware del dron, creo que sería mejor "
"realizar este experimento manualmente. A veces, es mejor no confiar en toda "
"la tecnología de lujo y en su lugar hacer las cosas a la antigua. ¿Estarías "
"dispuesto a realizar el experimento por mí? Tu nave debería ser lo "
"suficientemente resistente; no creo que haya ninguna posibilidad de daño.\""

msgid "\"I see. You must be busy with other things.\""
msgstr "\"Ya veo. Debes estar ocupado con otras cosas.\""

msgid ""
"\"Thanks! So what you brought back last time were some nebula crystals. "
"Nothing is really known about them, but, sometimes, they are found in old "
"wrecks or asteroids in the nebula. We know that these crystals seem to have "
"some weird properties, but nothing conclusive has been found about them. "
"While most Za'lek prefer to take a theoretical approach before trying "
"anything experimental, I am rather the opposite. It is much easier to figure "
"out the theory after you have seen how things work.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Gracias! Lo que trajiste la última vez fueron unos cristales de nebulosa. "
"En realidad no se sabe nada de ellos, pero, a veces, se encuentran en viejos "
"pecios o asteroides de la nebulosa. Sabemos que estos cristales parecen "
"tener algunas propiedades extrañas, pero no se ha encontrado nada "
"concluyente sobre ellos. Mientras que la mayoría de los Za'lek prefieren "
"adoptar un enfoque teórico antes de intentar algo experimental, yo soy más "
"bien lo contrario. Es mucho más fácil averiguar la teoría después de haber "
"visto cómo funcionan las cosas.\""

msgid ""
"\"The plan for the experiment is fairly simple. I have set up an amplifier "
"to create an energy focal point at the particle physics testing site. The "
"idea is pretty straightforward: you will just have to fly the nebula "
"crystals to the focal point, and we can leave the rest to particle physics. "
"I have also set up some recording drones that should capture anything and "
"everything that happens out there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El plan del experimento es bastante sencillo. He instalado un amplificador "
"para crear un punto focal de energía en el lugar de pruebas de la física de "
"partículas. La idea es bastante sencilla: sólo habrá que hacer volar los "
"cristales de la nebulosa hasta el punto focal, y podemos dejar el resto a la "
"física de partículas. También he montado algunos drones de grabación que "
"deberían captar todo lo que ocurra ahí fuera.\""

msgid ""
"You are about to ask about your safety, but seeing how excited Noona is "
"getting, you decide to rely on her word that your ship will shield you from "
"any potential particle physics mishaps."
msgstr ""
"Estás a punto de preguntar por tu seguridad, pero al ver lo emocionada que "
"está Noona, decides confiar en su palabra de que tu nave te protegerá de "
"cualquier posible percance de física de partículas."

msgid "Science!"
msgstr "¡Ciencia!"

msgid "Perform the particle physics experiment at {sys}."
msgstr "Realiza el experimento de física de partículas en {sys}."

msgid "Perform the experiment"
msgstr "Realiza el experimento"

msgid "You land after the dizzying event. What was that about?"
msgstr "Aterrizas después del evento vertiginoso. ¿Qué fue eso?"

msgid "\"You don't look so good. Did something happen?\""
msgstr "\"No te ves muy bien. ¿Ha pasado algo?\""

msgid ""
"You don't know how to start explaining and give up on mentioning anything."
msgstr "No sabes cómo empezar a explicarlo y renuncias a mencionar nada."

msgid ""
"\"The experiment looks like it collected a ton of data I'll need to process "
"and analyse. I was sort of expecting a more violent reaction, but you're "
"lucky that did not happen. You never know how things will go with particle "
"physics.\"\n"
"She gives you a not too reassuring smile."
msgstr ""
"\"El experimento parece haber recogido una tonelada de datos que tendré que "
"procesar y analizar. Esperaba una reacción más violenta, pero tienes suerte "
"de que no haya ocurrido. Nunca se sabe cómo irán las cosas con la física de "
"partículas.\"\n"
"Te dedica una sonrisa no demasiado tranquilizadora."

msgid ""
"\"I have to process some data real quick, but meet me up at the spaceport "
"bar in a bit. I should have another task for you.\"\n"
"She starts to hum and skips off towards her laboratory space."
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo que procesar algunos datos muy rápido, pero reúnete conmigo en el "
"bar del puerto espacial en un rato. Debería tener otra tarea para ti.\"\n"
"Comienza a tararear y se va corriendo hacia su laboratorio espacial."

#. vn.na( fmt.credits(reward) )
#. player.pay( reward )
msgid ""
"You helped Noona conduct her particle physics experiment. However, you saw "
"something you couldn't really make out during the experiments."
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste a Noona a realizar su experimento de física de partículas. Sin "
"embargo, viste algo que no pudiste distinguir durante los experimentos."

msgid "You were supposed to perform the experiment!"
msgstr "¡Se suponía que debías realizar el experimento!"

#. Spawn the drones
#. TODO better location once testing centre object is created
#. Hostile drone
msgid "Amplifier"
msgstr "Amplificador"

msgid "Experiment Site"
msgstr "Lugar del Experimento"

msgid "You access the amplifier's control panel and jack in."
msgstr "Accedes al panel de control del amplificador y lo conectas."

#. TODO maybe do another minigame?
msgid "Amplifier Control Panel"
msgstr "Panel de Control Amplificador"

msgid "You manage to adjust the settings and the amplifier turns on again."
msgstr ""
"Consigues ajustar la configuración y el amplificador se enciende de nuevo."

msgid "You failed to turn the amplifier on."
msgstr "No has encendido el amplificador."

msgid "Get close to the experiment site!"
msgstr "¡Acércate al lugar del experimento!"

msgid "Carefully push the crystals into the beam."
msgstr "Empuja con cuidado los cristales hacia el rayo."

msgid ""
"Hmmm. It looks like the amplifier needs some adjustments. Could you try to "
"fix it?"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. Parece que el amplificador necesita algunos ajustes. ¿Podrías intentar "
"arreglarlo?"

msgid "It looks like everything is OK now."
msgstr "Parece que todo está bien ahora."

msgid "Now push the crystals into the beam."
msgstr "Ahora empuja los cristales hacia el rayo."

msgid "Are you alright? Communication cut off for a bit."
msgstr "¿Estás bien? La comunicación se cortó un rato."

msgid "Come back to Katar I."
msgstr "Vuelve a Katar I."

msgid "You meet Noona who seems to be a bit more calm than usual."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras con Noona, que parece estar un poco más tranquila que de "
"costumbre."

msgid ""
"\"Thanks for all you've done for me. I've got a ton of data from the "
"experiment that will take me a long time to process. In the meantime, I've "
"written up a preliminary report that I need to send to {pnt} in the {sys} "
"system. I would go myself, except, I'm… a bit busy. Would you be willing to "
"do me this favour and deliver my report to {pnt}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias por todo lo que has hecho por mí. Tengo un montón de datos del "
"experimento que me llevará mucho tiempo procesar. Mientras tanto, he "
"redactado un informe preliminar que tengo que enviar a {pnt} en el sistema "
"{sys}. Iría yo mismo, excepto que estoy... un poco ocupada. ¿Estarías "
"dispuesto a hacerme este favor y entregar mi informe a {pnt}?\""

msgid ""
"\"Great! I can't thank you enough for all you've done for me.\"\n"
"She hands you the report package, which seems a bit heavier than you "
"expected, and waves you off."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Genial! No puedo agradecerte lo suficiente todo lo que has hecho por mí."
"\"\n"
"Te entrega el paquete del informe, que parece un poco más pesado de lo que "
"esperabas, y te hace un gesto para que te vayas."

#. Must be accepted beyond this point
msgid "Za'lek Report"
msgstr "Informe Za'lek"

msgid ""
"A in-depth report filled with jargon and technical details you can't "
"comprehend."
msgstr ""
"Un informe exhaustivo lleno de jerga y detalles técnicos que no puedes "
"comprender."

msgid "Deliver Noona's preliminary report to {pnt} in the {sys} system."
msgstr "Entrega el informe preliminar de Noona a {pnt} en el sistema {sys}."

msgid "Deliver a report to {pnt} ({sys} system)"
msgstr "Entrega un informe en {pnt} (sistema {sys})"

#. Just for the letter
msgid ""
"You land and head to where Noona told you to drop off the package. On the "
"way you get lost in the maze of research laboratories, coffee machines, "
"dangerous looking experiments, and Za'lek scientists engaged in heated "
"arguments who don't notice your presence."
msgstr ""
"Aterrizas y te diriges al lugar donde Noona te dijo que dejaras el paquete. "
"Por el camino te pierdes en el laberinto de laboratorios de investigación, "
"máquinas de café, experimentos de aspecto peligroso y científicos Za'lek "
"enfrascados en acaloradas discusiones que no advierten tu presencia."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eventually, you find the hidden away room labelled \"Particle Physics "
"Experiments Registration Department\", and enter to meet an unenthusiastic "
"academic secretary. You hand them the package, and, after sighing, they "
"proceed to inspect the contents. They mention something about Dr. Sanderaite "
"being at it again, and hand you an envelope that was in the package "
"mentioning that it is not part of the report."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, encuentras la sala oculta etiquetada como \"Departamento de "
"Registro de Experimentos de Física de Partículas\", y entras para "
"encontrarte con una secretaria académica poco entusiasta. Le entregas el "
"paquete y, tras suspirar, procede a inspeccionar el contenido. Menciona algo "
"sobre que el Dr. Sanderaite está en ello de nuevo, y te entregan un sobre "
"que estaba en el paquete mencionando que no es parte del informe."

msgid ""
"As you wonder about what is in the envelope, suddenly two Za'lek Military "
"officers bust in to the room."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te preguntas qué hay en el sobre, de repente irrumpen en la "
"habitación dos oficiales militares Za'lek."

#. TODO proper graphics
msgid "Za'lek Officer A"
msgstr "Oficial Za'lek A"

msgid "Za'lek Officer B"
msgstr "Oficial Za'lek B"

msgid ""
"\"Where is Chairwoman Sanderaite!? We just got the signal that she submitted "
"a report here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Dónde está la Presidenta Sanderaite? ¡Acabamos de recibir la señal de que "
"ha presentado un informe aquí!\""

msgid "The secretary lazily points at you."
msgstr "La secretaria te señala perezosamente."

msgid "\"Damnit, she got someone else to bring the report for her again…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maldita sea, ha conseguido que otra persona traiga el informe por ella "
"otra vez...\""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"The board should have never passed the law permitting third parties to "
"hand-in official reports.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El Consejo nunca debería haber aprobado la ley que permite a terceros "
"entregar informes oficiales.\""

msgid ""
"\"They're trying to revoke it, but last time the meeting ended in fisticuffs."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Intentan revocarla, pero la última vez la reunión acabó a puñetazos.\""

msgid ""
"\"Oh well, at least we have a hint to where she is now. On to Katar I!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, bueno, al menos tenemos una pista de dónde está ahora. ¡Hacia Katar I!"
"\""

#. Played in reverse
msgid ""
"The Za'lek officers leave as fast as they got there, barely acknowledging "
"your presence. Pondering how House Za'lek manages to get anything done, you "
"take your leave and open up the envelope that you got handed back. It has a "
"letter from Noona."
msgstr ""
"Los oficiales Za'lek se marchan tan rápido como llegaron, sin apenas "
"reconocer tu presencia. Reflexionando sobre cómo la Casa Za'lek consigue "
"hacer algo, te despides y abres el sobre que te han devuelto. Tiene una "
"carta de Noona."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You read the letter:\n"
"   Thanks for all your help at Katar I. By now you've probably realized I am "
"not just a researcher, but have been bestowed the curse of being the Za'lek "
"chairwoman. Not often do I get to get away from everything and focus on my "
"research. I have attached a credstick as a reward, and have given you "
"clearance for the Heavy Combat Vessel Licence. Your help was invaluable and "
"I hope we meet again."
msgstr ""
"Has leído la carta:\n"
"   Gracias por toda tu ayuda en Katar I. A estas alturas probablemente te "
"habrás dado cuenta de que no soy sólo una investigadora, sino que se me ha "
"otorgado la maldición de ser la presidenta Za'lek. No es frecuente que pueda "
"alejarme de todo y centrarme en mi investigación. He adjuntado un usb de "
"créditos como recompensa, y te he dado autorización para la Licencia de Nave "
"de Combate Pesado. Tu ayuda ha sido inestimable y espero que nos volvamos a "
"encontrar."

msgid ""
"You read the letter:\n"
"   Thanks for all your help at Katar I. By now you've probably realized am I "
"not just a researcher, but have been bestowed the curse of being the Za'lek "
"chairwoman. Not often do I get to get away from everything and focus on my "
"research. I have attached a credstick as a reward. Your help was invaluable "
"and I hope we meet again."
msgstr ""
"Has leído la carta:\n"
"   Gracias por toda tu ayuda en Katar I. A estas alturas probablemente te "
"habrás dado cuenta de que no soy sólo una investigadora, sino que se me ha "
"otorgado la maldición de ser la Presidenta de Za'lek. No es frecuente que "
"pueda alejarme de todo y centrarme en mi investigación. He adjuntado un usb "
"de créditos como recompensa. Tu ayuda ha sido inestimable y espero que nos "
"volvamos a encontrar."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You delivered Noona's report to {pnt} and found out that she is the Za'lek "
"chairwoman. You also got access to the Heavy Combat Vessel licence for your "
"help."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado el informe de Noona a {pnt} y has descubierto que es la "
"presidenta Za'lek. También obtuviste acceso a la Licencia de Nave de Combate "
"Pesado por tu ayuda."

msgid ""
"You delivered Noona's report to {pnt} and found out that she is the Za'lek "
"chairwoman."
msgstr ""
"Has entregado el informe Noona a {pnt} y has descubierto que es la "
"presidenta Za'lek."

msgid ""
"A scientist conspicuously sits in the corner. Perhaps he might be the person "
"you're supposed to get this stuff for."
msgstr ""
"Un científico se sienta llamativamente en la esquina. Tal vez sea la persona "
"a la que se supone que tienes que comprar estas cosas."

msgid "Contact Person"
msgstr "Persona de Contacto"

msgid ""
"You see a shifty-looking dealer of some kind. Maybe he has what you're "
"looking for."
msgstr "Ves a un traficante de aspecto sospechoso. Quizá tenga lo que buscas."

msgid ""
"You see a scientist talking to various pilots. Perhaps you should see what "
"he's looking for."
msgstr ""
"Ves a un científico hablando con varios pilotos. Tal vez deberías ver lo que "
"está buscando."

#. Mission details:
msgid ""
"\"Oh, hello! You look like you're a pilot; is that right? I've got a job for "
"you. Allow me to introduce myself; my name is Dr. Geller, and I am on the "
"brink of revolutionizing science! I've basically already done it; there's "
"just some minor fiddling to do. Would you like to help me out? I just need "
"you to find some samples that I can study.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Oh, hola! Parece que eres un piloto; ¿es así? Tengo un trabajo para ti. "
"Permítame que me presente: me llamo Dr. Geller y estoy a punto de "
"revolucionar la ciencia. Básicamente ya lo he hecho; sólo hay que hacer unos "
"pequeños retoques. ¿Te gustaría ayudarme? Sólo necesito que encuentres "
"algunas muestras que pueda estudiar.\""

msgid "I guess you don't care for science…"
msgstr "Supongo que no te interesa la ciencia…"

msgid ""
"\"Excellent! Here is the list.\" He hands you a memory chip and turns away "
"even before you can say anything and without giving you any cash to actually "
"do his shopping. Once you check the list, you find that it contains not only "
"a list of materials he needs, but also information where to retrieve them, "
"as well as a list of traders to contact."
msgstr ""
"\"¡Excelente! Aquí está la lista.\" Te entrega un chip de memoria y se da la "
"vuelta incluso antes de que puedas decir nada y sin darte dinero para que "
"hagas sus compras. Una vez que compruebas la lista, descubres que no sólo "
"contiene una lista de materiales que necesita, sino también información "
"sobre dónde conseguirlos, así como una lista de comerciantes con los que "
"contactar."

#. player.msg(mem.t_sys[3]:name())
msgid "The one with the Shopping"
msgstr "El de las Compras"

msgid "Go to the {sys} system and talk to the trader on {pnt}"
msgstr "Ve al sistema {sys} y habla con el comerciante en {pnt}"

msgid ""
"You've been hired by Dr. Geller to collect some materials he urgently needs "
"for his research."
msgstr ""
"Has sido contratado por el Dr. Geller para recoger unos materiales que "
"necesita urgentemente para su investigación."

msgid "The gratitude of science and a bit of compensation"
msgstr "La gratitud de la ciencia y un poco de compensación"

#. first trade: send player 2 2nd system, if he goes back here, tell them to get going...
msgid "\"What are you still doing here? No phosphine, no trade.\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué haces todavía aquí? Sin fosfina, no hay comercio.\""

msgid ""
"\"With what can I help you, my friend?\" says the shifty figure. You hand "
"him the memory chip the scientist handed you."
msgstr ""
"\"¿En qué puedo ayudarte, amigo mío?\", dice la figura sospechosa. Le "
"entregas el chip de memoria que te entregó el científico."

msgid ""
"\"Of course I have what you need. I'll trade it for some 3t phosphine. You "
"can find it on {pnt} in the {sys} system.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por supuesto que tengo lo que necesitas. Lo cambiaré por 3t de fosfina. "
"Puedes encontrarla en {pnt} en el sistema {sys}.\""

msgid "Go to the {sys} system and talk to the contact person on {pnt}"
msgstr "Ve al sistema {sys} y habla con la persona de contacto en {pnt}"

#. 2nd trade: Get player the stuff and make them pay, let them be hunted by the police squad
msgid ""
"\"You approach the dealer and explain what you are looking for. He raises "
"his eyebrow. \"It will be {credits}. But if you get caught by the "
"authorities, you're on your own. Far as I'm concerned, I never saw you. Deal?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"Te acercas al vendedor y le explicas lo que buscas. Él levanta una ceja. "
"\"Serán {credits}. Pero si te pillan las autoridades, te quedas solo. Por lo "
"que a mí respecta, nunca te he visto. ¿Trato?\""

msgid "Pay {credits}."
msgstr "Pagar {credits}."

msgid "\"Then we have nothing to to discuss.\""
msgstr "\"Entonces no tenemos nada que discutir.\""

msgid "\"You don't have enough money. Stop wasting my time.\""
msgstr "\"No tienes suficiente dinero. Deja de hacerme perder el tiempo.\""

msgid "Phosphine"
msgstr "Fosfina"

msgid "A colourless, flammable, poisonous gas."
msgstr "Un gas incoloro, inflamable y venenoso."

msgid "Return to the {sys} system to the trader on {pnt}"
msgstr "Vuelve al sistema {sys} al comerciante en {pnt}"

#. create hook that player will be hailed by authorities bc of toxic materials
#. 3rd trade: Get the stuff the scientist wants
msgid ""
"\"Ah, yes indeed,\" he says as he inspects a sample in front of him. \"That "
"will do. And here, as promised: a piece of a ghost ship from the Nebula. "
"100% authentic! At least, according to my supplier.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, sí, efectivamente\", dice mientras inspecciona una muestra que tiene "
"delante. \"Esto servirá. Y aquí, como prometí: una pieza de una nave "
"fantasma de la Nebulosa. 100% auténtica. Al menos, según mi proveedor.\""

msgid "Return to the {sys} system and deliver to Dr. Geller on {pnt}"
msgstr "Regresa al sistema {sys} y realiza la entrega al Dr. Geller en {pnt}"

#. final land: let the player land and collect the reward
msgid ""
"Dr. Geller looks up at you as you approach. \"Do you have what I was looking "
"for?\" You present the ghost ship piece and his face lights up. \"Yes, "
"that's it! Now I can continue my research. I've been looking everywhere for "
"a sample!\" You ask him about the so-called ghost ships. He seems amused by "
"the question. \"Some people believe in ridiculous nonsense related to this. "
"There is no scientific explanation for the origin of these so-called ghost "
"ships yet, but I think it has to do with some technology involved in the "
"Incident. Hard to say exactly what, but hey, that's why we do research!\""
msgstr ""
"El Dr. Geller te mira cuando te acercas. \" ¿Tienes lo que estaba buscando?"
"\" Le presentas la pieza de la nave fantasma y su cara se ilumina. \"¡Sí, "
"eso es! Ahora puedo continuar mi investigación. He buscado una muestra por "
"todas partes.\" Le preguntas por las llamadas naves fantasma. Parece "
"divertido por la pregunta. \"Algunas personas creen en ridículas tonterías "
"relacionadas con esto. Todavía no hay una explicación científica para el "
"origen de las llamadas naves fantasma, pero creo que tiene que ver con "
"alguna tecnología implicada en el Incidente. Es difícil decir exactamente "
"con qué, pero, ¡para eso investigamos!\""

msgid ""
"As he turns away, you audibly clear your throat, prompting him to turn back "
"to you. \"Oh, yes, of course you want some payment for your service. My "
"apologies for forgetting.\" He hands you a credit chip with your payment. "
"\"I might need your services again in the future, so do stay in touch!\""
msgstr ""
"Cuando se da la vuelta, te aclaras la garganta de forma audible, lo que hace "
"que se vuelva hacia ti. \"Oh, sí, por supuesto ,quieres algún pago por tu "
"servicio. Mis disculpas por haberlo olvidado.\" Te entrega una ficha de "
"crédito con tu pago. \"Puede que vuelva a necesitar tus servicios en el "
"futuro, así que mantente en contacto.\""

msgid ""
"You helped Dr. Geller at {pnt} in the {sys} system to obtain a \"ghost ship "
"piece\" for his research. When you asked about these so-called ghost ships, "
"he seemed amused. \"Some people believe in ridiculous nonsense related to "
"this. There is no scientific explanation for the origin of these so-called "
"ghost ships yet, but I think it has to do with some technology involved in "
"the Incident. Hard to say exactly what, but hey, that's why we do research!\""
msgstr ""
"Ayudaste al Dr. Geller en {pnt} en el sistema {sys} a obtener una \"pieza de "
"nave fantasma\" para su investigación. Cuando le preguntaste por las "
"llamadas naves fantasma, pareció divertido. \"Algunas personas creen en "
"tonterías ridículas relacionadas con esto. Todavía no hay una explicación "
"científica para el origen de estas supuestas naves fantasmas, pero creo que "
"tiene que ver con alguna tecnología implicada en el Incidente. Es difícil "
"decir exactamente con qué, pero, ¡para eso investigamos!\""

#. when the player takes off the authorities will want them
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"We have reason to believe you are carrying controlled substances without a "
"proper licence. Please stop your ship and prepare to be boarded.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tenemos razones para creer que están llevando sustancias controladas sin "
"una licencia adecuada. Por favor, detenga su nave y prepárese para ser "
"abordado.\""

msgid "\"Stand down for inspection.\""
msgstr "\"Retírense para la inspección.\""

#. Get called to Waterhole
#. disable weapons only
#. Give them disable weapons (Emprie don't have by default!)
#. Re-outfit the ships to use disable weapons.
#. move to the player ship
#. display msgs and have the ships disappear and fail the mission...
msgid ""
"\"You are accused of violating regulations on the transport of toxic "
"materials. Your ship will be searched now. If there are no contraband "
"substances, we will be out of your hair in just a moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se te acusa de violar la normativa sobre el transporte de materiales "
"tóxicos. Tu nave será registrada ahora. Si no hay sustancias de contrabando, "
"saldremos de aquí en un momento.\""

msgid ""
"The inspectors search through your ship and cargo hold. It doesn't take long "
"for them to find the phosphine; they confiscate it and fine you {credits}."
msgstr ""
"Los inspectores registran tu nave y la bodega de carga. No tardan en "
"encontrar la fosfina; la confiscan y te ponen una multa de {credits}."

msgid "the phosphine was confiscated!"
msgstr "¡la fosfina fue confiscada!"

