msgid ""
"You board the ship and enter the airlock. When you attempt to enter, an "
"authorization prompt opens up. Looking at the make of the ship, it seems "
"heavily reinforced. It looks like you're going to have to break the code to "
"gain complete access to the ship."
msgstr ""
"Subes a la nave y entras en la esclusa. Cuando intentas entrar, se abre un "
"aviso de autorización. Mirando la marca de la nave, parece fuertemente "
"reforzada. Parece que vas a tener que descifrar el código para acceder "
"completamente a la nave."

msgid ""
"A brief '#rAUTHORIZATION DENIED#0' flashes on the screen, and you hear the "
"ship internals groan as the emergency security protocol kicks in and "
"everything gets locked down. It looks like you won't be getting anywhere "
"here; the ship is as good as debris. You have no option but to return "
"dejectedly to your ship. Maybe next time."
msgstr ""
"\"Un breve '#rAUTORIZACION DENEGADA#0' parpadea en la pantalla y escuchas el "
"gemido de los internos de la nave mientras el protocolo de seguridad de "
"emergencia entra en acción y todo se bloquea. Parece que no vas a llegar a "
"ninguna parte aquí; la nave es tan buena como los escombros. No te queda más "
"remedio que volver abatido a tu nave. Tal vez la próxima vez."

msgid ""
"You board the derelict which seems oddly in pretty good condition. "
"Furthermore, it seems like there is no access lock in place. What a lucky "
"find!"
msgstr ""
"Abordas el derrelicto que, extrañamente, parece estar en muy buenas "
"condiciones. Además, parece que no hay ninguna cerradura de acceso. ¡Qué "
"suerte!"

#. Failed to get a reward, just default to data
msgid ""
"You access the main computer and are able to log in to find a hefty amount "
"of credits. This will come in handy."
msgstr ""
"Accedes al ordenador principal y puedes iniciar sesión para encontrar una "
"gran cantidad de créditos. Esto te será muy útil."

msgid ""
"You found an unusual derelict with large amounts of credits in the {sys} "
"system.."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un derrelicto inusual con grandes cantidades de créditos en "
"el sistema {sys}.."

msgid ""
"You access the main computer and are able to extract some Encrypted Data "
"Matrices. It does not seem like you can decrypt them without damaging them, "
"but they may have some other use."
msgstr ""
"Accedes al ordenador principal y eres capaz de extraer algunas Matrices de "
"Datos Encriptadas. No parece que puedas desencriptarlas sin dañarlas, pero "
"puede que tengan alguna otra utilidad."

msgid ""
"You found an unusual derelict with an Encrypted Data Matrix in the {sys} "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un inusual derelicto con una Matriz de Datos Encriptada en el "
"sistema {sys}."

msgid ""
"Exploring the cargo bay, you find something that might be of use to you."
msgstr "Explorando la bahía de carga, encuentras algo que podría serte útil."

msgid ""
"You explore the rest of the ship but do not find anything else of interest. "
"Although the ship is in very good condition, it is still not space-worthy, "
"and there is not anything that you can do with it. You let it rest among the "
"stars."
msgstr ""
"Exploras el resto de la nave pero no encuentras nada más de interés. Aunque "
"la nave está en muy buen estado, todavía no es apta para el espacio, y no "
"hay nada que puedas hacer con ella. La dejas descansar entre las estrellas."

